window.AKK_PARANORMAL_WRITER_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_PARANORMAL_WRITER_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1,"title":"Chapter 1","paragraphs":["In the end, the true heiress, in an attempt to prove herself, was egged on by a group of wealthy heirs and leaped off a bungee platform. She died from sheer terror during the fall.","The system skimmed through the ending and, seeing its unfazed host, continued to intimidate her: \"Even if you’ve transmigrated into the true heiress, you only have a month left to live—unless you publish literary works and accumulate enough reputation points to exchange for lifespan.\"","Qi Quan lowered her head, examining her calloused palms, and calmly accepted her new identity.","Born an orphan, she had been taken in by her master and raised in the world of metaphysics, becoming a once-in-a-century prodigy. Yet, due to her frail health, she died at 22. She had thought her story ended there, but then this so-called \"Writer System\" dragged her into a novel, transmigrating her into the body of a tragic true heiress who shared her name and age.","In her past life, Qi Quan had handled many supernatural cases and interacted with numerous wealthy families, some of whom had cases of switched daughters. Back then, she had privately mocked how such a mix-up could even happen. Who would have thought she’d one day become one of those switched children herself?","The original host’s life was simple: her adoptive parents died in an accident when she was five, leaving her to grow up in an orphanage. At eighteen, she graduated high school and began working odd jobs until, at twenty-two, she was discovered by the Qi family.","The Qi family was one of Longjiang City’s most prominent dynasties, with assets worth billions. To be part of such a family was a dream beyond the reach of most.","The original host, a lonely and destitute girl, was struck by this sudden fortune. Yearning for familial love and a happy life, she eagerly returned to the Qi household without hesitation.","However, life with the Qi family was nothing like she imagined.","Despite being the true bloodline, everyone doted on the fake heiress instead. Her parents deemed her unrefined, Qi Eldest Brother ignored her coldly, Qi Younger Brother bullied her with disdain, and even the household staff fawned over the fake heiress while secretly undermining her.","The same went for the other elite families who associated with the Qis.","Under such circumstances, the original host grew resentful. She repeatedly clashed with the fake heiress, repeatedly embarrassed the Qi family in high society, and repeatedly deepened everyone’s disgust toward her.","Tonight was no exception.","Standing by the pool, Qi Quan gazed through the floor-to-ceiling windows at the dazzling banquet hall inside, where guests in lavish attire mingled with glasses in hand, their smiles as polished as their masks.","The banquet hall’s lights shimmered across the water’s surface, flickering like stars in the night sky.","From the original host’s memories, she knew the entire Qi family had come to celebrate Old Master Du’s birthday banquet tonight—except the fake heiress hadn’t arrived with them.","The fake heiress had come arm-in-arm with her fiancé.","As the only son of Longjiang City’s real estate tycoon, the fiancé was worth billions himself, with striking looks that made him the dream man of many wealthy heiresses.","After enduring repeated cold shoulders from the Qi family, the original host’s mentality had twisted. Consumed by jealousy, she resented the fake heiress for stealing the happiness that should have been hers—especially when it came to the fiancé.","Just moments ago, she had publicly accused the fake heiress of stealing her betrothed, ignoring the Qi family’s furious expressions, before being forcibly dragged out by Qi Eldest Brother.","Once again, the Qi family became the laughingstock of their social circle.","Now, Qi Eldest Brother stood beside her, his handsome face dark as ink.","\"You’re running a fever and not thinking clearly. I’ll have someone take you home.\" The \"fever\" was nothing more than a flimsy excuse.","In her past life, Qi Quan had never bothered with the melodramas of wealthy families. Now that she’d been given a second chance at life, she had even less desire to get involved. Qi Eldest Brother’s suggestion suited her just fine.","She nodded indifferently. \"Alright.\"","Qi Eldest Brother: \"...?\"","He shot her a surprised glance. In the past, she would’ve thrown a fit—why was she so compliant this time? Was she plotting something bigger?","Of course, he didn’t have time to dwell on it. He promptly called for the driver and instructed him to keep a close eye on her during the ride back.","The driver maintained a respectful demeanor, though inwardly, he was sweating bullets.","If this troublemaker decided to act up on the way, what was he supposed to do?","Qi Quan stepped into the car in her stilettos, quietly lifting the hem of her dress as she settled into the backseat. The moment the door closed, she kicked off the heels and leaned back, finally free to respond to the Writer System.","\"How is reputation calculated? What’s the exchange rate between reputation points and lifespan?\"","Qi Quan cherished her life. If there was even the slightest chance to survive, she wouldn’t let it slip away. In her past life, she had tried countless methods to prolong her life, only to lose to fate in the end.","Fortunately, fate had cracked open a window for her, granting her a second chance.","The system replied: \"After analysis, this world’s online literature is highly developed. We recommend starting there. Reputation points are tied to your work’s collections, tips, and comments. The exchange rate is 1,000:1—meaning 1,000 reputation points buy you one extra day of life. Any other questions?\"","Qi Quan: \"If your goal is to change the true heiress’s fate, why didn’t you bind to the original host instead of pulling in my soul?\"","She didn’t want to die, but if she was stealing someone else’s chance at rebirth, she’d rather not live at all.","The system explained: \"My purpose is to help the host achieve fame through the Writer System, not to alter the ending. The original host had lost the will to live and already made a deal with the system. After evaluation, your survival instincts are exceptionally strong, your soul’s stability is high, and your name, age, blood type, etc., perfectly match the original host’s. You’re the most suitable candidate.\"","Qi Quan understood now.","The original host hadn’t wanted the task, and she happened to fit the criteria—hence her selection.","She had no lingering attachments to her past life. If she could keep living in this absurd novel world, so be it.","The car glided smoothly into the Qi family’s villa estate.","Seeing Qi Quan return alone, the servants exchanged knowing glances. Once she went upstairs, they huddled together, whispering among themselves.","They assumed she couldn’t hear them, unaware that Qi Quan’s soul had been replaced—and that her cultivation had followed her here.","As a top-tier metaphysics expert, her senses were razor-sharp. The servants’ murmurs reached her ears with perfect clarity.","\"Why’s she back by herself?\"","\"She must’ve done something outrageous again and got kicked out!\"","\"I don’t get why she keeps provoking Miss Yingxue. Isn’t she just humiliating herself?\"","\"If I were her, I’d just enjoy the money and stop making trouble.\"","\"Enough, all of you.\"","Qi Quan’s room was on the second floor, separated from Qi Yingxue’s by a single wall.","Materially, the Qi family hadn’t mistreated her. Her bedroom was decked out in lavish luxury—a style Qi Quan, a self-admitted money-lover, thoroughly appreciated.","The room was fully equipped, complete with a dedicated study for work or leisure.","The moment the system spotted the computer, it urged excitedly, \"Quick! Go register an author account!\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She ignored the system, grabbing her pajamas for a shower first before finally heading to the study.","In her past life, she’d never read—let alone written—fiction. She was clueless about the craft and didn’t even know where to begin looking for publishing platforms.","Earning reputation points by writing novels was by no means an easy task for her.","But while taking a shower earlier, an idea had struck her.","[System detected: The most renowned female-oriented fiction website in this world is \"Scream Literature City.\" Host is advised to register an author account there. Mission One: Successfully sign a contract with the website and become a contracted author. Reward: One day of lifespan. Penalty: None.]","Qi Quan raised an eyebrow: [There are missions too?]","System: [Missions are issued to help the host establish clear phased goals.]","Qi Quan nodded. One day of lifespan was still lifespan—no loss there.","She searched for Scream Literature City, registered with her phone number, and chose the pen name \"White Water Sage,\" planning to brainstorm overnight and start writing the next morning.","The system promptly reminded her: [After registering a pen name, it is recommended to publish content as soon as possible to avoid wasting time that could be spent climbing the New Authors Ranking.]","Qi Quan: \"...\"","After carefully reading the website’s ranking guidelines, she decided to write and post a chapter that very night.","Qi Quan didn’t read web novels, so she simply followed her own instincts and typed \"Diary of the Elite\" into the title field. The moment she pressed the spacebar, the system vehemently objected.","[No. This title lacks impact. It’s not eye-catching at all and won’t attract readers. Change it.]","Qi Quan humbly asked: [Then what kind of title do you think would be attention-grabbing?]","[Is this novel about your experiences and observations after returning to a wealthy family?] the system inquired.","[Correct.]","The system rattled off suggestions without hesitation: [The True Heiress: Writing Her Way to the Top After Binding with a System, The True Heiress: Getting Rich by Writing in a Wealthy Family, The True Heiress: Slapping Faces and Crushing Enemies Through Writing—any of these would work. Pick one.]","[......]","Qi Quan winced, her toes curling so hard they could’ve drilled through the ceiling. She tactfully declined: [I prefer shorter titles.]","The system sighed inwardly. A newbie’s stubbornness—she’d learn the importance of a compelling title once she hit a wall.","When it came to the synopsis, Qi Quan simply wrote: \"Experiences and observations after returning to a wealthy family.\"","Minimalist to the extreme.","The system couldn’t bear to look. It wanted to paste examples of well-crafted synopses for the host to learn from, but seeing Qi Quan’s unyielding expression, it decided to wait.","Only when the host lamented her icy-cold readership stats would she be open to advice.","Unaware of the system’s thoughts, Qi Quan typed swiftly, her mind and fingers flying. In half an hour, she finished a chapter, copied it, and hit \"Publish.\"","The system had watched her write the entire first chapter before commenting: [You’re really writing a diary? First-person narratives have a small audience these days. This won’t attract traffic.]","[It’s fine.]","Qi Quan had her own plans and didn’t care about the numbers.","By the time she finished the chapter, it was already 10 p.m. She collapsed into bed and fell asleep instantly, free from the anxiety most authors felt—constantly refreshing their stats every few minutes after posting.","The system, however, spent the entire night monitoring the data.","A restful night later, Qi Quan woke at 5 a.m., meditated for two hours, and went downstairs for breakfast at 7.","The rest of the Qi family was already seated at the dining table. Upon seeing her, Qi Father and Qi Mother showed no particular reaction, Qi Eldest Brother ignored her outright, Qi Yingxue offered a gentle smile, and Qi Younger Brother—Qi Yuan—flipped her an exaggerated eye roll.","\"Some people should look in the mirror. A toad lusting after swan meat!\"","Qi Mother scolded sharply: \"Qi Yuan!\"","The others pretended not to hear.","Qi Quan calmly took her seat, glanced briefly at his face, and dismissed the childish tantrum, focusing on her porridge instead.","...","Her indifferent expression only fueled Qi Yuan’s anger. He raised his voice even louder: \"What’s with that look? You think you’re better than me? You freeload every day, and you dare look down on me?!\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She sighed and replied, \"Aren’t you freeloading too?\"","In her past life, Qi Quan had never enjoyed dealing with people, and this life was no exception. She found the noise grating.","Qi Yuan choked, his face flushing red. Clenching his fists, he retorted, \"I’m a minor! What’s wrong with eating at home?\"","\"When I was a minor, I didn’t get to eat at home,\" Qi Quan responded evenly.","Qi Yuan: \"...\"","Amid his embarrassment, a flicker of suspicion arose.","In the past, Qi Quan would’ve already been shouting in fury. Why was she so composed today? Was she plotting something?","Meanwhile, Qi Mother felt a pang of guilt.","She looked at her slender biological daughter and, for once, spoke gently: \"You’ve suffered in the past. From now on, you don’t have to do anything. The family can support you for life.\"","After all, the Qi family owed her.","Qi Quan lifted her head, her delicate features exuding an air of quiet elegance. \"Thank you. But I’ve already found a job.\"","\"Don’t tell me it’s another café waitress gig?\" Qi Yuan sneered.","When the Qi family had first found Qi Quan, she’d been working as a café waitress—a fact Qi Yuan never missed a chance to mock her for.","Qi Father and Qi Eldest Brother paused their eating.","\"Don’t say that, A-Yuan,\" Qi Yingxue interjected with a gentle smile. \"No job is inferior. A-Quan can do whatever she likes.\"","Qi Yuan, who adored her, merely snorted and glared at Qi Quan, waiting to ridicule her new job announcement.","Under everyone’s gaze, Qi Quan replied leisurely, \"I don’t enjoy socializing outside, so I’ll be writing novels from home. The website is Scream Literature City, and my pen name is ‘White Water Sage.’ Feel free to support me when you have time.\"","Everyone: \"...\""]},{"number":2,"title":"Chapter 2","paragraphs":["The whole family quietly finished breakfast like a flock of chickens, then gradually left the house, leaving only Qi Yuan and Qi Quan behind.","It was summer vacation, and Qi Yuan had just finished his college entrance exams. It was the perfect time to go wild and have fun, and he hadn’t stayed home much these past few days. But just now, Qi Quan’s shameless audacity had stunned him so much that suddenly, going out to play felt pointless.","The rest of the Qi family wasn’t interested in Qi Quan’s novels—they just thought it was childish play-acting. But Qi Yuan was determined to see what kind of laughably bad stories someone with only a high school diploma like Qi Quan could write.","Rubbing his hands in anticipation, he was ready to use those novels as fresh material to mock Qi Quan.","He had never been into novels before. When Qi Quan mentioned something called “Jianjiao Literature City,” Qi Yuan wasn’t sure of the exact characters, so he just typed the pinyin randomly on his phone—and sure enough, there was a website called “Jianjiao Literature City.”","What was the pen name again? Qi Quan said something like Bai Shui Zhenren?","That was easy to guess. “Quan” definitely split into “Bai Shui.” Even picking a pen name was so crude and straightforward—just like a country bumpkin!","Searching by the pen name, he actually found an article titled *Diary of a Wealthy Family*, newly posted with only one chapter.","Qi Yuan sneered inwardly. “Diary of a Wealthy Family,” huh? This country bumpkin is already itching to show off to online readers? Such a lightweight!","The one-line summary only confirmed his suspicion.","With a mindset full of nitpicking, he clicked into the first chapter.","[I’m Qi Baishui, with a ridiculously melodramatic background. As one of the top wealthy families in Jiangcheng, the Qi family lost their biological daughter twenty-two years ago—and that daughter is me.","When I was told the truth by my biological father’s secretary at a coffee shop, I was baffled. How could the sharp and wise Qi family not know the truth for twenty-two years, and suddenly discover it now?","Of course, that’s not important. What matters is that they want to raise two daughters but didn’t even bother to inform my adoptive parents at their graves. Sigh, how the world has changed, and people’s hearts have grown cold.]","Qi Yuan: “......”","He didn’t even know where to start with the sarcasm.","Patiently, he continued reading.","[The Qi family is truly extravagant. Their garden alone is much larger than the combined farmland of my adoptive parents. Strange though, when I was a kid walking through the fields, I felt exhausted. But now, facing such a vast garden, I don’t feel tired at all—in fact, I want to run a few laps.","Honestly, I really don’t fit in with the Qi family.","My mother is very beautiful. Even at fifty, her skin is still fair and firm, her figure slim and well-proportioned. She smiles beautifully but rarely smiles at me.","My father is tall and handsome, well-maintained, not a greasy middle-aged man with a big belly. When I started working at eighteen, I even encountered someone who fancied me. What a toad trying to eat a swan... well, okay, I’m not exactly a swan either.","Then there’s my older brother, the Qi family’s carefully groomed heir, educated among elites. I probably have nothing in common with him. After three months at home, the most he’s said to me is, “You’re not all there upstairs.”","Lastly, there’s the girl my age, the one who was switched with me by mistake. She’s very fair-skinned, which suits her name perfectly, and she looks great in clothes.]","The first time we met, she was wearing a sky-blue dress adorned with pearls. I was completely mesmerized. Maybe because I stared at the dress for too long, she felt a bit embarrassed and said she wanted to give the dress to me.","I refused, saying I was too dark-skinned to deserve such a beautiful dress. But she insisted that sky blue looked great with dark skin and urged me to try it on.","For a moment, I even began to doubt my own taste. Maybe I was just a country bumpkin who couldn’t understand the fashion of high society.","Nevertheless, I politely accepted and changed into the elegant, flowing long dress. As I expected, I was met with disdainful glances from everyone.","They didn’t say a word, but their looks were even more humiliating than any words could be.","Reading this, Qi Yuan frowned, trying to recall the scene from back then, but it was already a bit blurry in his memory.","Wasn’t it Qi Quan who was jealous of his sister and insisted on demanding the exact same dress?","This woman was deliberately slandering his sister!","Qi Yuan’s anger flared up. He wanted to storm upstairs and confront Qi Quan directly, but since he hadn’t finished reading the first chapter, he held back and kept reading.","“Those three months used to fly by for me because I was busy making money and had no time to think about anything else. But during those three months at the Qi family’s, time felt unbearably long.","Tonight, my mother picked out a black long dress for me to wear to an elder’s birthday banquet. After three months without running around, I’d gotten a bit paler, and the black really suited me. Turns out, the fashion sense of high society isn’t set in stone.”","Qi Yuan was stunned for a moment. He read it over several times but never saw the youngest son of the Qi family make an appearance.","What was going on? Everyone had their moment in the spotlight except him?","Qi Quan must be doing this on purpose!","Although the article never explicitly said it, anyone with eyes could tell that Qi Quan was describing her own story. Otherwise, why would it be called *The Diary of a Wealthy Family*? It was the classic “switched-at-birth” trope, and the names Qi and Qi were a play on words.","Qi Yuan felt uneasy and reluctantly read on.","The later parts described events at the banquet, but to him, it was all a bunch of meaningless nonsense.","He sneered repeatedly, then after a moment of searching, found the comment section and typed a line:","[What kind of nonsense is this? Terrible writing, awful plot, overly sentimental to the point of annoyance—in short, garbage!]","He hit send eagerly.","He couldn’t wait to see his comment appear in the section, to watch Qi Quan’s reaction when she saw it and felt embarrassed.","But—","[5839623: Comments from regular users and junior VIPs will be displayed only after passing review!]","Qi Yuan: ...","What kind of trash website is this?!","If Qi Quan can’t see his comment, how can he enjoy her awkward expression?","How can he bypass the review?","Suddenly, a spark lit up in his mind. He remembered someone in the group liked reading novels and might know the answer.","The “Foodie Fanatics” group.","A few people were chatting casually when Qi Yuan posted a question:","[I just posted a comment on Screaming Literature City, but it’s under review and not showing up. Does anyone know why?]","There was a brief silence in the group.","[Qian Kun: Got hacked?]","[Su Nuanuan: Send a voice message.]","Everyone else was just a bunch of question marks.","Qi Yuan was helpless and had no choice but to send a voice message, his tone quite irritated.","[Su Nuanuan: Confirmed, it’s Brother Yuan himself.]","[Qian Kun: Since when did you start reading novels?]","[Qi Yuan: Do you even know what’s going on?]","[Su Nuanuan: Didn’t you top-up? Ten bucks should do it.]","[Qian Kun: Capitalists really are ruthless.]","[Su Nuanuan: If you have the guts, say this in front of your dad @Qian Kun. What novels does Brother Yuan like? Can you recommend some? I’m running out of good reads lately.]","Qi Yuan misunderstood the meaning and thought he needed to recharge to make his comments visible. Frustrated, he said, “I don’t want to top-up. Is there no other way?”","He definitely didn’t want to give money to Qi Quan.","[Su Nuanuan: Then you’ll have to wait for the review to pass before your comment shows up. If you’re not in a hurry, you can just wait.]","[Qi Yuan: I want the author to see it as soon as possible.]","He wanted Qi Quan to suffer sooner!","[Su Nuanuan: If you’re really impatient, just use my account. I’m a premium VIP, so my comments show up instantly.]","Qi Yuan was taken aback for a moment and asked, “You can comment without paying?”","[Su Nuanuan: Free chapters, yes. Paid chapters require payment.]","Qi Yuan didn’t understand how commenting on novels worked. After asking so many questions, he was a bit impatient and didn’t want to dig deeper, so he said, “Then help me post a comment.”","[Su Nuanuan: Okay, Brother Yuan, send me the title and the comment you want to post.]","[Qi Yuan: Bai Shui Zhenren’s novel “The Diary of a Wealthy Family.” Don’t you dare read it—it’s really terrible. Just write: ‘This is really trash!’]","[Su Nuanuan: No problem!]","Qi Yuan put down his phone, feeling smug as he glanced toward the second floor. Since it was her first time posting, she must be hoping to win readers’ favor. From now on, every time she posted a chapter, he would leave a negative review to annoy her!","Meanwhile, Su Nuanuan opened the app, searched for Bai Shui Zhenren’s “The Diary of a Wealthy Family,” and clicked in. Wow, only one chapter had been updated, zero bookmarks, and one comment under review—probably Qi Yuan’s negative comment.","She was very curious. Su Nuanuan never read novels, so why was Qi Yuan so hostile toward this one that he bothered to leave a bad review?","Su Nuanuan was a veteran user of the site, often stuck in a reading drought. Whenever she found a decent novel, it was like finding a treasure.","She had been in a reading drought for half a year.","Qi Yuan’s strange commenting behavior sparked a flicker of interest in this fledgling novel.","Driven by curiosity, she opened the first chapter.","The story of the real and fake daughters of the Qi family had already spread through the upper circles of Longjiang City. Su Nuanuan had read many reverse harem and sweet revenge novels about real daughters overcoming fake ones, so she initially had high hopes for following the Qi family’s saga. But eventually, she lost interest when she realized the real daughter Qi Quan really couldn’t outmatch the fake daughter Qi Yingxue.","From the very first paragraph, she knew this was about the real and fake daughters of the Qi family. Who dared to be so bold as to base a story on the Qi family? No wonder Qi Yuan was so furious.","As she read further, she sensed something was off. The tone clearly belonged to the real daughter!","The real daughter was impressive—how daring to openly “mock” the Qi family. So it turned out that “The Diary of a Wealthy Family” was actually a true diary of a wealthy family!","Su Nuanuan immediately felt a surge of intense curiosity.","She eagerly continued reading, noticing that the author introduced every character—except Qi Yuan—which finally made her burst out laughing.","Qi Quan was definitely doing it on purpose!","What gossip could be more thrilling than the person involved revealing it themselves?","Su Nuanuan watched the whole thing with a spectator’s amusement, until she reached the very last part—","[After getting into the car, I glanced back and saw a man in a suit smoking by the flower bed outside the banquet hall. He should be Uncle Su from the Shengxin Group. Next to his legs was a little boy of five or six years old, wearing a pale yellow padded jacket printed with dandelion patterns. His hair and jacket were a bit damp as he climbed onto the man’s knee, calling out “Dad.”]","Su Nuanuan’s eyes widened in disbelief.","Uncle Su from Shengxin Group was her father, wasn’t he?","Did her dad have an illegitimate child?!"]},{"number":3,"title":"Chapter 3","paragraphs":["The momentary shock and anger passed, and Su Nuanuan quickly regained her composure.","Maybe it was just a clueless kid who called everyone \"Dad.\"","But the more she tried to reassure herself, the more unsettled she felt.","Her mother's health was fragile—what if her father really had a secret child outside?","Su Nuanuan abandoned the idea of leaving a comment, grabbed her car keys, and rushed out.","Her home wasn’t far from the company headquarters—just a ten-minute drive. When she arrived, Su Linhai was in a meeting.","She waited in his office. Despite the sweltering summer heat, cold sweat trickled down her back.","She kept replaying the happy memories of her family, unable to believe her father could ever cheat. His love for her mother, his devotion to her—none of it could be fake.","Hunched over with her knees drawn up, Su Nuanuan stared blankly at the family photo on the desk. In it, she sat cradled in her father’s arms, beaming with joy.","Tears welled up without warning.","The office door suddenly swung open.","Su Nuanuan lifted her tear-streaked face. A tall, lean middle-aged man stood in the doorway, his expression lighting up with surprise. His voice was gentle. \"Nuanuan, what brings you here—you’re crying?\"","He quickly shut the door and strode forward, his brows furrowing with concern. \"Who upset you?\"","Su Nuanuan had been spoiled by him her whole life. Hearing his soothing voice, the floodgates burst open, and tears poured uncontrollably.","\"Nuanuan, what happened? You’re scaring me!\" The creases at Su Linhai’s eyes deepened with worry.","His daughter was usually bright and cheerful—if she was crying like this, something serious must have happened.","Su Nuanuan sniffled, her voice thick. \"Did you attend Grandpa Du’s birthday banquet last night?\"","\"Yes,\" Su Linhai answered, confused.","\"I stayed home with Mom. Did you take someone else with you?\" She turned her head slightly, watching him.","Su Linhai: \"Of course not!\"","How could he have another woman by his side? Who dared spread such nonsense to his daughter?","Su Nuanuan already trusted him, and his firm denial only strengthened her belief. She was now convinced Qi Quan had fabricated the story—but she pressed further.","\"Did you smoke by the flower bed outside the banquet hall last night?\"","\"Ah... yes.\" Su Linhai chuckled awkwardly. \"Don’t worry, I didn’t bring the smell home.\"","His wife’s health couldn’t tolerate smoke, but last night, the weight on his mind had driven him to sneak a cigarette.","\"And a little boy called you 'Dad'?\" Su Nuanuan wiped her tears, forcing a teasing smile.","Su Linhai shook his head, bewildered. \"No.\"","\"Really? I heard it was a five or six-year-old boy in a pale yellow coat, right by your legs.\"","\"Absolutely not.\" A shadow flickered across Su Linhai’s face before he softened again. \"Nuanuan, don’t listen to baseless rumors.\"","Eighteen years of familiarity allowed Su Nuanuan to see right through him—the pain buried deep in his eyes, churning like storm clouds.","He was hiding something.","Her trust, just moments ago unshaken, wavered. She studied him silently before speaking. \"Dad, the boy’s coat had a dandelion print. You really don’t remember?\"","Su Linhai’s face drained of color. His lips trembled, and even his usually straight posture slumped slightly.","Su Nuanuan froze, thunderstruck.","It was true. Her father had lied to her.","Her eyes burned red, but before she could demand answers, Su Linhai’s expression darkened with fury. \"Who told you this?!\"","In all her eighteen years, her father had never raised his voice at her like this.","A surge of indignation and rage swelled in Su Nuanuan’s chest. She glared up at him. \"Who is that boy? Why did he call you Dad? Tell me!\"","\"Nuanuan, just tell me who gave you this information. Don’t ask anything else.\" Su Linhai’s hands shook as he gripped her shoulders.","Su Nuanuan thought he was trying to cover his tracks. A bitter laugh escaped her. \"Don’t bother. It’s already online—everyone knows!\"","\"Online?\" Su Linhai’s face turned ashen. \"Where?\"","Had a business rival dug up his past to humiliate him?","No.","Nuanuan said a boy called him \"Dad\" while he was smoking.","But when he smoked, no one was around.","What was going on?","Seeing his daughter’s unfamiliar, distrustful gaze, Su Linhai’s heart ached. He sighed. \"Nuanuan, it’s not what you think. Just show me what’s online first, and I’ll explain everything, alright?\"","Su Nuanuan’s gaze fell on the streaks of gray at his temples. Her anger softened.","Maybe she had misunderstood.","She couldn’t just take Qi Quan’s word for it, could she?","She pulled up Qi Quan’s post and handed it to Su Linhai. \"Read this.\"","Su Linhai had little business dealings with the Qi family, but their younger generations mingled, so he was somewhat familiar with them. The Qi family’s affairs weren’t exactly secret—he’d heard bits and pieces despite his busy schedule.","He skimmed the earlier sections about the \"true and fake heiresses\" with disinterest, frowning—until he reached the final paragraph.","Su Linhai stood frozen.","Hearing Su Nuanuan’s retelling hadn’t affected him much, but reading those words firsthand shattered his composure.","The seasoned businessman covered his face and broke down sobbing.","Su Nuanuan was stunned. She fumbled to comfort him—she’d never seen her father cry, let alone like this.","It tore at her heart.","\"Dad, what’s going on?\" she asked hesitantly.","Su Linhai wept for a while. Facing his daughter’s concern, he had so much to say but no words to express it.","When he finally steadied himself, his voice was hoarse. \"The person who wrote this... is the Qi family’s recently returned daughter, right?\"","\"Probably.\"","Su Linhai spoke solemnly. \"I need to meet her.\"","Qi Yuan lounged on the living room sofa, growing increasingly impatient as Su Nuanuan failed to post the comment he’d asked for. Annoyed, he tagged her in the group chat:","[@Su Nuanuan What’s the hold-up? My comment’s already been approved, and you still haven’t posted yours?]","[Qian Kun: Bro, relax. It’s fine now. Maybe Nuanuan got held up with something.]","[Qi Yuan: What could possibly hold her up?]","The moment he sent that, Su Nuanuan messaged him privately:","[Qi Yuan, was this post written by Qi Quan?]","Qi Yuan snapped back: [Why does that matter? Scared to comment now that you know it’s her?]","[Su Nuanuan: No. My dad read it. He wants to meet Qi Quan. Is she home? We’ll come over now if she is.]","[...]","Qi Yuan: [...]","What kind of mess was this?!","He suddenly recalled the last part of the post. He’d assumed Qi Quan had added it for dramatic flair—but now... had she stirred up real trouble?","How did this woman manage to cause chaos even through fiction?!"]},{"number":4,"title":"Chapter 4","paragraphs":["After finishing breakfast, Qi Quan went upstairs to meditate and cultivate.","She didn’t care about the data of her new story, but the system kept monitoring it in real-time. It waited until she finished her meal before asking, [Do you want to know the stats of your new story?]","[No.]","[...]","The system was about to report the dismal results—zero collections, zero comments—when it detected an unmoderated comment in the review section.","It cheered excitedly, [There’s a comment! Too bad we can’t see the content yet.]","[Oh.]","[Hurry and check the author dashboard to see what it says!]","Qi Quan had posted the first chapter as bait—otherwise, she wouldn’t have bothered telling the Qi family her pen name.","Last night, when leaving the banquet hall, she had indeed seen the little boy standing beside Su Linhai’s leg. No one else had noticed him except her.","Because of this, she had devised her writing plan.","It would be difficult to make a name for herself purely through literary skill, so she had to find another path—one better suited to her strengths.","The Su and Qi families weren’t particularly close, but Su Nuanuan, the Su family’s only daughter, was friends with Qi Yuan. And Qi Yuan would never pass up an opportunity to mock her. This meant there was a good chance Su Nuanuan would come across her story.","Qi Quan was only speculating—she couldn’t guarantee that Qi Yuan and Su Nuanuan would act exactly as she predicted.","She just wanted to set the bait. The rest didn’t interest her.","But the system was acting more like an anxious newbie author than she was. Wanting peace to cultivate, Qi Quan finally opened the author dashboard.","The dashboard displayed the moderated comment. The system had been full of anticipation, but when it saw the content, it felt a chill run down its spine, its entire body turning cold.","Furious, it roared, [How dare this person say such awful things!]","Qi Quan, however, remained unruffled.","She never underestimated the malice of people.","The system grumbled, [I’m going to track their IP! I’ll find out who this cowardly bastard is!]","[Doxxing is illegal.]","The system deflated, muttering resentfully, [First-person narration might be niche, but that’s no reason to call it trash! Can’t people be more open-minded? If they don’t like it, they don’t have to read it.]","Qi Quan said calmly, [Once you post something on a public platform, you accept that anyone can comment. Of course, if the insults cross the line, you can report them.]","This comment wasn’t quite at the level of personal attacks, so reporting wasn’t necessary.","The system: [...]","If the host was always this detached, could she really write a satisfying revenge story about the real heiress’s comeback?","Qi Quan closed the dashboard and resumed her meditation.","Time passed slowly.","Downstairs, Qi Yuan received a private message from Su Nuanuan. His mind raced through countless possibilities before settling on one fact: Uncle Su was coming over.","Though he acted recklessly in front of Qi Quan, he was still reliable when it came to important matters. If Su Linhai, the chairman of Shengxin, was visiting and only he—a junior—was home, it wouldn’t be appropriate for him to receive the guest alone.","He immediately called Qi Father and relayed the news. Qi Father assured him he’d return as soon as possible.","Su Linhai, in his distress, had forgotten basic etiquette. Overwhelmed by complicated emotions, he hadn’t informed the Qi family in advance before rushing over.","Meanwhile, Qi Changrong was already on his way back.","When he received his son’s call, he was deeply puzzled. The Su and Qi families rarely interacted—why would Su Linhai suddenly pay a visit?","Upon hearing it was Qi Quan’s doing, Qi Changrong frowned. When he first learned about the daughter mix-up, he had felt some guilt toward his biological daughter. But after Qi Quan returned home and kept stirring up trouble, that guilt had evaporated.","In the business world, reputation was everything. A biological daughter with no emotional ties to him, who constantly embarrassed him, was hardly someone he could welcome with open arms.","Before, Qi Quan’s antics had been minor, and Qi Changrong had tolerated them. But now she had provoked Su Linhai—this was beyond unacceptable. It was time to discipline her properly.","His phone chimed. Qi Yuan had sent him a link to Qi Quan’s story.","At breakfast, Qi Quan had mentioned writing a novel, but Qi Changrong hadn’t paid it much attention. Who would’ve thought she’d cause trouble before noon?","He needed to see what she had written to anger Su Linhai so he could clean up the mess accordingly.","He clicked on the first chapter and read with a furrowed brow.","When he reached the line about not informing her adoptive parents at their graves, he wasn’t sure how to react.","At the part praising his wife, his expression softened slightly. When he saw the compliment about his own handsomeness, the wrinkles at the corners of his eyes relaxed. But when he read about a greasy man lusting after his daughter, his lips pressed into a tight line.","What kind of scum would dare covet his daughter? Disgusting!","Further down, when he saw his eldest son, Lin, frequently calling Qi Quan \"not right in the head,\" a flicker of concern crossed his eyes. No matter what, Qi Quan had grown up outside the family, without proper education—that wasn’t her fault. Lin really shouldn’t have mocked her like that.","As for the petty squabbles over clothes and taste between the girls, he paid them no mind.","Wait—why wasn’t Qi Yuan mentioned?","Qi Changrong kept reading, completely unaware that he was already engrossed, eagerly anticipating more.","For him, this was a novel way to understand his biological daughter’s thoughts. He was a traditional, stern father, not one to express emotions openly. Communication with his children had always been minimal. This was the first time he could so clearly glimpse into a child’s mind—it was a strange but intriguing feeling.","Then the final paragraph came into view.","\"She’s got some nerve!\" Qi Changrong smacked his seat.","Even if Su Linhai really did have an illegitimate child, what business was it of hers? Why did she have to write about it?","Maybe Lin wasn’t wrong—she really wasn’t right in the head.","The driver up front flinched and stepped on the gas.","The car pulled through the gates.","Before Qi Changrong even stepped out, he spotted the Su family’s vehicle.","Straightening his suit, he entered the living room, already rehearsing his words—only to find Qi Yuan alone on the sofa.","\"Where’s Chairman Su?\" he asked, puzzled.","Qi Yuan was just as confused. He pointed upstairs.","He didn’t get it either. Shouldn’t this kind of thing be handled by the parents? But Su Linhai had arrived and immediately asked to see Qi Quan—he hadn’t even waited for Qi Father.","Was the situation really that serious?","Father and son exchanged a glance, their expressions equally grave.","---","In the second-floor reception room, Qi Quan sat on the sofa in loose, beige loungewear, sipping tea leisurely.","Su Nuanuan studied her with curiosity.","She had seen Qi Quan once before, shortly after her return to the Qi family. Back then, Qi Quan had been dark-skinned and thin, her eyes brimming with poorly concealed unease.","She was different now.","Three months later, Qi Quan had grown fairer. The beige clothes didn’t clash with her at all—instead, they complemented her serene, gentle aura.","The sharp edges and hostility from before had faded, replaced by a calmer, more composed demeanor. Yet this very composure made her seem more distant.","A closer look revealed flawless features—delicate, intelligent eyes, and a beauty that even surpassed Qi Yingxue’s.","\"Did you need something?\" Qi Quan set down her teacup, her movements graceful and unhurried.","Su Linhai only now realized how impulsive he’d been. He hesitated, unsure how to broach the subject with a junior.","Understanding her father’s dilemma, Su Nuanuan took the lead. \"Sister Qi Quan, I wanted to ask—did you write The Diary of a Wealthy Family under the pen name Bai Shui Zhenren?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Then, the last paragraph of Chapter One—were you writing about my dad?\" Su Nuanuan got straight to the point.","Qi Quan remained calm. \"Yes.\"","\"That little boy—did you really see him?\" Su Linhai couldn’t hold back any longer and spoke up. \"Miss Qi, can you tell me what pants and shoes he was wearing? What did he look like?\"","After expanding his business, Su Linhai had seen much of the world. Many in his circle were superstitious—some for peace of mind, others out of genuine belief.","Back then, Su Linhai had believed too. He’d sought out many masters, but in the end, nothing came of it.","For years, this matter had weighed on his heart like a heavy shackle, suffocating him to the point where even breathing felt difficult.","Qi Quan’s novel had been like a shot of adrenaline, filling him with unparalleled hope. Yet, he feared disappointment so much that he felt adrift, unsure of where to turn.","He stared intently at Qi Quan, his eyes filled with an obsession and pain even Su Nuanuan couldn’t comprehend.","Qi Quan met his gaze calmly. \"Black cotton pants, with Donald Duck printed on the left knee. His shoes were white, with a rainbow stripe along the soles.\"","\"Anything else?\" Su Linhai leaned forward, fists clenched, his entire body trembling.","\"A mole on his right earlobe.\"","\"It’s him! It really is him!\" Su Linhai looked almost crazed. \"You really saw him call me ‘Dad’? He called me ‘Dad’?\"","The man suddenly hunched over, covering his face as he broke into loud sobs.","Su Nuanuan: \"...\"","She glanced at Qi Quan. The tall, slender woman remained seated composedly on the sofa, her expression unreadable, as if she’d long grown accustomed to such reactions.","\"Dad, stop crying.\" Su Nuanuan patted Su Linhai’s shoulder, awkwardly trying to comfort him. \"Is there anything else you want to ask Qi Quan?\"","Su Linhai, after all, had weathered the storms of the business world for years. He quickly regained his composure, wiping his tears. \"Forgive me, Miss Qi. That was unbecoming.\"","Qi Quan nodded. \"It’s only natural.\"","\"Since you can see him, Miss Qi, could you grant me this wish?\" Su Linhai’s gaze was earnest. \"Don’t worry—payment won’t be an issue.\"","Su Nuanuan: What payment? Was this what she thought it was? Who was she? Where was she? Had she stumbled into the wrong genre?","Even the system couldn’t help asking, [What does he mean by that?]","Qi Quan smiled faintly, lifting her teacup. Her tone was serene as she replied, \"I’m sorry, Mr. Su. I’m just an ordinary writer.\""]},{"number":5,"title":"Chapter 5","paragraphs":["Su Linhai was a businessman—when emotions faded, rationality returned.","Hearing Qi Quanting’s response, he wasn’t disappointed.","In the past, he had spent a fortune hiring masters of dubious skill. Now, for this sliver of hope, he was willing to do whatever it took to win Qi Quan’s favor.","\"Miss Qi, to be honest, I’ve consulted many masters, but none have ever given me an answer,\" he said, offering his sincerity. \"If you can help me find him, you’ll be a benefactor to the Su family.\"","The implication was clear: if Qi Quan helped him, no one in Longjiang City would dare cross her—not even the Qi family.","Yet Qi Quan remained unmoved, repeating the same line: \"I’m sorry, but I’m just a writer. To me, this is simply a novel in progress.\"","Su Linhai was about to speak again when Su Nuanuan stopped him.","Though she didn’t know who the little boy was, her years of reading fiction told her she might have just stepped into a mysterious world.","At least it had nothing to do with a \"love child.\"","She understood Qi Quan’s meaning and tugged at her father’s sleeve. \"Qi Quan, my dad and I will bookmark your story and become your loyal readers, eagerly awaiting each update.\"","Only then did Qi Quan smile. \"Thank you for your support.\"","Su Linhai began to grasp the situation—this Miss Qi operated differently from other masters.","He stood and bowed. \"When can we expect the next chapter?\"","\"Ten tonight.\"","\"Understood. I won’t disturb you further.\" With a respectful nod, Su Linhai left the parlor.","As he descended the stairs, he ran into Qi Changrong, who was on his way up.","\"Chairman Qi, my apologies for the intrusion,\" Su Linhai said, extending his hand first.","Qi Changrong was baffled. Shouldn’t he be furious? Why so polite?","Masking his confusion, he shook Su Linhai’s hand warmly. \"My child was reckless. Please don’t take it to heart. I’ll have her delete the article immediately.\"","Su Linhai: ???","\"No, no, Chairman Qi, you misunderstand,\" he hurriedly explained. \"Miss Qi’s novel is excellent. I’m quite fond of it.\"","Qi Changrong: ???","Qi Yuan was equally lost and pulled Su Nuanuan aside. \"What’s going on? Your father, he—\"","\"Don’t ask,\" Su Nuanuan waved him off. \"I’m just as confused. If you really want to know, check the update at ten tonight.\"","Qi Yuan: \"...\"","He didn’t want to give Qi Quan more clicks, but his curiosity was unbearable.","After exchanging pleasantries, Su Linhai couldn’t wait any longer. \"Chairman Qi, I apologize for the sudden visit, but I have urgent matters to attend to. Next time, I’ll make it up to you and Miss Qi with a proper meal.\"","Qi Changrong forced a smile. \"You’re too kind, Chairman Su.\"","What on earth was happening?","Once in the car, Su Linhai turned to Su Nuanuan. \"Do you understand what Miss Qi meant?\"","\"I think so.\" She opened the Scream app and showed him the story page. \"By emphasizing she’s a writer, she’s hinting that we should engage with her on those terms.\"","Su Linhai was lost. \"How?\"","\"Writers thrive on traffic—bookmarks, comments, and engagement. So we give her that.\"","After her patient explanation, Su Linhai downloaded the app, registered an account, and—in true tycoon fashion—topped up 100,000 yuan, dropping a thousand \"deepwater\" rewards.","A mediocre new story suddenly rocketed to the top of the homepage’s reward leaderboard, leaving the competition in the dust.","Su Linhai single-handedly inflated the day’s reward revenue.","Su Nuanuan: \"...\"","Though she was generous with rewards, her father’s spending was on another level.","The homepage exposure drew readers, especially those drawn to wealthy-family dramas.","The title was normal, but the synopsis? What even was that?","And the bookmarks? Two?!","Ah, a pay-to-win player.","The comments were sparse. The first was a negative review. The second, from a user named \"ForestSea,\" had an \"Invincible Overlord\" badge and read like a bot:","\"This story moved me to tears. I eagerly await the next update. Thank you, author, for such a masterpiece!\"","Readers: \"...\"","One chapter in, and you’re already crying? How desperate can you be?","Skeptical, they clicked into Chapter 1.","Huh? First-person POV? Weird, but let’s see.","Ah, the cliché \"switched at birth\" trope. Fine, let’s keep reading.","Some closed the tab immediately. Others bookmarked it. A few left scathing reviews:","[LaughingMyAssOff: Author’s profile says they’re a beginner, but this reads like a grocery list. Put in some effort.]","[XX’sDad: No amount of exposure can save bad writing. Rethink your plot.]","[RemindMeToPrepLessons: Where’s the tension? If you’re doing the switched-at-birth trope, go full wish-fulfillment or revenge. What’s with the last paragraph? Stepmom raising kids now?]","Su Nuanuan bombarded the comments with rewards and left her own:","[DyingForANewRead: Go, PlainWater! Can’t wait for more!]","In her bedroom on the Qi estate’s second floor, Qi Quan’s system buzzed with updates.","100,000 yuan! After the platform’s cut, that’s 50,000 in your pocket! And you’re on the reward leaderboard—traffic incoming!","Qi Quan arched a brow. Though 50,000 was pocket change in her past life, for an unknown writer, it was a fortune. Su Linhai’s willingness to pay for updates proved his sincerity in finding the child’s burial site.","Ugh, more hate comments!","Qi Quan chuckled. The system had already forgotten its earlier terror.","She reminded it: There’ll be more divination fees.","The system froze. Divination fees? As in...?","Yes.","After a long pause, it stammered: So that kid by Su Linhai’s leg... was he a... a...","Yes.","The system shrieked and went silent.","Qi Quan sighed. For a system, its fear of ghosts was pathetic.","She resumed her cultivation but paused at the sound of footsteps. A knock followed.","Opening the door, she met Qi Changrong’s stern face. \"What is it?\"","\"What did you two talk about?\"","Qi Quan blinked. \"He said he loves my novel and can’t wait for the next chapter.\"","\"...\"","\"I need to write now. We’ll talk later.\"","The door shut in Qi Changrong’s face.","He sheepishly went downstairs and bumped into Qi Yuan lurking at the stairwell. Irritated, he smacked the back of Qi Yuan’s head. \"What are you sneaking around for?\"","Qi Yuan had already been worn down by the inexplicable events, but one thing still gnawed at him.","\"It’s just a fabricated story. Why is Uncle Su Linhai taking it so seriously?\"","\"Fabricated?\" Qi Changrong shot him a glare.","From Su Linhai’s reaction, it was clear the last part of the story wasn’t baseless. In fact, it didn’t offend him at all—it might even be one of Su Linhai’s well-kept secrets.","So how did Qi Quan know about it?","Qi Yuan scoffed. \"What ‘Qi Family’? What ‘Jiangcheng’? None of this ever happened. Uncle Su doesn’t even have a son.\"","\"Can’t you really see it?\" Qi Changrong saw through him. \"I think you’re just upset you didn’t get a role in the story.\"","\"...\"","\"Look at you, so pathetic.\"","\"Dad!\" Qi Yuan’s face flushed red.","Qi Changrong ignored him. There was too much work at the company—he didn’t have time for his son’s nonsense.","Longjiang City Film Studios.","After reading the first chapter of Diary of a Wealthy Family, Qi Yingxue was so furious she threw her phone.","She’d heard Qi Quan mention it during breakfast and meant to check it out when she had time. But her morning schedule was packed, and she only got a free moment now.","She had debuted at eighteen through a talent show, starred in a few web dramas, and was now a rising star in the entertainment industry. With her family background and looks, her career had been smooth sailing—except for Qi Quan, the one thorn in her side.","When Qi Quan said she’d write a novel to make money, Qi Yingxue had been dismissive. She didn’t believe that country bumpkin could write anything decent—it would only humiliate her.","But curiosity got the better of her, and she clicked in to read.","What she saw made her blood boil—and also stirred a pang of guilt. She had secretly tried to suppress Qi Quan, but she’d been careful to cover her tracks. Yet here was Qi Quan, boldly writing it all out and painting her as the villain!","Glancing at the pitiful number of bookmarks and the so-called \"invincible overlord\" status, Qi Yingxue sneered. At the end of the day, wasn’t she just buying traffic with the Qi family’s money?","Then she scrolled to the comments.","There were both negative and positive reviews, with some even downvoting the criticism.","Who has such terrible taste? How could anyone like this trash?","The web dramas Qi Yingxue had acted in were all adapted from novels on Scream Literature City. To study her roles, she’d registered an account and bought the originals.","Perfect—she could leave a bad review herself.","[A Tree of Red Blossoms: The female lead is so paranoid, seeing enemies everywhere. The writing is also weirdly passive-aggressive. I prefer heroines with more grace.]","Several new readers liked the comment or replied with \"+1.\"","Satisfied, Qi Yingxue went back to filming.","Meanwhile, the system snapped out of its sulking only to find a pile of negative reviews—nearly crying again.","[Host, the hate comments are piling up! This ‘A Tree of Red Blossoms’ person actually insulted the real heiress! What kind of person does that?]","Qi Quan replied lazily, [Probably Qi Yingxue. She’s naturally opposed to the real heiress.]","[Huh? How’d you know?]","[\"A tree of red blossoms reflecting snow\"—just a guess.]","[...]","After a long pause, the system hesitantly asked, [Actually... did you divine it? Are you one of those legendary mystics?]","Qi Quan smiled without answering and went downstairs for lunch.","At home, only she and Qi Yuan were eating.","They sat across from each other. In the past, he would’ve mocked her without fail, but today, he was eerily quiet.","The meal passed in awkward silence.","As soon as he finished, Qi Yuan bolted for the door—if he stayed any longer, he’d suffocate.","\"Wait.\" Qi Quan suddenly called out to him.","He didn’t turn around, but his steps halted. \"What?\" he grunted.","\"Don’t drink today.\"","Qi Yuan: \"...\"","Who does she think she is, telling him whether he can drink or not?","He’d drink if he wanted to!"]},{"number":6,"title":"Chapter 6","paragraphs":["After dinner, Qi Quan took a walk in the garden.","The villa was empty except for her and the servants. Occasionally, a few maids would gather and whisper among themselves, their words carried to her ears by the wind.","\"Have you read Miss Qi’s novel?\"","\"Yes, yes! I read it as soon as I heard about it this morning.\"","\"I never realized before, but Miss Qi has had it tough.\"","\"But did she slander Miss Yingxue?\"","\"Not really. I happened to be outside the door that day, and Miss Yingxue did say something like that.\"","\"Really? Why didn’t you mention it before?\"","\"Mr. Su came to see Miss Qi today—was he upset about the last part?\"","\"He seemed fine to me.\"","Qi Quan channeled a bit of spiritual energy to her ears, blocking out the distant chatter.","[System, how many reputation points do I have now?]","The system promptly reported:","[Current stats: 203 article bookmarks, 100,005 mines received, 2 positive reviews, 5 negative reviews. Bookmarks, mines, and positive reviews convert to reputation points at a 1:1 ratio, while each negative review deducts one point. Your current total is 100,203 reputation points, which converts to approximately 100.2 days of lifespan.]","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She said, [I remember there were two positive reviews.]","[Reviews are categorized as valid or invalid. For example, the positive reviews from the Su father-daughter pair and the negative reviews from Qi Yuan and Qi Yingxue don’t count. Only objective feedback from uninvolved readers is valid.]","Qi Quan accepted this explanation—it prevented manipulation by fake reviewers and seemed fair.","But—","[What about donations? Are they all valid?]","[Given that Screaming Literature City prohibits review and bookmark manipulation but allows mine donations, all donations are counted as valid.]","Qi Quan: \"...\"","After her walk, she returned to her room, sat cross-legged on the bed, and pulled out a short strand of hair from somewhere. She snapped her fingers, and a faint blue flame flickered to life, consuming the strand and releasing a wisp of smoke.","The system was stunned.","Holy crap!","Never in its wildest dreams did it imagine that a writing system like itself would witness supernatural phenomena firsthand.","The smoke curled into a thin line, drifting steadily in one direction. Qi Quan’s eyes gleamed as she performed a quick calculation, already understanding the answer.","Once the smoke dissipated, she stood up and headed to the computer room. She opened a document and began typing the next chapter.","The system couldn’t resist asking:","[Host, what were you doing just now?]","Qi Quan:","[Using a direct blood relative’s hair to locate the child’s whereabouts.]","[Was it Su Linhai’s hair?]","[Yes.]","[When did you get his hair? I didn’t see it.]","[While you were busy being scared of ghosts.]","[...]","Qi Quan ignored it after that, her fingers flying across the keyboard without pause. She finished the update quickly, saved it in the drafts, set a timer for publication, and then resumed her meditation.","Before nightfall, the Qi family—minus Qi Yuan and Qi Yingxue—gathered around the dining table, waiting for the servants to serve dinner.","Qi Mother, Gu Qiao, looked weary as she said, \"Yingxue is busy with work and called to say she won’t be back for dinner. As for Yuan, who knows where he’s run off to—he didn’t even call.\"","Qi Quan quietly fiddled with her phone, offering no response. Qi Eldest Brother was a man of few words and rarely spoke unless necessary.","Only Qi Changrong offered comfort:","\"The children are grown now—they have their own lives. Don’t worry too much.\"","The Qi family still held some influence in Longjiang City, so no one would dare cause trouble for them. He wasn’t concerned about Qi Yuan’s safety.","Gu Qiao sighed softly.","She had three children. Her eldest son had been raised to be as cold as ice and was never close to her. The daughter she’d lovingly raised for twenty-two years turned out not to be her own. And her youngest son had been spoiled into a reckless troublemaker.","Her gaze drifted to Qi Quan.","This was her biological daughter, who had spent twenty-two years away from home. Her personality was already set, and she’d caused quite a stir when she first returned.","Gu Qiao was too old now—she didn’t have the energy to discipline her anymore.","She could only hope that Qi Quan would keep her word from this morning and focus on writing novels at home instead of stirring up trouble.","Remembering the novel, Gu Qiao’s maternal instincts kicked in, and she asked, \"Xiao Quan, you mentioned writing a novel this morning. Have you started? Can I read it?\"","Before Qi Quan could respond, Qi Changrong cut in:","\"That’s the child’s privacy. Let’s not pry.\"","He knew his wife was deeply attached to Yingxue. If she read Qi Quan’s novel and saw any resentment toward Yingxue, it would only upset her.","Better not to look.","Gu Qiao was about to agree when Qi Quan said, \"I told you the website and pen name this morning. You’re free to read it if you want.\"","Gu Qiao: \"...\"","She couldn’t admit that she hadn’t paid attention and didn’t remember.","Luckily, dinner was served just then. Qi Changrong cleared his throat.","\"Let’s eat.\"","Qi Lin had no interest in anything outside of work and pretended not to hear.","The four of them ate in silence before retiring to their rooms.","At ten o’clock that night, the Su father-daughter pair huddled in the study, refreshing the app for updates.","Su Linhai asked impatiently, \"Wasn’t it supposed to update at ten?\"","\"Don’t worry, the site’s servers are slow. There’s always a delay—just wait a bit longer,\" Su Nuanuan reassured him, long accustomed to the website’s sluggish performance.","Su Linhai: \"...\"","At 10:02, the update finally appeared!","They eagerly clicked in.","[On the way back, I couldn’t shake the feeling that something was off.","Maybe it was the dim lighting, but the child’s face seemed unnaturally pale, his hair and clothes dripping wet—completely out of place. Uncle Su didn’t react to his presence at all, as if he couldn’t see him.","Had I imagined it?","The cold air in the car sent chills down my spine.","Then I remembered—just as the car door closed, the little boy had locked eyes with me.","His pupils were too large, too dark, filled with a coldness that didn’t match his age.","I shuddered.","Back home, I soaked in a hot bath, trying to drive the chill from my bones. But even after lying in bed, the icy sensation clung to me like a stubborn shadow.","I drifted into a fitful sleep and dreamed of the boy.","He smiled at me, but his facial muscles twitched unnaturally, twisting his expression into something eerie.","He said, \"Sister, you saw me, didn’t you?\"","I nodded.","His grin widened, stretching nearly to his ears, his eyes alight with excitement. \"Sister, I’m so cold and lonely. Can you help me?\"","I nodded again.","His voice rose, hoarse as if damaged: \"I’m staying here now. Can you tell my dad? I want to go home.\"","A constellation of glowing dots formed words before my eyes:","Longtan City, Ningtao County, Seven Stars Town, Red River Village.","I jolted awake in terror.]","The Su father-daughter pair sat frozen in shock.","Su Nuanuan had only suspected before, but now her blood ran cold. Pale-faced, she asked Su Linhai, \"Dad... who is he?\"","Tears streamed down Su Linhai’s face as he abruptly stood and called his secretary. \"Little Li, postpone tomorrow’s meeting. I need to travel.\"","After hanging up, he dialed an old contact in Longtan City. \"Old Feng, I need a professional salvage team—cost is no issue. Thanks.\"","Based on the previous mention of \"hair and clothes dripping with water,\" if the location is correct, the child is most likely buried in the riverbed.","\"Dad, I'm coming too!\" Su Nuanuan said, her eyes reddened, as she waited for him to finish the call. \"Don't hide it from me anymore.\"","Su Linhai wiped away his tears, his voice hoarse. \"He's your brother. His name is Su Rong. Your mother isn't well, so let's keep this from her for now.\"","They could tell her once they confirmed it.","Accompanying the Su father and daughter in their pursuit was Qi Changrong.","He hid in his study, secretly refreshing the latest update.","Before reading, he never expected the plot to take a supernatural turn.","Having been in business for years, Qi Changrong didn’t believe in feng shui or the occult, but that didn’t stop many of his business partners from doing so. Over time, he’d picked up some knowledge about it.","Some even hired masters for spiritual guidance.","He’d never agreed with such practices, but after reading the part about the child’s haunting dream, he couldn’t help but frown deeply.","Logically, even people of his generation didn’t know the Su family’s secret—so how could Qi Quan possibly know?","The only explanation left was the most improbable one.","A chill ran down his spine.","He still refused to believe it—there had to be some coincidence at play.","He continued reading.","[Only then did the eerie coldness finally leave me.","I’d promised him I’d tell Mr. Su, so I couldn’t go back on my word. But I was just a nobody with no connections—how could I possibly meet the Chairman of Shengxin Group?","I agonized until breakfast the next day.","Because of my outburst at the birthday banquet the night before, my family treated me with disdain—except for the fake heiress, who gave me a faint smile.","\"Look at this toad lusting after swan meat. Why don’t you check yourself in a mirror first?\" A mocking voice came from my right.","I turned in surprise, but no matter where I looked, I couldn’t see anyone. My heart sank—was I encountering another ghost?","I hunched my shoulders and lowered my head to sip my porridge.","\"Living here, eating for free every day—how shameless.\"","Again?","I couldn’t hold back. \"Aren’t you eating for free too?\"","If you’re a ghost, why stick around? Must be the family’s offerings you can’t let go of.","\"I’m a minor!\" he retorted indignantly.","My heart ached. \"When I was a minor, I never got to eat at home.\"","The voice fell silent.","Mother seemed to soften, speaking gently. \"From now on, if you want anything, just tell us. We’ll take care of you for life.\"","I blurted out, \"I want to meet Mr. Su from Shengxin.\"","The room went dead silent. Their eyes all said the same thing: Who do you think you are? The Chairman isn’t someone you can just meet.","I hung my head in shame.","If I couldn’t meet Mr. Su, if I failed to fulfill that child’s request—what then?]","The chapter ended there.","Qi Changrong: \"...\"","He’d never done anything like this, so why did he feel inexplicably guilty?","Recalling how Su Linhai had come looking for Qi Quan earlier, he’d rushed home after receiving the call, fearing she’d caused trouble again. But it turned out he’d misjudged her.","Wasn’t this just another form of underestimation?","Things he’d overlooked before suddenly became clear.","As guilt gnawed at him, noise erupted downstairs—probably Qi Yuan returning after another night of mischief.","Thinking of the awful way he treated Qi Quan, Qi Changrong’s anger flared.","His study was on the third floor. He descended to the second floor just as Qi Yuan, reeking of alcohol, staggered up the steps. He opened his mouth to scold him—","Only for his unfilial son to grin drunkenly, cheeks flushed.","\"Dad, I’ve met someone! I want to marry her!\""]},{"number":7,"title":"Chapter 7","paragraphs":["That night, the Qi Family erupted into a fierce argument.","The stern father, Qi Changrong, and his rebellious son, Qi Yuan, engaged in a heated battle that lasted ten minutes before being stopped by Gu Qiao and Qi Lin, who rushed over upon hearing the commotion.","\"What’s all this noise in the middle of the night?\" Gu Qiao frowned as she caught the scent of alcohol on Qi Yuan. \"You’ve been drinking? You’re still young—stay away from alcohol.\"","Qi Lin swept a cold glance at Qi Yuan but remained silent.","\"Mom,\" Qi Yuan ignored Gu Qiao’s reprimand, grinning shamelessly instead, \"I’ve fallen for a girl. I want to marry her.\"","A blush spread across the young man’s face, his expression unmistakably lovestruck.","Gu Qiao: ???","\"How old are you?!\" Qi Changrong scolded again. \"Marriage? Absolutely not!\"","Gu Qiao added, \"Xiao Yuan, you’ve just graduated high school. Dating is fine, but marriage should wait until after college. You’re a man—you need to respect women and take responsibility.\"","\"I can’t wait any longer. I want to marry her now!\" Qi Yuan remained stubborn, insisting on bringing the girl home.","Qi Changrong’s face darkened further.","Qi Lin, the eldest brother, observed coldly from the sidelines. Though he rarely interacted with his family, having lived with them for over a decade, he understood Qi Yuan well.","On the surface, Qi Yuan seemed carefree and reckless, but his impressive academic performance proved he wasn’t as thoughtless as he appeared.","His hostility toward Qi Quan stemmed from his deep bond with Qi Yingxue—he feared losing his closest sister.","In this matter, he was acting immature, but in others, he wasn’t usually this unreasonable.","Qi Lin decisively said, \"Take him to the hospital.\"","Qi Changrong: \"...\"","Gu Qiao: \"...\"","The four of them headed to the hospital together.","Upstairs in the bedroom, the system marveled in Qi Quan’s mind: Qi Yuan doesn’t seem like the type to be a crazed romantic. Even though this happened in the original plot, it’s still hard to believe.","In the original story, Qi Yuan had indeed fallen head over heels for a girl at first sight and insisted on marrying her.","Unfortunately, the girl had other suitors—all top-tier heirs of Longjiang City.","Qi Yuan, unfortunately, became one of them.","But he was younger than the others, treated like a kid brother, and the girl paid him no attention.","Heartbroken and desperate, the once bright and cheerful boy turned gloomy and bitter.","And the original host’s death was indirectly linked to these obsessive heirs.","At lunch earlier, Qi Quan had noticed the ominous shadow over Qi Yuan’s forehead and, out of basic decency, warned him.","Whether Qi Yuan heeded her advice or not was his own business. If this was truly unavoidable, he would meet his demise regardless.","But she had done her part—her conscience was clear.","The system suddenly recalled something and asked mysteriously: Host, when you told him not to drink at lunch, did you foresee this?","Qi Quan smiled. Alcohol is bad for health.","The system felt it had stumbled upon a hidden expert and spoke more respectfully: Boss, as of now, the story’s collection count has risen to 345, and comments are pouring in—though no donations yet.","Hmm.","Oddly, the reader who left a negative review on the first chapter has reappeared.","Qi Quan was also puzzled. She didn’t understand readers’ preferences.","Luo Xiaoyu was a veteran user of Screaming Literature City, having dabbled in nearly every genre with no particular dislikes.","Bored, she often scrolled through the site’s rankings, searching for new favorites. When something excited her, she’d even toss a few \"thunder\" donations to the author.","Fresh out of college last year, she now taught at a middle school in the county. With summer break in full swing, she had returned to her rural hometown to relax.","The countryside offered little entertainment, but her phone was enough—she either played games or read novels.","Lately, however, she’d hit a dry spell, unable to find anything gripping enough to binge.","That morning, while casually browsing the rankings, she noticed a new story on the front page’s donation list—Diary of a Wealthy Family—and clicked in.","She loved rich-family dramas and the \"real vs. fake heiress\" trope, but after finishing the first chapter, she was speechless.","The title was Diary of a Wealthy Family, and the author really was writing a diary-style narrative!","She nearly closed the tab but decided to leave a comment, bookmark it, and see where it went.","At 11 p.m., she opened the app again, saw the update notification, and tapped in.","The first few paragraphs didn’t impress her—she’d read countless supernatural stories before.","But when the little boy revealed the burial site to the female lead, a chill shot down her spine.","The coincidence was uncanny—she was currently in Chibe Village, Qixing Town, Ningtao County, Longtan City. And right next to her house was a river.","The only river in the village.","It was more of a winding ditch than a proper river—narrow and shallow.","Her heart pounded wildly as she glanced at the window. The blue curtains were tightly drawn, blocking the night outside.","The countryside was eerily silent at night.","Luo Xiaoyu used to find this peaceful for sleep, but now, it unnerved her.","She blamed the author.","Most supernatural stories used fictional settings—why did this one have to use a real location, down to the exact village? It was terrifying.","Too unsettled to keep reading, she turned off her phone, left the desk lamp on, and tried to sleep.","Sometime later, half-asleep, she was jolted awake by voices and machinery noises.","Her phone showed 10 a.m.","Rubbing her eyes, she got up, washed up, and entered the main room, where her mother nagged, \"Staying up late, sleeping in, skipping breakfast—you’ll ruin your health like this!\"","\"I’m just relaxing during break. When school starts, I wake up earlier than the students,\" Luo Xiaoyu muttered before asking, \"What’s all that noise outside?\"","\"Breakfast’s warming in the pot—eat it quick, lunch will be ready soon. Some salvage team came to the village to dredge the river. Rumor says they’re big shots from Longjiang City.\"","\"Longjiang City?\"","Luo Xiaoyu hummed in acknowledgment, then froze mid-step.","Longjiang City! Jiangcheng! Was there a connection?","The burial site from last night’s chapter flashed in her mind, and her heart hammered again.","The chapter had just been posted last night, and now, this morning, a salvage team arrived? The timing was too coincidental.","She rushed outside in her sandals.","\"Where are you going? You haven’t eaten!\"","Luo Xiaoyu waved her off. \"To the river!\"","Su Linhai hadn’t slept all night. Before dawn, he had his driver take him and Su Nuanuan to Longtan City.","The small river in Chibe Village wound through the entire settlement, making the salvage operation time-consuming.","As the sun climbed higher, Su Linhai’s anxiety grew.","The thought of his son’s suffering pierced his heart like a knife. For years, he’d spent resources searching for his missing child, terrified he’d been living in hardship, vowing to cherish him if found.","So when he saw...","It wasn’t until after the first chapter that he broke down in tears.","The fact that his son had turned into a ghost meant he was no longer among the living.","“Why haven’t you found him yet?” His eyes were bloodshot, his face haggard and worn.","The captain of the salvage team replied, “Boss Su, this river is quite long. Without knowing the exact location, the search will naturally be slow.”","When he first received the task, the captain had felt uneasy.","Being asked to search for the remains of a six-year-old child in the river—bones that had been there for seventeen years—felt like a cruel joke.","But the payment offered by the boss was substantial enough, so he took the job after some hesitation.","Su Nuanuan had already learned about the past incident and was deeply grieved for the brother she had never met. She wanted to recover his remains as soon as possible so he could be laid to rest properly.","Seeing her father’s red-rimmed eyes and graying temples, her heart ached with sorrow.","“Dad, should we ask Qi Quan for a more precise location?”","Su Linhai froze for a moment, then let out a bitter laugh. “She’s probably reached her limit by narrowing it down to this area. If she could pinpoint the exact spot, she would’ve mentioned it in her story—”","Wait.","Why would the master be obligated to reveal such specific details in her writing? Or perhaps, Qi Quan couldn’t state it too explicitly in the novel.","Su Nuanuan urged, “How will we know if we don’t try?”","“Alright, I’ll ask her right now.” Su Linhai suddenly slapped his forehead in frustration. “I forgot to get her contact information yesterday.”","He really was losing his mind from desperation.","“Then let me ask Qi Yuan,” Su Nuanuan said. “Dad, why don’t you leave a generous donation under Qi Quan’s story first?”","Su Linhai agreed without hesitation, topping up another 100,000 yuan and pouring it all into The Diary of a Wealthy Family.","The daily rankings for the tipping chart were about to refresh, but The Diary of a Wealthy Family shot back up thanks to his contribution.","When Qi Quan received the system notification, she wasn’t surprised.","She opened her author dashboard and posted an announcement in her profile: [Weibo: @Whitewater Sage]","Some things couldn’t be mentioned in the story itself, so she’d provide an alternative channel. Those who were willing could follow the trail.","This was her way of using her first client to subtly establish the rules of engagement for future potential clients.","Su Nuanuan made several calls, but Qi Yuan didn’t pick up. Just as she was about to resort to asking directly in the comments section, she impulsively clicked into the author’s profile.","Many writers listed their Weibo handles there.","And there it was!","Her heart leaped with excitement as she hurriedly followed the account and sent a private message:","“Qi Quan, can you tell us the exact location?”","[Whitewater Sage: Under the banyan tree.]","Su Nuanuan showed the message to Su Linhai, but neither he nor the captain recognized the spot. Just then, they noticed a young woman standing nearby—likely a local—and approached her.","“Miss, could you tell us if there’s a banyan tree somewhere along this river?”","Luo Xiaoyu shuddered violently, her hands and feet turning ice-cold despite the sweltering heat."]},{"number":8,"title":"Chapter 8","paragraphs":["In Chibe Village, there was indeed a section of the riverbank where a large banyan tree grew. The tree leaned at an angle, half-dangling over the water.","The place was remote, close to the village’s burial grounds, surrounded by fields with few residents—an eerie and desolate spot.","Luo Xiaoyu didn’t dare waste a single moment, leading the group straight to the banyan tree.","\"Under the banyan tree, under the banyan tree...\" Su Linhai muttered incessantly, nearly diving into the water himself.","The team leader quickly stopped him, cautioning, \"Some of the tree’s branches are submerged, making it difficult to search. And it’s been over a decade—even if the river’s current isn’t strong, there’s still a chance the remains could have been carried elsewhere.\"","Su Linhai took a deep breath, his eyes red, and nodded.","The salvage team marked off an area and began their work.","The sun blazed hotter, the summer heat like a furnace, baking everyone until sweat poured down their backs—though it did dispel some of the chilling atmosphere.","Luo Xiaoyu stood to the side, arms crossed. If they actually found something, then The Diary of a Wealthy Family would truly be something extraordinary.","She opened the Scream app and revisited Chapter Two. She hadn’t finished reading the previous night, and now she was eager to continue.","Unfortunately, the author’s updates were sparse, and the chapter ended on a cliffhanger.","She scrolled to the comments section, surprised to see quite a few reactions.","【Even the production team’s donkey is faster than you: Wow... this is a plot twist I never saw coming. Are we shifting into supernatural horror now?】","【A Tree of Red Blossoms: The female lead’s playing ghost tricks? How boring.】","【Laughing Myself to Death: Author, I know you’re trying for a supernatural theme, but could you take notes from others? A dream message just doesn’t have the same thrill as a full-on revenge spree.】","【XX’s Dad: That little boy’s story is heartbreaking. I hope his father finds out soon.】","【Pear Blossoms in the Mist: Is no one talking about the invisible person?】","Luo Xiaoyu pursed her lips as she skimmed the mostly critical comments. If she hadn’t witnessed the eerie parallels between the novel and reality herself, she’d probably have left similar remarks.","But now, she felt a strange, almost smug satisfaction—like she alone knew the truth.","Perhaps fate had finally smiled upon Su Linhai.","After nearly an hour of searching, a shout rang out: \"Is that—bones?!\"","Everyone rushed over.","Luo Xiaoyu stood at the edge of the crowd, gripping her phone, her heart pounding.","The bones had been found about two meters from the banyan tree. The salvage team focused their efforts, eventually unearthing the skeleton of a child.","Su Linhai collapsed to his knees, sobbing uncontrollably.","Though scientific confirmation was still pending, Qi Quan’s precise calculations had already convinced him.","Luo Xiaoyu was utterly stunned.","The salvage team exchanged bewildered glances. How had Su Linhai known there was a child’s skeleton in Chibe Village’s river? And how had he pinpointed the exact location so suddenly?","It defied logic.","With Su Nuanuan’s comforting presence, Su Linhai gradually regained his composure. He paid the salvage team in full and immediately contacted the police.","When the officers arrived, Luo Xiaoyu, as an uninvolved bystander, was sent home.","On her way back, she wrestled with her thoughts before finally leaving a comment under the novel:","【If You See Me, Tell Me to Prep for Class: The location in the story is real. I happened to witness a salvage team pulling a child’s remains from the river.】","Luo Xiaoyu often commented on stories she read, and her username was familiar to many readers, especially those who frequented the app’s popular lists.","Her comment quickly drew replies.","【Random Bystander: OP, blink twice if you’re being held hostage...】","【123: Hahahaha OP’s clearly in cahoots with the author.】","【Male Virtue Enthusiast: OP’s got jokes.】","【Pythagorean Theorem: OP, go prep for class already!】","Luo Xiaoyu: \"...\"","Fine. It wasn’t like anyone would believe her anyway.","She quietly followed the author’s profile, discovered they had a Weibo account, and followed that too.","Then she tossed in a few more virtual \"thunder coins\" to calm her nerves.","This was one story she had to keep up with.","Qi Yuan had been poked and prodded all night, yet no traces of illicit substances were found in his blood, nor were there signs of mental instability. By dawn, he was finally allowed home—only to be confined to his room.","\"I didn’t take anything! I’m not sick! I’m completely sane!\" Qi Yuan snarled, frustration and desperation etched on his face. \"Let me out! I promised her we’d meet today!\"","Qi Lin replied coldly, \"Cancel via text. You’re not going.\"","\"I don’t even have her contact info!\" Qi Yuan shot back, lunging for the door.","Qi Lin shoved him back onto the bed, his voice icy. \"Stay put.\"","From childhood, Qi Yuan had always been intimidated by his elder brother. That fear now outweighed his so-called \"love,\" and he slumped back obediently.","Once the three Qi family members left the room, Gu Qiao fretted, \"Since when did Yuan’er have a girlfriend? And why is he acting so...\" possessed? She left the last word unspoken.","\"I’ll contact a more experienced psychiatrist,\" Qi Lin said before striding off.","Qi Changrong, exhausted from the sleepless night, massaged his throbbing temples.","Gu Qiao urged, \"Get some rest. I’ll keep an eye on him.\"","\"No,\" Qi Changrong waved her off. \"You rest. The company needs me, and there are enough people here to watch him.\"","Gu Qiao nodded reluctantly.","After instructing the staff to guard Qi Yuan, she retreated to her room. A few hours later, a call from a socialite friend drew her out again.","The villa fell into silence.","In her room, Qi Quan listened to her system’s report:","【\"Forest Sea\" just donated another 100,000 coins, and another reader gifted six thunder coins. Your collection count is now 514—definitely enough to monetize!】","【Current reputation points?】","【Over 200,000—that’s 200 days of lifespan converted! You’re incredible, Boss! Just two chapters, and you’ve earned half a year’s worth!】","Qi Quan asked, 【Is there a cap on convertible lifespan?】","【Nope! The more reputation you earn, the longer you can extend your life.】","Cultivation could prolong life, but even that had limits. This system, however, offered endless extension—a treasure beyond mortal dreams.","Of course, Qi Quan had little grasp of the struggles ordinary writers faced. For most, amassing enough reputation points before death was nearly impossible.","She spent the day meditating, emerging only for meals. Though Qi Yuan was still in the house, his meals were delivered to his room to prevent escape attempts.","In other words, he might as well not exist.","At dinner, Qi Quan’s gaze lingered on the young maid serving the dishes—a girl in her early twenties with delicate features and dimples when she smiled.","Ding Mei shrank under the scrutiny, quickly setting down the dishes and scurrying back to the kitchen.","Upstairs, Qi Yuan had no appetite. He picked at his food until his phone buzzed—a message from Qian Kun:","【Qian Kun: Bro, you missed out big time today! You won’t believe what just went down at Royal Club!】","Qi Yuan’s brow twitched. 【Spit it out!】","【Qian Kun: Du Jiaming, Yang Su, and Zhang Chengyan got into a public brawl—it was so intense that blood was drawn! The police were even called, and now they’re being questioned at the station!】","Qi Yuan’s heart skipped a beat.","He and Ruoruo had agreed to meet at the Royal Club. He hadn’t shown up—what if she’d been caught in the chaos and gotten scared?","It was all his fault for being so useless!","No, Ruoruo must still be waiting for him at the Royal Club. He had to go find her!","Qi Yuan abruptly stood and rushed to the window.","His bedroom was on the second floor, overlooking a secluded corner of the garden. If he climbed down from here, he could avoid the servants and finally escape!","He smacked his forehead in frustration—why hadn’t he thought of this sooner? A whole day wasted!","Mimicking the escape methods he’d seen on TV, Qi Yuan tore his bedsheet into strips, tied them into a rope, secured it to the bedpost, and carefully lowered himself down from the second floor.","Downstairs in the dining room, Qi Quan heard the commotion from above but pretended not to notice. He took a bite of tender shrimp paste, savoring the flavor with a contented sigh.","By the time the servants went upstairs to collect the dishes, Qi Yuan was long gone.","The villa erupted into panic.","Unfazed, Qi Quan leisurely returned to his room, opened his document, and began typing tonight’s update."]},{"number":9,"title":"Chapter 9","paragraphs":["When the Qi family returned home, Qi Quan had just finished writing a chapter.","Qi Yuan’s phone was turned off, and they couldn’t reach him.","Qi Changrong made several calls, using his connections to search for the runaway Qi Yuan. Qi Lin frowned as he contacted familiar friends, while Gu Qiao quietly sent a message in the ladies’ group chat.","[Gu Qiao: Lately, I’ve been feeling something’s off with me. The hospital checkup showed nothing wrong, but I’m still uneasy.]","[Fang Hui: What exactly feels off? What symptoms?]","[Gu Qiao: A bit dazed, sometimes feeling like I’m not myself.]","[Ma Yinglan: Oh dear, that sounds like a spiritual affliction!]","In Gu Qiao’s impression, Ma Yinglan was somewhat superstitious, often visiting Taoist temples and knowing many masters.","[Gu Qiao: What should I do then?]","[Ma Yinglan: Let me introduce you to a very powerful master. Why not consult him? Don’t dismiss it—sometimes we just need peace of mind.]","Gu Qiao had already been considering this and agreed. After receiving the master’s contact from Ma Yinglan, she hesitated briefly before sending a friend request.","The master’s WeChat name was “Master Xuanfeng of Lingxu Temple.” He was likely busy, as he didn’t accept the request immediately.","By 10 PM, there was still no news of Qi Yuan. Qi Changrong was frantic with worry and anger, Qi Lin’s expression was icy, and Gu Qiao was deeply troubled.","Only Qi Quan remained calm, slipping peacefully into sleep.","Chapter 3 was updated in real time.","Luo Xiaoyu clicked on the new chapter the moment it dropped, reading carefully.","[I racked my brains for a day and night, and finally, an opportunity presented itself.","Someone in the family had fallen ill—a madness illness.","I was shocked. I hadn’t seen anyone act crazy. I asked the housemaid Mei, who said it was the young master.","Who was the young master? Other than my elder brother, myself, and the fake heiress, were there other children in the family?","I grew a little scared. Listening to Mei’s description, I realized that the “ghost” I’d only heard but never seen was actually my biological younger brother!","It was utterly bizarre.","If he was my real brother, why did he harbor such hostility toward me? We’d never even met before.","Even with strangers, one could at least wear a polite mask.","Had I done something wrong?","Still, this invisible brother ended up helping me. He had a close friend, a beautiful girl, who came to visit him upon hearing of his illness.","This girl, surnamed Su, was Uncle Su’s daughter.","When Sister Su was about to leave after her visit, I mustered the courage to call out to her.","She turned around, her high ponytail sweeping a graceful arc in the air.","Her parents must love her dearly, I thought with envy.","“What is it?” she asked.","I told her about the dream I’d had. She didn’t seem convinced, but she didn’t scold me—instead, she promised to relay it to Uncle Su.","I hoped that little boy would return home soon.","Because of his madness, my invisible brother had to stay home.","But during dinner, while the servants weren’t paying attention, he leaped out the window, driven by his fervent love for his sweetheart.","Love makes people reckless—truer words were never spoken.","The house was thrown into chaos, and I lost my appetite. Mei dutifully came to clear the table, and when I glanced at her, I froze.","Beside her stood an elderly woman with graying temples, dressed in a plain floral cotton short-sleeve, blood trickling from her head. She gazed at Mei with gentle affection, murmuring...","“Mei, when are you coming home?”","Mei seemed oblivious, carrying the dishes to the kitchen.","I stared for a long while before the old woman vanished.","Suddenly, my heart felt as heavy as a stone.]","Luo Xiaoyu was deeply unsettled, a chill creeping up her spine.","She hurried to the comments section.","[Plum Blossom Tree: Madness illness? The female lead is being too harsh—just because her brother was cold, she calls him mad? So dramatic.]","[xx’s Dad: The boy’s issue isn’t resolved, and now a ghost? Was that old woman recently deceased?]","[Filial Piety LOL: The writing’s a bit amateurish, like a diary, but there’s a strange pull to it.]","[Where’s the Male Lead?: Is there a male lead? Are the leads each other’s first love?]","[Pear Blossom Rain: LOL why is the brother invisible?]","Luo Xiaoyu left a comment begging for more updates and tossed in a few virtual “thunder” tips.","She had no idea that, at that very moment, Mei was sobbing uncontrollably.","The Qi family’s servants lived in the first-floor staff quarters.","Ding Mei had been distracted during dinner, her heart uneasy. After finishing her chores, she showered and lay in bed, unable to sleep.","Moreover, with Qi Yuan’s escape, the servants feared pay cuts or even dismissal for negligence.","Ding Mei wanted to call her grandmother, but remembering the old woman’s early bedtime, she held back to avoid disturbing her.","By 10 PM, recalling Qi Quan’s novel update, she clicked in.","Having witnessed the Qi family’s true and fake heiress saga, she was curious about the protagonist’s perspective. Though skeptical of the supernatural elements, she couldn’t resist the drama.","Most of the villa’s staff were following the updates.","The sarcastic remarks about the younger brother in the early part amused her—Qi Quan had a sharp wit.","But when she reached the final paragraphs, her body went rigid.","She stared at the screen in disbelief. The words seemed to twist grotesquely, stabbing into her heart like needles. Her fingers trembled violently, and her phone thudded onto the bed.","A ringtone blared—her favorite singer’s song—but she recoiled as if seeing a ghost, too afraid to answer.","The ringing stopped after a long while, then started again.","Tears blurred her vision as she finally picked up. A familiar voice spoke—Auntie from next door, sounding distant.","“Mei, you should come back,” Auntie said solemnly. “Your grandmother’s gone.”","Ding Mei’s face drained of color.","Over the phone, Auntie sighed. “She had it hard, selling vegetables in the city at her age. She was hit by a car crossing the street. The hospital couldn’t reach the family—she didn’t have her phone. If not for Uncle Niu’s grandson recognizing her there, we wouldn’t have known...”","Ding Mei stopped hearing the words. The shock left her mind blank.","The other servants, after reading the update, wondered what grudge Qi Quan held against Ding Mei to curse her like that. They planned to console her in the staff group chat—until Ding Mei’s door burst open.","Holy crap, was she going to confront Qi Quan?","They rushed out after her.","Instead, Ding Mei, face streaked with tears, ran straight to Qi Changrong.","Was she going to complain to the boss?","Qi Changrong, along with his wife and eldest son, was waiting for news of Qi Yuan when the weeping maid appeared before him.","“What’s wrong?” He instinctively stepped back.","...","Ding Mei wiped her tears and said haltingly, \"Chairman Qi, I—I’d like to request a few days off.\"","Gu Qiao chimed in, \"Did something happen?\"","\"My—my grandmother passed away, wuwuwu,\" Ding Mei could no longer hold back her sobs. \"I want to go back to see her off.\"","The other servants: !!!","No way?!","Ding Mei’s grandmother died? Could such a coincidence really exist?","They exchanged glances, their eyes involuntarily darting toward the second floor, a chill creeping up from their soles to the crowns of their heads.","The more they thought about it, the more horrifying it seemed!"]},{"number":10,"title":"Chapter 10","paragraphs":["The Qi Family readily approved Ding Meiting’s leave request and even prepared a monetary gift as a gesture of concern.","Just then, Qi Yuan returned home.","He strode through the front door and, upon seeing the three members of the Qi Family, acted as if nothing had happened—radiant with joy, as if he’d won the lottery.","Qi Changrong’s reprimand lodged in his throat, his eyes bloodshot and veins bulging on his forehead.","\"Dad, Mom, Ruo Ruo agreed to be my girlfriend!\" Qi Yuan blurted out, his mind seemingly addled, instantly igniting the fury of the three before him.","Gu Qiao, her usual gentleness and maternal warmth gone, stopped Qi Changrong from raising his hand to strike. Coldly, she asked, \"Xiao Yuan, who is Ruo Ruo?\"","\"Her name is Qin Ruo, and she’s my girlfriend!\"","\"Are you serious about marrying her?\" Gu Qiao didn’t wait for his answer before continuing, \"Marrying her isn’t impossible, but at the very least, your father and I should meet her. Arrange a time and place, and bring her to see us.\"","Qi Changrong hesitated, silenced by a sharp look from Gu Qiao.","\"Great!\" Qi Yuan was overjoyed. \"I’ll ask her tomorrow!\"","With that, he dashed upstairs, completely forgetting his earlier dramatic escape through the window.","\"Wife, how could you agree to this?\" Qi Changrong, still processing, assumed his wife had softened.","Gu Qiao shot him a glance. \"Does your son seem normal to you?\"","\"No.\"","\"Then that Qin Ruo must be up to no good. I suggested meeting her to expose her tricks.\"","\"How?\"","\"Just leave it to me.\" Gu Qiao had already befriended Master Xuanfeng. Once she enlisted his help, she’d strip Qin Ruo’s facade bare.","Qi Changrong, of course, deferred to his wife.","\"I’ve already secured an appointment with the head of psychiatry at Longjing City’s First Hospital. He’s here on business, and I’m taking Qi Yuan for an evaluation tomorrow,\" Qi Lin stated flatly, his expression unreadable as ever.","Qi Changrong nodded. \"That’s excellent.\"","Longjing City was the capital, and the chief physician of its top hospital would undoubtedly be highly skilled.","After such a hectic day, Qi Changrong finally retreated to the bedroom. As he lay in bed after his shower, eyes closed, he couldn’t shake the feeling he’d forgotten something.","Half-asleep, he heard his wife murmur, \"With all this chaos at home, Xiao Quan hasn’t even shown her face. She’s too detached.\"","His eyes snapped open, and he sat bolt upright.","That was it—he hadn’t caught up on the latest chapter!","\"What’s wrong?\"","Qi Changrong reflexively countered, \"Yingxue hasn’t appeared either, and Xiao Yuan is closest to her.\"","\"Yingxue is busy with work, and no one informed her. Isn’t it normal she wouldn’t know?\" Gu Qiao instinctively defended her adopted daughter.","Qi Changrong stood by the bed, smiling faintly. \"Who in this family isn’t busy? She’s in Longjiang City—hardly far from home. Even if she couldn’t return, hasn’t she had two days to at least call?\"","Before Gu Qiao could respond, he slipped into the bathroom, hiding away to read the latest chapter of Diary of a Wealthy Family.","The opening paragraphs left him torn between laughter and exasperation.","Clearly, the rift between Qi Quan and Qi Yuan ran deep—a failure of their parenting.","After a moment of self-reproach, Qi Changrong lowered his gaze again.","[Beside her stood an elderly woman with graying temples, dressed in a plain floral cotton short-sleeve, blood trickling from her head. She gazed tenderly at Xiao Mei, murmuring, \"Xiao Mei, when are you coming home?\"]","His smile froze.","He remembered the young maid who’d just requested leave was named Ding Mei.","The bathroom window was open, the sheer curtains fluttering in the breeze. The summer night’s air carried an unexpected chill, creeping up his spine until his scalp prickled with dread.","Could Qi Quan truly see... those things?","And what about the little boy from the previous chapters who’d called Su Linhai \"Dad\"? Was he also a ghost?","A cold sweat broke out across his body.","The open bathroom window loomed like the gaping maw of a beast in the dark, ready to devour souls at any moment.","Qi Changrong hurried out, meeting his wife’s concerned gaze. Instantly, he steadied himself.","Perhaps Qi Quan had simply heard about Ding Mei’s leave and crafted those eerie final paragraphs for effect.","Forcing composure, he asked, \"Do you remember the exact time Ding Mei requested leave earlier?\"","Gu Qiao thought for a moment. \"Around 10:15, I think. Why?\"","\"...\"","Qi Changrong sank onto the bed, dazed.","Ding Mei’s leave had to be spontaneous—she wouldn’t have waited until their return otherwise.","Yet Qi Quan had published her story at 10:00 p.m., and writing required advance preparation. She couldn’t have known about Ding Mei’s grandmother’s death beforehand.","Only one conclusion remained.","If Su Linhai’s incident hadn’t convinced him, this undeniable event before his eyes forced him to accept that Qi Quan truly possessed... unusual abilities.","With that realization, he impulsively dialed Su Linhai’s private number.","Though their businesses didn’t intersect, they’d exchanged contacts as a formality.","After two rings, a hoarse voice answered, \"Who is this?\"","\"Chairman Su.\"","\"Ah, Chairman Qi. What can I do for you?\"","Qi Changrong tread carefully. \"Are you currently in Longjiang City?\"","A pause. Then Su Linhai replied, \"Chairman Qi, I’m occupied at the moment. Let me call you back tomorrow afternoon.\"","\"Of course. Rest well, Chairman Su.\"","As the call ended, Gu Qiao asked, \"Chairman Su? Which one? Why call so late?\"","\"Su Linhai of Shengxin Group. His daughter is friends with A-Yuan, and I thought she might know about his situation. But he’s busy now, so I’ll ask tomorrow.\" Qi Changrong smoothly covered his tracks.","Gu Qiao nodded. \"That’s a good idea.\"","Meanwhile, in a Longtan City hotel...","Su Nuanuan sat beside her exhausted father, urging gently, \"Dad, you didn’t sleep last night either. Get some rest. We’ll know the results tomorrow.\"","The forensic report would arrive the next day, confirming whether the skeletal remains belonged to her brother.","If so, the Su Family would demand justice.","A six-year-old disappearing in Longjiang City only to die in a remote Longtan village? The likeliest explanation was abduction—and they couldn’t begin to imagine the suffering he’d endured before death.","Even after seventeen years, they’d hunt down the perpetrator and make them pay.","For the Su father and daughter, the night stretched endlessly.","At the appointed hour, they arrived at the Longtan City police station and received the report.","When Su Linhai saw the \"99.99%亲子关系\" (parent-child match) result, he doubled over, overwhelmed by grief.","Su Nuanuan’s tears fell instantly.","Once composed, Su Linhai answered the officers’ questions.","\"Mr. Su, you mentioned you’d been searching for your missing son. How did you learn of Su Rong’s death, and how did you pinpoint the burial site?\"","Given the suspicious precision of his actions—searching fruitlessly for years, then suddenly locating the body—the police had doubts.","Su Linhai said, \"If I told you my son appeared to me in a dream, would you believe me?\"","The officers: \"...\"","No matter how they pressed, Su Linhai and Su Nuanuan stuck to their story.","However far-fetched, they couldn’t interrogate victims’ families without cause.","Su Rong had died in Chihe Village. Perhaps clues lay there.","After leaving the police station, Su Linhai and his daughter took Su Rong's remains back to Longjiang City.","During the journey, Su Linhai called Qi Changrong: \"President Qi, this is Su Linhai. Forgive my abruptness, but I’d like to formally visit your daughter tomorrow. I hope it won’t inconvenience you.\"","Qi Changrong replied after a pause, \"...Not at all. You’re most welcome.\"","Did Su Linhai just say \"you\" with respect?","The world really had gone surreal."]},{"number":11,"title":"Chapter 11","paragraphs":["Qi Quan woke up early in the morning for breakfast and immediately noticed a drastic change in the attitude of the household servants toward her.","They didn’t even dare to whisper among themselves anymore.","Even Qi Changrong kept staring at her with a dazed look while eating.","“Something on your mind?” She met his gaze openly.","“No,” Qi Changrong shook his head, then suddenly added, “Do you need anything? If you do, just go ahead and buy it.”","What he really wanted to ask was whether she needed custom-made tools like a compass or a peachwood sword for spiritual purposes, but he was too embarrassed to say it out loud.","He hadn’t quite overcome that mental hurdle yet.","The others misunderstood, assuming he was simply showing concern for Qi Quan’s daily life.","Gu Qiao had already sensed her husband’s change in behavior the night before, and now she was even more certain. She was quite pleased—family harmony was more important than anything else. So she chimed in, “Yes, buy whatever you want.”","Qi Quan replied, “Thank you, but I have my own money. I can buy things myself.”","She wasn’t Qi family’s real daughter, and she had no intention of freeloading. Once she earned enough, she planned to repay the Qis for her living expenses and move out.","Her author account already had some earnings, but unfortunately, she hadn’t signed a contract yet, so she couldn’t withdraw the money.","“Pfft!” Qi Yuan couldn’t resist sneering. “What money do you have? The card you’re using right now was given to you by Mom and Dad.”","Qi Quan: “...”","Even when he’s losing his mind, he still finds time to mock her. It seems hatred leaves a deeper impression than love.","Qi Changrong glared at him. “Show some respect to your sister! You’ve had the best upbringing this family could offer—how much have you earned yourself?”","Qi Yuan stiffened his neck. “I don’t acknowledge her as my sister!”","“She was born before you were even a single cell in existence. What gives you the right to ‘not acknowledge’ her?”","Qi Yuan: “...”","His father had changed! His father never used to interfere in their sibling squabbles before!","Qi Lin, annoyed by the noise, coldly ordered, “After breakfast, come with me.”","“Where to?” Qi Yuan shrank back, sensing something ominous in his brother’s tone.","Qi Lin ignored him.","After breakfast, the two brothers got into the same car.","Qi Yuan, drowsy against the seat, heard his phone ping. It was a message from Qian Kun:","[Bro Yuan, are you sick? Or in love?]","He ignored the first question and replied smugly:","[Yeah, I’m totally in love!]","[Qian Kun: Heard you jumped out the window to see your crush?]","[Qi Yuan: How’d you know?]","[Qian Kun: Never mind how I know. Answer me this—does your family have a maid named Xiao Mei whose grandma died yesterday?]","[Qi Yuan: What nonsense are you spouting? I haven’t heard anything about that.]","[Qian Kun: Seriously?]","The skepticism in his tone made Qi Yuan second-guess himself. He turned to Qi Lin, who was flipping through documents, and asked, “Bro, did a maid’s grandma really die in our house?”","“Yes.”","Qi Yuan blinked. “Since when? I didn’t know.”","“Last night. You weren’t home.”","“What was her name?”","“Ding Mei.”","Qi Yuan checked his phone again and typed:","[Yeah, there was a maid’s grandma who passed. Did you plant a spy in my house or something? How do you know all this?]","[Qian Kun: Wait, you really didn’t know?]","[Qi Yuan: ?]","[Qian Kun: That novel you shared in the group chat—everyone read it and wondered if it was based on real events.]","Qi Yuan: “...”","Damn it! Qi Quan’s novel! He forgot to leave a bad review!","He immediately opened the story, read two chapters, and nearly exploded in fury.","Petty revenge! Absolute pettiness!","What “invisible little brother”? What “delusional little brother”? All of it was nonsense made up by that country bumpkin!","Bad review! Bad review!","[5839623: Comments from regular users and basic VIP members will be displayed after moderation!]","Moderation again?!","Fuming, Qi Yuan impulsively topped up his account with ten yuan and angrily typed:","[This is garbage! How dare the author publish something so terrible? Who does she think she’s fooling?]","This time, the comment went through without moderation.","He felt satisfied.","Scrolling through the reviews, he saw mostly negative ones—good.","Some readers had even thrown “landmines” at the story. Landmines sounded like a bad thing, so he decided to throw some too—blow that bumpkin’s story to bits!","After figuring out how to do it, he noticed his username was just a string of numbers, nowhere near as flashy as other readers’. So he changed it.","[Bro Yuan Says Stop Writing: How deep is my love? Landmines shall prove it~]","He hurled ten landmines in a row. When he tried to throw the eleventh, the system prompted:","[Insufficient balance. Top up now? [Yes] / [Later]]","Qi Yuan froze.","Wait, what? He just topped up ten yuan!","So... landmines cost money?","Now even bad reviews require payment?!","He just gave Qi Quan ten yuan?!","Qi Yuan was devastated.","By the time he met with the doctor, he was still in a daze.","After the examination, the doctor told Qi Lin that there were no major mental health issues—just some emotional instability.","Qi Lin: “...”","The system cackled like a rooster.","[Who would’ve thought Qi Yuan was such a tsundere?] it marveled. [He hates it, yet he still throws landmines at it.]","At first, it hadn’t recognized him under the numerical username. But after he changed it to “Bro Yuan,” the system noticed the little mascot icon next to his name and realized the first moderated bad review had been his.","“Bro Yuan” was a dead giveaway.","Who else would hate Qi Quan while calling themselves “Bro Yuan”? Normal readers judged based on the story’s content—only he would outright call it “garbage.” Definitely not a genuine reader.","Conclusion: This was Qi Yuan.","Qi Quan couldn’t care less about Qi Yuan’s attitude. Judging by the dark aura thickening between his brows, he was bound to take a nasty fall over his so-called “crush.”","[Big news! You got a site message!] the system suddenly cheered.","Qi Quan opened her dashboard and clicked on the notification:","[Dear Author, thank you for publishing on Scream Literature. I’m Editor Zhe Gu, hoping to collaborate long-term. If interested, add me on QQ: xxxxxxx.]","The system whooped: [A contract! You can sign now!]","Qi Quan raised a brow. [With writing like mine?]","She didn’t think her story was that good.","[Don’t sell yourself short! Your stats are solid. Editor Zhe Gu has taste!]","Regardless of the story’s actual quality, the sheer extravagance of 200,000 yuan worth of landmines ensured the site wouldn’t turn her away.","These days, signing contracts only required e-documents—quick and easy.","Qi Quan added the editor, finalized the deal, and waited for the funds to be processed.","The thought of incoming cash excited her.","With money, she could move out of the Qi household, live however she pleased, and even recruit a few obedient ghost servants—just like her past life. Enjoyment first.","Suddenly, a faint trace of ghostly energy drifted in from outside the villa.","Qi Quan focused her gaze beyond the window, which overlooked the courtyard gate. A black sedan rolled slowly into the estate.","A middle-aged man in a tailored suit stepped forward, and trailing behind him was a dejected male ghost.","The ghost appeared to be in his early twenties, with an ordinary face, dressed in outdated sweaters and trousers, his hair disheveled as if it hadn’t been cut in ages. Hunched over and wearing a miserable expression, he shuffled behind the man.","The man entered the Qi family’s living room. Though Qi Quan couldn’t see him with her eyes, her spiritual awareness enveloped the entire first floor.","“Brother Qi!” the man greeted Qi Changrong warmly the moment they met. “You’re such a busy man—I couldn’t even get an appointment with you!”","Qi Changrong gestured for him to sit. “I’ve been quite occupied lately. Chairman Huang, about that land you mentioned on the phone...”","If not for that call, Qi Changrong wouldn’t have been waiting at home.","Without hesitation, Huang Qifeng pulled out a document and handed it to Qi Changrong, smiling. “Brother Qi, no need to be so formal. If it weren’t for you giving me a hand back then, who knows where I’d be now? I heard you were interested in that plot in the northern suburbs—turns out I have some connections. Take a look first.”","The northern suburbs housed an abandoned factory, and many were eyeing that land. Qi Changrong wanted a piece of the pie too, but with so many competitors, he had been scrambling for leads.","Huang Qifeng’s offer hit right where it mattered.","But Qi Quan’s spiritual perception saw the truth clearly.","This man did have ties to the Qi family—yet the thread connecting them was thick with a sinister black-red hue.","Black represented malice, red—blood debt.","In the original storyline, ever since the true heiress returned to the Qi family, chaos had ensued. Qi Yuan was manipulated, “Qi Quan” died from fright—everything seemed like mere coincidence.","But how many accidents and coincidences could there really be?","Qi Quan lowered her lashes, her hands forming a seal, and in an instant, she yanked the male ghost beside Huang Qifeng right before her.","The ghost: ???"]},{"number":12,"title":"Chapter 12","paragraphs":["Wang Hua was utterly bewildered.","He hadn’t even blinked, yet suddenly found himself in a different place. The two middle-aged men before him had vanished, replaced by a young woman.","Qi Quan reclined on the sofa, legs crossed, a book resting on her knees. Her voice was soft as she asked, \"What’s your name? Why were you following that man?\"","\"My name’s Wang Hua. I was following him because—\" He abruptly stopped, realization dawning as he eyed Qi Quan suspiciously. \"Wait, who are you? Why are you asking me this... No, hold on—you can see me?!\"","His shriek was loud enough to rival a system alert.","Of course, no one but Qi Quan could hear it.","Qi Quan lowered her gaze to the book in her hands, giving him time to collect himself.","Having been a ghost for years and trailing Huang Qifeng, Wang Hua had seen his fair share of the world. He quickly grasped the situation and, ever the pragmatist, blurted, \"I’ve never hurt anyone! Don’t exorcise me! I’m not ready to move on yet!\"","He assumed Qi Quan was some kind of exorcist here to send him to the afterlife.","\"Choosing to linger as a ghost means you have unfinished business,\" Qi Quan said, as if it were the most natural thing in the world. \"What is it?\"","Seeing she had no intention of attacking him—and having spent over a decade in lonely solitude with no ghostly companions to talk to—Wang Hua didn’t hesitate to spill his grievances like beans from a sack:","\"I couldn’t bear to leave my sister! When I died, she was the only one I worried about. On my deathbed, I made that scumbag Huang Qifeng swear to take care of her for the rest of his life. But who’d have thought? Once he made it big, he forgot all about his promises! If it weren’t for my sister managing the household and raising his kids, would he even be where he is today? That bastard!\"","As he raged, faint golden light flickered around him.","A ghost with karmic merit—no wonder Huang Qifeng could wear those blessed prayer beads on his wrist without Wang Hua being repelled.","While Wang Hua ranted endlessly about Huang Qifeng’s misdeeds, Qi Quan abruptly cut in, \"How long have you been following him?\"","Wang Hua paused. \"...Over a decade, I think. I’ve lost track.\"","\"Do you know the beads on his wrist are blessed?\"","\"Of course I do,\" Wang Hua said smugly. \"I know pretty much everything about him. But...\"","\"Hm?\"","He grinned sheepishly. \"I haven’t tasted real food in years.\"","Ghosts could consume offerings, but those were usually limited to fruits and raw meat. Plus, his hometown didn’t even have a tradition of offerings—his sister only burned paper money during Qingming and the winter solstice. He’d been craving a proper meal for over a decade.","Now that he finally had someone to talk to, was it too much to ask for a little compensation?","Qi Quan’s lips curled lazily. \"Ghosts aren’t meant to linger in the mortal world. Reincarnation would be better for you.\"","\"No!\" Wang Hua panicked. \"Fine, I’ll talk!\"","His storytelling was disjointed, often veering off-topic, but Qi Quan patiently sifted through his ramblings for the key details.","He was Huang Qifeng’s brother-in-law, having died after being crushed by a falling street sign while saving someone. On his deathbed, he’d begged Huang Qifeng to care for his sister, who had raised him.","After death, he’d been trapped near the street sign until one day, he spotted Huang Qifeng again—now dressed in a sleek suit, hair slicked back, sitting in a luxury car with a young, beautiful woman in his arms.","Furious, Wang Hua had charged into the car, demanding answers, but no one could hear him. Refusing to give up, he’d haunted Huang Qifeng ever since, witnessing every vile act the man committed.","\"You mentioned he occasionally meets with someone?\" Qi Quan asked.","Wang Hua nodded vehemently. \"But I never dared get close. That person... they scared me. I couldn’t show myself.\"","Qi Quan understood.","Ghosts instinctively feared those with spiritual power. The only reason Wang Hua wasn’t afraid of her was because she suppressed her aura as an exorcist.","\"What’s your wish?\"","\"To ruin him! Expose all his crimes! Make sure my sister and her kids live happily!\"","Qi Quan gave a slight nod. \"Stay with me for now.\"","Knowing she wasn’t someone to trifle with, Wang Hua obediently agreed.","Downstairs, Qi Changrong and Huang Qifeng’s discussion was winding down.","Qi Changrong had always been interested in that piece of land, and with Huang Qifeng’s help, the deal was even more tempting. Still, he remained cautious.","\"Thank you for your generosity, President Huang. But at my age, my eyes aren’t what they used to be. I’ll need time to review the documents. How about I give you an answer tomorrow? A deal worth billions deserves careful consideration.\"","\"Of course,\" Huang Qifeng said smoothly, rising without a hint of displeasure. \"I’ll await your call.\"","Meanwhile, Gu Qiao had arranged to meet Daoist Master Xuanfeng.","She spoke vaguely, \"Lately, my son seems... different. Could you take a look at him?\"","If seeing her son directly could dispel whatever influence was at work, then there’d be no need to involve that Qin Ruo!","Xuanfeng’s fingers danced in calculation. \"Your son is underage, yet his ‘Red Phoenix Star’ is already active. Troubling indeed.\"","Gu Qiao: !!!","He was spot on!","Instantly convinced, she pleaded, \"Please, Master, guide us.\"","\"Turmoil in one’s descendants often stems from imbalances in the household’s feng shui.\"","Taking the hint, Gu Qiao invited, \"Perhaps you could inspect our home first?\"","By the time she returned, Qi Lin had also brought Qi Yuan back.","Their meeting sent ripples through the calm.","Qi Lin, a staunch materialist, frowned at the sight of Xuanfeng.","Qi Yuan outright gaped. \"Mom, since when do you believe in this stuff?!\"","Xuanfeng stood serenely, the picture of an immortal sage.","\"I’ve been feeling unsettled lately. The Master is here to offer spiritual guidance,\" Gu Qiao said, though her voice wavered slightly.","The four entered the living room.","Qi Changrong and Huang Qifeng were gone, and the house staff had retreated to their quarters.","The space was pristine and silent.","Xuanfeng’s eyes narrowed, masking a sharp gleam as he surveyed the room. Under Gu Qiao’s expectant gaze, he declared, \"Stagnant water gathers yin energy. The fountain at the entrance should be removed. The vase by the staircase obstructs flow and attracts negative energy—\"","\"What a load of nonsense!\" Qi Yuan scoffed. \"You’re spouting the same garbage I can find online!\"","Xuanfeng remained unruffled, his smile unwavering.","\"Qi Yuan!\" Gu Qiao hissed.","With a chuckle, Xuanfeng met the boy’s disdainful gaze and said leisurely, \"Young friend, the ‘Peach Blossom Misfortune’ upon you runs deep.\"","He’d handled countless cases for wealthy matrons.","Most involved either cheating husbands or rebellious children—the latter often tied to romantic entanglements.","At first glance, Gu Qiao’s well-maintained appearance ruled out marital strife. Her concern over her son’s behavior suggested typical teenage rebellion—except parents usually didn’t resort to mysticism for that. The fact that she had implied something more serious, likely romance-related.","Rich mothers disapproving of their sons’ love interests? He’d seen it all.","And once again, he’d guessed right.","\"What nonsense are you spouting?!\" Qi Yuan shouted, jumping in fury. \"You're the one cursed with some ridiculous... peach blossom hex!\"","Qi Lin also showed clear disapproval.","\"Your current lover is not your destined match,\" Xuanfeng said calmly. \"She has deceived you.\"","Qi Yuan felt his lungs might explode from rage. So, this was all a scheme—his mother had colluded with this fake Taoist to stage a drama and tear them apart!","Overcome with anger and sorrow, his expression turned pitiful as he pleaded, \"Mom, she’s really a good girl. Please don’t break us up, okay?\"","Upstairs, Qi Quan had been enjoying the spectacle like a juicy piece of gossip. Seeing the situation veer toward a melodramatic tragedy, he waved at Wang Hua, who had been sneaking glances at the commotion.","Wang Hua instantly reappeared in the first-floor living room, face-to-face with Xuanfeng.","Assuming the Taoist couldn’t see him, he curiously tugged at the man’s long beard and chuckled. \"So, it’s all fake.\"","Only after speaking did he realize something was off.","Wait... Had the Taoist just locked eyes with him?","\"AAAAAHHHHH!\" Xuanfeng’s eyes bulged before he leaped up and sprinted away, shrieking in terror. \"A GHOST!!!\"","The Qi family trio: \"...\"","Wang Hua: What the hell just happened???"]},{"number":13,"title":"Chapter 13","paragraphs":["The sight of the Taoist priest fleeing in terror at the sight of a ghost dealt a heavy blow to Gu Qiao.","It took her a long moment to recover, only to face the silent reproach in her two sons' eyes.","\"Well, he must have been trying to skip out on the bill. How could there possibly be ghosts in our house? And if he really could see ghosts, wouldn’t that prove he has some skills?\" she defended weakly.","Qi Lin stood up and said, \"I have work at the company. I’ll take my leave.\"","Gu Qiao: \"...\"","She turned to Qi Yuan.","Qi Yuan scratched his head. \"If he could really see ghosts, why would he run away like a scaredy-cat? Doesn’t that just prove he’s a fraud? Mom, even the doctor said there’s nothing wrong with me. Why won’t you believe it? Qian Kun invited me out, so I won’t be back for lunch.\"","Gu Qiao: \"...\"","She watched her sons leave, her chest tight as if stuffed with cotton, suffocating her breath.","After much deliberation, she decided to message Ma Yinglan privately.","[Gu Qiao: The master you recommended came to my house today. We were chatting just fine, but then he suddenly claimed to see a ghost and ran off.]","[Ma Yinglan: That can’t be. The master is very experienced.]","[Gu Qiao: There’s surveillance footage in the living room. Want me to send it to you?]","[Ma Yinglan: ...Then maybe your house has a vengeful spirit, and the master wasn’t powerful enough. You should find someone else.]","[Gu Qiao: Superstitious nonsense!]","She refused to listen to Ma Yinglan’s nonsense anymore. A vengeful spirit? Was she cursing them?","Wang Hua drifted back to the second floor, her eyes lighting up when she saw the mastermind behind it all, Qi Quan. \"You can make people see me?\"","\"Anyone in the mystic arts can do that.\"","\"What about that Taoist priest earlier...\"","\"A fraud.\"","\"I knew it!\" Wang Hua burst into laughter at the memory of the scammer fleeing in terror. Then, shamelessly, she asked, \"Master Qi, could you let my sister see me? I have so much to say to her.\"","\"When the time comes, she will.\"","\"Thank you, Master!\" Wang Hua beamed.","At lunchtime, Qi Quan was still the only one at the table.","A different maid served the dishes—a woman in her forties who had worked for the Qi family for a decade and was braver than the new hires.","She had been following Diary of a Wealthy Family and witnessed Ding Mei’s incident the night before. Her curiosity gnawed at her, and after setting down the dishes, she finally gathered the courage to ask cautiously:","\"Young Miss Qi, did you really see Mei’s grandmother?\"","Nearby servants pricked up their ears.","Qi Quan replied calmly, \"Novels are fictional. Don’t take them seriously.\"","The maid: \"...\"","Human nature is strange—the more Qi Quan denied it, the more they believed her.","After this, the servants’ awe for Qi Quan reached new heights, and they dared not slight her in the slightest.","At 10 PM, it was time for the nightly update.","[Mei took leave to attend a funeral.","This incident left me feeling melancholy, reminding me of my late adoptive parents. They died in an accident when I was five, and I was sent to an orphanage until I turned eighteen and started working.","But enough of the past. Dwelling on it only brings sorrow—better to focus on something lighter.","Yesterday, I heard a ridiculous piece of gossip: three young heirs got into a brawl at a club, all because they were tangled in a love triangle!","No wonder TV dramas about the wealthy are full of melodrama—turns out it happens in real life too. The shocking part? All three were the same gender!","He loves him, he loves him, and he loves him.","As a country bumpkin, I’ve never seen anything like it. Is the upper class really this messy?","I didn’t dare ask for details.","...","This morning, two guests visited. One was vibrant and energetic, the other disheveled and downtrodden. Their dynamic was odd.","The former ignored the latter, while the latter kept shooting the former resentful looks, as if he were a heartless scoundrel.","After the guests and Father left, Mother returned.","She brought along a Taoist priest with an immortal-like demeanor and a haughty expression. The priest surveyed the front yard and living room, muttering about the fountain gathering negative energy and the vase at the staircase attracting evil...","I was baffled.","My materialist worldview was crumbling.","Before he could even ask for payment, one of Father’s earlier guests returned to retrieve something he’d forgotten.","Bathed in sunlight, his body seemed to shimmer faintly.","Suddenly, the priest shrieked, \"Ghost!\" and bolted like his life depended on it.","Mother looked utterly dejected, even ignoring the returning guest.","Perhaps this guest was just that forgettable—much like my invisible little brother.","Speaking of which, the fake heiress has been gone for days now. So much has happened at home, yet she remains blissfully unaware.","How fortunate she is.]","Readers of the latest chapter were at a loss for where to even begin criticizing.","[xx’s dad: What’s going on? Wrong genre? If you want to write BL, go to the romance section! First a wealthy love triangle, then ghosts and unrequited love—seriously?]","[Cosmic Shift: Author, stop spouting nonsense! There’s no such love triangle!]","[Yuan Ge Says Stop Writing: Bullsht! Total bullsht!]","[Remind Me to Prep Lessons: LMAO, the fake priest peed his pants at a real ghost. So that gloomy guest really was a ghost, huh?]","[Forest of Trees: 1000 deep-sea torpedoes!]","[Desperate for Good Reads: Keep it up, Whitewater! Here’s some clear liquid nourishment~]","In the \"Criminal Luncheon\" group chat:","[Qian Kun: What’s going on? Did Du Jiaming and the others really fight over a love triangle? That’s wild!]","[Sun Yu: No way. Isn’t this just Yuan’s sister making stuff up? How would she know the real reason?]","[Peng Peng: @Qi Yuan Bro, did your family really invite a priest today?]","Qi Yuan was equally puzzled.","When it happened, Qi Quan hadn’t even been in the living room. How did she know? Was she hiding in the stairwell spying? Sneaky!","And once again, she’d mocked him for being invisible!","[Su Nuanuan: Yuan Ge, did that priest really see a ghost today?]","Qi Yuan frowned. What was wrong with these people? They were treating Qi Quan’s novel like gospel.","He replied impatiently: [How should I know? I’m not a priest. These frauds are all talk anyway.]","Su Nuanuan didn’t respond further.","Late at night, at the Imperial Club.","Du Jiaming sat in a private room, drowning his sorrows in alcohol. A tattooed young man sidled up to him, teasing, \"Du Ge, why no company tonight?\"","Du Jiaming used to party with beauties left and right—what happened?","But now, all Du Jiaming could think about was Qin Ruo. Other women paled in comparison. He snorted. \"Boring.\"","\"Du Ge, mind if I ask something?\" the tattooed guy lowered his voice. \"Do you really like Yang Su or Zhang Chengyan?\"","Du Jiaming nearly dropped his glass.","After a stunned pause, he exploded. \"Who the hell likes those idiots?! Are you trying to piss me off? You wanna die?\"","Terrified, the guy blurted out the source.","\"A novel? A gay love triangle?\" Du Jiaming grabbed him by the collar. \"Did you drink so much your brain turned to mush?\"","\"No, no, Brother Du, I swear it’s not me saying this—it’s the real heiress of the Qi family who wrote it!\"","Du Jiaming shoved him away. \"The real heiress of the Qi family? You don’t mean that woman who made a scene stealing a man at my grandfather’s birthday banquet the other day, do you?\"","\"Yes, that’s her!\"","\"Where’s the novel? Let me see it.\"","To uninformed readers, The Diary of the Elite might seem like a mundane first-person account, but to those in the know, it’s a firsthand exposé of high-society scandals.","Ever since Qi Yuan shared the title in their group chat, his circle of wealthy, idle friends had been enthusiastically recommending it, and soon, many second-generation elites quietly began following the updates.","They were both awed by Qi Quan’s boldness in exposing the Su family’s \"illegitimate child\" scandal and impressed by her audacity to label the whole mess a \"love triangle.\" Now, they were eagerly waiting to see how the involved parties would react.","Meanwhile, Qi Changrong was holed up in his study, staring at the words \"two guests\" on his screen, cold sweat trickling down his back.","Had he... just encountered a ghost?"]},{"number":14,"title":"Chapter 14","paragraphs":["The second-generation socialites who had been following the story were the first to receive news from the Su Family.","At nine in the morning, a car from the Su Family drove into the Qi Family’s courtyard. Three people stepped out—it was the entire family of three.","Qi Changrong had received a call from Su Linhai the day before, so today, he and his wife and son were prepared for a formal reception.","Moreover, he was curious to know whether the \"little boy\" mentioned in the novel was real.","Seeing Su Linhai approaching with his wife and daughter, Gu Qiao couldn’t help but whisper, \"Lin, go call Quan down.\"","\"Such bad manners,\" Qi Yuan scoffed.","Qi Changrong shot him a glare and stopped Qi Lin. \"Don’t bother.\"","Qi Lin: \"...\"","The designated errand-boy silently stepped aside.","This was the first time the two families had met so formally, and with the Su Family taking the initiative to visit, Qi Changrong and Gu Qiao couldn’t help but feel a sense of pride.","Su Linhai was an exceptionally formidable figure in Longjiang City’s business world, one of the top players, and few could truly call him a friend.","Today, he had dressed meticulously, every detail of his appearance polished to perfection. Mrs. Su was similarly well-dressed, though her complexion was pale from years of poor health. Her eyes were slightly swollen, as if she had been crying, yet they shone with an unusual vitality.","She had always been reserved, rarely engaging in social interactions, but now she looked at Gu Qiao with an uncharacteristically gentle gaze.","Gu Qiao smiled at her, and she smiled back.","\"President Su, your visit brings honor to our humble home,\" Qi Changrong said, inviting the three to sit.","Su Linhai set down the gifts he had brought and spoke earnestly, \"I know President Qi is usually busy with work, so today’s visit is truly an imposition. Nuanuan, greet them properly.\"","Su Nuanuan obeyed, and out of the corner of her eye, she caught Qi Yuan’s bewildered expression, which gave her a strange sense of satisfaction.","He must still be completely lost.","After exchanging pleasantries, Su Linhai finally revealed the purpose of their visit. \"President Qi, is Miss Qi Quan at home today? My wife and I would like to see her.\"","\"She is. Should I have someone call her down?\"","\"No need,\" Su Linhai stood. \"I’ll go up to see her myself.\"","Qi Changrong smiled and led the way. \"This way, please.\"","He escorted Su Linhai and his wife upstairs, leaving Su Nuanuan in the living room.","\"Su Nuanuan, what’s going on?\" Qi Yuan finally blurted out. \"Why do your parents want to see Qi Quan? You haven’t been chatting in the group these past two days either—what happened?\"","Gu Qiao was equally confused, her ears perked up.","Su Nuanuan dropped a bombshell: \"Haven’t you read the novel? Why ask me?\"","\"Novel? What novel?\" Gu Qiao exclaimed without thinking.","\"Aunt Gu,\" Su Nuanuan feigned mild surprise, \"You really don’t know? Then do you know what Yingxue is doing now?\"","\"Yingxue is filming, of course.\"","\"What kind of film?\"","\"She said it’s Director Wang’s project, but she kept the details confidential.\" Gu Qiao frowned slightly after answering. Weren’t they talking about a novel? Why bring up Yingxue?","Su Nuanuan curved her eyes into crescents. \"Qi Quan-jie must have mentioned she’s writing a novel, right? Yuan-ge is even one of her readers.\"","If the siblings’ relationship was so bad, surely Qi Quan wouldn’t have told only Qi Yuan about it?","The fact that Aunt Gu didn’t know about Qi Quan-jie’s novel only proved that she hadn’t paid much attention to her.","It made her feel a little sad for Qi Quan-jie.","Gu Qiao understood—this girl was standing up for Qi Quan.","She admitted she favored Yingxue, but Yingxue was the child she had raised with her own hands. Twenty years of affection couldn’t be fake.","As for Qi Quan...","She had wanted to build a mother-daughter bond, but the girl’s sharp personality made it difficult. At her age, she simply didn’t have the energy anymore.","In the second-floor reception room, Su Linhai and his wife bowed deeply the moment they saw Qi Quan. She accepted the gesture calmly, but Qi Changrong was stunned.","\"Miss Qi, we came today to sincerely thank you for fulfilling our long-held wish.\"","Qi Quan poured them tea. \"Please, sit.\"","They took their seats on the sofa across from her, leaving Qi Changrong to sit to the side.","As steam curled from the teacups, he studied his daughter through the mist, his doubts and confusion growing stronger.","The young woman before him bore no resemblance—in demeanor, speech, or temperament—to the girl who had lived under his roof for the past three months.","Mrs. Su, her voice fragile with emotion, whispered, \"Miss Qi, I read your article yesterday. Thank you, truly.\"","Years of heartache had dissolved overnight. She had wept until dawn, forcing herself to gather her strength this morning to visit the Qi Family and thank their benefactor.","Qi Quan: \"No need for thanks. Mr. Su has already paid the divination fee.\"","They were even.","At the mention of payment, Su Linhai immediately pulled several documents from his bag—contracts he had drafted the moment he returned to Longjiang City yesterday—and handed them to Qi Quan.","\"Miss Qi, you are our family’s greatest benefactor. These are tokens of our gratitude. A small gesture, but we hope you’ll accept.\"","Qi Changrong’s sharp eyes caught the title on the top document—Share Transfer Agreement.","His heart skipped a beat.","Qi Quan flipped through the papers indifferently.","Five percent of Shengxin Group’s shares. A luxury villa worth 75 million. A high-end car valued at 37 million. And several sets of jewelry worth over a hundred million.","Setting aside the latter items, just the five percent stake in Shengxin Group was enough to make even Qi Changrong, a man worth billions, covetous.","It was an immeasurable, ever-flowing fortune.","Having seen vast wealth in her past life, Qi Quan remained unmoved. After reviewing the documents, her expression betrayed no excitement.","Her composure only deepened Su Linhai’s admiration.","\"Mr. Su, you didn’t come just to thank me, did you?\" Qi Quan pushed the documents back.","Sui Linhai glanced at Qi Changrong.","Qi Changrong: What? Did he need to leave?","Seeing that Qi Changrong wasn’t budging, Su Linhai decided to speak plainly, consequences be damned. \"Miss Qi, in yesterday’s chapter, the part about the Taoist priest seeing ghosts—was that your doing?\"","Qi Quan didn’t bother with subtleties. \"You want to see your son?\"","\"Miss Qi, please—we beg you to let us see him. I know this is presumptuous, but we miss him so much. Name your price, anything...\" Mrs. Su broke down in tears before she could finish.","Qi Quan lowered her gaze as if in thought. The Su couple held their breath, not daring to make a sound.","As for Qi Changrong, his worldview was crumbling in real time.","After a long pause, Qi Quan finally looked up. \"Where are his remains now?\"","\"At our home!\" Su Linhai answered urgently.","Qi Quan rose slowly. \"Then let’s go to your place to... summon your son.\"","The Su couple nearly wept with joy.","The system couldn’t resist asking: [Big Boss, you took so long to think—was their payment not enough?]","[No. I just don’t like going out.]","[...]","News of the true heiress boarding the Su Family’s car spread like wildfire among the second-generation novel enthusiasts.","Speculations ran wild.","[What’s really going on? What’s the Su Family’s stance? Why would Qi Quan get in their car?]","[Ugh, why is following a novel so stressful?!]","[Are the Su and Qi Families about to break ties?]","【Why hasn’t Young Master Du and the others arrived yet? If they’re late, the real heiress might already be crushed to dust by the Su Family.】","【As expected, the real heiress can’t compare to the fake one in terms of favor. The Qi Family didn’t even put up a fight—just handed her over like that.】","Qian Kun secretly messaged Su Nuanuan: 【Your family isn’t really planning to do something to the real heiress, are you?】","Su Nuanuan: ...","What kind of idiot is this?! Just like Qi Yuan—another big idiot!","Qian Kun waited but got no reply, so he sent another message—","【Message sent, but rejected by the recipient.】","He got blocked?!"]},{"number":15,"title":"Chapter 15","paragraphs":["On the road, Qi Quan noticed someone was following her—more than one party, it seemed. The three individuals angered by the \"male-male romance\" scandal were likely impatient to vent their fury.","The fish had taken the bait.","The car drove smoothly into the Su residence.","Su Linhai struggled to suppress his eagerness and instructed the servants to serve tea, but Qi Quan stopped him. \"Let’s proceed directly with summoning the spirit.\"","This was why she disliked dealing with people—everything was filled with unnecessary formalities. She preferred to get things done quickly.","Su Linhai didn’t understand her thoughts, but he was deeply moved.","In the past, he had hired many masters at great expense, most of whom were unbearably arrogant. A master like Qi Quan, with such grace and magnanimity, was truly rare.","Su Rong’s remains were carefully preserved in a small crystal coffin. According to the forensic report, the child had been strangled to death, tied to a stone, and sunk into the river.","Later, his flesh decomposed, the ropes loosened, and his bones were buried in the riverbed.","He had died unjustly, and his lingering resentment kept his spirit trapped in the mortal world. Driven by his unresolved grievances and longing for his family, he had found his way to Su Linhai.","But Longjiang City was far from his burial site, so he couldn’t stay by his father’s side all the time.","Now, he was back with his parents. Though this grand house wasn’t the home he had once lived in, as long as his parents were here, nothing else mattered.","Others couldn’t see him, but Qi Quan could.","A small spirit danced excitedly around the crystal coffin, spinning in circles.","Suddenly, Su Rong’s gaze met Qi Quan’s.","He froze, then warily hid behind the other side of the coffin, trying to conceal himself while peeking at her with just his little head.","Qi Quan raised her right hand and drew a talisman in the air. Pale golden spiritual energy condensed into an invisible charm in the void. Before the little ghost could react, the intangible talisman imprinted onto his spirit. Flecks of golden light spread like fireflies, and his form gradually solidified.","He looked down in surprise at his chubby little hands.","The three members of the Su family were equally stunned, their worldviews completely overturned.","Mrs. Su was the first to recover. She rushed forward to embrace the bewildered Su Rong, but he instinctively dodged, avoiding her arms.","Her embrace empty, Mrs. Su’s heart ached violently. Choking back sobs, she asked, \"Rongrong, do you blame Mommy? It’s my fault... I didn’t take good care of you. It’s all my fault...\"","\"Mommy,\" Su Rong suddenly called out, his round eyes lighting up with joy. \"Mommy! You can see me?!\"","Su Linhai also trembled as he spoke. \"Rongrong, I’m Daddy.\"","\"Daddy!\" Su Rong leaped forward excitedly, pressing his small body against Su Linhai’s leg. Tilting his head up, he smiled radiantly.","Mrs. Su: \"...\"","She burst into louder sobs.","Su Linhai crouched down, arms outstretched, wanting to hold him but afraid he might shatter this beautiful dream.","\"Rongrong, why don’t you hug Mommy?\" he coaxed gently.","Su Rong blinked and turned to look at Mrs. Su. His voice was childish, but his expression was solemn. \"But Mommy’s health is weak. If I get too close, I’ll hurt her.\"","That was why he always sought out his father whenever he could.","The Su family: \"...\"","Mrs. Su paused for a moment before abruptly pulling Su Rong’s tiny form into her arms, weeping uncontrollably.","After seventeen years, Su Rong was back in his mother’s warm embrace. Tears welled in his eyes—he didn’t want to harm her, but he couldn’t bear to let go.","Su Nuanuan stood to the side, quietly wiping her tears.","As the Su family teetered on the brink of a tearful reunion drama, Qi Quan had to intervene. \"Time is limited. Say whatever you need to say quickly.\"","Su Linhai panicked. \"Master Qi, what do you mean?\"","\"He’s lingered in the mortal world for too long. It’s time for him to reincarnate,\" Qi Quan replied calmly, accustomed to partings of life and death.","Mrs. Su tightened her embrace.","She knew reincarnation was the best outcome for Su Rong, but she couldn’t bear to let him go.","Suddenly, she remembered something. \"Rongrong, go meet your little sister. Her name is Nuanuan.\"","Su Rong obediently turned to Su Nuanuan and spoke with childlike innocence. \"Little Sister grew up so fast! When I left, she was still in Mommy’s tummy.\"","Back then, Mrs. Su had been pregnant with Su Nuanuan when she received the devastating news of Su Rong’s disappearance. The shock triggered premature labor, and she barely managed to deliver Su Nuanuan, leaving her health permanently weakened.","Su Nuanuan was a premature baby. If not for the Su family’s wealth and the meticulous care they provided, she wouldn’t have grown up so healthy.","\"Little Sister,\" Su Rong said, adopting a grown-up tone, \"from now on, it’s your job to take care of Mom and Dad, okay?\"","Su Nuanuan laughed through her tears, her eyes red. \"I will, Big Brother.\"","Calling a six-year-old child \"Big Brother\" felt strange, but the bond of blood was inexplicable. Even though they had never met before, she felt an instant connection to him.","\"Su Rong, it’s time to go,\" Qi Quan said, like an emotionless executioner severing the Su family’s hard-won reunion.","Mrs. Su immediately broke down in tears. Su Linhai turned away to wipe his eyes, and Su Rong hung his head in silence.","Su Nuanuan suddenly had an idea. \"But the murderer who killed Big Brother hasn’t been caught yet! He can’t leave just like that. Maybe... maybe after the culprit is brought to justice, then he can reincarnate?\"","\"Yes, yes!\" Su Linhai quickly agreed. \"Master Qi, can we wait until the killer is found before... before...\"","He couldn’t bring himself to finish the sentence.","Qi Quan glanced at Su Rong. \"Do you remember the people who harmed you? If you do, describe them, and we can have the police create a composite sketch.\"","Seventeen years ago, surveillance was scarce. But now, in the age of big data, as long as a suspect’s likeness could be drawn and they were still alive, finding them was only a matter of time.","Su Rong lifted his head, his expression no longer childlike—his eyes were deep and solemn. \"They wore masks. I only remember their eyes and eyebrows. But if I saw them again, I’d recognize them.\"","A composite sketch wouldn’t be possible.","\"They?\" Su Linhai caught the word. \"More than one? A group?\"","Su Rong nodded. \"The children they kidnapped... there were others besides me.\"","He had resisted fiercely, and in the struggle, the traffickers accidentally strangled him before dumping his body in a remote river.","The area was dense with graves, and the banyan trees there gathered yin energy. By coincidence, he became a conscious ghost.","Over the years, he had learned much about the modern world. His mind wasn’t that of a six-year-old—only his spirit’s appearance remained frozen at the moment of his death.","\"Damn those traffickers!\" Su Linhai cursed furiously.","Su Rong met Qi Quan’s gaze and asked earnestly, \"I don’t want to reincarnate. I want to stay with Mom, Dad, and Little Sister. I want to find the killers myself. Can I?\"","Qi Quan was silent for a moment. \"Even if it comes at a cost?\"","\"I know that if I choose not to reincarnate now, I’ll never get another chance,\" Su Rong said firmly, having already thought it through. \"I want to stay.\"","\"No!\" Mrs. Su immediately protested, her face filled with worry. \"Rongrong, you must reincarnate!\"","What’s so great about being a ghost?","Rongrong still had her next life and the life after that. No matter how much she couldn’t bear to part, she didn’t want her son to remain a ghost for eternity.","Su Linhai also urged, \"Rongrong, you should move on to reincarnation.\"","\"Mom, Dad, I’m not a child anymore. I know what I’m doing.\" Su Rong turned and knelt before them, kowtowing several times. \"If I don’t see the murderer brought to justice with my own eyes, I won’t rest in peace. Besides, I haven’t had enough of being your son.\"","The couple burst into tears.","Su Nuanuan sniffled, her nose stuffy, and asked in a muffled voice, \"Qi Quan, can you give my brother some more time? Let him stay until the killer is caught before he moves on?\"","\"If he doesn’t reincarnate soon, he’ll disappear entirely,\" Qi Quan explained. \"There are limits to how long a spirit can linger in the mortal world. If not for the unique nature of his burial site, he would have vanished long ago.\"","\"Then let’s rebury his bones—\" Su Nuanuan blurted out but abruptly stopped herself.","That was the place where her brother had been murdered. How could she even think of letting him remain buried in such a grim and horrifying spot?","What was she saying?","Qi Quan shook her head. Now that the bones had been retrieved, returning them would be pointless.","\"Master, please let me stay. I’m willing to bear the cost of forfeiting reincarnation,\" Su Rong said as he stood.","Qi Quan sighed inwardly. \"But that’s only one of the consequences.\"","\"Master, what other consequences are there?!\" Su Linhai exclaimed in alarm.","Qi Quan didn’t answer him. Instead, she asked Su Rong, \"Do you still wish to remain?\"","\"I do.\""]},{"number":16,"title":"Chapter 16","paragraphs":["\"To remain in the mortal world, one must abide by its laws.\"","Qi Quan decisively tossed him a spiritual talisman, which merged into Su Rong's consciousness. \"Follow its instructions and swear a soul oath—never harm any innocent humans or spirits. If you break this vow, you will face the wrath of heavenly thunder, your soul scattered to oblivion.\"","Su Rong acted just as decisively. Before the Su family could react, he firmly made the oath. Should he ever harbor malicious intent, he would face utter annihilation.","As soon as the oath was sworn, a faint rumble of thunder echoed above the Su family villa. Su Rong felt a hidden pressure settle deep within his soul—from now on, he would exist under the watchful gaze of the heavens.","This was the second price he had to pay.","But what followed was pure astonishment.","With the soul oath sworn, he was freed from the cycle of reincarnation. Under the laws of rebirth, Su Rong’s spirit had remained trapped in the form of a child. Now, released from those constraints, his spirit gradually transformed into that of a twenty-three-year-old young man.","Su Linhai and Mrs. Su had often wondered what their Rongrong would have looked like if he had lived.","Would he have been more capable than Qi Quan’s eldest brother? More handsome than the Song family’s son? More filial than the children of other wealthy families?","One thing was certain—he would never have turned out like those spoiled heirs.","Now, seeing him with their own eyes, he surpassed their wildest imaginations by a hundredfold!","The Su family had always been blessed with good looks, and Su Rong had inherited the finest traits from his parents—sharp brows, starry eyes, a noble nose—his features strikingly handsome.","Song Lin, Qi Yingxue’s fiancé, was often hailed as the dream husband of Longjiang City’s elite young ladies. But compared to Su Rong, he still fell short.","Su Nuanuan’s eyes widened in delight. \"Brother, you’re so handsome!\"","\"I—\" Before he could finish, Su Rong’s figure vanished.","Mrs. Su panicked. \"Where did he go?!\"","\"The talisman’s effect has worn off. He’s still here, but you can no longer see him.\" Qi Quan reminded them gently, \"Besides, prolonged contact with spirits isn’t good for you.\"","The Su family stood frozen in confusion.","\"Master,\" Su Rong spoke up, \"I’ve heard there’s a way for spirits to manifest at will.\"","Qi Quan raised a brow. \"Are you sure?\"","\"Since I’m already bound by the heavens,\" Su Rong tapped his temple, \"one more restriction means little. More importantly, you’ve done my family a great kindness. I have no way to repay you, so I wish to become your ghost servant and serve you.\"","A ghost servant bound to a master could freely manifest by drawing upon their master’s power—though it also meant being at their command.","Qi Quan: \"...\"","In her past life, she had kept ghost servants—obedient, attentive, and utterly devoted. This time, she had planned to find a few agreeable spirits after leaving the Qi family. Yet here one was, offering himself willingly.","A proper master-spirit bond required the ghost’s consent. Of course, some unscrupulous masters forced spirits into servitude, but Qi Quan had no taste for coercion. She preferred relationships built on mutual respect.","Su Rong’s attitude pleased her.","But with his family present, she felt obliged to inform them.","To her surprise, the Su family’s faces lit up with joy. Su Linhai’s eyes reddened with emotion. \"Wonderful! Thank you, Master, for taking Rongrong under your care.\"","As a spirit, Su Rong was vulnerable to other masters or malevolent ghosts. With Qi Quan’s protection, his father could rest easy.","Moreover, given Qi Quan’s formidable abilities, aligning with her could only bring benefits.","Mrs. Su and Su Nuanuan shared the same sentiment.","\"Very well. Let us forge the contract.\"","Qi Quan pricked her fingertip, drawing a drop of blood. Suspended in the air, it slowly morphed into a crimson sigil under her spiritual guidance.","\"Don’t resist.\"","The sigil shot into Su Rong’s forehead, embedding itself in his consciousness. To his shock, he felt no oppressive hierarchy—only a balanced agreement outlining rights and duties.","This was an equal contract!","Su Linhai noticed his son’s stunned expression. \"Is something wrong?\"","Su Rong replied, his voice tinged with disbelief, \"The master gave me an equal contract.\"","The Su family understood instantly, moved beyond words.","\"Qi Quan, from now on, you’re my goddess! If anyone dares speak against you, I’ll shut them down tenfold! Anyone who crosses you won’t last in Longjiang City!\" Su Nuanuan declared passionately.","Mrs. Su smiled warmly. \"Rongrong, you must take good care of the master. If you need anything, don’t hesitate to ask us.\"","Remembering something, Su Linhai hastily retrieved the contract Qi Quan had previously refused and presented it again.","\"Master, please accept this—no, this isn’t enough. I’ll—\"","\"No shares,\" Qi Quan declined, taking only the villa deed. \"This is sufficient.\"","She preferred clean transactions—no lingering debts, no future regrets.","Seeing her resolve, Su Linhai reluctantly withdrew the stock transfer agreement but silently vowed to support her in every way possible.","\"The villa is fully furnished. Move in whenever you wish. I’ll arrange for an experienced driver and household staff—\"","\"No need for drivers or servants,\" Qi Quan interjected.","\"As you say.\" Su Linhai produced a card. \"But please, take this.\"","Qi Quan accepted it calmly. Money was fine—shares were not.","With that settled, the Su family beamed in satisfaction.","The system observing everything marveled: [Big shot, you’re wasted as a writer! How did I get so lucky to be bound to you?!]","What ordinary writer could amass such wealth so quickly?","It had never seen people so eager to throw money at someone—and with such joy.","\"Master, what should we do with Rongrong’s remains?\" Su Linhai asked.","Qi Quan: \"He no longer needs them. Cremation is best. If they fall into the wrong hands, it could cause trouble.\"","\"Understood!\"","Su Rong: \"...\"","While consulting the master made sense, shouldn’t someone ask him about his own bones?","With matters concluded, Qi Quan took her leave with Su Rong in tow.","Now bound as a ghost servant, Su Rong could walk under sunlight without issue. To avoid startling passersby, he chose to remain invisible.","\"Master, let my driver take you home,\" Su Linhai offered earnestly.","Qi Quan shook her head. \"No need.\"","She left the Su villa alone, hailed a ride on her phone, and waited by the roadside.","Unbeknownst to her, three sets of eyes watched from the shadows, reporting her movements to their employers.","A tattooed man dialed Du Jiaming’s number. \"Du, Qi Quan just left the Su house—alone. No driver. She’s waiting on the street, probably for a ride.\"","Du Jiaming gritted his teeth. \"Follow her. If she heads back to the Qi residence, I’ll...\"","Just like the Su family coming to her doorstep, if she went somewhere else, that would make things even easier. Daring to slander me—I’ll make sure she learns her lesson!\"","A taxi arrived.","Qi Quan got in and said, \"Driver, to Lingxu Temple.\"","Lingxu Temple was a famous Taoist temple in Longjiang City, thriving with incense and bustling with devotees and tourists.","The driver, accustomed to such requests, stepped on the gas, and the car sped off.","Su Rong sat beside Qi Quan and asked, \"Why are we going to a temple?\"","As a ghost servant, he wasn’t afraid of ordinary temples, but he was still curious.","\"Fishing.\"","Su Rong: ?","The driver: \"...\"","Who was she talking to?!"]},{"number":17,"title":"Chapter 17","paragraphs":["The Lingxu Temple was located on a mountain in the suburbs of Longjiang City, where the houses along the way grew increasingly sparse and low-rise.","Qi Quan glanced out the window and spotted a sizable stretch of wasteland with several dilapidated factory buildings, above which hung a dense mass of dark energy.","This must be the fiercely contested northern suburban land Huang Qifeng had mentioned.","Su Rong, being a ghost, was naturally sensitive to his kind. He frowned and said, \"This place isn’t far from Lingxu Temple. Why is the yin energy so heavy here?\"","No one answered him.","The car wound its way up the mountain road and finally arrived at the temple entrance.","True to its reputation as a renowned temple, the gate was grand and solemn, with layers of buildings nestled among the mountain trees, exuding an air of secluded tranquility.","\"Stay here,\" Qi Quan instructed Su Rong to guard the entrance while she entered the temple.","Three cars parked almost simultaneously, not far from Su Rong.","The tattooed young man in one of the cars sent a message to Du Jiaming: \"Brother Du, she’s gone into the temple.\"","He had already informed Du Jiaming of the location when they were at the foot of the mountain. After all, there was only one Lingxu Temple on this mountain. No matter what Qi Quan was doing here, she couldn’t escape.","Du Jiaming replied: \"Be there soon.\"","Before long, three more luxury cars, each worth millions, pulled up at the temple entrance.","Du Jiaming recognized the familiar vehicles nearby and scowled. Furious, he flung the car door open but tripped as he stepped out, nearly face-planting on the ground.","The other two men suffered the same fate.","The trio dismissed it as a coincidence and quickly straightened up.","\"Yang Su, Zhang Chengyan, what are you two doing here?\" Du Jiaming glared at his former brothers—now rivals in love—with reddened eyes.","Yang Su sneered. \"What, is this temple yours?\"","\"Hey, let’s not argue,\" Zhang Chengyan, the most timid and superstitious of the three, didn’t want to cause a scene in front of the temple for fear of offending the Taoist deities. \"You’re both here for Qi Quan, right? How do you plan to teach her a lesson?\"","The invisible Su Rong nearby thought: Tripping them was definitely the right move.","Having overheard their subordinates reporting about the \"master,\" he guessed they were here to cause trouble for Qi Quan. So, he’d given them a little warning when they stepped out of their cars.","Now, it seemed the warning hadn’t been enough.","\"She came alone. Why not scare her a bit? She writes horror stories anyway—she can handle it,\" Yang Su suggested.","The three huddled together, whispering their plan.","Su Rong scoffed silently.","From the entrance to the main hall, there was a long flight of stone steps. As soon as they began climbing—","Thud! Du Jiaming fell flat on his face.","Crash! Yang Su landed nose-first, howling in pain.","\"Ah!\" Zhang Chengyan clutched his scraped palm, fear creeping in.","Tourists milling around the temple entrance stifled laughter at the sight of the three men tumbling in unison.","\"Did they offend the deities?\" someone in the crowd muttered.","Zhang Chengyan, the most superstitious, hugged himself nervously. \"This is weird. I tripped when I got out of the car, and now I fell again on the steps. Is this a sign from the deities that they don’t approve of us scaring people here?\"","\"Pathetic. And you think you can compete with me for Ruoruo’s affection?\" Du Jiaming mocked. \"If you’re too scared, I’ll go alone!\"","The mention of \"Ruoruo\" reignited Zhang Chengyan’s determination. He pushed aside his unease and stood up to try again.","Bang! All three fell once more.","\"Enough! Three strikes and we’re out. Today’s just not our day—better not push our luck,\" Zhang Chengyan declared, brushing himself off. \"I’m not scaring anyone. I’m going to get a protective charm instead.\"","He tentatively lifted his foot onto the step—and this time, he didn’t fall!","Elated, he sprinted up the stairs, shouting, \"Thank you, deities!\"","Du Jiaming: \"...\"","Yang Su: \"...\"","The two stubbornly tried again—only to eat dirt once more.","Yang Su, now thoroughly spooked, muttered, \"Maybe... we should get protective charms too?\"","Du Jiaming’s face darkened.","In the end, the trio abandoned their plan and settled for buying protective charms.","From behind a tree, Qi Quan watched the three men clutching their charms, her gaze shifting to Su Rong outside the temple.","She had lured them here intending to guide them toward the charms, but before she could act, her newly acquired ghost servant had inadvertently completed the task.","Quite useful indeed.","Qi Quan released three strands of spiritual energy, attaching them to the men’s charms, then left with Su Rong for the Qi residence.","The moment they stepped inside, the tense atmosphere was palpable.","Gu Qiao sat on the sofa, tearfully clutching her phone while Qi Changrong comforted her softly. Seeing Qi Quan enter, his expression turned complicated. Qi Lin frowned, looking as though he wanted to say something but held back.","\"What’s wrong?\" Qi Quan asked politely.","The heavy silence broke.","Gu Qiao, her eyes red, said, \"Xiao Quan, I... I haven’t been fair to you. I didn’t consider your feelings, and I made you suffer.\"","Earlier, spurred by Su Nuanuan’s words, she had asked Qi Yuan for the title of Qi Quan’s novel. After reading the fictionalized—or perhaps not so fictional—account of Qi Quan’s struggles, she and Qi Changrong shared the same realization: they had indeed neglected their biological daughter’s emotional well-being.","Even Qi Lin, not entirely heartless, felt a pang of guilt after reading the line about \"not having a clear mind.\"","A girl struggling just to survive couldn’t possibly access quality education. He had overlooked Qi Quan’s hardships, attributing her sharp, defensive personality to \"not having a clear mind.\" It was ignorance and indifference on his part.","He looked at his calm, seemingly resigned sister and said earnestly, \"I read your novel. The imagination is... impressive.\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She nodded slightly. \"Thanks. I’ll head upstairs now.\"","In the second-floor reception room, Wang Hua had been ordered to wait. Hearing Qi Quan return, he floated to the staircase to greet her—only to come face-to-face with Su Rong.","\"Master! Who’s this?\" Wang Hua exclaimed.","Su Rong lifted his eyelids, gave him a once-over, then closed them again.","An ordinary-looking ghost with no competitive edge. Not worth his attention.","\"Su Rong, you two can chat in the reception room. I’m going to my room.\"","After giving instructions, Qi Quan returned to her bedroom to work on that night’s chapter update.","[Master, \"Yearning Glances\" gifted 1,000 deep-water torpedoes, \"Everlasting Prosperity\" gifted 1,000, \"Awe-Inspiring Presence\" gifted 1,000, and with contributions from \"Ocean of Trees\" and other readers, your current reputation points total 576,000—equivalent to roughly 570.6 days of lifespan, or rounded up, two years!]","This is the perk of clinging to a master’s golden thigh!","Qi Quan smiled genuinely.","In her past life, her greatest regret had been her short lifespan. Though two years was far from a century, her novel had only just begun.","Qi Yingxue had been busy filming these past two days and hadn’t had the energy to check Qi Quan’s updates. At 10:30 p.m., after finishing her night shoot, she finally remembered she’d missed two chapters and braced herself to see how Qi Quan had slandered her this time.","By the end of Chapter 4, she was seething.","What kind of nonsense is—","“She has no idea about all the troubles at home”? What does “she’s such a lucky person” even mean?","Did something happen at home? But no one called her!","Qi Yingxue initially wanted to call home immediately, but then she remembered how late it was and worried about disturbing her parents’ sleep, so she decided against it.","Frustrated, she left a comment.","[Red Plum Blossoms: Ugh, why does Qi Baishui keep making shady remarks about the fake heiress? Being switched at birth wasn’t her fault—blame fate. Honestly, it’s giving bitter, jealous vibes.]","Night owls were always browsing novels.","Luo Xiaoyu lay in bed after finishing the latest chapter, scrolling through the comments section, when she stumbled upon “Red Plum Blossoms’” remark.","She’d seen this username in previous chapters too—always leaving negative reviews. Upon closer inspection, this person consistently defended the fake heiress’s perspective, which was... unusual.","After some thought, Luo replied: [Fate may have played its part, but if the privileged party acts like an innocent victim while showing no remorse and even tries to suppress the real heiress, that’s just heartless. At the very least, the fake heiress should show some gratitude to the parents who raised her and treat their biological child with kindness.]","Most readers agreed with Luo Xiaoyu’s take.","Qi Yingxue was so furious she lost her composure: [How do you know this isn’t just the real heiress making up lies to smear the fake one?]","[RemindMeToPrepLessons: Uh... isn’t this just a novel? The author wrote it this way—why are you taking it so personally?]","Qi Yingxue: ...","She’d been too angry to think straight.","Whatever. Time for the next chapter.","[Surprises always come unexpectedly.","A few days later, Uncle Su inexplicably gifted me a generous sum of money and a villa.","He said it was to thank me for fulfilling his lifelong wish.","I accepted it.","...]","Reading this, Qi Yingxue’s eyes widened in shock.","Uncle Su... had he lost his mind?"]},{"number":18,"title":"Chapter 18","paragraphs":["[...","Lately, I’ve been encountering strange incidents, so I decided to visit a Taoist temple in the suburbs to pray.","On the way, I unexpectedly spotted an abandoned factory not far from the temple. Oddly enough, a thick, dark mist seemed to gather around it.","I didn’t dare look too closely.","When I returned home from the temple, the atmosphere felt off.","My mother was sitting on the sofa, crying, while my father gazed at me with a complicated expression. My eldest brother, however, surprised me by saying, “You’ve got quite the imagination.”","Dazed, I retreated to my room.","This house isn’t a place I can stay in much longer. Maybe I should move into the villa Uncle Su gave me—at least I’d have some peace alone.]","Third-floor master bedroom.","Qi Changrong and Gu Qiao set down their phones and exchanged glances.","“I remember there’s a villa in the western suburbs. Why don’t we transfer it to Xiao Quan?” Gu Qiao suggested.","Qi Changrong nodded. “Tomorrow, have Lin take her to pick out a few cars and hire a driver.”","“Nature Jewelry just released a new collection. I’ll order some sets for her.”","“We should also introduce her to more social circles, let her meet promising young men... Wait, is she really planning to run away from home?”","The couple tensed, picking up their phones again to read the latest update.","Gu Qiao’s voice wavered. “Does she really resent us that much?”","Qi Changrong sighed in agreement, then suddenly had a thought. “Honey, are there any famous Taoist temples in our city?”","“Lingxu Temple, probably,” Gu Qiao answered without thinking—she’d heard Ma Yinglan mention it too many times to forget. “It’s on the mountain in the northern suburbs. Why?”","“Northern suburbs...”","A chill ran down Qi Changrong’s spine as he reread the passage in the novel. After following the story these past few days, one thing was clear: nothing in Qi Quan’s writing was ever superfluous.","The land he’d been eyeing was in the northern suburbs—and sure enough, there was an abandoned factory there!","If dark mist really surrounded it, the place might be cursed.","Then he recalled Huang Qifeng’s visit the day before, along with the “two guests” mentioned in the novel. His unease deepened.","He’d been puzzled earlier—why was Huang Qifeng, of all people, pulling strings to help him secure the land when so many others were competing for it?","Qi Changrong had never been close to Huang Qifeng. Years ago, he had simply taken pity on the man's down-and-out state and given him some money to survive. Later, Huang Qifeng rose swiftly in Longjiang City's business world, making a name for himself.","Though he couldn’t compare to families like the Dus, Songs, or Yangs, he’d still achieved considerable success.","Would Huang Qifeng really go to such lengths for him just because of that old favor? What was his relationship with the ghost by his side? Did he know about the anomalies on that northern suburban land?","Unlike his careful deliberation, the Su family reacted swiftly after reading the update.","Su Linhai declared immediately, “I’m withdrawing my bid for the northern suburban land.”","“Dad, I support you!” Su Nuanuan cheered. “Following Sister Qi Quan’s lead is always the right move!”","Mrs. Su teased her, “I’ve never seen you so invested in someone before.”","“Well, I never badmouthed her behind her back either,” Su Nuanuan said, relieved she hadn’t joined the other rich kids in gossiping about Qi Quan.","Of course, Qi Yuan rarely mentioned Qi Quan, which helped.","The group chat buzzed incessantly.","[Qian Kun: Everyone’s read the update, right? Question—is the abandoned factory with the dark mist the one in the northern suburbs?]","[Peng Peng: My mom mentioned that plot of land before. She said the competition was too fierce and gave up.]","[Sun Yu: I think so. It’s definitely near a Taoist temple.]","[Qian Kun: Holy crap, my dad still wants it!]","[Sun Yu: That’s insane. You actually believe this stuff?]","[...]","[Su Nuanuan: My dad’s backing out.]","[Qian Kun: Big Miss! Unblock me, please?]","[Peng Peng: Did Sis Nuan blacklist you? What awful thing did you do?]","[Sun Yu: Did your dad really give her money and a house?]","Su Nuanuan ignored them, dropping one last message before vanishing.","While Qian Kun and the others were just high school graduates with no say in family matters, Du Jiaming and his peers—closer to Qi Lin’s age—were different.","They’d already started handling family business and had access to more insider information. The “dark mist” described in the novel only earned their scorn.","[Du Jiaming: That woman’s just pretending to be mystical. @Qi Lin, control your sister!]","[Yang Su: What if this is the Qi family’s strategy?]","[Zhang Chengyan: Did you forget the bad luck we had at the temple today? We passed that area—I’m kind of freaked out now.]","[Du Jiaming: @Yang Su, Damn, the Qis are playing 4D chess! They spun this whole tale just to scare us off!]","[Yang Su: Modern problems, modern solutions. @Qi Lin, respect for the innovative tactics.]","[Song Lin: ?]","Yang Su: Well, well, look who graced us with his presence! Here to defend your future in-laws, Young Master Song?","[Song Lin: What tactics?]","[Du Jiaming: You haven’t heard? Your fiancée got dragged hard in that novel.]","Someone shared a link to the story.","Song Lin, after a busy day: ???","A few days away, and the world had gone mad—even the spoiled rich kids were reading web novels now.","He didn’t usually bother with online fiction, but since it involved his fiancée, he reluctantly clicked in.","After skimming, he cared little for the supernatural elements but worried about Qi Yingxue’s feelings. He called her.","“A-Lin?” Her voice sounded hoarse.","Song Lin frowned. “Did I wake you?”","“No, I was still up.” Qi Yingxue softened her tone. “Calling so late... did you miss me?”","“Mn. Still filming?”","“Yeah, it’s been hectic—lots of night shoots lately.”","He’d meant to comfort her, but realizing she might not know about the novel, he didn’t want to add stress. Changing tack, he simply said, “Get some rest. Goodnight.”","After hanging up, he messaged Qi Lin privately: [You know about the novel?]","[Qi Lin: What about it?]","[Song Lin: She’s slandering Yingxue, and you’re just letting it slide?]","[Qi Lin: Slander?]","[Song Lin: Don’t play dumb.]","[Qi Lin: Neither of us were there. Without evidence, you can’t prove she’s making it up.]","Song Lin laughed coldly: [You’re seriously claiming her ghost story isn’t fabricated?]","[Qi Lin: Fiction blends truth and imagination.]","[Song Lin: ...]","[Song Lin: Set up a meeting with her tomorrow. I’ll talk to her myself.]","He’d resolve this before Yingxue returned—no way would he let her get hurt.","[Qi Lin: Arrange it yourself.]","[Song Lin: ...]","After collecting another wave of reader reactions, the system had grown numb. It asked Qi Quan: [With your skills and mindset, you could’ve easily avoided those tragic backstory elements that stir controversy.]","The comment section was now a battleground over the rights and wrongs of the “real vs. fake heiress” trope.","Qi Quan replied: [The original owner died unjustly. She’s already reincarnated, but someone still needs to clear her name.]","What she wrote were the original’s true experiences and buried emotions—not for pity, but for justice.","Should the wronged stay silent?","That wasn’t how the world worked.","Neither she nor the system had expected that the next morning, right after breakfast, before she could even bring up moving out, Qi Changrong would beat her to it.","Qi Changrong handed Qi Quan a stack of documents printed overnight and said, \"Qi Quan, these are our heartfelt gifts for you. Take them.\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","System: \"...\"","Was this the unexpected reward for playing the victim? Or had Qi Changrong and Gu Qiao been provoked by the Su family's extravagant gestures?","Of course, Qi Quan refused.","Her expression was calm, leaving no room for argument.","\"No need. I'm moving out today.\""]},{"number":19,"title":"Chapter 19","paragraphs":["Neither Qi Lin nor Qi Yuan were home early in the morning.","Unable to dissuade Qi Quan and with no help at hand, the couple could only watch helplessly as she dragged a small suitcase out the front gate.","Qi Quan left behind a card containing all the expenses she had incurred during her stay, taking with her only a few worn-out sets of clothes—the same ones she had worn before returning to the Qi Family.","Aside from these, she also took two ghosts with her.","\"Once we move to the new place, can I finally play freely?\" Wang Hua floated around excitedly.","Su Rong replied, \"You can't. But I can.\"","Wang Hua: \"...\"","The resentment was real.","When he learned that Su Rong had chosen to become a ghost servant, he was utterly shocked.","As a ghost, he had picked up bits and pieces of knowledge, and he knew very few ghosts would willingly bind themselves as servants.","But Su Rong did so without hesitation.","Now, Su Rong could materialize at will, touch objects, and even savor the delicacies he craved.","Wang Hua wasn’t immune to the temptation, but he valued his freedom and the chance for reincarnation more.","With his accumulated merits, he could linger in the mortal world for a long time. Once he witnessed Huang Qifeng’s downfall and punishment, he would move on to the next life.","After Qi Quan left, Gu Qiao felt as if a gaping hole had opened in her heart, letting in a cold, howling wind.","\"She truly resents us,\" she sobbed, covering her face.","Qi Changrong sighed. \"With her abilities and the favor she’s earned from the Su Family, she’ll achieve great things. No one will dare bully her. Our home was ultimately a cage for her. If you’re worried, you can visit her more often.\"","After all, she had only been brought back as an adult. How much affection could three months foster? Especially when the family had indeed neglected her after her return.","The villa gifted by the Su Family was located in the southern suburbs, nestled by a lake with breathtaking views. Its classical architecture perfectly suited Qi Quan’s taste.","Upon entering, one was greeted by a spacious courtyard with a clear pond at its center, filled with blooming lotuses and the occasional flash of koi fish—a scene of serene beauty.","With no one else around, Su Rong materialized and considerately took Qi Quan’s suitcase.","Wang Hua: \"...\"","No comparison.","Not only was this guy handsome, but he also had high emotional intelligence. Even if Wang Hua were willing to serve, he couldn’t compete.","The only oddity was Su Rong’s outfit—a childish, bright yellow dandelion-patterned cotton jacket. Though it had grown along with his form and still fit, it looked absurdly comical.","Qi Quan seemed to notice this too and said, \"Once we’re settled, I’ll make you some proper clothes.\"","\"Make clothes?\" Wang Hua followed them into the living room, puzzled. \"Don’t you usually burn offerings for ghosts?\"","Ghosts typically relied on items burned as offerings—paper houses, paper cars, and the like.","Qi Quan smiled without answering.","The mystical arts had many ways to subdue ghosts but few to aid them. To her, ghosts were once human. As long as they didn’t cause harm, they were no different from the living.","In her past life, she had amused herself by crafting stylish uniforms for her ghost servants. That skill hadn’t faded.","Su Rong was easy on the eyes; he deserved clothes to match.","Burned offerings carried a charred smell—something she disliked.","The villa was vast, with a central hall and wings on either side. Qi Quan took the main residence, while Su Rong and Wang Hua occupied the east and west wings. Unless summoned, neither ghost was to disturb her.","The villa was fully furnished, even stocked with premium fabrics in the storage room. Qi Quan had planned to buy materials but now had no need.","She began cutting and sewing, crafting a new wardrobe.","Meanwhile, Du Jiaming dressed to impress for his date with the love of his life.","Qin Ruo had actually initiated the meeting this time—he was overjoyed!","They were to meet at a park.","Du Jiaming never frequented parks, but with Qin Ruo there, anywhere was paradise.","At the entrance, Qin Ruo stood in a pristine white dress that ended at her knees, revealing slender, flawless calves. Her jet-black hair cascaded over her shoulders, her skin glowing under the golden sunlight like a celestial maiden.","Du Jiaming was spellbound.","In a daze, he approached, his voice distant, his thoughts scattered—only instinct remained.","\"Ruo Ruo, you’re breathtaking.\"","Qin Ruo smiled softly, her delicate features curving like the moon reflected in water—ethereal and enchanting.","Seeing the infatuation in Du Jiaming’s eyes, her smile deepened.","For the first time, she reached for his hand.","The moment their skin touched, a searing pain shot through her fingers as if scorched by flames. She barely stifled a scream.","Snatching her hand back, she hid it behind her, forcing a sweet smile.","\"Jiaming, I just remembered something urgent. I have to cancel today. Let’s meet another time, okay?\"","Without waiting for a response, she hurried away.","Once in her car, she examined her right hand.","The tips of all four fingers (except the thumb) were blackened, reeking of burnt flesh, the pain unbearable.","Luckily, she carried mystical pills. After swallowing one, the marks gradually faded.","Her eyes darkened with malice as she dialed Yang Su’s number.","Du Jiaming had made her suffer—now he’d know the agony of heartbreak.","Yang Su, thrilled by the unexpected invitation, rushed to the café.","Their meeting spot was crowded, and all three men had spies keeping tabs on each other.","When Du Jiaming learned Qin Ruo had ditched him for Yang Su, his heart twisted in anguish. He didn’t blame her—his hatred was reserved for Yang Su.","She had chosen him! What had gone wrong during their park meeting?","Yang Su, on the other hand, felt like he’d won the lottery. Overjoyed, he reached for Qin Ruo’s hand.","Normally, she’d never let him touch her, but to torment Du Jiaming, she didn’t pull away.","The instant his fingers brushed her left hand, the same scorching pain flared. She wrenched free, her face contorting.","\"Yang Su, what are you wearing?\" Her usually sweet voice turned icy.","Yang Su was baffled. \"Wearing? Do I look bad?\"","Qin Ruo clenched her injured hand behind her back, seething.","Something was wrong. These idiots were sabotaging her!","Suppressing her rage, she called Zhang Chengyan in front of Yang Su.","\"Chengyan, where are you?\"","Yang Su’s face paled as he experienced the same heart-wrenching pain Du Jiaming had felt earlier.","\"Great, wait for me at Century Plaza.\"","The spies exchanged glances: What kind of game was this woman playing? And why were these three men acting like they were under a spell?","At Century Plaza, Zhang Chengyan finally saw Qin Ruo approaching.","He was utterly overjoyed, having assumed today would be a lost cause—only to find light in the darkest hour.","The square was spacious, and the person tailing them didn’t dare get too close, so they couldn’t overhear the conversation between the two.","Qin Ruo had already resolved not to touch anyone else today.","Standing before Zhang Chengyan, she looked at this man—so easily manipulated, utterly defenseless in her grasp—and felt nothing but contempt. Yet her expression remained soft as she murmured,","\"Why didn’t you ask to meet me yesterday?\"","Just the day before, the three of them had been perfectly fine. But after missing just one day, this had happened. There had to be something more to it.","\"Yesterday?\" Zhang Chengyan answered without hesitation. \"I went to a Taoist temple.\"","That’s it?","Qin Ruo frowned. A man she had ensnared could resist seeking her out for an entire day—just to visit some temple?","\"What did you go there for?\"","\"Don’t laugh, but I’m a bit superstitious. I went to get a protective charm.\"","\"Did Du Jiaming and Yang Su get one too?\"","\"...Yes.\"","Qin Ruo closed her eyes, suppressing the fury rising inside her. \"Which temple?\"","Which temple’s charm could possibly harm her?","\"Lingxu Temple.\"","Qin Ruo stiffened. How was that possible?!"]},{"number":20,"title":"Chapter 20","paragraphs":["The Lingxu Temple indeed enjoys thriving incense offerings, but as far as Qin Ruo knew, the temple housed very few highly skilled Taoist priests. Most of them lived reclusive lives, secluded in meditation and cultivation, rarely making public appearances—let alone handing out three highly potent protective talismans.","Just as she was about to inquire further, an anomaly occurred on the back of her hand. After two instances of spiritual energy burns, the spell she had cast on herself began to falter. Her originally fair and smooth skin now bore faint wrinkles.","Such domineering spiritual energy!","Unable to see her own face, Qin Ruo feared it might have aged as well. In the middle of a crowded square, she could no longer afford hesitation. \"I don’t like superstitious people,\" she said. \"Throw those talismans away.\"","Zhang Chengyan obeyed without question, tossing the protective talismans from his pocket into a nearby fountain. The paper talismans, soaked through, lost their power.","\"You’re so good to me,\" Qin Ruo praised, her gaze darkening.","The medicine could no longer suppress the spiritual energy’s erosion of her spell. Now, she had no choice but to take a desperate gamble—otherwise, she would be the one to perish.","Zhang Chengyan grinned foolishly. \"Who else would I be good to if not you?\"","\"Do you love me?\"","\"Of course!\"","\"Would you share everything with me?\"","\"What’s mine is yours.\"","\"Including your vitality? Your fortune?\"","\"Yes.\"","Qin Ruo suddenly smiled. She stepped forward and embraced Zhang Chengyan. Though she felt a twinge of reluctance to part with this \"walking blood bag,\" if he could help her survive this crisis, he would have fulfilled his purpose.","Goodbye, fool.","Zhang Chengyan was ecstatic, completely unaware that his vitality and fortune were being siphoned into Qin Ruo.","Meanwhile, two other observers reported back to their employers.","Du Jiaming and Yang Su felt as if their hearts had been pierced, the pain unbearable.","She hugged someone else!","In the square, Qin Ruo released Zhang Chengyan. Watching his eyes grow dull, she felt not an ounce of guilt. \"I have things to do. I’ll leave first.\"","Zhang Chengyan didn’t dare stop her, watching her retreating figure until she disappeared. Listless, he returned home.","Upon entering, he noticed the servants giving him odd looks, but he paid no mind, feeling only exhaustion. He went straight to his bedroom and collapsed onto the bed.","At lunchtime, the servants knocked but received no response. When they opened the door, they found an elderly man with deep wrinkles and graying hair lying on the bed!","A scream erupted, plunging the Zhang household into panic and chaos.","Father Zhang and Mother Zhang rushed to the hospital, rendered speechless by the sight of their son. Though he had aged drastically, they could still recognize him.","Zhang Chengyan had woken up, tears streaming down his face at the sight of his parents.","\"Doctor, what on earth happened?\" Mother Zhang sobbed.","The doctor was equally baffled. \"The patient’s bodily functions exhibit symptoms of accelerated aging—possibly progeria. Further tests are needed for a definitive diagnosis.\"","\"How could he suddenly develop this? Can it be treated?\" Father Zhang struggled to accept the situation.","The doctor shook his head. \"There’s currently no medication to halt the progression.\"","Mother Zhang collapsed onto the hospital bed, weeping uncontrollably.","Further examinations yielded no treatment plan. Zhang Chengyan’s aging was accelerating—he didn’t have much time left. Even if they rushed him to a top hospital in the capital overnight, he wouldn’t survive the journey.","Such a bizarre incident couldn’t be kept secret. Soon, word spread among Longjiang City’s elite circles.","Gossip ran rampant in private group chats.","[Sun Yu: This is terrifying. How did he suddenly turn into an old man? If this happened to me, I’d rather die.]","[Qian Kun: My mom thinks it’s a curse.]","[Peng Peng: Everyone knows Aunt Ma believes in that stuff. Remember when she introduced that so-called Taoist master to Aunt Gu? How did that turn out, huh? @Qi Yuan]","[Qi Yuan: None of my damn business.]","[Qian Kun: Then explain this—what kind of aging disease makes someone wither in an hour? I heard Zhang Chengyan was perfectly fine before he got home.]","[Su Nuanuan: Not entirely impossible.]","[Qian Kun: Oh, Sis Nuanuan, please, have mercy and unblock me?]","Su Nuanuan scoffed coldly, setting her phone aside to speak to Su Linhai. \"Do you think Zhang Chengyan’s sudden aging could really be a curse?\"","Su Linhai frowned. \"It’s possible.\"","He had business ties with the Zhang family. If they fell into crisis, his own family would suffer collateral damage. Moreover, he understood the agony of losing a child.","After some thought, he called Qi Quan first.","Qi Quan had spent the day crafting several sets of clothing—each no larger than a palm, yet exquisitely detailed.","She summoned Su Rong and handed them to him.","Su Rong looked down. Huh???","Was the master pulling his leg?","\"Take them.\"","Su Rong instinctively cupped his hands, and the moment the tiny clothes touched his skin, they miraculously expanded to human size. He was stunned.","Even as a ghost for years, he’d never witnessed such a phenomenon.","\"I’ve inscribed these with talismanic patterns. Only my ghost attendants can synchronize with them.\"","In other words, these clothes were tailor-made for Su Rong alone.","Touched, Su Rong gained a new appreciation for Qi Quan’s unfathomable abilities.","\"From now on, you’ll be the household’s head steward.\"","\"Yes.\"","Su Rong reverently carried the clothes to his room, trying on each set. Every piece fit perfectly. In the end, he chose the most classic ensemble—a white dress shirt paired with tailored trousers.","With his tall, slender frame, he looked even more strikingly handsome.","Wang Hua watched, green with envy.","Before he could comment, the landline rang.","Su Rong floated over to answer.","\"Hello?\"","Su Linhai’s voice softened on the other end. \"Rongrong?\"","Su Rong smiled. \"Dad, is something wrong?\"","Su Linhai wiped away tears, overjoyed to hear his son speaking like any normal person.","\"Rongrong, I need to speak with the master.\"","Su Rong replied, \"You can tell me. I’ll relay it to her.\"","The master disliked disturbances.","\"Alright.\" Su Linhai described Zhang Chengyan’s condition, then lowered his voice. \"I wanted to ask if this is a curse—and if it can be treated.\"","Su Rong relayed the question.","Qi Quan, who had already sensed the talisman’s activation, answered from behind her door: \"It is a curse. It can be treated. The hospital is too public. If they want help, bring him to the villa.\"","With confirmation, Su Linhai called Father Zhang. \"How is your son?\"","\"Thank you for your concern, Director Su. I’m afraid...\"","The words \"waiting to die\" stuck in his throat.","Su Linhai tread carefully. \"Have you considered consulting a master? At this point, you should try every possible solution.\"","\"Huh?\" Father Zhang’s mother had been superstitious, and Zhang Chengyan, raised by her, had absorbed those beliefs. Father Zhang himself, however, had never bought into such things.","Su Linhai pressed, \"If you’re willing, I can arrange for a true master to see him.\"","Father Zhang steeled himself. Desperate times called for desperate measures.","\"Then I’ll trouble you, Director Su!\""]},{"number":21,"title":"Chapter 21","paragraphs":["Zhang Chengyan certainly did not want to die.","Rather than counting down the hours, feeling his organs fail, and waiting for death to claim him, he decided to seek out a master and try his luck. He had always believed in such things, so after hearing his father’s suggestion, he immediately resolved to leave the hospital and head to the master’s residence.","Mother Zhang was already distraught, quietly sobbing as she followed them into the car. Once inside, she asked, \"Why the sudden decision to seek out a master? Is this master even reliable?\"","\"It was Director Qi who recommended him. He lives in a lakeside villa in the southern suburbs. We’ll know once we get there,\" Father Zhang replied, wiping his face. With their son’s life hanging by a thread—less than an hour left—the master was their only hope.","Zhang Chengyan lay in the car, tears streaming down his face. On the brink of death, he suddenly remembered the question Qin Ruo had asked him in Century Square—","\"Are you willing to share everything with me?\"","\"Including your life, including your fortune.\"","A chill ran through his blood, and just as doubt began to creep in, an eerie force suppressed his rationality, leaving only the image of Qin Ruo’s beautiful, innocent face in his mind.","Lakeside Villa.","The system reacted belatedly: [Boss, when you sent those three to Lingxu Temple earlier, did you already foresee this? Do you know who’s behind their suffering? If you know, why not just eliminate the culprit directly?]","Qi Quan chuckled softly: [I’m not some purely selfless savior.]","[Huh?]","[In the novel, why did the original host go bungee jumping?]","[She was egged on by a group of rich kids.]","[Why did they encourage her?]","[...?]","[Who exactly was involved?]","[Du Jiaming and his friends seemed to be the main instigators.]","[Don’t you find it strange? Without any grudge, why would they want to kill the original host?]","The system was baffled: [Kill her? Didn’t the original host die of fright?]","[You must’ve skimmed through it, but there’s a detail in the text: \"As Qi Quan plummeted, she seemed to see something utterly terrifying, so horrifying that her heart stopped. By the time the bungee jump ended, everyone realized she was already dead.\"]","[Right.]","[What was that terrifying thing?]","The system: [...]","It had signed up for a melodramatic, wish-fulfillment novel—accidentally stumbling into the supernatural genre was bad enough, but now it had veered into a mystery thriller?","This was giving it a headache.","Qi Quan said: [Even if they were just puppets, they’re not innocent.]","The system understood now—the boss wanted them to suffer the consequences of their actions, to endure more torment.","The Zhang family arrived at the lakeside villa in half an hour.","Zhang Chengyan was already on the verge of death. His skin had lost all moisture, sagging loosely like an empty sack. He couldn’t even sit up.","His parents carried him together through the villa gates.","They were greeted by Su Rong, dressed in a crisp white shirt and dress pants, his face wearing a polite smile as he led them to a room in the west wing.","\"Master! Please, save my son!\" Mother Zhang cried, disregarding all dignity as she nearly dropped to her knees before Su Rong.","Su Rong steadied her with a subtle force, surprising her, and said, \"The master will arrive shortly. Please, both of you, wait in the side hall.\"","Mother Zhang hesitated, but Father Zhang pulled her out of the room.","Inside, the dim yellow light cast eerie shadows over Zhang Chengyan’s clouded eyes, making him tear up again. He could feel death creeping closer with every second.","Terror gripped him, yet he couldn’t even tremble.","Through his blurred vision, a slender figure entered the room and approached him.","She wore a loose dress, her hair pinned up with a wooden hairpin, revealing delicate, serene features.","She looked familiar.","His eyes widened in shock—it was her?!","Qi Quan asked, \"Do you want to live?\"","Zhang Chengyan strained to force out a single word: \"Yes.\"","\"Good.\"","She extended a slender hand... and pressed a fingertip to his forehead.","Downtown, in an apartment.","Qin Ruo admired herself in the mirror, gently stroking her restored, smooth cheeks, reassured.","Though she had lost a pawn, the results were acceptable. Once things settled, she would investigate Lingxu Temple personally.","Knock, knock, knock.","She frowned. Who would visit so late? Could it be Du Jiaming and the others? If so, that saved her the trouble of hunting them down for nourishment.","She opened the door to find a middle-aged man standing there, his eyes brimming with anxiety.","\"What are you doing here?\" Qin Ruo sneered. \"Didn’t I tell you to stay away? Huang Qifeng, are you ignoring my orders?\"","Huang Qifeng grimaced. \"You turned off your phone.\"","Qin Ruo: \"...\"","After leaving Zhang Chengyan, she had shut off her phone to avoid harassment from those two men.","She stepped aside. \"Come in.\"","Huang Qifeng entered cautiously, not daring to sit, and stood before her. \"Qi Changrong still hasn’t responded. He might be backing out of the land bid. What should we do now?\"","Qin Ruo asked, \"Who else is in the running?\"","\"The Song, Du, Yang, and Zhang families.\"","\"I can get the Du and Yang families to withdraw. The Zhangs are too preoccupied now. As for the Songs... who’s handling the deal?\"","Huang Qifeng said, \"Song Lin.\"","A flash of resentment crossed Qin Ruo’s eyes. \"That devoted fiancé, the Song family’s only son.\"","She spat out the word \"devoted\" with venom.","Back when she had been scouting targets, Song Lin had been high on her list. But his heart belonged solely to that white lotus, Qi Yingxue. When Qin Ruo had tried to approach him, he had coldly sneered and uttered just one word—","\"Scram.\"","After that, she’d never gotten close to him again.","\"Right,\" Huang Qifeng nodded obsequiously.","Qin Ruo smirked. \"If Song Lin wants it, let him have it.\"","She’d see how long his arrogance lasted.","\"What about the Qi family—\"","\"Don’t worry. The Qis will soon—\"","Suddenly, blood gushed from Qin Ruo’s throat, splattering Huang Qifeng’s clothes.","His mind blanked for a second before he screamed.","\"Someone... broke... my... Peach Blossom Seal,\" Qin Ruo gasped, clutching her mouth. \"Quick—turn on my phone!\"","Huang Qifeng watched in horror as she spat another mouthful of blood, her once-youthful face instantly withering into wrinkles. His voice shook uncontrollably.","\"Hurry!\" Qin Ruo shrieked, swallowing pills frantically, but no amount of medicine could stop the reversal of her stolen vitality.","The Zhangs! Zhang Chengyan!","How had they found a master so powerful?!","Trembling, Huang Qifeng turned on her phone. Qin Ruo snatched it and dialed Du Jiaming and Yang Su, demanding they come immediately.","Back at the lakeside villa, the moment the Peach Blossom Seal shattered, Zhang Chengyan’s muddled mind cleared.","Recalling his foolish behavior over the past days, he wanted to slap himself silly. Connecting Qin Ruo’s last words to his unexplained aging, he’d have to be an idiot not to realize her scheme now.","That witch! This grudge was irreconcilable!","As vitality slowly returned to his body, his appearance reverted to that of a healthy young man in his twenties.","Zhang Chengyan looked at Qi Quan, who stood by his bedside performing the ritual, and thought of how he had once offended her. A wave of guilt and dread washed over him.","If Qi Quan held a grudge and refused to save him, he would truly be dead.","He might not even know how he died.","\"I'm sorry,\" he said hoarsely.","Qi Quan's gaze remained calm, ignoring his apology entirely, and simply stated, \"Though vitality has returned to your body, the portion that was consumed cannot be restored. Your lifespan will be shorter than before.\"","Zhang Chengyan: \"...\"","Clutching his chest, heart aching!","Father Zhang and Mother Zhang waited anxiously in the side room, glancing at their watches repeatedly, never having felt time pass so slowly.","Su Rong stood nearby the entire time. As if receiving a message, she lifted her head and said, \"The treatment is complete. Please follow me.\"","The couple pushed open the door with trepidation.","Their son sat on the edge of the bed, bending over to put on his shoes. Hearing the noise, he raised his head and gave them a smile—both aggrieved and relieved—before calling out hoarsely, \"Dad, Mom.\"","Mother Zhang rushed over and hugged him tightly, weeping uncontrollably.","Father Zhang, though equally emotional, remembered to thank the master. However, the master was nowhere to be seen in the room. With reddened eyes, he asked Su Rong, \"Where is the master? I’d like to thank our benefactor in person.\"","\"The master needs rest,\" Su Rong replied with a smile. \"Your son has been cured. The three of you may leave now.\"","\"But the payment...\"","Su Rong: \"That depends on Mr. Zhang’s discretion.\"","Father Zhang: \"...\"","Wasn’t the concern here giving too little and displeasing the master?","He wanted to ask further, but Zhang Chengyan interjected, \"Dad, why don’t we consult Director Su first and come back tomorrow to formally visit and express our gratitude?\"","Father Zhang was persuaded. \"Very well.\"","As the three stepped out of the villa’s front door, they couldn’t help but glance back. Mother Zhang sighed, \"What a remarkable person. It’s a shame we didn’t get to see them in person—they must have an immortal’s grace.\"","Zhang Chengyan: \"...\"","If you had actually seen them, you probably wouldn’t have believed it and might’ve even stopped them from treating me.","The master truly was a master. Maintaining an air of mystery avoided so much doubt and conflict.","The Zhang family’s driver had been waiting outside the villa the entire time.","He had witnessed the state Zhang Chengyan was in when he was brought here. In his opinion, there was no way he could be saved.","He had been prepared to see his employers emerge in tears. Never in his wildest dreams did he expect all three of them to walk out—alive and well!","The driver rubbed his eyes hard.","It was real! The young master had truly recovered!","This was nothing short of miraculous!","As soon as the Zhang family got into the car, Father Zhang called Su Linhai. After a string of effusive thanks, he finally asked, \"Director Su, how should we determine the master’s payment?\"","He was asking for the market rate.","Su Linhai couldn’t help but laugh. \"How much do you think your son’s life is worth?\"","Father Zhang: \"...\"","Even after being teased, he wasn’t angry. He simply said, \"His life is priceless to me. Director Su, please enlighten me.\"","Su Linhai stopped joking. \"The master’s ways differ from others. The payment is up to your discretion—just ensure it comes from the heart. But there’s one thing you must not overlook.\"","\"Please go on.\"","\"The master is serializing a novel online. If you have time, Director Zhang, you might consider supporting it.\"","Father Zhang: ???","After hanging up, faced with his wife’s anxious questioning, he said blankly, \"Director Su said the key is to support the master’s novel.\"","Mother Zhang was equally baffled. \"A novel?\"","\"A novel?\" Zhang Chengyan suddenly spoke up. \"I know about this!\"","He quickly opened the app and navigated to the novel’s page. A sudden realization struck him, and he pointed out the top name on the tipping leaderboard to his parents.","\"Director Su’s name is Linhai, right? This must be him!\" He scrolled down the leaderboard. \"'Forever Prosperous' must be Director Qi, right? And 'Aunt Gu’s Grace,' 'Qi Lin'...\"","The Zhang couple: A whole new world had opened before them.","Father Zhang immediately declared, \"Set one up for me too. I want to tip as well!\"","And so, the readers waiting late at night for an update were met not with a new chapter, but with three people tipping like mad.","The Zhang family poured all their effort into securing the top three spots on the leaderboard.","The system reported the data in real time, utterly numb by now.","[Big shot, it’s almost ten. What about today’s update?]","Qi Quan was utterly unbothered. [Taking a break today. No update.]","[Then at least post a notice.]","[A notice?]","The system said, [If you’re not updating, you should at least let your eagerly waiting readers know in advance.]","Qi Quan was puzzled. [I have readers?]","She had assumed those reading her work were just insiders privy to certain matters.","Even if there were readers, surely none were genuine fans.","The system: [You do. Someone even follows you on Weibo and defends you in debates with other readers.]","After some thought, Qi Quan posted a notice. Out of curiosity, she checked the comments section.","The latest comment—","[Today’s Auspicious: Thank you, Master, for saving my worthless life! I was blind before! If I’ve offended you in any way, please forgive me! Kowtowing in gratitude!]","Clearly, this was Zhang Chengyan, a former hater turned fan.","The novel had been sitting atop the tipping leaderboard, and the staggering amounts attracted droves of people coming to worship the wealthy patrons. The collection count had already surpassed three thousand.","As soon as the notice went up, someone spotted it.","[Call Me to Prepare Lessons: The person above really got saved by the master? So lucky! The master must be exhausted today. No update is fine—rest well!]","[Does the Rich Lady Need a Bed Warmer: Even though there’s no update today, I’m weirdly hyped?]","[Filial Piety is Dead: How are you not tired of playing along every day? The first time was funny, but now it’s just awkward. Though the author really is rich enough to do whatever.]","[Pythagorean Theorem ABC: The author’s legit loaded! I’m settling in here!]","[Pear Blossoms in Misty Rain: OMG, 'Linhai Forest' isn’t happy about losing the top spot and just reclaimed it! 'Aunt Gu’s Grace' and 'Forever Prosperous' aren’t backing down either—this battle is intense!]","The spectators were stunned.","This was a true clash of titans.","[XX’s Dad: The real winner here is Scream Literature City.]","The fight for the top spot was neither the beginning nor the end.","Even the system was getting fired up.","After browsing the comments, Qi Quan remained unperturbed. She shut her laptop and went to bed.","Meanwhile, Zhang Chengyan’s miraculous recovery was like a stone thrown into still waters, sending ripples far and wide."]},{"number":22,"title":"Chapter 22","paragraphs":["The Zhang family of three had been so engrossed in live-streaming rewards and leaderboard rankings that they only remembered their pressing matters once they returned home.","Zhang Chengyan immediately called Du Jiaming and Yang Su, hoping to persuade them to turn back from their misguided path, but neither answered their phones.","He had already explained the situation to his parents and now said anxiously, \"Dad, Mom, Du Jiaming and Yang Su have been bewitched just like I was. Today, Qin Ruo suddenly attacked me—I almost died. Now their phones are unreachable. What should we do?\"","After falling under the Peach Blossom Seal, he had turned against his best friends and even fought them publicly. Now that he had regained his senses, he couldn’t just stand by and watch them die at Qin Ruo’s hands.","Father Zhang’s expression darkened. \"I’ll call the Du and Yang families.\"","That enchantress had simultaneously ensnared the children of three families—he couldn’t help but suspect her motives.","This was no longer just about their own family’s interests.","When the Du and Yang families received his inquiries, they realized their sons were indeed missing—not at home, not at their usual hangouts, and their phones were all turned off. They immediately sent people to search.","Father Du couldn’t hold back his question: \"Chairman Zhang, what exactly happened to your son? Why are you asking about Jiaming?\"","\"Director Du, let’s find your son first,\" Father Zhang sighed. \"If there’s any problem you can’t solve, you can come to me.\"","The Yang family received the same response.","Originally, they had been observing the Zhang family’s situation, but now, while the Zhangs’ son had returned safely, their own son was nowhere to be found.","After making the calls, Father Zhang turned and saw his son staring intently at him.","\"What is it?\"","\"Dad, didn’t you want that plot of land in the northern suburbs?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Don’t pursue it.\"","\"Why?\"","Zhang Chengyan shook his phone, displaying a novel’s webpage. \"You donated so many rewards to the Master’s story, but you haven’t read it yet, have you? Read it from start to finish—you’ll understand.\"","Father Zhang, exhausted from the day’s harrowing events, felt his head pounding, but he complied and began reading. Mother Zhang, hearing this, picked up her phone and joined him.","The chapters were short, and they finished quickly, both wearing dazed expressions afterward.","Mother Zhang murmured, \"This story sounds so familiar.\"","Father Zhang had an epiphany. \"So Chairman Su recommended the Master to me because she helped him find his son?\"","\"But wait—shouldn’t the Master be an elderly sage with a long beard and an immortal aura? How... how is she just a young girl?\" Mother Zhang suddenly snapped back to reality and looked at her son. \"Did you meet the Master?\"","\"I did.\" Seeing his parents’ shock, Zhang Chengyan felt a twisted sense of satisfaction.","When he learned that Qi Quan was the Master who had saved him, his reaction had been even more exaggerated—after all, his life had been on the line.","\"So the Master is really...\"","Zhang Chengyan nodded. \"She’s the true heiress who recently returned to the Qi family. Uncle Su’s story is probably true, and so is the grandmother of that maid. I looked into it—the Master posted the new chapter before the maid even learned of her grandmother’s death.\"","Mother Zhang gasped.","Father Zhang added, \"So the Su and Qi families withdrew from the northern suburbs competition because of the Master’s novel?\"","\"Exactly.\" Zhang Chengyan spoke gravely. \"Before, you could dismiss it, but now—better safe than sorry.\"","As far as he was concerned, Qi Quan had his complete devotion.","Mother Zhang chimed in, \"Let’s listen to the Master. She did save Yan’s life, after all.\"","\"Fine. I won’t pursue the land either.\"","Meanwhile, in the \"Food Crime Syndicate\" group chat:","[Qian Kun: Holy crap! It’s a miracle! Zhang Chengyan is alive again!]","[Sun Yu: I have ten thousand curses I don’t even know how to articulate.]","[Peng Peng: I live next door to him—I knew before any of you. You have no idea how I felt seeing Zhang Chengyan alive and kicking.]","[Qian Kun: Didn’t the doctors issue a critical condition notice?]","[Sun Yu: I just want to know which divine healer pulled this off.]","[Peng Peng: My family’s driver said they went to a Master to save him.]","...","[Qian Kun: How does your driver know?]","[Peng Peng: Our drivers are close. Something this supernatural deserves to be shared.]","[Qian Kun: Which Master? Maybe my mom knows her.]","[Sun Yu: You mean the ‘Ghost-Fearing Taoist Priest’ Auntie Ma introduced? LOL.]","[Peng Peng: No idea, but apparently Father Zhang was directed to her by Chairman Su—somewhere in the lakeside villas in the southern suburbs.]","[Qian Kun: @Su Nuanuan, my dear Miss Su, are you really still not unblocking me? I admit I was wrong for doubting your family’s stance on Qi Quan and slandering Uncle Su’s character!]","[Sun Yu: Miss Nuanuan, was it really your dad who pointed the Zhangs to the Master?]","Su Nuanuan watched the group chat flood with messages, knowing they were itching for answers, but she played coy: [If you want to know, ask the Zhangs yourself.]","With that, she muted the chat and went to sleep.","The midnight moon was veiled by clouds.","In a downtown apartment, Qin Ruo had regained her youthful beauty. She addressed the two men with dull, lifeless eyes: \"You may leave now.\"","Du Jiaming and Yang Su obeyed without question.","Huang Qifeng, who had been hiding in the bathroom, emerged cautiously. \"Are these two pawns also useless now?\"","\"What are you implying?\" Qin Ruo sat before a mirror, admiring her eternally flawless face.","Huang Qifeng hesitated. \"What about the Master in the future...\"","\"Those three were just mediocre specimens. The truly high-quality ones are still out there.\"","\"You mean Song Lin?\"","\"One isn’t enough.\" Qin Ruo’s eyes darkened with malice. \"I can’t show myself right now. Go investigate—find out which expert the Zhangs hired.\"","\"What if the Zhangs refuse to talk?\"","Qin Ruo shot him a cold glare. \"Didn’t we just acquire two new test subjects? Can’t you follow them?\"","\"Yes!\"","Huang Qifeng left respectfully. Once alone, Qin Ruo dropped her composed demeanor and nervously dialed a number.","\"It’s late. What is it?\" A deep, authoritative voice answered.","Qin Ruo clenched her teeth. \"The Qi family is giving up on that land.\"","\"Why?\"","\"I’m not sure yet. Maybe the competition was too fierce.\"","The man fell silent before replying, his tone unreadable: \"What about Qi Quan?\"","\"Huh?\" Qin Ruo was taken aback. \"You mean the Qi family’s true heiress?\"","\"Yes.\" The man chuckled. \"You’ve been hunting in Longjiang City for so long—haven’t you noticed?\"","\"Noticed what?\"","\"Those three prey of yours combined aren’t worth half of her.\"","Qin Ruo’s heart lurched. \"But she’s just...\"","A mediocre country girl—how could she possibly possess such overwhelming fortune?","\"She will be your greatest obstacle.\" His voice lowered, laced with temptation. \"Those men are your weapons. Use them wisely.\"","\"And the Qi family...?\"","\"Without her, they’re nothing to fear.\"","\"I understand.\"","\"I’ll be visiting Longjiang City in a few days.\"","\"Understood.\"","Qin Ruo didn’t dare admit she had already lost three pawns. Clinging to hope, she resolved to hunt for higher-quality targets.","Like Qi Yuan.","Like Song Lin.","Qi Yuan had already been targeted. Compared to the other three, Qi Yuan's aura was stronger—devouring him would undoubtedly be far more satisfying.","Moreover, if she could use her own younger brother’s hands to eliminate Qi Quan, her greatest obstacle, wouldn’t that be even more perfect?","Thinking this, she still felt uneasy and retrieved a bracelet—one enhanced with a spell formation, far more advanced than Huang Qifeng’s.","Before, she had disliked the bracelet’s unattractive appearance and assumed there were no profound practitioners of the mystic arts in Longjiang City, so she hadn’t worn it.","Who would have thought that a moment of negligence would lead to the backlash of the Peach Blossom Seal, causing her to lose three pawns in an instant?","The bracelet bore a talisman array personally inscribed by that person, capable of blocking one...","...lethal attack. As long as the opponent’s cultivation wasn’t deeper than that person’s, they couldn’t harm her—instead, they would suffer the backlash.","Qin Ruo refused to believe that the practitioner who had saved Zhang Chengyan could possibly match that person’s level of cultivation.","The Du and Yang families had sent countless people to search for their missing children, but by dawn, the two boys had returned home on their own and collapsed into bed.","Seeing no obvious abnormalities on the surface, their families relaxed and went to rest.","The next morning, sharp, terrified screams erupted from both households.","Horrifying wrinkles now marred the faces of Du Jiaming and Yang Su. Medical examinations revealed that, while their conditions weren’t as severe as Zhang Chengyan’s, their bodily functions were indeed slowly deteriorating.","After receiving three patients with eerily similar symptoms in just two days, the hospital doctors began to suspect something was amiss.","But their deeply ingrained materialistic worldview kept them from considering supernatural causes. Their advice remained the same: transfer to a better-equipped hospital.","Without consulting each other, the Du and Yang families both arranged transfers to the capital’s top hospital.","Meanwhile, the Zhang family arrived at the lakeside villa bearing gifts.","Inside the villa, Su Rong served a lavish breakfast and sat down to eat with Qi Quan, while Wang Hua drifted nearby, his expression full of envy.","As he ate, Su Rong discreetly observed Qi Quan, mentally noting which dishes she favored and which she barely touched, determined to refine his cooking further next time.","Having been a ghost for over a decade, Su Rong had rarely left Chibe Village to search for his father. Most of his time had been spent among the graves by the river, where he befriended many elderly spirits.","One ghostly grandfather, whose ancestors had once served as imperial chefs, often boasted about his culinary skills. Su Rong, having listened countless times, had memorized many recipes.","A quick learner, he had mastered the art of cooking after just a few attempts in the villa.","Qi Quan ate with relish, thoroughly satisfied with the first ghost servant she had taken under her wing in this world.","After the meal, she called Su Rong over.","“From now on, I’ll often send you out on errands. Though you’re under my protection, there’s no guarantee some fool—human or ghost—won’t try to bully you.”","She pulled out several sheets of paper covered in writing and, in front of both ghosts, burned them with spiritual fire.","The ashes drifted into Su Rong’s hands.","“This is a cultivation technique for spirits. Study it on your own for now, and ask me if you have any questions.”","Su Rong’s face lit up with joy. “Thank you, Master!”","Who wouldn’t want to grow stronger?","Wang Hua: “...”","Was it too late to change his mind?","Soon after, the Zhang family arrived to express their gratitude.","Once again, Su Rong greeted them.","Last night, in their panic, they hadn’t looked closely at him, but now, Mother Zhang found Su Rong strangely familiar—though she wisely kept the thought to herself.","Father Zhang bowed respectfully. “Is the Master available? We’d like to thank her in person.”","“Follow me.” This time, Su Rong didn’t refuse.","The three were led to the backyard.","A small pond lay at the center, adorned with a pavilion surrounded by lush lotus leaves and blooming flowers.","Zhang Chengyan looked up.","Inside the pavilion sat a woman in a pale blue dress, her hair loosely pinned with a wooden hairpin, a few strands dancing in the breeze. She wore no other adornments, yet her presence was breathtaking—ethereal and effortlessly elegant.","Remembering the cruel remarks he and Du Jiaming had once made about her supposed “ugliness,” Zhang Chengyan burned with shame.","Her features hadn’t changed since her return to the Qi family, but back then, her sun-darkened skin and thin frame had obscured her beauty. Now, nourished and radiant, her allure was undeniable.","Father and Mother Zhang were equally awed.","Had their son not fallen victim to such a bizarre ordeal, they would never have known the Qi family’s daughter possessed such extraordinary abilities.","Bowing deeply, Father Zhang extended several documents and a card. “We owe you our son’s life. These are but small tokens of our gratitude.”","Qi Quan lazily scattered fish food into the pond. “No need for formalities.”","...and motioned for Su Rong to accept the gifts.","A property deed, a luxury car, and a card holding fifty million.","Predictable offerings, no different from her past life.","By the time of her death in that life, she’d lost count of her properties, cars, and bank balances—all rendered meaningless.","Perhaps this time, she could actually enjoy them.","Seeing her acceptance, Father Zhang relaxed slightly and ventured, “Master, regarding the woman Qin Ruo, who caused my son’s suffering... what should we do?”","“No need to worry. I have my own plans.”","Mother Zhang exhaled in relief, her reverence deepening. Hesitantly, she asked, “Master, if our son encounters someone like Qin Ruo again... could you grant him a protective talisman? Money is no object.”","Qi Quan fell silent.","It had been years since she’d last drawn a protection talisman, and she currently lacked suitable paper and cinnabar.","The Zhangs, mistaking her silence for disapproval, grew anxious.","“Forgive our thoughtlessness,” Father Zhang quickly interjected, pulling his wife back. “We won’t disturb you further.”","Qi Quan spoke softly, “I don’t have talisman paper or cinnabar on hand. Once I acquire some...”","“Master, tell us what quality you require, and we’ll have them delivered!” Father Zhang seized the opportunity to curry favor.","Qi Quan hesitated, then glanced at the eager man. “Anything will do.”","If the Master said “anything,” of course they’d procure the finest!","Father Zhang immediately prepared to arrange the purchase.","“Wait.” Qi Quan stopped them with a gentle warning. “Your son’s vitality has been drained, and his lifespan shortened. He should perform more good deeds, accumulate merit, and... exercise restraint in matters of the bedchamber.”","Zhang Chengyan: “...”","Father Zhang glared. “You hear that?!”","Hadn’t his son nearly died because of his lust? Why else would Qin Ruo target him and his friends, while men like Qi Lin and Song Lin remained untouched?","Blushing furiously, Zhang Chengyan muttered, “Understood.”","Even without the Master’s warning, he wouldn’t dare touch another woman recklessly.","After they left, Qi Quan remained in the pavilion, feeding the fish.","The system asked, [Great One, didn’t you draw talismans at the Su residence without paper or cinnabar?]","Qi Quan savored the tranquility. [Drawing talismans in midair consumes far more spiritual power.]","The system: So Zhang Chengyan only rates paper talismans, huh.","Before long, Su Rong approached with a phone.","“Master, you have a call.”","Qi Quan leaned back in her chair, eyes closed as she rested. \"Who is it?\"","\"Unknown.\"","Qi Quan didn’t even twitch an eyebrow. \"Ignore it.\"","\"Yes.\"","Just as Su Rong turned away, the phone rang again—still displaying the same unknown number.","\"Answer it.\"","The call connected. It was Qi Yuan.","\"Qi Quan, I need to talk to you. Meet me outside.\"","Su Rong: \"...\"","Who would’ve thought her own brother’s number would show up as unknown?","Qi Quan traced the lines on her fingertips, her voice calm and certain. \"It’s Song Lin looking for me.\"","\"How did you know?!\" Qi Yuan blurted out in surprise, glancing at the man seated across from him on the sofa.","Song Lin reached for the phone, his voice low and steady. \"Qi Quan, I’d like to discuss the content of your novel with you.\"","\"Go ahead.\"","\"Let’s talk in person.\" Song Lin preferred face-to-face negotiations.","Qi Quan: \"No time.\"","She hung up without hesitation.","Su Rong took the phone back, his expression gentle as he asked, \"What would you like for lunch?\"","\"Anything.\" Qi Quan wasn’t picky—she enjoyed all good food.","Su Rong smiled and left.","Inside the coffee shop’s private room, Qi Yuan and Song Lin stared at each other in silence.","\"Lin-ge, should we call again?\"","Song Lin shook his head. \"I’ll go to her place myself.\"","\"But... she’s already moved out.\" Qi Yuan had only found out about it last night when he returned home.","Good riddance—less trouble for him.","Just as Song Lin was about to press further, his phone rang again—this time from a subordinate. \"President Song, the Su, Qi, and Zhang families have all withdrawn from the bidding. The Du and Yang families probably won’t push forward either. The land in the northern suburbs is as good as ours!\"","His brow relaxed. \"Good. I’ll head to the company now.\"","Securing the northern suburban land was crucial. Everything else could wait."]},{"number":23,"title":"Chapter 23","paragraphs":["Unlike Song Lin, who was focused on his career, the other second-generation heirs were once again shocked by bizarre events.","[Peng Peng: Damn it! Du Jiaming and Yang Su also got hit with the aging syndrome? Something’s not right!]","[Qian Kun: My mom says it’s definitely not aging syndrome—it’s some kind of curse.]","[Sun Yu: Is Aunt Ma always this funny? Don’t tell me the guy who cured Zhang Chengyan was actually some kind of Taoist priest? Give me a break.]","[Su Nuanuan: orz]","[Qian Kun: Sister Su, care to share your thoughts?]","[Sun Yu: No way Sister Su would believe that. Didn’t the Su family just storm the Qi family’s gates before?]","[Qian Kun: @Qi Yuan, Bro Yuan, someone’s sabotaging our unity here.]","Qi Yuan didn’t respond for a long time.","[Peng Peng: Seriously, haven’t you guys heard?]","[Qian Kun: Spit it out already!]","[Peng Peng: Screw you, I’ll just DM someone else.]","[Qian Kun: ...]","[Sun Yu: Hahahaha serves you right for running your mouth!]","[Su Nuanuan: Just say it.]","[Peng Peng: Fine, for Sister Su’s sake. I heard Du Jiaming and the other two were all after the same girl. That fight at Royal Club last time? It was over her.]","[Sun Yu: Three playboys suddenly turning into love-struck idiots? That’s some fantasy-level stuff.]","[Qian Kun: Definitely a curse!]","[Sun Yu: Stop letting your mom brainwash you! Move out already!]","[Qian Kun: Soon—I’m heading to college at the end of the month.]","[Sun Yu: Damn, now that I think about it, it is soon. Just left high school, now diving into college life. Bet there’ll be tons of pretty girls there, heh!]","[Peng Peng: Pretty? None as pretty as Sister Su. Too bad she’s going to college in Longjing City—miles away from us. Sister Su, stay safe out there.]","[Qian Kun: What kind of nonsense is that? Bro Yuan’s also going to Longjing City for college.]","[Peng Peng: Oh right, they’re flying off together, leaving us behind.]","[Su Nuanuan: Screw off.]","[Qi Yuan: Screw off.]","[Sun Yu: Bro Yuan’s here! You’ve been MIA lately—got a girlfriend?]","[Qian Kun: Obviously.]","[Sun Yu: And you know this how?]","[Peng Peng: Breaking news! The Du and Yang families are transferring them to a hospital in Longjing City!]","[Qian Kun: Transferring? Didn’t they say Zhang Chengyan couldn’t be transferred before?]","[Peng Peng: Rumor has it their condition isn’t as severe as Zhang Chengyan’s—might last a few more days.]","[Sun Yu: Terrifying.]","As the group chattered away, the Zhang family had already purchased a massive stock of talisman paper and cinnabar, delivering it all to the lakeside villa.","The boxes nearly filled the storage room—enough to last decades.","Qi Quan: \"Thank you for your trouble.\"","Father Zhang cautiously asked, \"Master, when can we receive the protective talismans?\"","Qi Quan raised her hand slightly. \"Wait a moment.\"","Su Rong, standing nearby, immediately presented fresh talisman paper and a cinnabar brush, placing them on the table before her.","The Zhang family trio: ???","Impromptu talisman drawing?","Weren’t Taoist priests supposed to fast, bathe, and meditate for days before drawing talismans?","Unaware of their thoughts, Qi Quan lifted the brush, hovering the tip over the paper. With a brief focus, the cinnabar flowed like a dragon’s dance—complex, intricate symbols formed in one fluid motion, flawless and powerful.","As the final stroke landed, the talisman faintly emitted a golden glow, fleeting but unmistakable to the Zhang family.","Incredible! Truly a master!","All doubts vanished from their minds.","Qi Quan set the brush down. Su Rong handed the talisman to Zhang Chengyan. \"Keep this on you at all times.\"","Zhang Chengyan accepted it with reverence, unsure how to carry it properly.","Father Zhang spoke up, embarrassed. \"Master, I know how rare such a talisman is, but... could you bless my wife and me with one as well? We’ll pay any price!\"","Qi Quan glanced at them. \"No need.\"","She repeated the process, swiftly drawing two more talismans. \"Three talismans in exchange for all this paper and cinnabar.\"","Overjoyed, the Zhang family bowed repeatedly in gratitude.","They knew the paper and cinnabar were cheap and easily bought, but a life-saving talisman like this? Priceless. In truth, they were the ones getting the better deal.","Still uneasy, they showered The Diary of the Elite with more deep-water rewards.","By now, The Diary of the Elite had firmly secured the top spot on the tipping charts, untouchable by any competitor.","The system kindly reminded her: [Big shot, you took a break yesterday. Skipping today too?]","Qi Quan: [Updating today.]","She drew two different talismans and called, \"Wang Hua.\"","Wang Hua floated over immediately.","Qi Quan handed both talismans to Su Rong for safekeeping, instructing them: \"The one with the triangle in the upper right can make ghosts visible. Wang Hua, you can now visit your sister. Tell her everything Huang Qifeng has done over the years. If possible, have her report him anonymously. And if you want, enjoy a good meal from her. Su Rong, go with him.\"","Wang Hua hesitated. \"What if my sister refuses?\"","Qi Quan replied calmly, \"You’re a ghost.\"","\"So?\"","\"Fear of ghosts is a natural reaction.\"","\"But I’m her brother, she wouldn’t—\" Wang Hua trailed off, uncertain.","Even if his sister still remembered him, he couldn’t be sure she’d accept seeing him like this.","\"If she refuses,\" Qi Quan turned to Su Rong, \"you handle it.\"","\"Understood.\" Su Rong nodded. \"What about the other talisman?\"","\"In a few days, when the time is right, place this on Qi Yuan.\"","Su Rong didn’t question it, simply agreeing.","The two ghosts left the villa, drifting toward Wang Hua’s sister’s home.","Qi Quan returned to her room and started typing. Before long, an intense surge of emotion erupted from Su Rong—a seething, murderous rage, quickly suppressed.","Sensing no danger, Qi Quan resumed writing.","At the Huang family villa, Su Rong remained invisible, his gaze locked onto a car parked in the yard.","In the driver’s seat sat a man in a crisp white shirt, clean-shaven, hair neatly styled—the picture of respectability.","But Su Rong would never forget those eyebrows, those eyes.","This was the man who had killed him, tied him to a rock, and dumped him in the river under the banyan tree.","He’d thought it would take years to find him. Never had he imagined their paths would cross here.","Even with age altering his appearance, Su Rong was certain—this was the human trafficker who had murdered him.","For a moment, he nearly lost control, wanting nothing more than to tear the man apart. But he held back.","Master’s mission came first. And he refused to dirty his hands with scum like this.","Wang Hua, too excited to notice his companion’s turmoil, led him to the second floor.","In the bedroom, Wang Qin was taking a nap.","Years of insomnia left her exhausted, prone to dozing off during the day—though even then, sleep was fleeting.","Eyes closed, she listened to the wind howling outside, its mournful wail scraping against the window like a ghost’s whisper.","The villa was spacious. And empty.","Aside from her and the servants, few ever stepped inside.","Her marriage had long been a hollow shell.","\"Big sis... big sis... big sis...\" A faint voice suddenly called out in her ear—it was Wang Hua's voice.","Wang Qin thought she was dreaming until she jerked her eyes open and saw the young man standing by her bed. He was dressed in clothes that had been popular over a decade ago, his hair cut in a rough, delinquent style, no different from the street thugs back then.","This was a face she could never forget in her lifetime!","\"Wang Hua!\" Overjoyed, she scrambled out of bed and rushed to embrace him.","...","Wang Hua instinctively took a step back.","\"Wang Hua? Don’t you remember me? I’m your big sis!\" Wang Qin called out anxiously.","Wang Hua scratched the back of his head and grinned sheepishly. \"Big sis, I’m a ghost now. Being too close to me isn’t good for your health.\"","\"I don’t care!\"","The two had lost their parents young and relied on each other, forming an unbreakable bond. Wang Qin was nearly ten years older, practically a mother figure to him.","Su Rong, remaining invisible, said to Wang Hua, \"You have a talisman on you, so it should be fine. But the talisman has a time limit—make it quick.\"","\"Got it.\"","Wang Hua nodded and stepped forward, wrapping his arms around Wang Qin. The two clung to each other, weeping bitterly. If not for the soundproofing of the house, the servants downstairs would have been startled awake.","Fortunately, Wang Hua still remembered his mission.","\"Big sis, I came today because there’s something important I need to ask of you.\"","Wang Qin immediately asked, \"Are you hungry over there? Cold? Short on money? Don’t worry, I’ll burn offerings for you right away—as much as you need!\"","\"Big sis,\" Wang Hua stopped her, \"this is about Huang Qifeng.\"","Wang Qin’s fingers trembled. \"What about him?\"","\"I’ve been a ghost for many years now, always following Huang Qifeng around. I’ve seen so many of his secrets. The way he’s treated you—I wanted to beat him senseless! But as a ghost, I couldn’t do anything.\"","Tears instantly spilled from Wang Qin’s eyes. \"You’ve suffered so much. Why... why didn’t you move on to the next life?\"","Wang Hua also wept. \"I couldn’t bear to leave you and the kids.\"","\"You’re so foolish.\"","\"Big sis, I don’t have much time left. I know about many of Huang Qifeng’s hidden crimes—he’s hurt so many people. I want him to face justice. Big sis, will you help me?\"","Wang Qin hesitated. \"But... he’s the children’s father.\"","Having a criminal for a father would greatly affect their future.","Wang Hua also wavered.","\"Wang Hua, ask her who that driver in the courtyard is and what his relationship with Huang Qifeng is,\" Su Rong interrupted, cutting through his indecision.","Wang Hua repeated the question.","Wang Qin visibly relaxed and answered, \"He used to work for your brother-in-law. Later, he became our family driver, mainly driving for me.\"","\"What’s his name?\"","\"Niu Qiang.\"","Su Rong clenched his fists, his handsome face tense as he asked, \"Where is he from?\"","\"Big sis, where’s he from?\"","Wang Qin smiled. \"From the same village as your brother-in-law. Remember? Just five miles from our village—Chihe Village.\"","Boom—","Su Rong swayed slightly, his spirit nearly destabilizing.","If he weren’t a ghost servant, sustained by Qi Quan’s power, he might have already succumbed to rage and turned into a vengeful spirit, hunting Niu Qiang down.","He dug his nails into his palms, his voice low and hoarse. \"Wang Hua, time’s almost up. Ask her one more time.\"","\"Big sis, you probably don’t know this, but Huang Qifeng has many women outside. He’s betrayed you—he’s no good man. He’s done countless evil deeds. Someone like him deserves to be punished by the law! Big sis, will you—\"","\"Wang Hua!\" Wang Qin’s eyes brimmed with tears, as if a layer of her skin had been torn off in front of her closest kin. \"What he does doesn’t concern me anymore. I just want my children to be safe and happy.\"","\"But—\"","\"Wang Hua, whatever you need, I’ll burn it for you. Just... don’t meddle with your brother-in-law’s affairs anymore, alright?\"","Wang Hua stared at Wang Qin, stunned and heartbroken.","His sister wasn’t like this before.","The talisman’s time ran out, and Wang Hua’s figure vanished before Wang Qin’s eyes. She instinctively reached out but grasped only empty air.","Remembering the sorrow and disappointment in her brother’s eyes before he disappeared, Wang Qin covered her face and sobbed, \"I’m sorry... I’m so sorry...\"","Wang Hua hovered in the air, silently watching her with his head bowed.","The bold, righteous sister he once knew was gone.","He understood her difficult choice—but he couldn’t agree with it.","Su Rong steadied his emotions and said coldly, \"Let’s go.\"","The two ghosts drifted back to the villa, standing before Qi Quan to report.","\"Master, my sister... she didn’t agree,\" Wang Hua mumbled dejectedly.","This was within Qi Quan’s expectations.","She had sent Wang Hua mainly to fulfill his wish of seeing his sister one last time.","\"And you? What happened?\" She turned to Su Rong.","Su Rong’s eyes were dark as ink, a storm of fury swirling in their depths. His voice was rough as he said, \"I saw the man who killed me—the human trafficker. He’s in the Huang family villa.\"","Wang Hua: ???","He suddenly remembered and gasped, \"Is it that Niu Qiang?!\"","Su Rong didn’t answer, keeping his gaze fixed on Qi Quan as he continued, \"Wang Qin said Niu Qiang has always worked under Huang Qifeng. Back then, the traffickers weren’t just Niu Qiang alone. I suspect Huang Qifeng might have been part of it too—his initial wealth was likely built on dirty dealings.\"","\"What do you want to do?\" Qi Quan asked.","Su Rong gave a bitter laugh. \"There’s nothing I can do now.\"","Qi Quan smiled faintly. \"Why not?\"","\"I can’t harm anyone...\"","\"Only the innocent.\"","Qi Quan’s eyes held encouragement. \"Making sure the wicked face justice—that’s the ending I prefer.\"","Wang Hua: The master truly has a kind and righteous heart!","The gloom in Su Rong’s eyes dissipated, replaced by deeper gratitude toward Qi Quan.","The master was his benefactor—he couldn’t let her be implicated in the slightest.","Before, he had wanted to tear his enemies apart with his bare hands. But now? He found them too filthy to touch.","If the master wanted Huang Qifeng’s crimes exposed to the world, then Niu Qiang would be the perfect starting point.","If Huang Qifeng was truly involved in human trafficking seventeen years ago, once he was in police custody, all his hidden sins would be dragged into the light.","Su Rong quickly formulated a plan."]},{"number":24,"title":"Chapter 24","paragraphs":["It's late-night reading time again.","[I've moved.","I now live in a lakeside villa—spacious and expansive, where I can do whatever I please.","No more gossip to overhear, no more awkward glances to endure.","I’m happy.","After visiting the Taoist temple that day, I realized I could still see strange, inexplicable things.","So I picked up a few books on metaphysics and gained a deeper understanding of these phenomena.","Last night, an unexpected guest arrived—a young man who looked like an old man. I know how odd that sounds, but he truly suffered from such a bizarre condition.","His face was covered in wrinkles, his temples streaked with white hair, and he could barely stand.","At first, I didn’t recognize him, but after he introduced himself, I was shocked to learn he was actually the infamous playboy of Jiangcheng. It was hard to believe.","I could tell his time was running out.","He begged me to save him.","I saw it clearly—his fate line and life line stretched in another direction, tinged with a dark crimson hue.","A peach blossom mark was hidden between his brows.","I’d read about this in one of my books—a forbidden ghostly technique called the \"Peach Blossom Seal,\" used by malevolent spirits to steal a person’s vitality and fortune.","As the scion of a wealthy Jiangcheng family, he naturally carried great fortune. But how many other young heirs in the city were similarly blessed?","Following the methods described in the books, I removed the Peach Blossom Seal, dispelled the ghostly curse, and restored the stolen vitality and fortune to his body.","Once the seal vanished, he regained his senses.","After the exorcism, drained of energy, I retreated to my room to rest.","This morning, after breakfast, he returned with lavish gifts to express his gratitude. His spirit and complexion had improved dramatically.","Though... he’d do well to practice some restraint in the future.","After he left, my phone rang—an unknown number.","It was my invisible younger brother.","But the one seeking me wasn’t him—it was his future brother-in-law, the fiancé of his beloved older sister.","In the past, out of resentment, I’d said some harsh words to the fake heiress’s fiancé. Now that I’ve moved on and moved out, I no longer want to meddle in their family affairs.","But why is the fake heiress’s fiancé looking for me?","Could it be about that plot of land shrouded in dark energy?","Should I help him, if only out of respect for my biological parents’ future son-in-law?]","Luo Xiaoyu finished reading the latest update and immediately left a comment.","[CallMeWhenYouSeeMeStudying: So the author really saved someone last night! Author, if you’re not feeling well, rest more—here’s some white liquid for you~]","[DyingFromLaughter: I just want to see how long this act lasts. Yesterday, someone commented \"save my dog life,\" and today this chapter drops? Unbelievable!]","[NovelStarvationIsReal: The author’s story is so thrilling! I’m feasting on drama every day!]","[MaleChastityNovelsOnly: Is that fiancé the male lead? So cliché! Is this a double-first-love story? Author, please confirm!]","[TodayIsLucky: Pfft, as if he’s worthy of the master!]","[RealityShift: What a juicy scandal! I’m staying tuned!]","[RedPlumBlossoms: The female lead is so full of herself! Are these bizarre events just her delusions?]","The system couldn’t help but ask: [Big Boss, why did you call the dark art a \"ghostly technique\"?]","[It’s a forbidden arcane method—to prevent other practitioners from copying it.]","The system: [...]","The boss thinks of everything.","Song Lin had finally secured the land in the northern suburbs today, his blood thrumming with excitement.","Returning home from the banquet just past ten, his private phone suddenly went berserk, bombarded with messages.","[Qi Lin: You went to see her?]","[Zhang Chengyan: Congrats on the northern suburbs deal! Keep it up~ PS: You’re not worthy of the master!]","[Yingxue: Are you busy?]","[...","Yingxue: Did you go find her?]","[Yingxue: If you see this, please reply.]","Song Lin immediately called Qi Yingxue, but no one picked up—she was probably filming a night scene.","He didn’t try again, instead frowning at Zhang Chengyan’s cryptic message.","What nonsense was this?","Late-night film set.","Qi Yingxue’s distracted performance led to multiple NG takes, frustrating the director and crew.","\"Cut!\" The director roared, then took a deep breath, forcing patience. \"Ms. Qi, take a break. Let’s shoot the next scene first.\"","The next scene featured the second male lead and second female lead in a moonlit battle, their masks falling mid-fight, leading to a tearful reunion.","The scene demanded intensity in combat and restrained emotion in recognition, solidifying their love-hate dynamic.","The second male lead, Wei Xu, was a rising idol-turned-actor with mediocre skills, especially in line delivery.","The second female lead, Yuan Qing, was a seasoned actress with a decade of experience. Despite her talent, she’d never landed a breakout role. Her only lead project was scrapped after the crew met with disaster.","Strangely, every production she joined afterward suffered mishaps.","At first, no one linked it to her, but netizens noticed a pattern—male co-stars who filmed intimate scenes with her often encountered minor misfortunes.","Whether superstition or coincidence, Yuan Qing’s reputation as a \"jinx\" spread, relegating her to perpetual supporting roles.","Wei Xu, new to the industry and arrogant, hadn’t heard the rumors.","Seeing Yuan Qing’s mature beauty, he saw an opportunity to take liberties under the guise of acting.","As they rehearsed the wire-fu sequence, Wei Xu’s lackluster performance dragged the scene down—until the masks fell.","Suddenly, his acting improved, eyes brimming with awe and nostalgia.","Once grounded, he abruptly pulled Yuan Qing into an embrace, ad-libbing the clichéd line—","\"It’s you?!\"","The crew: ???","\"Cut!\" The director exploded. \"Wei Xu! No hugging here! You’re ruining the character! Again!\"","Wei Xu released Yuan Qing, feigning remorse. \"Sorry, Teacher Yuan. I got too into the moment.\"","Yuan Qing sighed but stayed professional.","On the retake, Wei Xu \"accidentally\" grabbed her hands.","The crew: \"...\"","Qi Yingxue, watching from the sidelines, smirked.","\"Yingxue-jie, is he doing this on purpose?\" her assistant whispered.","Before Qi Yingxue could answer, a wire snapped—Wei Xu plummeted to the ground with a sickening thud, his scream piercing the night.","Silence. Then chaos.","\"Call an ambulance!\" the director shouted.","Wei Xu lay sprawled on the ground, a pool of vivid crimson slowly spreading beneath him. His eyes were wide with terror as he stared blankly at the sky, his breath coming in ragged gasps.","Amid the chaos, Qi Yingxue felt her limbs turn to ice.","This was the first time she had witnessed such a gruesome scene.","Wei Xu was currently one of the biggest stars, and news of his injury couldn’t possibly be kept under wraps—especially not when it was this severe.","The film crew had no choice but to halt production.","Overnight, the incident exploded online. When the police launched their investigation, they discovered that the safety wire’s rope had been cleanly severed—as if cut with precision.","Such a clean cut couldn’t have been tampered with beforehand unless Wei Xu had deliberately wanted to die, somehow wielding a sharp tool mid-air to...","Slice through the rope.","But that theory made no sense either.","The wire rope was specially designed, nearly impossible for a human to cut so cleanly.","From the on-set footage, Wei Xu’s wire had remained intact until the third take, when it suddenly snapped, sending him plummeting to the ground.","The situation was growing increasingly bizarre.","The system, bored out of its mind, often indulged in online gossip.","When Qi Quan woke up that morning, it immediately launched into a rambling account of the incident before concluding: [Boss, that perpetual supporting actress really might be cursed. So many of her male co-stars have had accidents—this one’s especially bad.]","Qi Quan, savoring the meal Su Rong had prepared for her, narrowed her eyes in contentment. [There’s no such thing as a cursed person.]","[Really?]","[People just look for excuses to explain their misfortunes.]","[But the coincidences are too uncanny.]","Qi Quan asked, [Among the male actors who had accidents after working with her, were there any minor or background characters?]","[Hmm, not that I’ve heard. Mostly just the male leads or major supporting roles.]","[Why is that?]","The system pondered. [Probably because if a minor actor got hurt, no one would care enough to report it.]","Qi Quan nodded. [That’s a possibility.]","[So...?]","[So, I’m going to eat now. Be quiet.]","[...]","After breakfast, Qi Quan retreated to her room to meditate. Su Rong finished cleaning up and prepared to leave.","Wang Hua drifted over to him and asked, \"Are you going to see Niu Qiang?\"","Ever since reuniting with his sister, he had lost all vitality. If not for his determination to witness Huang Qifeng’s downfall, he would have long since moved on to the afterlife.","He understood his sister.","She had never seen the horrors Huang Qifeng had committed, so she could feign ignorance—but he had seen them firsthand.","Those atrocities had haunted him for over a decade.","Su Rong’s expression turned cold. \"What of it?\"","\"That Buddhist bracelet Huang Qifeng wears is powerful. Niu Qiang might have something similar—be careful. Also, I’ve told you all of Huang Qifeng’s secrets. If you have time, report them anonymously.\"","Without a physical form, he couldn’t operate a computer to file a report, but Su Rong could.","Su Rong’s expression softened slightly. \"Fine.\"","Huang Family Villa","Niu Qiang was fast asleep in a first-floor room.","Now Wang Qin’s personal driver, his job was leisurely since she rarely left the house.","His phone suddenly rang—his son was calling.","He had married late, and now in his forties, his six-year-old son was his pride and joy.","\"Dad, I miss you.\"","Niu Qiang’s face lit up with fatherly affection. \"I’ll come see you tonight, okay?\"","\"Okay.\"","\"Be good in class today. Listen to your teacher.\"","\"Dad... I don’t like piano lessons. Can I stop?\"","\"No, son. If you learn piano, you’ll be a little prince when you grow up—then you can marry a princess. So practice hard, alright?\"","\"Dad, I... it hurts... Uncle, please... don’t kill me... I’ll be good... don’t...\"","The voice on the phone abruptly deepened, turning eerie and cold.","\"Uncle, I’m so cold... the river water is freezing... I can’t breathe... it’s so painful... Uncle, won’t you come keep me company?\"","Niu Qiang’s eyes bulged in terror. Just as he was about to throw the phone away, something coiled around his neck—cold, slimy, like skeletal fingers soaked in water, tightening around his windpipe.","\"Ghk—ghk—\"","Air grew scarce. Choking, he thrashed like a fish out of water, veins bulging on his forehead, eyes bloodshot—on the verge of suffocation.","Then, the skeletal grip vanished.","He doubled over, coughing violently, gasping for air. Remembering the phone, he snatched it up in panic.","The call had ended. His wallpaper appeared—a photo of his son on his sixth birthday, beaming like an angel between his parents.","Trembling, Niu Qiang reached out to touch the screen.","Just before his finger made contact, the image twisted—his son’s face morphed into that of a ghastly child, skin blue-gray, eyes enormous and hollow, staring straight at him.","Niu Qiang screamed, hurling the phone against the wall, shattering it.","Scrambling to his feet, he fled the villa, speeding toward Huang Qifeng’s office in his car.","Huang Qifeng was at his desk when Niu Qiang burst in unannounced.","\"I’ve told you to knock,\" Huang Qifeng snapped. \"Why can’t you remember?\"","\"Boss!\" Niu Qiang’s face was pale with terror. \"I saw a ghost!\"","\"You look like you’ve seen one, alright!\"","\"I’m serious! A real ghost!\"","Huang Qifeng stiffened, recalling the monstrous face Qin Ruo had revealed after her dark arts failed. He didn’t dismiss it this time. \"What happened?\"","\"I—I saw that kid. He’s here for revenge! He threatened my son! Boss, what do I do?!\"","Huang Qifeng frowned. \"What kid?\"","He’d done too many terrible things to remember.","\"The one from Chìhé Village... the one I strangled.\"","It was his first time participating in child trafficking. Su Rong was the first child he’d killed—an experience etched into his memory.","Huang Qifeng scoffed. \"Just some brat’s ghost. What’s there to fear? I’ll get you a protective charm later to ward off bad luck. You’re just scaring yourself.\"","With his Buddhist beads shielding him, he’d never encountered a ghost—so he couldn’t fathom Niu Qiang’s terror.","Niu Qiang returned to his quarters, still shaken.","No matter where he looked, the child’s grotesque face haunted him.","Yet his neck bore no marks.","Had it all been in his head?","The only way to escape Su Rong’s torment was to—","Su Rong strolled back to Lakeside Villa, mentally planning Qi Quan’s lunch, when he spotted two figures walking side by side on the street.","Qi Yuan and a woman.","As Qi Quan’s ghost servant, he wasn’t fooled by illusions. Beneath the woman’s glamorous facade, he saw her true face—wrinkled and aged.","Watching Qi Yuan’s lovestruck expression, Su Rong silently applauded.","Even Zhang Chengyan had no idea what Qin Ruo really looked like. If they ever learned the truth, he wondered how they’d react.","Su Rong chuckled. Best not to shatter their illusions.","As he reached the villa gate, he found an unexpected visitor waiting.","Qi Yingxue stood at the villa's entrance wearing a hat and mask, dressed in a white sundress and carrying an exquisite handbag, repeatedly pressing the doorbell.","Unfortunately, Su Rong had been absent earlier, Wang Hua couldn’t assist, and Qi Quan had tuned out all noise—no one came to answer the door.","Su Rong glanced at her before drifting leisurely toward the main house.","\"Master, there’s a visitor at the gate—Qi Yingxue. Should we let her in?\"","Having grown bored from prolonged cultivation and itching to make more tiny outfits, Qi Quan sighed inwardly at Su Rong’s report.","One ghost attendant simply wasn’t enough.","If she recruited a few more, she could craft even more clothes.","\"Let her in.\"","\"Yes.\"","Qi Yingxue’s emotions were tangled.","Three months ago, upon learning the truth of her origins, she had been anxious. But after seeing the dark-skinned, timid Qi Quan, her worries vanished.","She remained the only princess of the Qi family.","Over those three months, Qi Quan’s antics only reinforced her belief—Qi Quan could never compare to her.","Yet after just a few days away filming, the world seemed to have turned upside down.","This villa before her... was something she couldn’t afford even after years of acting.","Yet Qi Quan had obtained it effortlessly.","And Song Lin—why had he sought out Qi Quan? What had they discussed?","Suppressing her unease, Qi Yingxue rang the bell again.","The door suddenly opened.","Greeting her was a tall, strikingly handsome man in a crisp white shirt and trousers, his deep, enigmatic eyes exuding an irresistible charm.","In her mind, Song Lin was exceptionally good-looking, surpassing many male celebrities. But compared to this man, he fell slightly short.","\"I’m the butler here. My surname is Su. And you are?\" Su Rong offered a polite smile.","Qi Yingxue’s brow twitched.","Su? The butler?","This property had originally belonged to the Su family. Had they even gifted the butler along with it?","\"Mr. Su, I’m Qi Quan’s sister. I’d like to see her.\"","After Qi Quan returned to the Qi family, since her adoptive parents had long passed, avoiding any custody disputes, the Qis simply treated Qi Yingxue as an adopted daughter, referring to them as sisters.","Qi Yingxue, radiant and poised, seemed more suited to the role of an elder sister compared to the frail and timid Qi Quan, thus becoming the adopted elder sister.","Su Rong ushered her inside.","Stepping into the courtyard, Qi Yingxue was further awed by the Su family’s extravagance. This exquisitely designed villa wasn’t just astronomically priced—it was likely priceless.","A thread of resentment coiled in her heart.","Passing through a lotus pond teeming with fish and a vine-covered corridor, she finally reached the pavilion in the backyard.","Inside, a woman lounged leisurely, feeding fish.","How carefree.","Qi Yingxue entered the pavilion and looked down at Qi Quan reclining on the rattan chair. Smiling, she said, \"Xiao Quan, I only found out last night after returning home that you’d moved out. Why so sudden? Was living at home unpleasant? Are you still upset with Mom and Dad? Or did Xiao Yuan offend you?\"","Before Qi Quan could respond, her system couldn’t hold back.","[Why does her tone sound so grating?]","Qi Quan didn’t even lift her eyelids, replying lazily, \"Do directors actually let you ad-lib like this on set?\"","\"......\"","System: [HAHAHAHA!]","Beside them, Su Rong’s lips curved slightly.","\"Xiao Quan, I understand if you weren’t used to living at home after just three months back. But moving out like this—Mom and Dad will be heartbroken.\" Qi Yingxue was no stranger to veiled sarcasm; she was a master of it herself.","Qi Quan cut straight to the point: \"No matter how heartbroken they are, it can’t compare to how you felt when you learned Song Lin came to see me. My time is precious—spare me the nonsense.\"","Qi Yingxue froze.","The old Qi Quan had been sensitive and explosive, easily provoked. How had she transformed into someone entirely different in just a few days?","Before she could dwell on it, she took a seat opposite Qi Quan. But when their eyes met, she was so stunned she forgot her words.","The entertainment industry was brimming with beauties, and her standards were sky-high.","Yet Qi Quan left her breathless.","True beauty lay in the bones, not just the skin. Qi Quan’s features were already exquisite, but her bone structure was even more flawless—a rare beauty by any measure.","When she first returned to the Qi family, twenty-two years of hardship had dulled her radiance, making her seem unremarkable.","But now, not only had her beauty returned, she carried an aura so unique it was mesmerizing—and intimidating.","Qi Yingxue found herself staring, dumbstruck.","[Big shot, this roundabout-talker seems to have been struck dumb by you.]","Qi Quan was unfazed: [Oh.]","In her past life, not only had countless men pursued her, but even exceptional women had clamored to befriend her.","\"Ms. Qi,\" Su Rong interjected softly.","Qi Yingxue snapped back to reality, lowering her head awkwardly and gripping the handle of her bag. \"I heard A-Lin came to see you. If he said anything inappropriate, I apologize on his behalf.\"","\"Finished?\"","\"Ah? Oh, yes.\"","Qi Quan gave her a sidelong glance and rose, stepping out of the pavilion.","\"See yourself out.\"","Qi Yingxue opened her mouth, then blurted, \"Xiao—Qi Quan, I know I took your place, but my feelings for A-Lin are real. We’ve known each other for over a decade, I—\"","\"Ms. Qi, please leave,\" Su Rong interrupted.","Qi Quan was already far away, her skirt fluttering in the breeze, her slender figure casting an ethereal, captivating silhouette—like an observer amused by the mortal world.","Back in her room, Qi Quan retrieved her half-finished miniature garments and resumed her artistic endeavor.","[Big shot, why did you agree to see her?]","Qi Quan: [Sensed some lingering ghostly energy. Wanted a closer look.]","[And?]","[She’s tainted by a third-tier ghost.]","The system asked curiously: [Ghosts have tiers?]","Qi Quan nodded.","[How are they classified? What about Wang Hua and Butler Su?]","[There are nine tiers, followed by Ghost Generals and Ghost Kings. Those two are merely first-tier white ghosts.]","[What’s a white ghost?]","[Those who’ve never killed are white ghosts, typically tiers one to three. First-tier white ghosts are the cleanest. Second-tier enjoy playing pranks to scare people. By third-tier, they’ve nurtured malice—even if they haven’t killed, they’ve caused accidents.]","[What else?]","Since she had time to spare, Qi Quan indulged in a basic lesson on mystical arts.","[Tiers four to six are red ghosts, ranked by their victim count. Seven to nine are blue ghosts—usually regional terrors, drenched in blood and devoured souls.]","The system asked naively: [So ghosts just need to kill to grow stronger?]","[But once they kill, they forfeit reincarnation. They’re bound to ghosthood forever.]","[I see. What about Ghost Generals and Ghost Kings?]","[Blue ghosts are rare enough. Those are even rarer.]","The system benefited greatly and grew even more curious about Qi Quan's abilities. It cautiously asked: [Then, oh great one, with your skills, what level of ghost could you defeat?]","[I don’t know.]","[You don’t know?]","Qi Quan smiled. [I’ve never encountered a Ghost King.]","The system was stunned—that meant she had faced Ghost Generals and won!","Oh great one, please accept this humble disciple’s bow!","[So, Qi Yingxue ran into a third-tier ghost?]","[She just got a bit of yin energy on her.]","[Oh, then it’s nothing serious.]","Life in the villa was peaceful and serene, and Qi Quan loved it here, as did Su Rong and Wang Hua.","Outside, however, the public was in an uproar over the news of \"Wei Xu’s severe injury.\"","Yuan Qing was once again dragged into the spotlight and roasted over the flames.","Fans who sympathized with Wei Xu directed all their anger at Yuan Qing, flooding her social media with insults, calling her a jinx, a curse, and worse.","Fans of other male actors who had \"suffered\" in the past also joined the \"righteous crusade,\" dredging up old grievances.","Some overzealous fans even tracked down Yuan Qing’s address and, taking advantage of living in the same neighborhood, splashed chicken blood on her front door.","Yet Yuan Qing remained silent.","Even the few rational voices defending her were drowned out by the tidal wave of vitriol.","Originally, this had nothing to do with Qi Quan, but there’s always someone who loves stirring the pot. A user named \"Flying Heaven Lu Ma\" tagged Qi Quan in a post.","[Flying Heaven Lu Ma: Lots of people are calling Yuan Qing a jinx. @White Water True Person, what’s your take on this?]","The system, monitoring the situation, was shocked.","[Who is this guy? Why tag you?]","To be honest, the \"White Water True Person\" account had very few followers—just some curious readers who stumbled upon it. No one actually took the account seriously as belonging to a genuine cultivator.","So this person’s sudden appearance was especially odd.","Qi Quan glanced at it casually and said: [Flying Heaven Lu Ma—a rare and expensive fate pattern. This person probably knows a bit about fortune-telling, happened to read my novel, thought I was spouting nonsense, and decided to mock me.]","[Even if he read your novel, aren’t there tons of supernatural stories out there? Why single you out?]","Qi Quan was certain: [He knows my real identity.]","The system had an epiphany: [That makes sense! His account has a decent following, and many of his posts are about divination and fortune-telling. He’s probably from the esoteric circles. So, great one, how will you respond?]","Though it asked, the system assumed Qi Quan would ignore it.","To its surprise, Qi Quan opened the app and replied with three words: [Not a jinx.]","The system was stunned. [Great one, you actually—]","[I’m just stating facts. Whether people believe it is their business.]","The system thought: The great one is all tough talk but soft-hearted—clearly trying to speak up for Yuan Qing.","Thanks to the traffic from \"Flying Heaven Lu Ma’s\" account and the frenzy of Wei Xu’s millions of fans, Qi Quan’s reply quickly went viral.","This struck a nerve with multiple fanbases.","How dare someone defend that jinx? Attack her!","The \"White Water True Person\" account’s follower count skyrocketed—though they were all haters, the numbers were real.","After that one reply, Qi Quan logged off, leaving the chaos behind without a second thought.","As for the person who tagged her—if they wanted to keep stirring trouble, their true colors would show eventually.","Qi Quan didn’t give it another thought.","The ignored \"Flying Heaven Lu Ma\" waited eagerly for Qi Quan’s next response. After two hours of silence, he slammed his mouse in frustration.","A message popped up in his group chat.","[Big Bro Fatty: School’s starting soon. When are you guys heading back?]","[2D Otaku: The campus Wi-Fi is slower than a clogged toilet. Home’s way better. Not looking forward to it.]","[Ning the Hero: Handling something right now. Might take a few days off.]","[Big Bro Fatty: @Chen Feilu, little bro, what about you?]","Chen Feilu’s eyes lit up, and he quickly messaged Ning Zhi privately: [Ning-ge, something weird happened near my place. Feels kinda supernatural.]","[Ning Zhi: Go on.]","[Chen Feilu: Someone here got hit with rapid aging. Hospitals couldn’t fix it, so they called in some \"master\" who cured them. Then two more people got it and were sent to the capital’s hospital. Heard they’re not doing well—they’re planning to find a top-tier master there.]","[Ning Zhi: Seriously?]","[Chen Feilu: You’re from the capital, right? Can you check it out? You’ve taught me a lot about the supernatural, but this? Never heard of it. Sounds like a tall tale. You’re the expert—can people really reverse aging?]","[Ning Zhi: I’ve heard of cases like this, but curing it is nearly impossible. It’s also super rare—almost extinct. How’d three pop up at once?]","[Chen Feilu: So it’s legit weird?]","[Ning Zhi: Gotta go. Talk later.]","After the chat, Chen Feilu was even more convinced.","If even Ning-ge said it was hard to cure, how could Qi Quan, the supposedly real daughter of the Qi family, have healed Zhang Chengyan so easily?","She’s way too young!","The Chen family, though not top-tier in Longjiang’s business world, was still wealthy and well-connected.","He’d stumbled upon The Diary of a Wealthy Family by chance.","In college, he’d met his roommate Ning Zhi and witnessed him wielding a peachwood sword to exorcise spirits. From then on, he idolized Ning Zhi, who taught him plenty about the supernatural.","Chen Feilu considered himself half an expert now. He could tolerate The Diary of a Wealthy Family as exaggerated fiction, but the author had to go and pretend to be some kind of celestial master.","The stuff about the Su family’s son, the nanny’s ghost, the factory’s dark energy—all nonsense!","He’d seen Su Linhai and visited the site himself. No ghosts, no dark energy.","He couldn’t refute it in the comments, and the \"White Water True Person\" account had no posts, leaving him frustrated. Seizing this chance, he impulsively tagged Qi Quan.","Now, with no reply, he pinned his hopes on Ning Zhi to expose the fraud once and for all.","In a mansion in Longjing City, Ning Zhi crossed the threshold and bumped into his uncle.","\"Perfect timing. I just got a job but can’t take it. You handle it.\"","Ning Zhi frowned. \"What job? No cheating-spouse cases.\"","\"Not that. Two 'rapid aging' cases. If you won’t go, I’ll find someone else.\"","Ning Zhi’s brow twitched. What a coincidence.","\"Fine, I’ll take it.\"","\"Good. You’re the most talented in the family. If you can’t fix it, neither can I.\"","Ning Zhi: \"...\"","With elders shamelessly slacking off, the younger generation had no choice but to work harder to uphold the family’s reputation.","Longjing City First Hospital.","Du Jiaming and Yang Su shared a hospital room. Staring at each other’s deeply wrinkled faces, the former rivals temporarily set aside their grudges and spoke from the heart.","\"Even the best hospital in the capital can't cure us. We might really be dying,\" Yang Su said, his eyes filled with despair.","Du Jiaming, however, remained calm in this critical moment. \"Your dad and my dad went to find a master. They’ll definitely cure us.\"","\"A master? Since when do you believe in that?\"","Du Jiaming replied, \"When Zhang Chengyan was hospitalized, who could’ve guessed he’d recover?\"","\"He was really cured by a master?\" Yang Su was shocked. \"I never thought Longjiang City had such a powerful master!\"","\"Have you even been keeping up with the novel updates?\" Du Jiaming frowned in disdain.","Yang Su widened his eyes. \"You still have the mind to read novels?!\"","\"'The Diary of a Wealthy Family'—it mentioned that Qi Quan was the one who cured Zhang Chengyan. I just confirmed it with Old Zhang. Think about it, doesn’t Old Zhang’s recovery and change of stance prove something?\"","\"Then let’s go back and find Qi Quan!\"","\"Are you stupid?\" Du Jiaming scoffed. \"How old is Qi Quan? If she could cure Old Zhang, surely the masters in the capital must be even more capable than her, right?\"","Yang Su thought about it and nodded. \"You’re right.\"","So the two of them lay back comfortably, waiting for the master to arrive.","Since childhood, no matter what trouble they caused, their families had always bailed them out. This time would be no different.","When Ning Zhi entered the hospital room, he saw two \"old men\" lying in bed, their expressions oddly serene.","It was strange. He had never seen terminally ill patients maintain such peace of mind. For a moment, he felt a surge of respect.","Behind him followed Father Du and Father Yang.","In Longjiang City, the Du and Yang families had extensive connections, but in the dragon-and-tiger den of Longjing City, they were like two drops of water in the ocean—utterly insignificant.","They had pulled strings with numerous business associates just to get in touch with the Ning family.","The Ning family was said to be an ancient lineage of metaphysics practitioners, with centuries of inherited knowledge—undoubtedly formidable.","Though Ning Zhi looked extremely young, the aura around him commanded respect.","Father Du asked respectfully, \"Master Ning, can these two children be cured?\"","Ning Zhi frowned as he examined them.","As the most talented exorcist of his generation in the Ning family, his foundation was solid, and he had handled many metaphysical cases. His experience allowed him to recognize at a glance that they had been afflicted with the \"Peach Blossom Seal.\"","The Peach Blossom Seal was a long-lost forbidden technique—one that could bewitch the mind and drain a person’s vitality and fortune. It had been banned by the metaphysical community for ages.","He had only ever read about it in family records.","The records... mentioned a way to break the seal, but if it were that easy, why would it be forbidden?","There was one stringent condition:","The exorcist attempting to break the curse must be at least two cultivation levels above the caster. Otherwise, not only would the attempt fail, but the victims would suffer severe backlash.","This forbidden technique also imposed strict requirements on the caster’s cultivation level. An exorcist could gauge the caster’s strength by examining the Peach Blossom Seal.","The seals on these two had four petals, meaning the caster was at least a fourth-level exorcist. Practitioners below the third level couldn’t even cast such dark magic.","And Ning Zhi himself had only just reached the fourth level.","For his age, being a fourth-level exorcist was already considered highly gifted.","His family’s talents had dwindled over time. The highest-level exorcist in their clan was only sixth-level and currently in seclusion. No one else could solve this problem.","Ning Zhi took a deep breath and said regretfully, \"I’m sorry. My abilities are insufficient to save them. You’ll have to seek help elsewhere.\"","Before coming, he had held onto a sliver of hope—maybe it wasn’t the Peach Blossom Seal, just some malevolent spirit causing rapid aging.","Du Jiaming and Yang Su instantly widened their eyes.","Was it really that difficult?!","Father Du quickly spoke up, \"Master Ning, please wait. You haven’t even tried. How can you be so sure it’s incurable?\"","\"To be honest,\" Ning Zhi said earnestly, \"this is my first time seeing something like this. I’ve only ever read about it. To save them, you’d need an exorcist at least two levels above me—and even if you found one, they might not be willing to help.\"","Father Yang didn’t understand. \"Why not?\"","It wasn’t like they couldn’t pay.","\"Saving them would require an enormous expenditure of spiritual energy,\" Ning Zhi said solemnly. \"In other words, curing one person would drain most of an exorcist’s power. Curing two would deplete their entire cultivation. The cost outweighs the gain.\"","Though cultivation could be regained through practice, in this day and age, few exorcists reached the sixth level. Everyone cherished their hard-earned power. What reward could compare to that?","\"That can’t be!\" Yang Su blurted out. \"Are you just trying to scare us into paying more?\"","Ning Zhi’s expression darkened. \"Believe what you want.\"","\"Wait,\" Father Du stopped him. \"Is this truly that difficult to treat? Even the exorcists in Longjing City wouldn’t take the case?\"","Ning Zhi was firm. \"Yes.\"","\"But I have a nephew whose condition was even worse than theirs—he wasn’t expected to last a day. Yet now he’s perfectly healthy.\"","Ning Zhi was skeptical, but then he recalled something Chen Feilu had told him. He asked, \"Are you from Longjiang City?\"","\"Yes, why?\" Father Yang was puzzled. What did geography have to do with it?","Ning Zhi pressed further, \"Do you know the name of the master who treated him?\"","If this was true, perhaps that nephew had stumbled upon an exceptionally skilled and benevolent exorcist. Such a senior was worth seeking out.","\"Name?\" Father Du shook his head.","He hadn’t read the novel and didn’t know which master the Zhang family had hired.","Du Jiaming suddenly spoke up. \"Her name is Qi Quan.\"","\"Qi?\" Ning Zhi searched his memory but found no record of a senior with that surname.","\"Come to think of it, she’s about your age, Master Ning. My friend was sent to her, and he recovered in no time.\"","Like Yang Su, Du Jiaming believed Ning Zhi was putting on airs. He wanted to provoke him by mentioning Qi Quan.","In his view, if Qi Quan could do it effortlessly, surely an exorcist from a prestigious capital family couldn’t possibly fail.","\"Impossible!\" Ning Zhi flatly denied. \"Not even a sixth-level exorcist could do it. How could someone barely in their twenties break such a curse so easily?\"","Either it was a rumor, or the person had never been afflicted with the Peach Blossom Seal to begin with.","Du Jiaming, seeing his dismissive attitude, grew furious. \"Just because you can’t do it doesn’t mean others can’t!\"","\"Jiaming!\" Father Du glared at him.","Did he not realize exorcists weren’t to be trifled with?","Ning Zhi’s face was stern. \"If you don’t believe me, go ask the Exorcist Association. Lives are at stake—I have no reason to lie. Goodbye.\"","He strode out of the hospital, then paused and dialed Chen Feilu’s number.","\"Ning-ge?\"","\"Feilu, that 'rapid aging syndrome' you mentioned before—what exactly happened?\"","Chen Feilu had already shared everything he knew. \"I’ll send you a link to the novel. It mentions something about a 'Peach Blossom Seal.' I’ve never heard you talk about it, so it’s probably just made up.\"","\"Peach Blossom Seal!\" Ning Zhi grew increasingly puzzled by the situation. \"Send me the link.\"","Chen Feilu forwarded it immediately.","The novel wasn't long, and he quickly reached the latest chapter, his frown deepening with each line.","\"Peach Blossom Seal\" was right—but could someone really break such a sinister curse so effortlessly? And a young woman at that, only twenty-two years old?","Ning Zhi found it hard to believe.","Perhaps he should make a trip to Longjiang City.","At the hospital, Father Du said to the two men, \"We've exhausted every possible solution. Master Ning is someone we barely managed to connect with, and as for the Heavenly Master Association, we can't even find the door.\"","The implication was clear: they were left with no choice but to wait for death.","\"Let's go home!\" Yang Su immediately declared. \"We'll find Qi Quan—she can save us!\"","\"That's right! If she could save Zhang Chengyan, she can definitely save us too!\" Du Jiaming, usually composed, was now anything but calm.","Father Du and Father Yang exchanged glances. At this point, it was their only option.","As they packed their things, they contacted Father Zhang.","Upon hearing the news over the phone, Father Zhang was stunned. \"Even the masters in Longjing City can't help? Is it really that difficult to cure? Then... then...\"","Their family had gotten off far too lightly!","Seeing how effortlessly Master Qi had revived Zhang Chengyan, he had assumed the curse was easy to break. Never in his wildest dreams did he imagine that even the masters in the capital would refuse to take the case.","What incredible luck had befallen their family!","No—the compensation they'd given before was far too little. The thought filled him with unease.","He immediately dropped everything, gathered his wife and son, and returned to Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan was meditating, so Su Rong received them in her stead.","\"Mr. Su, we won't disturb the master. Please accept these on her behalf.\"","Father Zhang handed over several bank cards and had servants carry in an assortment of jade, porcelain, jewelry, and other valuables.","\"That won't be necessary,\" Su Rong replied, knowing Qi Quan preferred clean transactions without lingering debts.","Mrs. Zhang quickly interjected, \"Oh, but it is! The master expended so much effort to save our Chengyan—these are only what she deserves. Mr. Su, you look familiar—have we met before?\"","She deftly changed the subject.","Su Rong: \"...\"","Wang Hua, floating nearby and invisible to the others, chuckled. \"If only they knew the truth—it’d scare them half to death.\"","\"We were blind before,\" Father Zhang pressed on. \"We had no idea the master’s abilities were so profound. These are just small tokens of our gratitude. We sincerely hope she’ll accept them.\"","Su Rong raised an eyebrow. \"Why the sudden realization?\"","Father Zhang sighed. \"Mr. Su, you may not know this, but the Du and Yang families tried seeking help from masters in Longjing City. Yet even after consulting one—a renowned master from a prestigious Heavenly Master family—they were told there was no cure.\"","Su Rong understood now.","If even the top masters in the capital couldn’t handle it, the \"Peach Blossom Seal\" must be an exceptionally tricky affliction.","Zhang Chengyan’s current vitality, compared to the other two’s dire states, only underscored Qi Quan’s extraordinary skill.","No wonder the Zhangs were showering her with gifts.","Wait—if that was the case, had his own family’s compensation been too meager as well?","Unsure how to proceed with so many valuables, he was about to consult Qi Quan when her voice echoed in his mind: \"Accept it.\"","The Zhangs were different from the Su family.","Though the Peach Blossom Seal hadn’t been a challenge for Qi Quan, it was still a rare and complex curse—no amount of payment would be excessive. The Su family had only needed a simple soul summoning, and now that Su Rong was her ghost attendant, tending to her daily needs, there was... a degree of personal consideration.","With Qi Quan’s approval, Su Rong accepted the gifts.","Father Zhang relaxed slightly and ventured cautiously, \"Would the master be willing to take on other patients?\"","\"Just schedule an appointment in advance,\" Su Rong replied.","This was the rule at Lakeside Villa. Qi Quan wouldn’t turn away \"patients,\" but from then on, anyone seeking her help would have to abide by her terms.","Father Zhang nodded eagerly. \"Of course, of course!\"","After the family left, Su Rong meticulously sorted through the gifts and discovered several high-quality peachwood pieces and even a few peachwood swords.","Peachwood repelled evil spirits, and ordinary ghosts would indeed fear it—but Su Rong had transcended the ordinary, so the wood posed no real threat.","The Zhangs had been thoughtful—Heavenly Masters often wielded peachwood swords.","Yet Su Rong had never seen Qi Quan use one.","Just as he was about to ask, a slender, pale hand reached into view.","The fingers brushed against a piece of peachwood, testing its texture before setting it down.","\"Good quality. Take them all to my room.\"","\"Yes.\"","With time to spare, Qi Quan carved a few peachwood talismans, etching intricate arrays into them for future use.","The villa’s phone suddenly rang.","\"Hello, Lakeside Villa,\" Su Rong answered, his tone polite but distant.","\"Brother!\" Su Nuanuan’s cheerful voice rang out. \"It’s me!\"","Su Rong’s expression softened. \"What is it?\"","\"My eighteenth birthday is in two days, and I’m throwing a party. Can you and Sister Quan come?\"","Su Rong longed to reunite with his family but needed Qi Quan’s consent first. \"Let me get back to you, alright?\"","\"Okay, I’ll wait for your call!\"","Qi Quan spent the afternoon carving talismans, and Su Rong didn’t disturb her until dinner.","After a moment’s thought, Qi Quan said, \"We’ll go.\"","Though she disliked crowds, Su Nuanuan’s birthday would undoubtedly draw Longjiang City’s elite—young talents included. A certain Miss Qin wouldn’t pass up such an opportunity.","Having lost Du, Yang, and Zhang as pawns, she’d surely be hunting for new, higher-quality replacements.","This was precisely the kind of spectacle Qi Quan enjoyed observing.","As expected, Qin Ruo saw the event as her golden chance.","The Su family ranked among Longjiang City’s most influential, and nearly every prominent household would attend—including the Songs and the Qis.","She wasn’t worried about running into Zhang Chengyan or the other two at the party. Even if Zhang Chengyan’s curse was broken and he now despised her, the Zhangs wouldn’t dare make a scene at the Su family’s event.","As for the other two, they were probably still waiting to die.","The expert who’d saved Zhang Chengyan wouldn’t have the energy to rescue them anytime soon.","With Qi Yuan protecting her and her own cultivation to rely on, she had nothing to fear.","Meanwhile, Du Jiaming and Yang Su sat in their car, both sneezing in unison.","\"Do you think Qi Quan might refuse to help us?\" Yang Su muttered nervously.","Du Jiaming shared his unease but kept his composure. \"We’ve already made an appointment—she wouldn’t back out now, would she?\"","Yang Su: \"Why not? Remember that trip we took to Lingxu Temple?\"","\"What about it?\"","\"The more I think about it, the weirder it seems. We’d been there before—why did all three of us keep tripping that day? And if Qi Quan really is a master, wouldn’t she have known someone was tailing her with ill intentions?\"","\"Yikes—\"","Du Jiaming shuddered at the realization.","Goosebumps prickled his skin as panic set in. \"Then what do we do?\"","\"Kneel and beg for forgiveness?\"","Du Jiaming: \"...\"","The car pulled into Lakeside Villa and stopped at the entrance.","With Father Du and Father Yang supporting their sons, Su Rong guided them to the treatment room.","\"Family members, please follow me to the side hall to wait,\" Su Rong instructed. \"The two patients will remain here.\"","Du Jiaming and Yang Su sat nervously in their chairs, their anxiety palpable.","A moment later, someone entered the treatment room. Without hesitation, the two men dropped to their knees, their aged faces lined with wrinkles, and pleaded desperately, \"Master, we beg you to save our wretched lives!\"","Qi Quan: \"...\""]},{"number":25,"title":"Chapter 25","paragraphs":["Qi Quan accepted the kneeling ceremony calmly.","She said, \"If you’re willing, stay here for two days. If not, you may leave.\"","\"What do you mean?\" Yang Su asked anxiously. \"Master, please save us!\"","When faced with death, dignity no longer mattered much.","Qi Quan glanced at him coolly. \"You don’t have many days left to live, so there’s no need to panic.\"","\"Master,\" Yang Su felt deeply uneasy, \"I apologize. I was short-sighted before, failing to recognize greatness. Your novels are simply profound and thought-provoking! Jiaming, don’t you agree?\"","His words abruptly stopped.","He stared at Du Jiaming in shock, who was frantically tapping on his phone. The screen lit up repeatedly with \"Deep Water\" rewards, almost blinding him.","Du Jiaming smashed the screen while saying, \"Master, Yang Su is right. Your writing is amazing. I’m sending a thousand Deep Water coins now, and as long as I’m alive, I’ll keep sending you thunderbolts every day!\"","Yang Su thought: Damn, how cunning!","He hurriedly took out his phone and followed suit, afraid of being left behind and losing the master’s favor.","Qi Quan: \"......\"","It was good to receive rewards, and she had no reason to stop them, but some things still needed to be said to prevent them from scaring themselves.","\"Reviving Zhang Chengyan before took a lot of my energy. Asking you to stay two days is to restore your vitality, so I can treat you better.\"","Of course, this was a fabrication, just to put their minds at ease.","\"Alright, we’ll stay two days as the master says!\" Du Jiaming responded first.","Yang Su quickly nodded in agreement.","In the living room, Su Rong received a message and told Father Du and Father Yang, \"The master needs quite some time to treat the two of them. You two should head back first.\"","The two men exchanged glances, dared not say more, and left.","At the same time, Ning Zhi arrived in Longjiang City.","Chen Feilu personally drove to pick him up. Once Ning Zhi was in the car, Chen asked excitedly, \"Ning, are you here to fight a fake master?\"","\"No,\" Ning Zhi replied, not so arrogant. \"I want you to introduce me to Miss Qi.\"","He had specifically asked his elders at home. Although they were experienced, they all agreed that the Peach Blossom Mark was hard to remove.","But since such a dark curse appeared in Longjiang City, as a member of the Taoist Masters Association, he had to investigate.","\"You want to meet her?\" Chen Feilu shook his head in embarrassment. \"I’m not very close with the Qi family. I might not have any connections.\"","Ning Zhi said, \"Just find out where she lives. I’ll visit her myself.\"","\"Alright.\"","Chen Feilu asked around among his friends and quickly found out her address, then headed toward the lakeside villa.","On the way, Ning Zhi explained the Peach Blossom Mark to him, but Chen still found it hard to believe. \"You say she’s only twenty-two, how could she be a Level Six Taoist Master?\"","Many Taoist Masters never reach Level Six in their entire lives.","Ning Zhi said, \"Before meeting me, many also said a twenty-year-old Level Four Taoist Master was impossible.\"","\"...True enough.\"","They had to accept the existence of a peerless genius.","The car stopped in front of the lakeside villa. Before getting out, Ning Zhi sensed a sinister aura inside.","He furrowed his brow and warned Chen Feilu, who was about to get out, \"You go back first.\"","\"Why?\"","\"There’s something going on.\"","Chen Feilu’s expression stiffened. He knew he was just dead weight, so without a word, he slammed on the gas and drove off.","If even a fourth-level Celestial Master couldn’t handle this, staying behind would only be a one-way ticket to death.","Ning Zhi slowly approached the door. The villa’s gate was tightly shut. He reached out and pressed the doorbell. Soon, the gate swung open, revealing a strikingly handsome man wearing a gentle smile.","Ning Zhi was momentarily stunned. Without thinking, he pulled out a talisman and hurled it at the “male ghost.” In a flash, Su Rong didn’t dodge but remained standing behind the gate, his gaze slightly darkening.","The talisman made a sharp “smack” sound, hitting something before falling limply to the ground at Ning Zhi’s feet.","Ning Zhi’s eyes widened in disbelief.","It was... a formation!","The entire yard was shrouded in an invisible formation, rendering his talisman useless against the ghost inside!","What kind of Celestial Master raises ghosts like pets?","Ning Zhi had every reason to suspect that the appearance and removal of the “Peach Blossom Seal” was all a setup—a scheme designed for fame!","He spoke sternly, “I want to see Miss Qi.”","Su Rong’s expression remained calm. “The master is cultivating and will not see visitors. Please leave.”","“Are you her ghost attendant?” Ning Zhi pressed.","Su Rong’s eyes darkened slightly. “None of your business.”","“This is sorcery and evil! I have every right to intervene!” Ning Zhi declared righteously. “Tell Miss Qi that if she doesn’t listen, she’ll bear the consequences.”","Su Rong was speechless.","Luckily, he hadn’t encountered a Celestial Master like this before, or he’d have been reduced to ashes long ago.","With a snap, he closed the door.","Chen Feilu hadn’t gone far. After receiving Ning Zhi’s call, he turned around and came back to pick him up, driving him to his own home.","“Didn’t see anyone?” Chen Feilu frowned, then thought of an idea. “Tomorrow, the Su family’s young lady is hosting a birthday banquet. My family was invited too, and I heard Qi Quan will be there. Why don’t you come with me?”","Ning Zhi clenched his fists. “Alright.”","Unfortunately, his knowledge of formations was shallow, so he couldn’t break through just now.","This Qi Quan was even more mysterious and profound than he had imagined.","At the same time, Qin Ruo received a call from Huang Qifeng.","“Qi Quan?” she said in disbelief. “You’re saying the one who revived Zhang Chengyan is Qi Quan? And Du Jiaming and Yang Su are with her too?”","“Master, that’s what I’ve found out.”","Qin Ruo was certain: “Impossible. A country bumpkin barely in her twenties can’t so easily break the Peach Blossom Seal.”","“No matter how we investigate, Qi Quan is the one who saved Zhang Chengyan. And...”","“And what?”","“She also wrote a novel. She has done the Su family a favor.”","Qin Ruo was puzzled.","Wasn’t this about Celestial Masters? Why was it suddenly about a novel?","“Master, there’s a way to test her depth.”","“Go on.”","“Apparently, Qi Quan was invited to the Su family’s birthday banquet, and she has agreed to attend. When you see her there, you’ll know for sure.”","Qin Ruo suddenly recalled that during the phone call, the person on the other end seemed particularly interested in Qi Quan. A thought crossed her mind, and she smiled. “That’s indeed a good plan.”","She was curious to see what kind of person could rival the fate of three others.","Soon, the birthday banquet began, with most of Longjiang City’s young business elites gathered in the grand hall.","Su Nuanuan wore a beautiful princess dress and light makeup as she sat in front of the mirror in the second-floor lounge, repeatedly asking Mrs. Su, \"Mom, when are Sister Quanquan and Brother coming?\"","Of course, Mrs. Su wanted to see her son, but the master had said that too much contact with spirits was bad for the living body. They usually called or video chatted when they had time, which was already very good.","She was especially content now.","\"Don't worry, your brother said he would come early with the master to spend more time with you.\"","No sooner had she spoken than they heard Su Linhai's excited and warm voice, accompanied by approaching footsteps.","Su Nuanuan immediately opened the door to greet them.","Outside stood a man and a woman.","The man was dressed in a sharp suit, handsome beyond compare. When he saw her, a hint of adoring smile appeared on his face. After entering, he handed her a gift box.","\"Happy birthday.\"","Su Nuanuan accepted it with delight. \"Thank you, Brother.\"","Then she turned to Qi Quan, her eyes full of admiration. \"Sister Quanquan, you look stunning today!\"","The strikingly beautiful woman wore a tailor-made qipao, understated yet elegant, outlining her slender waist and tall figure. Her hair was skillfully pinned up with a single hairpin, a few strands softly framing her face, exuding grace and calm.","Qi Quan smiled gently. She loved all things beautiful, including pretty clothes.","In short, she was extremely appearance-driven.","She handed over an exquisite peachwood box and said, \"Ha... Happy birthday. I wish you a lifetime of peace and happiness.\"","\"Can I open it and take a look?\" Su Nuanuan asked eagerly.","\"Of course.\"","Su Nuanuan lifted the lid to reveal a small, delicate jade gourd pendant in a serene shade of aquamarine. It seemed to be engraved with some patterns, giving off a mysterious aura.","The gourd, a homophone for \"fortune and prosperity,\" symbolized great blessings. Moreover, the jade itself was top quality.","\"Thank you, Sister Quanquan! I really like it!\"","Qi Quan said, \"Is there a quiet lounge? I want to rest for a while.\"","\"There is!\" Su Linhai personally led her there.","Su Rong stayed behind to keep Su Nuanuan company. Seeing how attached she was to the pendant, he smiled and said, \"There’s a protective charm engraved on the pendant. It can ensure your safety once.\"","\"Oh dear,\" Mrs. Su exclaimed, both surprised and a little regretful. \"I didn’t realize it was so valuable earlier and didn’t get a chance to thank you properly. I also heard from the Zhang family that the master is far more powerful than the ones in Longjing City. We really underpaid before...\"","\"It’s okay. We still have a lifetime to repay the kindness,\" Su Rong replied warmly with a smile.","Before the banquet began, guests arrived one after another.","Qin Ruo linked arms with Qi Yuan as they smoothly entered the banquet hall. Scanning the room, she didn’t spot Qi Quan and asked, \"Where’s your sister?\"","\"She’s with Brother Lin. She should be arriving a bit later,\" Qi Yuan answered honestly.","Qin Ruo rolled her eyes inwardly and smiled slightly. \"I meant your real sister.\"","\"I don’t know,\" Qi Yuan said.","\"...\"","Qin Ruo was speechless. What an idiot!","Compared to Du, Yang, and Zhang, Qi Yuan was a purebred straight man, a complete blockhead. Even after just a few days, she was close to losing her patience.","\"I’m feeling a bit unwell. I’m going to the restroom,\" she said, leaving Qi Yuan behind.","In the lounge, Qi Quan was watching the surveillance footage of the banquet hall.","This was something she had specially asked Su Linhai to prepare.","“Boss, the one next to Qi Yuan! Is that Qin Ruo?”","“Yeah.”","Whether she practiced some dark, forbidden art couldn’t be seen on the surface, but Qi Quan could clearly tell that Qi Yuan’s marriage and life lines were tightly bound to Qin Ruo.","“Why did she leave?”","Qi Quan: “Probably to scout for a new target.”","“That’s just insatiable. Qi Yingxue and her fiancé have arrived!”","On the screen, the two of them walked into the banquet hall intimately, the handsome man and beautiful woman dazzling everyone around.","Since the Song family took over the northern outskirts land, they had been busy planning its development these past few days. Song Lin was the project supervisor, often going over to oversee and inspect, and had already absorbed some ominous energy.","But his own fortune was extraordinary, so the consequences of the dark energy hadn’t yet shown.","“Boss, the banquet is about to start. Aren’t you going down?”","“Wait a little longer.”","Inside the banquet hall, Chen Feilu and Ning Zhi mingled among the crowd, helping to look for Qi Quan’s figure.","“Are you sure she’ll come?” Ning Zhi asked.","“She said she would, but whether she actually shows up, I don’t know.” Chen Feilu ducked into a corner. “Forget it, the banquet’s starting. We’ll talk later.”","Ning Zhi had no choice but to let it go.","Suddenly, the lighting in the hall shifted dramatically. Su Nuanuan descended the staircase in a stunning princess gown, catching every eye in the room.","The entire birthday party went off without a hitch. The Su family of three smiled brightly under the guests’ blessings.","After the ceremony ended came the free entertainment time.","Chen Feilu looked disappointed. “It’s all over now. She’s really not coming, is she?”","Ning Zhi: “Forget it, let’s go.”","Just as they took a step forward, a sudden gasp came from nearby.","He looked up.","A woman in a light-colored qipao, holding a wine glass with elegant poise, approached Su Nuanuan. Every movement seemed to carry a strange rhythm all its own.","This was the aura unique to a Taoist priest.","She was a Celestial Master!","Ning Zhi’s hearing was sharp; he could clearly catch their conversation.","Su Nuanuan happily linked arms with the woman, introducing her to the surrounding crowd of men and women: “This is Sister Qi Quan. She’s a benefactor of the Su family. From now on, when you see her, be extra courteous, okay?”","Qian Kun was the first to be stunned.","“Qi Quan? You’re Qi Quan? You weren’t like this before...”","“Of course!” Sun Yu cut him off, laughing as he saved the moment. “Even if Nuanuan hadn’t told us, we wouldn’t dare offend Sister Qi Quan, right? Such a beauty — who would want to?”","He was equally incredulous.","Three months ago, this woman had been thin, timid, and withdrawn. Now, she shone with radiant elegance and confidence.","All the single men in the room had their eyes fixed solely on her — even the women.","Qin Ruo was no exception.","Today she was Qi Yuan’s date, specially dressed up, but beside Qi Quan, she looked like a pheasant next to a phoenix — utterly overshadowed.","Secretly, she tried to use her divination arts to observe Qi Quan’s aura, wanting to see just how deep her fortune was. But the moment her fingers moved, a sudden, sharp pain exploded in her chest, and uncontrollably, a mouthful of blood spewed out.","“Ahhhhh!”","The banquet hall instantly erupted in screams.","If it was just blood, that would be one thing, and many calm people called for an ambulance or rushed to give first aid.","But the next second—","“Ahhhhh!”","A sharper, more piercing scream echoed through the banquet hall.","Under the watchful eyes of everyone present, Qin Ruo’s face instantly transformed from plump and delicate to a landscape of deep ravines and wrinkles. This eerie change terrified everyone into screams as they fled the scene.","“How is this possible...?”","Qin Ruo stared at Qi Quan in disbelief. He was right in front of her—so then, who was performing the ritual for Du Jiaming and Yang Su at this very moment?","The person hiding in the shadows was not Qi Quan!","And that person was able to break her protective talisman!","In the chaos, Qin Ruo could no longer care about anything else. She immediately grabbed the stunned Qi Yuan and shouted fiercely, “You promised me anything I wanted before. Now it’s time for you to keep your word!”","No sooner had the words left her mouth than Qi Yuan’s vitality almost instantly drained into Qin Ruo. In the blink of an eye, he became an old man whose body functions were failing, left only with a clear consciousness.","“Demonic witch, stop!”","Ning Zhi acted decisively, pulling out a talisman and swinging it toward Qin Ruo!","“Get lost!”","Qin Ruo revealed her true form and naturally could no longer stay there. She blocked Ning Zhi’s talisman light and fled swiftly from the banquet hall.","Ning Zhi pursued her relentlessly.","Everyone present was at a loss.","Chen Feilu watched helplessly as Qin Ruo’s face changed, and as Qi Yuan teetered on the brink of death, his heart pounded wildly.","There really was such a terrifying dark magic in this world!","But who exactly had broken that woman’s spell? Qi Quan himself was standing right there!","Not only he and the insiders were shocked—the system itself was confused: [Boss, why did Qin Ruo suddenly change? Du Jiaming and Yang Su are still in the villa, right? Could someone have saved them?]","Qi Quan: [I set up a talisman array in the treatment room.]","[Then?]","[The array will periodically break the Peach Blossom Mark on my behalf.]","The system was dumbfounded: [You can do that?]","Qi Quan smiled: [New era, new magic.]","She never liked sticking to old ways. The things left by the ancestors were good, but the Taoist sect had to innovate.","Taoist masters like Ning Zhi had been trained in the old family and sect traditions since childhood, so their thinking was rigid. That’s why when they saw Su Rong, they thought he was dabbling in forbidden sorcery.","The duty of a Taoist master was to exorcise ghosts—but only evil ones.","Only narrow-minded masters would chase after every spirit they saw.","Just because she was here didn’t mean she couldn’t perform rituals for Du Jiaming and Yang Su.","People had to learn to be flexible.","Qin Ruo’s unmasking in front of everyone was enough to shock all present. Qi Yuan’s current state also proved how dire Zhang Chengyan’s situation had been.","Those who had dismissed *The Diary of the Wealthy* as mere fantasy now found themselves believing a little.","“Quanquan, Qi Yuan is barely holding on!” Su Nuanuan said anxiously. “Can you save him...?”","Qi Quan called out, “Su Rong.”","Su Rong’s figure appeared immediately, though no one noticed exactly when he had arrived amidst the panic.","“I still have matters to attend to. This place is in your hands.”","“Yes.”","After Qi Quan left, Su Rong pulled out a talisman and quickly slipped it into Qi Yuan’s clothing.","This talisman could only guarantee that Qi Yuan wouldn’t die for the time being, but it couldn’t reverse his current state of being old and helpless.","Qi Yuan opened his eyes and stared at Qi Quan’s departing figure, unable to say a word.","When a person is on the brink of death, the surge of their will to survive often sharpens their clarity like never before.","He rarely shed tears, yet in that instant, a stream of regretful tears fell uncontrollably.","Five kilometers away, Ning Zhi and Qin Ruo were locked in a desperate chase.","Although Qin Ruo had absorbed Qi Yuan’s vitality, she was still severely injured. Even with the aid of a Swift Travel Talisman, her energy was rapidly depleting, and Ning Zhi was closing in.","In her current state, there was no way she could match the vigor of a Level 4 Celestial Master.","She had to take a gamble!","Suddenly, she crushed the jade Buddha pendant hanging around her neck and shouted out:","“Help me!”","*","Longjiang City Train Station.","A young man dressed casually strolled leisurely out of the exit. Under the flickering neon lights of the night, he clenched a string of prayer beads in his hand, his eyes fixed coldly toward the Qi family’s direction, a cruel glint lurking in his gaze.","The Qi family’s fortune had indeed diminished considerably.","It was time for him to reap the rewards.","He reached up to scratch the stubble on his head, humming a pleased tune as he climbed into a taxi.","The taxi slowly made its way toward the city center. The bustling nightscape, so foreign to someone who had lived deep in the mountains for years, filled him with a long-lost sense of excitement.","Halfway through the journey, something in his bag trembled suddenly, and a faint voice—inaudible to others—whispered in his ear:","“Help me!”","It was Qin Ruo.","Something had happened to her?","The man frowned and rummaged through his bag, pulling out a jade token. A red bloodline on the token was steadily shortening.","This was Qin Ruo’s lifeline.","Her vitality was slipping away, clearly because she had encountered a formidable enemy.","He hadn’t expected that even in a relatively small place like Longjiang City, there would be a Celestial Master of such caliber. Qin Ruo’s cultivation had already reached Level 4, and anyone who could force her to crush her jade Buddha and call for help had to be at least a Level 4 Celestial Master.","The man sneered softly and told the driver to pull over by the roadside.","After getting out, he affixed a Swift Travel Talisman to himself and dashed rapidly toward Qin Ruo’s location.","He didn’t care about Qin Ruo’s life, but he wouldn’t allow any other Celestial Master to cross him!","In the quiet and secluded outskirts, after crushing her jade Buddha, Qin Ruo was forced into a fierce battle with Ning Zhi.","Her cultivation was rooted in forbidden arts—bloody and ruthless. Every strike radiated overwhelming murderous intent. Coupled with years of combat experience, despite her recent injuries, she was far from being overwhelmed.","As long as she could hold on until help arrived, this annoying brat in front of her was doomed.","Judging by the time, that person should already be in Longjiang City.","The two were evenly matched, and for the moment, neither could gain the upper hand.","Ning Zhi’s expression grew increasingly grave.","This witch was no ordinary foe. She had just sent out a distress signal. If he couldn’t suppress her quickly, he would be the one to die!","He silently berated himself for being careless. Because he had attended a banquet, he hadn’t brought more talismans along.","He had thought that Qi Quan was the one stirring trouble in Longjiang City, and planned to meet him to confirm before reporting to the Celestial Master Association. Who would have thought that this witch would reveal her true colors at the banquet.","Ning Zhi had already been briefed by Chen Feilu about the influential figures and matters in Longjiang City’s upper circles.","He recognized the young man beside this woman as Qi Yuan.","He had witnessed Qi Yuan instantly turning into an old man with his own eyes, and he had heard the woman’s words clearly.","The one truly stirring trouble was not Qi Quan, but this very woman before him!","If she escaped tonight, countless more would surely suffer harm in the future.","Ning Zhi’s gaze hardened, gathering all his spiritual power in the palm of his hand as he struck toward...","Qin Ruo’s crown.","This was a unique technique of the Ning family, his trump card skill. He had to take down this demoness in one blow!","Qin Ruo couldn’t evade in time. At the critical moment, a mighty surge of spiritual energy thundered from behind her like a towering mountain, blocking Ning Zhi’s attack effortlessly and shattering his move.","He’s here!","Qin Ruo’s face lit up with surprise as she quickly slipped behind the man, swallowing several pills.","Ning Zhi staggered back a few steps, a metallic sweetness rising in his throat. He looked up at the newcomer.","The man appeared remarkably young, yet his eyes held none of the vibrancy of youth. Instead, they were like those of an old soul who had weathered countless lifetimes, filled with greed in their murky depths.","“A twenty-year-old Level Four Celestial Master,” the man sneered, “That’s truly rare.”","Ning Zhi asked, “Who are you?”","“Kid, you hurt someone of mine and you still ask who I am?” The man twisted the Buddhist prayer beads in his palm, his voice hoarse and unpleasant. “You might as well tell me your name. After you die, I’ll notify someone to collect your body.”","Ning Zhi was speechless.","He knew he couldn’t defeat this man, but fleeing in the face of battle was not in his creed.","He reached up and clenched the delicate jade pendant hanging from his neck.","Even if he died, he wanted to send a message home.","The man sneered contemptuously and suddenly slammed the prayer beads toward Ning Zhi’s forehead. Before Ning Zhi could crush the jade pendant, the beads were already inches from his brow!","Ning Zhi closed his eyes in despair.","In a flash, a gentle spiritual force arrived, like a spring breeze caressing willows, effortlessly dissolving the man’s overwhelming power.","The prayer beads collided with the spiritual force and exploded with a deafening blast!","Ning Zhi opened his eyes in astonishment.","A soft, low voice sounded behind him, calm and unhurried, as if the speaker had simply stepped out for a stroll, showing no sign of being involved in a battle.","“So it’s you.”","All three stared in surprise.","Qin Ruo and Ning Zhi’s eyes widened—it was Qi Quan!","So she really was the one who broke the Peach Blossom Mark?","But she was only twenty-two!","Qin Ruo knew the man’s cultivation level well, and Ning Zhi, who had just been struck by him, understood it too.","He was at least a Level Six Celestial Master!","An attack from a Level Six Celestial Master easily dispelled by a young woman of only twenty-two—who would believe that?","The man’s expression darkened. “Who are you?”","He didn’t recall anyone of such skill hiding in Longjiang City.","Qi Quan still wore the qipao from the banquet, low-heeled shoes clicking on the ground, carrying an exquisite handbag, utterly out of place in the desolate outskirts.","“Stealing someone’s fortune is dark magic. I’m just a passerby who can’t stand it,” she tilted her head, scrutinizing the man with a smile. “You’re a Buddhist cultivator, yet you still don’t understand birth, aging, sickness, and death?”","The man’s eyes flashed with malice. “You don’t know a damn thing!”","He was indeed once a Buddhist, but had long since left the order.","He wasn’t talented, nor was he particularly determined.","While his fellow disciples advanced one after another, leaving him far behind, resentment and self-loathing gnawed at his heart.","Cultivation brought endless benefits.","His stagnation had aged his face, while his brothers grew younger and stronger with each step forward.","By a stroke of fate, he came into contact with a mystical technique capable of altering one’s destiny.","He had found a new path!","Qi Quan was too lazy to waste words on him. With a flick of her hand, a talisman shot toward the man, while a peachwood charm was simultaneously aimed at Qin Ruo’s forehead.","The man was too preoccupied with his own survival to pay any attention to Qin Ruo.","Before a high-level Celestial Master, Qin Ruo stood no chance. Desperately, she watched as the peachwood charm struck the center of her brow. Darkness overwhelmed her vision, and she collapsed, unconscious.","Having roamed the martial world for years, the man’s survival skills were anything but lacking.","He fled wildly forward.","Qi Quan leisurely retracted the peachwood charm. Inside it was now a faint soul—Qin Ruo’s.","“You handle this,” she said, handing over Qin Ruo’s “body” to Ning Zhi before setting off in pursuit of the fleeing man.","Ning Zhi was speechless.","He wiped his face hard, hoisted Qin Ruo up, and followed.","The man’s escape route led ever farther from Longjiang City.","He carried a swift-travel talisman, running at breakneck speed, and kept veering into remote, dense mountain forests, trying desperately to shake Qi Quan off his trail.","Qi Quan followed at a leisurely pace, as if taking a casual stroll, maintaining a perfect distance to observe the man’s panicked retreat.","The system asked in surprise, “Boss, why don’t you just take him down right now?”","“Taking him out means having to find his lair. Too much trouble.”","“So you’re letting him lead you there?”","“Mm.”","“How do you know he’ll definitely run to his lair?”","“Guessing.”","Qi Quan wasn’t entirely sure where the man was headed, but no matter what, when someone’s backed into a corner, they instinctively flee to the place where they feel safest.","“But why do you want to find his lair?”","“The Peach Blossom Seal is a forbidden Daoist technique. It wouldn’t just appear out of nowhere. Given his and Qin Ruo’s abilities, they’re not capable of obtaining such a forbidden technique, nor covering up the traces it leaves behind.”","The system understood. “So you suspect there’s an organization behind them?”","“Mm.”","With the swift-travel talisman’s aid, the distance from Longjiang City grew greater, and they had already crossed into the territory of Longxi City.","Geographically speaking, Longjiang City, Longtan City, and Longxi City bordered each other. Longjiang City lay to the northeast, Longtan City to the southwest, with a relatively short boundary between them. Longxi City was to the northwest, sharing a long border with Longtan City.","Along that border stretched a long mountain range, rarely touched by human footsteps.","The man’s escape path led straight into those mountains.","The more he ran, the more panicked he became.","By seizing others’ vitality and destiny, he had cultivated himself to the level of a sixth-grade Celestial Master. Within the Daoist realm spanning the three cities, he was unmatched.","Who exactly was this woman?","She looked strikingly young, but her spiritual power was as deep as the ocean—unbelievable!","Could it be... she was an ancient monster in disguise?","Had she also mastered forbidden arts?","The man’s spiritual energy was nearly depleted. Just as he reached the doorstep of his home, he turned sharply, drenched in sweat, and stared at Qi Quan. “Who exactly are you?!”","Qi Quan halted.","Dressed in an exquisite qipao, she stood quietly in the tranquil mountain forest, as if this place wasn’t a remote wilderness, but a luxurious, high-class banquet hall.","“You set a trap targeting the Qi family, or rather, targeting me, without even knowing who I am?” She smiled softly, her every gesture graceful and lively.","Under normal circumstances, a man might admire such elegance, but at the brink of life and death, he couldn’t afford to notice any beauty.","“Qi Quan? You’re Qi Quan?! That’s impossible!”","How could such a genius exist in this world?","“You’re a Buddhist, yet you’re using Taoist talismans. What’s impossible about that?”","“......”","The man sneered, “I renounced my monastic vows long ago!”","“Oh, a rogue monk who abandoned Buddhism.”","“......”","Qi Quan no longer wasted words. With a subtle flick of her fingers, the dry branches on the ground floated into her palm, infused with spiritual energy.","Using a branch as a sword, she instantly thrust it toward the demon monk’s heart!","A fierce light flashed on the man’s brow as he pulled out a string of Buddhist beads from his chest. The beads blocked the sword’s edge and shattered instantly, buying him precious moments to escape.","But in the blink of an eye, his figure vanished.","System (surprised): [How did he disappear?!]","Qi Quan: [There’s an array set up here—it must be the lair.]","[What kind of array? Is it weak?]","Qi Quan: [Not bad.]","The array was indeed well constructed. It didn’t feel like the work of a demon monk. For someone with a Buddhist background to master such precise and rigorous Taoist formations was almost impossible.","The forest was silent under the dark night.","Qi Quan stepped on the dry leaves scattered on the ground, bent down, and picked up a few stones, tossing them precisely in several directions.","She had noticed upon arrival that this mountaintop was saturated with exceptionally dense spiritual energy—ideal for cultivators to train.","But such overwhelming spiritual energy was difficult to explain without the presence of rare treasures or heavenly materials.","Of course, there was another faint possibility.","But—","Could it really be?","After throwing the stones, Qi Quan received feedback and immediately deciphered the method to break the array.","A genius is a genius because, within their field of expertise, their abilities far surpass ordinary people.","The demon monk thought the array could hold for a long time, enough to wait for reinforcements, but he underestimated Qi Quan.","He fled into a hidden cave.","Both inside and outside the cave were intricately arranged with formations. If Qi Quan was here, she could easily recognize the defensive array outside and a massive spirit-gathering formation inside.","At the heart of the spirit-gathering formation sat a disheveled figure, bound tightly with chains around all limbs.","The demon monk grabbed the person’s hair roughly.","“Quick! Give me your spiritual energy!”","The young man was forced to lift his head.","His long hair obediently parted to reveal an exceptionally handsome face, his eyes pure and clear like a newborn lamb.","No matter how many times the demon monk looked, he couldn’t suppress the jealousy and resentment burning inside him.","Some people are born favorites of fate, needing neither effort nor struggle to receive heaven’s blessings.","Why him?!","He gritted his teeth, pulling harder at the young man’s hair, trying to see any sign of pain on his face. But, just like before, there was nothing.","He was like a soulless puppet, incapable of feeling pain.","The demon monk released his grip, struggling to suppress the dark fire in his heart. There were more pressing matters at hand; he couldn’t waste time.","“Quick! Give me your spiritual energy!”","The young man lowered his eyelashes, and where the demonic monk couldn’t see, his clear, pure eyes instantly turned pitch black, countless dark and sinister emotions surging within.","He closed his eyes, a faint curve tugging at the corner of his lips.","In the blink of an eye, a vast surge of spiritual energy flooded the dark, narrow cave, enveloping the demonic monk completely.","The monk, as if intoxicated by some hallucinogenic potion, bathed in the roaring spiritual energy, his entire face taking on a dreamlike expression, his complexion gradually growing rosy.","He greedily absorbed the spiritual energy, the endless flow coursing through his meridians and dantian, continuously filling, and filling again.","“That’s enough.” Feeling the fullness of the energy within, he said with satisfaction.","But the spiritual energy did not stop.","The demonic monk suddenly opened his eyes wide and shouted, “I said that’s enough!”","The young man lifted his eyelashes, tilting his head, looking at him with a bewildered, innocent expression, as if he didn’t understand a word.","The monk’s body had swollen like an overinflated balloon; the spiritual energy relentlessly poured into his meridians and dantian, reaching a critical point where a loud “pop” could erupt at any moment!","His face had already turned a deep purple-blue.","He tried to control the young man, but for some reason, the youth—who had previously been easily restrained by chains—remained completely unmoved, still tilting his head, observing the monk’s increasingly bloated body as if it were a fascinating toy.","“You... you’re faking it...” The flesh around the monk’s throat was stretched to the limit; he could barely speak.","The young man’s fingertips twitched, just about to enjoy the spectacle of the “balloon” bursting, when suddenly a soft voice came from outside the cave.","“You hid deep enough.”","The spiritual energy inside the cave abruptly dissipated, and the demonic monk collapsed like a deflated balloon with a soft thud.","The young man blinked, his gaze falling on the barrier at the cave’s entrance, curiosity flickering in his amber eyes.","The monk’s pupils dilated.","Impossible! The array on the mountain was set by a Level Six array master. Even if Qi Quan was powerful, there was no way he could break a Level Six array so easily.","There was a strict hierarchy among the disciplines of the Mystic Sect!","The woman outside spoke again, “Who set this array? It’s so crude. Do they even understand craftsmanship?”","The demonic monk: “...","...”","No way, could this woman be about to break through the cave’s barrier?","He struggled to rise, just about to sneak out and launch a surprise attack, when a cracking sound suddenly rang in his ears.","The barrier was broken.","Qi Quan stepped slowly into the cave, her gaze first drawn to the young man at the array’s core.","She was a complete beauty connoisseur.","Having seen countless types of beauties, her standards were exceptionally high. Even someone like Su Rong didn’t rank in her top ten.","But the young man before her, barely clothed, was undoubtedly one of the finest she had ever seen.","He returned her gaze, his eyes perfectly shaped, amber irises clear and pure, as innocent as a newborn’s, flawless from head to toe.","She subtly sized him up, then turned to the collapsed demonic monk, a faint smile curving her brows and eyes. “Quite the spirit-gathering array.”","The demon monk was never a man of strong will. Seeing himself at a disadvantage, he shamelessly tried to curry favor: \"I suppose you’ve already realized it. If you want him, I’ll give him to you.\"","A born spiritual body—something rare and precious.","In this world, where spiritual energy is scarce, possessing a natural spiritual body is like owning a treasure that can continuously supply you with vital energy. Who wouldn’t want that?","The demon monk assumed that Qi Quan would never refuse such a prize.","The young man at the core of the formation lowered his gaze again, his long lashes shielding the fierce cruelty and mockery lurking in his eyes.","Qi Quan was astonished. \"Is he more important than your life?\"","This demon monk had practiced dark arts for years and had likely caused countless deaths—enough to send someone’s soul into utter despair.","The demon monk was baffled.","Had Qi Quan seen through him or not?","He didn’t believe any cultivator could resist such temptation.","But Qi Quan could.","In her previous life, she never once entertained the thought of stealing someone else’s life force or destiny—let alone a mere natural spiritual body.","She had her pride. Her cultivation had always been achieved through her own efforts.","Qi Quan no longer wasted time toying with him. She directly summoned a piece of peachwood talisman and hurled it at the demon monk’s forehead!","An overwhelming pressure surged forth, freezing the demon monk in place. He couldn’t move or escape, helplessly watching as the peachwood talisman struck his forehead, plunging his vision into darkness.","His soul was sucked into the talisman, and his body collapsed stiffly, hitting the ground with a dull thud that echoed through the narrow cave.","The young man suddenly snapped his eyes open, scrutinizing the woman in the qipao with a strange, intense gaze.","She casually pocketed the peachwood talisman and strolled over to the formation.","\"Want to leave?\" she asked.","The young man said nothing, only staring at her.","Qi Quan repeated, \"Want to leave?\"","He gave a slight nod, his striking features curving into a faint smile, as if he had just discovered something far more interesting and fun.","Qi Quan examined the chains binding him.","His limbs were all shackled, and a collar circled his neck.","These were specialized restraints from the Xuan Sect, designed to suppress prisoners. The chains were controlled remotely; any slight movement would be detected, and the controller could inflict pain at will.","Judging by his long hair trailing the ground, he had been imprisoned for over ten years.","If not for his innate spiritual body, he would have been tortured into a state neither human nor ghost, unable to maintain such a clean and pristine appearance.","The young man looked no older than twenty. If Qi Quan’s guess was correct, he had likely been captured as a child and used as the core of the spirit-gathering formation.","After more than a decade, it was very possible he had lost the ability to speak.","Qi Quan stopped asking questions and instead gathered her spiritual power to form a blade, cutting at his shackles.","Whether the young man was truly innocent or feigning ignorance, he was a victim—and rescuing him was her duty.","Because he had been confined since childhood, the collar’s diameter was very small. As he grew, it had deeply embedded itself into his flesh and blood. If not for his natural spiritual body, his limbs and neck might have already become deformed.","When the collar shattered, it tore through flesh and blood, spilling a mixture of gore.","...","Yet the young man seemed oblivious to the pain, still sitting at the core of the formation, his eyes glued to Qi Quan, following her every move.","The innate power of the spiritual body manifested instantly.","The wounds on his limbs and neck, nourished by the spiritual energy, gradually faded away, leaving only a few faint flesh-colored scars.","If other cultivators from the Xuan Sect saw this, they might become greedy and start fighting over him.","Qi Quan sighed silently. If she abandoned the young man, his fate would be predictable. But if she took him back, it would likely bring a lot of trouble in the future.","She was someone who disliked trouble.","Yet, when she met the young man’s clear, pure eyes, she decided to do the right thing.","At the very least, she could keep him by her side and enjoy the sight.","She asked, “Are you coming with me?”","The young man blinked softly but said nothing.","Qi Quan compared the sizes of the demon monk and the young man, then stripped the demon monk’s T-shirt and jeans and tossed them onto the young man. Her tone left no room for argument: “Put these on and come with me.”","The young man had spent over a decade in a cave, never taught what shame was. Unbothered by his nakedness, he held the clothes and sat there blankly, clearly unsure of what to do.","System: [Wuwuwu, he’s so pitiful—he doesn’t even know how to wear clothes.]","Qi Quan: ...","She couldn’t very well help him put them on, could she?","[Boss, he only has the mind of a child. Maybe you should teach him?]","Qi Quan sighed in resignation and said, “I’ll only teach you this once. Next time, you have to do it yourself.”","Treating him like a robot, she inputted instructions one by one, and finally he managed to put on the clothes.","Though the shirt and pants were much too short, at least they covered most of him.","“Let’s go.” Qi Quan ignored the demon monk’s corpse and turned to leave the cave.","The young man lowered his head, his soft, long hair flowing down to his ankles.","If someone with such looks appeared on the street, it wouldn’t be surprising if photos were taken and uploaded online.","To avoid trouble, Qi Quan affixed a swift travel talisman on him, grabbed his wrist, and headed toward Longjiang City.","Before leaving the mountain’s interior, the young man glanced back.","Perched on a nearby treetop was a pitch-black crow. The crow locked eyes with him for a few moments, let out a strange caw, then flew toward the cave where the barrier had been lifted.","It crouched beside the demon monk’s corpse and let out a hoarse cry. Soon, countless crows swarmed out from the forest, a black wave gathering inside the cave, fluttering and pecking at the demon monk’s flesh.","In just a short while, only a pale skeleton remained inside the cave.","On the way back, the system continued to gush: [Boss, he’s unbelievably handsome—he’s the most beautiful person I’ve ever seen! Why not just keep him? Looking at him every day would brighten your mood so much.]","Qi Quan chuckled softly.","But the demon monk’s soul trapped inside the peachwood talisman had a very different opinion.","“Senior! I was wrong! I really was! If you let me out, I’ll tell you a secret!”","“Ah! My body! My body has been destroyed! It must be him! Senior, don’t be fooled by him—he’s faking it! He’s the one who destroyed my body!”","“Shut up!” another soul, Qin Ruo, shouted sharply. “Can you stop crowding me?”","Two souls sharing one soul talisman, of course, would be cramped.","The peachwood talisman was a specially crafted soul tag made by Qi Quan, designed exclusively to imprison vengeful spirits and evil Taoist priests.","Whether it was a vengeful ghost or a malevolent Taoist, those who had killed innocent people had to pay some form of punishment before their souls dissipated into nothingness.","Since vengeful spirits and souls couldn't be subjected to ordinary worldly punishments, the Taoist sect had its own law enforcement agencies. However, Qi Quan didn’t trust their efficiency or competence, so she created her own prison—a cage where these souls could reflect on their misdeeds.","Moreover, the forest formations were not something a single demon monk could set up alone. She needed to extract more information from both the demon monk and Qin Ruo.","Under the blessing of the swift travel talisman, the two moved at incredible speed and soon entered the territory of Longjiang City.","Qi Quan’s body was brimming with spiritual energy; as a young man born with innate spiritual power, he certainly wasn’t lacking in energy. The two arrived at a lakeside villa in the southern suburbs before dawn.","Su Rong and Wang Hua were anxiously waiting at the villa.","Upon hearing the commotion, they immediately floated out to greet them but froze when they saw the young man behind Qi Quan.","“Master, who is he?” Su Rong was surprised by the youth’s appearance but even more curious about his background.","Wang Hua was utterly amazed. “Wow, he’s a hundred times more handsome than any celebrity! How did he get to look like that?”","“He’ll be living here from now on. Su Rong, take good care of him.” Qi Quan handed off this “trouble” to the steward Su Rong and went straight back to rest.","Su Rong had intended to report on the Qi family’s affairs but, seeing that the Master had been on the move all night, swallowed his words.","Once Qi Quan returned indoors, he finally looked the youth in the eye.","“What’s your name?”","The youth glanced at him without a word and walked toward the direction where Qi Quan had disappeared.","“You can’t go!” Su Rong hurriedly stopped him. “The Master is resting; don’t disturb her.”","The youth stopped, barefoot, standing in the corridor, his expression dazed as he stared at the tightly shut door—much like a puppy abandoned by its owner.","He obediently didn’t proceed any further, crouching down on the hard floor, arms wrapped around his knees, chin resting on them, staring blankly at the courtyard bathed in morning light.","Wang Hua scratched his head. “What do we do now?”","Su Rong replied, “...Let’s wait until the Master is rested.”","While Qi Quan slept peacefully, the Qi household was shrouded in fear and lingering dread.","Qi Yuan lay on a hospital bed, clinging to his last breath. If it weren’t for a talisman Su Rong had slipped him, he would have long since turned to a pile of bones.","His cloudy eyes were open, his body heavier than ever before.","He was too old to get up but his mind was painfully clear.","At the moment Qin Ruo died, his peach blossom mark had automatically lifted.","Thinking back on his recent foolishness, he wished he could turn back time and beat himself into a pulp—anything was better than becoming a brain-damaged invalid.","The incident had happened at Su Nuanuan’s birthday banquet. Besides the Qi family, the Su family was also at the hospital.","Su Linhai advised Qi Changrong, “Since the talisman was placed by Su Rong under the Master’s instructions, there’s no need to worry too much.”","“Then why, if she knew Qi Yuan was possessed, didn’t she exorcise him in time?” Gu Qiao, anxious for her son, felt a chill at Qi Quan’s coldness. “She deliberately let Qi Yuan suffer this fate!”","“So what if she did?!”","Su Nuanuan stood not far away, holding a bag, her cold eyes watching Gu Qiao as she wept and complained, unable to suppress a lingering sense of injustice.","“Nuanuan,” Su Linhai called out to remind her.","But Su Nuanuan ignored him completely and strode straight into the hospital room, placing the bag on the bedside table.","“Nuanuan, how can you say that?” Qi Yingxue’s eyes were red, tears welling as she spoke softly, “A Yuan is your good friend. Now that he’s like this, aren’t you worried about him?”","Qi Lin frowned as he stood by the window.","He was a true businessman, always believing in fair trade principles.","From his point of view, Qi Quan didn’t owe the Qi family anything. Giving them a talisman to extend his life ahead of time was already more than generous. But others didn’t share this opinion.","“He’s been out partying recklessly, couldn’t control himself—who else is to blame?” Qi Lin said in a low voice.","“Brother...” Qi Yingxue looked at him in surprise.","Su Nuanuan’s face was stern. “Qi Yuan, what do you think?”","She used to be just an observer, unwilling to meddle in other people’s affairs. But now that Qi Quan was a great benefactor to their family, she wouldn’t allow anyone to slander him recklessly—not even a friend of over ten years.","Qi Yuan had thought a lot that night.","He wasn’t a fool who didn’t understand anything; he had always been fully aware of what he was doing.","He turned to Gu Qiao and spoke with difficulty, “Mom, the day I was possessed, before I left, she warned me not to touch alcohol. I didn’t listen. I drank the wine Qin Ruo handed me and fell under her spell.”","It was hard for a rebellious young man to admit his mistakes, but telling the truth was his responsibility as a man.","“I’ve read the novel she wrote, and so have you, but before the real trouble came, who took it seriously?”","“She mentioned the ‘Peach Blossom Mark’ in the novel. If we had looked more closely into the Zhang, Du, and Yang families, we could have asked her to save us in advance and avoided this risk.”","Teetering on the edge of life and death, Qi Yuan had finally grown up.","Gu Qiao lowered her head, wiping away tears, her face full of shame.","Qi Changrong and Qi Lin also felt some guilt.","“But we’re family,” Qi Yingxue’s gentle voice echoed in the hospital room, “Wouldn’t it have been better if she had warned us directly?”","“Do you even consider her family?” Su Nuanuan retorted coldly. “Did you support her from the start when she said she wanted to write a novel? When Qi Yuan bullied and looked down on her, did you ever truly reprimand him? Qi Yingxue, you’re so kind-hearted, but where were you when the supporting actresses in the crew were being bullied?”","Qi Yingxue was on the verge of tears. “What do you mean?”","“Don’t pretend with me. You shamelessly let Qi Quan take the initiative to save someone who bullied and suppressed her every day. Why didn’t you support Yuan Qing and deny that she was a disaster star? Being generous with others’ hardships is easy, isn’t it? Do you know how hard it was for Qi Quan to treat three people in succession? Do you think being a master is a walk in the park? If you had bothered to look into it, you wouldn’t have said such shameless things.”","Her words left Qi Yingxue’s mind blank.","“Uncle Qi, Aunt Gu, why are you waiting here for Qi Quan to come save the day? She was chasing after Qin Ruo all night—weren’t you even a little worried?”","Just because you’re “family,” does that mean you can sit back and wait for Qi Quan to come to the hospital and save Qi Yuan on her own?","Why shouldn’t I be the one to take the initiative and go ask?","Su Nuanuan couldn’t stand it any longer. Provoked by the attitude of the Qi family members, her anger finally broke through, and she couldn’t help but speak her mind.","Su Linhai waited until she finished before putting on a stern face and saying, “Nuanuan, what are you saying? Uncle Qi and the others are just worried and overthinking.”","“Sorry, I spoke too harshly just now,” Su Nuanuan said expressionlessly. “I’m going to the lakeside villa to see if Qi Quan has come back.”","With that, she turned and left the hospital room.","Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan had slept until noon. Just as she woke up, the system in her mind began nagging: [Boss, you haven’t updated for several days. The readers are all urging you in the comment section. Oh, and last night Du Jiaming and Yang Su dropped a ton of bombs on you again.]","[Hmm.]","[There are several guests sitting in the living room right now.]","Qi Quan: ...What a hassle.","She finished freshening up and changed into loose, comfortable loungewear, then rang the bell to call Su Rong.","“Have the guests meet me after dinner.”","Su Rong responded and left, but paused at the door, turning back to ask, “Master, what about the person you brought back? How should I arrange his accommodations?”","“Find him a place to stay. Just make sure he has enough to eat and drink.”","“But he doesn’t listen to me.”","Qi Quan: “...”","If it weren’t for goodwill, she wouldn’t bother with this trouble.","“Let him in.”","Su Rong hesitated for a moment, wanting to say something but holding back.","He appeared in the corridor, his gaze darkening as he looked down at the young man. “Master says you may come in.”","The young man lifted his head. His amber eyes were exceptionally clear and pure, like cold glass marbles, showing not a trace of the emotions humans are supposed to have. It sent an inexplicable chill down Su Rong’s spine.","He masked his expression and turned to leave.","The young man stood up, lowering his gaze again, and stepped barefoot onto the soft carpet inside the room."]},{"number":26,"title":"Chapter 26","paragraphs":["The room was filled with a faint, pleasant fragrance.","Qi Quan leaned against the sofa, her gaze calm as she studied the tall, slender young man.","“What’s your name?”","The young man blinked with strikingly beautiful eyes, staring at her steadily before shaking his head.","“How old are you?”","He shook his head again.","“Do you still remember how to speak?”","Silence.","Qi Quan: “...”","She sighed inwardly and said to the system, “I regret this.”","System: “But he’s obedient, well-behaved, and good-looking.”","That made sense.","Qi Quan asked again, “Can you understand when people talk to you?”","The young man nodded slightly, his eyes innocent and confused.","“Since you’re a born spiritual being, from now on you’ll be called Ling Sheng. If you’re willing to live here, you can stay. If not, you’re free to leave. I’ll arrange for someone to teach you daily self-care. Got it?”","Ling Sheng tilted his head, thought for a moment, then nodded in agreement.","“I don’t keep freeloaders. Once you learn to take care of yourself, you’ll have to work. You can’t just eat and live for free.”","Ling Sheng didn’t respond.","[Boss, don’t you think that name is a bit too hasty?]","Qi Quan: [It suits him quite well.]","[Alright then. Poor Ling Sheng, you’re so serious with him—won’t you scare him?]","Qi Quan smiled quietly. Only the system thought so.","The demon monk trapped inside the peach wood talisman kept shouting incessantly.","At that moment, Su Rong came in carrying a tray of food.","Qi Quan instructed, “Ling Sheng, you must listen to Housekeeper Su from now on. Su Rong, he’s been imprisoned for over a decade, his mind still immature—please teach him.”","“Yes.” Su Rong looked at Ling Sheng in surprise. Thinking of the pain he had endured buried away for so many years, his attitude softened. “Ling Sheng, come with me.”","Ling Sheng obediently followed behind him. Before leaving the room, he glanced back at Qi Quan, a dark shadow flickering in his pupils.","The door closed.","Qi Quan pulled out the peach wood talisman and ignited spiritual flames to burn it. Strangely, the talisman showed no damage at all, but the two trapped souls inside screamed in agony, one cry louder than the last.","“Forgive me, Senior!” Qin Ruo cried out, unable to bear it any longer. “I was wrong! I didn’t recognize your true status and offended you. I deserve to die! Please let me go to reincarnation—I’m in so much pain!”","Qi Quan ate her meal leisurely, speaking as if in casual conversation, “The more honest you are, the sooner you’ll be allowed to reincarnate.”","She had seen too many people facing death with no remorse.","Qin Ruo hurried on, “Senior! I came to Longjiang City searching for people with strong fortune, using the Peach Blossom Seal to steal their luck and vitality. I only wanted to stay forever young, but Ding Ji—he has a bigger scheme!”","Ding Ji was the demon monk’s secular name.","“Tell me, what scheme?”","“Shut up! Shut up, damn you!” Ding Ji roared like thunder.","But now he was just a wisp of a ghost and could do no harm to Qin Ruo.","Qin Ruo was eager to reincarnate and paid him no mind, continuing, “If I’m right, his main target is you, Senior!”","“How amusing,” Qi Quan chuckled lightly, “I’m just an ordinary person from a rural background—why would he target me? Or could it be that the switched-at-birth incident from twenty-two years ago wasn’t an accident?”","Ding Ji: “...”","Qi Quan propped her chin on her hand, staring at the souls trapped inside the peach wood talisman, and said slowly, “Let me analyze it for you. You tell me if I’m right.”","“There exists a kind of extraordinary fate in this world. Those blessed with such great fortune are usually favored by the heavens. If others kill them, it brings about a grave sin, and the heavens will punish the perpetrator. But if one only makes their life difficult, gradually wearing down their will and fortune until they willingly give up on life, no heavenly punishment will follow.”","“In other words, it’s called ‘finding a loophole.’”","Ding Ji was speechless.","“So, for reasons unknown to you, at my birth, you deliberately arranged for me to be switched at the hospital. Then, after I became an adult capable of independence, you made sure I returned to the Qi family. That was the second step.”","“An unfamiliar environment amplifies inner anxiety and fear. Living in the Qi household, I was constantly on edge, walking on eggshells. I tried desperately to prove myself, but how could I compare to a fake heiress who had received elite education for over twenty years?”","Qin Ruo was utterly shocked upon hearing this.","She asked incredulously, “So why did you set up such an elaborate scheme?”","Ding Ji suddenly sneered coldly, “What do you know? All that talk about great fortune and heavenly favor is a load of crap!”","“Were you jealous?” Qin Ruo suddenly understood.","Qi Quan said, “Go on, what’s your final step?”","“Didn’t you already guess?” Ding Ji’s eyes darkened. “Make you willingly give up on life.”","“What’s in it for you?”","“Nothing. I’m mediocre at best. I just can’t stand seeing others blessed with great fortune.”","The system was speechless: [How can someone be like this? His jealousy is way too intense!]","Qi Quan: [Do you really think it’s just jealousy?]","[Or is it not?]","Qi Quan pressed Ding Ji, “Can you tell me, what exactly is your final plan?”","“Getting you to commit suicide on your own is impossible. But what if you die accidentally while doing something fun? Then it’s none of my business.” Ding Ji said with a smug look.","Everything became clear.","Qi Quan nodded, “It’s bungee jumping.”","The system had reported the final moments of the real heiress’s death, but the text only vaguely mentioned she “died from extreme fright during the process,” without specifying the cause.","Qi Quan studied Ding Ji’s slightly startled expression. “Longjiang City does have a bungee jumping club, with the platform built over a lake. Let me guess — there are water ghosts haunting the lake, right?”","When bungee jumping, the brain and heart are already under extreme tension. If at that moment you suddenly see a terrifying water ghost in the lake, dying from fright would be entirely plausible.","In the original story, Du Jiaming and others took the real heiress bungee jumping, and Qin Ruo was definitely among them. With Qin Ruo there, it would have been easy for the heiress to see the water ghost.","Everything made sense now, except—","“If I die, my fortune disappears too. You gain nothing from this. So why did you spend over twenty years setting up this scheme?”","Ding Ji was taken aback by her sharp insight.","He said expressionlessly, “I just can’t stand people with good fortune.”","Seeing him so determined, Qi Quan didn’t press further. Changing the subject, he asked, “Whose child is Ling Sheng?”","“Ling Sheng?” Ding Ji suddenly snapped back, stubbornly, “Picked up from the roadside. Who knows, maybe he just got lucky.”","Qi Quan finished his meal and wiped his mouth.","“You know about the Peach Blossom Seal, but are you aware that the Xuan Sect has another forbidden technique—Soul Searching?”","Ding Ji’s soul trembled, his face suddenly paling.","He had heard of the Soul Searching technique before. Indeed, it was a forbidden art in the Xuan Sect, banned for its cruelty and the extreme demands it placed on the caster.","To perform Soul Searching, the caster must be at least three realms above the target and exercise absolute control over their spiritual energy. One slip-up, and the target’s spirit platform could be shattered, resulting in an excruciating death.","He had no idea what level Qi Quan was at, but he still refused to believe that someone so young could be three realms above him.","Clinging to a thread of hope, he said, “Everything I’ve said is true.”","Qi Quan’s eyes curved slightly. “Have you thought this through? It’s been a long time since I last used Soul Searching; I might be a bit rusty.”","Ding Ji had no choice but to remind him, “I’m a sixth-level Celestial Master.”","“So?”","“Surely you know the restrictions of Soul Searching?”","Qi Quan was too impatient for small talk. He reached out and seized Ding Ji’s soul. Suddenly, a complex Soul Searching talisman pierced into his spirit platform, and Ding Ji screamed in agony.","Just as the memory images were about to reveal themselves, a fierce power surged from deep within Ding Ji’s spirit platform, instantly destroying both his spirit platform and soul.","The soul in his hand shattered into nothingness in an instant.","Qi Quan wasn’t surprised. Someone like Ding Ji, who would rather have his soul scattered than speak, clearly had secrets to protect.","This only confirmed Qi Quan’s suspicion...","That behind him was a massive organization.","That burst of energy resembled a puppet talisman’s self-destruct program, roughly at the eighth level. It seemed this organization had a formidable talent pool.","Qin Ruo, watching from the soul talisman, was stunned.","She had thought Ding Ji’s soul was destroyed by the Soul Searching technique and feared Qi Quan might use it on her too. Hastily, she confessed.","“Senior, I-I’m only following Ding Ji’s orders. I really don’t know anything. Oh, there’s one more thing—the land in the northern suburbs. Huang Qifeng originally planned to use it against the Qi family, but the Qi family never got it. It was me who decided to give it to the Song family. I bear no ill will toward the Qi family!”","“Oh.”","“Senior...”","“Silence.”","Qin Ruo immediately shut her mouth, not daring to utter another word.","In the living room, the Du and Yang families waited quietly. Besides them were Su Nuanuan and Qi Lin.","Normally, these people would be chatting and laughing when they met, but this gathering was thick with awkward tension.","Su Nuanuan glanced at Du Jiaming and Yang Su, breaking the silence with a teasing tone, “Du Ge, Yang Ge, how have you both been?”","Du Jiaming and Yang Su had lost their previous arrogance, smiling warmly in reply, “Doing well, thanks to the master’s miraculous healing hands.”","“You both have read the novel, right?”","“Yes.”","“I remember the chapter about treating Zhang Ge included some post-recovery precautions. You two should watch out for those too.”","Du Jiaming chuckled bitterly, “Nuanuan, don’t tease us. We’ve been through life and death—we’re not about to go back to wild living.”","They were all wary of encountering another ‘Qin Ruo.’","After this incident, the three rascals might finally turn over a new leaf.","Du and Yang’s fathers felt somewhat reassured in their hearts.","They had always been troubled by the children's unruly behavior, but after this ordeal, the kids had matured quite a bit and wouldn’t cause any more trouble. Now that they were settled and ready to inherit the family business, everyone could finally rest easy.","Master Qi was truly a great benefactor to their family!","Once the topic was opened, the group quickly relaxed and dropped all formalities.","Du Jiaming looked curiously at Qi Lin. \"How come you have time to wait here today?\"","Qi Lin replied, \"I came to ask the Master to save my life.\"","\"Isn't the Master your own younger sister?\" Yang Su asked in surprise. \"Do you really need to come specially to ask?\"","Du Jiaming subtly nudged him and handed him a cup of tea, tactfully steering the conversation elsewhere. \"You guys know about the 'Yuan Qing Disaster Star' incident, right? Do you think she’s really that unlucky?\"","\"I checked the victim information compiled online—it actually makes a lot of sense,\" Yang Su responded.","Su Nuanuan snorted lightly. \"Quan Quan already said she’s not a disaster star. Why don’t you believe her?\"","\"What? The Master said that? Then Yuan Qing must be innocent. I’ll speak up for her right now!\" Yang Su played the sycophant role to perfection.","Du Jiaming asked, \"Does the Master even follow entertainment gossip?\"","Su Nuanuan explained, \"Someone kept tagging Quan Quan on Weibo, so she replied. But since Quan Quan spoke the truth, fans of other male stars didn’t like it and started flooding her with insults. Now the comments under that post are full of abuse—all because of that troublemaker ‘Flying Lu Ma’ stirring things up for no reason!\"","\"Damn! Someone actually dared to mess with the Master! I’m going to find people to go after him!\" Yang Su was furious. He opened Weibo but froze instantly. \"What’s the Master’s Weibo handle?\"","\"It’s her pen name. Don’t you even read her column?\" Su Nuanuan shook her head. \"But you don’t need to fight anymore. That person already apologized last night.\"","Du Jiaming quickly asked, \"What column?\"","Su Nuanuan: \"...\"","Well, it was their first time reading novels, so not knowing about the author’s column was understandable.","Qi Quan finished eating and came into the living room.","Both the Du and Yang families expressed deep gratitude and offered generous rewards.","Su Rong accepted them one by one.","\"Quan Quan, are you alright?\" Su Nuanuan asked with concern.","Qi Quan smiled gently. \"I’m fine. Why are you here?\"","\"I was a little worried after you left last night.\"","\"Hmm.\" Qi Quan turned to Qi Lin. \"Let’s go.\"","Qi Lin: ???","Go where?","\"You came just to have me rescue Qi Yuan. Now that I’m free, let’s go.\"","Qi Lin hesitated, eyes full of surprise.","Su Nuanuan snorted quietly. At the hospital, they had suspected the worst of her, but Quan Quan was just soft-hearted.","\"Thanks,\" Qi Lin said, looking a bit embarrassed.","The system was displeased: [Boss, aren’t you going to make him beg you first?]","[Why should I make him? If it’s not Qi Yuan, it could be someone else.]","Besides, Qi Yuan didn’t deserve to die and had already suffered the consequences.","She would save Du Jiaming and the others, so naturally, she wouldn’t abandon Qi Yuan.","System: I have a feeling the boss is up to something.","The Du and Yang families had already left on their own. Qi Lin, Qi Quan, and Su Nuanuan got into the Qi family car.","Seeing Qi Quan appear, Qi Changrong and Gu Qiao both looked pleasantly surprised, but faced with Qi Quan’s coldness, they swallowed their words.","Qi Yingxue was shameless enough and knew how to pick the right moment to earn some favor. With tears streaming down her face, she pleaded to Qi Quan, “Xiao Quan, can you please save Xiao Yuan? I know Xiao Yuan wasn’t kind to you before, and you’re upset with him, but no matter how angry you are, you can’t just ignore his life. If you’re still mad, I can apologize on his behalf...”","“Shut up.” Qi Quan snapped impatiently. “I have one condition.”","“Xiao Quan, you...”","“Ah, can you stop talking nonsense!” Su Nuanuan interrupted her with a look of disbelief. “Don’t delay the treatment!”","Qi Lin also looked at Qi Yingxue with an unfamiliar coldness in his eyes and said sharply, “Qi Yingxue, this is a hospital, not a film set.”","Qi Yingxue was left speechless.","She lowered her head in grievance and hid behind Gu Qiao.","Gu Qiao sighed, “Xiao Quan, whatever you want, we can give it to you.”","“We’re family. Why make things so awkward?”","Qi Quan glanced at Qi Yuan lying on the hospital bed and said, “I can save Qi Yuan, but from now on, I have no relation to the Qi family.”","She wasn’t the original person to begin with. Now that the original was gone and she was taking over, she didn’t want to acknowledge any family ties.","Besides, as someone from the mystical sect, it’s best not to have deep attachments with ordinary people; it’s better for both sides.","Her words stunned everyone present.","Su Nuanuan looked at her worriedly. “Quan Quan, are you sure about this?”","Qi Quan’s expression was resolute. “If you agree, I’ll start immediately.”","For the Qi family, this was a heart-wrenching and difficult choice, but the answer was clear.","Right now, Qi Yuan’s life was the most important.","Qi Changrong sighed helplessly and regretfully, “Xiao Quan, why did it have to come to this?”","“The old me was a burden and trouble to you all. Now, isn’t this a happy ending?”","Gu Qiao burst into tears.","“Xiao Quan, you’re my daughter, not a burden. We never thought that way.”","Qi Quan said calmly, “Forget the past. Since you’ve agreed, go out and close the door behind you.”","Only Qi Quan and Qi Yuan remained in the room.","Qi Yuan’s heart was full of bitterness. “You don’t have to do this. If you hate me, I can leave the family and stop bothering you.”","“I’m living outside now. Whether you leave the family or not has nothing to do with me.”","Qi Quan formed hand seals. The soul inside the peachwood talisman, Qin Ruo, suddenly looked old and weak. Qi Yuan noticed something seemed to be breaking inside his forehead, and his heavy body gradually began to recover.","But his heart felt empty.","Soon, Qi Yuan regained his original appearance, his eyes red as he sat up.","Just as Qi Quan was about to turn and leave, he suddenly called out, “Wait.”","Qi Quan stopped in her tracks.","“Sorry,” he said hoarsely, “and thank you for your warning that day.”","Qi Quan’s hand gripped the door handle. “Don’t forget the payment.”","The hospital room door opened.","Gu Qiao was the first to step forward. Seeing her lively son, she couldn’t help but hold him and cry.","Qi...","Changrong looked at Qi Quan, about to say something, but she said, “Chairman Qi, I have something to attend to. I’m leaving now.”","The distant “Chairman Qi” chilled Qi Changrong’s heart to the core.","He stood there stunned. “Let Qi Lin see you out.”","Qi Quan did some quick calculations.","“That’s fine.”","Qi Lin personally drove Qi Quan.","Neither of them were particularly talkative, and the car was so quiet you could hear a pin drop.","[Boss, the comments under your post are blowing up.]","Qi Quan: ?","Her writing had caused such a stir?","With nothing else to do, she opened the app and scrolled down to the comment section.","It was lively—many threads had dozens of replies, making it impossible to see the bottom at a glance.","[Scumbag, get lost: I’ve been reading for years, but this is the first time I’ve seen an author spend so lavishly. I just want to know, the author hasn’t even subscribed to VIP, yet throws out so many plot twists—how do they expect to make a profit?]","[Rich lady still needs leg accessories?: The wealthy don’t lack money, they lack fame.]","[So filial it kills me: Top of the entire site’s reward leaderboard, 666! The comments are more interesting than the story itself.]","[Calling me to prep class: Boss, did you go demon hunting again? Sending you a big cheer!]","[Flying Lu Ma: On Weibo, I was careless and offended the master. I’m throwing deep water your way in hopes you’ll forgive me.]","[So filial it kills me: Here we go again, how much for one comment? Maybe I’ll switch careers to acting.]","[Brother Xu is the Handsomest: Standing guard for that disaster Yuan Qing, trash author! Trash story!]","[Aspiring cat servant: Came here from Weibo gossip, is the author really a true master? The face reading is really accurate?]","[Eat well today too: No way, no way, can anyone really believe this? But for an author who writes supernatural stories, I guess what she says can be trusted?]","Qi Quan: ...","How could this even cause such a commotion?","She had only answered one blogger’s question.","“Sorry.” Qi Lin suddenly spoke up. “I wasn’t thoughtful enough about some things before.”","Qi Quan put down her phone, her tone flat. “You have nothing to apologize for.”","After the original character returned home, Qi Lin was the most rational and calm member of the Qi family. All his words and actions were based on protecting the family’s interests, without any personal emotions.","He hadn’t done anything wrong.","Qi Lin said, “Thank you for saving Qi Yuan.”","“Mm, just don’t forget the payment.”","“...”","The topic ended there.","The car quietly drove toward the villa. Before reaching the gate, they saw a car parked outside with two people standing beside it.","System: [That’s the person who chased Qin Ruo last night! Who’s the other one?]","Qi Quan got out of the car.","She had anticipated that these two would bring Qin Ruo’s body here, so she had taken Qi Lin’s car on purpose to let him see it.","The two hurried over to her and, without a word, bowed deeply—so low that their foreheads almost touched their knees.","Qi Quan: ...Impressive ligament flexibility.","Qi Lin closed the car door and instinctively stepped in front of Qi Quan, his eyes sharp and commanding as he asked, “Who are you? What do you want?”","Chen Feilu quickly said, “Hello, Mr. Qi. My name is Chen Feilu. The chairman of Hongyuan Group is my father. I wonder if you remember me?”","The Chen family didn’t rank in the top ten in Longjiang City overall, but they stood out in certain fields. Qi Lin had met the chairman of Hongyuan Group before, so he had some impression.","“I remember.”","Chen Feilu smiled. “This is my friend Ning Zhi. We’re here today specifically to visit Master Qi Quan.”","Qi Lin turned to look at Qi Quan.","“Have you brought the person?” Qi Quan looked at Ning Zhi. “Come in together.”","Ning Zhi looked at her tall, slender back and finally understood how his peers felt when they looked at him.","There really are people beyond people, and heavens beyond heavens.","A poor student competing with a genius is just asking for humiliation.","He and Chen...","Chen Feilu opened the trunk, hoisted out Qin Ruo’s body wrapped in a burlap sack, and stepped into the lakeside villa.","Qi Lin: ?","What is this thing?","He thought for a moment, and seeing that Qi Quan didn’t stop him, he shamelessly followed inside.","In the living room, Qi Quan sat down on the sofa while everyone else stood to the side.","Ning Zhi asked somewhat awkwardly, “Senior, may I ask how we’re supposed to handle the corpse?”","Last night, he had carried the body back himself. Luckily, he used an invisibility talisman; otherwise, he’d be on the news headlines today.","It wasn’t that he didn’t respect the law, but disputes within the Xuan Sect were usually settled internally, unless someone from the sect harmed an ordinary person, in which case both the sect and secular law enforcement would get involved.","Now that Qin Ruo was dead, and Du Jiaming and the others were alive and well, there was no need to alert the authorities.","Qi Quan said, “Untie the sack.”","Obediently, Chen Feilu untied the burlap, revealing Qin Ruo’s corpse. Because the Peach Blossom Seal had been broken, vitality returned to the victim’s body, making the corpse horrifyingly grotesque.","Inside the peachwood talisman, Qin Ruo kept screaming, “I want to go to reincarnation! I want to go to reincarnation!”","She couldn’t bear to see herself in this state!","Qi Lin frowned, recalling that it was this monster who stood beside his younger brother last night, and he felt a strong sense of unease.","“Su Rong, take a photo and send it to Nuan Nuan,” Qi Quan called over the steward, giving instructions. “She’s going to study out of town. Let this serve as a warning not to drink strangers’ wine.”","Su Rong smiled and responded affirmatively.","Qi Lin: “...”","This is a jab at Qi Yuan, isn’t it?","Thinking about Qi Yuan’s recent behavior, he also took a photo and sent it to him.","Then, thinking better of it, he sent it to the group chat as well.","A person and a ghost couldn’t hear Qin Ruo’s screams from inside the peachwood talisman.","“Don’t take pictures! Don’t take pictures! Waaaaaah!”","For someone extremely vain, this was the most terrifying and cruel torture imaginable.","The system commented at the perfect moment: [So scary.]","The big shot sure knows how to hit where it hurts.","Qi Yuan had just been discharged from the hospital and returned home when he received the photo from Qi Lin. He opened it without much thought.","!!!","He bolted to the bathroom and vomited violently into the toilet.","“Are you feeling unwell? Is this some kind of aftereffect? Should we go back to the hospital and have it checked?” Gu Qiao asked worriedly.","Qi Yuan had no energy left to respond.","He recognized Qin Ruo at a glance; the horrifying face in the photo reminded him of the old face that had appeared for only a few seconds last night.","At that time, he hadn’t even reacted before Qin Ruo had stolen his vitality, causing him to collapse. Later, lying on the hospital bed waiting to die, he had no energy to think about how disgusting that face was.","The photo Qi Lin sent instantly brought back the real image of Qin Ruo, and Qi Yuan just couldn’t hold it in—he vomited until he was dizzy and faint.","He’d probably avoid strange women outside like the plague for a long time to come.","Seeing him like that, Gu Qiao was frantic and about to call their family doctor when the phone on the washbasin rang with a few group messages popping up.","They were from the group Qi Yuan had hastily added himself to in his panic.","The Drunken Revelers Group.","[Su Nuanuan: [picture]]","[Su Nuanuan: The mastermind behind this whole incident.]","Last night, everything happened so fast that except for a very few, no one really saw Qin Ruo’s face change.","[Qian Kun: Ugh!]","[Sun Yu: I was eating just now, and I threw up!]","[Peng Peng: Asking for Yuan Ge’s psychological trauma area.]","[Qian Kun: I want to interview the key people involved about their inner thoughts right now.]","[Su Nuanuan: This incident teaches us that one must keep oneself pure and decent.]","[Qian Kun: Nuanuan, you’re absolutely right! So, when will you let me out of the little black room?]","[Su Nuanuan: Considering the birthday gift, I forgive you!]","......","Gu Qiao stopped reading the messages after that because she was rushing to another... bathroom, clutching the toilet as she vomited violently.","Qin Ruo had been maintaining her youth by stealing vitality and luck, but forbidden arts are forbidden arts after all. Once broken, the caster suffers backlash.","After multiple backlashes, Qin Ruo’s face was utterly ruined, long beyond the realm of a normal person.","Anyone who hadn’t been in close contact with her could barely stand looking at her, let alone those who had once “loved” her.","Du Jiaming and the other two hadn’t even had time to recover from last night’s banquet when they suddenly saw the pictures Qi Lin posted in the group, revealing Qin Ruo’s true face. They all ran off and vomited until they were dizzy and pale.","[Song Lin: ?]","[Qi Lin: You were at the birthday party last night too, didn’t you see it?]","[Song Lin: I was busy and didn’t see it.]","[Qi Lin: Heard about what happened, though?]","[Song Lin: Mm.]","[Qi Lin: I suggest you seriously reconsider developing the Northern Suburb.]","[Song Lin: I don’t believe that.]","[Qi Lin: ......]","[Du Jiaming: Just finished vomiting. Song Lin, trust me, do you forget how miserable I was before?]","[Zhang Chengyan: Second that.]","[Yang Su: Even if you don’t believe it, why not find a master to take a look, just for peace of mind?]","Master Qi already said in the novel that the Northern Suburb land is filled with dark energy — there must be something wrong!","[Zhang Chengyan: Thanks to the master for saving my dog’s life! No, I have to go smash some thunder talismans to calm my nerves.]","[Du Jiaming: I’m going too.]","[Yang Su: Count me in.]","Qi Lin quietly opened the app and started fiercely competing for the top spot on the leaderboard.","[Song Lin: ......]","At the lakeside villa, Qi Lin took a photo and then left. Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu showed no intention of leaving.","Qi Quan gathered spiritual energy at his fingertips and placed it on Qin Ruo’s corpse. The energy transformed into pale blue ghostly flames, and the body instantly turned to ashes.","“The body’s been burned. You all may leave now.”","Ning Zhi mustered his courage and stepped forward: “I am Ning Zhi, twelfth-generation successor of the Ning family in Longjing City. May I ask which sect or school you belong to, sir?”","He searched his mind for a long time but could not find a sixth-level Taoist master named Qi.","He had personally experienced her unfathomable power. Her overwhelming spiritual energy easily shattered the sixth-level spells of the demon monk. Such a person, however, was unknown in the Taoist world — utterly unbelievable.","Ning Zhi had considered the possibility of her being above sixth-level, but that seemed impossible; he was very clear on what sixth-level and above meant.","Her ability to defeat the demon monk must have been due to a slightly higher realm and a more solid foundation than the luck-stealing demon monk.","Qi Quan toyed with the peachwood talisman in his hand, speaking casually: “No sect, no school.”","She had crossed over from another world, all alone. If you asked about her sect, she only had herself.","Ning Zhi: “......”","He didn’t believe her but didn’t want to press further, so he switched the topic.","“Senior, would you be willing to join the Taoist Masters Association?”","If such a powerful Taoist master joined the association, they would be unstoppable, able to handle even more difficult cases.","Qi Quan was someone who hated trouble—there was no way she would make things inconvenient for herself.","“I’m not interested.”","Ning Zhi was once again met with a cold refusal.","He lowered his head in frustration.","Chen Feilu stepped forward with tact, bowing deeply at a ninety-degree angle, his apology sincere: “Master, I apologize for any offense I may have caused online before. Please forgive me.”","Qi Quan asked, “Who are you?”","“My Weibo handle is Feitian Luma. You answered one of my questions.”","“Oh.”","Chen Feilu was not one to let an awkward silence linger. Even though Qi Quan’s attitude was cold, he didn’t just stand there like Ning Zhi. He continued:","“Since you can tell that Yuan Qing isn’t a disaster star, can you figure out why those male actors keep getting into trouble?”","He looked fresh and clean, dressed in a light-colored T-shirt and jeans, radiating youthful energy with a bright, infectious smile.","Qi Quan sized him up and asked, “If you care so much, why don’t you and your friends investigate it yourselves?”","“Uh...” Chen Feilu hesitated...","His gaze involuntarily shifted to Ning Zhi.","Ning Zhi had been focused on the “Peach Blossom Mark” case and wasn’t yet familiar with the “Yuan Qing Disaster Star” incident, his expression somewhat blank.","“There’s a level-three ghost around Yuan Qing,” Qi Quan pointed out.","A level-three ghost didn’t require her to intervene personally.","Ning Zhi’s expression instantly hardened. “I’ll handle it right away.”","He bowed and left the Linhu Villa with Chen Feilu.","At last, the place was peaceful.","Qi Quan relaxed, leaning back on the sofa and pondering what to write for tonight’s update.","A figure appeared at the door, slowly approaching her.","Qi Quan suddenly opened her eyes.","The young man stopped, his amber eyes fixed intently on her.","His long hair had been cut short, with fine strands falling over his forehead, making him look even younger.","He had changed out of the clothes taken from Ding Ji, now wearing a simple T-shirt and casual pants that outlined his tall, slender figure—very much to Qi Quan’s aesthetic taste.","No wonder he was a born spiritual entity.","She leaned back on the sofa, shamelessly admiring his stunning looks, lazily asking, “What is it?”","The young man slowly moved closer, crouching beside her leg, and carefully placed a hand on the back of hers.","Qi Quan: ?","The next moment, a stream of spiritual energy flowed gently into her meridians.","She met the young man’s cautiously pleading eyes.","The system couldn’t hold back: [Wuwuwuwu, Ling Sheng is just too obedient and handsome!]","Qi Quan: ...Obedient?","That little expression did make it hard not to soften.","She had cast a spell for Qi Yuan and burned Qin Ruo’s corpse with spiritual fire, which did consume some spiritual energy, but only a tiny bit—no need for special replenishment, a few breaths would restore it.","She pulled her hand away and said seriously, “I don’t need you to provide spiritual energy. You don’t have to do this anymore.”","Ling Sheng looked confused.","Su Rong saw off the guests and returned to the living room just in time. He said, “Master, there’s been some movement on Niu Qiang’s side. I want to go check it out.”","Qi Quan nodded. “Go ahead. And if you have time, find some instructional videos for Ling Sheng.”","“Understood.”","After responding, Su Rong turned to Ling Sheng and said, “Master needs to rest now. Let’s go.”","Ling Sheng slowly stood up, his eyelashes drooping slightly, revealing a trace of disappointment. As he followed Su Rong out the door, he glanced back at Qi Quan once more.","But Qi Quan had already closed his eyes.","The system observed clearly: [He’s so pitiful, boss. Aren’t you being a bit too cold toward him?]","Qi Quan replied: [I’m letting him stay here for free, and you think I’m cold?]","[You’re supposed to be his salvation. He’s devoted himself entirely to you.]","Qi Quan: [If I don’t save him, he can save himself.]","Spiritual beings are born with two extremes: they either become saints or demons.","This young man has been imprisoned for over a decade. Can he still be called normal? Was the destruction of Ding Ji’s body really just an accident?","System: [...He’s been locked up for more than ten years. If he could save himself, he would have done it long ago.]","Qi Quan ignored it and returned to his room to start typing.","*","Niu Qiang had been trapped in nightmares for a long time. He hadn’t had a good night’s sleep in days, constantly haunted by the pale face of that child.","“The ghost has come back for revenge! It’s definitely the ghost coming back for revenge!”","He sought out Huang Qifeng, his eyes bloodshot and wild, saying in a chilling tone, “Brother Feng, didn’t you say you’d find a master to get me a talisman? Where’s the talisman? Give it to me now!”","Huang Qifeng was already struggling to keep his own head above water.","He had been anonymously reported, and his company was now under investigation. The things he’d done behind the scenes might all be uncovered.","He desperately tried to contact Qin Ruo but couldn’t reach her. Even going to Qin Ruo’s place yielded no results.","He was sinking into endless panic.","“What talisman? What master? If you want a talisman, go to a temple and get it yourself!”","Niu Qiang fixed his gaze on Huang Qifeng’s wrist, his voice vicious. “Don’t think I don’t know — all these years... if it weren’t for this string of prayer beads, you’d be the one seeing those filthy things! Give me the beads!”","“What are you talking about? You’re crazy!”","Niu Qiang was on the verge of a breakdown. He even saw Huang Qifeng’s face change, the seemingly simple but actually cunning expression twisting into the grin of a little boy!","“Give me the beads! Give me! Hurry!”","The strength of a madman was terrifying. Huang Qifeng couldn’t hold him back. The string holding the beads around his wrist suddenly snapped under the strain, and the beads scattered across the floor.","It was as if a protective barrier near his ear shattered all at once.","Huang Qifeng immediately felt a chill flood through his limbs, and countless dark shadows screamed madly around him.","He let out a terrified scream and collapsed unconscious.","The company’s security guards finally arrived. Seeing their boss passed out, they quickly restrained the frenzied Niu Qiang and called the police.","At the police station, Niu Qiang suddenly regained clarity.","He felt an unprecedented calm. Those pale ghostly faces, the eerie smiles, the hoarse voices—all had vanished.","Overjoyed, he shouted, “Officer! I’ve committed a crime! Please arrest me! I want to go to jail! I want to go to jail!”","The police officer: “......”","Maybe... a drug test first?","The police station was filled with righteousness, and no ghosts or monsters dared to trespass lightly. Naturally, the illusions that Su Rong had cast on Niu Qiang lost their power.","Yet, the shadow that Su Rong had cast over Niu Qiang still took effect. At the very least, Niu Qiang cooperated fully and confessed to the crimes he had committed with Huang Qifeng, including the abduction and murder of Su Rong.","When Su Linhai received the call from the police station, he was completely stunned.","Seventeen years of injustice had finally come to light. The scoundrel who killed his son was finally facing justice.","He embraced his wife, and they wept bitterly together.","As the investigation deepened, the police uncovered numerous cold cases and inhumane criminal networks. There were missing children and women—all sins committed by Huang Qifeng and his gang in their ruthless quest for initial capital.","It was simply beyond condemnation!","Without the protection of Qin Ruo and Ding Ji, Huang Qifeng was nothing.","He admitted to all his crimes, and death penalty awaited him.","His assets were confiscated, his wife divorced him and took the children away. He was left with nothing.","Among the crimes he confessed to, one shocked the upper circles of Longjiang City.","Twenty-two years ago, on someone's orders, he deliberately swapped Qi Quan and Qi Yingxue, which caused the true heiress of the Qi family to be lost and raised outside the family for many years.","The Qi family was stunned.","Qi Changrong was so furious that he suffered a stroke and was hospitalized.","No one had ever imagined that the person they once showed a moment of kindness to had harbored such deep malice against their family!","Gu Qiao felt a chill deep in her heart.","They had been powerless, unable to uncover the truth, always believing it was just an accident. But who would have thought that the suffering of their biological daughter was rooted in someone else’s jealousy of their family?","In Huang Qifeng’s own words, he couldn’t stand the Qi family’s hypocritical, condescending attitude of charity.","He had been scheming for more than twenty years, all to see the Qi family sink into the mud and live in misery.","These horrifying revelations only spread within a small circle in Longjiang City; others remained unaware. But Luo Xiaoyu was not among them.","Ever since a child's remains were dug up from the village river, she had been following the case closely. The villagers had been abuzz with talk.","“I always said it—how did that Huang family suddenly get rich back then? Turns out they’re heartless monsters capable of such evil!”","“So pitiful, only six years old, and killed like that.”","“I heard the child’s restless spirit appeared in a dream, and that’s how his father found him. Spooky, right?”","Luo Xiaoyu listened with growing anger. When she got home, she asked her mother, “Is that Huang, the trafficker, from our village?”","“Yeah,” her mother rolled her eyes, “He got rich over ten years ago and became a big shot in Longjiang City. Never thought he’d be so cruel and heartless!”","Luo Xiaoyu nodded in agreement.","Such a scumbag deserved the death penalty!","Thinking of the little boy who had called out “Daddy,” a storm of grief and anger churned inside her.","“It's late, aren’t you going to bed?” her mother nagged.","“Coming, coming!” Luo Xiaoyu said.","She crawled back into her room and lay on her bed, her mood heavy as she unlocked her phone.","White Water, the popular streamer, hadn’t updated in days. Was he off fighting demons again?","She instinctively opened the Screaming app, and her eyes suddenly widened—there was an update!","White Water had finally posted a new update!","She clicked into the new chapter with a cheerful heart.","[The Peach Blossom Mark wasn’t an isolated case.","After saving one person, two more fell victim.","That malevolent spirit certainly has a big appetite.","They came to me, hoping I could save them just like I saved Number One (let’s call him Number One for now).","But I’m just an ordinary person with low cultivation.","Healing Number One drained most of my energy; I had no strength left to help the other two. Fortunately, their conditions weren’t severe—they could survive for a few more days.","I planned to rest for a couple of days, regain my strength, and then help them.","But I never expected that malevolent spirit’s appetite to grow even bigger.","Two days later was the birthday banquet of Miss Su, the heiress of Shengxin Group.","I was invited.","At the banquet, Miss Su was charming and lovely. She introduced me to her friends, and my invisible younger brother was there too.","Of course, I’ve read plenty of metaphysics books, so now I can see my brother.","He looked pretty much as I imagined—a handsome young man, though his gaze was unsettling.","More importantly, the black cloud hovering over his head was thick and ominous.","That’s a sure sign of impending death!","Even though he once offended me, he didn’t deserve to die. I couldn’t just stand by and watch him perish.","Before I could warn him, he suddenly changed—transforming from a young, handsome man into an old grandpa. He couldn’t even speak before collapsing to the ground.","Chaos erupted around us.","I quickly pulled out a talisman I always carry and slipped it into his clothes. At least before dealing with that troublesome spirit, he could hold on to his life.","The malevolent spirit fled.","Surprisingly, there was a Taoist priest at the scene who chased after it.","I wasn’t at ease, so I followed along.","Before leaving, in a daze, I seemed to catch sight of a young man whose forehead faintly glowed black—he might encounter some trouble, but nothing serious.","After a night of fierce battle, I returned home exhausted.","Someone blocked my door and asked, “Is Yuan Qing a disaster star?”","I sized him up. He was young, full of spiritual energy—a rookie in the metaphysical world, probably lacking experience.","I didn’t know who Yuan Qing was, but there’s no such thing as a disaster star in this world.","Yet people are strange—they always blame their misfortunes on others, as if it comforts their hearts.","But how innocent are those slandered and smeared?","I told the truth.","But very few wanted to listen.","It’s truly bizarre.","The recent events have shattered my worldview. I feel my fragile heart might not be able to take it.","I heard extreme sports can strengthen the heart. I wonder if Jiangcheng has any suitable ones.]","Luo Xiaoyu reached the end of the text and immediately knew that the “xx” referred to Yuan Qing. She had been watching the online turmoil from the sidelines. Bai Shui Zhenren’s Weibo was flooded with hateful comments from various fans, and she had seen it all.","She trusted Bai Shui Zhenren’s words.","Scrolling down to the comment section, she saw someone had already left a remark.","[Brother Xu is the Handsomest in the World: The author is disgusting! Always whitewashing that b*tch Yuan Qing! Are you her fan, writing this to clear her name? My brother is still lying in the hospital. How can you be so vicious!]","Luo Xiaoyu frowned deeply and reported the comment without hesitation.","Such malice was unbearable.","[Really Desperate for New Stories: Ahhh, it’s updated! Keep it up, Bai Shui!]","[Just want to...","[“Where’s the male lead? Why hasn’t he appeared yet?”]","[I’m dying of admiration: I feel like... this content looks a bit familiar.]","[Good luck today: Master! Who’s that young guy at the banquet with a dark spot between his eyebrows? Scared.jpg]","[Great fortune today: Damn, who’s the lucky one this time? Definitely not me, I wasn’t there that day.]","[Great luck and prosperity: I wasn’t there either.]","Those in the know caught the hint in the story — the young man with the dark spot between his eyebrows is definitely in trouble or about to be.","Those who trust Qi Quan naturally take it seriously; those who don’t just scoff.","Luo Xiaoyu is one of those who believe it.","[If you see me, please call me to prepare lessons: The author is so kind, even giving a warning!]","Of course, some new readers found it confusing.","[My OTP is real: Wait, why are the comments so strange? Everyone’s totally immersed in the story?]","[Random passerby A: Came here from VB, the author’s really stubborn to defend someone in a situation like this.]","[456: Isn’t this just an ordinary (and saying ordinary is flattering) fantasy novel? Why are the readers under the story losing their minds one by one?]","Those unaware really can’t understand.","Those in the know excitedly discussed it in their private groups.","[Zhang Chengyan: Did you see the update? Guess who the person with the dark spot between the eyebrows is.]","[Du Jiaming: I guess it’s Song Lin.]","[Yang Su: Agreed.]","[Zhang Chengyan: Damn, exactly what I thought!]","[Song Lin: ?]","[Qi Lin: No, he wasn’t at the scene then. Besides, she won’t say the same thing twice.]","[Zhang Chengyan: True, the master already warned @Song Lin in the story, but the young master didn’t believe it.]","[Song Lin: ...... ]","[Du Jiaming: So who is it? Anyway, I wasn’t at the banquet, so definitely not me.]","[Zhang Chengyan: I was far away and didn’t see clearly. But I do know that the people closest to Su Nuanuan at that time were her friends Qi Yuan, Qian Kun, and the others.]","[Yang Su: Excluding Qi Yuan.]","[Du Jiaming: I bet those kids are scared stiff right now.]","Indeed, Qian Kun and the others looked a bit pale.","[Qian Kun: Ahhhhh, I was really close to Brother Yuan that time. Could it be me? I just looked in the mirror and my forehead does feel a bit dark, what do I do!]","[Sun Yu: I think it might be me. Lately, everything’s been going wrong—I trip over flat ground.]","[Peng Peng: Could be me too. I felt Qi Quan gave me a special look before leaving that day.]","[Su Nuanuan: ... Stop scaring yourselves. There were a lot of people there.]","The young ones, frightened by the story, couldn’t sleep that night, but Qi Quan slept soundly.","The next morning, Su Rong, as usual, served up a delicious breakfast.","He was in a great mood, a smile on his face, the morning light slanting over him, looking exceptionally handsome.","Another person sat at the table.","It was the Ling Sheng she had rescued.","Seeing two handsome guys so early in the morning made Qi Quan equally happy.","She enjoyed the breakfast and sincerely praised, “Butler Su, your cooking keeps getting better.”","Su Rong was pleasantly surprised by the compliment. “I’ll keep working hard.”","Ling Sheng gripped his chopsticks tightly, his amber eyes slightly dim.","He seemed... completely helpless.","Just after finishing the meal, Wang Hua drifted over, his face marked by reluctance and melancholy.","Qi Quan asked, \"Are you going to reincarnate?\"","\"Yeah, Huang Qifeng has fallen, and my sister... she has children, so I don't need to worry about her. I have nothing left to hold onto.\"","Besides, no one cared about what he was attached to anyway.","Qi Quan nodded. \"Go ahead.\"","The transparent soul form turned into a speck of light, gradually fading into the air.","Qi Quan heard a weak voice coming from the peach wood talisman.","\"I want to reincarnate too, please let me go.\"","After losing her vitality and fortune, Qin Ruo’s soul was barely holding together. If she didn’t reincarnate soon, she would simply dissipate into nothingness.","Qi Quan felt no sympathy for her.","If you’ve done wrong and hurt others, don’t expect to reincarnate smoothly.","\"Master, there’s someone outside visiting. They said...\" Su Rong hesitated for a moment before continuing, \"They want to invite you to the Heartbeat Club for bungee jumping.\"","Qi Quan was not surprised; this new chapter was clearly the point.","\"Got it. Tell them to wait a moment.\"","Outside the villa, several luxury cars were parked side by side.","Du Jiaming, Yang Su, and Zhang Chengyan glared at each other.","They had deliberately avoided mentioning it in the group chat last night, planning to invite the Master separately. They never expected each of them to be even more cunning than the others.","\"Yang Su, Zhang Chengyan, I got here first. Both of you, get lost!\" Du Jiaming snapped.","\"Who says I can’t invite the Master? Mind your own business,\" Yang Su retorted.","\"Enough fighting. Wouldn’t it be more fun if we all went together?\" Zhang Chengyan acted as the peacemaker. \"When the Master comes out later, don’t look so grim.\"","Du Jiaming and Yang Su sneered but dared not argue loudly anymore.","After a moment, the villa’s front door swung open.","Before the other two could react, Zhang Chengyan scampered over, holding up a delicate little parasol, wearing a fawning smile: \"Master, please get in the car.\"","The other two were speechless.","Damn, this guy really is the sneakiest of them all!"]},{"number":27,"title":"Chapter 27","paragraphs":["Qi Quan was accustomed to being served by others.","She calmly allowed Zhang Chengyan to hold the umbrella for her as she settled into the back seat of the Zhang Family's luxury car.","Zhang Chengyan's grin practically reached the back of his ears.","Under the murderous glares of the other two, he took the passenger seat and urged the driver, \"To the Heartbeat Club.\"","A convoy of three cars made their way to the club.","Inside the car, Zhang Chengyan kept checking on Qi Quan.","\"Master, is it too hot? Should I lower the AC a bit?\"","\"Master, are you cold? Should I turn it up?\"","\"Master, are you thirsty? I brought some drinks.\"","\"Master...\"","Qi Quan complained to her system: 【Why does he talk so much?】","The system remarked with feeling: 【This is the treatment of a top expert. You need to get used to it.】","【......】","\"Be quiet,\" she said.","Zhang Chengyan immediately turned around and clamped his mouth shut.","The group chat was buzzing nonstop.","【Du Jiaming: You sly dog!】","【Yang Su: All these years, I misjudged you.】","Zhang Chengyan chuckled to himself: 【That's because you two lack vision.】","【Yang Su: Hmph, once we get to the club, you won't be so useful!】","Zhang Chengyan: ...","The owner of the Heartbeat Club had some connections to the Yang family. If Yang Su just said the word, everything would be arranged perfectly.","But he wasn't worried. At least he had Du Jiaming below him in the pecking order.","The cars stopped at the club entrance. The club owner himself was waiting outside to greet them. Seeing the three young masters get out, he stepped forward, beaming:","\"Young Master Yang, Young Master Du, Young Master Zhang, welcome, welcome. I've arranged for the best instructors and equipment. Please, this way.\"","The three young masters, however, didn't respond.","They raced each other to the rear door of the Zhang family car, their smiles even more ingratiating than the club owner's.","Zhang Chengyan personally reached out and opened the car door.","\"Master, please step out.\"","Club Owner: ???","He wasn't part of their inner circle, at best having some ties to a relative of the Yang family, and knew nothing of the affairs in the upper echelons.","Witnessing this scene, he was utterly bewildered.","Was he dreaming?","Any one of these three young masters was a top-tier second-generation heir in Longjiang City. They were always the ones being flattered, never the ones doing the fawning.","Could there be a VIP in the car?","The owner immediately snapped to full attention.","The door of the luxury car opened. A foot stepped out, wearing comfortable sneakers. The pant leg was pulled up slightly, revealing a slender, pale ankle.","It was a woman.","The club owner squinted. Could she be the object of the three young masters' ardent pursuit?","The sole of the shoe touched the ground. Qi Quan bent forward and got out of the car.","She was tall and slender, wearing a loose tracksuit that made her seem even more lithe and willowy. Her hair was tied up in a high bun, with a few stray strands framing her temples, revealing a smooth forehead. Her features were exceptionally delicate and beautiful.","The owner had seen many beauties, but one with such a unique aura was a first.","Zhang Chengyan opened a parasol, respectfully shielding her from the sun.","The club owner's eyebrow twitched. This didn't look like courting a woman; it looked more like serving an ancestor.","Could this woman have a formidable background?","He suppressed his curiosity and focused on being a diligent guide.","\"I've prepared some snacks and tea in the lounge. Young Master Yang, would you like to rest for a bit first?\"","Du Jiaming was the first to ask, \"What does the Master think?\"","The club owner clearly heard the address: Master?","What the heck!","Qi Quan: \"Unnecessary.\"","\"Alright,\" Yang Su instructed the owner. \"Take us directly to the bungee platform.\"","The bungee platform was built on a cliff face by the lake, over two hundred meters high. A narrow jump platform extended from the cliff like a fragile arm, capable of holding a maximum of five people at once.","\"Who's first?\" the bungee instructor asked.","Du Jiaming, who... loved extreme sports, immediately replied, \"I'll go.\"","He was going to show off his heroic stance in front of the Master!","Zhang Chengyan was the most timid of them all. He didn't even dare look down, his legs turned to jelly.","\"Scared stiff and you still dared to come,\" Du Jiaming said with a scornful look. \"Coward.\"","Zhang Chengyan stiffened his neck. \"Even if I'm scared, I'll still accompany the Master!\"","He hoped the Master would see his sincerity.","His family had made it clear: the Master was his savior. He absolutely had to serve the Master well. An expert like her was a rare encounter.","Yang Su rolled his eyes hard, then turned back with a fawning expression: \"Master, would you like to jump second or third?\"","Qi Quan's gaze fell on the lake surface: \"Second.\"","The lake shimmered with light. Standing over two hundred meters high, the view was expansive, offering a panoramic scene of the lake.","Her spiritual sense probed into the lake water.","\"Ahhhhhhhhh—\"","A scream, following the vertical drop of the tether rope, reached their ears from mid-air. Du Jiaming spread his arms, swinging back and forth high above, his expression one of extreme excitement.","The scream seemed to disturb something in the lake.","In a place invisible to the naked eye, a pale, bluish ghostly face emerged from the lake surface. The ghost watched the screaming Du Jiaming in mid-air with great interest, laughing and clapping as if interacting with him.","Even though no one could see him, he was having a great time.","Qi Quan: ...","This was a first-level white ghost, one who hadn't harmed anyone.","She wondered, in the original storyline, when Qin Ruo used him to scare the true heiress to death, if it brought karmic debt upon this water ghost.","Qi Quan had come here to resolve the true heiress's death from the original book. Seeing that this water ghost was harmless, she didn't plan to disturb its self-amusing ghostly existence.","However—","This water ghost was clearly a victim of murder. Should she intervene in this case?","\"Master, it's your turn,\" Yang Su called out respectfully.","Qi Quan walked to the edge of the platform. The staff equipped her with the harness. Looking down at the lake two hundred meters below, her expression remained utterly calm.","A staff member sincerely praised, \"You're really brave, miss.\"","\"Of course, the Master is a top expert!\" Zhang Chengyan shouted.","The staff member took it as a joke and didn't pay it much mind.","The rope equipment was secured.","Qi Quan stepped to the very edge of the jump platform and, without the slightest hesitation, leapt cleanly into the void.","\"Wow! The Master is so cool!\" Zhang Chengyan's eyes shone with admiration.","Yang Su shared in the pride: \"The Master definitely knows how to fly and move through the earth. What's a little height like this to her?\"","The wind rushed past her ears. The view of the lake grew larger and larger on her retinas. Qi Quan clearly saw the water ghost looking at her enviously, flicking water droplets into the air with its fingers.","Faintly, she seemed to see epaulets on the ghost's shoulders.","Before, it had only shown its head and hands, everything below the neck submerged, unclear. Now, being closer, the ghost's movements were more pronounced, and the epaulets surfaced.","Looking at its overly young face, Qi Quan felt a pang of compassion.","The water ghost had been amusing itself, but gradually, it realized something was off.","It was looking at the female tourist swinging in the air, and the female tourist was also looking at it.","A coincidence, right?","It had been here for years. No one had ever been able to see it.","It ducked under the water. After a moment, a pair of eyes cautiously peeked back up at Qi Quan.","Qi Quan happened to swing directly above it. Human and ghost made eye contact.","\"Ahhhhhhh—\" The water ghost, terrified, plunged deep into the water with a splash.","Qi Quan: \"...\"","After swinging for a short while, she landed on a small boat on the lake surface.","The staff helped her out of the harness, put on a life jacket, and headed for the shore.","Qi Quan attached a strand of her spiritual sense to the water ghost, sensing that it was following behind the boat, just not showing its head.","\"You really cut a dashing figure, Master!\" Du Jiaming waved at her from the shore.","Qi Quan came ashore, and Du Jiaming immediately offered her drinks and fruit.","The club owner...","stood to the side, already numb to the young master Du's fawning attitude.","He glanced at Qi Quan's composed demeanor, and a sense of awe spontaneously arose in his heart.","This was definitely a VIP!","\"Master, shall we head back now?\" Du Jiaming asked with a smile.","He was quite handsome, just his demeanor was a bit greasy.","Qi Quan didn't look at him, her gaze fixed instead on a pale, bluish ghostly hand on the lake embankment.","\"In a while.\"","\"Right away!\"","Another hand emerged.","The water ghost peeked out cautiously, stealing glances at Qi Quan, then whoosh—pulled back. After a moment, it looked over again.","After repeated verification, he finally confirmed that this female visitor could really see him.","They had made eye contact several times!","The water ghost became visibly excited. He waved his arms wildly at Qi Quan, shouting, \"Hey! Can you see me?!\"","He was wearing a police uniform.","Qi Quan lowered her eyes. Due to certain experiences in her past life, she held a certain fondness for those in police uniforms.","A young officer meeting an unjust death—she couldn't simply turn a blind eye.","She pulled a peach wood talisman from her zippered pocket.","Du Jiaming's eyes lit up. \"Master, are you going to perform a ritual?\"","The club owner: \"...\"","Wasn't that just an ordinary piece of wood?","Qi Quan didn't answer. Spiritual energy gathered at her fingertips and flowed into the peach wood talisman. The array inscribed on it activated, releasing a powerful suction force that pulled the water ghost into the wooden token.","Water ghost: ???","Qin Ruo was already inside the peach wood talisman.","The water ghost said belatedly, \"Hiss, you look kinda familiar.\"","Qin Ruo: \"...\"","She had already reached a point of resignation.","\"We met once before you died.\"","The water ghost was shocked. \"You know me?! Where did we meet? Are you dead too? What is this place?\"","Qin Ruo sighed. \"I don't know you, but I saw you on your last mission. This is a place where a Taoist master keeps ghosts. The person who could see you just now is the master.\"","\"Ah?\" The water ghost scratched his head in confusion. \"Last mission... I received a call, went to Huayuan No.1 Community, saw some people forcing a girl into some kind of ghost marriage, so I ordered them to stop, and then... then on my way home, somehow I ended up dead in the lake.\"","He paused, looked at Qin Ruo's aged spirit form, and said in surprise, \"Were you there too?\"","Qin Ruo was indeed there.","She was still a newcomer in the \"Mystic Sect\" back then, following a senior to fulfill a contract, going to someone's house to perform a ghost marriage ritual.","A young police officer suddenly barged in, interrupted their spellcasting, and gave them a verbal warning.","After the officer left, the senior immediately reported it. Qin Ruo faintly overheard instructions to have the young officer killed.","She couldn't understand it. Although they were the \"dark practitioners\" who operated in secrecy within the Mystic Sect, not to be discovered by so-called orthodox cultivators, and couldn't let word leak out, the young officer only thought they were engaging in superstitious activities. There was no need to kill him.","But the higher-ups believed it was better to kill by mistake than to let go.","The situation was indeed tense for dark practitioners at the time, so the young officer fell victim to an illusion spell, stumbled, fell into the lake, and drowned.","Qi Quan stood up at the right moment. \"Let's go back.\"","On the diving platform not far away, Zhang Chengyan was still screaming in fear. Although Yang Su had gotten onto the speedboat, he hadn't come ashore yet.","Du Jiaming immediately seized the opportunity. \"Alright, I'll drive you back!\"","Club owner: To think a scion of a wealthy family also had a talent for being a lackey. My respects!","Yang and Zhang, left behind at the club: Damn! How sneaky!","The Du family car left the club, driving along the main road towards the lakeside villa.","The area was relatively remote, with little traffic. The plane trees lining the road cast dappled shadows.","\"Master, are you hot?\"","\"Master, are you thirsty?\"","\"Master, you...\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She had avoided Zhang Chengyan, but still couldn't...","escape Du Jiaming. No wonder they were brothers who had known each other for over twenty years.","\"Master,\" Du Jiaming said with an ingratiating smile, \"I heard your protective talismans are especially powerful. I wonder if you'd be willing—\"","BANG—","A sudden sound of a collision came from ahead. The driver slammed on the brakes.","\"Damn! What happened?!\" Du Jiaming frowned.","About fifty meters ahead, a blue car had rear-ended a black car. Both vehicles had stopped.","It seemed like an ordinary traffic accident, but the next second, the blue car reversed dozens of meters, accelerated, and rammed into the black car again. The black car, unable to avoid it, lurched forward a few meters.","That wasn't enough.","The driver of the blue car seemed to have gone mad, repeatedly slamming into the rear of the black car with all their might.","Other vehicles and pedestrians on the road stopped, staring in shock at the absurd scene.","Qi Quan extended her spiritual sense.","\"Die! You bitch, die!\"","She performed a quick hand calculation and said to Du Jiaming in the passenger seat, \"Lend me an umbrella.\"","Du Jiaming hurriedly pulled out an umbrella. \"Master, are you getting out? Let me hold it for you.\"","\"No need. You stay in the car.\"","She got out.","The blue car was still madly \"rear-ending\" the black car, which had no choice but to pull over to the side. Bystanders had already called the police.","The driver of the black car got out, intending to confront the blue car's driver, when suddenly three people jumped out of the blue car, holding glass jars, and sprinted towards the black car.","One person yanked open the rear door, another unscrewed the lid of a jar, and a third raised a phone.","\"Yuan Qing! Get out of the entertainment industry!\"","The liquid from the glass jar was suddenly flung into the car.","Before anyone could scream, in that critical moment, a delicate parasol snapped open, blocking the splashing liquid.","The liquid hit the umbrella's surface with a sizzling, corrosive sound. A foul odor wafted into the noses of the onlookers with the wind.","\"Holy shit! Sulfuric acid!\"","\"It's sulfuric acid! That's too vicious!\"","\"They're insane.\"","Many people raised their phones to record the video.","This was a serious criminal case—first intentionally ramming the other car, forcing it to stop, then opening the door to throw sulfuric acid. This was utterly lawless!","They didn't look that old either. How could they do such a thing?","The girl who threw the acid, seeing her plan fail, glared fiercely at Qi Quan. She was about to hurl the remaining sulfuric acid in her jar at her when a sudden pain shot through her wrist. The glass jar fell to the ground with a smash, shattering. A small amount of sulfuric acid splashed onto her shoes. She stumbled back in terror, her face pale.","So she did know the consequences of getting sulfuric acid on herself.","The system was indignant: How could they do this! That's too malicious!","By now, Du Jiaming had also run over and, along with other bystanders, restrained the frenzied girls, waiting for the police to arrive.","Qi Quan glanced at the woman in the back seat.","She was wearing sunglasses and a mask, her body pressed against the opposite door, hands tightly crossed over her chest—a classic defensive posture.","\"Th-thank you,\" the woman murmured, her voice extremely hoarse.","Qi Quan calmly withdrew her gaze and closed the car door for her.","She clearly saw that the woman's marriage fate line was tied to a third-level ghost, shimmering with a malicious blackish-red hue.","The third-level ghost had coarse, ugly features and a lewd gaze. It stared at the woman, emitting a creepy chuckle, leaning close to her ear and blowing icy cold breath.","Qi Quan stood outside the car. Du Jiaming dutifully held a new parasol over her.","She concealed her aura as a Celestial Master; otherwise, that disgusting third-level ghost wouldn't have dared to make such lewd gestures right in front of her.","The police arrived quickly.","The troublemakers, the victim, and the witnesses were all taken to the police station for questioning.","As the \"hero\" who acted bravely for a just cause, Qi Quan naturally went to the station as well, with Du Jiaming accompanying her.","It was only after arriving at the station that the onlookers learned the victim of the car collision and acid attack was actually the major celebrity Yuan Qing!","The perpetrators were several underage girls.","\"She's harmed so many people, why does she get to stay in the entertainment industry...? Doesn't she know she'll hurt more people?\" the girls argued vehemently.","The police: \"...\"","They were aware of the whole \"Yuan Qing, the Jinx\" incident. Just as the heavily criticized White Water True Person had said, what kind of jinx exists in this world?","They had investigated the case of Wei Xu's fall from the wire. While it was unclear why the wire snapped, there wasn't a single piece of evidence pointing to Yuan Qing as the culprit, let alone the absurd and laughable conviction of a \"jinx constitution harming people.\"","Since the girls were all minors, the police contacted their parents.","When the parents arrived at the station, another round of commotion ensued.","However, the nature of this incident was particularly egregious. The charge of intentional assault was unavoidable, though the sentence could be reduced considering the attempt and their age. If they obtained the victim's forgiveness, they might avoid jail time.","But a criminal record was certain, affecting their entire future.","The parents of the perpetrators all knelt on the ground, begging Yuan Qing.","\"They're still young, they don't know any better.\"","\"Could you please be magnanimous and let them go?\"","\"You're a big star, why bother with them?\"","\"I'll kowtow to you!\"","Qi Quan watched from a distance, neither too close nor too far, and said to the system: [Emotional blackmail, it really is everywhere.]","[Big Boss, you seem to be in a bad mood.]","[It's fine.]","System: It doesn't look like it's just fine.","Beside her, Du Jiaming seized the moment to say, \"Master, the questioning is over. Shall we head back now?\"","At that moment, Yuan Qing over there spoke up.","Her voice was very soft and gentle: \"Alright, I forgive them.\"","She forgave the malice of her attackers, bearing the world's endless slander and harm with her slender frame.","Qi Quan responded to Du Jiaming, \"Let's go back.\"","[Ahhhhhh so infuriating! Why did she forgive them! She's such a doormat!] The system howled in anger.","Qi Quan got into the car. [She's not a doormat.]","[How is that not being a doormat?]","[Perhaps, she also believes she is guilty.]","System: ?","At the same time, in a room of the lakeside villa, a children's educational cartoon played on the TV screen. Some books and writing utensils were placed on the desk.","Ling Sheng was bent over the desk, studying.","Suddenly, a \"tap tap tap\" sound came from the window. He looked up to see a sparrow pecking at the glass with its beak, tilting its head to look at him, its round, shiny eyes bright and alert.","Ling Sheng moved his fingers, and the window opened automatically.","The little sparrow flew onto the desk, chirped for a while, and the young man's brows and eyes curved slightly as he reached out to stroke its little head.","An invisible stream of spiritual power flowed into it. The sparrow, as if receiving a top-notch spa treatment, closed its eyes in comfort, its feathers puffing out slightly.","Ling Sheng moved his hand away and patted its wing. Understanding, the sparrow spread its wings and flew out the window.","The sunlight outside was blazing.","Du Jiaming drove Qi Quan back to the villa gate. Just as he was about to personally hold an umbrella for her, he saw a tall, slender young man already standing by the car.","He was holding a plain-colored umbrella, shielding Qi Quan from the scorching sun.","Du Jiaming took a closer look and was stunned.","Although he only loved beautiful women, this person's appearance could truly be called a peerlessly handsome man. The most beautiful women he had ever seen couldn't compare.","Of course, the only one who could hold her own against such a beauty was Master Qi, whose aura was as profound as the sea.","Du Jiaming, thinking of something, chuckled slyly: \"Then I won't disturb you, Master.\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","Ling Sheng's clear, bright eyes were fixed only on Qi Quan, not giving Du Jiaming a single glance.","Du Jiaming got into his car with a lecherous smile.","\"Why did you come out?\" Qi Quan asked, walking slowly towards the courtyard gate, her tone even.","Ling Sheng raised the umbrella in his hand slightly, his eyes brightening.","System: [Sniffle... Ling Sheng is so good!]","Qi Quan: ... This silly system.","Although no official information was leaked, some busybodies among the roadside onlookers uploaded the videos they shot to the internet, sparking numerous discussions.","Netizens, with their eagle eyes, quickly identified the owner of the black business van.","[Look at the license plate and that driver. It must be Yuan Qing in that car!]","[Right, those girls were telling her to get out of the entertainment industry. Probably some crazy fans.]","[Was that really sulfuric acid in the cup? That's too vicious!]","[Yuan Qing really has it rough.]","[Rough? If she weren't a jinx, would there have been so many accidents on set?]","[That girl who blocked the acid with the umbrella was so cool!]","[Thank goodness it was blocked, otherwise Yuan Qing's life would have been ruined.]","[That heroine is so pretty!]","[Beautiful and fierce, love it.]","Opinions varied online. Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu had staked out Yuan Qing's residence all day but hadn't seen her.","Prompted by Qi Quan, they had come to deal with that third-level ghost.","Unfortunately, with Yuan Qing absent, the third-level ghost was also missing, forcing them to head back empty-handed.","\"Damn!\" Chen Feilu, scrolling through Weibo, shoved his phone in front of Ning Zhi. \"Isn't this the Master?\"","Ning Zhi watched from the beginning.","The video briefly showed a woman in the car for about two seconds. With his sharp eyes, he immediately spotted the third-level ghost beside her.","His expression turned grave.","That's odd. Since Senior was present, why didn't she just capture that ghost right away?","He decided then and there to go to the lakeside villa first thing the next morning.","His question was also raised by the water ghost inside the peachwood talisman.","Being a ghost himself, the water ghost could naturally sense the presence of the third-level ghost, while the peachwood talisman prevented the third-level ghost from detecting him.","\"Master, why didn't you capture it directly?\"","Qi Quan took a sip of tea and said unhurriedly, \"Let's talk about your story first.\"","Water ghost: \"...\"","Ten years ago, he had just graduated from university and become a community police officer. That day, he received a report. As he happened to be nearby, he went directly to a residential building.","A household in the building was engaged in feudal superstitious activities. He interrupted them and gave them a verbal warning. On his way home, for some inexplicable reason, he stumbled and drowned in a lake.","Actually, he knew how to swim, and his route home didn't pass by the lake.","After drowning, he became trapped in the lake, an unseen water ghost.","A young life had vanished from the world just like that.","Qin Ruo, having given up resisting by now, spilled everything: \"The senior who initiated me placed a Confusion Talisman on you. The direction you thought was home was actually the lake.\"","Water ghost: \"...\"","He had only stopped a ghost marriage.","\"Yuan Qing is also bound by a ghost marriage to that ghost,\" Qi Quan stated. \"The scope of these dark practitioners' business is quite broad.\"","First the Peach Blossom Mark, now ghost marriages. Who knows what other forbidden arts haven't been uncovered yet.","Qin Ruo understood: \"You want to use Yuan Qing as a lead to uncover this whole industry chain?\"","Qi Quan curved her lips into a smile.","Many hands make light work.","At ten o'clock in the evening, the new chapter was updated on time.","[Bungee jumping was really fun, I enjoyed it thoroughly.","However, on the way back, I encountered an incident.","In broad daylight, someone was deliberately ramming their car into another vehicle and even used sulfuric acid to disfigure someone.","How could such insane things exist in this world?","I don't know where I found the courage, but I used a parasol to block the terrifying sulfuric acid.","The person throwing the acid kept hurling insults at the woman inside the car.","I glanced over. The woman was wearing sunglasses and a mask, so her face wasn't clear, but based on my experience in metaphysics, I could clearly see her marriage fate line.","So young, and already married.","From her full forehead and facial contours, one could tell she was a rare beauty.","I wonder who had the good fortune to marry such a lovely lady.","As an eyewitness, I...","went to the police station to give a statement.","Right after finishing, a huge commotion erupted outside.","The perpetrator showed no remorse, and their parents tried to plead and pressure by using their youth as an excuse.","Utterly pointless.","It's so strange how the wrongdoers feel entitled to demand forgiveness from the victim, even attacking the victim with accusations of \"bullying a child.\"","What a twisted logic.","The victim stood alone before this madness, her figure slender yet resilient.","Under everyone's expectant gaze, she magnanimously forgave them.","I opened my mouth, but no words came out.","If I hadn't blocked the sulfuric acid, would these people still be so shamelessly begging for the victim's forgiveness?","The answer was obvious.","Leaving the police station, I suddenly heard an indignant voice: \"This is too much! Really too much!\"","I was surprised. It was a young man in a police uniform.","To my knowledge, police officers generally don't express personal opinions so bluntly in front of involved parties. Why was this young officer so forthright?","I got in the car and asked him, \"What do you mean?\"","He got in the car with me, snorting coldly, \"Moral blackmail again.\"","Again?","I was about to ask when it suddenly hit me.","He had floated into the car.]","Luo Xiaoyu's pupils contracted sharply. She put down her phone, patting her chest.","She hadn't expected a ghost to suddenly appear at the end of the chapter. It was genuinely a bit scary, but... that cool and beautiful sister who blocked the sulfuric acid trending on Weibo today, could it be Master?!","Oh my god!","She hurried back to Weibo, clicked on the video, and watched it again.","Although only her profile was captured, she was really beautiful, with that unique, irreplaceable aura, particularly eye-catching and captivating.","Initially, netizens didn't know the identity of the rescuer, and the buzz was gradually dying down. Suddenly, late at night, someone posted excerpts from the new chapter of \"The Heiress's Diary\" online.","Bai Shui Zhen Ren had already been trending before, so many people knew about \"The Heiress's Diary,\" with those fans still coming daily to check in and criticize the author.","As soon as the new chapter was posted, the internet exploded again.","At first, netizens' reactions were like this.","Male Celebrity Fan Club: [It's all Yuan Qing's fault, Yuan Qing deserves to die, and Bai Shui Zhen Ren who stands up for Yuan Qing deserves to die too.]","Yuan Qing's Fans: [Our goddess is so tragic! Please punish the intentional assailant severely. Thank you, Bai Shui Zhen Ren, for saving her! Going to send virtual gifts now!]","Bystanders: [Kids these days are too terrifying. Lack of education! The entertainment industry is insane. What era is this, 'jinx'?]","Regular Readers: [What? The rescuer, the stunning beauty, is the author? Wow! The author is amazing! Sending gifts!]","Longjiang City Second-Generation Heirs: [Master is truly the Master!]","Later, someone finally timidly asked: [Is no one paying attention to the marriage fate line mentioned in the novel? If Bai Shui Zhen Ren truly has such abilities, then doesn't that mean Yuan Qing is already married?]","Public opinion exploded.","Having a marriage fate line means being married, right?","Yuan Qing is married? Impossible!","Instantly, countless paparazzi sprang into action. Netizens heatedly debated, and many rushed to the comments section of \"The Heiress's Diary\" to ask Qi Quan. Her Weibo comments became even more lively.","Seeing the insults, the system felt indignant: [Yuan Qing is so pitiful!]","Not just the system, but Chen Feilu, who was in the know, felt the same way.","He asked again in disbelief, \"Brother Ning, are you serious? Yuan Qing really... with a ghost... that?\"","Ning Zhi frowned slightly.","\"I hadn't met her before, only heard you say she was a jinx. Thinking about it now, it's probably related to the ghost beside her.\"","He rewatched the video. The fleeting ghostly shadow was indeed there, and the marriage fate line truly connected Yuan Qing and that ghost.","Such sinister arts are naturally also forbidden in the metaphysical world.","He never expected that coming to Longjiang City...","he would encounter so many evil techniques.","Or perhaps, someone deliberately lifted a corner of the darkness.","Thinking of that casual, languid Senior Qi Quan, and the seemingly brainless yet subtly pointed \"The Heiress's Diary,\" Ning Zhi increasingly felt that Qi Quan was profoundly inscrutable.","Are such cases of witchcraft only found in Longjiang City?","Unlikely.","Ning Zhi's heart grew heavier.","Someone felt even heavier.","In a residence somewhere in Longjing City, a soul tablet symbolizing life had already extinguished. The young man tasked with tending the room saw it, his eyes widening in shock, and he hurried to report to the steward.","The steward was utterly astonished, \"But that was a Level Six Heavenly Master!\"","The man, full of anxiety and fear, asked, \"What should we do?\"","\"What do you mean, 'what should we do'? It's not like we killed him. What's there to fear?\" The steward steadied himself, adjusted his expression, and headed to the main courtyard with a solemn face.","\"Ding Ji is dead?\" The handsome man raised an eyebrow, then said carelessly, \"Useless trash. Dead is dead.\"","A Level Six Heavenly Master, with no match in Longjiang City, died just like that, without a sound?","He carved into a piece of jade with a small knife, saying lightly, \"Send someone to investigate the cause of death.\"","\"Yes.\"","After the steward left, the man continued carving, but accidentally slipped, leaving a mark on the jade. A fierce look flashed in his eyes. He clenched his fist, and the priceless jade instantly turned to dust.","\"Trash is trash.\"","The dust slipped through his fingers onto the floor. He lifted his head to look at the sky outside the house, where dark clouds seemed to be gathering ominously on the horizon.","Longjiang City.","All the informed second-generation heirs were staying up late following the drama.","Netizens did not disappoint them, quickly digging up the gossip about Yuan Qing's suspected marriage.","[Peng Peng: Damn, have you guys seen it? Netizens dug up that she was once crazily pursued by He Chao. Do you know who He Chao is?]","[Sun Yu: Yeah! The son of the clothing magnate. In our Longjiang City, he was considered quite wealthy, right?]","[Su Nuanuan: But he died five years ago.]","[Peng Peng: Exactly. Five years ago, Yuan Qing's career was booming; she was the goddess of many people. He Chao pursued her very aggressively. Then, once, on his way to visit her on set, he had an accident and died.]","[Sun Yu: Seems like Yuan Qing's career started going downhill from then on.]","Su Nuanuan: If Sister Quanquan says there’s a marriage fate line, then there definitely is. This matter isn’t that simple.","[Qi Yuan: Indeed.]","[Peng Peng: Brother Yuan is here! How's your health?]","[Qi Yuan: Pretty good.]","[Su Nuanuan: Someone else dug up that Yuan Qing goes to the suburban cemetery almost every year, but she doesn't have any close friends or relatives who have passed away.]","[Qi Yuan: If I remember correctly, He Chao's death anniversary is today.]","[Sun Yu: How does Brother Yuan remember so clearly?]","[Qi Yuan: Good memory.]","[Peng Peng: Damn! The car in front of Yuan Qing's car today was the He family's! The situation was chaotic at the time, no one paid attention, but a netizen just released a video, and it was indeed the He family's car!]","[Su Nuanuan: So they went to visit the grave together?]","[Sun Yu: Looking at it this way, Yuan Qing must have some connection with the He family. Could she have married He Chao? If she had married He Chao, he would have definitely made a huge deal about it.]","[Su Nuanuan: I've been reading a lot of books on metaphysics lately. I'm guessing the marriage they entered was definitely not a normal one.]","[Peng Peng: ?]","[Sun Yu: ?]","[Qi Yuan: If it were a normal marriage, my sister probably wouldn't have specifically pointed out this privacy in her novel. It should be a ghost marriage.]","[Peng Peng: !!!]","[Sun Yu: ...]","[Su Nuanuan: That makes sense then. The male actors who have scenes with Yuan Qing on set tend to have accidents. It's likely that her 'husband' doesn't like her having contact with other men.]","[Qi Yuan: Mhm.]","[Peng Peng: We believe your sister, but netizens definitely won't believe something like a ghost marriage.]","[Su Nuanuan: They don't need to believe it. Where's Qian Kun?]","[Peng Peng: Right, why hasn't Old Qian made a sound all day?]","[Sun Yu: Asleep?]","[Peng Peng: A gossip hound like him would give up on juicy news to sleep?]","[Sun Yu: Whatever, never mind him.]","Netizens had indeed uncovered countless connections between Yuan Qing and the He family, but they would never think of a ghost marriage. At most, they thought Yuan Qing had secretly married He Chao, still maintained close contact with the He family, and visited the cemetery every year to pay respects.","[So, Yuan Qing really is married?]","[Is what White Water True Person said true? I don't believe it!]","[This hurts. How could my beautiful goddess be tainted by some ugly guy.]","[The He family is rich. Aren't female celebrities just looking to marry into wealth? Looking at it this way, Yuan Qing really is a jinx, just marrying in and then 'overcoming' her husband to death.]","[Wow, can some haters watch their mouths? What era is this, still talking about 'overcoming husbands'?]","The online situation intensified. Even though netizens didn't think of a ghost marriage, the He family couldn't help but feel anxious.","The head of the He family was He Chao's father, He Jianshe. In his early years, he went to Hong Kong to privately transport clothing to the mainland to sell at high prices, earning his first pot of gold and making his fortune from then on.","Hong Kong places more faith in feng shui and metaphysics. He Jianshe, dealing with those big bosses, naturally picked up some of it. Moreover, he had done some not-so-small bad deeds, felt guilty in his heart, and started studying metaphysics with those bosses.","\"I've said it before, that Yuan Qing is nothing but trouble! She caused Chao'er's death, and now she's stirring up all this trouble again!\" Mrs. He said, her eyes full of hatred.","She could never forget the sight of her son lying in a pool of blood.","If it weren't for Yuan Qing, her son wouldn't have died.","Her son's death hit her too hard. With a heart full of pain and nowhere to vent it, Yuan Qing became the target of her venting and revenge.","He Jianshe, his features fierce and malicious, said, \"So what if netizens think she was married to Chao'er? It doesn't affect us at all.\"","\"Then why do you look like that?\" Mrs. He frowned.","He Jianshe narrowed his eyes. \"Don't you feel like there's a hand pushing this from behind?\"","\"You mean that White Water True Person?\" Mrs. He sneered. \"I asked around. It's just the Qi family's biological daughter who came from the countryside. She wrote a novel and is pretending to be a master.\"","He Jianshe: \"If she were really pretending, would Su Linhai treat her with such respect? Don't you know what kind of person Su Linhai is?\"","\"What are you implying?\"","\"She definitely has a master guiding her from behind. What I'm afraid of now is that if this blows up, the metaphysical community will find out.\"","Ghost marriages are not accepted by the orthodox metaphysical community. Once they find out, they will definitely send someone to investigate. What will happen to our Chao'er then?","Mrs. He panicked. \"Then let's go find Master Ding quickly!\"","\"Can't reach him.\" He Jianshe lit a cigarette.","Mrs. He: \"...\"","Where the hell did he go at a critical time like this?","The annual huge membership fee was really wasted!","Netizens were stuffed with gossip, but the fan clubs of the male celebrities were relentless.","[Who cares if she's married or not? Is this some new way to whitewash herself? Even if she gets married a hundred times, she's still a jinx who harms people!]","[That's right. Since she's already married into a wealthy family, can she just stop acting and harming people?]","[Yuan Qing, get out of the entertainment industry!]","[Yuan Qing, get out of the entertainment industry!]","Wei Xu was still lying in the intensive care unit. His fans had the strongest combat power, and his management company also released statements playing the victim card.","All of this added pressure to the police investigating the case.","They repeatedly studied the shooting video and the broken wire, but couldn't figure out how the perpetrator had done it.","As long as the case remained unsolved for a day, the mudslinging at Yuan Qing couldn't be washed away for a day.","\"Captain Han, how on earth did the perpetrator do it?\" an officer beside him asked, feeling rather stumped.","He had never investigated such a bizarre case before.","Han Mian frowned, his eyes fixed on the shooting video on the screen. Slowed down, it was clear to see some of the small actions Wei Xu had made towards Yuan Qing.","The originally sturdy wire suddenly snapped. Wei Xu fell freely from mid-air, blood spreading beneath him.","\"Really damn spooky,\" the officer muttered.","Han Mian turned his head. \"What did you say?\"","\"Ah, I was just talking to myself,\" the officer scratched his head. \"Captain Han, I'm not superstitious, really.\"","Han Mian asked instead, \"You know about the Su Rong abduction case, right?\"","\"Of course. It's spread all over Longjiang City. Su Linhai went to Longtan City and found his son's remains, from seventeen years ago. Everyone in the system finds it unbelievable.\"","\"You find it unbelievable too?\"","\"Of course.\"","Han Mian tapped the desk lightly with his fingertip. \"Wei Xu's case is similarly unbelievable.\"","The officer was confused. \"Captain Han, you believe in... this?\"","\"I don't 'believe' in it.\" Han Mian sighed softly and pinched the bridge of his nose.","He was just reminded of something from the past.","\"Captain Han, you seem to have some thoughts. Why not share them, and we can all discuss it together.\"","\"Yeah, Captain Han.\"","Everyone wanted to solve the case sooner.","Han Mian gave a wry smile, his voice low and hoarse. \"It's not really a thought, more like remembering an old case.\"","\"What case?\"","Han Mian lowered his eyelashes, his expression inscrutable.","\"Right after graduation, a classmate from the police academy and I were assigned to the Nanhu District as beat cops. Once, we got a report, and he rushed over. Then...\"","\"Then what happened?\"","\"On his way home, he accidentally fell into a lake and drowned.\"","\"Huh?\" The officer was puzzled. \"Didn't the police academy have swimming lessons? What did the coroner say?\"","Han Mian said expressionlessly, \"Natural drowning. I investigated for a long time, but all the evidence indicated he fell into the lake by himself.\"","\"...\"","The officers looked at each other. They all had some investigative experience and sensed the strangeness of that case.","\"What case was he handling?\" an officer got straight to the point.","Han Mian's eyes darkened slightly. \"A girl reported that her family had sold her birth date and time for a ghost marriage ritual.\"","\"Ghost marriage?\" The officer was exasperated. \"That's so superstitious. Even if it's harmless, it's just too creepy.\"","Han Mian looked up at the group. \"But we pulled Yuan Qing's file. She was unmarried.\"","He had a strange intuition that Yuan Qing's case was somehow bizarrely connected to his colleague's accidental drowning.","\"Captain Han, should we... go ask that Ms. Qi?\"","Han Mian: \"...\"","An author who writes supernatural horror novels?"]},{"number":28,"title":"Chapter 28","paragraphs":["The next morning, the sky was painted with the rosy hues of dawn.","Qi Quan got up to have breakfast. Sitting obediently by the dining table was Ling Sheng, dressed in a well-fitted casual outfit. His tall, slender figure and strikingly handsome features were truly a delight to behold.","Qi Quan had a thought, and he released the Water Ghost from the peachwood talisman, channeling a surge of spiritual energy onto him.","The pale blue Water Ghost gradually transformed back into his living form.","He was young, with a neat and handsome appearance. There was still a hint of youthful innocence between his brows, and his eyes shone with a clear, pure light. He wore a crisp police uniform, standing tall and dignified.","He looked down at his hands, his expression a mix of joy and sorrow, murmuring, \"I’ve returned to my original form...\"","It was a sight that tugged at the heartstrings.","Qi Quan asked, “What’s your name?”","“I’m Qi Zheng.” He quickly noticed the gazes from Ling Sheng and Su Rong, surprised, “You can all see me?”","Qi Quan replied, “Officer Qi, please have a seat.”","“Ah?” Qi Zheng was a little stunned.","Qi Quan instructed Su Rong, “Prepare some offerings for Officer Qi.”","Su Rong smiled lightly, “Yes.”","Turning to Qi Zheng, he asked, “Officer Qi, what would you like for breakfast?”","Qi Zheng instinctively said, “Anything is fine.”","Can a ghost eat food?","But after so many years without tasting a meal, he truly missed it.","Soon, Su Rong brought over a bowl of lean pork congee and some steamed buns, placing them in front of Qi Zheng with a graceful and courteous smile. “Officer Qi, please enjoy your meal.”","Being served by such a handsome man, Qi Zheng felt a bit overwhelmed with gratitude and quickly stood up to bow, “Thank you.”","He noticed that this villa was filled with top-tier handsome men and beautiful women—just a feast for the eyes.","Except for Qin Ruo, who shared the same talisman with him.","The aroma of congee and steamed buns wafted to his nose. Carefully, he picked up the porcelain spoon, scooped a bit, and brought it to his lips.","The rich fragrance of rice and the savory taste of meat instantly warmed his heart.","He quickly took a mouthful.","Heaven, he could really taste it! It was delicious!","Qi Zheng had no time to ponder why he could savor the flavors of the living world. His instincts took over as he eagerly spooned the pork congee into his mouth, occasionally nibbling on a bun.","He was as happy as a god.","Watching him eat, Qi Quan’s own appetite grew.","After the meal, she asked Su Rong, “How is Ling Sheng’s progress with his lessons?”","“He’s already reached second grade in elementary school. He’s very smart and making good progress.”","Qi Quan nodded. Being a born spiritual entity, Ling Sheng was naturally gifted both in hardware and software aspects. Reaching only second grade meant someone was deliberately slowing him down.","She hadn’t yet decided how to deal with Ling Sheng.","He had been trapped for over a decade, unfamiliar with human emotions. But he could fight back and command crows to feast on Ding Ji’s flesh and blood, showing he had independently grasped and followed the principle of “an eye for an eye.”","A person like that must have his own logic and wouldn’t easily accept universal values.","But no matter what, Ling Sheng was a victim. His destruction of Ding Ji’s corpse was only natural. Qi Quan’s worry lay in the legends surrounding born spiritual beings.","They either become saints or demons.","If he were to become a demon, what should she do?","Qi Quan had been staring at Ling Sheng for too long. The young man lifted his head, his amber eyes locking onto hers like a clear spring, pure and untainted.","He curved his brows and smiled at her gently.","System: [Ling Sheng is honestly the most beautiful carbon-based life form I've ever seen!]","Qi Quan: [Oh?]","System: [Oh no, the boss is the most beautiful!]","Qi Quan: ...","Thanks, she clearly had no intention of competing in beauty with a man.","“Can you talk now?” she asked.","Su Rong looked troubled: “...No.”","Whether she really couldn’t or just didn’t want to, it was hard for outsiders to tell.","Qi Quan looked away and got up, heading toward the room.","“Master,” Su Rong called after her, “Nuan Nuan will be going to Longjing City for college the day after tomorrow. I want to see her off.”","“Send her to... Longjing?”","“No, she wants to take the bullet train. I’m going to take her to the station.”","Qi Quan was surprised. “No driver at home?”","“Uh, just to experience life.”","Qi Quan nodded. “Alright then.”","It was understandable—rich heiresses usually traveled by private car or plane, and had never taken a bullet train before.","After only a short time meditating in her room, there was a visitor at the door.","“Master, it’s a police officer from the city bureau,” Su Rong reported from outside.","Qi Quan opened her eyes. “Please have them come to the living room.”","Han Mian entered the villa with his officers and was immediately struck by the scene before him. No wonder this was a priceless top-tier villa; he’d heard the Su family had specially gifted it to Qi Quan—a truly generous gesture.","He glanced at his officers, who quickly shut their wide-open mouths.","No matter how stunned they were, they had to maintain the dignity of public servants.","Passing through a courtyard pond filled with lotuses and crossing a quiet corridor, the group followed Su Rong and arrived at the antique-style main living room.","Qi Quan sat leisurely on the sofa, sipping tea.","Before coming, Han Mian had already investigated Qi Quan’s background. She grew up in the countryside until she was eighteen, then went out to work. Just over three months ago, the Qi family had found her again.","As a genuine heiress from a rural background, her reputation in high society was poor—some might say really bad.","But after the Du family’s birthday banquet, she changed.","She gained massive wealth and attention through her serialized novel, *The Heiress Diaries*.","Han Mian had carefully studied the novel and compared it with the cases of Su Rong’s kidnapping, the death of the Qi family’s nanny, and incidents involving the Du, Yang, and Zhang families. He found *The Heiress Diaries* strangely uncanny.","He had to take it seriously.","“Officer Han, please have a seat,” Qi Quan said politely.","They had met before at the police station during the acid attack case yesterday and already exchanged names.","Han Mian and his officers sat down.","“Ms. Qi, do you know about the case involving Wei Xu’s fall?” he asked directly.","Qi Quan nodded. “Yes.”","“Is *The Heiress Diaries* on Screaming Literature City your work?”","“Yes.”","“You used the Weibo account ‘Bai Shui Zhen Ren’ to reply to a post asking if Yuan Qing was a jinx—is that correct?”","“Yes.”","“Ms. Qi, you have some knowledge of feng shui and metaphysics?”","Qi Quan smiled slightly. “A little.”","Now the main topic arrived.","“So, the ‘marriage thread’ you mentioned in last night’s new chapter—was that also calculated?”","One young officer couldn’t help but chuckle.","Han Mian shot him a sharp look and continued seriously, “But we checked the records—Yuan Qing is unmarried.”","“Do you mean my calculations are wrong?”","“No,” Han Mian shook his head, “I’ve read the earlier chapters of your novel. They’re actually quite accurate.”","Qi Quan raised an eyebrow.","Han Mian continued probing the details, “May I ask, in the realm of metaphysics, under what circumstances does a marriage thread appear?”","This question was highly uncharacteristic for a police officer.","The junior officer was taking notes while sneaking glances at him.","Qi Quan answered calmly, “It appears only in marriage relationships recognized by certain rules, excluding mere verbal agreements of romantic relationships or purely physical connections.”","“......”","Han Mian lowered his head and cleared his throat softly. The young officer’s ears turned red.","“Purely physical connections...”—that was quite a tactful way to put it.","“Can you be more specific?”","Qi Quan replied, “For example, a marriage relationship recognized by the laws of the living world, or a bond formed under the laws of the underworld by exchanging birthdates and tying a red thread.”","Han Mian and the officer were stunned.","They still refused to believe such an absurd thing, but with Wei Xu’s fall, they couldn’t find a single trace. It was as if an invisible hand had silently cut the safety wire in mid-air.","But how could that be possible?","...","If they handed in this as a case report, there was no way they’d be allowed to keep wearing their police uniforms.","Just as the two were at their wit’s end, Qi Zheng, having just finished a hearty meal, walked out of the dining hall.","He hadn’t tasted anything delicious in years and was so caught up in eating that he didn’t notice what was happening in the living room. Holding his stomach and burping, he came over to thank Qi Quan.","Then—","“Han Mian!”","“Qi Zheng!”","Han Mian sprang up abruptly, staring at Qi Zheng in disbelief, his eyes nearly popping out.","He had personally witnessed his friend’s corpse, swollen and waterlogged, had attended the funeral, and never missed visiting the grave on the anniversary. Qi Zheng was truly dead, so how was this man in a police uniform standing right before him?","The two looked at each other in silence; the living room was deathly quiet.","The junior officer didn’t recognize Qi Zheng and, seeing his uniform, assumed he was a colleague from the system, awkwardly greeting him.","Then he asked Han Mian, “Captain Han, do you know each other?”","Han Mian was speechless.","He was so shocked that his worldview was on the verge of collapse.","Qi Zheng quickly composed himself, walked up to him, and smiled, “It’s been so many years. You’ve become a captain at the city bureau, not bad!”","Only then did the junior officer notice Qi Zheng’s police badge.","Something was off—was this badge a mistake?","Han Mian’s eyes suddenly reddened. “How... how are you here?”","He even suspected he was dreaming. Otherwise, how could something so absurd happen?","Qi Zheng scratched his head, unsure how to explain, and glanced at Qi Quan.","Qi Quan didn’t hesitate at all: “I went bungee jumping, found him in the lake as a water ghost, and fished him out.”","[Boss, can you really tell ordinary people this?] The system was shocked.","Qi Quan: [Why not? Su Linhai and the others aren’t ordinary people.]","[But they’re police officers...]","[The Wei Xu case was a malicious ghost attack. It’s an unsolved mystery. Do you want them to never close the case?]","[But they still can’t close it now.]","Qi Quan frowned slightly: [They probably won’t.]","In this book’s world, it should be no different from her original world, right?","Her words were spoken lightly, but to Han Mian and the young police officer, they struck like a thunderclap.","A water ghost?!","What kind of ghost?!","What on earth is going on?!","The two stared wide-eyed, mouths agape, as if they had just been struck by lightning.","Qi Quan remained remarkably patient, leisurely sipping his tea.","This tea was extremely rare, specially sent by the Su family to the villa for Qi Quan to savor.","Indeed, it left a lingering fragrance on the palate.","The subtle aroma of the tea gently brought the two back to reality.","Han Mian quietly looked at the still “young” Qi Zheng before him, his voice hoarse as he asked, “How did you become a water ghost?”","No matter how absurd this was, all he wanted now was to catch up with his old brother.","Qi Zheng replied, “According to the master, I died unjustly. I had accumulated some good deeds, so I’m allowed to linger in the mortal world.”","He was a man with a strong sense of justice, having helped many people, and had thus earned some merit points—the golden light of virtue.","Han Mian caught the key phrase: “Died unjustly?”","They had investigated over and over back then, and all evidence pointed to Qi Zheng’s death being a suicide.","This matter had weighed heavily on his heart all these years—he never imagined it was truly a wrongful death!","He immediately asked, “Who did this to you?”","The young police officer beside him was utterly baffled.","Captain, are we sure we’re not on the wrong set?","Qi Zheng shook his head. “I don’t know either. You’d have to ask the master.”","Even he was confused.","Han Mian murmured, “Back then, you went to stop a ghost marriage, and Yuan Qing had a fate thread on her body. So, these two things are connected, right?”","His gaze burned intensely toward Qi Quan.","Qi Quan set down his teacup. “Whether there’s a connection or not, we’ll only know when the fox shows... its tail.”","“What do you mean?”","Qi Quan said, “This involves the mysterious Dao. You can ask your superiors to send someone from the Supernatural Affairs Department to handle it.”","In her previous life, she often dealt with the Supernatural Affairs Department.","“What’s the Supernatural Affairs Department?” Han Mian was a bit confused.","Qi Quan guessed his rank was low, so he probably didn’t know about such things. She said, “You can ask your superiors.”","Han Mian glanced at Qi Zheng, held back his words, and stepped outside to call his superior.","Not long after, he returned to the living room, a doubtful expression on his face. “The director said there’s no such department.”","And he even scolded me.","Qi Quan was speechless.","That shouldn’t be. In her world, there definitely was an official Supernatural Affairs Department, specially liaising with the mysterious Dao to handle cases involving ghosts harming people.","It was impossible the director’s rank wasn’t high enough.","As she pondered this, Su Rong reported at the door, “Master, Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu have arrived.”","Qi An’s expression tightened slightly. “Let them in.”","Perhaps she had some misconceptions about this world, and now that Ning Zhi was here, she could ask him.","Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu just stepped into the living room and were slightly surprised to see the three in police uniforms.","Ning Zhi could tell Qi Zheng was a ghost; Chen Feilu could not.","“Senior, yesterday we planned to deal with the level-three ghost near Yuan Qing, but she wasn’t at her residence.”","Qi Quan didn’t answer but instead asked, “Do you know about the Supernatural Affairs Department?”","Ning Zhi: ???","What’s that supposed to be?","He understood every word but had never heard the phrase before.","The expression on the young Taoist master's face was unmistakable.","Qi Quan shifted his angle and asked, \"You're a Taoist master. Using this Level 3 ghost injury case as an example, how would you handle it?\"","\"Find the Level 3 ghost and make sure it no longer lingers in the mortal world,\" Ning Zhi replied matter-of-factly.","\"And then?\"","\"Then what?\"","Qi Quan said, \"For the police handling the case, it becomes a cold case. Neither Wei Xu nor Yuan Qing's injuries have been resolved.\"","Although Wei Xu's way of using the play to flirt can't be considered entirely innocent, it hardly justifies what happened. Yuan Qing's label as a \"disaster star\" is even harder to clear.","Ning Zhi seemed half to understand: \"But I’m just a Taoist master. I’m only responsible for dealing with ghosts and demons. Everything else is not my concern.\"","From the moment he was born, he was given this mission. His actions were confined within this set of principles, making it difficult to break free from this mindset all at once.","Han Mian, however, understood Qi Quan’s intention.","If the Taoist sects handled malicious ghost injury cases the way Ning Zhi did, many cases would become cold cases, and many incidents would defy logical explanation.","Take the Qi Zheng lake-jumping case or Wei Xu’s fall, for example.","Victims would never get justice, and the public would be left without reasonable answers, causing the police to lose credibility.","If, as Qi Quan suggested, an official occult squad were established to handle such supernatural cases, it would unravel this puzzle.","But is such a unit something that can just be set up overnight?","Han Mian couldn’t help but look at Ning Zhi.","Could it be that those people really aren’t known to the higher-ups?","Impossible.","Chen Feilu’s mind worked quickly, and he immediately said, \"Actually, the Taoist sect does have a Taoist Masters Association.\"","\"Yes,\" Ning Zhi chimed in, \"The Taoist Masters Association is a supervisory body established jointly by various Taoist sects and prominent families nationwide, dedicated to handling ghost and demon cases across the country.\"","Han Mian asked, \"Are there local branches of the Taoist Masters Association?\"","\"There are,\" Ning Zhi nodded, \"Most Taoist masters register with the Association.\"","Han Mian said, \"I’ve never heard of it.\"","Having been a cop for so many years, he knew every corner of Longjiang City, yet he had never heard of any Taoist Masters Association.","Ning Zhi explained, \"Because Taoist masters are skilled at hiding and don’t interact with you guys, even though ordinary people might seek out Taoist masters, to you, it probably just looks like... superstitious folklore.\"","Han Mian agreed deeply.","He had indeed seen \"spirit invocation\" and similar superstitious activities before, but they were usually met with some verbal warnings and never taken seriously.","A young officer next to him snapped back to reality and asked the soul-searching question, \"So, Captain Han, how do we close this case now?\"","Han Mian felt a headache coming on.","From Ning Zhi’s description, the Taoist Masters Association exists only to balance the various Taoist factions. They still have no connection to the police.","He certainly couldn’t close the case just based on the Taoist master’s words.","The system listened in and said: [Boss, the Taoist Masters Association already exists. The higher-ups can’t not know.]","[Of course they know.]","[Then why don’t they open the door for us?]","[Maybe the time hasn’t come yet.]","Qi Quan gained a deeper understanding of this world.","Unlike her original world, the development of the Xuan Sect in this world seemed somewhat lagging behind, with various systems still far from perfect.","In her world, the government had a special task force dedicated to handling supernatural incidents nationwide. This team was carefully selected from the top masters across the country.","Back then, as the head of her sect and given her short lifespan, she hadn’t joined the supernatural management department, but she was familiar with the team’s development process.","At the beginning, forming the team wasn’t smooth at all.","The Xuan Sect practitioners lived carefree lives; why would they want to accept official leadership?","No one was willing to join, and even those who did had very few teammates. They had to compete with the deeply rooted Xuan Sect factions to handle cases, making things extremely difficult.","Later on...","“Senior, do you have any suggestions?” Ning Zhi asked respectfully.","He had already checked the registry of the Master Association and found no one named “Qi Quan” listed as a Level Six master or above. It was clear that Qi Quan was a rogue cultivator, unaffiliated with any Xuan Sect faction.","Qi Quan snapped back to reality, thought for a moment, and said, “You should each write an application and submit it to the higher authorities.”","She didn’t believe the government lacked the intention; it was just that the specific measures were not yet in place, and the formation of the team was still a long way off.","In the current situation, no one wanted to be the first to step forward.","Han Mian: “...”","He was at a loss.","Ning Zhi then asked, “What about that Level Three ghost? How do we handle it now?”","“You’re a Level Four master, can’t you deal with it?”","“But Yuan Qing isn’t at her residence.”","Qi Quan said, “Han, it shouldn’t be hard to track her down, right?”","“Sure,” Han Mian nodded. “We’ll cooperate.”","Though Ning Zhi was constrained by the rules of the Xuan Sect, he was still a daring and pragmatic young man, not so rigid in his thinking—otherwise, he wouldn’t have taught Chen Feilu those occult skills.","The Xuan Sect had strict rules against casually passing knowledge to outsiders, and Ning Zhi had technically broken one of those rules.","At this point, they should have left the villa to handle the case, but Han Mian hesitated.","He looked at Qi Zheng, his voice thick with emotion: “Ah Zheng, do you have any unfinished wishes?”","Qi Zheng was an optimist. Even after being a water ghost for so many years, he hadn’t become gloomy. Hearing the question, he broke into a hearty laugh: “Nothing much. Just want to see my parents and sister again. It’d be even better if I could find the culprit who hurt me.”","He had already heard from Qin Ruo about what happened back then, but the senior who had brought her into the sect had long since left Longjiang City and was now nowhere to be found.","Han Mian’s eyes showed guilt. He couldn’t fulfill either wish.","If it were a regular case, he would have done everything in his power to find the culprit, but since it involved the Xuan Sect, he found it difficult to make progress.","“Don’t worry. I’ll definitely apply to the higher-ups and request the Xuan Sect to reopen your case.”","A young officer suddenly asked, “Why not ask Master Qi?”","From calling her “Miss Qi” to “Master Qi,” it was clear he had begun to accept the supernatural world’s reality.","Han Mian looked toward Qi Quan.","The fact that she could make ghosts appear before people proved her skills were no ordinary feat.","“Once the Master team is formed, everything will be resolved smoothly,” Qi Quan said calmly, showing no interest in their expectations.","...","Han Mian didn’t press further and left the villa with the officers, with Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu following along.","Through police methods, they quickly located Yuan Qing’s current whereabouts.","Han Mian frowned as he looked at the pinpointed location.","“Captain Han, this should be the He family’s place. She’s right there!” a young officer exclaimed in surprise.","It seemed the netizens hadn’t been digging up information for nothing—Yuan Qing really did have ties to the He family!","The four rushed toward the He family’s villa.","In a dimly lit room, the woman’s painful moans stirred a twisted excitement in He Chao. His pale, sallow face was ugly and contorted with rage as he viciously beat the woman beneath him. He yanked her hair, smacked her face like toying with a small animal, and sneered cruelly:","“Little bitch! You’re nothing but trash! I thought you were so pure, but now you’re just obediently taking the beating and insults. You’re nothing but a whore—flirting around on set. How far have you gone with that Wei Xu, huh?”","Yuan Qing’s eyes were hollow, and she collapsed to the floor like a dying fish, drained of water and air, her gaze void of any light.","She should have been dead long ago.","Tears streamed down from the corners of her eyes, and her cracked lips oozed dark blood, which He Chao then scraped off with his hand and tasted on his tongue.","“Delicious.”","Yuan Qing could hardly comprehend how she had endured this.","Ever since that inexplicable ghost marriage began, her life had been ruined.","This demon in front of her didn’t just assault and abuse her at will—he was constantly stripping away her life force and destiny.","He clung to her, yet maliciously destroyed her.","Despair filled Yuan Qing’s heart.","She had thought about seeking help from masters and spiritual experts, but He Chao watched her like a hawk every moment. She had no way to escape this hellish prison.","“Knock, knock, knock.”","The door was knocked, and a cruel voice called from outside like a demon: “Chao Chao, stop playing and come down for dinner.”","It was He Chao’s mother.","She and her husband were the ones who had hired the “master” to bind He Chao and Yuan Qing in this ghost marriage.","Every year on He Chao’s death anniversary, they had to visit the cemetery to reinforce the bond between Yuan Qing and He Chao, and pay a huge sum to the “master’s” account.","They were nothing but a group of devils!","He Chao smiled cruelly, dragged her hair, and opened the door. Seeing Mrs. He outside, he immediately suppressed his ferocity and put on a docile expression.","“Mom, she’s caused so much trouble. Don’t feed her today.”","Mrs. He smiled sweetly and replied, “Alright, I’ll listen to you.”","The door was locked again.","As they went downstairs, Yuan Qing could still hear their conversation.","“Mom, how should we handle the online situation?”","“What’s there to fear? Who would believe in ghost marriages? Who even knows she’s still alive?”","“True,” He Chao snorted coldly. “I really don’t want her acting anymore. She’s such a slut, throwing herself at every man she sees. So annoying.”","“Chao Chao, be good. She’s fine like this—she has some fame, which can share some of your life force, and she’s not too popular to overshadow you. If she contacts other masters, it’ll ruin our plan.”","From downstairs, He Chao’s father agreed, “Yes, the master said maintaining this state is best for you.”","“Alright, then I’ll just tolerate it.”","Yuan Qing lay on the cold floor, trembling in pain all over, as if she had fallen into an ice cave, chilled to the bone.","Why was she still alive?","But if she died, would the He family target her parents? She couldn’t even afford to die.","The He family’s dinner table was laden with a variety of dishes.","The three of them sat around the table, about to enjoy a happy meal together when suddenly the doorbell rang.","Because they kept a ghost, the He family had dismissed their live-in housekeeper and normally only hired hourly workers. The chef came and went on a schedule.","There was no one else around during mealtime at the He household.","Hearing the doorbell at this moment meant they had to answer it themselves.","He Jianshe pressed the video monitor and saw Han Mian’s face on the screen. His heart tightened, and he asked, “Han... Officer?”","Han Mian stood outside the courtyard gate, his expression serious. “Mr. He, please open the door.”","No matter how powerful He Jianshe was, he dared not defy a public official, so he opened the door.","“Chaochao, the police are here. Go upstairs and hide for a while.”","He Chao grumbled, “Why don’t I just turn invisible? The police can’t see me anyway.”","“Fine then,” Mrs. He said again, “Be careful. I’ve heard Han Mian has a sharp eye.”","“Got it,” He Chao muttered.","Soon, Han Mian led the officers through the He family’s gate. Ning Zhi suppressed his exorcist aura, and Chen Feilu disguised himself as a plainclothes officer.","Han Mian glanced at the dining table. “Sorry to disturb you. I have a few questions for Mr. He and Mrs. Wang. Is this a convenient time?”","“Officer Han, please have a seat,” He Jianshe said with a mild smile on his plain face.","Han Mian looked at Ning Zhi, who tugged at the hem of his clothes. He understood immediately.","That was their signal: if the He family had a ghost, Ning Zhi would tug his clothes to alert him.","Han Mian sat on the sofa and asked the first question.","“Mr. He, do you have guests at home?”","“What do you mean?”","“There are three sets of bowls and chopsticks on the table. Mr. He, Mrs. Wang, who else is dining with you?”","He Jianshe managed to keep his composure, but Wang Cui’s face suddenly turned pale.","They had slipped up!","The living room fell into an unsettling silence.","Wang Cui quickly thought on her feet, tears streaming down her face as she cried, “Officer Han, we just miss our son so much. We set an extra place at the table to feel like he’s still here.”","Her sorrowful expression was deeply moving. If Han Mian didn’t know He Chao was really there, he might have been fooled.","Even so, the young officer’s eyes reddened.","No matter what, a mother’s love always evokes empathy.","Han Mian walked over to the table and looked at the chopsticks stained with cooking oil and the rims of the bowls. His face grew serious.","“What? The dead can feed themselves now?”","Mrs. He: “...”","They had been too rushed earlier to notice these details. Besides, they weren’t truly afraid of the police. Even if the police sensed something was off, they couldn’t actually see He Chao.","He Chao hid his form, and when he saw the officers frowning in confusion with no way to prove anything, he cheekily danced and made silly faces right in front of them.","Ning Zhi: “...”","Eye-burning.","He threw a confinement talisman toward He Chao’s ghostly body. Caught off guard, He Chao froze for a second before letting out a startled scream. Suddenly, a man appeared in the living room, oil still smudged around his mouth.","Han Mian: “...”","He Jianshe’s father and mother were utterly shaken, their eyes wide as they stared at their son. At this moment, He Chao was trapped by talismans, completely unable to break free.","He was only a third-level ghost, while Ning Zhi was a fourth-level Taoist master. Under such a rank disparity, resistance was impossible.","“Chao Chao!” He Jianshe suddenly turned into a drama king, tears welling up in his eyes as he rushed forward, shouting, “You’ve been with us all along! It’s all our fault, your father and mother—we didn’t take good care of you. Why didn’t you tell us?”","Mrs. He snapped back to reality and joined the theatrical display: “Chao Chao, Mommy misses you so much! How have you been over there? If you need anything, just tell Mommy—I’ll burn incense for you.”","Ning Zhi and the others: “......”","They were stunned—completely stunned.","Han Mian, despite his professional training, was struggling to keep a straight face. He stepped forward and said solemnly, “Mr. He, Mrs. Wang, we need to take He Chao for questioning.”","“Questioning?” Mrs. He stood protectively in front of He Chao. “Chao Chao is dead! You police want to question a dead man?”","Han Mian had no choice but to look to Ning Zhi.","Ning Zhi pulled out his ID card, proving he was a fourth-level Taoist master, and said, “I’m a Taoist master with the Taoist Association. Under the ‘Taoist Regulations,’ we need to question He Chao. Please come with us.”","“On what grounds? My son is dead! What right do you have to take him away?” He Jianshe glared angrily.","Han Mian’s body camera had been running the entire time, even capturing the image of He Chao’s ghostly form. This would serve as evidence when applying for higher authorization.","“He Chao, since you’ve become a ghost, you should understand the rules of the occult. Please come with us,” Ning Zhi said, mimicking Han Mian’s tone.","He used spiritual power to activate the restraining talisman, instantly pulling He Chao into the paper talisman. On its surface appeared a distorted ghostly shadow—the image of He Chao at the moment of his death.","Wang Cui screamed and lunged forward but was stopped by the junior officer.","Ning Zhi appeared to turn and leave the He family’s home but suddenly stopped, tilting his head to listen closely to faint noises upstairs.","As a fourth-level Taoist master, his hearing far surpassed ordinary people. Following the faint sounds, he accurately pinpointed them to the east side of the third floor.","He Jianshe watched, heart pounding wildly, and shouted, “Give me back my son! Give him back!”","His shouting drowned out the subtle noises. Ning Zhi turned his head and continued toward the door, but out of the corner of his eye, he noticed the sudden relaxation in He Jianshe’s expression. He immediately said to Han Mian, “There’s something going on on the east side of the third floor!”","Han Mian’s expression stiffened. He quickly led the junior officers upstairs.","“Ah—” Wang Cui screamed, trying to block their way, “Get out! Get out of here!”","Han Mian paid her no mind.","They had come to the He household for two reasons: first, for He Chao; second, for Yuan Qing. Now that He Chao was in custody, they certainly wouldn’t abandon Yuan Qing.","Lingering downstairs had only given Ning Zhi enough time to locate Yuan Qing precisely.","In a hidden room on the east side of the third floor, Yuan Qing lay face down on the floor.","Thinking of the hellish years she’d endured, she wished she could just die.","But if she died, what would happen to her parents?","If she died, He Chao would also vanish, and the He family would surely not spare her parents.","Yet, she could no longer hold on.","Her whole body ached, chilled to the bone, as if her blood had frozen, sinking into a boundless, bottomless ice cave. The entire world was shrouded in darkness.","She wanted to die.","Just to be dead would end everything.","After all, no master had summoned her soul, no master had bound her to another to cling to life in the mortal realm. She wouldn’t become a ghost—she would simply enter reincarnation.","Yuan Qing clawed desperately at the cold floor, summoning every ounce of strength to lift her head and slam it fiercely against the hard marble ground.","Thud!","Thud thud!","Thud thud thud!","She used all her strength, but it was so feeble that although her forehead bruised purple and blue, it wasn’t fatal.","After a few strikes, she lost every bit of energy.","She closed her eyes, hopelessly waiting for the torment and pain to come.","Suddenly, the door to the dark room slammed open with a bang, letting in a shaft of light.","Han Mian had seen countless cruel and horrifying cases, but when he saw Yuan Qing, he was still stunned.","She lay motionless on the floor like a discarded sack of rags. Her exposed skin was nowhere near normal—bruised, purple, and bleeding.","A junior officer, inexperienced and unprepared, couldn’t help but let out a startled “Ah!”","Han Mian immediately ordered, “Call an ambulance, quickly.”","The junior officer fumbled for his phone.","“No... no...” Yuan Qing somehow found the strength to scream hoarsely, “Don’t call the ambulance!”","She passed out immediately after shouting.","Only then did the junior officer remember her celebrity status and hesitantly ask, “Should we still call?”","“Her injuries aren’t life-threatening, just terrifying to look at,” Ning Zhi arrived upstairs, leaving Chen Feilu downstairs to hold back the He family couple.","“What do we do now?” Han Mian hadn’t dealt with victims of Yin Marriage before, and wasn’t familiar with the customs of the occult sect.","Ning Zhi thought for a moment and said, “I’ll ask Senior Qi.”","He hadn’t cooperated with the police before either.","“Alright,” Han Mian agreed.","Ning Zhi dialed the phone at the Linhu Villa, and Su Rong answered.","“Mr. Su, I need to consult Senior Qi about something.”","Su Rong knew they were on a ghost-hunting mission and didn’t delay, immediately notifying Qi Quan.","After hearing the call, Qi Quan replied, “Send her to Anji Hospital under the Du family’s name.”","As long as she was under the Du family’s protection, the hospital would guarantee complete privacy for Yuan Qing’s treatment...","Du Jiaming had kept his distance from women since the “Peach Blossom Seal” incident. He found life rather dull, with nothing to do besides boosting the rankings for *The Heiress Diary* every day.","He had wanted to study the occult but realized it wasn’t his calling.","Just as he was idly killing time at the company, he received a call from Linhu Villa, and his expression suddenly brightened.","“No problem. I’ll arrange doctors and nurses immediately! Please rest assured, Master Qi—the hospital will not leak a single word!”","After hanging up, he contacted the hospital director and rushed to the hospital himself.","He had read the latest chapters of *The Heiress Diary* and knew Master Qi was very interested in Yuan Qing’s case. That “marriage fate line” wasn’t baseless; everyone was waiting for the master to take action. He never expected the master to be so efficient.","To be personally involved was his honor!","Moreover, the master only entrusted him with the task—what does that mean? It means the master values him!","Yang Su and Zhang Chengyan, along with those other fools, all had to take a back seat!","He happily ran to the hospital, just as Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu arrived.","Yuan Qing had already been sent for a forensic injury assessment and could stay at Anji Hospital to recover until the situation calmed down.","Once she woke up, they could question her.","No matter what, she was covered in wounds when she appeared in the He family’s secret chamber. The He couple definitely wouldn’t escape punishment.","Han Mian took the He couple back to the police station, while Ning Zhi settled Yuan Qing before returning to the Linhu villa with Chen Feilu.","In the antique-style living room, Ning Zhi released He Chao from the confinement talisman and threw him onto the floor, eyes filled with disgust. “Senior, this is He Chao.”","To a celestial master like Ning Zhi, He Chao’s true form was different from what ordinary people saw.","At least Qi Quan and Ning Zhi could see the black-red marriage bond lines on He Chao’s body—Chen Feilu could not.","Su Rong and Qi Zheng floated over, eager to join the fray.","Both being ghosts, they could sense the malice and deadly aura radiating from He Chao. If things continued, he would inevitably become a malevolent spirit threatening ordinary people.","He Chao lay crooked on the ground, his eyes filled with hatred as he glared at Qi Quan.","“Do you know who I am? I advise you to release me immediately! Otherwise, when the master arrives, you won’t come out unscathed!”","Seeing that Qi Quan and Ning Zhi were both young, he was certain none of them were as powerful as the master who had cast spells for him. So, he acted recklessly.","Master Ding had told him that there was no higher-ranking celestial master in the entire Longjiang City—meaning no one could break the marriage bond line between him and Yuan Qing.","He felt invincible.","“Just because you harm others doesn’t mean you’re right!” Qi Zheng, bursting with a strong sense of justice, couldn’t hold back. “Even if you were the king of gods, if you break the law, you must be punished!”","He Chao sneered at him, “Hmph, a first-level white ghost.”","Qi Zheng was speechless.","Su Rong, who greatly respected the police and disliked seeing Qi Zheng belittled, struck He Chao with a burst of ghostly energy. He Chao cried out in pain.","Having learned ghost arts from Qi Quan, Su Rong was no longer the lowly first-level white ghost he once was. Taking down a spirit like He Chao, who survived by draining people’s luck, was well within his capabilities.","“Senior, should we sever the ghost marriage?” Ning Zhi asked.","Thinking of Yuan Qing’s ordeal, a fire burned in his heart.","Before Qi Quan could answer, He Chao sneered, “Sever it? Hahaha, you think you can? Even if you could, I’m bound by a curse. If you touch it, Yuan Qing will die. Do you dare?”","Qi Zheng was speechless.","It wasn’t that the ghosts had turned bad—it was the bad people who had become ghosts.","Hands itching to strike, the urge to beat down the spirit was palpable.","Ning Zhi frowned. He truly couldn’t break the marriage bond line on He Chao. If what He Chao said was true—that severing the ghost marriage would kill Yuan Qing—then he would indeed hesitate.","His gaze involuntarily shifted to Qi Quan.","Qi Quan asked leisurely, “Is the person who arranged your ghost marriage named Ding?”","“So what if he is?” He Chao stiffened his neck and retorted.","Qi Quan smiled softly, his voice calm, “I have some bad news for you. Ding Ji is dead.”","“Impossible!”","“Oh, believe it or not.”","Qi Quan casually stretched out a...","A slender hand, delicate and pale as the finest warm jade, fingertips entwined with spiritual energy that gradually formed into a tiny hook.","The hook playfully probed into He Chao’s soul, snagging the black and red thread of fate entwined with his destiny.","Ning Zhi’s pupils contracted slightly, sensing the overwhelming mastery of spiritual control!","“No! You can’t kill me! Yuan Qing will die! She will definitely die!” He Chao shouted in terror.","Qi Quan curved her lips into a faint smile.","The hook abandoned the thread of fate, but before He Chao could breathe a sigh of relief, it brushed against a forbidden seal that Ding Ji had once laid.","It was nothing more than a rudimentary formation, designed to share Yuan Qing’s vitality and fortune. Truly a sinister and poisonous dark art, worthy of Ding Ji’s craftsmanship.","Qi Quan detested such bandit-like tactics.","Her gaze deepened, a faint golden light flickering in her pupils. Her spiritual power surged suddenly, flooding into the slender hook like a raging torrent, striking the forbidden seal.","Crash—","The seal shattered explosively."]},{"number":29,"title":"Chapter 29","paragraphs":["Ning Zhi thought back to his earlier confrontation with Ding Ji.","The spiritual power that had seemed as towering as a mountain before him was nothing more than a handful of loose sand in front of Qi Quan. With just a casual wave of her hand, that vast spiritual force was utterly routed.","Once again, he clearly recognized her unfathomable depth.","All that remained in his heart was awe.","He Chao was completely dumbfounded.","He never imagined that the bold claims he had just made would be proven wrong in the blink of an eye.","This woman was too terrifying, truly too terrifying.","He promptly admitted defeat, curling up on the ground to kowtow to Qi Quan, tears and mucus streaming down his face as he pleaded, \"Master, please spare me! I haven't killed anyone, I really haven't killed anyone!\"","\"Wei Xu is seriously injured, Yuan Qing is unconscious, and you still have the nerve to say such things?\" Chen Feilu was simply speechless. \"You bind others' vitality and fortune and still put on an innocent face, why don't you just ascend to heaven? Someone like you deserves the eighteenth level of hell!\"","The system felt vindicated: [This kid said exactly what I wanted to scold him for, satisfying!]","Qi Quan also found it pleasing to hear and couldn't help but glance at him a few more times.","The young man was decent-looking with a good demeanor, but mainly he was eloquent and more outgoing than someone as reserved as Su Rong.","Chen Feilu keenly sensed her gaze and immediately straightened his posture, his expression turning solemn.","He had been blaming himself for his previous recklessness, which had caused the master to face backlash from netizens, and he felt guilty about it.","Qi Quan shifted her gaze away.","After the hook shattered the restriction, it once again caught hold of that fateful marriage thread. The thread tightly bound the fates of He Chao and Yuan Qing together; as long as Yuan Qing lived for one day, He Chao could remain in the mortal world for one day.","Qi Quan's expression turned slightly cold. With a flick of her fingertips, the slender hook gave a gentle tug, and a crack appeared in the marriage thread.","He Chao's face instantly transformed.","He had originally appeared like a normal person, albeit with a somewhat pale and bluish complexion. Now, with the marriage thread damaged and the supply insufficient, his face became distorted, revealing marks as if he had been run over by a car.","Everyone: \"...\"","[Oh, system gods!] the system exclaimed in fright.","Qi Quan held no prejudice against someone who died accidentally, nor against disfigured appearances. However, He Chao was truly too malicious and vile. If they were merely facing a ghost who died in a car accident, she believed no one present would show any strange reaction.","The key was He Chao's eyes, filled with resentful venom and bloodshot, paired with his distorted face—it was truly repulsive.","With one final hook, the marriage thread completely snapped.","He Chao let out a piercing scream, reverting to his appearance at the moment of death.","He angrily opened his mouth, but before he could utter any threats, a ball of spiritual fire was stuffed into it.","\"Ahhhhhhh—\"","The spiritual fire scorched his soul-body. Under the agony that pierced his very soul, he writhed and howled on the ground, unable to speak.","It hurt too much! It really hurt too much!","Qi Quan took out a talisman. The paper floated in the air, choosing the best angle to aim at He Chao on the ground.","\"A Recording Talisman!\" Ning Zhi exclaimed in surprise.","This was a high-level talisman, commanding an exceedingly high price within the mystic arts community.","He Chao's soul-body was already unstable. After ten minutes of excruciating burning by the spiritual fire, he finally couldn't hold on any longer, dissolving into gray specks of light that dissipated into the air.","Qi Quan handed the Recording Talisman to Ning Zhi.","\"Give this to Yuan Qing when she wakes up.\"","Ning Zhi solemnly accepted it, deeply admiring her thorough and considerate way of handling matters.","The system was indignant: [Letting him 'die' like that was really letting him off easy!]","[Who said he 'died'?]","[Huh? Didn't his soul scatter?]","[No, he just went to where he belongs.]","He Chao hadn't killed anyone, so he could still reincarnate. Just now, he had chosen reincarnation because he could no longer endure the pain.","According to his sins, he could only be reborn into the animal realm.","What awaited him would be the suffering of being abused and slaughtered for several lifetimes.","The moment He Chao disappeared, the jade pendant around Wang Cui's neck suddenly shattered.","She had just arrived at the police station, stepping out of the police car, when she saw the pendant break into pieces. Her mind went blank for an instant as if struck by a heavy blow... then she screamed hysterically, \"Chao Chao! My Chao Chao! He Jianshe! They killed Chao Chao! I want revenge! I want revenge!\"","He Jianshe was also heartbroken, his eyes hiding a towering rage as he said venomously, \"Master Ding left us a talisman paper before. He said if we encountered an emergency, we should tear this talisman, and then a powerful master would come to our aid.\"","\"Yes, yes, yes!\"","The police officers nearby: \"...\"","These two were completely delusional.","Wang Cui hurriedly found the talisman paper, and right in front of the police, the two of them tore it apart together.","The moment the talisman paper was torn, a man who was investigating the cause of Ding Ji's death at the junction of three cities felt a twitch between his eyebrows.","He looked in the direction from which the talisman had been activated—","Longjiang City.","He hadn't found the cause of death at Ding Ji's lair. Coincidentally, the internal communication talisman of the organization had been activated. Perhaps he could find clues over there.","Lakeside Villa.","After Qi Quan dealt with He Chao with a wave of her hand, everyone present, human or ghost, felt a great sense of satisfaction.","During his time in Longjiang City, Ning Zhi had benefited greatly.","He had been raised since childhood as the heir of his family, strictly adhering to family and mystic arts rules. He had always believed that celestial masters and ghosts were opposing forces; that any ghost must be sent to where they belong.","That's why, during his first visit, upon seeing Su Rong, he had acted without hesitation.","But with the occurrences of the \"Peach Blossom Mark\" and the \"Yuan Qing Incident,\" he came to understand more profoundly that what opposes celestial masters is not ghosts, but evil humans and ghosts.","Like Su Rong, like Qi Zheng—they were all kind and righteous ghosts. As long as they didn't defy the natural order, what harm was there in them staying in the mortal world?","Thinking of this, he said solemnly, \"Senior, after I return, I will definitely apply to higher authorities to form a team of celestial masters.\"","The mystic arts community was powerful, with too many intertwined interests among its members, leading to excessive delays and pedantry in handling cases.","Both the Peach Blossom Mark and ghost marriages were forbidden arts within the mystic arts community, yet they could run rampant in Longjiang City. This was truly a failure of the mystic arts community.","The Celestial Masters Association was, at best, merely a buffer zone for the major sects and families.","The system sincerely praised: [Young Master Ning is quite bold!]","After all, as the heir of a mystic arts family, Ning Zhi received the full support of his family's cultivation resources. Once he chose to join another faction, he would inevitably face significant upheaval.","The mystic arts community had enjoyed freedom and lack of restraint for many years. Who would willingly submit to control?","His proposal would undoubtedly face obstruction and rejection from most people.","Qi Quan sighed inwardly; she couldn't bear to see talented individuals wither away.","\"Let's wait for news from Han Mian's side first.\" If the authorities were truly intent on pushing this forward, it could certainly be accomplished.","In the face of the state machinery, no one could obstruct it.","Ning Zhi looked convinced. \"Understood.\"","“Um, about that...” Chen Feilu awkwardly scratched the back of his head, hesitantly saying, “Master, can I join?”","He was quite interested in the mystic arts, but his abilities weren't up to par yet.","Qi Quan asked with a smile, \"What can you do?\"","Chen Feilu's face instantly flushed bright red. Right now, he only knew a little about it, not even enough to call it knowledge. He had already made a fool of himself in front of the master during the \"Yuan Qing Jinx\" incident.","\"My, my university major was computer science,\" he blurted out, thinking on his feet. \"I can filter information, collect data, and build our own team's database. Then we can allocate resources nationwide, maximizing information sharing and resource utilization as much as possible.\"","System: [Not bad, young man!]","The corners of Qi Quan's lips lifted. \"I can't decide if you can join. There will naturally be recruitment criteria then.\"","\"Ah?\" Chen Feilu was stunned.","Ning Zhi also said, \"Senior, you're the founder of the team. How could it have nothing to do with you?\"","Qi Quan was someone who dreaded trouble immensely. In her past life, her master made her the sect's chief disciple. To repay his kindness, she had no choice but to fulfill the duties, toiling diligently for the sect's growth and expansion.","Now that she had transmigrated into another world, she had no desire to keep shouldering responsibilities.","\"I just made a suggestion,\" she said with an innocent look.","Chen Feilu showed an anxious expression. \"But besides you, who else is qualified to be the team leader?\"","Only someone with overwhelming strength could make the team truly submit.","Qi Quan waved her hand. \"I need to cultivate now. You two should head back first.\"","\"......\"","The two had no choice but to bid farewell.","Late August. Autumn was about to bid farewell. A slightly warm breeze drifted through the front courtyard, brushing past the delicate and beautiful window lattice, faintly carrying a hint of spiritual energy.","Qi Quan's brow twitched slightly. She pivoted on her heel and headed for the pavilion in the backyard.","The flowers in the backyard were in full bloom.","Ling Sheng, wearing a simple T-shirt and casual pants, was squatting by the pond. He held a thin twig in his hand, teasing the fish swimming in the water.","Spiritual energy from his palm poured unsparingly into the twig. Drawn by instinct, the entire school of fish gathered around the twig's tip, pecking frantically at the spiritual energy concentrated there.","They greedily absorbed it, their scales becoming increasingly glossy and dazzling.","Qi Quan stood beside him, watching for a long moment.","[Is Ling Sheng too lonely, that he can only come here to tease fish?] The system said, heart aching.","Qi Quan: ...","This system was even more of a looks-person than she was.","\"Your control of spiritual energy is quite good,\" she praised with a smile.","Ling Sheng was slightly startled and looked up at her.","He was facing the sun, his fair skin glowing, countless golden rays gathering in his amber pupils, warm and profound.","Even from this angle, he looked so handsome. What a uniquely gifted face.","Qi Quan always had a special leniency towards people with high looks. As long as they didn't cross her bottom line, even if they were \"mute,\" she would be gentle enough.","\"But don't overdo it. I don't want to raise a few fish that develop spiritual awareness.\"","A natural spiritual body was not only beneficial to cultivators but also held certain benefits for all living creatures. If Ling Sheng continuously poured spiritual energy into the fish, one day the fish in the pond might become fish spirits.","Presumably, on the mountain where he was imprisoned, many creatures had already awakened their spiritual awareness.","Playing the pig to eat the tiger—quite clever.","Even without her, he would have eventually turned the tables on Ding Ji and escaped his cage.","Ling Sheng lowered his gaze, withdrawing the spiritual energy back into his body. Deprived of the energy, the fish scattered in a flurry.","He reached out a hand, as if wanting to touch Qi Quan.","\"I don't need it,\" Qi Quan said seriously. \"I don't need to plunder spiritual energy from others. You can stay here if you wish, or leave if you want to. Don't feel obligated on my account.\"","Ling Sheng immediately retracted his hand, lowered his head, and rested his chin on his knees, presenting a pitiful picture.","[Wah wah wah, the poor child is so pitiful.] The system couldn't bear to see good-looking people wronged.","Qi Quan felt a fond pity for its naivety and ruthlessly turned to leave.","She knew Ling Sheng was testing her.","No cultivator who found a person with a natural spiritual body could remain calm. Even if they didn't drain the person dry, it was hard not to be tempted at all.","Perhaps in Ling Sheng's eyes, she was a hypocrite with a well-hidden nature.","He was tempting her. He wanted to see through her disguise.","Qi Quan shook her head inwardly. She had her own pride and principles.","Anji Hospital.","Du Jiaming personally led the team guarding the special ward, not forgetting to show off in the group chat.","[Du Jiaming: Heh heh heh heh heh.]","[Yang Su: What are you giggling about? Have you taken a fancy to another pretty girl?]","[Du Jiaming: I've already sworn off women, okay? Heh heh heh heh.]","[Zhang Chengyan: Possessed again?]","[Yang Su: Really? Should we go invite a master?]","[Du Jiaming: You're the ones who are possessed! I'm just happy.]","[Yang Su: Happy about what? Spill it so we can be happy too.]","[Du Jiaming: Can't say.]","He knew the injured person was the female celebrity Yuan Qing and guessed there must be something going on. The master told him to protect Yuan Qing strictly, so he couldn't let it slip.","[Zhang Chengyan: Just keep us in suspense then!]","[Zhang Chengyan: Speaking of which, I saw Song Lin today. He seemed to have bumped his head, had a bandage on it.]","[Song Lin: It's fine, a minor thing.]","[Yang Su: That's minor? I heard you've been having a streak of bad luck these past few days, always having accidents. You should be more careful.]","[Qi Lin: Get a master to take a look.]","[Song Lin: ??? Since when do you believe in that stuff?]","[Du Jiaming: Good heavens, is there still someone who doesn't believe in Master Qi? The master already pointed out there's dark energy in the northern suburbs, and you still had to go! And the master turned the tide and saved Qi Yuan's life! Qi Lin saw it with his own eyes, how could he not believe?]","[Song Lin: ...]","Might as well change the group name to \"Qi Quan Fan Club.\" Was it too late for him to leave the group now?","[Du Jiaming: Forget it, not telling you guys anymore. I'm going to check for the update!]","[Yang Su: Oh crap, it's 10 o'clock!]","[Zhang Chengyan: The website is too crappy! It won't load!]","[Qi Lin: Good read.]","[Song Lin: ...]","He touched the wound on his temple and, as if guided by a ghost, opened the Scream APP.","[I know very clearly that I encountered a ghost.","He had a decent appearance, a very young man, yet he passed away in the prime of his youth.","It's truly lamentable.","He had a good character, full of a sense of justice.","He told me he witnessed a family selling their daughter back then.","They traded the girl's birth date and time for the down payment on their son's marital home.","The girl was unwilling and called the police.","When he arrived, he happened to hear the girl's family's ignorant and selfish scolding.","The father said: \"A ghost marriage won't affect you at all! We've raised you for so many years, and you won't even do this little thing? What an ingrate!\"","The mother pleaded tearfully: \"Just help your brother out. It's not like you're really getting married, it's just a formality. A ghost marriage doesn't matter. Be obedient. Later, when you get married, your brother will support you too.\"","The brother said flippantly: \"Sis, it's all fake. It's just that their family lost a son and wants some psychological comfort. Don't take it seriously. Think about it, a ghost marriage can get you 200,000, way more than the bride price you'd get from a real marriage. We're not losing out.\"","He was furious and tried his utmost to stop this superstitious activity.","But on his way home, he accidentally fell into the water and died.","After hearing his story, my heart felt heavy and uncomfortable.","Such a righteous and kind person died innocently because of others' wickedness.","Yes, he died a wrongful death.","Ghosts who died wrongfully are different from other ghosts. I could see that.","Prompted by his reminder, I suddenly realized: that woman who had acid thrown on her, her marriage fate line was tinged with black!]","A ghost marriage?!","She had entered into a ghost marriage!","No wonder, no wonder accidents kept happening around her.","I've read metaphysics texts; people bound in ghost marriages have their surrounding magnetic fields altered. When the yin energy is too strong, their bad luck multiplies, and people close to them are prone to accidents, especially those who have intimate contact with them.","Thinking carefully, every person who had an accident was someone who had a lot of contact with her, both on and off set.","Everything makes sense now.]","End of new chapter.","Song Lin rubbed his forehead in exasperation. He must have been out of his mind to read such a nonsensical novel.","What a waste of time!","He turned off his phone and went back to work.","The desk lamp illuminated his face. In the corner, where the light didn't reach, a shadowy figure slowly rose.","The comments under \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family\" were in an uproar.","【Wei Xu's Brother is the Handsomest in the World: What kind of crap is the author writing? Trying to whitewash that bitch now? Trash!】","【Xu Fan Reporting In: The victim is still lying in the hospital, and the perpetrator is shamelessly trying to whitewash herself? What is wrong with this world!】","【Passerby A: Ghost marriage? Bad luck? Is this some new whitewashing tactic?】","【123: Just asking, it's just a novel, what's everyone fighting about in the comments?】","【If You See Me, Tell Me to Go Prepare Lessons: That's terrifying, actually selling one's daughter to... enter a ghost marriage. Just thinking about it gives me chills! It's such a pity about the police officer's sacrifice, what exactly happened?】","【Today is Auspicious: Some people should stop barking in the comments. The master explained it clearly. Haven't you all seen the filming video online? The wire suddenly snapped, it was just bad luck. What does that have to do with the actress he was acting opposite?】","【Today is Profitable: Five hundred deepwater torpedoes!】","【Auspicious and Profitable: Five hundred deepwater torpedoes!】","【A Tree of Red Plum Blossoms Blooms: The author's novels always allude to reality. It feels a bit off to read, especially since the injured person is still in the hospital and the police haven't announced the investigation results yet. I'd advise the author not to speak carelessly.】","【Dying of Laughter: Who would have thought reading a story could tie into the entertainment industry? Interesting.】","【I Just Want Male Virtue Stories: I saw the filming video. A certain male actor kept messing up and getting cut, always hugging waists or holding hands. Serves him right for having an accident.】","【Brother Yuan Tells You to Stop Writing: One hundred deepwater torpedoes!】","Su Nuanuan carefully scrolled through the comments under the story. Suddenly seeing this username, she had a thought, took a screenshot, and sent it to the group chat.","【Su Nuanuan: Is this you? @Qi Yuan】","【Qi Yuan: ......】","Su Nuanuan couldn't help but laugh.","【Su Nuanuan: I remember someone who once criticized \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family\" as utterly worthless, even begrudging spending ten bucks.】","【Qi Yuan: ......】","【Sun Yu: Hey, who knew back then that Sister Qi Quan really had serious skills! By the way, where's that kid Qian Kun? @Qian Kun Where the hell have you gone!】","For Brother Yuan's pride, he had to forcefully change the subject.","However, Qian Kun still didn't make a sound.","What's going on? He hasn't spoken in the group chat since last night, and he's such a chatterbox!","【Sun Yu: What's up? I'll give him a call.】","【Peng Peng: I already called. Didn't get through.】","【Qi Yuan: I just called too. No one answered.】","【Sun Yu: Wow, since when does Brother Yuan care so much about Old Qian? Feels like Brother Yuan has changed.】","【Su Nuanuan: Anyone who walks through the gates of hell would change. It's a good change.】","【Qi Yuan: Mhm.】","Having experienced a life-and-death situation, Qi Yuan had matured a lot compared to before.","【Qi Yuan: I heard you're taking the high-speed train to Longjing City. I'll go with you.】","【Su Nuanuan: Did you buy a ticket?】","【Qi Yuan: ......】","He had been driven around by chauffeurs since childhood, never even taken the subway, and had completely forgotten about buying tickets.","Qi Yuan searched online for how to buy tickets and downloaded the app. Before it finished downloading, he heard movement outside his room.","It was the sound of his mother coming down the stairs and speaking urgently.","He got up and opened the door, asking casually, \"What's wrong?\"","\"Aunt Ma has something going on over there. I'm going to check on her.\"","Aunt Ma?","That's Qian Kun's mom!","Qi Yuan quickly followed, \"I'm coming too!\"","At that very moment, Ma Yinglan sat by the hospital bed, crying uncontrollably.","\"I'll contact my acquaintances in Longjing City right now, transfer him overnight. I refuse to believe the major hospitals in the capital can't cure him.\" Qian Kun's father clenched his teeth in frustration.","Ma Yinglan wiped her tears, looked at her son lying unconscious on the bed, and choked out, \"But the hospital can't find anything wrong. I think he's been hexed. We should go find a powerful master...\"","\"Master, master, that's all you know!\" Qian Kun's father glared at her with red eyes. \"The one you invited today, that Xuan something Feng, cost five hundred thousand. Was it useful? Did your son wake up? If we hadn't wasted this day, I could have transferred him to the capital already!\"","Ma Yinglan: \"...\"","She wanted to say there were masters more powerful than Xuan Feng, but she didn't dare speak up now.","Qian Kun's father went to the corridor to call friends, but hospitals in the capital were already overcrowded. Besides, with Qian Kun's unexplained coma, they didn't even know which specialist department to register for.","He was sweating profusely with anxiety.","After all, the Qian family's connections couldn't compare to the Du or Yang families.","...","A short while later, Gu Qiao and Qi Yuan arrived.","After hearing Ma Yinglan's account, they finally understood what had happened to Qian Kun.","Longjiang University started early. Qian Kun went to register at school yesterday. After tidying up his dorm, he enthusiastically took his out-of-town roommate on a campus tour—being a local, he had visited Longjiang University several times.","Longjiang University is a comprehensive university, and its forestry program is nationally ranked, with very high vegetation coverage.","There's a grove on campus, deep and quiet, considered a forbidden area of the school. They say there are rare tree species inside, and to prevent damage, no one is allowed to enter.","As they passed by the roadside near the grove, Qian Kun had just said a few words when he suddenly felt drowsy and fainted on the spot, scaring his roommates who rushed him to the infirmary. The infirmary couldn't figure it out, so they sent him to Longjiang City Hospital.","The hospital contacted his parents.","\"Suddenly fainted?\" Gu Qiao frowned. \"I always thought little Kun was quite a healthy kid.\"","\"That's right!\" Ma Yinglan cried. \"Even the doctor said after the check-up that there's nothing physically wrong with him.\"","\"And then?\"","\"Then I thought, a sudden faint, could it be a hex? I discussed it with Kun's dad, and we invited Master Xuan Feng.\"","Gu Qiao: \"...\"","Qi Yuan: \"...\"","That master who ran at the sight of a ghost, and you still trust him?","\"Taoist Priest Xuan Feng performed a ritual, but Kun still didn't wake up.\" Although Ma Yinglan realized she'd been duped, she was too embarrassed to admit it, only saying, \"I think this time, whatever Kun encountered is not simple. Xuan Feng's level of cultivation couldn't suppress it.\"","\"...\"","Gu Qiao said, \"How about going to a major hospital in the capital first for a look?\"","Meanwhile, Qi Yuan stepped out of the ward and briefly sent the information to the group chat.","The group chat fell silent.","【Su Nuanuan: He was very healthy during the college entrance exam physical. It shouldn't be a sudden acute illness. Since the hospital can't find the cause, maybe we should find a master to take a look. This time, I support Aunt Ma.】","【Sun Yu: Suddenly remembered the content of Chapter 7 of \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family,\" which mentioned a young man with a darkening aura at his temples at Nuanuan-jie's birthday banquet. Was that referring to Old Qian? This time, I support Auntie Ma.】","【Peng Peng: I suggest going directly to Qi Quan-jie, don't waste time.】","【Su Nuanuan: But at this hour, Quanquan-jie is probably asleep.】","【Sun Yu: I remember on the day of Nuanuan-jie's birthday banquet, there was a guy who ran out chasing after Qin Ruo. He seemed to be a celestial master too, a good friend of the Chen family's youngest son, said to be from a celestial master family in Longjing City, with decent skills.】","【Qi Yuan: Who has the contact info for the Chen family's youngest son?】","【Sun Yu: I'll ask around.】","【Sun Yu: Got it, sent it to you privately.】","Qi Yuan immediately dialed the number.","It was already late at night, but young people are often night owls. Chen Feilu hadn't rested yet; he had just finished reading the new chapter of \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family\" and was currently sparring with people on Weibo.","Those fans who love to stir up trouble had deliberately posted the new chapter on Weibo, painting \"White Water Real Person\" as a marketing account trying to whitewash Yuan Qing.","Chen Feilu, using the handle \"Soaring Feilu,\" was in the thick of arguing with the haters.","His phone suddenly rang.","He put it on speakerphone, his hands still not leaving the keyboard, and asked casually, \"Who is this?\"","\"Is this Chen Feilu?\"","\"Yeah, who are you?\"","\"I'm Qi Yuan. Can I ask for your help?\"","Chen Feilu: ???","He lifted his fingers from the keyboard, surprised, \"Qi Yuan? Qi the Master's younger brother?\"","Qi Yuan: \"...Yeah.\"","In the past, people always referred to him as \"Chairman Qi's youngest son\" or \"Elder Brother Qi's younger brother.\" Being called \"Qi the Master's younger brother\" was a first.","It felt novel.","He no longer resisted the sibling relationship with Qi Quan.","\"What can I do for you?\" Chen Feilu asked politely.","He had heard that Master Qi didn't have good relationships with the Qi family members, and her relationship with Qi Yuan was especially poor.","Qi Yuan: \"My friend is in trouble. I'd like to ask your celestial master friend to take a look, is that possible? The fee won't be short.\"","Chen Feilu: \"Now?\"","\"Yeah.\"","\"Let me ask.\" Chen Feilu walked to Ning Zhi's room door and knocked, \"Ning-ge, someone's asking for your help. Will you go?\"","\"Who?\"","\"Master Qi's younger brother.\"","The door swung open instantly. Ning Zhi looked solemn, \"I'll go.\"","In the hospital, Qian Kun's father was still desperately trying to contact people in the capital. Gu Qiao was keeping Ma Yinglan company.","Qi Yuan sat on a bench in the corridor, head bowed, looking at his phone.","In the past, he never imagined he would ever benefit from Qi Quan's reputation. Just now, using the banner of \"Master Qi's younger brother\" to ask someone to save a life, the mere thought made him feel quite ashamed.","He used to bully her, and now he was borrowing her influence. He looked down on himself.","But with Qian Kun lying here in this unclear state, he couldn't just stand by.","Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu arrived quickly.","\"Hey, wait, who are you?\" Qian's father stopped the two who were about to enter the ward.","To avoid complications, Qi Yuan told a white lie, \"Uncle Qian, they're Qian Kun's friends, here to see him.\"","Both looked like college students, young. Qian's father didn't suspect anything and let them in.","As soon as Ning Zhi entered the ward, he saw the dark aura over Qian Kun's temples, and moreover...","Frowning, he walked to the bedside and, right in front of Ma Yinglan, took out a small, ancient-looking mirror and shone it on Qian Kun's face.","The mirror showed no reaction.","\"Young man, what are you...?\" Ma Yinglan was a bit confused.","Ning Zhi's expression was grave, \"His soul is missing.\"","His bodily functions are intact, but lacking a soul, of course he can't be woken up.","Ma Yinglan: ???","She looked at Qi Yuan; this person was brought by him.","\"Madam, hello, this is Master Ning,\" Chen Feilu introduced with a smile, \"He is a Level Four Celestial Master certified by the Celestial Masters Association. Mr. Qi Yuan invited us here.\"","Ma Yinglan: \"...\"","So young, can he really handle it?","She had heard before that Qi Yuan was near death in the hospital and was saved by the Qi family's biological daughter using mystical methods. At the time, she was quite dismissive.","What profound skills could a young girl from the countryside possibly have? It might just be the Qi family putting on a show to build up their biological daughter's reputation.","Who in their circles doesn't know that celestial masters make good money?","Ma Yinglan had previously harbored some minor resentment, feeling that Gu Qiao superficially looked down on the Mystic Wind Taoist Priest she favored, yet unrealistically promoted her own daughter's fame, which displeased her.","But now that her son was in trouble, she realized Mystic Wind was just a fraud.","Seeing how concerned Gu Qiao and Qi Yuan were about her and her son, she felt deeply guilty and uneasy inside.","However, the celestial master Qi Yuan found was indeed too young. She still didn't quite dare to believe.","\"What happens if a soul is missing?\" Gu Qiao asked, \"Can it be retrieved?\"","Having witnessed Qi Quan's methods firsthand, she had come to believe in the mystical arts a bit more.","Ning Zhi gathered spiritual energy at his fingertip and pressed it on Qian Kun's temples, completely occupied and unable to answer the question.","\"Generally speaking, if a soul has been missing for no more than three days and hasn't been harmed, it can be retrieved,\" Chen Feilu pointed at Qian Kun, \"How long has he been like this?\"","Hearing this, Ma Yinglan felt a surge of hope and hurriedly said, \"It started yesterday afternoon at four! It hasn't been three days yet!\"","She just didn't know if the soul had been injured outside.","Ning Zhi closed his eyes to sense the location of Qian Kun's soul. An invisible tether stretched far into the southwest direction.","He withdrew his hand, opened his eyes, and asked, \"Where exactly did he faint?\"","\"At the university!\" Ma Yinglan choked up, \"He was walking fine on the road and suddenly collapsed.\"","Ning Zhi: \"Is the university in the southwest direction?\"","Qi Yuan nodded, \"Correct.\"","\"Let's go to the university.\"","\"Wait,\" Qi Yuan stopped him, \"It's so late, the university won't let anyone in.\"","Ning Zhi: \"...\"","Chen Feilu explained with a smile, \"Well, that... school gates can't stop... Master Ning.\"","Mystical methods are numerous; a simple invisibility talisman would do the trick. As for school walls and gates, they were no obstacle for a Level Four Celestial Master.","Qi Yuan: \"...\"","Ning Zhi hurriedly left the hospital, activated a swift movement talisman, and soon arrived at Longjiang University.","The campus lights were out, pitch dark.","Standing at the main gate, he took out a compass. The needle slowly pointed in a direction. He applied an invisibility talisman, jumped over the wall into the campus, and headed towards the area gathering Yin energy.","It was a dense grove of trees, somewhat eerie.","Ning Zhi concentrated spiritual energy in his eyes. A few streams of light flashed in his pupils. Looking at the grove again, he couldn't help but be greatly shocked.","Such thick Yin energy!","He pondered for a moment, not daring to act rashly, and left Longjiang University under the cover of night.","After he left, a dark shadow suddenly appeared within the grove. Blood-red eyes watched the direction he had gone, then slowly faded back into the darkness.","The next day, Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan leisurely enjoyed the delicious breakfast made by Su Rong and went through the routine question, \"How is Ling Sheng's coursework coming along?\"","Asking daily had become a habit.","Su Rong respectfully replied, \"He's already reached the third-grade level.\"","\"Too slow, speed it up,\" Qi Quan glanced at the young man playing the fool.","Ling Sheng: \"...\"","\"With just video lessons, the effect might not be ideal,\" Su Rong said, \"Should we hire a tutor?\"","Qi Quan: \"Tutor fees are very expensive these days.\"","Su Rong: \"...\"","Master, do you know how much assets you have now?","Of course, he wouldn't defy Qi Quan, so he just said, \"I will supervise Ling Sheng's studies.\"","\"Mm.\" Qi Quan put down her bowl and chopsticks. \"Also, Ling Sheng studies all day, which is rather monotonous. You can arrange some appropriate tasks for him.\"","Before, she pitied him for suffering over a decade, but now that his health is fully restored, he can't just eat and live here for free.","She glanced at Ling Sheng and said nonchalantly, \"Since your spiritual power has nowhere to go, why not learn to draw some Dust-Cleaning Talismans? Steward Su works hard doing housework every day.\"","Ling Sheng's eating speed involuntarily slowed down.","Qi Zheng, sitting to the side, kept his head down the whole time, not daring to get involved.","Su Rong suppressed a laugh but couldn't hold it back, letting out a soft chuckle before casually changing the subject. \"Master, Nuanuan is going to Longjing City today. I'll see her off at the station.\"","\"Go ahead.\"","He went to make a call but returned a moment later.","\"Nuanuan says she rescheduled for tomorrow.\"","Registration lasts for two days, so going tomorrow is possible, though it would be a bit rushed.","Qi Quan asked, \"What happened?\"","\"She says her friend is unconscious, so she's staying to check on the situation first.\"","\"Oh.\" Qi Quan didn't inquire further.","As soon as she finished speaking, someone came to visit outside the villa.","Su Rong floated to the courtyard gate and, seeing it was Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu, let them in.","Ning Zhi hadn't slept all night and hadn't eaten breakfast. He arrived right on time, and the aroma of food wafting from the dining room made his stomach growl twice.","His face instantly flushed red with embarrassment.","Qi Quan noticed the urgency in his eyes and asked, \"What is it?\"","Ling Sheng put down his bowl and chopsticks and came over to observe as well.","This was his first appearance before others, and his face was simply a devastatingly handsome weapon.","Chen Feilu's eyes widened in shock.","Steward Su was already handsome enough, but he never expected the Master to take in another peerless handsome man.","Respect.","Ling Sheng stood quietly to the side, his gaze drifting to the osmanthus tree outside the window. A small insect flew from a leaf to the windowsill, greedily trying to squeeze into the house through a crack in the window.","He flicked his finger slightly. His spiritual power transformed into an extremely fine thread, wrapped around the insect's body, and flung it far away.","Ning Zhi abruptly looked towards the windowsill.","He had just sensed a fluctuation of spiritual power, but now it was gone again.","Qi Quan swept a glance at Ling Sheng.","He's really getting bold, even in front of others...","Daring to reveal spiritual power, isn't he afraid of people finding out he's a Natural Spiritual Body?","Ling Sheng lowered his head, assuming a well-behaved and obedient demeanor.","The atmosphere in the living room became somewhat subtle.","Su Rong smiled and broke the silence. \"Master Ning?\"","Ning Zhi snapped back to attention, his expression turning serious. \"Last night, I went to the woods at Longjiang University. The forest was heavy with yin energy, seemingly harboring a vengeful ghost of no low level. Qian Kun's soul is trapped in the woods. I didn't dare act recklessly.\"","\"Qian Kun?\" Qi Quan didn't recognize the name.","\"He's a friend of Mr. Qi Yuan,\" Chen Feilu explained. \"Mr. Qi Yuan sought Master Ning's help last night.\"","Qi Quan asked, \"How many days has the soul been separated from the body?\"","\"Today is the third day.\"","She lowered her eyes in silence.","System: [Big shot, are you reluctant to go out again?]","Qi Quan: [Mm.]","[It's not like you have to walk yourself.]","[It's not about walking.]","It's about dealing with people and ghosts.","She looked at the two expectant faces before her and irresponsibly pondered: if she could cultivate talent capable of handling things independently, wouldn't she not need to personally intervene in everything anymore?","But personally cultivating them is still troublesome.","Outwardly calm and collected but inwardly utterly world-weary, she stood up and instructed Ning Zhi, \"Contact Han Mian. We'll go to Longjiang University together.\"","Han Mian, who received the call: ???","The application to superiors hasn't even been approved yet, and we're collaborating again already?","The campus was bustling with the flow of people during the enrollment season.","Han Mian parked the car in a spot near the school and met up with Qi Quan and the others with his junior officer.","To avoid attracting attention from teachers and students, they wore plain clothes and entered the campus with the crowd, heading towards the woods.","There were fewer people near the woods. As Han Mian turned a corner, he saw Qi Quan under a camphor tree by the roadside.","She wore a set of lightweight, breathable sportswear, her hair tied up in a bun at the back. A few strands fell casually by her temples, accentuating her delicate and beautiful features, giving off a youthful and energetic vibe.","She was idly playing on her phone, while her handsome and dashing butler diligently held an umbrella, shielding her from the blazing sun and the admiring glances of passersby.","Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu beside her, however, were miserably baking under the scorching sun.","Ning Zhi, possessing spiritual energy, wasn't bothered by the heat, but Chen Feilu was just an ordinary person, his face already sunburned red.","\"How did you get here?\" Han Mian asked.","Chen Feilu: \"I drove.\"","\"Mm.\" Han Mian turned to Qi Quan. \"Is there a problem here?\"","Qi Quan pointed at the \"No Entry\" sign not far away and asked Han Mian, \"Can we go in?\"","\"...\"","Since they were on campus, they had to follow the rules. If it said \"No Entry,\" they certainly couldn't barge in.","Han Mian said helplessly, \"You need to tell me what happened first, so I can communicate with the school administration.\"","Qi Quan glanced at Chen Feilu.","Chen Feilu's radar picked up the signal, and he briefly explained Qian Kun's situation to Han Mian, concluding, \"I'm not sure what exactly is in the woods.\"","But since the police were called, it was likely related to a homicide.","Han Mian thought the same and walked aside to make a call.","Qi Quan continued playing on her phone.","[Big shot, 'Brother Yuan Says Stop Writing' threw a thousand Deep Waters, 'Book Famine is Deadly' threw a thousand Deep Waters. Probably both were for Qian Kun.]","[Mm.]","[And there's more good news!]","[What?]","[Congratulations, Big Shot, for reaching the top of the site's Newcomer Rankings! Reward: Ten days of lifespan.]","As a writer's system, such an achievement was enough to make it pleasantly surprised. It never expected the big shot's unconventional approach to yield such excellent results.","[Calculations show your currently accumulated reputation value is 3,140,522, which converts to approximately 3,141 days of lifespan, that's over eight years!]","In just these few days, she earned eight years of life!","Even someone as composed as...","Qi Quan couldn't help but feel joy. In her previous life, she only lived to twenty-two. This life, she could actually aim for thirty.","She chuckled and said, \"Well done.\"","System: [Hehe.]","Qi Quan asked again: [Is this top of the Newcomer Rankings also a phased goal? You didn't mention it before?]","System: [Just wanted to give you a surprise.]","[What's the next goal?]","[Getting on the first official chart.]","Qi Quan was puzzled: [What chart?]","[The manually curated charts. Once you reach the required word count, you can apply for listing, and then the editor arranges the rankings.]","[Oh.]","Han Mian hung up the phone and came back to tell Qi Quan, \"The school will send an administrator to accompany us.\"","\"Mm.\"","\"I submitted yesterday's video and wrote the application report.\"","\"Mm.\"","Han Mian was used to her terseness. He smiled and then cautiously asked, \"What will happen to... Qi Zheng?\"","\"Once you dismantle that business chain.\"","Qi Zheng died because he tried to stop the ghost marriage. If the authorities can uncover this case and bring those involved to justice, he can successfully go for reincarnation.","\"We will.\" Han Mian stated solemnly.","The school administrator arrived quickly—a portly middle-aged man of average height with a slightly receding hairline.","After he and Han Mian introduced themselves, he led the group into the woods.","\"This grove was planted thirty years ago when the school was expanded. Not many people usually come here.\" Director Sun struggled through the weeds and dead branches, wiping sweat from his forehead. \"Officer Han, is there a particular reason for coming into the woods?\"","Officer Han: \"...\"","Could he say he was here to check because he sensed ghostly energy?","Chen Feilu deftly changed the subject: \"Director Sun, how long have you worked at the school?\"","The dense canopy blocked the sunlight. The further they went, the darker and more shadowy the environment became. There were no other sounds around, only heavy breathing and the rustling of branches and leaves.","Director Sun felt an inexplicable sense of unease but maintained a cheerful expression. \"Eighteen years.\"","\"Since you're in management, you must be quite familiar with school affairs, right?\"","\"Fairly.\"","Chen Feilu keenly sensed the chill around them intensifying and boldly continued, \"Then, have there been any missing persons at the school?\"","\"Missing?\" Director Sun sensed something was off and stopped walking. \"Officer Han, what exactly is the purpose of your visit today?\"","Han Mian: \"Official business.\"","\"We really can't go any further. The bushes are blocking the way.\" Director Sun showed some resistance.","As a school administrator, he naturally didn't want any problems for the school.","Qi Quan suddenly stopped, gazing into the deep woods ahead, and said, \"Ten o'clock direction, sixty meters.\"","In the eyes of a Taoist master, that spot gathered the most concentrated ghostly energy, the source of the gloom in the entire grove. It was highly likely that a corpse was buried there.","Dumping a body in an uninhabited woods was not an uncommon occurrence.","Han Mian was stunned for a second, then immediately led the officers over. They had brought equipment for excavation.","\"Hey, what are you doing?\" Director Sun hurriedly followed, sweating profusely. \"You can't just dig here randomly. Some of these are rare species; they mustn't be damaged.\"","Chen Feilu and Ning Zhi both joined the digging team.","Suddenly, all the leaves became still.","Thick, viscous black energy surged from all sides, carrying a bone-chilling cold. It was like a sky-blotting beast, blocking all light and trapping the group in this small, dense patch of forest.","The black energy churned, and the faint silhouette of a woman flickered within.","\"Who are you? What do you want?\" A hoarse, unpleasant voice came from all directions, like surround sound.","Qi Quan: That's a neat trick.","[Ahhhhhh, a ghost!] The system screamed in fright.","It wasn't that it had never seen a ghost before; it was just that Su Rong, Qi Zheng, and the others were all handsome and well-kept in appearance. But this ghost in front of them didn't have a single intact part on her body. Her head, limbs, and torso seemed stitched together with thread, looking utterly terrifying...","Ning Zhi's expression turned grave. \"A fifth-level red ghost.\"","Higher level than him.","Chen Feilu frowned. \"Doesn't that mean she's harmed many people?\"","\"Doesn't seem like it.\" Ning Zhi shook his head. \"The strength is indeed fifth-level, but she doesn't carry the karma of murder.\"","\"Huh? I thought after the third level, they all had to have killed someone?\" Chen Feilu was puzzled.","Ning Zhi was also confused inside.","Hearing their conversation, the system asked Qi Quan.","[Generally, that's how ghost levels are categorized, but there are exceptions to everything.]","As Qi Quan spoke, her spiritual power transformed into a slender rope that whooshed through the female ghost's black energy barrier. The black energy instantly cracked like dominoes, the fissures spreading outward before vanishing completely.","Only then did everyone see clearly that behind the female ghost was a listless living soul, currently drooping its eyes, looking drowsy.","\"It's Qian Kun!\" Chen Feilu exclaimed in surprise.","Seeing her black energy dissipate, the female ghost didn't become agitated. Instead, she glanced at Han Mian and the officers still digging, then turned her sharp, cold gaze to Qi Quan and asked again:","\"Who are you people? Why have you come here?\"","System: [Wow, she's very lucid.]","Qi Quan: [She hasn't harmed anyone, so of course she's not a mindless evil spirit.]","\"This... sister,\" Chen Feilu replied bravely, \"we're here looking for someone.\"","The female ghost pulled Qian Kun's living soul forward. \"You mean him?\"","\"Yes. We'd appreciate it if you could be accommodating.\"","The female ghost shook her head disdainfully. \"That won't do.\"","\"Sister, you clearly have a kind heart. If he doesn't go back soon, something bad will happen! If you really like him, how about letting him come visit you in the woods more often later?\"","Everyone: \"...\"","Is that even an option?","Female Ghost: \"I don't need his company.\"","Chen Feilu: \"Then what do you need?\"","\"His attitude isn't right, and his foundation is poor. I'm giving him some extra tutoring. I'll send him back when the time comes.\"","Everyone: ???","\"We found something!\" a young officer exclaimed.","In the ground lay scattered white bones, clearly chopped into several pieces with a sharp tool—the result of murder and dismemberment.","Han Mian's brow furrowed tightly. \"Little Li, notify the station immediately.\"","\"Yes, sir!\"","The female ghost was stunned for a moment, then asked in surprise, \"You're the police?\"","Trapped here for so many years, waiting for so long, she had long given up hope of being discovered. She never imagined that just casually luring a living soul would bring the police.","Qi Quan had no patience for further talk.","Since the remains had been unearthed, the next steps were the police's business. She just needed to take the female ghost away.","She quickly produced a peach wood talisman. Before the female ghost could react, she was abruptly sucked into the talisman's space.","\"Ning Zhi, take the living soul back.\"","\"Yes, Master.\"","Qi Quan pocketed the peach wood talisman, ignoring the female ghost's shouts, and turned to walk out of the woods.","\"Master, what about him...\" Chen Feilu pointed at Director Sun, who had fainted from fright on the ground.","Qi Quan: \"Leave him to the police.\"","\"Oh, okay.\"","The system asked: [Master, why not just let the police question the female ghost directly? Wouldn't that make solving the case more efficient?]","[And what if the victim in the next case hasn't become a ghost?]","[Good point.]","Just as Qi Quan got into the car, she received a call from Du Jiaming.","\"Master, she's awake!\"","At Anji Hospital, Yuan Qing felt as if she had had a very long dream, a dream where she was stuck in quicksand, and the whole world was filled with darkness and cruelty.","She opened her eyes. A ray of sunlight met her gaze.","The smell of disinfectant and the pure white color reminded her she was in a hospital.","Back in the hospital again?","She curled her lips in a self-mocking smile.","The door suddenly opened. Yuan Qing didn't turn her head, still staring out the window.","It was undoubtedly someone from the He family...","She didn't want to see them.","\"You're awake.\" Du Jiaming tried to soften his voice as much as possible. \"Are you hungry? Thirsty? Should I get you some water?\"","Yuan Qing frowned. She hadn't heard this voice before.","She instinctively turned her neck and met Du Jiaming's kind yet awkward gaze, slightly taken aback.","She recognized this face—the famous playboy from the Du family.","What was going on?","\"Well, you're at Anji Hospital now. Don't worry, it's very safe here. Just focus on recovering. We can discuss the details once the police arrive.\"","\"The police?\"","\"Yeah.\" Du Jiaming nodded. \"Your injury report is out, and it's quite serious. You were rescued from a secret room in the He family, so they'll need to ask about the specifics.\"","Yuan Qing felt no emotional stir inside.","Could the police handle a ghost marriage? Could they sever the connection between her and He Chao—","Wait!","She suddenly straightened up, frantically shaking her head. After a few seconds of shock, she let out a sharp cry: \"He Chao, go to hell!\"","Du Jiaming: ???","He took a frightened step back.","Yuan Qing waited a moment, then proceeded to curse He Chao's ancestors for eighteen generations. Still unable to \"provoke\" He Chao into showing himself, she burst into wild, hysterical laughter.","She could feel it—the tether that had connected her to He Chao was gone!","She was free!","It was as if a chronic, heavy illness had suddenly lifted, and her whole being radiated with new vitality.","She turned to Du Jiaming, her eyes blazing with excitement.","\"When will the police arrive? I want to report a crime!\""]},{"number":30,"title":"Chapter 30","paragraphs":["Han Mian had just finished briefing the case from the school woods when he received another call and rushed to Anji Hospital.","By the time he arrived, Yuan Qing had already calmed down. The eldest son of the Du family was sitting by her hospital bed keeping her company. Both were looking down at their phones, muttering to themselves.","\"I'm telling you, the master is amazing. If it weren't for the master, you wouldn't be sitting here so peacefully right now. The master even spoke up for you in her novel. A bunch of mindless fans went to curse at her, sigh!\"","Yuan Qing was carefully reading \"Diary of the Rich and Powerful,\" especially the latest two chapters, which she had already read several times.","During these days trapped in the He family's secret room, she had no idea what was happening outside, but she could imagine the torrent of abuse directed at her. She just never expected that someone would be willing to speak up for her.","Moreover, the person who wrote this article was her benefactor, the one who had shielded her from the sulfuric acid.","Yuan Qing had always wanted to thank her savior but was hindered by the He family's restraints and couldn't find an opportunity.","Without hesitation, she topped up her account and gifted \"Diary of the Rich and Powerful\" two thousand \"deep water\" torpedoes.","Under the He family's control all these years, she hadn't been able to save much money. Two hundred thousand was almost all of her savings.","She still needed to keep some for medical and hospitalization fees.","She would continue thanking White Water True Person once she earned more money in the future.","Han Mian knocked on the hospital room door.","\"Officer Han is here.\" Du Jiaming, perceptive as ever, got up and left, giving Yuan Qing and the police officer space.","Han Mian, accompanied by another officer, began taking her statement.","The police statement wouldn't involve supernatural phenomena. His questions all pertained to He Jianshe and his wife.","After all, it was He Jianshe and his wife who had imprisoned Yuan Qing. He Chao initially had no physical form and couldn't commit crimes; everything was driven by the couple's \"excessive love for their son.\"","Yuan Qing cooperated fully, recounting her experiences over the years.","Starting from being forced into the ghost marriage, to being frequently locked in the dark room and suffering abuse, she described the He couple's crimes in meticulous detail.","The junior officer taking notes was so angry his hand trembled.","So despicable! So utterly inhuman!","Meanwhile, a middle-aged man appeared outside the He family villa. He was dressed plainly, with an average appearance, the kind easily lost in a crowd.","The He villa was already cordoned off with police tape; officers were still searching the secret room for evidence.","Pretending to be an onlooker, he blended into the crowd for a while, then casually asked someone beside him, \"What happened here?\"","\"I heard they got into some trouble. Not sure exactly what, but I saw the police come and take them away yesterday.\"","\"I got a rough idea. The police rescued a woman covered in injuries. Probably a couple of sadistic torturers,\" another person clicked their tongue.","Those living in this area were all wealthy or influential; some even had competitive relationships with the He family, so they weren't afraid to speak plainly.","The middle-aged man nodded, then slipped out of the crowd and quickly disappeared.","He found a quiet spot and dialed a number.","\"Check the list of ghost marriage clients in Longjiang City. See if there's anyone surnamed He.\"","A reply came quickly: \"Yes, He Jianshe. Matched his deceased son, He Chao, with a female celebrity named Yuan Qing.\"","\"Yuan Qing...\" The man narrowed his eyes. \"Also check He Chao's current status for me.\"","\"He Chao is gone.\"","'Gone' meant he was no longer in the mortal realm.","Who could make him disappear from the mortal realm besides a Taoist master? It certainly couldn't have been the police, could it?","Was this righteous Taoist master who intervened justly connected to Ding Ji's death?","\"Investigate further. See if any Taoist masters entered or left the He residence yesterday.\"","The other party quickly hacked into the villa district's surveillance system, sent a screenshot to the man, and attached identity information.","Ning Zhi, heir to a third-rate Taoist master family from Longjing City, twenty years old, fourth-level Taoist master, considerable talent.","A mere fourth-level Taoist master, how could he possibly have killed Ding Ji?","The man: \"Continue tracking Ning Zhi's movements in Longjiang City.\"","A Taoist master from Longjing City suddenly showing up in Longjiang City must involve something fishy.","The other party: \"Go to Weibo... search for 'Yuan Qing jinx,' and you'll understand the whole story.\"","The man hung up and started searching.","Topics about Yuan Qing on Weibo were already diverse, with the most frequent mention being of a novel called \"Diary of the Rich and Powerful.\"","Was he too old to keep up with the times? How could a female celebrity be connected to an online novel?","[Please lock yq and bszr together forever!]","[Please get yq out of the entertainment industry!]","[Am I the only one wondering if jxz can continue filming?]","What on earth do these letters mean?","The man rubbed the back of his head and sighed inwardly. The internet really isn't friendly to old-timers like them.","Amidst the sea of curses, he finally pieced together a relatively complete story and found White Water True Person's \"Diary of the Rich and Powerful.\"","The novel had only updated nine chapters, each with very few words. Sitting on a bench, he finished it in moments.","What kind of nonsense is this?","He scoffed and shook his head. How could a girl barely over twenty possibly break the Peach Blossom Seal?","It's nothing but a young girl's unrealistic fantasy.","Compared to that, he'd rather believe Ning Zhi had support from another powerful master behind the scenes or a family heirloom artifact, which allowed him to break the formation at Ding Ji's lair.","Ding Ji's cultivation was built on plunder and was quite hollow to begin with. This Ning Zhi was a promising young genius; defeating Ding Ji might have been a slim possibility.","Convinced he had found the truth, the man sent a text: [Find out Ning Zhi's current location.]","[Longjiang City First Hospital.]","The man put away his phone and headed towards the hospital.","Inside the hospital, Ning Zhi returned with Qian Kun's soul.","Ma Yinglan asked anxiously, \"M-master, how is my son?\"","Qian's father suddenly barged in, eyes red. \"Quick! I've made arrangements with a hospital in the capital. We're transferring him now!\"","He had spent the whole night making calls, begging and pleading, finally getting a connection to a top expert in the capital. They had to get there as soon as possible.","\"Wait.\" Ning Zhi stopped him.","\"Get out of the way!\" Qian's father was so anxious blisters had formed at the corners of his mouth. \"I won't argue with you because you're young. Don't engage in feudal superstitions at your age; go home!\"","Ning Zhi glanced at Chen Feilu. Chen Feilu understood and quickly stepped forward to persuade, \"Just five minutes! Give us five minutes!\"","The soul is already back, why transfer hospitals?","Ning Zhi extended his index finger, pressed it against Qian Kun's glabella, silently recited a few incantations, then suddenly shouted, \"Qian Kun! Return to your body!\"","The living soul stood by the bedside, drawn by spiritual energy. It had been dazed, but upon hearing this shout, like a thunderclap in its ears, it jolted awake and instantly returned to the body.","Qian's father was still pushing and shoving with Chen Feilu, almost coming to blows in his urgency, when suddenly a familiar \"Dad\" made his movements freeze.","He looked up, disbelief written on his face.","Qian Kun was already propping himself up, sitting up, grinning a carefree, heartless grin, and said to him, \"Dad, why that expression? Aren't you happy I'm awake? Look at Mom, she's crying with joy.\"","Qian's father: \"...\"","Ma Yinglan: \"...\"","The atmosphere in the room became strangely awkward.","Ning Zhi: \"...I'll take my leave first.\"","If we don't leave now, we might get a front-row seat to witness the cooking process of bamboo shoots stir-fried with pork.","\"Master, wait!\" Ma Yinglan said with a devout expression. \"You saved my son's life. No amount of gratitude from our family would be enough. May I ask where you practice, Master, and what your honorable name is...\"","\"It wasn't me who saved him,\" Ning Zhi said earnestly. \"If you wish to thank someone, go to Lakeside Villa.\"","If it weren't for Qi Quan, they wouldn't have been able to find Qian Kun's living soul so easily.","As soon as he finished speaking, two more people entered the hospital room—Su Nuanuan and Qi Yuan, who had just gone out for a meal.","\"You're finally awake!\" Su Nuanuan exclaimed with delight.","Qi Yuan glanced Qian Kun up and down, and seeing him full of vigor, felt relieved.","...","\"Didn't you guys go to register?\" Qian Kun asked, scratching his head.","\"It's all because of you,\" Su Nuanuan said, exasperated. \"What on earth happened to you? Why did your soul suddenly leave your body?\"","Ning Zhi was about to leave but was caught by the sleeve by Chen Feilu.","He also wanted to know why Qian Kun's soul had left his body. More precisely, why that female ghost had specifically targeted Qian Kun.","Qian Kun looked utterly bewildered: \"I don't know. I was just walking normally with my roommate on the road, chatting, when suddenly I felt dizzy. Then I found myself floating in a forest. Let me tell you, these past two days have been miserable. That terrifying female ghost kept forcing me to do practice problems! I just finished the college entrance exams, I don't want to do more problems! If I got them wrong, she'd scold me, calling me stupid as a pig, saying I lacked ambition, and then she'd throw another pile of problems at me. I don't remember what happened after that.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","Su Nuanuan, having read many novels, had a more imaginative train of thought and asked, \"Did you say something you shouldn't have?\"","\"At the time, I was just telling my roommate that once we get to university, we can play to our heart's content, date if we want to, no more piles of homework. It's going to be awesome.\"","He said with a pitiful look, \"I didn't say anything offensive to her at all.\"","Su Nuanuan was amused by his bizarre ordeal and patted his shoulder. \"Since you're better now, I'm relieved.\"","\"By the way,\" Qian Kun then remembered to ask Ning Zhi, \"Master, was it Sister Qi Quan who saved me?\"","Qi Yuan suddenly looked up, then lowered his head again.","\"Yes. Without her, I couldn't have saved you.\"","After saying this, Ning Zhi left with Chen Feilu.","As the two reached the hospital entrance, they passed by a middle-aged man. Ning Zhi keenly sensed a faint ripple of spiritual energy, but it vanished the next second.","\"Brother Ning, where are we going now?\"","Ning Zhi: \"First, go to Anji Hospital, then back to Lakeside Villa.\"","\"Brother Ning, do you remember we need to go back to school for classes?\" Chen Feilu asked with a smile.","\"...\" Ning Zhi sighed inwardly. \"Let's ask for leave.\"","Anji Hospital.","Through Du Jiaming, Ning Zhi easily met with Yuan Qing.","Her mental state was quite good now. Freed from the constraints of the ghost marriage, her whole person seemed to radiate a bright light.","\"Thank you for saving me.\" Yuan Qing expressed her sincere gratitude and even insisted on getting out of bed to bow to them.","Ning Zhi stopped her and handed her a talisman paper.","It was a Shadow-Retaining Talisman.","Spiritual energy activated the talisman. Suddenly, a \"screen\" appeared in the hospital room. The edges of the \"screen\" were misty and hazy, like ethereal immortal magic, while the center, like a water mirror, played the scene of He Chao being punished.","Before Yuan Qing could marvel at this miraculous sight, she was drawn to He Chao's wretched state.","She stared fixedly at He Chao's agonized screams and cries, dark eyes burning with intense, excited flames.","The corners of her mouth lifted into a smile, the anger and pent-up frustration in her heart dissipating greatly as He Chao vanished.","But as she laughed, she then covered her face and began to sob uncontrollably.","Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan released the female ghost from the peachwood talisman. Finding her patched-together limbs rather unsightly, she used her spiritual energy to repair them. In moments, the female ghost was completely renewed.","She was a rather beautiful woman.","She had a neat, chin-length bob, an oval face, thick and finely shaped eyebrows, slightly upturned outer corners of her eyes, and strong, defined facial contours. She possessed a kind of bold yet aloof beauty.","Qi Quan, being an appreciator of beauty, treated her a bit more gently.","\"Su Rong, serve tea for our guest.\"","Su Rong smiled understandingly, floated to the tea room, brewed a pot of tea, and poured two cups.","The female ghost raised an eyebrow, staring straight at Qi Quan. Suddenly, the aroma of tea drifted into her nostrils. She looked down in surprise, puzzled, \"How is this possible?\"","Could a ghost also smell the scents of the mortal world?","Qi Quan's smile deepened. \"Have a taste.\"","The female ghost hurriedly picked up the teacup and took a small sip, her eyes immediately lighting up.","\"Aren't you afraid I might have tampered with it?\"","The female ghost said candidly, \"You're different from other Taoist masters.\"","\"Other Taoist masters?\"","\"Hmph.\" The female ghost sneered. \"In the past, when I couldn't control my yin energy, some Taoist masters sensed it and tried to destroy me without even asking for an explanation.\"","If I hadn't studied ghost techniques on my own and quickly advanced my level, I probably would have been utterly annihilated long ago.","\"Today in the forest, your first action was to look for my remains. That's very different from others. I like you, and I like your tea.\"","The female ghost spoke sincerely.","Although she had died a tragic death, she had never harmed anyone. Her eyes were still as clear and bright as when she was alive.","Qi Quan admired her even more and asked, \"Why did you capture Qian Kun's living soul?\"","\"I struggled greatly in my own studies back then. I can't stand seeing young people nowadays wasting their time and lacking ambition, especially students who are smug and complacent just because of their family wealth. I didn't mean to harm him. I originally planned to teach him for three days and then send him back.\"","Qi Quan said unhurriedly, \"But regardless, your actions caused trouble for others.\"","The female ghost nodded. \"That's true. So, how do you plan to deal with me?\"","During their encounter in the forest, the female ghost knew she was no match for Qi Quan. She was a very pragmatic person. Moreover, Qi Quan had the police dig up her remains to seek justice for her. This was a debt of gratitude she had to repay.","\"Since you enjoy educating people, then before your justice is served, you can work here as a tutor for free.\" Qi Quan held her teacup, smiling amiably.","The female ghost suddenly felt a chill run down her spine.","\"Teach who?\"","Qi Quan: \"Teach a young friend, starting from elementary school level.\"","In the adjacent side room, Ling Sheng was using his spiritual energy to \"eavesdrop\" on their conversation. His hand holding the pen suddenly tightened, leaving a black mark on the test paper.","\"Elementary school?\" The female ghost widened her eyes. \"I have a Ph.D., and you want me to teach elementary school?\"","Qi Quan: \"Keep teaching, and eventually, it'll be university level.\"","\"...\"","Su Rong, standing to the side, could barely contain his laughter.","\"Of course, as payment, I can make you several beautiful little dresses.\"","Qi Quan had been itching to use her skills for a while.","Previously, she only had Su Rong as a ghost attendant. She couldn't make clothes for him every day. Besides, compared to men's clothing, she preferred making all sorts of women's outfits.","Especially since the female ghost had a striking appearance and a tall, slender figure—she would be an excellent model.","The smile on Su Rong's lips faded slightly. He glanced at the female ghost, who looked pleasantly surprised, and felt a sense of crisis.","The Master is a woman. Would she be closer to another woman?","If this female Ph.D. also chose to become a ghost attendant, would his own competitiveness decline?","Su Rong wasn't being unnecessarily anxious; his intuition was correct.","In her previous life, Qi Quan had raised quite a few ghost attendants, both male and female. Her relationship with the female ghost attendants was indeed more intimate, as women understood women's thoughts better and were more skilled at cheering her up.","Su Rong secretly resolved that he must guard his position as the villa butler well and not let any other ghost snatch it away.","\"You'll make it for me?\" the female ghost asked, surprised after her initial delight. \"Not burn it?\"","\"Burned clothes have a charred smell. Do you like that?\" Qi Quan subtly tempted her. \"What floral scent do you prefer? I can perfume your clothes with it, lasting a long time.\"","Su Rong: \"...\"","His clothes had no fragrance.","The female ghost was completely won over. \"Alright, I'll be the tutor. But don't blame me if I don't teach well.\"","\"Of course, if the teaching isn't effective, it's not your problem, but his.\"","The female ghost smiled brightly. \"Deal.\"","As soon as the words fell, two people entered through the door.","It was Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu.","Qi Quan had given them permission to enter, so they no longer needed to ring the doorbell for Su Rong to let them in.","\"Senior, Qian Kun's living soul has returned to his body,\" Ning Zhi reported respectfully. \"Also, regarding the—\"","He saw Qi Quan's eyes suddenly turn sharp and cold. A needle-like burst of spiritual power shot from her fingertip. In a flash, the needle tip struck Chen Feilu's left shoulder. A shrill, piercing screech was heard as an invisible tracking beetle suddenly revealed itself and fell to the ground with a splat.","This was the Mystic Arts' insect control technique, specifically used for tracking.","Ning Zhi's face turned deathly pale.","He suddenly remembered the spiritual energy fluctuation he sensed at the hospital entrance and was filled with intense guilt and self-blame. \"I was careless.\"","Qi Quan crushed the insect and said calmly, \"The caster's cultivation level is higher than yours. It's normal you didn't notice.\"","\"I've dragged you down, Senior,\" Chen Feilu also said regretfully. Having no cultivation himself, he was like a soft persimmon in the eyes of practitioners, easy to squeeze.","Qi Quan said lightly, \"It's not a big deal.\"","It was just some members of a certain cult organization coming to Longjiang City to investigate the truth behind Ding Ji's death, who had mistakenly traced it to Ning Zhi.","Not far from Lakeside Villa, a middle-aged man swallowed a pill to calm the backlash and surging spiritual power within him.","From the tracking beetle, he had only heard a few inconsequential sentences.","Just who lived in Lakeside Villa? To be called \"Senior\" by a fourth-level Celestial Master, their cultivation level must be quite high. Otherwise, they wouldn't have so easily seen through and killed his tracking beetle.","He took a photo of the villa and sent it to the person on the other end: [Investigate who lives here, which Celestial Master.]","The other end replied: [Qi Quan.]","The man: [Who is Qi Quan?]","The other end: [Haven't you watched \"Diary of the Rich\"?]","The man: ...","He was completely unaware of the current situation in Longjiang City. Back when he was in Ding Ji's position, Longjiang City wasn't this developed.","Having not visited for many years, the place had long since changed beyond recognition.","He thought for a moment and headed to the Longjiang City branch of the Celestial Master Association. Pulling out his Celestial Master certificate, he went straight to the archives room.","The person managing the archives was a young man. Seeing the \"Level Six\" on his certificate, he couldn't help but feel a deep sense of respect.","“Senior Yan Wu, what would you like to check?”","\"Information on a Celestial Master in Longjiang City named 'Qi Quan'.\"","The administrator: \"Alright, please wait a moment.\"","He performed a search on the computer. The results appeared quickly, but—","\"Sorry, zero results.\"","Yan Wu was somewhat surprised. Zero results meant this person named Qi Quan was not registered with the Celestial Master Association.","The Mystic Arts had a rule: whether from a sect, a family, or a wandering practitioner, as long as one was a Celestial Master, they must pass an assessment, register their personal information with the Celestial Master Association, and be granted a Celestial Master certificate by the association.","Only with a Celestial Master certificate could one officially take on cases.","Those without a certificate were not allowed to handle supernatural cases privately.","Yan Wu smiled slightly, tapped the administrator's computer, and said, \"I want to report someone for working without a license.\"","The administrator: \"...\"","The discovery of a human skeleton dug up in the woods of Longjiang University quickly sparked heated discussion and was posted online by well-meaning individuals, climbing the trending searches.","[So terrifying! Died and no one noticed?]","[I heard it was dismemberment; the bones were broken in several places.]","[What a pervert!]","I just got into Longjiang University this year! Just finished registering! I'm totally numb now.","This old senior is also shivering.","Longjiang City Municipal Bureau.","Han Mian instructed his officers: \"Now we'll split into two teams. One team will follow up on the He family ghost marriage case, while the other investigates the Longjiang University dismemberment case.\"","\"Captain Han, He Jianshe, and Wang Cui insist that they were just being superstitious, arranging a ghost marriage between He Chao and Yuan Qing, and that Yuan Qing consented. He Chao and Yuan Qing were already dating when He Chao died. The reason Yuan Qing was at their house was because she was the He family's daughter-in-law. Her injuries were due to her self-harm tendencies.\"","\"That's right, Captain Han. We just found out Yuan Qing once went to a psychologist, saying she had fairly severe depression. Depression can involve some self-harm and suicidal tendencies.\"","Han Mian pinched the bridge of his nose. \"The injuries on Yuan Qing's body aren't something self-harm could achieve. Keep interrogating.\"","\"Captain Han, the forensics report is out.\"","Han Mian took the report.","The deceased was female, aged between 28 and 30, height 1.68 meters. Time of death was approximately five years ago. Cause of death was a blunt force impact to the back of the head.","These were just preliminary findings. Genetic comparison to confirm identity would take more time.","Han Mian said: \"First, investigate whether Longjiang University had any missing female teachers or female doctoral students five years ago.\"","\"Yes, sir.\"","\"Captain Han,\" another officer approached. \"We just found out Wang Cui wires money to an overseas account every year. Ten million each time.\"","An officer beside him: \"Ten million! I couldn't earn that in a lifetime as a cop.\"","\"What kind of account?\"","\"An orphanage.\"","Someone joked: \"Have they ever donated to any domestic orphanages?\"","\"Didn't see any.\"","\"Well then, seems they prefer foreign children.\"","Han Mian: \"Alright, enough joking. Keep investigating that orphanage.\"","He felt he had touched a corner of the iceberg. This business chain soaked in the suffering of girls might soon be dug up.","Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan kept her word and entered the sewing room to make pretty little dresses for the female ghost. Meanwhile, the female ghost, led by Su Rong, came to the room where Ling Sheng studied.","Ling Sheng hung his head low. Even though the angle hid most of his face, the female ghost could still make out his excellent features.","However, she wasn't concerned with appearance, but rather—","\"Him? Third grade?\"","Su Rong explained gently: \"He was imprisoned by someone when he was very young and was only rescued by the Master not long ago.\"","The female ghost reluctantly nodded. \"Alright then.\"","It seemed the people or ghosts in Lakeside Villa all had their share of misfortune.","The female ghost didn't want to waste a single moment. \"Then let's start right now.\"","Su Rong nodded and walked towards the door. Suddenly remembering something, he turned and asked: \"What's your name?\"","Female ghost: \"Xue Hong. Hong as in rainbow.\"","\"Alright.\"","Qi Quan stayed in the sewing room the entire afternoon and finally finished two sets of dresses before dinner.","And Xue Hong's teaching had also shown quite some effectiveness.","The two met, both quite satisfied with each other.","Xue Hong changed into a red dress, exuding a rich fragrance of roses. The skirt hem reached the bend of her legs, revealing slender, fair calves. She said excitedly, \"I almost never wore dresses before for convenience's sake. I never thought I could wear such a beautiful dress even after becoming a ghost. Your craftsmanship is truly excellent!\"","\"As long as you like it.\"","Qi Quan was also quite satisfied with her own taste. Xue Hong had a striking, beautiful appearance that went very well with red. There was also a black one, which was even more mysterious and coolly elegant.","\"Su Rong said Ling Sheng finished learning all the elementary school material in one afternoon,\" she said with a smile. \"Teacher Xue's teaching skills are quite impressive.\"","Xue Hong's eyes brightened slightly. \"He's very smart.\"","Before teaching him, she hadn't expected Ling Sheng's comprehension to be so strong.","Qi Quan smiled meaningfully. That's more like it. How could someone with a natural spiritual constitution be a fool?","\"But... is he mute?\" Xue Hong hadn't heard Ling Sheng speak all afternoon.","\"Hmm, he's mute,\" Qi Quan agreed.","Ling Sheng, who was just entering the room, paused his step.","\"Food's ready,\" Su Rong called from the dining room.","Currently, there were only two humans and three ghosts in the villa.","Qi Zheng floated over from some corner, looked at the full table of dishes, and felt so happy he could cry.","\"I don't even want to reincarnate anymore,\" he said, stuffing a meatball into his mouth.","Xue Hong glanced at him. \"No one's making you go.\"","\"Ah? I don't have to reincarnate?\" Qi Zheng asked blankly.","Xue Hong pointed at Su Rong. \"He didn't go.\"","\"But...\" He hesitated and didn't continue.","Xue Hong was quite the thinker. She said, \"Are you talking about the restrictions Su Rong faces from the Heavenly Dao? But think about it carefully, weren't you bound by the laws of nature and society when you were alive? Even if you're reborn into a good family in your next life, you'd still have to be a law-abiding citizen.\"","\"That makes sense,\" Qi Zheng said, led astray by her words, adopting a thoughtful expression.","Xue Hong added, \"Moreover, my life goal is to keep learning until I'm old. Even after becoming a ghost, I don't want to give up studying. I plan to embrace the boundless sea of knowledge with my endless ghostly life. After finishing this subject, I can learn that one.\"","\"That really makes a lot of sense,\" Qi Zheng sighed. \"But ghosts can't linger in the mortal world for too long.\"","...","\"It's fine, just become a ghost servant,\" Xue Hong suddenly turned to Qi Quan. \"Master, how about we make the contract after dinner?\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","The system was also shocked: 【She's so bold!】","Qi Quan chuckled inwardly: 【She's a very interesting person.】","She ate her food leisurely and said, \"My standards for accepting ghost servants are very high.\"","Xue Hong was full of enthusiasm. \"Let's hear them.\"","\"Looks, both kinds of intelligence (IQ & EQ), and a special skill. None can be missing.\"","Su Rong raised the corner of his mouth, unable to suppress a smile.","\"Am I not good-looking? Is my intelligence not high? Don't I teach well?\"","The rosy glow of twilight shone in at a slant, coating the dining room in a warm, romantic hue.","A warm glow filled Qi Quan's eyes as she nodded with a smile. \"You're good-looking, and you teach well. But how do you prove your intelligence?\"","\"I have a Ph.D.\"","\"Hmm, a Ph.D. who was brutally murdered.\"","Xue Hong: \"...\"","She continued, \"My relationships with my advisor and classmates were pretty good.\"","\"Hmm, disappearing without a trace yet no one filed a missing person report. The relationships were indeed pretty good.\"","\"...\"","Xue Hong rested her head on her hand, fell silent for a moment, and said in a low, hoarse voice, \"Everyone makes mistakes in life.\"","\"Hmm, so think carefully before making a decision,\" Qi Quan said.","After dinner, Xue Hong didn't mention the contract again. Instead, she sat in the yard gazing at the stars, seemingly contemplating her ghostly existence.","Qi Quan left her alone and went to her room to write.","【Big Boss, \"Qiankun Great Shift\" threw two thousand depth charges, \"Malan Flower Blooms Thirty-One\" threw two thousand depth charges, \"Wealth Flows In\" threw two thousand depth charges.】","【Noted.】","【Big Boss, I won't disturb your writing.】","At ten p.m., Chapter 10 of \"Diary of the Elite\" was published.","[Ghost marriage is a forbidden art of the mystic arts, an extremely malicious and evil technique.","First, I need to figure out who she entered the ghost marriage with.","I don't know where she lives, but I shielded her from one disaster, creating a slight connection with her. Using mystic arts methods, I sensed her location.","She is currently in a high-end villa district. The people living there are all notable figures in Longjiang City.","I'm not familiar with Longjiang's elite social circle, so I specifically consulted a former client of mine.","It turns out she lives in the house of a major entrepreneur.","But, she has no blood or legal relationship with the entrepreneur couple. Why does she live there?","I feel inexplicably worried.","Fortunately, there's a police officer with an overwhelming sense of justice by my side. Hearing my concerns, he decided to go investigate personally.","He's a ghost, others can't see him, which is indeed convenient.","A moment later, he returned with a grave expression.","I hurriedly asked, \"What's wrong?\"","He said with self-reproach and anguish, \"I'm so useless. I can't help her!\"","He is a good person. Good people feel ashamed and upset when they can't help others, while bad people enjoy building their happiness on the suffering of others.","When bad people die, they become bad ghosts.","Bad ghosts are even more unrestrained. They can completely ignore the laws of the mortal world, disregard social morality, acting solely for their own selfish desires.","The just police officer choked up and said, \"When I arrived, she was being brutally beaten. The one beating her was a ghost, the very one she's in the ghost marriage with. She was beaten terribly. I wanted to help, but that ghost seems to be under some kind of protection, much more powerful than me.\"","\"This isn't your fault,\" I comforted him. \"Blame those bad people and bad ghosts.\"","He lowered his head, his face full of desolation, and said, \"But I'm a police officer.\"","I fell silent, my throat aching terribly.","I patted his shoulder. \"Evil ghosts running amok naturally should be handed over to the mystic arts community to deal with.\"","Perhaps, my stumbling into the realm of mystic arts holds special meaning for me as well.","It just so happens I know a quite capable Taoist master. After hearing about it, he went without hesitation to...","handle it.","I hope everything returns to peace and well-being.]","Qi Quan fabricated a lot, but the core of the story remained unchanged. Anyone with eyes could tell the new chapter was about Yuan Qing.","【Lose 20 lbs in 3 Months: Caught up. It's good, helps with weight loss.】","【If You See Me, Tell Me to Prep Lessons: Domestic violence is truly intolerable! Even ghost marriages have domestic violence! Of course, ghost marriages are also intolerable!】","【Dying from Laughter (sarcastic): The author's writing is getting more and more absurd, and adapting real-life figures with wild twists might not be appropriate?】","【Passerby A: Reported.】","【Brother Xu is the Handsomest in the World: Due to the commenter having too many comments recently deleted for complaints, this comment is temporarily collapsed [Click to expand comment]】","【Today is Auspicious: So wicked! The Master is so righteous! Ten depth charges!】","【Good Fortune and Great Profit: She really was beaten terribly. Some people simply aren't human. Ten depth charges!】","【Great Profit Today: Truly the scum of Longjiang City! Ten depth charges!】","【A Tree of Red Plum Blossoms Blooms: Emmmm the author really shouldn't make wild assumptions. The official announcement hasn't been released yet.】","【No New Books is Deadly: Hahahahaha, Red Plum Building Owner, why don't you go check Weibo?】","【Scumbag, Get Lost: I really don't understand the comment section. It feels like another world, and I've accidentally stumbled in?】","【Does the Rich Lady Need Another Leg Accessory?: Be bold. Maybe this story is actually a real diary.】","Qi Yingxue had been staying at home recently because her film crew had suspended work and she had few schedules.","She had witnessed Qi Quan's method of reviving Qi Yuan and knew Qi Quan was extraordinary, but she wasn't afraid of being discovered for speaking online, so she continued posting nitpicky negative reviews as usual.","Moreover, she didn't think she was wrong.","Wei Xu's case wasn't closed yet, and the official investigation results hadn't been announced. What gave Qi Quan the right to write whatever she wanted?","Wasn't that spreading rumors?","Considering herself righteous, she thought it was only natural to confront Qi Quan in the comments.","It wasn't until she saw the comment from \"Book Famine is Deadly\" that she suddenly felt a pang of panic.","She hurriedly opened Weibo.","【Longjiang City Public Security V: Recently, an in-depth investigation was conducted into the case of Mr. Wei's fall from the wire. The investigation result is: the wire did break accidentally, not due to human intervention...】","Qi Yingxue didn't have the heart to read the rest.","The officially announced result felt like a heavy slap, stinging her face.","Not human intervention? Could it really be, as described in \"The Rich Family Diary,\" that a ghost did it?","A chill crept up her spine like a snake.","The online sentiment also began to shift because of the official announcement.","【So why did the wire break? Was it the props team's responsibility? Should the film crew be held accountable for the injured actor?】","【Finally dared to speak after holding back for days. I really don't understand, in this day and age, some fans still blame the accident on the \"jinx.\" It's laughable. If Yuan Qing were really that powerful, why is it only your 'gege' who had an accident? Targeted projection?】","【Maybe there really is targeting. Didn't \"The Rich Family Diary\" write that those who enter a ghost marriage are prone to bad luck, and those too close to them are easily affected? Did no one really notice Wei Xu deliberately hugging and holding hands in the video? So disgusting!】","【Watch your mouth. Our Xu-ge is still lying in the hospital. To slander a patient like this shows your character.】","【Exactly, that old woman Yuan Qing, our Xu-ge would never be interested in her.】","【Xu fans really crack me up. Are you really fans? How come you don't even know your Xu-gege has woken up?】","Wei Xu had indeed woken up.","He felt like he had had an extremely terrifying dream. In the dream, he saw a ghastly, pale ghostly face.","That ghost used sharp fingernails to cut his wire.","Excruciating pain swept through his entire body.","\"Xu-ge, you're awake!\" his assistant exclaimed joyfully.","Wei Xu's head was still foggy. He asked hoarsely, \"What time is it? How long have I been asleep?\"","\"Xu-ge, you've been in a coma for over a week.\"","Wei Xu was startled. \"Has... has the role been recast?\"","\"No, the whole production has shut down. Who would they recast?\" The assistant said concernedly, \"You rest well and recover. The role is definitely still yours.\"","\"No, I don't want it anymore,\" he said, his face pale.","He was somewhat superstitious. The ghostly face he saw before the fall lingered in his mind, impossible to forget.","Assistant: \"Xu-ge, you really don't want it?\"","Wei Xu countered, \"What are people saying online now?\"","The assistant was a gossip enthusiast and quickly summarized the events of the past period.","\"You just mentioned, the He family?\"","\"Yes, netizens dug it up. Yuan Qing has connections with the He family and even went grave-sweeping with them.\"","Wei Xu: \"A real ghost marriage?\"","\"Pfft, it's all nonsense written by that Bai Shui Zhen Ren. Don't take it seriously,\" the assistant said, personally disbelieving in ghosts.","But then he heard Wei Xu ask in a trembling voice, \"Is... is there a photo of He Chao?\"","The assistant quickly looked down to search. \"Yes, hold on.\"","He pulled out a photo. It was a picture of the eldest He son from his university days—unremarkable looks, short stature, really quite ordinary.","But Wei Xu's face turned deathly pale.","This was exactly the ghostly face that cut his wire!!!","He demanded in panic, \"Where's my phone!\"","The assistant hurriedly found it and handed it to him. \"Xu-ge, here it is.\"","Without a second thought, Wei Xu logged into his main Weibo account and directly posted.","【Wei Xu V: I have safely woken up. Thank you everyone for your concern and support. I am now aware of the events of these past days. I apologize for not waking up sooner to clarify the situation. @Yuan Qing is an excellent actress. When acting opposite her, I was often drawn into the scene, feeling the emotions between the characters, but I failed to control it properly, leading to some unnecessary misunderstandings. I bow and apologize again! The wire breaking was truly just an accident, my own bad luck.】","As soon as the Weibo went live, fans and netizens exploded.","But Wei Xu felt a weight lift off his shoulders.","He had seen \"He Chao\" with his own eyes. He didn't have the courage to experience another \"accident.\"","Therefore, he had to distance himself from Yuan Qing and could not throw mud at her.","【Oh my god, I'm dying of laughter. I don't know what Xu fans have been jumping around for these days. The man himself has come out to say there's nothing between him and Yuan Qing.】","【Feels like Wei Xu got injured and his EQ increased. Wasn't he always arrogant before?】","【It's so great that Xu-gege has recovered!】","【Xu-gege's acting is so good, he really gets into the character's heart.】","【Hey now, isn't it too early to say everything's settled? Who's gone to apologize to Yuan Qing?】","【No way, no way, people actually believe this? Before your Xu-gege was unconscious, I held back out of humanitarian concern. Now that he's awake, I can finally say it. Pictures below.】","This person's Weibo was pushed to the trending list.","The online wind direction completely changed.","Several GIFs were picked from various variety shows and behind-the-scenes footage.","In the GIFs, Wei Xu wore a \"I'm the hottest\" expression while making inappropriate physical contact with different female artists. He did it subtly, so people watching the videos usually wouldn't pay much attention.","But when clipped out separately, it became quite obvious.","Several female artists showed faintly repulsed expressions but, constrained by being on camera, couldn't make a scene. Even if they complained afterward, given Wei Xu's backing, it would likely come to nothing.","【OMG, he's so greasy and disgusting!】","【Holy crap, that includes my Tian Tian! Heartbroken, crying my eyes out!】","【So damn sleazy. And he's a star? More like bullshit!】","So, Yuan Qing was cursed so badly before, almost had sulfuric acid thrown at her to disfigure her. Has anyone apologized to her? Where are those people now?","【Don't call him Wei Xu anymore, call him the Perverted Ghost.】","【Unfollowed.】","【Unfollowed +1】","【Unfollowed +2】","Wei Xu never expected that his first trending topic after waking up would be \"Wei Xu Get Out of the Entertainment Industry.\"","And he gained a new nickname—Greasy Pervert.","His face turned from pale to green, and he fainted again.","On the internet, some people rushed to Yuan Qing's Weibo to apologize, while others didn't take it to heart.","They didn't think harsh words online could really hurt anyone. If someone was hurt, it just meant they were too fragile.","Some also went to Bai Shui Zhen Ren's Weibo to apologize.","But among the flood of apologetic comments, one particular comment stood out.","【Can someone kind-hearted please help me: Master, can you really tell fortunes? Can you help me find out where my daughter is now? I've been searching for so many years, I'm truly at my wit's end. I would give everything I own if I could just find her! My profile picture is her photo.】","The blogger's profile picture was indeed of a girl, around her teens, with a somewhat lonely and cold expression.","The system, having nothing better to do, liked to help Qi Quan filter through messages. Seeing this comment, it came to ask Qi Quan:","【Boss, are you taking this job?】","Qi Quan clicked open the girl's photo, gave it a glance, and sighed: 【A life full of hardships.】","【You figured it out?】","【Mhm.】","【Will you tell him now?】","Qi Quan shook her head.","【Is it because you want him to pay a deposit first? Wouldn't that make netizens call you cold-hearted?】 The system was a little worried.","Qi Quan chuckled; this system's thoughts were quite human.","She said: 【Judging from the girl's facial features, her parents have been dead for a long time.】","System: ???","Chilling to think about it in detail!"]},{"number":31,"title":"Chapter 31","paragraphs":["Qi Quan paid no mind to the online commotion, simply lying down on her bed and drifting into sleep.","Others, however, were deeply troubled by that particular Weibo comment.","Many people were replying under the post, pleading with Master Bai Shui to perform a divination for that person. Seeing that Master Bai Shui had not responded, trolls seized the opportunity to muddy the waters, posting malicious remarks.","[\"A self-proclaimed 'Master'—how could they possibly have any real skill?\"]","[\"Hah, wrote a poorly crafted supernatural story and really thinks she's a grandmaster now?\"]","[\"Have you all forgotten? She's just a young, ordinary writer. Do you actually believe this?\"]","[\"I just don't get it. These days, beauties don't rely on their looks to gain fans; they have to create personas. This one is even more exaggerated, crafting a 'Taoist master' persona.\"]","Chen Feilu saw these comments and clenched his fists in anger. He was about to log into a burner account to argue with them when he paused, his eyes caught by the avatar of the user \"Please, kind people, help me.\"","Something seemed off.","He enlarged the photo on the avatar. Based on his studies in metaphysics, he scrutinized it carefully, and the more he looked, the more convinced he became that something was wrong.","Worried his skills might not be proficient enough, he hurried to knock on Ning Zhi's door.","\"Ning-ge, have you seen Weibo?\"","Ning Zhi: ?","Chen Feilu facepalmed. Right, Ning-ge doesn't really use Weibo much.","He quickly showed Ning Zhi the photo of the young girl. \"Can you take a look at her facial features? Is there a problem?\"","Ning Zhi glanced at it.","\"Lost both parents at age eight. Thin kinship ties. A life of many hardships. No children in her fate. Her later years will be relatively stable.\"","\"Exactly!\" Chen Feilu said excitedly. \"That's what I saw too.\"","\"So what's the issue?\"","Chen Feilu switched to the interface showing the blogger's comment. \"Look, he says it's his 'daughter.' Isn't that a huge problem?\"","Ning Zhi's brow furrowed slightly. \"He's asking... Senior?\"","\"Right. Now, lots of people under the post are speaking up for him, hoping Master will do a divination for him. But it's obvious this person has issues. If Master replies, it might cause harm to that girl. If she doesn't reply, netizens will just curse her for having no real ability.\"","The more Chen Feilu analyzed, the angrier he got. \"It's so frustrating!\"","\"Can't we just point it out directly?\" Ning Zhi asked.","Chen Feilu was stunned for a moment, then laughed wryly. \"Don't be fooled by how many netizens are now hoping Master will do the divination. In reality, no one would believe it. Even if Master points out this person isn't the girl's parent, as long as this person plays the victim and spins a story, and we can't provide scientific evidence, netizens will just say Master couldn't figure it out and is making excuses.\"","Ning Zhi: \"...\"","So, this problem has no solution?","Chen Feilu said worriedly, \"Master doesn't check Weibo much; she might not even know about this yet. No, I must go to the Lakeside Villa tomorrow and ask her.\"","Early the next morning, Qi Quan leisurely finished her breakfast.","Su Rong said, \"Master, Nuan Nuan is taking the train to Longjing City this morning. I'm going to the station to see her off.\"","\"Go ahead.\"","Truth be told, Qi Quan was somewhat reluctant to see Su Rong leave, as there were quite a few guests scheduled to visit today, and then there would be no one to receive them.","At eight in the morning, the first batch of guests arrived: Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu.","These two were familiar with the place and didn't need special hospitality, but it would be impolite not to offer them even tea.","Just as Qi Quan was about to tell them to help themselves if they were thirsty, a tall, slender figure appeared at the doorway, holding a tea tray. The faint, soothing aroma of tea instantly calmed the visitors' anxious minds.","The young man wore light-colored casual clothes. Stepping in with the morning light, his appearance was exceptionally striking.","He methodically placed the tea tray on the coffee table and, imitating Su Rong's manner, poured tea for Qi Quan and the two guests.","After finishing, he looked up at Qi Quan, his eyes sparkling brightly, seemingly saying, \"Praise me, praise me!\"","System: [Wow, Ling Sheng has learned how to receive guests! What a good boy!]","Qi Quan was equally pleased. A good-looking, well-behaved, and sensible young man truly brought a sense of fondness.","She didn't hold back her praise: \"Well done.\"","Ling Sheng's eyes curved into smiles, his pupils shining with light. After pouring the tea, he didn't leave but stood quietly to the side.","Qi Quan didn't ask him to leave either.","The last time Ning Zhi saw Ling Sheng, he had already sensed the surging spiritual power within him but hadn't thought much of it. Now, he took another look.","\"What is it?\" Qi Quan asked.","Ning Zhi shook his head. He was still young and inexperienced, and didn't think of the legendary constitution.","He simply assumed Ling Sheng was a cultivator of astonishing talent.","\"Master, do you know about the Weibo situation?\" Chen Feilu got straight to the point. \"I suspect someone is deliberately trying to tarnish your reputation.\"","Qi Quan hadn't expected them to come because of this. In her view, it was an extremely trivial matter, yet they took it so much to heart.","She didn't show any particular reaction, but Ling Sheng, standing beside her, lifted his gaze slightly, his lips pressing down a little.","Qi Quan nodded. \"I know.\"","\"What do you plan to do?\" Chen Feilu asked.","Qi Quan countered, \"What are your thoughts?\"","Chen Feilu said, \"Ning-ge and I discussed it on the way here. Perhaps we could ask an authoritative fellow practitioner on Weibo to point it out. That way, netizens wouldn't have much to say.\"","\"That's not a bad approach,\" Qi Quan said with a smile. \"However, there's an even more thorough method.\"","\"What is it?\" Ning Zhi asked curiously.","He couldn't think of anything more reliable.","Qi Quan said earnestly, \"When there's trouble, call the police.\"","The two: ???","\"Since you believe the blogger is problematic and can also divine the girl's general location, why not let the police intervene to investigate and clarify the matter? Then follow the clues to uncover the person hiding behind the internet.\"","Chen Feilu's eyes lit up. \"Right!\"","They had fallen into a fixed mindset, thinking matters of the mystical world had to be solved with mysticism. It never occurred to them that the blogger was just an ordinary person, and letting the police deal with him was sufficient.","Ning Zhi, having grown up within the mystical community, generally didn't consider police involvement in such matters, so the concept wasn't in his mind.","Fortunately, Qi Quan enlightened him.","One shouldn't be too rigid when handling things. If a flexible approach can reach the goal more efficiently, why not take it?","His face was filled with admiration, feeling he still had much to learn.","\"Senior, I could only divine that the girl is in the Qingfeng County area of Longxi City. I couldn't get more specific.\"","Qi Quan nodded. \"That's already quite good.\"","The doorbell rang from the courtyard.","Ling Sheng had just lifted his foot when Chen Feilu darted out, diligently going to open the door.","Ling Sheng lowered his eyelashes and retracted his step.","The system laughed: [Haha, Ling Sheng was going to answer the door, but Chen Feilu beat him to it. What a pity.]","Qi Quan was puzzled: [Pity what?]","[Pity he couldn't earn your favor.]","Qi Quan: ...","She looked up at the young man. Sensing her gaze, Ling Sheng also turned his head. Their eyes met—one pair deep as an abyss, the other clear and luminous.","Qi Quan felt a slight stir in her heart.","Compared to when he first arrived, the young man seemed to have gained more emotion, no longer resembling a cold, ruthless beast.","Was he really trying to please her?","Footsteps from outside the living room pulled her thoughts back.","The visitors were Qian Kun and his family of three. Like previous clients, they brought many gifts.","Mr. Qian had originally been skeptical, but after Ning Zhi performed the ritual, witnessing Qian Kun's spirit return, he had no choice but to believe.","Even if he still held some skepticism, just the fact that Qian Kun had woken up was something he needed to acknowledge.","Ma Yinglan was far more enthusiastic than him.","\"Thank you so much, Master Qi Quan.\" She presented the usual three gifts: a house, a car, and a card.","Since Su Rong wasn't present, Ling Sheng stepped forward to receive them.","Suddenly seeing Ling Sheng's face, she gasped, her eyes lighting up with an expression of awe.","Mr. Qian cleared his throat lightly and also presented gifts separately to Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu: \"Master Ning, Master Chen, we originally planned to visit you personally to express our gratitude. We didn't expect you to be here as well. Thank you both so much this time.\"","Although it was ultimately Qi Quan who resolved... the problem, both Chen Feilu and Ning Zhi contributed their efforts, so thanks were certainly due.","Ma Yinglan snapped back to reality, reluctantly tearing her gaze away from Ling Sheng's face, and smiled apologetically at Qi Quan: \"I read your novel. I didn't know about your abilities before and recommended a mediocre Taoist priest to your mother. I was really showing off my meager skills in front of an expert.\"","When she read the chapter about Xuan Feng, her face burned with embarrassment.","Qian Kun said earnestly, \"Sister Qi Quan, you didn't hold my past disrespect against me and were magnanimous enough to save me. Thank you so much!\"","The matter of the true and false heiresses in the Qi family had become widely known. Back then, Qian Kun and others, influenced by others' attitudes, hadn't taken Qi Quan seriously. Thinking back on it now, he really wanted to slap himself!","\"Sister Qi Quan, from now on, your matters are my matters. Whatever you command, I will not refuse!\"","Young people are always full of fervor.","Qi Quan smiled and asked, \"If the female ghost who harmed you were standing before you now, how would you want to deal with her?\"","\"Ah?\" Qian Kun scratched his head in confusion.","\"She caused your soul to leave your body. If it had gone on too long, you would have lost your life. Don't you want to punish her?\"","Qian Kun thought for a moment, then a look of shame appeared on his face. \"Actually, she didn't really hurt me. She just couldn't stand my lack of ambition. I can understand that. Also, I saw the news... she, she had a pretty tragic fate too.\"","Even after being brutally dismembered, she still didn't forget to study diligently after death. That kind of spirit made him feel utterly ashamed.","He had indeed been recklessly wasting his youth, relying on his family background.","Mr. Qian and Ma Yinglan also sighed softly.","Of course, they resented the female ghost, but no matter what, the ghost hadn't intended to harm anyone, and her death was so miserable. They couldn't bring themselves to wish severe punishment upon her.","\"Forget it. Surviving a great disaster surely brings future blessings,\" Mr. Qian said.","Qi Quan nodded. \"Mr. Qian is right.\"","She took out a prepared brocade pouch and handed it to Qian Kun, saying, \"Inside is a peace talisman I drew. It can protect you from a fatal danger once.\"","The Qian family of three: !!!","By now, they had had ample time to inquire about everything concerning Qi Quan.","They heard that the Zhang family, because they had gifted many talisman papers and cinnabar, received three peace talismans drawn by the Master for free. Those three treasured them immensely, wearing them close to their person everywhere.","The Du and Yang families wanted to buy them but couldn't!","And they had obtained one so easily?","Qian Kun happily accepted it, his smile exceptionally bright. \"Thank you, Sister Qi Quan!\"","As soon as the words left his mouth, a woman in a red dress stepped into the living room. She had a striking, beautiful face, a tall figure, and a pale, bluish-white complexion that carried an eerie allure.","Xue Hong stood before Qian Kun and suddenly bowed deeply, nearly one hundred eighty degrees. If not for the exceptional flexibility of her ghostly form, her waist might have snapped.","Qian Kun was startled and hurriedly took a few steps back.","\"What are you doing?\" He didn't recognize Xue Hong with her restored appearance.","Xue Hong straightened up and said sincerely, \"I'm very sorry. I lured away your soul, causing your parents worry and fear. I never intended to take your life. I had thought about releasing you back when the time came. I am truly sorry. You can punish me however you see fit. I will accept it.\"","\"Ah, you're the female ghost from the woods?\" Qian Kun's face was full of surprise.","He hadn't expected her to be so good-looking. What kind of monster could have brutally murdered her!","He waved his hands hastily. \"It's alright. I know you didn't mean to harm me. It was my fault for saying the wrong thing when I passed through the woods, upsetting you.\"","Putting himself in her shoes, if he had been murdered in the prime of his youth, losing a bright future, and heard someone brazenly talk about indulging in pleasure, he would probably feel uncomfortable too.","One should cherish such precious time!","Xue Hong couldn't help but smile, warmth shining in her eyes. \"Thank you.\"","The human and the ghost reached a reconciliation, and the Qian family of three took their leave.","Xue Hong turned to Qi Quan, her expression serious. \"Let's complete the contract. I'll be your ghost servant.\"","She understood the intent behind Qi Quan giving Qian Kun the peace talisman just now—it was undoubtedly to protect her.","Xue Hong was an orphan who had experienced the fickleness of human relationships since childhood, relying on her own hard work and effort to get into university and pursue a doctorate.","She was beautiful, academically top-notch... and never lacked suitors trying to curry favor with her. But those people's eyes were filled with nothing but desire, very different from Qi Quan's actions just now.","It had to be said, Qi Quan's protection had touched her.","She liked Qi Quan's character and way of doing things, and she liked everyone and every ghost in this villa.","Qi Quan asked, \"Have you thought it through?\"","\"I have,\" Xue Hong said with a smile. \"Your house is full of men. That must be inconvenient sometimes, right? And with only Steward Su, in situations like today, there was no one to take charge.\"","Ling Sheng looked up.","[Our Ling Sheng did perfectly fine!] The system protested on his behalf.","Qi Quan smiled. \"That's true. You taught Ling Sheng well. In just half a day, he learned to proactively serve tea and water and entertain guests.\"","Children should be encouraged when they do things well.","Xue Hong: \"...\"","Although she had only interacted with him for an afternoon, she understood Ling Sheng's nature quite well.","He proactively made tea?","How strange!","She looked at Ling Sheng. The young man's lips were slightly upturned, his eyes bright as he gazed at Qi Quan, seemingly very pleased to hear her praise.","It seemed he was only special towards Qi Quan.","Qi Quan squeezed out a drop of blood from her fingertip. The blood formed a talisman seal in the air, which then sank into Xue Hong's spiritual platform.","The two successfully established the contract.","Xue Hong looked somewhat surprised. \"This contract of yours... is quite in line with core socialist values.\"","Not feudalistic, not capitalistic, very respectful of human rights.","Qi Quan nodded. \"Ours is a relationship of cooperation and mutual benefit. There's no need for bloody suppression. New era, new contract.\"","\"I like you even more now,\" Xue Hong didn't hesitate to express her thoughts.","Ning Zhi, who had been observing, hung his head in guilt.","\"Senior, is your contract with Steward Su also an equal one?\"","Qi Quan: \"Yes.\"","\"I misunderstood you before,\" he apologized sincerely. \"I previously thought you also used the forbidden arts of the mystic realm.\"","Just that you didn't use them to harm people.","He felt deeply remorseful for his narrow-mindedness.","Chen Feilu patted his shoulder. True brothers in hardship—he had also misunderstood the Master before.","He still hadn't gotten over the feeling of guilt.","The two young men wore expressions full of self-reflection, to the point where even Qi Quan felt a bit overwhelmed. Taking their sincerity into account, she asked earnestly:","\"What kind of arts do you consider to be forbidden arts?\"","Ning Zhi answered without thinking, \"Arts that harm people.\"","Chen Feilu, not having been steeped in the traditions of mystic families or sects, had a more flexible way of thinking. He said, \"Perhaps the arts themselves have no inherent good or evil. It depends on how people use them.\"","\"Hmm.\" Qi Quan's smile deepened. \"Let's hear it.\"","\"Take the Peach Blossom Seal as an example. We all know it plunders a person's vitality and fortune. But what if someone couldn't bear to let their loved one go and willingly shared their vitality with them?\"","Ning Zhi shook his head in rebuttal. \"But there's absolutely no benefit to a ghost marriage.\"","Chen Feilu was stumped for a moment.","\"Not necessarily,\" Xue Hong said. \"Perhaps some people have that particular preference, liking to marry ghosts. You have to allow such people to exist.\"","Ning Zhi: \"...\"","Mind blown.jpg","\"What is the Master's esteemed opinion?\" Chen Feilu asked at the right moment.","Qi Quan said, \"Esteemed opinion is not the word. I just think that the development of the mystical arts shouldn't be stuck in the past. It needs to abolish the old and establish the new. Every technique has its own value.\"","The group of people and ghosts listened attentively. Even Qi Zheng, who had no interest in the mystical arts, was quietly standing outside the door.","\"Since the Peach Blossom Seal can seize vitality, naturally it can also provide vitality. If practitioners of the mystical arts encounter a powerful enemy and engage in a group battle, can we, based on the principle of the Peach Blossom Seal, set up a formation that allows sharing vitality and distributing damage? This could minimize casualties to the greatest extent.\"","Usually in such situations, those with lower cultivation levels would die faster.","Some might scoff, thinking if the low-level ones die, they die—they're not much use anyway. But often, low-level practitioners are the new recruits trained by major sects and families... they are the reserve force. Once they suffer losses, it creates a talent gap.","A practitioner's life is very precious.","Chen Feilu had a sudden realization. \"Just like a support role in a game! That way, casualties really can be minimized.\"","He eagerly sought guidance. \"What about the ghost marriage? What kind of modification can be made?\"","\"A truly effective ghost marriage essentially allows a ghost to linger in the mortal world by borrowing a living person's vitality. Moreover, it can closely follow the living person anytime, anywhere, possessing tracking and binding functions.\"","\"I understand.\" Ning Zhi finally grasped the essence, his eyes shining with excitement. \"If my companion and I encounter an enemy, and I'm injured and unable to move, my companion can use the binding function to take me along.\"","The senior truly is a senior, able to transform decay into magic.","This trip to Longjiang City, he had really benefited greatly.","If the official mystical arts team were led by Master Qi, he would join without hesitation!","Chen Feilu clenched his fist excitedly; his thoughts were the same as Ning Zhi's.","Master Qi was truly different.","Amid this lively atmosphere, the doorbell outside the courtyard rang again.","The third group of guests had arrived.","This time, Ling Sheng reacted faster than Chen Feilu. He was at the front courtyard patio almost instantly.","\"Come back!\" Qi Quan commanded in a low voice.","Ling Sheng's steps halted. He turned to look at her, a hint of grievance in his eyes that made one's heart soften involuntarily.","[Big Boss, why not let him open the door?] The system was puzzled.","Qi Quan's expression turned serious. She walked to the patio, stuffed a Concealment Talisman into his pants pocket, and said, \"The newcomers mean trouble. Aren't you really afraid of being tied up like livestock again?\"","Ling Sheng was stunned, staring at her blankly.","\"Go back to your room.\" Qi Quan patted his arm.","An experienced master could tell Ling Sheng's special constitution at a glance. Qi Quan hated trouble more than anything in her life. To avoid causing disputes, she had to keep him well hidden until he could protect himself.","Ling Sheng's slender fingers reached into his pocket, clutching the thin talisman paper tightly.","He had endured for over a decade, almost personally killing Ding Ji at the final moment, but was interrupted by Qi Quan.","Qi Quan's intrusion was an accident.","He wanted to know what kind of greedy, disgusting face this accidental intruder would show him.","But she didn't, not at all.","Perhaps her disguise was too good, so good even he couldn't tell.","He followed her to this villa.","Now in her territory, would she reveal her true nature?","Still, she did not.","For the first time, Ling Sheng felt confused. He was treated like a mute child, forced to complete a set amount of homework every day.","He detested being forced.","But in this matter, he didn't feel as resistant.","\"What are you standing there dumbly for? Go back to your room.\"","Qi Quan's soft, low voice pulled his mind back.","Ling Sheng tightened his grip on the talisman. The icy cold in his eyes seemed to waver for a moment. The corners of his lips curved slightly as he obediently returned to his room.","The feeling of being protected was actually quite nice.","Under Qi Quan's instructions, Xue Hong and Qi Zheng, both ghosts, left the living room.","Chen Feilu was still the one to open the door.","Outside the courtyard stood three people, two men and one woman, dressed in casual clothes with work badges hanging around their necks. The badges faced Chen Feilu, printed with the words \"Master Association.\"","People from the Master Association?","\"What's the matter?\" he asked coldly.","He had clearly seen Master Qi's actions just now. If the Master said the newcomers meant trouble, then they definitely meant trouble. Even if they were from the Master Association, he wouldn't be polite.","Yan Wu stood behind the two staff members, trying to observe the energy flow inside the villa through the open courtyard gate, but it was blocked by a transparent substance.","The villa clearly had a formation set up, likely a protective one, of a high level, something only a master proficient in formations could accomplish.","Could a twenty-two-year-old practitioner really possess such capability?","Yan Wu was skeptical.","...Perhaps she had a powerful backer behind her.","The female staff member said, \"Hello, we are officers from the Master Association. Someone reported that Ms. Qi Quan used mystical methods without a license, violating the association's rules. We're here to inquire.\"","Chen Feilu: \"...\"","What nonsense is this!","Speechless, he let them in.","Yan Wu followed inconspicuously behind, entering the main house's living room.","Only Qi Quan and Ning Zhi remained in the living room, both holding teacups and sipping tea, presenting a picture of leisurely tranquility and peaceful times.","But then, an excited cry suddenly came from the peachwood plaque.","\"It's him! The one at the back is the senior who introduced me to the path back then! His name is Yan Wu!\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","What a coincidence.","She composed herself and said calmly, \"I heard your purpose for coming.\"","Her words stopped the staff member who was about to speak.","The staff of the Master Association are all masters, but those doing clerical work are usually low-level masters. The two staff members who came were only Level Two.","A Level Two master can at most help summon spirits; encountering a Level Three or higher fierce ghost would be hopeless.","The male master couldn't discern Qi Quan's cultivation level and didn't dare be negligent. He said gently, \"Master Qi might not be familiar with the association's rules and failed to register information with the association in time. The association has now discovered this oversight. We ask for Master Qi's cooperation.\"","\"How should I cooperate?\" Qi Quan asked.","The female master smiled. \"Just come with us to the association to register.\"","Qi Quan said nonchalantly, \"Must I go in person?\"","\"Of course.\"","Qi Quan sighed softly. \"What era is it now?\"","\"Pardon?\"","\"Online service portals, online certification processing, haven't you heard of them?\" Qi Quan truly looked down on the conservatism of the mystical arts community. \"The mortal world can achieve efficient and convenient office procedures, yet the mystical arts community doesn't even have a proper online office system?\"","The staff members: \"...\"","Yan Wu: \"...\"","Are young practitioners these days all so fanciful?","Chen Feilu and Ning Zhi tried very hard to hold back their laughter.","The master truly lives up to the title, every word strikes right at the heart.","But this indeed reflects the current state of the Mystic Arts community: stagnant, conservative, with not a shred of innovation.","Qi Quan asked again, \"Is registering my information all that's required?\"","\"No, an on-site level assessment is also needed to issue the Celestial Master certificate.\" The male Celestial Master, reminded, found a ready-made reason. \"Because rating is involved, we need you to make the trip in person.\"","The female Celestial Master quickly nodded in agreement.","\"Oh.\"","The two of them inwardly breathed a huge sigh of relief. It was good that she agreed.","\"How does the Association assess levels?\" Qi Quan asked further.","The male Celestial Master replied, \"Press your palm against the Testing Stone and channel your spiritual energy. The stone will determine the level based on the concentration of the energy.\"","The higher the level of a Celestial Master, the denser the spiritual energy condensed within their body.","Qi Quan posed another soul-searching question, \"Since you're already here, why didn't you bring the Testing Stone with you?\"","\"......\"","The female Celestial Master forced a smile. \"Every Celestial Master is tested this way.\"","The Celestial Master Association, perched high above, would never consider the thoughts of a minor Celestial Master.","Qi Quan's face turned cold. \"When you've installed an online service system that allows for on-site assessments, then I'll consider registering my information.\"","It wasn't that she was unwilling to cooperate.","The Celestial Master Association was merely a balancing zone for power struggles among the sects and major families. At most, the Association had some restraining power over independent practitioners and low-level sects or families, but it held no real authority over those deeply rooted, powerful sects and families.","Moreover, this visit from the Celestial Master Association was merely a tool for someone to come and probe.","She naturally wouldn't play into their hands.","The male Celestial Master felt his dignity was wounded, his tone turning stiff. \"Master Qi, if you refuse to register with the Association, you will be forbidden from using any Mystic Arts methods in the future.\"","\"Oh.\"","The male Celestial Master: \"......\"","Unbearable, he was getting so angry he could barely breathe.","He had never encountered such a stubborn...","such an audacious independent practitioner who dared to defy the Celestial Master Association!","Yes, they had judged her to be an independent practitioner.","Generally, sects and families had their own rosters. After consulting them, they found no record of anyone named Qi Quan.","From this, they concluded that Qi Quan was merely an independent practitioner without sect, family, or backing.","\"In that case, we'll take our leave,\" the female Celestial Master said coldly. \"Ms. Qi Quan, if the Association discovers you privately using Mystic Arts methods to earn money or valuables, you will be penalized according to the 'Celestial Master Regulations.' We hope you'll know better.\"","Qi Quan: \"I won't see you out.\"","After the three left, Ning Zhi immediately said, \"That person who remained silent the whole time is the one we encountered at the hospital entrance yesterday.\"","Chen Feilu was shocked. \"You mean the one who placed the tracking beetle on me?\"","He hadn't paid attention yesterday and had no idea what the troublemaker looked like.","\"Yes, it was him,\" Ning Zhi stated with certainty. \"Today, he used the Celestial Master Association's name to enter the villa for reconnaissance. His intentions are likely sinister.\"","\"So what does he want? Why is he targeting the Master?\"","Ning Zhi frowned. \"The Peach Blossom Seal, the ghost marriage... the forces behind these run deep. Could it be that the major sects and families haven't detected anything at all?\"","\"The Master solved these two cases, so the organization behind them sent someone to investigate?\" Chen Feilu worried. \"They won't harm the Master, will they?\"","Once again, the two young men looked at Qi Quan with anxious faces.","Qi Quan: \"......\"","Did she really seem so easy to bully in their eyes?","\"Su Rong is back,\" she said, trying to divert their attention, but her face turned cold the next second.","A vast surge of spiritual energy blasted toward the area outside the villa.","Outside the villa, Su Rong, returning home, happened to run into the three leaving. Although he had concealed his form, to a Celestial Master, low-level ghosts being visible or invisible made little difference.","Upon sensing a ghost's presence, what should one do?","Of course, capture it!","Su Rong had been practicing ghost arts for some time now, his strength equivalent to a second-level White Ghost. If he encountered a single second-level Celestial Master, he might have had a chance to escape. But facing one sixth-level and two second-level opponents, he was nothing but fish on the chopping block.","Yan Wu was experienced and sharp-eyed. He blurted out, \"He's a ghost servant!\"","Privately keeping a ghost servant was not permitted for Celestial Masters; at least on the surface, it violated the Celestial Master Association's management regulations.","Hearing this, the two Celestial Masters from the Association found a reasonable outlet for their hidden annoyance at Qi Quan's lack of cooperation.","This ghost servant was heading into the villa; it must belong to Qi Quan.","Qi Quan had violated the rules; they had the authority to take her in!","Su Rong instantly grasped their intention. His first thought was to avoid implicating the Master. He decisively fled in the opposite direction.","Would Yan Wu let him go?","A talisman capable of annihilating a fifth-level ghost shot toward Su Rong's back.","A scorching, powerful force nearly enveloped Su Rong. He felt the terror and trembling of his soul facing destruction.","But he did not look back.","At the critical moment, another gentle wave of spiritual energy interposed between him and the talisman. The cool, soothing energy wrapped around his entire being like water, dissolving the searing pain deep within his soul.","It was the Master.","The vast spiritual energy was as ethereal and soft as a misty sea, yet it effortlessly swept away the talisman. The talisman was torn to shreds by spiritual energy fine as a hair, each fragment carrying immense force as it slapped against Yan Wu's face!","Again and again, right in front of the Celestial Master Association staff, merciless and fierce.","Even with his spiritual energy protecting him, Yan Wu couldn't withstand Qi Quan's powerful counterattack. His entire head had swollen into a pig's head, his features barely recognizable.","The male and female Celestial Masters: \"......\"","They took a step back in unison.","Terrifying, utterly terrifying. This was a one-sided beating!","They couldn't afford to provoke a Celestial Master like this!","As the last scrap of talisman paper fluttered to the ground, Yan Wu's face was no longer human. If not for the slight rise and fall of his chest, one might think him dead.","Qi Quan had still let him off.","If you don't let the pawn go...","how can you hook the big fish hiding behind it?","The two from the Celestial Master Association didn't dare linger a moment longer. They hastily picked up Yan Wu and fled the Lakeside Villa at top speed.","Su Rong drifted back into the villa, full of self-reproach.","\"I was discovered.\"","And worse, he had become a liability.","He couldn't always rely on the Master to save him, could he?","Su Rong secretly resolved to practice his ghost arts even more diligently, striving to gain the ability to protect himself.","\"It doesn't matter,\" Qi Quan said, unconcerned about the Celestial Master Association's opinion.","But Ning Zhi shared Su Rong's worry. \"Senior, the Celestial Master Association forbids keeping ghost servants. You've violated the regulations. They will definitely report this to headquarters and send someone to arrest you.\"","\"What kind of lousy association is that?\" Chen Feilu fumed, rolling his eyes. \"They ignore the Peach Blossom Seal harming people, ignore ghost marriages harming people, but insist on policing whether the Master keeps a ghost servant? What kind of logic is that!\"","Ning Zhi: \"Regardless, the Celestial Master Association is powerful. And just now, Senior injured that man. If the person behind him holds a high position, they probably won't let this opportunity slip by.\"","Chen Feilu scratched his head. \"Then what should we do?\"","[That's right, Big Boss, what if they gang up to fight you?] The system also fell into anxiety.","Qi Quan: ...","Every single one of them was a pessimist.","But seeing their genuine concern, she chose to set their minds at ease.","\"Ning Zhi, what is the highest level among current Celestial Masters in the Mystic Arts community?\"","Ning Zhi was taken aback for a moment, then realized something, his heart suddenly pounding wildly.","He stared dumbfounded at Qi Quan. \"Eighth level.\"","The higher the level of a Celestial Master, the more difficult it is to advance. Don't think the gap between the sixth and eighth levels is just two steps; it's separated by countless chasms.","The difference is far greater than that from the first to the sixth level.","Many Celestial Masters stop at the sixth level. Without sufficient luck or innate talent, breaking through the sixth level is likely impossible in one's lifetime.","But even so, in the current metaphysical world, a sixth-level Celestial Master is already considered a first-rate expert, because those at the seventh and eighth levels are reclusive patriarchs who rarely show themselves.","Take their Ning family, for example. The sixth level is already considered a patriarch.","After all, the lifespan of a sixth-level Celestial Master can reach three hundred years.","Qi Quan said with a calm expression, \"Then there's nothing to fear.\"","Ning Zhi: ???","What does that mean?","He had always speculated that Qi Quan's level was at most the sixth level. The sixth level could be further subdivided into three stages. Judging from her few actions that overpowered other sixth-level masters, she had at least reached the second stage of the sixth level.","However, he had still underestimated her.","If even an eighth-level Celestial Master was nothing to fear in her eyes, how profound was her cultivation really?","Chen Feilu was also dumbfounded.","He originally thought Qi Quan was a big shot, but he never imagined she could be an even bigger shot.","Respect, so much respect!","He decided then and there: from now on, he would follow this supreme master. He would endure beatings and scoldings, work hard without complaint, and never go west if told to go east.","\"Master, are you still in need of a disciple who can go to university, has thick skin, and is eloquent?\" Chen Feilu mustered up the courage to ask.","Qi Quan shook her head: \"I don't take disciples.\"","Taking a disciple meant responsibility, and she truly feared trouble.","Chen Feilu's whole person instantly deflated.","\"However,\" Qi Quan changed her tone, \"if you truly wish to enter this profession, I can give you an introductory cultivation method. Once you become a first-level Celestial Master, you can choose a path that suits you among sword techniques, talisman arts, or formation arrays.\"","Chen Feilu was ecstatic. He tried hard to suppress his rising smile and said, \"May I ask presumptuously, which path do you cultivate, Master?\"","Hearing this, Qi Quan smiled slightly but did not answer.","\"Su Rong, contact Officer Han,\" she changed the subject. \"Ask him to come over.\"","Su Rong, holding back a laugh, went to make the call.","Chen Feilu whispered to Ning Zhi, \"What does that mean?\"","Ning Zhi gave him a pitying look: \"The senior excels in all subjects; she has no weaknesses.\"","\"Didn't you say that the metaphysical world has specialized talisman masters, formation masters, and the like?...\" Shock could no longer describe Chen Feilu's feelings.","\"Feilu, you need to accept the existence of a peerless genius.\"","Chen Feilu was stunned for a moment, then suddenly jumped up: \"I accept, I accept! I accept it wholeheartedly!\"","How could he not accept it? He would only be more excited, okay?","Having an all-subject genius master to guide him, what more could he possibly be dissatisfied with?","Hehe.","Hehehe.","Hehehehe.","When Han Mian rushed over, he saw Chen Feilu sitting on the steps by the courtyard, giggling foolishly.","\"What's wrong with him?\"","Su Rong said with a smile, \"Overjoyed.\"","\"......\"","Han Mian stepped into the living room and asked directly, \"Master Qi, what did you need me for?\"","\"Ning Zhi.\" Qi Quan would absolutely not speak if she could avoid it.","Ning Zhi pulled out Weibo and explained the oddities of the \"Please Kind People Help Me\" account to Han Mian.","With years of experience as a criminal investigator, Han Mian's alertness was quite high.","He said gravely, \"I'll have someone investigate the person behind this account and then contact the local police.\"","It was very easy for the police to check someone's background.","Soon, the true identity of \"Please Kind People Help Me\" surfaced.","He was from Longtan City, living in a small county town. A middle-aged man with no proper job, a loafer, who had been to the police station several times for gambling. The local officers were very familiar with his family situation.","He had an older, unmarried son at home, also without a proper job, staying home playing games all day. It was said he was a game booster, but his skills were mediocre, earning very little money.","The family relied entirely on the man's wife, a cleaner, to make ends meet.","\"Does his family not have a daughter?\" Han Mian asked.","The officer said, \"No, just one son. But there is a niece, his elder brother's daughter. This girl's parents died in an accident when she was eight.\"","\"How is his relationship with his niece?\"","\"The niece left after graduating high school. There shouldn't be much contact.\"","Han Mian's eyes darkened. \"Could you help keep an eye on him for me? See who he's been in close contact with recently, anyone suspicious.\"","\"Sure.\"","After ending the call, Han Mian's expression turned somewhat grim.","He had a strange premonition that perhaps this inexplicably appearing man might be connected to the ghost marriage case.","He asked, \"I see more and more people questioning you on Weibo. Do you want to respond?\"","If this person truly had impure motives, perhaps they could trick him, turning his scheme against him.","\"Oh no!\" Chen Feilu suddenly exclaimed, \"Someone on Weibo has already given the answer!\"","Han Mian gritted his teeth. \"Who?\"","\"It's Hengfeng Sect disciple Wei Huanyang. He's gained quite a few fans online through fortune-telling and is quite popular.\" Chen Feilu was very familiar with this \"competitor.\"","Ning Zhi frowned. \"It's him. The closed-door disciple of the Hengfeng Sect's sect leader, twenty-five years old, fourth-level third stage, ranked fourth in the last Metaphysical World Grand Competition.\"","\"......\"","Han Mian couldn't help but say, \"There's a Metaphysical World Grand Competition? It's like a cultivation novel.\"","\"Brother Ning, you never told me about this. What rank did you get in the competition?\"","\"Third.\"","Chen Feilu gave a thumbs up. \"Impressive! And you're five years younger than him!\"","Ning Zhi's lips curled up slightly.","No matter how steady he was, he was only twenty. Receiving praise naturally made him happy.","\"Don't get caught up in compliments just yet,\" Han Mian said. \"Now the girl's address is exposed.\"","Chen Feilu snapped back to reality. \"Right, what should we do now? What's wrong with this Wei Huanyang? Is he an idiot? He's a fourth-level Celestial Master, can't he tell the girl's parents are deceased?\"","Actually, he understood in his heart. How would a lofty Celestial Master care about the life or death of an ordinary person?","What he sought was merely the empty fame of being admired by the masses.","Ning Zhi said decisively, \"I'll go to Longxi City to find that girl.\"","\"I'll go with you.\" Chen Feilu thought it was an unfamiliar place, and having another person would provide some support.","After speaking, the two looked at Qi Quan, seemingly both... somewhat worried.","Qi Quan: ???","\"Senior, please be careful of the Enforcement Division of the Celestial Masters Association,\" Ning Zhi said solemnly.","Qi Quan smiled. \"Alright.\"","After the three left, Qi Quan let out a light sigh of relief. Finally, there were no more matters to trouble her mind.","She left the living room, intending to return to her room to write tonight's update. Ling Sheng approached her, holding a stack of talisman paper in his hand.","To be precise, a stack of Dust-Cleaning Talismans.","He spread out the Dust-Cleaning Talismans and offered them to her.","Qi Quan: ?","System: [Master, didn't you say before that he should learn to draw Dust-Cleaning Talismans to help Butler Su share the housework?]","[Ah, right.]","So, he drew a whole stack?","Seeing her not accepting them, Ling Sheng anxiously tried to stuff them into her hand, his eyes completely filled with the message \"these are very useful.\"","It carried a rather amusing sense of \"every potter praises his own pot.\"","Qi Quan couldn't help it and let out a soft laugh."]},{"number":32,"title":"Chapter 32","paragraphs":["10 PM.","Yuan Qing lay on a hospital bed at Anji Hospital, opening the Screaming app to read the latest chapter of \"The Diary of a Tycoon,\" which had just been updated.","[The businessman who imprisoned the girl is surnamed Hei—I’ll just call him Mr. Hei.","Mr. Hei is a successful entrepreneur with countless assets, a prominent figure in Jiangcheng.","He had a son who died in a tragic accident.","It’s said that this son once obsessively pursued a certain girl, xx.","Perhaps it was out of a desperate love for his son that Mr. Hei committed such a cruel act.","A Taoist master and the police went together to his home.","Mr. and Mrs. Hei were having dinner. Strangely, in their large villa, there wasn’t a single servant in sight. Even stranger, across from their seats was a third set of bowls and chopsticks.","The dishes even showed signs of having been used.","Yet, there was no third person in the villa.","A seasoned police officer asked sharply, “Why is there a third set of bowls and chopsticks?”","Thinking quickly, Mrs. Hei replied, “It’s to remember our son.”","The Taoist master sneered, saying nothing more, and cast a talisman that landed beside Mrs. Hei.","A hoarse scream echoed through the empty living room, and suddenly, another figure appeared!","No—more precisely, a ghost.","His face was exactly the same as the Hei family’s son who had died years ago.","Amid the Hei couple’s anger and terror, the Taoist master subdued the ghost of their son.","Just as they were about to leave, a faint noise came from upstairs.","The Taoist master’s expression changed sharply. “There’s someone upstairs!”","The police rushed up immediately.","In a corner, they discovered a hidden room—a cramped, windowless chamber surrounded by walls on all sides, suffocating and dark.","Even more suffocating was the woman lying on the floor.","She was covered in wounds, a heartbreaking sight.","This wasn’t “a father’s desperate love,” this was “a father turned demon.”","Though xx was rescued, my mood remained heavy. In corners I couldn’t see, there were many more innocent victims like her.","Those around me noticed my gloom and suggested I go out for some fresh air.","The new semester had just started at Jiangcheng University, bustling with youthful energy. There, young students blossomed like sunflowers basking in the sun—passionate, vibrant, and pure.","I never attended university. To survive, I had to start working early, and I often envied the carefree lives of college students.","Taking their advice, I decided to visit Jiangcheng University.","The start of the school year was indeed lively.","I walked along the campus path, flanked by ginkgo trees whose leaves were turning golden as autumn approached.","On the sports field, young people were full of enthusiasm, sweating and giving their all.","The sun blazed overhead.","I moved toward a shady spot under the trees.","Suddenly, a chill, sinister aura drifted from nearby. Under the blazing sun, it felt eerie, sending shivers down my spine.","I turned to look and was stunned.","Under the bright sky, such overwhelming darkness—here, inside this ivory tower of learning.","I hurried over.","The source of the dark energy was a dense, shadowy grove, rarely visited by people.","Following the aura, I found its origin.","Beneath a towering tree, the dark energy spiraled endlessly.","I felt an immense hatred radiating from it.","And rightly so.","Beneath the fertile soil lay a dismembered skeleton.","One could only imagine the suffering it endured in life.","A deep sorrow washed over me. Even this pure campus couldn’t escape the shadow of darkness.","When I got home, my heart remained heavy.","The righteous police officer comforted me, saying, \"There will always be darkness in this world, but we are born to bring light.\"","Looking at his young, innocent face and recalling his sacrifice, I suddenly understood.","Since darkness exists, I must strive to learn and break through those eerie shadows.","I opened the ancient texts on mysticism.","Suddenly, someone reached out to me on social media.","He said his daughter was missing, nowhere to be found, and that he had heard I possessed some mystical skills. He hoped I could help him find her.","Some kind-hearted netizens also urged me to be a good person.","I glanced at the photo of his daughter and stared wide-eyed in shock.","Afraid I had made a mistake, I double-checked many times, but the result was always the same.","This girl’s parents had long since passed away.","]","End of the new chapter.","Yuan Qing read it, laughing and crying at the same time.","The novel was written so simply, but only she could deeply feel the torment of being imprisoned all these years—like an endless hell, burning her soul and will.","And as the story said, there are many others in this world still suffering.","She had been saved by the master, but what about the others?","Yuan Qing’s eyes grew passionate, and she silently made a decision.","She had originally planned to donate money, but her savings were nearly gone, so she settled on leaving a positive comment in the review section to show her gratitude.","And the comment section, stirred up by the latest chapter of *The Heiress Diary*, had already erupted with waves of discussion.","[“If you see me, please call me to prepare lessons: The last line scared me so much! I saw that Weibo post—Master Baishui hasn’t replied, and many people mocked him. Then someone claiming to be a Taoist priest responded. Oh my god! I’m really freaking out!”]","[“Lucky Today: Damn! The girl’s parents are dead, so what’s the person who posted that help request trying to do?”]","[“Great Fortune: That so-called Taoist priest must be crazy! How can he not see the parents are both gone?”]","[“Big Luck Today: So what should we do now? Is the address that idiot gave even correct?”]","[“Literary Drought is Killing Me: Thinking about it deeply is terrifying.”]","[“So Touching: This story always links with Weibo, feels so subtle. Is the author trying to go viral in a bad way? Are the comments all staged? I really don’t get it.”]","[“Lost 20 Pounds in 3 Months: Whether the author is right or not, we should all stay vigilant, right? It would hurt so much if a girl got hurt because of negligence.”]","[“A Plum Blossom in Full Bloom: That Taoist on Weibo actually has a legit priest certificate. The author’s just a novelist—you can’t really believe what they say, can you?”]","Yuan Qing was stunned by one of the comments.","It wasn’t the content that surprised her, but the username.","She had seen that nickname before.","She and Qi Yingxue had collaborated before; they had been guest stars on a variety show, each only participating in one episode.","During a break, Qi Yingxue was probably preparing for her next role and was holding her phone, reading the original novel.","At that time, the website was lagging, and Qi Yingxue grew a bit anxious, trying to switch pages. As she passed by, Yuan Qing caught a glimpse of Qi Yingxue’s personal homepage—the nickname was “A Plum Blossom in Full Bloom.”","Yuan Qing knew the phrase “A Plum Blossom in Full Bloom” from the poem “A Plum Blossom in Full Bloom, Yingxue Opens.”","That nickname left a particularly deep impression on her.","Could “A Plum Blossom in Full Bloom” really be Qi Yingxue?","Over the years, besides acting, she had endured nothing but suffering and hadn’t paid much attention to anything else happening in Longjiang City. But recently, she had vaguely heard about the whole “true and fake heiress” scandal involving the Qi family while on set.","Fans and netizens might be clueless, but she knew the truth about Qi Yingxue’s real identity.","Could the “fake heiress” mentioned in *The Diary of a Wealthy Family* be referring to Qi Yingxue?","Yuan Qing furrowed her brows and began scrolling through the comments under each chapter.","There were comments under every chapter of *A Tree of Red Plum Blossoms*, and almost all of them subtly opposed the author, filled with sarcasm. Yet, Yuan Qing sensed a hint of insecurity behind those words.","In the chapters mentioning the “fake heiress,” the hostility in the comments was especially blatant.","Yuan Qing was ninety percent sure that this “A Tree of Red Plum Blossoms” was none other than Qi Yingxue.","She held no grudge against Qi Yingxue, so logically, she shouldn’t care how the other person commented. But—","The one being slandered and mocked was her lifesaver!","Whether it was shielding her from the acid attack or sending Ning Tianshi and the police to the He family, she could never repay Master Qi’s kindness.","She couldn’t just turn a blind eye.","Earlier, Du Jiaming had been taking care of her here, and they had exchanged contact information...","Given Du Jiaming’s deep admiration for Master Qi, there was no way he would just ignore this.","Du Jiaming had just finished reading the story and was about to leave a detailed comment under *The Diary of a Wealthy Family* when a few messages popped up on his phone.","[Yuan Qing: *[screenshot]*]","[Yuan Qing: I’ve seen Qi Yingxue’s reader nickname before—it’s the same as this one.]","Du Jiaming immediately understood.","Ever since becoming a fan of Master Qi, he had taken it upon himself to patrol the comment sections. Whenever he encountered foul-mouthed users, he would report them, so he was quite familiar with some of the accounts that often posted negative reviews.","This “A Tree of Red Plum Blossoms” always left snarky comments but never crossed the line into outright offensive territory, which made people feel frustrated and helpless.","He had always found this user strange, but seeing Yuan Qing’s message suddenly sparked a revelation.","So that’s it!","No wonder “A Tree of Red Plum Blossoms” always took the side of the fake heiress and harbored an inexplicable hostility toward the story’s true heiress.","Those comments really stood out.","Readers usually empathize with the protagonist, but this person clearly identified with the supporting character.","Du Jiaming sneered coldly. That’s it—Song Lin was still worried his fiancée might be mistreated.","If what the story said wasn’t true, Qi Yingxue would have spoken up and shared her grievances long ago. How could she only leave subtle negative reviews?","He immediately contacted Su Rong.","After clinging to Master Qi’s coattails, he had actively exchanged contact details with Su Rong.","Su Rong was a ghost who didn’t need to sleep at night.","He was fully immersed in cultivating ghost arts when his phone began buzzing nonstop.","[Du Jiaming: *[screenshot]*]","[Du Jiaming: Su Butler, this was sent to me by Yuan Qing. I think this suspicion isn’t baseless. You should decide whether to inform the Master.]","[Du Jiaming: If it really is her, she’s such an ungrateful wretch! The novel wasn’t lying—the Master has suffered so much. Sob sob sob.]","[Du Jiaming: The Master truly repays evil with kindness.]","Su Rong’s expression darkened after reading the messages. There were always these pests slandering the Master.","He had to come up with a way to unmask Qi Yingxue’s alternate identity.","While the comment section was ablaze with heated discussions, the storm on Weibo was no less intense.","Before 10 p.m., the comments under Baishui Zhenren’s Weibo account were almost all ridicule and mockery, while Wei Huanyang of the Hengfeng Sect, who had provided the exact address, gained a lot of followers.","Some even claimed they were going to find the girl to prove Wei Huanyang’s fortune-telling was accurate.","After 10 p.m., the new chapter of *The Diary of a Wealthy Family* was posted on Weibo, and many people were left speechless.","When they read the last sentence, most of the fervent crowd had a bucket of cold water poured over their heads, a chill creeping from the soles of their feet all the way through their bodies.","Those with a clear head calmed down.","If Baishui Zhenren hadn’t been mistaken, then what exactly did the people claiming to be the girl’s parents want?","Yet some still shouted loudly.","“Master Wei was doing his fortune-telling before Baishui Zhenren even knew where she was.”","“Hahaha, isn’t it obvious? Baishui Zhenren said herself—she’s just working a part-time job and never even went to university.”","“A literate person can’t even do fortune-telling? Can she even read all the characters in those mystical classics?”","“Come on, seriously? Is there really someone who believes Master Wei over the author of a supernatural novel?”","“If the girl’s really an orphan, do you think Master Wei wouldn’t have noticed?”","Wei Huanyang really hadn’t noticed.","To be precise, it wasn’t that he couldn’t see it—he simply hadn’t looked carefully.","Of course, even if he had seen the “orphaned” sign in her fate, he wouldn’t have cared whether the person asking had ill intentions.","At first, his Weibo comments were filled with praise, but by midnight, strange remarks began to appear.","“Maybe you should take another look?”","“Master Wei, some say the girl’s parents are dead. Maybe we’re doing more harm than good.”","“I’m really worried now. What if something happens to her?”","Wei Huanyang frowned and took a closer look at the “Please, kind-hearted people, help me” avatar. Indeed, the reading showed “parents deceased.”","He was born into...","Favored, talented, and always surrounded by praise—never once questioned.","So of course, the mistake wasn’t his, but that damned Baishui Zhenren’s!","He let out an angry laugh and posted on Weibo:","“Hengfeng Sect Wei Huanyang V: Minors can be adopted.”","Once he said that, the tide of opinion gradually shifted.","“Yeah, if her biological parents are gone, isn’t it normal to have adoptive parents?”","“Exactly, that Baishui Zhenren’s just stirring up trouble.”","Wei Huanyang relished the feeling. With just one sentence, everyone revolved around him, and those who opposed him were quickly silenced.","While he was basking in this atmosphere, Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu had already arrived at the girl’s residence.","It was an old residential complex, the exterior walls weathered and peeling, the facilities outdated, a six-story building with no elevator.","There was barely any security at the entrance, so the two slipped inside easily.","Just as they reached the foot of the stairwell, a short, sharp scream suddenly pierced the night, startling against the darkness.","The scream abruptly stopped. It wasn’t very loud, and other residents behind doors and walls couldn’t hear clearly. If not for Ning Zhi’s keen hearing, it might have been missed.","He hurried upstairs.","Just reaching the second floor, a figure dashed down quickly. Ning Zhi grabbed them sharply as they brushed past, pinning them against the stair railing, and instructed Chen Feilu, “You go up first and check.”","Before Chen Feilu could move, another figure came running down, wearing slippers and holding a personal alarm.","They were stunned to see the group by the railing.","Chen Feilu pointed to the person pinned against the railing and asked, “Hey, miss, are you chasing after him?”","The person being held down wore a baseball cap and a mask, clutching a phone tightly in his hand, whining, “I didn’t do anything! Let me go!”","The girl, hearing this, grabbed a slipper and started smacking him in the face—over ten times—just to vent her anger. Then she yanked off his hat and mask, revealing a plain, unremarkable face.","“Hand over your phone!” she growled fiercely.","The man sobbed as he handed over the phone. “I-I didn’t mean any harm. I just wanted to prove something.”","“Prove what?” the girl sneered. “That you’re ugly and creepy?”","Chen Feilu sighed inwardly: Wow, this girl is impressive!","The girl unlocked the man’s phone. The screen was still on the camera app. She opened the photo gallery—and there, glaring back at her, were pictures of herself: disheveled hair, no makeup, caught at the worst angles!","Absolutely horrifying.","She pulled out her own phone and, ignoring the man’s desperate pleas, immediately called the police.","Only then did she solemnly thank Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu.","“Alright, spill it. What on earth did you want to prove?” the girl said, tapping the man’s face with the sole of her slipper. “What’s so earth-shattering that you’d do something this crazy in the middle of the night?”","The man: “...”","Ning Zhi twisted his arm and said sternly, “Speak!”","“Ow, ow, ow! Okay, okay, I’m talking!”","“There was a post on Weibo—someone said their daughter was missing and asked a fortune teller to find her. The so-called master gave a specific address, and I was curious if it was accurate.”","Chen Feilu sneered, “And what about the photos?”","“I-I just wanted to share my ‘proof’ with my followers—ah—ow!”","“I think you just wanted to ride the hype,” Chen Feilu rolled his eyes. “Disgusting.”","The girl looked suspicious. “What daughter? What fortune telling?”","Chen Feilu said, “Search ‘Bai Shui Zhen Ren’ on Weibo.”","A few minutes later, the girl put down her phone, furious, and spat out a curse word with perfect timing: “Damn!”","The profile picture of the “Please, kind strangers, help me” post was her photo!","“That Wei guy must be crazy! What does this have to do with him?”","Her tone was sharp. “So what are you two doing here?”","“Uh...”","Before Chen Feilu could come up with an explanation, the police arrived.","All four of them went to the police station.","After hearing the whole story, the officers were utterly speechless.","Superstition is one thing, but going to someone’s home just to prove it?","Knocking on doors and taking photos?","If it weren’t for this girl’s bravery, she’d have been terrified.","The girl’s name was Ma Sisi, twenty-four years old, originally from Longtan City. After graduating high school, she left Longtan City without telling anyone and never contacted any acquaintances.","She said, “The person looking for me on Weibo is my blood uncle. I never expected he wouldn’t give up after all these years.”","Police asked, “Do you know why he’s looking for you?”","“I barely graduated high school when he brought someone home and looked at me with this disgusting look, like I was a piece of meat on a chopping block. I already knew Ma Zhi wasn’t a good person and felt something was off. After they left, I took my household registration and ID and ran away, but I don’t know exactly what they wanted.”","The police officers thought to themselves: This girl is really sharp.","Ma Sisi said again, “Now that he knows where I live, he’s definitely going to come after me.”","Just thinking about it made her furious!","Meanwhile, Chen Feilu and Ning Zhi finished taking the statement and immediately contacted Han Mian.","Han Mian said, “Alright, I’ll get in touch with the local police.”","A moment later, based on Ma Sisi’s description, Han Mian learned the rough appearance of the man Ma Zhi had brought back.","Crew cut, thick eyebrows, triangular eyes, hooked nose, a flesh mole on the right cheek, and very thick lips.","He stared intently at the description, feeling like he had seen this person somewhere before.","“Captain Han, isn’t this the accomplice mentioned in the Huang Qifeng case?” a junior officer said in surprise.","Han Mian suddenly realized.","During the investigation of the Huang Qifeng case, Huang Qifeng had indeed confessed to having an accomplice, but that accomplice had only been involved in a few cases of trafficking women before disappearing without a trace.","The police never managed to track him down.","No one expected to find any trace of him in this case.","Everything is interconnected—philosophy does not deceive.","So, could the suspect who once participated in trafficking women be connected to the ghost marriage case?","“Captain Han, Wang Cui confessed that she had secretly imprisoned Yuan Qing and forced her into a ghost marriage with He Chao. Those injuries were caused by her. He Jianshe handles the company’s affairs and is often away from home; he had no idea.”","Han Mian scoffed, “Clever, very clever.”","But no matter how much she tries to talk her way out of it now, it’s meaningless.","Still, why did Wang Cui suddenly confess?","Of course, Wang Cui didn’t want to admit guilt, but she and her husband couldn’t stay in the police station forever—they had to get out to avenge their son.","What she didn’t expect was that the police had already gathered plenty of evidence of their illegal activities from Yuan Qing’s testimony.","Because Yuan Qing was under their control, they acted with impunity in front of her, assuming she wouldn’t dare to reveal anything. So occasionally, they let slip many secrets behind closed doors.","The police worked day and night to intensify their investigation, finally uncovering the He family’s sordid dealings.","Not only were they involved in the ghost marriage trafficking ring, but they were also implicated in human trafficking.","The crimes were unspeakably vile.","The officers on the case all felt a chill run down their spines.","These villains even had accomplices in hospitals who could check the girls’ exact birth times and then calculate their birth charts. For those whose records were too old to access, other methods were used to obtain the information.","Piece by piece, the facts became clear, the evidence irrefutable. When all of this was laid out before He Jianshe and his wife, they were left speechless.","What awaited them was the death penalty.","This case was far-reaching; even the high-end ghost marriage trafficking ring they uncovered in Longjiang City was just the tip of the iceberg.","Where there are high-end operations, there must also be low-end ones.","A degenerate like He Chao could match with a woman like Yuan Qing—someone with extraordinary fortune and striking looks—but ordinary people seeking ghost marriages had to settle for girls of lesser quality, like in the case Qi Zheng encountered.","Unfortunately, Han Mian and his team still haven't found the business chain behind the \"low-grade ghost marriage.\"","The police released information about the He family couple’s case, but many details were kept vague. They only confirmed that Yuan Qing was illegally detained and intentionally harmed, and that the He couple was suspected of trafficking women.","There was no mention of any supernatural occurrences.","Netizens were outraged.","Are these even human beings?!","Just because your son liked someone while he was alive, you force a ghost marriage on her? Where’s your conscience?","They furiously condemned the He couple while sympathizing with the tormented Yuan Qing.","“No wonder Yuan Qing has seemed a bit off these past few years—she’s been so pitiful.”","“Those who called Yuan Qing a jinx, come out and apologize!”","“Exactly, Goddess Yuan is a victim too, yet she bore all the insults.”","“Wishing the goddess peace and happiness from now on.”","“So, will the previously halted drama resume filming?”","Yuan Qing didn’t respond.","She had made up her mind: if the production continued, she would finish the drama, collect her pay, and then leave the entertainment industry.","She wanted to do something more meaningful.","---","Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan enjoyed a good sleep, then freshened up and changed into comfortable casual clothes. Bathed in the soft morning light, she savored her breakfast.","Handsome men and beautiful women sat on either side of her—a truly pleasing sight.","After the meal, Su Rong reported on the “A Tree of Red Plum Blossoms” incident, suspecting it involved Qi Yingxue. Qi Quan was not surprised.","She had guessed it all along.","She also anticipated that Qi Yingxue’s secret identity would eventually be exposed, but not so quickly—and certainly not by Yuan Qing.","It just goes to show, nothing is set in stone.","“Master, should we take care of this?” Su Rong asked.","Qi Quan mainly wrote to earn longevity; she rarely checked the comment sections and didn’t care much about others’ opinions.","If Su Rong hadn’t brought it up, she might have forgotten about Qi Yingxue altogether.","“Take care of it? What do you have in mind?” she asked.","Su Rong said, “She maliciously slandered you. If we expose her secret identity and let the Qi family know who she really is—”","“She can just use another fake account.”","“...”","Xue Hong, who had been eavesdropping nearby, tucked a stray lock of hair behind her ear and said with a smile, “It’s really simple.”","Su Rong glanced at her.","He used to be the only ghost attendant, the one the Master trusted most. Now there’s another—stronger in ghostly power and able to get closer to the Master thanks to her gender advantage.","He felt a strong sense of threat.","Xue Hong paid no attention to his gaze and said, “A rat hiding in the dark should be brought into the sunlight. How many in the Qi family actually know about this? When she sheds a few fake tears, can twenty-plus years of feelings just be discarded so easily?”","Qi Quan asked with interest, “So?”","“So, let me borrow a few of your guys under your command.”","Qi Quan: Guys under her command?","Did she even have any?","Before long, Du Jiaming, Yang Su, Zhang Chengyan, and Qian Kun were all added to a group chat.","Su Rong was the group owner, and the group was named “Master’s Protection Squad.”","[Qian Kun: What orders does Steward Su have?]","[Du Jiaming: Does the Master have something for us to do?]","[Yang Su: I’m available!]","[Zhang Chengyan: At your service, Master!]","Xue Hong sat beside Su Rong, directing him on what to say.","[Su Rong: It’s not the Master giving orders. I just can’t stand seeing the Master being bullied.]","[Du Jiaming: Got it! It’s about what I told you last night, right?]","[Qian Kun: Huh? What are you hiding from us?]","Su Rong sent a screenshot.","[Yang Su: Uh... I wanted to tag Song Lin here.]","[Zhang Chengyan: Yeah, before he was worried that Qi Yingxue would feel upset reading the novel. And now? Haha.]","[Du Jiaming: What’s the butler Su planning to do? We’ll follow any orders!]","As the team started making their plans, Ling Sheng returned to his room and knocked on the window.","Soon, a little sparrow fluttered down onto the windowsill—round and plump, its feathers glossy and well-groomed.","Ling Sheng gently stroked its tiny head. The sparrow chirped softly, nuzzling straight into his palm.","It absolutely loved the sensation of spiritual energy nourishing its body!","Ling Sheng curved his lips into a slight smile. From the center of his left palm, wisps of black mist began to seep out. The mist swirled slowly at first, then faster and faster, like a miniature whirlwind spinning wildly in a tiny space.","In moments, the black mist condensed into a tiny black bead, about the size of a mung bean. The sparrow easily picked it up in its beak, flapped its wings, and flew out of the lakeside villa.","Inside the main house, Qi Quan, who was practicing cultivation, suddenly opened her eyes.","Outside, the sky was a clear blue, and the round little sparrow disappeared into the horizon.","She propped her chin on her hand, pondering for a moment, then asked the system: [If you find someone doing something bad, what should you do?]","System: [Stop them! Teach them a lesson!]","[What if the one doing bad is Ling Sheng?]","[Impossible!]","[...]","The system, feeling cornered, cautiously asked: [Boss, what did Ling Sheng do?]","Qi Quan smiled: [Nothing much, just childish mischief.]","[That's good then. He's still young, just teach him some more.] The system spoke with a fatherly tone.","Qi Quan: This AI’s obsession with appearances is hopeless.","At the Qi family villa.","Qi Yingxue had gone to bed late last night and was still lying in bed, unable to get up.","Half asleep, she kept hearing a persistent \"tap tap tap\" sound, as if coming from outside the window.","Annoyed, she got up and pulled aside the curtain.","On the windowsill stood a gray sparrow, tilting its little head to look at her, pecking repeatedly at the window frame with its beak.","Qi Yingxue: \"...\"","She tapped on the window, trying to scare the sparrow away.","But this sparrow was no ordinary bird—it showed no fear at all. Its shiny black eyes blinked, and it kept pecking at the window.","Qi Yingxue was utterly speechless. She had no choice but to open the window, hoping to physically shoo away this dream-disturbing sparrow.","As soon as the window opened, the sparrow immediately fluttered inside.","Qi Yingxue was stunned.","What kind of sparrow spirit was this?!","She hurriedly grabbed a piece of clothing and waved it around, trying to drive the sparrow out of the room.","The sparrow flew along the ceiling, always just out of reach. Qi Yingxue ran around, gasping for breath.","No good, she needed to call someone to come and chase it away.","Just as she picked up her phone, the sparrow landed on the floor by the bed. Out of her sight, it dropped the tiny black bead it had been holding into the gap between the headboard and the wall.","With a swoosh, it flew out the window.","Qi Yingxue: \"...\"","After all that commotion, her sleep was completely ruined.","She was heading toward the bathroom when, just as she reached the doorway, her foot suddenly slipped. Her whole body lost control and crashed to the floor, pain forcing a sharp cry from her lips.","Everyone else in the Qi family had already left the house, leaving only the housemaid inside.","Ding Mei was cleaning downstairs when she heard a noise from the second floor. Hesitant, she hurried up and knocked on Qi Yingxue’s door.","“Miss Yingxue?”","Qi Yingxue weakly called out, “Come in and help me up.”","Ding Mei opened the door, surprised to see her fallen without any apparent reason. Her face remained expressionless as she helped her up.","The fall wasn’t serious—just a sharp pain in that moment—but she had mostly recovered by now.","Qi Yingxue let go of Ding Mei’s arm and headed toward the bathroom again.","This time, she didn’t slip.","Seeing she was fine, Ding Mei turned and went back downstairs.","But she hadn’t gone far down the stairs when a piercing scream shattered the quiet, nearly bursting her eardrums.","Ding Mei: “...”","She rushed back upstairs.","Qi Yingxue was crouched on the floor, covering her mouth, toothpaste foam smeared all over her hands, flecked with streaks of fresh blood.","She was utterly helpless.","How could she be so unlucky!","First, she had fallen, and now she’d accidentally nicked her gums while brushing her teeth—pain was unbearable.","Her mouth was filled with the bitter taste of toothpaste mixed with the metallic tang of blood.","Ding Mei cautiously asked, “Do you want me to call the family doctor?”","“...Mm,” Qi Yingxue nodded.","In this situation, Ding Mei really couldn’t do much to help, so she called the doctor.","After a while, Qi Yingxue finished washing up and, dressed in her home clothes, headed downstairs. But just as she was about to step down the last stair, misfortune struck again—her shoe sole slipped, and a sharp pain shot through her ankle. Her body twisted into an awkward position and collapsed onto the cold marble floor with a dull thud.","Qi Yingxue: “...”","Ding Mei: “...”","Well, the family doctor wasn’t enough anymore. It was time to go straight to the hospital.","Qi Yingxue’s left ankle was sprained, swelling high and painful, leaving her unable to walk. Ding Mei had no choice but to carry her to the car.","“Miss Yingxue, maybe you should visit the temple for a blessing?” Ding Mei couldn’t help but suggest.","Since the last time Miss Qi Quan had visited her grandmother, Ding Mei had become a devoted fan of *The Heiress Diaries* and truly believed in Qi Quan’s abilities.","But she knew Miss Yingxue and Miss Qi Quan didn’t get along well, so she didn’t outright mention finding a “master,” instead offering a gentle hint.","She just felt that Miss Yingxue’s string of bad luck so early in the morning was really suspicious.","Qi Yingxue, who had no patience for superstitions, ignored her.","At the hospital, the doctor took an X-ray. Luckily, no bones were broken, but the sprain was severe and required plenty of rest.","On the way home, Qi Yingxue was in a foul mood.","She took a photo of her swollen ankle and sent it to the family group chat, then forwarded it to Song Lin.","After waiting for a while with no response, frustration bubbled up inside her. With no outlet to vent, she opened the Screaming App and browsed through the negative reviews of *The Heiress Diaries*.","Whenever she was in a bad mood, seeing people trash *The Heiress Diaries* always comforted her.","But today, just reading the bad reviews wasn’t enough.","She sneered coldly and tapped into the comment box to start typing.","After just three lines, the car suddenly braked hard. Because she hadn’t fastened her seatbelt in the back seat, her body lurched forward, and at the same time, her phone slipped out of her hand, landing right in Ding Mei’s lap on the front passenger seat.","It was such a coincidence.","Ding Mei lowered her head, and the screen of her phone displayed the comment section under “A Tree of Red Plum Blossoms.”","She was completely stunned.","In the eyes of the fans of *The Diary of the Wealthy Family*, every comment under “A Tree of Red Plum Blossoms” was harsh and abrasive.","Ding Mei was no exception.","Her eyes instinctively scanned the three lines of text—","[To be honest, this story is trash. The writing and plot are terrible. The female lead’s characterization is just ridiculous—either playing the victim nonstop or acting like she’s uneducated and inferior to the adopted daughter. Immature, rude, savage, and what’s with the so-called “Heavenly Master” persona anyway...]","Ding Mei: “...”","She pressed her lips together, about to pretend she hadn’t seen it and hand the phone back to Qi Yingxue, when the driver anxiously said, “The car broke down.”","The car had stalled right in the middle of a busy street, causing a traffic jam.","By chance, a traffic officer was at the intersection and quickly came over, asking, “What happened?”","“The car suddenly died and won’t start,” the driver replied with a worried frown.","It had just been serviced not long ago—what terrible luck!","“Everyone get out of the car and wait for the tow truck,” the officer instructed.","Qi Yingxue retrieved her phone from inside the car, but the screen had already gone dark. She thought Ding Mei hadn’t noticed and let out a sigh of relief.","Ding Mei, phone in hand and wearing a mask, stepped out and helped support her to the roadside.","“Call for another driver from home.”","Ding Mei said, “The other two drivers are with Director Qi and the madam.”","Qi Yingxue: “...”","The sky was gloomy, dark clouds blocking the sun, and a storm seemed imminent. Her mood grew even more restless.","Ding Mei suggested, “Let’s order a ride-share?”","“Okay.”","Qi Yingxue leaned on Ding Mei with one leg supporting her weight. After a string of misfortunes, her anger had reached its breaking point.","She reopened her phone and continued editing her message.","“Qi Yingxue!” Suddenly, a voice nearby called out excitedly, “You’re Qi Yingxue, right?”","...","Qi Yingxue was a rising star over the past two years. She usually took care to stay low-key when out, but today was far from ideal—she was only wearing a mask.","Sharp-eyed fans could recognize their idols even if they turned to dust, let alone just a simple mask.","One fan exclaimed, and soon passersby gathered around.","A celebrity!","Meeting a star in real life was rare, so everyone wanted to get a closer look.","Qi Yingxue’s injured foot made it impossible for her to run.","The crowd grew tighter, and neither Ding Mei nor the driver could hold back the enthusiastic fans. Someone was even live-streaming nearby and rushed over to join the excitement.","In the pushing and shoving, Qi Yingxue stumbled and fell. Her phone slipped out of her hand.","It landed right by the streamer’s feet.","The streamer bent down to pick it up, and the phone’s camera happened to capture the screen of Qi Yingxue’s phone, displaying its contents live.","The chat froze for a moment.","After a while, someone typed:","[Uh...]","[Uh...]","[Uh...]","The live chat viewers lined up with the same reaction.","Qi Yingxue’s emotions snapped instantly.","Her hair fell loose around her face, hands pressing against the ground as she screamed hysterically at the crowd:","“Get away! Get away! Get away!”","Luckily, the traffic officers arrived just in time to disperse the crowd, preventing further harm.","Qi Yingxue broke down in tears.","The speed at which this spread online was staggering.","“Qi Yingxue Breaks Down in Public,” “Popular Young Star Roars and Cries on the Street,” “Qi Yingxue’s True Face Revealed,” “Qi Yingxue’s Sweet Image Shattered”—these topics quickly surged to the top of the trending charts.","Whether it was videos shot by passersby or comments in live streams calling it “A Tree of Red Plum Blossoms,” netizens couldn’t get enough.","Everyone was rushing to the frontlines of gossip and discussion.","“Wow, hasn’t she always had that ethereal fairy image? Gentle, gracious, sweet and lovely—how could she possibly be shouting and crying in public like that?”","“Heh, it’s all just an act.”","“Never thought celebrities read online novels too!”","“That comment sounds a bit malicious, don’t you think? Feels like pure emotional venting. Didn’t expect Qi Yingxue to be like this behind the scenes. I’m done with her.”","“Count me out too.”","“A Tree of Red Plum Blossoms... that nickname sounds so familiar.”","“Maybe you’ve read *The Diary of a Wealthy Family*? Heard the gossip about Bai Shui in real life?”","“No way! *The Diary of a Wealthy Family*?! Qi Yingxue reads it too?”","“I heard from people in the circle that Qi Yingxue is actually a fake heiress. Anyone who’s read *The Diary of a Wealthy Family* knows what that means.”","“No wonder her comments are so vicious.”","When the Qi family found out about the news and returned home, Qi Yingxue had already locked herself in her room, refusing to answer anyone.","Gu Qiao knocked repeatedly but got no response.","“Stop knocking!” Qi Changrong said coldly.","He had already learned the whole story and was filled with anger.","He prided himself on never having treated Qi Yingxue unfairly. Even when their biological daughter came back, nothing in the family changed for Qi Yingxue; if anything, they felt they owed Qi Quan more.","Yet despite all that, she still harbored resentment toward Qi Quan.","On the surface, she was gentle and gracious, but who would have thought she was so sharp behind closed doors?","So, the snide remarks about the fake heiress in *The Diary of a Wealthy Family* were true after all?","Qi Lin frowned deeply, scrolling through the comments from “A Tree of Red Plum Blossoms” chapter by chapter, veins bulging on his arm.","He just couldn’t understand it—he really couldn’t.","Before he finished reading, his phone rang. It was Qi Yuan calling.","Qi Lin answered and put the call on speaker.","“Brother, how’s she doing?” The young voice was a bit hoarse.","Qi Lin said, “You focus on studying in Longjing City. You don’t need to get involved in this.”","After all, this was a matter of morals, not something that would cause serious consequences.","Qi Yuan was silent for a moment before saying, “Brother, I’ve thought a lot about it, but I still don’t quite get it. Even when I was reckless, I knew she had already gotten more than enough compared to Qi Quan. Honestly, the reason I treated Qi Quan that way before was because she told me she was afraid of being abandoned by the family. I just wanted to reassure her.”","But in truth, the family had never wronged her.","The only one they owed was Qi Quan.","What was she really unhappy about?","If she was dissatisfied with *The Diary of a Wealthy Family*, she could have just said so openly. But secretly pulling these stunts? It was really hard to accept.","Gu Qiao and Qi Changrong fell silent after hearing this.","Qi Lin said, “Last time at the hospital, when Qi Quan went to treat you, didn’t you notice what Qi Yingxue said back then?”","“...”","Qi Yuan obviously caught on.","But shattering the lens he’d held for eighteen years was just too difficult.","But when it comes down to it, the ones truly to blame are none other than themselves—they were the ones who pushed Qi Quan away with their own hands.","Qi Yingxue’s situation was like a sharp slap across their faces, a harsh wake-up call.","Three months ago, that cautious girl who had just returned home was forced, by their neglect and indifference, to don a hardened armor and sever ties with them with the coldest expression.","Who else could they blame?","Lakeside Villa.","A little sparrow pecked at some grains on the windowsill, its feathers slightly fluffed, looking relaxed and comfortable.","Ling Sheng finished a set of practice papers, put down his pen, and gazed out the window. After a moment of deep thought, he rose and headed toward the main house.","Inside the east wing, Su Rong was staring blankly at her phone.","The small team members were stuffing themselves with gossip.","[Du Jiaming: What’s going on? We just finalized the plan, and Qi Yingxue’s secret identity got exposed?]","[Yang Su: Who did it?]","[Zhang Chengyan: Probably fate. No coincidence here.]","[Qian Kun: But this fate is even more perfect than our plan.]","[Du Jiaming: Indeed, maybe even heaven couldn’t stand her secretly bullying the Master.]","[Zhang Chengyan: By the way, do you think the Master really didn’t know before?]","[Qian Kun: ......]","[Yang Su: ......]","[Su Rong: The Master has no time to care.]","[Zhang Chengyan: Ah, I meant the Master is broad-minded and noble, totally indifferent to this. I’m not saying the Master did it.]","Su Rong glanced over at Xue Hong.","Xue Hong rolled her eyes. “Do you think I’d bother going out of my way?”","She found it strange too.","It seemed someone had beaten them to it and exposed Qi Yingxue’s secret identity first.","Why?","Putting themselves in their shoes, it was obviously to protect the Master, to prevent him from being hurt.","So, who was the one working behind the scenes?","She didn’t believe in accidents or coincidences. Qi Yingxue’s sudden downfall had to be because she’d gotten involved with something dirty—a streak of bad luck.","Outside the main bedroom, a young man lightly knocked on the door.","Qi Quan paused his training. “Come in.”","The door opened, and the young man stepped onto the soft carpet.","He looked at Qi Quan with bright, sparkling eyes, like a child hoping for praise.","Qi Quan smiled.","Should she praise him for a job well done?","She sat down on the carpet by the floor-to-ceiling window and beckoned him over.","The young man obediently came forward and knelt down. In his clear, transparent eyes, storm clouds were gathering.","But the clouds couldn’t fully block out the sunlight. The stubborn rays pierced through the gloom, casting golden light onto the earth.","She reached out and gently ruffled Ling Sheng’s fine, soft hair.","“Well done.”"]},{"number":33,"title":"Chapter 33","paragraphs":["The villa was set up with formations, so very little could escape Qi Quan's notice. She knew Ling Sheng had summoned a little sparrow and was aware of its destination.","In the original story, Qi Yingxue's disguise fooled everyone. In contrast, the real heiress appeared impulsive, thoughtless, foolish, and unreasonable.","However, aside from that, she hadn't committed any more grievous sins. A bit of bad luck was sufficient to settle that karmic debt.","\"Thank you for helping me vent my anger. She has received her due lesson; that's enough,\" Qi Quan said with a smile.","Her eyes held a gentle warmth, shining brightly like flawless gemstones.","Ling Sheng's lips involuntarily curved upwards, his eyes and brows coming alive with vivid expression.","In front of Qi Quan, he conjured a wisp of black energy in his palm, sent it forth, and a few seconds later, drew it back in.","System: [Big shot, what does that mean?]","Qi Quan: [It means he has retrieved the bad luck he sent to Qi Yingxue.]","[Oh, I see. Why does he still not speak?]","Qi Quan glanced at the young man's neck. When he was trapped in the cave, a tiny locking collar had clamped around his neck, biting deep into his flesh—a torment beyond ordinary endurance.","Yet he had borne it for over a decade.","If not for the powerful self-healing ability of his innate spiritual body, he would have been deformed long ago.","\"Master, Officer Han is here to see you.\" Su Rong's gentle voice sounded from outside the room.","Qi Quan: \"Understood.\"","She stood up and left the room, with Ling Sheng following closely behind her.","Qi Quan paused, turning to look at him: \"Have you finished today's homework?\"","Ling Sheng: \"...\"","He lowered his head dejectedly and changed direction.","Qi Quan entered the living room to see Han Mian.","Han Mian had come with a request.","He had been busy with the case these past few days, his eyes bloodshot, his voice hoarse from exhaustion.","“Master Qi, Master Ning and the others have seen that girl. We plan to go along with the scheme, pretending to be Ma Sisi returning to Longtan City, and follow the clues of her uncle Ma Zhi. Master Ning says there's an illusion technique in the mystical arts community that can disguise someone as another person, and he can perform it. But this case most likely involves the mystical arts community. If we encounter a master from that world, we'll probably be seen through.”","\"And so?\" she prompted.","\"So, could you possibly spare the time to come with us to Longtan City?\" Han Mian asked, his tone apologetic.","Qi Quan: ...","[Big shot, you really want to refuse, don't you?] The system, now quite familiar with her homebody nature, guessed.","[Longtan City is so far away.]","System: Pfft.","Actually, it was only just over two hours by car.","Qi Quan held her teacup: \"Ning Zhi is capable enough.\"","\"Master Ning says a Level Four Master is too weak. If we encounter a formidable opponent, he's afraid he won't be able to handle it,\" Han Mian explained, equally helpless.","He never imagined he'd one day be handling cases like this.","Qi Quan: ...","Since when could a Level Four Master be considered \"too weak\"?","[Big shot, think about it. Since Ning Zhi came to Longjiang City, every master he's met has been Level Four or above. The weakest, Qin Ruo, is Level Four. Ding Ji and Yan Wu are Level Six. And you, well, we won't even go there.]","How could that not be a blow to his confidence?","Qi Quan: ...","The system teased: [Big shot, do you still have material for your novel? Maybe you should go out, get some inspiration, do some field research.]","Qi Quan: That makes sense.","\"The Diary of a Wealthy Family\" was now her lifeline. For the sake of her little life, she should indeed take a trip.","\"Alright, I'll go with you.\"","Han Mian felt a wave of relief.","\"Officer Han, please wait outside for a moment. I have a few words for my household.\"","Han Mian complied and stepped out.","Qi Quan gathered the three ghosts and one person in the living room for a small meeting.","\"I'm going to Longtan City. While I'm away, everyone listen to Steward Su. It's best not to leave the villa before I return. The villa's formations can withstand attacks from masters below Level Eight.\"","Su Rong understood: \"The Mystical Arts Association lost face yesterday; they'll definitely try to reclaim it.\"","\"How many days will you be gone?\" Xue Hong smoothed the hem of her black dress.","Qi Quan: \"It depends on the situation.\"","\"Master, are you going to catch criminals?\" Qi Zheng's eyes lit up.","Qi Quan nodded.","\"Great!\"","\"And you,\" Qi Quan looked at Ling Sheng, \"for now, don't use your spiritual power casually. Focus on your studies.\"","Ling Sheng blinked his eyelashes, indicating he understood.","[Sigh, probably won't see Ling Sheng for several days. Heartbreaking.] The system mumbled sadly.","Qi Quan stood up: \"That's all. Meeting adjourned.\"","\"Master.\" Su Rong stopped her, bringing a wooden lunchbox from the kitchen. \"I made some pastries for the road.\"","System: [Wow, Steward Su is so thoughtful! Love it!]","Qi Quan: [So, do you love Steward Su or Ling Sheng?]","She took the box with a smile. \"Thank you for your trouble.\"","[Can't I love both?] The system was conflicted.","Ling Sheng, seeing the smile on her face, seemed thoughtful.","Traveling light, as Qi Quan passed through the front courtyard's skywell, someone suddenly tugged her sleeve.","It was Ling Sheng.","He handed Qi Quan a white jade pendant.","The pendant was palm-sized, square, with a little sparrow carved on the front. The rest was smooth and polished.","The jade was probably from the household treasury.","Qi Quan was never stingy with her own people. Everyone could basically use the things in the house, just needing to apply in advance to Su Rong, who managed the treasury.","[Big shot, why is Ling Sheng giving you a jade pendant?]","[It contains a significant amount of spiritual energy. It can be a lifesaver in a critical moment.]","System: [Wow! I love Ling Sheng so much!]","Qi Quan accepted Ling Sheng's thoughtful gift and asked with a smile, \"Did you carve the sparrow yourself?\"","Ling Sheng nodded.","\"It's very well done.\"","Ling Sheng showed obvious delight. His pupils were a shade lighter than most people's, making them seem exceptionally clear. They reflected Qi Quan's image, holding her within their small space.","\"I'm leaving.\" Seeing him so obedient and endearing, Qi Quan couldn't help but reach out and gently pinch his cheek.","Ling Sheng nodded.","Qi Quan turned decisively and gradually disappeared beyond the courtyard gate.","After she left, both the people and ghosts in the house felt a gaping emptiness, lacking the spirit for anything.","\"I'll go cultivate,\" Su Rong said, returning to his room.","For him, Qi Quan came first, cultivation second.","Xue Hong sighed softly, \"I'll go read. Ling Sheng, remember to do your practice papers.\"","Qi Zheng scratched his head, \"Then I'll watch TV.\"","The three ghosts dispersed. Ling Sheng returned to his room, worked on his papers for a while, then silently opened the tablet used for his lessons and started searching for cooking videos.","Qi Quan rode in the same car as Han Mian.","Since arriving in this world, this was her first time traveling so far.","From Longjiang City to Longtan City, the journey was over two hundred kilometers. The scenery along the highway wasn't particularly noteworthy.","Qi Quan leaned back in her seat, drowsy.","The system suddenly exclaimed: [Big shot! If you're on a business trip, what about your novel updates!]","Qi Quan said lazily: [I'll take a leave.]","Do you still have to write while on a business trip?","[No, you can't always take leaves. You're an author, you need to be responsible to your readers!] The system, being a writing assistant system, cared deeply about this.","Qi Quan found an excuse: [I didn't bring my laptop.]","[You can write on your phone!]","[...]","She automatically blocked out that statement and began circulating her spiritual energy to cultivate.","The system had to admit, although its host was overly lazy when it came to writing, she was absolutely more diligent than anyone in cultivation, truly practicing at every possible moment.","Top talent coupled with diligence—it's clear that such a high level of cultivation wasn't achieved for nothing.","By the time they reached the Longtan City expressway exit, it was already four in the afternoon.","The car slowed down as they began to pass through the ETC lane.","Han Mian, sitting in the passenger seat, turned his head and called out to Qi Quan.","Qi Quan opened his eyes.","\"Master, we're about to get off the expressway. Just now, our colleagues from another unit sent me a message. Ma Zhi has already bought a ticket online to Longxi City. He plans to go find Ma Sisi using the address provided by Wei Huanyang.\"","Although Wei Huanyang had given the address yesterday, Ma Zhi was so addicted to gambling that he only remembered it after losing all his money. This coincidence gave Han Mian and his team just enough time.","Qi Quan nodded. \"Then let's get there as soon as possible.\"","The young police officer driving couldn't help but ask, \"Captain Han, I don't really understand. That Wei Huanyang could divine the address, but couldn't tell that Ma Sisi's parents are deceased? And leaking a citizen's private information—isn't that illegal? Isn't he afraid of getting arrested?\"","Han Mian frowned. \"Probably.\"","He actually understood the mindset of people like that.","He had handled many cases, quite a few involving high-society individuals. Most of these people were arrogant and looked down on ordinary folks; they simply wouldn't consider such \"minor details.\"","If those who merely possessed wealth were like this, how much more so those from the mystical world with special abilities?","For those with extraordinary skills, mundane laws likely held no binding power at all.","Wei Huanyang was just a reflection of most people in the mystical community.","However, there were exceptions.","Like the utterly sincere Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu, or the seemingly lazy and indifferent yet actually kind and benevolent Qi Quan.","If the authorities really decided to establish their own team of masters, these three were definitely ones to recruit.","\"Huh?\" The young officer exclaimed in surprise, looking ahead and keenly sensing something wrong. \"Why has fog suddenly appeared?\"","Qi Quan glanced over and lightly tapped the car window. His spiritual power transformed into several fine needles, piercing into the fog ahead. After a few soft pfft sounds, the fog completely dissipated, almost as if it were fleeing in a hurry.","It was really like seeing a ghost.","Han Mian helplessly rubbed his forehead. Since he started handling supernatural cases, his worldview had begun to crumble.","Now he could even personify fog.","\"Master, what was that just now?\" he asked.","Qi Quan replied, \"Just a roadblock set up by some ghosts and monsters.\"","\"A roadblock?\"","\"Don't you have to pay when passing through a toll booth on the expressway?\"","The young officer was confused. \"Didn't it already get deducted just now?\"","\"The systems of the living world and the spirit world are separate.\"","\"Then why should they collect money from us in the living world?\" The young officer widened his eyes. That was just too unreasonable.","Qi Quan looked at the aggrieved, fleeing fog and smiled. \"Maybe they could tell you guys are kind-hearted and easy to bully.\"","\"...\"","The eerie fog was just a minor episode. The car smoothly merged into the city's main road.","Compared to Longjiang City, Longtan City's economy was slightly less developed. Not only were there fewer lanes, but they were also particularly narrow.","Ma Zhi lived in an old, run-down neighborhood in the west of the city.","When they arrived, Ma Zhi happened to be rushing out of the neighborhood with a bag in hand, his son in tow.","Qi Quan had looked at recent photos of Ma Sisi. He cast an illusion spell on his face, transforming it into Ma Sisi's appearance.","\"Incredible! Truly incredible!\" the young officer exclaimed in amazement.","Qi Quan got out of the car alone, turned the street corner, and came face-to-face with Ma Zhi and his son.","The moment the two saw her, it was as if they had spotted a gold ingot.","\"Sisi!\" Ma Zhi greeted her with a beaming face. \"It really is Sisi! Haven't seen you in so many years, you've become so pretty.\"","Ma Zhi's son said with a snotty tone, \"So you're back? Couldn't make it out there?\"","He looked over Qi Quan's clothes, a hint of disdain flashing in his eyes. Qi Quan, for convenience, was only wearing a gray tracksuit she had made herself. It had no brand label. Ma Zhi's son, seeing no logo, assumed it was just cheap street-market stuff.","Accustomed to comparing himself to others, he instinctively assessed his long-lost cousin.","Qi Quan wasn't good at acting. Keeping a straight face, she said stiffly, \"Wasn't it you who deliberately posted pitiful stories online to find me? If I hadn't come back, were you planning to go to Longxi City? I came back this time specifically to find out: what do you want, pretending to be my parents?\"","\"Look at you, what kind of talk is that?\" Ma Zhi, thinking she really had seen the posts online, put on a slick smile. \"Your dad... was my brother. You're my niece. Round it off, aren't you just like my own daughter? Since you're back, let's go home first. Your aunt will make something nice for dinner tonight.\"","Qi Quan said, \"Oh.\"","[Master, your acting is really stiff,] the system quietly complained.","Qi Quan: [In my past life, I never participated in missions like this.]","[Ha ha ha, was it because your acting was too poor?]","[No, it was because I had plenty of talented people under me.]","System: Ah, got shown up.","Fortunately, Ma Zhi and his son didn't care about her attitude. After so many years apart, it was normal for the relationship to be distant and cold.","Anyway, she was just a girl. Now that she was back, could she possibly run away again?","The neighborhood was very old. A garbage shed was built to the side of the entrance. Trash was piled way outside with no one managing it. Flies buzzed incessantly, and the stench was overwhelming.","The system felt a bit sorry for her. [Master, this must be hard for you.]","[Hard? Why?]","[This place is so dirty and messy!]","Qi Quan: [Oh, it's okay.]","[This is just 'okay'?]","[Yeah. I've been to real landfills, working in piles of garbage.]","System: Oh... that...","It wasn't that it was prejudiced, but ever since it bound with its host, the host had always appeared lazy, casual, and particularly fond of comfort—not someone who seemed like they could handle dirty, hard work.","So it had been narrow-minded.","[Master, I'm sorry. I shouldn't have questioned your professionalism.]","[Hmm?]","[You are a dedicated and professional master!]","Qi Quan: That's really not necessary.","The Ma family lived on the third floor. The apartment was small, about fifty square meters, with two bedrooms. The layout was very cramped; with a few people standing together, there was hardly room to turn around.","The home was a mess. The coffee table was piled high with shells from sunflower seeds and peanuts. Crushed beer cans were casually thrown next to the sofa, and a cigarette butt was even stuffed into the seam of the sofa cushion.","A strange odor filled the room.","System: Numb.","Qi Quan glanced around, saw no place to sit, and showed a hint of subtle disgust.","\"Your aunt is lazy; she hasn't cleaned up,\" Ma Zhi said hypocritically, wiping a chair with a napkin. \"It's clean now. Sit, Sisi.\"","System: [He's so shameless! He's clearly the lazy one! A father and son relying on a woman to support the family, and still slandering her like this. So despicable!]","Qi Quan sometimes thought sending the system to teach ethics classes in school wouldn't be out of place.","She pulled out several napkins in a row, meticulously covered the entire seat of the chair, and only then sat down.","Ma Zhi and his son: ???","\"Sisi, when did you become so particular?\" Ma Zhi's son, his face covered in acne scars, looked at Qi Quan with a highly disrespectful gaze. \"You've become very different.\"","Although Qi Quan wore the relatively ordinary face of Ma Sisi, the aura surrounding her couldn't be concealed.","It was normal for Ma Zhi's son to have such doubts.","\"Enough nonsense. Tell me, why were you looking for me?\" Qi Quan asked, maintaining her expression.","Ma Zhi sighed softly, \"When you get old, you always end up reminiscing about the past. The other day, I saw a photo of your dad and suddenly remembered our childhood days, and I really missed him. You're his only flesh and blood, I... I...\"","As he spoke, he choked up and began wiping away tears.","System: [Such acting talent, wasted on him.]","[He's ugly, so not a waste.]","System: Boss is as sharp-tongued as ever.","\"Oh.\" Qi Quan responded coldly, making a move to stand up. \"Well, now you've seen me. I should be going back.\"","\"Don't! You've finally come back. Stay at least one night. Your aunt hasn't even seen you yet.\" Ma Zhi hurriedly stopped her. \"Ajun, look after Sisi. I'm going out to buy some braised dishes and some meat for dinner to welcome Sisi home.\"","Ma Jun naturally nodded in agreement.","The door opened and closed, leaving only Qi Quan and Ma Jun in the room.","Ma Jun asked with a smile, \"Sisi, do you have a boyfriend?\"","\"No.\"","\"No is good, no is good.\" He chuckled. \"You're still young, don't get fooled by anyone. Why not find someone here in your hometown? You'd know their background, and with family around to keep an eye out, nothing could go wrong.\"","Qi Quan: \"You don't even have anyone yourself.\"","Ma Jun: \"...\" Ouch, that hurt.","He was almost thirty, had achieved nothing, his family was poor, and his looks were... less than pleasing to the eye. Finding a partner was simply impossible.","But now \"Ma Sisi\" was back.","Elsewhere, Ma Zhi went downstairs, passed the garbage room, and headed towards the nearby market while dialing a number.","\"Brother Liang, it's me, Ma Zhi.\"","\"Brother Liang, are you free tonight? Come over for dinner.\"","\"You have plans?\" Ma Zhi said with a grin. \"But if you don't come to my place, what if the 'goods' get lost again?\"","\"That's right, found her.\"","\"Okay, it's settled then. Yes, yes, yes, don't you worry one bit, she won't run.\"","Not long after, dusk began to fall.","Qi Quan sat quietly on a chair, cultivating. Ma Jun, meanwhile, made small talk, chattering incessantly in her ear. She occasionally hummed in response, but in truth, she wasn't listening at all.","\"By the way, have you heard about the 'Six-Year-Old Ghost Child Appearing in a Dream' case? It happened in Ningtao County in our city. A child was killed in Chihe Village. Seventeen years later, he appeared in his father's dream, and the father actually found the remains based on it. Isn't that bizarre?\"","Qi Quan: ...","Yeah, quite bizarre indeed.","Ma Jun said enthusiastically, \"To be honest, I feel like Ningtao County over there really has a creepy vibe. There might actually be some ghosts or monsters.\"","\"How so?\" Qi Quan handed him the conversational lead.","Seeing her interest, Ma Jun got more excited: \"You know that mountain in Ningtao County, right? Last night, a few middle schoolers apparently went into the mountains on a dare, and then went missing. Some teachers and parents went looking for them, and they went missing too. The situation blew up, the government sent a lot of rescue personnel, but who knew they'd lose contact after going in. Spooky, right?\"","He couldn't help but pull out a cigarette, about to put it in his mouth and light it, but his peripheral vision caught Qi Quan pretending to leave, so he quickly stuffed it back.","\"Don't go, I won't smoke.\"","Qi Quan sat back down; it had just been a feint.","Footsteps sounded outside the door, heavy and labored, as if each step up the stairs drained all their strength.","The footsteps stopped at the door. A key went into the lock, the cylinder turned with a click, and the door opened.","A woman stood outside.","She wore a dirty shirt and pants, thin as a rail, with messy hair showing a few gray strands. The wrinkles at the corners of her eyes were full of hardship and a certain numbness.","Yet, upon seeing Ma Jun, a trace of a kind smile appeared.","Ma Jun didn't appreciate it, his tone harsh: \"Ugh, what's that on you? It stinks. Also, this is Sisi. Sisi, remember? She's back. We're having dinner at home tonight. Dad went to buy groceries. You should clean up the place before he gets back. It's filthy!\"","\"Alright! I'll clean up right away!\" The woman stepped inside, not even glancing at Qi Quan, and rushed straight to the balcony to grab a broom and dustpan.","System: [I'm furious!]","System: [These two Ma's are parasites of society! Scum! Do they treat their wife and mother like slaves?]","System: [And now they want to sell Ma Sisi for money!]","It simply couldn't bear it!","Qi Quan couldn't help but smile. The system could be quite adorable sometimes.","By the time the woman finished cleaning the living room, dragging her exhausted body, Ma Zhi returned.","Behind him followed a man with a fleshy mole on his face.","His aura was ordinary, not someone from the Mystic Arts world.","\"Sisi, this is Uncle Liang. Remember him? You've met before.\"","Qi Quan said coldly, \"I don't remember.\"","Han Mian had given her a detailed introduction to Ma Sisi's situation on the way. Back then, it was this man with the mole who came to her home, looking her over with an appraising gaze, as if she were goods.","Ma Sisi had been orphaned young; surviving this long wasn't just luck.","...She was a smart girl. She hadn't shown anything at the time, but after they left, she quietly ran away.","So all these years, Ma Zhi only thought Ma Sisi had simply planned to go out and work, unaware that Ma Sisi had seen right through his intentions.","Wu Liang grinned, revealing a mouthful of yellow teeth.","\"Already 24, huh.\"","It seemed like casual chat, but Ma Zhi caught his meaning.","He thought she was too old and wanted to lower the price.","He hurriedly said, \"Only 24, still fine.\"","\"Hey, Uncle Liang, Sisi has never been in a relationship,\" Ma Jun stepped forward, a hint of greed in his eyes. \"You gotta help our Sisi find a good match, none of the bad ones.\"","Wu Liang pulled a cigarette from his pocket: \"Easy enough.\"","Seeing the lighter approach the cigarette, Ma Jun immediately grabbed Wu Liang's hand, laughing it off: \"Uncle Liang, it's stuffy inside. How about we go out for a smoke?\"","Wu Liang glanced at him. \"Alright.\"","The two went downstairs.","\"Uncle Liang, I guarantee she's untouched. Think you can give me a good price?\" Ma Jun fawned over him, lighting his cigarette.","Qi Quan extended her spiritual sense downstairs, hearing everything clearly.","\"How much do you want?\" Wu Liang asked, puffing smoke with a profound look.","Ma Jun held up a hand with all five fingers spread.","\"You really dare to ask!\" Wu Liang sneered.","Fifty thousand? Did he take him for a fool?","Qi Quan: Is fifty thousand a lot?","Is a person's future and fate only worth fifty thousand?","\"Uncle Liang, money isn't worth much these days. What can fifty thousand even do? At most buy a second-hand no-name car.\"","Wu Liang: \"Depends on whether the other side is satisfied.\"","\"Deal.\"","After finishing their smoke, the two went back upstairs.","Qi Quan was truly fed up and had no intention of staying for dinner. She said, \"I have some things to attend to. I'm leaving first.\"","\"Don't! You haven't eaten yet!\" In his anxiety, Ma Zhi reached out with his greasy, rough hand to grab her.","Qi Quan sidestepped to avoid it, her expression icy.","Seeing her so uncooperative, the three men in the house naturally wouldn't just let her go.","Wu Liang and Ma Zhi exchanged a look. Suddenly, Wu Liang pulled a talisman from his pocket and threw it at Qi Quan.","Qi Quan: ...","System: ...","That's it? Seriously?","It was a Mystic Arts Confusion Talisman. Back then, Qi Zheng fell into the lake precisely because Yan Wu had stuck one of these on him.","System: [This really is... showing off one's skill with the axe before Lu Ban, the master carpenter!]","Qi Quan played along with their act and, under the guidance of the Confusion Talisman, began walking in the direction they had intended.","She went downstairs, left the residential complex, hailed a taxi, and under the influence of the bewitching talisman, said, \"To Zhuying New Village.\"","Zhuying New Village was in the east of the city. Taking the city roads, it would take about an hour.","The driver, afraid the journey would be boring, asked, \"Mind if I turn on the radio?\"","\"Not at all.\"","The radio was broadcasting news: [\"...Students from Ningtao County First High School have gone missing in Yao Mountain. Parents and teachers who entered the mountain to search have also disappeared. The county public security bureau and fire department dispatched dozens of rescue personnel into the mountain for search and rescue, but they too have lost contact and their whereabouts are unknown...\"]","This news was the same as what Ma Jun had said.","The taxi driver sighed, \"I'd heard before that Yao Mountain was strange, but I never thought even rescue workers would go missing. Ah.\"","[Big boss, so many people have disappeared. Could it be an evil ghost causing trouble?] The system hugged itself in fear.","Qi Quan: [It's not impossible.]","Seeing she wasn't responding, the driver thought she wasn't interested in the news and switched to a music channel.","The hour passed quickly.","Qi Quan stood before Zhuying New Village, looking at this complex that was only slightly cleaner than the one Ma Zhi lived in, and fell silent.","This cult organization not only did business with wealthy clients like He Jianshe, but also with ordinary people.","However, someone like He Chao could arrange a ghost marriage with a top-tier beauty celebrity like Yuan Qing, while the buyer in Zhuying New Village could only find someone of similar economic standing like Ma Sisi.","The cult organization was truly serious about doing business.","...","Having wasted so much time, she was growing impatient.","Inside a room in Zhuying New Village, a man and a woman were pacing anxiously.","\"Brother Liang said he'd be here in an hour. Will he really come?\" The woman clenched her hands, looking at her son's portrait on the altar, both nervous and expectant.","The man said, \"He'll definitely come. If you don't trust Brother Liang, can't you trust the Master? Master, you must be getting impatient, right? Let me pour you another cup of tea.\"","Beside the table, a master with a long beard nodded arrogantly.","\"No need to worry. The talisman won't fail.\"","\"That's good, that's good—\"","The voices cut off abruptly.","The man looked out the window in terror, his lips trembling so much he couldn't speak.","The night outside the window was thick, with faint starlight and scattered lights visible.","A woman floated in the air outside the window, silently watching the living room, just like a female ghost in a movie coming to claim a soul.","One must remember, their apartment was on the fifth floor.","\"Ahhhhhhhhh—\"","The woman's piercing scream startled the tea-drinking master.","A chill ran down the master's spine, his hair standing on end. He slammed down his teacup, shattering it, and was about to pull out a magical instrument to subdue the \"female ghost\" outside the window.","Qi Quan moved her finger slightly. The long-bearded master was involuntarily pressed against the window, his facial features distorted by the pressure, his eyes filled with terror.","A third-level celestial master could indeed act with impunity in Longtan City, but encountering Qi Quan was simply his bad luck.","This person's aura was tinged with black and red; he had done many heinous deeds. Even having his soul scattered wouldn't be an excessive punishment.","Qi Quan couldn't be bothered with wasting words on him. She directly hooked his soul and placed it into a peachwood talisman.","The corpse slid down the window and fell, still wearing the same terrified, disfigured expression from before his death.","The man and woman hosts: \"Ahhhhhhhhh—\"","Qi Quan's gaze turned to the portrait. Beside it stood a young male ghost, trembling with fear.","\"Don't kill me! Don't kill me!\" He knelt on the floor, crying and begging, \"I died without even having a chance to fall in love! I can't accept it! I can't accept it! I'll never dare again...\"","A cold light flashed in Qi Quan's eyes. Spiritual power struck his ghostly form, sending him directly into reincarnation.","The animal realm awaited him.","She descended to the ground and left the complex.","Han Mian and the others were already waiting outside the complex. Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu had also come.","\"Master, you've worked hard.\" Chen Feilu handed her a hot drink. \"Let's go eat first. The restaurant is already booked.\"","Qi Quan looked at him with satisfaction. \"You and Ning Zhi have worked hard too.\"","\"We didn't do much,\" Ning Zhi shook his head.","They had gone to Longxi City to protect Ma Sisi's safety, but it turned out the girl was quite capable herself and didn't need their protection at all. Moreover, Ma Zhi had missed his chance to go to Longxi City due to gambling, so they hadn't expended much effort.","Inside the residential building, quite a few people heard the screams of the man and woman. Neighbors from left and right all opened their doors to see what the commotion was.","The couple, terrified by Qi Quan, had fled their apartment and ran straight into the concerned neighbors.","\"What happened?\"","\"What's going on?\"","Everyone knew their son had died in an accident. The tragedy of parents burying their child had earned them the neighbors' sympathy.","Those who could help, did.","The couple shook their heads desperately. \"It's nothing, really nothing!\"","Someone with sharp eyes spotted a person lying by the window through the crack of the open door.","\"Why is there someone in your house?\"","\"Someone? Who?\"","The neighbors rushed into the apartment and saw the long-bearded Taoist master lying motionless by the window, his face frozen in terror. They all screamed.","A brave one went to check his breath—","\"Someone's dead! Someone's dead!\"","\"He's really dead! Call the police!\"","The couple closed their eyes in despair. It was over.","The neighbors called the police.","After the police arrived, the couple, utterly frightened, spilled everything like beans from a bamboo tube.","The police: \"...\"","They hired a master to arrange a ghost marriage for their dead son, and then the master was killed by a female ghost outside the window...?","What kind of nonsense was this!","\"Who is this Brother Liang you mentioned?\" the police asked.","The couple answered honestly, \"He's the one who introduced us to the girl.\"","Introducing a girl for a ghost marriage?","The police officer's face darkened. \"Do you have contact information? Do you know where he is?\"","\"Yes, we do.\"","And so, the previously undefeated ghost marriage business was exposed.","The onlookers looked at the couple with disdain.","Grieving the loss of a son was understandable, but arranging a ghost marriage? Wasn't that just creating bad karma?","How could they be so foolish!","Under the couple's confession, everyone involved, including Wu Liang and the father-son pair Ma Zhi, were summoned to the police station.","The veteran officer handling the case said, \"This could turn out to be a major case!\"","After interrogation, Ma Zhi and his son, as well as Wu Liang, all confessed.","The police officers were utterly shocked.","Who would have thought that in the unseen corners, such a sinister business chain was hidden?","Wu Liang had been operating on this line for a long time. Under the protection of the third-level celestial master, no one had discovered his tracks. Even when the police noticed cases of missing girls, they couldn't trace it back to this line.","However, during interrogation, he only confessed to the business chain in Longtan City. As for other regions, he claimed not to know.","\"This is just too vile!\" a young officer said indignantly.","To meet the \"buyers'\" demands, they scoured various places for \"affordable girls,\" exchanging them for tens of thousands of yuan.","There were even ignorant parents who, to earn money, were willing to sell their own daughters.","\"Even if a ghost marriage doesn't actually affect those girls, no matter what, it's still extremely disturbing!\"","The veteran officer said gravely, \"Doesn't affect them? Not necessarily.\"","Having handled many cases, he could see the bizarre aspects of today's incident at a glance.","\"In the couple's statement, they said a female ghost suddenly appeared outside the window, and the female ghost killed the master, right?\"","The young officer said, \"Isn't that just their nonsense?\"","The veteran officer glanced at him. \"What did the forensic report say?\"","\"Hmm...\"","It seems the cause of death really wasn't determined.","That point is truly baffling.","The old policeman let out a long sigh. \"There's still so much in this world we don't know.\"","\"...\"","While Ma Zhi and the others were being interrogated, the Long-Bearded Celestial Master wasn't left out either.","His soul was trapped inside the peachwood plaque, forced to watch his killers eat and drink to their hearts' content. The bitterness and resentment in his heart were indescribable.","He had died just like that!","He was a Third-Level Celestial Master! Practically unmatched in all of Longtan City!","\"Stop glaring,\" Qin Ruo advised, floating within the peachwood plaque. \"Even a Sixth-Level Celestial Master would be turned to dust meeting her, let alone you, a mere Third-Level. Hah.\"","For Qi Quan to personally take action was already elevating his importance.","Long-Bearded Celestial Master: \"...\"","He glared furiously at Qin Ruo. \"You old, ugly woman aren't fit to speak to me!\"","Qin Ruo: \"...\"","Ahhhhhhh! She wanted to kill him!","After finishing her meal, Qi Quan, right in front of everyone, directly released the Long-Bearded Celestial Master's soul form. A pulse of spiritual power shot from her fingertip, making the soul form solidify. It landed on the ground, revealing a visible shape.","\"Whoa!\" a young officer exclaimed in surprise.","No matter how many times he saw it, he couldn't help but marvel, while simultaneously mourning his long-lost worldview.","\"Who are you people? What right do you have to kill me? Do you know who I am?\" the Long-Bearded Celestial Master raged.","Chen Feilu: \"We are agents of justice. We killed you because you committed heinous acts. I don't know your name, but I know you deserved to die.\"","The system applauded: [Well said!]","The Long-Bearded Celestial Master swallowed the words on the tip of his tongue.","His eyes darted around, finally settling on Qi Quan's face. He put on a deep, meaningful air. \"Young and arrogant. You have no idea what kind of disaster you've brought upon yourselves.\"","...","Qi Quan: \"Know Ding Ji?\"","Long-Bearded Celestial Master: ?","\"He's dead.\" Qi Quan smiled slightly. \"I killed him.\"","The Long-Bearded Celestial Master shuddered involuntarily.","\"He died horribly. I used a soul-searching technique, but then the puppet talisman self-destructed. He exploded, leaving not even ashes behind.\"","\"...\"","Qi Quan propped her chin on one hand, smiling faintly. \"Would you like to join him?\"","The Long-Bearded Celestial Master suddenly deflated.","Of course he knew Ding Ji. That was the most powerful figure in the territories of Longtan, Longjiang, and Longxi cities, a Sixth-Level Celestial Master who dominated all three cities, dealing with their famous wealthy elites.","Not like him, only able to mingle in ordinary civilian circles.","Yet even such a supreme expert had died at the hands of a young woman.","Just who was she?!","\"I'm just an insignificant little Celestial Master. I know the things I did were inhumane. I deserve to die. Please, let me go to the cycle of reincarnation.\"","Qi Quan: [Sigh, one after another. After doing wrong and getting caught, all they think about is going off to enjoy a carefree reincarnation, without a shred of remorse.]","The system: [Exactly! Can't let him off easily!]","Qi Quan's eyes darkened slightly. \"Tell me everything you know, and I can send you to reincarnation.\"","A Celestial Master's spoken words are bound by the laws of heaven.","The Long-Bearded Celestial Master felt a wave of relief. Not caring about anything else, he said, \"All I know is, the ghost marriage business isn't for money.\"","\"Then what is it for?\" Chen Feilu asked.","\"I'm not sure either.\"","Qi Quan put herself in their shoes. In both her past life and this one, her first priority was life itself, and her second was money.","So, the mastermind behind this organization was most likely after life.","What connection could there be between arranging ghost marriages and extending one's life?","She closed her eyes, carefully recalling the \"typical cases.\"","With Yuan Qing's talent, it was only a matter of time before she made it big in the entertainment industry; she could be considered someone with flourishing fortune. After being forcibly bound to He Chao, He Chao relied on her vitality and fortune to manifest at will, no different from a living person, but Yuan Qing consequently became \"plagued by a curse star.\"","In other words, Yuan Qing's vitality and fortune were continuously being transferred to He Chao.","And then what?","Qi Quan had an inkling of an idea, but it wasn't clear.","Ultimately, even if she was an all-around genius, there were areas she hadn't delved into deeply enough, especially such sinister, underhanded methods.","Oh well, the road will appear when you reach the mountain. The truth will come out one day.","Any sinister conspiracy is a paper tiger in the face of absolute power.","She just needed to cultivate, cultivate, and cultivate some more!","Qi Quan waved her hand, having the Long-Bearded Celestial Master return to the peachwood plaque.","\"Didn't you promise to let me reincarnate?\"","Qi Quan said offhandedly, \"Are you sure you told me everything?\"","Long-Bearded Celestial Master: \"...\"","The puppet talisman was still carved into his soul. He didn't dare.","Qi Quan cast a seemingly casual glance at Qin Ruo.","Qin Ruo shrank back in fright to a corner of the peachwood plaque, putting on a pitiful, delicate appearance.","An insult to the term 'pitiful and delicate'.","Qi Quan understood perfectly well that Qin Ruo, even to this day, hadn't revealed all her secrets.","These evil cultivators had a bone-deep fear of the puppet talisman.","She didn't understand. Wasn't it better to be a free Celestial Master? Why willingly put on such a deadly shackle?","\"Master, no more questions?\" Han Mian inquired.","Qi Quan: \"Mm. A Third-Level Celestial Master wouldn't have access to any core secrets.\"","Han Mian didn't press further.","This industry chain ran deeper than he had imagined.","\"The matters in Longtan City will have to be left to the local police; it's not my place to interfere,\" he said. \"Master, are you planning to return tonight or tomorrow?\"","Just as Qi Quan was about to answer, her phone suddenly rang.","It was a call from Ning Zhi.","He took out his phone. \"Second Uncle?\"","His second uncle's voice was loud, coming through the speaker clearly enough for Qi Quan and the others to hear.","\"Nephew, who has our Ning family offended?!\"","Ning Zhi's heart tightened. \"...What happened?\"","\"The Celestial Master Association says you've colluded with evil cultivators. They're going to investigate our Ning family. All the Celestial Masters in the Ning family have had their licenses revoked, and they're summoning you back to answer for it!\"","\"...\"","The Celestial Master Association had made its move.","He asked, \"How are you all doing now?\"","\"We're fine, just idle at home.\" Second Uncle Ning sighed heavily. \"Nephew, tell me the truth. Did you collude with evil cultivators?\"","Ning Zhi's expression turned cold. \"No.\"","\"We believe you're not that kind of person, but the Celestial Master Association wouldn't target you for no reason, right? Even though our Ning family is weak, if you're really in trouble, don't shoulder it alone. Tell us.\"","\"Second Uncle...\" Ning Zhi turned to face the wall, his voice slightly choked. \"You taught me since I was young to uphold justice and punish evil. I wouldn't do bad things.\"","Second Uncle Ning: \"Don't I know what you're like? Tell me, what exactly have you run into?\"","\"In Longjiang City, Longxi City, and Longtan City, I discovered a ghost marriage business chain involving people from the mystic arts community. Under the guidance of a certain senior, I found some clues and uncovered a few threads of it. Tell me, did I do wrong?\"","Second Uncle Ning stated firmly: \"Of course not!\"","Ning Zhi smiled slightly. \"Good. I'll tell you all the details when I get back.\"","He also believed he hadn't done wrong.","The ones in the wrong were those who neglected their duties and confused right with wrong."]},{"number":34,"title":"Chapter 34","paragraphs":["Ning Zhi hung up the phone, his mood somewhat heavy.","On one hand, he disapproved of certain practices of the Master Association, and on the other, he blamed himself for implicating the entire Ning family.","The Ning family was only considered a third-rate lineage in Longjing City. They had been relatively unknown until Ning Zhi rose to fame at a young age, which brought the family more resources within the mystical community.","\"I don't understand. The Master Association turns a blind eye to those harmful Cultivator organizations but insists on targeting us. Why?\" Chen Feilu complained indignantly.","Qi Quan said, \"They are targeting me.\"","There were still unresolved doubts surrounding the original body's death. The reason Ding Ji gave—\"jealousy\"—seemed particularly flimsy.","Since he was a member of a Cultivator organization, he was undoubtedly acting on orders from someone behind the scenes.","The mastermind wanted the \"real heiress\" dead but couldn't be too obvious about it. First, there was the \"switched at birth,\" then the \"return,\" and finally, manipulating someone to \"scare the real heiress to death.\" The plan was meticulous and thorough.","But now she was alive and well. She had killed Ding Ji, injured Yan Wu, and disrupted their operations. Naturally, the other side couldn't sit still anymore.","Pressuring the Ning family was a warning.","\"No,\" Ning Zhi shook his head. \"Some people also have a grudge against me.\"","He was a newly risen genius who had stolen the spotlight from certain individuals, which naturally bred resentment. The resources within the mystical community were finite; having one less family to compete with was only better for others.","Where there are people, there is conflict.","Chen Feilu frowned. \"Could it be Wei Huanyang? He was publicly embarrassed on Weibo and must be holding a grudge. Plus, you outperformed him at the last Mystical Arts Tournament. It's entirely possible he's seizing this chance to cause trouble.\"","\"Unclear.\"","Ning Zhi's heart felt heavy. Due to his outstanding talent, he had borne the family's high hopes since childhood. His family wished for him to lead the clan to prosperity and secure a place for them within Longjing City's mystical circles.","At the very least, to shed the \"third-rate\" label.","But now, his family was bearing risks because of his choices.","Han Mian couldn't interfere in mystical matters, but he still couldn't help grumbling. \"Instead of doing their actual jobs, they hassle the Masters who are. We might as well form our own team.\"","He was both worried and genuinely interested in recruiting Qi Quan and Ning Zhi for the official side.","Ning Zhi forced a smile to mask the bitterness in his eyes. He took a deep breath and said, \"Senior, I need to return to Longjing as soon as possible.\"","Qi Quan said, \"Don't rush.\"","\"Senior, please give any instructions you have.\" He now had complete trust in Qi Quan.","His previous prejudice, born from her having ghost servants, had completely vanished after witnessing Qi Quan's seemingly casual yet principled and just way of handling matters.","Her taking in ghost servants hadn't harmed anyone. In fact, it had been a blessing for Su Rong and Xue Hong, a mutually beneficial good deed, fundamentally different from how other Cultivators raised ghost servants.","If the Master Association targeted her for this while ignoring rampant Cultivator organizations, Ning Zhi would only grow more disappointed in them.","\"Flying Crane Talisman,\" Qi Quan turned to look out the window.","The restaurant private room was on the second floor by the window. Across from it were newly built residential buildings, their lights twinkling like stars. In the interweaving of night and lamplight, a translucent, jade-glowing Flying Crane Talisman landed on the windowpane.","The crane tapped the glass with its wing.","Ning Zhi exclaimed in surprise, \"Why is this here?\"","The Flying Crane Talisman was a method used by the mystical community for long-distance notifications. This crane had the Master Association's emblem on its wing. Any registered Master carrying a Master Certificate could be found by it.","It could sense Masters within a set range via their certificates.","Ning Zhi opened the window.","The Flying Crane Talisman floated in, holding its head high and extending its right wing with an air of restraint.","On its right wing was etched a peach wood sword pattern—the emblem of the Master Association.","Ning Zhi took out his Master Certificate and aligned its emblem with the one on the wing. The crane immediately emitted a flash of light. After the light, an ethereal voice reached his ears:","[Master Ning Zhi, greetings. Welcome to Longtan City. An urgent mission requires your assistance. In Yaoshan, Ningtao County, a large number of people have mysteriously disappeared, suspected to be a paranormal phenomenon. The official authorities have requested aid from the Master Association. You may proceed to Yaoshan to participate in the search and rescue operation for the trapped individuals based on your actual circumstances.]...","After the notification finished, the crane's form dissipated into points of light.","Due to remote control and being dispatched in large batches simultaneously, Flying Crane Talismans consumed significant spiritual power. The Master Association didn't use them lightly.","Likely, the high number of trapped individuals and the slightly firmer stance from the officials forced the Longtan City branch of the Master Association to resort to this method.","However, judging by the wording of the notification, the Master Association's attitude was haughty, exuding arrogance between the lines.","They showed no real interest in the rescue operation, nor did they strongly urge Masters to go to Yaoshan.","Most Masters were arrogant and looked down on ordinary lives. With such a perfunctory call for aid, most Masters wouldn't care.","Wouldn't it be better to use this time to improve their cultivation? Or take on a paid job to earn some money?","Why exert effort for free?","\"Yaoshan in Ningtao County,\" Chen Feilu quickly located it on his phone. \"An hour's drive.\"","He knew Ning Zhi's character well and was sure he wouldn't stand by without helping.","Ning Zhi's expression turned solemn. \"Alright, saving people is the priority.\"","Han Mian thought to himself: He really has the makings of a good police officer.","\"Master, perhaps you should return to Longjiang City first,\" Ning Zhi said apologetically. \"Feilu and I will go to Yaoshan.\"","Just as Qi Quan was about to speak.","[Big Boss, a reader sent you a private message on Weibo! It's a cry for help!] the system suddenly announced.","Qi Quan: [Read it.]","[If you see this, tell me to go prepare lessons: Master Clear Water, I don't know if you can see this, but I believe you must be a very capable Master. The remains of the trafficked child mentioned in your novel were found in the river of my village; I witnessed it myself. I didn't want to bother you, but I really don't know what to do now. Several children, teachers, and parents from our school have gone missing. The police went to search for them and have also lost contact. I'm really worried now. If you have time, could you please perform a divination to find out where they are? I'll send you gifts!]","After reading it, the system said: [Big Boss, this reader has been commenting since the first chapter. She did mention in the comments that she was present when Butler Su was retrieved from the river. Also, she often defends you in comments and sends you gifts.]","Its meaning was quite clear.","Qi Quan had already intended to go to Yaoshan. The situation there was likely beyond what Ning Zhi, a fourth-level Master, could handle alone.","The Long-bearded Master had said that within the Longtan City area, he was considered a top expert. This indicated that the Masters in Longtan City had limited capabilities. Even if some went, it might not help.","She said to Ning Zhi, \"I'll go with you.\"","The situation was urgent. Without further discussion, the group parted ways outside the restaurant.","Han Mian was still tied to the \"Longjiang University Dismemberment Case\" and couldn't accompany them, so he returned to Longjiang City with his officers.","Just as the car was about to drive off.","\"Wait.\" Qi Quan stopped him, opened the rear door, and took out a box of pastries.","Su Rong had packed these for her to eat on the road; she hadn't touched them yet.","\"Master, shall we set off now?\" Chen Feilu asked.","Qi Quan nodded and got into their car.","Chen Feilu drove the car, with Ning Zhi in the passenger seat, leaving the back seat for Qi Quan alone.","She took out her phone and opened her Weibo private messages.","Ningtao County First High School teacher's dormitory.","Luo Xiaoyu sat on her bed, refreshing Weibo over and over, and praying together with her colleagues in the teachers' group chat.","Those missing children were also students she taught. Although they were usually a bit mischievous, they were all good kids. She really didn't want anything to happen to them.","I wonder if Master Baishui will see the Weibo message.","Although the authorities hadn't revealed any plans to enlist a Taoist master, and ordinary people assumed the missing persons were just in danger without considering other possibilities, Luo Xiaoyu was a devoted fan of \"Diary of a Wealthy Family,\" so her mind went there.","She had heard the stories about Yao Mountain since she was a child.","When her grandmother was still alive, she often told her that Yao Mountain used to be a place of beautiful scenery, with abundant resources on the mountain. Villagers often went into the mountains to find food and useful things; Yao Mountain sustained many people.","...","But about thirty years ago, Yao Mountain changed.","People frequently went missing in the mountains, never to be found. Later, as the country developed and the economy prospered, people no longer had to rely solely on the mountains for survival. Fewer and fewer people ventured into the mountains, and the eerie nature of Yao Mountain gradually became little known.","Only people near Yao Mountain might have heard of it.","In the year she was born, Ningtao County planned development. Yao Mountain had many rare tree species, and its climate and soil were suitable for growing some useful plants. The authorities organized an expert research team to survey the mountain. However, the entire team disappeared into the mountains and was never heard from again.","The development of Yao Mountain had to be halted.","Luo Xiaoyu grew up hearing these stories and felt a deep-seated awe for Yao Mountain.","Before reading \"Diary of a Wealthy Family,\" she wouldn't have been so earnest about seeking help from a master. But after personally experiencing the incident of retrieving a child's remains, she had extraordinary faith in Master Baishui.","When the incident happened, her first reaction was to ask Master Baishui for help.","Luo Xiaoyu clutched her phone, so nervous she was breaking out in a cold sweat.","Only at this moment did she realize how insignificant she was.","Her phone chirped.","She looked excitedly, but it was a message in the group chat, not a private message.","Just as she felt disappointed, a private message popped up.","[Baishui Zhenren: Okay.]","That simple one-word reply made Luo Xiaoyu burst into tears instantly.","She wiped her tears away and, regardless of whether Master Baishui could actually help, went to the \"Diary of a Wealthy Family\" page and donated a lot of \"thunder\" gifts, almost equivalent to half a month's salary.","In the car, the system reported to Qi Quan: [Big Boss, \"If You See Me Please Tell Me to Go Prepare Lessons\" just gave you 20 Deep Water gifts.]","Qi Quan: [Just based on her intention to save people, she will surely have peace and smooth sailing, a worry-free life from now on.]","The system: [Yes! You will too, Big Boss!]","The more time it spent with the Big Boss, the more it could sense the benevolent heart hidden beneath her indifferent demeanor.","A Taoist master like this was truly a good one.","It's just a pity she wasn't a good writer, alas.","There would definitely be no update tonight.","At the foothills of Yao Mountain in Ningtao County.","The authorities' second wave of rescue teams had arrived, including forest firefighters, the county fire brigade, and a professional civilian rescue team, totaling forty-five people.","The leader was Fire Brigade Captain Lin Yue.","Tents had been set up in the foothill area, establishing a temporary command center.","He stood outside a tent, anxiously looking down the road.","\"Captain Lin, what are we still waiting for? Every second we wait, the safety of the missing persons decreases by a bit.\"","The speaker was a man in his thirties named Zheng Guangming. He looked ordinary but was tall and powerfully built. He was the vice president of the Outdoor Sports Association and also the leader of the civilian rescue team.","Lin Yue was also very anxious, but his superiors had instructed him to wait for people from some Taoist Master Association to enter the mountain together. They were to wait for one hour from the time of the order. If no one showed up after an hour, they would proceed into the mountain as originally planned.","Having worked for many years, Lin Yue had never heard of an organization called the Taoist Master Association. Judging by the name, it sounded like a profession from fantasy novels, usually involving Taoist priests or monks.","He was very puzzled. What did rescue missions have to do with Taoist priests or monks?","But he had to follow orders.","\"There are still rescue personnel who haven't arrived. Let's wait a little longer.\" He took a deep breath. Only ten minutes remained.","Zheng Guangming had participated in many rescue missions but had never encountered such low efficiency. Anxious to save people, he couldn't wait any longer and said in a rough voice, \"Captain Lin, how about you wait here, and we'll go into the mountain first?\"","To rescue the missing persons as soon as possible, they were willing to enter the mountain even at night.","\"Entering the mountain at night isn't safe. Let's wait a little longer.\"","As soon as Lin Yue finished speaking, the beams of two headlights shone directly towards them.","They're here!","Soon, a car worth around seven or eight hundred thousand stopped in front of them. Two people got out.","One was a man who appeared to be in his thirties, with decent looks and an extraordinary air. The other was a young man in his early twenties, good-looking, wearing brand-name clothes and a watch worth hundreds of thousands—clearly someone who didn't lack money.","Zheng Guangming saw them and felt speechless.","Just these two?","Lin Yue stepped forward to greet them, extending his hand. \"I'm Lin Yue, the person in charge of this rescue mission. Hello.\"","The older man didn't speak, maintaining an inscrutable demeanor.","\"Captain Lin,\" the young man said with a grin, shaking his hand. \"We've been assigned by the Taoist Master Association to participate in the rescue mission. I'm Fang Ye, and this is Senior Chu Changyi.\"","Zheng Guangming: ???","What in the world?","Of course, anyone who could participate in the rescue mission and contribute was a good comrade. He shouldn't judge by appearances.","\"Welcome, welcome!\" he said hurriedly. \"Since you're here, let's prepare to enter the mountain!\"","\"Wait a moment.\" Fang Ye smiled, pulling a compass from his backpack.","He had been relaxed at first, but when he saw the compass needle spinning wildly like a headless fly, his heart instantly tightened.","He instinctively looked at Chu Changyi.","\"Senior, this...\"","Chu Changyi's expression remained unchanged, but a trace of wariness flashed in his eyes.","The compass was powered by spiritual energy. For it to spin wildly like a headless fly meant either there was a problem with the spiritual energy field, or the entity here exceeded a certain threshold.","He quickly produced a talisman. The talisman transformed into a stream of light and shot towards the dark, eerie depths of the mountain range. Within seconds, the light suddenly dimmed, and Chu Changyi's face paled.","Fang Ye noticed something was wrong and couldn't help but feel afraid.","Before coming, he hadn't known the severity of the situation. He was a newcomer to the Association. This time, after the Taoist Master Association received the official notification, they used a Flying Crane Talisman to notify the masters within the Longtan City area. Finding that almost an hour had passed with no response from any master, they had to put on a show and send him and Senior Chu.","They were in a difficult position now.","Leaving would mean losing face; staying could mean risking their lives.","Who would have thought the ghostly thing in Yao Mountain was so powerful?","\"Senior Chu, doesn't the Association have a department that monitors local ghosts and monsters? How could something of such a high level have gone unnoticed all this time?\"","Chu Changyi glanced at him.","Youth is youth. Having just entered the Association, how could he know how deep the waters ran inside?","The forces within the Celestial Master Association are intricate and complex. Monitoring and dealing with ghosts and monsters is a thankless task that also wastes cultivation time. Who would be willing to do it?","To gain a voice within the Celestial Master Association, various sects and major families all push their people into the association. Positions like monitoring ghosts and monsters, which both waste spiritual power and easily offend people, are ones nobody wants.","Firstly, monitoring ghost and monster activity signs across the entire city requires activating complex and massive arrays, consuming a great deal of spiritual energy. In the current world, spiritual energy is a precious resource, and no one is willing to waste it.","Secondly, once a powerful ghost is detected, should it be reported or not?","If reported, the association organizes Celestial Masters to go exterminate the ghost. The masters, unwilling but forced to go, would naturally harbor resentment. If not reported, and evil ghosts later run rampant, the monitoring department would be the first to be held accountable.","Therefore, the current monitoring department exists in name only.","He flicked his sleeve and said, \"The sudden appearance of an evil ghost must be due to committing a great many killings in a short time. Let's go back. The person cannot be saved.\"","Fang Ye hesitated, \"...Understood.\"","Lin Yue and Zheng Guangming: ???","Are you two putting on a show here?","Both of them had seen clearly the scene of the talisman paper transforming into a stream of light.","Lin Yue, knowing their identities and somewhat mentally prepared, managed to hold his composure. Zheng Guangming completely failed to hold his, his eyes wide open until he heard Chu Changyi's words, which snapped him back to reality.","\"Captain Lin, let's just head into the mountains,\" Zheng Guangming said in a rough voice.","Lin Yue felt quite disappointed. Seeing Chu Changyi perform the spell, he had thought there might be some genuine mystical skill, but who knew... Ah, forget it.","After all, they weren't professional rescue personnel to begin with. It's understandable they didn't want to enter the mountains.","Even if the missing person had truly met with an accident, the rescue team still needed to recover the body.","...","He turned to mobilize the rescue team.","Suddenly, another pair of headlights approached, cutting through the pitch-black path and arriving before the tents.","Zheng Guangming was already impatient. If not for Lin Yue holding him back, he would have led the team into the mountains long ago.","\"Captain Lin, time is of the essence!\"","Lin Yue checked the time. Not a minute more, not a minute less, perfectly hitting the last minute. Just in time.","The car stopped next to Fang Ye's vehicle.","The two from the driver and passenger seats got out first, both extremely young men who looked like university students.","They're too young. Are they reliable?","Then, the rear door opened.","A young woman bent down and stepped out. She wore a minimalist grey tracksuit, was tall and slender, with her hair in a ponytail. Below her smooth forehead were exceptionally beautiful eyes and brows.","The gloom at the mountain's foot couldn't suppress her radiant aura and brilliance.","Fang Ye's eyes lit up slightly, his intended departing steps unconsciously slowing.","Sensing the Celestial Master aura on Ning Zhi, he smiled and stepped forward, \"Hello, I'm Fang Ye from the Longtan City Celestial Master Association, a Second-level Celestial Master.\"","He extended his hand towards Ning Zhi, but his peripheral gaze was fixed on Qi Quan.","System: [Big shot, this guy is stealing glances at you, how creepy!]","Qi Quan: ...","She turned around, gazing towards Yao Mountain in the night.","The forest was dense, the shadows silent.","The sky was dim and lightless, stars and moon obscured by dark clouds. The pitch-black mountain forest was the favorite carnival ground for ghosts and monsters.","A carnival ground, yet also a sturdy cage.","A soaring black aura enveloped the entire mountain range. Within the black aura lurked suppression, fury, hatred, and a desperate, all-or-nothing resolve.","Ning Zhi shook Fang Ye's hand. \"Ning Zhi, Fourth-level Celestial Master from the Longjing City Celestial Master Association.\"","Fang Ye: \"...\"","Can't compare, can't compare.","He forced a slightly unnatural smile and said casually, \"Senior Ning, are you planning to enter the mountains?\"","Ning Zhi: \"Yes.\"","\"The thing in the mountains is no simple matter,\" Fang Ye said. \"Senior, please be careful.\"","\"Naturally,\" Ning Zhi nodded.","Fang Ye, having failed to strike up a conversation with Qi Quan, felt somewhat disappointed. A flash of inspiration hit him, and he said, \"This young lady and that young man had better not enter the mountains. It's very dangerous.\"","Observing the auras of Qi Quan and Chen Feilu, he couldn't discern anything particular, concluding that the two were not Celestial Masters.","Chen Feilu blinked.","He would indeed be deadweight going into the mountains, but for the Master to go in would be like having a golden thigh to cling to!","By now, Lin Yue and Zheng Guangming had prepared the rescue equipment and supplies, assembled the team, and were ready to set off immediately.","Lin Yue, out of courtesy, asked, \"Which of you are entering the mountains?\"","Ning Zhi pointed to himself and Qi Quan. \"The two of us.\"","\"Alright, let's go.\"","Although he didn't hold much hope for the young Ning Zhi and Qi Quan, since Fang Ye addressed Ning Zhi as 'senior,' it meant this young man Ning Zhi likely had some skill.","\"Huh?\" Fang Ye exclaimed in surprise. \"The young lady is going too?\"","He froze for a few seconds, gritted his teeth, and then followed the team as well.","Chu Changyi: \"What are you doing?\"","Fang Ye: \"Rescuing people!\"","Chu Changyi: \"...\"","Young people, always so competitive and eager to show off. Hah, truly reckless and unaware of the dangers.","He paid no more attention and drove away by himself.","Chen Feilu stayed at the command center, mingling with the logistics support staff.","Within the rescue team, Zheng Guangming leaned close to Lin Yue's ear and whispered, \"You're really taking three youngsters into the mountains?\"","\"Since it's an instruction from above, whoever they send, we just follow orders,\" Lin Yue said firmly.","Zheng Guangming sighed helplessly, \"I'm just worried that if we really encounter danger, we won't be able to look after them.\"","They're all vibrant lives. It's truly hard to bear the thought.","Looking at these three, each younger than the last, each more attractive than the last, they didn't seem like people who could endure hardship.","\"Should we have them walk in the middle of the team?\"","Lin Yue thought for a moment. \"That might be good.\"","...","When setting off, he equipped all three with communicators. He then opened the channel, preparing to call them.","Who would have thought that as soon as he pressed the button, the communicator emitted a sharp \"crackle\" and completely lost signal.","\"What's going on?\"","Zheng Guangming's heart tightened. He quickly adjusted his own communicator, only for another \"crackle\" to sound, rendering it completely useless.","\"Stop right where you are!\"","Lin Yue used his flashlight to signal the team behind with different light patterns.","The team halted.","At the rear, Fang Ye sidled up to Qi Quan's right side and said with great masculine bravado, \"Don't worry, miss. Actually, Yao Mountain is nothing much. If there really is something, I'll definitely protect you!\"","Ning Zhi: \"...\"","The system shared his sentiment: [Where did this overconfident guy come from!]","Qi Quan said, \"The team has stopped.\"","\"Ah?\" Fang Ye, hearing her speak for the first time, felt a surge of joy in his heart and didn't even clearly hear what she said.","Zheng Guangming strode to the back of the team.","\"You three, come with me to the front.\" He was tall and imposing, with an upright face that exuded a strong sense of security.","With the team's communicators down, it was better to keep these three under close watch. The other team members were professionally trained and more reliable.","Qi Quan said, \"The communicators are unusable. It's very dangerous.\"","Zheng Guangming was taken aback. \"We haven't gone far. You can still turn back now.\"","\"What I mean is, it will be very dangerous for you to continue into the mountains,\" Qi Quan said with a serious expression.","With so many people, if danger arose, she couldn't guarantee she could protect everyone.","But these people were following orders. It wasn't her place to arbitrarily tell them to withdraw from the rescue mission.","Zheng Guangming saw the concern in her eyes and felt a warmth in his heart. He said gently, \"The people trapped in the mountains are in greater danger. You're still young, go back.\"","Qi Quan said earnestly, \"Mr. Zheng, my suggestion is for the team to stay put here. You and Captain Lin Yue should come with us.\"","\"Wait, have you misunderstood—\" Zheng Guangming's words cut off abruptly.","A pale talisman appeared in Qi Quan's palm.","The talisman was exquisitely crafted, floating just above her hand. It seemed to depict a semicircle, shimmering with a faint golden light.","This miraculous sight left him stunned and speechless.","\"A Guardian Array Talisman!\" Fang Ye exclaimed in surprise.","This was a high-level, rare talisman. It required a Master to be proficient in both talisman-crafting and array formations, combining a protective array with a talisman to create a portable charm. At a critical moment, it could activate a protective array to ward off external threats.","External threats included ghosts and other Masters.","He had only read about such Guardian Array Talismans in ancient texts, thinking they were just an exaggerated legend.","Within the Mystic Arts community, those who mastered a single discipline to a high level were already as rare as phoenix feathers and unicorn horns, let alone mastering two disciplines simultaneously at a high level.","No wonder she was so confident; she must have a formidable backer.","Fang Ye wisely set aside his previous underestimation.","\"Mr. Zheng, we can't afford to waste any more time.\"","Qi Quan stood in the pitch-black mountain forest, her slender shoulders and back ramrod straight, her expression solemn and grave. The miraculous object in her palm demanded attention.","Zheng Guangming swallowed and said, \"But our duty is search and rescue. We can't just hide here and do nothing, right?\"","It went against their professional code.","Qi Quan said calmly, \"You can risk your lives to save others, and you also have the right to accept rescue from others.\"","Zheng Guangming felt a lump in his throat, momentarily unable to speak.","He led a civilian rescue team. All its members possessed warm, kind hearts. They received no salary, no benefits, no holidays—only a chest full of courage and determination.","They did heroic work, yet sometimes what they received in return were complaints and a sense of entitlement from others.","This was the first time he had heard someone say they wanted to protect them.","\"Time is running out. Gather the team members and have them huddle together,\" Qi Quan instructed.","Zheng Guangming wiped his face.","When the com...munications equipment failed, he and Lin Yue had already noticed the abnormality and prepared for the worst.","\"Alright.\"","He ran back to explain the situation to Lin Yue. Naturally, Lin Yue was unwilling to watch his team members walk to their deaths. After personally verifying Qi Quan's capabilities, he asked one question:","\"Master Qi, are you confident?\"","Qi Quan nodded.","Lin Yue said, \"In that case, Old Zheng and I will go with you. The other team members should return the way they came.\"","\"Look at the path behind you,\" Qi Quan reminded them.","Lin Yue and Zheng Guangming quickly shone their flashlights behind them.","Heavens!","The path had completely vanished!","Had they really encountered a \"ghost wall\"?","Qi Quan said calmly, \"Make your decision.\"","The two men exchanged a glance and immediately made up their minds.","They gathered all the team members and informed them of the actual situation. The team members had all received professional training. Though somewhat nervous, they all maintained a calm demeanor.","\"Everyone, sit down in a tight circle. Do not move recklessly until we return.\"","Once the team members were gathered in an orderly circle, Lin Yue turned to Qi Quan. \"We appreciate your efforts.\"","Qi Quan stood before the group. The Guardian Array Talisman shot into the air above them like a meteor.","The team members: ???","Even though they were mentally prepared, seeing it with their own eyes still felt like they'd wandered onto the wrong movie set.","Qi Quan sent a pulse of spiritual power from her fingertips. The pale talisman instantly transformed into streams of fine, shimmering light, taking on a semicircular shape that enveloped all the team members within the protective array.","This way, they would be shielded from sinister, ghostly influences.","System: [Big Boss, why didn't you stop them from going up the mountain back at the foot?]","Qi Quan: [They wouldn't have believed me. I didn't want to waste time on pointless debate.]","[Big Boss thinks of everything.]","Everyone marveled at this magical and beautiful scene. The faint golden array dispelled the darkness and terror of the mountain forest.","Warm and bright.","Lin Yue and Zheng Guangming looked at Qi Quan, about to ask about the next steps, when they heard her give orders:","\"Ning Zhi, you take Captain Lin. This one...\"","She looked at Fang Ye.","\"This junior is called Fang Ye,\" Fang Ye promptly replied.","Qi Quan: \"Master Fang, take Mr. Zheng. Use Swift Movement Talismans.\"","\"Yes.\" Ning Zhi didn't hesitate, immediately placing a Swift Movement Talisman on Lin Yue.","Fang Ye, not wanting to fall behind, followed suit.","Everything was ready.","Qi Quan: \"Follow me.\"","A gentle wind rustled through the forest, leaves whispering, yet no trace was left on the ground.","Ning Zhi grabbed Lin Yue's wrist, activated the Swift Movement Talisman with spiritual power, and closely followed the figure ahead.","Fang Ye: \"...\"","Wait for me!","High-speed movement didn't affect the Masters, but for ordinary people, it was a formidable challenge. Fortunately, Lin Yue and Zheng Guangming were enveloped in spiritual energy and remained unaffected.","Qi Quan followed the source of the dark energy, heading straight for the heart of the mountains.","[Big Boss, since you're confident you can deal with the malevolent ghost, why bring them along?] The system was puzzled.","Actually, it thought the Big Boss could have just entered the mountains alone to vanquish the ghost.","Qi Quan: [And after vanquishing it?]","[What?]","[There are still the people waiting for rescue.]","The system asked: [What about them?]","[Who will reassure them?]","The system fell silent for a moment.","That made sense.","But—","[The first batch of rescuers went into the mountains.]","[They're scattered, not in the same place.]","[I see.]","The pitch-black mountain forest held not a sliver of light, like a massive cage wrapped in black cloth.","The heart of the mountains.","A man floated in mid-air, dressed in worn, old-fashioned work clothes, his back slightly hunched. Beneath his disheveled hair, his eyes glowed red, the color of fresh blood.","...","He was waiting.","When midnight arrived, he could feast on those few fresh, delicious living souls below. Using that moment of peak Yin energy, he would successfully advance his rank.","Once he advanced, he could leave this damned place forever!","He could go find that scumbag and take his revenge!","The male ghost revealed a sinister, twisted smile.","The so-called living souls were the several missing students, along with the teachers and parents who had come searching for them.","As for that first batch of rescuers, because their righteous aura was formidable and they all carried merit from good deeds, the male ghost didn't dare provoke them lightly and had trapped them in an illusion instead.","Hmm? More people have entered the mountains?","Hah, they really don't know when to quit.","He spread his arms. Dark energy churned within him; the entire mountain was under his control.","The second rescue team also stepped into the illusion. Their communications failed, the path ahead and behind vanished.","The male ghost sneered contemptuously.","As he laughed, resentment welled up again. His gaze, filled with jealousy and loathing, fell upon the people below.","Why!","Why is it that when these people go missing, they send batch after batch of rescuers?","Yet when he disappeared all those years ago, not a single person cared?","The male ghost let out a cold laugh and swooped down, grabbing a male student and flying back into the air.","\"Ahhhhhhhhh—\"","The boy, already terrified from being trapped here, nearly lost his soul when lifted into the air and fainted on the spot.","\"Pathetic coward,\" the male ghost scoffed, pretending to drop him from the great height.","Anyway, it's almost time. He's going to die regardless.","\"No!\" the boy's father cried out in anguish.","He instinctively stretched out his arms, trying to catch his son, but the malevolent ghost maliciously changed direction, throwing the boy towards a tree further away.","Just as the boy's head was about to smash against the tree trunk, a gentle surge of spiritual energy lifted his body, allowing him to land softly.","The boy's father went from shock to joy, kneeling on the ground and shouting, \"Little Feng! Little Feng!\"","He was trapped within the malevolent ghost's ghost domain, unable to break free to check on his son.","\"Who's there?!\" The malevolent ghost's expression abruptly changed, his face turning severe as he stared in the direction where the boy had landed.","From behind the dense thicket of the jungle, a woman came into view.","The red in the malevolent ghost's eyes deepened.","Why hadn't he sensed her at all? Who exactly was this woman?","Qi Quan stood still, looking up at the malevolent ghost hovering in mid-air.","Deeply stained with the sin of killing. A Level Five Red Ghost.","Ning Zhi and the others stopped behind her. Ning Zhi and Fang Ye had desperately sprinted to keep up with Qi Quan's pace, and now their faces were somewhat pale; Fang Ye was even panting.","\"Ever since becoming a Master, I've never run out of breath like this,\" he said, bending over with his hands on his knees, taking deep breaths.","Zheng Guangming said apologetically, \"I held you back.\"","He was a bit heavy.","Compared to the two exhausted young Masters, Lin Yue and Zheng Guangming seemed rather excited.","They both had adventurous personalities. After adapting to the high-speed run and witnessing a whole new, astonishing world, it was impossible for them not to be excited.","Except—","Was there a person floating in the air?","Oh no, that wasn't a person, it was a ghost.","Ghosts above Level Three can manifest at will. A Level Five Red Ghost already possesses a relatively solid ghost form, visible even to ordinary people.","The two men rubbed their eyes, utterly amazed.","The malevolent ghost stared fixedly at them, letting out a shrill laugh.","\"To think, I truly never thought that a few mere ordinary people could dispatch Masters. How enviable.\"","Qi Quan said, \"You're very noisy.\"","The malevolent ghost: \"...\"","Three words inexplicably ignited his fury.","The red glow in his eyes grew increasingly dense. A bloody scent spread through the mountain valley, and a viscous substance, red bordering on black, suddenly shot towards Qi Quan.","Qi Quan condensed her spiritual energy into a sword.","The sword shot forth, instantly piercing through the ghost domain's trickery. The black-red filth immediately turned to dust and vanished.","The malevolent ghost was shocked... and dumbfounded. \"Impossible!\"","He was a Level Five Red Ghost! Could there really be a Master of such profound cultivation in Longtan City?!","The sword's momentum did not diminish. Like a meteor streaking across the sky, it sped to the malevolent ghost's face, carrying a thunderous force.","The malevolent ghost screamed in terror, \"I have hostages!\"","The sword tip halted, suspended in mid-air, still pointing directly at the malevolent ghost's face.","The malevolent ghost spoke sharply and fiercely, \"You can't kill me! A group of people are trapped by me! If you kill me, they'll die too!\"","Lin Yue's expression turned grave. \"It's the first rescue team.\"","\"This damned bastard!\" Zheng Guangming spat.","The situation was at an impasse.","Regaining his footing, the malevolent ghost gradually showed a smug expression on his face. Unafraid of the spiritual sword that could take his ghostly life at any moment, he said, \"I just want to go out and get revenge. Once I have my revenge, even if I have to enter the eighteenth level of hell, I'm willing.\"","\"And your method of revenge is to harm innocent lives?!\" Zheng Guangming couldn't hold back.","The malevolent ghost looked down at him. \"Don't judge me with such hypocritical talk. I was innocent too. I did nothing wrong, so why was I killed? I just want to seek justice. Why is it so difficult? Why... why...\"","He muttered with red eyes, seemingly lost in some agonizing memory, acting crazed and looking quite terrifying.","\"He's lost his mind,\" Lin Yue said.","Qi Quan's spiritual sense covered the entire mountain range. She quickly found the first rescue team. They were trapped in an illusion, utterly exhausted.","The illusion was controlled by the malevolent ghost. If he wished, he could make those people blindly walk off a cliff.","And those people were currently circling right at the edge of a cliff.","She lowered her gaze, pondered for a moment, then took out another Protective Formation Talisman.","Fang Ye behind her was already numb. He had become numb the moment he saw her condense spiritual energy into a sword.","Condensing spiritual energy into a sword was a realm he didn't even dare to imagine.","Just who was she?!","Were Protective Formation Talismans like cabbages at the market?","\"Go.\" Qi Quan sent the talisman flying.","The malevolent ghost snapped back to attention, his eyes filled with fierce malice. \"Don't even think about it!\"","He actually split off a second ghost body to block the talisman's path, while also using the people on the ground as hostages.","\"If you act again, I'll kill them! And those others will die too!\"","He refused to believe this woman could save both sets of hostages simultaneously.","That cliff was far away. Even a talisman would need time to fly there. Moreover, activating and opening the talisman required spiritual energy. At such a distance, it was impossible for her to have any spare spiritual energy to activate the talisman!","The malevolent ghost's reasoning was clear.","He thought he had blocked all of Qi Quan's options.","Both Ning Zhi and Fang Ye's expressions were extremely grim.","As Masters, they clearly understood that it was very difficult for a Master to remotely transmit spiritual energy to another location and activate a talisman formation with precise accuracy.","Especially with a standoff right in front of them.","The system was also anxious: [Big shot, what should we do now?]","Qi Quan smiled slightly, inserted her left hand into her pants pocket, and pulled out a small, exquisite sparrow jade token.","The jade token felt warm and smooth in her hand, containing abundant spiritual energy within.","She lightly tapped it with her fingertip.","The jade token instantly transformed into a stream of light, carrying the talisman as it broke through the malevolent ghost's ghost body and shot like lightning towards the cliff.","Malevolent ghost: ???","At the same moment, the spiritual sword thrust towards the malevolent ghost!","The sword's radiance was too brilliant. The malevolent ghost instinctively released the hostages to dodge. Qi Quan threw a peach wood plaque, striking him squarely in the face.","The malevolent ghost let out a miserable scream. He only had time to activate the illusion before being sucked into the plaque.","At the distant cliff, one second the rescue team was stepping into the abyss, the next second, the Protective Formation Talisman arrived. Utilizing the spiritual energy from the sparrow jade token, it opened a protective formation, steadily shielding them within the array. Not a single person was injured.","The rescue personnel who had fallen to the cliff bottom: Were they dreaming?","Wasn't the \"surviving a cliff fall\" rule reserved for protagonists?","This world had become fantastical.","In the mountain hollow, with the malevolent ghost subdued, the several students, parents, and teachers finally came to their senses.","They were saved!","They hugged each other, weeping loudly from the delayed fear.","...","Qi Quan said, \"Captain Lin, Mr. Zheng, I'll leave them to you.\"","She truly had no talent for comforting victims.","Lin Yue was endlessly grateful. \"Thank you so much, Master Qi. What about that rescue team...\"","\"They are safe and sound.\"","Zheng Guangming was moved to tears, choking up as he said, \"If it weren't for Master Qi this time, we... we...\"","These ghostly tricks and illusions were something ordinary people like them could never have broken through.","Fortunately, Captain Lin followed the instructions from his superiors and waited for such a formidable expert.","Qi Quan said, \"Those rescue personnel are at the bottom of the cliff. When you go over, please bring back a sparrow jade token for me.\"","\"Absolutely!\" Lin Yue assured her.","Lakeside Villa.","The Young Man's carving knife suddenly paused, jade dust sprinkling onto the table.","The jade token...","He abruptly stood up and strode towards the door, but then halted.","It's fine now.","He let out a sigh of relief, turned around, and slowly returned to the table.","Just as he was about to pick up the carving knife again, the villa's protective formation suddenly came under attack.","The bad guys are here!"]},{"number":35,"title":"Chapter 35","paragraphs":["Yan Wu was thoroughly humiliated at the Linhu Villa, and his anger burned fiercely within him.","After all, he was a dignified Level Six Celestial Master. Even in the dragon-filled metropolis of Longjing City, others treated him with utmost respect.","Yet here he was, in the small Longjiang City, making such a huge fool of himself right in front of the Celestial Master Association officials.","He couldn’t swallow this bitter pill!","After leaving Linhu Villa, he immediately reported the incident to the Longjing City Celestial Master Association, portraying Qi Quan as a rogue Celestial Master who operated outside the Association’s control, secretly kept ghost servants, and was extremely dangerous.","Operating beyond the Association’s supervision?","That was unacceptable!","The Longjing City Celestial Master Association promptly decided to send investigators.","Two Celestial Masters were dispatched. Since Yan Wu emphasized Qi Quan’s high cultivation level, both were Level Six Celestial Masters—one specialized in talisman crafting, the other in formation magic.","Level Six Celestial Masters were rare elsewhere, but the Longjing City Association could afford to send such high-level experts.","Under Yan Wu’s lead, the three arrived at Linhu Villa. To avoid being seen by ordinary people, they chose to come under the cover of night.","As a top-tier villa district, the houses were spaced far apart, with trees and flowers planted between them, perfectly obscuring the view.","When they reached Qi Quan’s villa, the surroundings were dim, with only the distant city’s neon lights casting a faint glow in the sky.","“There’s a protective formation around the villa,” the formation master said. “And it’s a high-level formation—complex and precise, not easy to break.”","Being only Level Six, he naturally couldn’t penetrate an eighth-level formation.","The talisman master added, “Since it’s a formation, it requires spiritual energy to maintain. Celestial Masters can’t constantly expend their energy to uphold a formation. I suspect she’s using spiritual talismans.”","Spiritual talismans are special papers that store a fixed amount of spiritual energy, usually used to supplement energy at critical moments or maintain formations.","The combination of talismans and formations is an extremely difficult skill to master, requiring close cooperation between talisman crafters and formation masters. It’s rare to find a Celestial Master proficient in both disciplines.","Before coming, they had already investigated Qi Quan’s background.","A seemingly ordinary life history—how could it possibly support such extraordinary and refined skills?","The formation master speculated, “Perhaps she has mentors behind her—a talisman master and a formation master.”","“Sounds about right,” the talisman master nodded.","Yan Wu was speechless.","You’re here to arrest Qi Quan, not to chat!","“So, what’s the plan now?” Yan Wu asked.","The talisman master replied, “The spiritual energy stored in the talismans will eventually run out. Once the formation’s energy depletes, the formation will collapse on its own. I doubt she can sustain the entire formation with her personal energy alone.”","None of the three knew that Qi Quan was currently away on a business trip.","Yan Wu nodded. That made sense.","“Shall we begin?” he asked.","“Let’s start,” came the reply.","This time, the talisman master came well prepared, carrying a large supply of offensive talismans. Though he hadn’t had the chance to use them on Qi Quan herself, he began by unleashing them on the formation.","He hurled a barrage of thunder talismans. The overwhelming power of lightning struck the villa’s formation, causing it to flicker repeatedly, but it held firm against the assault.","Inside the villa, Ling Sheng stood beneath the courtyard.","Su Rong, Xue Hong, and Qi Zheng stood nearby.","One person with three ghosts—no matter who they were, they could not be seen by the Celestial Masters outside the villa. If discovered, imprisonment and extermination would await them.","Su Rong’s expression was grave. “The formation’s glow seems to be dimming a bit.”","\"Showing up at midnight—those fools from the Taoist Association really have no manners,\" Xue Hong said, her face full of displeasure.","Qi Zheng: \"...\"","He sighed silently. Whether human or ghost, there are good and bad among them.","Another fierce wave of attacks surged forward. The transparent protective array seemed to tremble, revealing a fragile vulnerability as if it could no longer hold.","Ling Sheng’s brows furrowed with a fierce expression. His palm radiated countless streams of spiritual energy, which he desperately funneled into the array’s key points. These points, nourished by the overwhelming spiritual energy, restored the protective shield to an impenetrable state.","The three ghosts’ eyes suddenly brightened, all fixated on him.","Ling Sheng: \"...\"","Outside the villa, the talisman master...","Having thrown half of his remaining attack talismans, he watched as the array’s spiritual energy neared exhaustion—only to see it flash brilliantly and return to full strength.","The three exchanged puzzled looks: ???","The array master said, \"Could it be that she prepared a large reserve of backup talismans?\"","Yan Wu’s eyes darkened. \"It’s not impossible.\"","Could it be that he wouldn’t get his revenge?","The Taoist Association sending a sixth-level Taoist was already a major move. Taoists above sixth level were mostly in seclusion or hidden cultivation and wouldn’t bother with these matters. Asking them to intervene was almost a pipe dream.","Just let it go like this?","No way! He couldn’t forget the humiliation he suffered that day!","\"Maintaining the array requires a lot of talismans, and talismans require a lot of spiritual energy. I refuse to believe she has that many fully charged talismans,\" he rasped.","In today’s mystical world, spiritual energy is a scarce resource. Only sects or families with deep foundations can store talismans of various sizes for emergencies.","Besides, making talismans isn’t like planting cabbages—it’s not that easy.","The talisman master thought for a moment, then nodded and continued throwing attack talismans, draining the array’s spiritual power.","Gradually, the array’s glow began to dim again.","The three were pleased—there was hope!","As the array’s spiritual power neared a critical low, the talisman master suddenly intensified his assault. The three’s hearts jumped, eyes glued to the protective shield, waiting for it to collapse—","But once again, a faint white light suddenly flashed!","\"Damn!\" The talisman master nearly coughed up blood in frustration.","All the talismans he painstakingly crafted had gone to waste!","The array master glanced sideways at Yan Wu. \"Who exactly is she? Could she be from some hidden noble family? Where does she get so many talismans?\"","Unbelievable!","Yan Wu: \"...\"","He silently swallowed back a mouthful of old blood.","The talisman master, now scared of the array, clutched his chest and moved aside weakly, counting his remaining stock with reddened eyes. \"You try breaking the array.\"","Array master: \"...\"","Though aware of his limits, he couldn’t refuse outright. He put on a show of studying the villa’s array, scrutinizing it for a long time but failing to unravel its secrets. Clearing his throat, he dryly said,","\"Let’s just report back. I think it’s better to befriend a figure like this.\"","Most Taoists, chasing cultivation and longevity, value their lives more than anyone and are especially pragmatic.","Especially those who already have a reputation.","Why bother making an enemy they can’t understand?","Yan Wu: \"...\"","His eyes darkened as he said, “The head of the family has made it clear: a rebellious Tianshi like her is prone to going astray. It’s better to kill mistakenly than to let her go.”","The talisman master and the array master exchanged glances, both somewhat wary of the “head of the family” he mentioned.","“Besides, we’re not asking you to kill her, just to bring her back for questioning, to make her accept discipline and obedience. As you said yourselves, talents like her are best treated as friends. So why not have such a Tianshi serve the Tianshi Association?”","Yan Wu watched their expressions carefully.","“If you can get her to accept the Association’s control, wouldn’t that be a great achievement?”","He coaxed them gently, tugging at their hearts.","As a talisman master and an array master, they both needed abundant cultivation resources. To craft more advanced talismans, they required materials of superior quality. To delve deeper into array formations, they needed plentiful spirit talismans and array stones infused with spiritual energy.","The greater the merit, the more resources they could obtain.","The talisman master immediately shook off his earlier lethargy. If they could break the array and capture Qi Quan, he would surely earn top honors.","He was all in!","He didn’t believe Qi Quan had that many spirit talismans to sustain her!","Even a third-rate family in Longjing City couldn’t produce so many spirit talismans at once.","He would try again.","Inside the villa, one person and three ghosts stood in neat formation, looking up at the array guarding the villa.","...","Su Rong said, “Ling Sheng, if you want to eat anything in the future, just tell me.”","Xue Hong crossed her arms and said, “Ling Sheng, I will teach you everything I’ve learned in my lifetime.”","When it was Qi Zheng’s turn, he scratched his head, unsure how to repay her, and said, “How about when I go to the cycle of reincarnation, I plead with the King of Hell to extend your lifespan?”","“......”","Ling Sheng’s face remained calm, but a faint smile flickered in her eyes.","The third wave of attacks came as expected.","What others found difficult to communicate with or absorb—the spiritual energy of heaven and earth—flowed smoothly into Ling Sheng’s body. After circulating once, it was expelled to nourish the villa’s array.","When the talisman master threw his last attack talisman, he was stunned.","No talismans left, no credit earned.","He had lost both the lady and the soldiers!","Staring at his empty talisman pouch, he felt like crying.","Yan Wu: ???","Could that woman really have some profound background?","But he had investigated her thoroughly; her life was incredibly simple.","Could someone be hiding her past?","Two hundred kilometers away in Longtan City.","At the very moment the villa’s array was under attack, Qi Quan sensed it.","She sat on the bed in a guesthouse room, cultivating.","The guesthouse was booked by Chen Feilu, with a touch of antiquity, spotlessly clean, and very comfortable.","[Boss, your eyelid just twitched—are you having trouble with your cultivation?] the system asked with concern.","Having followed Qi Quan for so long, it was well acquainted with her cultivation state. Usually, when undisturbed, she would enter a motionless state, her pulse and breath nearly silent.","But just now, she had moved slightly.","Qi Quan replied: [Someone is attacking the array at home.]","[Ah? What should we do? Su the butler and the others are still inside. If the array breaks, will Su and the others be in danger?]","[Don’t worry.]","【Well, the formation has eight levels, right? They wouldn’t send an eighth-level formation master to deal with you, would they?】","【Running a formation consumes a massive amount of spiritual energy. Once the energy runs out, the formation collapses on its own.】","The system panicked: 【So what do we do?】","It didn’t want Su Rong or Ling Sheng to get hurt!","Qi Quan smiled gently: 【Don’t worry. If this formation breaks, there’s another one.】","She always liked to keep a backup plan. The villa’s formation wasn’t just the visible protective array; there was actually a hidden formation beneath it.","As long as the protective formation remained intact, the hidden formation wouldn’t activate. But once the protective formation was broken, the hidden one would appear.","This hidden formation was a new design she had developed in her previous life. It could automatically absorb and store spiritual energy from the environment. After days of accumulation, it should be able to hold out for quite a while.","Besides...","The naturally gifted spiritual being she had kindly taken in was diligently guarding the house for her.","The system breathed a sigh of relief: 【That’s a relief.】","Relaxing, it then grumbled: 【But who exactly is attacking the house? It can’t be the Celestial Masters Association, can it? Do they really have the nerve to come here and embarrass themselves?】","Qi Quan chuckled at its words, laughing softly before sinking back into her cultivation.","A whole night passed.","The spiritual energy she had spent the night before was fully restored. Qi Quan opened her eyes, refreshed and full of spirit. After washing up, she headed to the dining room for breakfast.","Chen Feilu, worried that the guesthouse’s chef might not cook well enough to whet Qi Quan’s appetite, had gone out to buy food from a nearby restaurant.","“Master, I analyzed it last night — this breakfast place has the highest customer satisfaction.”","Qi Quan nodded. “Thank you, it’s quite good.”","The system couldn’t help but praise: 【Feilu is quite impressive—has potential!】","【Indeed, he does.】","System: 【Is the big boss planning to mentor him?】","Qi Quan leisurely sipped her porridge: 【We’ll see.】","Chen Feilu was unaware of the private conversation between her and the system, quietly reporting the aftermath of the rescue mission.","“Master, all personnel have... safely left the mountain. Without you, who knows how many would have been lost in Yaoshan.”","His eyes shone with admiration, but he wore a hesitant expression as if holding something back.","“Speak up.”","Chen Feilu cautiously said, “Captain Lin contacted me this morning. He said you performed a great deed last night. The authorities want to hold a commendation ceremony for you — this very noon.”","Qi Quan replied calmly, “No need.”","She wanted to go home.","Though the breakfast here was indeed good, it still couldn’t compare to Su Rong’s cooking.","Speaking of which, she hadn’t yet eaten the snacks Su Rong had given her.","She asked Chen Feilu, “Are the snacks I left in the car still there?”","“Yes, yes.” Chen Feilu immediately stood up. “I’ll get them for you right now.”","The snacks were packed in a box, thoughtfully sealed with a layer of soul energy by Su Rong to keep them fresh for a short time.","When the box was opened, the aroma was still as fresh and rich as ever.","Qi Quan never skimped on those she considered her own and shared some with Chen Feilu and Ning Zhi.","Chen Feilu happily accepted, and Ning Zhi was pleased as well. But thinking of the call from his second uncle last night, his mood was somewhat heavy.","“Brother Ning, are you heading straight back to Longjing later?” Chen Feilu asked.","Ning Zhi nodded. \"All active Celestial Masters in the Ning family are under the supervision of the Celestial Masters Association. I can’t just refuse to return.\"","He didn’t want to endanger the entire family because of himself.","“In that case, I’ll first escort the Master back to Longjiang, then head to Longjing to find you. We’ve both taken several days off already; if we don’t go back soon, our teachers will start worrying,” Chen Feilu said, trying to sound casual.","The system had a good impression of these two young men full of righteousness and sighed: [Boss, do you think Master Ning will be alright?]","Qi Quan: [It depends on his choice.]","[Are you really not going to intervene?]","[He’s an adult. I have no ties to him.]","System: [Alright then, I hope he can safely get through this crisis.]","Just after finishing their meal, Lin Yue arrived—he wasn’t alone.","There were four people in total.","The other three appeared to be two officials accompanied by a secretary.","“Master Qi, this is Luo Zhangyuan, the county magistrate of Ningtao County, and Lv Shengyang, the director of the Ningtao County Public Security Bureau,” Lin Yue introduced dutifully. “And this is Master Qi Quan, who rescued all the missing persons and the rescue team last night in Yaoshan.”","Luo Zhangyuan was in his fifties, his hair half gray and receding at the temples. His features were dignified, and he carried an imposing presence.","His gaze was sharp and discerning.","Although Qi Quan was dressed modestly and looked unusually young—quite different from the Masters he had imagined—her calm eyes and serene demeanor, along with the aura around her, marked her as no ordinary person. The two young men beside her showed subtle signs of respect, confirming she was a high-level expert beyond ordinary understanding.","He offered a sincere smile. “Master Qi, we are deeply grateful for your rescue of over a hundred trapped people in my county. Your immense kindness is unforgettable. I hereby sincerely invite you to attend the commendation ceremony. The car is ready outside; I hope you can spare the time.”","Qi Quan hesitated.","Lv Shengyang took the opportunity to persuade her. “Master Qi, we have already consulted Master Fang Ye. Yesterday, only you and your team responded to the call to assist in Yaoshan. Without you, the situation there would have been far more difficult to resolve. Moreover, regarding the background and details of the Yaoshan case, we may need to conduct further inquiries with that... gentleman.”","The male ghost from Yaoshan had been subdued by Qi Quan, and everyone present could see it clearly.","Naturally, the authorities wanted to understand the male ghost’s motives for killing, so they could report back to their superiors and the victims’ families.","Qi Quan found it hard to refuse those in police uniforms.","After a moment’s thought, she nodded. “The commendation ceremony isn’t necessary, but the ghost can be interrogated.”","She disliked being in the spotlight and hated giving speeches on stage.","It was a reasonable request, and Luo Zhangyuan and Lv Shengyang readily agreed.","Still, those who deserved credit had to receive it—they had already written their reports and submitted them to higher authorities.","This request for support from the Celestial Masters Association was also made under orders from above, but the outcome was far from ideal.","Luo Zhangyuan personally went to negotiate with the president of the Celestial Masters Association...","But the president was evasive and aloof, acting as if the lives of mere mortals were insignificant, which infuriated Luo Zhangyuan.","If not for the many favors he had promised, the association probably wouldn’t have budged.","Unfortunately, after the association dispatched the Flying Crane Talisman, none of the local Celestial Masters went to Yaoshan. In the end, they had no choice but to send Chu Changyi and Fang Ye.","Unexpectedly, Chu Changyi panicked upon arrival at Yaoshan and simply turned around and drove back.","At that moment, he was waiting in the office for updates. When he heard the news, he nearly stormed straight to the Taoist Masters Association demanding an explanation.","Fortunately, there was still a Level Four Taoist Master from Longjing City.","Luo Zhangyuan glanced at Ning Zhi, feeling a deep sense of relief.","But—","Fang Ye had also pointed out that Qi Quan, who had made the first significant contribution, was not listed in the Taoist Masters Association’s roster.","In other words, she never received any notification from the Association. She had simply happened to be with Master Ning and, without hesitation, went straight to Yaoshan to rescue people.","To say it wasn’t moving would be impossible.","Luo Zhangyuan was now filled with gratitude and admiration for Qi Quan. Not a trace of neglect in his attitude, he even personally opened the car door for her.","Qi Quan: “...”","She calmly settled into the car. Ning Zhi, eager to return to Longjing City as soon as possible, politely declined the invitation. Only Chen Feilu accompanied her to the government office building.","Inside the Ningtao County Government Office building, several people were already waiting in the conference room.","Fang Ye looked slightly excited. Although he hadn’t been much help last night, he had participated in the rescue efforts and was sure to be praised.","As for Senior Chu...","He stole a glance at Chu Changyi.","Chu Changyi sat next to the president, his expression far from pleasant, his brows still carrying that arrogant look.","There was another person, sitting quietly in the corner, almost invisible, but on closer look, he carried an imposing aura, with a military demeanor.","He had a buzz cut, was in his thirties, with a square face and striking features. His physique was strong and powerful, with smooth muscle lines clearly visible.","Not someone to be trifled with.","Fang Ye withdrew his gaze.","“President, I’m wondering if that kid last night just got lucky. Yaoshan’s ghost is at least Level Five. How could a Level Four Taoist Master take it down?”","The president’s expression was inscrutable: “He comes from Longjing City. The Taoist Masters there have substantial resources.”","The implication was clear—he must have had some high-level magical artifacts on hand.","Fang Ye listened in secretly, quietly amused.","He hadn’t told the Association the full story last night, so even the president and Chu Changyi still believed it was Master Ning who had taken action.","After a moment, footsteps sounded outside the door.","Everyone looked up.","Leading the group was Luo Zhangyuan. He entered with a broad smile, courteously inviting a woman inside the meeting room.","The woman was young, with exceptionally delicate and beautiful features.","“Master Qi, please have a seat.” Luo Zhangyuan personally pulled out a chair for her.","It was the first seat on the left side, clearly showing his respect for Qi Quan.","The Taoist Masters Association president: ???","He was only the second seat on the right!","The rightmost seat was reserved for Lv Shengyang, with Chen Feilu sitting immediately to Qi Quan’s right in the second seat on the left. Fang Ye sat further down.","As for Chu Changyi, he was relegated to the third seat on the right.","The man with the square face remained quietly in the corner, not participating in the meeting.","The president and Chu Changyi nearly spat blood.","What was Luo Zhangyuan doing? Was he trying to humiliate them? How could he let a few young upstarts sit above them?","He clenched his anger and, before Luo Zhangyuan could speak, was the first to ask, “Which one is Master Ning?”","Luo Zhangyuan was speechless.","He felt uncomfortable inside but kept a calm expression.","When the president asked, his gaze was directed at Chen Feilu. Knowing that Master Ning was a young man, who else could it be besides Chen Feilu?","However, neither Qi Quan nor Chen Feilu spoke, and for some reason, Fang Ye didn’t say anything either.","The atmosphere grew awkward.","The chairman’s expression grew increasingly grim.","Luo Zhangyuan and Lv Shengyang exchanged a glance, feeling a subtle sense of satisfaction...","They had endured too many slights from the Taoist Association.","Before the Yaoshan incident, Ningtao County had also experienced supernatural phenomena. They had requested support from the Taoist Association many times, but the association only gave them the runaround, never truly caring about the lives of ordinary people.","They had been repeatedly stonewalled.","Chu Changyi cleared his throat lightly, stepping in to ease the chairman’s tension. “Where’s Master Ning? Why isn’t he here?”","Only then did Chen Feilu speak, smiling as he said, “He’s busy, can’t make it.”","“Then what about the Yaoshan evil spirit?” Chu Changyi asked. “Isn’t that the demon Master Ning subdued? If he’s not here, are we just going to interrogate thin air?”","Chen Feilu was speechless.","He tilted his head and looked toward Qi Quan.","Qi Quan remained unfazed, said nothing, and directly tossed out a peachwood talisman.","Spiritual energy poured into it, and suddenly the Yaoshan evil spirit appeared behind Chu Changyi, its pale blue ghostly hand resting on his shoulder.","Chu Changyi: ...","Ahhhhh, a level-five red ghost!","He instinctively pulled out a set of talismans, ready to throw them at the Yaoshan ghost.","“Chu Changyi!” the chairman barked sharply.","Only then did Chu Changyi snap back to reality.","The Yaoshan ghost was no longer behind him but had been pulled by Qi Quan to the last chair.","Even Luo Zhangyuan and Lv Shengyang, who had been prepared, were stunned by such a supernatural display.","They even suspected it was some kind of 3D projection.","The Yaoshan ghost had been cramped inside the peachwood talisman all night and had just been educated by Qin Ruo — that old, ugly woman — about Qi Quan’s terrifying abilities. Now, it had lost all will to resist.","It drooped its brows and arched its back slightly.","In the corner, a square-jawed man suddenly fixed his gaze sharply on the Yaoshan ghost, then glanced over at Qi Quan, and to avoid offense, quickly returned his eyes to the male ghost.","Lv Shengyang composed himself and asked, “What’s your name? Why are you harming people?”","Having been a cop for most of his life, this was his first time interrogating a ghost.","The Yaoshan ghost hung its head in dejection. “If I tell you, will you help me get justice?”","“Go ahead, tell us.”","The ghost, long pent up with grievances, immediately straightened up, eyes reddening with fury.","“My name is Wei Hao — Wei as in guard, Hao as in bright. I was murdered.”","The name was ordinary enough, but both Luo Zhangyuan and Lv Shengyang were slightly taken aback.","Fang Ye’s eyes also revealed surprise.","Because they all knew someone named “Wei Hao.”","Lv Shengyang’s expression darkened. “Who killed you?”","“Wei Tianbao.”","Lv Shengyang: !!!","He asked in shock, “You mean Wei Tianbao, son of Wei Guangchang, chairman of Fengmao Group?”","Fang Ye couldn’t help but say, “Isn’t the chairman’s son named Wei Hao?”","“He changed his name!” Wei Hao cursed furiously. “He deliberately took my name! He ruined my entire life! I want revenge! I want revenge!”","He screamed hoarsely, eyes bloodshot, but couldn’t break free from Qi Quan’s restraints.","Lv Shengyang had heard about Wei Tianbao’s name change before.","He asked, “What year were you born?”","Wei Hao calmed himself and choked out, “For six or seven years, my family was poor, but my parents sold everything they had to send me to school. I studied hard and did well. In 1985, I took the college entrance exam. I was confident, waiting eagerly for the acceptance letter. But no matter how long I waited, even after all the universities had started classes, my letter never came.”","At this point, everyone present began to suspect something.","He continued, “My family was disappointed, and I was heartbroken. I planned to retake the exam for another year, but my father collapsed from exhaustion trying to earn money. The medical bills were huge, so I had no choice but to go out and work.”","“I worked many jobs. Though exhausting, I was able to support my family. I thought this would be my life—I stopped dreaming foolish dreams of one day entering the hallowed halls of a university, graduating with honors, getting a respectable job, then honoring my parents and starting my own family.”","“I accepted my fate.” He lowered his head. No one could see his expression, but the heaviness in his heart was palpable...",".","“But one day, while working as a waiter in a restaurant, I heard someone call out ‘Wei Hao.’ I turned around, only to realize they weren’t calling me, but the man in front of me.”","“He was dressed in clothes worth tens of thousands, wearing a watch worth millions—a kind of wealthy man I had never dared to speak to before. I didn’t dare look closely, but I was desperate to see what a person with my name looked like.”","“I saw him!” Wei Hao became excited, laughing and crying at the same time. “He’s not really Wei Hao at all! He’s my former classmate, Wei Tianbao! His father used to be the biggest boss in our county—everyone at school knew that!”","“How could he be called Wei Hao? What right does he have to that name?!”","Lv Shengyang sighed softly and asked, “Then what happened?”","“Well...” Wei Hao covered his face with both hands, his voice hoarse, “I still didn’t dare ask. After they left, I finally asked the manager who that ‘Wei Hao’ was. The manager said he’s the heir to the Fengmao Group, very talented, and a top student at Longjing University of Technology. But I had chosen Longjing University of Technology as my only choice back then! And his grades were a complete mess!”","Everyone understood now: it was because of this identity theft that all these misfortunes came to pass.","Wei Hao sneered bitterly, “He stole my life. If it weren’t for him, I could have lived the life I wanted! I couldn’t bear it anymore, so I went to find him. The life that was taken from me could never be returned, so I just wanted to ask him for some money. My parents’ health was failing, and I needed to save money for their treatment. But not only did he refuse to acknowledge me, he even had people beat me up and throw me out.”","“I had no choice but to sue. But before I even got to the police station, I received a call from home—my father was dying. I rushed back, but I never got to see him one last time. Someone hit me from behind with a club and buried me in Yaoshan.”","He died with endless resentment and regret. Yaoshan is a place with exceptional feng shui, so he became a ghost.","He wants to seek revenge and find out how his mother is doing.","Wei Hao pleaded, “I died at 27. When I died, my mother was only 47. How many years have passed since then? She should still be alive, right?”","The crowd fell silent.","It had been thirty years since he lost him. If his mother were still alive, she would be seventy-seven by now. But judging from his earlier description, it was hard to say whether a woman, faced with the immense blow of her husband’s death and her son’s disappearance, could have held on.","“I’ll have someone look into it right away,” Lv Shengyang said, then left the conference room.","The atmosphere inside the room was heavy and tense.","The system sighed sadly: [He’s so miserable. His father and mother suffered so much too.]","Qi Quan: [No matter how tragic, it’s no excuse to harm others.]","[True. But the most hateful person is still that Wei Tianbao! How could he steal someone else’s life!]","Qi Quan made no further comment.","Soon, Lv Shengyang returned to the conference room. His expression had shifted from the earlier solemnity to one of urgency. “Wei Hao, your mother, Ms. Cao Fang, she’s still alive.”","Wei Hao’s mind went completely blank.","He stared at Lv Shengyang in a daze, his ears buzzing. The shock was overwhelming—he was too stunned to respond.","In truth, he had already prepared himself for the worst.","But never in his wildest dreams had he expected his mother to be alive!","She was still alive!","Snapping back to reality, Wei Hao burst into uncontrollable tears.","System: [Sigh.]","It was truly heartbreaking.","Soon, all of Cao Fang’s information was laid out on the table.","Even the well-experienced Lv Shengyang couldn’t help but feel deep respect for this seventy-seven-year-old woman.","Thirty years ago, after losing her husband and discovering her son missing, she had fallen ill under the double blow.","But not long after, despite her frail health, she made her way alone to the city where Wei Hao had been working. Living by scavenging garbage, she painstakingly gathered information about her son bit by bit.","After five years, she finally located the manager of the restaurant where he had once worked.","On the very day Wei Hao received the call, he had taken leave from the restaurant manager to return to his hometown—and then vanished without a trace.","The restaurant manager, moved by her plight, told her everything about Wei Hao in detail, including the encounter with Wei Tianbao.","After that...","This mother, fully aware of the problem, began a decades-long campaign of petitions and appeals.","Unfortunately, to this day, she has yet to receive any answers.","Chen Feilu, looking at this long-delayed truth, couldn’t help but shed tears.","He simply couldn’t bear stories like this.","Wei Hao was even more overwhelmed with grief.","He sobbed and pleaded, “Can I please see my mother? I really want to see her. There’s so much I want to say to her. Please, I beg you... I’m begging you...”","He knelt down and kowtowed to Qi Quan and the others.","System: [Wuwuwuwu.]","Qi Quan struck with spiritual energy, helping him to his feet. His expression was calm as he said, “Have you ever thought about the families of those you harmed? They suffer just like your mother.”","Wei Hao’s crying paused.","He said, “I’m willing to bear whatever punishment. I only ask for one thing: to give my mother an answer.”","What answer?","Naturally, it was the justice she had waited half her life for.","Lv Shengyang’s expression grew serious. “This matter—I will make sure your mother gets a proper explanation.”","Wei Hao had worked in Longlin City, and now his mother lived there too.","The once-powerful tycoon of Ningtao County had long since moved beyond Longtan City to become the richest man in Longlin City.","Wei Tianbao was now fifty-seven, living a happy life surrounded by a harmonious family, children, and grandchildren, carefree and at ease.","Chen Feilu whispered, \"Master, back then Wei Tianbao was only eighteen, not capable enough. The impersonation must have been done by his father, Wei Guangchang.\"","\"Hmm.\" Qi Quan stood up. \"The matter is settled. It's time to go back.\"","What followed was the police's responsibility.","She sealed Wei Hao into the peach wood talisman, making as if to leave.","\"Wait!\" Chu Changyi suddenly called out, blocking her path. \"Wei Hao, you can’t take him away!\"","Qi Quan didn’t even spare him a glance.","\"The ghost was caught by the master, so why can’t he be taken away?\" Chen Feilu rolled his eyes.","Chu Changyi said, \"This is a ghost from Longtan City, so it should be under the jurisdiction of the Longtan City Taoist Association. Besides, you still haven’t shown your Taoist credentials. You don’t have any, do you?\"","He had just taken a moment to check, and Qi Quan’s name was nowhere to be found on the association’s roster.","Operating without a license was a major taboo!","The association president feigned surprise and turned to Luo Zhangyuan. \"Without Taoist credentials, you have no authority to detain evil spirits. Moreover, intervening in Taoist affairs without certification violates the association’s regulations. Director Luo, this person needs to be taken in for questioning.\"","Luo Zhangyuan was speechless.","If it weren’t for his position, he would have rolled up his sleeves and dealt with him right then and there.","Lv Shengyang was equally dumbfounded.","He said, \"Master Qi was the hero of the Yaoshan incident. She saved hundreds of lives. Isn’t what you’re doing completely backwards? From what I know, Master Chu personally came to the scene last night but backed down at the last moment, didn’t he?\"","Chu Changyi replied confidently, \"I knew I was outmatched. Should I have rushed in just to throw my life away?\"","\"...\"","Chen Feilu sneered, \"An association that can’t even subdue a local ghost has no right to talk about jurisdiction. This is just laughable.\"","Chu Changyi was about to retort but was stopped by the president.","\"No matter what, Master Qi is without credentials. That’s a fact. You’ve already violated the 'Taoist Association Regulations.' The association has the right to hold you accountable.\"","Qi Quan couldn’t be bothered and ordered Chen Feilu, \"Let’s go.\"","\"Yes, master!\"","The president’s face darkened like ink. He prided himself on his prestigious status. In Longtan City, no one had dared to humiliate him like this before.","He gathered spiritual energy in his palm, aiming it at Qi Quan’s back.","\"Master Qi, please wait!\"","A deep voice suddenly rang out. A broad-faced man stepped in front of Qi Quan, blocking the president’s spell.","Qi Quan turned around.","She had noticed this man from the start.","Though he tried hard to lower his presence, the golden light of merit radiating from him made him the most dazzling figure in the crowd to a Taoist’s eyes.","...","She had always respected those with profound merits.","\"What is it?\"","The broad-faced man said politely, \"I wonder if Master Qi has time for a chat?\"","\"About what?\"","\"There are some questions I’d like to ask. I hope Master Qi can enlighten me.\"","Qi Quan roughly guessed his intention and said, \"We can talk on the way.\"","The broad-faced man hesitated for a moment before nodding in agreement.","The president, having been interrupted, had no choice but to give up.","He stared at Qi Quan’s retreating figure, his gaze darkening.","\"Master Chu,\" Lv Shengyang called out to Chu Changyi, \"May I ask how you determined last night that you couldn’t subdue the Yaoshan ghost?\"","Chu Changyi replied, \"Naturally, it was through Taoist methods.\"","“I can understand your way of protecting your own life, but as a Taoist priest whose duty is to exorcise ghosts, it’s really...” Lv Shengyang paused, then turned to the chairman. “There was such a high-level evil spirit in Yaoshan, and the Taoist Association didn’t notice it at all? Chairman, shouldn’t you give us an explanation?”","The chairman: “......”","He snorted coldly and walked away with a flick of his hand.","Lv Shengyang had expected this outcome. He wasn’t saying these things to cause pointless sacrifices, but simply to needle them a little.","After all, they had shown disrespect to Master Qi.","On the way back, Chen Feilu was driving, Guozi with his square face sat in the front passenger seat, and Qi Quan leaned against the back seat.","“Let me formally introduce myself. My name is Li Guoyan. I’m here this time to get in touch with you. I apologize for the sudden intrusion.”","Qi Quan: “Is this about establishing a paranormal management department?”","“That’s right.” Li Guoyan’s composed face showed a faint smile. “We’ve reviewed Han Mian’s application materials. He mentioned you in them. We conducted a preliminary investigation and found that you’re not affiliated with any sect or clan of Taoist priests, nor are you registered with the Taoist Association.”","These were all public facts. Even without an investigation, anyone could easily find out.","Qi Quan didn’t care.","Her tone was firm: “I will not join any sect, clan, or other organization.”","Li Guoyan smiled.","“So, we want to hire you as the chief consultant for the investigation department. There will be salary and allowances. We won’t disturb you unnecessarily. Only when there are difficult problems that can’t be solved will we ask for your help. Of course, if you agree, the salary and allowances can be paid to you through Screaming Literature City.”","System: [Wow! This way you can exchange for lifespan!]","Qi Quan: ...","She knew very well that the authorities couldn’t possibly know she could exchange lifespan through the data of *The Heiress Diary*, but perhaps they guessed how much she valued it, so they struck right at her weak spot.","She had to admit, it did tickle her itch.","She asked, “How much is the salary? And the allowances?”","Li Guoyan answered sincerely, “Everything is negotiable.”","Qi Quan fell silent.","“There’s more,” Li Guoyan said with a concerned expression, “I received news last night that the Taoist Association of Longjing City sent two sixth-level Taoist priests to attack your residence. You don’t have a Taoist certificate, and the Taoist Association is unilaterally intimidating you. If you join us, we can guarantee that such incidents won’t happen again.”","The authorities were not unprepared.","After the problems arose within the Daoist world, the government had already started cultivating special talents, secretly gathering Daoist cultivators willing to serve the government. Now, the entire system was roughly in place.","Qi Quan was their unexpected prize.","They didn’t know her exact level, but judging from her several actions, she was very likely a high-level Taoist priest skilled in both talismans and formations.","Perhaps even beyond sixth level.","Such talent was exactly what they desperately needed.","System: [Wow, he’s really sincere! Since we can’t get along with the Taoist Association anyway, why not be their consultant? More money, less trouble, higher status.]","Qi Quan was somewhat tempted, but she still asked cautiously, “Besides solving difficult cases, what else does a consultant have to do?”","“Your level is high; you’re a senior member of the team...","Our newly formed team members are still like seedlings. When they have questions, if they can come to you, I hope you’ll help clear up their doubts.”","Qi Quan understood immediately—it was about being the coach.","In her past life, she had spent no small effort guiding disciples in her sect. Who would have thought, after all the twists and turns, she would still have to shoulder responsibility?","But there was one fundamental difference.","In her last life, she was destined to die young. This life, however, she could continuously exchange for more life.","She had to admit, getting paid through Screaming Literature City really hit the spot.","She wanted to live longer.","And Li Guoyan wasn’t entirely wrong.","She had already fallen out with the Taoist Masters Association. Even if she wasn’t afraid of them, having flies buzzing in her ears every day was annoying. It would be different if she had a strong backing.","This was a mutually beneficial cooperation.","She said, “I need to look over the employment contract first before I can give you an answer.”","Li Guoyan smiled happily.","He knew she was already softening.","Suddenly, Qi Quan asked, “Can I have an assistant?”","Li Guoyan was taken aback for a moment. “Of course.”","Qi Quan pointed at the driver, Chen Feilu. “Him. From now on, if there’s anything, you can contact him.”","The car nearly swerved into an S-shape.","Chen Feilu was overjoyed, his heart pounding wildly. Excitedly, he shouted, “Master, rest assured! I will work hard to be the best assistant!”","Li Guoyan: ...","This kid has unlimited potential.","Qi Quan added, “Since the team urgently needs talent, I can recommend someone.”","“Please do.”","“Ning Zhi,” Qi Quan said. “I believe you’re familiar with him. He’s about to face disciplinary action from the Longjing City Taoist Masters Association.”","Li Guoyan nodded. “Don’t worry, we will make sure to give you a satisfactory resolution on this matter.”","Qi Quan had no more questions and closed her eyes to cultivate.","At this moment, at the Qi family villa.","Qi Yingxue, who had stayed in her room for a whole day and night, finally opened the door.","She wasn’t as disheveled as expected; in fact, she had made a point to dress up a little, though her eyes were a bit red and swollen, and her feet were bandaged.","She glanced around the Qi family living room.","Only Gu Qiao was there.","Although Gu Qiao still felt somewhat awkward, more than twenty years of relationship wasn’t fake.","She asked with concern, “Yingxue, the online incident has been suppressed. You don’t need to worry.”","Qi Yingxue nodded and asked, “Has Song Lin come by?”","Gu Qiao was stunned for a moment and shook her head stiffly.","Logically, with such a big incident happening to Qi Yingxue, as her fiancé, Song Lin shouldn’t have been silent, right?","Qi Yingxue’s expression was calm.","She sat down on the sofa and suddenly said softly, “Mom, don’t you think Qi Quan is very strange?”","“Strange how?”","Qi Yingxue: “It’s like she’s become a different person.”","“...”","Gu Qiao suddenly felt a little flustered. “Yingxue, what do you mean by that?”","“Mom, the Qi Quan before the Du family’s birthday banquet and the Qi Quan now—are they really the same person?” Qi Yingxue didn’t give her a chance to respond. “Would the real Qi Quan use such eerie methods? She doesn’t seem like someone who grew up in the countryside at all. Haven’t you ever suspected anything?”","Gu Qiao: ...","Her face suddenly turned pale. “What are you trying to do by saying these things?”","Qi Yingxue said, \"Mom, I just want to uncover the truth.\"","As the saying goes, the person who knows you best is often your greatest enemy.","Under the relentless attacks and ridicule online, Qi Yingxue clung to Qi Quan like a lifeline. She locked herself in her room, desperately piecing together the events of the past few months. It seemed that if she could just find Qi Quan’s fatal flaw, she could clear her name.","Fortunately, she found it.","Qi Quan’s sudden and drastic change in behavior had to mean something was wrong.","She was determined to strip Qi Quan down to his core!"]},{"number":36,"title":"Chapter 36","paragraphs":["Lakeside Villa.","Last night's successful defense of the home was entirely thanks to Ling Sheng's spiritual power output, so early this morning, Su Rong made a lot of delicious food to reward him.","Ling Sheng didn't quite understand the way they were looking at him, but it didn't stop him from enjoying the feast.","After breakfast, it was study time.","Xue Hong said with a beaming smile, \"You performed a great service last night. I'll reward you with ten sets of high school entrance exam past papers. Finish them today.\"","Ling Sheng: \"...\"","\"Last night I said I would impart all my lifelong learning to you. I won't go back on my word.\"","Before she could finish speaking, Ling Sheng had already finished the multiple-choice questions with swift strokes.","These questions required no thought; he knew the answers at a glance.","Xue Hong secretly marveled: Such a monstrously talented seedling—who on earth was the damned one who imprisoned him! Otherwise, he would have been shining brightly in the world's academic forest long ago!","The villa's telephone rang.","Su Rong drifted over to answer it.","\"Hello, Lakeside Villa.\"","A woman's voice came from the other end of the line, soft and gentle.","\"Hello, is Qi Quan at home?\"","Su Rong frowned. Nowadays in Longjiang City, hardly anyone addressed the Master by her full name.","\"May I ask who's calling?\"","\"I'm her mother.\"","Su Rong's expression turned cold. \"If I remember correctly, after Master revived Qi Yuan, she severed ties with the Qi family.\"","Moreover, this mother had never once visited Lakeside Villa, showing how little she cared for the Master.","Gu Qiao was taken aback for a moment but continued, \"I'd like to see her. Is that possible?\"","\"Master is in cultivation and is not receiving guests.\" Su Rong hung up directly.","Gu Qiao: \"...\"","She glanced at Qi Yingxue beside her.","Qi Yingxue lowered her eyes. \"Go there directly.\"","Gu Qiao actually didn't really want to go, but she had been frightened by Qi Yingxue's words.","If the current Qi Quan wasn't the previous Qi Quan, then who exactly was she?","Where did all her bizarre abilities come from?","The two took a car to Lakeside Villa.","Outside Lakeside Villa.","The Talisman Master and Formation Master, having hit a wall here, had already returned to Longjing City. Only Yan Wu persisted.","He sat on a bench not far from Qi Quan's home, silently pondering how to deal with her. He was already certain that Ding Ji's death was her doing.","He had reported to his superiors, and their instruction was—prioritize control, eliminate if necessary.","This stumped him.","Even the Celestial Master Association couldn't do anything about her, what else could he possibly do?","Yan Wu was in a somber mood.","Equally somber was Gu Qiao, who was being stopped outside the villa.","\"Ms. Gu, my apologies. The Master is truly in cultivation and is not receiving outside guests.\" Su Rong's voice came from the video intercom.","Gu Qiao's face burned with shame.","Having been Mrs. Qi for so many years, few people had ever refused her so bluntly and without consideration.","And this person was her own biological daughter's butler.","Her pride wounded, she had no choice but to turn back after being rejected, but was called to stop just as she was about to get in the car.","While Yan Wu was deep in thought, he heard voices not far away and his mind stirred.","He had gone over Qi Quan's biographical information and social connections repeatedly.","He recognized Gu Qiao.","\"Wait, you're Celestial Master Qi's mother, right?\"","Gu Qiao turned around. Seeing his ordinary appearance and sincere smile, she instinctively replied, \"Who are you?\"","\"I'm from the Celestial Master Association. This is my Celestial Master certificate.\" He showed her his ID. \"I'm here to discuss official business with Master Qi.\"","His voice wasn't low, and Qi Yingxue, sitting unseen inside the car, also heard.","Celestial Master Association?","Gu Qiao said, \"She's in cultivation and not receiving guests. You should head back for now.\"","\"I know.\" Yan Wu sighed. \"Actually, I came to see Celestial Master Qi before, hoping to persuade her to join the Celestial Master Association. There are rules in our line of work; those without a Celestial Master certificate cannot handle paranormal cases. She has already violated the association's regulations, so... However, Master Qi doesn't seem very welcoming of me.\"","Gu Qiao frowned. Facing a stranger, she still defended her family.","\"I don't understand these things.\"","She turned to get into the car.","\"Wait, Ms. Gu,\" Yan Wu took out a business card and handed it over. \"You are Celestial Master Qi's mother. Surely she will listen to your advice. I hope you can help me. Otherwise, the Celestial Master Association will resort to coercive measures against her. I imagine you wouldn't want to see that happen, right?\"","\"Coercive measures?\" Gu Qiao stopped. \"What kind of coercive measures?\"","\"It's quite similar to official law enforcement. If you violate the regulations, you naturally have to accept punishment.\" Yan Wu smiled. \"After you persuade Celestial Master Qi, please inform me promptly.\"","He offered the card again.","Gu Qiao didn't take it.","The car window suddenly rolled down. Qi Yingxue reached out and took it. \"Thank you for the reminder. We will do our best to persuade her.\"","Yan Wu smiled and left.","Gu Qiao returned to the car absentmindedly, worriedly saying, \"How did it come to this?\"","Qi Yingxue said, \"The Celestial Master Association sounds like a powerful department. Perhaps Qi Quan isn't unwilling, but afraid. If she really is a Celestial Master, why wouldn't she comply with the Association's rules and regulations?\"","\"If she's not a Celestial Master, then what is she?\"","Qi Yingxue said with a deep, obscure expression, \"We'll only know after we ask clearly.\"","Meanwhile, Qi Quan, who was still on her way back, suddenly opened her eyes.","[Big Shot, what's wrong?]","Qi Quan glanced casually out the window, smiled, and asked: [System, when you bound me and entered this body, could it be detected by others?]","Her intuition had always been sharp. Just a moment ago, she sensed a trace of malice.","Her cultivation was high; almost no one could harm her. If it were just a normal attack, it wouldn't trigger her intuition. Only something targeting her \"soul\" would put her on alert.","System: [Of course not! Your compatibility with this body is absolutely perfect. You could say you are the original person.]","Qi Quan believed it.","This body looked exactly like her previous life's. If not for the completely different experiences, it wouldn't be an exaggeration to say they were the same person.","Same name, perfect physical compatibility, and also... fortune—","If she remembered correctly, the reason Ding Ji went through such convoluted means to have the \"real heiress\" die accidentally from fright was precisely because the \"real heiress\" had extraordinary fortune and couldn't be easily dealt with.","But if the \"real heiress\" truly had overwhelming fortune, how could she have died so easily?","Fortune...","Could the System's sudden binding be referring to this fortune?","Qi Quan felt she might have touched upon the truth of her transmigration.","This could also explain why, in her previous life, she was free from illness and disaster, possessed astonishing talent, and had profound cultivation, yet only lived to twenty-two.","Qi Quan suddenly felt a bit of affection for the System.","Perhaps it was the embodiment of \"fortune,\" using this unique method to allow the \"real heiress\" to be reborn from the hands of an evil cultivator, granting her a chance to extend her life.","Qi Quan couldn't help but curve her eyes in pleasure.","If the System truly was \"fortune,\" then this body was actually her original self. After the accident, with the help of \"fortune,\" she gained rich experiences in another world. At the age of twenty-two, her destined time of death, she returned to her world of origin.","But \"fortune\" couldn't be without limitations.","Her memories of the world of origin were blocked. She became a newborn in another world. From confusion and ignorance to the turning point of life at twenty-two, how much \"experience\" she could gain depended entirely on her own efforts.","Even if she had talent, if she didn't work hard, it would all come to nothing in the end.","This perfectly explains why, when she transmigrated to this world, she was able to bring all her cultivation with her.","The existence of the system was merely to rationalize the \"fortune\" and guide her on how to use this \"fortune\" after her return.","The doubts buried deep in her heart suddenly cleared.","The car left the national highway and entered the territory of Longjiang City.","Qi Quan received a call from Han Mian.","\"Qi... Master, the victim's identity in the Longjiang University dismemberment case has been confirmed, and the suspect has been identified.\"","Qi Quan hadn't asked about Xue Hong's cause of death before and was somewhat curious: \"Go on.\"","\"Her name is Xue Hong, 29 years old. She obtained her Ph.D. in Biochemistry from Longjiang University at 28 and subsequently taught in the Biochemistry department there.\"","\"She was a strict teacher. Before her disappearance, a student who failed her final exam had a dispute with her. Three days later, a post appeared on her social media saying she was heartbroken and planned to leave this place of sorrow to study abroad. She also submitted a resignation letter to the university via email. After that, she vanished without a trace.\"","Qi Quan's eyes darkened slightly: \"And no one noticed anything was wrong?\"","\"She devoted all her energy to her studies and work, had almost no friends, and minimal social interaction. No one really knew if she had ever been in a relationship.\"","\"What about the student who failed the exam?\"","\"He graduated successfully.\"","Qi Quan frowned. To kill and dismember someone just over failing an exam?","The hatred seemed excessive.","Or perhaps, there was an inherent tendency towards depravity.","\"What's his name?\"","Han Mian: \"His surname is Wei, Wei Tao. He's the grandson of Wei Guangchang from Fengmao Group in Longlin City, and the youngest son of Wei Tianbao.\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","What a coincidence!","But it's not impossible.","Years ago, Wei Guangchang and Wei Tianbao stole a prestigious university spot from someone else, stealing their future. Thirty years ago, Wei Tianbao brutally murdered Wei Hao and dumped the body in the mountains. Five years ago, Wei Tao, driven by resentment and rage, killed Xue Hong and disposed of her body in the woods.","This is a true \"family tradition\"!","Even the system was trembling: [If Wei Tao really did it, then this family is too terrifying!]","Qi Quan asked: \"Is it confirmed to be Wei Tao's doing?\"","Han Mian: \"I'm about to take a team to Longlin City to investigate.\"","\"Alright.\"","\"There's also some good news.\"","\"Oh?\"","Han Mian said with slight excitement: \"Over in Longtan City, following the lead from Wu Liang, they've uncovered part of the low-end ghost marriage business chain. Evidence shows this chain has a wide reach, with girls from multiple areas like Longjiang City and Longxi City having been victimized.\"","\"That's good,\" Qi Quan said. \"As for the participants from the metaphysical community, leave them for the metaphysical authorities to handle.\"","Han Mian: \"With your word, I'm reassured.\"","The ghost marriage case involved too wide a scope and too many regions to be fully exposed quickly, but at least there was a lead now. Many suspects in Longtan City and Longjiang City had already been apprehended.","Qi Quan hadn't forgotten what Qin Ruo said.","The senior who introduced her to the path back then was Yan Wu. Yan Wu was involved in the ghost marriage case years ago and, following orders from a malevolent cultivator organization, caused the death of Officer Qi Zheng. That was already ten years ago.","In ten years, that network would only have spread wider.","She originally wanted to use Yan Wu to lure out bigger fish. Unfortunately, members of the malevolent cultivator organization were cunning and tried to use the Celestial Master Association's influence to suppress her.","The person behind it all was deeply hidden.","After hanging up, the car had already entered the suburban area of Nanhu District, approaching the lakeside villa.","Li Guoyan said, \"Master Qi, I'll get off here. I will deliver the letter of appointment to your residence later.\"","\"Alright.\"","Longlin City.","In a luxurious villa, a young man clutching his phone hurriedly knocked and entered the study.","\"Grandfather!\"","The old man inside was practicing calligraphy and didn't even look up. \"What's with this rashness? It's unbecoming.\"","\"Grandfather,\" the man said, his face pale, \"That matter... it seems to have been discovered. What should I do?\"","The old man didn't pause his hand, smoothly finishing the last stroke. The paper clearly bore the character \"Chang\" (Prosperity).","This character was good; it could ensure their Wei family's prosperity for generations.","Seeing he had finished writing, Wei Tao said impatiently, \"Someone discovered those bones, I don't know who. They've been dug up now, people are discussing it online, the police are investigating. I heard from a friend in Longjiang City that... the police already know I had a conflict with her. What if they come to question me?\"","\"What's there to panic about?\" Wei Guangchang glanced at him. \"So many years have passed, what evidence could remain?\"","Wei Tao's anxious mood was instantly soothed. He let out a sigh of relief, a smile appearing on his face. \"Right, it's been several years. Who could possibly find out?\"","As soon as the words left his mouth, another person rushed into the study in a panic.","\"Dad, something happened at Yaoshan,\" Wei Tianbao said, his face even paler than Wei Tao's. \"It seems there's something unclean inside. Do you think it could be, could it be...\"","Wei Guangchang frowned.","Why were things happening one after another all of a sudden?","He looked down at the freshly written character \"Chang.\" He hadn't noticed before, but now he saw one stroke was slightly crooked.","An inexplicable sense of foreboding struck his heart.","All these years, his intuition had never been wrong.","Wei Guangchang immediately dialed a number. It rang for a long time before being answered. The voice on the other end was lazy, carrying a hint of arrogance.","\"Wei Guangchang? What do you want?\"","Despite his age and high status, Wei Guangchang wasn't angered by being addressed so directly. He chuckled, \"Celestial Master Wei, are you free today? I have some newly arrived top-grade jade. Shall I personally deliver it to your residence later?\"","\"Fine, come over.\"","Wei Guangchang hung up, glared sternly at his son and grandson, and sighed heavily. \"Later, you two come with me. Let Celestial Master Wei take a look.\"","\"Dad, are you talking about the one from the Hengfeng Sect?\" Wei Tianbao asked eagerly.","Wei Guangchang nodded, his expression one of yearning and melancholy.","\"Speaking of which, going back three or four generations, we share the same lineage with Celestial Master Wei. How did their branch produce a Wei Huanyang?\"","As Wei Guangchang grew older, he often lamented, wishing he could also practice metaphysical arts.","He heard many masters were much older than him but looked younger than his son.","Unfortunately, their family hadn't produced a promising seedling.","Not long after, the three of them, carrying the precious jade, headed to a luxurious mansion in the suburbs.","A young acolyte opened the door, with hair tied in a high topknot, wearing a Taoist robe, looking delicate and cute.","He spoke in a clear, crisp voice: \"Master is bathing and changing. Please wait in the living room.\"","The three sat waiting in the living room. No one attended to them.","Wei Tao was young and didn't know much about the metaphysical world. He only knew his family members all possessed priceless protective talismans bought from Master Wei.","He had never met Master Wei. Judging by the title, he should be an ethereal, immortal-like master.","\"Grandfather, was that Master's disciple who opened the door?\"","Wei Guangchang: \"You could say so.\"","Wei Tao: \"...\"","What did that mean?","He was about to ask more when a figure suddenly appeared outside the door. Footsteps silent, dressed in loose casual clothes, expression calm, he walked in.","He was a very young man, handsome and of extraordinary bearing. He didn't look like some master, but rather like a young master from a wealthy family.","Wei Tao: ???","Seeing his grandfather and father simultaneously rise and respectfully step forward to greet the man, he had to swallow the words in his mouth and follow behind them.","\"Master Wei, pardon the intrusion.\" Wei Guangchang signaled to Wei Tianbao.","Wei Tianbao hurriedly presented an exquisite box, filled with the finest jade stones. Over the years, the resources the Wei family had provided for Wei Huanyang's cultivation could be described as an astronomical sum.","\"Master, this is a small token of our Wei family's esteem. We hope you will accept it.\"","Wei Huanyang sat on the sofa, opened it for a glance, and casually set it aside.","The quality of these jade stones was quite good; they could be used to curry favor with the sect elders. Jade could be used to craft higher-grade talismans, their efficacy far surpassing that of paper talismans.","Take spirit talismans, for instance. A paper talisman could store only a fraction of the spiritual power a jade spirit talisman could. A jade talisman could be life-saving at a critical moment.","Although he couldn't enjoy spirit talismans of that level himself, he could use these jade stones to exchange for more cultivation resources.","\"Speak. What do you want from me?\"","Wei Guangchang said, \"Master, could you please take a look and see if the two of them might...\"","...","\"No need to look,\" Wei Huanyang said, idly toying with a peach pit in his palm, his tone indifferent. \"They have the look of death about them.\"","The three members of the Wei family: \"...\"","Wei Guangchang's heart skipped a beat, and he hurriedly asked, \"Master, is there a way to resolve this?\"","\"To be perfectly honest, if you were being haunted by evil spirits, I could handle it for you. But if you're about to be arrested by the mundane police, I can't help you.\"","He had no reason to go against the police.","Wei Tianbao's heart trembled, his face paling with anxiety.","\"Master, save me! Please, look, if Tao Tao and I get arrested, what will happen to the Fengmao Group in the future? If Fengmao is gone, won't you stop receiving...\" His gaze fell on the box full of jade stones.","Wei Huanyang's fingers paused slightly. A crack appeared on the surface of the peach pit. He looked coldly and arrogantly at Wei Tianbao and sneered, \"Do you really think I can't do without your Wei family?\"","He had more than just the Wei family under him.","Wei Guangchang promptly slapped Wei Tianbao across the face. \"If you can't speak properly, then shut up!\"","He then turned back to Wei Huanyang with a smile. \"Master, please don't be angry. He's just lost his mind and is clumsy with words. As long as you can guarantee their safety, our entire Wei family will follow your lead!\"","Wei Huanyang tossed away the cracked peach pit and finally revealed a smile, saying dismissively, \"Now that's a pleasant thing to hear.\"","He wasn't interested in the three Wei family members, but he was very interested in the wealth of the Fengmao Group. That wealth could be exchanged for a great many cultivation resources.","Wei Guangchang bent at the waist, flattering with a smile, \"Then what about the two of them...\"","\"I happen to have two slots for registered disciples left. I'll give them to you.\" Wei Huanyang instructed a young attendant to bring two identity tokens. \"With these, you will be members of my Hengfeng Sect and are not subject to mundane laws.\"","He was a Level Four Celestial Master.","Generally, Celestial Masters of Level Three and above could accept disciples.","There were also limits on accepting disciples.","A Level Four Celestial Master had quotas for two formal disciples, four registered disciples, and six unofficial disciples.","As long as one obtained an identity token, even if they hadn't personally stepped into the field of metaphysics, they were considered half a member of the mystic community. Mundane laws held little binding power over them.","This was one of the privileges of the mystic community.","Not an official privilege, just something the authorities couldn't do much about.","The three Wei family members were overjoyed, hastily storing the identity tokens and leaving the residence with a thousand thanks.","Longjiang City, Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan's return was met with a warm welcome from everyone.","Su Rong: \"Master, what would you like to eat? I'll make it for you.\"","Xue Hong: \"Do you want to bathe? I'll draw a bath for you.\"","Qi Zheng: \"I... I'll cut some fruit for you.\"","That left Ling Sheng. He didn't say a word, simply handing her a new sparrow jade token, filled with abundant spiritual energy.","Qi Quan: \"...\"","Oh no. Last night, she had instructed Yue Lin and Zheng Guangming to find the sparrow jade token and return it to her. But she had left the meeting in a hurry today, so those two probably hadn't found a suitable opportunity.","Having lost the jade token, she felt a tiny bit guilty. She waved her hand and said, \"No need, I've already recovered.\"","The hopeful light in Ling Sheng's eyes instantly dimmed, tinged with a hint of grievance. He hung his head dejectedly, looking at the token in his hand, seemingly unable to understand why she didn't like it.","\"Master, Ling Sheng performed a great service last night,\" Su Rong said with a smile.","Xue Hong nodded in agreement. \"Yes, if he hadn't defended the house, we would all have been done for.\"","Those Celestial Masters outside wouldn't have been polite to ghosts like them.","Qi Zheng scratched his head, unsure what to say.","Qi Quan looked at Ling Sheng and smiled. \"You did very well, helping me defend our home. Maintaining the operation of an array requires a lot of spiritual energy. You consumed so much; keep this spiritual energy for your own use.\"","Ling Sheng didn't move.","\"Be good,\" she said.","Ling Sheng glanced up at her, then withdrew the token, though he still seemed a bit sullen.","After the meal, Su Rong reported to her again.","\"Ms. Gu Qiao visited this morning, saying she wanted to see you. I refused, saying you were in seclusion cultivating.\"","Qi Quan's expression remained calm. \"I see.\"","[Big shot, what did she come for? Aren't you already cut off from them?]","Qi Quan: [Probably because what I said last time wasn't clear enough.]","She never shied away from assuming the worst about people, especially in matters related to Qi Yingxue.","Gu Qiao cared about face. She wouldn't come to Lakeside Villa for no reason. The most likely possibility was that Qi Yingxue had urged her to.","What reason did they have for specifically paying a visit?","Qi Quan thought of that trace of malice.","Returning to her room, she pondered for a moment before starting to write a new chapter of \"Diary of a Wealthy Family.\"","Longjing City.","As soon as Ning Zhi stepped out of the high-speed rail station, he ran into two people. Judging by their aura, one was a Level Four Celestial Master, and the other was slightly higher than him, probably Level Five.","Even though he was prepared, his heart still felt somewhat heavy.","\"Ning Zhi, right? Come with us.\" The two showed their Association work IDs, their expressions serious.","Ning Zhi offered no resistance and got into the car with them.","The Longjing City Celestial Master Association oversaw branches across the country, holding a supremely high status. The Association was filled with numerous experts, mostly elite figures from various families and sects.","This wasn't Ning Zhi's first time here, but it was his first time arriving as a detained Celestial Master.","His face expressionless, he stepped through the Association's doors.","The Celestial Master Association was built in the suburbs of Longjing. On the surface, it looked no different from an ordinary factory, but the interior was vastly different.","The talisman patterns on the walls were intricate and mysterious, and there were small spirit-gathering arrays in the corners, making the spiritual energy inside the building particularly abundant.","The interrogation room was on the third floor.","As Ning Zhi stepped onto the stairs, he encountered another group descending from the second floor.","At their head was a young man, exceptionally handsome, with a cold expression. A red cord was tied around his wrist, from which dangled a miniature peachwood sword.","He was the leading figure among the younger generation of the mystic community, the champion of the previous Mystic Arts Grand Competition, Yan Huai.","It was said his swordsmanship was peerless. He rarely drew his sword; even during the Grand Competition, no one had managed to make his sword leave its sheath.","Such a brilliantly talented individual would normally have a multitude of admirers.","However, Yan Huai's temperament was exceptionally cold and aloof. His heart held only cultivation; he never formed friendships and never spared anyone's feelings, which resulted in him having very poor relationships within the celestial master community.","But no one dared to provoke him.","Not only because of the powerful family behind him, but also because of his own formidable abilities.","A sixth-level celestial master at merely twenty-seven years old—who would dare to offend him lightly?","Ning Zhi withdrew his gaze and went upstairs.","The two groups passed each other by.","Yan Huai was followed by two people, one fat and one thin, both disciples of the Yan family from this generation.","Once outside the association, the two couldn't help but whisper among themselves.","\"Was that the little genius from the Ning family just now?\" the fat one asked.","The thin one said, \"Yes, that was indeed Ning Zhi. What a pity.\"","\"Pity what?\"","\"I heard he colluded with an evil celestial master. Now the entire Ning family has had their celestial master certificates revoked, and he has to undergo interrogation.\"","The fat one was astonished: \"An evil celestial master? Who?\"","\"Reportedly, it's someone from Longjiang City, a sixth-level celestial master. Not only did they refuse to join the Celestial Master Association and spoke insolently to its members, but they also privately kept ghost servants.\"","\"Hiss, that audacious?\" The fat one looked gossipy. \"And now? Ning Zhi is here, but what about the one he colluded with?\"","\"Who knows? Probably couldn't apprehend that one, so they're just squeezing the soft persimmon, Ning Zhi.\" The thin one shrugged. \"To be honest, Ning Zhi is quite a righteous and stubborn person. I don't believe he could collude with any evil celestial master.\"","The fat one nodded with an air of seriousness. \"So what exactly did he collude in? Did he actually do anything wrong?\"","The thin one: \"Who knows? We'll have to wait for the interrogation results.\"","Interrogation Room, Celestial Master Association.","Ning Zhi was forced to sit in a Spirit-Restraining Chair, unable to move his entire body. The chair was specially made; once seated, the spiritual power within one's body would be suppressed and unable to circulate...","This feeling of being a fish on the chopping block, completely at another's mercy, was truly suffocating.","Two people were interrogating him, one man and one woman.","\"Ning Zhi, why did you collude with the evil celestial master?\"","Ning Zhi's face was expressionless: \"What evil celestial master?\"","\"Qi Quan from Longjiang City. She refused to accept the supervision of the Celestial Master Association, injured a sixth-level celestial master, violated the association's regulations, privately kept ghost servants, and even personally dealt with a fifth-level red ghost in front of the president of the Longtan City Celestial Master Association, despite knowing she was unlicensed. Were you aware of all this?\"","Ning Zhi's eyes darkened: \"May I ask a question?\"","\"Go ahead.\"","\"There have been multiple 'Peach Blossom Mark' cases in Longjiang City, and several instances of ghost marriages. Did the Celestial Master Association even know about them? A fifth-level red ghost appeared in Yao Mountain, Longtan City. Why wasn't it detected by the association's monitoring? People went missing after entering the mountain. The association knew evil ghosts were harming people, so why wasn't there a timely rescue? There was even a Celestial Master Chu who fled the scene! Did you handle any of these matters?\"","This was the first time he had ever used such a cold, sharp tone to deliver such a long string of accusations.","The interrogators: \"...\"","The male interrogator's eyes turned severe: \"Ning Zhi! Right now, we are interrogating you. Do you or do you not know about Qi Quan's violations of the celestial master regulations?\"","Ning Zhi was utterly disappointed and began to doubt himself. For a moment, he didn't even know what he had been doing with his life for the past twenty years.","He lowered his head and said hoarsely, \"I don't know.\"","\"Are you sure?\" the male interrogator said. \"According to our investigation, you frequently visited Qi Quan's residence in Longjiang City and had a very close relationship with her. Moreover, when association personnel went to her door that day, you were present. Ning Zhi, lying will add to your charges!\"","Ning Zhi was silent for a moment, then smiled. \"If you can answer the questions I just asked, then I will answer yours.\"","\"...\"","The female interrogator said, \"Lock him up for a while first.\"","The two left the interrogation room and turned off the lights.","Ning Zhi's world was instantly plunged into complete darkness.","He couldn't see, couldn't move, couldn't hear any sound—all his senses were rendered useless.","They were trying to break his will through this torment.","Ning Zhi closed his eyes, his expression resolute.","The two interrogators went to report to their superior's office and ran into a colleague who looked travel-worn and ashen-faced.","\"Weren't you sent to arrest Qi Quan?\"","The Talisman Master sighed heavily, shaking his head, not wanting to say anything. The Array Master hadn't lost anything, but failing in their mission was embarrassing to talk about.","The four of them entered the office together.","They all belonged to the Enforcement Division of the Celestial Master Association, specializing in arresting, interrogating, and punishing evil celestial masters.","The head of the Enforcement Division was a sixth-level, third-tier celestial master, a man over a hundred years old but with a youthful face.","Seeing the Talisman Master and Array Master, he was somewhat surprised.","\"You didn't bring her back?\"","The Array Master said, \"Her protective array was too high-level; I couldn't dismantle it.\"","The Talisman Master: \"I used up all my attack talismans and still couldn't deplete the array's spiritual power.\"","\"So, you're saying you didn't even get to see the person?\" The Division Head could hardly believe it. \"You, a sixth-level, first-tier Talisman Master, and you, a sixth-level, first-tier Array Master, are the most capable officers in our Enforcement Division. How could you not handle a young celestial master?\"","The Talisman Master, already heartbroken over his lost talismans, felt wronged: \"That Yan Wu from the Yan family couldn't do anything either, and even got beaten up. He's probably holding a grudge and wants to use the Enforcement Division to get revenge.\"","The Division Head: \"...\"","He frowned in thought for a moment, then asked again uneasily, \"Was the array really that powerful?\"","The question gave the Array Master a bit of heartburn: \"Yes.\"","\"Alright, I understand. You two go back and get some proper rest.\"","The Talisman Master: \"But my talismans...\"","\"I'll put in a request for you,\" the Division Head waved his hand.","The Talisman Master finally breathed a sigh of relief.","After the two left, the interrogators reported the interrogation situation to him.","The Division Head said with a headache, \"Then keep him locked up for—\"","A knock on the door interrupted his words.","\"Division Head, officials from the government are here.\"","The Division Head: \"...\"","In the dark interrogation room, Ning Zhi couldn't sense the passage of time. It might have been short, or it might have been long.","He thought of Yuan Qing.","In the past, he only focused on capturing ghosts, never taking the time to empathize with the victims.","But now, he understood the fear Yuan Qing must have felt in that dark room. The darkness, like a festering bone disease, could devour a person's will and soul.","Though reluctant to admit it, Ning Zhi himself had realized that he used to be somewhat arrogant.","He thought he had mastered unique laws and could control the existence of ghosts. But now, thinking back, he was no different from ordinary people, perhaps even inferior to them.","Yuan Qing endured torment and could persevere for five long years, which showed the incredible strength of her willpower.","He was not her equal.","Suddenly, the door to the interrogation room opened.","\"Ning Zhi, you can come out now.\"","The Spirit-Restraining Chair lost its effect. He regained his freedom, yet felt the weight on his shoulders had grown heavier.","The person who came to take him out was someone he didn't know.","He guessed this person's purpose, but got into the car without hesitation.","Longjiang City, Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan had just finished writing when Li Guoyan arrived with a letter of appointment, along with a detailed list of rights, obligations, and terms.","She quickly skimmed through them, quite satisfied with the sincerity shown and deeply impressed by the government's decisiveness.","\"Good, I agree.\"","She picked up a pen and swiftly signed her name.","Li Guoyan smiled brightly and said, \"It's been a pleasure working with you. I look forward to your guidance in the future.\"","After he left, Qi Zheng drifted over.","The young policeman seemed somewhat embarrassed to speak.","Qi Quan sipped her tea and asked, \"Is something the matter?\"","\"Master Qi,\" Qi Zheng said anxiously, \"I'm going to reincarnate.\"","The ghost marriage case in Longjiang City had come to an end, and he had no more regrets. He just wanted to see his family one last time before his reincarnation.","\"Qin Ruo said the one who killed you was Yan Wu. Yan Wu is still alive. Don't you want to see the person who harmed you get punished?\" Qi Quan asked.","Qi Zheng, however, shook his head. \"The one who truly caused my death is the person behind him, but I probably won't live to see that day. Master Qi, thank you, truly.\"","[Ah, Officer Qi died so unjustly.] The system sighed with heartache.","Qi Quan respected his decision. She shot out a stream of spiritual energy, which merged into his soul. Qi Zheng felt a warm, comforting sensation all over, as if soaking in a hot spring.","Wearing his crisp police uniform, he solemnly saluted Qi Quan, then turned to face Su Rong, Xue Hong, and Ling Sheng.","\"Thank you for taking care of me these past days.\"","Lakeside Villa had filled the lonely decade of his afterlife; he had grown very fond of this place, but now he had to leave.","\"Master Qi, if you see Han Mian, please tell him for me: thank him for his efforts back then. I hope he can solve many more cases and have a safe and peaceful life.\"","Qi Quan smiled gently. \"Alright, I'll pass on your message.\"","The autumn wind swept through the courtyard, carrying Qi Zheng's soul drifting into the distance.","It was the direction of his home.","He would see his white-haired parents and his lovely younger sister, and then, with no regrets left, proceed to his reincarnation.","At ten o'clock in the evening, a new chapter of \"Diary of a Wealthy Family\" was updated.","[A single ordinary comment forced me to go on a business trip.","I don't understand why a master capable of divining an address couldn't see through the girl's fortune through physiognomy.","Even if they truly couldn't discern it, why did they have to broadcast the address publicly?","Private messages are free.","Cases involving the mystical realm naturally require the mystical realm to handle.","The events of this day and night could fill tens of thousands of words, but here I will only provide a brief summary.","\"Please, kind people, help me\" was a scam online, impersonating parents, attempting to trade a girl's future and fate for wealth.","How is this any different from what the Hei couple did?","Ghost marriages are not isolated incidents. I hope everyone remains cautious and protects...","themselves and their loved ones.","Although this matter left me feeling heavy-hearted, another story touched me deeply.","It was about a ghost burdened with the karma of many killings.","His life was stolen by another person. He once sought justice but was murdered.","After his death, to seek revenge, he killed many innocent people.","Knowing his sins were grave, he was willing to accept any punishment, but his only wish was to restore justice for his mother.","When he died, his mother was only in her forties. Thirty years have passed since then.","Thirty years ago, this frail yet resilient woman lost her husband and couldn't find her son. Under this double blow, she resolutely embarked on a journey to find her son.","Dragging her ailing body, she survived by scavenging through trash in another, unfamiliar city.","After several years, she finally learned everything her son had endured.","She wanted to demand justice.","But villains run rampant precisely because they feel they have nothing to fear.","She was destined for disappointment.","Yet she didn't give up. She spent her entire life, decade after decade, pursuing a nearly impossible goal.","This maternal love moved me deeply.","My adoptive parents passed away when I was very young. I can't even remember their faces clearly anymore.","When I was in school, I often saw classmates around me throwing tantrums, crying, begging, and making scenes with their parents.","I didn't understand why children who were already so fortunate would still cry and make a fuss; I also didn't understand why disobedient children could still receive so much love.","These childhood memories deeply affected me.","Until my biological parents found me.","I was anxious yet hopeful, worried they wouldn't like me, yet desperately longing for them to give me care and affection.","Unfortunately, I neither possessed a lovable appearance nor a pleasing personality. I was just a quiet, dull country bumpkin. How could I possibly win the love of strangers who were my relatives?","Could it be because I was too quiet, so they didn't notice my existence?","I've heard that the squeaky wheel gets the grease.","I couldn't help but recall those childhood memories—how those children would get all their parents' attention and care just by crying and making a scene.","Foolishly, I tried to copy that tactic.","But I forgot I was no longer a child.","With an adult's face, I engaged in irrational behavior, trying to gain my relatives' attention.","But it didn't work.","They only grew more disgusted with me.","I seemed trapped in a vicious cycle: the more they ignored me, the more I acted out; the more I acted out, the more they despised me.","Finally, one day, a remark from my biological elder brother woke me up.","He said, \"Your mind isn't clear.\"","It dawned on me. He was right; my mind wasn't clear. I had become obsessed with gaining my family's affection.","That wasn't my true nature.","From that day on, I decided to let go of this obsession.","From the moment I was switched at birth, it was destined that I and my relatives had no true bond.","The senior who guided me into the mystical realm once said that some people are born with shallow familial bonds.","That must be my fate.","Those in the mystical realm are destined to maintain distance from their mundane relatives; otherwise, they will only hurt each other.","I saved my invisible younger brother's life once, and I also warned about the dark aura at the North Suburb factory, helping them avoid a disaster.","I have repaid the debt of giving me life. From now on, there is no connection.]","After reading the new chapter, the small group chat erupted.","[Qian Kun: What's going on? Did something happen to the Master? Did someone in your family bully her again? @Qi Yuan]","[Su Nuanuan: I just called and asked. Today, Aunt Gu and Qi Yingxue went to Lakeside Villa.]","[Sun Yu: What did they go for? Was it because of the identity leak?]","[Peng Peng: What does that have to do with the Master? Do they want the Master to step forward and tell the netizens she forgives Qi Yingxue?]","[Su Nuanuan: @Qi Yuan, maybe you should ask...","your mom.]","In another group chat, Qi Lin was also being constantly tagged.","[Du Jiaming: @Qi Lin, did the Master really cut ties with your family? When did this happen?]","[Yang Su: I guess the Master made that decision the day she moved to Lakeside Villa?]","[Zhang Chengyan: If the Master would take me as her disciple, I'd give her endless care and affection! @Qi Lin, tell us, how did your family offend the Master this time?]","[Du Jiaming: As if she needs your care? Keys are ten yuan for three, are you worthy?]","[Yang Su: Am I the only one curious about who the senior who guided the Master is?]","[Zhang Chengyan: They must be extraordinary. They say a great teacher produces brilliant students, no wonder the Master is so amazing!]","[Du Jiaming: If the Master is so amazing, why did she live in poverty before?]","[Zhang Chengyan: She probably didn't have the opportunity before; she was too young, clients likely didn't believe her. If it weren't for \"Diary of a Wealthy Family,\" we wouldn't know how incredible she is either.]","Qi Lin, who was being tagged, had a headache.","He sat in the Qi family's living room. Everyone except Qi Yuan was present, each holding a phone.","\"I didn't even see her today, I didn't get to say anything at all,\" Gu Qiao said, feeling somewhat wronged.","Qi Changrong sighed lightly, \"Then what was your intention in going?\"","\"I, I...\"","She couldn't help but lower her head.","Originally, after hearing Qi Yingxue's words, she had indeed harbored doubts. But after reading the new chapter, she realized how foolish she had been!","Wasn't it perfectly normal for a girl who lacked love since childhood, upon returning home and finding herself neglected, to be stimulated into those unsavory actions in an attempt to attract her family's attention?","Even if she possessed some mysterious abilities, she was ultimately just a girl hoping for her parents' affection. Before the Du family's birthday banquet, there was no need for her to resort to those methods.","She hadn't changed; she had simply returned to her normal self after being disappointed by them.","Gu Qiao felt deeply remorseful.","She suddenly realized she didn't understand her biological daughter, and understood her adopted daughter even less.","Yingxue, she...","\"It was me who begged Mom to take me there,\" Qi Yingxue suddenly spoke up, her eyes reddening. \"I wanted to apologize to her in person.\"","Qi Lin's gaze turned probing.","He hadn't understood or paid much attention to Qi Yingxue before, but ever since the incident saving Qi Yuan, when he heard the things she said, he knew she wasn't as harmless as she appeared on the surface.","He said coldly, \"She already stated last time that she has no further relationship with us. If you wanted to apologize, you could have done so in the comments section or on Weibo. Why, with your leg injury not yet healed, did you insist on going to Lakeside Villa? What were you trying to do?\"","Qi Yingxue was taken aback for a moment, then quick-wittedly replied, \"I... I just wanted to beg her to help A'Lin. I know she must hate me, but I really can't just ignore A'Lin. I'm truly at my wit's end!\"","Qi Lin frowned, \"What's wrong with Song Lin?\"","Tears streamed down Qi Yingxue's face. \"He keeps having accidents lately. First it was his forehead, then before that his shoulder, and last time he was almost pierced by a falling steel bar!\"","\"What?!\" Qi Changrong asked in surprise. \"Is he still frequently going to the northern suburbs?\"","Qi Yingxue said helplessly, \"I've tried to persuade him, but he says the project is his responsibility and he must see it through...\"","\"Anything else?\" Qi Lin didn't truly believe her explanation.","If that were really all, Mrs. Gu Qiao wouldn't have shown a guilty expression earlier.","Qi Yingxue said, \"There really isn't anything else.\"","She looked pleadingly at Gu Qiao.","Gu Qiao turned her head away uncomfortably and said sullenly, \"It was just Yingxue and I feeling something was off. Xiao Quan never mentioned anything about entering the Mystic Arts world to us after coming home. After the Du family banquet, she seemed like a completely different person all of a sudden. We just wanted to go and ask...\"","\"Ask what? Ask her how she became utterly disappointed with this family?\" Qi Changrong asked, his face dark.","The final sentence of the new chapter had ripped off the fig leaf completely, leaving no room for face-saving.","Gu Qiao's face turned pale. \"I...\"","A ringing phone suddenly interrupted her.","It was Qi Changrong's phone.","Seeing the caller ID, a chill ran down his spine... He answered and put it on speakerphone.","\"In-laws!\" Mrs. Song's grief-stricken, sobbing voice came from the other end. \"A'Lin and his father have both had an accident! Can you please help me!\"","Qi Changrong sprang to his feet."]},{"number":37,"title":"Chapter 37","paragraphs":["The comment section of \"Diary of a Wealthy Family\" is bustling with activity.","[\"If you see me, please tell me to go prepare my lessons\": Wuwuwuwu, thank you so much, author! I really, truly don't know how to express my gratitude! Anyway, I will remember this kindness forever! Five deepwater torpedoes!]","[\"I'm dying of laughter\": Seeing \"Lesson Preparer\" being so sincere makes me feel like something really happened. So, what actually happened?]","[\"Book famine is killing me\": Sigh, some people really don't care about others' lives. Cheers to the author!]","[\"Malan flowers bloom thirty-one\": The Master is benevolent and compassionate, saving people from dire straits. One hundred deepwater torpedoes!]","[\"Rich lady, do you still need a leg accessory?\": What does \"stolen life\" mean? Like someone stealing a university admission spot? If that's really the case, then I hope whoever stole that university spot rots in the eighteenth layer of hell!]","[\"Today is very auspicious\": Wuwuwuwu, my heart aches for the Master, one hundred deepwater torpedoes!]","[\"Today brings great profit\": Master, we are all your loving family! One hundred deepwater torpedoes!]","[\"Auspicious and Profitable\": Master, don't be sad, I'll take care of you from now on! One hundred deepwater torpedoes!]","[\"Passerby A\": These days, I can't even understand comment sections anymore. I'm outta here.]","\"Diary of a Wealthy Family\" is quite popular online these days.","As soon as a new chapter was published, some busybody compiled a list of key points and posted it on Weibo.","[\"First in Line for Gossip\": Let me analyze the key points of the latest chapter of \"Diary of a Wealthy Family\".","First, the author mentioned going on a business trip, which was likely to handle a metaphysical case in another city. This case is related to the ghost marriage case and also to the comment left by @PleaseKindPeopleHelpMe.","Therefore, I speculate that this \"PleaseKindPeopleHelpMe\" intentionally asked the Master to help find the girl in order to carry out some illegal activities. The Master probably saw through this from the beginning, which is why she never responded.","So here's the question.","Why did that Wei Huanyang from the Hengfeng Sect give out the specific address?","If he couldn't read her fortune from her appearance, how did he calculate the specific address? If he could read it, why would he give out the specific address?","What puzzles me even more is, this matter originally had nothing to do with him, why did he butt in?","Secondly, the \"stolen life\" mentioned by Master Bai Shui, I seem to have heard something about it. I just saw local news about students, teachers, parents, and rescue personnel mysteriously disappearing in the mountains. An hour after a second batch of rescuers entered the mountains, all personnel were safely rescued.","Not long after, police excavated a thirty-year-old skeleton from somewhere within the mountain. The specific details are still under investigation.","As for the content later in the chapter, I won't comment.","But regarding the first two incidents, I just want to ask two questions.","When practitioners of the metaphysical arts use their methods, can they really disregard the lives of ordinary people?","Can those who steal others' lives, even kill others, receive the punishment they deserve?]","Once this post was published, countless comments flooded in.","Many people started thinking, that's right, why did Wei Huanyang so carelessly give out the specific address without any regard for the girl's safety?","Even if \"PleaseKindPeopleHelpMe\" wasn't a bad person, what about others who saw it online? What if someone followed that address to do something bad?","When the system saw this analytical post, it felt a bit odd, but couldn't pinpoint exactly what was wrong.","[Big boss, take a look at this article.]","Qi Quan skimmed through it and said, [Directly pointing out the flaws within the metaphysical community, that's brave.]","[Isn't he afraid of being targeted by the metaphysical community?]","Qi Quan: [Since he dared to post it, he should have the ability to protect himself. While there are indeed many problems within the metaphysical community, there are also people with decent character. Ning Zhi is one, and this person might be another.]","[But he's riding on your popularity, and he's putting you in the spotlight.] The system was somewhat displeased.","Qi Quan laughed: [I also rode on Yuan Qing's popularity once.]","System: ...","Longlin City.","Han Mian had just returned to the hotel from the Wei family. Furious, he punched the wall, his chest heaving violently.","He had come for the Xue Hong case.","An innocent female teacher was brutally dismembered at Longjiang University. If not for casually hooking a living soul, which attracted Master Qi... and their attention, the case might have remained buried for another dozen or several decades.","Now, all the evidence points to Wei Tao. They originally had the authority to take Wei Tao away. Unfortunately, Wei Tao produced some kind of metaphysical identity card, claiming he was no longer under the jurisdiction of secular law and that the police had no right to interfere.","\"Captain Han, what do we do now?\" The young officer was equally furious, his fists clenched tightly. \"We've already asked our superiors. The metaphysical community has indeed done similar things before.\"","\"Does joining the metaphysical community mean you can escape punishment after killing someone? Since when is that the rule!\" Han Mian threw another punch at the wall.","The wall shuddered with a \"thud\".","\"Hey, can you keep it down in the middle of the night?\" The soundproofing in the small hotel was poor, and the guest next door shouted loudly. \"Go to sleep, stop disturbing people.\"","Han Mian: \"Sorry.\"","He took a deep breath, sat on the bed, and gulped down most of a bottle of mineral water.","\"Captain Han, actually, we've seen this kind of thing before.\" The young officer lowered his voice. \"In some historical dramas, villains who harmed many people could have their crimes absolved just by shaving their heads and becoming monks. It's pretty much the same nature.\"","Han Mian: \"...\"","He tugged at his hair. \"No, a murderer must be punished. Otherwise, where is justice?\"","The young officer nodded vehemently. \"Captain Han, since they're using the metaphysical community's influence to evade responsibility, then we can also ask the metaphysical community for help.\"","\"Ask who?\" Han Mian frowned. \"Master Qi doesn't have a Master's Certificate. If we involve her in this, it might cause unnecessary trouble.\"","The young officer sighed.","\"Captain Han, get some rest early. You haven't slept much for several days now.\"","Han Mian nodded. \"Alright, you go too.\"","While he was investigating the Xue Hong case, police from Ningtao County also arrived in Longlin City, found Cao Fang, and placed her under protection.","Lv Shengyang personally led the team.","The disappearance case on Yao Mountain involved many people, and he had to give an account to the people of Ningtao County.","The seventy-seven-year-old woman had a head of gray hair and was frighteningly thin.","When they found her, she was hunched over, rummaging through a trash bin for vegetable leaves that weren't yet rotten. She clutched a woven plastic bag filled with drink bottles and cans.","A few young officers' eyes reddened immediately.","Cao Fang's physical condition wasn't great, but her spirits were surprisingly good, as if something was sustaining her, preventing her from collapsing.","The old woman's hearing had declined, but her speech was still fairly clear.","Upon hearing the police's purpose, she became so agitated she immediately tried to kneel and kowtow. Luckily, Lv Shengyang reacted quickly and caught her, preventing her from actually kneeling.","If they had let the old woman kneel, they'd probably have their lifespans shortened.","The Wei Hao incident was originally a failure of the Ningtao County police. Thirty years later, they only learned the truth because of the disappearance case. Even now, they still couldn't give this strong and great mother the justice she deserved.","Cao Fang took them to her dwelling—an extremely simple shack with almost no belongings inside.","It was hard to imagine how the old woman had survived in this city for so many years.","Lv Shengyang left a few officers behind to take statements and took others with him to the Longlin City Police Department.","They had already been in contact before his arrival.","However, Fengmao Group is a giant in Longlin City. \"Wei Hao\" was the president of Fengmao Group at the time. Relying solely on the words of the Yao Mountain ghost, it was impossible to bring him down.","Fengmao Group's business scope is very broad, covering almost dozens of industries in Longlin City, with tens of thousands of employees. It could be said that a single move affects the whole situation.","Lv Shengyang and Han Mian were plagued by the same frustration.","Longjiang City.","The sudden accident involving the Song father and son shocked the entire upper-class circle, and the stock market of Shengyuan Real Estate was in turmoil.","Qi Yingxue never imagined that a casual excuse she made would lead to things turning out like this.","In the hospital corridor, Mrs. Song was crying uncontrollably.","With her husband and son lying on the operating table, their lives hanging in the balance, and Shengyuan Group in a state of panic, her mind was a complete blank. She simply didn't know what to do and could only pin her hopes on the Qi family.","The Qi family and the Song family...","were related by marriage. In such an emergency, the Qi family was the only one she could think of.","\"Auntie, A-Lin and Uncle will be alright,\" Qi Yingxue sat beside her, sobbing as she offered comfort.","On the other side, Qi Changrong had already learned the details of the incident.","The Song father and son had gone together to attend a banquet today. Everything was normal initially, but on the way back, they suddenly collided with an out-of-control large truck. Their high-performance car, worth tens of millions, was sent tumbling over a dozen meters.","But the strange thing was, the driver only suffered minor injuries, while the Song father and son were injured in the crash. Mr. Song's injuries were relatively lighter, but Song Lin suffered multiple fractures all over his body. Both were now lying on the operating table.","Everyone couldn't help but think of \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family.\"","Qi Changrong asked Mrs. Song, \"Has Chairman Song or A-Lin had any minor accidents recently?\"","Mrs. Song stopped her tears, thought for a moment, and her expression gradually turned grave. \"Yes, quite a few times. But who doesn't have minor mishaps in life? And they were all just small accidents, so we didn't pay them much mind. The most serious one was just two days ago when the elevator A-Lin was in malfunctioned. He was trapped inside for two hours and came out unconscious.\"","Qi Yingxue cried, \"Why didn't he tell me!\"","\"That day...\" Mrs. Song's eyes were red, \"You also had an incident. He didn't want you to worry. He even wanted to go see you, but I saw his face was too pale and couldn't bear to let him. Yingxue, it's not that he didn't care about you, please don't blame him, blame me.\"","\"Compared to his health, what does my little issue matter?\" Qi Yingxue shook her head desperately, tears rolling down. \"I just want him to be okay now.\"","Mrs. Song patted the back of her hand, feeling very comforted.","She didn't care about the online gossip; she only cared about Qi Yingxue's feelings for her son.","The light in the operating room went out.","Mrs. Song immediately stood up and rushed forward, already forgetting her usual elegant demeanor.","\"Doctor, how are they?\"","The doctor said, \"No life-threatening danger, but the injuries will require a long time to recuperate.\"","\"That's good, that's good.\" Mrs. Song's emotions were too volatile, and she nearly fainted, but was supported by Gu Qiao.","\"Family, you should go rest for a while. We'll keep watch, you can rest assured,\" she said.","Mrs. Song was grateful but shook her head, \"I want to see them wake up.\"","The Longjiang City second-generation group chat was buzzing with discussion.","[Du Jiaming: What's the situation now? Is Song Lin okay? Although he can be a bit aloof and arrogant, his heart isn't bad.]","[Yang Su: No life danger, but he'll probably need half a year to recover.]","[Zhang Chengyan: He looked terrible when they carried him to the hospital, covered in blood.]","[Du Jiaming: So, was this really an accident, or...]","[Zhang Chengyan: Do you guys remember how Song Lin was always having bad luck before? I believe the master. That North Suburb factory definitely has problems.]","[Qi Lin: Haven't you all looked at the information related to the North Suburb factory?]","[Yang Su: Hey, we're not like you and Song Lin, capable of taking charge alone and participating in this project.]","[Du Jiaming: Go on, what did you find?]","[Qi Lin: Actually, the investigation materials at the time mentioned that the abandoned factory in the North Suburb was built twenty-eight years ago. But not long after completion, a fire suddenly broke out overnight, killing many people and leaving only a few factory buildings. It was classified as a major safety accident at the time. Because so many people died, the land was left idle and remains so to this day.]","After so many years, with the urban expansion of Longjiang City requiring more land resources, the North Suburb plot was naturally included in the city's planning blueprint.","So much time had passed, the tragedy of that year was already sealed in history, and no one paid it much mind anymore.","[Zhang Chengyan: So many people died. Do you think... could they have died unjustly?]","[Du Jiaming: That's probably not it. Could the land have been problematic even before the factory was built?]","[Zhang Chengyan: It's driving me crazy! The master specifically mentioned the North Suburb again in her post today. It definitely wasn't without purpose.]","[Yang Su: Even if Song Lin and Uncle Song are out of danger this time, what about next time? Or the time after that?]","[Du Jiaming: Let's not discuss that for now. I just want to know if the master really...","cut ties with your family? @Qi Lin]","[Qi Lin: Yes.]","[Zhang Chengyan: Oh wow. I didn't know how to interact with you before. You're the master's older brother, should I show you some respect too? Now it seems it's not necessary. We can just be like before.]","[Yang Su: [Handshake]]","[Qi Lin: ...]","He had never thought about taking advantage of Qi Quan. Qi Quan made it very clear when she saved Qi Yuan that there was truly no possibility of any further connection between her and them.","The \"Criminal Elements\" group chat.","[Qian Kun: Did you guys hear? Brother Song and Uncle Song had an accident!]","[Sun Yu: We know. Is it related to the North Suburb?]","[Peng Peng: I have a question. Why would the master, knowing the North Suburb has problems, not go and subdue the possible ghosts there?]","[Qian Kun: ...]","[Su Nuanuan: I also have a question. Why did someone insist on pushing the project even after the master gave a warning?]","[Qi Yuan: @Pengpeng If you don't understand, don't talk nonsense.]","[Su Nuanuan: @Pengpeng Do you think catching ghosts is easy? Is cultivation simple for the master? Is she obligated to go subdue ghosts? How do you know if the master has her own considerations? How do you know what's really going on with the North Suburb land? Why should the master pay the price for the Song family's land?]","[Peng Peng: Sister Nuanuan, Brother Yuan, I know I was wrong. My brain short-circuited, and I just blurted it out. I understand now. The master must have her own reasons, and she gave a very kind warning. It's just that some people who aren't afraid of death insisted on charging ahead.]","[Su Nuanuan: Just wait. This matter will definitely have a conclusion.]","Longlin City.","Wei Huanyang got up early to check if his Weibo followers had increased, but instead—","[Are you really some disciple of the Hengfeng Sect? Can you really tell fortunes? Then why couldn't you see that the girl's parents had passed away?]","[I think it's not that you couldn't see, but that you simply didn't care. You don't take human life seriously at all!]","[What are you all talking about? Couldn't the girl have adoptive parents?]","[Adoptive parents? Hey, Wei's fans upstairs, maybe read more news and don't get scammed by online fraudsters!]","\"What kind of mystic master is this, disregarding human life! Trash!\"","\"What news are you all talking about? Is it about 'Please kind people help me'? Why haven't I seen it?\"","\"Follow 'Longtan City Public Security Bureau', you're welcome.\"","Wei Huanyang saw everyone cursing him under his Weibo post, and his follower count was plummeting. Furious, he released his spiritual energy, shattering the water glass on the table with a crash as it spilled onto the floor.","\"Master?\" a young attendant asked from outside.","Wei Huanyang: \"Get lost! Don't bother me!\"","He searched for Longtan City Public Security Bureau and saw their latest announcement.","【Longtan City Public Security Bureau V: Recently, our city cracked down on a ghost marriage business chain and arrested multiple individuals involved. Among them, suspect Ma @Please kind people help me used the guise of 'parents' to fraudulently obtain victim information online, employing extremely cunning and vile methods. We hereby advise all netizens to use the internet rationally and guard against scams.】","Wei Huanyang: \"...\"","The official announcement was a total slap in the face.","He hadn't taken it seriously at first. It was just because \"White Water Real Person\" had suddenly risen to prominence, rapidly gaining followers by riding on \"Yuan Qing's\" popularity, which made him uncomfortable.","What's a writer of supernatural fiction doing pretending to be a mystic master?","Of course, he was usually busy with cultivation and didn't constantly monitor Weibo.","That day, when he opened Weibo, he saw his fans discussing in the comments, mentioning that \"White Water Real Person\" was a fake mystic master who would go silent and not reply when he couldn't figure things out, completely incomparable to their Master Wei.","Driven by vanity, and to solidify his own mystic master persona and attract more fans, he casually posted a Weibo about the girl's address.","As for what intentions \"Please kind people help me\" might have had, or what consequences exposing the girl's address might lead to, he hadn't considered at all.","But he never expected that such a trivial matter would cause him to crash and burn!","It's all that White Water Real Person's fault for meddling!","...","Also, the Weibo post by \"First Line for Gossip\" was clearly mocking him.","When had Wei Huanyang ever suffered such humiliation?","He immediately observed the profile pictures of \"White Water Real Person\" and \"First Line for Gossip,\" attempting to divine their fortunes.","But just as he looked at White Water Real Person's profile picture, his eye suddenly sharp pain, as if pricked by a needle, and he couldn't help but cry out in agony.","There was only one reason for this situation—","White Water Real Person's cultivation level was higher than his. His attempt to divine her fortune was an offense, and that attack just now was a warning.","Wei Huanyang was stunned.","A high-level mystic master, not focusing on cultivation properly, why write supernatural fiction?","After recovering for a while, he opened his eyes again and looked at the \"First Line for Gossip\" profile picture.","This time there was no needle prick, but the profile picture was shrouded in a faint mist, making it unclear.","Wei Huanyang: \"...\"","Feeling targeted.","Two random people, and both are high-level mystic masters?","This \"First Line for Gossip\" was at least on the same level as him.","Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan was designing autumn clothes for Su Rong and Xue Hong when she received a call from Han Mian.","\"Master, Wei Tao obtained an identity token from the Mystic Gate. We can't easily touch him now.\" The usually upright and spirited police captain sounded uncharacteristically dejected.","His tone was filled with confusion and suppressed anger.","Qi Quan said, \"Don't worry, the matter will be resolved soon.\"","\"Really?\" Han Mian sounded somewhat disheartened. \"But the Wei family clearly has connections with the Mystic Gate. If the Mystic Gate insists on protecting them, can we still bring the murderer to justice?\"","Qi Quan: \"Yes.\"","Her tone was so certain, as if she already knew something.","Han Mian's eyes suddenly lit up. \"Master, is it... is that organization going to be established?\"","Qi Quan smiled. \"Officer Han, you've worked hard. I have a guest, let's talk later.\"","The authorities were far more decisive than Han Mian imagined.","At the very least, before inviting her, the authorities had already been secretly cultivating talent. However, the Mystic Gate was teeming with capable individuals, and the authorities lacked a master powerful enough to suppress the Mystic Gate, so they couldn't bring it into the open.","The actions of the Mystic Masters Association during the Yaoshan incident once again crossed the authorities' bottom line. It was estimated that the authorities would soon take action.","The first to bear the brunt would be those involved in the Yaoshan incident.","\"Master, there's a visitor. His name is Zheng Guangming. He says he's a friend from Yaoshan and has brought a token.\" Su Rong reported from outside the room.","Qi Quan: \"Understood. Brew tea for the guest.\"","She finished sketching the last outfit and went to the living room.","Upon seeing her, Zheng Guangming immediately stood up, bowed deeply to her, and said with heartfelt gratitude, \"Master Qi, thank you so much for saving my life!\"","System: 【Hearing thanks daily has become numb.】","Qi Quan glanced at his face and said calmly, \"Mr. Zheng, you didn't come today just to express thanks, did you?\"","\"Master truly is a master!\" Zheng Guangming took out the sparrow jade token and handed it to Qi Quan. \"This was found under the cliff, intact. Captain Lin's work is of a special nature, so he couldn't come personally to thank you and return it. He entrusted me to come on behalf of everyone.\"","Qi Quan: \"Hmm.\"","She took the jade token, playing with it in her palm.","\"There's one more thing I'd like to consult you about. Don't worry, I specifically inquired about the rules of your profession and definitely won't take advantage of you.\" His expression was sincere.","Qi Quan: \"About your sister?\"","Hearing this, Zheng Guangming was completely convinced, his expression growing even more respectful. \"Yes. She married into this area a few years ago. I came last night and stayed at her place. She works here and rarely returns to our hometown except during holidays, and even then, she mostly goes to her husband's family. I haven't seen her for quite a long time, but this time when I saw her, I noticed she's changed a lot.\"","Qi Quan: \"Tell me more.\"","\"It's her mental state that seems off. She used to be very lively, but now she doesn't talk much, her reactions are slow, and she smiles less. Last night, I got up and saw her sitting on the sofa, holding a doll in her arms...","humming a song. I called out to her, but she didn't respond. Then her husband came and coaxed her back to the room.\"","System: 【So creepy!】","Qi Quan asked, \"What did your brother-in-law say?\"","Zheng Guangming wiped his face. \"He said my sister had a miscarriage before, the blow was too great, and she couldn't handle it mentally, so she became like this. But my sister never mentioned this to our family. Such a big thing, would she really hide it from everyone?\"","\"Has she seen a psychologist?\"","\"She has, and took medication, but it didn't work.\" Zheng Guangming said with a pained expression. \"All this is what my brother-in-law said. My sister barely talks to me anymore.\"","【Big shot, could it be a ghost possession?】 The system was now fully immersed in this supernatural channel.","Qi Quan looked at Zheng Guangming.","【He doesn't have any yin energy on him.】","【Oh, then probably not. Could it just be as his brother-in-law said?】","Qi Quan said: 【However, there's another possibility. Zheng Guangming has saved many people and has deep merit. Even if he picked up a bit of yin energy, it would quickly be dispelled by his aura of merit.】","The system learned something new: 【I see! So what should we do now?】","\"Do you have a photo?\" Qi Quan asked.","Zheng Guangming, with his extensive experience in rescue work and meticulous nature, quickly took out his phone and flipped to the latest photo in his album. \"I felt something wasn't right, so I secretly took this before leaving this morning while they weren't paying attention. It's not a full frontal shot.\"","In the photo, the woman had casually tied her hair into a low ponytail. Her complexion was somewhat pale, her eyes vacant, and she was holding a watering can.","\"She happened to be going to the balcony to water the plants,\" Zheng Guangming said. \"I turned off the sound effects and secretly took this picture.\"","It was strange.","Clearly a person who had lost her spark, yet she still thought to water the flowers. People who tend to plants usually have a love for life. If she had truly suffered such a great blow that it affected her mental state, how could she still remember the flowers on the balcony?","Qi Quan withdrew her gaze and said, \"This is not your sister.\"","System: ???","Zheng Guangming's eyes widened, and he said urgently, \"What do you mean?\"","His mind was a complete muddle, unable to process thoughts.","Qi Quan: \"To be precise, this is your sister's physical shell, but the one residing inside is not your sister.\"","\"......\"","Zheng Guangming felt a chill shoot from the soles of his feet to the crown of his head.","He said with difficulty, \"Master, I beg you, please help my sister!\"","How could this happen? How could such a thing happen to his sister?","System: [Big Boss, is his sister possessed by a ghost?]","[Yes.]","[Then... does her husband know?]","Qi Quan: [Good question. I don't know either.]","[Big Boss, are you taking this case?]","[Of course, why wouldn't I? It's not like I have to travel far.]","System: The Big Boss seems to be more accommodating towards people who possess virtue and merit.","Qi Quan looked at Zheng Guangming: \"Choose a time. I'll go with you to their home. It's best if your brother-in-law is also there.\"","\"Thank you so much!\" Zheng Guangming hurriedly bowed in gratitude. \"Master, tomorrow is Saturday. They don't work and will be at home. How does that sound?\"","\"Fine.\" Qi Quan nodded. \"Come here at nine tomorrow morning.\"","\"No problem!\"","With the matter settled, Zheng Guangming got up to leave. Su Rong saw him out to the courtyard gate.","\"Mr. Zheng, you might have inquired about the rules of the Mystic Arts world, but you probably aren't clear about the Master's rules.\"","Zheng Guangming, who had been thinking about getting a new bank card, was taken aback. \"What rules?\"","Su Rong whispered a few words with a smile.","Zheng Guangming: ???","What? A novel?","Not long after Qi Quan returned to her room, she heard the system announcement: [Big Boss, \"Light in My Heart\" has gifted you five hundred 'Deep Waters'!]","Five hundred 'Deep Waters', converted into lifespan, meant fifty days. She was still making a profit.","Now, \"Diary of the Wealthy\" received daily gifts of 'mines' from dedicated readers, with Du Jiaming and others being the most diligent, not missing a single day.","Qi Quan's lifespan continued to extend.","In a pleasant mood, she started making small clothes...","Wei Huanyang, however, was furious.","He had previously looked down on \"Diary of the Wealthy\" and wouldn't deign to read it, but now that he was being criticized, he couldn't swallow his anger. He read from the first chapter to the latest.","The accusatory tone in the latest chapter truly infuriated him.","Wei Huanyang had been exceptionally talented since childhood, taken in as the closed-door disciple by the Hengfeng Sect's leader, and had been pampered and praised while growing up. When had he ever suffered such indignity?","If he couldn't deal with the White Water True Person, couldn't his senior brothers and sisters?","White Water True Person, just you wait!","Longjing City, the Ning Family Residence.","Ning Zhi returned from the Exorcist Association and, under the concerned gazes of his family, made an extremely difficult decision.","\"Respected elders, brothers and sisters, I have decided to withdraw from the Exorcist Association starting today. To avoid implicating you all, I am willing to request removal from the family registry. I am truly sorry!\"","The family had cultivated him to be the future head, pouring all sorts of cultivation resources into him. His current actions were no different from those of an ingrate.","But he had no choice.","The Exorcist Association had released him, giving face to the official authorities, and allowed the Ning family to continue holding Exorcist Certificates. However, he knew that while the Association wouldn't openly act against the Ning family, they could employ various underhanded methods to restrict them in private.","The Exorcist Association's target was him. Perhaps only if he left the Ning family could they continue to gain a foothold in Longjing City.","Second Uncle Ning stroked his goatee and said, \"You should first tell us what exactly happened.\"","\"Yes, yes,\" others chimed in.","Ning Zhi then recounted all his experiences during this period. Of course, he didn't elaborate on the private matters concerning the lakeside villa.","\"Ah!\" Second Uncle Ning shook his head with a sigh. \"Actually, most of the things you mentioned, we experienced in our youth as well.\"","Ning Zhi said, \"I want to join the official Investigation Department. This time, it was the official authorities who sent people to rescue me.\"","\"Very well. Our Ning family was never particularly welcome in Longjing City anyway,\" Second Uncle Ning said. \"Actually, over a decade ago, the Mystic Arts world once intensified its crackdown on evil cultivators, but it had little effect. Moreover, the techniques of evil cultivators are bizarre and treacherous. Many young cultivators were lost at that time, so the Mystic Arts world gave up.\"","Ning Zhi nodded. Qin Ruo had indeed said something similar about \"the situation being tense back then\" after seeing the water ghost Qi Zheng.","\"It seems the official authorities are determined this time. However, the influence of the Mystic Arts world runs much deeper than you imagine. The official authorities may not necessarily be able to protect you,\" another elder of the Ning family said.","Ning Zhi showed no fear on his face: \"I believe there are righteous cultivators within the Mystic Arts world. Not everyone is willing to collude.\"","At the very least, the people in their Ning family had principles.","In front of everyone, he burned his Exorcist Certificate and then put on the work badge just issued to him by the authorities —","National Special Cases Investigation Department - Longjing City Branch - Field Team - Fourth-Level Investigator","From now on, he was Investigator Ning, not Exorcist Ning.","Second Uncle Ning patted his shoulder. \"Good lad! This counts as having a government job, right? We have high hopes for you!\"","Ning Zhi's eyes suddenly grew moist.","How fortunate he was to have such a family!","\"Second Uncle, I've already received my first assignment and need to depart for Longlin City immediately. I must go now.\"","Second Uncle Ning nodded. \"Go ahead. Be careful.\"","Longjiang City.","In the hospital, the Song father and son woke up one after the other. Mr. Song's condition wasn't too severe, but Song Lin, with multiple fractures all over his body, lay immobilized on the bed like a mummy.","Song Lin had never been in such a wretched state before.","He somewhat regretted taking on the North Suburb project.","Although it hadn't been confirmed that his accidents were all due to the dark energy from the North Suburb, this car accident had dealt him a heavy blow.","The pain was wearing down his willpower.","Mrs. Song seemed to have aged overnight, staying by their hospital beds, unwilling to leave for a long time.","\"Auntie, you've been up all night. Your body won't be able to take it. With me and the nurses here, everything will be fine. Please go rest,\" Qi Yingxue urged.","Mr. Song looked at his wife with a guilty expression, forcing out a breathy whisper, \"Go rest.\"","\"Yingxue, then I'll trouble... you. And you're still wearing a bandage yourself,\" Mrs. Song said gratefully. She really couldn't hold on any longer and went back to rest.","Qi Yingxue sat by Song Lin's bedside, forcing a comforting smile. \"A'Lin, you'll recover soon. Don't worry.\"","Song Lin's gaze fell on her foot.","\"It's nothing, just a slight sprain,\" she said with a light laugh, teasing herself. \"Probably heaven punishing me for doing something wrong.\"","Song Lin looked at her inquiringly.","\"It's nothing. You rest well,\" she said.","Song Lin was indeed severely weakened and soon closed his eyes, falling into a deep sleep.","Qi Yingxue quietly left the hospital room, closed the door, thought for a moment, and took a business card from her bag.","It bore words like \"Yan Wu, Sixth-Level Exorcist.\"","There was more than just Qi Quan in this world who was an exorcist!","She was deliberately not dealing with the sinister energy in the northern suburbs, deliberately letting the Song family suffer, deliberately wanting Ah Lin to go beg her.","A master with such malicious intentions, yet so many people idolized her!","Qi Yingxue couldn't swallow this injustice. She input the number and sent a text message: [Hello, can I consult you about something?]","Yan Wu replied after a moment: [Go ahead.]","Qi Yingxue: [I've been having frequent accidents lately, is it possible I've encountered something evil?]","Yan Wu: [What kind of accidents specifically?]","Qi Yingxue sent over all the details of Song Lin's accidents.","There was no reply from the other side for a long time.","Yan Wu wasn't playing hard to get; he just felt this \"client\" might have encountered something more than ordinary evil.","High-level masters generally don't act lightly.","Minor spirits aren't worth the effort, major spirits require caution.","No one's cultivation comes easy; he needed to weigh the pros and cons before deciding whether to intervene.","Judging from the continuity and severity of these accidents, the spirit's level was not ordinary.","However—","He had only given out one business card recently, so this unknown number was very likely someone from the Qi family.","Anything related to Qi Quan piqued his interest.","He slowly typed: [I need to see the situation in person.]","Receiving the reply, Qi Yingxue felt somewhat apprehensive.","Should she really invite the master?","Meanwhile, Mrs. Song woke up with a start after less than two hours of sleep.","She scrambled out of bed in a panic, about to order the driver to the hospital, when several guests arrived at the house.","It was Mrs. Du, Mrs. Yang, and Mrs. Zhang.","Their four families were all major players in Longjiang City, usually interacting quite closely and having a good relationship.","The three of them first offered extensive comfort, bringing Mrs. Song to the brink of tears, before getting to the main point.","Mrs. Zhang: \"I heard your Song Lin had several accidents before?\"","\"That's right,\" Mrs. Song wiped her tears.","Mrs. Du: \"Do you know about the incidents where our Jiaming and their boys ended up in the hospital?\"","\"I know.\"","Mrs. Yang: \"Then you also know we invited a master to save our sons?\"","The entire Song family didn't believe in such things, so they had always been skeptical of the stories circulating in their social circle.","She nodded gently, \"You mentioned it before.\"","Mrs. Zhang advised, \"If you ask me, it's better to invite a reliable master to take a look. Even the unluckiest person has a limit, and your Song Lin's situation seems to go beyond mere bad luck.\"","\"Exactly, aren't you afraid he'll have another accident before his injuries even heal?\" Mrs. Du countered.","Mrs. Song's heart clenched. Ah Lin couldn't afford another accident!","He was lucky to escape with his life this time, but what about next time?","She already felt something was subtly wrong, and hearing the three of them say this, she no longer cared about superstitions or feudal beliefs. She decisively asked, \"Can you help refer me to someone?\"","\"The one who saved our sons was Master Qi,\" Mrs. Zhang said. \"Let me be clear, you can't doubt her just because she's young. Even masters from Longjing City couldn't compare to her!\"","\"Absolutely,\" the others chimed in.","Mrs. Song was torn between laughter and tears: \"If I don't trust her, I still trust you all, don't I?\"","Lakeside Villa...","Qi Quan had made four sets of autumn clothes, two for Su Rong and two for Xue Hong.","Although ghosts couldn't feel seasonal temperature changes, life still needed a sense of ritual.","Butler Su received the clothes and, as always, showed a grateful smile, happily taking them back to his room to change.","Xue Hong was more straightforward, changing right in front of Qi Quan into a set of women's tailored trousers and a jacket, looking slim, long-legged, and sharp.","The other set was casual wear, elegant and tasteful, made from a fabric with a nice drape, very comfortable to wear.","She was extremely satisfied with both.","\"I always thought I had bad luck, but now I feel my luck is truly unbeatable.\"","Qi Quan: \"I'm also very lucky, saving a lot on tutoring fees.\"","\"......\"","Xue Hong said helplessly, \"You have more money in the bank than you can count, and you still begrudge a little tutoring fee? See, someone else is bringing you money.\"","The visitor was indeed Mrs. Song.","She got out of the car, stood at the gate of the Lakeside Villa courtyard, and nervously rang the doorbell.","Mrs. Zhang had come with her and comforted her, \"The Master is very approachable, don't worry.\"","\"I know, I'm just worried about Ah Lin and his father,\" Mrs. Song replied softly.","Not being by their side, she couldn't feel at ease.","The door was opened by Su Rong, who had already changed into his new clothes, looking exceptionally handsome.","Mrs. Song, consumed by anxiety, had no mind to appreciate a handsome man. She just said, \"Hello, I'd like to ask the Master for help.\"","\"Please come in.\"","Su Rong led them into the living room.","At that moment, Ling Sheng entered carrying a tea tray and poured tea for the two ladies.","Mrs. Song, originally distraught, shouldn't have noticed anyone's appearance, but when she caught a glimpse of Ling Sheng out of the corner of her eye, she was suddenly taken aback.","She blurted out without thinking, \"Have we met before?\"","Su Rong: ?","Ling Sheng acted as if he hadn't heard, finished pouring the tea, turned, and left.","Mrs. Song: \"......\"","Qi Quan stepped into the living room.","She had heard the previous sentence but paid it no mind. Regardless of Ling Sheng's identity, he was now a member of the Lakeside Villa.","She had absolutely no intention of investigating his background.","Mrs. Song straightened up: \"Master Qi, my visit is presumptuous, I apologize for the disturbance.\"","Qi Quan got straight to the point: \"You're here for Song Lin.\"","\"Yes, I beg Master Qi to save him.\"","Qi Quan said calmly, \"I can't save him.\"","\"Master Qi,\" Mrs. Song was on the verge of tears, \"I know you young people had some disagreements before. I apologize to you here. As long as you save him, our Song family will agree to any request!\"","Qi Quan sighed inwardly: \"It's not that I won't save him, it's that I cannot.\"","\"Master Qi...\"","\"Mrs. Song,\" Qi Quan interrupted her, her expression serious, \"If the Song family does not give up on that plot of land in the northern suburbs, Song Lin's accidents will be endless.\"","Mrs. Song: \"......\"","\"Of course, even if you give it up now, you will have to pay an extremely high price to secure peace.\"","\"What price?\" Mrs. Song asked instinctively.","Qi Quan said lightly, \"Dissipate your entire family fortune.\"","Mrs. Song: ???","Mrs. Zhang: Well, this...","The system was shocked: [Big shot, is this true? You're not just trying to scare her, are you?]","Qi Quan: [Guess what level the thing in the northern suburbs is?]","[Six... level six?]","Qi Quan: [It is indeed level six, but it's a spirit approaching level seven. Against such a spirit, even a master of the same level would find it difficult to gain an advantage. For the Song family to break this situation, they must make a sufficient gesture. Otherwise, if the major spirit isn't appeased, all efforts will be in vain.]","[How did such a powerful spirit appear?] The system was surprised.","Qi Quan: [Who knows.]","The living room fell into silence.","After a moment, Mrs. Song stood up and said politely, \"Master Qi, thank you for your time.\"","She turned and left the Lakeside Villa.","The system was very curious: [Big shot, why don't you go subdue that major spirit? What if it becomes a blue-level ghost and brings disaster to the world?...]","Qi Quan: [I still have to write my novel, no time.]","System: ......","It didn't believe that for a second!"]},{"number":38,"title":"Chapter 38","paragraphs":["Mrs. Song left the lakeside villa, her mind unsettled as she headed to the hospital.","Her heart felt like it was in her throat the entire way.","She got out of the car and, stepping quickly in her low-heeled leather shoes, hurried into the hospital.","The floor numbers on the elevator display climbed slowly.","She took a deep breath, patted her cheeks, and prepared to face her husband and son with a relatively relaxed expression.","The elevator bell suddenly dinged.","A shiver ran through her whole body.","The elevator had arrived, the doors opened.","She stepped briskly out of the cabin. Before she could even reach the ward door, a tremendous crash sounded—","The hospital bed collapsed without warning.","Song Lin suffered secondary injuries and was rushed back to the operating room.","\"How could this happen? How could this happen?\" Thinking of her son's wretched state, she cried and slumped to the floor.","Qi Yingxue wiped her tears. \"Auntie, this is beyond human capability now. Maybe... maybe we should seek out a master!\"","She had been right by the bedside, witnessing the bed's sudden collapse firsthand, giving her a profound understanding of this \"accident's\" power.","Mrs. Song's face was ashen. \"What kind of master?\"","\"Auntie, my mother and I met someone before. He said he was a Level Six Celestial Master from the Celestial Master Association and gave us a business card. I've heard Level Six is extremely high, very high. Shouldn't we try?\"","\"Level Six... is it really that high?\" Mrs. Song clung to this last hope like a drowning person.","Qi Yingxue nodded. \"I specifically inquired. Among Celestial Masters, Level Six is equivalent to a top-tier expert.\"","\"Good, quick, try it quickly!\" Mrs. Song could not bear another blow.","A Level Six Celestial Master must be more capable than a young woman in her early twenties.","It wasn't that she didn't believe Qi Quan, but Qi Quan seemed too young and had proposed a method she couldn't accept.","What if another master could suggest a more perfect solution?","She looked at Qi Yingxue with anticipation.","Qi Yingxue took out her phone and sent a message back to Yan Wu.","At the appointed time, Yan Wu arrived at the hospital and saw the re-bandaged Song Lin.","He was horrified!","Thick, churning black energy swirled at the center of Song Lin's forehead. Only a Level Six or higher malevolent spirit could leave such intense yin energy on a living person.","Spirits of that rank mostly harbored extremely deep obsessions. If it wanted to toy with someone, it wouldn't allow others to interfere. Anyone meddling would likely get themselves into serious trouble.","He knew his limits.","But he was curious: where had this wealthy young master provoked such a formidable spirit?","\"Before these 'accidents' started, did he go anywhere unusual?\"","Qi Yingxue: \"The northern suburbs! The abandoned factory in the northern suburbs!\"","The northern suburbs?","Yan Wu froze in place, memories from years ago flooding back.","Ten years ago, he was just a small-time operator, running a low-end ghost marriage business chain in Longjiang City.","As the business expanded, he received rewards from the organization, gaining many cultivation resources, and became unmatched within Longjiang City.","His cultivation had reached Level Five at the time.","His profound skill earned him many followers, making him a highly sought-after master in Longjiang City. Just as he was feeling smug, he received a job.","Someone asked him to subdue a spirit at the abandoned factory in the northern suburbs.","The place was desolate back then; he hadn't been there and didn't know what kind of spirit resided there.","He went, brimming with confidence.","The result? He went in standing up and came out lying down.","After that, too ashamed to stay, he fled Longjiang City in a panic.","He had buried this humiliation deep in his memory, almost forgotten, but now it was brought up again.","Yan Wu's hands began to tremble involuntarily.","That spirit was terrifyingly powerful ten years ago; ten years later, it would only be more horrifying.","The black energy on Song Lin's forehead seemed to morph into a pale, bluish ghostly face, roaring as it charged at him.","He took a step back.","Qi Yingxue: ???","Mrs. Song: ...","\"...Ladies, it's not that I'm unwilling to help you,\" he took another step back, \"but that entity is not someone I can provoke.\"","Before the two could speak, he hurriedly rushed out of the ward, but had a sudden inspiration at the doorway and blurted out:","\"But there is one person who can!\"","Mrs. Song's despairing face instantly lit up with hope.","\"Who?!\"","\"Qi Quan!\" Yan Wu's expression was strange. \"In this world, probably only she can help you!\"","Mrs. Song: \"...\"","Qi Yingxue, with her rich acting experience, instantly caught the malice and schadenfreude in his eyes.","Her heart skipped a beat.","If this spirit was truly so powerful, and if Qi Quan went to confront it, then...","\"No! Not her!\" Mrs. Song said with a grave expression.","Yan Wu was surprised. \"You've already sought her out?\"","\"Yes.\" She didn't elaborate, her face cold. \"Surely there are Celestial Masters more powerful than her in the world?\"","\"There are, of course.\"","Mrs. Song stared at him intently.","\"It's just... you can't hire them.\" Yan Wu waved his hand. \"If this isn't resolved, your son's condition will only get worse, until he loses his life.\"","He turned to leave, but before going, he shot an invisible black thread into Mrs. Song's hair.","Mrs. Song didn't notice. Overwhelmed by despair, she swayed and nearly fell.","Qi Yingxue cried, \"Auntie, let's go beg Qi Quan. A Lin is in real danger now. Whatever she wants, I can give it to her!\"","She thought Qi Quan's price was too high and Mrs. Song was unwilling to pay.","Mrs. Song gave a bitter smile. \"Thank you, Yingxue. Let me think about it some more.\"","She walked slowly to her husband's bedside and sat down dazedly.","She knew very well what was more important: her husband and son's lives, or their wealth.","But what if?","What if she could deal with that spirit without having to disperse the family fortune?","Sunlight slanted in through the window, warm and cozy, yet she felt cold all over.","After returning home, Qi Yingxue told the Qi family about the matter.","\"I specifically inquired before; Level Six Celestial Master is indeed a high rank. If even a Level Six Celestial Master dares not confront that thing head-on, then we shouldn't let Qi Quan take the risk,\" Qi Changrong said.","Gu Qiao also nodded.","They couldn't let their daughter take a risk for someone else's son, could they?","Even though this daughter had already severed ties with them.","Qi Yingxue said, \"But Mrs. Song went to the lakeside villa before. From her expression, it didn't seem like she was just rejected.\"","\"How so?\" Gu Qiao asked, surprised.","\"She seemed to be making a difficult decision,\" Qi Yingxue guessed. \"Perhaps the entity is too hard to deal with, and the rules at the lakeside villa are quite strict.\"","Qi Lin glanced at her. \"Don't interfere in this matter anymore. If the Song family needs other help, we can assist. But matters involving the mystical realm are the Song family's own affair.\"","\"A Lin is right. You don't need to concern yourself with finding a master anymore,\" Qi Changrong stated decisively.","Qi Yingxue: \"...\"","Longlin City.","Ning Zhi exited the train station, where two young people came to greet him.","\"Are you Investigator Ning?\" The young man smiled warmly and extended his hand. \"I'm Shen Hui from the Longlin City Investigation Department, a Level Two Investigator. This is my colleague, Tang Mian, a Level Three Investigator. We received orders from above to meet you at the station.\"","Ning Zhi checked his credentials and shook his hand.","Tang Mian stood nearby, hands in her pockets, a lollipop in her mouth, her hair in dreadlocks like a rebellious teenager, showing no intention of shaking his hand.","Ning Zhi didn't mind.","He said, \"I'm here under orders from my superiors to investigate Wei Tianbao and Wei Tao.\"","Though he said \"investigate,\" it essentially meant taking them into custody.","Regarding the Yaoshan Ghost Case and the Xue Hong Case, the authorities had already gathered sufficient evidence through investigation and now only awaited the apprehension of these two individuals.","However, they had previously sought out Wei Huanyang and obtained the Mystic Sect... identity token, thus receiving the Mystic Sect's protection. Due to certain unspoken rules between the authorities and the Mystic Sect, the authorities had to negotiate with the Mystic Sect and wait for their approval before making an arrest.","Previously, the Mystic Sect had played a crucial role in major special cases, forcing the authorities to make concessions and grant them a special status. But in recent years, the Mystic Sect had become increasingly reckless, to the point of disregarding the lives of ordinary people.","With their bottom line repeatedly crossed, even a rabbit will bite when cornered.","The authorities secretly cultivated talent across the country, but in a short time, they still couldn't compare to the deeply rooted Mystic Sect, making progress extremely difficult.","But while they could wait, the public could not.","Since the homegrown talent wasn't developing fast enough, they would recruit from outside.","The authorities possessed a list, a register of major families and sects. By analyzing the daily speech, conduct, and behavior of Mystic Sect cultivators, they assessed their suitability for recruitment and filtered a group of talents who could be brought in.","Ning Zhi was prominently on that list.","Shen Hui and Tang Mian were internal personnel from the start, so they still felt a slight sense of distance towards Ning Zhi, this \"external talent.\"","However, Shen Hui was socially adept, always wearing a smile on his face, neither overly enthusiastic nor too cold.","\"Alright, Investigator Ning, whatever arrangements you have, we'll follow your lead.\"","Tang Mian kicked a pebble by her foot, crunched the lollipop in her mouth, and threw the stick into a trash can.","\"Head straight to the Wei residence,\" Ning Zhi said.","This was the first case he was handling since joining the investigation department, and there absolutely could not be any slip-ups.","The Wei Residence.","Wei Tao was sprawled on the sofa, acting frivolously. \"Dad, now that the police from both places are here, do you think we should go into hiding?\"","\"Go into hiding?\" Wei Tianbao chuckled coldly. \"Why not suggest going abroad?\"","\"Going abroad is even better! They won't be able to find us if we go abroad!\"","Wei Tianbao looked at him as if he were an idiot. \"You'd probably be caught by the police the moment you step into the airport.\"","\"Caught is caught. Anyway, we have Master Wei's protection now. The police don't dare touch us. Just thinking about that Officer Han's frustrated face makes me want to laugh,\" Wei Tao said, swinging his legs.","Wei Tianbao put down the newspaper. \"I hope Master Wei can protect us and make the authorities drop this matter. Otherwise, I just can't feel at ease. Your grandfather is getting old too; we can't have him worrying every day.\"","\"Didn't Master Wei say? As long as we have this identity token, the authorities won't easily lay a hand on us,\" Wei Tao said, twirling the registered disciple identity token in his hand, looking smug.","The doorbell suddenly rang.","The spinning token abruptly stopped.","Father and son looked at each other, their hearts simultaneously leaping into their throats, seeing panic mirrored in each other's eyes.","Wei Tao bolted upright.","The doorbell rang incessantly like a death knell.","A housemaid ran to open the door but was stopped by a sharp shout from Wei Tianbao, too scared to move.","The doorbell still didn't stop.","Wei Tao said hesitantly, \"It should be fine, right?\"","Wei Tianbao took a deep breath and instructed the maid, \"Find out who it is before opening the door.\"","A moment later, the maid returned.","\"They said they're some kind of Heavenly Master.\"","\"Heavenly Master?!\" Wei Tianbao quickly got up and started walking out, but after a few steps, he turned back. \"Did they say what their surname is?\"","The maid shook her head. \"No.\"","Wei Tao turned on the surveillance screen, which showed a young, handsome face.","\"Who's this? Don't know him.\"","Wei Tianbao thought for a moment. \"Maybe he's sent by Master Wei to inform us of something.\"","\"Couldn't he just call?\" Wei Tao said warily. \"What if it's the police in disguise? Don't they often pretend to be property management or plumbers on TV?\"","Wei Tianbao: \"...\"","He slowly retreated. \"Then don't open it.\"","Outside the door, Ning Zhi and the other two waited for a long time, but still no one answered.","Shen Hui said, \"They've been under surveillance. The father and son haven't left the house.\"","\"Then we go in directly,\" Ning Zhi said decisively. \"Since they're relying on the Mystic Sect's influence, it's only fair that we use Mystic Sect... methods on them.\"","Before he could finish his sentence, a figure took the lead and flew into the courtyard.","Ning Zhi and Shen Hui looked at each other, stunned. The next second, two angry roars came from inside the courtyard, followed by a series of howls, along with the screams and collisions of maids and security guards.","It was extremely lively.","As Ning Zhi took a step, the courtyard gate was opened. Two \"pigs' heads\" landed at their feet one after the other. The girl, with a lollipop in her mouth, arrogantly patted her palms clean.","\"...\"","Wei Tianbao, being older, lay crooked on the ground, moaning and groaning, spitting out a few words: \"Ambulance... call the police... Master, save us...\"","Wei Tao scrambled up, waved the Mystic Sect identity token, and blustered, \"You can't arrest me! I'm a disciple of the Hengfeng Sect! Master Wei said you can't arrest me!\"","\"Pfft,\" Tang Mian slapped him with her palm. \"We're not the police.\"","Wei Tao fell to the ground, shocked and furious. \"No matter who you are, you can't arrest me! Do you know who I am? I'm Wei Guangchang's grandson! I'm also Wei Huanyang's registered disciple! If you arrest me, watch your lives!\"","\"Don't worry,\" Shen Hui said with a smile. \"We're just taking you back for questioning. Since you admit to being a Mystic Sect disciple, we'll handle it according to Mystic Sect rules.\"","Ning Zhi wasted no time on words and directly handcuffed them.","The moment his hands were cuffed, Wei Tao screamed in terror, \"Master, save me! Master Wei, save me!\"","\"Too noisy.\" Tang Mian flicked out a Silencing Talisman, cutting off the noise source.","Ning Zhi: \"...\"","This girl really is a bit fierce.","Hengfeng Sect.","Wei Huanyang was still unaware of the arrest of the Wei father and son. He was humbly consulting his senior brother: \"Can you discern the fate of this 'White Water True Person' and 'First in Line for Melon Eating'?\"","The senior brother said, \"Can't see anything for the former. For the latter, I can glimpse a bit. But as you know, we Mystic Sect cultivators have different fates from ordinary people. Cultivators generally don't perform divination for each other.\"","\"I know,\" Wei Huanyang said, inwardly surprised. \"From what I know, this 'White Water True Person' is just a woman in her early twenties. You're a Fifth-Level Heavenly Master, can you really not see anything at all?\"","Senior brother: \"Can't see anything.\"","He was much older than Wei Huanyang, had more experience, and had seen through many things.","There are countless geniuses in the world, so even if you encounter one, there's no need to make a fuss.","But he could understand his junior brother.","This junior brother of his had been exceptionally talented since childhood, indulged by everyone in the sect, given all the cultivation resources he wanted, and had developed a proud and arrogant temperament.","Ever since losing to the Ning family's little genius at the Mystic Sect Grand Competition the year before last, he had held a one-sided grudge against Ning Zhi. He had been secretly cultivating diligently and was now close to the peak of the Fourth Level, with hopes of breaking through to the next realm.","Wei Huanyang was unwilling to accept this.","With Ning Zhi already weighing on his head, he didn't want another person added to that pressure.","His phone suddenly rang, and he instinctively answered it.","\"Master Wei! Save my son and grandson! They've been taken!\" Wei Guangchang said, his voice filled with anger and heartache.","Wei Huanyang frowned. \"By whom? The police?\"","\"No, it seems like it was some... some kind of Heavenly Master!\"","\"Heavenly Master?\" He was even more surprised. In Longjiang City, was there a Heavenly Master who dared not give face to the Hengfeng Sect?","\"I understand. I'll look into it.\"","He hung up and bid farewell to his senior martial brother.","His senior brother gave him a look and spoke with deep feeling, \"Junior Brother, those of us in the mystical arts should focus on cultivation. There's no need to care too much about some vain reputations. For matters that cannot be interfered with, one must learn to let go.\"","\"......\"","Wei Huanyang couldn't listen to this advice at all. He just found it irritating, and a bit of that showed on his face as he frowned slightly. \"Senior Brother, if one does not enter the world, how can one transcend it?\"","After saying that, he bowed and left.","His senior brother shook his head and sighed. \"Entering the world also requires the right methods.\"","Longjiang City Investigation Department.","Ning Zhi and the other two threw the Wei father and son into the interrogation room, and their task was considered complete.","They were the field team, responsible only for tracking and capturing people. Interrogation was handled by professionals.","To be honest, given their current experience and abilities, they weren't entirely qualified for the work of the Investigation Department, but the situation was urgent, and they had to make do.","Shen Hui said with a smile, \"Investigator Ning, wait a bit longer. You might need to negotiate with the Hengfeng Sect people later.\"","It was called negotiation, but in reality, it was about whose fist was harder.","If the Longjiang City Investigation Department wasn't short on senior investigators, the higher-ups wouldn't have specifically dispatched Ning Zhi here.","Sending him was precisely to have someone formidable holding the fort.","Wei Huanyang followed the location of his disciple token and arrived, spotting Ning Zhi just as he was walking out of the Investigation Department's main gate.","When enemies meet, their eyes blaze with hatred.","He strode forward, speaking sharply and severely, \"Ning Zhi! Was it you who captured my disciples?!\"","Ning Zhi replied calmly, \"Heavenly Master Wei, I did indeed capture two people earlier. I don't know if they are your disciples.\"","\"Wei Tao and Wei Hao!\" Wei Huanyang, suppressing his anger, gave a cold laugh. \"You captured people from my Hengfeng Sect without consulting us? You're breaking the rules of the mystical community!\"","Ning Zhi: \"I only captured Wei Tao and Wei Tianbao. There's no Wei Hao.\"","\"......\"","Wei Huanyang glared at him with fierce brows. \"Don't try to dodge the issue! Even if they committed a crime, it should be handled by the Enforcement Division of the Heavenly Masters Association. You arresting them privately violates the 'Heavenly Master Regulations'! Release them immediately!\"","He didn't care about the lives of those two; he cared about his own face.","Being humiliated by his enemy on his own turf—how could he easily swallow this bitter pill?","Ning Zhi took out his credentials, his expression solemn. \"Heavenly Master Wei, I am currently affiliated with the National Special Cases Investigation Department. It has been confirmed that Wei Tao and Wei Tianbao are connected to two special cases. I have the authority to take them away.\"","\"What kind of third-rate Investigation Department is that? Are you trying to fool me?\" Wei Huanyang didn't believe it at all. \"Since you won't listen to reason, let's settle this with our skills!\"","His cultivation had improved significantly compared to two years ago. This time, he absolutely could not lose to Ning Zhi!","Fourth-grade thunder talismans rained down on Ning Zhi's head, thrown as if they were free, all aimed at him.","Wei Huanyang specialized in the talisman path. The talismans he drew were quite lethal. Dumping them all on Ning Zhi like this showed he was going all out.","Ning Zhi was not afraid in the slightest.","While Wei Huanyang's cultivation had increased, Ning Zhi hadn't fallen behind either. Moreover, during this period following Master Qi, he had gained immensely. His realm had already shown signs of loosening, and he precisely needed a battle like this to break through!","The junior investigators of the Investigation Department retreated to a safe distance to observe the duel between masters.","Shen Hui, hiding inside a small protective array, said cheerfully, \"Our Investigator Ning's fighting spirit is quite high.\"","\"Just worried that beating the young one might summon the old one,\" Tang Mian remarked, watching with crossed arms.","\"Shouldn't come to that,\" Shen Hui shrugged. \"It's just a spar between juniors. No need to make such a big deal out of it.\"","Tang Mian: \"No one likes being suppressed.\"","The authorities had drawn their sword. Could the mystical community still sit idly by?","Arresting Wei Tao and Wei Tianbao was the authorities' demonstration of attitude towards the mystical community, and also the first \"battle.\"","They could only win.","Could Ning Zhi win?","At the mystical community competition two years ago, he had defeated Wei Huanyang by a narrow margin. Could he still win now?","Of course he could!","Ning Zhi struck Wei Huanyang's shoulder with a palm. Wei Huanyang flew backward, crashing onto the steps of the Investigation Department, his face instantly turning pale.","\"You... you...\" He pointed at Ning Zhi, filled with rage and unwillingness.","Ning Zhi was momentarily stunned before belatedly realizing—","He had actually broken through!","His cultivation, stagnant for two years, had broken through during the fight, propelling him directly into the realm of a fifth-grade Heavenly Master!","The people at the Investigation Department were also dumbfounded, followed by delight.","Shen Hui praised sincerely, \"As expected of the promising talent officially recruited. Truly outstanding.\"","Tang Mian: \"Indeed very strong.\"","They, the latecomers, would have to redouble their efforts.","Wei Huanyang shot Ning Zhi a resentful glare, clutched his chest, and left in disgrace.","The first battle was victorious.","Lakeside Villa.","Chen Feilu was guiding his energy according to the cultivation method.","His aptitude was fairly good. Although he hadn't yet crossed the threshold, he was already touching the edge of it. As long as he persisted, he would eventually step through.","He was very patient.","His phone rang a few times.","Chen Feilu ended his cultivation session, picked up his phone, and opened it. It was his university dormitory group chat.","[Fat Bro: @Ning Daxia @Feitian Luma How long are you two planning to take leave? Do you even remember you're supposed to be in school?]","[2D-Otaku: Curious about what you're actually doing. Come out and say something?]","Chen Feilu sighed in distress. He wasn't sure about the current situation either.","Logically, he had no tasks now and could return to university, but he was also Master Qi's assistant. Shouldn't an assistant be ready to receive orders at any time?","If he went to school and couldn't respond to the master's instructions promptly, would there still be a place for him by the master's side when he was on vacation?","It was a real dilemma.","He replied in the group: [Wait a couple more days. I might take a one-year leave of absence from school.]","[Fat Bro: ??? Did something happen to you?]","[2D-Otaku: Bro, if you have problems, just say it. We'll help if we can!]","[Fat Bro: Yeah, without you, it's really tough. Even online gossip isn't as fun.]","[2D-Otaku: But maybe it's good you're not coming back. Our school seems to be haunted these past couple of days. Take your leave peacefully and come back after the trouble passes.]","Chen Feilu's heart skipped a beat: [What haunting?]","[Fat Bro: Probably rumors spreading. There's no such thing as ghosts.]","[2D-Otaku: But it's a fact that three people in the girls' dorm got hurt.]","[Fat Bro: Right, and wasn't there one who was perfectly fine?]","[2D-Otaku: Maybe the ghost thought Department Beauty Su was too pretty and couldn't bear to hurt her.]","Chen Feilu: [Department Beauty Su?]","He was very sensitive to the surname Su now.","[Fat Bro: She's a freshman. She was voted department beauty on registration day. There are photos on the forum. She really is pretty.]","Chen Feilu: [What's her name?]","[2D-Otaku: What? Interested? I heard she's also from Longjiang City, same as you. Her name is Su Nuanuan. The name sounds really cute.]","Chen Feilu: [...]","In a dorm room, only one person remained unharmed. The most likely explanation was that Su Nuanuan was wearing a protective talisman.","Considering the relationship between the Su family and the Master, it was highly probable the Master had given Su Nuanuan a protective talisman. With such protection, being unharmed by evil spirits made perfect sense.","He got up and went next door to find Su Rong.","After hearing about the incident, Su Rong's expression turned serious. \"I'll give her a call.\"","\"Alright.\"","Soon, Su Nuanuan answered the phone.","\"Brother, I'm fine. It was probably just that the beds in our dorm aren't very sturdy. They collapsed in the middle of the night. The other three got some minor injuries, but I'm completely unharmed. It's just that the jade gourd Sister Quan gave me got a little cracked from the impact. I'm so heartbroken!\"","Su Rong: \"...\"","He said with exasperation, \"That's a life-protecting jade talisman. It doesn't crack easily. The fact that it's cracked now means it has already saved your life once. Don't take it lightly.\"","\"Mm, I understand.\"","\"What about the ghost incident?\"","Su Nuanuan replied, \"I don't know. It seems like when the three of them were going to the hospital, one of them kept shouting 'ghost, ghost!' The other two and I didn't see any ghost.\"","\"Be careful in everything,\" Su Rong warned.","\"Mm!\" Su Nuanuan laughed. \"I know.\"","After hanging up, Chen Feilu said, \"How about this, I'll ask Brother Ning when he has time to come back to the university. He can go take a look.\"","Su Rong nodded. \"Thank you.\"","\"Hey, why be so polite with us? Aren't we all family?\" Chen Feilu patted his shoulder.","A smile returned to Su Rong's face. \"What do you want to eat tonight?\"","\"Braised prawns!\" Chen Feilu said without hesitation.","\"Alright.\"","That evening, Su Rong cooked... a table full of delicious dishes. Everyone, human and ghost alike, ate to their heart's content.","\"Tomorrow morning, I need to go out. You all guard the house well,\" Qi Quan said.","Su Rong: \"Don't worry.\"","Xue Hong: \"Ling Sheng is here. You can go with peace of mind.\"","Chen Feilu, confused, asked, \"What about Ling Sheng?\"","He didn't know about Yan Wu leading people to attack the villa's protective formation.","Qi Quan smiled and said, \"You all can't always rely on Ling Sheng. What if Ling Sheng isn't here in the future? Would you just not guard the home then?\"","A spoon fell into the soup bowl with a crisp clink.","Ling Sheng remained frozen in the posture of reaching for the spoon, staring blankly at Qi Quan as if he didn't understand why he would \"not be here\" in the future.","\"Master, please don't scare Ling Sheng like that,\" Xue Hong said, quite satisfied with her exceptionally talented student.","Su Rong said, \"Ling Sheng was probably abducted as a child. If he finds his family one day, he'll likely return to them.\"","Chen Feilu sighed with emotion: The people and ghosts of Lakeside Villa all had painful pasts. If not for the Master, they would still be trapped in their own personal hells.","Qi Quan: ???","Her original intention was just to encourage Su Rong and Xue Hong to work harder on improving their own abilities. Why did it get turned into a discussion about Ling Sheng?","Even the system chimed in mournfully: [Big Boss, the villa is so big, there's plenty of room for Ling Sheng.]","It even rhymed.","Just as Qi Quan was about to speak, Ling Sheng suddenly stood up, walked over to her, his eyes showing a trace of panic and unease. Then, from his shirt pocket and pants pockets, he pulled out one jade sparrow token after another, urgently stuffing them into her hands.","The amount of spiritual energy stored in each token was at least double that of the previous ones.","He looked at Qi Quan with pleading eyes. Seeing she wasn't reacting, he knelt down on one knee, tapped Qi Quan's index fingertip, and then pointed to the center of his own forehead.","Qi Quan couldn't help but laugh. \"You want to form a contract with me too?\"","Ling Sheng nodded. He remembered the actions when Qi Quan formed the contract with Xue Hong.","\"No,\" Qi Quan said.","Ling Sheng's eyes widened slightly: Why?","\"They are ghosts. You are not,\" Qi Quan said, smiling as she ruffled his hair. \"I won't drive you away, unless you want to leave yourself.\"","Ling Sheng shook his head.","Qi Quan tried to return the jade sparrow tokens. \"Keep them yourself. Don't take them out easily when others are around.\"","The young man pushed them back, insisting on giving them to her. On this matter, he seemed unusually stubborn.","[Big Boss, he's afraid you don't want him.] The system advised. [Maybe you should just accept them.]","Looking at the obedient and handsome young man, it was impossible for Qi Quan not to feel a softening in her heart.","She smiled and said, \"Alright, I'll keep them for you.\"","The unease in Ling Sheng's eyes dissipated. It didn't matter if she kept them or used them, as long as they were in her hands.","Everyone couldn't help but smile.","A faint warmth filled the villa.","On the internet, the release of one piece of news instantly blew up Weibo.","[Longjiang City Public Security V: Recently, the police conducted an in-depth investigation into the dismemberment case at Longjiang University.","Five years ago, the victim, Ms. Xue, was teaching at Longjiang University. A student named Wei, dissatisfied with her strict grading methods, had a conflict with her. After taking a make-up exam, Wei still failed to pass the course and went to Ms. Xue's residence to beg her.","Ms. Xue refused. In a fit of rage, Wei attacked the back of Ms. Xue's head, killed her, dismembered the body at her residence, then used Ms. Xue's own suitcase to transport the remains and buried them in a wooded area on campus.","Afterwards, Wei used Ms. Xue's phone to post on her social media, fabricating the illusion that she had gone abroad, and also forged a resignation letter submitted to the university.","The suspect, Wei, has now been arrested.","We hereby urge all university students to study diligently, improve their cultural literacy, and strengthen their ideological and moral development. Exams are merely one method of evaluating learning outcomes, not the entirety of life. Do not act impulsively.]","Wei Tao had a weak will. After being taken to the Investigation Department's interrogation room, he confessed to everything before long.","Before confessing, he still held onto a sliver of hope, believing his grandfather would definitely find a way to rescue him from the outside.","When the interrogators showed him the video of Wei Huanyang's defeat, his will to resist instantly crumbled.","If even Master Wei couldn't save him... who else could he count on?","Faced with the police's evidence, he had no defense.","Actually, his plan for murder and body disposal had been successful.","Five years had passed, and the person Xue Hong had long been forgotten. If she hadn't become a ghost, this case would have remained forever sealed in that dark grove of trees.","Netizens who saw the case report felt chills run down their spines.","[If you fail an exam, just fing study harder! What's the point of killing the teacher?!]","[It proved useful, didn't it? The female teacher was killed, and then he got his credits, right?]","[I'm so angry I could die, I'm so angry I could die, I'm so angry I could die! I'm a university counselor. If I encountered a psycho like this, it would be the worst luck imaginable!]","[Holy crap, Longjiang University, my alma mater!]","[Alumni! Me too! Five years ago I was a freshman. I went to a lecture to take attendance for a friend and have never forgotten it. Although the teacher was indeed strict, she was really, really beautiful! Her surname was Xue! But later when I went back to her class, she was gone! It couldn't be her, could it?!]","[Holy crap, how beautiful was she to make you remember her all these years?]","[I secretly took a photo of her during class. [Photo]]","[Dude, you're really devoted... Holy shit, she really is beautiful!]","[So pretty! Oh my god, reading the news now, I really, really can't bear it!]","[I just confirmed with someone... the one in the news... it's her.]","[I can't take this. I want to beat that murderer to death!]","[He has to get the death penalty for this, right?]","[Death penalty!]","[By the way, does anyone know about Fengmao Group?]","【Everyone's discussing the case details, why are you bringing this up!】","【It's said that the murderer is Wei Tao, the grandson of Wei Guangchang, chairman of Fengmao Group. Moreover, Wei Tao's father also killed someone. Pointing the way @Longjiang City Police】","That night, Weibo crashed.","The public's blood, however, was boiling.","The evil deeds of the Wei father and son finally came to light. Countless people were furious, cursing and swearing to make the criminals face due punishment.","Suddenly, one comment caught everyone's attention.","【Has anyone read \"Diary of a Wealthy Family\"? The latest chapter seemed to mention 'stealing a life,' which directly corresponds to what that Wei guy's dad did, right? So, who exactly is Bai Shui Zhen Ren?】","【I've read it! It really matches up!】","【Was she involved in this case?】","【She's really brave. That's the Fengmao Group! Isn't she afraid of retaliation from Wei Guangchang?】","【Hahahaha with your comment, even if Wei Guangchang wants to retaliate, he wouldn't dare now.】","【Retaliate? Both his son and grandson have killed people. Do you really think Wei Guangchang is clean? His son was only eighteen back then, how could he have pulled off that identity theft by himself? Wei Guangchang must have done it!】","【But it was so long ago, it's really hard to investigate. And there doesn't seem to be a specific charge for identity theft?】","【Sue him for violating the constitution!】","【Hmph, with a business that big, how can it be truly clean? Just wait and see.】","【Bro, you're really brave.】","Many people stayed up all night, but Qi Quan was not among them.","She had been willful last night, submitted a leave note and didn't update. However, her readers didn't mind; they were already stuffed full from feasting on the online drama.","Readers discovered that \"Diary of a Wealthy Family\" was a complete collection of explosive scandals, each one bigger and juicier than the last, truly irresistible.","A flood of people rushed over, some commenting, some tipping with virtual \"thunder.\"","With just twelve short chapters, \"Diary of a Wealthy Family\" exploded in popularity, breaking out of its original circle.","Overnight, its metrics skyrocketed.","Qi Quan cultivated the entire night. In the morning, she changed into a simple beige knitwear top, her hair down, adding a touch of gentleness.","\"Master, I need to go back to my university today,\" Chen Feilu reported to her. \"I'll definitely come back early after I finish my business!\"","He had successfully guided Qi into his body last night, his eyes subtly holding joy, full of vigor.","\"Come back for what?\" Qi Quan asked.","Chen Feilu: \"Huh? Aren't I your assistant?\"","Qi Quan said earnestly, \"A university diploma is also very important. Finish your studies first.\"","Chen Feilu's heart sank: \"But...\"","\"Before you go back, come with me somewhere first.\"","His face lit up with a smile: \"Alright!\"","At nine o'clock, Zheng Guangming arrived on time.","He hadn't stayed at his sister's place last night, opting for a random hotel instead. He probably didn't sleep well, with deep dark circles under his eyes.","\"Master, I've already asked. They're home today,\" Zheng Guangming said while driving, his tone somewhat heavy.","Qi Quan's expression was indifferent: \"Mm.\"","The car slowly drove into the residential area in the east of the city.","Zheng Guangming's sister lived in a high-end residential complex. Security for non-resident vehicles was quite strict. Zheng Guangming had entered and exited the past two days, so the guard remembered him and didn't stop them much.","The neighborhood greening was well done, and the roads were relatively wide.","Zheng Guangming found a parking spot.","\"Her place is in that building. Shall we go straight up?\"","Qi Quan nodded and handed Chen Feilu a talisman paper.","\"What's this?\"","\"You've just started, you don't know how to restrain your aura yet. Wear this.\"","\"Thank you, Master!\" Chen Feilu happily put it in his shirt's inner pocket.","The three took the elevator to the sixteenth floor.","One elevator per household, a large flat. An apartment like this was probably worth seven or eight million.","Chen Feilu glanced around, mentally estimating the price.","It seemed this client's family was fairly well-off.","Zheng Guangming rang the doorbell.","Soon, the door opened from the inside, revealing a decent-looking face wearing glasses, appearing scholarly and polite.","From an ordinary person's perspective, the man could be considered handsome.","But everyone at Lakeside Villa was top-tier in looks; Chen Feilu's standards had already been raised sky-high.","He didn't find anyone handsome anymore.","\"Big brother, come on in.\" The man stepped aside. Seeing Qi Quan and Chen Feilu, he asked in surprise, \"And these two are?\"","\"Oh, my friends. They heard you're in investments and wanted to come consult. I forgot to mention it earlier. You don't mind, right?\" Zheng Guangming chuckled.","The man adjusted his glasses: \"Of course not.\"","The three entered the house and sat on the sofa.","\"What would you like to drink? Tea or coffee?\" the man said politely. \"We also have soft drinks at home.\"","Chen Feilu smiled and replied, \"Thank you, but no need to trouble yourself. We'll just ask a few questions and be on our way.\"","The man paused, a flicker in his eyes behind the lenses.","He picked up a cup, pretending to go to the kitchen for water, casually calling out a few times: \"Hui Hui! Hui Hui! Big brother is here, stop whatever you're doing!\"","The bedroom door opened.","A woman in a floral dress stood in the doorway, looking at the three people in the living room.","Her reaction seemed a bit slow. Only after a good while did she force a smile at Zheng Guangming, her voice stiff: \"Brother.\"","If not for Qi Quan's warning yesterday, Zheng Guangming might have still thought she was like this solely due to the blow of the miscarriage. But if you substituted \"possessed by a ghost,\" everything made sense.","When the software and hardware don't match, you get this kind of lag.","When he met \"Zheng Hui\"'s lifeless eyes, all the hairs on his body stood on end.","\"Big brother, are you feeling unwell?\" The man's hand lightly rested on Zheng Guangming's shoulder, his voice low and deep.","Zheng Guangming: \"...\"","\"Ahem,\" Chen Feilu quickly stepped in to smooth things over, \"Mr. Feng, are you aware of what happened on Weibo last night? Brother Zheng couldn't sleep well because of the Wei father and son incident.\"","Mr. Feng raised an eyebrow slightly. \"Is that so.\"","He smiled and sat down, gesturing for Zheng Hui to come over. Zheng Hui slowly walked to his side and sat closely next to him on the sofa.","\"What would you two like to ask about?\" He held his teacup, like a polite gentleman.","Chen Feilu racked his brains for investment-related questions when Qi Quan abruptly spoke.","\"How is your relationship with your first love?\"","\"Pfft—\"","Zheng Guangming was drinking water to calm his nerves. Hearing her question, he sprayed it out completely.","First love? What first love?!","Wasn't Hui Hui his first love?","The atmosphere in the living room suddenly turned eerie. No one paid attention to whether he had soiled the sofa or floor.","Mr. Feng's hand holding the teacup was steady. Zheng Hui stared intently at Qi Quan.","\"Did your first love have a miscarriage?\"","\"Who was prettier, your first love or Miss Zheng?\"","\"Which one did you like more?\"","\"You—\"","Thud! The teacup bottom hit the coffee table. Mr. Feng leaned forward, crossed his hands, and said with a heavy gaze, \"Miss, do you think such a clumsy method can drive a wedge between Hui Hui and me? You overestimate yourself.\"","Chen Feilu: ???","What the hell kind of nonsense are you spouting!","System: 【Ahhhhh! Boss, take him down! What a conceited, ordinary man!】","Qi Quan: ...","She raised her hand. Spiritual power transformed into chains, swiftly disappearing into Zheng Hui's head. With a slight tug, a wisp of a soul floated out from her body.","Zheng Hui slumped straight back onto the sofa.","Mr. Feng could no longer maintain his composure. Furious, he said, \"You've killed Hui Hui! I'm calling the police!\"","\"Master, what on earth is wrong with Hui Hui?\" Zheng Guangming rushed to Zheng Hui's side, as frantic as an ant on a hot pan, pacing in circles.","Mr. Feng had already called the police: \"Someone has intentionally harmed my wife! My wife is now unconscious!\"","Chen Feilu was utterly confused by his actions.","\"Master, what is he doing?\"","Qi Quan: \"Probably something like, 'it's everyone's duty to oppose feudal superstition.'\"","\"...\"","Chen Feilu understood.","This Feng guy was determined that the police wouldn't believe in any talk of ghosts and spirits, and was deliberately calling the police to mess with them.","\"Big brother.\" Mr. Feng regained his composure, his expression turning cold and stern. \"How could you bring outsiders here to harm Hui Hui? She's your own sister.\"","Zheng Guangming: \"...\"","Qi Quan released a surge of spiritual energy, causing the spectral form to solidify.","\"Mr. Feng, take a good look. Is she really your first love?\"","Mr. Feng instinctively turned his head, and his eyes suddenly widened in shock.","How could this be!"]},{"number":39,"title":"Chapter 39","paragraphs":["The spirit was a female ghost.","She looked nothing like Zheng Hui.","Her features were ordinary, her appearance plain—so unremarkable that she’d be lost in a crowd without a trace.","Once separated from the mismatched “hardware” of Zheng Hui, her expressions became noticeably more vivid.","Mr. Feng couldn’t believe it. “Who are you?!”","The system was stunned: [He’s acting so convincingly! Not at all like someone who’s known Zheng Hui’s appearance for a long time.]","Qi Quan: [He really doesn’t know.]","[What?] The system was baffled.","Qi Quan’s words cut deep: “You think Zheng Hui’s body is still occupied by your first love, right?”","“Impossible! That’s impossible!” Mr. Feng took a few terrified steps back, staring hard at the ghost’s unfamiliar face, then turned to Qi Quan. “You must have tampered with something!”","Qi Quan glanced at the ghost. “Don’t you want to say something to him?”","The ghost stepped forward.","The man instinctively retreated a few steps.","On the ghost’s pale face, a few strands of grievance flickered. She lowered her head, wiped away tears that didn’t really exist, and said in a hoarse voice, “A-Kai, don’t you remember me?”","Feng Kai shuddered all over. “I don’t know you! Why are you inside Hui Hui’s body?”","His panic and disbelief were genuine.","Zheng Guangming and Chen Feilu were completely confused by his behavior.","Just a moment ago, Feng Kai had acted like the mastermind behind the scenes!","“You really don’t remember me,” the ghost said softly, tears welling up, looking pitiful for a moment—but in the next second, her expression darkened suddenly. Black mist covered her eyes as she roared angrily, “You only remember that bitch Zhou Qian! You only remember her! Not even your own wife...”","“Shut up!” Feng Kai’s aura surged. “I don’t know what you’re talking about!”","He was quite savvy, red-eyed as he said to Zheng Guangming, “Big brother, I truly don’t know that Hui Hui’s been possessed by this filthy thing. I thought she was just traumatized and changed like this. Luckily, you noticed something was wrong and brought in a master.”","Chen Feilu caught on: This guy was pretty sly.","After all, no one could prove he knew that the person inside Zheng Hui’s body wasn’t really Zheng Hui.","He was just an innocent victim.","Zheng Guangming was disgusted too. With Feng Kai’s previously polished, scoundrel-like face, he definitely knew something.","But there was no evidence.","Zheng Guangming ignored him and asked Qi Quan, “Master, is Hui Hui still salvageable?”","If this ghost had taken over Hui Hui’s body, then where was Hui Hui?","Qi Quan glanced at the man. “Ask him.”","Zheng Guangming immediately rushed over to Feng Kai, grabbed his collar, almost lifting him off the ground, and growled fiercely, “Where did you take Hui Hui? Tell me now!”","He was tall and strong; when angry, he was intimidating, towering over Feng Kai.","Feng Kai’s glasses were crooked, and he didn’t even bother to fix them. “I don’t know, I really don’t know. Big brother, I like Hui Hui so much—how could I let this strange ghost take over her body?”","Qi Quan said, “Because you thought it was your first love.”","Feng Kai: “...”","[Boss, how did you figure that out?] The system admired.","Qi Quan: \"It's simple. Feng Kai's facial features show that he once had a deep and passionate first love, but sadly, that first love passed away early. He doesn't care at all about the strange situation with Zheng Hui, which means he knows about it. But he doesn’t realize that the 'Hui' inside Zheng Hui is actually another female ghost.\"","[So what role exactly does he play in all this?]","Qi Quan: \"He is both the mastermind and the deceived.\"","[I see, he’s basically shooting himself in the foot.]","\"Speak up! Where is Huihui?\" Zheng Guangming was nearly frantic.","He didn’t care about whatever entanglement Feng Kai had with the ghost; all he wanted was his sister back.","The ghost spoke softly, \"Feng Kai, do you know why Zhou Qian had a miscarriage?\"","\"Shut up!\" Feng Kai lost all composure. \"I don’t know what you’re talking about!\"","The ghost’s eyes glowed with dark energy as she stared at him, a faint smile curling at the corner of her lips, as if enjoying his expression on the brink of collapse. With a rough voice, she said:","\"Because your parents are snobs. They wanted you to marry a rich wife, someone like Zheng Hui, whose family could provide the funds to boost your career.\"","\"Stop talking nonsense! I only love Huihui!\" Feng Kai shouted.","The ghost chuckled coldly, \"Last night you were still calling me 'Qianqian,' and now you’ve forgotten? Feng Kai, you love Zhou Qian’s gentle nature and are reluctant to leave Zheng Hui’s wealthy family, but you can’t stand Zhou Qian’s poverty and can’t live under Zheng Hui’s dominance. So you came up with the perfect plan—to combine the two of them and enjoy the benefits of both, right?\"","Zheng Guangming: !!!","Chen Feilu: Holy crap!","System: \"Damn! Feng Kai is twisted!\"","\"Who are you! Who the hell are you?\" Feng Kai’s eyes were bloodshot as he swung his fists at the ghost.","System: \"He was so calm just now, how did he suddenly go crazy?\"","Qi Quan: \"Anyone capable of doing something like this is already crazy.\"","The system shivered involuntarily as it thought about it.","Just now, when the ghost was inside Zheng Hui’s body, the mismatch between the software and hardware—the glitches—were truly unsettling.","And Feng Kai wasn’t scared at all?","Zheng Guangming snapped back to reality, grabbed Feng Kai by the collar, and punched him hard in the face. His glasses fell off, the lenses shattered, and the frame was crushed underfoot.","\"Pervert! Pervert! Pervert! Tell me! Where’s my sister?\"","\"Hahaha,\" Feng Kai suddenly burst into wild laughter, his dark eyes fixed on Zheng Guangming. \"Your sister? She’s just lying on the sofa, isn’t she? Zheng Guangming, your whole family is crazy!\"","Qi Quan was annoyed by the noise and sealed Feng Kai’s mouth with spiritual power.","“If you don’t want to talk, then don’t.”","\"Mmm mmm mmm...\"","Qi Quan then turned to the ghost. \"If you have anything to say, now’s your chance. Say it all, then you can move on.\"","The ghost was silent.","Her pale face turned even whiter as she quietly pleaded, \"I never wanted to hurt anyone. I just... I just...\"","\"I get it. You just want to be with the one you secretly love,\" Qi Quan nodded calmly. \"Talk more now, because you won’t get another chance later.\"","The ghost let out a pitiful wail.","She knew she couldn't match Qi Quan's strength, so for now, she could only fight for the greatest benefit—confessing her feelings to Feng Kai.","“Back in high school, you often wrote love letters to Zhou Qian and had a girl deliver them for you. You probably forgot the girl who helped you deliver those letters, right?”","Feng Kai: “......”","“That’s right, I’m that girl who delivered your love letters.”","Chen Feilu wiped his face, thinking, \"How did this perfectly normal supernatural channel turn into a teenage heartbreak drama?\"","The girl went on and on, recounting the bittersweet memories of her high school crush. She wore a smile, as if that long-gone time was the most unforgettable chapter of her brief life.","“I liked you so much, so much. But why did you have to like Zhou Qian? Why did you have to like...","Zhou Qian!”","Chen Feilu muttered quietly, “But... what did Zhou Qian ever do wrong?”","“She did nothing wrong!” The ghost laughed coldly, “Her only mistake was making a man unable to forget her. After all these years, he even hired a master to bring her back to life, to be reborn in Zheng Hui’s body.”","Feng Kai: “......”","“But you didn’t expect this, did you? When you and the master stood before Zhou Qian’s tombstone, what you saw wasn’t Zhou Qian’s spirit—it was mine.”","“Ugh ugh ugh...”","“Want to know why?” The ghost smiled eerily, “Because before I died, I just wanted to see you a little longer.”","Feng Kai often visited Zhou Qian’s grave, and the ghost’s lingering wish before dying was to see Feng Kai frequently. Her attachment caused her to cling to Zhou Qian’s tombstone. The graveyard’s heavy yin energy allowed her to stay in the mortal world for quite a while.","Every time Feng Kai came to visit, she could shamelessly admire his handsome face, no longer forced to bow her head in shame like before.","But Feng Kai didn’t come every day—at most, once a month.","From luxury to frugality is hard.","Humans become greedy, and ghosts are no different.","Waiting a whole month was torture for her. She wanted to stay by his side forever, to watch him day and night.","Finally, one day, her chance came.","Feng Kai came with a Taoist master.","She was terrified at first, thinking Feng Kai had discovered her and was going to send her away.","She hid trembling behind the tombstone.","Feng Kai anxiously asked, “Master, is she still there?”","The master, cold and aloof, replied, “Yes.”","“Can you perform the ritual?”","“Yes.”","And so, the ghost was taken back to Feng Kai’s home by the master.","The master trapped her inside Zheng Hui’s body. It was agonizing—she felt none of the freedom or lightness she had as a ghost. But when she opened her eyes and saw Feng Kai’s affectionate gaze, she stopped caring about anything.","She imitated Zhou Qian’s tone and mannerisms perfectly. She even fabricated a story about missing a child lost to miscarriage, using Zhou Qian’s own history to dispel Feng Kai’s suspicions.","After all, it’s always difficult to adapt when one’s soul occupies another’s body. Even if she acted strangely, Feng Kai wouldn’t suspect too much.","She would never tell Feng Kai that the master had deceived him.","But now, the dream was finally shattered.","She watched Feng Kai’s devastated, nauseous face and couldn’t help but laugh.","Her laughter was sharp and haunting.","Qi Quan: “......”","With a casual flick of his hand, Qi Quan sealed the ghost into a peach wood talisman.","The peach wood talisman now contained four spirits: Qin Ruo, the long-bearded Celestial Master, Wei Hao, and the newly arrived female ghost.","It was no different from a prison cell.","“Why is it so cramped in here!” Qin Ruo shouted angrily. “Newcomer, get over to the side!”","The female ghost said nothing.","She quietly pressed herself into a corner, not daring to argue with the prison bully.","“Knock, knock, knock.”","There was a knock at the door.","“Hello, police? Is anyone home?”","Qi Quan ended Feng Kai’s silencing spell.","Feng Kai’s eyes lit up, and he hurried over to open the door. As soon as it opened, he choked up and said, “Officer, it was me who reported this. They harmed my wife, and now she’s unconscious!”","Two police officers stepped inside and saw Zheng Hui lying on the sofa. One asked, “Have you called an ambulance?”","Feng Kai was taken aback. “No.”","Since Zheng Hui wasn’t truly injured or ill, he hadn’t thought of it.","The officers frowned, surveying the living room. It didn’t look like a scene of violent struggle, and the others seemed unnervingly calm.","“Officer, look at my face,” Feng Kai pointed at Zheng Guangming. “He’s the one who hit her.”","Zheng Guangming had just punched Feng Kai’s face, leaving several visible marks.","“Call an ambulance first,” one officer instructed. “The rest of you will need to come with me later.”","At that moment, Chen Feilu stepped in front of the two officers and pulled out an ID card.","The words “National Special Case Investigation Department” caught their eyes.","The two officers exchanged glances, surprise evident in their eyes.","Their department had just received notice yesterday about a newly established agency—an official, government-backed unit similar to theirs, dedicated to handling special cases. It was called the “National Special Case Investigation Department.” If they encountered such cases during investigations, they could transfer them to this unit.","What kind of special cases they handled, no one really knew.","Colleagues speculated it might be about investigating cold cases or cleaning up social misconduct.","But no one expected to see this ID so soon.","A fellow officer—this made things easier.","“Comrade, what’s going on here?” one officer asked.","Chen Feilu answered seriously, “We’re from the Investigation Department. This case is now under our jurisdiction. The victim here does not need an ambulance.”","The officers thought: the notice was only issued yesterday, so it was unlikely a scammer would already have forged such a credential. Still, they asked cautiously, “Can we see your ID?”","Chen Feilu handed it over.","The officers flipped it open.","[Chen Feilu, Male, 20 years old, Chief Consultant Assistant, National Special Case Investigation Department, ID No. xxxxxx]","There was a red official stamp below. It looked genuine.","They returned the ID and asked, “Are you sure no ambulance is needed?”","He hesitated, glancing at the motionless Zheng Hui.","Chen Feilu was about to explain when suddenly, a very thin spiritual thread rose gently from Zheng Hui’s third eye.","It was the Master.","He stared intently.","Ordinary people couldn’t see the spiritual energy manifest as a fine thread; only a novice like Chen Feilu could.","Everyone else: ???","Why was he suddenly staring so fixedly at the young woman?","Feng Kai shouted in anger and shock, \"Why are you looking at her? Officer, please call an ambulance! They’re bad people, scammers! Don’t listen to their nonsense!\"","Just now, he saw Chen Feilu show his badge to the police. Although he didn’t get a clear look, the change in the officer’s attitude made him realize that things were quickly spiraling out of his control.","What should he do? What on earth should he do?!","Qi Quan extended his spiritual energy deep into Zheng Hui’s soul, probing bit by bit. After a short while, the spiritual thread curved, slowly extending outward.","[Boss, what exactly are you doing?]","[Every person’s body and soul are perfectly matched. Even if a female ghost has taken over Zheng Hui’s body, having used it for over twenty years, she can’t suddenly become someone else overnight. The lingering instincts will guide us to find her true soul.]","The system applauded: [Impressive, boss!]","The spiritual thread cautiously stretched out its tendrils, as if searching and testing, gradually drifting toward a bedroom.","It was from this very bedroom that the “Zheng Hui” had just emerged.","The master bedroom of the house.","Qi Quan followed the thread and opened the door.","Suddenly, the spiritual thread became excited, twirling in the air before striking a specific spot.","It was a wedding photo — a solo portrait of Zheng Hui.","She wore a pristine white wedding dress, holding a bouquet of fresh flowers, standing on lush green grass, her smile dazzlingly bright.","And this photo faced directly toward the bed.","...","Chen Feilu stepped in behind and, seeing the scene, felt a chill run through his entire body, making him shiver uncontrollably.","If Zheng Hui’s soul really was trapped inside this photo, then every night she would have to watch her husband cozying up to another woman — what kind of torment would that be?","Especially since the other woman was using *her* body.","When Feng Kai held that body, was he calling her “Huihui” or “Qianqian”?","Qi Quan gazed softly at the woman in the photo and said gently, “Zheng Hui, it’s time to come back.”","No sooner had he spoken than the spiritual thread suddenly withdrew from the photo, pulling out an elegant and beautiful woman.","The woman glanced at Qi Quan briefly, then, under the thread’s tug, instantly returned to her body.","Chen Feilu held his breath.","The others were utterly confused.","First, they stared at Zheng Hui, then their vacant gazes shifted to the photo in the bedroom, and then back at Zheng Hui again.","Had they all gone mad?","Outside, the wind stirred the curtains, sunlight streaming in, bringing a touch of warmth to the cold-toned room.","Zheng Hui’s eyes suddenly snapped open.","The very first thing she did upon waking was to rush at Feng Kai, slapping him repeatedly — over a dozen hard slaps — until her arms gave out. Not even the police could stop her.","“Pervert! Scumbag! Die! You got rich off me, and this is how you treat me! You’re dead meat! You really are dead meat!”","System: [What a spectacular scene — even the curses sound beautiful.]","Qi Quan: ......","“Huihui!” Zheng Guangming snapped back to reality, his face lighting up with joy. “Huihui! It’s really you! You’re back?”","But the hysterical Zheng Hui suddenly froze in place.","She turned around to look at Zheng Guangming, opened her mouth, froze for a few seconds, then suddenly threw herself onto him and burst into tears.","“Brother! Brother! Feng Kai hurt me! He hurt me! I want to put him in jail!”","Zheng Guangming wiped away his tears. That was more like it! This was how Miss Zheng of the Zheng family should be—there was no way she’d pretend to be mentally ill every night.","He patted Zheng Hui’s shoulder, his tough exterior softening with affection as he said, “Alright, do whatever you want. We’ll divorce him! We’ll put him behind bars! If he dares to bully you, our whole family won’t let him off!”","Feng Kai knelt on the ground, his face swollen and red, utterly desperate.","How could things have come to this? How did it all turn out like this?","The police officers exchanged glances: as expected, this was a special case, one they couldn’t quite understand.","“Assistant Chen, what’s going on here?”","Chen Feilu looked at Qi Quan’s methods with deep admiration, his eyes shining brightly. “This is the chief consultant from the Investigation Department, Qi Quan. She just saved Ms. Zheng Hui. We’ll handle this case thoroughly. Thank you all for coming out.”","“No trouble at all,” the police waved their hands. “So, what about Mr. Feng...”","“Of course, he will be taken away by us,” Chen Feilu replied.","Li Guoyan had already explained the Investigation Department’s procedures to him. Any case involving the mystical sect—whether the suspect is a sect member or an ordinary person—must be brought to the Investigation Department for interrogation, and then sent to the special court for judgment.","Once convicted, sect criminals are sent to a special prison, while ordinary criminals go to regular prisons.","Now, they needed to escort Feng Kai to the Investigation Department.","“On what grounds are you arresting me? I don’t know anything! I know nothing!” Feng Kai shouted and raged.","Chen Feilu clicked his tongue. “You can scream all you want once you’re behind bars.”","He turned to the Zheng siblings. “The victim and witnesses need to give statements.”","“That’s right, that’s right,” Zheng Guangming nodded repeatedly.","Zheng Hui bowed deeply to Qi Quan, sincere and grateful. “Thank you for rescuing me.”","Qi Quan simply replied, “Mm.”","The Longjiang City Investigation Department was located in a standalone villa on the outskirts, with no address plate—probably a temporary office. Since cases were few and manpower limited, there was no need for a large operation yet.","Once the system was fully established, its reputation would surely rival the Taoist Master Association.","The car stopped in front of the villa.","Qi Quan closed her eyes in the back seat to rest, instructing Chen Feilu, “You take them inside.”","She didn’t get out of the car.","Chen Feilu immediately understood and respectfully asked, “What about the female ghost?”","Qi Quan pulled the ghost out, binding her with a spiritual energy chain, and handed her over to Chen Feilu.","The ghost whimpered, “I didn’t mean to, it was Feng Kai and the master who cast spells forcing me into Zheng Hui’s body.”","“...”","So, when it came time to go to the station, she wasn’t going to keep feeling sorry for Feng Kai?","Feng Kai furiously cursed at her.","Zheng Hui slapped him hard across the face, and he quieted down.","The group, along with the ghost, entered the Investigation Department. Qi Quan remained in the car, meditating quietly.","After a short while, Chen Feilu returned to the car.","He was Qi Quan’s exclusive assistant and did not participate in interrogations.","“Master, the Investigation Department colleagues said that once the case is closed, they will provide us with a detailed transcript.”","Qi Quan opened her eyes. “Why?”","“Ah?” Chen Feilu was puzzled. “You’re the chief consultant. Since this case is personally handled by you, shouldn’t it have been assigned to you in the first place?”","Qi Quan replied, “Oh.”","Chen Feilu thought to himself: The master really doesn’t like mundane affairs.","He pulled out his phone and reported, “Director Lu just sent me a video about Wei Hao’s mother. He also said that Wei Hao’s level is too high for the Longtan City Investigation Department to handle, so they’ve asked you personally to take care of it.”","The peachwood talisman was crowded; indeed, it was time to clear some space.","Qi Quan then released Wei Hao.","The malevolent spirit could freely change its form. To avoid Wei Hao taking up too much space in the car, Qi Quan shrank him down to about the length of a finger.","He hung there listlessly in midair.","Qi Quan instructed Chen Feilu, “Play the video for him.”","Destroying a high-level malevolent spirit requires a significant amount of spiritual energy. If the spirit could be persuaded to willingly dissipate, that would be even better.","Wei Hao’s tragic fate in life was truly pitiful, but after death, he had harmed many people and was doomed to never enter reincarnation.","Chen Feilu placed the phone upright in front of him and started the video.","The video was specially recorded by Lv Shengyang.","In the footage, an elderly woman with graying hair and a frail figure stood outside a shed. She stooped forward, repeatedly clasping her hands in gratitude, bowing deeply to the police officers with tears streaming down her face. “Thank you all, thank you for giving my son justice. In my next life, I will repay you by becoming an ox or a horse...”","Wei Hao burst into tears.","“Director Lu said the authorities will arrange for the elderly lady to live in a county nursing home, where she will be cared for and no longer have to survive by scavenging garbage. When her time comes, someone will perform the funeral rites for her,” Chen Feilu’s voice was hoarse.","Among everyone involved in this case, the most innocent and heart-wrenching was Old Mrs. Cao.","When the video ended, Wei Hao sobbed uncontrollably.","“I’ve failed her,” he pounded his head desperately. “I caused deaths, I betrayed her teachings.”","Qi Quan said calmly, “Being her son was your blessing.”","“Yes, it was my blessing,” Wei Hao said with a mournful smile. “Please thank Director Lu for me, and everyone who helped bring justice and cared for my mother. I must go now.”","He was reluctant to leave this mortal world, but those who do wrong must face the consequences.","His ghostly form turned into specks of gray light and completely dissipated.","Longjiang City First Hospital.","Mrs. Song had kept vigil all night. In the early hours, she finally witnessed an accident happen right before her eyes.","The fluorescent tube above the hospital bed suddenly exploded without warning, terrifying her so much she nearly fainted.","The shattered fragments of the tube struck Song Lin’s head almost entirely. If it weren’t for the bandages covering his face, he might have been seriously injured or disfigured.","Mrs. Song was truly terrified.","Accidents were like a persistent tumor, always lurking nearby. She didn’t know when another accident might strike, or if the next one would take Song Lin’s life.","Or perhaps, the lives of the entire Song family.","Old Song was already lying in the hospital bed—how much longer could she hold on?","If she also fell, what would become of the Song family?","The nurse carefully removed the fragments of the broken lamp and replaced the hospital bed with a new one.","Mrs. Song sat nearby, tears streaming down her face.","“Mom...” Song Lin struggled to open his eyes and weakly called out.","Mrs. Song hurriedly wiped away her tears. “Lin, are you feeling unwell? I’ll go find the doctor.”","“No... Mom... please ask Qi Quan... ask her to save me...” Song Lin’s voice was faint and broken.","At this point, he no longer dared to doubt the *Diary of the Wealthy Family*.","The series of accidents were no coincidence.","Earlier, when the hospital bed suddenly collapsed, he had caught a glimpse of a shadowy figure—pitch black, with deep, cold, merciless eyes, as if watching him step by step toward hell.","Song Lin wouldn’t gamble anymore.","“But... but...” Mrs. Song was moved by her son’s pleading eyes and couldn’t find the words to respond.","If her son’s life was at stake, what use was money?","But such a serious matter had to be discussed with Old Song.","She nodded firmly, “I will ask her to save you.”","Leaving the ward, Mrs. Song went to find her husband.","Chairman Song was already awake. Seeing Mrs. Song, he quickly asked, “How is our son?”","“He’s not in any immediate danger, but...”","Mrs. Song recounted all the recent accidents and the fact that she had asked a master for help. Then, with determination, she said, “Old Song, I want to save our son. No matter how much Qi Quan asks for, I’m willing to pay. Money can be earned again, but if he dies, what’s the point of money?”","Chairman Song was speechless.","He hesitated, “Did she really say we have to ‘spend the entire family fortune’?”","“She did,” Mrs. Song said, holding onto a sliver of hope. “I don’t know what exactly ‘spend the entire family fortune’ means. Maybe it’s not as extreme as it sounds.”","Chairman Song sighed deeply. He was not as optimistic as Mrs. Song.","The Song family’s foundation was built painstakingly over decades—how could they just throw it all away?","But if they didn’t, the accidents would keep coming, and in the end, the family might be destroyed.","Tears welled up in Chairman Song’s eyes.","He was a man of firm decisions; otherwise, he wouldn’t have built the family empire.","“Old Du and Old Qi advised me before, but I didn’t listen. This is probably a calamity for the Song family. If we can get through it, it will be fine. You go ask Master Qi to help, and while you’re at it, find out about her rules. Don’t offend her.”","Mrs. Song nodded. “Alright.”","She immediately left the hospital and instructed the driver to head to the lakeside villa.","Standing once again at the gate of the lakeside villa, her mindset had already shifted.","She pressed the doorbell.","Su Rong opened the door with a smile. “The master is out on business. Please come back another time.”","Mrs. Song spoke urgently, “When will the master be back? I can wait!”","Su Rong was about to respond when another car pulled up.","It was Zheng Guangming’s car.","The master had returned!","Su Rong’s smile deepened suddenly, and Mrs. Song instinctively turned around.","Under the tall tree canopy, a young and beautiful woman stepped out of the car. She wore a beige knitted cardigan, her hair loosely tied back, exuding a somewhat lazy and casual air.","Mrs. Song’s eyes lit up as she stepped forward.","“Master Qi, I apologize for my earlier rudeness—”","A thin, black thread suddenly shot out from her hair, piercing toward Qi Quan’s eye with lightning speed!","Chen Feilu and Su Rong didn’t even have time to shout.","The black thread struck the pupil.","“Pfft.”","The faint sound of something bursting reached Chen Feilu’s ears. He stared in shock at the shattered black thread, feeling both terrified and awed.","A cluster of black liquid, wrapped in spiritual energy, hovered in the air.","Chen Feilu pushed Mrs. Song aside and stood in front of Qi Quan, his tone sharp and stern: “What are you doing?!”","Mrs. Song was completely stunned.","She hadn’t seen the black thread fly out, but she clearly saw it stop right before Qi Quan’s eyeball.","“It’s not me... it’s not me! I really didn’t mean to harm Master Qi. I came to ask him for help—how could I possibly want to hurt him?!” She was so anxious that her words stumbled over each other.","Qi Quan glanced at her coldly and said lightly, “You may leave.”","“Master?” Mrs. Song’s despair turned into a desperate plea. “Master, please save us. We’ll pay any price!”","Qi Quan replied, “I’ve already told you the solution. How you choose to proceed is up to you.”","The ball of spiritual energy wrapped around the black thread fell into her palm. She turned and walked toward the villa’s front door.","Mrs. Song cried out anxiously, “But, but—”","Chen Feilu blocked her way, his face cold. “The Master has already given you a way out. What are you hesitating for?”","Mrs. Song staggered backward, tears streaming down her face.","At the lakeside villa.","Qi Quan had just sat down when Su Rong brought over a cup of tea at just the right temperature, and Xue Hong handed over neatly sliced fruit. The service was impeccable.","Having thoughtful ghost attendants really was a blessing.","Qi Quan took a sip of tea, ate a piece of melon, leaned back on the sofa, and released the black thread’s corpse.","The body was already in pieces, unrecognizable.","“Master, what is this thing?” Chen Feilu asked.","Qi Quan said, “In the world of the occult, there’s the sword path, talisman path, and formation path—these three are well-known. But beyond these, there are many lesser-known methods. The beast-taming path is one of them.”","“Last time, we tracked beetles!” Chen Feilu recalled. “Could it be that Yan Wu released bugs again this time?”","Qi Quan said with interest, “This is far more advanced than tracking beetles. It’s called the Ghost Gu—a sinister, stealthy poisonous insect. It moves incredibly fast. Those who are infected often don’t even have time to react before the insect burrows into their body.”","[Master, how did you avoid it?] the system asked in admiration.","Qi Quan: [My body is covered with a layer of protective spiritual energy. The Gu insect can’t break through my defense, so it can’t enter my body.]","The occult world is full of cunning and treacherous methods. She had encountered many in her previous life. Knowing that enemies were present, how could she have put herself in danger?","There are probably very few who can break through her protective spiritual energy.","Su Rong asked, “What harm does the Ghost Gu cause?”","“It damages the dantian and spirit platform, greatly reducing cultivation, and can even turn someone into an ordinary person,” Qi Quan said...","She ignited spiritual flames—ghostly blue fire that consumed the Gu insect’s corpse until it turned to ash.","Xue Hong’s face darkened. “The enemy has made a move. Isn’t it time for us to strike back?”","“Don’t worry, the counterattack has already begun.” Qi Quan lifted his head and looked at Chen Feilu. “Notify the Investigation Department. Arrest Yan Wu.”","Chen Feilu’s spirit jolted. “Yes!”","Inside a room somewhere in Longjiang City.","Suddenly, Yan Wu spat out a mouthful of fresh blood, his face as pale as gold paper. His eyes widened in terror, disbelief written all over his face.","How is this possible? How could this be?","The Ghost Gu was cultivated with his own essence blood over eight years before it finally matured. Although it was only level six, the power of the Ghost Gu lay in its ability to instantly break through the defenses of any Celestial Master two levels higher than itself!","Celestial Masters at level eight or below simply couldn’t withstand it!","The Gu insect was connected to his essence blood—it was almost like a half-extension of himself. So the moment the Gu insect died, he suffered a backlash and severe injuries.","He had been careless.","Qi Quan’s cultivation was far more unfathomable than he had imagined!","This isn’t good; he had to get out of here quickly!","Without a second thought, the man grabbed a swift-travel talisman and was about to leap out the window to escape Longjiang City.","Suddenly, a large net covered his head.","Having just suffered the backlash, his vital energy surged chaotically, and his spiritual power couldn’t be used effectively. Trapped in the net, he failed to break free in time.","“Bring him back,” said the newcomer cheerfully.","They had been secretly tailing him for a long time and acted immediately after receiving orders.","The authorities were not without means.","Yan Wu couldn’t see what was happening outside the net; he could only hear the voices.","“Bring him back? Where to?”","Was Qi Quan the one who ordered them to capture him and take him to the Linhu Villa?","Filled with questions, he was taken to the interrogation room of the Investigation Department.","“Where is this?” he asked.","It looked like a police station, but the chairs here could restrain spiritual power.","He couldn’t use any spiritual power at all now.","The Celestial Master Association’s Law Enforcement Department? But why would the Celestial Master Association arrest him?","“Name?”","“Yan Wu.”","“Gender?”","“...Male.”","“Age?”","“Seventy-four.”","“Cultivation level?”","“Level six.”","At this point, Yan Wu suddenly understood something.","He had vaguely heard rumors before that the government was starting to crack down on the mystic sects and was establishing Investigation Departments nationwide to handle cases of Celestial Masters breaking the law.","He had scoffed at it before.","Crackdown on the mystic sects?","The mystic sects had deep roots and flourished widely. There were countless Celestial Masters in major sects and noble families. Could they really be cracked down on just like that?","Impossible.","The talent pool alone was far inferior to the mystic sects, let alone high-level Celestial Masters.","High-level Celestial Masters lived freely and gloriously within their sects or families. How could they possibly work for the government?","Because of this, mystic sect practitioners became even more rampant.","They were utterly fearless of the authorities, never believing the government truly had the power to rein them in.","So what was going on now?","Could Qi Quan be the government’s secret trump card?","His mind was filled with questions.","“Do you know why you’re sitting here?”","Yan Wu remained silent.","“Ten years ago, you operated a ghost marriage trafficking ring in Longjiang City, harming at least five hundred innocent girls, didn’t you?”","Yan Wu: “......”","“Six years ago, you were involved in...”","Harboring a murderer, helping him eliminate the vengeful spirits of his victims, and then giving him a disciple’s talisman to help him escape legal punishment—is that right?”","Yan Wu kept his head down.","“Four years ago, you...”","“Wait.” He finally spoke, cutting off the interrogator’s question.","The interrogator waited.","Yan Wu smiled faintly and said, “You accuse me of harboring him, but aren’t you yourselves harboring and condoning?”","“What do you mean?”","“Qi Quan secretly keeps ghost servants, yet you don’t arrest her?”","The interrogator was speechless.","Yan Wu sneered, waiting for their response.","“We handle cases based on facts, not on the ‘Tianshi Regulations.’ As long as there’s no crime against heaven or humanity, we don’t interfere.”","Yan Wu was left speechless.","“Can I get a lawyer?” he asked.","The interrogator was silent.","Of course, he could get a lawyer.","Besides cultivation, practitioners of the Xuan Sect also engage in worldly practice—learning and working is a form of cultivation.","Take Ning Zhi, for example; he went to university like anyone else.","Within the Xuan Sect, there are also legal masters—Tianshi—but the Investigation Department doesn’t operate by secular law; they have their own set of rules.","“Don’t dodge the question! Yan Wu, answer me!”","Yan Wu said, “I am a Tianshi Master of the Tianshi Association. You have no authority to detain or interrogate me.”","“...”","Forget it, just hold him for a while.","Lakeside Villa.","Chen Feilu received the interrogation results on Feng Kai’s case and forwarded them to Qi Quan.","“Master, Feng Kai admitted that he asked Master Lu Shen—who’s quite well-known around their area and popular among acquaintances—to help.”","Feng Kai was an investor, so most of his contacts were from the financial world.","The more money you make, the more you drift, and the more unsettled your heart becomes.","Generally, when business grows, people tend to believe in something—except for the Song family, who were an exception.","Lu Shen was introduced to Feng Kai by others. His appearance fee was quite high. Booking him required a fifty-thousand deposit, with the final fee depending on the difficulty of the task.","Feng Kai’s request wasn’t too difficult, but not simple either. The price was five million.","Five million—that could buy him the warmth and tenderness of his first love, and Zheng Hui’s fortune.","Why not?","But what he never expected was that the spirit summoned wasn’t his first love, Zhou Qian, but an unknown female ghost.","“This Lu Shen helped with something that goes against the natural order. The Investigation Department has decided to summon him for questioning,” Chen Feilu said.","Qi Quan nodded. “Good.”","“Master, I’m heading to Longjiang City. Do you have any instructions?”","Qi Quan: “Study hard, improve every day.”","Chen Feilu couldn’t help but laugh and cry at the same time.","Longjiang City First Hospital.","“Is it still only these four words?” Chairman Song coughed lightly, wincing in pain, his face pale.","Mrs. Song said, “Yes, I guess she means we need to make a move first, to show it to... that person.”","Chairman Song nodded.","He pondered for a moment, then asked, “What’s the deal with the attack on the Master’s belongings? The Master didn’t misunderstand you, did he?”","Mrs. Song wasn’t stupid.","She had been panicked because her husband and son were injured, but now that she had calmed down, she had begun to figure things out.","“That kind of thing can only be a mystical Taoist technique. It must have been cast by that Taoist master Yan Wu. He wants to harm Master Qi...”","Chairman Song was startled. “Why?”","“That’s unclear,” she frowned, “He clearly admires Master Qi, so why would he want to harm him?”","Chairman Song understood and said, “I’m afraid the admiration is fake, but the harm is real. He’s betting that the technique is powerful and wants Master Qi to confront it head-on. You need to tell Yingxue not to trust him anymore.”","“Alright.” Mrs. Song hesitated, “When should we start liquidating the assets?”","Chairman Song’s face was bitter. “Company shares, real estate, cars, jewelry, antiques—anything that can be converted into cash, we’ll sell it all and donate the money. As for the antiques, let’s donate those to the museum.”","Overnight, the Song family collapsed.","When Qi Yingxue received this news, she was tending to a twisted ankle.","Pressing deeply on the injured spot, she bit back a cry of pain.","“Auntie, are you really planning to give away all the family wealth?” Qi Yingxue held her phone, incredulous.","The Song family’s assets were worth billions—just giving it all away?","Wouldn’t that leave the Song family penniless?","She tightened her grip on the phone, breathing rapidly. “Auntie, don’t rush. Let’s ask Qi Quan to deal with that thing first. We don’t necessarily have to liquidate everything. What about Alin? What does he say? Isn’t he still hospitalized with Uncle?”","Mrs. Song said, “I’ve already told him, and he agreed. Yingxue, nothing is more important than life. This is the only chance he has right now. As for the hospital bills, I’ll borrow the money. Once they’ve recovered, we can repay it slowly.”","Qi Yingxue was speechless.","The Song family has fallen. What should she do now?"]},{"number":40,"title":"Chapter 40","paragraphs":["Longjiang City First Hospital.","Ever since the Song family decided to disperse their wealth, miraculously, Song Lin had not suffered any further accidents.","Except for when Mrs. Song, rushing to leave the hospital to handle the family assets, tripped and fell.","The words had been spoken, and that ghostly entity had heard them. If she didn't follow through, the consequences would be unthinkable.","As soon as Mrs. Song got into the car, her first action was to notify the company and convene a meeting of the major shareholders and board members.","The Song family held nearly half of the group's shares. Converting these shares into cash would amount to an astronomical sum.","However, the other major shareholders, whose wealth was second only to the Song family, were all immensely rich themselves. Pooling their resources, they should be able to absorb the shares.","Then there were all the real estate properties, movable assets, and more—everything had to be converted into money or donated directly.","The colossal Song family empire crumbled in an instant.","Mrs. Song sorted through the family assets while weeping bitterly.","All of this had been built up by their family bit by bit through hard work; she truly couldn't bear to let it go.","But with her husband and son lying in the hospital, she had no other choice!","Meanwhile, Qi Yingxue hurried to the hospital.","Her face etched with anxiety, she asked, \"A-Lin, have you and Uncle Song really decided to give up the Song family fortune?\"","Song Lin: \"...\"","He had just started feeling a bit lighter physically, but now the heaviness returned.","It seemed that if he denied it, accidents would start happening again.","Not daring to be careless, he stated with absolute certainty, \"Yes, we plan to donate all that money—to hope primary schools, orphanages, and so on. The rest will be handed over to the authorities for disposal.\"","\"But how will you live afterwards?\" Qi Yingxue blinked, her voice full of concern. \"You and Uncle are still in the hospital. If you give all the money away, how will you pay the hospital fees? Will Aunt Song have to support everything alone outside?\"","Thinking she was worried, Song Lin smiled gently and said, \"Yingxue, if we don't give it up now, my parents and I might lose our lives. Money gone is gone; we can earn it again later. Do you believe in me?\"","\"Of course I believe in you!\" Qi Yingxue nodded.","Song Lin looked at her sincerely. \"Originally, our wedding was set for next spring. But now our family has nothing. Marrying me would be a hardship for you, Yingxue. Can you wait for me?\"","He didn't mention breaking up. He believed that with his abilities, he could make a comeback in the future.","A flicker of hesitation passed through Qi Yingxue's eyes, but on the surface, she smiled tenderly. \"Of course. We're still young. Once you're better, we'll work hard together!\"","\"Thank you,\" Song Lin said hoarsely.","Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan was sitting at her desk typing when suddenly, a strange, captivating fragrance slipped through the door crack, wafted to her nose, and completely destroyed her motivation to write.","What was that amazing smell? Was Steward Su cooking something delicious again?","But this aroma was different from Steward Su's usual culinary skills. Had Steward Su leveled up again?","Unable to resist, she abandoned her keyboard and followed the scent to the kitchen.","In the kitchen, a tall, slender young man stood with his back to her, holding a long-handled soup ladle and stirring a pot slowly.","\"Ling Sheng?\" she exclaimed, extremely surprised.","Hearing her voice, Ling Sheng turned around, his eyes bright as morning stars.","He took a bowl from the cupboard, ladled in some soup, placed a ceramic spoon inside, and handed it to Qi Quan.","System: [Ling Sheng is learning to cook now?!]","Although it couldn't smell the aroma, just the appearance was incredibly enticing.","Silver ear fungus, osmanthus, and lotus seed soup—crystal clear and utterly appetizing.","Qi Quan took the bowl, took a small sip, and her eyes instantly lit up.","How was this possible?","It wasn't that she had never eaten lotus seed soup before, but for some reason, this bowl was completely different from any previous one. It was as if all the impurities in the soup had been removed, and the pure sweetness and fragrance of the silver ear fungus, osmanthus, and lotus seeds had been brought to their absolute peak.","A master's senses differed from those of ordinary people. A regular person might only marvel at the deliciousness of this lotus seed soup, but she keenly detected the spiritual energy contained within it.","Lotus seed soup stripped of impurities, pure and flawless, imbued with spiritual energy—how could it not captivate one's heart and mind?","Who could have imagined that a Natural Spirit Body possessed such a skill!","Qi Quan couldn't help herself; she finished the bowl in a few spoonfuls and then handed the empty bowl back to the young man.","Ling Sheng's eyes curved into happy crescents as he took the bowl.","Just as he was serving her another portion, Su Rong and Xue Hong also arrived, drawn by the fragrance.","\"So fragrant,\" Xue Hong said, gazing at the pot of soup with burning eyes. \"May I try some?\"","Ling Sheng nodded but didn't reach out to serve her.","Xue Hong didn't mind. She ladled herself a large bowl. After one bite, her pale, ghostly face seemed to flush with a rosy hue.","She clearly felt a strange power generating within her ghostly form, making her soul more solid and substantial.","It actually had a boosting effect!","She eagerly shared, \"Steward Su, you have to try this!\"","Su Rong was both amused and exasperated.","The kitchen was originally his exclusive domain. But ever since the Master went on a business trip to Longtan City last time, Ling Sheng had started tinkering in the kitchen every now and then, accompanied by the sounds of cooking videos playing.","He had initially thought Ling Sheng was just having a fleeting interest, casually playing around. He never expected him to actually succeed in creating something.","Su Rong, being a skilled cook himself, naturally also loved fine food.","He served himself a bowl. The clear and sweet lotus seed soup touched his taste buds, causing them to bloom. A peculiar sensation enveloped his ghostly body. To his astonishment, he discovered his ghostly power had actually increased.","This...","This was far more than just a bowl of delicious soup!","He looked at Ling Sheng in confusion.","To be honest, he still didn't understand exactly what Ling Sheng was.","Last time when the villa was attacked, it was Ling Sheng who protected the formation and repelled the intruders. That alone proved Ling Sheng was also part of the Mystical Arts world.","But the Master had never mentioned Ling Sheng's master level.","Was he even a master?","After finishing her second bowl, Qi Quan inwardly marveled. Who would have thought that rescuing someone on a whim would net her the ultimate support character.","A Natural Spirit Body was truly extraordinary and divine.","She asked, \"Does making this waste a lot of spiritual energy?\"","Ling Sheng shook his head.","\"In the future, when there are outsiders present, don't make it,\" Qi Quan instructed the other two ghosts. \"This matter is only for the four of us to know.\"","Su Rong and Xue Hong naturally agreed.","If such a great treasure were known to the masters and supernatural beings outside, peace at Lakeside Villa would be a thing of the past.","System: [And me! And me!]","Qi Quan said gravely: [Yes, you must also keep it secret.]","System: [...]","It was just joining in the fun. The big shot was being a bit too serious.","The entire pot of lotus seed soup was devoured by Qi Quan and her two ghost attendants. Ling Sheng sat quietly to the side, carving jade tokens.","He seemed to have developed a fondness for this activity, carving a few pieces every day, infusing them with spiritual power, and then handing them to Qi Quan for safekeeping.","Qi Quan also noticed that Ling Sheng's control over spiritual energy was becoming increasingly proficient. For the same type of jade token, the ones carved later stored denser spiritual energy—a clear result of compressing the energy.","After drinking the soup, feeling refreshed and invigorated, with the spiritual energy within her body circulating more smoothly, the human and the two ghosts all returned to their rooms. Seizing the moment before the boosting effect faded, they dedicated themselves to serious cultivation.","At dusk, Qi Quan exhaled a turbid breath and slowly opened her eyes. A faint golden light shimmered deep within them.","Her realm seemed on the verge of a breakthrough.","Pleasantly, she stood up and walked to the floor-to-ceiling window, watching as the setting sun slowly sank below the horizon, its afterglow fading away.","It was time to eat again.","Su Rong laid out a lavish dinner.","He had broken through to the third level during his afternoon cultivation session and was in high spirits. His culinary skills seemed to have improved yet again, and both humans and ghosts ate their fill with great enjoyment.","Xue Hong patted her stomach and sighed, \"What kind of life was I living before?\"","Now, she was simply too happy.","Qi Quan's eyes curved into crescents; she loved seeing her ghost attendants so joyful.","\"Master, the feng shui of our home is excellent, and the spiritual energy is abundant. I was thinking, should we plant some fruit trees? The fruits might taste even better than those on the market,\" Steward Su proposed with a smile.","Qi Quan didn't need to think: \"Do as you suggest.\"","She paused, then added, \"However, things are quite chaotic outside right now. The three of you should not go out for the time being. Hire someone to handle it.\"","Xue Hong asked, \"How is it chaotic?\"","\"The authorities are cracking down on Taoist masters. Many who have broken the law are on a blacklist. There might be turmoil for a while,\" Qi Quan explained.","When the authorities finally moved, they struck with a heavy fist.","Their previous restraint was merely to accumulate strength and gather evidence. Once the time was ripe, they acted swift as lightning.","Those Taoist masters who helped others commit evil deeds were likely being arrested, fleeing, hiding, or desperately seeking help.","Investigation departments across the regions would probably soon face a severe shortage of personnel.","She was right.","In Longjiang City, the number of personnel at the Investigation Department was disproportionate to the caseload.","The person in charge was nearly tearing his hair out.","\"Director, Yan Wu still hasn't confessed.\"","\"Director, Lu Shen has been captured, but he claims he is the nephew of a certain Elder Lu from the Guiyuan Sect and that we have no right to convict him.\"","\"Director, the Yan family in Longjing also called, saying that if Yan Wu has done wrong, he should be dealt with by the family.\"","\"Director, another Taoist master has broken the law in the East City.\"","\"Director, we are truly short-handed!\"","\"Director...\"","Meng Yunzheng massaged his temples, utterly exhausted, and asked, \"Headquarters said they would transfer personnel from other regions. Have they arrived?\"","\"Not yet...\"","\"Director!\" A young investigator suddenly rushed in, his face lit up with excitement. \"New recruits are here!\"","\"Excellent!\" Meng Yunzheng waved his hand. \"Aren't we short-handed? Put them to work immediately!\"","The phone rang suddenly.","Meng Yunzheng picked it up casually, but after listening for a few moments, his expression gradually turned grave.","\"Yes, we will definitely complete the task!\"","After hanging up, he sighed softly.","\"Director, what's wrong?\"","Meng Yunzheng said, \"Everyone knows about the situation with the land in the northern suburbs, right?\"","\"Yes,\" the investigator replied. \"We previously monitored the concentration and fluctuations of Yin energy there. The data indicates the entity there is at least Level Six. We currently have no way to deal with it.\"","With urban development, land had become increasingly precious. The fact that the plot in the northern suburbs remained unused was a great regret for Longjiang City.","Meng Yunzheng nodded. \"Now, with the Song family incident, the higher-ups believe dealing with the northern suburbs matter is urgent.\"","\"Why?\" the investigator asked, puzzled.","Since it had been left untouched for so many years, waiting a bit longer shouldn't be an issue.","\"Someone from the Mystic Arts community has proposed a trade. They will help us deal with the malevolent ghost in the northern suburbs, and we release the detainees,\" Meng Yunzheng said, frowning. \"But the authorities don't want us to be controlled by others again. They've ordered us to resolve this matter as soon as possible...\"","The investigator looked indignant. \"They are Taoist masters! Protecting ordinary people and catching ghosts is their duty! To be so... so...\"","He couldn't find the right words.","\"Enough. Follow orders,\" Meng Yunzheng said sternly.","The investigator protested, \"But that's at least a Level Six Red Ghost!\"","The highest level in their Investigation Department was only Level Four. They couldn't even touch the hem of a Red Ghost's garment.","Meng Yunzheng: \"I will handle this matter. You take the new members and familiarize them with the work.\"","\"Yes!\"","At ten o'clock at night, readers of \"Diary of a Wealthy Family\" saw the update and excitedly clicked in.","[Knowledge changes fate. This saying truly does not deceive.","I worked hard to acquire knowledge, and knowledge has rewarded me.","Now that I am well-fed, well-clothed, and free from worldly worries, I wish to do something to give back to society.","After the age of five, I grew up in an orphanage. The orphanage gave me shelter from the wind and rain, allowed me to study and learn, and granted me a new life.","I have always wanted to repay that kindness.","Now that I have earned money, I want to donate a portion to help more homeless children, giving them a bright future.","After inquiring with an acquaintance, I decided to consult a lady known for her charitable work.","Let's call her the Charitable Lady.","After setting a time, I paid a personal visit.","Her husband opened the door. He looked scholarly, wearing gold-rimmed glasses, and gave me a polite, well-mannered smile.","After studying Mystic Arts, I've developed a habit of reading people's faces. I was startled.","My acquaintance had told me that the Charitable Lady and her husband had been together since their first love, deeply affectionate and very much in love.","But this gentleman's facial features indicated he had experienced one passionate, earth-shattering romance.","Was I mistaken?","Entering with doubts in my heart, the Charitable Lady's husband was a gracious host. He personally brewed tea for me and kept me company.","I asked, puzzled, \"Where is the Charitable Lady?\"","He said, \"In the room. I'll go call her.\"","I was full of surprise. I had clearly contacted the Charitable Lady herself, so why was she avoiding me?","Only when she walked out of the room and forced an extremely stiff smile at me did I suddenly feel a chill, as if my head had been struck by something, leaving me stunned and blank.","This was no Charitable Lady!","It was clearly a malevolent ghost that had seized a human body!","Instinctively, I shot out a talisman.","The talisman successfully yanked the ghost out of the Charitable Lady's body. The lady collapsed on the sofa, unconscious.","Just as I was about to subdue the ghost, the Charitable Lady's husband called the police. He wanted to falsely accuse me of harming his wife.","Hah, foolish man.","I walked into their bedroom and stood before a photograph.","It was the Charitable Lady's solo wedding photo, positioned directly opposite the double bed.","Her soul was trapped within that small frame, forced to watch day and night as her husband and the strange female ghost occupying her body were intimate.","No one could understand her pain and despair.","Using the knowledge I had learned, I shattered the confinement and freed her from her cage, allowing her to return to her own body.","The moment the Charitable Lady opened her eyes, she fiercely slapped her husband dozens of times!","It turned out, it was all her husband's scheme!","This gentleman came from an ordinary background. With the support of his wife's family, he climbed the social ladder to become successful, but he couldn't bear his wife's overly strong personality.","By chance, he met a master.","He asked the master to change his wife for him.","He wanted the soul of his long-deceased first love to merge with the Charitable Lady's body. That way, he could have the best of both worlds.","But he never imagined that his first love had already reincarnated. The female ghost the master found for him was not his first love at all.","I was disgusted.","I also don't understand why some masters would aid and abet such evil.","I returned home feeling gloomy.","Unexpectedly, we had a visitor. She carried a faint trace of black energy on her, but her own fortune was extraordinary, so the black energy couldn't harm her for now.","There was also an acquaintance with her, the mother of the Peach Blossom Mark's first client.","They were very polite, asking if I could intervene to save someone.","I hesitated.","It wasn't that I didn't want to save them, but that I couldn't.","The dark energy in the northern suburbs isn't something that can be easily resolved. Since it has claimed that land, you must \"let the one who tied the bell be the one to untie it.\"","I pointed out a path for her: \"Dissipate all your family wealth.\"","Whether she understood or not, she left in a daze.","The mother of the first client seemed somewhat embarrassed. After all, she was the one who brought the person here, yet a perfect solution wasn't achieved.","But how many things in this world are truly perfect?","Just as she was also turning to leave, I suddenly called out to her.","She turned back.","A few faint wisps of dark energy floated over her glabella.","End of new chapter.","[If you see me, tell me to go prepare lessons: Damn! This social-climbing man still wants to enjoy the blessings of two wives? Get lost! I really felt the despair of that kind-hearted lady trapped in the photo, it's so unsettling just thinking about it. Thankfully, the Master saved her! The person with dark energy at the end of the chapter should hurry and seek the Master's help!]","[Today is Auspicious: Peach Blossom Mark's first client... holy crap???]","[Today is Favorable: Patting the person above.]","[Auspicious and Favorable: Hang in there, brother.]","[Lose Twenty Pounds in Three Months: Great read, throwing flowers.]","[Scumbags and Fools, Get Lost: What kind of freakshow of a major scumbag is this! He genuinely disgusts me. Did Nuwa forget to fill in your brain when she was mending the sky? Get the hell out!]","[Wanting Male Virtue Stories: Sigh, that's just how reality is. Get promoted, get rich, and the wife dies. Why is 'the wife dies' equated with the first two? Because in the eyes of certain scumbags, it's a heavenly joyous event!]","[Malan Flowers Bloom Thirty-One: First client's mother, go find the Master quickly!]","[Qiankun Great Shift: Holy crap, waiting for the update!]","The Zheng Family in Longtan City.","After her experience of being possessed by a ghost, Zheng Hui followed Zheng Guangming back to their hometown.","Comforted by her family, the despair and chill in her heart had completely dissipated.","After reading the latest chapter of \"Diary of a Wealthy Family,\" filled with deep gratitude towards Qi Quan, she fiercely threw a thousand deep-water torpedoes.","\"Brother, did you tell the Master that I'm involved in charity?\" Zheng Hui asked, holding her phone.","Zheng Guangming shook his head, \"No, I didn't.\"","\"Then how did she know?\" Zheng Hui pointed out the content in the story, \"This is definitely talking about me.\"","Zheng Guangming scratched his head and guessed, \"The Master is, after all, a Master. It's normal for her to know.\"","\"Alright.\" Convinced by him, she added excitedly, \"Do you think the Master specifically mentioned in the story about consulting me as a hint? Is she implying she wants me to help manage her charity work?!\"","\"...That's possible.\"","...","Zheng Hui said joyfully, \"Then I'll return to Longjiang City tomorrow and go ask at the Lakeside Villa.\"","Lakeside Villa.","The system had the same question: [Master, how did you know Zheng Hui is involved in charity work?]","Qi Quan: [Saw it on a magazine cover.]","[Alright.] The system then asked, [And the 'first client's mother' you mentioned at the end of the chapter, does that refer to Mrs. Zhang?]","The one who accompanied Mrs. Song that day was Mrs. Zhang.","[Yes.]","[What's wrong with her?]","Qi Quan: [It's not her. It's someone related to her.]","The Zhang Residence.","Zhang Chengyan knocked on the master bedroom door, phone in hand.","\"Mom, are you asleep? Did you read the Master's new chapter?\"","The door quickly opened.","Father Zhang said with a grave expression, \"Your mom is hiding under the covers, too scared to move.\"","Zhang Chengyan: \"...\"","He walked in, looked at the trembling quilt mound, and felt both amused and exasperated: \"Mom, don't worry. The Master's wording is always precise. Since she said it's 'faint,' it definitely can't be serious. Don't scare yourself. First thing tomorrow morning, we'll go to the Lakeside Villa and beg the Master to intervene.\"","\"Stay away from me!\" She poked her head out to take a breath of fresh air, then quickly ducked back under, \"Don't get tainted by my dark energy.\"","Zhang Chengyan: \"...\"","\"Ever since you got that Peach Blossom Mark, I've been doing charity work non-stop, accumulating blessings for our family. How could something happen again? I don't understand!\"","Zhang Chengyan's eyes shifted, \"Mom, maybe it's because you've been in contact with Aunt Song for a long time, and you picked up a little.\"","\"Probably not,\" she said gloomily from under the covers, \"If that were the case, the Master wouldn't have needed to point it out.\"","\"True.\"","Father Zhang and son looked at each other, not knowing how to comfort Mrs. Zhang.","The phone on the nightstand rang abruptly.","No movement from the quilt mound.","Zhang Chengyan: \"Mom, it's your phone. Uncle is calling.\"","A hand shot out from under the covers, deftly grabbed the phone, adjusted her tone, and asked, \"Ah Qi, what's the matter?\"","Mrs. Zhang's maiden name is Wei, Wei Suhe. She has a younger brother named Wei Qi.","\"Sis, if you have time, come to Longlin. Xiao Qian... he might not make it.\" Wei Qi's voice was choked with tears.","Wei Suhe shot out from under the covers, sitting bolt upright, her face full of worry: \"What happened to Xiao Qian? What on earth happened? Tell me clearly!\"","\"I don't know.\" Wei Qi sobbed, \"He suddenly collapsed unconscious during a P.E. class at school. The hospital couldn't find anything wrong, but he just won't wake up.\"","Wei Suhe: \"He's been hexed!\"","Wei Qi: \"...\"","Somewhat resentfully, he said, \"Sis, what kind of joke is this at a time like this?\"","\"Ah Qi!\" Wei Suhe couldn't explain, she just said, \"Believe me, go find a Master to take a look.\"","Wei Qi: \"...\"","He silently hung up the phone.","Wei Suhe: ???","She froze for a moment, then suddenly realized: \"I know! It's not me who's in trouble, it's Xiao Qian! No, I need to go to Longlin City tomorrow. Old Zhang, help me pack.\"","\"Mom, I'll go with you,\" Zhang Chengyan said while simultaneously throwing deep-water torpedoes at \"Diary of a Wealthy Family.\"","\"Fine,\" Wei Suhe agreed readily.","In the \"Guardian Master Squad\" group chat.","[Du Jiaming: @Zhang Chengyan, remember to find the Master.]","[Yang Su: @Zhang Chengyan, remember to find the Master.]","[Qian Kun: @Zhang Chengyan, remember to find the Master.]","[Zhang Chengyan: It's not my mom, it's my cousin. Need to go to Longlin City tomorrow.]","[Su Rong: The house needs some fruit trees planted. Not sure if there are any purchasing channels...?]","[Du Jiaming: Butler Su! What fruit does the Master like? I can get anything, and I can even bring people to plant them!]","[Yang Su: Tomorrow! I'll buy them and come over tomorrow!]","[Qian Kun: And me too! I want to go plant fruit trees for the Master, so when she eats the fruit later, she'll think of me!]","[Zhang Chengyan: ...]","He wanted to go too!","The next morning, just after Qi Quan finished breakfast, three groups of people arrived in the yard.","Multiple trucks were parked outside the villa, all loaded with various kinds of fruit trees.","Du Jiaming: \"Master, they are all professionals at planting fruit trees. We'll be quick and won't disturb you for too long!\"","Yang Su: \"Master, I specifically bought fruit trees you like. You can leave this to me with complete confidence!\"","Qian Kun: \"Master, I guarantee you'll be able to eat the fruit next year!\"","Qi Quan: ...","Well, that was sudden.","She left them in Butler Su's care and returned to her room to cultivate.","When Meng Yunzheng arrived at the lakeside villa, he was startled by a long line of trucks.","Who was going to such great lengths?","He muttered to himself, carefully avoiding the trucks and parking at the villa's entrance.","Huh? So it was this Consultant Qi who wanted to plant trees.","He walked to the courtyard gate and was about to press the doorbell when a handsome man approached, calmly directing people in and out of the yard.","Meng Yunzheng's eyelids twitched.","As a fourth-level Celestial Master, he could tell this handsome man was a ghost, a ghost servant.","It seemed the information was correct. This eccentric Consultant Qi did indeed keep ghost servants.","However, the Investigation Headquarters had analyzed that Qi Quan acted with principle and restraint, had a bottom line, did not collude with evil cultivators, and possessed profound cultivation. There was a high probability she was proficient in both talisman and array techniques, making her a Celestial Master of exceptional talent.","But she disliked constraints and was reluctant to be overly restricted, so the higher-ups' attitude was primarily one of courting her; saying 'recruitment' might be a bit presumptuous.","Fortunately, this Celestial Master Qi had accepted the Headquarters' appointment and was now a consultant for the Headquarters.","If they could persuade her to take action this time, the possibility of resolving the situation with the vengeful ghost in the northern suburbs would greatly increase.","He spoke politely, \"Hello, Mr. Su. My name is Meng Yunzheng. I'm the head of the Longjiang City Investigation Department. I've come specifically to visit Senior Qi.\"","Su Rong turned and looked at him through the protective array, saying, \"Please show your credentials.\"","Meng Yunzheng took out his ID.","Every credential from the Investigation Department was intimately linked to its holder and could not be counterfeited by others.","Su Rong nodded. \"Please come in.\"","Having been granted access, Meng Yunzheng passed through the array and followed him into the living room.","\"Please wait a moment.\" Su Rong left the living room to report to Qi Quan.","Meng Yunzheng waited alone, distinctly feeling the exceptionally rich spiritual energy within the villa. Every pore in his body seemed to open up.","Could it be that the senior had set up a Spirit Gathering Array in her home?","A moment later, a tall figure appeared outside the door.","She wore a black maxi dress with a plain-colored cardigan over it. The dress reached her ankles, faintly revealing slender, pale ankles. She wore slippers on her feet, her attire quite casual.","He quickly stood up and bowed.","\"Senior Qi, I am Meng Yunzheng, a junior and the head of the Longjiang City Investigation Department. I come uninvited today because there is a matter requiring your assistance.\"","His manner was humble, without a trace of official arrogance.","Qi Quan sat down and said calmly, \"Director Meng, are you referring to the Red Ghost in the northern suburbs?\"","\"Yes.\" Meng Yunzheng's face showed anticipation. \"It's embarrassing to say, but I, as the head, am only at the fourth level. The investigators in our department are still inexperienced. In all of Longjiang, besides you, I'm afraid no one can subdue that... Red Ghost.\"","Qi Quan asked, \"How do you plan to handle it?\"","\"Naturally, subdue it and purify the dark energy in the northern suburbs.\"","Qi Quan gave him a faint glance.","Though not severe, Meng Yunzheng still felt a wave of pressure.","He steeled himself and asked, \"Senior, is there something inappropriate about that?\"","\"Have you read the relevant materials on the northern suburbs?\" Qi Quan inquired.","Meng Yunzheng nodded. \"I have.\"","\"A sixth-level Red Ghost has very deep obsessions. If its obsessions can be resolved, the chances of success will be much greater. If not, forcing a confrontation offers no benefit.\"","Meng Yunzheng said, \"When you had the Song family disperse their wealth, were you trying to resolve its obsessions?\"","Qi Quan nodded. \"The Song family was merely collateral damage. It cannot truly resolve the Red Ghost's obsessions. Only by finding the root cause can the northern suburbs see the light of day again.\"","\"Thank you for the guidance, Senior. I will return and investigate carefully.\"","The events from years ago were already very vague, and the records were incomplete. The Investigation Department did not know how the Red Ghost came to be.","But since Qi Quan had pointed this way, he could only follow this direction in his investigation.","Meng Yunzheng took his leave and departed.","The system asked Qi Quan: [Big shot, do you know what happened back then?]","Qi Quan: [No.]","The system: [Huh?]","[I took a look on the way to Lingxu Temple. The dark energy is indeed heavy, but there's one thing I didn't mention.]","[What?]","Qi Quan smiled: [There's a golden light shimmering within the dark energy.]","[Huh? What does that mean?] The system was baffled. Just when it thought it had learned a lot about metaphysics, the big shot would prove it wrong.","[It means this ghost has accumulated merit.]","[...]","The system asked, puzzled: [But isn't it a Red Ghost?]","[Xue Hong was also a Red Ghost.]","[That's true.]","But—","[It caused Song Lin to have constant accidents, didn't it harm people?]","[If someone dances on your grave, are you not allowed to fight back?]","The system: [...Alright then.]","Due to the collapse of the Song family, Longjiang City's business world was in turmoil.","Those in the know felt pity, but they couldn't help but admire the decisiveness of the Song family.","Not everyone could give up such a vast commercial empire.","The Song family sold off all their assets, truly becoming penniless.","Miraculously, not only did Song Lin stop having accidents, but the speed of his physical recovery was astonishingly fast.","The attending physician looked astonished. \"The cellular activity in your body is many times stronger than an average person's!\"","Song Lin: ...","Mr. Song's injuries were lighter than his and he could already get out of bed and walk.","Such a supernatural occurrence forced the Song family to believe completely.","Mrs. Song said, \"I borrowed some money from a friend and rented a place outside. Once you're both recovered, our family will find jobs together. We're not afraid of not being able to support ourselves.\"","With their wealth completely gone, she had become more open-minded.","Things couldn't get worse than this.","Song Lin's eyes reddened slightly. \"Mom, you've worked hard. It was my stubbornness and refusal to listen to advice. If I had sensed something was wrong when they withdrew from the competition, if I had believed in 'The Diary of a Tycoon,' our family wouldn't have ended up like this.\"","\"Out with the old, in with the new.\" Mrs. Song smiled. \"Right now, I just hope you can be safe and sound.\"","In just a few days, wrinkles had already appeared on her once well-maintained face.","Mr. Song looked at her with heartache and patted her hand. \"In the future, the two of us men will work. You rest at home.\"","\"No need. After all, I graduated from university back in the day.\" Mrs. Song said proudly. \"I'll feel more at ease once we pay back the borrowed money sooner.\"","...","Mr. Song smiled.","Mrs. Song suddenly said, \"However, when I donated all our assets before, I forgot to set aside something to thank the Master. Suhe and the others told me we should follow the Master's rules and give a tip for the article.\"","\"How much money do we have left now?\" Song Lin asked.","Mrs. Song: \"Only fifty thousand.\"","She didn't dare borrow more, afraid that 'that thing' wouldn't be satisfied.","Song Lin: \"I'll ask some friends to borrow a bit more.\"","Lakeside Villa.","Du Jiaming had just finished directing the workers planting the fruit trees when a message popped up on his phone.","[Song Lin: Can you lend me some money?]","Well, well! The lofty Song Lin was actually asking to borrow money!","He was about to screenshot it and send it to Yang Su when Yang Su leaned over mysteriously and said, \"Do you know what message I just got?\"","Du Jiaming waved his phone. \"You're not going to say it's this, are you?\"","\"He asked you too?!\" Yang Su exclaimed in surprise. \"I thought he would never ask to borrow money.\"","Just then, Zhang Chengyan sent a screenshot.","Song Lin had asked all three of them!","To be honest, even though the Song family was gone, they didn't look down on Song Lin because of it. Song Lin's abilities were obvious to all. Given the opportunity, he would surely soar again.","They just never expected Song Lin to ask for a loan.","\"So, are you going to lend it or not?\" Yang Su asked.","Du Jiaming said, \"Lend it, why not? Think about it, he's pretty pitiful, getting caught up in this mess.\"","\"Just unlucky, I'd say.\" Yang Su then asked, \"How much are you planning to lend?\"","\"Depends on how much he needs.\"","Du Jiaming replied to Song Lin: 【How much do you need?】","Yang Su replied at the same time.","【Song Lin: One hundred thousand.】","A hundred thousand is nothing!","Du Jiaming and Yang Su immediately transferred the money.","\"Actually, with the Qi family's support, Song Lin will probably bounce back quickly,\" Yang Su remarked with a sigh.","Du Jiaming chuckled, \"He won't ask the Qi family for help. His pride won't allow it.\"","\"True.\"","Du Jiaming put his phone in his pocket. \"The trees are planted, we should head back.\"","\"A shame, we didn't get another chance to see the Master,\" Yang Su lamented.","\"Mr. Du, Mr. Yang, you've worked hard. The Master invites you to the living room for some tea and rest,\" Su Rong appeared at the right moment to say.","\"Great!\"","The two entered the living room, where Qian Kun was already sitting on the sofa drinking tea.","\"Brother Du, Brother Yang, come quick, this tea is really amazing!\"","Du Jiaming and Yang Su: \"...\"","Well, yes, but your flattery is a bit too blunt.","What kind of expensive tea haven't they tasted before?","The tea here at the Master's place is top-notch, sure, but the flavor should be about the same as the ones they have at home, not something to praise as if it were divine nectar, right?","The two took a sip.","!!!","They took another sip.","They couldn't help but exchange a glance, then poured the entire cup into their mouths like oxen chewing peonies, gulping it down.","They immediately felt the fatigue in their bodies swept away, replaced by a strange sense of lightness.","Du Jiaming eagerly asked, \"Butler Su, what kind of supreme tea is this? Where can I buy it?\"","His family's old man loves fine tea. If he could bring back tea like this, the old man would definitely be overjoyed.","Yang Su also looked at Su Rong with hopeful eyes.","\"Don't bother asking,\" Qian Kun waved his hand. \"I already did. It's not for sale.\"","Their faces fell instantly.","Su Rong smiled.","Ever since Ling Sheng figured out a new way to use spiritual energy and saw that the Master liked it, he had filtered all the food and drink in the house.","Naturally, these things couldn't be sold.","...","If people outside found out, who knows what a huge commotion it would cause.","The Master had instructed that since these three had delivered and planted the fruit trees and certainly wouldn't accept payment, they should be offered a cup of spiritual energy-infused tea as a token of gratitude.","This cup of tea was beneficial for cultivators and ghosts, let alone ordinary people.","The reason they felt so refreshed after drinking it was because the spiritual energy nourished their bodies and dispelled their fatigue.","In the bedroom.","The system reported to Qi Quan: 【Big shot, a new reader 'Lin Yuan Xian Yu' just gifted you three thousand deep-water torpedoes.】","Qi Quan: 【Hmm.】","The system was puzzled: 【Which client of yours is this?】","Usually, only big clients were this generous.","Qi Quan: 【Probably Song Lin.】","【Ah? He still has money for gifts?】 The system had almost given up on the Song family being able to afford divination fees anymore.","Qi Quan: 【Borrowed.】","【Big shot, will the Song family be able to make big money again in the future?】","【Don't know.】","She wasn't interested in other people's lives.","In the afternoon, the lakeside villa received another visitor: Zheng Hui.","Her body hadn't fully recovered yet, her face was somewhat pale, but her spirits were high.","\"Master, thank you for saving me that day.\" Zheng Hui bowed deeply. \"There was so much going on that day, I was very emotional and didn't get a chance to thank you properly.\"","Qi Quan got straight to the point: \"Do you still plan to continue your charity work?\"","\"Yes!\"","Qi Quan nodded. \"I'd like to ask you to help me set up a charitable foundation, dedicated specifically to philanthropic causes.\"","Zheng Hui: \"Does the Master have any specific directions in mind?\"","There were many types of charity projects.","Qi Quan thought for a moment and said, \"Orphanages, rescue for trafficked children and women, aid for out-of-school children. Those for now.\"","In her previous life, she had more money than she could spend, and the amount she poured into charity was countless. In this life, now that she had earned enough to secure her living and cultivation, it was better to help more people.","Zheng Hui: \"No problem!\"","Both parties signed a contract, with Zheng Hui managing the charitable foundation on her behalf and reporting to her regularly.","After Zheng Hui left, Qi Quan lazily leaned back on the sofa, holding a teacup, inhaling the subtle fragrance of the tea, feeling content and at ease.","【Big shot, you haven't written today's update yet.】","Qi Quan felt a headache coming on: 【No inspiration, can't write.】","The system: 【Actually, novels can be fabricated. You don't necessarily have to write a real diary.】","【Sorry, no imagination.】","【...】","The system offered a suggestion: 【Then what about the things you encountered in your previous life? Could you write about those?】","Qi Quan fell silent for a moment.","Why hadn't she thought of that?","Longlin City.","Zhang Chengyan and Wei Suhe rushed to the hospital and saw their cousin, Wei Qian.","Wei Qian was only eighteen this year, just started university. He was handsome and athletic, with a very cheerful personality. It was said he was the school heartthrob in high school.","His grades weren't top-notch; he only got into the local Longlin University and had been enrolled for less than a month.","Who would have thought that the lively young man from before would now be lying unconscious in a hospital bed?","Wei Suhe asked with heartache, \"Have you found a master?\"","Wei Qi: \"...\"","He pinched the bridge of his nose and asked, \"Sis, you really weren't joking last night?\"","\"No.\" Wei Suhe was very serious.","Wei Qi certainly understood his sister wouldn't joke about something like this, but he really couldn't bring himself to accept this bizarre suggestion right away.","\"No matter what, we have to try every possible method,\" Wei Suhe urged.","Wei Qi thought about it; that made sense.","\"Alright, I'll go ask around!\"","He ran out of the ward to make a call.","Zhang Chengyan watched his retreating back, feeling like he had forgotten something.","What was it?","A moment later, Wei Qi returned with a look of disbelief, frowning at the mother and son. \"I found a master, but...\"","\"But what?\" Wei Suhe quickly asked.","Wei Qi hesitated: \"A master... is it really that easy to find one? Could it be a scam?\"","He even felt like he was dreaming.","Before seeking out a master, he thought his friends were like him—not believers in this sort of thing. So before making the call, he had braced himself for mockery and ridicule.","Who knew that as soon as he brought it up, a friend enthusiastically recommended a master to him and even sent over a WeChat contact.","Utterly bewildering.","Zhang Chengyan said, \"What's the master's name? I can ask around.\"","He could use his connection with Chen Feilu to check if this master was a legitimate Taoist priest.","Wei Qi said, \"His name is Wei Huanyang. He's young, but they say he's quite skilled.\"","Zhang Chengyan: !!!","Wasn't that the idiot who leaked a girl's address on Weibo?","No wonder he felt he'd forgotten something.","The Hengfeng Sect was right here in Longlin City!"]},{"number":41,"title":"Chapter 41","paragraphs":["Back at the Longlin City Investigation Bureau, Wei Huanyang had been publicly defeated by Ning Zhi, a humiliation that had festered in his heart ever since.","He had believed that in two years' time, he would surely surpass Ning Zhi. Who could have predicted he would lose to him again?","What was even more infuriating was that Ning Zhi had actually achieved a breakthrough during their duel!","Such a disgraceful matter was not something he wished to publicize. Hiding away in his residence for some peace and quiet was his only recourse.","A young apprentice stood outside the door to report.","\"Master, a client has referred a new case. Will you take it?\"","Wei Huanyang thought to himself: If he couldn't handle Ning Zhi, could he not handle mere ghosts?","\"I'll go.\"","At the hospital, Wei Qi received the news and promptly sent a car to fetch him.","\"Uncle, are you really set on finding Wei Huanyang?\" Zhang Chengyan frowned. \"Aren't there any other Taoist masters?\"","Wei Qi said, \"I asked around. Everyone says this Master Wei is exceptionally skilled. Why? Is there a problem?\"","Zhang Chengyan shook his head. \"No.\"","Forget it. This Wei Huanyang was currently the only lifeline his uncle could grasp. He'd better not pour cold water on the idea just yet.","Besides, no matter how questionable Wei Huanyang's character might be, he was still a Taoist master. He should be capable of dealing with this sort of affair, right?","Before long, Wei Huanyang arrived at the hospital.","He wore custom-made clothes, understated yet luxurious. Though twenty-five, his cultivation made him appear exceptionally youthful, hardly different from an eighteen-year-old.","Wei Qi thought: So young. Is he reliable?","Burying the doubt, he said with earnest sincerity, \"Master, please, see if there's any hope for my son.\"","Wei Huanyang walked to the bedside with an air of aloof pride, casting a casual glance.","The young man on the bed was pale as ash, looking as if his time was nearly up.","Wei Huanyang took out a small mirror and held it up to Wei Qian's face, stating, \"His soul is missing.\"","Huh?","Zhang Chengyan raised an eyebrow. Wasn't this similar to what happened with Qian Kun?","\"Master, can it be retrieved?\" Wei Suhe asked nervously.","Wei Huanyang maintained a stern, inscrutable expression. \"Wait a moment.\"","He produced another talisman, placed it on Wei Qian's forehead between his eyebrows, pressed his fingertip against the paper, closed his eyes, and began murmuring incantations.","Zhang Chengyan: ???","Master Qi's rituals weren't this flashy.","Wei Huanyang chanted for a while. A faint golden light flickered on the talisman.","Unexpectedly, the talisman suddenly tore with a rip, splitting cleanly in two. The pale golden light was instantly engulfed by thick, dark Yin energy!","Wei Huanyang, greatly alarmed, hastily withdrew his power and stepped back.","The torn talisman fluttered slowly to the ground.","\"Master?!\" Wei Qi exclaimed. \"How is my son?!\"","Wei Huanyang's face turned ashen. He said with difficulty, \"This ghost harbors extremely strong resentment, and its Yin energy is several times that of an ordinary spirit. What your son has provoked is no common ghost.\"","\"Master, please save him!\"","Wei Huanyang frowned deeply.","He was a fourth-level Taoist master, bordering on the fifth! What was the origin of this ghost?","He had just used a Soul-Guiding Talisman to try and locate the living soul's whereabouts but was counter-attacked by an immensely powerful ghostly force. What surprised him more was that the attack seemed to carry a hatred directed specifically at him.","If he tried again, there was no guarantee this malevolent spirit wouldn't fight him to the death.","With a grave expression, he shook his head. \"Your son must have done something truly heinous to incur the wrath of such a formidable ghost.\"","Wei Qi: ???","Are those human words?","Zhang Chengyan couldn't hold back a cold, scoffing laugh. \"If your skills are lacking, just admit it. Why shift the blame onto the victim?\"","\"If he hadn't provoked it, would the ghost have latched onto him?\" Wei Huanyang, already in a foul mood and having lost face in front of ordinary people, felt his temper flare. \"Since you look down on me, then find someone else more capable!\"","He refused to believe these people could find a more powerful Taoist master than him in all of Longlin City.","Although Wei Huanyang was only fourth-level, within his sect, only he and disciples of lower cultivation were active in the secular world taking commissions.","Those with higher cultivation were all in seclusion within the sect.","In other words, for someone willing to handle this matter, there was probably no one else in Longlin City.","He turned and left without hesitation.","Wei Qi was stunned for a moment, about to chase after him, but was stopped by Zhang Chengyan.","\"Uncle, don't chase him. His cultivation is too low to help. Begging him further is useless.\"","Wei Qi was on the verge of tears. \"But everyone said Master Wei is the most skilled! If even the best can't save Xiao Qian, then, then...\"","\"Uncle, don't worry. There is a more powerful master!\"","\"Who?\"","Wei Suhe declared resoundingly, \"The benefactor who saved my son!\"","Lakeside Villa.","After dinner, Qi Quan was strolling in the backyard, accompanied by her two ghost attendants.","Many new fruit trees had been planted in the backyard, the soil freshly turned.","Xue Hong said, \"Will these transplanted trees survive?\"","\"Ling Sheng just infused them with spiritual energy. They'll definitely live,\" Su Rong stated with certainty.","The spiritual energy around Lakeside Villa was inherently abundant, a place plants adored. Nourished by such plentiful energy, they were sure to grow strong and bear fresh, delicious fruit next year.","Steward Su's mind instantly filled with numerous recipes involving fruit.","Qi Quan nodded. Ling Sheng was becoming more and more proficient at his tasks.","She asked casually, \"How is Ling Sheng's studies coming along?\"","\"At his current level, he could take the college entrance exam,\" Xue Hong said. \"I plan to get him some past exam papers tomorrow. Once he passes those, he can start university-level courses.\"","Qi Quan thought: With this kind of learning ability, is having him only learn to draw Dust-Cleaning Talismans a terrible waste?","She pondered for a moment, returned to her room to fetch a booklet, and went to Ling Sheng's door, knocking.","The door opened automatically, but the young man remained seated in his chair, head bowed as he carved a jade pendant.","This was using spiritual energy to form a hand, opening the door remotely.","She gained an even deeper understanding of the freakish comprehension abilities of a born spiritual entity.","\"Ling Sheng,\" she called softly from the doorway.","The young man abruptly stilled, then immediately set down the carving knife and jade, sprang to his feet, turned around, and hurried forward. His eyes sparkled with eagerness, like a big, happy dog seeing its owner.","Qi Quan smiled slightly and handed him the booklet.","\"This book contains the methods for drawing various types of talismans. You can learn them all in your free time.\"","Ling Sheng took it, holding it tightly against his chest.","Qi Quan saw the new pile of jade pendants on his desk and felt a pang of tenderness. It was people who lacked security who strove so desperately to prove their worth.","Her gaze softened as she said, \"Don't overwork yourself. You can watch TV or listen to music in your leisure time. Balance work with rest.\"","The young man's light-colored eyes curved slightly as he nodded gently.","\"I'm leaving now.\"","As Qi Quan turned to go, her sleeve was tugged.","She looked back in surprise. Ling Sheng had grasped her sleeve, actively raising her hand to rest on his own soft, dense hair, and was looking at her with expectant eyes.","Qi Quan instinctively ruffled it.","The young man happily narrowed his eyes, wearing an expression of pure enjoyment and contentment.","Qi Quan: !!!","This genuinely hit her cute spot.","She couldn't resist ruffling it again.","It had to be said, the young man's reaction pleased her greatly.","She had never kept a pet before and had no idea receiving feedback from a \"pet\" could be so delightful.","Qi Quan thought: He's so adorable!","The System: [Hahahahaha.]","Of course, Ling Sheng was a person. She couldn't truly treat him like a pet.","Qi Quan reluctantly withdrew her hand, adopting a stern tone. \"Don't tire yourself out. Rest appropriately.\"","Then she turned and left.","In the room, Su Rong was practicing ghost techniques when his phone kept buzzing incessantly.","[Zhang Chengyan: Butler Su, help!]","[Zhang Chengyan: Butler Su, my cousin's soul has gone missing. We hired a Level 4 Celestial Master, but it didn't work. We're really out of options. Could you please ask Master Qi for us?]","[Zhang Chengyan: Butler Su, please, I'm begging you!]","He hadn't wanted to bother the Master for every little thing, which is why he initially just asked his uncle to find a Celestial Master in Longlin City. Who could have guessed the ghost his cousin encountered would be so powerful?","Su Rong thought for a moment and asked: [Where?]","[Zhang Chengyan: Longlin City!]","[Su Rong: [Smiley Face]]","The Master really hates business trips.","[Zhang Chengyan: Butler Su, that smiley face is genuinely creepy. What does it mean?]","[Su Rong: Too far.]","[Zhang Chengyan: It's just over two hours by car! I'll drive back personally to pick up the Master! My cousin's soul has been separated for almost three days now. If it doesn't return soon, he's really done for!]","A life was at stake. Su Rong couldn't make the decision on his own.","He went to Qi Quan's room to report the matter.","Qi Quan: \"...\"","Are Crimson Ghosts being mass-produced these days? They just keep coming, one batch after another.","The system couldn't stop laughing. The more the big shot disliked traveling, the more cases from out of town seemed to need her attention.","\"Master?\" Su Rong inquired.","Qi Quan: \"Wait a moment.\"","She sent a message to Li Guoyan: [What level is the person in charge of the Longlin City Investigation Department?]","[Li Guoyan: Level 4.]","Qi Quan: \"...\"","The talent pool really is lacking.","If Li Guoyan knew what she was thinking, he'd probably be quite aggrieved.","Over the years, the official establishment had built this entire system and trained so many members, which was already considered highly efficient. It's just that high-level Celestial Masters aren't easy to cultivate anywhere.","The mystic arts world had developed for many years, yet even among the major sects and families, the number of Level 6 and above Celestial Masters wasn't particularly high.","[Li Guoyan: What's wrong?]","[Qi Quan: A Crimson Ghost above Level 4 has appeared in Longlin City. Can you dispatch personnel to handle it?]","She was making one last attempt to avoid going.","[Li Guoyan: Above Level 4... Ning Zhi reached Level 5 while handling the Wei family case, but his foundation isn't stable yet. He's returned to the capital to consolidate his cultivation. The Longjing Investigation Department has a Level 5 investigator, but they're tied up with another case and can't be spared.]","[Qi Quan: ...]","[Li Guoyan: May we trouble Advisor Qi to make time to handle this? Travel expenses will be sent to you shortly.]","The establishment of the Investigation Department wasn't just to regulate mystic practitioners, but also to take responsibility for resolving supernatural cases for ordinary citizens.","Even though this was a private matter, Li Guoyan took it very seriously.","Qi Quan didn't refuse further: [Alright.]","It wasn't that she was putting on airs. In her past life, she rarely intervened personally for matters of this level; such Crimson Ghosts were usually left to her subordinates.","She hadn't truly realized just how scarce talent was within the Investigation Department until now.","Of course, there was another, more crucial reason she was willing to go.","A business trip was a perfect excuse not to write!","Going out wasn't... the thing she hated most anymore. Writing was!","Qi Quan replied to Su Rong: \"We'll set off now.\"","\"Should we wait for Zhang Chengyan to pick us up, or...\" Su Rong asked hesitantly.","If only ghosts could get driver's licenses, he could have driven the Master to Longlin City himself.","Qi Quan: Oh, right. The little assistant is currently attending school in Longjing City.","She thought for a moment and instructed: \"Ask Director Meng of the Investigation Department if there are any investigators willing to go along.\"","Meng Yunzheng received the call and was overjoyed. He immediately said, \"Don't worry, don't worry, I'll definitely assign someone with good driving skills!\"","This was the big shot taking a newcomer under her wing. They had to seize this opportunity.","Who to send?","Right, two new members had just been transferred from Longlin City, one male, one female. One could drive, the other could look after the big shot. Perfect.","With a wave of his hand, he decided: It would be them!","Not long after, a car stopped in front of the Lakeside Villa.","Shen Hui in the driver's seat asked, \"Is this the place?\"","\"Mm.\" Tang Mian got out of the car and instinctively observed the energy above the villa, but was blocked by an invisible barrier, unable to see clearly.","\"A formation is set up.\"","Shen Hui nodded and rang the doorbell.","The door opened.","What greeted them was a handsome man—to be precise, a male ghost. Even though they had been briefed by Director Meng beforehand, they were still taken aback by the sight.","To be honest, in orthodox mystic circles, Celestial Masters who kept ghosts were considered evil practitioners. For this mysterious big shot to openly keep a ghost and still gain official recognition, even respect, spoke volumes about her status.","Shen Hui said with a smile, \"Hello, we're investigators from the Investigation Department, here to pick up Senior Qi.\"","\"Please wait a moment.\"","Su Rong closed the door and went back inside.","Shen Hui: Uh...","Tang Mian frowned, took a lollipop from her bag, and popped it into her mouth.","Sweetness helped ease anxiety.","A moment later, the door opened again.","The handsome male ghost was now accompanied by a young woman.","She was exceptionally beautiful, tall and slender, dressed in simple, comfortable casual clothes. Her hair was down, and she carried an elegant bag, its contents unknown.","She looked like she was going out for a stroll, not on a business trip.","\"Let's go,\" she said, walking up to them.","The two of them: ???","Weren't they told she was an incredibly powerful senior? She's this young?!","Shen Hui asked with a smile, \"Are you Senior Qi?\"","Qi Quan nodded. \"Yes.\"","Shen Hui: He really hadn't seen enough of the world.","He perceptively opened the car door for Qi Quan, waited for her to get in and settle, then closed the door as gently as possible.","The car set off from Lakeside Villa and soon entered the highway.","Shen Hui's driving was indeed very steady.","He occasionally stole glances at Qi Quan in the rearview mirror. Seeing her eyes closed in rest, he wanted to speak but didn't know what to say.","Tang Mian was bolder than him.","She usually didn't initiate conversation with people or things she wasn't interested in, but when she was curious, she would strike up a conversation.","\"Senior Qi, what level Celestial Master are you?\"","Qi Quan opened her eyes. \"What level are you?\"","\"I'm Level 3.\"","Qi Quan: \"I'm a few levels higher than you.\"","Actually, she wasn't sure what level she was considered now.","In her past life, she had defeated a Ghost General. Ghost Generals were above Level 9 ghosts. Comparatively, she should be beyond a Level 9 Celestial Master.","Beyond Level 9, it was Human Sovereign, then Human Immortal.","If she really said that, no one would probably believe her. It was better to be vague.","Sure enough, neither Shen Hui nor Tang Mian dared to think too high, only guessing she was probably around Level 6.","\"May I ask... your venerable age?\" Tang Mian asked again.","She had just been transferred from Longlin City to Longjiang City and knew nothing about the affairs there. She hadn't heard of Qi Quan, let alone the matter of the real and fake daughters of the Qi family.","Generally speaking, a mystic practitioner who could reach Level 6 was at least several decades older than their appearance suggested.","It's just that high-level Celestial Masters were skilled at preserving their youth, so it wasn't apparent from the outside.","Of course, peerless geniuses were an exception.","If Senior Qi truly was a peerless genius, she couldn't possibly be unknown in the mystic arts world.","Qi Quan: ...","System: [Hahahahaha, 'venerable age'!]","She asked, \"How old are you?\"","Tang Mian: \"Twenty.\"","Qi Quan: \"I can't claim 'venerable age,' though I am a mere two years your senior.\"","\"......\"","Tang Mian stared at Qi Quan with wide, disbelieving eyes, as if wishing she had X-ray vision installed in them.","A Level 6 Celestial Master at twenty-two...","Heavens!","Shen Hui was so shocked he almost swerved the car.","Their respect for her instantly reached its peak.","The gap was too vast, leaving only awe.","Shen Hui's usual composure faltered. He held back, then couldn't resist asking cautiously, \"Senior Qi, are you a secretly trained expert by the official authorities?\"","Did their Investigation Department really have such a powerful expert?","The current state of the Investigation Department was an open secret. If they were to clash head-on with the deeply rooted Mystic Sects, they wouldn't gain the upper hand. After all, the sheer number of low-level Mystics from the other side could overwhelm them.","At such times, it came down to the top-tier experts.","If the Investigation Department still had experts like this, why worry about not being able to crush the arrogant attitude of the Mystic Association?","Qi Quan: \"No.\"","The two of them: Alright then, she must be a genius big shot the authorities dug up from somewhere. Respect!","A little over two hours later, the car entered Longlin City.","Zhang Chengyan was waiting at the hospital entrance to greet them. Su Rong had sent him the license plate number, and he had been watching the passing cars.","Finally, he saw it!","As soon as the car stopped, he hurried forward, respectfully opened the rear door, and said with an ingratiating smile, \"Master, please get out!\"","Shen Hui and Tang Mian: \"...\"","Qi Quan got out of the car carrying a bag. Zhang Chengyan reached out again, \"Let me carry that for you.\"","Qi Quan didn't stand on ceremony and handed him the bag.","\"This way.\" Zhang Chengyan played the role of a sycophant to perfection.","Shen and Tang were utterly amazed.","They took the elevator directly to the ward.","Wei Qi was anxiously waiting by the hospital bed. When he saw the three people behind Zhang Chengyan, he was stunned.","So young again?","He opened his mouth to speak, but Wei Suhe beat him to it: \"Master, you're here! Thank you so much for your trouble!\"","[Big shot, \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family\" received two more tips. One is five hundred 'deep waters' from 'Nation's Fortune Endures', and the other is a thousand 'deep waters' from 'Today is Auspicious'.]","Qi Quan: A business trip in exchange for 150 days of lifespan. Acceptable.","She looked at Wei Qian on the bed.","His face was deathly pale, his breath weak. Two of the three fires on his body were already extinguished. If his living soul didn't return soon, he would indeed die.","This man had decent features and good fortune. He was kind-hearted and enthusiastic by nature, destined for a peaceful and smooth life, yet this accident had occurred.","She extended her right hand, her fingertip hovering over Wei Qian's glabella.","Wei Qi: Huh? She's not using a talisman!","He stared wide-eyed, not blinking, observing Qi Quan's state, afraid she might become another Wei Huanyang.","...","Following the instinctive guidance from Wei Qian's consciousness, Qi Quan sensed the location of his living soul and also felt the intense resentment of that red ghost.","But strangely, the ghost only put up a token resistance and did not fight back fiercely.","Lost in thought, she withdrew her spiritual power.","\"Master, how is it?\" Zhang Chengyan hurriedly asked.","Wei Qi and Wei Suhe wore equally tense expressions.","This time, it simply had to work!","Qi Quan said, \"At Longlin University.\"","\"Really?\" Wei Qi asked excitedly. \"Then what should we do now? Go find it?\"","Given Qi Quan's abilities, she could completely pull the living soul back from the red ghost's grasp from a distance, but she was unwilling to do so.","\"To Longlin University.\" She turned and instructed Zhang Chengyan, \"You come with us.\"","\"Absolutely!\"","At dusk, the sky was filled with rosy clouds.","Qi Quan sat in the car, observing the aura above the city.","There was a place in the southeast where the aura was exceptionally dense.","She asked, \"What's in the southeast direction?\"","Shen Hui understood: \"The Hengfeng Sect is located there. It's rich in spiritual energy, an excellent place for cultivation.\"","Hengfeng Sect?","Sounded slightly familiar.","System: [Big shot, the one who exposed Ma Sisi's address was Wei Huanyang from the Hengfeng Sect.]","[Oh.]","\"Master, to be honest, the Mystic my uncle hired before was Wei Huanyang from the Hengfeng Sect. He couldn't subdue the evil ghost and even deliberately said my cousin brought it on himself. His character is terrible!\" Zhang Chengyan complained to her.","Qi Quan smiled slightly.","She was all too familiar with such things.","The car stopped outside the campus, and they entered the university on foot.","Following the direction of the living soul, Qi Quan walked all the way to the sports field.","University students on the field were full of youthful energy; on the red synthetic track, some were running hard, sweating profusely.","\"Master, the ghost isn't buried under the field, is it?\" Zhang Chengyan, having heard of \"the buried body under the sports field case,\" blurted out.","\"What is that place?\" Qi Quan pointed to a small building beside the sports field.","Shen Hui said, \"Should be the sports equipment room.\"","\"Hmm.\"","The four of them walked onto the field.","Qi Quan led the way, the other three following side by side behind her. All were handsome men and beautiful women, attracting frequent glances from the students.","The boys whistled, one after another.","System: [How vulgar!]","Qi Quan: ...","Ignoring the stares, she arrived at the door of the sports equipment room.","It was getting dark, all classes for the day were over, and the door to the sports equipment room was tightly locked.","\"Who are you? Can I help you?\" A tall male student walked over and asked.","A group of boys in tracksuits trailed behind him, all stealing glances at Qi Quan.","\"She's so pretty!\"","\"A real beauty! Haven't seen her on campus before.\"","\"Her aura is really special.\"","The boys huddled together, whispering, thinking others couldn't hear.","However, except for Zhang Chengyan, Qi Quan and the other two heard them perfectly clearly.","Shen Hui subtly shifted his position, slightly blocking Qi Quan from others' view.","\"Hello, can this equipment room be opened?\" Zhang Chengyan asked politely.","The boy happened to be the Sports Minister of the university student council and had the authority to open it, but he couldn't just open it without reason.","\"You have to tell me what you need first.\"","Zhang Chengyan turned to look at Qi Quan.","Qi Quan looked at the boy and smiled slightly: \"Lost something. Want to find it.\"","The boy's face instantly flushed bright red.","His heart raced, his mind buzzed, but he still... asked responsibly, \"D-did you bring your student ID?\"","Shen Hui said, \"We forgot. We're just looking for something. With so many of you watching, we couldn't possibly do anything wrong.\"","That was true.","The boy stole another glance at Qi Quan, nodded with a red face, \"Alright. You can't mess with the things inside. Leave once you find your stuff.\"","During P.E. classes, students often came to the equipment room to get sports gear. It was normal for things to get lost inside.","He'd encountered this before, so he wasn't too suspicious.","Besides, there were so many people watching from behind.","He took out the key.","System: [Big shot, his face is really red. Were you using a beauty charm just now?]","Qi Quan: ?","She was just answering politely.","The door opened. The faint metallic smell of equipment mixed with the rubbery odor of leather balls wafted out.","It was quite dusty inside.","The boy asked, \"What did you lose? I can help you look.\"","Qi Quan didn't answer.","She looked towards the corner behind the rack of rackets.","Shen Hui and Tang Mian followed her gaze and immediately fell silent.","\"Master?\" Zhang Chengyan asked in a low voice.","The boy waiting for an answer: ???","Master? What's that about?","He asked again, \"What does the lost item look like?\"","Qi Quan instructed Zhang Chengyan: \"Call the police.\"","This case was different from Zheng Hui's case.","Zheng Hui's case was too \"supernatural\" for the police to get involved; the Investigation Department could handle it. But this case was clearly a murder case. The police had to be called.","Zhang Chengyan's heart tightened. He hurriedly dialed the emergency number.","The boy: ???","He frowned warily, \"Who exactly are you people? What do you want?\"","Shen Hui took out his credentials, smiling as he said, \"Don't worry, classmate. We are official case handlers. Leave this place to us for now, you can step outside. Of course, if you're uneasy, you can wait outside with your classmates.\"","Some things are better not for young people to see.","The male student: \"...\"","He looked down at the credentials — National Special Cases Investigation Division.","Huh? There's a department like that? Is it like the 'Dragon Group' from novels?","Oh my god!","Hesitant yet excited, he left the equipment room and thoughtfully closed the door for them.","The other boys all crowded around.","\"Why did you come out alone?\"","\"Was something stolen?\"","\"What's her name? Is she from our school?\"","\"What are they really doing here?\"","The clamor of questions muddled his mind.","The male student cleared his throat, \"Don't rush, let's wait for the police to arrive.\"","The boys: The police?!","Inside the equipment room, after the boy left, a ghostly figure materialized in the corner behind the rack of rackets.","Zhang Chengyan: !!!","It was a female ghost with a distorted face. Her features were displaced, likely due to a massive impact during her life, causing a shift from a shattered skull, making her look utterly terrifying.","She wore a set of ordinary casual clothes, stained with blood.","Wei Qian's living soul stood beside her.","Her gaze swept over their faces, finally settling on Qi Quan's. Her voice was hoarse and unpleasant:","\"Are you here to save him?\"","Qi Quan replied calmly, \"Yes.\"","\"You are strong,\" the female ghost said. \"But I cannot hand him over to you.\"","\"Why?\"","...","The female ghost grabbed Wei Qian's neck, saying bitterly, \"He killed me! He killed me! How can you help a bad person!\"","\"Impossible!\" Zhang Chengyan said urgently. \"Xiao Qian is a good person, he couldn't possibly harm anyone!\"","Seeing the ghost's wretched appearance, he refused to believe his cousin could have done this to her.","\"You're all birds of a feather!\" the female ghost wailed shrilly. \"Eight years ago you wouldn't let me get my revenge! Now that I've finally waited for him again, you still want to stop me?!\"","Qi Quan expressed surprise, \"Since you want revenge, why not just kill him directly?\"","The ghost was quite rational, \"I still want to continue my cycle of reincarnation. He deserves to die, but I don't want to dirty my hands.\"","\"Then why did you lure his soul away?\" Shen Hui was very puzzled.","The ghost said, \"I just want justice. Give me justice, and I'll release him.\"","Qi Quan glanced at Zhang Chengyan.","\"Ah, I've already called the police, you heard that earlier, right?\" Zhang Chengyan quickly added. \"The police will be here soon. You can state your grievance. But think carefully again, are you absolutely sure you didn't lure the wrong person?\"","\"No mistake.\"","\"But eight years ago, my cousin was only ten!\"","The female ghost: \"...\"","She pulled Wei Qian closer, examining him carefully for a long moment before saying, \"I heard someone call him 'Young Master Wei'.\"","Zhang Chengyan didn't know whether to laugh or cry. \"His surname is Wei. Calling him 'Young Master Wei' was probably a joke. You can't just decide he's the one who harmed you based on that, can you?\"","\"No. He also said a sentence,\" the ghost said faintly. \"The person who killed me said the exact same words.\"","Zhang Chengyan: \"What words?\"","\"'This place is really quiet, a good spot.'\"","Zhang Chengyan: This is giving me a headache.","He could swear his cousin's meaning when saying that sentence was completely different from the murderer's meaning!","Wait—","\"You can't even recognize the face of the person who killed you?\"","The ghost paused, awkwardly admitting, \"I'm a bit face-blind.\"","\"...\"","Is that just 'a bit'?","Are you sure it's not completely, utterly face-blind?","\"But, I remember the voice,\" she tugged at Wei Qian. \"His voice is very similar to the killer's, almost identical. He's also called 'Young Master Wei', and said the exact same sentence.\"","That's why she couldn't hold back and lured this person's soul away.","She had waited too long.","Zhang Chengyan had never been so speechless. He said, \"But my cousin is genuinely only eighteen. He couldn't have killed you when he was ten, could he? Besides, people can look alike, and voices sounding similar is normal, right? Also, that 'Young Master Wei' of yours, what's the actual character for the surname?\"","\"I don't know,\" the ghost shook her head. \"I never knew him.\"","Zhang Chengyan: That's tragic too.","He sighed mournfully, \"Miss, you really have the wrong person. You said you don't want to harm anyone, right? How about you release my cousin first, and when the police arrive, let them seek justice for you?\"","The female ghost: \"...\"","\"The police are here!\"","Shouts suddenly came from outside the door.","The arrival of the police stirred up many people. School officials also rushed over immediately.","The sports field was packed solid. The police struggled to disperse the crowd.","The captain from the municipal bureau arrived with several officers.","\"Who reported the case?\" the captain asked.","Zhang Chengyan raised his hand, \"Me.\"","Shen Hui stepped forward at the right moment, flashed his credentials, and said politely, \"Comrade, we're from the Investigation Division. We're here handling a case and need to cooperate with the police.\"","The existence of the Investigation Division was no longer a secret within the police force.","The captain nodded seriously, \"Understood.\"","They entered the equipment room, closed the door, blocking the view from outside.","Even with mental preparation, the officers were still shocked upon seeing the distorted ghost.","The captain managed to maintain composure and asked in a low voice, \"Comrade Shen, what exactly is going on?\"","Shen Hui looked at the female ghost, \"The police are here. You can speak now.\"","The ghost gazed at the captain and said faintly, \"Eight years ago, I reported the case. If you go back and check, you should find a record.\"","She began to recount her grievance.","The system asked, [Big shot, why not let the police investigate this time, but have her state the case herself?]","Qi Quan replied, [She reported the case but failed to get justice, meaning the police lacked sufficient evidence.]","Moreover, the female ghost's intention was different from Xue Hong's.","If the ghost couldn't get justice, she wouldn't release Wei Qian; Xue Hong just wanted to push Qian Kun to study and always intended to release him.","\"They raped me here. I only heard someone called 'Young Master Wei'. They somehow knew I was face-blind. While hurting me, they laughed and asked if I remembered their faces... Later, I went to report the crime. But I didn't remember their faces, and my body had been cleaned. The police could only investigate people who had been in the equipment room during that time period. But there were no surveillance cameras on the field, so nothing was found.\"","The captain: \"You just said you went to deliver water near the equipment room after receiving a phone message notification. Was that text message investigated?\"","\"It was investigated. A senior from the sports department notified me, but he said he left before I delivered the water.\"","\"...\"","This was clearly a setup!","Unfortunately, there was no evidence.","\"I couldn't accept it. I had to find that person!\" the ghost said. \"Whoever could open the equipment room easily was likely someone from the sports department. I started secretly watching every day. Finally, one day, I heard 'Young Master Wei' again, and that familiar voice!\"","\"I secretly took a photo with my phone, planning to call the police again, but I was discovered! He snatched my phone and pushed me off the sixth floor!\"","The team leader frowned, \"The female university student falling case at Longlin University?\"","He remembered this case quite well.","Because the day the falling incident happened was exactly his first day reporting to the municipal bureau. He didn't participate in the investigation, but he had vaguely heard some details of the case, only knowing it was eventually closed as a 'suicide' due to lack of evidence.","\"Hah.\" The female ghost sneered, \"They didn't know that after I fell, I became a ghost.\"","\"Everyone thought I committed suicide because I had been violated, I was 'dirty', I couldn't bear the pressure of public opinion, so I chose to jump.\"","\"Bullshit! I just wanted revenge!\"","The female ghost said through gritted teeth, \"Even if I became a ghost, I would haunt him for revenge!\"","Qi Quan interjected coolly, \"You found him again, using the convenience of your ghost form to terrorize him, wanting him to confess. But you didn't expect that he knew a capable Taoist priest. He asked the Taoist priest to eliminate you. No, he was even more malicious than you imagined. He asked the Taoist priest to trap you forever in this corner of the equipment room, making you live in torment every moment, making you writhe in agony within painful memories every second.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","A chill instantly swept through their bodies, and they couldn't help but shiver.","This was too vicious!","\"Correct.\" The female ghost laughed bitterly, \"I still remember that Taoist priest's aura. Before you, it was that Taoist priest who aided the villain that wanted to come looking!...\"","\"He must have long forgotten about this matter, otherwise why would he still be trying to come find it now?\"","Zhang Chengyan was horrified, \"You mean Wei Huanyang!\"","Before seeking out Master Qi, they had only sought out one person - Wei Huanyang!","\"He's also surnamed Wei?\" The female ghost seized the key point and scoffed, \"Then my death wasn't in vain.\"","With a Taoist priest helping to conceal the crime, how could the police possibly find the murderer who pushed her to her fall?","The team leader and the officers looked grave.","Such a heinous criminal had actually been at large for so many years, it was truly depressing and infuriating!","Zhang Chengyan's imagination ran a bit wild, \"Could it be related to Fengmao Group again?\"","\"Probably not.\" Shen Hui, more familiar with the situation in Longlin City, said, \"Wei Guangchang's family doesn't have anyone who studied at Longlin University. We can check Wei Huanyang's own family.\"","Wei Huanyang was a disciple of the Hengfeng Sect. Most people in his own family were still ordinary people. But because they had backing, the Wei family's status in Longlin City was somewhat transcendent.","At the very least, people who had favors to ask of Wei Huanyang would treat his family members with a degree of courtesy.","If it really was a person surnamed Wei who committed the crime, then Wei Qian truly suffered a calamity through no fault of his own.","The female ghost also realized something and stared blankly at the living soul in her hand.","\"He really is only eighteen, not the person you're looking for,\" the team leader said.","The female ghost hesitated for a moment, then released Wei Qian.","She had been blinded by rage before, having a stress reaction when she heard that sentence, mistaking Wei Qian for the murderer.","The murderer had said that sentence when violating her, and again when asking the Taoist priest to trap her here.","It had caused her immense psychological trauma.","So when she heard Wei Qian say that sentence with a similar voice, she thought it was her old enemy revisiting the scene, wanting to see his handiwork firsthand and admire her misery.","Without a second thought, she captured his soul.","\"I'm sorry,\" she apologized awkwardly.","Qi Quan instructed, \"Take the living soul back.\"","Tang Mian immediately used a talisman to contain the living soul and asked, \"Go back to the hospital now?\"","Qi Quan said, \"You go to the hospital to save the person first. Shen Hui, come with me to the Investigation Department.\"","She looked at the female ghost, \"This matter involves the mystical arts community, you also have to come with us.\"","Female ghost: ???","\"What is the Investigation Department?\"","Qi Quan couldn't be bothered to explain. She tossed a peach wood plaque over, and the female ghost's figure disappeared.","Everyone: So simple and rough.","The team leader said, \"We'll go back now to investigate the suspect.\"","As for the matter of Wei Huanyang covering up the crime, naturally it would be handled by the Investigation Department.","The division of labor was clear.","The Longlin City Investigation Department was also located in a standalone villa in the suburbs, situated in the northwest part of the city, facing the Hengfeng Sect from afar.","Arriving at the Investigation Department, Qi Quan remained seated in the car, only sending Shen Hui inside with the female ghost.","The female ghost was placed in an interrogation room.","Based on her statement, the Investigation Department had the authority to summon Wei Huanyang for questioning.","But the person in charge was in a difficult position.","\"Shen Hui, Wei Huanyang is a fourth-level, third-rank Taoist priest, nearly fifth-level. Where do we have a master powerful enough to summon him? Master Ning has already returned to Longjing City. We can't ask him to come back again, can we?\"","Shen Hui found it both funny and exasperating, \"Director, that ghost is a fifth-level red ghost. How do you think I managed to bring her back?\"","Director: \"...\"","Too busy to think straight.","He had an epiphany and said mysteriously, \"I heard the higher-ups invited a grandmaster who lives in Longjiang City. This time, you didn't come with this grandmaster, did you?\"","...","Shen Hui smiled and nodded.","\"Where is the grandmaster?\"","\"Outside in the car.\"","The director was surprised, \"Why didn't you invite them in?\"","\"Senior prefers not to socialize much,\" Shen Hui replied.","After just a few hours of interaction, he had roughly figured out Grandmaster Qi's personality.","Director: \"Alright, then I won't disturb them. You go with the grandmaster to summon Wei Huanyang.\"","The authorities have been observing Wei Huanyang for a long time.","Talented, famous from a young age, vain and arrogant, lacking compassion for ordinary people, acting recklessly and without restraint. But with the backing of the Hengfeng Sect, a formidable mountain, the authorities couldn't easily move against him.","However, this time there was the victim's testimony, and with a grandmaster backing them up, he would have to come whether he wanted to or not.","The Investigation Department was newly established, and branches everywhere were eager to achieve some results. Longlin City couldn't afford to hold them back.","Unexpectedly, Shen Hui smiled and said, \"He's under the jurisdiction of your Longlin City branch, so naturally you should go.\"","\"You rascal! Daring to mock me!\" The director laughed angrily.","Shen Hui took out a talisman and handed it to him, saying, \"I still have to drive for the senior. This is a sixth-level Soul Confinement Talisman. It should be more than enough to deal with a fourth-level Taoist priest, right?\"","Director: !!!","It's really easy to relax under the shade of a big tree!","He carefully held the sixth-level talisman, patted Shen Hui's shoulder, and said earnestly, \"Xiao Shen, don't forget you started out from our Longlin City Investigation Department.\"","Shen Hui: \"...\"","He waved his hand, \"The senior is still waiting for me. Wishing you a triumphant return.\"","At the hospital, Tang Mian had already returned the living soul to Wei Qian's body. Wei Qian opened his eyes, seeing his overjoyed father crying with happiness, feeling somewhat bewildered.","At 8 PM, Wei Huanyang was cultivating at his residence when someone suddenly came to the door.","A young attendant reported, \"Master, someone is here. They say they're from the Special Cases Investigation Department and are here to summon you.\"","\"Investigation Department?\" Wei Huanyang gnashed his teeth, \"Is Ning Zhi here?\"","\"No.\"","\"Ha!\"","Wei Huanyang sneered. Ning Zhi wasn't here, yet those people still dared to come looking for trouble? Did they really think he was easy to bully?","He strode quickly to the door, intent on venting his anger, when a flimsy talisman paper suddenly shot toward his face. He raised a hand to block it, but the paper attached itself directly to the back of his hand, utterly unfazed by his spiritual power. It even suppressed the circulation of his energy!","How was this possible?!","Wei Huanyang was shocked and dismayed. He frantically tried to tear the talisman off, but it remained immovable. He couldn't muster even the slightest bit of spiritual power anymore.","\"Click.\"","A pair of cold handcuffs was fastened around his wrists.","Wei Huanyang only had time to instruct the young attendant to \"notify the sect\" before he was taken away by the investigators.","The young attendant: \"...\""]},{"number":42,"title":"Chapter 42","paragraphs":["Wei Huanyang has been arrested!","This news struck like a thunderclap, causing shockwaves throughout the mystical sects.","Who is Wei Huanyang?","The closed-door disciple of the Hengfeng Sect's sect master, a quasi-fifth-level Celestial Master at twenty-five, and fourth place in the Grand Mystical Tournament!","Given his status and abilities, among the worldly Celestial Masters in Longlin City, he could be considered an authority of extraordinary stature.","And the authorities just arrested him, just like that?","A quasi-fifth-level Celestial Master, captured so easily?","Are the authorities' talent reserves really that strong?","Whether it was the various sects, the great families, or the independent cultivators affiliated with the Celestial Master Association, everyone was on high alert.","The Special Case Investigation Division had been arresting Celestial Masters involved in illegal activities across the country, but most were just small fry, not yet touching the foundations of the various mystical factions.","But Wei Huanyang was different.","He was a microblogging celebrity, known by basically every Celestial Master in the mystical world; he was also the fourth-place winner of the Grand Mystical Tournament, with a prominent reputation; furthermore, he was the closed-door disciple of the Hengfeng Sect's master, holding a lofty position.","Such a person naturally garnered more attention than other Celestial Masters.","Like Yan Wu, an \"old-timer\" who served his family from the start, even as a sixth-level Celestial Master, his arrest didn't cause much of a stir.","The major powers were all watching and waiting.","They were anticipating the game of chess between the Hengfeng Sect and the authorities.","Compared to the deeply rooted sects and families, some independent cultivators without backing were filled with anxiety and fear.","In the independent cultivators' group chat.","【Baldness Daoist: Are the authorities serious this time? Even Wei Huanyang has been taken in. Can we still protect ourselves?】","【Toe-Picker Daoist: What are you afraid of? You haven't broken any laws.】","Baldness Daoist: Thinking back carefully, it seems when I first started, I wanted to try flying and earth-traveling, but lost control and floated up outside a window on the tenth floor, accidentally seeing a man taking a shower.","【Whale Daoist: Tsk, you're both men, so what if you saw?】","【Baldness Daoist: But I... am a woman.】","【Toe-Picker Daoist: ???】","【Whale Daoist: !!!】","【Melon-Eater Daoist: [Black person question mark.jpg]】","Whale Daoist: Whoa, even Brother Melon has been shocked into appearing! @Baldness Daoist, your melon is really ripe!","【Toe-Picker Daoist: In that case, you might as well offer yourself to him in marriage.】","【Baldness Daoist: ...Who told him not to close the window while showering!】","【Whale Daoist: That's not reasonable. He lives on the tenth floor; who would think someone could float up to the tenth floor?】","Melon-Eater Daoist: That doesn't count as indecent assault; at most, it's disturbing public order. Don't be afraid, fifteen days detention max.","【Toe-Picker Daoist: Brother Melon, given the current situation, do you think many of our colleagues will have to go in?】","【Melon-Eater Daoist: I don't acknowledge law-breaking criminals as my colleagues. Wei Huanyang should have gone in for ideological re-education long ago.】","【Whale Daoist: Only you would dare say that.】","【Baldness Daoist: Brother Melon is always brave. Last time you even posted on Weibo mocking Wei Huanyang. Aren't you afraid of retaliation?】","【Toe-Picker Daoist: Second place in the Grand Mystical Tournament, what's to fear?】","【Melon-Eater Daoist: What second place? I didn't even force Yan Huai to unsheathe his sword.】","【Whale Daoist: Don't be too hard on yourself. What family background does Yan Huai have? He's from the Yan family, the top family in Longjing! For an independent cultivator like you to take second place is already something to be proud of in the mystical world.】","【Baldness Daoist: Exactly, exactly!】","【Toe-Picker Daoist: What do you all think the mystical world will become in the future?】","【Melon-Eater Daoist: The mystical world shouldn't take itself too seriously. If everyone obeys the law, everything will be fine.】","...","【Whale Daoist: Brother Melon's awareness remains as high as ever!】","Hengfeng Sect.","After receiving the notification from the young disciple, the senior brother immediately called a meeting with several fellow disciples.","\"The Sect Master and elders are in secluded cultivation. We shouldn't disturb them for now. Now that Junior Brother Wei has been taken by the Investigation Division, what are everyone's thoughts?\"","They looked at each other.","\"Senior Brother Feng,\" someone said, \"we'll all follow your lead.\"","\"Yes, we'll follow you.\"","Feng Ke: \"...\"","He sighed inwardly, maintaining a calm expression. \"The Investigation Division must have a reason for arresting Junior Brother Wei. My thought is to first clarify that reason, then decide on the next step. Right now, someone needs to go to the Investigation Division to inquire. Who is willing to go?\"","\"Senior Brother Feng, I think there might be negotiations and mediation with the authorities later. It definitely requires someone with prestige from our sect. You are the most suitable candidate.\"","\"I agree.\"","\"Senior Brother Feng is undoubtedly the most suitable.\"","Feng Ke: \"...\"","No one wanted to get involved in worldly affairs; they all preferred to stay in the sect and cultivate in peace. It seemed he would have to handle this matter personally.","As the Sect Master's head disciple, it was his responsibility to take charge.","The moment Feng Ke left the sect, the head of the Investigation Division received notification, and other factions also learned the news. Instantly, all eyes were focused on him.","He was well aware of the many little tails following behind and the numerous prying eyes watching from the shadows.","He had no time to bother with them.","This contact with the authorities would determine the future development of the Hengfeng Sect. He could not afford to be careless.","Feng Ke arrived at the Investigation Division.","As a fifth-level Celestial Master, higher in rank than anyone at the Investigation Division, he unleashed his full aura the moment he stepped out of the car.","The staff: \"...\"","Feng Ke: \"I'm looking for your person in charge.\"","Under his pressure, a staff member struggled to speak. \"The Director is on the third floor.\"","A fifth-level Celestial Master... could they really contend with him?","Feng Ke went straight up to the third floor.","The director's office door was wide open, rather like an \"open invitation\" setup.","Compared to the Hengfeng Sect, this place was truly too simple and crude.","No high-level formations, no abundant spiritual energy, and even the investigators' levels were so low. Feng Ke didn't understand how they had managed to capture Wei Huanyang.","What confidence did the authorities have to let such a plain Investigation Division stand against the Hengfeng Sect?","Feng Ke stepped into the office, meeting the director's composed gaze.","Neither spoke.","Under the pressure of a fifth-level Celestial Master's aura, a fourth-level Celestial Master would find it very difficult to hold their ground, but the director seemed completely unaffected.","His gaze remained calm, his demeanor composed, not losing ground at all.","How could this be?","Feng Ke was slightly startled inwardly. Was he deliberately concealing his cultivation level?","No, why would a director need to conceal his level?","He didn't know that the director was currently enduring with great difficulty.","The authorities trained special personnel, not cowards. Before joining, they had undergone countless training sessions. Among these, spiritual energy cultivation was actually the least emphasized.","They had to participate in various arduous tasks under conditions of depleted spiritual energy, including enduring the pressure of high-level Celestial Masters, learning how to maximize the utilization rate of spiritual power within their bodies, and so on.","They got used to it through practice.","The people at the Investigation Division, despite their seemingly low individual levels, were each elite soldiers and fierce generals. They were well-trained, cooperated seamlessly, and at the same level, were definitely more combat-capable than other Celestial Masters from the mystical sects... This was their unique advantage.","A Celestial Master's spiritual power would eventually be exhausted. Once it was depleted, what mattered was physical strength.","The Celestial Masters from the major sects and families had smooth sailing in their cultivation since childhood, basically never experiencing hardship. They lacked firm willpower and robust physiques. Once they lost their spiritual power, they were a bunch of weaklings.","For example, Ding Ji, whose first reaction upon encountering an enemy was to beg for mercy.","Take Chu Changyi for example, who only knows how to retreat when faced with trouble.","The person in charge has undergone countless training sessions. To sit in this position, he must have some real skills. If he couldn't withstand Feng Ke's pressure, he might as well go home and sell sweet potatoes early.","Feng Ke: ???","For the first time, he deeply realized that the official Investigation Department was not as incompetent as he had imagined.","He subconsciously withdrew his pressure.","The person in charge curled his lips into a smile. \"Master Feng, please have a seat.\"","Feng Ke sat down opposite him.","\"Would you like something to drink?\" The person in charge made a move to stand up. \"I only have ordinary tea and water here.\"","Feng Ke's expression turned somewhat unpleasant. \"That won't be necessary.\"","He got straight to the point: \"I just want to know why your department arrested my junior brother, Wei Huanyang.\"","The person in charge didn't waste words either, directly tossing him a file. \"This is our investigation report on him. Take a look first.\"","While cultivating talent, the official side has also been secretly investigating typical Masters from various regions, gathering evidence of illegal activities, waiting for the right moment to make arrests.","Feng Ke opened the investigation materials.","The further he read, the tighter his frown became.","He had long resided within his sect, focusing on quiet cultivation. Although he had heard some rumors about Wei Huanyang's conduct outside, he only thought it was due to youthful arrogance and a lack of tact.","Who would have thought he had done so many things that crossed the line!","But—","He couldn't just believe this one-sided account.","Steadying his mind, he said, \"Are you sure all of this is true?\"","The person in charge raised an eyebrow. \"To be honest, our department has no grudge against him. There's no need to fabricate charges. We are just an official law enforcement unit. Whoever commits a crime, we arrest them. He broke the law, so he must accept punishment. Moreover...\"","He paused. \"Wei Huanyang believed the authorities couldn't do anything to him, so he never concealed his actions. Investigating him was easy.\"","Feng Ke: \"...\"","\"Master Feng,\" the person in charge leaned back slightly, \"I don't believe you are unaware of the increasingly rampant behavior of Masters in recent years.\"","\"...\"","\"You are Masters, possessing special abilities and considering yourselves different from ordinary people. I can understand that. But there are some lines that cannot be crossed. If you insist on pleading his case, why not come with me to see for yourself.\"","\"See what?\"","\"The interrogation.\"","Feng Ke: \"...\"","Inside the interrogation room, Wei Huanyang's spiritual power was suppressed, forced to sit in a chair answering the Investigation Department's questions.","He originally didn't take it seriously. But under the interrogator's intensely oppressive barrage of questions, and with no rescue from his sect in sight, he finally began to feel fear.","When it came down to it, his past pride stemmed solely from others' flattery and his sect's indulgence.","Although he was a twenty-five-year-old quasi-fifth-level Master, his mental fortitude was severely underdeveloped.","\"Eight years ago, you helped a member of your clan suppress the soul of a victim, correct?\"","Wei Huanyang: \"...\"","Eight years ago? How could he possibly remember something from so long ago!","He racked... his brains, finally dredging up the incident from the depths of his memory.","\"There seems to have been something like that,\" Wei Huanyang said with a frown. \"At the time, someone from the family came begging for my help, saying a malicious ghost was haunting him, trying to take his life. But he didn't want to destroy the ghost, just suppress it, so I helped him suppress it.\"","Interrogator: \"...\"","\"You helped him suppress it without clarifying the cause and effect?\"","Wei Huanyang: \"What cause and effect? I'm a Master. I deal with ghosts.\"","\"What if the ghost was the victim and the person was the perpetrator?\"","\"Isn't catching bad guys the police's job?\"","\"...\"","Outside the interrogation room, separated by a pane of glass, Feng Ke was speechless.","He knew very well in his heart that there were many Masters who shared Wei Huanyang's way of thinking. Even he himself had to admit that when facing ghosts, he wouldn't waste time figuring out the cause and effect of a situation.","The person in charge said, \"To be honest, there are many lawbreakers who, under the protection of Masters, evade legal sanctions. And the Masters, by aiding and abetting, inflict secondary harm on the victimized ghosts. The authorities are in a difficult position too.\"","Otherwise, they wouldn't be cracking down so hard.","Feng Ke: \"...\"","Inside the interrogation room, Wei Huanyang confessed to several more actions that crossed the line. Feng Ke couldn't bear to listen any longer and asked the person in charge, \"If all these things are true, what punishment will he face?\"","Person in charge: \"Sheltering a criminal suspect is punishable as the crime of harboring. The other charges will also be adjudicated and sentenced according to the law, with combined punishment for multiple offenses in the end.\"","\"...\"","As the head disciple of the Hengfeng Sect, Feng Ke still had certain principles. Otherwise, he wouldn't have been entrusted with managing the entire sect while the sect leader was in seclusion.","He had no face to stay any longer. He cupped his hands towards the person in charge and left quickly.","After he had gone far, the person in charge let out a long sigh of relief.","Fortunately, this Feng Ke was relatively reasonable.","Feng Ke's departure sparked much speculation among the various forces in the metaphysical community.","\"Is the Hengfeng Sect planning to abandon Wei Huanyang?\"","\"What exactly happened to Wei Huanyang?\"","\"Did Feng Ke not put up any fight at all?\"","\"Is the Hengfeng Sect deciding to bow to the authorities?\"","\"Hengfeng Sect...\"","The rumors grew rampant.","None of this had anything to do with Qi Quan.","Arranged by the Wei family, she moved into an unoccupied villa. Shen Hui and Tang Mian stayed with her.","\"Master, here is your bag.\" Zhang Chengyan stood at the door, handing the bag back to her, reluctant to part. \"Master, I'll come see you again tomorrow.\"","He was going to stay at his uncle's house tonight to keep his frightened little cousin company.","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She did not require visits, thank you.","[Great One, 'Miracle Master' has gifted you two thousand 'Deep Waters'.] The system reported calmly.","Receiving 'Deep Waters' no longer brought the initial surprise; it had become routine.","Qi Quan sat on the bed and opened the exquisite bag. Inside were the snacks prepared by Steward Su.","The assorted preserved fruits emitted a sweet and fragrant aroma.","She was happily eating the preserves when she suddenly froze. She immediately got up, went to the window, pulled back the curtain, and looked out at the city under the pitch-black night sky.","Something's wrong.","At the same time, a sharp alarm sounded at the Longlin City Investigation Department.","The person in charge looked up in shock.","Someone rushed anxiously into the office, face pale, and said, \"Director, it's a Level Six alarm!\"","Everyone at the Investigation Department knew what a Level Six alarm meant.","It signified the appearance of a Level Six Red Ghost!","...Why so sudden?","The person in charge gritted his teeth and quickly ordered, \"Immediately report to higher-ups and request assistance! Mobilize the field teams!\"","\"Yes!\"","The sudden appearance of a Level Six Red Ghost caught them completely off guard.","Even if the Investigation Department deployed all its field teams, they would be no match for a Level Six Red Ghost.","\"Hurry, contact Shen Hui! Ask him if that senior is willing to intervene!\"","But that senior was at most Level Six as well. Could she withstand a Level Six Red Ghost?","Judging by the alarm, this Red Ghost's power was even close to Level Seven!","\"Director, should we request aid from the Hengfeng Sect?\" someone asked.","The Hengfeng Sect had several Level Seven Masters. If they could be persuaded to act, the threat of the Level Six Red Ghost could naturally be eliminated.","But would the Hengfeng Sect be willing?","The person in charge furrowed his brow, a sudden flash of insight crossing his mind.","Was the appearance of this Level Six Red Ghost really just a coincidence?","Hengfeng Sect.","Feng Ke had just finished explaining the matter of Wei Huanyang to his fellow disciples when the sect's alarm bell suddenly rang out.","\"Senior Brother Feng!\" A disciple rushed over in a panic. \"The Level Six Red Ghost in the wetland park is about to break free!\"","Feng Ke's heart skipped a beat. \"Quickly gather people to go suppress it!\"","Wasn't that malevolent ghost being properly suppressed? How could it suddenly be about to escape? Could the sealing array have loosened?","He was just about to head to the storeroom to prepare high-level talismans when a familiar voice sounded from behind him.","\"Ake.\"","Feng Ke turned around in pleasant surprise. \"Master!\"","It was Yu Lanzhi, the sect master of the Hengfeng Sect.","\"Where are you going?\"","Feng Ke reported, \"Master, the malevolent ghost at the wetland park is emerging. Before the suppression array completely fails, I wanted to take my fellow disciples to reinforce it.\"","\"You, a Level Five Celestial Master, can confront a Quasi-Level Seven malevolent ghost?\" Yu Lanzhi asked calmly in return.","Feng Ke asked hopefully, \"Does Master intend to take action personally?\"","Yu Lanzhi was a Level Seven, First Tier expert. Dealing with a suppressed Quasi-Level Seven ghost would definitely be more than sufficient.","Instead of answering, he asked, \"How is your junior brother Wei?\"","\"Junior Brother Wei is undergoing interrogation at the Investigation Department.\"","Yu Lanzhi: \"Have you negotiated with them?\"","\"Yes.\" Feng Ke lowered his head in shame. \"It was my lapse in management that allowed my junior brother to cause this trouble.\"","He had actually warned his junior brother, but the latter hadn't listened.","Yu Lanzhi sighed lightly, his tone sorrowful and compassionate. \"The malevolent ghost's emergence requires significant talismans and array stones to suppress again. Our sect's talisman supply is insufficient. Huanyang is proficient in talisman arts. Call the Investigation Department and have them release him for now.\"","\"Master?!\" Feng Ke looked up in astonishment.","Yu Lanzhi's expression was unreadable. \"Hmm?\"","Feng Ke's heart pounded with fear. Bracing under the pressure, he asked, \"Does Master intend to exchange suppressing the fierce ghost for Junior Brother Wei's freedom?\"","\"It's merely a coincidence,\" Yu Lanzhi said indifferently, sweeping a glance at him. \"Go handle it.\"","\"...Yes.\"","Yu Lanzhi stood on the high platform, gazing into the distance at the soaring black aura, his expression inscrutable.","The Investigation Department had directly arrested Wei Huanyang, showing no regard for their face at all.","If the official authorities wanted to make an example of the Hengfeng Sect first, how could he allow the other factions of the Mystic Arts world to laugh at them?","Investigation Department.","Upon learning the Hengfeng Sect's stance, the person in charge snapped the pen in his hand in two.","His eyes were bloodshot, the muscles on his face trembling.","\"What a fine Hengfeng Sect!\"","He had thought the matter was settled after Feng Ke's visit. Now it seemed the Hengfeng Sect was blatantly challenging the official authorities!","Truly audacious and unafraid!","Did they really think the authorities had no way to deal with a Level Six Red Ghost without them?","\"Headquarters... any instructions? What did Shen Hui say?\"","\"Director, headquarters' instruction is to follow Advisor Qi's command for this operation entirely. Investigator Shen also sent word that Advisor Qi has already set off for the wetland park.\"","\"And then?\" the director asked.","\"And then what?\"","The director: \"Didn't they say to follow command? Don't we need to dispatch personnel?\"","\"Investigator Shen said Advisor Qi's instruction is: if the department is interested, they can go observe the Level Six malevolent ghost, participate in the suppression, broaden their horizons, and enrich their experience.\"","The director: \"...\"","Wetland Park. A crescent moon hung like a hook in the sky.","\"There's a swamp inside, it's a restricted area,\" Shen Hui pointed at the sign ahead.","The park staff had already clocked out, the main gate shut tight. They had simply \"floated\" in.","Inside the park, the trees were lush and dense. With few neon lights nearby, the deep night was exceptionally eerie and sinister. Pale silver moonlight bathed the park, faintly revealing large bird nests on the tree branches.","Within the restricted area, a dense black aura almost blotted out the moonlight.","Tang Mian frowned. \"It's about to break out. Should we go in?\"","\"Mm.\"","Qi Quan channeled her spiritual power, rising into the air. The spiritual energy enveloped her body, flowing over her surface like water, allowing her to avoid the park's surveillance cameras.","Her toes touched the treetops, leaving no trace, her movement ethereal and graceful, like a fairy under the moonlight.","Shen Hui and Tang Mian exchanged a glance, both seeing awe and admiration in each other's eyes.","Merely being a Level Six Celestial Master wouldn't allow for such control of spiritual power!","The two followed closely, but their movements were noticeably heavier, causing leaves to rustle as they passed over the canopy.","Qi Quan alighted on a tree beside the swamp, looking down at the array on the verge of being destroyed by the black aura.","The operation of an array required spiritual energy to sustain it. This Level Six Red Ghost had been suppressed here, requiring a large amount of spiritual energy daily, presumably all supplied by the Hengfeng Sect.","A precise machine, missing any single component, could cause the entire system to collapse.","The same was true for arrays.","Once a flaw or omission appeared in any part of the array, its effectiveness would greatly diminish, giving the malevolent ghost a significant chance to break through and re-emerge.","Qi Quan asked, \"Since they could suppress it with an array, why not simply exterminate it?\"","Shen Hui said, \"This ghost was suppressed decades ago. I've only read about it in the Investigation Department's files. It's said that back then, the Celestial Masters' levels weren't high enough. This malevolent ghost was jointly suppressed by several Level Six Celestial Masters from the Hengfeng Sect. They were even injured in the process. After the suppression, they went into seclusion to cultivate, probably having gained some insights from the battle. Not long after, they broke through to Level Seven.\"","With several Level Seven Celestial Masters as pillars, the Hengfeng Sect rose to become the third major sect in the Mystic Arts world.","\"Since they broke through to Level Seven, why continue suppressing it?\" This ghost was nearly Level Seven, had committed countless killings, and should have been annihilated long ago. Why keep it, wasting spiritual energy to maintain the array?","Shen Hui shook his head. \"I don't know about that. However, with this fierce ghost here, the Hengfeng Sect's status in Longlin City has always been transcendent.\"","\"Hmph.\" Tang Mian scoffed.","System: [Wow, they couldn't have kept this ghost on purpose just for this very situation, could they?]","The official authorities' attitude towards the Mystic Arts world wasn't something the sects were completely unaware of, but due to their special abilities, the sects hadn't paid it much mind.","Take the wetland malevolent ghost, for instance. Once it broke free, the citizens of Longlin City would undoubtedly be harmed. The official authorities couldn't just stand by and watch. If they couldn't subdue the fierce ghost, they'd have no choice but to request the Hengfeng Sect's intervention.","Thus, they would be forced into a weaker position.","It had to be said, it was quite a clever open stratagem.","They just lacked a good beating.","The black aura at the center of the swamp had already formed a vortex. The fierce ghost's figure gradually became visible. It roared, crashing against the greatly weakened array, its expression excited and frenzied.","Qi Quan shot out a spirit talisman, landing on a damaged array stone.","The array suddenly glowed brighter, becoming more stable.","Fierce Ghost: ???","Realizing something, it abruptly looked up at the three figures atop the tree.","\"ROAR—\" It howled in rage, pounding the array with fist after fist. Its powerful ghost force struck, making the array sway precariously.","This array was only Level Six, a rather old and crude one. It probably couldn't withstand such a frenzied assault from the malevolent ghost.","Qi Quan remained perfectly calm. She asked the two nervously watching, \"Want to give it a try?\"","\"Try what?\" Shen Hui asked, bewildered.","Qi Quan smiled. \"Back then, the Hengfeng Sect's Level Six Celestial Masters broke through to Level Seven after battling this malevolent ghost. Don't you want to achieve a breakthrough through combat as well?\"","The two: \"...\"","They did want to, but the level gap was just too huge!","One was Level Two, the other Level Three. Facing a Level Six malevolent ghost, wouldn't they be pulverized to dust before they even got close?","Qi Quan drew a talisman in the air, and a pale golden talisman merged into the bodies of the two individuals.","\"Go,\" she said, waving her hand and sending both of them into the formation.","Before they could even react, they found themselves face-to-face with the malevolent ghost.","The oppressive aura of a Level Six malevolent ghost was utterly terrifying.","However, both of them had undergone professional training and managed to withstand the pressure with steely resolve.","Since they were already here, they might as well give it their all!","They didn't know what kind of talisman Qi Quan had drawn, so they didn't dare to rely on luck. Instead, they summoned their strongest abilities to confront the ghost.","The Malevolent Ghost: Aaaaaah! To think he was being used as a training dummy for two low-level Celestial Masters! He was furious!","He swung his dark energy, striking the duo who seemed sent just to be defeated.","Shen Hui and Tang Mian were both sent flying, coughing up blood. It felt as if their internal organs had been displaced.","The dark energy closed in again.","The two rolled on the ground, swiftly dodging, then with astonishing agility, leaped up from the ground and once again thrust their peachwood swords at the ghost!","The peachwood swords were magical tools they carried with them, usually only palm-sized, but they would enlarge when infused with spiritual power.","Their shallow spiritual power clashed with the thick dark energy, and they were sent flying back once more.","After several such exchanges, even if they weren't dead, they were seriously injured.","After observing a few rounds, Qi Quan calculated their critical limits. Just as the ghost was about to strike again, a talisman shot into the formation like a meteor and stuck firmly onto the ghost's body.","The Malevolent Ghost: ???","His ghostly power had suddenly regressed to Level Three, Third Tier!","The dark energy visibly thinned.","Tang Mian, being a Level Three Celestial Master, was the first to react. She shot an utterly astonished glance at Qi Quan before re-engaging in the fight.","To so effortlessly \"manipulate\" the ghostly power of a quasi-Level Seven malevolent ghost—what a terrifying level of cultivation!","Shen Hui was equally incredulous, but the battle was right before him, and he couldn't give up.","When the head of the Investigation Department arrived with his team, they saw the two locked in fierce combat with the ghost.","Wasn't it supposed to be a Level Six malevolent ghost?","Weren't Shen Hui and Tang Mian only Level Two and Level Three Celestial Masters?","Was this even scientific?","The other investigators also wore expressions full of question marks.","Only when Shen and Tang had exhausted their spiritual power and were about to resort to hand-to-hand combat did Qi Quan pull them out of the formation.","They collapsed to the ground, utterly spent, yet their spirits were extremely exhilarated.","During the fight, both had gained new insights.","The department head looked up and asked, \"Senior Qi, what should we do now?\"","Qi Quan looked down at the ghost and said calmly, \"Exterminate it.\"","Why keep it around for the New Year?","The department head felt a surge of... heroic passion welling up inside him. As long as this ghost was eliminated, the Hengfeng Sect would no longer be able to put on airs!","\"You give the order, and we'll carry it out!\"","Qi Quan glanced at the eager investigators, hesitated for a moment, then moved her fingers, adjusting the ghost's level to Five. \"Anyone who wants to try can enter the formation,\" she said.","It seemed a bit wasteful to exterminate it directly. Better to make use of this piece of trash.","Seeing how fiercely Shen Hui and Tang Mian had fought, the others naturally had ideas of their own. Hearing Qi Quan's words, they excitedly jumped into the formation, unleashing all sorts of attacks on the ghost.","The Malevolent Ghost: ???","So he was being used to farm experience points?","With a furious roar, he charged at these Celestial Masters who didn't know the meaning of death.","The system asked curiously, [Big shot, what was that talisman you gave to Shen Hui and Tang Mian earlier? Why didn't you give it to these people?]","Qi Quan: [It wasn't a talisman. I just tricked them.]","The system: [...Then why not trick this group?]","[They've already been fooled by Shen Hui and Tang Mian.]","[True.]","The system looked at the investigators in the formation who were fighting as if their lives depended on it, feeling a deep sense of sympathy for them.","Hengfeng Sect.","Yu Ranzhi waited and waited, but still hadn't received any plea for help from the authorities.","He stood with his hands behind his back on a high platform and asked, \"Has the call come?\"","Feng Ke shook his head. \"No.\"","\"Could it be they plan to stand by and do nothing?\" Yu Ranzhi was surprised.","Feng Ke said, \"I heard the head of the Investigation Department personally led a team to the wetland park.\"","\"He's only Level Four. How dare he?\"","Feng Ke: \"I'm not sure.\"","An inexplicable sense of unease stirred in Yu Ranzhi's heart. The dark energy in the distance seemed to have thinned. The bright moonlight poured down, gradually covering the ghost's dark aura.","What on earth was going on?!","Wetland Park.","The group in the formation fought until they had used the very last bit of their strength before Qi Quan waved her hand and pulled them out.","Not just them—even the ghost was somewhat at his limit.","Although his ghostly power was strong, he had been suppressed to Level Five by that terrifying woman. Surrounded and beaten by a group of low-level Celestial Masters, he had consumed most of his ghostly power. It was enough to make him vomit blood.","This was the greatest humiliation of his ghostly existence!","He glared viciously at Qi Quan, about to spew curses, when a small peachwood plaque carrying immense force slammed into his ghostly form.","In the next second, the malevolent ghost vanished.","The peachwood plaque returned to Qi Quan's hand.","She said, \"I'm heading back first. Do as you please.\"","Then she turned and left with a cool and composed air.","Everyone: \"...\"","After a good while, an uninformed investigator quietly asked, \"Director, who exactly is she? It feels like that quasi-Level Seven ghost was completely outmatched in front of her, like a minor sorcerer meeting a grandmaster.\"","\"Watch your words!\" The department head would have given him a knock on the head if he could lift his arm. \"Who are you calling a grand sorcerer?\"","\"My mistake, that's just how I meant it. That ghost didn't even have a chance to perform in front of her.\"","\"Yeah, yeah, she even suppressed the ghost's level!\"","\"She's a true grandmaster.\"","The department head said cheerfully, \"Heh, she's our headquarters' consultant. With her here, our Investigation Department is set!\"","\"The head consultant!\" the investigator exclaimed in awe. \"Where did the higher-ups dig her up from? With cultivation like that, she could walk sideways anywhere she wanted, right? And she's willing to join the Investigation Department?\"","Look, would those old monsters from the sects and families be willing?","The department head: \"She has noble character and sterling integrity, far beyond what those scum can compare to. Don't sully the head consultant's name.\"","\"My apologies.\"","The dark energy in the wetland park completely dissipated. Celestial Masters observing from the shadows were all filled with suspicion and doubt.","Cultivator Chat Group (Unofficial).","[Pay-to-Win Taoist: Holy crap, how did it suddenly disappear? Did Hengfeng Sect fix the formation?]","[Toe-Picking Taoist: No way, no way? Did the Investigation Department compromise? Did Hengfeng Sect gain the upper hand?]","[Hair-Loss Taoist: Sigh, I have a feeling those sects and families are going to become even more unrestrained.]","[Pay-to-Win Taoist: To be honest, the Celestial Masters Association is now controlled by those major sects and families. Life isn't easy for us rogue cultivators either. Just look at my nickname. If you want to take on jobs and build a reputation, don't you still have to send some \"gifts\" upwards?]","[Hair-Loss Taoist: It's best not to say such things at a time like this, in case someone finds out and makes things difficult for you.]","[Pay-to-Win Taoist: I just want to do some practical work and not waste this cultivation.]","[Toe-Picking Taoist: Just lay low. Has Brother Melon gone silent?]","[Hair-Loss Taoist: But I haven't heard that Wei Huanyang was released. Could it be that Hengfeng Sect had a change of heart this time?]","[Pay-to-Win Taoist: Unless Feng Ke had a change of heart.]","[Melon-Eating Taoist: I'm not silent, I'm over the moon!]","Toe-Picking Taoist: Brother Melon has been driven mad by the blow. One second of pity.","[Melon-Eating Taoist: Latest news: The Longlin City Investigation Department subdued the Level Six Red Ghost! Hengfeng Sect's plan failed! Hahahahaha!]","[Pay-to-Win Daoist: Are you still dreaming? The person in charge of Longlin City is only level four, right? Subduing a level six Red Ghost? Cheating, huh?]","[Hair-Loss Daoist: Brother Melon, tell us more!]","[Melon-Eating Daoist: Don't you all know that the Investigation Department has hired a top expert as the Chief Consultant?]","[Toe-Picking Daoist: How top? Higher than a level six Red Ghost?]","[Melon-Eating Daoist: Mhm.]","[Hair-Loss Daoist: Really? Is this for real? That must be level seven then?!]","[Pay-to-Win Daoist: Even if it's level seven, it shouldn't be that easy, right? I heard the Wetland Malevolent Spirit is quasi-level seven.]","[Melon-Eating Daoist: Even the authorities don't know exactly how high her cultivation level is.]","[Hair-Loss Daoist: Brother Melon, are you sure you didn't mistype? Her? A woman?]","[Melon-Eating Daoist: No mistake.]","[Hair-Loss Daoist: Oh my heavens! From now on, the Chief Consultant is my goddess! I want to follow in her footsteps! Friends, I want to join the Investigation Department, any of you have the same thought?]","[Pay-to-Win Daoist: Before that, I have a question.]","[Toe-Picking Daoist: I also have a question.]","[Melon-Eating Daoist: Want to ask why I know the Investigation Department's affairs so clearly?]","[Pay-to-Win Daoist: Yes.]","[Toe-Picking Daoist: Exactly.]","[Melon-Eating Daoist: It's exactly what you're thinking.]","[...]","[Hair-Loss Daoist: So, Brother Melon is already on the government payroll? Sob sob sob, please introduce me! I want to join! I want to see the goddess!]","Longjing City Investigation Department.","The young man put down his phone, rubbed his buzz cut, and hummed a cheerful tune.","Suddenly, someone knocked on the door.","\"Come in.\"","\"Captain, a level four Red Ghost has appeared at Longjing University.\"","The young man stood up briskly, twirling the peach wood hammer on its thin cord with his index finger. \"Grab one more person, let's go together.\"","Longjing University, Girls' Dormitory.","Su Nuanuan clutched the gourd-shaped jade pendant around her neck, hiding in a corner and desperately tapping her phone.","Perhaps due to a magnetic field disturbance, her phone had no signal at all.","Her roommates were already unconscious, and her jade pendant had several cracks. It probably wouldn't hold out much longer.","In the darkness, a pair of sinister crimson vertical pupils stared coldly at her, occasionally emitting low growls. Yet, wary of the gourd jade pendant, it dared not approach.","...","The gourd jade pendant emitted a faint halo of light, but this halo was quickly fading.","Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu, being nearby, sensed the sinister aura and rushed to the scene immediately.","They had looked for Su Nuanuan during the day, but she seemed fine then. Her roommates had only suffered minor injuries before, and no trace of ghosts or monsters was found on campus, so they had to put the matter aside temporarily.","Who would have thought the ghost would appear tonight.","\"Level four Red Ghost.\" Ning Zhi pulled out his peach wood sword, spiritual power coating his body, and whooshed towards the third floor.","He hovered in mid-air and knocked on the balcony door.","\"Su Nuanuan, it's me.\"","The campus was silent in the dead of night, all lights in the dormitory building were off, not a glimmer of light.","Under the shroud of the ghost's dark energy, the other dorm rooms couldn't hear any commotion.","In her moment of despair, Su Nuanuan heard Ning Zhi's voice.","She looked towards the outside of the balcony in pleasant surprise.","His body, enveloped in spiritual energy, glowed faintly, especially conspicuous in the pitch-black night.","Clutching her pendant tightly, ignoring the frantic shrieks of the creature with crimson eyes, she rushed to the balcony door and quickly opened it.","Ning Zhi didn't barge recklessly into the girls' dorm. He stood on the balcony, his peach wood sword striking like lightning towards the Red Ghost in the corner. The Red Ghost let out a piercing wail, its crimson eyes dimming slightly, even revealing a hint of pleading.","The sword tip hesitated.","Ning Zhi's expression turned serious. \"Binding Spirit Talisman, go!\"","The talisman hit the Red Ghost, which was then unwillingly sucked into the talisman.","The viscous dark energy instantly dissipated.","Ning Zhi put away the Binding Spirit Talisman and immediately turned around. \"It's safe now. You should go back and rest.\"","Only then did Su Nuanuan notice she was wearing pajamas.","Oh my goodness!","She quickly crossed her arms in front of her chest, her face slightly flushed. \"Thank you.\"","Ning Zhi: \"That jade pendant of yours is about to lose its effectiveness. You'd better get a new one.\"","\"But Sister Quanquan gave this to me!\" Su Nuanuan said, heartbroken. \"It's very powerful!\"","She knew the pendant was almost spent, but she couldn't bear to part with it. Besides, such a valuable item—how could she have the nerve to ask Sister Quanquan for a new one?","Ning Zhi: \"...\"","He said nothing more and simply jumped down from the balcony.","Just as he landed, before he could even speak to Chen Feilu, three people appeared before them.","\"Captain, the Red Ghost is gone,\" one of them said, looking at Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu.","Ning Zhi looked up, his gaze falling on the young man with the buzz cut, a hint of surprise in his expression. \"What are you doing here?\"","\"You can be here, why can't I?\" The buzz-cut young man twirled his peach wood hammer, snorting with a laugh.","Ning Zhi: \"I study here.\"","Buzz-cut young man: \"...\"","His two teammates secretly covered their mouths to stifle laughter.","Chen Feilu smiled, breaking the awkwardness, and asked Ning Zhi, \"Ning-ge, your friend? Aren't you going to introduce him?\"","Ning Zhi opened his mouth.","\"Not friends,\" the buzz-cut young man extended his hand, his handsome, rugged face wearing a somewhat roguish expression. \"Di Meng. Ning Zhi's opponent from the Mystic Arts Competition back in the day.\"","Chen Feilu smiled and shook his hand. \"So it's the runner-up from the Mystic Arts Competition! My apologies, my apologies!\"","\"Pfft—\"","The teammate ultimately couldn't hold back and laughed out loud.","Di Meng: \"...\"","This kid is sharp. How did he end up with Ning Zhi?","\"Alright, enough chit-chat,\" Di Meng withdrew his hand and looked at Ning Zhi. \"Was it you who captured the Red Ghost just now?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Since you still have to study, I'll take it back to the department.\"","Ning Zhi didn't refuse and handed him the Binding Spirit Talisman.","...","\"By the way, I heard you were questioned by the Taoist Master Association for colluding with a dark cultivator, and that's why you had no choice but to join the Investigation Department?\" Di Meng looked at him with a teasing glint in his eyes.","Ning Zhi said earnestly, \"It wasn't 'had to.' It was 'turning over a new leaf.'\"","\"I like that answer!\" Di Meng patted his shoulder. \"To be honest, back at the Mystic Arts Competition, you were the one I admired the most. Keep it up, do well!\"","Ning Zhi suddenly asked, \"Did you join a long time ago?\"","Di Meng smiled, leisurely twirling the thin cord. \"Definitely earlier than you.\"","\"I'll give that same line back to you,\" Ning Zhi said solemnly.","Di Meng: \"What line?\"","\"My most worthy opponent.\"","Di Meng was surprised. \"Not Yan Huai? He was first place!\"","\"Aren't you too?\"","\"I lost to him, it left a shadow!\" Di Meng complained. \"He's like a human weapon!\"","Ning Zhi: \"...\"","\"Forget it, let's not talk about him,\" Di Meng waved his hand. \"How about you tell me about that 'dark cultivator' in Longjiang City?\"","Ning Zhi: ...","\"It's very late. You should take the Red Ghost and head back.\"","Di Meng: \"I'll look you up when I have time later!\"","Only the air answered him.","A teammate asked, \"Captain, are you interested in dark cultivators?\"","\"What dark cultivator? That's a senior master!\"","\"...\"","At that very moment, in a manor house dozens of kilometers away in the suburbs.","Yan Huai stood tall and straight, his expression stern and cold. Seated opposite him was a middle-aged man with a refined, scholarly face.","\"Yan Wu has been arrested. You know, right?\" the man asked.","Yan Huai: \"I know.\"","\"Although he is not a member of our immediate family, he still bears the Yan surname. I must understand the circumstances,\" the man said calmly. \"Go to Longjiang City and investigate thoroughly.\"","\"Yes.\"","\"And, do not neglect your cultivation while on this assignment.\"","Yan Huai: \"Understood.\"","He turned to leave.","\"Wait.\" The man stopped him. \"Remember my words clearly. You are going to investigate, not to pick a fight. Avoid antagonizing the Investigation Department if possible.\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Also, the Level Six ghost in the Longlin City wetlands has been subdued. Inquire about who was responsible for that.\"","\"Mm.\"","The man: \"...\"","He waved his hand in resignation. \"Forget it. Have Yan Geng accompany you.\"","Yan Huai offered no reply, turning and leaving the room."]},{"number":43,"title":"Chapter 43","paragraphs":["Longlin City.","Including the Hengfeng Sect, all the Tian Master forces have temporarily fallen silent.","Beneath the calm surface of the lake, undercurrents are swirling.","Within the Investigation Department, however, there is jubilation.","Having been \"drilled\" by the Level Six Fierce Ghost, all personnel who participated in the battle benefited greatly. Shen Hui and Tang Mian directly advanced in rank—the former jumping from Level Two, Third Tier to Level Three, First Tier, and the latter from Level Three, First Tier to Level Three, Third Tier.","The remaining few investigators also made some progress.","This operation can be said to be a resounding success.","Of course, the chief credit undoubtedly belongs to Qi Quan.","To be more accurate, all the credit belongs to Qi Quan, as the others merely had the opportunity to gain experience under the expert's control.","The expert possesses the ability to hold up the sky and the sea; they were just lucky to follow behind and get some scraps.","As soon as Qi Quan returned to her residence, she received a call from Li Guoyan.","\"Thank you very much, Consultant Qi, for your assistance to Longlin City. A bonus will be issued shortly. Please check for it in time.\" His words were quite formal.","Qi Quan: \"A pleasure working with you.\"","\"You are a person of true character, Master, so I won't beat around the bush.\" Li Guoyan changed his tone and said with a laugh, \"Master, now that you've captured that ghost, how do you plan to handle it?\"","Qi Quan asked bluntly: \"You want me to continue training troops in this way?\"","\"Exactly.\"","Qi Quan: \"Can you control this ghost?\"","\"That's why we ask you to spare some time from your busy schedule to add a bit of experience for our seedlings.\"","\"My time is precious.\"","Her lifespan was still too short, not enough for her to squander.","Li Guoyan replied without hesitation: \"How about issuing a bonus based on the effectiveness of each training session? It won't take up too much of your time—once a week, at the location in Longjiang City.\"","System: [Wow, they're really asking the seedlings to line up to be tortured.]","Qi Quan thought for a moment and replied: \"Agreed.\"","\"You probably still have the two Tian Master souls in your possession?\"","Qi Quan: \"What about them?\"","\"Yan Wu is dead. Currently, the only ones who might be connected to the evil cultivator organization behind the ghost marriage case are probably those two.\" Li Guoyan said solemnly, \"Keeping them with you is naturally the safest.\"","Qi Quan was surprised: \"Dead?\"","\"Yes, he suddenly exploded and died during the interrogation.\" Li Guoyan's voice sounded somewhat heavy. \"He was the most valuable Tian Master we had captured for information, but unfortunately...\"","Qi Quan: \"Without him, there will be others.\"","Li Guoyan laughed, \"Master, you are truly broad-minded.\"","After ending the call, Qi Quan sat on the bed to cultivate.","[Expert, \"Nation's Fortune Enduring\" has tipped \"Diary of a Wealthy Family\" with a thousand deep-water torpedoes!]","Qi Quan curved her lips into a smile. A few more missions, and she could live to a hundred.","The next day, Zhang Chengyan arrived early, bringing a sumptuous and delicious breakfast.","\"Master, are you returning to Longjiang today?\"","Qi Quan: \"Yes.\"","\"Then let's go together!\" Zhang Chengyan said excitedly. \"Master, why not ride in my car? I'm an extremely steady driver!\"","Shen Hui: \"...\"","Don't steal his job, okay?","Qi Quan: \"No need.\"","Zhang Chengyan sighed lightly: \"I feel so useless, never getting a chance to serve the Master.\"","\"...\"","Tang Mian shuddered all over. The white lotus tone was truly horrifying.","The system timely suggested: [Expert, how about bringing some Longlin City specialties back? Butler Su and the others have never been able to go out. Thinking about it, they're really pitiful. Why not bring them some specialties?]","Qi Quan was taken aback for a moment. Good idea.","She asked Zhang Chengyan: \"What are the specialties of Longlin City?\"","\"Specialties?\" Zhang Chengyan's eyes lit up. \"I'll ask my uncle right away!\"","He immediately ran out to make a phone call.","Shen Hui: \"...\"","He could have been asked too.","\"Master, news from the city bureau: the murderer of the female ghost has been found. It's a member of Huan Yang's own clan. They have been apprehended,\" he reported.","Qi Quan nodded.","System: [That young lady was truly pitiful. Even after death, her reputation was slandered. The murderer from the Wei family, relying on the backing of Tian Masters, was utterly lawless!]","Qi Quan: [Justice has long arms.]","Sometimes, it just hasn't arrived yet.","In no time, Wei Qi arrived, transporting a large quantity of local specialties.","Qi Quan took out her phone: \"I'll scan to pay.\"","\"No, no, no need!\" Wei Qi hurriedly refused. \"Master, you saved Xiao Qian's life. No matter how much I give, it's not enough. You mustn't give me money!\"","Qi Quan: Alright then.","She put her phone away.","Wei Qi was immediately delighted.","He personally moved a pile of specialties onto the car for Qi Quan's return journey and even stuffed Zhang Chengyan's car full, earnestly instructing his nephew: \"You must deliver all these things to the Master's home. Don't miss anything!\"","Zhang Chengyan: \"Don't you trust me to handle things? Even if I get lost, I won't lose the Master's things.\"","With everything loaded, Qi Quan got in the car and set off.","As soon as she returned to the Lakeside Villa, before the specialties could be unloaded, Meng Yunzheng came to visit.","Qi Quan handed the specialties over to Zhang Chengyan and the others and sat down in the living room.","\"Senior, I've already investigated some things about the northern suburbs, but I'm not sure how accurate the information is,\" Meng Yunzheng said respectfully.","After all, he hadn't seen the great ghost himself.","Qi Quan: \"Tell me.\"","\"Thirty years ago, Longjiang City wanted to develop its economy and began attracting investment. Many corporations came to Longjiang for development projects, which required a lot of land. One corporation took a liking to the area in the northern suburbs, but back then it wasn't empty land—it was a village.\"","Thirty years ago, the urban area of Longjiang City was very small; the northern suburbs fell under the category of countryside.","Qi Quan nodded: \"And then?\"","\"To get that land, they naturally had to relocate the residents first. Perhaps due to limited oversight at the time, the developers were overbearing and unreasonable. They threw some money at the residents, directly demolished the houses, and disregarded the people's demands.\"","System: [That's too much! Just because they have money doesn't mean they can do whatever they want!]","Meng Yunzheng sighed lightly and continued: \"That was the villagers' lifelong hard work! Before development could begin, the authorities had issued a notice stating that construction could only start after all villagers had relocated. Some villagers were willing to relocate, others were not. Conflicts arose between the unwilling villagers and the developers, which were only resolved after official mediation. But one household never agreed.\"","System: [Could it be that great ghost? Were they killed in a conflict with the developers?]","Qi Quan: ...","\"Actually, it wasn't that they disagreed.\" Meng Yunzheng continued: \"That family only had an old lady. Her son had gone to work outside and hadn't returned. Communication was difficult back then—no telephones, letters took many days to arrive. There had been no news from her son. The old lady refused to move, saying she would wait for her son to return.\"","\"She could wait, but the developers couldn't. Every day delayed meant more money down the drain.\"","Qi Quan's voice turned slightly cold: \"So they forcibly demolished the house?\"","Yes. During the forced demolition, the old lady desperately tried to stop them, was pushed to the ground, hit the back of her head on a brick, and didn't survive the rescue efforts.","System: [Wow! That's too cruel! What's the harm in waiting a few more days? She was just waiting for her son to return! It wasn't that she refused to relocate!]","\"A few days later, her son rushed back, only to see his mother's remains and his home razed to the ground.\"","... That kind of grief and regret is hard to understand for those who haven't experienced it.","\"It is said his father died early, and he was raised single-handedly by his mother. Their bond was extremely deep. He couldn't accept her sudden death, so he went to demand justice from the developers and even filed official complaints. But a dead person cannot be brought back to life. At most, he could only get the developers to pay some compensation and have the person who accidentally pushed his mother imprisoned. Since it wasn't intentional murder, a death sentence was impossible.\"","Qi Quan: \"How did he die then?\"","Meng Yunzheng shook his head. \"That part is truly unclear. He just suddenly disappeared. No one knew he had died.\"","\"However, two years later, after the factory was built and began operations, a major fire broke out not long after, burning down the factory and trapping many workers inside. Some speculated he had turned into a vengeful ghost seeking retribution.\"","Qi Quan, however, shook her head. \"If he were seeking revenge, he would surely target the developers from back then, not innocent workers.\"","\"If he truly had his wits about him, how could he have become a quasi-seventh-level powerful ghost?\" Meng Yunzheng was puzzled.","Qi Quan said, \"He hasn't killed anyone. That fire likely wasn't his doing either; it was probably just an industrial accident.\"","\"Then he...\"","\"He carries the radiance of virtuous merit.\"","Meng Yunzheng was confused. \"How could that be? A quasi-seventh-level powerful ghost possessing virtuous merit?\"","\"There is one possibility.\"","Meng Yunzheng smiled apologetically. \"This junior is ignorant. I beg senior to enlighten me.\"","Qi Quan spoke slowly and softly. \"It might be the fate of a Ten-Worlds Virtuous Being. If he hadn't suffered this ordeal in this life, his next life's fate would have been extremely noble.\"","Meng Yunzheng was startled, his eyes widening. \"A Ten-Worlds Virtuous Being?!\"","\"Yes.\" Qi Quan also felt a deep sense of regret. \"This life should have been his final one. If completed successfully, he would have been reborn into an exceptionally good destiny.\"","Therefore, after becoming a ghost, bolstered by the merit from his previous nine lives, he was able to grow into a quasi-seventh-level powerful ghost.","Of course, this was merely Qi Quan's speculation; she couldn't be entirely certain. Because one point was very strange: if he had become a ghost seeking revenge, as a quasi-seventh-level powerful ghost, he should have long broken free from the shackles of his place of death to go and exact vengeance.","Why did he remain in the northern suburbs?","The system was shocked: Does he himself know about this?","Qi Quan: Generally, one knows after death.","The system felt immense heartache: Then he... is just too tragic.","Just one lifetime short of completing his virtuous merit and being reborn into an extremely noble fate.","Argh! It's infuriating!","But—","Master, how do you know this was the final lifetime? Couldn't it be the ninth or eighth?","Qi Quan: Because only upon death in the final lifetime can one receive the merit from the previous nine lives, combined with this one to achieve completion. However, this lifetime itself hasn't truly been fulfilled.","Perhaps because of this, even with the aid of nine lifetimes' worth of merit, it still took the ghost thirty years to only reach the quasi-seventh level.","Qi Quan had never seen a Ten-Worlds Virtuous Being; she had only read about them in books. Everything was merely conjecture.","She asked, \"What about the developers from back then?\"","\"After the factory incident, the developers suffered losses and lived in destitution,\" Meng Yunzheng said. \"He died of illness ten years ago.\"","With the person dead, the karmic debt was settled.","Qi Quan said calmly, \"What do you plan to do next?\"","\"It's like this,\" Meng Yunzheng replied. \"Senior, I think we may need to communicate with the powerful ghost.\"","They truly couldn't find out the cause of the powerful ghost's death. They must meet him to clarify things before they can give him a proper resolution.","Due to the events of the past, the powerful ghost resents those developing the land in the northern suburbs, which is why the Song family encountered mishaps.","Judging from the previous minor accidents, he knew the Song family wasn't the one who developed the land back then... so initially, he just gave small warnings. But since the Song family continued their development project on his \"territory,\" he had to resort to severe measures to make them back off.","Now that the Song family has dispersed their wealth and the whole family is crammed into a cheap rental, with no further accidents occurring, and the injuries of Mr. Song and his son healing remarkably fast, it's evident this powerful ghost is quite reasonable.","Truly worthy of a Ten-Worlds Virtuous Being.","Qi Quan nodded and said, \"You can try.\"","Meng Yunzheng asked hopefully, \"This junior has little experience and a low cultivation level. If I make a mistake facing the powerful ghost and anger him, wouldn't the loss outweigh the gain? I wonder if senior could spare the time to come along? You wouldn't need to speak, just lend this junior some courage.\"","After all, that's a quasi-seventh-level powerful ghost, the kind who could take a life in a fit of anger. He didn't dare joke about such matters.","Qi Quan happened to be interested in the Ten-Worlds Virtuous Being as well. Upon hearing this, she nodded and said, \"Tell me once you've set the time.\"","\"You just returned from Longlin City. Rest for a day. How about tomorrow?\" Meng Yunzheng asked.","Qi Quan nodded.","Actually, the business trip wasn't very tiring. She had already replenished her expended spiritual power during the journey.","Longjiang City Station.","Yan Geng carried a light travel bag, following behind Yan Huai. He was thin and small, his entire frame hidden behind the tall Yan Huai.","\"Brother Huai, should we find a place to stay first, or go to the Investigation Department first?\"","He walked with his head down, not noticing Yan Huai had stopped, and bumped into his back with a thud. He asked blankly, \"What's wrong?\"","Yan Huai lifted his head to look towards the northern part of the city, his brow slightly furrowed. He said coldly, \"There's a powerful ghost.\"","\"Ah?\" Yan Geng followed his gaze and his expression changed. \"How could such a powerful ghost appear in Longjiang City? Should we go and subdue it?\"","Judging by the density of the dark energy, its level was no less than sixth.","Although his Brother Huai was only at the sixth level, once his sword left its sheath, he could challenge opponents above his level. Vanquishing a sixth-level ghost wouldn't be a problem.","Yan Huai observed intently for a moment, then withdrew his gaze. \"Let's go to the Investigation Department first.\"","\"Alright.\"","Longjiang City Investigation Department.","Due to Yan Wu's explosive death, the atmosphere in the department was heavy.","He was a big fish. Digging deeper could likely have uncovered the mastermind behind it all, but unfortunately, the big fish was gone.","\"Do you think, since this Yan Wu is from the Yan family in Longjing, could it be that...\"","\"That's the Yan family. Without sufficient evidence, would you dare approach them?\"","\"I'm just speculating. Could we follow this line of investigation?\"","\"Investigate the Yan family? The number one great family in Longjing is no joke.\"","Great families have countless methods. If they truly did evil, they would hide it very deeply. How could they let people discover it easily?","\"Sigh, just who is so sinister, arranging ghost marriages all over the country? What's the purpose? Logically, with such capability, they shouldn't lack money.\"","\"Who knows.\"","\"Stop chatting. Someone's coming from outside.\"","\"Who is it?\"","\"It's someone from the Yan family! Remember the Mystic Arts Grand Competition two years ago? The champion whose sword never left its sheath the entire time, Yan Huai!\"","\"Wow, a sixth-level expert!\"","\"Is he here because of Yan Wu?\"","\"Definitely.\"","At the entrance of the Investigation Department, Yan Huai and Yan Geng verified their identities and were led inside by a staff member.","\"He died suddenly from an internal explosion last night during interrogation. His body already... only a few scraps of cloth remain.\"","Yan Huai's steps halted. \"He's dead?\"","He didn't know Yan Wu was already dead before coming.","\"We absolutely did not use torture during interrogation. If you don't believe us, we can provide the interrogation recording.\"","Yan Huai said expressionlessly, \"Please provide the interrogation recording, as well as the evidence your department used to apprehend Yan Wu.\"","\"Certainly.\"","The staff led the two into an empty office and provided backups of the evidence and interrogation video.","Yan Huai opened the file first.","It detailed the facts and evidence of Yan Wu's illegal and criminal activities.","Ghost marriages, killing police officers, harboring criminals, and so on—each and every incident was clearly listed, with a complete and sufficient chain of evidence, leaving no room for error or fabrication.","Yan Huai's voice was cold as he asked, \"Which branch of the family is Yan Wu from?\"","By \"which branch,\" he meant a certain collateral line of the Yan family.","The Yan family had been passed down for centuries, with deep roots and lush branches, making its personnel extremely complex. Just the main lineage to which Yan Huai belonged had many branches. There were at least several hundred clansmen of Yan Huai's generation, not to mention those elders with extremely long lifespans.","Yan Geng answered honestly, \"He should be from the line of the family head's third cousin.\"","Third cousin?","Somewhat close to the family head, but rather distant from Yan Huai. He had focused on cultivation since childhood, hardly recognizing everyone in the main family, and had even less impression of these more distant cousins.","Yan Huai lowered his eyes, closed the file, and opened the interrogation video.","In the interrogation video, Yan Wu revealed nothing and did not confess. The Investigation Department personnel could do nothing with him and had no choice but to leave him aside. Unexpectedly, last night, in the unsupervised interrogation room, Yan Wu's eyes suddenly bulged, and his flesh and blood exploded.","The moment his body burst, the surveillance was also destroyed, capturing only an instant of the scene.","Even that brief instant was enough to send a chill down one's spine.","Yan Geng was puzzled, \"He didn't say anything, right? Why did he die suddenly? Was it self-destruction or...\"","\"Abandoning the pawn to save the king,\" Yan Huai said with a stern expression, turning off the video.","Yan Geng asked doubtfully, \"But given Yan Wu's tight-lipped nature and the Investigation Department's interrogation progress, there was no need for such a move.\"","Yan Huai said, \"There was a change last night.\"","\"What change?\"","\"Father instructed me to find out the reason.\"","Yan Geng's expression changed slightly. \"You mean, the person behind him was worried we would use the family's methods to make Yan Wu talk?\"","But Yan Huai had just received the order last night; only a handful of people knew. Who could have learned the news in such a short time and remotely caused Yan Wu's death?","Wasn't this too unbelievable?","Yan Huai stood up and left.","The Investigation Department's information was no longer useful. Yan Wu's inexplicable death made him sense a whiff of conspiracy.","\"Brother Huai, where are we going now?\"","\"To Longlin City.\"","\"What for?\"","\"To find out who subdued the Wetland Fierce Ghost.\"","\"Oh, okay. Then what about the powerful ghost in Longjiang City we just saw? Do we ignore it?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Alright.\"","Longlin City, Hengfeng Sect.","Yu Lanzhi was also having people search for the one who subdued the ghost.","He really didn't want to believe that the Investigation Department could have a celestial master with such profound cultivation.","Feng Ke came to report, \"Master.\"","\"Did you find anything?\"","\"Disciple discovered this on the formation stones in the marshland.\" He handed over a talisman paper.","This was left behind by Qi Quan when she repaired the formation last night.","The talisman had already lost its efficacy and was now a spent talisman, but the cinnabar marks were still clearly imprinted on the paper.","Yu Lanzhi, with his rich experience, could tell at a glance the masterful skill in talisman art possessed by the one who drew it.","He narrowed his eyes and sighed, \"Who exactly is this person?\"","Feng Ke remained silent.","...","With the Wetland Fierce Ghost destroyed, overnight, the status of the Hengfeng Sect seemed to plummet. Previously, the sect's gates were bustling with activity, but now they were deserted.","All the various forces in Longlin City had quieted down.","They felt the official's strong stance and, after seeing the Hengfeng Sect's defeat, none dared to stick their necks out anymore.","If this continued, the mystical world of Longlin City would be suppressed by the Investigation Department.","\"How is Huan Yang?\" Yu Lanzhi asked.","Feng Ke lowered his head and said, \"He violated the law. It's said he will face trial and will likely go to prison.\"","\"...\"","Yu Lanzhi handed the talisman paper back to him. \"Take a photo and send it to other sects and families. Ask if they have ever seen a celestial master with this style of talisman drawing.\"","\"Yes.\"","Every renowned talisman master has their own unique style of drawing talismans. The more profound their cultivation, the more distinct this style becomes.","Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan had just finished coding a chapter when she received a call from Chen Feilu.","\"Master, last night Brother Ning and I caught a fourth-level red ghost!\"","Qi Quan put the phone aside on speakerphone, ate some fruit, and leaned back on the sofa by the floor-to-ceiling window.","\"Not bad.\"","Chen Feilu said, \"I haven't told Steward Su about this yet, afraid he might worry.\"","\"Is it related to Su Nuannuan?\"","\"Yes. It's also thanks to the jade pendant you gave her, otherwise she would have suffered too,\" Chen Feilu said. \"But this is the first time I've seen a ghost formed from animals.\"","\"Oh?\"","\"We handed the ghost over to the Investigation Department. They told us this morning that the ghost was formed from the combined souls of some cats and dogs, all of whom were cruelly tortured and killed. They died horribly.\"","The system was indignant: 【Cats and dogs are so cute, why torture and kill them!】","\"It was done by one of Su Nuannuan's roommates. In high school, her family was extremely strict, which drove her to psychological distortion. She vented all her dark emotions on stray cats and dogs. It's truly cruel! However, those cats and dogs had no consciousness, had harmed innocent people, and have already been dispersed. Su Nuannuan's roommate was expelled from the university because of this.\"","Qi Quan's brow twitched. \"Strictly managed?\"","\"Yes. Her parents wanted their daughter to become a phoenix, forcing her to study every day and not allowing her to do anything else. Well, now she did get into Longjing University, but she became psychologically twisted.\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She forced Ling Sheng to study every day. Could she also drive him to become twisted?","She asked hesitantly, \"Then besides studying, what else can one do?\"","Chen Feilu didn't expect the Master to be interested in this. Without thinking, he said, \"Studying with your head buried in books all the time isn't good for psychological growth. You need to go out and relax at appropriate times. When I was in high school, although my parents were strict with me, they occasionally took me out on weekends. A balance between work and rest, you know.\"","Qi Quan: \"I see.\"","She was making Ling Sheng study textbook knowledge and also learn to draw talismans. Thinking about it carefully, since Ling Sheng arrived at the house, he had been trapped by the word \"study\" and had never gone out.","Qi Quan hung up the phone and called for Su Rong.","\"Steward Su, are there any places for entertainment nearby?\"","Su Rong: ?","He smiled and asked, \"What kind of entertainment does the Master mean?\"","Qi Quan: \"The kind where one can relax.\"","Su Rong shook his head. \"I'm not really sure about that. However, Young Master Du and the others are probably very familiar with Longjiang City's entertainment venues. Why not ask them?\"","\"That works too.\"","Su Rong asked curiously, \"Does the Master want to go out and relax?\"","Qi Quan said, \"Not me, it's for all of you.\"","She shouldn't favor one over the others; taking Ling Sheng but not the ghost servants wouldn't be fair.","It would be best to find a place that doesn't... require ID for entry. Ling Sheng had been back for so long, and she still hadn't taken him to get an ID.","To be precise, he was still living off the books.","It wasn't that Qi Quan didn't want to help him get one, but the timing wasn't right yet.","\"All of us?\" Su Rong's eyes curved into a smile. \"The Master is taking us out to play?\"","\"Mm.\"","\"Then I'll go ask Young Master Du and the others right now.\"","Su Rong smiled and left the room, opening the group chat.","【Su Rong: Are there any places nearby suitable for four people to have fun?】","【Yang Su: Oh, Steward Su is going out to play?】","【Du Jiaming: The autumn weather is clear and crisp, it's truly a great season for an outing. Housekeeper Su, would you prefer something relaxing or something more thrilling?】","【Su Rong: Anything that helps clear the mind is fine.】","【Zhang Chengyan: I have an idea! I heard there's a well-reviewed resort in Changshun County, under Longjiang City. It's only about an hour and a half drive away. Want to give it a try?】","【Yang Su: I agree! I was actually planning to check it out. If Master and Housekeeper Su are going, I'll cover all the expenses!】","【Du Jiaming: You think you'll cover it? Housekeeper Su, I've already booked the tickets for the day after tomorrow.】","【Zhang Chengyan: You're quick on the draw! Housekeeper Su, that's four people, right? I'll send a car to pick you all up the day after tomorrow!】","【Yang Su: Damn it!】","【Su Rong: Thank you for the suggestion. I'll go ask Master.】","He returned to the room and told Qi Quan about the resort.","Qi Quan nodded in agreement. \"Remember to inform Xue Hong and Ling Sheng.\"","\"Alright.\"","At ten o'clock in the evening, a new chapter of \"Diary of the Wealthy\" was updated.","[In fact, I could see ghosts since I was a child.","Once, on my way home from school, I saw a person floating in the village pond. Thinking someone was drowning, I quickly ran to the village to call for help. When I returned, however, there was nothing in the pond.","The villagers thought I was a \"boy who cried wolf\" type of child and scolded me disapprovingly. I desperately tried to prove I hadn't been mistaken, even describing the person's clothing and the large black mole on their chin.","But after I finished speaking, the way everyone looked at me changed.","\"Her parents just died, could she have seen something unclean?\"","\"What she described sounds exactly like Qi Erzhu, who drowned six years ago.\"","\"Oh dear, I always thought this girl was a bit eerie. Turns out she can see unclean things.\"","\"Stay away from her from now on, and don't get too close to her at school, understand?\"","Only then did I realize what I had seen wasn't a person, but a ghost.","From then on, no one would play with me, so I started playing with ghosts instead. I made quite a few ghost friends, and they were happy to be able to talk to a living person.","However, just as there are good and bad people, the same goes for ghosts.","I met two powerful ghosts.","They were truly formidable; all the ghosts in the village listened to them.","But, two tigers cannot share one mountain, and two powerful ghosts cannot share one village.","They both wanted to be the king among the village ghosts.","One ghost was benevolent, friendly towards the villagers, and had a strong sense of justice. If thieves or troublemakers appeared in the village, he would go and scare them away. The other ghost was malevolent, only wanting to increase his own power, regardless of the villagers' lives or deaths.","Each ghost had their own followers, and neither would yield to the other.","But just as people can be greedy, so can ghosts. More and more ghosts, arrogantly wielding their supernatural ghostly powers, began to see the villagers as ants.","The benevolent ghost wanted to uphold justice but was threatened by the malevolent ghost using the villagers' lives.","One day, an outsider ghost appeared in the village, intent on bringing disaster to the villagers.","The benevolent ghost, finding his strength insufficient, pleaded with the malevolent ghost to help protect the homeland they all depended on.","The malevolent ghost said, \"Let me be the boss from now on, and I'll help you get rid of this ghost.\"","The benevolent ghost was caught in a dilemma.","If he agreed, the home he loved would likely lose all justice in the future. If he refused, the outsider malevolent ghost would devour the entire village in the next moment.","What should he do?","I don't know what happened next, because I had already left the village for an orphanage.","At the orphanage, no one knew I could see ghosts. I made many friends, including ghost friends.","One day, a cute and pretty ghost friend was hiding in a corner, crying very sadly.","I approached her and asked what was wrong.","She said—]","The new chapter ended abruptly.","The readers were all stunned.","【Lose 20 lbs in 3 Months: Holy crap! The author actually left it here!!!】","【I Want Male Virtue Novels: Author, you have no heart!】","【Dying from Filial Piety: You actually learned how to cliffhanger, that's great progress.】","【Pythagorean Theorem abc: Author, update quickly, don't make me beg you on my knees!】","【If You See Me, Tell Me to Prepare Lessons: Hahahaha, author, you actually learned to cliffhanger, impressive!】","【Book Famine is Deadly: Ahhhhhh! What did she say?!】","【Today is Auspicious: One hundred depth charges!】","【Today is Profitable: One hundred depth charges!】","【Auspicious and Profitable: One hundred depth charges!】","This cliffhanger by Bai Shui Zhen Ren (White Water True Person) brought out many usually lurking readers. Everyone was on tenterhooks, venting their frustration in the comments.","The system was also unbearably curious: 【Big shot, please spoil it for me, ahhhhh!】","Qi Quan remained indifferent: 【Rejected for being ugly.】","System: ......","It never imagined that as a writing system that had read countless stories, it would one day be driven mad by a cliffhanger.","Ordinary readers focused on the last line.","Some who were in the know saw the deeper meaning within the text.","【Big shot, \"Nation's Fortune Enduring\" has thrown five depth charges for you!】","The system said in surprise: 【He used to throw a lot more before. Why only five this time?】","It wasn't complaining about the amount, just purely curious.","Qi Quan: 【Before, it was the salary and bonuses issued. This time, it's probably from his own pocket, spending his own money.】","【Oh, right.】","【Big shot, is the orphanage incident based on your personal experience from your previous life?】","Qi Quan: 【No.】","System: 【Didn't you think my suggestion to write about supernatural stories from your past life was good?】","Qi Quan: 【It was indeed good. What I wrote is someone else's story.】","【So, what exactly did that ghost friend say?】 The system still refused to give up.","Qi Quan pretended not to hear and focused on cultivating in peace.","Late at night.","In a cheap rental apartment in Longjiang City, Mrs. Song said tearfully, \"How could this happen?\"","Mr. Song's voice was full of bitterness: \"I don't know either.\"","After his injuries had mostly healed, he went out to look for a job. After all, he was once the chairman of Shengyuan Real Estate, with rich experience and considerable ability. Finding a job shouldn't have been difficult.","Unfortunately, no one was willing to hire him.","Some were willing to give him work, but with an intention to humiliate him, which Mr. Song could clearly see.","If he couldn't find a job soon, the family's livelihood would be hard to maintain.","Mrs. Song was slightly better off. With introductions from Mrs. Zhang and others, she found a job in jewelry design.","She used to do this, had some talent, but after getting married and having children, she rarely did it anymore. However, with money and leisure time, her understanding of jewelry wasn't worse than other professionals.","This job suited her well.","But she had just started and hadn't received a salary yet.","The family of three was about to face dire straits.","Song Lin recovered from his injuries extremely quickly and was already able to walk around with a cane. Pale-faced, he said, \"I'll go borrow some from Yingxue to tide us over, and also try my hand at stock trading.\"","Unless absolutely necessary, he didn't want to borrow money from his fiancée either.","Moreover, since he was discharged from the hospital, Qi Yingxue hadn't visited him once.","He had some suspicions in his heart, but he didn't dare to confirm them.","Mrs. Song's tears fell: \"No, I'll go borrow some from Wei Suhe and the others. They are still willing to help me.\"","While the Song family struggled to get by, Qi Yingxue had already returned to her film set.","After the Wei Xu case was resolved, the crew resumed filming.","To catch up on the schedule, and with a new actor for the male supporting role, everyone's filming workload was very heavy.","Qi Yingxue finished filming her scenes for the day, her head feeling heavy and muddled. As she headed to the changing room, she overheard a group of people gossiping not far from the corner.","\"Why is she still in the crew? How can they still use her?\"","\"She's the Qi family's young lady, how could they possibly kick her out?\"","\"What young lady? I heard she's actually a fake heiress.\"","\"Didn't you see the Weibo hot search last time? The comments she posted looked so vicious. You really can't judge a book by its cover.\"","\"If she's the fake heiress, then who's the real one?\"","\"Have you read 'The Rich Family Diary'? The author is probably the real one.\"","\"Ah? So she must know, right? And she still deliberately left nasty comments under the real heiress's novel?\"","\"Yeah, her character is really no good.\"","Their voices faded into the distance until they were completely gone.","The cool autumn night wind swept up dust from the ground.","Qi Yingxue felt a chill seeping from deep within her body. She couldn't help but crouch down, wrapping her arms tightly around herself.","\"Teacher Qi?\" A clear, pleasant voice sounded.","Qi Yingxue's heart skipped a beat. She stood up and turned her head.","It was He Yang, the newly cast male lead number two. Handsome and refined in appearance, with a gentle and composed temperament, he was thirty-two years old. He had acted in many series, remaining moderately popular in the entertainment industry for ten years until, two years ago, he suddenly exploded in popularity, his worth multiplying.","Taking on this role was merely to repay a past favor.","\"Teacher He, am I in your way?\"","He Yang smiled. \"No, I just saw you seemed upset. Was it because the director scolded you earlier?\"","\"No,\" Qi Yingxue shook her head. \"I'm just a little cold.\"","He Yang's expression remained gentle. \"I watched your scene earlier, Teacher Qi. You acted very well, very moving.\"","\"Thank you.\"","\"Teacher Qi, actually, judging from both your looks and your acting skills, you should be destined for great popularity. But recently, you might have hit a bit of bad luck, causing your career to dim somewhat.\"","Qi Yingxue inwardly mocked herself.","Wasn't she just having a run of bad luck?","Mocked by the entire internet, her family holding grudges against her, her fiancé suddenly falling from power, and now even minor roles in the crew could gossip about her behind her back.","Heh.","She forced out a resilient yet pale smile. \"Life always has its surprises. I'll be fine once I get over this hurdle.\"","He Yang nodded. \"You're right. However, once your luck is suppressed, as long as the person suppressing your fortune remains, you'll never be able to turn things around.\"","\"You—\"","\"Teacher Qi, it's late. Get some rest early.\"","Leaving these words behind, He Yang smiled and walked away.","Qi Yingxue stood rooted to the spot for a long moment.","Suppressed? By whom? Besides Qi Quan, who else... could it be?","Before Qi Quan returned, her life had been smooth sailing. When had she ever been this wretched?","Qi Yingxue suddenly thought of He Yang's career path.","Ten years of obscurity, then sudden, explosive fame.","Her heart gave a violent thump.","The next day, the sky was gloomy, dark clouds blocking the sun as the chill of autumn began to envelop the world.","Qi Quan got into Meng Yunzheng's car and headed for the northern suburbs.","After the Song family incident, all projects in the northern suburbs had been halted. On the desolate, remote plot of land, construction materials were piled beside the foundation, covered only with waterproof tarps, the unfinished foundation exposed.","The originally abandoned factory had already been demolished.","Meng Yunzheng parked the car by the roadside, looked up at the towering black energy, and let out a low whistle. \"Heard the Wetland Fierce Ghost in Longlin City was about this level.\"","Qi Quan: \"Mhm.\"","Both were Level 6 major ghosts, nearly Level 7.","However, the Wetland Fierce Ghost's energy was black tinged with red, while the ghost here in the northern suburbs had faint golden light shimmering within its black energy.","Meng Yunzheng also saw the golden light and sighed, \"What a shame, truly.\"","The two walked towards the source of the black energy.","Sensing their approach, the major ghost gradually directed its black energy to encircle them. Qi Quan protected herself with spiritual energy, so the black energy couldn't touch her and instead swirled around Meng Yunzheng.","Meng Yunzheng: \"...\"","Even a Ten-Worlds Virtuous Person picks the soft persimmon to pinch?","He was only Level 4, no match for a Level 6 major ghost.","But this ghost wasn't taking an attacking stance; it was just coiling its black energy around him. If he made the first move, the energy would likely shred him instantly.","Qi Quan stopped and looked at the most concentrated mass of black energy not far away. \"Come out.\"","The black energy churned and rolled, a hoarse voice emerging: \"Who are you? What do you want?\"","Knowing he was no match for Qi Quan, he dared not act recklessly.","Meng Yunzheng: \"Ji Shengzhe, we've already investigated the events of that year. If we can give you justice, are you willing to find release?\"","\"Release?\" Ji Shengzhe's voice was low and hoarse, each word seeming to weep blood. \"How can I find release?\"","\"You—\" Meng Yunzheng's eyes suddenly widened in shock, stunned on the spot.","A man's figure materialized within the black mist.","He had regular, decent features, the kind that should have belonged to a sunny, kind young man. But a pair of gloomy, dark eyes made him appear twisted.","What shocked Meng Yunzheng wasn't his face, but the strange, vein-like protrusions covering it.","These protrusions were embedded in his soul body, emitting a dim golden light—a light that originated entirely from the Virtuous Merit golden glow on his body.","In theory, the merit accumulated over nine previous lifetimes, carried into this tenth life, should have been blindingly bright, or at least brighter than a lightbulb. But the golden light on Ji Shengzhe's body was already thin and faint, and it was still continuously being siphoned away!","Meng Yunzheng was speechless with horror.","He had been forcibly trapped here for thirty years, and someone had cast a spell to steal his Virtuous Merit!","This was utterly, despicably outrageous!","All the carefully prepared words he had planned to say were thrown out of his mind.","If this had happened to him, he'd probably have gone mad long ago.","A Ten-Worlds Virtuous Person truly lived up to the name.","The system asked curiously: [Big Boss, why did Director Meng suddenly turn ashen-faced?]","Qi Quan's gaze was solemn: [Ji Shengzhe is trapped here by a spell. The Virtuous Merit on his body has also been almost completely stolen by someone.]","The system: [I beep— beep— beep—!]","All the swear words were blocked.","Anyone would turn dark after something like this!","Toiling hard accumulating merit for nine lifetimes, only to have the tenth life cut short... fine, at least the nine lifetimes of merit could ensure a pretty good reincarnation. But damn it, all the merit was actually stolen!","The system was furious to the point of incoherence. [Big Boss, if his merit hadn't been stolen, with nine lifetimes' worth, could he have directly become a Ghost King?]","And now, he was only a Level 6 ghost.","Qi Quan: [Probably.]","When she passed by before, she had glanced briefly and knew this ghost hadn't committed any killings, but she wasn't clear on the specifics. She hadn't originally planned to get involved, but now she changed her mind.","The person who stole the Virtuous Merit must not be forgiven!","\"Do you remember who killed you?\" she asked.","Ji Shengzhe shook his head blankly. \"I don't know. I don't even know how I died.\"","Qi Quan: \"I can break the forbidden art that's stealing your Virtuous Merit for you.\"","Ji Shengzhe: \"Condition?\"","\"No conditions.\"","Ji Shengzhe looked at her in surprise.","Qi Quan asked, \"Do you want it broken?\"","\"Of course!\" Even after suffering such injustice, Ji Shengzhe still retained a childlike innocence.","He seemed to have no wariness towards Qi Quan and agreed without hesitation.","Qi Quan walked up to him, her expression extremely cold.","She reached out her hand. Vast spiritual energy transformed into countless points of light, slowly seeping into Ji Shengzhe's soul body, attaching to the vein-like tentacles that were siphoning his Virtuous Merit.","\"It might hurt a bit.\"","As soon as the words fell, Ji Shengzhe let out a painful roar.","The spiritual power attached to the tentacles transformed into countless tiny hooks, deeply piercing them and pulling in one direction.","Qi Quan's expression was cold and detached, her fingertips slowly dragging the tentacles, pulling them out by the roots.","At the moment of separation, Ji Shengzhe's soul trembled in agony, yet simultaneously, he felt an extremely gentle spiritual power soothing his spirit.","His lips trembling, he arduously uttered two words.","\"Th... thank you.\"","Above the northern suburbs, the dark clouds slowly dispersed, and golden sunlight poured down, spilling over Ji Shengzhe's soul.","He felt a warmth he hadn't known in a long time."]},{"number":44,"title":"Chapter 44","paragraphs":["The forbidden technique was broken, and Ji Shengzhe felt a lightness wash over him.","Under the shroud of dark energy, his ghostly form was slowly suffused with a pale golden light, continuously nourishing his injured soul.","\"It's very difficult to retrieve merit that has already been seized,\" Qi Quan said calmly.","Ji Shengzhe hung his head. \"I know.\"","[Master! This is too tragic! Even if we find the villain and make him pay, Ji Shengzhe still won't be able to get a good reincarnation!] The system cried out in indignation.","Qi Quan smiled. \"But it's not entirely without a solution.\"","[Master!]","Ji Shengzhe's eyes lit up, looking at Qi Quan with surprise and hope. Meng Yunzheng was no different.","\"Senior, can lost merit really be taken back?\"","Qi Quan: \"Merit can change fate, commonly known as changing one's luck. A person with merit, barring external influences, often has a smoother path than others. However, for celestial masters, merit has limitations.\"","\"What do you mean?\" Meng Yunzheng had never heard of this before.","\"Celestial masters cultivate for longevity; they are people of great fortune to begin with,\" Qi Quan explained. \"The Heavenly Dao would not allow celestial masters to obtain merit without limit. Otherwise, using merit for cultivation, wouldn't they ascend to immortality very quickly?\"","\"The merit a celestial master can accumulate is limited. At each level, the amount of merit they can use is fixed.\"","Celestial masters attain the Dao and longevity, already having fewer cycles of reincarnation than ordinary people. They cannot accumulate merit like ordinary people do, to be used for a better next life.","If Ji Shengzhe could truly complete ten lifetimes of virtue, his next life might become a cultivator with supreme talent, with the merit accumulated over ten lifetimes all transforming into 'the favor of the Heavenly Dao.'","But after becoming a celestial master, there would be no more beyond that.","This is the limitation set by the Heavenly Dao.","For someone of Qi Quan's cultivation level, the amount of merit she could use was only about one-twentieth of Ji Shengzhe's. Even that one-twentieth, she hadn't yet accumulated enough merit usable at her current level.","Of course, celestial master cultivation doesn't necessarily require merit; one can advance in realm without it. However, having merit to assist increases the probability of a breakthrough.","Like opportunities or sudden enlightenment, merit is also something that can be encountered but not sought.","Moreover, it's not easy for celestial masters to accumulate merit. Celestial masters are born with the duty to exorcise evil and capture ghosts, but exorcising countless evils and capturing numerous ghosts doesn't guarantee accumulating merit.","Many celestial masters therefore don't fixate on merit, but there are also greedy ones who covet the merit of others.","\"So, the evil cultivator who used the forbidden technique, the merit he obtained from Ji Shengzhe couldn't possibly all be used on himself. It's very likely he stored it for other purposes,\" Meng Yunzheng analyzed.","Qi Quan nodded.","\"So, as long as we find this person and retrieve the stored merit from him, we can return it to Ji Shengzhe?\"","Ji Shengzhe looked excited.","\"But the merit might have already been used on someone else, with little left,\" Qi Quan said.","Ji Shengzhe said firmly, \"No matter what, finding it is what matters!\"","\"If the merit was used on an ordinary person, as long as that person is returned to their state before the luck change, the merit can be refunded. If it was used on a celestial master, the merit cannot be retrieved.\"","\"I'm already like this,\" Ji Shengzhe said with a bitter smile. \"How much worse can it get?\"","Qi Quan: \"Good.\"","She tossed out a peach wood talisman. The talisman floated in front of Ji Shengzhe.","As a powerful ghost, he could sense what this was.","But he didn't hesitate in the slightest.","Helping him break the forbidden technique that stole his merit had already made him immensely grateful.","He trusted her!","\"Is that all?\" Meng Yunzheng felt like he was dreaming.","Qi Quan: \"The culprit hasn't... been found yet.\"","Meng Yunzheng's expression turned solemn. \"The Investigation Department will spare no effort in the search!\"","Striving to recover as much merit as possible for Ji Shengzhe.","The system's anger also subsided: [Wuwuwuwu, Master, I love you so much! You are the light of this world!]","Qi Quan: ...","That's really not necessary.","[But Master, I still have a question.]","[Speak.]","[A celestial master who seizes another's merit, won't they incur heavenly retribution? And those evil celestial masters before, aren't they afraid of karmic retribution for doing so many bad deeds?]","Qi Quan said: [Doing bad things will be punished by law; this is a truth everyone understands. But every moment in the world, there are people committing evil deeds.]","Everyone understands the principle, but the hand that commits evil cannot be controlled.","[But celestial masters doing these things, aren't they afraid of their souls being scattered?]","Evildoers face punishment, but at least they still have a chance for reincarnation.","Qi Quan: [The law has loopholes, and the Heavenly Dao is not omnipotent. There will always be people who like to exploit gaps.]","The system was convinced: [That's true.]","Longlin City.","Just as Yan Huai exited the train station, he received a message on his phone.","[Father: This is a photo sent by the Hengfeng Sect. When subduing the wetland ferocious ghost last night, an expert left behind a talisman. The method of drawing this talisman is quite unique.]","He zoomed in to look carefully.","It was indeed different from ordinary talismans.","The Yan family had many talisman masters. Even if they came from the same school, each talisman master's method of drawing talismans was different.","It's like practicing calligraphy from the same copybook; everyone's results are different.","Who exactly is this expert?","Could it be an ace up the official sleeve?","Yan Huai hurried to the wetland park, applied an invisibility talisman, and flew with Yan Geng towards the swamp area.","The remnants of the formation were still in place, but without spiritual power to sustain it, it could no longer operate.","He carefully searched the surroundings but found no traces.","Yan Geng muttered, \"Brother Huai, do you remember last time at the Celestial Masters Association, we ran into that Ning Zhi from the Ning family?\"","\"Hmm.\"","Yan Huai wasn't truly arrogant to the point of ignoring everyone. At the very least, he had some impression of the second and third place winners of the Grand Alchemy Competition.","\"At that time, Fatty and I were discussing, saying Ning Zhi was colluding with an evil cultivator in Longjiang City and was summoned by the Celestial Masters Association for interrogation. You heard that too, right?\"","\"Hmm.\"","\"But not long after, Ning Zhi was released,\" Yan Geng said mysteriously. \"It's said that officials sent someone to negotiate with the Association and took him away. He's now working for the officials.\"","\"Hmm.\"","\"...\" Yan Geng said helplessly, \"Aren't you curious at all?\"","Yan Huai looked up towards the treetops. \"You want to say that the officials wouldn't recruit a celestial master who colludes with evil cultivators.\"","\"Yes, yes, yes!\" Yan Geng nodded vigorously. \"So there was never any evil cultivator to begin with. Then why did the Association want to convict Ning Zhi?\"","Yan Huai withdrew his gaze, his expression cold and stern. \"Righteous and evil, it's just a matter of different stances.\"","Who is righteous and who is evil isn't determined by words.","Yan Geng sighed. \"So what do we do now?\"","\"Return to Longjiang City.\"","\"Ah?\"","Yan Huai's figure flashed, and he was already out of the wetland park.","When the two returned to Longjiang City, they found the dark energy over the northern suburbs was gone.","Yan Geng rubbed his eyes, shocked. \"Brother Huai, it's gone!\"","That was a quasi-seventh-level powerful ghost!","Could the Longjiang City Investigation Department really have such a master—","Wait.","This scene felt familiar.","There was one in Longlin City, and now another appears in Longjiang City. It couldn't be... that the officials' masters are mass-produced, could it?","His eyes widened, and he exclaimed, \"The master is right here in Longjiang City!\"","Yan Huai ordered: \"First find accommodation, then go to the Celestial Masters Association.\"","\"Yes!\"","The most familiar with the local celestial masters' situation would be the Celestial Masters Association.","Lakeside Villa.","As soon as Qi Quan returned, she released Ji Shengzhe from the peach wood talisman.","Ji Shengzhe: ???","Why were there two other ghosts in front of him?","Su Rong smiled, \"The Master has brought back another one.\"","Xue Hong crossed her arms and said, \"Don't worry, he doesn't meet the Master's strict standards for taking on a ghost servant. He won't steal your job.\"","\"...\"","Ji Shengzhe felt that after being trapped for so many years, he could no longer understand modern ghosts.","\"Let me introduce, Ji Shengzhe, a Level Six Red Ghost from the northern suburbs,\" Qi Quan said succinctly.","Su Rong extended his right hand, \"Hello, I'm Su Rong, the butler here. If you need anything in the future, please don't hesitate to ask me.\"","Ji Shengzhe shook his hand in a daze.","\"I'm the family tutor,\" Xue Hong said with an air of a cool, capable older sister. \"If you have any questions, you can come to me.\"","\"...Hello, teacher.\"","\"Pfft.\" Xue Hong couldn't help but laugh.","This Level Six major ghost was a bit simple-minded.","She teased, \"You're a big celebrity in our Longjiang City now, the most mysterious topic of conversation in high society.\"","Ji Shengzhe: ?","\"Was it you who caused Song Lin's accident?\" Xue Hong asked.","\"Yes,\" Ji Shengzhe said seriously. \"I was trapped there, and the place is heavy with yin energy. Building a factory there was no good for them. I just wanted them to cut their losses in time.\"","Xue Hong raised an eyebrow, \"Wasn't there a bit of a desire for revenge?\"","\"...A little,\" Ji Shengzhe admitted sheepishly. \"My mother had an accident because of the demolition. I don't have much goodwill towards those developers.\"","Song Lin's suffering was not unjust; he should even be thanking Ji Shengzhe for his restraint.","Qi Quan said, \"You all chat, I'm going back to my room.\"","She returned to her room alone to cultivate.","As the butler, Su Rong was in charge of all matters in the villa. He was used to the Master occasionally picking up a pitiful ghost and bringing it home. The routine for hosting ghosts was familiar to the point of being second nature.","He led Ji Shengzhe to a room in the west wing and said, \"You'll stay here for now.\"","The room's appearance and decor were antique, reminiscent of classical Chinese gardens, yet fully functional, drawing exclamations of amazement from Ji Shengzhe.","\"A TV! Can I watch TV?\"","Su Rong: \"...\"","He recalled Ji Shengzhe's year of death. Back then, televisions weren't fully widespread yet; they were considered a major appliance, unaffordable for many families, so naturally, he never had the chance to watch one.","\"Of course you can.\"","Ji Shengzhe excitedly floated up, releasing wisps of black energy into the air as he played around.","Su Rong smiled slightly and turned on the TV.","After all, Ji Shengzhe was a ghost; he couldn't use any other household appliances anyway, so there was no need for further introductions.","The seventy-inch screen captured the Level Six major ghost's complete attention. He simply sat down on the carpet and began watching TV with rapt focus.","Su Rong left the room, giving him his space.","Longjiang City Taoist Master Association.","When Yan Huai presented his Level Six Taoist Master certificate, the association staff immediately beamed with enthusiastic smiles.","\"Senior Yan, how may I assist you?\"","Yan Huai's expression was cold, and he did not reply.","Yan Geng, standing beside him, spoke up, \"We'd like to check the list of Level Six and above Taoist Masters registered in Longjiang City.\"","The staff member was slightly taken aback. \"I'm sorry, but there are no registered Level Six Taoist Masters in Longjiang City, let alone any above Level Six.\"","...","\"How can that be?\" Yan Geng frowned. \"If there are no Level Six masters, then who subdued the major ghost in the northern part of the city?\"","And in such a short amount of time!","The staff member looked surprised, \"A major ghost in the north of the city?\"","\"You didn't know?\" Yan Geng's eyes widened. \"Doesn't the Taoist Master Association have a monitoring department? You didn't detect such a powerful ghost?\"","The staff member smiled stiffly, \"Sorry, I'm new here, not very familiar with this. There does seem to be a major ghost in the northern suburbs, but it's true that Longjiang City has no Taoist Masters above Level Six.\"","Actually, most Taoist Masters in Longjiang City had heard of the major ghost in the northern suburbs, even if they hadn't seen it themselves, but none paid it much mind.","That ghost never harmed anyone, and they couldn't defeat it anyway, so they just pretended it didn't exist.","The northern suburbs were far from the Taoist Master Association. Unless you flew up high, you couldn't see any towering black energy. Over time, everyone gradually forgot about it.","Yan Geng felt stifled by his dismissive attitude.","He said coldly, \"Now that the major ghost is gone, someone must have taken action. Are you sure Longjiang City really has no Level Six Taoist Masters?\"","\"Let me think...\" The staff member's eyes lit up as he remembered something. \"There should be one, but she's not on the association's registry.\"","\"If she's not on the association's registry, how do you know about her?\" Yan Geng's expression grew even more unpleasant.","This Longjiang City Taoist Master Association had serious issues with its work attitude!","The staff member noticed his dissatisfaction and immediately straightened up, adopting a serious tone. \"Because previously, a Senior Yan Wu came to the association to report that a female practitioner named Qi Quan, who didn't have a Taoist Master certificate, was privately handling paranormal incidents. My colleague and I went with him to visit her. As a result, Taoist Master Yan Wu was... well, defeated by her easily. Considering Yan Wu is Level Six himself, the opponent should be at least Level Six, I suppose.\"","Yan Huai lifted his eyelids, \"Where?\"","\"Pardon?\"","Yan Geng: \"He's asking where that Qi Quan lives!\"","\"Oh, Linhu Villa, Nanhu District.\"","Yan Huai turned and left.","Someone who could easily defeat a Level Six Taoist Master yet had never registered with the Taoist Master Association was very strange.","\"Brother Huai,\" Yan Geng caught up with him, \"do you think this Qi Quan could be a secretly trained expert by the official authorities?\"","Only practitioners cultivated by the official authorities wouldn't appear on the Taoist Master Association's registry.","Yan Huai didn't answer, his expression still stern.","The two moved extremely fast, arriving at Linhu Villa in just a short while.","Yan Geng was silent for a moment, then instinctively asked, \"Is this expert incredibly wealthy, or are the official authorities exceptionally generous to her?\"","This villa was truly impressive.","He stepped forward and rang the doorbell.","A moment later, the door opened. An extraordinarily handsome man, impeccably dressed and smiling, exuded gentlemanly demeanor.","Oh no, a male ghost.","A male ghost!","Yan Geng instinctively reached for his peach wood sword. Yan Huai glanced at him and pressed his hand back down.","\"Ghost servant?\" Yan Huai uttered two icy words.","Su Rong's smile faded as he met Yan Huai's gaze without fear. \"Can I help you?\"","\"I am Yan Huai, here to pay a visit to Taoist Master Qi.\"","Su Rong: \"...\"","The way he spoke was oddly formal and old-fashioned.","Sensing these two meant trouble, he said, \"The Master is cultivating and is not receiving visitors.\"","He moved to close the gate.","\"Wait!\" Yan Geng stopped him. \"Taoist Master Qi privately keeps ghost servants, and the official authorities don't intervene?\"","He was genuinely curious.","Keeping ghost servants was a forbidden art in the mystical community. How could the official authorities have no reaction at all?","It was too strange!","Even if the official... authorities valued Qi Quan, they wouldn't let her act so recklessly, would they? If that were the case, why bother rectifying the mystical community?","Might as well keep turning a blind eye.","He truly couldn't figure it out.","Su Rong's face turned cold as he slammed the courtyard gate shut with a smack.","Yan Geng: \"...\"","He looked up at Yan Huai. \"Brother Huai, what should we do now? Yan Wu has high cultivation; he shouldn't have been easily subdued by the Investigation Department. It was probably this Qi Quan who took action.\"","Yan Huai: \"Let's go.\"","\"Huh? Go where?\"","\"The hotel.\"","Back at the hotel, Yan Geng was still puzzled. \"Brother Huai, what do you think the official authorities are actually thinking? Isn't privately keeping ghost servants the mark of an evil Taoist Master? So, Ning Zhi associating with her really is colluding with an evil practitioner? The Taoist Master Association wasn't mistaken? My head is all muddled now.\"","Yan Huai: \"That ghost's aura is pure and righteous. It has never harmed anyone.\"","\"So?\"","\"There is no trace of coercion or gloominess.\"","\"Mhm, and then?\"","Yan Huai: \"The ghosts have not committed atrocities, and neither have the humans. So how can either be called evil?\"","\"...\"","Yan Geng's mindset still hadn't shifted. He hesitated, \"But, but the rules of the Xuanmen say...\"","\"The Xuanmen rules say the Master Association must constantly monitor local ghost activity. Neither side has followed the rules. Which one causes greater harm?\" Yan Huai's voice was cold and sharp.","Yan Geng was stunned.","He stared at Yan Huai in surprise, thoughtfully saying, \"Brother Huai, I've noticed you talk more now than you did in Longjing, and you're more willing to explain things to me.\"","Yan Huai: \"...\"","\"But thinking about it carefully, what you say makes sense.\" Yan Geng nodded. \"If Master Qi hasn't used ghost servants to harm people, then it is somewhat acceptable.\"","He was about to ask more, but saw Yan Huai had already closed his eyes to cultivate, so he shut his mouth.","Yan Geng quietly took out his phone.","He had a friend who previously studied at Longjiang University and stayed in Longjiang City after graduation. If Qi Quan was truly a master, he might be able to find out something.","[Yan Geng: I want to ask you about something.]","[Live to Gacha, Die to Gacha: Grinding a game! Wait a sec.]","Yan Geng waited ten minutes.","[Live to Gacha, Die to Gacha: What's up?]","[Yan Geng: Have you ever heard of a Level Six Master named Qi Quan?]","[Live to Gacha, Die to Gacha: Qi Quan? Heard of her! She's quite famous. But I don't know if she's a Level Six Master.]","Yan Geng's eyes lit up: [How is she famous?]","[Live to Gacha, Die to Gacha: [Link][Link][Link] Read these and you'll know. Each scoop is juicier than the last!]","Yan Geng: ...","The first two links were about Weibo, fine, but what on earth was the last one?","Scream Literature City's \"Diary of a Rich Family\"?","Are you sure you didn't send the wrong link?","Even though he didn't read novels, he knew this was a web fiction site.","[Live to Gacha, Die to Gacha: Why are you asking about her?]","[Yan Geng: We suspect she's the official expert. The fierce ghosts in Longlin City disappeared overnight, and the major ghost in Longjiang City also vanished suddenly. It should all be the official's doing.]","[Live to Gacha, Die to Gacha: It definitely is the official's doing, why even guess?]","[Yan Geng: ??? How are you so sure? Aren't you a rogue cultivator?]","[Live to Gacha, Die to Gacha: Ah, this... I've already decided to join the Investigation Department, so you better not get into trouble.]","[Yan Geng: !!!]","[Live to Gacha, Die to Gacha: Huh? Wait, you just said you suspect Qi Quan is the official expert who subdued the fierce ghosts? Why do you say that!]","[Yan Geng: We inquired at the Master Association. Her cultivation level should be Level Six or above. Also, the official poached Ning Zhi from the Association, who is on good terms with her. I think she's the expert the official values.]","[Live to Gacha, Die to Gacha: !!!]","Rogue Cultivators Group Chat.","[Gacha Daoist: Guess what I found out!]","[Balding Daoist: You're going bald?]","[Foot-Picking Daoist: Got a stye?]","[Gacha Daoist: ...]","[Gacha Daoist: I know who the expert is that led the Longlin City Investigation Department to subdue the fierce ghosts and utterly humiliate the Hengfeng Sect!]","[Balding Daoist: Ahhh! My goddess! Who is it!]","[Foot-Picking Daoist: Spill it!]","[Melon-Eating Daoist: How do you know?]","[Gacha Daoist: A friend asked me about someone. He suspects this person is the expert who captured the wetland fierce ghost. The expert is in the same city as me, so lucky! I'm applying to the Investigation Department right now!]","[Balding Daoist: So who is it already!]","[Gacha Daoist: Perhaps, have you read \"Diary of a Rich Family\"?]","[Foot-Picking Daoist: Who hasn't read it? The novel alludes to the ghost marriage case and the Yaoshan ghost. Many are sure the author is from the Xuanmen, and very likely from the official side.]","[Balding Daoist: You mean... Master Whitewater is the goddess?!]","[Foot-Picking Daoist: Holy crap, I've eaten her melons before. She seems to have saved a female celebrity who had acid thrown at her. There's a video of her saving someone online. I saw it. She looks to be in her early twenties at most!]","[Balding Daoist: No way? The expert is only in her twenties?]","[Gacha Daoist: If I haven't guessed her identity wrong, she should only be twenty-two. Not just looks twenty-two, but genuinely is twenty-two!]","[Foot-Picking Daoist: Oh my god...]","[Balding Daoist: Wuwuwu, then my goddess must be much more powerful than Yan Huai! Where's the video? I want to see!]","[Foot-Picking Daoist: Let me look... Huh, seems it was deleted. It's gone.]","[Balding Daoist: So sad.]","[Gacha Daoist: Don't be sad. Your goddess is serializing a novel.]","[Balding Daoist: Right! I'm going to shower \"Diary of a Rich Family\" with gifts!]","Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan finished cultivating and opened her eyes, hearing the system report.","[Great One, a user \"First in Line for Melons\" gifted you 500 Deepwater Explosions! \"Staying Up Balds\" gifted you 200 Deepwater Explosions! \"Can Grind Another Hundred Years\" gifted you 100 Deepwater Explosions! \"Foot-Picking Neighbor Next Door\" gifted you 100 Deepwater Explosions!]","Qi Quan converted it into lifespan and immediately felt refreshed and invigorated, thinking she could write for another five hundred years!","In a certain hotel room, Yan Geng clicked on the novel link to \"Diary of a Rich Family.\"","After reading the first chapter, it felt weird.","But since this was a novel written by a \"master,\" he patiently continued reading.","Huh? It seems quite interesting.","It was his first time reading a novel on his phone. He read slowly, time passing bit by bit, until the last chapter.","[She said—]","He frantically tried to scroll further, dumbfounded.","That's it? It ends here? What on earth did she say?","Yan Geng's heart felt like it was being scratched by a cat, desperate to know what that orphanage ghost friend said.","He was really so curious!","He held his phone, restless and fidgeting, and couldn't help but leave a comment asking the author when the next update would be, only to find—","[65987354: Comments posted by regular users and primary VIP users will be displayed after review!]","Ah, this...","Yan Geng felt even more anxious inside. What's wrong with this website? It doesn't even show comments!","\"What are you doing?\" A cold voice sounded.","His fidgeting state finally caught Yan Huai's attention.","Yan Geng said apologetically, \"Sorry, Brother Huai, I didn't mean to disturb your cultivation.\"","Yan Huai glanced at his phone. \"Spend less time on the phone, more time cultivating.\"","He was strict with himself and equally strict with close disciples from his clan.","Yan Geng said miserably, \"Brother Huai, I just can't focus on cultivating right now.\"","\"...\"","\"Brother Huai, do you read novels? How about I recommend one to you.\"","\"Yan Geng.\" Yan Huai's expression was stern.","Yan Geng: \"It's written by that official expert.\"","\"...\"","After a moment, Yan Huai asked, \"What novel?\"","Yan Geng tapped a few times on his phone. \"Sent the link to your phone.\"","Yan Huai sat upright, raised his phone to eye level, and slowly began reading.","First he frowned, then his brows relaxed, then frowned again, relaxed again, and at the end, it stopped abruptly.","Yan Geng chuckled and asked, \"Brother Huai, how do you feel?\"","Yan Huai: \"...\"","\"Isn't it itching at your heart, desperately wanting to read the next chapter?\"","\"...\"","\"Hey, is this expert doing this for extra cash? Is the official salary really that low?\"","Yan Huai finally spoke: \"Easy to understand.\"","\"Pfft—\"","Yan Geng burst out laughing. What was the difference between this evaluation and the \"amateurish writing\" comment in the review section?","\"Through an absurd story, it exposes the good and evil of human nature, reflects the struggle between powers, and achieves another state of engaging with the world. This is forging a new path.\"","Yan Geng: ???","Brother Huai, blink if you've lost your mind.","Yan Huai suddenly stood up. \"You see it so clearly!\"","\"...\" Yan Geng quickly stopped him. \"Where are you going so late?\"","\"To pay a visit.\"","Yan Geng was speechless. \"Who pays a visit this late? If you really want to go, wouldn't it be more appropriate to visit with gifts tomorrow morning?\"","Showing up like this makes it seem like you're looking for a fight.","Yan Huai: \"Alright.\"","He sat back down and began meticulously rereading \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family.\"","\"Brother Huai, I just checked out this website's features. If you really like it, why not give this book a tip?\"","\"A tip?\"","Yan Geng patiently taught him how.","\"Alright.\" Yan Huai understood immediately and directly transferred five hundred thousand, throwing it all at \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family.\"","Yan Geng: \"...\"","Damn, that's really extravagant.","\"Ah, it's ten o'clock, the new chapter should be updated!\" Yan Geng had already found the answer about the update time from the comment section.","He immediately looked down and refreshed.","[She said—","Because I'm afraid of pain.","I was extremely surprised and asked, \"Ghosts are afraid of pain too?\"","The ghost friend turned to look at me and said faintly, \"Yes, I am.\"","Her eyes were empty, yet filled with endless despair.","\"Every year at this time, I hurt so much, so much. It feels like my body is being torn apart. The time is almost here again. I don't want to hurt, I really don't want to hurt!\"","I hurriedly asked, \"Is there anything I can do to help you?\"","\"I don't want to stay here anymore. Can you let me go?\"","I asked, \"How can I let you go?\"","She was stunned for a moment, shook her head, and the light completely faded from her eyes.","\"No, you can't.\"","As soon as the words fell, a rough, large hand suddenly appeared. It viciously grabbed the ghost friend by the collar, flung her to the ground, and then...","Countless dark ghostly energies enveloped them.","I could only hear shrill cries for help and wails...","and one last, shattered mournful cry.","I felt chills all over.","The originally warm and cozy orphanage seemed to transform into a monstrous abyss, filling me with an inexplicable dread.","I felt deep guilt for my own powerlessness.","That night, I had a nightmare.","In the nightmare, I became food for the monster, being torn to pieces bit by bit.","When I woke up, the bed was ice cold.","I thought, I should do something. I must do something.","If I can't even save my friend, what else can I do?","Today, I met another pitiful ghost.","He died in confusion and haste.","He used to be a kind person, but was trapped for decades because of the wicked deeds of others.","My heart ached for his decades of \"imprisonment.\" I plan to take him out for a walk tomorrow to let his ghostly life have fewer regrets.]","The new chapter ended.","After reading it, Yan Geng couldn't help but ask, \"Is the ghost met in the novel today the big ghost from the north of the city we saw?\"","Yan Huai put down his phone. \"She is going out tomorrow.\"","\"So?\"","Yan Geng caught on. \"You mean we can't visit tomorrow?\"","\"Mm.\"","\"That's simple. She's going out for a walk, we can just go for a walk too, right?\"","Yan Huai was silent for a few seconds. \"Alright.\"","Lakeside Villa.","The system exclaimed: [Big shot, five thousand depth charges! Five thousand at once! Which tycoon is this again? The username is... Yan Huai? This name sounds somewhat familiar.]","Qi Quan: [Butler Su mentioned it today.]","[Oh right! A Taoist priest named Yan Huai came to visit today. He even recognized Butler Su as a ghost servant and was turned away by him. So what does he mean by dropping so many bombs? A door-opener?]","Qi Quan: [Perhaps.]","She wasn't interested in other people's motives, as long as she could earn lifespan.","Comment section under \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family.\"","[If you see me, tell me to go prepare lessons: Could there be something wrong with that orphanage? That little girl is so pitiful!]","[Running out of things to read is deadly: Scumbags, drop dead!]","[Pythagorean theorem abc: The vast majority of welfare institutions in the country are quite good. Of course, there are definitely a few scumbags. Sigh, I hope the authorities can increase efforts to rectify this area.]","[Dying from laughter: Going out for a walk? The author isn't going to use going out as an excuse to stop updating again, is she?]","Ordinary readers wouldn't pay attention to the tipping leaderboard, but the second-generation heirs competing for rankings daily knew the leaderboard rankings like the back of their hands.","As Qi Quan's personally appointed assistant, Chen Feilu paid even more attention to \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family.\"","Seeing the sudden rise of \"Yan Huai,\" he was utterly stunned.","He turned and asked Ning Zhi: \"Brother Ning, didn't you tell me before that the first-place winner of that competition was named Yan Huai?\"","They were in the dorm now, so it wasn't good to directly say \"Mystic Sect Competition.\"","Ning Zhi: \"Mm, why?\"","\"Take a look at this.\" He handed his phone over.","Ning Zhi: ???","Is this Yan Huai? Impossible.","\"In my impression, he's a rather aloof person, doesn't communicate much with others, and puts all his focus on cul... studies. He probably wouldn't do something like this.\"","Chen Feilu asked: \"How many times have you met him?\"","\"Three or four times.\"","\"Then is it possible that you don't really know him?\" Chen Feilu said. \"Besides, directly using his real-world name is exactly his style, isn't it?\"","Ning Zhi: \"That's true too.\"","He glanced at Yan Huai's ranking, then glanced at his own username, \"Tranquil and Far-reaching,\" which happened to be right below Yan Huai, and decisively recharged his account.","Thus, the second-generation heirs studying the tipping leaderboard were baffled.","[Du Jiaming: Who is this \"Yan Huai\"? Popped up out of nowhere.]","[Yang Su: \"Tranquil and Far-reaching\" pushed him down again.]","[Zhang Chengyan: Wait, this \"Yan Huai\" dropped a whole bunch more, he's at the top now!]","[Du Jiaming: Damn, what is he trying to do? Steal my throne? Crush him!]","The three second-generation heirs all recharged and dropped bombs, finally pushing \"Yan Huai\" down.","In the hotel, Yan Huai was also studying the tipping leaderboard.","He didn't know about this feature originally; Yan Geng pointed it out to him, saying, \"Brother Huai, you've always been first in everything before. This time, you're being pushed down by quite a few people.\"","Yan Huai: ?","His ranking was so low. Would the expert think he lacked sincerity?","Yan Huai himself was the benchmark among the younger generation of the Mystic Sect, a twenty-seven-year-old sixth-level Taoist priest, a genius among geniuses. But after learning that Qi Quan was only twenty-two, a strong sense of rivalry ignited within him.","He had rarely encountered opponents in recent years. Finally meeting one, his excitement was almost unbearable.","Since a direct sparring match wasn't possible in the short term, he would show his respect by dropping bombs.","\"Yan Huai\" leapt to the top of the tipping leaderboard!","Some cultivators who were secretly following \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family\" saw this and thought they were still dreaming.","That ice-cold champion of the Mystic Sect?","Impossible!","It must be someone with the same name. The Mystic Sect champion would never read novels.","They refused to have their illusions shattered.","The fierce competition on the tipping leaderboard didn't affect Qi Quan.","The next morning at breakfast, all members of the Lakeside Villa were present, except for the newly arrived ghost.","Su Rong explained, \"I went to call him, but he refused to eat.\"","\"Even food has no appeal to him?\" Xue Hong was shocked.","Back when she found out she could still taste delicious food as a ghost, she couldn't wait, okay?","Su Rong smiled slightly. \"He said he wanted to finish watching this episode.\"","\"...\"","Xue Hong asked hesitantly, \"He didn't watch all night, did he?\"","\"Yes.\"","Ghosts don't need sleep. Watching for three days and three nights straight is no problem.","Xue Hong was deeply impressed. \"So, shall we take him along to the resort later?\"","\"Does the resort have a TV?\" Ji Shengzhe suddenly drifted over to ask.","Xue Hong: \"...\"","Ji Shengzhe realized his mistake. \"Hello, teacher. It's not that I don't want to study, it's just that I haven't watched TV in so long...\"","\"No, you don't need to study.\" Xue Hong hurriedly waved her hands.","She only has one student!","Just as they finished eating, the second-generation trio arrived in their cars, each one flashier than the last.","Zhang Chengyan had specifically driven an extended limousine and said enthusiastically, \"Master, please ride in my car! It's spacious!\"","Qi Quan wasn't picky; she could ride in anyone's car.","For convenience, Su Rong, Xue Hong, and Ji Shengzhe were all taken into Qi Quan's peach wood talisman. Only Lingsheng accompanied her in the back seat.","He wore a Concealing Breath Talisman, masking his dense spiritual energy. Any exorcist below Qi Quan's level would be unable to discern his special constitution.","\"Master, the resort combines water scenery with forests. There are plenty of fun activities: rafting, boating, camping, barbecuing, jungle exploration, and so on,\" Zhang Chengyan diligently introduced. \"If there are any other activities you prefer, just let me know, and I'll arrange them.\"","Having fun wasn't part of Qi Quan's life pursuits, so she wasn't very interested. But the main purpose of this trip was to give the two ghost servants in the villa... and Lingsheng a break.","Steward Su, aside from cultivation, only managed household affairs every day. Tutor Xue, aside from studying, only taught. As for Lingsheng, aside from burying his head in practice exams, he buried his head in learning to draw talismans.","It was indeed too monotonous.","She asked the three ghosts in the peach wood talisman: What do you want to do?","Su Rong: A picnic.","Xue Hong: Reading a book while boating is also a kind of romance.","Ji Shengzhe: Can I just watch TV in the room?","Qi Quan: ...","Each one is more laid-back than the last.","She turned to ask Lingsheng, \"Are there any activities you'd like to do? You can write them down.\"","Everyone and every ghost in the villa had been equipped with a phone. After studying, Lingsheng could also type on the phone.","He thought for a moment, typed on his phone for a bit, and then handed it to Qi Quan.","Picnic, boating, jungle exploration.","Qi Quan: ?","She could communicate telepathically with her ghost servants, and Su Rong had asked Ji Shengzhe's preference from within the talisman, so Lingsheng couldn't possibly have heard.","Were the first two a coincidence?","Or had Lingsheng observed Su Rong and Xue Hong's preferences through their usual interactions and written those down?","Or perhaps she was overthinking it, and Lingsheng simply liked those three activities himself.","Qi Quan smiled. \"Alright, we'll do these three activities first.\"","A little over an hour later, the car arrived at the resort.","Du Jiaming and the other two had already made all the arrangements; they could check in directly.","It was a villa-style resort integrated with natural landscapes. The exterior looked exceptionally exquisite and beautiful.","Each villa had enough rooms. The group of people and ghosts stayed in the same villa. Du Jiaming and the other two were busy running around, moving luggage and arranging entertainment activities.","\"What's this?\" Yang Su pointed at the narrow console table in the entryway.","On the marble tabletop, a forearm-length humanoid statue quietly watched them. The figure had its hair in a high bun, wore Taoist robes, and a horsetail whisk draped from the crook of its left arm, presenting an image of immortal grace.","A staff member from the resort enthusiastically explained.","\"This is the Fortune God. It can bring people good luck. Our boss believes in this, so one is placed in every room. Guests can buy one if they like it.\"","Yang Su: ???","What Fortune God? Wouldn't it be better to just cling to Master Qi's leg?","He asked curiously, \"Do guests really buy them?\"","\"Yes!\" the staff member said with a smile. \"The vast majority of guests who have visited our resort have bought one because it's really effective!\"","Du Jiaming couldn't help but say, \"It can really change your luck? How does it work? It can't be that your luck just gets better after staying here for a couple of days, right?\"","\"As long as you are sincere, your fortune will turn.\"","\"That's not right. Were all the guests who came to your resort unlucky before they came?\" Zhang Chengyan asked, puzzled. \"Otherwise, how would the change in fortune be so obvious?\"","The staff member patiently explained, \"Of course not. Everyone encounters more or less unpleasant things in life, but after coming to the resort, everything gets resolved.\"","\"...\"","The system humbly sought advice: Big shot, is there really such a thing as a Fortune God?","Qi Quan: Doesn't it sound familiar?","Familiar how? The system asked, then quickly reacted, exclaiming in shock, It can't be that much of a coincidence!","Qi Quan: Don't forget, Ji Shengzhe has accrued merit. Once freed from his shackles, good fortune will follow.","Coming to a resort and discovering something related to \"changing fortune\" was probably truly a case of fate.","The system: Should we investigate?","Qi Quan: This matter should naturally be handed over to the Investigation Department.","She was just an ordinary tourist here to relax with her family.","There were no surveillance cameras inside the villa... After the staff left, Qi Quan released Su Rong and the other two ghosts.","Du Jiaming and the other two had long guessed Su Rong was a ghost, so they weren't surprised. Two more made no difference.","Ji Shengzhe rushed eagerly into a room to watch TV. Su Rong began organizing ingredients for the picnic. Xue Hong held her phone, reading an academic paper.","\"Master, how about the four of us play cards?\" Yang Su suggested.","Du Jiaming mocked him, \"Haven't you lost enough at the card table these past few days?\"","\"I refuse to believe my luck is always this bad. With Master here today, my card luck is sure to be prosperous!\"","Qi Quan happened to want to test the \"Fortune God,\" so she agreed.","Sure enough, Yang Su's hand was incredibly bad every time, the kind of terrible hand even the best skills couldn't salvage.","\"Seriously, my card luck is just too awful!\" He covered his face and wailed.","Qi Quan suggested, \"How about trying the Fortune God?\"","The three men: ???","Master, are you serious?","Qi Quan smiled. \"I'm very serious.\"","\"Yeah, I'm quite curious too. Just go and try it.\" Zhang Chengyan was always very interested in such things.","Du Jiaming also urged, \"If Master tells you to go, then go. It's no big deal.\"","Yang Su was also curious, so he walked over to the Fortune God.","Next to the god was a standing sign with instructions for use.","Scan the QR code below and follow the \"Fortune God\" official account.","Yang Su did as instructed.","After following, he clicked into the service page.","Recharge 9999 yuan to become a member. After becoming a member, send \"Name + Date of Birth\" to receive an initial luck value of 100 points.","Yang Su held up his phone for them to see, saying with a look of disbelief, \"This really isn't a scam?\"","How could anyone believe this?","Du Jiaming: \"Just give it a try. It's only 9999 yuan. If you really get scammed, you can definitely get it back by reporting to the police.\"","\"Yeah, yeah,\" Zhang Chengyan agreed.","Yang Su topped up 9999 yuan and sent his name and date of birth.","[Luck God: Congratulations on obtaining an initial luck value of 100 points. Go and give it a try!]","Yang Su put away his phone, quickly returned to the card table, rubbed his hands together, and said, \"Deal the cards, let me see what it's like to have 100 points of luck!\"","He was originally just joking, and neither Du Jiaming nor Zhang Chengyan took it seriously, however—","\"Wow! My luck really has turned around!\"","\"My hand is too good, you guys are doomed to lose!\"","\"Forget it, I could just throw this hand away and still win.\"","Yang Su, as if injected with adrenaline, won every single round.","Du Jiaming and Zhang Chengyan couldn't help but glance at the Luck God.","It really was remarkably effective!","\"Master, what's going on exactly?\"","Qi Quan looked calm and composed. \"Continue.\"","By the twentieth round, Yang Su's card luck had noticeably declined quite a bit. In the twenty-first round, he started getting terrible hands again.","He chuckled coldly, \"Did I buy just twenty rounds of card luck for 9999 yuan? That's a bit expensive for luck points.\"","Qi Quan put down his cards. \"Butler Su has the ingredients ready. Let's go for a picnic.\"","\"Alright!\"","The three of them promptly put the Luck God out of their minds.","Longjiang City Film and Television Base.","Qi Yingxue accidentally fell while filming, scraping the palm of her hand. It was broken skin, oozing tiny beads of blood.","She sat gloomily in a corner, staring blankly at the wound on her palm.","To avoid continuity errors during filming, she couldn't even use a band-aid.","Since returning to the crew, she had clearly felt that the staff didn't respect her as much as they used to.","The label of being scheming and malicious was stuck tightly to her. Everyone looked at her with strange, judgmental eyes.","She really couldn't take it...","anymore.","\"I told you, you excel in every aspect, you're just lacking a bit of luck,\" He Yang stood before her, backlit, looking down at her from his height.","Qi Yingxue gave a wry smile. \"Luck? My luck ran out a long time ago.\"","\"If it's gone, you can get it again,\" He Yang's voice was low. \"As long as you have money, you can even buy luck.\"","Qi Yingxue was silent for a moment, then lifted her head.","\"Alright, I'll buy it.\"","Outside the resort, Yan Huai and Yan Geng, having failed to make a reservation in advance, were stopped by staff.","\"Aren't there any extra rooms available?\" Yan Geng asked.","Staff: \"I'm very sorry, there aren't.\"","Yan Geng: \"...\"","Seriously? A resort in a small county town is this fully booked?","He had no choice but to say, \"Brother Huai, maybe we should find a place nearby to wait for a bit.\"","Yan Huai: \"Alright.\"","The two found a noodle shop and sat down.","It was almost noon, perfect for a bowl of noodles.","The place was quite remote, so the noodle shop didn't have many customers. The proprietress, seeing Yan Huai's handsome and impressive appearance, became a bit more chatty.","\"Are you two planning to go to the resort?\"","\"Yes,\" Yan Geng replied. \"We forgot to make a reservation, so we couldn't get in.\"","The proprietress smiled. \"You need a reservation, otherwise you can't get in.\"","Yan Geng was puzzled. \"Logically, this place is pretty remote. Why are so many people coming?\"","\"I've never been, it's very expensive,\" the proprietress shook her head. \"I've just heard that people who go there have their luck improve. Don't know if it's true or not.\"","\"How could that be? That's just a marketing gimmick,\" Yan Geng said dismissively.","Proprietress: \"Whether it's a gimmick or not, I don't know. But I do know the owner is someone who hit the jackpot.\"","\"How so?\"","\"He's a local, I used to know him,\" the proprietress lowered her voice, speaking mysteriously. \"Back then, he didn't have a proper job, just hung around on the streets all day. Guess what happened?\"","Yan Geng played along: \"What happened?\"","\"He suddenly had a huge stroke of luck, said he won ten million in the lottery!\" The proprietress unconsciously raised her voice. \"That's ten million!\"","\"And then?\"","Proprietress: \"And then? Then he became rich, of course. Isn't that hitting the jackpot?\"","Yan Geng: \"...\"","He thought it was going to be some shocking inside information.","Yan Huai suddenly said, \"Search for his photo.\"","Yan Geng was startled for a moment, then understood his meaning. He went online, searched for a photo of the resort owner, and took a close look.","\"Whoa!\"","This was not the face of someone destined for great fortune at all!","\"Brother Huai, this...\"","Yan Huai: \"Investigate.\""]},{"number":45,"title":"Chapter 45","paragraphs":["The resort backed against a mountain forest. The grassland used for picnics occupied the best vantage point, offering a view of a small waterfall on the mountain. The water tumbled vertically down, merging into the stream below and kicking up sheets of sparkling spray.","Qi Quan chose a spot out of the surveillance cameras' view. For extra insurance, she deliberately set up a concealment spell to hide the three ghosts' forms.","The autumn sunlight possessed a unique kind of warm intensity, glaring yet not overly unrestrained.","Xue Hong lay flat on the grass, sighing contentedly. \"With a ghostly life like this, what more could one ask for?\"","The trio of Du, Yang, and Zhang were in high spirits, completely unafraid of the three ghosts. Instead, they clinked cups and exchanged toasts with them, a lively back-and-forth.","\"Teacher Xue, you should indulge in more enjoyment in the future. Academia is good, but leisure is also essential,\" Du Jiaming suggested with a smile.","Xue Hong nodded with great seriousness. \"You make a very valid point.\"","\"Damn!\" Zhang Chengyan, scrolling through his phone, suddenly exclaimed. \"Have you guys seen the news? An orphanage was exposed for...\"","\"Exposed for what?\" Yang Su leaned over. \"Don't leave us hanging...\"","His voice trailed off, his expression turning equally grave.","Du Jiaming tossed an empty drink bottle at him. \"What's with the riddle?\"","\"It's... the kind that's an orphanage on the surface but runs a flesh trade in the shadows,\" Zhang Chengyan said with difficulty.","He shot a glance at Qi Quan.","The contents of the latest chapter of \"Diary of a Wealthy Family,\" updated last night, were still fresh in his memory.","The novel didn't explicitly state what kind of violation the ghost friend had suffered, but everyone had their vague suspicions, just not something they could easily voice aloud.","Who would have thought that merely a night later, such news would really break in reality? It was utterly chilling.","How old were the children in that orphanage?","It was just too vile!","\"They're all worse than beasts!\" Xue Hong said with disgust.","Ji Shengzhe added, \"Truly disgusting.\"","[Big Boss, do you know something? Did you write that chapter on purpose? Everyone who's read 'Diary of a Wealthy Family' is now saying you divined it.] The system asked curiously.","Qi Quan: [No.]","It was just a coincidence.","In this world, similar events always occur within the same timeframe. If one were to statistically analyze the data, they'd find coincidences everywhere.","Her phone chimed. It was a message from Li Guoyan.","After testing the abilities of the \"Luck-Bringing Immortal,\" she had sent Li Guoyan a message, asking the Investigation Department to look into the resort's background.","The Investigation Department's efficiency was quite impressive.","She opened the file.","The first thing that caught her eye was a photo of a man. Calling him plain would be generous.","His eyebrows were a disorderly mess, he had triangular eyes, a bulbous nose, thick lips—there wasn't a single redeeming feature on his entire face.","Of course, Qi Quan never looked down on others for their appearance. What she despised was this greedy, cunning physiognomy.","Judging by his facial features, this man had no fortune to speak of, yet in reality, he owned this highly profitable, money-making resort.","Clearly, he had used unconventional means.","She read the detailed information.","Seven years ago, Sun Yong, then a local hoodlum, came into a windfall and leaped to become a wealthy man in Changshun County. From then on, his rise was meteoric. He became a major boss in Changshun County, even founding a real estate company and building this resort there.","Initially, no one was optimistic about this resort.","What kind of tourist flow could a remote little county town attract?","But who would have guessed? After the resort was built, its business grew more prosperous by the day. A steady stream of visitors came and went, rooms were fully booked daily. Even Du Jiaming's tickets were obtained through connections, bought at a high price from someone else.","What kind of magic did such an utterly ordinary resort possess?","Online reviews of the resort were also overwhelmingly positive.","[Big Boss, he probably used that Luck-Bringing Immortal to change his fortune, right?] The system said, heart aching. [If this Luck-Bringing Immortal is really connected to Ji Shengzhe, how much merit must have been consumed?]","Qi Quan: [It will come back.]","She put down her phone and leisurely enjoyed the food and sunshine.","Longjing City Investigation Department.","Di Meng received his new assignment and was momentarily stunned.","\"Longjiang City, Changshun County? Is that right?\"","Li Guoyan said, \"Correct. This case might be related to a Level Six major ghost. The person behind it is likely not simple. Your cultivation is high, so I need you to go personally.\"","\"But doesn't Longjiang City have an expert?\" he asked in surprise.","Li Guoyan: \"...\"","He glanced at Di Meng. \"You figured it out?\"","Di Meng grinned lazily. \"Was it hard to guess? It's pretty obvious.\"","\"She's the Investigation Department's chief consultant, not part of the field team. We can't trouble her every time something comes up. This is a training opportunity for you all! Moreover, this case was forwarded by her. You might even get to meet her in person when you go.\"","Di Meng's handsome features instantly brightened. \"I guarantee I'll complete the mission!\"","\"Good. We've found that Sun Yong is currently in Changshun County. Follow his lead and trace the origin of the Luck-Bringing Immortal. I'll have others investigate whether other Luck-Bringing Immortals exist.\"","\"Yes, sir!\"","Longjiang City Film and Television Studio.","He Yang led Qi Yingxue to the dressing room.","His status in the industry was high, granting him a private dressing room. Once the door was closed, no one would disturb them.","\"Teacher He?\" Qi Yingxue felt somewhat flustered.","He Yang smiled gently. \"Don't be nervous. I just need to invite the Great Immortal out.\"","He opened his bag and carefully brought out a Taoist statue about the length of a forearm. \"This is the Luck-Bringing Immortal. Would you like to give it a try?\"","Qi Yingxue: \"...\"","A major celebrity suddenly turning into a mystic was a bit disillusioning.","But then, this world was already quite fantastical. Having a Luck-Bringing Immortal seemed almost normal.","She asked, \"How do I try it?\"","He Yang said in a low voice, \"First, pay a 9999 yuan membership fee. I've sent the official account to you.\"","It was only ten thousand yuan. Qi Yingxue didn't mind the cost.","She gritted her teeth and did as instructed.","He Yang pointed to the reply she received. \"See, you've already gained 100 luck points. This is a trial. If you genuinely feel your luck has improved, you can come to me to buy one to take home.\"","\"Isn't it enough to just pay the official account?\" Qi Yingxue asked. \"What's the use of buying it?\"","He Yang's expression remained unchanged. \"Because it is the Luck-Bringing Immortal. Buying one to place at home means it will always watch over you.\"","\"No need to keep paying?\" Qi Yingxue was skeptical.","He Yang said unhurriedly, \"When you feel you need more luck points, you pay a certain fee as needed. Then, facing the Luck-Bringing Immortal, say three times, 'Great Immortal, bestow luck upon me,' and send the name and birth date of the person you dislike.\"","\"Why?\"","He Yang replied casually, \"As long as you can obtain luck points, why bother knowing so much? You're a smart person. Even if I don't say it, you can probably guess, right?\"","Qi Yingxue's heart pounded wildly.","She asked with difficulty, \"Can it really change one's fortune?\"","\"You just gained 100 points. Go try it and see for yourself?\"","Qi Yingxue stared at him. \"Why are you helping me?\"","\"I just feel you need it,\" He Yang sighed softly. \"When I was at my lowest point, it saved me. I want more people to revere it.\"","Qi Yingxue: \"...\"","Even so, she still felt there was something a bit off about He Yang.","She took a deep breath. \"Fine, I'll give it a try.\"","Leaving the dressing room, it was just time for her scene.","Whether it was psychological or a stroke of luck, her shots this time went incredibly smoothly. The director not only didn't call for a retake but also praised her with great satisfaction.","Even the crew's attitude towards her shifted slightly.","The entire day continued like this!","\"I think Qi Yingxue's acting is quite good, and she's pretty too. She seems alright.\"","\"Yeah, you can't always believe everything you see online.\"","\"It's normal to get angry when you hit a pet peeve in a novel. Was her issue really that big of a deal?\"","Hearing these whispered comments, a look of pure delight flashed in Qi Yingxue's eyes.","She was truly experiencing the benefits brought by the luck points.","She decisively sought out He Yang.","\"I want a Fortune Immortal statue.\"","He Yang wasn't surprised at all and said with a smile, \"One million.\"","Qi Yingxue was shocked. \"One million?\"","For an ordinary stone statue? Was this robbery?","He Yang: \"You can also choose not to buy it.\"","Qi Yingxue gritted her teeth. \"I'll buy it!\"","Once she made a comeback, what was a mere million?","Resort.","After the picnic, everyone lay on the grass, too lazy to move.","Zhang Chengyan browsed the web on his phone, frowning. \"Master, I've searched everywhere but haven't found any comments about the resort's Fortune Immortal. Logically, if the Fortune Immortal was really that effective, someone would have mentioned it.\"","\"There's only so much luck in the world. Who would want to tell others where they can buy it?\" Yang Su said. \"If I could buy gambling luck here, I definitely wouldn't tell anyone.\"","Zhang Chengyan nodded. \"That makes sense.\"","\"Another possibility,\" Du Jiaming raised an eyebrow, \"is that there's something wrong with this Fortune Immortal. Those who bought it feel guilty and don't dare to talk about it.\"","\"What kind of problem?\" Yang Su asked.","Du Jiaming: \"Why don't you buy one from the staff before you leave and find out?\"","Yang Su: \"...\"","Was he supposed to be the sucker again?","He turned to Qi Quan: \"Master, you told me to try the Fortune Immortal before. Did you notice any problems?\"","Qi Quan nodded. \"There is a problem.\"","\"Please enlighten us, Master.\"","Everyone, living and spectral, listened attentively.","Qi Quan: \"What is the calculation method for one hundred luck points? Luck is intangible. How much effect do one hundred points actually have? No one knows.\"","\"Oh right, I spent ten thousand, but I have no idea how much he actually gave me.\" Yang Su instantly felt ripped off.","Qi Quan: \"Also, where does the Fortune Immortal's luck come from? Every product has a complete supply chain. You are the buyer, the luck points are the product. So what is the raw material used to produce this product?\"","\"Exactly,\" Du Jiaming agreed. \"You have no luck, yet you can buy luck. That purchased luck must have an origin. Is it someone else's luck?\"","Yang Su: !!!","His face immediately paled, and he hurriedly asked Qi Quan, \"Master, then... have I committed a sin? Will there be karmic consequences? I don't want to harm someone unknowingly.\"","\"It's nothing. At most, your gambling luck will just get worse,\" Qi Quan said nonchalantly.","Yang Su: \"...\"","...","Du Jiaming and Zhang Chengyan couldn't stop laughing.","\"Master, would you like to go boating?\" Su Rong, having packed up the picnic tools, asked with a smile.","Qi Quan gave an indifferent nod.","There was a river beside the resort, specifically set up for boating. The river, formed from mountain streams, was extremely clear. Under the sunlight, you could see the stones on the riverbed. The water surface was calm and ripple-free, perfect for a wooden raft.","The raft could carry six people. The three ghosts didn't count towards the weight, so Qi Quan and the other four living people all boarded, plus the raft poler, making exactly six.","The boatman had a weathered face, a simple and honest smile, and spoke with a strong local accent, his voice booming, \"All passengers, please sit tight! Setting off now!\"","The raft drifted on the river. Up close, the water was a translucent green; in the distance, the forest was dense. You could even see the lightning rods on the resort villas' roofs.","\"So refreshing and relaxing!\" Yang Su sighed.","Zhang Chengyan: \"This place really is well-developed. Look, fish!\"","Fish swam around the raft, wagging their tails. He reached out to catch one, but it darted away instantly, showing no mercy.","\"Let me try!\" Du Jiaming rolled up his sleeves.","Men's competitive spirit could emerge anywhere.","He plunged his hand into the water, focused on a fish, and made a grab. The fish swished its tail, slapped the back of his hand, and swam away proudly.","\"Hahahaha!\" Yang Su laughed at the two of them. \"You guys are so childish!\"","The system complains: [They really are childish.]","Qi Quan couldn't help but curve her lips into a slight smile.","Silly antics brought more joy.","Ling Sheng sat beside her. Seeing her relaxed, happy smile, he tilted his head, then mimicked the others, reaching his hand into the water.","\"Don't copy them,\" Yang Su advised upon seeing this. \"There's no way you'll catch a fish—\"","A small fish lay obediently in the young man's palm, its scales shimmering red, looking extremely beautiful under the sunlight.","Ling Sheng held the little fish out towards Qi Quan.","Zhang Chengyan and the other two stared, mouths agape, in disbelief.","What was going on?!","Qi Quan's gaze moved from the fish to the young man's hand.","His knuckles were just the right size, fingers long and slender like bamboo stalks, holding the fish with a gentle, almost pleading gesture.","She looked up into Ling Sheng's eyes.","The young man was backlit. His amber pupils, light and translucent, held a hint of anticipation.","Qi Quan said calmly, \"Let it go.\"","She wasn't a cat; what did she need a fish for?","Ling Sheng was momentarily stunned, then returned the fish to the water. Unexpectedly, the fish seemed attached to him, chasing after the raft and staying close to him, refusing to leave.","\"How strange. What kind of charm do you have? Or has this fish become sentient?\" Zhang Chengyan looked puzzled.","Du Jiaming laughed. \"Maybe it's a fish that judges by looks.\"","\"...\"","The raft drifted quietly forward. The wind brushed against their faces, carrying the scents of the forest and river, refreshing and pleasant.","\"Hel...p... me...\"","Suddenly, a faint, intermittent cry for help drifted over with the wind. Listening carefully, it disappeared again.","Qi Quan instinctively straightened her posture.","Seeing her reaction, Ling Sheng's gaze turned towards the direction the cry for help had come from.","The sound was too faint. Apart from Qi Quan and Ling Sheng, no one else heard it.","Du Jiaming and the other two were still chatting and laughing.","The long pole plunged into the river bottom, lifted, and broke the surface with a splash of water.","\"Help... me...\" The weak cry for help sounded again.","Qi Quan communicated telepathically with her ghost servant: \"Xue Hong, go check the woods in the eleven o'clock direction. Someone is calling for help.\"","...","Upon hearing this, Xue Hong immediately floated away from the raft.","\"Master, can we go into the mountains?\" Qi Quan asked aloud.","The boatman replied, \"Sure can! There's a landing up ahead. Once you disembark, you can go play the jungle adventure project. But there are restricted areas in the mountains, some places you can't go.\"","\"Alright, please stop at the landing.\"","The boatman complied, dropping them off at the landing.","\"Master, are you going to play jungle adventure?\" Du Jiaming loved this kind of activity.","Qi Quan: \"Yes.\"","At that moment, Xue Hong sent a message: \"Master, there really is a person. He fell down a slope, his thigh was cut by a sharp branch, and he's lost quite a bit of blood. His phone is broken, so he can't call for help.\"","Qi Quan: \"Good. Wait for us to arrive.\"","She quickly changed into her jungle exploration gear and, without waiting for Du Jiaming and the other two, headed straight into the jungle.","Ling Sheng followed her closely, with Su Rong and Ji Shengzhe floating along behind them.","\"Master! Wait for us!\" the three of them called out urgently, but all they saw was Qi Quan's merciless back as she abandoned them.","A staff member chuckled, \"What are you following them for? To be a third wheel?\"","The three men: \"...\"","It suddenly dawned on them.","\"Yeah, well, the Master is so powerful anyway, she doesn't need our protection,\" Du Jiaming said.","Yang Su nodded in agreement, slowing his movements. \"Should we just go explore on our own then?\"","\"Let's not disturb the Master,\" Zhang Chengyan nodded in agreement.","This mountain forest was largely undeveloped, with dense, deep woods. Once inside the forest, you couldn't see anyone at all.","Qi Quan's goal was very clear.","A thigh injury, lots of blood loss, unable to move, likely in life-threatening danger.","She couldn't just stand by and watch a life fade away.","She had died young in her previous life, so she cherished life all the more.","Qi Quan moved swiftly, arriving at the scene in moments.","The person calling for help heard the commotion and instantly burst with immense joy, straining his voice: \"Help! Help me!\"","He was already feeling chills all over. If he didn't get to a hospital soon, he feared he would go into shock from blood loss.","Under extreme terror, tears streamed down, blurring his vision.","Through that blurred vision, two figures entered his world.","At that moment, light pierced the gloomy, despairing forest.","The man choked out, \"Please, call an ambulance for me, I'm dying.\"","Qi Quan glanced at him. A face marked by clinging misfortune, yet with a fortune that turns peril into safety.","He wouldn't die.","Qi Quan calmly called an ambulance and notified the resort's management.","System: [Big shot, his leg is still bleeding.]","It would take time for the ambulance to arrive, especially here in the mountain forest where it wasn't easy for vehicles to get in. Emergency doctors wouldn't arrive that quickly either.","Fortunately, the resort had a first-aid station. The management, having been notified, should dispatch doctors from there to come as soon as possible.","Ling Sheng's gaze swept indifferently over the man, settling on Qi Quan's calm face.","Though calm, her eyes still held a hint of intent to save someone.","He lowered his head in thought, walked over to the injured man, squatted down, and pressed his fingers a few times around the man's wound.","Imperceptible spiritual energy probed into the wound.","Qi Quan raised an eyebrow in surprise.","She clearly saw that, under the young man's control, subtle spiritual energy nourished the flesh of the wound in an extremely precise manner, but it only slowed the bleeding, not healing the wound completely.","What incredibly precise control of spiritual energy!","But then she remembered he had been imprisoned in a cave, enduring for over a decade with shackles deeply embedded in his flesh, and her surprise faded.","Over a decade of self-healing was enough for him to master such fine control.","The injured man's eyes widened.","His sensation was the clearest. The wound that had been bleeding continuously just moments ago had almost stopped, all because this extraordinarily handsome young man had pressed a few points around it.","He blurted out, \"Did you study traditional Chinese medicine? Was that acupressure to stop the bleeding just now? You're a miracle doctor!\"","Ling Sheng: \"...\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","Xue Hong, taking advantage of her ghostly form, laughed heartily without restraint.","Seeing that he was out of immediate danger, the man's panicked mood gradually calmed, and he even started chatting with Qi Quan and the other.","But Qi Quan rarely spoke, and Ling Sheng never spoke, so he ended up chattering to himself in lonely solitude.","\"I'm really unlucky. I was walking just fine, then suddenly my foot slipped for no reason, I fell down, got my leg pierced by a branch, almost died. If you hadn't shown up in time, I'd probably be gone by now.\"","\"This forest is really weird. Can a project like this really guarantee tourists' safety?\"","\"No way, I'm going to file a complaint... Ah!\"","A dollop of bird droppings landed squarely on his forehead.","\"Pfft.\" Xue Hong couldn't help but laugh again. \"He really is quite unlucky.\"","The man felt like crying but had no tears. He pulled out a wet wipe from his bag and wiped it off, feeling like a foul smell lingered around his nose.","\"Is this resort cursed or something? I heard people who come here get lucky! How come I'm the only one so unlucky?\"","Qi Quan spoke up abruptly, \"Who did you hear that from?\"","\"Huh?\" The man looked confused. \"Just... from people talking.\"","There was no mention online about the resort affecting luck, yet this man knew about it. Strange.","\"The internet only says the resort is nice, it doesn't mention luck,\" she guided his train of thought.","The man instinctively replied, \"I didn't see it online. I heard it from people around me. To be honest, since I got to the resort, I really haven't felt anything special about this place. How did it get so popular?\"","Qi Quan studied him carefully.","A flicker of guilt passed through his eyes, but more prominent were feelings of resentment and confusion.","\"Master!\" Du Jiaming's voice came from not far away. \"So you came here too.\"","The three of them walked over cheerfully, pausing when they saw the injured man on the ground.","\"Buddy, you okay?\" Zhang Chengyan walked over and asked with concern.","The man shook his head, looking at Ling Sheng with gratitude. \"This miracle doctor here stopped my bleeding just now. I'm fine now, just a bit dizzy and cold.\"","\"Miracle doctor?\" Du Jiaming approached curiously.","The man finally got a clear look at his face, paused for a moment, then asked cautiously, \"You... are you the eldest son of the Du family?\"","\"You know me?\" Du Jiaming looked him over carefully, no recognition. \"You're from the city too?\"","The man smiled, \"Yes. I saw Chairman Du at a cocktail party once. You were standing right beside him then.\"","The Du family was a giant in Longjiang City's business world, with plenty of people currying favor. This man was likely among them.","Du Jiaming didn't dislike such people. In business, it's business—whether the other party flatters or acts aloof, as long as there's mutual benefit and profit to be made, they were a potential partner.","Du Jiaming asked with interest, \"Then we really are fated to meet. What do you do?\"","Hearing this, the man felt he'd hit the jackpot, running into the Du family's eldest son deep in the wild mountains. He grew excited and said hurriedly, \"I'm in real estate development. I even discussed a cooperation project with Chairman Du before. A shame I didn't win his favor.\"","Real estate development again.","Du Jiaming asked, \"Which specific area? Residential? Office buildings? Or something else?\"","\"Well... I previously developed a vacation villa resort. Unfortunately, no customers came. Lost my shirt, sigh!\"","Xue Hong tutted: \"No wonder he's criticizing this resort. He's just jealous of their customer traffic.\"","System: [So he's just jealous. Then I don't sympathize with him.]","Qi Quan curved her lips slightly: [Even if he's jealous, as long as he hasn't caused actual harm, he shouldn't have such terrible luck.]","If she hadn't heard his cries for help, if Ling Sheng hadn't stopped his bleeding, he probably would have gone into shock long ago. He wouldn't be here trying to cozy up to Du Jiaming.","System: [You mean?]","[The Luck Immortal is very interesting. It can protect its owner from any adverse effects and reflect them back.]","Probably this man, filled with resentment, must have cursed the resort, and as a result, suffered a backlash of bad luck.","System: [Ah, this... it's too sinister. This isn't an immortal, it's a ghost, right?]","\"So you came here to seek enlightenment?\" Du Jiaming saw through his little scheme. \"And ended up getting hurt by accident?\"","\"I think this place is really shady. Before I came, I clearly heard that people who enter would have good luck. Looking at it now, it's all just 'stepping in dog poop' kind of luck!\"","Yang Su asked in surprise, \"You don't know about the Fortune God?\"","\"What Fortune God?\" The man was confused.","\"When you came in, didn't the staff explain it to you?\" Yang Su thought of something and glanced at the man's clothes.","A real estate boss, with his entire outfit worth less than five hundred bucks. It seemed he really had lost a lot of money.","The staff judged people by their appearance, figuring he couldn't afford the membership fee, so they couldn't be bothered to waste their breath.","The man: \"No, no one mentioned any Fortune God to me. Damn it, is Sun Yong involved in some crooked, shady path?\"","\"You know Sun Yong?\" Qi Quan asked.","The man nodded: \"We're in the same line of business, of course I know him. And it's not just because of that; actually, I knew him even before he made his fortune. We used to live across the street from each other.\"","\"Who's Sun Yong?\" Yang Su asked.","\"He's the owner of this resort,\" Zhang Chengyan answered him, then turned back to the man. \"So you're not doing as well as him now.\"","The man said sourly, \"I was in the business before him! After I made a small fortune, he came begging me to take him on, to give him a job. I softened up and let him try, but a slacker is always a slacker. He was always slacking off and cutting corners. I got angry and fired him. Who would've thought that bastard would suddenly hit the jackpot one day, won ten million, and also got into real estate, competing directly with me.\"","\"You really had it rough,\" Yang Su sighed.","From Sun Yong's perspective, it was a classic story of comeback and revenge. But for this man, it was undoubtedly a humiliation.","He must have been mocked by Sun Yong plenty of times.","System: [Sun Yong probably surpassed him after his fortune changed.]","Qi Quan didn't comment.","Things might not be that simple.","Soon after, the ambulance arrived. The man was taken to the hospital. The resort manager repeatedly apologized, saying they would cover all medical expenses and compensate for various losses.","He also bowed in thanks to Qi Quan and the others.","\"Honored guests, thank you so much for your timely rescue. Your visit today is completely free. Here are our resort's gold cards. From now on, whenever you grace us with your presence, no need to book in advance, and all expenses will be 30% off.\"","The manager's attitude was extremely sincere.","Du Jiaming and the other two took the gold cards and casually tucked them into their pockets. After the manager left, they joked, \"There's a reason their business grew so big.\"","Outside the resort...","...Yan Geng, who had been waiting for an opportunity, suddenly stood up.","\"Brother Huai, it seems someone got injured inside. They've already taken an ambulance. Does that mean there's a vacant room now?\"","Yan Huai strode off immediately.","There was indeed a vacant room, but not the injured man's. The resort also wouldn't dare to move his luggage while he was being sent to the hospital.","The two paid and smoothly entered the resort.","As core disciples of the Yan family, the two were dressed in understated luxury, all high-end custom-made. The staff couldn't recognize the brands and couldn't make assumptions. They simply led them to a villa suite, not mentioning the Fortune God.","However, Yan Geng had sharp eyes. He spotted the statue on the narrow console table in the entryway and felt something was off.","\"Brother Huai, look at this.\"","Yan Huai's gaze fell on the eyes of the Fortune God statue.","He possessed extraordinary talent, majored in sword techniques, and his sword energy was vast and pure, a natural bane to sinister, ghostly entities.","This statue looked ethereal and immortal-like, yet it gave people an uncomfortable feeling.","\"There's a problem,\" he trusted his intuition.","Yan Geng: \"What do we do?\"","\"Take a photo, send it back, investigate.\"","\"Yes.\"","The Yan family had deep roots and channels for investigation. This Fortune God, able to appear openly before people, would surely have left clues.","At the same time, the Longjing City Investigation Department found some leads.","\"Director Li, we haven't traced the origin of the Fortune God yet, but we discovered that this Fortune God appeared ten years ago. At first, it spread only within small circles. After establishing a public account five years ago, the number of believers in the Fortune God surged dramatically. Moreover, a single Fortune God statue sells for one million.\"","Li Guoyan: \"...\"","Isn't this just another cult-like pyramid scheme?","With such a large scale of fortune-changing, even if there really was some great immortal, that immortal would be worked to death.","He said, \"Investigate the high-level leaders.\"","\"Yes!\"","Longjiang City Film Studio.","Qi Yingxue had an incredibly smooth day and became even more convinced of the Fortune God's power.","But on the way back to the hotel after filming, the car almost crashed into a road sign, frightening her terribly.","Back in her hotel room, she took out the Fortune God statue, placed it on the bedside table, pulled out her phone, and opened the public account.","Inside the public account, the prices were clearly listed.","One hundred points of luck required ten thousand yuan. The previous 9999 yuan was just a first-time membership discount.","Qi Yingxue was speechless.","A discount of one yuan? That's too stingy.","She thought for a moment, transferred twenty thousand over, and said to the statue three times, 'Great Immortal, please grant me luck.' She waited for a while, but there was still no reply.","Did she really have to send the name and birth date of someone she disliked?","Qi Yingxue's mind conjured up Qi Quan and her own birthday.","She hesitated for a moment, then hardened her heart, typed into the dialog box, and clicked send.","One second passed.","Five seconds passed.","Ten seconds passed.","The public account still showed no reaction. Qi Yingxue felt she had been scammed and was about to call He Yang to question him when suddenly—","Boom!","A huge explosive sound blasted in her ears. Her eardrums buzzed, nearly deafened by the explosion.","Qi Yingxue was scared out of her wits, frozen in place, unable to even scream.","The statue, with its immortal and dignified demeanor, instantly turned into dust.","The statue was made of ordinary stone, relatively hard in texture, yet it shattered into powder right before her eyes.","It was impossible not to be terrified.","...","After regaining her senses, Qi Yingxue quickly called He Yang.","He Yang's voice was still warm and gentle: \"What's up?\"","\"I just used the Fortune God, and it suddenly exploded! Shattered to pieces! What on earth is going on? Isn't it a counterfeit?\"","He Yang said in surprise, \"How could that be? Take a photo and show me.\"","Qi Yingxue took a picture of the pile of powder and sent it over.","[He Yang: ...]","[Qi Yingxue: No way, refund my one million! And the twenty thousand I just sent to the public account!]","[He Yang: Let me ask for you first.]","A moment later, Qi Yingxue received a reply.","[He Yang: Did you say a name you shouldn't have? This might be a backlash. Be careful these next few days.]","[Qi Yingxue: What do you mean?!]","[He Yang: It means you've provoked someone you shouldn't have. Your luck might become extremely bad from now on. Take care.]","[Qi Yingxue: What about my money!]","[Message sent, but rejected by the recipient.]","Qi Yingxue: ...","Resort.","Qi Quan, having finished a day of fun, was sitting on the bed cultivating when suddenly a chill ran down her back. A wisp of black energy inexplicably descended, swirling and hovering above her head. However, due to the presence of her protective spiritual energy, it dared not land.","She opened her eyes.","System: [Big shot, what's wrong?]","Qi Quan raised her head, reached out, and grabbed that mass of black energy. She kneaded it with her spiritual power, and with a soft poof, it burst apart.","Someone was plotting against her.","[Big Boss, what is that?]","Qi Quan: [Something that steals luck.]","[Ah? Who dares to steal your luck? Not only are they bold, but their face is bigger than the sky!]","Qi Quan performed a quick divination with her fingers, not feeling surprised in the slightest.","As the counterpart to the \"true heiress,\" the false heiress Qi Yingxue had an extraordinary destiny.","Qi Quan couldn't divine her own fate, but she could see that Qi Yingxue's destiny was inherently in conflict with that of the Qi family.","From this perspective, Qi Yingxue should be her nemesis.","Calling her a nemesis might be giving her too much credit, but at the very least, Qi Yingxue was born with a certain purpose.","They were opposites.","Therefore, very often, the actions Qi Yingxue took happened to harm her in just the right way.","For example, the targeting after returning to the Qi family, being used by Yan Wu to deal with her, and this current attempt to steal her luck.","It was only because the Qi family had always treated her well and hadn't provoked her \"influence\" that things had been smooth sailing all these years.","Once she harbored resentment towards the Qi family members, she might very well subconsciously do certain things that \"countered\" them.","Qi Quan gained a deeper understanding of the \"painstaking efforts\" of the mastermind behind all this.","Finding a person with such a \"uniquely favored\" destiny must have taken immense effort.","To orchestrate a timely \"mix-up at birth,\" preparations had to be made in advance.","Could it be that the hidden hand had long since calculated her immense fortune?","The deeper she dug, the more interesting this matter became.","Without hesitation, Qi Quan sent a message to Li Guoyan: [Arrest Qi Yingxue. Get clues about the Luck Transfer Immortal from her.]","She had already tested the waters today.","This Luck Transfer Immortal indeed possessed the ability to alter luck, but—","The sheer volume of luck being supplied was not something that Ji Shengzhe's nine lifetimes of merit could sustain.","For \"founding members\" like Yang Su, obtaining one hundred points of luck might have been transferred from the Luck Transfer Immortal's own reserve, but the subsequent supply of luck absolutely could not be.","No individual or organization could afford such a massive quantity of luck, leaving only one possibility—","Borrowing luck.","Judging by his facial features, the injured man from today should have had a destiny of wealth and honor. Yet, he was nearly driven to bankruptcy by Sun Yong's oppression, and just because he criticized the resort a few times, he had a terrible stroke of bad luck, almost bleeding to death.","It was hard for Qi Quan not to suspect that Sun Yong, out of resentment for being fired back then, used the Luck Transfer Immortal to transfer his enemy's fortune to himself.","The black energy targeting her just now further confirmed this.","Who else but Qi Yingxue could do such a thing?","She was quite confident that Qi Yingxue had encountered the Luck Transfer Immortal.","Her phone chimed.","[Li Guoyan: Okay. I've already instructed the Longjiang City Investigation Department to proceed with the arrest.]","A certain hotel.","Qi Yingxue was fuming with anger, gnashing her teeth, when her phone rang again. She hurriedly looked down.","It wasn't He Yang, but Song Lin.","Her expression changed slightly. She waited nearly ten seconds, pressing answer just as the ringtone was about to end.","\"A-Lin? Is something wrong, calling so late?\" Qi Yingxue deliberately made her voice sound hoarse, pretending to be extremely sleepy.","Song Lin's voice was low. \"Yingxue, I hope I'm not disturbing you? I asked around and found out you just finished shooting and returned to the hotel, so I called.\"","Qi Yingxue: \"...\"","She gave a light cough. \"It's fine. I said too many lines today, my throat is sore.\"","Song Lin said with concern, \"Take care of yourself. Buy some throat lozenges.\"","In the past, he would have personally paid to have someone buy and deliver them, but now, he didn't have the means.","Qi Yingxue's expression was indifferent, but her voice remained unchanged from usual. \"Mhm, I know. You should rest more too.\"","\"Yingxue, could you... help me with something?\" Song Lin finally got to the point.","\"Go ahead,\" Qi Yingxue said.","\"Could you lend me five million? I promise I'll pay you back in a month, with interest,\" Song Lin's tone was somewhat awkward. He really had no other choice but to ask his fiancée for a loan.","To make a comeback, he needed capital. Five million was truly pocket change to his former self, and it wasn't a huge sum for Qi Yingxue either.","Qi Yingxue gave a light laugh. \"Why be so polite with me? But A-Lin, you know how it is, the entertainment industry is all about fame and fortune. I've earned quite a bit before, but it all went on gowns, jewelry, things like that. I haven't saved much at all. If I had the money, I would definitely give it to you!\"","What she said wasn't entirely false.","She had indeed earned a lot after entering the industry, but her expenses were also high. She didn't have much cash on hand, having just spent a million today. She really couldn't come up with five million.","Song Lin: \"...\"","\"How about this,\" Qi Yingxue suggested, \"I'll have my assistant sell all my bags and jewelry. I'm sure we can scrape together five million. I'll give it to you then, okay?\"","In truth, the gifts Song Lin had given her in the past were worth far more than five million.","Song Lin, who had once been capable of managing major projects single-handedly, was no fool. It was just that having known Qi Yingxue for over a decade, he was unwilling to believe his fiancée could change her attitude so quickly.","He covered his face, gripping the phone tightly.","It had taken immense courage for him to make this call, only to hear her seemingly concerned yet actually cold words.","How ironic.","He said hoarsely, \"Thank you, but that won't be necessary.\"","The call ended.","\"A-Lin, are you okay?\" Mrs. Song looked at him worriedly.","His face was far too pale.","Song Lin shook his head, smiling self-deprecatingly. \"Mom, Dad... let's call off the engagement with the Qi family.\"","Mr. Song wasn't surprised.","Their family had fallen to such a state; they really were no longer suitable to be in-laws with the Qi family. The Qi family hadn't brought it up yet, only out of consideration for saving face.","But they couldn't drag it on any longer.","Taking the initiative to bring it up would show more backbone than being forced into it.","He sighed. \"Your mother and I had this thought before, but considering your good relationship with Qi Yingxue, we were afraid you'd take it hard, so we didn't mention it.\"","Song Lin was stunned. So he had been naive.","He had still been thinking about starting from scratch, not letting Qi Yingxue suffer with him. He had even asked her to wait for him. Thinking back now, he had been presumptuous and lacked self-awareness.","Rather than waiting for his uncertain future, it would be better for her to find another \"Song Lin.\"","He confessed frankly, \"I just asked her to lend me five million, but she refused. I think... she probably doesn't want to be with me anymore.\"","\"Mhm.\" Mr. Song, having experienced more, saw things more clearly. \"Since she's made her attitude clear, you shouldn't contact her anymore in the future.\"","Mrs. Song was more emotional. \"Was your over-a-decade-long relationship fake? No matter how busy you were before, you never forgot to spend time with her, spent so much money on gifts for her. How could she be so heartless!\"","\"Only sharing prosperity, not adversity. We've seen plenty of people like that. No need to be heartbroken over it.\" Mr. Song hadn't had much interaction with Qi Yingxue and was quite objective.","Mrs. Song said angrily, \"She just looks down on our family now that we're drowning in debt, thinks we can't rise again! I'll make sure she sees clearly!\"","Knowing his wife, Mr. Song couldn't help but frown. \"A-Mei, are you planning to...\"","Mrs. Song, named Zuo Mei, was from Longjing City. In her youth, she could be considered a wealthy heiress. However, during university, she fell in love with a poor young man named Song Weisheng—Song Lin's father.","Song Weisheng came from a poor family but was handsome, talented, and highly capable. The two were a perfect match, one with beauty and the other with talent.","Unfortunately, the Zuo family looked down on Song Weisheng. Furthermore, as the family needed Zuo Mei for a strategic marriage alliance, they firmly opposed the relationship.","Zuo Mei, however, was resolute. She was willing to sever ties with her family to be with Song Weisheng.","The couple left Longjing City and came to Longjiang City to build their lives.","Many years had passed. Song Weisheng had achieved success and fame, but Zuo Mei still held a grudge in her heart and had never initiated contact with her natal family.","Now, however, she had no choice but to take this step.","She smiled and said, \"It's been decades. It's time to let go. Face isn't important now; what's important is our family.\"","Song Weisheng held her hand, his eyes moist. \"It's my fault for not being capable enough.\"","\"It's fine. Big Brother used to dote on me. If I go to him, he'll surely be willing to lend us the money.\"","The Zuo family was a prominent household in Longjing City; coming up with a few million or even ten million would be effortless.","Song Weisheng also smiled. \"Yes, Big Brother did care for you deeply. He even punched me back then.\"","The couple reminisced about the past and couldn't help but laugh together.","Song Lin chimed in with a smile, \"Mom is so beautiful, of course she was well-liked.\"","\"Not bad,\" Zuo Mei said modestly. \"But if we're talking about beauty, it has to be the one back then—\"","Her words cut off abruptly.","\"The one back then what?\" Song Lin asked curiously.","Zuo Mei suddenly stood up, her face filled with astonishment. \"I know why she looks familiar! I remember now!\"","She was stunned for a long moment, then murmured, \"But how is that possible? It can't be...\"","Father and son: ???","Inside the hotel, Qi Yingxue heard the call end, and a trace of reluctance welled up in her heart, but it was quickly suppressed by her inherently self-serving nature.","Suddenly, there was a knock at the door.","An inexplicable panic arose in her. She didn't respond.","The knocking continued.","\"Excuse me, is the guest in the room there? We are the police. Please open the door.\"","Qi Yingxue: ?","...Why were the police looking for her?","She looked through the peephole. A male officer and a female officer stood outside; the one speaking was the female officer.","It was unlikely someone would impersonate police inside a hotel, right?","She asked through the door, \"What is this about?\"","The female officer said, \"You may have been involved in an illegal pyramid scheme organization. Please cooperate with our investigation.\"","Pyramid scheme?!","Qi Yingxue whirled around and looked at the statue that had turned to dust.","She really had been scammed!","\"Ms. Qi, please cooperate with the police investigation,\" the female officer said sternly again.","Deep down, Qi Yingxue felt some fear of the police. She had no choice but to open the door, her eyes reddening as she said, \"I was tricked!\"","The female officer, however, didn't look at her but turned her head towards the back.","A girl with dreadlocks suddenly stepped forward, produced her credentials, and said with a serious expression, \"Hello, Special Case Investigation Division. Please come with us.\"","Qi Yingxue: \"...\""]},{"number":46,"title":"Chapter 46","paragraphs":["\"Name.\"","\"Qi Yingxue.\"","\"Gender.\"","\"Female.\"","\"Do you know why you're sitting here?\"","Qi Yingxue: \"...\"","How would she know? She was utterly bewildered.","She had thought the police were looking for her, but the people who arrested her weren't police at all; they were from some \"Investigation Department.\"","She had never even heard of this agency!","She asked, \"Who are you people? What right do you have to arrest me?\"","The interrogator took out a bag of powder and asked her, \"What is this?\"","Qi Yingxue's heart sank with panic. \"I don't know. Maybe the hotel cleaning wasn't thorough.\"","Interrogator: \"I never said this was from your room.\"","\"...\"","When people lie, they often subconsciously say more, trying to make their story hold up, but the more they say, the more holes appear.","\"Speak.\" The interrogator threw the bag onto the table.","Qi Yingxue had always had a smooth life, never been in trouble. Once tricked into revealing herself, she grew even more panicked and confused, so she confessed everything.","\"It was He Yang who lured me into buying it. He said it could change my luck, but it was completely useless! He swindled over a million out of me!\"","\"Who is He Yang?\"","\"The male lead number two in the film crew.\"","Outside, watching the interrogation, Meng Yunzheng immediately said, \"Summon He Yang.\"","When He Yang was apprehended, he was meticulously wiping the statue of the Fortune Immortal, treating it like some priceless treasure.","He frantically tried to hide the statue, but it was too late.","Overnight, both the female lead and the male lead number two of the crew were taken away. Many people saw them being escorted from the hotel into vehicles. The news spread to Weibo, shooting straight to the top of the hot search list.","[Are they police? They don't look like it.]","[No, but there are police accompanying them. Judging by the uniforms, it seems like some special department.]","The Investigation Department's uniforms are quite similar to police uniforms, the difference being the former are specially made to defend against magical attacks.","[Did Qi Yingxue do something wrong? And He Yang too? What's with this crew's feng shui?]","[First Wei Xu and Yuan Qing, now He Yang and Qi Yingxue. This male lead number two role must be cursed. Whoever plays it gets into trouble, and each time drags down a female actor too.]","[Don't compare Qi Yingxue to Goddess Yuan! One is a perpetrator, the other was a victim, okay!]","[The official announcement hasn't come out yet, don't just spout nonsense. How do you know Qi Yingxue did something wrong?]","[Are you blind? Didn't you see her being escorted into the car?]","The Qi family, having received the news, was at a loss.","Qi Changrong rushed to the police station to inquire, but the police wouldn't reveal a thing. He asked many friends, but not a single one could find out any information.","\"What on earth happened? Wasn't she filming on set?\"","Gu Qiao's face was pale, but she forced herself to stay calm. \"It might be a misunderstanding.\"","Qi Lin returned from outside, his expression icy. \"I found out. It is indeed an official law enforcement department, investigating special cases.\"","He had some connections with second-generation circles and could gather some information.","Anyway, there was no need to hide these things. As Qi Yingxue's family, they would be notified sooner or later.","\"Official? Special cases?\" Gu Qiao asked anxiously. \"What kind of special cases? What exactly did she do?\"","Qi Lin's gaze was cold and heavy. \"Something that harms people.\"","\"Ah?\" Gu Qiao was stunned.","Qi Changrong was equally surprised. \"A Lin, how much did you actually find out?\"","\"The specifics I don't know, but reportedly, she joined an illegal pyramid scheme organization and used special methods to harm people. This is beyond our control.\"","...","\"What should we do now?\"","Qi Lin: \"Wait. The authorities will notify us.\"","Sure enough, officials soon came to notify them.","It was Shen Hui and Tang Mian.","Both were devoted followers of Qi Quan. Upon learning that Qi Quan had been secretly harmed, and by such clumsy means at that, they were furious and specifically applied for this task.","Now, among those who knew Qi Quan, who hadn't read \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family\"?","In the novel, the Qi family treated the Master with indifference, and Qi Yingxue hid needles in her cotton-wool demeanor, secretly bullying the Master. They had long wanted to see this family for themselves.","Shen Hui's smile was gone, his face cold. \"Mr. Qi, Mrs. Gu, your daughter Qi Yingxue is suspected of involvement in an illegal pyramid scheme and the use of special means to intentionally harm others. She is currently under criminal detention.\"","Gu Qiao nearly fainted.","\"Illegal pyramid scheme? How could she get involved in a pyramid scheme? It's not like she doesn't have money!\"","Actually, this charge was just for show on the surface. The methods used by the occult world to harm people couldn't be explained in detail to ordinary people.","But regardless, He Yang's actions of luring Qi Yingxue into paying membership fees and buying statues at high prices using the Fortune Immortal did indeed constitute this crime.","Moreover, this wasn't his first time doing such things.","He had developed quite a few downlines.","Under the Investigation Department's interrogation, he revealed a lot about the organization, but he was just a small fry; they couldn't dig out the big fish.","As for Qi Yingxue, being a first-time offender who hadn't yet had time to develop downlines, she technically didn't constitute the crime of illegal pyramid scheme in the strictest sense. However, using the Fortune Immortal to secretly harm Qi Quan was an established fact.","The money transfers and text messages in her phone were all clear evidence.","Tang Mian handed the printed evidence to Gu Qiao.","After reading it, Gu Qiao felt a stabbing pain in her heart. She was stunned for a long moment before breaking down into sobs.","Qi Changrong's hands trembled.","He didn't understand what sending \"name + date of birth\" to the Fortune Immortal public account actually meant, but he knew clearly that what Qi Yingxue sent was indeed Qi Quan's name and birth date!","He choked up and asked, \"Officer, I just want to know, what exactly happens when you send this to the public account?\"","Shen Hui said coldly, \"At best, an accident. At worst, loss of life.\"","The injured man at the resort was proof.","Although these occult evil arts shouldn't be easily disclosed to ordinary people, the Qi family had personally experienced occult methods before, so telling them wasn't a big deal.","Qi Changrong clenched his jaw tightly, his eyes reddening, his voice hoarse. \"I truly never expected this!\"","Previously, when Qi Yingxue anonymously slandered \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family,\" he thought it was just a young girl's jealousy, at most a moral issue. Because of this, he had distanced himself somewhat from this adopted daughter.","But who would have thought she would silently do such a harmful thing!","Was she really that resentful?","What on earth is her heart made of?","For over twenty years, she lived a princess-like life in the Qi family, while his biological daughter grew up in an orphanage. She had already received so much, why did she harbor such great hatred towards Qi Quan?","He truly didn't understand.","Qi Lin took several deep breaths and asked, \"Then what will happen to her in the future?\"","Shen Hui: \"That depends on how the case is judged.\"","\"Understood. Thank you for informing us.\"","Shen Hui and Tang Mian left the Qi residence and got into their car.","\"Mrs. Gu cried so miserably,\" Tang Mian muttered sarcastically. \"When Senior Qi first returned home, did she ever cry out of heartache for her?\"","Shen Hui said calmly, \"After all, she raised her with care for over twenty years. The bond is deep.\"","\"Hmph.\" Tang Mian pulled out a lollipop...","...stuck it in her mouth, and crunched it to pieces.","Shen Hui: \"...\"","While online discussions were buzzing, Di Meng arrived alone at the Changshun County resort early the next morning.","His demeanor was casual and somewhat roguish, not looking like a proper character, making the staff who received him quite cautious.","The two of them walked into the villa, one after the other.","On the foyer table stood a statue, glaringly conspicuous.","The staff member noticed him looking at it a few extra times, mentally appraised the price range of his clothes, found them all to be unknown brands of little value, and thus offered no introduction.","Di Meng didn't ask either.","After the door closed, he took several photos of the statue from different angles, along with the QR code tag, and sent them all to Li Guoyan's phone.","[Li Guoyan: Received. Proceed with caution.]","Di Meng tugged at the corner of his mouth.","He stared at the statue, pondered for a moment, and thought of a plan.","In the neighboring villa.","Yan Geng received the investigation results from the Yan family and couldn't help but frown.","\"Brother Huai, they said they found no trace of the statue in Longjing City, but have seen them in Longjiang, Longxi, Longtan, and Longlin.\"","Yan Huai: \"Hmm.\"","\"What should we do now?\"","Yan Huai asked: \"Can't trace the source?\"","\"Not yet.\"","Yan Huai rubbed the peach wood sword on his wrist with his thumb, thought for a moment, and said, \"Investigate the resort owner first.\"","\"How? Drag him here for interrogation?\" Yan Geng sighed.","Yan Huai was about to speak when his gaze suddenly froze.","\"Brother Huai, what's wrong?\" Yan Geng followed his line of sight and was instantly startled. \"What's going on!\"","The Fortune Immortal was smiling slightly, but its eyes suddenly shed tears of blood, extremely horrifying.","All the statues in the resort shed bloody tears, terrifying the tourists who fled in panic, overwhelming the customer service hotline.","The manager ran over, sweating profusely. Seeing the eerie statues, his heart pounded violently. He roared, \"Go check! See if someone is playing a prank!\"","A staff member trembled and said, \"Manager, all these statues started doing this at the same time. Who could have that capability? Could it really be a ghost?\"","Manager: \"...\"","He slapped the staff member. \"Just go check! Couldn't it be someone deliberately applying chemicals to create the illusion of bloody tears appearing simultaneously?!\"","Staff member: \"...\"","With so many villas in the resort and surveillance everywhere, who could possibly have that skill?","He grumbled inwardly, his heart pounding as he cautiously approached a statue. He wiped under its eyes with a napkin—nothing came off. He tried with a wet wipe—still nothing.","The statue continued to smile while shedding bloody tears.","Oh god, it looked even creepier up close!","The staff member instinctively threw away the tissue, ran back pale-faced, and said, \"Manager, it won't wipe off!\"","The tourists at the resort couldn't control their tempers anymore.","\"Is your resort haunted?\"","\"Isn't this supposed to be the Fortune Immortal? Why is it crying tears of blood? Will staying here really not bring bad luck?\"","\"Refund! Refund! Refund!\"","\"I dare not stay any longer, refund my money!\"","\"The resort is haunted! The owner is a fraud! Compensate me for my mental distress!\"","The manager's head was spinning.","He tried to placate the tourists while ordering someone to call and report to the higher-ups.","Yan Geng blended into the crowd and whispered to Yan Huai, \"Brother Huai, what exactly is going on?\"","Yan Huai: \"Just an illusion.\"","The spellcaster's cultivation was at level five; Yan Geng was only at level four, so it was normal he couldn't see through it.","\"An illusion?\" Yan Geng exclaimed. \"An exorcist did this? Which exorcist is so clever, impressive!\"","Yan Huai closed his eyes to sense, opening them again after just a few seconds. He turned to look towards the very back of the crowd.","He was tall, standing out like a crane among chickens. Looking over the sea of tourists' heads, his gaze met that of the young man at the very end.","Di Meng was watching the commotion when he suddenly sensed a mystical aura. He looked over and was stunned on the spot.","Yan Huai?!","Why is he here too?","Yan Huai moved through the crowd and stopped in front of Di Meng, stating with certainty, \"You did it.\"","\"None of your business.\" Di Meng rolled his eyes.","Every time he thought of the Great Exorcist Competition, he felt suffocated with frustration. Seeing Yan Huai naturally put him in a bad mood.","Yan Geng couldn't hold back. \"We're investigating these statues, so of course it's our business!\"","\"Investigating?\" Di Meng sneered. \"What's your Yan family meddling for? This has nothing to do with you.\"","\"What Yan family?\" Yan Geng said indignantly. \"We are also exorcists from the Exorcist Association. When we see evil and crooked ways, we naturally investigate thoroughly!\"","\"What bullshit Exorcist Association?\" Di Meng showed no respect. \"That Yan Wu from your Yan family committed so many crimes. Why didn't your Exorcist Association deal with him? You even called the Investigation Department trying to borrow a level-six great ghost to get him out. And now you're here pretending to be the good guys? How shameless!\"","Yan Geng: \"...\"","He really couldn't find a point to refute.","Yan Wu had indeed committed many wrongs. As for whether the Yan family had contacted the Investigation Department, he didn't know.","Yan Huai said, \"Yan Wu is not from the main family branch. I am not familiar with him. Regarding the phone call, I will clarify the matter.\"","\"Who cares!\" Di Meng scoffed. \"Anyway, exorcists from your association have been committing evils for years without you punishing them. Stop embarrassing yourselves here.\"","Yan Geng argued unhappily, \"It's not us who did the bad things. Why are you yelling at us? Brother Huai and I are investigating this case very seriously. Don't take your anger out on us.\"","\"To be honest, your Yan family is the number one great clan in Longjing. Yan Wu was involved in such a large-scale ghost marriage business chain. Did your Yan family really not notice at all? So, either your Yan family is complicit, or your Yan family is incompetent. Pick one.\"","\"...\"","Yan Geng was almost crying from anger.","He had always followed Yan Huai and never done anything bad. Being berated like this was hard for him to take.","\"Brother Huai...\"","Yan Huai remained stern and cold, as if he hadn't heard the harsh words.","In a villa not far away, Zhang Chengyan was lying on the windowsill looking out, gleefully saying, \"Everyone's shouting for refunds. I think the manager is about to be drowned in the tourists' spit.\"","\"I was scared too just now,\" Yang Su said as he leaned beside him. \"If the master hadn't told us it was an illusion, I would have run over there demanding compensation for mental distress from the manager too. It was way too scary!\"","Du Jiaming said, \"Which clever person thought of this method? If this blows up, Sun Yong will probably come to take charge.\"","Outside, the uproar continued, but their villa remained peaceful.","Qi Quan sat on the sofa, her right hand holding a cup of tea brewed by Steward Su, while her left hand pinched the dried fruit that Ling Sheng had removed impurities from. She listened to the three second-generation heirs chatting about the gossip outside, feeling utterly content.","[Great One, the way you are right now really has the potential of a behind-the-scenes boss.]","Qi Quan: ...","System: [However, you have people under you now, you can order others to work, and you have plenty of time. How about writing a new chapter to publish?]","Daily reminders to update were the sworn duty of a writer's system.","Qi Quan turned a deaf ear, continuing to leisurely drink tea and enjoy the spectacle.","Outside the villa, the situation was increasingly spiraling out of control.","The staff and security guards couldn't hold back the crowd. The manager had been scratched by someone a few times, leaving several thin red marks on his face.","Some people even tried to film the statues crying bloody tears to post online.","The resort's higher-ups couldn't sit still any longer.","Sun Yong happened to be in Changshun County. Hearing about the incident, he rushed over immediately to calm the situation.","This was his biggest cash cow; it couldn't afford any mishaps!","He arrived with over a dozen tall and imposing bodyguards. The black-clad guards standing there immediately intimidated the noisy tourists.","Sun Yong was not particularly good-looking, but he was saturated with the scent of money. Having mingled in high society for so long, he had acquired a certain imposing air, making him appear somewhat intimidating.","He stepped onto a slightly higher step, raised a hand to quiet the clamoring crowd, and declared solemnly, \"Honored guests, please don't panic. I understand how everyone feels. We can discuss any issues.\"","\"I am the person in charge of this resort. My surname is Sun. The fact that such an incident has occurred at the resort must have a reason. I have already reported it to the police and invited professionals to investigate. I will definitely give everyone a satisfactory answer.\"","\"If the investigation shows that our service was indeed inadequate, we will certainly compensate everyone for your losses. If someone deliberately caused trouble, we will also compensate for any psychological distress.\"","\"Since the results aren't out yet, why not wait a little longer? All activities within the resort today are free of charge. You can enjoy them to your heart's content. Food, beverages, and accommodation are also provided free of charge. Once the results are in, we will notify everyone immediately.\"","\"Manager Wang, take some people and prepare a resting area for everyone. Provide drinks, tea, snacks, and fruits to help everyone cool down.\"","Manager Wang breathed a sigh of relief. \"Yes, sir.\"","Seeing the person in charge being so sincere, the tourists' anger subsided considerably. Further pacified by the tea and drinks provided by the staff, their agitation completely died down, leaving them with no reason to continue making a scene.","At that moment, the police also arrived.","Zhang Chengyan remarked with admiration, \"This Sun Yong really has some skills.\"","\"Definitely. Even with the best luck, if the person themselves is incompetent, it's hard to prop them up, just like the fool Liu Shan,\" Yang Su agreed.","Du Jiaming asked, \"Huh? Why are the police coming towards us?\"","After the police arrived, Sun Yong explained the \"paranormal phenomena\" occurring at the resort.","\"Tears of blood?\" The police entered one of the villas and indeed saw the red streaks beneath the statue's eyes.","Sun Yong sighed heavily. \"These blood tears can't be wiped off no matter what. It's like it's haunted.\"","The police officer asked, \"Are all the statues in every villa like this?\"","Sun Yong replied instinctively, \"Yes...\"","\"There's one villa we haven't checked,\" a staff member said. \"One villa's door has been closed the whole time, and no one has come out.\"","Sun Yong asked, \"Are they resting?\"","He glanced at the sun's position. That's quite a late sleep-in. How could they not have heard all the commotion outside just now?","The police said, \"Let's go take a look.\"","There were two reasons for the lack of movement: either they hadn't seen the blood tears, or their statue wasn't crying blood.","Led by the staff, Sun Yong and the police headed towards the villa where Qi Quan was staying.","Zhang Chengyan turned back to report, \"Master, the police are here.\"","Qi Quan remained leaning on the sofa without moving. Su Rong and Xue Hong voluntarily concealed their forms. As for Ji Shengzhe, he was still hiding in his room watching TV.","\"Let them come. We haven't done anything wrong,\" Xue Hong said.","The three second-generation heirs: \"...\"","Hearing a voice from an invisible presence is really scary!","The doorbell rang...","Zhang Chengyan proactively ran to open the door.","\"Officers, you're finally here!\" He got into character, his face pale as he cried out, \"We woke up this morning and found this statue crying tears of blood! We didn't dare touch anything, afraid the villa might be cursed. Thankfully, we finally waited for you!\"","Sun Yong: \"...\"","The Police: \"...\"","\"Then why didn't you call the police?\" an officer asked.","Zhang Chengyan said, \"I was afraid some dirty thing was watching me. This resort is too terrifying. Anyway, I'm never coming back!\"","Sun Yong: \"...\"","He felt Zhang Chengyan looked somewhat familiar but couldn't place him at the moment.","\"I'm truly sorry. It must be someone playing a prank to scare people. Please don't worry, there's no curse.\"","As he spoke, his gaze involuntarily drifted towards the sofa.","It was nothing else; the man and woman on the sofa were simply too good-looking, more attractive than any handsome men or beautiful women he had ever seen.","Zhang Chengyan seemingly unintentionally blocked his line of sight and said impatiently, \"Is that so? Well, that still means your resort's oversight was lacking. You have to take responsibility. Also, what exactly is this thing? It looks ancient and weird, completely clashing with the villa's style.\"","Sun Yong: \"...\"","Why is this guy's tone so annoying?","At that moment, Manager Wang hurried over and whispered to Sun Yong, \"Boss Sun, the master has arrived.\"","Sun Yong immediately said, \"Officers, these blood tears simply cannot be wiped off. It really is a bit bizarre. While I believe in science, sometimes you just want peace of mind. I've just invited a Daoist priest over to take a look at these statues.\"","Police Officer: \"...Superstition is not advisable.\"","\"But the situation is genuinely strange. The resort is covered in surveillance cameras. If someone really made all the statues cry blood simultaneously, how could the cameras not have captured anything?\"","The system was quite puzzled: [Why didn't he just invite the master earlier? Why call the police at all?]","Qi Quan: [The police hold authority in the minds of ordinary people; they can calm the situation.]","[That's true.]","The frightened tourists all showed expressions of relief upon seeing the police.","If Sun Yong hadn't called the police, the tourists would definitely have thought he was insincere, and their trust in him would have greatly diminished.","But now a problem arose: would the police allow a Daoist priest to touch this potential evidence?","On the plaza, all the statues had been gathered together. The streaks of blood tears looked quite spectacular.","The police had already tested them with instruments and found nothing unusual. The blood tears were truly peculiar.","Just as they were about to take them back to the station for detailed examination, Sun Yong arrived with a tall, thin middle-aged man.","Di Meng had orchestrated this whole scene precisely to draw out Sun Yong, who would then actively lead to the mastermind behind him—the celestial master.","He sat on a bench not far from the plaza, glanced at the tall, thin celestial master, and slightly frowned.","A Level 4 Celestial Master?","How could a Level 4 Celestial Master have this much influence?","There must be a bigger fish behind him.","On the neighboring bench, Yan Geng was also muttering.","\"Brother Huai, this guy doesn't look like the mastermind.\"","\"Mhm.\"","On the plaza, the tall, thin celestial master scanned the blood tears and faintly sensed a trace of spiritual power fluctuation. However, his cultivation was not as high as Di Meng's, so he couldn't see through it.","\"Master, what do you think?\" Sun Yong asked expectantly.","The tall, thin celestial master put on a profound expression and said, \"This matter is of great importance. I must report it to my superiors.\"","The Police: ???","The tall, thin celestial master felt inexplicably panicked. He didn't care what the police thought at the moment. He walked to the side, pulled out his phone, found a number, and was just about to dial when his body suddenly stiffened.","Why couldn't he move?!","A hand swiftly snatched his phone, glanced at the number, and clicked his tongue twice...","The tall, thin celestial master's eyes widened.","Why hadn't he considered that if a celestial master was causing trouble at the resort, they wouldn't necessarily leave after causing it!","He really had panicked and lost his head!","\"Mmph mmph...\"","Di Meng sent the phone number to Li Guoyan, a half-smile playing on his face. \"Are you trying to ask who I am? Or are you trying to threaten me that the person behind you is someone I can't afford to provoke?\"","The tall, thin celestial master: \"...\"","Di Meng took out a pair of handcuffs and decisively slapped them on him.","The handcuffs used by the Investigation Department to arrest the celestial master were specially made to suppress their spiritual power, preventing them from using mystical arts to escape.","The tall, thin celestial master: \"Mmmph! Mmmph!\"","Di Meng dragged him towards the stunned police officers.","A wall appeared in front of him.","He chuckled with annoyance, \"Yan Huai, I caught him. Don't even think about swooping in.\"","Yan Huai: \"There are others behind him. Doesn't the Investigation Department need help?\"","\"...\"","While Di Meng's outward attitude towards him wasn't great, inwardly he still respected his cultivation level.","He said, \"You're from the Celestial Master Association.\"","There's a barrier between the Celestial Master Association and the Investigation Department.","Yan Huai: \"I am a citizen. Citizens have an obligation to assist law enforcement departments.\"","Di Meng: Tsk, this guy's sophistry skills are on par with his swordsmanship.","He was somewhat persuaded.","The Investigation Department was indeed short-handed at the moment, especially high-level celestial masters. If they could recruit Yan Huai, wouldn't that be a great thing?","\"I'm afraid you'll leak secrets,\" Di Meng deliberately provoked him. \"You're an elite of the Celestial Master Association and the heir of the first great family. Who knows what you're really after.\"","Yan Geng said angrily, \"How can you disparage someone like that?\"","\"Isn't Yan Wu from your family?\"","\"...\"","Yan Huai said, \"I will not leak secrets, or my cultivation will never advance another step.\"","The vows made by celestial masters carry the force of rules. This punishment is too terrifying for a celestial master to joke about.","The corner of Di Meng's mouth lifted. \"Fine.\"","There might be even bigger fish on this line. He was only Level Five, while Yan Huai was already Level Six. Having him would provide more security.","Moreover, this was a great opportunity to boss around the Yan family's top talent.","He handed the tall, thin celestial master over to Yan Huai, walked up to the police, and, right in front of Sun Yong, pulled out his credentials.","\"Hello, comrades. I am an investigator from the Investigation Department. Sun Yong is suspected of involvement in a special case. Please assist with the investigation.\"","Police: !!!","Sun Yong: ???","In a moment of panic, he instinctively turned and tried to run.","The police reacted swiftly, grabbing him by the collar and hauling him back, handcuffing him.","The legendary Investigation Department! Finally got to see it in action today!","Meanwhile, Investigation Department branches in other involved regions successively apprehended numerous suspects possessing the \"Fortune Transfer Immortal,\" including both celestial masters and ordinary people.","The phone number the tall, thin celestial master tried to contact was also traced to its owner.","The people at the Longjiang City Investigation Department were shocked.","\"Who?\"","\"Lu Shen.\"","Meng Yunzheng massaged his forehead. It was that celestial master who helped fuse a first love's soul with a wife's body.","After his arrest, Lu Shen had always styled himself as the \"nephew of the Lu Elder of the Guiyuan Sect,\" supremely confident that the sect would rescue him, and thus refused to cooperate with interrogations.","For such a difficult case, the Investigation Department could only keep him detained.","The Guiyuan Sect had indeed proposed an exchange: to help Longjiang City deal with the North Suburb Great Ghost. But after the North Suburb Great Ghost disappeared... there had been no further movement from the Guiyuan Sect.","The Investigation Department believed that Lu Shen, a mere Level Five celestial master, likely didn't have the capability to create such an extensive network. There must be someone else behind him.","It was highly likely to be the Guiyuan Sect's Elder Lu.","To be called an \"Elder\" within a sect, one must be at least a Level Seven celestial master.","But aside from an enigmatic Chief Consultant, all other investigators in the Investigation Department were below Level Seven, completely incapable of suppressing such a figure.","Of course, the authorities weren't entirely without means to deal with high-level celestial masters.","No matter how high a celestial master's level, they are ultimately still bound by mortal flesh. No matter how miraculous their methods, they would still succumb to heavy weaponry.","However, the authorities would only resort to that as a last resort.","Meng Yunzheng instructed his subordinates: \"First, retrieve the files on the Guiyuan Sect's Lu Jiang. Then increase the interrogation pressure on Lu Shen.\"","While the Investigation Department was busy making arrests, netizens were busy feasting on the gossip.","Following last night's news about He Yang and Qi Yingxue, reports emerged from various places about more entertainment industry figures being arrested. One scandal followed another, making it livelier than New Year's and leaving people utterly stuffed.","[So what did all these people do? Feels like a major case.]","[Scary. I was eagerly eating it up last night, but now I'm almost afraid to look.]","[Actually, what's been exposed is probably just a small part. People in the entertainment industry have high visibility, after all. There might be many outsiders arrested too, we just don't know.]","[What kind of case is this, really? I'm completely in the dark.]","[Whispering... I heard it's illegal pyramid schemes.]","[Pfft, pyramid schemes? You're kidding, right?]","[Are these people that short on money? Or were they threatened? The people behind this scheme must be incredibly powerful then.]","[The worst off is still the jxz crew. Their feng shui is truly awful. First there was Wei Xu and Yuan Qing, now He Yang and Qi Yingxue, and both are legal offenders. I'm just saying, they should go pray to the Bodhisattva.]","[They are truly pitiable. Sympathy for a second.]","Resort.","With Sun Yong arrested, the resort was classified as a \"pyramid scheme den.\" Authorities notified all tourists to leave, then sealed it off for investigation.","Qi Quan was already on the road back to the city.","\"Master, does that mean I've incurred karma?\" Yang Su asked again, his face pale.","He now knew the \"Fortune Transfer Immortal\" transferred others' luck to oneself and was terrified he might have committed some sin.","Qi Quan: \"No.\"","\"That's good, that's good!\"","The amount of luck gained from a few card games was minuscule and negligible. The Fortune Transfer Immortal wasn't that generous with handing out substantial \"benefits\" to new members.","Furthermore, Yang Su had acted on her instructions without malicious intent, so he wouldn't incur karma.","Her phone suddenly rang. It was a call from Li Guoyan.","\"Master Qi, enjoying your trip?\" he asked with a laugh.","Qi Quan: \"Quite.\"","\"The minor ringleader for the Fortune Transfer Immortal in Longjiang City is Lu Shen. Do you recall him?\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","Who was Lu Shen again?","Li Guoyan probably guessed and patiently explained, \"The celestial master from the wife-swapping case, currently detained at the Investigation Department. He is the biological nephew of the Guiyuan Sect's Lu Jiang. We retrieved Lu Jiang's files and discovered that thirty years ago he was only a Level Three celestial master, but now he's Level Seven.\"","The difference between Level Three and Level Seven is vast.","\"Thirty years ago he was already thirty-five. Without some special opportunity, it would be very difficult to jump four levels in thirty years,\" Li Guoyan said meaningfully.","Only reaching Level Three by thirty-five indicated rather mediocre talent. With such mediocre talent, becoming Level Seven in just thirty years inevitably raised suspicions that there must be something fishy going on.","Fast-money methods are all written in the criminal code. By the same logic, aren't fast-cultivation methods all found in the forbidden arts of the mystical world?","Qi Quan: \"Do you have a photo?\"","\"Yes, I'll send it to you.\"","The photo arrived immediately, showing a man with the face of someone in his thirties, utterly ordinary in appearance.","Qi Quan released Ji Shengzhe from the peachwood talisman and asked, \"Have you seen him?\"","Ji Shengzhe, still immersed in the TV drama he had just been watching, listlessly lifted his eyelids. His vacant gaze fell on the photo.","The next second, his eyes widened abruptly.","He floated over urgently, staring fixedly at the person in the photo. Dark energy instantly erupted from his ghostly form, his eyes turning a dense, bloody red.","\"I remember!\" he rasped hoarsely. \"I remember him!\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","The fortune of a ten-life virtuous person is truly invincible.","She wasn't certain that Lu Jiang was the mastermind behind the Fortune Immortal, but on a whim, she casually asked him to identify the person. Unexpectedly, there was a connection.","Qi Quan shot out a strand of spiritual energy, suppressing the black aura around Ji Shengzhe and pulling him back to his senses.","\"Who is he?\"","Ji Shengzhe murmured, \"I went to confront the developer back then, and this person was next to the developer!\"","A photograph unlocked a sealed memory.","\"The developer seemed to treat him with great respect. Because the developer was bossing me around and ordering me about, the contrast made me remember it quite clearly. But I didn't know who he was. I just remember when the security guards were throwing me out, he seemed to glance at me a few times, looking somewhat excited.\"","But at the time, he thought it was just his imagination and didn't pay it much mind.","Now, Master Qi had produced this person's photo, which meant this person was definitely problematic!","The case was beginning to clear up.","It's normal for developers to hire masters to assess feng shui. Back then, although Lu Jiang was an obscure third-level master, he was more than capable of checking the feng shui of a plot of land.","What was supposed to be an ordinary business transaction unexpectedly led him to encounter a nine-life virtuous person. Just one more fulfilled life, and they would achieve the accomplishment of perfect ten-life merit!","Lu Jiang was instantly overcome with greed.","Qi Quan relayed Ji Shengzhe's words to Li Guoyan.","Li Guoyan said gravely, \"No matter what, we must summon Lu Jiang for questioning.\"","With the victim ghost's testimony, it's perfectly reasonable to just summon him for an inquiry.","But would a seventh-level master be willing to give them this face?","Li Guoyan said earnestly, \"Master Qi, we might have to trouble you to go on a business trip.\"","For a seventh-level master, only Qi Quan could handle it.","Qi Quan remained silent.","\"The travel expenses will be transferred immediately,\" Li Guoyan said.","[Big Boss, \"Nation's Fortune Endures\" has thrown three thousand deep-water torpedoes at \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family\"!]","Three hundred thousand in travel expenses—a generous and very sincere gesture.","It made it hard for Qi Quan to refuse out of embarrassment.","She asked, \"Where?\"","\"What?\"","\"Where am I going for this trip?\"","Li Guoyan: \"... The Guiyuan Sect is in Longjing City. You'll need to come to Longjing for this assignment. The Investigation Department will arrange a dedicated car to pick you up.\"","\"Thank you.\"","Qi Quan hung up the phone and looked up, meeting Ling Sheng's inquiring gaze.","He was sitting beside Qi Quan, very close.","Qi Quan could even smell his scent, somewhat like lush green grass, full of vitality.","She always had a favorable impression of clean and fresh-smelling boys.","\"What's wrong?\" Qi Quan asked with a light laugh.","...","Ling Sheng typed on his phone: [You're going on a business trip.]","Qi Quan nodded, deliberately teasing him: \"Gotta go on trips to earn money, so I can support this whole big family.\"","Yang Su, who was driving: \"...\"","Master, can you even count all your assets?","Ling Sheng, however, was very serious: [I can earn money too.]","\"How will you earn money?\" Qi Quan asked with interest.","[I've heard talismans from the Mystic Arts sell for a lot.] He looked at Qi Quan expectantly.","Qi Quan: \"Only high-level talismans sell for a high price.\"","Ling Sheng nodded and didn't type anymore.","The car drove all the way to Lakeside Villa.","Outside Lakeside Villa, Zuo Mei stood patiently in the shade of a tree. She was dressed plainly; the earrings, necklaces, bracelets, and other accessories worth millions from her past were nowhere to be seen.","She had rung the doorbell for a long time with no response, so she could only wait here.","Fortunately, her luck was good, and she finally waited for Qi Quan.","Qi Quan got out of the car.","\"Master Qi!\" Zuo Mei strode forward but stopped a meter away, not daring to get any closer.","Last time, she had been used by someone and almost harmed Qi Quan, which left her feeling quite guilty.","Qi Quan glanced at her facial features and said calmly, \"Come in.\"","Zuo Mei gratefully followed behind.","Du Jiaming and the other two tactfully said their greetings and left.","In the living room, Zuo Mei stood awkwardly beside the sofa, her gaze involuntarily drifting towards Ling Sheng.","Ling Sheng seemed oblivious to her looks, quietly making tea for Qi Quan.","Because Zuo Mei was present, Qi Quan couldn't very well release the three ghosts in front of her, so Ling Sheng took over Butler Su's duties.","The fresh aroma of tea gradually soothed Zuo Mei's nerves.","Qi Quan: \"Please, have a seat.\"","Zuo Mei instinctively sat on the sofa, her fingers unconsciously twisting the fabric of her skirt. She asked with difficulty, \"Master, is our family... out of trouble now?\"","She still had lingering fears about the powerful ghost, worried it might still be targeting the Song family, preventing them from earning money again.","Qi Quan nodded: \"The karma has been settled.\"","\"Thank you for your guidance, Master.\" She paused, then gathered her courage to ask, \"This gentleman looks very familiar to me. May I ask where his family is from?\"","Qi Quan said calmly, \"Mrs. Song, you might as well speak plainly.\"","Zuo Mei gritted her teeth, opened her phone's photo album, and handed it to Qi Quan.","\"Master, look at this.\"","In the photo, the woman had thick, dark hair, slightly curled and cascading over her shoulders. Her demeanor was elegant, yet her eyes and brows were exceptionally charming. In terms of appearance alone, she ranked in the top three in Qi Quan's mind.","The most crucial point was that Ling Sheng looked extremely like her.","Judging by their facial features, they were undoubtedly mother and son.","Qi Quan was only surprised internally; not a hint showed on her face.","Seeing her reaction, Zuo Mei grew uneasy.","\"Master...\"","Qi Quan: \"Who is she?\"","Zuo Mei didn't hold back: \"The Fu family in Longjing City, Fu Jiuge. I've only ever seen her from afar before. This photo was sent to me by an acquaintance.\"","\"Thank you for telling me. Mrs. Song, if you have any requests, please feel free to ask,\" Qi Quan said politely.","Zuo Mei clutched her phone tightly and asked, \"Master, I'd like to ask you to help divine my son's marriage prospects.\"","\"...\"","The last time Qi Quan saw Song Lin was on the surveillance screen from the restroom during Su Nuanuan's birthday banquet. If the system hadn't mentioned it at the time, she wouldn't have paid any attention.","Back then, Song Lin was already tainted with Yin energy, but his marriage thread was still tightly bound to Qi Yingxue.","As for now...","She said, \"I need to see a recent photo.\"","Zuo Mei was prepared. She pulled up a photo of Song Lin.","Qi Quan glanced at it casually and was taken aback.","In the system's description of the... original book, Qi Yingxue and Song Lin were a match made in heaven, their marriage thread extremely thick and strong, almost impossible to break.","In this photo, however, Song Lin's marriage thread already had a crack, showing faint signs of disappearing, though it wasn't completely severed yet.","She thought for a moment and asked, \"Mrs. Song, are you aware that his fiancée has been criminally detained?\"","\"Ah?\" Zuo Mei was stunned.","The three of them in her family were now busy making ends meet every day and paid no attention to online news. Therefore, they didn't know about Qi Yingxue trending on social media last night.","Others who were aware wouldn't specifically test them on this matter at this juncture.","She truly had no idea about Qi Yingxue's situation.","They had just discussed last night how to approach the Qi family to call off the engagement.","She came to her senses and asked incredulously, \"You mean... criminal detention?\"","Qi Quan nodded.","Zuo Mei: \"...\"","She abruptly stood up, hastily bid farewell, and hurriedly left Lakeside Villa."]},{"number":47,"title":"Chapter 47","paragraphs":["Zuo Mei returned home with a heavy heart.","She glanced toward the window.","Song Lin was intently studying the stock market trends, his face a bit pale. His vitality had been severely depleted before, and he still hadn’t fully recovered.","Perhaps it was because Qi Yingxue’s cold attitude last night had hurt him, adding a layer of gloom to his pallor.","The soft golden sunlight streamed onto him, casting a quiet loneliness around him.","He was a proud man, not one to easily show his emotions.","How could Zuo Mei not understand him?","She picked up the thin blanket on the sofa and gently draped it over Song Lin’s legs, her expression tender, eyes filled with concern. “You’re recovering quickly, but your body’s still weak. Don’t catch a cold.”","Song Lin obediently arranged the blanket and smiled faintly. “Mom, do you have something you want to say to me?”","Mother and son understood each other perfectly.","Zuo Mei hesitated for a moment, then asked with utmost seriousness, “Lin, are you really determined to completely cut ties with Qi Yingxue?”","Song Weisheng, sitting in the living room, keenly sensed something was wrong with her.","“Mei, did something happen?”","Zuo Mei had already checked the news online during her trip home.","She took a deep breath and said, “Qi Yingxue was detained by the police last night.”","The two Song men exchanged stunned looks.","“The internet is buzzing about it, and there’s even a video.”","Song Lin’s fingers paused mid-air. “I talked to her last night...”","“Right after the call ended, the police took her away,” Zuo Mei said coldly.","She wasn’t truly cold-hearted.","When Qi Yingxue’s public image collapsed and made headlines, Zuo Mei was too worried about her son being trapped in an elevator to pay much attention to the online rumors.","Later, when bigger troubles arose, she had even less energy to care about the online chaos. She still held onto the old image of Qi Yingxue.","It wasn’t that she genuinely liked Qi Yingxue—only that Qi Yingxue had always behaved particularly obedient and gentle in front of her, and her son truly liked her. So, in her heart, she accepted Qi Yingxue as her daughter-in-law.","Having experienced the pain of being forced apart by her own parents, Zuo Mei naturally did not want her son to suffer the same fate with any girl.","Last night, when Qi Yingxue’s attitude toward her son turned cold and he took the initiative to say he wanted to break off the engagement, Zuo Mei saw how gloomy he was. Worried that he might have spoken in anger, she went to the lakeside villa.","She tried to calm herself down this way.","If her son’s relationship was truly over, she would go to Qi’s family to cancel the engagement; if it wasn’t, then there was still hope.","But reality dealt her a harsh blow.","She had once bravely defied family pressure and worked hard with her husband, but that didn’t mean others would endure hardships alongside her son.","Still, the severed engagement line left her with only a trace of sorrow. Qi Yingxue’s detention was a complete and utter disappointment.","She never imagined that the daughter-in-law she once accepted could actually harm others!","On her way back, she carefully read through every online report about Qi Yingxue’s situation before finally understanding that Qi Yingxue’s public image had collapsed because she truly had fallen from grace.","It wasn’t just rumors!","Zuo Mei reached out and patted her son’s shoulder with a light sigh. “Lin, a girl like this—our family simply can’t accept her.”","“Last night, we already decided to call off the engagement,” Song Weisheng said in a low, firm voice. “Even if we do it now, some might accuse us of kicking someone when they’re down, but I have a clear conscience.”","He was always decisive, immediately picking up his phone to contact Qi Changrong.","Unexpectedly, Qi Changrong called first.","“Old Song,” Qi Changrong’s voice was a little hoarse but still calm, “You know about Qi Yingxue’s trouble, right?”","Song Weisheng put the call on speaker...","“I only know she’s been detained, but I don’t know the details.”","“She tried to harm someone—she tried to harm Qi Quan,” Qi Changrong’s voice carried a trace of restrained anger. “I admit the Qi family hasn’t wronged her, and your family hasn’t either. But now she’s done something wrong and is about to face trial. I don’t want to hold up A Lin. He’s a good kid. Let’s just end the engagement between our two families here.”","Song Weisheng secretly breathed a sigh of relief and felt touched by Qi Changrong’s initiative to end the engagement.","When the Song family fell, Qi Changrong said nothing; now that Qi Yingxue was in trouble, he took the first step to break off the engagement.","No matter what, Song Weisheng and Zuo Mei were grateful to him.","“Alright,” he replied solemnly.","The bond between Song Lin and Qi Yingxue was completely severed.","At the Linhu Villa.","After Mrs. Song left, Qi Quan released the Three Ghosts.","Su Rong went to prepare ingredients, Xue Hong read a book, and Ji Shengzhe ran off to watch TV in his room again.","[Boss, you really should update today, right?] The system seemed eager enough to hold a little whip.","Qi Quan: [Alright, alright.]","She stood up and went back to her room. Just as she opened her computer, there was a knock on the door.","“Come in.”","The door opened, and Ling Sheng stepped in.","He was holding a thick stack of talisman papers.","Qi Quan: [This scene feels familiar.]","The system chuckled: [Last time it was a bunch of dust-removal talismans. What’s it this time?]","With curiosity in her eyes, Qi Quan watched as Ling Sheng handed over the talismans along with a note: [Make money.]","Qi Quan: “...”","She reached out to take the talismans and suddenly froze.","On top was a Level Six Thunder Talisman!","This was an offensive talisman—not too difficult to draw, but a Level Six Thunder Talisman required a high level of skill.","Whether in sects or noble families, raising a Level Six talisman master took enormous resources.","And she just happened to pick one up casually?","Looking further down, there were Level Six Spirit Talismans, Level Six Binding Talismans, Level Six Exorcism Talismans... except for a few that were Level Five, the rest were all Level Six!","Qi Quan couldn’t help but sigh: [Ding Ji is truly wasting talent like this—such a gifted person is only being used as a power bank.]","System: [...]","The boss was as sharp as ever.","Facing Ling Sheng’s expectant gaze, Qi Quan couldn’t find a single word to refuse, so she earnestly praised him, “You draw them very well, but I’m not very familiar with the talisman market in the Xuan Sect. Let me ask around and calculate how much you can make.”","Ling Sheng nodded.","Qi Quan sent a message to Li Guoyan: [What’s the market price for Level Six Xuan Sect talismans?]","Li Guoyan immediately called.","“Master, why the sudden question?”","Qi Quan finally understood how happy Xue Hong must feel—having a genius student really gave a huge sense of accomplishment.","In her past life, she had taught countless disciples, yet none could draw talismans directly from the manual without her holding a class and explaining carefully.","Qi Quan’s voice was calm, but the corner of her eyes held a smile.","“Just asking casually.”","Li Guoyan didn’t expose her and patiently explained, “Level-six talismans are considered high-grade in the Daoist sect and aren’t cheap. However, the value varies by type—some talismans are in higher demand and thus more expensive, while others, with less demand, cost less. Take the most common offensive thunder talisman, for example: a level-six thunder talisman sells for eleven thousand per piece. But for rare talismans, like spirit talismans, one piece can fetch fifty thousand.”","“Got it, thank you.”","Li Guoyan said, “Alright, I’ll send you a price list for various talismans later.”","“Okay, much appreciated.”","“Master,” Li Guoyan hesitated for a moment but decided to speak up, “If you have any spare talismans, would you consider selling them to the Investigation Department? We’re willing to buy at market price. Last time in Longlin City, you gave the local head a level-six imprisonment spirit talisman, and even low-level investigators were able to easily capture Wei Huanyang. It really brought great convenience to the department.”","Qi Quan replied, “Let’s talk about this in person tomorrow.”","“Alright.”","The call ended.","Qi Quan didn’t make decisions on her own and asked Ling Sheng, “Are you willing to sell talismans to the Investigation Department?”","Ling Sheng typed on his phone: [It’s all yours.]","He used talisman paper, cinnabar, and other materials—all provided by Qi Quan. The talisman manual was also gifted by her, so he considered all the talismans he drew as hers.","That was his logic.","Qi Quan smiled and asked, “You don’t want money? I can get you an ID card and a bank account, and deposit all the money from selling talismans for you.”","Ling Sheng shook his head seriously.","Qi Quan thought of the piles of sparrow jade cards in the storage room and decided to hold onto them for him. If he ever wanted them, she’d give them to him.","Upon learning that Qi Quan would be traveling tomorrow, Su Rong and Xue Hong both showed signs of reluctance.","Ji Shengzhe noticed Qi Quan staring at him and asked, “Am I going too?”","“Lu Jiang is very likely the one who stole your merits. Aren’t you going?” Qi Quan said.","Ji Shengzhe’s expression turned sharp: “I’m going!”","Watching the drama is more important than revenge!","Qi Quan instructed, “Butler Su and Teacher Xue will stay at home. Ling Sheng is coming with me to Longjing City.”","“You’re bringing Ling Sheng?” Su Rong was surprised.","Having spent so much time together, he guessed Ling Sheng’s constitution was special, and Qi Quan rarely let him travel. Why bring him this time?","Qi Quan didn’t hide it: “Ling Sheng’s relatives are from Longjing City.”","“Master, is it possible that Ling Sheng’s abduction wasn’t an accident?” Xue Hong asked seriously.","Qi Quan smiled, “I understand what you mean. Until we find out the truth, I won’t let Ling Sheng take any risks.”","The people and spirits of the lakeside villa had become like family who cared deeply for each other.","Qi Quan felt very gratified.","“There are plenty of spirit talismans stored in the warehouse. If there’s anything unusual with the villa’s formation, those jade cards can sustain it for quite a while.”","Su Rong smiled, “Thanks to Ling Sheng’s hard work carving them every day.”","It gave them peace of mind.","Qi Quan said, “Alright, meeting adjourned.”","A residence in Longjing City.","A handsome man sat in a chair, listening to his subordinate, the steward, report the latest news. Half of his face was shrouded in shadow, making his expression hard to read.","“You’re saying Yan Huai went too?” His voice was somewhat hoarse.","The steward replied nervously, “Yes, sir. Young Master Yan, along with personnel from the Investigation Department, escorted them onto the vehicle. They should have already been brought back to the Longjing Investigation Department by now.”","“Why is he tangled up with the Investigation Department?” The man scoffed. “Utter nonsense.”","The steward remained silent, unwilling to answer.","“Those two useless fools won’t spill anything. Don’t bother with them.”","“But Lu Shen is still in the interrogation room at the Longjiang City Investigation Department,” the steward reminded him.","The man sneered, “Do you really think those low-level investigators can touch a Level 7 Celestial Master? Ridiculous.”","The steward forced a smile. “Indeed.”","“However, I heard the authorities hired some sort of expert,” the man’s voice grew cold.","The steward replied, “At most, he should be a Level 6, Third Rank. Elder Lu is a Level 7, Second Rank.”","“Hmm.”","---","At 10 PM, late at night, the latest episode of *The Heiress Diaries* was released...","[Poor ghost died young.","When he died, televisions weren’t even widespread yet.","So after he broke free from prison, he became a TV addict. No matter where he went, the first thing he did was find a TV to catch up on dramas.","The night before going out to play, he stayed up all night watching shows, even skipping breakfast.","Such a habit actually saved on food.","I heard a recommendation and chose a highly praised resort.","The resort was nestled amid clear mountains and pure waters, filled with birdsong and blooming flowers. There was no industrial smoke or water pollution. The sky was a deep blue, the rivers crystal clear, and the air fresh.","We had a picnic on the grass.","From afar, the mountains rose tall and deep, the sky vast and the earth wide. It was truly uplifting.","Just as we were enjoying this beautiful scene, a cry for help echoed from the forest.","I took Poor Ghost with me to investigate.","It was an injured man. He had slipped down a hillside during an expedition, scratched deeply by sharp branches, bleeding heavily. His phone was broken and he couldn’t send a signal, so he had to shout for help.","Luckily, my hearing was good enough to catch it.","I called an ambulance for him, then took a closer look at his face.","Strange. He was born into a wealthy fate, yet looked so downtrodden.","—His messy hair and simple clothes made it obvious.","He was talkative. Before I could ask, he began to pour out his troubles.","He had once made a fortune, but for some unknown reason, bad luck struck him suddenly. His prospects plummeted, and his company was on the verge of collapse.","But judging by his appearance, he truly had financial luck and hadn’t faced many hardships.","Curious.","After he was taken to the hospital, I returned to the villa with Poor Ghost.","Nothing in the villa had changed, but for some reason, my attention was suddenly drawn to a statue.","Staff had introduced it to me when I first arrived.","It was called the “Luck-Transforming Deity.” As long as you had money, you could buy luck.","As a practitioner of the Mystical Path, I had never heard of such a bizarre thing.","Where in the world can you buy and sell luck?","Luck isn’t a product that can be manufactured or processed—it’s intangible.]","Suddenly, it occurred to me: could the man with a stable fate but plagued by bad luck be connected to this so-called \"Luck-Transforming Master\"?","I’m not entirely sure about this, but one thing I do know is that this \"Luck-Transforming Master\" is a sinister entity. People pay money to \"buy luck\" from him, but sooner or later, that luck will turn into misfortune and boomerang back onto themselves.","Sure enough, the very next morning, trouble struck the \"Luck-Transforming Master.\" The police sealed off the resort, and I had no choice but to return home.","After getting home, I received a notification.","Tomorrow, another business trip awaits.","[End of new chapter.]","【If you see me, please call me to prepare lessons: Hahaha, the newly appeared \"ghost\" is so cute, staying up late to binge-watch. That \"Luck-Transforming Master\" clearly isn’t a good guy. If someone’s luck could really be turned around that easily, everyone would be climbing the ladder and making fortunes. Total landmine!】","【Good luck today: Sigh, there are too many bad people. The master really has it tough! A hundred deep-water drops!】","【Rich lady still needs leg accessories?: Business trip? The author isn’t using this as an excuse to delay updates again, is he?】","【So touched I could die: Upstairs just revealed the truth.】","【Literary drought is deadly: Ahhhhh, so happy! Ten deep-water drops!】","【Flying Luck Horse: Looking forward to it! Fifty deep-water drops!】","【Peaceful and Far-reaching: Fifty deep-water drops!】","【Only want male virtue novels: Shall we pool deep-water drops in the comments? This feels like a stream-of-consciousness novel, so where’s the appeal... but I just can’t stop reading. What to do?】","...","【Random passerby: Hahahahahaha】","《Diary of the Wealthy》 has a considerable following online. After many readers saw the new chapter’s content, they couldn’t help but feel uneasy.","Many of them have a statue of the Luck-Transforming Master at home.","Luck-Transforming Master Believers’ Group.","【Has anyone read 《Diary of the Wealthy》?】","【...Yes, I have.】","【What is this? A novel?】","【You know that resort in Changshun County, right? It’s been shut down by the authorities.】","【No way, is it connected to the Master?】","【I heard that at the resort, the Luck-Transforming Master caused everyone to wake up drenched in blood and tears overnight. Very scary.】","【Stop it, stop it, I’m terrified now. I don’t dare look at the Master anymore.】","【This has nothing to do with us, right? We didn’t do anything wrong.】","【...】","【...】","【Everyone knows deep down. Just from what’s been said and done, you can guess. Anyway, the police have now classified this as illegal pyramid schemes. Everyone, be careful.】","【So what do we do? Destroy them?】","【So, does 《Diary of the Wealthy》 say the Master is real? And that the Master’s power backfires?】","【Whether luck backfires or not, the law clearly states no harm can be done.】","【How do you regulate something you can’t see or touch?】","【Exactly, and there’s no evidence anyway!】","【Do you think the police who arrested He Yang and Qi Yingxue were just ordinary cops?】","【...】","Small groups like this exist in multiple regions. Believers are anxious, seeking comfort in their chats.","Some believers, afraid of trouble, decisively discarded their Masters and deleted all related info from their phones.","But they overlooked one thing: the information on the internet and phones is under official surveillance.","Authorities monitor these groups’ activities, trace IP addresses, and sweep them all up in one go.","Those who harm others through such practices will inevitably suffer backlash.","What awaits them is severe legal punishment.","Longjiang City Investigation Department.","Inside the interrogation room, after a series of relentless questions, Qi Yingxue finally broke down and admitted to purchasing a Luck Transfer Talisman with the intent to harm Qi Quan.","She wept bitterly, tears streaming down her face like falling blossoms. “I didn’t know, I really didn’t know. I didn’t realize it would steal someone’s luck. I only used it once. It didn’t even require the other person’s name, and it gave me a hundred luck points. I truly didn’t understand it could cause harm... sob sob sob...”","Tang Mian watched from behind the glass and asked Shen Hui, “How can they possibly charge her for this?”","Stealing someone’s luck is a tricky matter; the extent of harm is difficult to define.","Shen Hui replied, “According to current laws, it’s considered attempted intentional injury, and since it’s a first offense with relatively minor circumstances, the punishment shouldn’t be too severe.”","Tang Mian pressed, “What if they don’t follow the law?”","Shen Hui smiled, “Then they’d have to consider the senior official’s face. If she wants to harm someone, but she’s the chief consultant of our investigation bureau, do you think the bureau would tolerate that?”","“So, what will actually happen?” Tang Mian asked again.","Shen Hui shrugged. “Most likely, it’ll be reported to headquarters, and they’ll decide from there.”","As officials representing fairness and justice, they were supposed to uphold the law and avoid favoritism.","The next morning, Steward Su packed Qi Quan’s luggage and sent her and Ling Sheng off by car.","Before leaving, Qi Quan cast an illusion over Ling Sheng’s face, disguising his appearance so he now looked like an unremarkable, delicate young man standing beside her—nothing that would draw attention.","Not only that, she placed talisman papers on him to mask his unique constitution.","Shen Hui was driving.","He had been assigned by the investigation bureau specifically to escort Qi Quan to Longjing City. When he got this assignment, he caught Tang Mian’s envious gaze and challenge.","“I’ll practice my driving skills and definitely drive better than you,” she said.","Shen Hui: ...","The drive from Longjiang to Longjing took about six hours.","Qi Quan closed her eyes to cultivate from the moment she got in until they arrived.","The car stopped in front of a villa.","The surroundings were beautiful, far from the bustling city—a very pleasant place to live.","“Master, Director Li said you should rest for a day first. Tomorrow, he’ll personally come to discuss the matter of summoning Lu Jiang,” Shen Hui reported quietly.","Qi Quan nodded.","Just as she reached the villa’s gate, the door suddenly opened from inside.","“Quan Quan, sister!” A young, beautiful girl rushed out excitedly. “It’s been so long! I’ve missed you so much!”","Su Nuanuan was dressed simply in a jacket and jeans, her hair tied in a high ponytail, radiating youthful energy.","Behind her were Chen Feilu and Ning Zhi.","Qi Quan was puzzled.","Shen Hui smiled and explained, “Master, this villa was purchased by Mr. Su for Miss Su, so she can attend school here. Knowing you were coming, Miss Su volunteered to host you.”","“Quan Quan, even if you’re on a business trip, you have to be comfortable. I’ve already prepared your room. Take a look and see if you like it,” Su Nuanuan said brightly.","Behind her, Ning Zhi sighed quietly.","As a local of Longjing City, he should have been the gracious host, but his mind wasn’t quick, and he assumed the bureau would arrange accommodations for the master. He hadn’t anticipated this situation.","The Investigation Department would indeed arrange a place to stay, but the official budget was limited—it was impossible to provide such a nice villa.","So when Su Nuanuan brought it up, everyone agreed unanimously.","Qi Quan smiled and said, “Nuanuan, you’ve worked hard.”","“Not at all!” Su Nuanuan said, leading her upstairs and opening a door. “I specifically asked my brother about your preferences. Take a look and see if there’s anything else you need.”","The room was large, decorated much like the lakeside villa’s bedroom, clearly showing her thoughtfulness.","Qi Quan was about to nod in approval when the system suddenly chimed in excitedly: [There’s even a computer!]","Qi Quan: ...","[Hahaha, boss, you can’t use that as an excuse anymore!]","Su Nuanuan didn’t get a response and nervously asked, “Qi Quan, is there something wrong?”","“No,” Qi Quan replied calmly, “It’s perfect.”","Su Nuanuan beamed and turned around, only to freeze when she spotted a young man in the hallway outside the room.","Huh, he looked quite delicate—why hadn’t she noticed him before?","He was practically invisible.","She asked, “Qi Quan, is that your assistant? Where does he sleep?”","Qi Quan casually replied, “Next door, I guess.”","“But...” Su Nuanuan hesitated, “I was planning to stay next door to you.”","“You’re not living on campus?”","“You rarely come here. I want to share a room with you,” Su Nuanuan coaxed softly, “Qi Quan, I don’t have many friends in Longjing, I want to live with you.”","Qi Quan didn’t really care where Ling Sheng stayed.","She nodded, “Alright.”","Su Nuanuan smiled brightly and arranged a room for Ling Sheng a bit farther away.","Ling Sheng said nothing, just following Qi Quan’s lead.","Downstairs.","Chen Feilu was pushing a suitcase and found himself in a standoff with Shen Hui.","“I’m the master’s assistant; I’ll carry it up.”","Shen Hui smiled gently, “The director told me to take good care of the senior this trip; I’ll carry it up.”","“I’ll do it!”","“No need, I’ve got this.”","“I’m her assistant—that’s assistant work.”","“I’m following orders from the leader.”","Chen Feilu: “...”","He was worried it was finally happening!","He couldn’t always stay by the master’s side, so others jealous of his position were eyeing it!","This Shen guy was really pushing it.","A hand reached out and effortlessly lifted the suitcase.","It was Ning Zhi.","He glanced at the two, saying, “The senior doesn’t like to waste time.”","Before they could react, he carried the suitcase upstairs on his own.","Both of them: Damn, so sneaky!","Longjing City Investigation Department.","“Director Li,” Di Meng knocked and entered the office, his thick brows tightly furrowed. “I just took the team to Lu Jiang’s residence. As per your instructions, we knocked and called out, and Lu Jiang’s disciple opened the door, but Lu Jiang himself didn’t appear. It seems he’s unwilling to cooperate with the investigation.”","A seventh-level Celestial Master, no matter where he went, was treated like a revered existence. If he could be summoned by the Investigation Department so easily, where would his dignity be?","Li Guoyan understood the logic of these high-level Celestial Masters.","However, the country had its laws. Standing on this land meant abiding by its rules.","Breaking the rules of the Spirit Sect comes with a price—no one gets away unscathed.","He smiled and said, “Isn’t that a good thing?”","“A good thing?” Di Meng was puzzled.","How could Lu Jiang’s refusal to cooperate be considered a good thing?","“He doesn’t live inside the Guiyuan Sect, which actually makes things easier for us,” Li Guoyan explained. “That way, we don’t have to negotiate with Guiyuan Sect directly.”","The Guiyuan Sect was built in a secluded valley on the outskirts of Longjing City—a place essentially off-limits to ordinary people. Naturally, no one could see what went on inside the sect’s grounds.","Within the sect, spiritual energy was abundant, and protective arrays were set up. Generally, senior elders of high rank preferred to cultivate quietly within the sect, rarely venturing out into the mundane world.","But this Elder Lu liked to stay outside. No one believed there wasn’t something fishy about that.","Could his residence possibly have better spiritual energy than the sect itself?","Di Meng finally understood, but he still asked, “What if he gets the news and runs back to the sect?”","“That’s even better,” Li Guoyan replied.","Di Meng blinked in surprise.","“Our investigation department will inevitably clash with the great Taoist sects or influential clans eventually. If he returns to the sect, we’ll just go straight to the Guiyuan Sect’s sect master and see whether he protects Lu Jiang or cooperates with us.”","Di Meng thought, Li Guoyan is truly formidable!","But—","Can the investigation department really go head-to-head with the top sect?","Li Guoyan saw the doubt in his eyes but said nothing, only smiling as he asked, “Did you run into that genius from the Yan family at the resort?”","“Yes. Didn’t expect him to show up there,” Di Meng said regretfully. “Too bad I didn’t get to see that senior.”","Li Guoyan gave him a sly look. “What do you think of Yan Huai?”","“You’re thinking of recruiting him into the investigation department?” Di Meng guessed his intention and replied seriously, “He’s pure-hearted and not morally ambiguous, but after all, he was born into the Yan family. I’m afraid...”","They both knew what was left unsaid.","The Yan family was Longjing City’s foremost Taoist clan, and Yan Huai was the new rising star, poised to inherit the family’s leadership. If he joined the investigation department, it would mean going against clans and sects—and the Yan family would never agree.","Li Guoyan’s gaze grew deeper. “Even if he doesn’t join the investigation department, he can still be useful.”","They needed to unite all the forces they could.","At Lu Jiang’s residence.","Lu Jiang was seated in meditation, cultivating, when a disciple outside reported, “Master, the investigation department people have left.”","“Mm, you may leave now,” Lu Jiang said.","The disciple nodded and left.","Lu Jiang opened his eyes. Though his face was plain and unremarkable, the aura of a high-level Taoist master added an ethereal, almost immortal charm to his presence.","He rose and walked to his desk.","On the desk stood a golden statue. Apart from its color and material, it was identical to the statue of the Fortune Master.","This one was crafted entirely from pure gold, making it the most precious of its kind.","A gleam of pride and arrogance flickered in Lu Jiang’s eyes as he reached out and twisted a hidden mechanism beneath the statue. A door opened, revealing a secret chamber.","He stepped inside.","The chamber was no more than ten square meters. In its center stood an altar adorned with a complex array formation. At the heart of the formation was a transparent crystal orb, glowing with golden light.","The orb was small enough to hold in one hand. Inside, the golden light had been compressed into a flowing substance, nearly filling the entire sphere, slowly intertwining and shifting within.","The crystal orb was connected to the intricate ley lines of the formation, channels responsible for transmitting golden light, gradually filling the orb bit by bit.","Lu Jiang’s eyes burned with fervor.","Over the years, he had relied on these golden merits to cultivate at an astonishing pace. In just thirty years, he had risen to become a Level Seven Celestial Master, reigning supreme over the entire Xuan Sect.","Unfortunately, the cultivation methods available to a Celestial Master at his level could only utilize a limited amount of these golden merits. The remaining merits he could no longer convert.","Wait—","At the end of the formation’s ley lines, a blank spot appeared!","What was going on?","These ley lines were firmly connected to that ghost’s body, which should have been continuously supplying merits. Although the process was slow, the lines should have been glowing with golden light without interruption!","Lu Jiang leaned in for a closer look.","Every single ley line ended abruptly.","This meant the supply had been completely cut off!","His heart pounded wildly. He hadn’t checked in for just a few days, so how could this sudden change have happened?","He had used this formation for thirty years without a single fault. Moreover, after reaching Level Seven, he had even reinforced the formation.","No one below Level Seven Celestial Master could possibly have broken the ghost’s sealing technique!","Unless... that ghost was truly “dead.”","But that ghost had nearly reached Level Seven itself. Who could have killed it?","Things seemed to be spiraling out of control.","Could the investigation department’s discovery of the “Transport Master” incident be connected to the ghost’s destruction?","Lu Jiang’s chest tightened with unease.","But he quickly calmed himself.","He was a Level Seven Celestial Master. His estate was protected by a Level Seven guardian formation. No matter how many investigators came, they couldn’t touch him.","Even if the ghost was gone and could no longer supply merits, he had already gathered enough golden merits. The small remainder was insignificant.","He left the dark chamber and resumed his cultivation with peace of mind.","One day, he would find a way to break through his limitations and absorb all the merits.","He would become a Celestial Immortal!","---","At Su Nuanuan’s villa.","Qi Quan had been cultivating in his room all afternoon and finally opened his eyes as mealtime approached.","A deeply enticing aroma wafted through the narrow cracks of the door, boldly invading his nostrils.","Her eyes brightened.","She had been worried about eating unfamiliar food during her business trip without Su Nuanuan’s housekeeper, but now she was pleasantly surprised.","The last time Ling Sheng had made lotus seed soup, she had been unable to forget the taste.","But he had only cooked it that once.","Downstairs in the living room, the four of them were already entranced.","This smells absolutely incredible!","She murmured,","“No wonder Quan Quan insists on bringing him along even on business trips. This cooking skill is truly unbeatable.”","Just smelling the aroma made her swallow hard.","Chen Feilu complained bitterly, “Masters always attract talented people with unique skills. The competition for positions is so fierce, I feel like I’m going to be crushed on the beach.”","Ning Zhi lowered his head without saying a word, but his expression clearly agreed with Chen Feilu’s remark.","Shen Hui: “...”","Maybe I’ll just diligently stick to being the driver.","Qi Quan came downstairs just as Ling Sheng finished preparing the last dish.","Everyone rubbed their hands in anticipation, ready to eat.","However—","Ling Sheng carried in several exquisite vegetable dishes on a tray. Each dish was served in delicate small bowls and plates, with just the right amount for two people, all placed in front of Qi Quan and himself.","Qi Quan: ?","Everyone else: ???","“Um...” Su Nuanuan couldn’t help but speak up, “Hey, handsome, aren’t there any vegetables for us?”","Ling Sheng pointed toward the kitchen.","Chen Feilu dashed into the kitchen. The dishes looked just like the master’s vegetables, but were served in large plates, and the aroma seemed to lack the master’s signature fragrance.","He brought out two plates and said, “Help yourselves. You’ve got to do it yourself to be self-sufficient. I’m not serving you.”","The three of them squeezed into the kitchen.","Ling Sheng’s culinary skills were quite impressive; the four of them devoured the dishes swiftly, each a fierce competitor for the best vegetables.","But as they ate, Chen Feilu began to feel something was off.","“Master, it’s the same vegetable dish, so why do ours feel rougher?” he asked.","Su Nuanuan nodded in agreement.","Compared to what they were eating, the two servings in front of Qi Quan were clearly more appealing.","Strange.","Qi Quan calmly said, “Maybe it’s because the vegetables in others’ bowls are more fragrant.”","“...”","She glanced at Ling Sheng, who lowered his eyelashes, focused on eating. The soft light of the restaurant’s lamps cast a gentle glow on his face, making him look especially kind and warm.","The system asked: [Boss, is Ling Sheng giving you special treatment?]","Qi Quan: [Yes. The vegetables in my meal have had impurities removed and contain spiritual energy. What they’re eating is just ordinary vegetables. But this is good—it helps hide his spiritual constitution.]","Except for Su Nuanuan, the other three were cultivators. If they ate the same vegetable dishes, they would taste the spiritual energy within.","It wasn’t that they were untrustworthy, but since it concerned Ling Sheng’s spiritual constitution, the fewer people who knew, the better.","The next morning, Li Guoyan arrived at the villa with Di Meng.","Di Meng pulled the handbrake and asked, “Aren’t we going to find Lu Jiang?”","“Have you not read the new chapter of ‘The Heiress Diary’?” Li Guoyan got out of the car, closed the door, and rang the doorbell.","Di Meng: “I’ve been busy watching the interrogation, didn’t have time.”","Sun Yong and the tall, thin Taoist master were minor leaders in the Fortune Transfer Great Immortal organization, having recruited many subordinates. Especially Sun Yong, who used the resort to promote the vegetables, pulling many clients in.","He was watching the interrogation while instructing his men to follow leads and make arrests, having no time to open the app.","“Why bring this up all of a sudden—”","Suddenly, he realized, his handsome eyebrows lighting up with excitement, “You didn’t invite her, did you?”","Li Guoyan deliberately left him hanging, not answering.","Di Meng: Damn! No one told him!","He quickly took out his phone and looked at the screen. He hadn’t rested much these past two days; his complexion looked a bit off, dark circles were obvious, his hair was unkempt, and his clothes...","His image was suffering!","Moments later, the door opened.","Su Nuanuan peeked out, glanced at the middle-aged man and the roguish young man at the door, and asked, “Who are you guys?”","Li Guoyan replied warmly, “Hello, we’re here to see Master Qi.”","“Oh!” Su Nuanuan opened the door wider, “Quan Quan said you’d be coming today. Please, come in.”","The two men stepped into the villa.","Qi Quan had just finished breakfast and sat by the window, basking in the morning light while savoring the herbal tea Ling Sheng had brewed for her.","The spiritual energy was ethereal and refreshing, soothing to the soul.","Out of the corner of his eye, he noticed two figures appear in the front courtyard.","Guests had arrived.","Di Meng felt a bit nervous, but more than that, he was excited.","He had come across the novel *The Diary of the Wealthy Family* by chance. At first, he dismissed it as a cliché romance story, but the deeper he read, the more he sensed the profound thoughts of Master Baishui woven within.","She was different from the other Taoist masters! She was a master with ideals and aspirations!","Di Meng had long grown weary of the distorted state of the Taoist sect. Though he appeared carefree on the surface, deep down he was loyal to the true path and utterly disdained the petty squabbles within the sect.","Suddenly encountering such a fresh and refined novel, he felt he had found a kindred spirit.","Yet, he had assumed Master Baishui was just a low-ranking minor master—after all, no high-ranking master would have the leisure to write novels.","But then, from the Yao Mountain ghost case, he picked up clues.","As an investigator, Di Meng was naturally well-informed about the details of what had happened at Yao Mountain. Coincidentally, Master Baishui mentioned “a business trip” and “life swapping” in her writing, which made him realize she was not a low-level master, but rather a noble and upright senior!","Di Meng tugged at the corner of his shirt, tightening his expression as he followed Li Guoyan into the villa’s living room.","“Investigator Li.”","A soft, low voice drifted through the air like a gentle breeze brushing the willow tips, like sweet rain nourishing the fields—gentle and embracing, carrying an aura of serene clarity without any arrogance or pride.","This was the true senior worthy of respect!","Di Meng turned to look.","She stood by the window, dressed simply yet elegantly, her brows and eyes calm and composed. The slanting sunlight caught her hair, reflecting a faint golden glow.","He sensed no spiritual energy from her.","Not because she was ordinary, but because she was overwhelmingly powerful.","Di Meng quickly put aside his casual demeanor and stood straight and solemn behind Li Guoyan.","Li Guoyan glanced back with a teasing smile and introduced, “Master Qi, this is Di Meng, a level-five investigator from the Longjing Investigation Department. He’s only twenty-three and quite gifted.”","Qi Quan looked at Di Meng.","The young, handsome man instantly held his breath.","*He looks so nervous,* the system mused.","Despite being a big shot, he wasn’t serious at all.","Qi Quan smiled lightly. “He truly has talent.”","Di Meng felt ashamed; compared to this senior, he hardly considered himself a genius.","“Haha, of course, I can’t compare to you,” Li Guoyan joked. “Master, shall we head out now?”","Qi Quan nodded. “Let’s go.”","Five people went to Lu’s residence.","Qi Quan rode with Shen Hui, and Ling Sheng accompanied them.","As for Su Nuanuan and the others, they had to rush to school for morning classes.","Lu Jiang was quite a man who knew how to enjoy life.","He had deliberately chosen a residence with excellent feng shui. The house was spacious—in a place like Longjing City, where land was precious, owning such a mansion spoke volumes about his wealth.","He was utterly confident.","Despite having received warnings from the Investigation Department yesterday, he still stayed at his residence to cultivate his skills.","...","Was this not a blatant show of contempt for the Investigation Department?","A few people got off the car, leaving Shen Hui alone inside to keep an eye on the surroundings.","Li Guoyan glanced at Qi Quan, whose expression remained calm and composed. Feeling somewhat reassured, he said, “When handling a case, we always start with courtesy before resorting to force. Yesterday, the investigation team already showed their courtesy; today, it’s time to show our strength.”","Qi Quan replied, “He has set up a seventh-level protective formation.”","“Exactly.” Li Guoyan’s expression grew serious. “Breaking through a seventh-level formation requires a large number of attack talismans, but Lu Jiang should have plenty of spirit talismans on hand.”","Qi Quan opened his palm. “Investigator Di, may I borrow the peachwood hammer from your wrist for a moment?”","The peachwood hammer was Di Meng’s treasured magical artifact, rarely allowed to be touched by others. But exceptions were made.","Excitedly, Di Meng took off the peachwood hammer and asked, “Do you want me to enlarge it?”","Qi Quan shook his head. “No need.”","The miniature version of the peachwood hammer was placed in his palm.","Qi Quan gently held it, infusing spiritual energy onto its surface, then swung the hammer like a shooting star, striking the protective formation.","Ripples spread across the formation.","He repeated the process, the hammer hopping around the formation—tapping on the east side, then pounding on the west—seemingly random and chaotic.","Inside the manor, Lu Jiang opened his eyes from meditation and sneered contemptuously at the peachwood hammer hovering above the formation.","Breaking his seventh-level formation with this? Dream on—","Crack.","Suddenly, several obvious cracks appeared on the protective shield.","Lu Jiang sprang up, instinctively pulling out a spirit talisman to reinforce the formation, but in the next moment, the formation collapsed with a thunderous roar!","The system applauded proudly: [No one understands protective formations better than the master!]","Di Meng was stunned. “What just happened...?”","Li Guoyan was much more composed, but a trace of excitement still flickered in his eyes as he sincerely praised, “Master Qi’s expertise in formations is truly impressive.”","With effortless skill, he identified the weaknesses in the seventh-level formation, struck precisely, and shattered it instantly.","Respectable! Admirable!","The miniature peachwood hammer completed its task and retreated, flying back under spiritual control to stop before Di Meng.","Di Meng was still dazed.","“Stop daydreaming!” Li Guoyan snapped, giving him a light tap.","Snapping back to reality, Di Meng’s eyes lit up as he carefully picked up the little hammer and strapped it back onto his wrist.","He had never found the little hammer so adorable before!","In the courtyard, Lu Jiang’s disciples stood frozen in shock.","After recovering from his surprise, Lu Jiang saw the intruders had already entered the courtyard. A ferocious glint flashed in his eyes as he unleashed a surge of spiritual power, activating another formation within the courtyard and shouted,","“Those who trespass will die!”","Just as Di Meng stepped into the courtyard, the scene before him suddenly shifted. The elegant pavilions and towers twisted into a gloomy, eerie nightmare, with countless malevolent spirits surging forward.","He instinctively swung his hammer to strike them down, but found his spiritual energy blocked, unable to release even a trace of power.","The ghosts closed in on his face!","In the blink of an eye, a slender, pale hand grabbed him by the collar and yanked him out of the illusionary formation.","He tumbled out of the courtyard, dazed, and looked up.","The illusion shattered like bubbles.","Within the exquisite and elegant Ting courtyard, a woman dressed in simple, understated attire carried herself with calm poise. One hand gripped Lu Jiang’s neck, while the other gracefully produced a seventh-level Spirit Binding Talisman, pressing it gently onto Lu Jiang’s forehead.","Lu Jiang: \"...\"","In his heart, Di Meng shouted wildly—","I swear to follow my senior to the death!"]},{"number":48,"title":"Chapter 48","paragraphs":["A Level Seven Celestial Master, proficient in formations, and backed by the mighty Guiyuan Sect—Lu Jiang's status within the Mystic Arts world was undeniably high.","He never imagined he could be captured so easily.","Why?","Just why?!","Lu Jiang stared at the woman before him. She was like a deity reigning supreme above all, with a mere wave of her hand seizing the throat of his destiny.","This feeling of powerlessness, of being unable to break free, plunged him into extreme terror.","\"I am from the Guiyuan Sect! I've done nothing wrong. You have no right to arrest me!\" he blustered, his roar fierce but hollow.","Di Meng: \"Tsk tsk, you are a Level Seven Celestial Master. Don't lose your composure. If you have grievances, let's discuss them in the interrogation room, shall we?\"","Lu Jiang: \"...\"","Provoked, he finally calmed down.","\"The police must also work with evidence. Without evidence, you cannot arrest me.\"","Di Meng raised an eyebrow: \"What's the hurry? We're just summoning you for questioning, not a formal interrogation. If you haven't committed a crime, there's no need to be guilty. I wonder what you were hiding from.\"","\"I wasn't hiding! You say 'summon' and I have to go? I am a Level Seven Celestial Master, I...\"","Di Meng couldn't hold back a snort of laughter.","\"Seriously, have you fried your brain from cultivation?\"","Lu Jiang said expressionlessly, \"I could sue you for slander.\"","\"...\"","Li Guoyan cleared his throat softly, reminding, \"Investigator Di.\"","Di Meng put away his playful smirk, his eyes turning solemn. \"Enough nonsense. Citizens have an obligation to cooperate with investigations. Come with us.\"","His spiritual power was already suppressed, yet he still put on airs.","\"Senior, are we heading back?\" he asked.","Qi Quan shook her head, turning to ask the petrified disciple: \"Where is the room he usually cultivates in?\"","The disciple had long been utterly shocked by her methods, completely losing any will to resist. Trembling with fear, he stammered, \"O-over there... W-would you like me to show you the way?\"","\"Thank you for the trouble.\" Qi Quan gave a slight nod.","Her politeness lessened the disciple's inner panic somewhat, replaced by a growing sense of awe and excitement.","He actually spoke to a supreme expert of that level!","And the expert was super gentle and courteous!","In his eyes, Lu Jiang's level was already unreachable. Someone who could effortlessly crush Lu Jiang, like Qi Quan, was nothing short of a god.","She truly deserved reverence and worship.","Lu Jiang's face turned livid with anger.","Although it was just an insignificant menial disciple, such a swift betrayal was a massive blow to his pride.","The disciple led Qi Quan to Lu Jiang's cultivation room. Li Guoyan and Di Meng escorted Lu Jiang, who was in their custody, following behind.","Ling Sheng hadn't spoken a word, his presence barely noticeable.","Wherever Qi Quan went, he followed.","The cultivation space of a Level Seven Celestial Master was quite luxurious.","Both inside and outside the courtyard, Spirit Gathering Formations were arranged, seemingly trying to draw all the world's spiritual energy into one place.","But spiritual energy wasn't a case of \"the more, the better.\"","The human body had a limit to how much spiritual energy it could contain. Only by continuously refining it, compressing it again and again to raise one's cultivation realm could space be made for new energy to be stored.","That's why progressing to higher levels became increasingly difficult.","Lu Jiang's setup with these formations was purely wasteful.","The door was open, showing how panicked and rushed Lu Jiang had been when he came out earlier.","Incense was burning inside the room, its fragrant smoke curling up from the burner, having a calming and mind-clearing effect.","Di Meng couldn't hold back again, sneering, \"If your heart isn't pure, lighting all the incense in the world won't help.\"","Lu Jiang: \"...\"","He struggled to suppress his guilt, forcing calmness as he said, \"You said it yourself, it's just a summons. You have no right to barge into my room and search it.\"","Di Meng really wanted to gag him.","Li Guoyan stepped forward, his gaze falling on the golden statue of the Fortune God.","\"Take the evidence back with us.\"","Di Meng grinned, \"Yes, sir!\"","Couldn't this prove his connection to the Fortune God?","He walked towards the statue, failing to notice the flicker of anxiety in Lu Jiang's eyes.","[Big shot, he looks so guilty!]","The system observed Lu Jiang from every angle without missing a detail, immediately spotting something was off.","\"Wait.\" Qi Quan spoke up to stop him.","Di Meng halted and turned, awaiting instructions.","Qi Quan scanned the entire room, then extended her spiritual sense to probe it. She raised an eyebrow slightly.","The room was cleverly designed. Upon entering, one couldn't tell the difference between its interior and exterior area, but it actually contained a hidden space.","If she hadn't used her spiritual sense, she probably wouldn't have discovered it.","Di Meng's cultivation level was lower than Lu Jiang's; even using spiritual sense, he couldn't see through it. Li Guoyan had no cultivation at all and was even less likely to detect such an advanced illusion technique.","Of course, for someone without cultivation to become the head of the Investigation Department, while the authorities wanting to show their stance was one aspect, the other was his exceptional abilities.","Qi Quan said, \"There's a hidden chamber.\"","Li Guoyan was taken aback. He was highly experienced but had been momentarily fooled by the Mystic Arts techniques. Now, with Qi Quan's hint, he sharply sensed something was wrong.","He suddenly turned to Lu Jiang, catching a flash of guilt on his face.","Where would a domineering, supremely arrogant person place the mechanism?","Most likely with the Fortune God statue.","This was the means he used to amass enormous wealth. He would keep it under his own watchful eye, yet with extreme arrogance, also use it as the mechanism for his secret base—carefully concealed yet supremely confident.","Li Guoyan took a few steps forward, reached out, and grasped the Fortune God statue, giving it a gentle twist.","An extremely perfunctory mechanism.","The door to the hidden chamber swung open.","A ten-square-meter secret room, perfectly square, without any decorations, completely empty.","At least, that's what Di Meng and Li Guoyan saw.","What Qi Quan saw was a different scene. However, she had already suspected as much and, keeping her emotions in check, showed no reaction, as if she saw nothing unusual.","Lu Jiang secretly observed their expressions. Seeing no strange looks in any of their eyes, he secretly breathed a sigh of relief.","\"Senior?\" Di Meng asked quietly.","Qi Quan took out a peach wood talisman and called, \"Ji Shengzhe.\"","As soon as the words were spoken, a near-Level-Seven powerful ghost appeared in the secret room.","Li Guoyan and Di Meng showed faint surprise.","Lu Jiang's eyes widened in disbelief.","But considering Qi Quan's capabilities, he had to admit he was probably truly finished.","Ji Shengzhe floated in the air, his faintly red ghost eyes fixed intently on one spot.","His merit was hidden there; he could sense it!","“Master, there's a formation blocking the way. I can't get in.” Black energy churned around him. If not for his remaining reason, he would have already lunged at Lu Jiang for revenge.","Qi Quan shot out an attack talisman, instantly shattering the formation within the secret room and revealing the hidden golden crystal ball.","\"This is...\" Di Meng, after his initial shock, felt a surge of rage. \"He actually stole merit!\"","Ji Shengzhe whooshed over, his bluish-white ghostly hand touching the surface of the ball.","Lu Jiang's face turned as pale as gold paper.","All the merit he had painstakingly accumulated!","A mouthful of blood rushed to his throat, but he forcibly swallowed it back.","The formation was already broken. The golden light of merit within the crystal ball began to scatter and flee, but under the guidance of its original owner, Ji Shengzhe, it obediently flowed into his ghostly form.","His pitch-black ghostly body gradually turned pale gold, then bright gold, finally flashing with a brilliant golden light before suddenly retracting.","His bluish-white ghostly face actually became as vibrant and full of life as a living person's.","Ji Shengzhe was so excited he was nearly in tears.","With red-rimmed eyes, he bowed deeply to Qi Quan, his voice choked with emotion, \"Most of the merit has returned. He didn't waste much of it.\"","There are inherent limits to how much merit a Celestial Master can utilize. Even if Lu Jiang extracted the maximum allowable merit at each cultivation level for his own practice, it wouldn't consume much.","The system asked in surprise: [But didn that Luck Transfer Immortal use a great deal?]","Qi Quan replied: [Only the initial 100 points of luck value granted to founding members were drawn from this merit sphere. The rest were all fortunes plundered from the enemies of the buyers.]","[With so many founding members, the total from all of them must still be considerable, right?]","[One hundred points is merely the luck equivalent of twenty rounds of good card draws. Compared to nine lifetimes' worth of merit, it's like a single drop in the ocean, a single grain of sand in the desert. Even if you add up all the founding members, it's still just a ladle of water or a handful of sand.]","The system said happily: [So, the nine lifetimes' merit hasn't been used much, and Ji Shengzhe can be reborn into an exceptionally good life?!]","Qi Quan smiled: [That's right.]","[Excellent!]","Ji Shengzhe also thought it was excellent.","He gazed deeply at Qi Quan and suddenly extended his hand, his palm emanating several strands of golden light. The golden radiance pulsed reluctantly before obediently drifting towards Qi Quan.","\"Master, I am sincerely grateful for your help. Without you, I would have eventually dissipated into nothingness, without even knowing who my enemy was. This is a small token of my gratitude. I hope you will accept it.\"","Qi Quan was no saint who helped others without seeking any return.","She accepted it promptly.","The golden light merged into her spiritual platform, and in an instant, her long-stagnant cultivation realm showed a crack.","Countless spiritual energy surged into Qi Quan's body, forming a pale white vortex within the narrow secret chamber.","Di Meng and Li Guoyan: \"...\"","Lu Jiang felt heart-wrenching pain, his hatred making his eyes bloodshot.","The merit he had schemed so hard to obtain was now effortlessly gained by this woman, who even advanced her cultivation because of it!","And the spiritual energy in this courtyard was all gathered by his spirit-gathering array!","\"Chief Li, let's step out first and guard for the senior while she breaks through,\" Di Meng said.","Li Guoyan readily agreed.","Qi Quan's advancement was an unexpected boon for the Investigation Department.","She was the department's stabilizing pillar.","Li Guoyan marveled once again that the Investigation Department truly had some luck, to be able to employ such a master.","The two escorted the nearly-vomiting-blood Lu Jiang out of the room and stood guard in the courtyard.","\"Wait, did someone not come out?\" Li Guoyan asked.","Di Meng: \"Who? That victim ghost?\"","\"No, the... assistant by the master's side?\" Li Guoyan vaguely remembered such a person but always found himself unconsciously overlooking him. It was strange; he was usually very good at remembering people.","Di Meng: \"Since he's an assistant, let him stay inside.\"","Inside the secret chamber.","Qi Quan felt the bottleneck that had confined her for so long finally shatter. For a Celestial Master of her level, advancing a realm required a tremendous amount of spiritual energy; otherwise, it would affect the stability of the new realm...","Spiritual energy from the courtyard flooded madly into her body.","Not enough. Still not enough.","The speed at which the spirit-gathering array concentrated energy was far outpaced by Qi Quan's absorption rate. Soon, the spiritual energy within the mansion and its surroundings was completely depleted.","Ji Shengzhe wore a look of regret.","He should have given his gift when the master was fully prepared. What should he do now?","Just as he was growing anxious, suddenly, an extremely vast and mighty concentration of spiritual energy gathered within the chamber. The originally colorless energy, under extreme compression, took on a thick, milky-white hue, flowing slowly like a stream, gradually forming a giant \"cocoon\" that enveloped Qi Quan.","Ji Shengzhe looked over.","It was Ling Sheng.","Under the effect of illusion art, the young man with delicate features wore an expression of intense focus. Innumerable streams of spiritual power flowed from his body, all converging around Qi Quan. His amber eyes seemed covered by a white film.","No, that wasn't a film—it was concentrated spiritual energy.","Qi Quan seemed to sense something, slightly opening her eyes before quickly re-entering the profound state of breaking through the bottleneck.","An unknown amount of time later, a soft \"crack\" sounded within her spiritual platform.","She had advanced.","Although it was only a minor realm within her current major stage, a minor realm at this level was harder to achieve than three major realms at lower levels.","Both opportunity and conditions were indispensable.","For a sudden advancement like hers, without sufficient spiritual energy support, it would likely have stalled halfway. To continue the ascent would then require waiting for the next opportunity.","Being stuck halfway would have been incredibly frustrating.","Fortunately, her luck was truly good.","As all the spiritual energy was absorbed into her body, she opened her eyes. A fleeting radiance passed through her gaze before settling back into profound calmness.","Turning around, she saw a tall, slender figure slowly collapsing.","Qi Quan instinctively reached out to catch him.","The young man, drained of spiritual power, fell pale into the crook of her arm, yet his eyes shone brighter than stars in the night sky.","He weakly raised a hand, tugging at her sleeve, as if sharing in her joy, yet also seeming to seek affection.","Qi Quan's heart softened, warming with a peculiar feeling.","Since her previous life, she had grown accustomed to solitary cultivation. Apart from her master who guided her in her initial training, everything else she had learned through her own exploration.","She was the head disciple of her sect. When her master and elders secluded themselves in meditation, she alone shouldered all worldly affairs. Her junior brothers and sisters respected her, but they never worried about whether she encountered setbacks on her cultivation path.","Because she was a genius.","A genius possessed exceptional talent and fortune—did they still need others' help?","All her ghost servants revered her because she could offer them better ghostly lives, allowing them to live almost like normal people.","She believed their devotion was genuine.","But—","Qi Quan smiled, taking the young man's hand. Spiritual power flowed into his body, gradually restoring strength to his over-exerted form.","—But during the process of handling heavy burdens and cultivating alone, she occasionally still felt loneliness.","She was human, not a saint.","To be human is to have the seven emotions and six desires.","In her previous life, she had saved countless people and ghosts, yet she couldn't save herself, and no one could save her. That sense of frustration and helplessness had pained her for a long time.","Even though she later came to terms with it, the mark remained in her heart.","Just moments ago, when her spiritual energy was exhausted during the breakthrough and her ascending realm suddenly stalled, that...","...in that instant, a similar sense of helplessness surged up again.","She couldn't save herself, and no one could save her.","But within a second, a torrent of spiritual energy poured into her meridians, allowing the stalled realm to once again climb madly.","It was like a parched traveler in the desert seeing an oasis.","\"Master, congratulations on your advancement!\" Ji Shengzhe exclaimed excitedly, as if it were his own breakthrough.","He had been terribly afraid of causing harm with good intentions.","The system suddenly noted with surprise: [Big shot, the golden light on Ji Shengzhe seems to have increased!]","Qi Quan helped Ling Sheng up, released his hand, and looked at Ji Shengzhe.","Compared to before, his merit had indeed grown more substantial.","Ji Shengzhe also noticed it. His gratitude towards Qi Quan deepened further, his eyes slightly reddening as he said, \"Master, meeting you must be the fortune I cultivated in a past life. I offered you merit merely as a small token of repayment, yet I never imagined it would aid your ascension. You must be a person blessed with great fortune. By helping a noble person, I received the heavens' reward, replenishing the merit I had previously lost. I've even accumulated a full lifetime's worth of merit now.\"","To be perfectly honest, before this, he had truly believed all his merit was going down the drain.","He frantically watched television, largely to force himself not to think about that matter. He was afraid he would go mad, lose his sanity.","Who could have expected such a dramatic turn of events? Everything is governed by cause and effect.","After becoming a ghost, he hadn't harmed anyone, giving himself a chance for redemption. Then, with the master's help, he recovered his merit, and after aiding the master, he directly accumulated a full measure of merit.","Ji Shengzhe was now incredibly excited and invigorated.","His gratitude towards Qi Quan was beyond words.","\"Master, my merit is full. It's time for me to move on to reincarnation.\"","Lu Jiang had already been captured, the wicked would be punished, and he had no more regrets.","He bowed deeply to Qi Quan, a smile on his face as his ghostly form transformed into a faint golden light, dissipating into the air.","The system bid him farewell: [Hope you get a good rebirth!]","Even though Ji Shengzhe couldn't hear it, it still wanted to have a sense of ceremony.","Qi Quan smiled slightly. \"Let's go.\"","She turned and left the secret room, with Ling Sheng following closely behind.","Outside the room, Li Guoyan and the other two had waited until noon before Qi Quan's figure finally appeared.","At first glance, she seemed unchanged, but upon closer perception, one would find her aura even more inwardly contained, with no trace of spiritual power leaking out.","It carried a profound sense of returning to simplicity, truly inscrutable.","Di Meng's attitude towards her instantly elevated to one of reverence and awe.","\"Master, shall we return to the Investigation Department now?\" Li Guoyan asked.","Qi Quan thought for a moment. \"Alright.\"","The group headed to the Investigation Department together.","The news of Lu Jiang's arrest quickly caused a stir and heated discussion within the metaphysical community.","The Yan Family.","While Yan Huai was deeply engrossed in cultivation, he was summoned by the family head once again.","He sat in the chair, his back ramrod straight, like an unsheathed sword—sharp, cold, and radiating a chilling aura.","Being interrupted during cultivation was extremely irritating for a cultivation fanatic.","Seeing him like this, the Yan Family Head sighed with a hint of helplessness. \"Regarding your trip to Longjiang City, I have a few more questions.\"","\"I've already said all that needs to be said,\" Yan Huai stated expressionlessly. \"Right now, you should be thoroughly investigating whether Yan Wu's actions are connected to that branch of the family.\"","The Yan Family Head: \"...\"","He sighed softly, his tone instructive. \"Our family's power structure is complex; it's not something that can be investigated just because we want to. This matter involves too many interests; it's not that simple.\"","Yan Huai remained silent.","Yan Family Head: ...","When the news came back that Yan Huai had traveled with Di Meng and escorted a criminal suspect into the Investigation Department, he had been utterly shocked.","After all, his son was single-mindedly devoted to cultivation, hardly communicating with outsiders, not even getting along with people within the family, let alone doing something like jointly escorting a criminal suspect.","The Yan Family Head had inwardly cursed at the time.","This kid definitely had a rebellious streak.","But what could he do?","He could only put up with his own son.","He cleared his throat lightly and continued asking, \"That diary writer you mentioned, what was the name again? How high is their cultivation level exactly?\"","Yan Huai's expression finally showed a flicker of change.","\"The Diary of a Tycoon, Master Bai Shui. I don't know.\"","\"...\"","\"You didn't get to meet the master in person?\"","Yan Huai shook his head.","He had visited but was turned away at the door.","Later, he went to the resort, ran into Di Meng, returned to the capital with him escorting the prisoner, and then came home. He hadn't seen Master Bai Shui.","The Yan Family Head's gaze turned profound. \"I just received news. Lu Jiang has been captured.\"","Yan Huai's face remained impassive.","The Yan Family Head felt weary, explaining, \"He is a Level Seven Celestial Master, and also skilled in formations.\"","\"Oh.\"","\"The Investigation Department doesn't even have a Level Six investigator, let alone Level Seven. I suspect the person who defeated Lu Jiang is the same one who subdued the marshland malevolent spirit.\"","Yan Huai's expression shifted slightly, his eyes clearly showing a spark of interest.","The Yan Family Head stated with certainty, \"Master Bai Shui is currently in Longjing.\"","The young man abruptly stood up.","\"Where are you going?!\"","\"Out.\"","Yan Family Head: \"...\"","Longjing City Investigation Department.","The ashen-faced Lu Jiang was escorted into the interrogation room.","Qi Quan did not participate in the interrogation and was arranged in a lounge. Li Guoyan personally poured tea for her and Ling Sheng.","\"Master, regarding the high-level talismans you mentioned yesterday, would you be interested in selling them to the Investigation Department?\" He got straight to the point.","Qi Quan didn't waste words either. She took three talismans from her bag.","One Level Six Thunder Talisman, one Level Six Spirit Talisman, and one Level Six Protection Talisman. Attack, spirit replenishment, and defense—all covered, and all high-level talismans.","Li Guoyan couldn't help but look pleasantly surprised.","The investigators at the Department were all elite, but they lacked the support of high-level talismans. They couldn't match the Celestial Masters in terms of level, which created significant obstacles during investigations.","If they could be supplied with high-level talismans, at least the investigators would have more security when facing Celestial Masters below Level Six.","Suppressing his excitement, he asked, \"How many can you provide?\"","Qi Quan countered, \"How many do you need?\"","She wasn't very clear about the specifics of the metaphysical community, so naturally, she couldn't casually propose a number.","Li Guoyan had done his research and tentatively suggested, \"Each month, ten Level Six attack-type talismans, ten spirit talismans, and ten protection talismans.\"","He understood that crafting talismans was difficult for Celestial Masters, but having learned indirectly that Qi Quan was proficient in the talisman path, he carefully proposed a monthly transaction of thirty talismans.","Qi Quan: \"...\"","Seeing her silence, Li Guoyan had no choice but to take a step back. \"How about eight of each then?\"","Qi Quan couldn't help but ask, \"How many Investigation Departments are there nationwide?\"","\"Over forty, large and small,\" he said.","Qi Quan: \"Twenty-four talismans a month, is that enough to distribute?\"","Li Guoyan smiled. \"Please don't underestimate our investigators either. Issuing high-level talismans is just to add an extra layer of security for them; they can't become overly reliant on talismans.\"","Moreover, not all regions had high-level Celestial Masters. Take Longtan City for example, a Level Three Celestial Master could practically swagger around there.","Qi Quan nodded. \"As per the original suggestion, thirty talismans.\"","\"Calculated at market price, Level Six attack talismans are ten thousand each, spirit talismans fifty thousand each, and defense talismans fifty thousand each. The Department would need to pay you one million, one hundred and ten thousand.\" Li Guoyan immediately did the math.","\"Alright.\"","Li Guoyan asked, \"Still through Scream Literature City?\"","\"No. Deposit it into a new card,\" Qi Quan said decisively.","This was the fruit of Ling Sheng's labor; she couldn't arbitrarily take it away.","Li Guoyan suggested, \"Every member of the Department is assigned a salary card. You have one too, you just haven't used it. The Department will deposit this money into your salary card on time each month. What do you think?\"","He assumed all these talismans were crafted by Qi Quan herself, completely not considering Ling Sheng by her side.","Just as Qi Quan was about to refuse, someone tugged at her sleeve.","A phone was handed to her, with a few words written on the screen: [No new card. Use the salary card.]","Qi Quan turned to look at Ling Sheng. The young man curved his eyes into a smile at her.","The system felt gratified: [Ling Sheng is growing up, learning to earn money to support the family.]","Qi Quan always respected the wishes of her family members. She wouldn't pry relentlessly or stubbornly insist on her own way. As long as the ghost servants or others in the household had their own ideas, she generally supported them.","Anyway, she wouldn't use the salary card.","\"Fine.\"","She agreed with a nod and directly took out thirty talismans from her bag—ten of each type.","Li Guoyan: \"...\"","Had he asked for too little?","\"The money will be transferred to your salary card shortly.\"","Qi Quan naturally trusted he wouldn't go back on his word.","\"There's another matter I need to discuss with you.\" Li Guoyan put away the talisman and said solemnly, \"Qi Yingxue has been arrested for intentional assault. She has confessed and is now awaiting sentencing. Do you have any thoughts on this?\"","Qi Quan: \"Handle it according to the law.\"","Qi Yingxue was just a minor pawn. Qi Quan had no interest in her life whatsoever, nor would she seek personal revenge.","The punishment should fit the crime.","She would not interfere.","Li Guoyan smiled. \"It is my honor to have you as the Chief Consultant for the Investigation Department. If you need anything, please don't hesitate to ask the department.\"","With his words, Qi Quan naturally didn't hold back. \"Help me investigate someone.\"","Li Guoyan was slightly surprised. \"Go ahead.\"","\"Fu Jiuge, from the Fu family in Longjing City.\"","Li Guoyan didn't ask for a reason and agreed directly.","\"I'll send you the information once I find it.\"","Suddenly, someone knocked on the door.","\"Director Li, a call from the Guiyuan Sect.\"","Li Guoyan's expression turned serious. He stood up and said, \"My apologies, I need to attend to this.\"","Qi Quan nodded. \"I'll trouble you with the information.\"","Then she left leisurely.","Returning to Su Nuannuan's villa, Shen Hui asked, \"Senior, when are we returning to Longjiang?\"","Qi Quan: \"No rush.\"","\"Alright.\"","Having received his answer, he went back to his room to cultivate.","Qi Quan took Ling Sheng upstairs.","\"Earlier, when Mrs. Song came, she mentioned your background. You know about it.\" Her tone was certain.","Ling Sheng didn't avoid the topic. His gaze was clear and calm as he looked at her and nodded.","\"Do you want to reunite with your family?\" Qi Quan asked seriously, staring at him. \"You must tell the truth.\"","Ling Sheng shook his head without hesitation.","For some reason, Qi Quan felt a surge of happiness and couldn't help but reach out to ruffle his hair.","She felt not a shred of guilt for \"taking\" someone else's child.","\"However, we still need to investigate the circumstances of your abduction back then, so we'll be staying in Longjing a few more days.\"","Ling Sheng took out his phone and typed: [I'll listen to you.]","His hand was pale and slender, with perfectly proportioned joints. The afternoon sun slanted in, casting a faint, pearlescent glow on his skin.","Qi Quan already considered him family and asked the question that had been buried in her heart: \"Why don't you speak?\"","Ling Sheng lowered his eyes and typed: [Cannot.]","It was \"cannot,\" not \"do not know how.\"","The self-healing ability of a natural spirit body was very strong. It couldn't be a problem with his vocal cords. If he said he couldn't speak, there must be a special reason.","Qi Quan was just concerned about him, not truly curious.","\"You overdrafted your spiritual energy earlier. Go back to your room and rest.\"","Ling Sheng pointed to the floor-to-ceiling window and typed: [There's sunlight here. Can I stay?]","Qi Quan: \"...\"","To be honest, she wasn't fond of having someone stay in her room for long periods, but—","The young man's slightly pale complexion and expectant eyes made her swallow her refusal.","Ling Sheng's room was opposite hers, and indeed didn't get sunlight at this time.","\"Alright,\" she nodded.","A smile touched Ling Sheng's lips. He sat down cross-legged by the floor-to-ceiling window, closed his eyes, and began restoring his spiritual energy.","Golden sunlight danced on his hair like lively little sprites.","Qi Quan withdrew her gaze and also sat down to consolidate her cultivation.","Investigation Department.","Li Guoyan hung up the phone. His expression hadn't changed, but the aura around him had clearly shifted.","\"Director Li, what did they say?\" Di Meng asked with a frown.","Li Guoyan said gravely, \"It was the Sect Leader of the Guiyuan Sect. He said that Lu Jiang, after all, is a sect elder and a Level 7 Array Master, with a rather high status in the Mystic Arts community. Being summoned to the Investigation Department in such a disgraceful manner has provoked protests from many of the old-timers.\"","Here, \"old-timers\" referred to those high-level cultivators, the old monsters.","The arrest of Wei Huanyang had caused a stir before, more due to his reputation and it being the first official contest of wills with the Mystic Arts community.","Later, the official side won a round, Wei Huanyang remained in custody, and the matter was considered over.","Ultimately, he was only a Level 4 Celestial Master, not enough to completely shake the foundations of the Mystic Arts community.","But this time was different.","If even a Level 7 Celestial Master could be arrested just like that, it naturally made those old-timers uneasy.","They had been able to wield power and live freely within the Mystic Arts community based on their cultivation levels. Now, with the emergence of an Investigation Department capable of easily arresting Level 7 Celestial Masters, it was like a Sword of Damocles hanging over their heads. Naturally, they were unwilling.","Di Meng, now filled with increased confidence, said, \"So they protest. What can they really do?\"","\"What can they do?\" Li Guoyan said. \"If they truly unite to challenge our Investigation Department, or stir up trouble within the Mystic Arts community, the department's cases will become much harder to handle.\"","The power of a single Level 7 Celestial Master was formidable enough. If all Level 7 Celestial Masters banded together, the Mystic Arts community would certainly fall into chaos.","The Mystic Arts community wasn't truly detached from the mortal world. Many sects traded with the mortal world for cultivation resources. If the Mystic Arts community fell into chaos, ordinary people would inevitably suffer.","This was the last situation the authorities wanted to see.","Di Meng slammed the table in anger. \"They've been spoiled!\"","He hesitantly asked, \"Can't we ask Senior to intervene?\"","Li Guoyan glared at him. \"Does Master Qi have dozens of clones? If disturbances break out in multiple places across the country, even if she's willing to help, could she possibly handle it all?\"","\"...\"","Di Meng said shamefully, \"It's still because we're too weak.\"","Li Guoyan sighed lightly and patted his shoulder. \"It will get better.\"","They were just starting out. The investigators still needed to grow. You have to eat one bite at a time; you can't rush.","Feeling frustrated, Di Meng walked out of the Investigation Department and almost bumped into the tall, aloof, and upright figure of Yan Huai.","\"What are you doing here?\"","Yan Huai: \"To pay a visit to the Senior.\"","\"...\" Di Meng thought he misheard and rubbed his ear. \"Visit who?\"","\"Bai Shui Zhen Ren (White Water True Person).\"","\"...Pfft.\"","Di Meng couldn't hold back. It was just too funny seeing him say the pen name with such a serious face.","\"You actually read novels?\" he asked, laughing enough, looking at Yan Huai with an extremely curious gaze.","Yan Huai: \"The Senior writes very well. It gave me deep insights.\"","\"What insights?\"","\"Insights on cultivating within the mundane world.\"","Di Meng became interested. \"Care to elaborate?\"","Yan Huai: \"Introduce me to her.\"","Di Meng: \"...\"","This guy isn't stupid either.","He stopped teasing and said, \"The Senior isn't at the Investigation Department. I can't introduce you.\"","Yan Huai was taken aback for a moment, then turned to leave.","\"Wait!\" Di Meng called out to stop him.","Yan Huai turned back.","\"The Investigation Department arrested Lu Jiang. What's your take on that?\" Di Meng asked casually, but his expression was serious.","Yan Huai said expressionlessly, \"No opinion.\"","Di Meng waved his hand. \"You can go.\"","He had wanted to sound out his thoughts, but got such an extremely perfunctory yet airtight answer.","The leader of the Mystic Arts community had some substance.","Yan Huai returned home and was again summoned by the Family Head to the conference room.","In the conference room, several elders of the family were seated around the table. A large screen was set up at the front for a video conference.","\"I received a call from Sect Leader Yin Yi of the Guiyuan Sect. He plans to hold a joint meeting with various sects and families for discussion. You should sit in and listen,\" the Yan Family Head instructed Yan Huai.","Yan Huai didn't refuse and sat down straight-backed.","Moments later, the video conference began.","Participants: Guiyuan Sect Leader Yin Yi, Xuanqing Sect Leader Wan Du, Hengfeng Sect Leader Yu Lanzhi, Yan Family Head Yan Fengjun, Fu Family Head Fu Jiuchong, along with several elders and core disciples.","Sect Leader Yin, a man of refined and handsome appearance with an elegant, scholarly demeanor, was the first to speak. \"Thank you all for taking the time to attend this meeting. I am grateful. I presume everyone has heard about the arrest of our sect's seventh-level elder, Lu Jiang.\"","\"A seventh-level celestial master, arrested just like that. This is a slap in our face,\" a senior from the Hengfeng Sect exclaimed indignantly.","The authorities' move had left all high-level celestial masters feeling insecure.","They might not know what Lu Jiang had done, but after cultivating for so many years, they were all too aware of their own past actions.","Life is long, and everyone makes mistakes. If the authorities arrest people for minor transgressions, they'd probably all be summoned to the police station for questioning.","Cultivating for longevity isn't about spending extra years in prison.","Yu Lanzhi also spoke up. \"Previously, when my disciple Wei Huanyang was arrested, none of you paid it much mind. You must understand, once the authorities make their first move, there will be a second, a third, and more.\"","\"If my information is correct, the highest-ranking investigator in the Investigation Department is only a fifth level,\" Sect Leader Wan said, puzzled. \"A fourth-level celestial master is one thing, but how could a seventh-level master be taken so easily? Elder Lu was an array master, wasn't he?\"","The Xuanqing Sect, located in Longhai City, was less affected by the turmoil in Longlin and Longjing Cities. They were more concerned with how strong the authorities' power truly was.","Sect Leader Yin said, \"I've heard the Investigation Department enlisted the help of an expert.\"","\"An expert capable of defeating a seventh-level array master—how many such individuals exist in this world? If an expert of that caliber left their sect or family, it's impossible that no news would have leaked,\" Sect Leader Wan mused, stroking his beard.","The room fell silent.","None of the sects or families represented there had a seventh-level celestial master serving the Investigation Department. That left only minor sects, minor families, or lone cultivators.","And lone cultivators were virtually impossible.","\"Family Head Yan... what is your view?\" Yu Lanzhi asked.","Yan Fengjun replied with an inscrutable air, \"Perhaps... have any of you read 'The Heiress's Diary'?\"","Everyone: ???","What thing?","Yan Fengjun enjoyed their bewildered expressions and smiled. \"The answer you seek lies within that novel.\"","When he first heard Yan Huai mention 'The Heiress's Diary,' he had worn the same expression.","Misery loves company.","Fu Jiuchong, who had remained silent until now, unexpectedly spoke. \"The Yan Family Head has... interesting hobbies.\"","Yan Fengjun: \"You flatter me, you flatter me.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","That was clearly sarcasm!","\"Rather than identifying this expert, we should consider the future path of the mystic arts community,\" Yan Fengjun said, his smile fading, his tone grave.","Sect Leader Wan: \"Indeed.\"","\"The authorities' intent is quite clear,\" Yu Lanzhi said, his eyes profound. \"The Celestial Masters Association likely won't last much longer.\"","If the mystic arts community in the future were to accept the leadership and regulation of the authorities, the Celestial Masters Association would inevitably face dissolution.","This was forcing them to relinquish power.","Those who hold authority—how could they be willing to give up the wealth and influence already in their grasp?","Probably no one present wanted that.","Sect Leader Yin said, \"I have already called Li Guoyan. He has not yet given a definitive response.\"","At a time like this, no one could afford to back down first.","\"I have a question,\" a young woman suddenly spoke up.","She sat behind Fu Jiuchong; she was his daughter, Fu Luanfei.","Sect Leader Yin smiled kindly. \"Please go ahead, young friend.\"","\"From what I understand, the celestial masters the Investigation Department has arrested so far are all individuals with heinous records, those who have broken laws and violated regulations. These evil celestial masters were arrested because they committed wrongs. So, what do celestial masters who haven't done anything wrong have to fear?\"","Her looks were inherited from her father, her eyes and brows possessing a natural vigor. She was a remarkably capable and straightforward girl.","Her words left the assembly at a loss for a response.","The logic was clear to everyone, but after wielding immense power, who was still willing to abide by mere logic?","Fu Jiuchong's expression remained placid. \"Spoiled at home. My apologies for the amusement.\"","Yet he did not reprimand or scold Fu Luanfei.","Sect Leader Yin smiled. \"The young friend is sharp. It's just that the matter is not as simple as you think.\"","Fu Luanfei smiled slightly. \"My perspective is shallow. I've made a fool of myself.\"","She lowered her eyes and resumed being part of the background.","Someone proposed, \"We could investigate the identity of this expert, first attempt to recruit them. If we can bring them to our side, the problem would be easily solved.\"","\"That makes sense.\"","\"Indeed, the Investigation Department's confidence in arresting celestial masters stems from having an expert backing them.\"","Yan Fengjun also nodded in agreement.","Sect Leader Yin asked, \"Brother Yan, do you already know the expert's identity?\"","\"I am not certain,\" Yan Fengjun shook his head. \"If you want to investigate, start with 'The Heiress's Diary.'\"","Everyone: \"...\"","In truth, Qi Quan's identity wasn't a secret. Neither the Investigation Department nor she herself had deliberately hidden it. It was just that her movements were mysterious, she rarely acted, and she was extremely young, so most people wouldn't think of her.","The night the wetland wraith was subdued, aside from the Investigation Department personnel, other sects and families hadn't yet figured out who was responsible.","Today's arrest of Lu Jiang similarly went unwitnessed.","Yesterday, when Di Meng led people to summon Lu Jiang, the mystic arts community in Longjing City wasn't unaware, but they didn't take it seriously. It wasn't that they were foolishly overconfident, but rather they simply refused to believe the Investigation Department could take away a seventh-level array master.","Thus, they missed the perfect opportunity to learn the truth.","The meeting had reached a point where continuing was unnecessary. Everyone ended the video call.","...","Yan Huai stood up silently.","\"Wait,\" Yan Fengjun called out to him, asking casually, \"Do you think that expert would accept recruitment?\"","Yan Huai: \"I don't know.\"","He turned and left the conference room.","Yan Fengjun: \"...\"","He's becoming more and more rebellious.","The Su Family Villa.","Qi Quan sat on the sofa, receiving the information Li Guoyan had sent.","The information was quite brief.","[Fu Jiuge, formerly a twenty-five-year-old fourth-level celestial master. Younger sister of the current Fu Family Head, Fu Jiuchong. Currently forty-five years old. Twenty years ago, she lost her mental faculties in an accident. Since then, she has lived in seclusion within the Fu residence, never appearing in public again.]","She handed the information to Ling Sheng.","Ling Sheng glanced at it only once before looking away, showing not the slightest interest.","He was busy purifying impurities from the villa's tea leaves, his expression gentle and focused, as if performing an extremely important task.","Qi Quan said, \"The 'accident' is the key point.\"","Ling Sheng looked up at her, pressed his lips together, then lowered his head again, sealing the purified tea leaves. He actually seemed somewhat displeased.","Before Qi Quan could figure out what was wrong, he walked over with his phone, half-knelt before her, and pointed to the top of his own head.","Qi Quan chuckled and instinctively reached out to ruffle his hair.","\"I just think that accident might be related to what happened to you. It's possible someone knows of your existence. You are a person of the Lakeside Villa. You should live in the sunlight. Any hidden dangers must be nipped in the bud.\"","She was quite protective of her own.","Ling Sheng gazed up at her, his eyes completely filled with her reflection."]},{"number":49,"title":"Chapter 49","paragraphs":["Of course, a web novel like \"Diary of a Wealthy Family\" would never be personally read by the grandmasters of the mystical sects.","When the task was assigned to their disciples, the disciples were baffled.","Read a novel?","What kind of task is this?","Naturally, there were disciples who enjoyed surfing the internet and were already aware of \"Diary of a Wealthy Family.\" After receiving the task from their elders, they immediately shared what they knew.","The elders: ???","A twenty-two-year-old super-sixth-level Celestial Master?","Are they living in some fantasy script?","The Fu Family.","Fu Jiuchong didn't have a disciple read it; he personally skimmed through the novel's brief sixteen chapters. After finishing, his expression remained unchanged.","\"Luanfei, share your thoughts.\"","Fu Luanfei said seriously, \"It critiques contemporary issues with profound insight.\"","The first few chapters were more humorous and it was hard to tell, but the further one read, the more one could sense Bai Shui Zhenren's temperament.","Especially the chapter \"Two Ghosts Vie for Supremacy,\" which was full of satire.","She wondered what expression the people from the Hengfeng Sect would have after reading it.","Fu Jiuchong: \"I don't think so.\"","Fu Luanfei: ?","\"The author wrote quite casually, probably just putting down whatever came to mind without overthinking it.\"","Fu Luanfei: \"...\"","Your perspective is quite unconventional, huh.","She said, \"A super-sixth-level at twenty-two, even surpassing Yan Huai. With a genius like that, we can't possibly guess what she's thinking.\"","So let's not do any more literary analysis.","Fu Jiuchong put down his phone, maintaining a solemn expression. \"A genius like that would be difficult to recruit.\"","\"And if recruitment fails, what happens to the genius?\" Fu Luanfei asked with a grim face.","\"Either control her, or grind her into the dust.\"","They wouldn't resort to killing, but they had plenty of ways to make a genius fall.","Fu Luanfei's face showed reluctance. \"Should I go and...\"","\"You're only eighteen, a fourth-level Celestial Master. What can you do?\" Fu Jiuchong interrupted her.","Fu Luanfei said earnestly, \"At the very least, I can give her a warning.\"","\"...\"","\"Dad, I have a way. No one will find out.\"","Fu Jiuchong lowered his head, not looking at her.","\"Dad, such an outstanding talent. Do you really want her to suffer this?\" Fu Luanfei stared intently at him. \"If I don't follow my conscience, my cultivation will definitely be hindered.\"","Fu Jiuchong was silent for a moment, then said quietly, \"Prioritize your own life.\"","\"I'll remember!\"","The Su Family Villa.","Su Nuanuan returned from school and asked Qi Quan, \"Sister Quan, how long do you plan to stay in Longjing? I heard from Ning Zhi and the others that your business here is finished.\"","Her face was full of reluctance.","Qi Quan took out a peace talisman, folded into a triangle shape.","\"The jade pendant has lost its effect. I didn't bring any jade this time. This peace talisman can ward off negative energy for you a few times.\"","Su Nuanuan exclaimed joyfully, \"Sister Quan, you're so good to me!\"","She took the talisman and rushed forward to hug Qi Quan tightly.","Qi Quan: ...","To be honest, she had never been this physically close to anyone before. She was genuinely a bit startled and somewhat at a loss.","The girl's soft body pressed tightly against hers, emanating a sweet fragrance. Their temples touched, and the soft rustling sound was clearly audible, bringing a strange, unfamiliar sensation.","At the table, Ling Sheng, who was doing his homework, silently looked up.","...","The homework was assigned by Xue Hong. Even on a trip, he couldn't neglect his studies.","He had no particular feelings about doing homework. He studied diligently every day simply because Qi Quan wanted him to.","Propping his chin on his hand, he watched the two embracing, lost in thought.","Qi Quan snapped back to reality and gently pushed Su Nuanuan away.","\"I'll stay in Longjing a few more days. If the peace talisman ever loses its effect, you can tell me.\"","\"Ahhh, that's great!\" She was overjoyed, her face beaming, then thought of something else. \"Does drawing talismans take a lot of energy?\"","Qi Quan smiled. \"It's more than enough for you.\"","She had been staying here for a few days; it was only right to give the host a token of thanks.","A peace talisman was really nothing to her.","\"Then I won't stand on ceremony!\" Su Nuanuan's eyes curved like crescent moons.","Qi Quan: \"I'll head back to my room first.\"","\"Mhmm, I'm going to do some yoga!\"","Qi Quan went up to the second floor. Just as she opened her door, her sleeve was tugged.","She didn't need to look back to know who it was.","There was only one person in the world who liked tugging her sleeve.","\"Yes?\"","Ling Sheng lowered his head, the top of his dense hair facing her.","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She asked her system: [Does he really think of himself as a pet?]","System: [...]","Seeing no reaction from her, Ling Sheng grew a bit anxious. He pointed to the top of his own head and looked at her expectantly.","Qi Quan: Was this a daily routine now?","If it weren't for his innate spiritual physique keeping his hair clean and fresh every day, Qi Quan might have vetoed this activity.","She reached out and ruffled it.","Good boy, go back now.","Unexpectedly, as soon as her hand dropped, the young man spread his arms and hugged her.","An invisible barrier appeared between them.","Qi Quan raised an eyebrow. \"What are you doing?\"","Ling Sheng looked somewhat wronged. Seeing she wouldn't allow it, he took out his phone and typed: [Just now, she was happy, hugged you, and you were happy too.]","He showed it to Qi Quan.","Qi Quan: ???","Was she happy? She was flustered and panicked, okay?","She denied it seriously. \"I was not happy.\"","Ling Sheng: \"...\"","He had clearly sensed it; the spiritual energy around her had been lively.","Qi Quan: \"It's late. Time to rest.\"","A hint of dejection appeared in Ling Sheng's eyes. His head drooped as he turned and left.","[Master, you haven't updated today,] the system stated coolly.","Qi Quan: [Tired. Taking a break.]","[...]","The system added: [Master, were you feeling shy just now?]","Qi Quan remained calm: [What are you talking about?]","[Actually, when Su Nuanuan suddenly hugged you, you were quite pleased, right?]","Qi Quan lay on the bed, pondering.","Was she pleased?","It seemed she really was, a little.","Hugging someone, feeling their body warmth and heartbeat, their breath and emotions, was indeed a novel experience.","The system chuckled: [Master, no need to be embarrassed.]","Qi Quan: [I'm not embarrassed, just unaccustomed to it.]","[Alright.]","Qi Quan dismissed the jumble of thoughts in her mind and began to meditate and cultivate.","Meanwhile, the major sects were discussing how to recruit Qi Quan.","Guiyuan Sect.","\"It's confirmed? A twenty-two-year-old super-sixth-level Celestial Master?!\" A elder was utterly astonished.","A disciple replied respectfully, \"Based on the content of 'Diary of a Wealthy Family' and information online, it's confirmed that Bai Shui Zhenren's real identity is Qi Quan, a resident of Longjiang City, and a super-sixth-level Celestial Master.\"","... \"Super-sixth-level\" was actually an understatement. To capture a seventh-level Celestial Master, she must be at least seventh-level herself.","Sect Leader Yin sighed. \"This surpasses even that kid from the Yan family.\"","\"How should we go about recruiting her?\"","Someone suggested, \"Find out her preferences. Whether it's money, cultivation resources, or handsome men, we lack for nothing.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","The first two are fine, but the third? Are you serious?","The disciple replied, \"Based on relevant information, this disciple infers that this Celestial Master has three hobbies.\"","\"Speak!\"","\"Being a homebody, keeping ghost attendants, and writing novels.\"","Writing novels is understandable. If it weren't a hobby, why would a high-level Celestial Master spend time and energy writing novels?","As for being a homebody and keeping ghost attendants...","\"She keeps ghost attendants?\" someone exclaimed, eyes wide. \"That doesn't sound like something a proper Celestial Master would do!\"","\"Exactly, the authorities keep arresting people, but never her. Is it just because she's helping the Investigation Department?\"","An elderly person asked, \"What does 'dead otaku' mean? Dying in the house?\"","A young disciple wiped sweat, \"...It means someone who doesn't like going out.\"","\"Her hobbies aren't very useful as reference points. Being a homebody and writing novels aside, keeping ghost attendants... does that mean we should select a few good-looking ghosts to send over?\"","\"...\"","Even Sect Leader Yin's refined composure was starting to crack.","He took a deep breath and instructed, \"Investigate further!\"","The disciple accepted the order and left.","Similar discussions were happening in other sects and families.","None of this, however, affected Qi Quan.","After a night, her cultivation realm had stabilized. The breakthrough had brought her many benefits.","Her spiritual sense and all five senses had been elevated to a higher level. Now, she seemed to vaguely touch upon a certain law of nature, gaining a deeper understanding of the world and its workings.","Her control over spiritual energy surpassed her past self.","Just after finishing the breakfast Ling Sheng made, Ning Zhi and Chen Feilu arrived.","\"Master, I have some questions about cultivation I'd like to ask you,\" Chen Feilu said with a grin.","Although he was officially the master's assistant, he considered himself half a disciple. Of course, he should consult the master about cultivation issues.","Of course, the 'half-disciple' title was self-proclaimed.","Qi Quan nodded. \"No classes today?\"","\"It's Saturday, no classes.\"","Qi Quan thought: People who don't work lose track of the days of the week.","She led Chen Feilu to sit at the tea table by the window.","One asked, one answered, and two others listened in.","The listeners were Ning Zhi and Shen Hui.","The former had learned everything from his family's traditions since childhood, while the latter studied mystic arts through the Investigation Department's training. Their systems were completely different, and neither could understand Qi Quan's explanations.","Chen Feilu listened with great interest.","After all, he was learning from the cultivation method Qi Quan had given him; he had already accepted and understood her system.","This was tough on the other two.","They had originally hoped to listen in on the expert's profound cultivation insights and take some notes, but ended up completely baffled. Listening more was pointless, so they retreated to cultivate on their own.","The Q&A session ended.","Chen Feilu happily ran off to meditate.","[Master, it's a day off. You really should write now, right?] The system said weakly.","As soon as it finished speaking, Qi Quan's phone rang.","She smiled. [Another mission is here. It'll probably be quite tiring.]","System: [...]","Just keep procrastinating!","...","The call was from Li Guoyan.","\"Master, it's Saturday,\" he said with a laugh. \"I wonder if you have time to train the Investigation Department's seedlings.\"","They had previously discussed using the Wetland Fierce Ghost as a \"trainer\" once a week. Since Qi Quan was now in Longjing, it saved the investigators the trip to Longjiang.","Qi Quan agreed readily. \"Anytime is fine.\"","\"Good, I'll send someone to pick you up later.\"","The one who came to pick her up was Di Meng.","Qi Quan simply brought Shen Hui, Chen Feilu, Ning Zhi, and Ling Sheng along. Training together, a few more or fewer people didn't make much difference.","Only Su Nuanuan was left at home.","Fortunately, she loved to have fun and had already planned to go shopping.","The group arrived at the Longjing City Investigation Department.","Compared to other branches, the Longjing Department had a more upscale facade. The main gate was imposing and solemn, with formations set up inside and out. The interior was spacious and filled with abundant spiritual energy.","Li Guoyan personally came out to greet them.","\"Master, we have a dedicated training room here. Shall we use that?\"","Qi Quan nodded. \"That works.\"","The Investigation Department had five floors.","The first floor was the case-handling hall, the second floor housed the on-duty rooms for field teams, the third floor was for administrative offices, the training area was on the fourth floor, and the fifth floor contained the offices of leaders like Li Guoyan and the storage area for cultivation resources.","They reached the fourth floor.","Almost the entire floor was a training ground, with a few rooms serving as medical facilities.","The training ground was specifically designed for the investigators.","How to precisely control spiritual power, how to use it flexibly, and how to fight or escape after it was depleted were their essential subjects.","Although they lacked much experience fighting ghosts, each one was an elite soldier.","One area of the training room had hanging ribbons.","The ribbons were tied with sharp little thorns.","When a breeze blew, the ribbons swayed randomly. If an investigator couldn't precisely control their spiritual power to dodge while passing through the ribbons, they would be pricked by the thorns.","The thorns wouldn't cause injury but would record the number of hits. The training score for this item was graded based on the number of pricks.","Exceeding a certain number meant failing.","The other training items were similar, all designed to push the investigators' potential.","Compared to the mystic sects' daily meditation, this kind of training indeed better tempered one's will and improved control over spiritual power.","Given time, the Investigation Department's combat power was bound to surpass that of the mystic sects.","Li Guoyan led them to a relatively open area.","\"Master, is this spot okay?\"","Qi Quan nodded and directly released the Wetland Fierce Ghost.","After being confined for so many days, the ferocity in the ghost's eyes had mostly faded. His current level was suppressed to the fifth rank, and he didn't dare act recklessly in front of Qi Quan at all.","He could sense that this woman was even more terrifying than she was that night.","She had actually advanced again!","The fierce ghost hung his head dejectedly, floating in the air with no fighting spirit whatsoever.","Qi Quan thought: This won't do.","She thought for a moment and said to Li Guoyan, \"This ghost is quite cowardly. Investigators below the second rank will suffice.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","Fierce Ghost: ???","Second rank? Who are you insulting!","Training, is it? Using him to grind experience? Just watch him beat those low-level celestial masters until they're crawling on the floor!","Anyway, this woman still had some use for him. He could go all out...","He wouldn't get in trouble for training them hard.","Li Guoyan naturally understood her intention. He gathered investigators below the second rank and sent them into the training room in batches to spar with the fierce ghost.","Batch after batch went in standing and came out lying down.","Qi Quan had suppressed the ghost to the second rank, third tier. But a fierce ghost was still a fierce ghost, and his methods were quite ruthless. He vented a lot of the resentment built up from being imprisoned in the peachwood plaque by beating people to his heart's content.","However, as the investigators' ranks got higher, even when the ghost's level was adjusted slightly above theirs, he found it hard to easily overpower them.","High-ranking investigators had undergone countless training sessions. Their combat styles were more concise and powerful, and their teamwork was more tacit, leaving the fierce ghost running in circles.","Investigators entered and left the training room one after another. Finally, only Di Meng and Ning Zhi, the two fifth-rank investigators, remained.","Having watched until now, Di Meng was already brimming with fighting spirit.","He glanced at Ning Zhi, rubbing his hands together. \"Want to have a competition?\"","Ning Zhi raised his peachwood sword. \"Of course.\"","The two charged into the training room together.","Ning Zhi was at the fifth rank, first tier; Di Meng was at the fifth rank, second tier. The fierce ghost's current level was set at the sixth rank, first tier.","This could be considered fighting a monster above their level.","But two against one was still somewhat fair.","Facing the two of them, the fierce ghost didn't dare be careless. Relying on his sixth-rank advantage, he engaged them. After fighting for so long, he was actually somewhat tired, but more than anything, he felt frustrated.","Previously, he had been suppressed below the fifth rank, unable to use his full abilities, playing house with those low-level celestial masters. Naturally, it hadn't been satisfying.","Now, having suddenly risen to level six, the immense ghostly power ignited his fighting spirit.","You two brats, just you wait!","He dodged the attacks of the two, patiently observing their weaknesses. Suddenly, a strand of ghostly power snaked behind Ning Zhi, transforming into a foot that kicked him flying.","\"Hahahahaha!\"","The next second, a giant peach wood hammer swung towards his chest.","\"Boom!\"","Di Meng wore a mocking smile, raising the peach wood hammer and pummeling down with a series of cracks and thuds. As he hit, he said, \"What are you laughing at, you weakling? You have the nerve to laugh?\"","Over there, Ning Zhi quickly stood up and joined the team brutally beating the malevolent ghost.","Only then did the malevolent ghost realize that the earlier kick was merely an act put on by the two, and he had lost his due vigilance because of his arrogance!","Damn it!","Black mist coalesced into another clone, roaring as it engaged the two in fierce combat.","The battle lasted a very long time, so long that Qi Quan had already sat on the sofa and completed three major meditation cycles.","Inside the training room, both men and the ghost lay sprawled on the floor, unable to even lift a finger.","Di Meng gasped for breath, laughing, \"That was exhilarating!\"","He hadn't fought like that in a long time and was extremely excited.","Ning Zhi felt the same.","He smiled sincerely. Compared to his past experiences as a celestial master, he much preferred the feeling of fighting side-by-side with a colleague like this.","The malevolent ghost lay on the ground, almost crying.","What a miserable ghostly existence this was!","Qi Quan, sitting on the sofa, directly threw out a peach wood talisman and captured the malevolent ghost.","The malevolent ghost found himself squeezed together with Qin Ruo and the long-bearded celestial master from Longtan City.","He wiped his face and said bitterly, \"When I was suppressed in the wetlands, I never felt this aggrieved.\"","Qin Ruo advised gloomily, \"You should be glad you still have value to be recycled. You need to perk up, otherwise, when you lose your value, you'll face soul dispersion.\"","The malevolent ghost: \"...\"","His fate was truly bitter!","This training session was quite effective.","Some low-level investigators who had been stuck at bottlenecks... after a thrilling battle, all gained some insights and directly advanced in their cultivation.","High-level celestial masters find it difficult to advance, but this unconventional battle deepened their understanding of mystical arts.","[Master, \"Enduring National Fortune\" has thrown a thousand deep-water torpedoes.] The system announced.","Qi Quan nodded with satisfaction. The investigators gained a lot, and she also reaped a considerable harvest.","One mission for a hundred days of lifespan—not a bad deal.","Since Shen Hui, Chen Feilu, Ning Zhi, and Di Meng all participated in the battle and were now in no condition to drive, Li Guoyan personally drove Qi Quan back to her residence.","As she was about to get out of the car, Li Guoyan suddenly said, \"Master, your identity is no longer a secret within the mystical community. Their methods are bizarre and endless, so please be very careful.\"","Qi Quan smiled and said, \"It's fine.\"","\"I suspect the mystical community's attitude towards you will likely start with attempts to recruit you.\"","Qi Quan said calmly, \"That depends on their sincerity.\"","Li Guoyan: \"...\"","He quickly understood and said peacefully, \"The department respects your decision.\"","Whatever choice Qi Quan makes, as long as she doesn't cross the official bottom line or collude with evil cultivators, the authorities will respect it.","The system exclaimed, [Wow! Master, those people from the mystical community definitely have ill intentions. You must not be fooled!]","Qi Quan: [That's why others can be department heads, and you can only be a writer system.]","System: [...]","What did it say wrong?","Qi Quan entered the villa. Su Nuanuan hadn't returned yet; only she and Ling Sheng were home.","Regarding investigating Ling Sheng's origins, she still had no leads.","The Fu family is the second-largest influential family in Longjing. Investigating rashly could easily attract unwanted attention from multiple parties.","But to settle the cause and effect and make Ling Sheng truly a member of the Lakeside Villa, she had to uncover the truth of what happened back then.","She sat by the floor-to-ceiling window deep in thought, her brow unconsciously slightly furrowed.","Ling Sheng brought over a cup of tea from which impurities had been removed, presenting it to her with both hands.","The clear, subtle fragrance of the tea wafted over, pulling her back from her thoughts. She smiled and took it. The tea in the cup was a clear, jade-green color, soothing just to look at.","She took a small sip, and the chaotic emotions vanished completely.","Ling Sheng also held a cup, sitting opposite her.","She took a sip, he took a sip; she didn't drink, he didn't drink either.","Qi Quan asked the system: [What is he doing?]","System: [Imitating you, probably.]","[Don't you think he's been acting a bit strange these past two days?]","[Has he?]","Qi Quan: [He's been strange since yesterday.]","System: [I think he just wants to be close to you.]","Qi Quan: ...","Alright, Ling Sheng really doesn't have much sense of security.","But she truly wasn't used to being close to people yet.","[Master, someone sent a private message to your Weibo!] The system reported.","Qi Quan: [Read it.]","[Passerby A: Do you really think you're that powerful?]","Qi Quan: ...","The system said angrily, [Master, this person is provoking you! Deal with him!]","[No need.]","Qi Quan had zero interest in this elementary school-level kind of provocation.","[He sent another one!]","Passenger A: You are indeed a genius, but even two fists are no match for four hands. No matter how talented you are, can you withstand the siege of other level-seven celestial masters?","The system was confused: [What is he talking about?]","Qi Quan, however, was thoughtful.","She personally opened the private message. \"Passerby A\" had a default avatar, nothing special to see. But precisely because it was so generic, it seemed suspicious.","[Master, should we reply?...]","Qi Quan typed: [Thanks for the reminder.]","This person was likely from the mystical community. Worried that a simple \"reminder\" private message wouldn't be eye-catching enough, they used provocative words.","Only provocation could pique interest.","After Qi Quan replied, the other party didn't continue the conversation. Clicking in again showed the account had been deleted.","The system found it odd: [Master, was he really reminding you?]","[Yes.]","At her level of cultivation, discerning whether a person's words carry good or ill intent wasn't difficult.","The person reminding her might have obtained some internal information but couldn't warn her openly, resorting to this covert method.","After achieving the goal of the reminder, quickly deleting the account indicated great concern about being traced online.","This also meant the mystical community likely had people skilled in networking, and this \"passerby A\" was carefully avoiding them.","She pondered for a moment, then pulled Qin Ruo out and asked:","\"How did you obtain your targets' information, even their whereabouts?\"","To plant a peach blossom mark on someone, you must be able to touch the target.","Qin Ruo was an evil cultivator. When she first started, it coincided with the mystical community's crackdown on evil cultivators. Her cultivation was low at the time, and she hid carefully in Longjiang City, remaining unknown.","It wasn't until recent years, when the mystical community relaxed its suppression of evil cultivators, giving them room to breathe, and she had cultivated to level four, that she decided to enter the world to \"cultivate.\"","But she had no connections and couldn't access the social circle of people like Du Jiaming.","Even if she could use means to confuse people, those she could confuse were only a few peripheral individuals who only knew the usual places where Du Jiaming and the others often appeared, but had no idea about their specific schedules.","To contact Du Jiaming and the others, she needed to know their precise whereabouts to plan ahead.","This required someone to provide her with specific information.","Qin Ruo, with an aged face, respectfully replied, \"There's a public account. I paid some money to get their whereabouts.\"","This wasn't any core secret, so revealing it had no impact.","Qi Quan: ...","Is the modern mystical community this up-to-date these days?","First, there was the \"Luck God\" public account, and now one selling information.","Qi Quan asked, \"What public account?\"","\"Baixiaosheng's Thousand Questions.\"","The system couldn't help but complain: 【So cringe-worthy!】","Qi Quan completely agreed.","She waved her hand, sending Qin Ruo back into the peachwood talisman, and sent a message to Li Guoyan: 【Is selling citizens' private information illegal?】","【Li Guoyan: Yes, it is.】","【Qi Quan: The public account 'Baixiaosheng's Thousand Questions' provides citizens' private information to practitioners. Investigate it.】","【Li Guoyan: No problem.】","He acted with remarkable swiftness and decisiveness.","Not long after, Li Guoyan sent a message:","【Previously, through Yan Wu's phone, we found that shortly after he arrived in Longjiang City, he had phone calls and text messages with someone. The content was about Ning Zhi and you. The information about you was all findable online, which is how he found the Lakeside Villa to test you, confirming this point.","However, the matter wasn't considered important, so the department didn't mention it to you.","We traced the number he communicated with. The number has been deactivated, and we couldn't find the person, but we roughly located the area through the base station accessed during the call.","The public account you just mentioned—our department's technical personnel tracked the user's IP, but the other party noticed and likely used mystical means to escape.","This IP address falls within the general area of the aforementioned base station. Technical personnel suspect it's probably the same person.","The IP showed... the address is in a residential building in the suburbs of Longjing City. I've already sent people to pursue and apprehend them.】","Qi Quan: 【Okay.】","This computer expert probably never expected to be suddenly tracked by the authorities.","The system was speechless: 【With skills like that, isn't any legitimate career path better? Why break the law?】","Qi Quan: 【Right now, we can't determine if this person is simply selling citizens' information or if they're connected to the evil cultivator organization.】","【Hopefully, the Investigation Department can catch them.】","Unfortunately, when the Investigation Department arrived, the place was already empty. All the machinery and equipment had been destroyed by thunder talismans, leaving no clues behind.","Judging from the traces at the scene, a sixth-level thunder talisman was used.","The other party likely used concealment talismans, making tracking via surveillance impossible.","Although no one was caught, at least the other party wouldn't dare act so recklessly online for a while.","The Fu Residence.","Fu Luanfei received a reply. After deactivating the account, she felt relieved and left her room to find food in the kitchen.","\"Warning delivered?\" Fu Jiuchong, sitting on the living room sofa, asked abruptly.","Fu Luanfei, mimicking his solemn expression, replied, \"Don't worry, I've already erased the traces.\"","\"Right now, all sides are keeping a close eye on Qi Quan, and her Weibo account is no exception. Your little tricks won't escape the tracking skills of experts.\"","Fu Luanfei remained silent.","\"I know you can't bear to see it,\" Fu Jiuchong turned to look at her, his expression serious, \"but you also know the other side has a computer expert. If he discovers you contacted Master Baishui, you...\"","\"Dad, you didn't stop me, did you?\" Fu Luanfei got straight to the point. \"You couldn't bear it either, right?\"","Fu Jiuchong: \"...\"","\"Have to say, she's a very smart person. I'd actually like to meet her,\" Fu Luanfei said earnestly.","\"...\"","\"It's late, time to rest.\" He rose with a stern face and headed towards his room, pausing suddenly. \"Be careful when you're out.\"","Fu Luanfei watched him enter his room, unable to suppress a smile.","The next day.","After enjoying breakfast, Qi Quan instructed Su Nuanuan and Shen Hui: \"There will be guests later. Nuanuan, go upstairs. Shen Hui, you receive them.\"","\"What about him?\" Su Nuanuan pointed at Ling Sheng.","Qi Quan paused. \"He goes upstairs too.\"","Before long, visitors arrived at the villa.","Three people. The leader was a fourth-level Celestial Master, male, of exceptional appearance, elegant and graceful, looking to be in his twenties, though his actual age was unknown.","The two youths behind him had lower cultivation levels. Their looks were also top-tier, just younger, their faces slightly more youthful.","They each held exquisite rosewood boxes.","Shen Hui received them courteously.","\"Mr. Shen, hello. I am Zhou Xu, a 23rd generation disciple of the Zhou family. I am here by the family head's order to specially visit Senior Qi.\"","Calling him \"Mr. Shen\" right away showed they had done their homework beforehand.","After the mystical community bigwigs held their meeting yesterday, other smaller sects, schools, and families received the message to send representatives to Qi Quan's residence to recruit her on behalf of the mystical community.","The Zhou family's status in Longjing City was mid-to-upper tier, below the Yan and Fu families but above the Ning family.","Thus, they were sent as the vanguard.","Shen Hui looked at these three disciples of exceptional appearance and thought, does the mystical community now consider looks when accepting disciples?","He smilingly ushered them inside.","The three entered the living room, glancing around.","No one was in sight.","Zhou Xu asked, \"Might I ask where Senior Qi is?\"","Shen Hui poured them tea and said, \"The Master is currently occupied with important matters. Please wait a moment.\"","The tea was good tea—for ordinary people. For Zhou Xu, it couldn't compare to the Zhou family's tea at all...","He didn't drink it, and the other two disciples didn't either.","Time passed slowly. Even Zhou Xu, accustomed to meditation, couldn't help but feel a growing impatience.","He spoke up again: \"Could Mr. Shen please inform her?\"","They had waited half an hour already!","Shen Hui's smile didn't waver: \"The Master says cultivation lies in the heart. Sincerity brings efficacy; without sincerity, nothing can be achieved.\"","Zhou Xu: \"...\"","They want sincerity? Fine, he could wait!","The minute hand made circle after circle. After a full three circles, Qi Quan finally appeared on the stairs.","Zhou Xu and the two disciples were thoroughly numb by then.","He was a proud person by nature. After waiting three hours, his anger meter was full. Disregarding Qi Quan's cultivation level, he didn't even rise, stating directly:","\"I am here by the family head's order to specially visit Celestial Master Qi. This is a small token of appreciation from our Zhou family. We hope Celestial Master Qi will accept it.\"","The two youths presented the boxes on the low table.","Qi Quan sat on the sofa.","Shen Hui immediately served her a cup of supreme-grade tea. Its fragrance was delicate and refreshing, soothing to the heart and mind.","Zhou Xu: ???","Is this how a high-level Celestial Master treats guests? Good tea for herself, inferior tea for guests?","Unbelievable. Truly unbelievable.","His anger deepened, but he remembered the family head's instructions. With a stiff face, he said, \"Celestial Master Qi, with your profound cultivation, even within a major sect you could enjoy supreme honor and access more cultivation resources. 'The vast sea allows the fish to leap; the high sky lets the bird fly free'—how unrestrained and carefree that would be. Why confine yourself to shallow waters?\"","Shen Hui, who worked for the \"shallow waters,\" smiled slightly.","The system complains: 【This guy's negotiation skills are terrible. Kick him out. Next!】","Qi Quan didn't answer, but her gaze fell upon the rosewood boxes.","Zhou Xu thought there was a chance and signaled the young disciple to open the lids. The left box was filled with exquisite jade pieces, and the right box with gold bars.","Covering both secular wealth and cultivation resources.","\"As long as Celestial Master Qi is willing to become an elder of our Zhou family, all of this and more will be yours.\"","Qi Quan thought to herself: 【These would be good to donate to charity.】","The system: 【Hahahahaha!】","\"You're right, I shouldn't confine myself to shallow waters,\" she said.","Zhou Xu's eyes lit up.","Qi Quan said leisurely, \"Shen Hui, see the guests out.\"","\"What do you mean?\" Zhou Xu was stunned for a moment before reacting, his face flushing with anger.","Shen Hui smiled and added fuel to the fire: \"It means the water in the Zhou family is too shallow.\"","\"...\"","Zhou Xu glared at him hatefully. Seeing it was futile, he could only order the young disciples to put away the wooden box and stormed out of the living room in a rage.","By the floor-to-ceiling window on the second floor, Ling Sheng looked down at the three people in the courtyard, a wisp of black energy silently released from his palm.","Zhou Xu had just stepped out of the villa's gate when his foot suddenly slipped on the steps, sending him tumbling face-first to the ground.","The two young disciples: ???","A fourth-level Celestial Master can still trip and fall? Couldn't he use spiritual energy to balance himself when falling? Was he so angry he lost his mind?","Zhou Xu: \"...\"","Numb. He was truly numb.","The news of the failed first attempt was relayed back, and the influential figures of the Mystic Sect held another meeting to discuss their plan.","\"That Shen Hui said sincerity is important. She probably just looked down on those things.\"","\"Right, I said before not to send the Zhou family.\"","\"So who goes this time?\"","\"Stop discussing for now. I just heard from a disciple's report that she posted on Weibo.\"","[White Water True Person V: The White Water Charity Fund is officially established today. Your attention and support for charitable causes are welcome.]","Everyone: ???","\"What does she mean by this?\"","\"Is it what I'm thinking?\"","\"Seeking sponsors?\"","\"This might be what 'sincerity' means.\"","Ordinary netizens, however, were full of praise.","[Doing charity to help more people is great.]","[Go for it! Fully supporting!]","[Doing good deeds accumulates blessings. I hope the blogger stays safe and well forever!]","The White Water Charity Fund was indeed officially established that very day.","Before Zhou Xu's visit, Qi Quan had already received Zheng Hui's report. Seeing the gold bars and priceless, top-quality jade Zhou Xu brought, she conceived this idea.","Since they wanted to recruit her, they should show some sincerity.","But Qi Quan wouldn't make any promises.","Whether they spent money to curry favor and win her regard was their business. Whether she accepted their recruitment was her decision.","It was just a high-stakes gamble.","This unexpected move of hers completely baffled the leaders of the sects and families.","But baffled or not, the recruitment plan had to proceed.","\"Headmaster, how much should we donate?\"","\"Family Head, is ten million enough?\"","\"Fifty million? Are we trying to appease a beggar?\"","A charity fund is a non-profit organization that can accept donations from individuals, legal entities, or other organizations. All this money would be used for charitable causes.","Zheng Hui continuously updated her on the situation.","\"Master, Mr. Wan, in the name of his sect, donated one hundred million.\"","\"Master, Mr. Yan, in the name of his family, donated one hundred million.\"","\"Master, Mr. Fu, in the name of his family, donated one hundred million.\"","\"Master, Mr. Su, in a personal capacity, donated fifty million.\"","\"Master, Mr. Qi, in a personal capacity, donated fifty million.\"","\"Master, Du...\"","Apart from the first four, the rest were Qi Quan's clients. Seeing this Weibo post, they all contributed to the charitable cause.","Each sum was insignificant to them, but combined, it was enough to feed and clothe countless orphans, help more women in need, and allow out-of-school children to sit in clean classrooms and walk towards a brighter future.","At the Longjing Investigation Department.","Li Guoyan showed an appreciative expression and said to Di Meng, \"The Master's methods are as unique as ever.\"","Unique, but profoundly meaningful.","Di Meng also wore a look of admiration. \"I was worried those people constantly showing up would disturb our senior. Now it seems, a senior is indeed a senior.\"","He didn't have much savings, but he donated most of it to the charity fund, keeping only a little for his living expenses.","In the villa, Su Nuanuan came downstairs, nestled beside Qi Quan, hugged her arm, and said with a look begging for praise, \"Sister Quanquan, I donated all my pocket money to the foundation!\"","Qi Quan smiled and said, \"Kindness will be rewarded.\"","One Weibo post from the White Water True Person sparked a wave of donations.","Seeing that Headmaster Wan, Yan Fengjun, and Fu Jiuchong had donated, some smaller sects and families also followed the trend and donated some money.","However, the number one major sect, Guiyuan Sect, and the third major sect, Hengfeng Sect, remained silent.","In the freelance cultivators' group chat.","[Balding Taoist: Ahhhhh! My goddess is just so cool! Recruitment, huh? Show your sincerity first!]","[Pay-to-Win Taoist: Sigh, they're all so rich. A hundred million, and they don't even blink.]","[Toe-Picking Taoist: Your understanding of sects and families is really too shallow. A hundred million, to them, is probably like ten bucks to us.]","[Pay-to-Win Taoist: ...]","[Pay-to-Win Taoist: Wuwuwuwu! Thinking back, I used to give money to the Celestial Master Association just to get jobs... That little bit of money... I'm not worthy!]","[Balding Taoist: The end of the universe is a government job. Let's join the Investigation Department together. There will definitely be real work for you to do.]","[Toe-Picking Taoist: Should we change our group name?]","[Balding Taoist: Let's call it 'Investigation Department Reserve Force'!]","...","[Pay-to-Win Taoist: What about Brother Melon? Where does that leave him?]","[Melon-Eating Taoist changed the group name to \"Investigation Department Active Duty Exchange Group\"]","[Balding Taoist: ???]","[Pay-to-Win Taoist: ???]","[Toe-Picking Taoist: ???]","[Melon-Eating Taoist: Your applications have been approved by the department after review. You will be notified within three working days.]","[Balding Taoist: Oh... You know our identities?]","[Melon-Eating Taoist: You've been under consideration for a long time.]","[Pay-to-Win Taoist: Ah! Brother Melon! Why didn't you appear sooner? I wasted so much money!]","[Melon-Eating Taoist: Precisely because you sent gifts, the review period was longer.]","[Pay-to-Win Taoist: ...]","[Pay-to-Win Taoist: I... I really wasn't trying to bribe! It's just that I kept getting held up during the quarterly assessments. If I'm held up, I can't get my Celestial Master certificate. Without the certificate, I can't help people exorcise spirits or catch ghosts. I was forced! Please believe me, organization!]","[Toe-Picking Taoist: Sigh, freelance cultivators without connections often face this. If you don't pay your respects, they hold you back. Of course, there are also honest examiners in the Celestial Master Association. It's just luck of the draw.]","[Melon-Eating Taoist: Don't worry. The organization recognizes you. Welcome to the Investigation Department!]","[The Three: Ahhhhhh! So excited!]","Across the country, similar things were happening in many small freelance cultivator group chats.","The freelance cultivator community was full of potential and had always been a group the authorities wanted to unite.","With the decline of Hengfeng Sect and the news of Lu Jiang's arrest spreading, more and more cultivators began to admire the authorities' strength.","Some, like Balding Taoist, had already decided to join the Investigation Department. Others, more cautious, were still watching the situation within the Mystic Sect.","Guiyuan Sect and Hengfeng Sect not donating demonstrated their stance.","Qi Quan helping the Investigation Department capture Lu Jiang and Wei Huanyang had already touched on their sect's interests. Naturally, they wouldn't rush to show goodwill.","Major sects cared more about face.","Qi Quan didn't mind and continued her cultivation.","Just as she was settling into her practice, the system suddenly reported.","[Big shot, someone sent you a private message asking for help!]"]},{"number":50,"title":"Chapter 50","paragraphs":["【Binbin's Mom: Hello, are you really that kind of master? I'd like to consult you about a problem, is that okay?】","【Binbin's Mom: I have a son, he's fifteen this year. He was always very normal before, but lately he's been acting a bit strange. One weekend I forgot a document when I went to work and went back home to get it. I found him actually wearing a dress!】","【Binbin's Mom: When I asked him about it, he said it was for a cross-dressing role in the school's Mid-Autumn Festival party. I specifically asked his homeroom teacher, and there was no such thing. Later, I found out he started growing his hair long, got his ears pierced, and even started learning how to put on makeup!】","【Binbin's Mom: He's becoming more and more strange. I really don't know what to do. Master, please help me take a look. Is he possessed by an evil spirit?】","The person seeking help sent a long string of messages, the core point being that her son was possessed.","The system said: 【It might not necessarily be possession. Maybe he's just a cross-dressing streamer.】","It had been spending a lot of time online and knew a lot.","Qi Quan: ...","The system: 【It could also be heavy teenage curiosity, imagining himself as a girl.】","Qi Quan took a screenshot and sent it to Li Guoyan.","For this kind of case, the Investigation Department could just send someone.","Li Guoyan quickly replied: 【The account's IP has been confirmed, it's in Longjing City. The family situation is also understood. A family of four: a couple, their fifteen-year-old son, and the child's grandfather. Nothing abnormal seems apparent. Di Meng has already taken people over.】","Qi Quan: 【Okay.】","Originally, as far as she was concerned, the matter ended here. Unexpectedly, not long after, Li Guoyan called:","\"Master, there really is a ghost inside that boy, but we have no way to force it out.\"","Qi Quan: \"High level?\"","\"The instrument detected that the ghost energy isn't very dense, probably just a minor ghost. But the strange thing is, we can't use talismans to force it out of the boy's body.\"","Qi Quan: \"Did it put up a fierce resistance?\"","\"No. The talismans had no effect when struck against the boy. Di Meng and the others exhausted all kinds of techniques, but still couldn't force it out. Other methods would harm the boy, so they can't be used.\"","Furthermore, according to Di Meng's description, the ghost inside the boy was even looking at them with a mocking expression.","It infuriated the investigators, leaving them frustrated and aggrieved.","Since the establishment of the Investigation Department, the investigators had handled many cases of ordinary people encountering ghosts, but this was the first time they encountered such a bizarre case. It was truly baffling.","Qi Quan said, \"If it's not urgent, I can go take a look tomorrow morning.\"","It was too late now, she didn't want to go out.","That ghost had been inside the boy for quite some time, yet the mother's tone was still relatively calm. The situation probably wasn't too severe.","Li Guoyan: \"Alright, I'll have Di Meng pick you up tomorrow.\"","Early the next morning, as soon as Qi Quan went downstairs, she saw Di Meng waiting in the living room. Shen Hui was chatting with him, and Ling Sheng was making breakfast in the kitchen.","Her breakfast, as usual, had impurities removed.","Di Meng hadn't eaten breakfast yet. He wolfed down two big bowls and praised, \"Senior, no wonder you brought this assistant on your business trip. His skills are truly excellent.\"","Shen Hui: \"...\"","You probably haven't smelled the dishes this \"assistant\" specially makes for the master. Those are what's truly amazing.","Qi Quan smiled without comment.","After eating, the three got into Di Meng's car.","Shen Hui sat in the passenger seat, Qi Quan and Ling Sheng sat side by side in the back.","Di Meng was driving the Investigation Department's car. The interior space was relatively small. Sitting two people in the back wasn't cramped, but it certainly wasn't spacious either.","With a sudden sharp turn, Ling Sheng, following the inertia, leaned and bumped against Qi Quan's shoulder.","Qi Quan: ?","...","Logically, with spiritual energy balancing the body, that shouldn't happen.","Di Meng was a cool guy, and he drove coolly too, going for whatever was most thrilling.","Actually, with Qi Quan in the car, he had already restrained himself a lot.","Another turn ahead on the road. Di Meng tried to slow down as much as possible, but still turned quite sharply. However, this time the inertia was in the opposite direction. Qi Quan remained motionless.","Ling Sheng lowered his head, fiddling with his phone.","He had it on silent. The navigation software opened without making a sound. Qi Quan didn't know what he was doing and didn't pay attention.","Ling Sheng searched for the route to the destination.","There were five more right turns along the way.","He couldn't help but curl up the corners of his mouth, memorized the specific route, exited the app, and put down his phone.","Thus—","For the rest of the journey, Qi Quan was \"bumped into\" five times in a row.","Saying \"bumped\" is an overstatement; it was really just slight touches, brushing against her and quickly pulling back. Qi Quan couldn't even tell if it was intentional or not.","They arrived at the residential area somewhat bewildered.","The residential area was located in the suburbs of Longjing City, relatively old.","The head of this household's surname was Fang, the wife's surname was Ruan, the son was named Fang Bin, and there was also the child's grandfather. Following Di Meng and the others' instructions from the night before, they had been waiting at home.","It should have been a warm family of four, but the atmosphere was extremely tense.","Fang Bin sat alone in the center of the sofa, a strange, mocking smile on his face. Mr. Fang turned his head away, not daring to look. Ms. Ruan's eyes were filled with tears. As for the child's grandfather, he was kneeling before a Buddha statue in the living room, murmuring prayers.","They had noticed something was off with the child before, but just thought it was teenage rebellion causing a drastic change in temperament, not thinking too deeply about it.","But after Ms. Ruan saw him wearing a dress, she truly sensed something was wrong.","They weren't without seeking other masters, but none had been able to help.","Ms. Ruan usually paid more attention to the internet. Knowing about the \"White Water Real Person\" account, she tried asking.","Then the Investigation Department came to their door.","Knowing they were official personnel, their hearts settled somewhat. But unfortunately, the officials couldn't expel the ghost either.","\"I wonder if the one coming today will be able to do it,\" Mr. Fang shook his head and sighed.","Ms. Ruan sobbed, \"They said it's an expert. It should be possible.\"","\"Heh.\" Fang Bin sneered.","He seemed fearless, not worried about being forced out of the body.","After all, they had sought many masters, and he knew those so-called masters couldn't restrain him.","Ms. Ruan's tears immediately streamed down.","\"I beg you, please leave my son's body, okay? Whatever you want, I can satisfy you. I'm begging you.\"","Fang Bin stared at her silently, a trace of reluctance flashing through his sinister eyes, but it was quickly followed by resentment.","He pursed his lips tightly, not uttering a word.","Just then, a knock sounded at the door.","All four of them froze.","Mr. Fang quickly snapped back to reality and hurried to open the door. Ms. Ruan looked towards the entrance with anticipation. The old man stopped praying, stood up, and looked at Fang Bin.","Fang Bin happened to look up at him too, revealing a sinister smile.","A flicker of fear passed through the old man's eyes.","Qi Quan entered the house.","The apartment wasn't big, the living room seemed crowded, but it was relatively clean and tidy.","She stepped out of the entryway, her gaze meeting the boy on the sofa.","Fang Bin immediately felt a sense of crisis. He still sat up straight, but his hands subconsciously clenched.","\"Um, Comrade Di, didn't the expert come?\" Mr. Fang took a glance and saw they were all young people, so he couldn't help but ask hesitantly.","Di Meng glanced at him: \"She's here. She's looking at your son right now.\"","Mr. Fang: \"...\"","...","Why does it feel a bit unreliable?","But he didn't dare say anything, just instructed Ms. Ruan to serve tea to the guests.","Ms. Ruan then went to the kitchen to pour water.","Qi Quan stood opposite Fang Bin. Ling Sheng brought over a chair, cleaned it with a dust-clearing talisman, and placed it behind her.","She sat down accordingly.","Suppressing his fear, Fang Bin looked at Qi Quan and Ling Sheng with great interest and said, \"He treats you very well, better than my dad treats my mom.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","Mr. Fang, flushed with shame and anger, retorted, \"You are not my son!\"","\"Shall we go get a paternity test then?\" Fang Bin shrugged.","Mr. Fang was left speechless, his hands trembling with rage.","Shen Hui asked, \"Well, although we already asked this last night, we have to ask again now. What will it take for you to leave Fang Bin's body?\"","\"Why ask? You can't drive me out anyway. This is my home, and I want to stay right here,\" Fang Bin said, then turned to ask Ms. Ruan, \"Mom, don't you like me?\"","Ms. Ruan: \"...\"","She was so startled she almost dropped the tea tray.","Fang Bin suddenly stood up, walked over to her, and said, \"Mom, let me help you. Dad and Grandpa are both terrible, always ordering you to do this and that. Grandpa, well, he's old and almost bedridden, but what about Dad? Still young, yet already a cripple. Tsk.\"","Mr. Fang felt as if his face had been slapped repeatedly, turning as red as a boiled lobster.","Ms. Ruan looked at Fang Bin with tear-filled eyes, her eyelids red, her gaze a mix of gratitude and helplessness.","In this household, she held the least authority.","Yet this strange ghost was speaking up for her.","Shen Hui watched the highly expressive expressions on Mr. Fang and the old man's faces, desperately holding back laughter until his own face turned red.","Di Meng wasn't as restrained; he laughed outright and teased, \"Since you care so much about your mom, then stop scaring her. Come out, become the head of this household, and make sure no one else can bully her.\"","\"You think I'm stupid?\" Fang Bin placed the tea tray on the coffee table and rolled his eyes. \"Trying to trick me into coming out so you can kill me? Since you can't do anything to me, have some tea to cool your temper.\"","Di Meng: \"...\"","The system burst out laughing: 【Hahahaha, this ghost is quite interesting, Boss. It hasn't harmed anyone, right?】","Qi Quan: 【No, at most a Level Two White Ghost.】","【But Di Meng is Level Five. Why can't he handle it?】","Qi Quan suddenly turned to Ms. Ruan and asked, \"You once had a daughter. What was her name?\"","Both Ms. Ruan and Mr. Fang were taken aback. The old man lowered his eyes, his fingers unconsciously tugging at the hem of his clothes.","Di Meng and the others weren't surprised.","Judging by Ms. Ruan and Mr. Fang's physiognomy, they indeed once had a daughter, but she met with an accident.","\"You even investigate such private matters when you come to perform rituals?\" Mr. Fang clearly expressed displeasure.","Di Meng scoffed, \"Investigate? It's something you can tell at a glance. What's there to investigate? Are you insulting my professionalism?\"","\"What kind of attitude is that?\" Mr. Fang's face flushed with anger. \"Is this how you official people handle cases? Can't exorcise ghosts, but love to gossip about people's privacy!\"","\"Shut up!\" Fang Bin jumped up, pointed at Mr. Fang, and cursed directly, \"Why the hell do you have so much nonsense! She's asking about my mom, what crap are you spouting!\"","Mr. Fang: \"...\"","Ms. Ruan: \"...\"","Although... but, it felt satisfying.","She gave Fang Bin a gentle glance, nodded, and replied, \"Yes, I did have a daughter. She was Binbin's older sister. But she went missing when she was three. I searched for a long time but never found her.\"","As she spoke, tears began to roll down her cheeks.","That was her first child. Even after more than ten years, she could never forget the grief from back then.","The fierce expression on Fang Bin's face softened slightly.","Awkwardly, he pulled out a tissue and handed it to Ms. Ruan, saying, \"You look ugly when you cry. Stop crying.\"","Ms. Ruan took the tissue and cried even harder.","Fang Bin: \"...\"","He turned around, no longer looking at her.","After waiting for her emotions to settle somewhat, Qi Quan asked again, \"What was her name?\"","\"Her formal name was Fang Lan. Her nickname was Cancan (meaning 'bright' or 'brilliant'), because she loved to smile from the moment she was born. Every smile was as bright as sunshine, so we called her Cancan.\"","Recalling the past, Ms. Ruan's eyes reddened again.","Fang Bin sat back on the sofa, head bowed low, his expression unreadable.","Qi Quan said, \"Do you still remember her exact date and time of birth?\"","\"I remember!\" Ms. Ruan nodded emphatically. \"I remember very clearly!\"","Without hesitation, she reported the date and precise time of birth.","Those in the mystical arts community who hear such details typically instinctively calculate the Eight Characters/Birth Chart.","After mentally calculating, Di Meng and Shen Hui suddenly felt surprised and exchanged a look.","This was a destiny pattern of Pure Yang Eight Characters!","According to their knowledge, people with Pure Yang Eight Characters aren't much different from ordinary folks while alive, but it's different after death.","Generally, ghosts cannot linger in the mortal world for too long after death, and White Ghosts below Level Three cannot manifest physically, but there are exceptions.","Like Su Rong, who died near a grave mound, or Wang Hua and Qi Zheng, who carried merit. They could linger in the mortal world for longer.","Another exception is those whose own destiny pattern is Yang-aligned.","People with such a destiny pattern, if they wish after death, can linger in the mortal world for a very long time, even manifesting visibly before people.","But such destiny patterns are rare; this was the first time Di Meng and the others had encountered one.","They couldn't help but look at Fang Bin.","The Master never spoke idly. Did specifically mentioning Fang Lan mean that...","Qi Quan said to Ms. Ruan, \"Call out 'Cancan'.\"","Ms. Ruan hesitated.","\"Why do you keep picking at old wounds?!\" Mr. Fang suddenly roared. \"We were already in pain when she disappeared, why bring her up again?!\"","Fang Bin yanked off a slipper and threw it at his face, his gaze fierce as he said, \"Didn't I tell you to shut up?!\"","\"Thwack—\"","The slipper accurately landed on Mr. Fang's face, and the noise ceased.","The old man, who had remained silent until now, immediately pulled his son aside, glaring gloomily at Fang Bin. \"He is your father!\"","Fang Bin sneered contemptuously, \"He's not worth a damn.\"","Mr. Fang: \"...\"","His dignity and face were utterly lost!","Once the ghost inside Binbin's body was captured, he would definitely take revenge!","Qi Quan continued to look at Ms. Ruan.","Ms. Ruan took a deep breath, looked around blankly, and called out in a trembling voice, \"Cancan, Cancan, Cancan...\"","Fang Bin abruptly turned his back, wiping at the corner of his eye.","Di Meng and Shen Hui understood in their hearts.","So that's how it is!","Qi Quan's voice was low and gentle: \"Ms. Ruan, do you truly miss her very much?\"","\"I do! How could I not? She was my daughter. She was truly adorable, like a little sun. No matter how hard my work was, coming home to see her smile at me filled me with energy. I often thought, when she grew a little older, I'd send her to kindergarten, wearing a beautiful little dress, carrying a beautiful little backpack, spending her childhood happily, and then...\"","At this point, she was already sobbing uncontrollably.","Mr. Fang frowned, his fists clenched tightly.","He said impatiently, \"It's been so many years. What's the use of saying all this now? Comrades, if you can't exorcise the ghost, please leave.\"","Ms. Ruan suddenly erupted, shouting loudly, \"I will say it, I will say it! What right do you...\"","Why won't you tell me! Every time I bring it up, you say you're afraid of upsetting Binbin's mood! Binbin is my son, don't you think I care for him? Why can't he know he has an older sister? What right do you have to burn all of Cancan's photos! Give me back the photos! Give them back!\"","The power that burst forth from the usually gentle woman was astonishing.","She forcefully pushed Mr. Fang over, then turned towards Old Mr. Fang.","\"For so many years, I've kept some words bottled up inside. Your son and I were busy with work; Cancan was always in your care. I know you never liked having a granddaughter. I've heard more than once from the neighbors that you'd stare at other people's grandsons. Ever since Cancan went missing, you bought that Buddha statue and prayed every day, saying it was to bless Cancan, but I think you were just feeling guilty! Was it you who hurt Cancan? Was it!\"","\"Have you gone mad!\" Mr. Fang shouted in shock and anger, getting up and raising his hand to strike.","But his wrist was caught firmly by a hand.","\"Hitting your wife right in front of us, are you even a man?\" Di Meng's expression was dark and cold.","His aura was formidable; Mr. Fang, blustering but cowardly, instantly backed down.","Di Meng released his hand and said to Ms. Ruan, \"You've actually had your suspicions for a while now, haven't you?\"","Ms. Ruan paused.","\"Mom.\" Fang Bin suddenly spoke up, asking tearfully, \"Did you really miss me?\"","Ms. Ruan stared at him blankly.","The Fang father and son abruptly widened their eyes, looking at Fang Bin in horror.","Or rather... at Fang Lan.","Fang Lan turned around, tears streaming down her face, and said, \"Actually, I've been back for a long time.\"","Ms. Ruan asked instinctively, \"A long time?\"","\"Yes,\" Fang Lan said. \"I found my way back when my brother was five years old.\"","Ms. Ruan realized something, her face suddenly turning pale. Her lips trembling, she asked, \"Cancan? You're Cancan? You really are Cancan! Then you are already...\"","The words \"dead\" simply couldn't be spoken.","All these years, her greatest heartache had been her missing daughter.","She prayed in her heart every day that her daughter was still alive, living well somewhere.","But, Cancan's current state... did it mean she had died long ago?","Tears blurred her vision; she couldn't see Fang Bin's face clearly, yet she could strangely sense the soul within Fang Bin's body.","Having been dead for so many years, Fang Lan had long accepted the fact of her death.","She comforted, \"After I came back, my brother was already in kindergarten. No one could see me, so I just followed my brother to school every day. I learned a lot of knowledge at school, Mom. All those things you hoped for, I achieved them. I secretly did my brother's test papers; I often got perfect scores! Mom, aren't I amazing?\"","Ms. Ruan burst into loud sobs, wrapping her arms around her in a hug filled with heartache and grief.","Mr. Fang, coming back to his senses, softened his expression and said, \"Cancan, why didn't you say so earlier? If you had told your mother and me, we wouldn't have been so worried. Also, by occupying your brother's body like this, aren't you hurting Binbin? How about this, you come out, and our family can live together.\"","Fang Lan looked at him with a cold laugh and said, \"Live together? So your dear father can harm me again?\"","Ms. Ruan's body went rigid.","A few seconds later, she raised her head very slowly, staring at Old Mr. Fang, and said in an eerie tone, \"You harmed Cancan? It really was you!\"","Over the years, she hadn't been without suspicion, but there was simply no evidence.","Old Mr. Fang flatly denied it: \"Don't listen to her nonsense! Some stray ghost from who knows where, possessing my grandson's body, trying to drive a wedge between our family!\"","\"That's right, honey, how can you trust outsiders over me and Dad? Back when Cancan went missing, Dad... blamed himself so much he fainted and was hospitalized. How can you suspect Dad?\" Mr. Fang urged anxiously.","After so many years of marriage, how could Ms. Ruan not understand him?","His eyes held guilt!","Her mind went blank. She stared dumbly at this husband she had shared a bed with for over a decade, her heart settling into a strange calm born of extreme disappointment.","Expressionlessly, she turned her head to Fang Lan and said, \"Cancan, what exactly happened to you back then? Tell Mom. No matter what, Mom will help you get justice.\"","Fang Lan smiled. \"With your words, I am satisfied.\"","She closed her eyes, then suddenly drifted out of Fang Bin's body, manifesting visibly before everyone.","She wasn't worried about being captured by Qi Quan and the others.","From Qi Quan's attitude, it was clear the investigators were willing to give her a chance to tell her story.","She maintained the appearance she had at the time of her death.","The little girl was only three years old, fair and adorable, with her hair in princess braids. She wore a pink dress that reached her knees, white stockings covering her calves, and little red leather shoes on her feet—the kind that showed the top of the foot, with a thin strap across the ankle fastened at the ankle bone.","A very typical style from over a decade ago.","Ms. Ruan covered her mouth, biting her lip hard.","She had done those princess braids herself, picked out that dress herself, put on those shoes and socks herself.","She remembered it all clearly.","Looking at the girl's ghostly pale face, she felt as if a sharp awl had pierced her heart, the pain so intense she couldn't speak.","Mr. Fang managed to keep his composure, his face showing delight as he said, \"Cancan! It really is Cancan!\"","But Old Mr. Fang had turned pale, his eyes shifty, not daring to look at Fang Lan at all.","\"Mom,\" Fang Lan spoke again, now in a little girl's voice, \"I didn't hurt my brother.\"","She didn't want to be misunderstood.","Fang Bin now opened his eyes too. Seeing the little girl in front of him, he playfully made a funny face.","He said excitedly, \"Mom, this is a game Cancan and I play!\"","Ms. Ruan: ?","The Fang father and son: ???","[Master, are kids these days all this... bizarre?] The system was utterly stunned.","Qi Quan: [Just individual differences.]","Facing everyone's speechlessness, Fang Bin continued blithely, \"Actually, I've known about Cancan for a long time. One day I forgot to do my homework, and Cancan did it for me after I fell asleep. Cancan is really amazing! Whenever I didn't understand something in class, I'd ask Cancan after, and she could always teach me!\"","\"Fang Bin!\" Mr. Fang was so angry he became incoherent. \"Didn't you see how worried your mom, your grandpa, and I were?! You think this is a game? I'm going to beat you to death today!\"","Fang Bin ducked behind Di Meng and chuckled, \"You weren't worried about me! Mom was the first to notice something was wrong with me. Since I was little, have you ever cared for me?\"","\"Your grandpa raised you!\" Mr. Fang, blocked by Di Meng, didn't dare approach.","Fang Bin stuck out his tongue: \"He never cared about me either! When I was little and hungry, he'd just be busy gambling, ignoring me. He'd badmouth Mom to me every day, till my ears were calloused! He just used me as an excuse to get money from Mom!\"","Ms. Ruan: \"...Binbin, why didn't you tell me before?\"","\"You always listened to Dad,\" Fang Bin hit the nail on the head. \"Dad just had to coax and persuade you a bit, and that was it. I was young, had no say, and you wouldn't listen anyway.\"","Ms. Ruan: \"...\"","Her eyes red, she said, \"I'm sorry.\"","She had failed both her daughter and her son.","\"Don't blame Mom...\"","\"Fang Lan suddenly tugged at her sleeve. 'It's because Mom was too exhausted, she didn't have the energy left to deal with these things.'\"","Fang Bin nodded vigorously. \"Exactly.\"","He looked at the Fang father and son, speaking bluntly, \"Anyway, you never cared for me my whole life growing up. Mom had to earn money to support the family and do so much housework. One of you gambled, the other neglected the family, and you still didn't appreciate her!\"","The Fang father and son: \"...\"","Ms. Ruan felt a surge of immense courage. She asked, \"Cancan, what really happened when you disappeared?\"","Fang Lan tilted her little face up and pointed at Old Mr. Fang. \"He sold me.\"","Everyone: !!!","Ms. Ruan had mentally prepared herself, but hearing the words still sent a wave of rage that clouded her mind. She grabbed a teacup and hurled it at Old Mr. Fang, screaming with all her might, \"You old beast! How dare you sell my daughter! You ruined Cancan! You deserve to die!\"","[Old beast! He should get the death penalty!] The system was so angry it lost its composure.","Mr. Fang blocked the teacup, anger flashing in his eyes. \"Have you gone mad!\"","\"What if I have? It's still better than the beastly ways of you Fang father and son!\"","Ms. Ruan had a sudden, clear awakening.","She said coldly, \"Let's get a divorce.\"","Before Mr. Fang could speak, she added, \"And you, get ready for prison.\"","She glared fiercely at Old Mr. Fang.","Di Meng spoke up at the right moment. \"All of you, come with us.\"","Old Mr. Fang wasn't originally worried. The incident happened many years ago; so what if he sold his granddaughter? Was there any proof?","Surely the authorities couldn't just take his granddaughter's word for it, right?","Ms. Ruan asked Fang Lan through tears, \"Why didn't you tell Mom when you came back?\"","Fang Lan said, \"I was very ugly before. I was afraid I'd scare you, Mom. Also, I'm a ghost. I was afraid you wouldn't accept me.\"","Having been sold by her own family, of course she felt insecure.","Ms. Ruan glared at Fang Bin. \"And you didn't say anything either?\"","\"I had to keep my promise,\" Fang Bin said with a grin. \"I promised Cancan I wouldn't tell anyone.\"","Ms. Ruan: \"...\"","She composed herself and asked, \"Why did Cancan need to possess your body? Was it some kind of game?\"","\"Cancan said her time is running out. She wanted to experience being human again, to taste Mom's cooking, to feel Mom's care.\" The smile faded from Fang Bin's face. \"Cancan said it took her a long, long time to find her way home.\"","Not just Ms. Ruan, even the system nearly shed tears.","[Wuwuwu, Cancan is so tragic!]","Ms. Ruan cried all the way to the Investigation Department.","Both Fang father and son were taken into interrogation rooms.","\"Thank you,\" Fang Lan stood before Qi Quan, lifting her small head earnestly. \"I actually wanted to test if Mom could recognize me too, but I knew it was just wishful thinking. That would have been too much to ask of Mom.\"","Di Meng couldn't help but ask, \"Last night, I'm sorry, but I still want to know why our techniques had no effect on you.\"","\"Not just yours, other Taoist masters' techniques were the same,\" Fang Lan explained. \"Mom had sought out Taoist masters before, and none could do anything. Because my brother willingly let me stay inside him. Unless both he and I agree, no one can force me out.\"","Shen Hui was surprised. \"Is that really possible?\"","Never mind a foreign spirit \"moving in,\" even a person's own living soul could be drawn out.","Fang Lan said, \"It was a method taught to me by an Uncle Ghost. I practiced it for a long time.\"","\"What Uncle Ghost?\"","Fang Lan shook her head. \"At the place where I died, there was an Uncle Ghost. He knew many things, some quite similar to your Taoist masters' techniques.\"","Shen Hui: ?","Could it be a very old, powerful ghost?","He... couldn't help but glance at Qi Quan.","Qi Quan said calmly, \"It's a type of technique only applicable between blood relatives. After an agreement is formed between the human and the ghost, it creates a rule. This rule can resist third-party laws.\"","In other words, after the agreement between Fang Lan and Fang Bin, aside from the two of them, no one else could make Fang Lan leave Fang Bin's body.","Shen Hui said shamefully, \"I was ignorant.\"","The more cases he experienced, the more he realized his own shortcomings.","He continued asking, \"How did you die? Where is the place you died?\"","Pain surfaced in Fang Lan's eyes. \"I was killed by someone who drained all my blood. I don't recognize the place where I died.\"","Everyone felt something was off.","Why would someone drain a little girl's blood?","If she had died from illness during trafficking, or been beaten to death while resisting, they wouldn't have found it so strange.","But draining her blood?","It carried a sense of special ritual.","Di Meng immediately asked, \"Do you remember what the person who killed you looked like?\"","Fang Lan shook her head.","\"Do you remember the general scene of that place?\"","Fang Lan thought carefully and said, \"It was just rows of single-story houses. There was a tree in front of the houses. I don't remember anything else.\"","\"...\"","This kind of scene had no distinctive features and would be very hard to locate. Moreover, over a decade had passed; that place had likely changed dramatically.","[System: Then what do we do? We can't find the murderer who killed Cancan.]","Qi Quan remained silent.","\"Captain Di!\" A young investigator walked over to report. \"The Fang father and son have confessed!\"","Neither of them were strong-willed. Once in the interrogation room, under the investigator's questioning, they were frightened into telling the truth.","Back then, Ms. Ruan and Mr. Fang were busy with work and left their granddaughter with Old Mr. Fang to look after.","Old Mr. Fang was a gambler. At that time, his son and daughter-in-law's careers weren't very successful, their salaries weren't high, and even living in the Beijing suburbs, life was quite tight.","He couldn't get money for gambling, but then he heard people talking about \"buying and selling children,\" and a thought began to stir.","He never liked his granddaughter anyway, always wanting his son and daughter-in-law to have another child. But his daughter-in-law felt one daughter was enough and refused to have more, and his son also thought raising another child would be a heavy burden on the family.","Old Mr. Fang wouldn't listen. He didn't want the Fang family line to die out.","If he sold his granddaughter, he could get ten thousand yuan.","That was ten thousand yuan over a decade ago!","This way, he'd have money for gambling and a reason for his son and daughter-in-law to have another child.","Once the idea took root, he couldn't stop it.","He watched his daughter-in-law buy this and that for a mere girl every day, growing more resentful. Finally, on a bright, sunny afternoon, he sold his granddaughter to a human trafficker.","He used a white knee-high sock to gag Fang Lan's mouth.","It was a pair Fang Lan loved to wear.","Though only three years old, the moment she was forced to leave home was forever etched in her memory, not forgotten even after death.","\"Bang!\" Di Meng had a hot temper. He punched the table, his voice heavy with anger. \"What about the other one, surnamed Fang?\"","\"He didn't know originally, but later he heard his father talk in his sleep and realized his daughter had been sold by him.\"","\"And then? He just let it go?\" Shen Hui asked, incredulous.","The young investigator also wore a look of disdain. \"His daughter was already gone. He didn't want to send his old father to prison, so he helped cover it up. Out of guilt, he couldn't bear to see his daughter's photos, so he burned them all, claiming it was to stop his wife from living in pain.\"","\"...\"","\"Scum!\"","The system also said: [Scum! Go die!]","Qi Quan asked calmly, \"What about leads on the trafficker?\"","\"He said the trafficker wore a mask and sunglasses, couldn't see his face clearly. He also didn't want to see clearly, afraid of getting involved.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","The trail went cold just like that.","\"Senior, we could use a blood relative's hair as a guide,\" Shen Hui suggested.","System: [\"That's right! Boss, didn't you use this method to find Butler Su back then?\"]","Qi Quan: [\"If the remains have turned to ash, it won't work.\"]","[\"...\"]","Nevertheless, she decided to give it a try.","She took a strand of Ms. Ruan's hair. Spiritual fire ignited the strand, producing a wisp of blue smoke. If the bones still existed, the smoke would point the way. But unfortunately, the smoke simply curled upwards without any movement.","Fang Lan's remains were likely gone.","Everyone felt rather disappointed.","Qi Quan stood up and said, \"Let's go back.\"","\"Wait,\" Fang Lan called out to her, \"Will they go to jail?\"","Qi Quan nodded. \"They will.\"","Fang Lan revealed a brilliant smile. \"That's good.\"","Now she could spend her remaining time with her mother and brother without any burdens before moving on to reincarnation.","For some reason, the moment she laid eyes on Qi Quan, she felt an inexplicable sense of trust. Later, when Qi Quan asked her mother about her, her fondness for Qi Quan grew even stronger.","Unlike the previous Taoist masters who only knew how to exorcise spirits.","She hadn't found any of her photos or personal belongings left at home and had never heard her mother mention her in front of her brother, so she assumed her mother didn't care about her at all. That's why she had never dared to tell her mother.","If not for Qi Quan, she might have gone to her reincarnation never knowing how much her mother had always loved her.","On the drive back to the villa, Di Meng and Shen Hui were unusually quiet.","Failing to find the culprit filled them with deep remorse.","The System asked: [\"Boss, why did the culprit drain Cancan's blood?\"]","Qi Quan: [\"Either they're a psychopath, or they bought the child specifically for the blood.\"]","[\"...\"]","Suddenly, her sleeve was tugged.","Qi Quan turned her head. Ling Sheng, sitting beside her, handed her his phone. A sentence was written on the screen.","[\"Ding Ji is hiding a type of red pill that smells of blood.\"]","Qi Quan: ...","The System outright exclaimed: [\"Oh my god! It can't be what I'm thinking, right?!\"]","Qi Quan nodded, saying nothing.","The car drove all the way back to the villa. Before even reaching the gate, they could see several luxury cars parked outside, each with a handsome young man standing beside it.","Shen Hui got out first, blocking the crowd rushing forward. \"Who are you? What's the matter?\"","One of them, his voice clear and mellow, said, \"Senior Qi Quan, I am a disciple of the Xuanqing Sect. By order of our Sect Leader, I have come specially to invite you to serve as an Elder in our sect.\"","The others, having been preempted, immediately began speaking all at once.","\"Senior Qi Quan, by order of the head of the Yan Family, I have come to invite you to serve as an Elder of the Yan Family...\"","\"Senior Qi Quan, by order of the head of the Fu Family, I have come to...\"","\"Senior Qi Quan, I...\"","Anyone who had donated money to the charity fund had sent someone to recruit her.","They assumed that since Qi Quan had accepted the money, she had tacitly agreed.","But Qi Quan had never made any promise; she had merely posted a Weibo update.","Shen Hui and Di Meng had headaches.","This was poaching right in front of their faces!","Qi Quan got out of the car, her gaze sweeping coolly over the group of handsome sect disciples. Everyone involuntarily fell silent.","...As expected of a master sought after by the big shots, her aura was truly powerful!","They watched Qi Quan with burning eyes, waiting for her answer.","Qi Quan smiled.","\"Thank you all for your generous contributions to the charity foundation.\"","Leaving only these words, she leisurely entered the villa.","The crowd: ?","That's it?","How were they supposed to report back?","As they started to clamor again, Di Meng directly pulled out a pair of handcuffs and shook them. \"Causing a disturbance and disrupting social order is illegal.\"","The crowd: \"...\"","Inside the villa, Qi Quan released Qin Ruo from the peachwood talisman.","Qin Ruo bowed respectfully. \"Senior, what are your instructions?\"","Qi Quan asked, \"Have you eaten pills that smell of blood?\"","\"...\"","\"It seems you have.\"","Qin Ruo hurriedly said, \"I did eat them. Those pills can instantly replenish spiritual power. Ding Ji gave them to me, but I truly knew nothing about them!\"","She had taken a few only after being burned by the talismans on Du Jiaming and Yang Su.","\"You dared to eat them without knowing what they were?\"","Qin Ruo said with a bitter face, \"I... I asked once. Ding Ji said the ingredients included rooster blood, so I didn't ask further.\"","Actually, asking or not asking made little difference.","Not asking clearly allowed her to deceive her own conscience a little.","Qi Quan waved her hand, sending Qin Ruo back into the peachwood talisman.","[\"Boss, what should we do now?\"]","Qi Quan: [\"Contact the Investigation Department.\"]","She sent a message to Li Guoyan, who quickly replied: [\"I will send someone to investigate the blood-scented pills. The Investigation Department just received an invitation.\"]","Qi Quan: [\"An invitation from a sect?\"]","[\"Li Guoyan: Master, you see things with piercing clarity. The Guiyuan Sect has invited me to observe their internal competition tomorrow. Would you be interested in attending?\"]","This was a banquet at Hongmen—a trap.","Their previous attempts to recruit Qi Quan were merely the \"courtesy\" part of their \"courtesy before force\" strategy. Now, seeing that recruitment had failed, they were setting up this trap, testing whether the Investigation Department dared to attend.","Not going would mean losing face; going carried certain risks.","On the surface, the Guiyuan Sect invited the Investigation Department, but their real target was Qi Quan. In their view, the Investigation Department without Qi Quan was no match for the Mystic sects.","They had been looking down from their high perch for too long, so long they'd forgotten that the rules of the world were not set by them.","Qi Quan asked: [\"Only the Investigation Department was invited?\"]","[\"Li Guoyan: The top three sects and families have all received invitations.\"]","Qi Quan: [\"We'll go.\"]","[\"Li Guoyan: Good. I'll pick you up tomorrow.\"]","After the call ended, Qi Quan went upstairs and turned on her computer.","The System said excitedly: [\"Boss, are you going to write?\"]","[\"Yes.\"]","[\"Alright, I won't disturb you then!\"]","At ten o'clock at night, readers flooded into the new chapter of \"Diary of a Wealthy Family.\"","[This business trip was quite pleasant.","I successfully apprehended the mastermind behind the resort case.","But regrettably, he does not admit his guilt.","He holds two trump cards.","His professional skills are outstanding. From this perspective, he could be considered a pillar of talent. He doesn't believe the authorities would abandon such an excellent individual.","He is a core member of a top-tier non-governmental organization. This organization has deep roots and formidable strength, to the extent that it doesn't even regard the official authorities with respect.","He believes the organization will rescue him.","And indeed, that is the case.","The organization is already working on his behalf.","Somehow, they found out about me and even sent people to deliver gifts. Priceless jade and a box of gold bars were presented without batting an eye...","Is this perhaps the legendary bribery?","How am I worthy of such extreme measures from them?","At the same time, I couldn't help but sigh with emotion—they are truly wealthy.","I refused the bribes and chased them out of my residence.","Coincidentally, a kind-hearted lady called at that moment to inform me that the charity foundation I had previously asked her about had been established.","In my happiness, I posted a Weibo update to commemorate the occasion.","Who would have thought that right after posting, the foundation would receive massive donations.","Their generosity confused me.","Could it be that kindness and passion still lie buried deep in their hearts?","I apologize for my previous prejudice.","However, when even more people showed up the next day to offer me high positions, I realized I had been too naive.","What gave them such an illusion?","Is donating to charity an alternative form of bribery?","I don't accept it!","Once again, I declined their invitation and returned home in low spirits.","This matter should be over now, right?","I thought, gazing out the window.","Before I could figure it out, a top-tier folk organization suddenly sent an invitation, asking me to participate in their martial arts tournament.","Is this an attempt to intimidate me with force?","Through the clean windowpane, I looked toward the distant sky.","Beneath the firmament, it seemed a dark aura shrouded a mysterious mountain range.","That was in the southwest direction.","End of new chapter.","[If you see me, tell me to go prepare my lessons: Ahhhhh! The author updated! So good! I believe the author will definitely uphold justice and triumph over evil!]","[Serenity leads to far-reaching vision: The southwest...]","[Kind-hearted sir, what is your honorable age?: The southwest...]","[Today is auspicious: What about the southwest? What's in the southwest?]","[Today brings great benefit: Based on the author's writing style, that folk organization is likely in the southwest direction.]","[Auspicious and prosperous: That makes sense!]","The disciples of the Guiyuan Sect who were secretly following the updates were stunned.","Southwest? Dark aura?","Master! Something terrible has happened!"]},{"number":51,"title":"Chapter 51","paragraphs":["The Yan Family Residence.","Yan Geng had just finished secretly catching up on the latest novel chapters in his room. Unable to contain himself, he ran to Yan Huai's door and knocked.","\"What is it?\"","\"Brother Huai, I have some questions about cultivation I'd like to ask you.\"","\"Come in.\"","Yan Geng entered and closed the door, asking mysteriously, \"Brother Huai, have you finished reading the new update?\"","\"...Weren't you asking about cultivation?\"","\"One thing at a time,\" Yan Geng lowered his voice. \"Did you read it or not?\"","\"Yes.\"","Yan Geng grew excited. \"So, what do you think? Does 'the southwest' really refer to the Guiyuan Sect?\"","Yan Huai didn't respond.","\"The family head received the invitation, right?\" Yan Geng asked expectantly. \"You're going tomorrow, aren't you? That means you'll get to see the expert?\"","Yan Huai: \"Mm.\"","\"Sigh, do you think the expert guessed tomorrow's gathering is a trap, and that's why she used that metaphor in the story?\"","What does 'dark aura' mean?","It means misfortune is impending.","The Guiyuan Sect is such a massive sect, abundant in spiritual energy and talented individuals. How could disaster possibly strike there?","But Qi Quan didn't name names. No matter how furious they were, the Guiyuan Sect couldn't openly retaliate.","'The southwest' covers a vast area.","\"Brother Huai, how high do you think the expert's cultivation level really is? Can she win?\"","Yan Huai: \"I don't know.\"","\"Sigh, I really wish I could go and observe,\" Yan Geng lamented.","Those attending tomorrow's 'trap banquet' would surely be the sect leaders of major sects, the heads of various families, and their core elite disciples. He definitely wouldn't have a chance to go.","Yan Huai: \"I'll take you.\"","\"Really?!\" Yan Geng was overjoyed.","\"Mm.\"","Yan Geng beamed with delight. \"Haha, tomorrow we'll get to watch a good show! I'd really like to see the expressions on the faces of the Guiyuan Sect people right now.\"","Guiyuan Sect.","After listening to his disciple's report, Yin Yi's refined, smiling expression became slightly strained.","\"She really said that?\"","The disciple nodded. \"She only mentioned a dark aura in the southwest, but based on the context, it should be referring to our Guiyuan Sect.\"","\"...\"","Yin Yi pondered for a moment, then said, \"It's merely a young person's provocation. Pay it no mind. We have distinguished guests to receive tomorrow. Is everything prepared?\"","\"Everything is ready.\"","\"Good, you may leave.\"","The disciple obeyed and left.","A nearby elder remarked, \"That girl is quite audacious.\"","\"Geniuses are always arrogant about their talent. They think they can break conventions and establish new rules,\" said another elder.","Yin Yi said, \"A twenty-two-year-old Level Seven Celestial Master does indeed have the capital to be arrogant.\"","\"Hmph, tomorrow I'll see for myself!\"","The next morning.","Qi Quan, dressed in smoke-blue casual wear and white sneakers, got into Li Guoyan's car.","Naturally, Ling Sheng accompanied her as always.","Others invited to attend were Di Meng and Ning Zhi, both Level Five investigators, considered the face of the Investigation Department.","They were in another car.","The cars drove towards Guiyuan Mountain in the southwest.","Qi Quan glanced at the car behind them and said, \"You brought Lu Jiang?\"","\"Yes,\" Li Guoyan replied with a smile. \"He is a Level Seven elder of the Guiyuan Sect, and a rare formation master at that. Whether for the sake of their reputation or for talent, the Guiyuan Sect will want to win him back. Bringing him is also to serve as a witness at the end.\"","He paused, glancing at Qi Quan in the rearview mirror.","\"Master, this trip might be somewhat... challenging.\"","...","Qi Quan smiled. \"It certainly will be challenging. The dark aura shrouding them is a fact.\"","Li Guoyan secretly breathed a sigh of relief. \"It seems the Master has a well-thought-out plan.\"","Qi Quan didn't answer.","She hadn't written nonsense in her story last night. Observing the Guiyuan Sect's fortune, it would indeed begin to decline from today onward.","But a starved camel is still bigger than a horse.","As the number one major sect, even with diminished fortune, it would remain a colossal entity.","Before long, the cars arrived at the mountain gate.","A formation was set up before the gate, invisible to ordinary people. Even if someone stumbled upon this place, they would be guided in another direction.","The stone steps before the gate were high, leading down to a spacious parking lot where several luxury cars were already parked.","Li Guoyan got out of the car, standing tall and straight, his aura fully unleashed.","Today, at this 'trap banquet,' he was likely the only ordinary person present. But having weathered countless battles, he felt no fear.","Qi Quan had attended numerous sect conferences in her past life and saw no reason to feel intimidated.","Her attire was understated, her hair in a ponytail. Aside from her exceptionally striking face, nothing else drew particular attention.","Two disciples were at the mountain gate to receive guests.","One was handsome and amiable; the other gentle-featured and poised.","They had noticed Qi Quan's group when their car parked.","The male disciple whispered, \"Is that them?\"","The female disciple smiled and nodded. \"Yes.\"","\"That one!\" The male disciple widened his eyes. \"Is that the White Water True Person? She's the only woman.\"","The female disciple: \"It should be.\"","There were six in the group.","Qi Quan and Li Guoyan walked side by side, with Ling Sheng slightly behind. Di Meng and Ning Zhi flanked Lu Jiang, who was in custody.","“Those two... aren't they the second and third place winners from the Metaphysical World Grand Competition the year before last? I heard they joined the Investigation Department.”","The female disciple: \"...\"","\"And there's one I haven't seen before. Who is that?\"","\"Damn, isn't that Elder Lu?!\" The male disciple's expression changed slightly upon seeing the handcuffs on Lu Jiang's wrists.","Regardless, this was a blatant slap in the face.","The female disciple: \"They're here.\"","The six approached.","The male disciple's curious gaze fell on Qi Quan's face. After only a second of admiration, he suddenly felt a slight sting in his eyes and had to look away, turning his attention to Li Guoyan. The pain subsided.","What was that?","Does the expert not even allow people to look at her?","Suppressing his displeasure, the male disciple stepped forward politely. \"Welcome, esteemed guests. The Sect Leader and other distinguished guests are already waiting at the Starview Platform. Please follow me.\"","After all, they were the premier major sect; they wouldn't stoop to discourtesy in hosting guests.","Qi Quan and her group were the last to arrive.","The moment they stepped through the mountain gate, the sect's grand formation suddenly activated, sealing off the outside world's prying eyes but also trapping everyone within the sect grounds.","The Starview Platform was the Guiyuan Sect's internal competition arena.","In the center was a raised stage, surrounded by spectator stands—essentially no different from a sports stadium.","There was also a separate viewing platform where several prominent figures of the metaphysical world were already seated.","Guiyuan Sect Leader Yin Yi occupied the host's seat. Master Wan of the Xuanqing Sect, Master Yu of the Hengfeng Sect, the Heads of the Yan, Fu, and Zhou Families were seated on either side.","Two seats remained empty.","Master Wan said, \"Sect Leader Yin, if I recall correctly, your sect's internal competitions usually start next month.\"","Next February would be the triennial Metaphysical World Grand Competition. Each sect and family would first select their elite talents internally before sending them to compete.","The Guiyuan Sect's internal selection typically took place in late October.","Yin Yi, maintaining an elegant demeanor, replied, \"A surprise test isn't... a bad way to assess them either.\"","\"That makes sense,\" the Head of the Yan Family said with a smile, turning to ask, \"Brother Fu, when does the selection contest in your family begin?\"","Fu Jiuchong replied expressionlessly, \"Unchanged.\"","\"Will Luanfei be competing next year?\"","\"Mm.\"","Yan Fengjun praised, \"I heard she's already reached Level Four. Truly a young prodigy.\"","Fu Jiuchong: \"...\"","In the spectator stands, Yan Geng leaned close to Yan Huai and whispered, \"Brother Huai, by letting us observe their internal competition now, isn't the Guiyuan Sect worried about losing their edge for next year's Grand Competition?\"","Other sects have now clearly seen the Guiyuan Sect's techniques and will certainly study tactics based on them.","Yan Huai: \"Today is only for intimidation.\"","Yan Geng thought for a moment, \"That's true.\"","The Guiyuan Sect has an extremely large number of disciples within its ranks. On the surface, this is an internal competition, but in reality, it's meant to flex their muscles for the Investigation Department. As for whether it's a genuine selection tournament, no one really cares.","The Guiyuan Sect also certainly won't reveal their true strength.","\"Brother Huai, look over there. Isn't that Fu Luanfei?\"","Yan Huai: \"Mm.\"","\"And Liu Qiang, the top disciple of Guiyuan Sect; Hu Ying from the Xuanqing Sect; Feng Ke from the Hengfeng Sect; Zhou Xu from the Zhou family, and so on. The core disciples from the top three sects and families are all here,\" Yan Geng said with great interest.","The spectator stands were divided into different sections. Disciples from various sects and families carved the seating into several large blocks, with a subtle sense of confrontation between them, none willing to yield to the others.","Of course, no one dared to challenge Yan Huai.","Yan Huai had no interest in the others. Sitting ramrod straight, his gaze fell on the miniature peach wood sword on his wrist, and a flicker of excitement actually began to rise within him.","Was it because she was coming?","\"She's here!\" Yan Geng suddenly whispered urgently.","Yan Huai turned to look.","A group of six people had just stepped into the Stargazing Platform and immediately captured the attention of the entire crowd.","Li Guoyan was tall and robust, his brow radiating righteous authority, his presence as unshakable as a mountain.","Beside him was a tall, exceptionally beautiful young woman. She wore simple, low-key casual clothes, her hair in a ponytail, no different from a university student in her early twenties.","Was this Qi Quan?!","The entire arena wore expressions of bewilderment.","This wasn't quite what they had imagined!","The imagined level-seven master should have been a cold, cultivation-obsessed robot like Yan Huai, not the image of a vibrant, youthful young woman.","Had Qi Quan not come today?","Was she just an ordinary investigator from the Investigation Department?","Yet, from the way she walked shoulder-to-shoulder with Li Guoyan, one could see her transcendent status within the Department.","Qi Quan was actually such a master!","Her demeanor was relaxed, her steps leisurely, as if she were attending not some potential trap, but an open-air dance.","Both male and female disciples gazed at her with fervent eyes.","Firstly, because of her top-tier looks, and secondly, because of her supreme cultivation level.","No matter where you are, the strong are always respected.","Guided by a Guiyuan Sect disciple, Qi Quan slowly ascended to the highest viewing platform in the arena.","The big shots from various sects and schools were all up there.","She could already feel the scrutinizing gazes bearing down from above.","The big shots' pressure gradually began to manifest—this was meant to put the Investigation Department in their place...","The people on the viewing platform were all at level seven or above. The pressure from a single one of them could already overwhelm an ordinary person, let alone several combined.","Even someone as tough as Li Guoyan couldn't withstand the combined pressure of these mystic realm masters.","His steps became extremely heavy, sweat faintly beading at his temples.","Qi Quan suddenly lifted her gaze, locking eyes with someone on the platform. The aura of someone surpassing level nine erupted in full force, directly pressing down on the level-seven big shots on the viewing platform. It enveloped everyone from the Investigation Department, leaving out only Lu Jiang, whose spiritual power was sealed.","\"Pfft—\"","Lu Jiang violently spat out a mouthful of blood, staining the clean steps crimson.","Under Qi Quan's overwhelming pressure, his legs turned to jelly, unable to take a single step forward. He could only let Ning Zhi and Di Meng drag him up.","The big shots on the viewing platform weren't faring much better.","Facing pressure surpassing level nine, even level-seven Heavenly Masters couldn't hold their ground. They exerted all their strength, channeling their entire spiritual power, just barely managing to save face by not vomiting blood or collapsing in front of everyone.","The big shots: \"...\"","What the hell kind of person is this?!","They instantly withdrew the disdain from their eyes, replacing it with deep apprehension.","To pressure all the level-seven Heavenly Masters single-handedly—what profound cultivation was this?","Could it be... she had already reached level eight?","What did level eight mean? It represented the existence of the strongest in the mystic realm!","Where on earth did the Investigation Department dig up such a genius?","No, this was no longer just a genius.","This was a monster!","On the viewing platform, Sect Leader Yin Yi's face paled as he struggled to swallow back the blood rising in his throat. His earlier intention to put on a show of force completely evaporated.","He had originally thought that a twenty-two-year-old level-seven Heavenly Master, no matter how talented, couldn't compare to old-timers like them.","Who could have imagined that these old-timers would make such fools of themselves.","In the mystic realm, strength is revered.","Sect Leader Yin Yi privately didn't wish to make an enemy of such a master. He quickly adjusted his attitude and, with a smile, personally stood up to welcome Qi Quan, who had just stepped onto the platform.","\"Honored guests have arrived, and we failed to greet you properly!\" He looked kindly and amiable, his smile quite approachable, making people feel favorable towards him.","The other big shots: ???","As expected of the number one major sect, their face-changing speed is truly impressive.","The Head of the Yan Family wore a smile, watching the others' ugly expressions with great interest.","Yu Lanzhi of the Hengfeng Sect had the palest face, followed by the Head of the Zhou Family. Master Wan of the Xuanqing Sect showed shock, while Fu Jiuchong remained expressionless as ever.","During the earlier show of force, only Yan Fengjun and Fu Jiuchong had not acted.","Qi Quan was someone who clearly distinguished gratitude from grievance. Her pressure, surpassing level nine, did not weigh down on those two, so they did not experience the awkward state of being nearly crushed to the point of spitting blood.","However, as level-seven big shots themselves, they could sense the undercurrents swirling inside and outside the arena. When the pressure surpassing level nine swept past them, it raised goosebumps all over their bodies.","Seeing the discomfited expressions of the others, if the occasion allowed, Yan Fengjun probably wouldn't have hesitated to laugh out loud.","The covert clash concluded with Qi Quan utterly crushing everyone.","Facing Sect Leader Yin's smiling face, Qi Quan gave a slight nod, then turned to Li Guoyan: \"Director Li, the hospitality of the number one major sect is indeed refreshingly unique.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","Li Guoyan couldn't hold back a smile, the corners of his mouth quirking up slightly, a hint of amusement appearing in his eyes. He cleared his throat and said, \"We've certainly witnessed it today. It's just hard on Elder Lu.\"","...","Lu Jiang: \"...\"","Di Meng couldn't hold back a laugh, revealing two rows of neat teeth. He dragged the weak-legged Lu Jiang out, tossed him on the ground, and asked, \"When does the competition start?\"","Seeing a sect elder lying on the ground like a dead pig, Yin Yi's eyelid twitched. The smile on his face was about to slip, his voice turning stiff as he asked, \"What is the meaning of this, Director Li?\"","\"Nothing much,\" Li Guoyan's face returned to seriousness. \"Your esteemed sect wished for Elder Lu to return to the mountain, so I brought him.\"","Before Yin Yi could speak, he instructed Di Meng and Ning Zhi: \"You two take Elder Lu to watch the competition first. We'll discuss matters after the competition.\"","\"Yes.\"","Di Meng and Ning Zhi then dragged Lu Jiang away from the viewing platform.","Sect Leader Yin could only watch helplessly as Lu Jiang was taken away, unable to say a word.","Qi Quan's counterattack from earlier still left him with lingering fear.","He changed the subject, looking at Ling Sheng who remained on the platform, and asked, \"And this is?\"","There were only two empty seats left on the viewing platform, reserved for Qi Quan and Li Guoyan.","Qi Quan: \"My assistant.\"","Yin Yi then said, \"Then we'll add another chair.\"","He was a pragmatic man. Since he couldn't win in a fight, it was better to correct his attitude and leave a good impression.","Qi Quan: \"Sorry to trouble you.\"","A Guiyuan Sect disciple quickly brought up a chair, and the three of them took their seats.","Originally, the positions of the two chairs were set slightly lower. Whether intentional or not, when the disciples placed the new chairs, they subtly adjusted the other two as well.","Qi Quan and Li Guoyan were now almost level with Yin Yi. As an \"assistant,\" Ling Sheng naturally sat just slightly lower than Qi Quan.","The other big shots: \"...\"","They were furious but dared not speak up.","In the spectator stands, disciples from various sects were also whispering among themselves.","Yan Geng didn't know about the \"pressure and counter-pressure\" incident, but that didn't stop him from noticing the shift in the situation before and after.","\"Brother Huai, did Elder Lu Jiang just vomit blood?\"","\"Hmm.\"","\"Brother Huai, why did Sect Leader Yin Yi suddenly change his expression?\"","\"Brother Huai, Master Yu seems to be in even worse shape.\"","\"Brother Huai, Sect Leader Yin Yi is being so polite to Senior Qi.\"","\"Brother Huai...\"","Yan Huai: \"...\"","On the Fu family's spectator stand, Fu Luanfei silently watched Qi Quan walk onto the viewing platform.","She understood very well what today's competition meant.","The Guiyuan Sect was trying to unite with other sects to put the Investigation Department in its place!","She had been somewhat worried initially, but after seeing Lu Jiang vomit blood and Yin Yi's change in demeanor, she secretly breathed a sigh of relief.","Senior Qi is truly a role model for our generation!","And she's only twenty-two!","Thinking of herself being only Level 4 at eighteen, her sense of urgency grew even stronger.","She would take Senior Qi as her goal, cultivate diligently, and strive to protect those she wanted to protect.","On another side, disciples of the Hengfeng Sect were also whispering.","\"Why is our sect leader frowning?\"","\"The sect leader seems to have stumbled a bit.\"","\"This Senior Qi seems incredibly formidable.\"","\"No wonder she subdued the Wetland Fierce Ghost so easily.\"","\"It's no accident Junior Brother Wei ran into her.\"","Feng Ke frowned and said, \"What do you mean 'ran into her'? He broke the law himself.\"","\"Senior Brother Feng is right.\"","On the viewing platform, Qi Quan and the other two had already taken their seats. Yin Yi, his mind elsewhere, instructed his disciples: \"Begin the competition.\"","After that earlier episode, this display of strength had lost all meaning.","Even if the sect had many elite disciples, they couldn't compare to a single Qi Quan.","He wasn't even sure if she had used her full power earlier, nor could he guess how profound her cultivation truly was.","In the face of a supreme master, any number of lower-level cultivators seemed utterly insignificant.","His heart was heavy, and the other sect leaders and family heads weren't feeling any better.","Yan Fengjun's gaze fell on Yan Huai in the spectator stands, and he sighed inwardly.","His son was considered the strongest among his peers, but unfortunately, he had encountered a prodigy like Qi Quan.","Yet, having a rival was better than having none.","Yan Huai had been number one for too long; it wasn't good for him.","He could see that the fighting spirit within Yan Huai had been growing more intense these past few days, almost to the point of being unbearable.","Fu Jiuchong remained expressionless, not sparing an extra glance for anyone.","With the sound of a distant bell, the intra-sect selection competition officially began.","The intra-sect competition was to select outstanding young cultivators for the grand Mystic Arts Tournament. Participants were mostly Level 3 or above Masters.","In the eyes of high-level Masters, the matches between low-level Masters were rather dull.","Qi Quan only watched a few moments before focusing wholeheartedly on her cultivation.","Li Guoyan, however, watched with great interest, his eyes fixed on the battles on the competition stage.","To be honest, it was quite a spectacle—just too many flashy, soft, cumbersome moves without much combat effectiveness.","The other big shots didn't watch much either, occasionally observing Qi Quan and Li Guoyan from the corners of their eyes.","The former's expression never changed; the latter watched with relish but showed no signs of being intimidated.","Ah, what a defeat!","There weren't many Level 3 or above Masters among the younger generation to begin with, and Sect Leader Yin Yi couldn't possibly send them all out at once, so the competition soon drew to a close.","Yu Lanzhi suddenly said, \"Sect Leader Yin, I have a suggestion.\"","\"Brother Yu, please speak.\"","\"Everyone is here today, and each family's core disciples have been brought along, as have the Investigation Department's elites. This is a great opportunity. Why don't we have a friendly spar? As the saying goes, you don't really know someone until you've crossed blows with them.\"","He turned to Li Guoyan. \"We don't know much about the Investigation Department. Director Li, could you give us this chance to understand each other?\"","Li Guoyan asked, \"How does Master Yu propose we do that?\"","He had anticipated this move when he came today.","Di Meng and Ning Zhi were already the highest-level investigators in the Investigation Department. If they couldn't match the core disciples of the various families, it would undoubtedly put the Investigation Department at a disadvantage.","But they were only Level 5.","Yan Huai from the Yan Family, Liu Qiang from the Guiyuan Sect, and Hu Ying from the Xuanqing Sect were all Level 6. Feng Ke from the Hengfeng Sect, though Level 5, was approaching Level 6.","Only the Fu and Zhou Family disciples were below Level 5.","But just the first four were enough that Di Meng and Ning Zhi might not be able to hold their own.","Now that Qi Quan sat as an equal with the big shots, it was tacitly understood she wouldn't participate in the younger generation's competition.","Yu Lanzhi said, \"My head disciple, Feng Ke, is at Level 5, Third Stage. He would like to experience the Investigation Department's prowess for himself.\"","He infused his voice with spiritual energy as he spoke, ensuring it carried far enough for everyone present to hear.","Feng Ke, who was suddenly named: ???","No, he really didn't want to. He just wanted to cultivate in peace. Fighting and killing weren't for him.","But the sect leader had given an order; he dared not disobey.","He could only stiffen his face, rise, and fly down to the Star-Gazing Platform. His movements were crisp, his appearance handsome, winning cheers from many in the crowd.","Truly worthy of being the Hengfeng Sect's chief disciple.","Li Guoyan smiled. \"Di Meng, Level 5, Second Stage.\"","Di Meng stood up, casually swinging his miniature peachwood hammer as he sauntered onto the Star-Gazing Platform.","He had a crew cut, a high nose bridge, and deep-set eyes, suggesting some ethnic minority heritage. Paired with his casual demeanor, he had a roguishly handsome air.","As the runner-up in the Mystic Arts Tournament two years prior, many recognized him.","As a rogue cultivator, achieving second place in the grand tournament had earned Di Meng the respect of many peers and the appreciation of sects and families back then. Some had even extended olive branches to him, but he had refused them all.","Who would have thought that such a seemingly untamed young man had joined the Investigation Department so early?","Feng Ke wasn't from Di Meng's generation, but since Wei Huanyang had placed fourth in that tournament, he had a rather deep impression of Di Meng.","He bowed with great courtesy. \"Feng Ke of the Hengfeng Sect. I seek your guidance.\"","Di Meng casually cupped his hands in return, a grin spreading across his face. \"Sure thing.\"","Feng Ke: \"...\"","The crowd: \"...\"","The system asked nervously, [Great One, Di Meng is one stage lower than Feng Ke. Could he lose?]","Qi Quan: [No.]","Although Di Meng was a stage lower, he had undergone the Investigation Department's professional training. Having also fought the Wetland Fierce Ghost before—even if it was a two-on-one fight with Ning Zhi—the fact that he could hold out for so long under the pressure of a Level 6 Fierce Ghost spoke volumes about his spiritual energy control and combat skills.","[That's good!]","Sure enough, once the two exchanged blows, the difference became apparent to everyone.","Feng Ke exerted himself to the utmost, while Di Meng appeared relaxed and at ease.","It was as if their cultivation levels had been reversed.","A hint of a smile appeared on Li Guoyan's honest-looking face.","The elite soldiers of their Investigation Department were all capable of fighting one against two and challenging those above their level. Di Meng was a master among them.","Whispers started up again in the spectator stands.","Yan Geng said, \"Brother Huai, during the Mystic Arts Tournament, I saw Di Meng couldn't beat you and thought he wasn't that impressive. Looking at it now, he's really quite formidable.\"","Behind him, other disciples said, \"Back then he was only at the fifth level, first tier, while Brother Huai was already at the sixth level. Fighting across a whole level naturally put him at a disadvantage. That Feng Ke is only at the fifth level, third tier. Now there's just a one-tier difference between them, so it should be easy for Di Meng, right?\"","\"Exactly. Back then, Di Meng held out for so long against Brother Huai, unwilling to fall even when covered in blood. He's a truly tenacious person.\"","Yan Huai: \"Hmm.\"","He understood his opponents.","Di Meng possessed an unyielding resilience, making him a cultivator worthy of respect.","Yan Geng's level was low, so two years ago he hadn't grasped all these intricacies. Hearing this now, he couldn't help but feel a surge of respect for Di Meng.","Looking back at the Star-Gazing Platform, Di Meng subdued his opponent with a single move. His peachwood hammer struck Feng Ke's shoulder, sending Feng Ke flying backwards, a trickle of blood escaping the corner of his mouth.","Feng Ke's face paled. He instinctively glanced at Yu Lanzhi's expression, his heart sinking. In a hoarse voice, he said, \"I concede defeat.\"","Di Meng put away his playful smile, his expression turning solemn. \"I accept your courtesy.\"","The entire arena fell silent.","In the viewing stand, Yu Lanzhi's expression remained unchanged, but everyone could sense his frustration and humiliation.","He looked at Li Guoyan. \"The second-place finisher from that year's Grand Competition, who refused invitations from several families... who would have thought he'd join the Investigation Department? I heard the third-place finisher was also recruited by the Investigation Department. The Investigation Department truly is teeming with talent.\"","Li Guoyan was completely unfazed by this veiled sarcasm. He replied, \"People have their own aspirations. The Mystic Realm is full of hidden dragons and crouching tigers. Losing two talents surely isn't a major concern.\"","Yu Lanzhi: \"...\"","Just as he was about to speak again, Yan Fengjun suddenly said, \"Advisor Qi, I wonder if you could do this humble Yan a small favor?\"","Qi Quan looked at him but didn't answer.","She was only here to watch the competition and had no desire to become the focus of attention on the Star-Gazing Platform.","Asking her to take the stage? Impossible.","Yan Fengjun naturally understood her meaning, but thinking of his son, he still mustered the courage to ask, \"This humble Yan has a son, Yan Huai, who wishes to learn from your esteemed assistant's skills.\"","...","He was referring to Ling Sheng.","Since the big shot couldn't be moved, he'd try asking the assistant.","Ling Sheng was wearing a talisman Qi Quan had given him, so the senior figures couldn't tell if he had any cultivation.","But since he could follow such a master, he certainly wasn't an ordinary person.","Qi Quan: \"No.\"","Yan Fengjun: \"...\"","He was in a rather difficult position.","Yan Huai had no match among sixth-level Masters within the family. However, the family's seventh-level experts were either in seclusion or pursuing quiet cultivation. That left only himself. He couldn't bring himself to fight his son seriously, and because they shared the same lineage and techniques, familiar with each other's moves, it wouldn't serve to stimulate his son's potential.","That's why he wanted to seize this opportunity to enlist external help.","Who would have thought Qi Quan would refuse outright.","The scene fell into a wordless awkwardness.","The system suddenly said, [Big shot, this Head of the Yan Family previously donated 100 million to the charity fund. Today, he also didn't go along with the others in trying to put you in your place. I actually have an idea that could satisfy him without requiring you or Ling Sheng to take action, and even earn you some lifespan.]","Qi Quan: [...Go on.]","[Release the Wetland Fierce Ghost!]","Qi Quan's mind stirred.","Right. What's interesting about Masters fighting Masters? Masters should fight fierce ghosts to improve their ghost-subduing skills.","She spoke unhurriedly.","\"Mr. Yan, do you wish to temper your son, or do you wish for him to be defeated on this high platform?\"","Yan Fengjun quickly replied, \"To temper him, of course.\"","He didn't want his son to be beaten to a pulp, mocked by others, and have his confidence shattered.","Qi Quan: \"I have my rules.\"","Yan Fengjun: \"Please state them.\"","Li Guoyan had a sudden flash of understanding. He knew what Qi Quan was planning to do. This wasn't a bad solution—it wouldn't require her to act personally, wouldn't offend the dignity of the top family, and could also establish the Investigation Department's authority.","He proactively answered for Qi Quan: \"Since it's guidance, naturally a guidance fee is required.\"","Yan Fengjun was taken aback for a moment, then smiled. \"Of course.\"","\"The guidance fee needs to be paid through the platform of Screaming Literature City.\"","Yan Fengjun: ???","Everyone: ???","What was that?","In the audience seats, Yan Huai, upon hearing this, didn't hesitate. He recharged one million and poured it all into \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family,\" instantly skyrocketing to the top of the tipping leaderboard!","The system promptly announced: [Big shot, \"Yan Huai\" tipped you ten thousand deep-water torpedoes!!!]","Ten thousand at once—truly outrageously wealthy!","Qi Quan did the conversion. She had gained another thousand days of lifespan. This trip was worth it.","This Yan Huai was quite perceptive.","Before everyone could react, she threw out a peachwood plaque, which landed on the Star-Gazing Platform.","A ghostly shadow, black tinged with red, suddenly materialized.","\"A red ghost! It's a red ghost!\"","\"Heavens! It's actually a red ghost!\"","\"That must be at least sixth-level, right?\"","\"She released a red ghost? She really does like keeping ghosts!\"","The disciples below the platform buzzed with discussion, all raising their weapons defensively.","On the viewing stand, Yu Lanzhi's expression changed instantly.","This was the Wetland Fierce Ghost from Longlin City! So it really had been subdued by Qi Quan!","His gaze turned cold and stern as he looked at Qi Quan.","\"Master Qi, what is the meaning of this? You release a sixth-level red ghost right before our eyes—are you trying to intimidate the disciples below?\"","Li Guoyan, knowing Qi Quan likely couldn't be bothered to deal with him, answered on her behalf: \"This action is in imitation of your esteemed sect's methods. We ask Master Yu not to take offense.\"","\"What do you mean?!\"","\"That night when the formation suddenly loosened, releasing the fierce ghost... the reasons for that, Master Yu knows well in his heart.\" Li Guoyan's smile faded. \"However, the appearance of the fierce ghost did serve as a lesson for our department's investigators, with quite effective results.\"","...","\"......\"","The fierce ghost on the Star-Gazing Platform: ???","Using him as a training dummy again!!!","He swept his gaze over the disciples in the audience, then looked up at the senior figures on the viewing stand, and fell silent.","Aside from that terrifying woman, there were several seventh-level Masters present. He didn't dare act out.","But asking him to be a training dummy for so many disciples? He couldn't handle that!","He looked pleadingly at Qi Quan.","Qi Quan spoke up: \"You may begin.\"","Only then did everyone realize—this fierce ghost was completely under Qi Quan's command!","Their admiration instantly soared to new heights.","Moreover, they had all heard what Director Li said just now.","Using a sixth-level fierce ghost to train investigators?","That was so cool!","And it was quite effective?","Whimpering internally, they were so envious!","Many disciples put down their ritual tools, their eyes burning as they stared at the Wetland Fierce Ghost.","In all their lives, they had never even seen such a powerful ghost, let alone fought one.","Anyway, with so many senior figures watching, they definitely wouldn't get hurt.","They wanted a turn too!","The fierce ghost: \"...\"","Yan Huai ascended the Star-Gazing Platform.","His eyes shone brightly, fixed intently on the quasi-seventh-level Wetland Fierce Ghost.","The man and the ghost were roughly equal in level. However, the fierce ghost had, after all, been jointly suppressed by several sixth-level Masters back in the day. Its inherent abilities were absolutely formidable, and it didn't fall behind when facing Yan Huai.","The battle on the platform grew increasingly intense. This time, the fierce ghost wasn't having its level suppressed, so the fight was thrillingly fierce!","Yan Huai felt the same.","The quasi-seventh-level fierce ghost actually forced him to draw his sword!","Sword light flashed through the air. Pale golden sword radiance pierced towards the fierce ghost's pitch-black form. The fierce ghost couldn't dodge in time, letting out a miserable shriek. A red light flashed over its body, and its aura became even more terrifying.","The disciples below the platform watched, their blood boiling with excitement.","Especially the younger disciples.","They hadn't yet learned worldly sophistication and smoothness. Their passion and fighting spirit still remained. Seeing Yan Huai's fierce battle with the ghost, they were all ignited with a desire to fight.","\"The champion is mighty!\"","\"Brother Yan, you're amazing!\"","\"That was brilliant!\"","In the stands, Yan Fengjun couldn't help but show a satisfied smile.","This sparring match would surely give Yan Huai some valuable insights.","Yu Lanzhi gritted his teeth in silent fury.","Their Wetland's fierce ghost had just become a training partner for the Investigation Department!","Not only did they take what was theirs, but they were also showing off right in front of them. It was utterly humiliating!","The fierce ghost, too, was provoked into a fighting rage.","He became more cautious, starting to play a game of guerrilla tactics with Yan Huai.","He had learned this from those low-level exorcists in the Investigation Department.","Being a training dummy wasn't without its benefits. At the very least, he had never encountered a more cunning and tricky fighting style than that of the Investigation Department's people. He had learned a lot and was now using it against Yan Huai.","The man and the ghost fought with increasing fervor.","The battle only had to end when the sun reached its zenith.","Yan Huai's spiritual power was completely depleted. Drenched in sweat as if pulled from water, he leaned on his sword to support himself. Though his body felt extremely heavy, his spirit was exhilarated.","He had a vague feeling that he would soon break through his bottleneck.","The fierce ghost wasn't faring much better. His ghostly power was nearly exhausted, his spectral form wounded by the sword numerous times, the pain intense.","He looked pitifully towards Qi Quan.","Qi Quan coldly waved her hand. A peachwood talisman struck the ghost, and he returned to the talisman.","Gasps rose from below the stage.","\"So cool!\"","\"That's awesome!\"","\"I want a fierce ghost as a training partner too!\"","...","\"People in the Investigation Department are so lucky!\"","Li Guoyan seized the moment to say with a smile, \"The department holds training sessions for this program every week.\"","The young disciples: !!!","Li Guoyan added, \"Any investigator below level seven can participate in this training program.\"","The young disciples: !!!","Any level? Is he serious?","They knew all too well that in their own sects or families, lower-level disciples received fewer cultivation resources, let alone such practical experience opportunities.","They were shamelessly tempted.","Sect Master Yin: Numb.","Today's so-called internal competition had turned into a showcase for the Investigation Department.","Now Li Guoyan was poaching talent right in front of them.","He cleared his throat and said clearly, \"The Investigation Department's training method is indeed novel and interesting. However, a fierce ghost, having committed countless killings, deserves to have its soul scattered. Allowing it to remain in the mortal realm is somewhat improper.\"","Li Guoyan smiled.","Trying to argue principles? Fine.","He wholeheartedly agreed, \"Sect Master Yin, with your noble character and clear sense of justice, surely you also approve of the Investigation Department's punishment for Lu Jiang?\"","Yin Yi: \"...\"","Li Guoyan pressed his advantage: \"Lu Jiang, driven by greed for another's merit, took a life, used forbidden arts to steal merit, secretly formed a pyramid scheme organization, operated the 'Fortune Immortal' public account, defrauded countless people of money, caused many to lose their luck, leading to numerous tragedies. Such an evil exorcist, with countless killings to his name, indeed deserves to have his soul scattered.\"","Yin Yi: \"...\"","The other disciples with a conscience felt extremely heavy-hearted.","That's right, someone like that deserves to die without a proper burial!","Yu Lanzhi, however, said, \"Since the fierce ghost can be a training partner, presumably a level seven array master like Lu Jiang can also be put to some use, right?\"","Everyone: \"...\"","That... kind of makes sense!","They all looked at Li Guoyan, waiting for his response.","Li Guoyan wasn't thrown off track at all. He said, \"That is indeed appropriate. The department's punishment for him is: abolish all cultivation, life imprisonment, with possible sentence reduction based on significant meritorious service.\"","\"What counts as significant meritorious service?\" a bold disciple asked.","Li Guoyan: \"For example, writing a comprehensive guide on array techniques, allowing more cultivators to learn about arrays.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","That's practically no different from recycling waste!","The system indignantly said, [Why not let him die?]","Qi Quan replied, [Death is too easy for him.]","[Huh?]","[He was a level seven array master, originally with a lifespan of nearly 350 years. Once his cultivation is abolished, his lifespan will drastically decrease, to a maximum of 100 years. He's already 65 now. Ji Shengzhe was trapped for 30 years; he should also serve at least 30 years in prison.]","The system understood, excitedly saying, [Oh! Waiting for death day by day is much more torturous than dying immediately!]","Moreover, Lu Jiang was used to maintaining a youthful appearance. After his cultivation was abolished, he would become a white-haired old man. Such a contrast would drive him mad.","Ji Shengzhe was a ten-life virtuous man; even after great suffering, he could maintain his sanity.","But Lu Jiang?","He was just a greedy, selfish villain.","He wouldn't be able to withstand it.","With Li Guoyan's explanation, Sect Master Yin and Yu Lanzhi could no longer argue.","If the Guiyuan Sect had managed to intimidate the Investigation Department today, Sect Master Yin might have fought for it. But now, not only had they failed to humble the Investigation Department, they themselves had been intimidated by it.","In front of so many people, both emotionally and logically, he could not bring it up again.","It was easy to imagine how the sect's reputation and prestige would plummet after today.","He suddenly remembered the latest chapter of \"The Rich Family's Diary\".","Black aura in the southwest...","Wasn't that exactly a black aura?","He couldn't help but glance at Qi Quan, who looked relaxed and at ease.","Strange, how had someone like her never gained any reputation before?","While he was pondering, Di Meng and Ning Zhi escorted Lu Jiang onto the viewing platform.","All eyes gathered on the platform.","Lu Jiang knew exactly what awaited him.","He had long lost his previous composure. Kneeling on the ground, he wept and pleaded, \"Don't abolish my cultivation, please, I beg you, don't abolish my cultivation. I can be a training partner like the fierce ghost, I can teach them array techniques, I—\"","A surge of spiritual power sealed his mouth.","Qi Quan glanced at him and said calmly, \"Who will do it?\"","The senior figures all felt a chill.","The fear of being dominated by her super level-seven pressure returned.","Sect Master Yin sighed inwardly.","Since things had come to this, and the Guiyuan Sect was forced to concede, it was better to do it gracefully.","He said, \"I will.\"","Lu Jiang shuddered, staring at Sect Master Yin in disbelief, then his eyes filled with pleading, hoping Sect Master Yin would spare him out of sect camaraderie.","Yin Yi avoided his gaze, hardened his heart, gathered spiritual power in his palm, and slammed it towards Lu Jiang's abdomen.","The spiritual power, sharp as an awl, pierced Lu Jiang's dantian and churned violently within.","Lu Jiang's face contorted in agony. He tried to scream, but with his mouth sealed, only muffled grunts emerged.","His eyes, filled with venomous hatred, glared at Yin Yi, at everyone present. The intensity of his resentment was enough to send chills down one's spine.","Suddenly, an extremely powerful energy erupted from within his body.","Before anyone could react, Qi Quan instantly raised a spiritual energy barrier, firmly containing that energy within an extremely small area, not letting a single wisp escape.","Everyone: !!!","They stared in shock at what was inside the barrier.","That could no longer be called Lu Jiang. It was just a pile of his flesh and blood.","He had attempted to use self-destruction to take everyone present down with him!","Self-destruction didn't require active spiritual power. Even if an exorcist had not a trace of spiritual power left, they could unleash an immensely powerful energy during self-destruction.","It came at the cost of burning one's life force.","The self-destruction of a level seven exorcist was comparable to some highly potent thermal weapons.","Even a level seven exorcist would be severely injured, if not killed.","At such a critical moment, only Qi Quan acted swiftly, saving them all in time.","To suppress the energy of an instant self-destruction within a single breath, confining it to an extremely small area—what a truly transcendent and extraordinary method!","Everyone present realized with utmost clarity—","Qi Quan was absolutely not someone they could afford to provoke!","It was fortunate they hadn't openly offended him to the point of no return.","Yu Lanzhi's already pale and ashen face grew even paler.","He stared at the pool of flesh and blood within the spiritual energy shield, sensing the immense power contained within, and involuntarily took a step back.","Fu Jiuchong, who had remained silent until now, was the first to speak.","\"Senior Qi Quan, for saving my life, I, Fu, have no adequate way to repay you.\"","In front of everyone, he took out his phone, opened the Scream APP, and without the slightest hesitation, dropped ten thousand Deepwater Bombs!","The crowd: \"...\"","My heavens...","Fu Jiuchong, you really know how to make a move!"]},{"number":52,"title":"Chapter 52","paragraphs":["Qi Quan's move truly shocked everyone present.","Immediately after, everyone was stunned by Fu Jiuchong's actions.","Who would have thought the head of the Fu family was like this!","Yan Fengjun glanced at him with a smile, also took out his phone, and leisurely threw a \"thunder\" (a type of tip/virtual gift) at \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family\".","Having been saved, one must show some gratitude.","The system was very satisfied: [These two have some sense!]","Seeing this, the others also wanted to follow suit, but unfortunately, none of them had downloaded the app and had no idea how to do it.","Master Yin laughed to ease the awkwardness, saying, \"It's almost noon. Why don't you, Senior Qi, and the distinguished guests from the Investigation Department stay for a simple meal?\"","He would instruct his disciples to pay the reward later!","The other sect leaders and family heads thought the same, planning to repay this debt of gratitude during the meal.","Master Wan of the Xuanqing Sect pointed at the pool of flesh and blood and asked, \"How should this be handled?\"","We can't keep it wrapped in a spiritual energy shield forever, right?","Everyone instinctively looked towards Qi Quan. The disciples below the stage also gazed at her eagerly, waiting for her answer.","Yan Geng could no longer contain his admiration, whispering excitedly into Yan Huai's ear.","\"So cool! Senior Qi is just too cool!\"","\"Brother Huai! I'm going to be her fan! I have to be her fan!\"","Yan Huai, having fought fiercely, was physically tired but in excellent spirits.","He looked up at that viewing platform, his gaze gradually firming.","\"Mm.\"","Yan Geng suddenly froze, looking at him suspiciously: \"Mm?\"","Yan Huai said seriously, \"I support it. Be her fan.\"","\"......\"","The disciples from other sects were no less enthusiastic than Yan Geng.","The moment Lu Jiang self-destructed, although they were far away, they all keenly sensed that immense energy.","With their cultivation level, encountering it would have meant certain death.","But!","Senior Qi merely waved her hand and completely controlled the situation.","Ahhhhh! Goddess!","The young people, full of passion, opened \"Scream Literature City\" and frantically threw \"thunders\". Their usernames were uniformly cheesy, like \"Goddess Bai Shui I Love You\", \"Goddess I want to have your babies\", \"Goddess, for saving my life, I offer myself to you\", and so on.","The readers of \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family\" were confused.","[If you see me, tell me to go prepare lessons: The author said she was going to a martial arts tournament today. Could she have saved people?]","[Can still grind for another hundred years: Ahhhhhh! What exactly happened? I really want to know!]","[Staying up late makes you bald: It's such a pity not to have witnessed the goddess's heroic bearing in person!]","[Dying from laughter: ???]","Soaring Sky Lu Ma: Ahhhhh! I also really want to know what happened! It's all because I'm too weak!","On the viewing platform, Qi Quan moved her fingers.","The spiritual energy shield slowly compressed, gradually squeezing the self-destruction energy into a basketball-sized sphere.","\"Master Yin, where in your sect is suitable for a controlled explosion?\" she asked.","Master Yin: \"...\"","He asked, \"We dare not trouble you further, Senior Qi. Can someone else go to throw it?\"","Qi Quan nodded.","Master Yin immediately summoned his chief disciple, Liu Qiang.","Liu Qiang looked very young and elegant. After coming up, he paid his respects very politely. The corner of his eye glanced at Qi Quan, excitement overflowing.","Master Yin: \"...\"","A perfectly good disciple has become someone else's fan!","\"Master, what are your instructions?\"","Master Yin said, \"Take this to the back mountain.\"","\"Yes.\"","He respectfully picked up the sphere and was about to turn and leave.","\"It can only be maintained for five minutes,\" Qi Quan reminded.","Liu Qiang smiled... \"Thank you for the reminder, Senior. I'll remember.\"","He attached a Swift Movement Talisman and swiftly disappeared from everyone's sight, rushing to a deserted place in the back mountain and throwing the sphere into the bottom of a deep pool.","Five minutes later.","\"Boom—\"","A loud explosion came from the back mountain, causing the restaurant where the Guiyuan Sect entertained distinguished guests to shake several times.","Everyone: \"...\"","That power... the lingering fear was real!","The restaurant was divided into an inner dining hall and an outer dining hall. The inner hall was where the big shots ate, and the outer hall was for ordinary disciples.","The Guiyuan Sect was the number one major sect, with strict sect rules. Usually, everyone was reserved and silent during meals, but today they were discussing excitedly in low voices. With the addition of disciples from other sects, the discussions became even more heated.","The moment the loud noise came from the back mountain, everyone fell silent. The dining hall became so quiet you could hear a pin drop.","\"Clap, clap, clap.\" Suddenly, a round of applause sounded.","It was as if a switch had been flipped. Everyone started applauding, the sound like thunder, instantly reaching the inner dining hall.","The big shots in the inner dining hall: \"...\"","System: [Big shot, I think they're all still feeling the aftereffects of fear.]","Qi Quan: [It's only human.]","Everyone fears death, including her.","The Guiyuan Sect's dishes leaned towards the light side, but the taste was quite good. Qi Quan ate unhurriedly, completely indifferent to the surrounding gazes.","The others had little appetite for food.","Lu Jiang self-destructed and died in front of everyone, his body exploding into a pool of flesh and blood, his soul also scattered to ashes. This matter ended here, but everyone knew it was actually just a beginning.","Master Yin asked with a smile, \"I wonder if the dishes suit Senior Qi's taste?\"","Qi Quan obliged: \"Not bad.\"","\"That's good.\" He turned to ask Li Guoyan, \"And Director Li?\"","Li Guoyan praised, \"Excellent.\"","Ling Sheng sat beside Qi Quan. Due to the illusion technique concealing him, he had little presence, and the big shots didn't specifically ask him either.","Master Wan sighed and couldn't help asking, \"May I ask, Director Li, today you were invited here. Besides dealing with Lu Jiang, you must have other matters to discuss, right?\"","The official's stance was clear. Lu Jiang wasn't important enough for them to make a special trip.","Those present were all shrewd people.","Li Guoyan thus didn't beat around the bush and directly delivered a heavy statement.","\"Our department believes that the Celestial Master Association has long existed in name only.\"","All the big shots: !!!","Yu Lanzhi was the most impulsive and asked, \"What does Director Li mean by that? Does the official intend to disband the Celestial Master Association?\"","The atmosphere grew tense.","System: [The Celestial Master Association holds positions without doing their duties. They should have been disbanded long ago!]","Li Guoyan said seriously, \"The cases recently investigated by our department are all related to Celestial Masters causing trouble. The official side is also in a difficult position. Originally, Celestial Masters were supervised by the Celestial Master Association. As long as they didn't harm the public, we turned a blind eye. But the Celestial Master Association has clearly lost its supervisory function. The official analysis concludes that the association no longer has a reason to continue existing.\"","\"There are still many diligent Celestial Masters within the association who diligently capture ghosts and exorcise evil, never harming anyone,\" Master Wan said.","Master Yin also said, \"Once the association is dissolved, our sect disciples are fine, but wouldn't those independent cultivators be even less supervised?\"","\"What do the rest of you think?\" Li Guoyan asked.","The Yan Family Head said with a smile, \"Everything has its pros and cons.\"","Fu Jiuchong remained expressionless.","Master Zhou had the least presence and didn't know what to say, chiming in, \"Supervision is indeed necessary, but there's no need to disband the association. At least let those independent cultivators have a home.\"","\"Well said.\" Li Guoyan smiled. \"Master Zhou's words hit the key point. As long as supervision is in place and Celestial Masters are prevented from committing evil, there is indeed no need to disband the association.\"","The official side's steps couldn't be too big at once. Taking too big a step might cause a backlash from the mystical community, which would be counterproductive.","Previously, cracking down on the evil celestial masters was merely a warning bell.","The current negotiation is also to ensure the healthier development of the Mystic Arts Sect.","The Mystic Arts Sect is not the official target of the crackdown.","Master Yin: \"What does Director Li mean?\"","Li Guoyan: \"The official body is deeply disappointed with the Celestial Masters Association's self-regulation, so it has decided to establish supervisory teams within the local Celestial Masters Associations to oversee their operations.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","Wasn't this like hanging a sword of Damocles over their heads?","Calling it a supervisory team was essentially taking over the Celestial Masters Association.","In the long run, wouldn't the Celestial Masters Association truly become another branch of the Investigation Department?","The atmosphere at the dining table was extremely heavy.","No one spoke first.","The sound of a spoon pressing against a bowl abruptly rang out.","Everyone looked up.","Qi Quan set down her spoon, used a warm small towel to wipe the corners of her mouth, and under everyone's gaze, calmly placed it down. She looked at Li Guoyan and asked:","\"When are we going back?\"","Li Guoyan smiled, \"I'll have someone take you back right now.\"","Qi Quan nodded.","\"Senior Qi Quan, as a celestial master beyond the seventh rank, what do you think should be done?\" the Yan Family Head suddenly inquired.","Qi Quan said mildly, \"Do your duty well. It's not difficult.\"","Yan Fengjun was momentarily stunned, then chuckled wryly.","He raised his cup, \"I toast to you.\"","After this battle, the regression of the Mystic Arts Sect was an established fact. Even if Master Yin and the others were unwilling, they had no choice but to agree to the official decision.","The official body did not directly disband the Celestial Masters Association, giving them a chance to catch their breath and avoid a desperate, risky counterattack.","They still harbored a sliver of hope.","The Celestial Masters Association was filled with their own factions, deeply entrenched and intertwined. Even if the official body wanted to further control the association by establishing supervisory teams, they would have to see if they could actually manage it.","Those present were all top leaders of the Mystic Arts Sect; they could set the rules for the sect just by holding a meeting. They could completely decide the future development of the Mystic Arts Sect without needing to consult others.","After exchanging glances, they finally decided to retreat a step.","They couldn't win a fight anyway, so this was the only way.","The official body achieved its goal, and the Mystic Arts Sect didn't suffer too great a loss. For a time, both hosts and guests were content.","Outside the mountain gate, as Qi Quan was about to get into the car with Ling Sheng, someone suddenly called out to her.","It was a young, beautiful woman. Judging by her features, she resembled Fu Jiuchong quite a bit; she was likely a member of the Fu family.","\"Senior Qi Quan.\" Fu Luanfei's gaze was direct and fervent. \"May I ask you a question?\"","Qi Quan's brow moved slightly. This girl actually had some kind of karmic connection with her.","How could that be?","She carefully searched her memories and finally grasped a possibility.","The person who had sent her that private message on Weibo to warn her that night was probably this girl.","Only someone from within the Mystic Arts Sect who could participate in certain important meetings would be able to warn her about the sect's movements. This girl was likely a direct descendant or core disciple of the Fu family who, upon learning the news, went to Weibo to warn her.","Yet she had concealed her identity, acting with extreme caution.","Qi Quan nodded and said, \"Please go ahead.\"","\"May I ask, are you an eighth-rank celestial master?\" Her voice was very low, but her eyes shone with a burning light, as if awaiting a definitive answer.","Qi Quan replied evenly, \"What is the matter?\"","Fu Luanfei's handsome, spirited features grew even more anxious. She took a deep breath, her fist clenching slightly, and said, \"If you are, I would like to ask for your help.\"","\"Luanfei.\" Fu Jiuchong stood not far away, his expression impassive. \"It's time to go home.\"","He glanced at Qi Quan and gave a slight nod.","Fu Luanfei's face showed reluctance, but she had no choice but to obey her father and follow him into the car.","The system was very curious: [Big shot, what does she want your help with? The Fu family is, after all, the second-largest great family. They shouldn't lack resources or talent.]","Qi Quan: [I don't know.]","She sat in the car and looked at Ling Sheng beside her.","Through the illusion technique, at first glance, he didn't look much like the Fu father and daughter. But upon closer inspection, one could detect a slight resemblance in their bearing.","Qi Quan felt a headache coming on. How could she uncover Ling Sheng's origins while also ensuring he remained firmly a part of the Lakeside Villa?","\"Master,\" Li Guoyan said while driving, \"This mission has been successfully completed, and you deserve the highest credit. The bonus will be issued promptly upon our return.\"","Qi Quan: \"Thank you for your trouble.\"","Li Guoyan glanced at her in the rearview mirror and suggested with a smile, \"You rarely come to Longjing City. Now that all tasks are finished, why not take a tour of the various scenic spots in Longjing? The department has a few free admission passes. I'll have someone send them to you after we return.\"","Qi Quan didn't refuse.","Whether she toured or not didn't matter to her, but knowing that Ling Sheng was likely from the Longjing Fu family, and if he had been imprisoned since childhood, he would have had no chance to appreciate the sights of Longjing City.","With free passes, there was no need to show ID to buy tickets, which was indeed more convenient for Ling Sheng, who had no official identity.","\"Master, regarding the Bloody Pills, the department hasn't found any related leads yet,\" Li Guoyan said.","Qi Quan nodded: \"The Mystic Arts forces in Longjing City are densely packed; evil cultivators would inevitably be cautious. It might be better to investigate in more remote areas like Longjiang, Longtan, or Longxi.\"","\"You're right, Master. I was thinking the same,\" Li Guoyan agreed.","Inside the Fu family car.","Fu Luanfei suppressed her excitement and asked, \"Dad, is she eighth rank?\"","Before Fu Jiuchong could answer, she continued, \"To instantly suppress a seventh-rank celestial master's self-detonation, she must be beyond seventh rank!\"","Fu Jiuchong nodded: \"She certainly is.\"","Although he hadn't directly felt the pressure, he had sensed the fluctuation of spiritual power. Such formidable spiritual power, he had only experienced from the eighth-rank elders within his family.","No, to be precise, the eighth-rank elders were weaker compared to her.","Otherwise, it would be hard to explain why Master Yin and the others instantly changed their attitude.","If she were merely eighth rank, the various sects and families wouldn't fear her. But if she were beyond eighth rank, then they would have to be extremely careful.","Yet no one dared to guess, let alone ask.","A celestial master beyond eighth rank at twenty-two years old—could such a thing truly exist?","For now, they didn't want to shatter their worldview.","Fu Luanfei didn't overthink it. She said urgently, \"She is a righteous but not rigid celestial master. Do you think if we asked for her help, she might agree?\"","\"I don't know,\" Fu Jiuchong also had no certainty.","From their brief interaction, it was clear this super eighth-rank expert was a celestial master with principles and a bottom line. Whether she would agree to such a request was hard to judge.","The urgency in Fu Luanfei's heart also subsided.","She said bitterly, \"We've waited so many years. This might be our only hope now. If we don't try, I really can't accept it.\"","Fu Jiuchong closed his eyes.","\"She keeps ghost attendants, doesn't she?\" Fu Luanfei said. \"That shows she's not the type of celestial master who rigidly follows the rules. Maybe... maybe she'll agree.\"","Fu Jiuchong: \"Let's think about it more.\"","Father and daughter returned home. Without a word, they both turned towards the most deeply hidden small courtyard in the Fu family estate.","A high-level array was set up outside the courtyard to prevent outsiders or family disciples from intruding.","From outside the array, it appeared to be nothing more than a desolate, dilapidated little yard. But once one stepped into the array, they would discover the courtyard was exquisite, beautiful, and filled with abundant spiritual energy.","In the open space of the small courtyard, a rocking chair swayed rhythmically.","On the rocking chair, a woman with lovely features had her eyes closed. Her thick, dark hair was loosely draped over the headrest of the chair, cascading down from the very top. Under the sunlight, it shimmered with a satin-like luster.","The woman was covered with a thin blanket, her hands folded over her abdomen. They were so pale they seemed to glow, yet also withered and thin, like old tree branches that had lost all their moisture.","Fu Luanfei half-knelt beside the rocking chair and called out with a smile, \"Aunt.\"","The woman slowly opened her eyes, her gaze drifting towards Fu Luanfei, blank and empty like a sheet of paper stripped of all color.","Even so, a trace of her former grace and charm was still faintly discernible between her brows.","Su Family Villa.","Qi Quan received the complimentary tickets sent by Li Guoyan's people. There were four in total, perfect to share with Su Nuanuan and Shen Hui. It was very thoughtful.","\"Aquan-jie, I love you!\" Su Nuanuan made to rush forward and hug her again, but was stopped by a single finger from Qi Quan pressed against her forehead.","She paused for a moment, then put on an act of being wronged. \"Aquan-jie, don't you like me anymore?\"","Qi Quan withdrew her finger and said, \"I'm going upstairs.\"","She still hadn't gotten used to such intimate contact.","Su Nuanuan blinked, watching Qi Quan's retreating back which seemed almost like a hasty escape, and suddenly laughed.","Yan Family.","After the intense battle, Yan Huai felt his cultivation realm had loosened somewhat, though it wasn't yet time for a breakthrough.","He sat ramrod straight across from Yan Fengjun, his expression stern and cold, yet with a faint thread of excitement hidden within.","Yan Fengjun studied him for a moment and said, \"Ah Huai, if I asked you to join the Investigation Department, would you be willing?\"","\"No.\" Yan Huai answered without the slightest hesitation.","Surprise flashed in Yan Fengjun's eyes, but he quickly concealed it. \"Why not?\"","\"You said I am the heir of the Yan family. I don't need to think about anything else. I just need to focus on cultivation, to ensure the family's legacy continues.\" Yan Huai recited this methodically.","Yan Fengjun: \"...\"","He eyed Yan Huai suspiciously.","This kid... was he truly clueless, or just pretending?","Or had they all misjudged him all these years?","He said, \"The current situation is different from before. The Investigation Department's influence is growing, and they plan to establish a supervision team within the Heavenly Master Association. In the long run, the Association will be constrained by them.\"","\"Oh.\"","Yan Fengjun: \"You are a quasi-Seventh Grade Heavenly Master. I believe the Investigation Department won't refuse your application.\"","\"I only wish to cultivate in peace. The Investigation Department has to handle all sorts of cases. It would delay my cultivation. Send someone else.\" Yan Huai's expression remained cold and indifferent, showing not a flicker of wavering.","Yan Fengjun: \"...\"","He used to think raising a block of wood was frustrating. Now he discovered this block of wood might actually be pretending, which was even more frustrating.","He said irritably, \"Are you doing this on purpose?\"","Yan Huai appropriately showed a look of surprise.","Yan Fengjun glared at him. \"Stop pretending with me. Do you really think I can't see through your little schemes?\"","His refusal to join the Investigation Department definitely had another purpose.","\"As you say.\" Yan Huai replied solemnly.","\"...\"","Yan Fengjun: \"Get out!\"","Yan Huai immediately stood up and returned to his room.","Not long after, Yan Geng slipped in.","\"Brother Huai, I heard the authorities are setting up a supervision team in the Heavenly Master Association. Is it true?\"","\"True.\"","\"Whoa.\" Yan Geng exclaimed in surprise. \"Master Yin and the Family Head and the others... they all agreed?\"","Yan Huai didn't answer.","Yan Geng figured it out on his own.","...","\"Everyone's saying now that Senior Qi is a Super Eighth Grade Heavenly Master, someone even more formidable than the Eighth Grade masters from the various sects and families. Is that why Master Yin and the Family Head agreed to this?\"","\"Mhm.\"","\"Senior Qi is truly amazing!\" Yan Geng was young and spent all his time following Yan Huai around. His personality was still quite naive, full of a young person's passion and fervor.","He looked at Yan Huai enviously. \"Brother Huai, what was it like, fighting that fierce ghost?\"","Yan Huai: \"...\"","\"Brother Huai, I want to fight a fierce ghost too. I saw a lot of people in the group chat discussing it. They think Senior Qi is the coolest, and the people in the Investigation Department are so lucky to have such a big shot using fierce ghosts to train them.\"","Yan Huai: \"...\"","\"Some people are even saying they want to join the Investigation Department as investigators.\"","\"...\"","\"Do you think... we could go?\"","Yan Huai lifted his eyelids to glance at him.","\"Alright, I'll stop talking. You focus on your cultivation.\"","After the \"Banquet at Hongmen,\" the authorities revealed a more assertive stance than before.","Heavenly Master Associations across the country received notifications that supervision teams would soon be stationed within them, exercising supervisory authority over the Associations.","The higher-ups of the Heavenly Master Associations: ???","Had they heard wrong?","Weren't the authorities afraid of upsetting the powerful masters of the Mystic Arts world by doing this?","Someone asked just that, and then got thoroughly schooled.","[Is the Association really setting up a supervision team?]","[How did the world change overnight?]","[So the big shots have no reaction at all? In the future, should we independent cultivators listen to the Association or the supervision team?]","[Isn't it obvious? Right now, the authorities have gained the upper hand over the Association. Naturally, listen to the authorities. Unless you want to end up like Wei Huangyang and Lu Jiang?]","[So why did things suddenly change like this?]","[I suggest you read the latest chapter of \"Diary of a Wealthy Family.\" They were probably beaten into submission by the White Water big shot.]","[Are you serious?]","[I just want to know what use this supervision team has.]","[Ah, I feel like I'm witnessing history!]","The authorities worked with high efficiency.","The day after \"negotiating\" with the Mystic Arts leaders, they dispatched supervisory personnel to the Dragon Capital City Heavenly Master Association.","The supervisory personnel were all rigorously trained and selected. They were experienced, keenly insightful, acted decisively, and were all from other regions with no local connections, giving the Association higher-ups no opportunity to obstruct their work.","A \"supervision fever\" swept through all regions.","These matters did not affect Qi Quan.","However, after her trip to the Guiyuan Sect, she suddenly gained a large number of enthusiastic fans. Her Weibo follower count had reached several hundred thousand, and the comments section of \"Diary of a Wealthy Family\" was filled with various \"thunder\" comments (expressing awe/support). Mixed in were also comments like \"Goddess, I want to marry you.\"","The system was too embarrassed to read them out to her.","Qi Quan spent three days touring the scenic spots of Dragon Capital City with Ling Sheng.","Both carried spiritual energy within them and had abundant stamina. They completely lacked the symptom of other tourists collapsing after visiting one spot, so their efficiency was particularly high.","In her previous life, Qi Quan was busy with sect affairs and never had the chance to travel and play freely. In this life, however, she was making up for it thoroughly.","First the resort, now the major scenic areas.","Her mindset seemed to have changed because of this as well.","The system noticed it too and chuckled secretly. [Big shot, you used to dislike going out the most.]","Qi Quan smiled. [Going out before meant dealing with matters. It was mentally draining and exhausting... better to just stay home and cultivate.]","[So that's why you resisted going out before?]","[Perhaps.]","[Then in this life, you can enjoy yourself more. After all, you can live a long time now, with both money and leisure.]","Qi Quan stood atop the high city wall, looking down at the vast land below, a smile curling at the corner of her lips.","[Coming out to play occasionally is really quite nice.]","Ling Sheng saw her smile, and a hint of a smile also appeared in his eyes.","It happened that Qi Quan turned to look at him and caught that expression, making her mood even more cheerful.","She said: [It seems Ling Sheng really enjoys going out to play. He really was kept shut in for too long before.]","System: [...Perhaps.]","After enjoying the final scenic spot, the two returned to the villa.","A car was parked at the villa entrance.","The system exclaimed in surprise: [It's the Fu family's car!]","It had been seen last time at the Guiyuan Sect gate.","As Qi Quan entered the villa with Ling Sheng, they immediately heard the sound of two girls chatting in the living room.","\"Wow! This one is really so cool! Amazing!\" Su Nuanuan's voice rang out with delighted praise.","\"These were all secretly taken by others. I saw them in a group chat and downloaded them,\" came the voice of Fu Luanfei from inside. \"Should I send them to you?\"","\"Yes, please!\" Su Nuanuan eagerly agreed. \"Sister Quan is just too awesome!\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","The system was also shocked: [How do those two know each other?]","Just then, Qi Quan stepped into the living room.","Both girls looked up simultaneously, their eyes shining with fervent admiration and joy.","Su Nuanuan immediately introduced, \"Sister Quan, this is my schoolmate, Fu Luanfei. We met in a club!\"","Fu Luanfei stood up politely and said, \"Senior Qi Quan, I apologize for the presumptuous visit. I hope I'm not disturbing you.\"","\"Mm. What were you looking at?\"","Qi Quan walked over and sat down on the sofa.","\"Photos of you from that day at the Martial Arts Assembly!\" Su Nuanuan handed over her phone. \"They're taken so well!\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She wasn't a celebrity. Why were people taking her picture?","And also—","She looked at Fu Luanfei and asked, \"Was photography allowed?\"","Logically, internal competitions within the Guiyuan Sect shouldn't permit photography or recording, especially since the situation that day was more complex than a standard internal match.","Fu Luanfei replied respectfully, \"As long as it doesn't involve leaking secrets, photography and internal sharing are allowed.\"","She glanced at Su Nuanuan. \"Nuanuan isn't an outsider.\"","Su Nuanuan truly wasn't an outsider. Her own brother served as Qi Quan's ghost attendant, making her practically family.","Hearing this, Qi Quan didn't press further.","She had no particular feelings about having her picture taken.","An extremely delicate and refreshing aroma of tea wafted over, making Fu Luanfei instinctively look towards its source.","A tall, slender, and clean-cut young man set down a tea tray and prepared a cup of tea for each of the three.","Fu Luanfei thought: This assistant is too considerate and thorough.","\"Ah, I forgot to offer you tea,\" Su Nuanuan said with a look of guilt.","Fu Luanfei shook her head with a smile and got to the main point.","\"The day after tomorrow is my eighteenth birthday. My family plans to hold a birthday banquet for me, and I would like to invite all of you to attend.\"","She took four invitations from her bag; everyone in the villa was listed on them.","One, bearing Qi Quan's name, was solemnly presented to her.","Qi Quan accepted it without hesitation.","She could tell Fu Luanfei had a request.","She had already intended to make contact with the Fu family to investigate the events surrounding Ling Sheng from years ago. This invitation arrived at the perfect time.","...","Seeing her accept, Fu Luanfei visibly relaxed.","She didn't stay much longer, excusing herself on account of other matters.","System: [Big shot, are you really going to attend her birthday banquet?]","Qi Quan: [It's hard to refuse a sincere invitation.]","[...]","It didn't believe that, saying: [You're doing it for Ling Sheng, aren't you?]","Qi Quan: [Also to settle a karmic debt.]","[What karmic debt?]","[That reminder via private message on Weibo that day was probably sent by her.]","The system didn't understand: [Since she knows Su Nuanuan, she must also know Su Nuanuan lives with you. Why didn't she use Su Nuanuan to relay the warning?]","Where Qi Quan lived was no secret.","The top masters of the Mystic Arts world, wanting to recruit her, would have thoroughly investigated her background. Her connection to the Su family would be well-known to them.","Everyone knew Su Nuanuan was by her side.","If Fu Luanfei had excessive contact with Su Nuanuan before the \"Banquet at Hong Gate,\" it would certainly draw the attention of the Mystic Arts circles. The consequences would be unpredictable.","Qi Quan: [She didn't want to expose herself.]","System: [True.]","Somewhere in the suburbs of the capital, at a certain estate.","A steward reverently presented a bowl of medicinal decoction. The liquid was pitch black and emitted a foul odor.","A man sat in a chair, a carving knife in his hand, jade dust falling in a fine shower.","\"Family Head, your medicine.\"","The man paused. Smelling the decoction that nearly made him retch, he suddenly drove the carving knife into the jade. A hint of madness flickered in his eyes as he swept his hand out, knocking over the medicine bowl.","The liquid spilled onto the floor, its odor evaporating into the air, becoming even more unbearable.","\"Ding Ji is dead, Yan Wu is dead, many of our operations have been destroyed by the Investigation Department,\" he chuckled darkly. \"Truly a person of great fortune. Once given a chance to turn things around, no one can stand in her way.\"","\"Family Head...\"","The man's expression turned cold and fierce: \"What is it!\"","\"The day after tomorrow is the birthday banquet for the Fu family's young miss. Will you be attending?\"","The man was momentarily taken aback.","\"The Fu family's young miss?\" His eyes held a complex, inexplicable emotion, tinged with a trace of reminiscence. He murmured, \"Just a little girl. What's the point in going?\"","He paused. \"Prepare a congratulatory gift.\"","\"Yes.\"","Time flew, and soon it was the day of the Fu family young miss's birthday banquet.","The Fu residence was filled with a gathering of distinguished guests, all major figures from Longjing City. Other sects and families of similar stature sent their most core disciples to offer congratulations.","Liu Qiang, representing the Guiyuan Sect, arrived neither early nor late and was soon surrounded by a group of young people.","\"Brother Liu, tell us again about how the Level Seven elder self-destructed but was suppressed by Senior Qi Quan!\"","As the person who had personally received the \"bomb,\" Liu Qiang had garnered immense attention these past few days, both within and outside the sect, in both the real world and online.","He was the disciple closest to Senior Qi Quan that day; the only disciple who had spoken with Senior Qi Quan that day; the one personally entrusted by Senior Qi Quan with the task of catching the thrown \"bomb.\"","He had become the object of everyone's envy.","Liu Qiang, after all, was the sect's chief disciple. Though inwardly thrilled, he managed to maintain his composure on the surface.","He smiled with practiced grace. \"Today is Miss Fu's birthday banquet. We can talk about that another time when there's a chance.\"","As soon as his words fell, the entire hall fell silent.","He was puzzled. Had he said something wrong?","Liu Qiang instinctively followed the crowd's gaze.","Outside the banquet hall, a tall, slender figure appeared in their line of sight...","She wore a form-fitting black evening gown. The dress was beautifully tailored, perfectly contouring her figure and outlining an excellent physique. The minimalist black gown outshone any ornate attire.","A jade hairpin held up her long hair, with a few delicate strands loose at her temples, framing exceptionally striking features. Her fair skin glowed with a jade-like luster.","This was...","Someone in the crowd whispered, \"Senior Qi Quan!\"","Only then did Liu Qiang realize—it was Senior Qi Quan!","That day at the Stargazing Platform, he hadn't dared to look too closely. Moreover, his attention had been completely captivated by her formidable methods throughout, so he hadn't really noticed her appearance.","Probably many of the disciples present were the same.","In their eyes, she was an exalted senior, far beyond their reach. No one would care about her outward appearance because it simply wasn't necessary.","But who could have imagined that the senior, having traded casual clothes for an evening gown and with her hair up, would be so stunning!","She was like a radiant presence, drawing the gaze of everyone present.","In truth, Qi Quan had dressed quite modestly.","The gown was one she had tailored herself in her spare time. The fabric was of high quality, but the style was exceptionally simple.","She didn't take anyone's arm, walking into the banquet hall on her own.","Ling Sheng, dressed in a well-fitted suit, followed closely beside her, holding her bag.","Such a combination was peculiar, yet no one found it odd.","Su Nuanuan slowed her pace by a step, walking alongside Shen Hui.","Upon learning of Qi Quan's arrival, Fu Luanfei personally came to greet her.","She possessed a striking, handsome beauty, dressed in a women's suit with her hair styled in a very efficient manner, making her an exceptionally eye-catching presence in the entire banquet hall.","The Fu family had no unattractive people.","\"Senior Qi, Nuanuan, the banquet hasn't started yet. Please go upstairs to rest first.\"","She guided the four of them upstairs.","In the lounge, tea had long been prepared.","Fu Luanfei took Su Nuanuan's hand. \"Nuanuan, I have a few accessories and can't decide which to choose. Could you help me with your opinion?\"","\"Of course!\" Su Nuanuan, being perceptive, left with her.","Shen Hui also said, \"Senior, I'll step out and take a look.\"","Only Qi Quan and Ling Sheng remained in the lounge.","Qi Quan leaned back on the sofa, her demeanor calm and peaceful. She then turned to look at Ling Sheng and asked, \"How do you feel?\"","Ling Sheng was momentarily stunned, then lowered his head to type: [The clothes are uncomfortable to wear.]","Qi Quan: \"...\"","Having not worn clothes for over a decade, and after moving to the Lakeside Villa only wearing loose garments, it was indeed uncomfortable to be constrained by a suit.","But that wasn't what she was asking.","Still, it wasn't important.","She smiled and said, \"You won't have to wear them again in the future.\"","Ling Sheng curved his lips into a smile and nodded seriously.","A knock sounded at the door.","Qi Quan: \"Come in.\"","A man opened the door and walked in with steady steps.","\"Senior Qi, I, Fu, was occupied with matters earlier and couldn't welcome you personally. My apologies for the discourtesy.\"","Qi Quan had no patience for beating around the bush. \"Mr. Fu, you may speak directly.\"","Fu Jiuchong sat on the opposite sofa, casually pressed a button. The light of an array suddenly flashed, disappearing a few seconds later.","It was an isolation array.","It could block any form of external prying, including spiritual sense.","Qi Quan's expression remained unchanged.","Fu Jiuchong's eyes were full of admiration. In a low voice, he said, \"The reason for inviting Senior Qi today is to ask for your assistance.\"","\"And if I hadn't come?\"","Fu Jiuchong said, \"To be honest, your coming is what surprised me more.\"","...","Their Fu family had no prior relationship with Qi Quan. An expert of Qi Quan's level had no need to attend a young girl's coming-of-age ceremony.","He was very curious about Qi Quan's reason for coming.","Qi Quan did not hide it: \"Miss Fu and I share a karmic connection.\"","Fu Jiuchong thought for a moment and understood it was because of the warning Fu Luanfei had given her.","His expression grew even more sincere. \"A single warning doesn't amount to much.\"","Qi Quan knew he spoke the truth.","Before going to the Guiyuan Sect, almost everyone speculated she was at most a seventh-level cultivator.","Despite seventh-level Heavenly Masters being rare, in the eyes of major sects and great families, they weren't considered particularly significant.","Which sect leader or family head wasn't at least seventh-level?","Within their sects and families, there were several seventh and even eighth-level elders.","Facing a Qi Quan who was \"only seventh-level,\" they felt no fear and saw no need to curry favor or build ties.","The previous \"grand\" recruitment efforts were merely a perfunctory formality to demonstrate the demeanor of the mystical community.","No one truly took it seriously.","Otherwise, the Guiyuan Sect wouldn't have sent an invitation to a banquet with ulterior motives so soon after Qi Quan's refusal.","Therefore, Fu Luanfei's earlier warning to her was genuinely well-intentioned.","Qi Quan acknowledged this kindness.","\"A pure heart is rare,\" she praised.","Fu Jiuchong, however, said, \"Rare, and also difficult to survive with.\"","Qi Quan sensed there was more to his words but did not respond.","\"I heard Senior Qi keeps a ghost servant,\" Fu Jiuchong, not expecting her to be talkative, continued, \"You don't consider keeping ghost servants to be a heretical art of the mystical path?\"","Qi Quan: \"If it causes no harm to heaven and reason, how can it be heretical?\"","\"Haha,\" he couldn't help but laugh, then asked seemingly casually, \"I wonder if Senior Qi has heard of the Soul-Searching Art?\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","Not only had she heard of it, she had used it.","Fu Jiuchong said, \"It's a forbidden art of the mystical path. Those whose souls have been searched become, at best, foolish, insane, or deranged; at worst, they lose their lives. The process is also extremely painful. Have you heard of it, Senior?\"","\"I have heard of it.\"","Fu Jiuchong suddenly glanced at Ling Sheng, implying something.","\"He is under my protection,\" Qi Quan said. \"Mr. Fu need not worry.\"","\"Good.\"","He mustered his courage and said, \"After being soul-searched, if one becomes foolish, they can only remain so. But there is an exception. If the person's soul, at the instant of the search, self-seals their spiritual consciousness—rather than having their spiritual platform destroyed by the perpetrator—they can still be saved.\"","Qi Quan understood.","He was seeking her help to treat an illness.","There indeed existed a forbidden art in the mystical path that could restore a person with such symptoms to normalcy, but the cost was significant.","There were three conditions.","Three eighth-level Heavenly Masters must perform the ritual simultaneously; an enormous supply of spiritual energy is required; and the soul of a blood relative must serve as a guide.","The first condition alone was enough to disqualify the vast majority.","Why was it a forbidden art?","Because performing this forbidden art was extremely dangerous.","The danger lay not with the eighth-level Heavenly Masters performing it, but with the blood relative who risked their life.","During the ritual, the living soul must leave the body, attach to the patient, and, aided by the art, delve deep into the patient's spiritual platform. There, it must find the self-sealed barrier, break it, then guide the sealed memories and soul to return, thus achieving the goal.","However, during the performance of this forbidden art, not a single mistake or omission could be allowed, and the supply of spiritual energy must be extremely abundant. Otherwise, if any deviation occurred, not only might the patient be beyond saving, but the living soul might also be unable to return.","Fu Jiuchong was asking for her help, likely because of the super eighth-level cultivation she had displayed.","Qi Quan asked, \"...Are you sure you want to do this?\"","Fu Jiuchong breathed a sigh of relief.","It seemed she wasn't averse to using the forbidden art.","\"Yes, I have a reason that compels me to do this.\" His voice grew hoarse, his eyes slightly reddened. \"I must know what exactly happened back then.\"","Qi Quan remained silent.","\"Senior Qi, I know this is asking a great deal, but I still wish to try.\" He said solemnly, \"After it concludes, regardless of the outcome, half of the Fu family's assets will be transferred to your name.\"","\"Half your family's assets?\"","Fu Jiuchong: \"I must leave something for Luanfei.\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She had no interest in other people's family fortunes.","Fu Jiuchong realized his mistake. \"I misunderstood your meaning. I do indeed intend to personally participate in the rescue.\"","If something happened to him, Fu Luanfei was still young and her cultivation insufficient. Even with the support of the elders, it would be difficult for her to command respect.","It was better to relinquish half. With fewer covetous eyes upon her, she could live more peacefully.","If he didn't meet with misfortune and the forbidden art succeeded, then Qi Quan would be a great benefactor to the Fu family. Offering half their assets would be only right and proper.","Qi Quan was curious: \"Do you truly trust me?\"","The Fu family already had two eighth-level Heavenly Masters. For so many years, they hadn't attempted the forbidden art, probably because Fu Luanfei was not yet an adult, and also because they were unwilling to trust an eighth-level master from outside.","Why place such trust in her?","Fu Jiuchong said, \"I don't know why either. I just feel you are worthy of trust.\"","As he spoke, he unconsciously glanced at Ling Sheng.","In truth, he not only felt favorable towards Qi Quan, but also felt a natural affinity towards the assistant by her side.","He trusted his intuition.","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She asked, \"Who is the patient?\"","\"My younger sister, Fu Jiuge.\"","As expected.","Qi Quan had stayed in Longjing precisely to resolve the karmic connection between Ling Sheng and the Fu family.","This was an opportunity, and she had no reason to refuse.","She thought for a moment and said, \"I don't want half of the Fu family's fortune. Once the matter is settled, I have one condition.\"","Fu Jiuchong: \"Please, speak your mind.\"","\"I'll state it after the matter is settled,\" Qi Quan said.","Fu Jiuchong: \"...\"","You seem quite certain that this will succeed.","Qi Quan never fought a battle she wasn't sure of winning.","She said, \"If you trust me, Mr. Fu, we can begin right after the coming-of-age ceremony concludes.\"","Fu Jiuchong: ???","Are you in such a hurry?"]},{"number":53,"title":"Chapter 53","paragraphs":["After Qi Quan was invited upstairs, the banquet hall buzzed with heated discussion.","\"Is she... is she really Senior Qi?!\"","\"Someone of her stature, why would she come?\"","\"Yes, I truly never expected to see her here today!\"","\"Wuwuwu, how is she so perfect?\"","\"How on earth did the Fu family manage to invite her?\"","It wasn't that they looked down on the Fu family, but such were the unspoken rules.","If today were the birthday of the Fu family head, the leaders of various sects and the heads of prominent families would likely have come to offer congratulations.","But this was merely the coming-of-age ceremony for the Fu family's young lady.","Those leaders and family heads were all Fu Luanfei's seniors; they wouldn't come in person, only sending their elite disciples with gifts, which was already giving considerable face.","In their minds, Qi Quan was on par with these grand figures, even a presence surpassing them.","Such a titan shouldn't have appeared here.","As Fu Luanfei led Su Nuanuan downstairs, many people gathered around her.","\"How did you manage to invite her?\"","\"Oh my, if Senior Qi could attend my birthday party, I would surely die of happiness!\"","\"So jealous.\"","\"Wuwuwu, when will Senior Qi come down again? I want to see her a few more times.\"","\"Me too, she looked so incredibly beautiful today!\"","Amidst her helplessness, Fu Luanfei felt a secret thrill.","In the past, it was always others benefiting from their association with the Fu family; the Fu family had never basked in someone else's glory.","Admittedly, this feeling was novel and somewhat exhilarating.","\"Hehehe, Sister Quan attended my birthday party before too. Back then, I was just like you, surrounded by people asking all sorts of questions,\" Su Nuanuan whispered close to her ear.","At that time, Qi Quan had saved three top-tier second-generation heirs and was a benefactor to the Su family, giving her a transcendent status within Longjiang City.","But that was only among ordinary people.","Now, Qi Quan had become a transcendent existence within the entire mystical world.","Su Nuanuan felt immensely proud by association.","The two young women, sharing this similar experience, smiled in unison.","In truth, today's birthday banquet was merely a pretext.","If the Fu family had specifically and separately invited Qi Quan, it would have undoubtedly drawn others' attention. Using the birthday banquet as an excuse made it much more reasonable.","Of course, some might wonder why a titan would attend a young girl's coming-of-age ceremony, but even if suspicious, they wouldn't investigate deeply.","Perhaps the titan simply enjoyed attending such occasions.","A short while later, it was time for the ceremony.","Under everyone's anticipation, Qi Quan reappeared in the banquet hall, accompanied by the Fu family head, Fu Jiuchong.","Fu Jiuchong was quite reticent in public.","If it were another family's father, he might have given a lengthy speech on stage, expressing wishes and hopes for his daughter's future.","He did not.","He only said one sentence.","\"Fu Luanfei, a fourth-level, second-rank Celestial Master, my only daughter. From today onward, she is an adult. She is officially the heir of our Fu family.\"","That was it.","The crowd: ???","While this was a foregone conclusion, announcing it so hastily and abruptly like that—was it really appropriate?","The system remarked with feeling: 【Is he giving his final instructions?】","Qi Quan: 【Yes.】","【He's a real man!】","Qi Quan thought so too.","A family head with cultivation reaching the seventh level, willing to risk himself for a sister who suffered a tragic accident many years ago... he was indeed worthy of respect.","Fu Luanfei was also a bit stunned.","Prior to this, she had been completely unaware of this matter.","\"Dad?\" Her voice softened, as if that could negate the suspicion growing in her heart.","Fu Luanfei only knew that saving her aunt required three trustworthy eighth-level Celestial Masters and sufficient spiritual energy; she was unaware of the final condition.","But now she guessed something.","She stared intently at Fu Jiuchong, waiting for his answer.","Meeting her questioning gaze, Fu Jiuchong did not deny it. His eyes conveyed reassurance as he said, \"You stay here and entertain the guests. I'll go attend to Senior Qi.\"","\"Dad!\" Fu Luanfei grabbed his wrist. \"I can't handle it alone. I need you here.\"","Fu Jiuchong sighed softly and said, \"I believe in you. I taught you myself, after all.\"","He paused. \"Believe in me, and believe in Senior Qi.\"","Fu Luanfei understood very clearly that this matter had been buried in her father's heart for nearly twenty years; he would not abandon it halfway.","She felt lost and helpless now.","She didn't know what to say.","Try to persuade Dad not to go? The words wouldn't come.","But after hearing her father's words, she couldn't just stand by and watch him walk into danger.","Father and daughter understood each other well.","Fu Jiuchong said quietly, \"I've told you before, this matter is very important.\"","This wasn't just about saving Fu Jiuge; it was also about uncovering the truth of what happened back then.","A terrifying enemy lurked in the shadows, and they had to root him out.","Fu Luanfei understood his meaning.","She was momentarily dazed, then slowly released Fu Jiuchong's wrist.","Fu Jiuchong took a final look at her and left the banquet hall with Qi Quan.","In the eyes of the guests, it appeared to be a scene of a daughter reluctant to let her father go, and a father encouraging his daughter to grow up and become independent.","They smiled understandingly, unaware that within the Fu family's secluded backyard, an isolation array had already been set up.","On the way to the backyard, Fu Jiuchong shed his public reticence. As if making a final account, he revealed the events of the past to Qi Quan.","\"Actually, evil Celestial Masters have always existed. It's not that the mystical world hasn't cracked down on them.\"","Qi Quan nodded.","She had heard about this from Qin Ruo. Ten years ago, when Qin Ruo first entered the mystical world, evil cultivators were being suppressed, like rats scurrying in dark sewers.","Of course, this timeframe was based on Qin Ruo's own experience.","The mystical world's campaign against evil cultivators likely began even earlier.","\"Over twenty years ago, Jiuge was also part of the team hunting evil cultivators. She uncovered a lead, left a letter, and hurried away from home. For a long time, there was no news of her.\"","Fu Jiuchong's voice grew hoarse and heavy. \"It was nearly a year later that we found her. By then, she had become mentally impaired, her spiritual power completely depleted, and her dantian almost destroyed.\"","The system whimpered: 【So tragic!】","\"We desperately tried to save her, barely managing to preserve her dantian. However...\" He smiled bitterly. \"...the family discovered she had given birth.\"","Qi Quan: ?","The system was shocked: 【What's going on?! So Ling Sheng's mother left home not pregnant, but was found having given birth to a child, and that child is Ling Sheng?】","Qi Quan instinctively glanced at Ling Sheng.","The young man's expression was calm, as if the matter being discussed had nothing to do with him.","\"Later, we learned she was already pregnant when she left home.\"","Qi Quan: ??","The system: 【Ah, this... plot twist.】","The system: 【Wait, was Ling Sheng's mother married...?】","\"That missing child is likely my brother-in-law's,\" Fu Jiuchong said.","The system: 【...Could you please not talk in such breathless bursts?】","Qi Quan asked, \"What about Mr. Fu's brother-in-law?\"","\"The day before Jiuge left home, my brother-in-law received another assignment and went on a business trip to Longhu City. Later, he suddenly lost contact and was never heard from again. Back then, a servant cleaning up found a pregnancy test in the trash and told us. That's how we knew Jiuge was pregnant when she left.\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She did want to clarify Ling Sheng's origins, but Fu Jiuchong proactively telling her all this—what was his intention?","\"Senior Qi,\" the man with a sorrowful expression suddenly stopped and said solemnly, \"If something happens to me...\"","Qi Quan interrupted him, \"Mr. Fu, are you entrusting your orphan to me on your deathbed?\"","Fu Jiuchong: \"...\"","\"Miss Fu is intelligent and wise, and she has the support of the elders. You don't need to be so pessimistic.\"","\"But Jiuge's child,\" Fu Jiuchong said with shame, \"I don't know if he's alive or dead, nor do I know where he is, but I sense he is still alive. Presumably, the evil cultivators want to use him as a bargaining chip or hostage.\"","\"I know the official authorities are bound to crack down on the evil cultivators. You are the Chief Consultant for the official side. If one day, you encounter Jiuge's child, could you look after him a little?\"","He had never met his nephew and couldn't use mystic arts to divine his whereabouts. Since his nephew was still alive, he also couldn't use his sister's hair for guidance.","Qi Quan sighed softly: [He thinks really far ahead.]","System: [He's a good man. But how does he know you'll recognize the child's identity if you meet him?]","[As long as I see Fu Jiuge today, I can tell from her facial features.]","[Oh, right.]","Qi Quan said calmly, \"Mr. Fu, let's start the treatment early. Don't waste any more time.\"","Fu Jiuchong: \"...\"","The three of them arrived at a secluded courtyard.","The courtyard was set with an array. Inside, two Level 8 Celestial Masters were already waiting—one a male Celestial Master in his thirties, and the other a female Celestial Master around thirty.","Of course, they only appeared to be in their thirties.","Both Celestial Masters' gazes fell upon Qi Quan.","They had heard of Qi Quan, and while they initially had some doubts, seeing her now completely dispelled them.","They actually couldn't gauge her depth!","Fu Jiuchong said respectfully, \"Greetings to both Elders. Thank you for your trouble.\"","\"That girl Jiuge is pitiful,\" the female Celestial Master said. \"We also want her to be freed from her suffering soon.\"","The male Celestial Master said solemnly, \"Let's begin.\"","The group entered the room together.","\"Wait,\" the female Celestial Master suddenly noticed Ling Sheng. \"Who is he?\"","Why does he have such a low presence?","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She had indeed placed talismans on Ling Sheng to conceal his constitution, but it shouldn't make him this unnoticeable.","Could it be Ling Sheng's own skill?","Because he was a Natural Spirit Body, he could perfectly blend with his surroundings, reducing his presence?","She said, \"My assistant.\"","The two Celestial Masters: ???","What? You need to bring an assistant for spellcasting?","Qi Quan took her bag back from Ling Sheng, pulling out many spirit talismans brimming with spiritual energy. She said, \"During the spellcasting, if spiritual energy runs low, my assistant can replenish it.\"","Of course, the spirit talismans were both a backup and a cover.","She just wanted Ling Sheng to see his mother.","Fu Jiuchong: ?","He asked, \"Did you know this would happen all along?\"","Otherwise, why would she bring a bag full of spirit talismans just to attend a birthday banquet?","Wait, that's a whole bag!","...","If he wasn't mistaken, those talismans were all Level 6 or above!","Since when have high-level spirit talismans become so common?","The calm expressions of the two Celestial Masters also cracked slightly.","Qi Quan: \"No, it's just a habit when going out.\"","The three of them: \"...\"","After a moment of silence, the five of them stepped into the room.","Inside, a woman with excellent bone structure lay on a low couch.","\"Bone structure\" was all one could say, as she was terribly emaciated.","Although the Fu family had repaired her dantian for her, it was only a patchwork job, not fully healed.","If not for the trace of spiritual energy nourishing her body, Fu Jiuge would likely have passed away long ago after all these years.","Qi Quan spoke calmly, \"Let's begin.\"","The female Celestial Master immediately began setting up the array.","Using a forbidden technique required a special array. She had studied it for many years and was extremely proficient in its setup.","After the array was set, the male Celestial Master took out a stack of top-grade jade talismans and placed them around the array stones.","As long as the spiritual energy within the jade talismans didn't run out, the forbidden technique array would not fail.","Fu Jiuchong lay down beside Fu Jiuge.","Qi Quan and the two Celestial Masters sat in three positions around them.","Ling Sheng remained outside the array.","His gaze stayed fixed on Qi Quan.","The forbidden technique was activated.","Under the spellcasting of Qi Quan and the two Celestial Masters, Fu Jiuchong's living soul drifted out of his body. To keep the living soul strong in both reason and power, the three Celestial Masters had to establish a connection between the living soul and Fu Jiuchong's spiritual platform.","This was a crucial part of the forbidden technique, and no mistakes could be allowed.","The three of them formed seals at Fu Jiuchong's spiritual platform.","The forbidden seals were extremely complex and precise, requiring the casting Celestial Masters' full concentration without the slightest lapse.","However, this wasn't difficult for Qi Quan.","Celestial Masters capable of cultivating to Level 8 naturally possessed far greater focus than ordinary people. The other two Celestial Masters weren't struggling too much either.","But forming the seals required an immense amount of spiritual energy.","The spiritual energy of the forbidden technique array was being rapidly consumed. The spirit talismans beside the array stones were dwindling.","Before this, the Fu family had never performed such a forbidden technique. They didn't know exactly how much spiritual energy it would require, so they had taken out all the spirit talismans the Fu family had stored away.","Piles of spirit talismans turned to ash.","Qi Quan could clearly feel that the initially abundant spiritual power was gradually becoming thin and weak.","Finally, the forbidden seals were completed.","Fu Jiuchong's living soul was suddenly infused with vitality. The living soul floated in the air, smiled at the three of them, bowed, and without hesitation, entered Fu Jiuge's brow.","After entering Fu Jiuge's brow, he needed to find the barrier she had once erected to seal herself off. Only by shattering that barrier could her memories and consciousness fully return.","Qi Quan and the two Celestial Masters continuously channeled spiritual power into the forbidden seals.","Each time the living soul struck the barrier, the spiritual power on the forbidden seals sharply decreased. The three had to keep infusing spiritual energy without stop.","The glow of the forbidden technique array gradually dimmed.","The stockpiled spirit talismans were about to be completely exhausted.","Just as the two Celestial Masters prepared to exhaust their own spiritual power, the array suddenly blazed with light again! The spiritual energy flowing into the forbidden seals tripled!","Right, there was an assistant outside the array!","Ling Sheng stared unblinkingly at the array. Seeing its glow dim, he threw out a stack of spirit talismans, landing them beside the array stones.","He couldn't see clearly what was happening inside. His fingers tightly clutched Qi Quan's bag, which was filled with talismans, yet a sense of unease still grew in his heart.","...","He didn't know if all this would be enough.","Inside the array, Qi Quan was still relatively at ease, while the other two Celestial Masters gradually showed signs of fatigue.","Maintaining such intense focus and precise control for so long was becoming difficult even for Celestial Masters accustomed to long periods of quiet cultivation.","During her last advancement at the Lu residence, Qi Quan's comprehension of the world's spiritual energy and laws had become more detailed and accurate. Her control over spiritual power far surpassed the other two, so the process of drawing spiritual energy from the array and channeling it into the forbidden seals was much easier for her.","With Ling Sheng's support, the array's glow never faded.","Fu Jiuchong's living soul relentlessly struck the barrier.","A living soul could only wield a tiny fraction of the original body's power. Even though he was a Level 7 Celestial Master, facing the barrier erected by Fu Jiuge, a Level 4 Celestial Master, it was still very hard to break through in one go.","He knew very well that the stored spiritual energy was limited. He had to break through the barrier as quickly as possible to find Jiuge's consciousness.","The spirit talismans in Ling Sheng's hands were also dwindling.","The barrier still hadn't shattered. The two Level 8 Celestial Masters frowned slightly, feeling the situation was developing unfavorably.","Qi Quan reminded them in a low voice, \"Focus.\"","The two immediately cast aside their worries and continued controlling the flow of spiritual energy into the forbidden seals.","Fu Jiuchong desperately battered against the barrier again and again!","He could no longer care about the damage to his soul, each impact more forceful than the last.","Finally—","A crack appeared in the barrier.","He rushed towards it with elation, only to find his connection to the spiritual platform suddenly weaken.","He realized his spiritual energy was nearly exhausted!","Outside the formation, Ling Sheng had emptied his bag of all spirit talismans.","The formation's glow dimmed abruptly. Qi Quan and the two Celestial Masters clearly sensed the spiritual energy becoming thin.","\"The barrier is cracked; we cannot stop halfway!\" The female Celestial Master resolutely drew spiritual energy from her own body.","The male Celestial Master did the same.","Qi Quan remained impassive. Compared to the river-like spiritual power of the other two, her spiritual power was more like a vast, boundless ocean.","The two Celestial Masters felt a surge of relief in their hearts.","Thankfully, the family head had managed to invite such a divine being!","Even if they had sought help from other eight-level Celestial Masters from different families or sects, none could match Senior Qi Quan's capabilities, and their trustworthiness couldn't be guaranteed either.","With the eight-level Celestial Masters' spiritual power flowing into the forbidden seal, Fu Jiuchong's life soul regained strength. He strained to batter the crack, which grew larger and larger, on the verge of shattering completely—","The connection weakened again!","Even piles of spirit talismans couldn't sustain it for long. The spiritual energy reserves of the eight-level Celestial Masters themselves were insufficient for the consumption of the forbidden technique.","The two eight-level Celestial Masters had completely depleted their spiritual power.","Only Qi Quan remained.","They watched her nervously, silently praying in their hearts that she could hold on until the end, until the barrier was broken, until Jiuge returned.","No matter how vast the spiritual energy within Qi Quan's body was, it was not infinite.","Soon, she too was about to face the brink of exhaustion.","The formation, losing its spiritual power support, gradually dimmed until its glow was almost extinguished. Through the now-thin formation shield, Ling Sheng watched Qi Quan's spiritual energy output grow increasingly faint.","He remembered Qi Quan's warning not to reveal his constitution in front of others.","But he also knew clearly that Qi Quan did not want the forbidden technique to fail.","Ling Sheng's face was expressionless, but a trace of anxiety flickered in his eyes.","He glanced at the other two Celestial Masters who were resting, his gaze gradually darkening, a faint gray spiritual energy shimmering in his palm.","This spiritual energy would instantly plunge people into a deep sleep.","Just then, Qi Quan suddenly opened her eyes. A surge of immense spiritual power poured entirely into the forbidden seal...","Perfectly synchronized with Fu Jiuchong's life soul striking the barrier.","Boom—","The barrier shattered abruptly.","Fu Jiuchong immediately probed deep into the spiritual platform, finding the slumbering Fu Jiuge.","Fu Jiuge's soul was damaged and required spiritual energy to awaken.","Now, only Qi Quan was left!","The two Celestial Masters stared intently at Qi Quan. They knew well that the last powerful strike had likely drained Qi Quan's spiritual power completely.","Ling Sheng pressed his lips tightly together.","At such a critical moment, knocking out those two would be utterly inappropriate.","How could he help Qi Quan?","The young man closed his eyes, his fingers digging deeply into the surface of his bag, leaving deep marks.","He understood Qi Quan's purpose in agreeing to the Fu family's request was to sever the karmic ties between him and the Fu family.","The young man suddenly opened his eyes, determination flashing within them.","He tried to open his mouth, his voice as faint as a mosquito's hum, barely audible.","\"Grant... her... power!\"","With each word, his face grew paler. By the time the last syllable fell, a trickle of blood suddenly overflowed from the corner of his mouth. He staggered back, bumping into a solid table with a muffled groan.","In the vast, mysterious heights of the sky, a faint golden light seemed to appear.","Torrential spiritual energy poured entirely into Qi Quan's body!","Qi Quan seemed to sense something, glancing sideways at the young man outside the formation, pale and spitting blood. Her heart trembled slightly.","As the spiritual power flooded into her, she seemed to feel the power of laws from a distant, lofty realm.","That was...","She opened her eyes wide in surprise.","Abundant spiritual energy infused the forbidden seal, maintaining the operation of the forbidden technique.","But Qi Quan had no more attention to spare for Fu Jiuchong.","She remembered what Ling Sheng had once told her.","—He could not speak.","Within the Mystic Arts, there were paths of the sword, talismans, formations, and many obscure methods, but one existed only in legends, extremely rare.","This legendary method was known as—","Word-Soul.","The language of a Word-Soul Master could kill, but it could also save.","Yet such a powerful method surely came with restrictions.","Before Word-Soul Masters fully mastered the laws, they could not speak lightly. Even if they spoke, it could only be about trivial matters.","If the words spoken exceeded the laws they controlled, they would suffer backlash from those laws.","When Qi Quan's spiritual power was nearly exhausted, with her hearing sharper than that of the two eight-level Celestial Masters, she faintly caught a whisper.","She initially thought it was an auditory hallucination, but upon receiving the sudden influx of spiritual energy, she suddenly remembered.","The other two hadn't spoken, so the speaker could only be Ling Sheng.","His current state was clearly the result of backlash from Word-Soul laws.","Qi Quan couldn't help but increase the intensity of the spiritual energy she channeled.","Finally—","Fu Jiuchong awakened Fu Jiuge.","With the aid of the innate spiritual energy, the forbidden technique was successfully completed!","Qi Quan could no longer concern herself with Fu Jiuchong and Fu Jiuge. She rose and walked over to Ling Sheng, feeling both helpless and deeply moved.","In truth, she still had reserves, enough for Fu Jiuchong to awaken Fu Jiuge.","The strongest strike she gave Fu Jiuchong had only exhausted the spiritual energy in her dantian. At the Human Sovereign realm, she could store spiritual energy not only in her dantian but also in her meridians.","But Ling Sheng didn't know that.","He only saw her nearing depletion and...","For that, he did not hesitate to invoke Word-Soul laws beyond his control.","Qi Quan took the young man's hand. Abundant spiritual power poured into Ling Sheng's body, gradually soothing the injuries from the backlash.","She also used a cleansing technique to wipe the blood from the corner of his mouth.","The other two Celestial Masters were focused on the condition of Fu Jiuchong and Fu Jiuge and didn't notice this side.","Ling Sheng's face was pale, but the corners of his mouth were lifted high, his amber eyes burning brightly as he looked at her.","Qi Quan smiled and said, \"Let's go home.\"","Her expression remained calm, but beneath the calm surface of the lake, ripples had already begun to form.","Ling Sheng nodded and followed her.","\"Wait a moment.\"","An extremely hoarse voice sounded, rough from years of disuse, vocal cords unaccustomed to speech.","Qi Quan turned around.","A woman with thick, dark hair sat up from the low couch. Though her face was pale and she was skin and bones, she still carried the grace of her youth.","Having lost her senses for so long, the moment she regained consciousness, an intense feeling arose within her.","Her gaze shifted from Qi Quan to Ling Sheng.","Qi Quan raised an eyebrow.","It was normal for a mother and child to share a connection; the intuition of cultivators was even sharper.","Though they hadn't seen each other for nearly twenty years, the bond of blood could not be severed.","Fu Jiuge quietly gazed at Ling Sheng.","But Ling Sheng only looked at Qi Quan.","The entire room fell into an inexplicable silence.","Qi Quan pondered: Fu Jiuge was Ling Sheng's mother. If she wanted Ling Sheng to stay with the Fu family, should she be the one to play the villain?","\"Jiuge, what's wrong?\" Fu Jiuchong's life soul had returned. Seeing Fu Jiuge awake, he was overjoyed, but her expression worried him.","Fu Jiuge came back to herself and looked at Qi Quan again. Her smile was stiff from years of unused muscles, but the sincerity in her eyes was unmistakable.","\"Thank you for saving me.\"","Her gaze did not linger on Ling Sheng again.","Qi Quan stood at the doorway, locking eyes with her for several seconds. Two extraordinarily beautiful women instantly reached a silent understanding.","Ling Sheng's identity would not be revealed.","He would continue to follow Qi Quan, completely becoming a member of the Lakeside Villa.","\"No need for thanks.\" Qi Quan turned and left.","Fu Jiuchong hurriedly said, \"Senior Qi, I am a man of my word. What was the condition you mentioned earlier?\"","Qi Quan had already walked out of the courtyard, her soft, low voice drifting over.","\"The condition has already been met, Mr. Fu. We are even.\"","Fu Jiuchong: ???","Front courtyard banquet hall.","The guests had already dispersed. Fu Luanfei looked at the empty room, feeling a sour, swelling ache in her heart.","She quietly curled up on a sofa in the corner.","Su Nuanuan had stayed behind to wait for Qi Quan. Seeing her sorrowful expression, she squatted down in front of her and asked worriedly, \"I could see you were forcing a smile earlier. Did something happen?\"","\"It's nothing.\" Fu Luanfei forced herself to perk up and asked, \"You haven't left yet?\"","\"No, I'm waiting for Sister Quan.\"","Hearing \"Sister Quan,\" Fu Luanfei couldn't help but feel a jolt of energy.","She immediately straightened up and said, \"Can you tell me about Senior Qi? She's so powerful, surely nothing is difficult for her, right?\"","\"I don't know about that.\" Su Nuanuan said proudly, \"But I do know that if Sister Quan is willing to take action, she must be confident of success!\"","She keenly sensed that Fu Luanfei was nervous, and what she was nervous about was related to Sister Quan.","Fu Luanfei's eyes brightened slightly: \"Really?\"","\"Actually, I don't know much about your mystic world affairs, and I don't know the specific situation. But before, Sister Quan wrote about some martial arts tournament in 'The Diary of a Wealthy Family,' and you went. You even showed me photos others took. Since so many people admire Sister Quan, something very exciting must have happened that day, right?\"","Fu Luanfei thought of that day when Qi Quan effortlessly controlled the self-destruction of a Level Seven Celestial Master. Instantly, she felt a surge of strength pour through her body.","She is so powerful, so unfathomable.","She definitely can—","A tall figure suddenly stepped into the banquet hall.","Fu Luanfei stood up abruptly, her voice hoarse and strained, her expression anxious as she asked, \"Senior Qi, how did it go?\"","Qi Quan was still wearing her black evening gown, her fair skin glowing like jade under the lights.","Like a powerful yet gentle elder, she said calmly, \"There's no need to worry.\"","The heavy stone in Fu Luanfei's heart instantly fell away.","She looked at Qi Quan with gratitude, bowed deeply, her eyes slightly warm.","\"This junior will never forget your great kindness and virtue!\"","Qi Quan smiled slightly. \"No need.\"","She looked at Su Nuanuan. \"Let's go back.\"","Su Nuanuan: \"Alrighty! Goodbye, Luanfei!\"","Fu Luanfei watched their departing figures, lowered her head to wipe away a tear, then turned and ran towards the backyard.","In the car on the way back.","Shen Hui was driving, Ling Sheng sat in the passenger seat, while Qi Quan and Su Nuanuan sat side by side in the back.","Having just performed the forbidden technique, she was somewhat mentally fatigued. Qi Quan leaned against the seat and closed her eyes to rest.","[Host, this mission felt a bit dangerous.] The system finally found a chance to speak.","Qi Quan: [How so?]","[Look, you used a forbidden technique and ended up with no spiritual energy left in your body. Even without Ling Sheng, you could have held on until the last moment, but at the moment your spiritual energy was exhausted, if someone had taken the chance to attack you, wouldn't you have had no way to resist?]","Qi Quan: ...","She said helplessly, [Do you have some misunderstanding about me?]","[Huh?]","[Even if I exhaust my spiritual power, no one present could harm me.]","[Why?]","Qi Quan: [Level Eight Protective Talisman.]","System: !!!","The supreme expert is still the supreme expert. It was naive.","Qi Quan: [And one Level Eight Retribution Talisman.]","System: [What's a Retribution Talisman?]","[If someone attacks me, they will suffer double the retribution.]","System: Amazing, my host!","It shouldn't have doubted the host's life-preserving methods.","Back at the villa, Qi Quan instructed Shen Hui: \"We return to Longjiang City tomorrow.\"","Shen Hui immediately agreed and began packing.","Su Nuanuan felt very reluctant. \"I wish Sister Quan lived in Longjing.\"","\"Your home is in Longjiang too.\" Qi Quan said with a smile.","Su Nuanuan: \"Oh, right!\"","After graduation, she would go back to work in Longjiang City.","Qi Quan went upstairs to her room, taking Ling Sheng with her.","She sat on the small sofa, looked at the still pale-faced young man, and asked, \"Is your injury better?\"","Ling Sheng nodded, half-knelt before her, tentatively reached out his hand, fingertips exuding wisps of spiritual energy, gently brushing against the back of Qi Quan's hand.","The spiritual energy was smooth, without any sense of obstruction.","It seemed he was indeed almost recovered.","Qi Quan said, \"You never speak because you know your words have the power of verbal incantation?\"","Ling Sheng nodded again.","Before fully mastering the laws of verbal incantation, he could not speak lightly. The more he spoke, the more the power of his incantations would diminish.","Things are always more valuable the rarer they are.","The system sighed: [Ling Sheng's constitution is almost breaking the rules. How much merit must he have accumulated over lifetimes? Probably even more than Ji Shengzhe's, right? But it might also have been bought with the suffering of his first nearly twenty years.]","Qi Quan: ...","She ruffled the young man's hair, receiving a pleased response from him, which lightened her mood considerably.","\"Go back and rest.\"","Ling Sheng seemed somewhat reluctant, but still obeyed Qi Quan's words and left. However, before going out the door, he turned back to look at Qi Quan once more.","Qi Quan: ...","He did look a bit pitiful, but she still had important matters to attend to.","Qi Quan stood up and walked towards the computer room.","The system knew she was tired today and, for once, didn't urge her to write and update. Who would have thought she would take the initiative to turn on the computer.","It was extremely surprised: [Host, are you going to write?]","Qi Quan: [Mm.]","System: Suddenly feels like manna from heaven.","The Fu Residence.","Fu Luanfei rushed to the backyard. Seeing her father completely unharmed and her aunt restored to clarity, she was so excited her eyes reddened.","She called softly, \"Aunt.\"","Fu Jiuge smiled, a touch of charm gathering at the corners of her eyes, her voice low and hoarse as she said, \"Big brother just told me about you. I was thinking Luanfei must be both beautiful and spirited. I wasn't wrong.\"","Fu Luanfei was amused.","She had never interacted with her aunt while she was lucid. This was their first formal meeting, and with just one glance, she felt an infinite fondness.","\"Jiuge, I plan to tell the Investigation Department about what happened back then.\" Fu Jiuchong said solemnly.","He had already briefly explained the current state of the mystic world to Fu Jiuge.","Fu Luanfei said without hesitation, \"The mystic world has been in chaos for so long. With just our family's strength, we cannot shake those evil cultivators. Cooperating with the authorities is indeed the best choice.\"","She paused, \"However, the fact that I gave birth, let's not mention that for now.\"","\"Alright.\" Fu Jiuchong agreed, then asked hesitantly, \"And your husband...\"","Fu Jiuge's expression turned sorrowful. \"It's unlikely he's alive. But we made a Dao Companion pact. I can sense that his soul still exists.\"","\"We will definitely find him.\" Fu Jiuchong said gravely.","The Su Family Villa.","After finishing a chapter and putting it in the draft box, Qi Quan received a message on her phone.","[Li Guoyan: Fu Jiuge has woken up.]","Qi Quan's mind stirred. If the Investigation Department had only received news of Fu Jiuge's awakening, Li Guoyan wouldn't have specifically mentioned it to her.","[Li Guoyan: She proactively explained the case from that year to the Investigation Department. The case is related to the bloody pills you asked about before.]","Qi Quan was slightly surprised: [She found a clue?]","[Li Guoyan: Yes. She followed the clue to Longhu City, but unfortunately, she was ambushed, seriously injured, and went into hiding. She was discovered by a Buddhist cultivator who took her away.]","The system exclaimed in shock: [It's Ding Ji! So that's how Ling Sheng fell into Ding Ji's hands!]","Everything connected!","[Li Guoyan: That Buddhist cultivator was likely a peripheral member of the evil cultivator organization. His cultivation wasn't high, but he knew many forbidden techniques. He wanted to perform a soul-searching technique on Fu Jiuge to obtain more information and curry favor with his superiors. Fu Jiuge had no choice but to choose self-sealing. By the time the Fu family found her, she was in a village in Longhu City, taken in by a kind elderly couple.]","Qi Quan understood.","Ding Ji, having failed to get what he wanted, was naturally unwilling. But with the situation tense back then, it was inconvenient for him to travel with a woman. Learning she was pregnant, he... abandoned her with a kind-hearted family.","Once the child was born, he would have two hostages.","Two hostages are always more valuable than one.","But he never expected that Fu Jiuge's child would be a natural-born spirit body.","The child was born with immense spiritual energy.","Ding Ji was overjoyed.","Harboring selfish motives, he kept this a secret. Leveraging the advantages of the natural-born spirit body, he quickly became a high-level Celestial Master.","Having tasted the sweetness, he naturally became even more unwilling to let go.","After obtaining the child, he originally planned to kill the now-useless Fu Jiuge. But the Fu family soon investigated, forcing him to flee with the child in haste.","Moreover, if Fu Jiuge died, the Fu family would certainly seek furious revenge. It was better to let them rescue a mentally incapacitated person. While they busied themselves treating Fu Jiuge, they would have less energy to pursue the child's whereabouts.","Ding Ji succeeded.","He used Ling Sheng as a tool for storing spiritual power, from the moment of birth, for a full nineteen years.","The system was heartbroken: [Wahhh... trapped in a cave since birth, for nineteen years! Boss, when you performed the soul-searching technique on Ding Ji, it was truly fate's design! Dealing with such an evil person, an eye for an eye is the way!]","Qi Quan replied to Li Guoyan: [Understood.]","[Li Guoyan: I plan to send investigators to Longhu City to uncover the truth.]","Qi Quan: [Good.]","The system was somewhat worried: [Twenty years have passed. The clues are probably long gone, right?]","[Not necessarily.]","The system: [Does the boss have any insights?]","Qi Quan: [If I remember correctly, the \"true heiress's\" adoptive parents are from Longhu City.]","[!!!]","The system said in shock: [So, this Longhu City was likely once a major den for evil cultivators!]","To suppress the true heiress's fortune, the evil cultivators deliberately orchestrated the baby-switch. They certainly wouldn't let the true heiress grow up freely, but rather under their watchful eyes.","Fu Jiuge traced the clues of the bloody pills to Longhu City, suggesting the \"production base\" for the bloody pills was likely in Longhu City.","The two matters converged!","From this, it could be inferred that Longhu City must harbor secrets.","The system asked excitedly: [Then are we going to Longhu City too?]","Qi Quan: [No.]","At 10 PM, readers waiting for \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family\" finally refreshed to see a new chapter.","[The dark energy in the southwest has dissipated, faintly revealing a sense of righteous aura.","My business trip task ends here.","It suddenly occurred to me that this is my first time on a business trip here.","Since I'm here, might as well visit the famous scenic spots.","The scenic area was packed with people, a sea of dark heads at a glance.","What you see isn't the scenery, just a mass of heads.","But from another perspective, watching the crowd has its own unique flavor.","Everyone's facial features are unique.","I've read many people's faces, but always when clients came to me voluntarily, seeing one or a few faces at a time. I've never tried observing dozens or even hundreds of faces flowing past at once.","All kinds of faces flowed before my eyes.","At a glance, most were ordinary faces, destined for a mundane life without major upheavals, with occasional minor mishaps being normal.","A few faces were more interesting.","Not far away, a young couple argued in low voices, both faces etched with irritability and impatience. Yet, judging by their features, their feelings for each other were deep, destined to grow old together.","...","Another young couple appeared intimate, but the young man's features showed rampant peach blossom luck, while the young woman's features revealed coldness and greed. It was not a good match.","Suddenly, my gaze was drawn to a middle-aged couple.","The man shielded his wife as they moved with the crowd. The wife held a lovely child in her arms, the child's sleeping face flushed with an eerie redness—","Wait.","Judging by their features, this couple had no blood relation to the child!","This couple's features were sinister, venomous, and cold-blooded, far from being good people.","My heart tightened.","Channeling spiritual energy to my eyes, I saw even more clearly!","Behind them surged a towering black energy, rolling with endless resentment. I could even hear the eerie laughter of children.","Under the bright daylight, a chill ran through me.","They were human traffickers!","No, they weren't just traffickers; they were executioners.","Their hands were stained with the blood of countless children!","If they were just traffickers for money, why kill so many children?","I immediately called the police.","The police arrived quickly, taking them to the station. The child's parents rushed over anxiously, trembling with fear.","This child was saved.","But what about all the other innocent, abducted children?","What suffering are they enduring right now?]","The new chapter ended.","Di Meng put down his phone.","He had been assigned and was traveling overnight to Longhu City to investigate the bloody pills case.","The investigator beside him asked, \"Captain Di, was the boss hinting at something?\"","Di Meng said with a grave expression, \"Remember the Fang Lan case? Perhaps the bloody pills are related to these abducted children.\"","If her guess was correct, then the mastermind was truly devoid of conscience.","Hearing this, the investigator's face also changed abruptly.","After a moment, he asked quietly, \"By writing this chapter now, isn't the boss afraid of alerting the enemy?\"","Weren't they going to investigate the bloody pills? If they alerted the other side and they fled, what then?","Di Meng chuckled, \"A criminal organization that could hide for over twenty years... Sending more investigators would be futile. Alerting the enemy might be better.\"","\"Makes sense,\" the investigator said, suddenly enlightened. \"The boss thinks far ahead.\"","Di Meng shared the pride: \"Of course.\"","In the villa, the system was also asking Qi Quan.","[Boss, when you and Ling Sheng were at the scenic spot, did you actually encounter human traffickers? I don't remember that at all?]","Qi Quan: [You said fiction can be fabricated.]","[...]","The system asked again: [But the content of your new chapter is quite obvious. Aren't you afraid those villains will see it?]","[Seeing it is better. After hiding for so many years, it's time for them to make a move.]","System: ...","Respect, boss!"]},{"number":54,"title":"Chapter 54","paragraphs":["A manor in the suburbs of the capital.","The steward hurried to the main house and reported, \"Master, the authorities are setting up supervisory teams in the Heavenly Master associations across various regions. It seems there will be major moves later.\"","The man's hand, which was carving jade, paused.","\"Supervisory teams?\" he sneered coldly. \"Relying on those investigators with their mediocre cultivation?\"","The steward: \"...\"","Well, but... the Investigation Department does have one formidable figure.","He asked in a low voice, \"Master, how should we deal with that Qi Quan?\"","The man raised his head to look at the pitch-black night sky.","\"A Heavenly Master beyond level seven. What do you think we can do?\"","The steward dared not answer.","The man frowned. \"There's one thing I don't understand. She never had any contact with the mystical arts in Longhu City back then. So why, after returning to the Qi family, did her cultivation reach beyond level seven in just three months?\"","\"You once said she is a person of great fortune. Perhaps... she had some special encounter,\" the steward replied.","Hearing this, a surge of violent resentment rose in the man's heart.","\"A person of great fortune? Why? Why do they get such good fortune, while I...\" His hands trembled, jade dust from his fingertips falling onto his trousers. He grabbed the fabric of his pants and pounded it fiercely. \"Why did I end up like this!\"","No matter how hard he struck, his legs remained completely numb.","The steward hunched his back, trembling with fear. \"M-Master, once the new type of pill over there is successfully developed, it... it should be able to cure your legs.\"","\"They've been researching for so many years, not a single pill has been effective. They're all useless!\"","The man's handsome face twisted in distortion. With a sweep, he destroyed all the jade pieces on the table, turning them into fine powder that settled in a layer on the floor.","The steward: \"...\"","Ah, such a waste of money.","It took a while for the man to regain his composure after his fit of rage.","A young servant suddenly came to report, \"Master, we've received news. The Investigation Department might already know about the pills!\"","The man was taken aback. \"How?\"","The servant wasn't sure how to explain. He pulled out his phone and said, \"The White Water True Immortal mentioned human traffickers in the latest chapter of 'The Diary of a Rich Family'!\"","The man: ???","The steward: ???","They could understand each word individually, but the sentence made no sense to them.","The former was solitary and gloomy, spending his days carving jade in the manor. The latter was old-fashioned and rigid. Neither of them read online novels, nor did they even use the internet much. They had no idea what the young servant was talking about.","The servant hurriedly explained, \"It's a novel written by that expert from the Investigation Department. It's mostly based on real cases. In her latest update, she wrote about going to a scenic spot and seeing the sins of child murder on a human trafficker. She even asked in the story why the trafficker had to kill so many children. They think the authorities might already know about the pills.\"","\"They\" referred to the organization's informants, specialized in gathering and collating information.","The man: \"...\"","The steward: \"...\"","They were utterly bewildered.","A Heavenly Master beyond level seven... writing novels?","Are the young cultivators in the mystical arts world these days so... playful?","The man took a deep breath and said, \"Bring me that novel to read.\"","The servant cautiously asked, \"It's serialized online. You can read it on a phone or computer. Should I download the app for you on your phone?\"","The man: \"...Fine.\"","A moment later, the servant installed the software, registered an account, opened the first chapter of \"The Diary of a Rich Family,\" and then withdrew.","The steward followed him out of the room, cleared his throat, and said, \"Download one for me too.\"","The servant: \"...\"","\"The Diary of a Rich Family\" only had a little over ten chapters, each extremely short. The man finished reading quickly and was deeply stunned.","This is a novel?","Having studied ancient texts since childhood and never neglecting his academic studies, he really couldn't bring himself to call \"The Diary of a Rich Family\" a novel.","Of course, bewilderment aside, the servant's words still needed to be taken seriously.","He called the steward back and gave a few instructions.","The steward acknowledged and left.","The next day, Qi Quan got into the car for the return journey. The trunk was stuffed full of Longjing city specialties by Su Nuanuan, Ning Zhi, and the others, making the car feel slightly heavy as it started.","Shen Hui drove as steadily as ever.","Once the car was on the highway, Qi Quan quietly cultivated, and Lingsheng joined her.","The system, gazing at the receding skyline of Longjing City, suddenly sighed. 【Master, are we really leaving just like that?】","Qi Quan: 【You can stay and play a few more days.】","【That's not what I meant,】 the system said. 【Is Lingsheng really cutting all ties with the Fu family like this?】","Qi Quan: 【The karmic debt has indeed been settled.】","The system felt a bit reluctant. 【Actually, was it absolutely necessary to settle it?】","【How so?】","【He's suffered so much since birth. Now that he's found his mother, wouldn't it be better to have one more person who loves him?】","Qi Quan chuckled. 【I never said he couldn't.】","【Huh? But the karmic debt is settled?】","Qi Quan: 【That karmic debt specifically refers to Fu Jiuge's debt of giving him life. Settling the debt means Lingsheng does not need to stay with the Fu family to repay the debt of life, nor does he need to serve the family as a member of the Fu clan. By helping me save Fu Jiuge, he has already repaid the debt of life. As for their mother-son bond, that depends on fate in the future.】","【So that's how it is! Then why didn't you tell the Fu family?】","Qi Quan: 【Fu Jiuge already knows Lingsheng's identity. She doesn't want him to be dragged into those matters. She might not be fully aware of Lingsheng's special constitution, but she instinctively wants to protect her son. The Fu family is a large clan, not a monolithic entity.】","【So from now on, Lingsheng is part of the Lakeside Villa?】","Qi Quan smiled. 【Yes. He's an adult, educated, mentally sound, and knows what he's doing. This is also his own choice.】","Even before contacting the Fu family, she had asked him.","Moreover, given his innate spiritual body constitution, if he returned to the Fu family, it would definitely be exposed. The Fu family couldn't even fully protect Fu Jiuge, let alone protect an innate spiritual body.","Lingsheng had been imprisoned by Ding Ji for nineteen years, only witnessing the cunning and malice of evil cultivators. No one had taught him the ways of the world.","She had raised him to be who he was now and couldn't bear to send him back into a den of shrewd people.","He was more suited to the Lakeside Villa than the intricate web of a powerful family.","The system understood. 【The Lakeside Villa is better indeed.】","Midway through the journey, Shen Hui suddenly spoke up.","\"Senior, the navigation shows the highway ahead is closed. We'll have to get off at the nearest exit and change routes.\"","Qi Quan: \"Alright.\"","The car turned off the highway, entering the area of Longwan City.","Longwan City was a light industrial city, with factories lining the roads and numerous freight trucks on the streets.","Every time a truck passed, it kicked up clouds of dust.","Shen Hui silently switched the air conditioning to recirculation mode.","Unfamiliar with the roads, he followed the navigation, driving relatively slowly. A bit further ahead, they could bypass the construction zone on the highway and get back on from another entrance.","This was the city's outskirts, and it was working hours. There weren't many pedestrians on the roadside, so the view was relatively open. Therefore, when a figure appeared in the distance waving to flag down the car, Shen Hui saw it very clearly.","At first, he didn't pay it much mind. But as they got a little closer, he couldn't help but pause.","That wasn't a person. It was a ghost.","The ghost waving to flag down the car was dressed in ordinary clothes, with a few specks of red paint on them, resembling blood.","He had an average appearance, wore a pair of worn-out sneakers, and his face was pale, bluish-gray, and ashen, wearing a timid, ingratiating smile.","Other drivers on the road couldn't see him, so naturally wouldn't stop.","Shen Hui saw the hitchhiking ghost for the first time and felt curious. He asked Qi Quan, \"Senior, there's a ghost trying to hitch a ride ahead. Should we stop and ask?\"","Qi Quan opened her eyes.","She had sensed the ghostly aura earlier but hadn't planned to intervene. A second-level white ghost didn't require too much attention; they could just let the Longwan City Investigation Department handle it.","However—","She glanced at the hitchhiking ghost's face and changed her mind.","\"Alright.\"","The car slowly pulled over to the side, and the window rolled down.","Shen Hui deliberately suppressed his Taoist master aura. Qi Quan, with her high cultivation level, could control her spiritual energy freely. Lingsheng was wearing a Concealment Talisman and had little presence.","The ghost happily approached the window, seemingly unaware of anything amiss. He bent down to look at Shen Hui and asked, \"Hey man, can I get a ride? Don't worry, I'll definitely pay!\"","Shen Hui: \"...\"","Does this ghost not know he's already dead?","He replied casually, \"Where are you going? I won't take you if it's not on my way.\"","The hitchhiking ghost quickly said, \"I'm going to Longjiang City. My hometown is in Longjiang City. I see your license plate is from Longjiang, so it must be on the way!\"","Shen Hui: What a coincidence?","He became more cautious and added, \"I don't give free rides. It's a three-hour drive from here to Longjiang.\"","\"Don't worry, I'll definitely pay for the ride!\" The hitchhiking ghost's eyes pleaded. \"I've been trying to flag down a car for so long, but none would stop. Can you help me out, man?\"","Shen Hui: \"There are buses from Longwan to Longjiang. Why don't you take one?\"","Hitchhiking ghost: \"I was planning to find a bus, but I just can't seem to leave this area. I don't know what's wrong. Every time I try to walk away, I end up back here.\"","Shen Hui understood. For second-level white ghosts like this one, their spirits usually remain at the place of death after they die. If they don't move on to reincarnation, they are forever trapped there.","Of course, ghosts have their own ways, and there are always exceptions.","Under the guidance of that unknown ghost uncle, Fang Lan successfully returned home as a white ghost and even formed a contract with her younger brother, possessing his body.","Hiss, come to think of it, that powerful ghost uncle is quite extraordinary.","Shen Hui asked, puzzled, \"Since you can't leave, what's the point of getting a ride even if you succeed?\"","\"No, I've heard from older ghosts that if someone is willing to give me a ride, I can leave. Please help me, man. I haven't been home for so many years. I really, really miss home!\"","Shen Hui said with a smile, \"So, you know you're already dead?\"","\"...Yes.\" The hitchhiking ghost looked despondent, but then suddenly remembered something and widened his eyes in surprise. \"Wait, you... you all can see me?! You really can see me! I was so happy earlier I forgot about that!\"","His excited expression was evident.","But as he spoke, he nervously took a step back and whispered, \"You... you all aren't...\"","\"Aren't what?\"","Fear was written in the hitchhiking ghost's eyes. \"Aren't you the legendary Taoist masters?\"","Shen Hui asked with a smile, \"So, do you still want to get in the car?\"","\"You won't capture me, will you?\" The hitchhiking ghost hugged himself uneasily, fingers clutching his clothes. \"I... I'm willing to go for reincarnation. I just want to go home and see my family. Once I'm home, I'll do whatever you say.\"","Shen Hui: \"...\"","He asked, \"How long have you been dead?\"","Hitchhiking ghost: \"I don't know. It feels like many, many years.\"","[Master, didn't you say white ghosts like this can't linger in the mortal world for too long?] The system asked.","...","Qi Quan: [They can if someone helps them.]","She had just glanced at the hitchhiking ghost and sensed the aura of a high-level Taoist master on him—at least eighth rank. The aura was extremely faint. If she weren't beyond the eighth rank herself, she would have had difficulty detecting it.","Shen Hui looked at Qi Quan through the rearview mirror. Their eyes met, and he received an affirmative answer. He then said, \"Fine, we'll give you a ride. Get in.\"","He leaned over and opened the car door.","The hitchhiking ghost hesitantly got into the car.","He didn't dare look back, just huddled in the passenger seat and thanked them sincerely.","The car started moving again.","Shen Hui chatted with him intermittently.","\"Where do you live? I'll set up the GPS.\"","The hitchhiking ghost gave a location, a small town under Longjiang City's jurisdiction.","He said, \"You don't have to take me all the way. I can walk home after I get out.\"","By getting into the car, he had already left the place of his death. Once in Longjiang City, he could float his way home.","Shen Hui said with a smile, \"Alright. But since you're dead, how are you going to pay? I'm driving you back; I can't exactly accept a bunch of spirit money, can I?\"","Hitchhiking ghost: \"...\"","He scratched his head, thought for a moment, and said, \"How about I work for you to pay off the debt!\"","Shen Hui: \"...\"","He asked, speechless, \"What kind of work can a ghost like you do?\"","\"Can't I?\" The hitchhiking ghost scratched his head. \"I heard from other ghosts that one can keep ghost servants.\"","\"Ghost servants can never reincarnate. Are you willing?\" Shen Hui's smile faded slightly.","\"Ah?\" The hitchhiking ghost quickly shook his head. \"Then I'm not willing!\"","Shen Hui glanced at him sideways. \"So, you plan on not paying your debt?\"","\"No, no!\" The hitchhiking ghost frantically waved his hands, afraid Shen Hui would send him back. His pale face looked pained. \"But I really don't know what I can do. I... I...\"","Shen Hui interrupted him: \"How did you die?\"","The hitchhiking ghost paused, then said in a low, hoarse voice, \"I was killed.\"","\"I can tell.\" Shen Hui glanced at the wound on his waist, where blackened bloodstains mixed with red paint. \"I'm asking who killed you?\"","The hitchhiking ghost looked somewhat confused. \"I don't know either. I didn't know them. I just wanted to find a corner to pee... to use the restroom. They saw me and killed me. I really don't know why. I didn't know them at all. Why did they kill me? Why did they kill me...\"","He seemed to fall into the obsession of his death, repeating the question over and over.","Shen Hui paid him no mind. Qi Quan and Lingsheng in the back seat remained silent the whole time.","After a while, the hitchhiking ghost snapped out of it and said apologetically, \"Sorry, did I disturb you just now?\"","Shen Hui: \"Understandable.\"","Hitchhiking ghost: \"...\"","He was silent for a moment, then cautiously asked again, \"Are you really Taoist masters?\"","Shen Hui replied casually, \"What, don't we look like it?\"","\"Not really.\"","Shen Hui: ?","He laughed. \"Tell me, what doesn't look right?\"","The hitchhiking ghost said, \"I've heard from others that Taoist masters capture ghosts on sight, but you didn't.\"","\"You're too naive.\" Shen Hui spoke like a seasoned veteran. \"Every group has good and bad people. By that logic, I could say all ghosts are bad. Do you agree?\"","\"Of course not!\"","Shen Hui: \"Well, there you have it.\"","Hitchhiking ghost: \"...\"","He seemed to understand and said quietly, \"Sorry, I shouldn't have spoken ill of Taoist masters. You are good people.\"","\"Then are you a good ghost?\"","Hitchhiking ghost: \"Of course! I've never harmed anyone!\"","\"But you've played pranks, right?\" Otherwise, he wouldn't be a second-level white ghost.","The hitchhiking ghost hurriedly explained, \"...I didn't do it on purpose. After I died, I was in a daze for a long time. I might have scared some people, but I really didn't mean to.\"","\"Alright, I believe you're a good ghost now. Good ghosts get good karma. So, I won't charge you the fare. Go home, take one last look, and then move on to your next cycle.\"","The Hitchhiking Ghost: \"How can that be? Debts owed in this life must be repaid in the next. I... I want to repay it in this life.\"","He suddenly thought of something and said excitedly, \"I know how to pay the fare!\"","Shen Hui asked with interest, \"How?\"","\"I've heard you exorcists need to capture ghosts to build your track record, to get more cultivation resources. You are an exorcist. If you could capture a powerful Red Ghost or Green Ghost, you'd earn a lot, right?\"","Now Shen Hui was genuinely intrigued.","He asked with a smile, \"So?\"","The Hitchhiking Ghost said, \"I've been around that factory area for many years and heard many stories from out-of-towners. Once I overheard a truck driver chatting with someone. He said there's a village in his area, a really eerie place. Seems like a powerful ghost eats children there. The villagers have to sacrifice a child every year to keep the village safe.\"","System: [There are such evil ghosts! How wicked!]","Qi Quan: ...","\"What place? If even a truck driver has heard of it, surely the Exorcist Association must have taken notice?\" Shen Hui said.","The Hitchhiking Ghost sighed, \"I saw his license plate was from Longhu City, but I don't know if he's actually from there. He said several Taoist priests had gone to that village, but none of them came out. After that, no one dared to go anymore. That ghost must be really powerful.\"","Shen Hui nodded, \"Indeed powerful.\"","\"If you captured such a powerful ghost, wouldn't that be a great achievement?\" the Hitchhiking Ghost said happily. \"Then, would that count as repaying you for the ride?\"","Shen Hui: \"...\"","He said gloomily, \"But I'm from Longjiang City. Longhu City isn't under my jurisdiction.\"","The Hitchhiking Ghost looked disappointed: \"Ah? Really? Then let me think if there are any powerful ghosts in Longjiang City.\"","Shen Hui: \"...\"","Good performance. Don't do it again.","He was certain now. This ghost was a minor underling sent after they had \"stirred the grass to scare the snake.\"","\"Senior, it's noon. There's a service area ahead. Should we stop?\" he asked.","Qi Quan: \"Mm.\"","The car drove into the service area and stopped.","\"Senior, what would you like to eat? I'll go buy it for you,\" Shen Hui turned and asked.","Qi Quan: \"Anything is fine.\"","\"Alright.\"","Shen Hui got out of the car, leaving only two people and one ghost inside.","In the enclosed space of the vehicle, no one spoke, yet the Hitchhiking Ghost felt an invisible pressure bearing down on him, making it hard to breathe.","Of course, he didn't need to breathe; it was just an analogy.","A Level Two White Ghost facing Qi Quan—the level gap was simply too vast. Even without Qi Quan intentionally releasing her aura, he would instinctively shrink his ghostly form.","System: [Big shot, he seems very nervous.]","Qi Quan: [Just a guilty conscience.]","[So what's his purpose?]","[It's me.]","System: [Ah? A Level Two White Ghost? Targeting you? Whose genius idea was that!]","Qi Quan smiled: [They want to lure me to Longhu City.]","The system was puzzled: [That's also genius? Didn't you already display your combat prowess at Guiyuan Sect?]","Who could be so blind!","Qi Quan: [See, you're curious now, aren't you?]","System: [...]","It was about to ask more when suddenly a piercing scream rang out.","\"Give me back my son! Give me back my son! Give me back my... son!\"","A woman's agonized wail reached the parking lot.","Neither Qi Quan nor Lingsheng reacted, but the Hitchhiking Ghost was more curious and peeked out slightly.","There was a commotion in front of the service area building.","Shen Hui returned quickly, frowning as he said, \"Senior, I just asked around. Three days ago, this woman's child went missing at this service area, but the surveillance footage didn't capture anyone taking her child. She can't accept this and comes here every day to cry and plead.\"","[How tragic!]","\"I took a look at her face,\" Shen Hui said in a low, hoarse voice. \"Her son is already dead.\"","[Ahhhhh! Human traffickers deserve to die!]","Qi Quan's expression remained unchanged as she slowly ate the food just bought.","The atmosphere in the car was heavy and somber.","Shen Hui had little appetite, the smile gone from his face.","\"When I was in the Longwan area, I think I saw a few children hidden in a truck, around three years old, both boys and girls. Could they have been transported to Longhu to be offered to that powerful ghost?\" the Hitchhiking Ghost whispered.","Shen Hui glanced at him and said expressionlessly, \"If it were really done by ordinary villagers, how could the surveillance not have caught it?\"","\"That's true.\"","Just then, Qi Quan's phone rang.","It was a call from Li Guoyan.","His tone was grave: \"Master, Di Meng followed a lead into a village and then lost contact.\"","It was quite similar to the incident involving Fu Jiuge years ago.","Qi Quan said calmly, \"I understand.\"","\"Master, we may need you to go on another business trip,\" Li Guoyan said with utmost sincerity. \"The travel fee will be transferred to you shortly.\"","Even if Li Guoyan hadn't called, Qi Quan would have gone to Longhu City.","The person behind this had gone to great lengths—first using the clumsy guidance of the Hitchhiking Ghost, then the human tragedy at the service area—all to plant the idea of going to Longhu City in her mind.","She replied, \"Alright.\"","After hanging up, Qi Quan instructed Shen Hui: \"Change course to Longhu.\"","Shen Hui was surprised: \"Senior?\"","Could it be that Senior hadn't realized the Hitchhiking Ghost's purpose?","Qi Quan smiled, looked at the Hitchhiking Ghost, and said in a slow, measured tone, \"What level is your master?\"","The Hitchhiking Ghost: \"...\"","\"How many exorcists are waiting for me in Longhu City?\"","\"...\"","\"Level Seven? Level Eight? Or perhaps Level Nine?\"","\"...\"","Shen Hui was stunned.","Level Eight and Level Nine? Was she serious?","What faction could dispatch several Level Eight exorcists at once, just for Senior alone?","\"It's been a long time since I've truly fought. I'm looking forward to it.\"","After saying this, Qi Quan closed her eyes to cultivate once more.","Silence fell in the car.","Shen Hui felt a surge of blood boiling with excitement, his eyes shining.","Senior looked so cool when she delivered that warning!","The Hitchhiking Ghost huddled in his seat, trembling.","He was just a weak and helpless Level Two White Ghost, after all.","In the back seat, Lingsheng looked at Qi Quan's profile, his eyes slightly curving into a smile. He performed a cleansing technique, purifying the smell of food from the car.","The car drove all the way to Longhu City.","A mountain village in Longhu City.","The village was extremely remote, without even a proper road wide enough for vehicles, almost completely isolated from the world.","It was hard to imagine such a village still existed in this day and age.","Rows of single-story houses were built in the village, dilapidated and old, looking like they belonged to a different world compared to the world outside the mountains.","Di Meng, along with several investigators, had quietly infiltrated the secluded mountain village, following the clues provided by the Fu family.","They had arrived in the early hours of the morning.","The sky had not yet dawned; the morning star hung in the sky, exceptionally bright.","The area around the village was covered in dense forests, shrouded in mist that obscured their vision.","\"Captain Di, this place really is a bit strange,\" one investigator whispered.","Di Meng's expression was grave. \"Everyone, be careful.\"","After all, the intelligence provided by the Fu family was already twenty years old. After two decades, it was unclear if the stronghold connected to this clue still existed.","Moreover, the way they found this place was far too easy, as if someone had already set a trap, waiting for them to walk right in.","It seems the senior's \"Diary of a Wealthy Family\" has truly made the people behind the scenes restless.","Di Meng sneered. The sooner they surfaced, the sooner they could destroy their den.","The investigators were all equipped with Level Six talismans, guaranteeing their safety. Even if this was a trap, they would break through it!","But no one could have predicted that the Cultivators of Evil would go all out, specially dispatching several high-level Masters to set a trap here.","The intended guest was Qi Quan.","Di Meng and his team were merely the appetizers who had wandered into the snare.","Inside the mountain village, three Level Seven Masters and one Level Eight Master sat around a table, each holding playing cards.","\"Someone's here,\" the Level Eight Master said.","The three Level Seven Masters were momentarily taken aback.","\"Already here?\" The tall and burly Level Seven Master said in a deep, resonant voice, \"I'll take the first round.\"","The Level Eight Master said with an air of profound mystery, \"Not her. Just some small fry from the Investigation Department.\"","\"The highest level among investigators is Level Five. They're stuck in the formation and can't get out. Don't bother with them. Keep playing. Pair of Jacks, anyone?\" The speaking Level Seven Master played a pair of Jacks, raising his eyebrow-less brows.","The short, stout Master threw down a pair of Aces. \"So, is that person coming or not?\"","\"She's a righteous and kind-hearted Master, not like us. With the guidance of a Level Two White Ghost, the impact of a human tragedy, and then receiving news of the investigators losing contact, she'll definitely rush over without delay.\" The eyebrow-less Master snorted with a laugh.","The Level Eight Master wore a look of pity: \"They say she's only twenty-two. What a pity.\"","The other three: \"...\"","Who are you trying to fool in front of us? Everyone knows you, old man, have the strongest jealousy and kill any genius you see!","The tall, burly Master said with a fierce expression, \"So what if she's a super-Level Seven at twenty-two? She'll still die under my fists!\"","Level Eight Master: \"It's not absolutely necessary to kill her.\"","\"Right!\" the short, stout Master said. \"Controlling her is also an option.\"","The eyebrow-less Master smiled. \"If she really gets controlled, being such a genius, would she become the Venerable One's new favorite?\"","The other two couldn't help but glance at the Level Eight Master.","The Level Eight Master had a clear, upright appearance. Hearing this, he revealed a profound smile. \"Naturally not.\"","The three: \"...\"","Damn, these pretentious show-offs are really annoying.","A residence in the Beijing suburbs.","A man sat in the courtyard, looking up at the azure sky, and asked quietly, \"Is everything ready?\"","Steward: \"Ready. The Venerable One dispatched three Level Sevens and one Level Eight. The Level Eight Master also set up a Spirit-Devouring Formation.\"","Man: \"Heh, they really think highly of her.\"","\"Her display at Guiyuan Sect did intimidate quite a few people,\" the steward said.","The man's lips curled slightly. \"Wasn't it said her destiny is immense, reaching to the heavens? They exhausted themselves suppressing... her destiny before. Now they can hunt her down?\"","Steward: \"...\"","To be honest, he wasn't too clear about this either. The Venerable One's actions were not for them to question.","However, he had a bit of a guess.","\"Perhaps her growth speed has reached an intolerable level.\"","That's why the Venerable One would spare no cost to strangle her before she fully matured.","The man gazed at the vast, high sky, his eyes deep and profound.","\"Can someone with destiny reaching to the heavens really be killed so easily?\"","He let out a low chuckle.","Longhu City.","The car had already entered the Longhu area. The Road-blocking Ghost was no longer as chatty as before.","He picked at his fingers, watching the road ahead with nervous anticipation.","In the back seat, Qi Quan suddenly opened her eyes.","Lingsheng immediately turned his head, his eyes showing concern.","The system also asked: [Big shot, what's wrong?]","[The Lakeside Villa is under attack.]","[Damn it, a diversionary tactic! How despicable!] The system cursed angrily, [I beep— beep— beep—]","Qi Quan's eyes turned cold and deep, yet the corners of her lips lifted into a smile.","A surge of fighting spirit rose from the depths of her heart.","It had indeed been a long time since she had engaged in a truly thoroughly satisfying battle.","She was looking forward to the journey ahead.","Longjiang City.","When the Lakeside Villa came under attack, Su Rong was in the kitchen researching a new recipe, while Xue Hong was curled up in her room, engrossed in professional books.","The villa's protective formation trembled slightly.","The two ghosts immediately floated to the front courtyard's atrium.","Xue Hong said coldly, \"Again?\"","Su Rong smiled slightly: \"I'll go to the storeroom to get some jade tokens.\"","Outside the villa, two Level Six Masters took out attack talismans and relentlessly assaulted the formation's protective shield.","\"She's not in the villa this time. Let's see how this formation holds up,\" one said.","The other was puzzled: \"If she's not in the villa, why are we attacking the formation? Got too many talismans to use up?\"","\"Are you stupid? She went to Longhu, right? Our superiors ordered us to do this to unsettle her, to prevent her from focusing.\"","\"Right. With her home about to be broken into, and facing three Level Sevens and one Level Eight, she definitely can't win.\"","In the courtyard, Xue Hong observed the protective formation while reading her book. Whenever the formation's glow weakened, she added a few more jade tokens, and the formation remained as solid as ever.","The two outside were baffled.","\"What's going on? Isn't she supposed to be away?\"","\"Maybe... the ghost attendants?\"","\"Even if the ghost attendants are there, can they sustain it for so long using spirit talismans? Are spirit talismans like cabbages to them?\"","\"So what do we do now?\"","\"What else can we do? Keep smashing it.\"","\"...\"","Longhu City.","Following the navigation's directions, the car headed into increasingly remote areas.","This place was originally a location with excellent feng shui, but due to the evil deeds of certain people, it had become a sinister ghost realm.","The mountain road ahead was impassable by car, leaving only travel on foot.","Shen Hui glanced at the Level Two White Ghost in the passenger seat. The White Ghost gave him a smile, no longer showing the previous nervousness, perhaps because they were now on its home turf, it had become somewhat smug and forgetful.","\"Thanks for the ride, buddy,\" it said, drifting out of the car leisurely.","Shen Hui: \"...\"","What are you, a mere Level Two White Ghost, so cocky about?","\"Since you've guessed it, I won't beat around the bush,\" the Road-blocking Ghost said. \"The Masters are waiting in the mountain village. Follow me.\"","It wasn't worried about Qi Quan running away at this point.","They had already stepped within the range of the formation. Trying to escape would be impossible.","Qi Quan...","Laughed softly. \"Lead the way.\"","Road-blocking Ghost: ?","She can still laugh when death is at hand?","It didn't believe for a second that three Level Seven Masters and one Level Eight Master could lose.","Moreover, they had a secret weapon.","The Road-blocking Ghost didn't waste words, leading them onto the narrow mountain path.","The surrounding forest was dense and shady, overgrown with weeds, eerily quiet without even a single bird call.","Qi Quan suddenly remarked, \"Not a bad formation.\"","It barely reached Level Eight standard, though the construction was somewhat crude and the flaws rather large.","The Road-blocking Ghost looked smug: \"Of course! This is an Level Eight formation personally set up by the master. Few in the world can break it!\"","\"Is that so?\" Qi Quan chuckled lightly.","Inside the mountain village, the Level Eight Master was slightly startled.","He was the master of this formation and was acutely aware of all movements within it.","Hearing Qi Quan's light chuckle, an inexplicable chill ran down his spine.","\"What's wrong?\" The eyebrow-less Master noticed his unease.","The Level Eight Master maintained his composure: \"She's here.\"","The other three immediately stopped and stared at him intently.","The tall, burly Master said gruffly, \"I'll go test her first!\"","\"She's someone who can instantly suppress a self-destructing Level 7 Celestial Master. You want to go alone? You'd probably die without even knowing how! The Honored One told us to attack together, yet you insist on fighting her one by one?\" the short, stout Celestial Master grumbled.","The tall, burly Celestial Master snorted coldly. \"I think you're just scared!\"","\"Me? Scared?\" The short, stout Celestial Master's eyebrows shot up. \"I think you're an idiot!\"","\"Enough,\" the Level 8 Celestial Master said with authority. \"Stop arguing. My formation has a spirit-devouring effect. We'll deplete her spiritual energy first, and later we'll—\"","His words cut off abruptly.","The eyebrowless Celestial Master asked, \"What's wrong?\"","The Level 8 Celestial Master's face suddenly turned as pale as gold paper.","Inside the Spirit-Devouring Formation.","Qi Quan stopped walking and said, \"The path you're leading us on is wrong.\"","The road-blocking ghost feigned surprise. \"This is the only road. There's no other way into the village.\"","\"Is that so?\"","\"...Yes.\" The road-blocking ghost suddenly had an ominous feeling.","The next second, a peach wood talisman came flying at him. Before he could even utter a cry for help, he was stuffed inside.","\"Qin Ruo, he's yours.\"","Qin Ruo: \"...\"","This was about making her exercise the \"authority\" of the prison bully.","No problem, she was very familiar with this job!","The road-blocking ghost's wails soon echoed from within the peach wood talisman.","Shen Hui asked, \"Senior, have we accidentally walked into a trap?\"","\"It's fine.\"","She was tired of playing games with them.","Spiritual energy coalesced into a long blade, abruptly appearing in her hand.","Shen Hui was astonished. \"This is...\"","Using spiritual energy to form a weapon—he had only read about such a technique in ancient texts. He never imagined he'd have the privilege of witnessing it firsthand.","The senior was getting serious.","His heart pounded wildly. With keen awareness, he took several steps back, his gaze tightly fixed on the figure ahead.","Majestic as a mountain, profound as the sea.","Qi Quan, holding the long blade, flew into mid-air, the hair at her temples dancing lightly.","She raised the long blade and slashed it fiercely towards the formation!","Torrential spiritual energy struck the formation, overwhelming the entire Spirit-Devouring Grand Formation with an irresistible, crushing force.","Crash—","The Level 8 formation shattered completely.","With just a single move.","Shen Hui: !!!","No words could express his feelings at this moment.","So cool! Absolutely incredibly cool!","He was screaming wildly in his heart, yet on the surface, he had to maintain the dignified composure of an... investigator.","With the Spirit-Devouring Formation broken, the Level 8 Celestial Master felt it most keenly.","He shot out of the room, hovering in mid-air, staring intently towards the direction of the village entrance, his expression extremely grave.","How is this possible?","How could this be possible!","The Level 8 formation he personally set up couldn't be broken so easily by human power. She was at most Level 8 herself, so how could she shatter the formation with just one move?","He truly couldn't believe it!","The other three Celestial Masters ran out after him but remained on the ground, looking up.","\"Senior, what exactly happened?\" the eyebrowless Celestial Master asked in shock.","The Level 8 Celestial Master's eyes turned bloodshot, his voice hoarse as he said, \"She's here.\"","As soon as the words left his mouth, a slender, tall figure appeared in mid-air, facing the Level 8 Celestial Master from a distance.","Her appearance was exceptionally striking. Under the pale golden sunlight, her skin glowed with a jade-like luster. Not a trace of spiritual energy leaked from her, yet all four present felt a profound, heavy pressure.","This pressure stemmed from the unknown.","They couldn't discern her cultivation level; they didn't know just how powerful she was.","The Level 8 Celestial Master facing Qi Quan directly had just experienced her overwhelming strength firsthand.","'Overwhelming force defeats all skill' perfectly described the scene of her breaking the formation with one move.","He said with difficulty, \"You are not a Level 8 Celestial Master.\"","Qi Quan's laughter was light and unhurried. Wasting no more words, she raised the long blade in her hand.","The three standing on the ground were pressed down so hard their legs trembled uncontrollably.","The short, stout Celestial Master still found time to mock the tall, burly one: \"Weren't you going to face her alone? Go on then.\"","The tall, burly Celestial Master: \"...\"","The eyebrowless Celestial Master sighed. \"I fear we are doomed today.\"","He reached into his pocket and pulled out a dark red pill, about the size of a soybean, almost invisible between his fingers.","He hesitated, his face conflicted.","Seeing this, the other two followed suit, each taking out a pill and holding it in their hands.","In mid-air, Qi Quan didn't hesitate in the slightest. With one slash, she aimed her blade at the Level 8 Celestial Master.","A massive blade shadow appeared across the azure sky.","The blade shadow spanned the heavens, blocking out the sun. The pale white long blade descended slowly from high above, carrying earth-shaking momentum, like a demon-slaying blade firmly enveloping all four of them.","The Level 8 Celestial Master hadn't even made a move before he was suffocated by the immense pressure of the giant blade shadow.","His eyes nearly burst from their sockets, blood gushing from his mouth. Only one thought remained in his mind—","She is definitely not just Level 8!","Facing such a formidable opponent, they stood no chance!","The Level 8 Celestial Master acted decisively. He took out a dark red pill and quickly put it in his mouth.","As soon as the pill entered his stomach, an extremely powerful force surged from his dantian. The spiritual energy around his body skyrocketed wildly. In just a few breaths, his level actually climbed directly from Level 8 to Level 9!","The increase in level brought him tremendous benefits.","His eyes bloodshot and red, his body felt lighter than ever, as if he possessed infinite power. Even facing that long blade, he wouldn't—","Huh?","How is this possible!","He stared in horror at the long blade slowly descending from the sky, still unable to muster even a shred of resistance.","The Level 8 Celestial Master—no, the now Level 9 Celestial Master—was incredulous, his voice trembling terribly. \"You're not Level 9 either! You... you are...\"","The words \"Human Sovereign\" were completely obliterated.","The giant blade fell. In an instant, it was as if the sky had collapsed and the river of stars reversed its flow. The Level 8 Celestial Master—no, the now Level 9 Celestial Master—was utterly annihilated by the spiritual energy blade, reduced to dust.","Again, just one move.","Flesh, blood, and soul vanished without a trace.","The three on the ground: \"...\"","So... so terrifying!","The tall, burly Celestial Master was actually the first to kneel and beg for mercy. \"This lowly one has eyes but failed to recognize Mount Tai! I beg you, Senior, spare my worthless life!\"","The eyebrowless Celestial Master: \"...\"","The short, stout Celestial Master: \"...\"","A torrent of curses swirled in their minds, with no place to start.","In this situation, taunting/venting was no longer the priority. They had to survive!","Qi Quan hovered in mid-air, looking down at the three with an indifferent expression.","\"What are those pills in your hands?\" she asked.","The eyebrowless Celestial Master immediately answered, \"Replying to you, Senior, these are Blood Burst Pills. They can instantly boost a Celestial Master's cultivation level, giving a significant advantage in battle. Of course, someone of your stature has absolutely no need for such auxiliary items.\"","Qi Quan asked calmly, \"Whoever provides the pill formula will have performed a great service.\"","The three: \"...\"","It wasn't that they were unwilling, but that they couldn't.","It involved the organization's secrets. If they revealed them, they would likely suffer soul annihilation, just like the Level 8 Celestial Master.","The three turned pale, cold sweat sliding down their cheeks and dripping into the soil before them.","The soil faintly glowed red.","Qi Quan lowered her gaze. \"Forget it.\"","Spiritual energy gathered once more into a long blade, suspended above their heads.","The tall, burly Celestial Master, terrified, prostrated himself on the ground and cried out, \"I'll talk! I'll talk!\"","The other two: ???","The tall, burly Celestial Master, still clinging to a sliver of hope, said, \"We actually don't know much about refining the Blood Burst Pills either. Those are made by the alchemists. I'm just a hired hand; I know nothing about pill formulas! Please see the truth, Senior!\"","The system was shocked: [Big shot, what are alchemists? How come I've never heard you mention them?]","Qi Quan: [You've read so many cultivation novels, and you really don't know?]","[Reading is one thing, but I've been with you for so long, and I've never heard of alchemists existing in this world. You've never mentioned them either.]","Qi Quan: \"Within the mystical sects, there are paths such as the Sword Path, Talisman Path, and Formation Path, along with some other less common ones. The Healing Path is one of them. However, the Healing Path is extremely difficult to master and requires using one's own spiritual power to heal others, so few are willing to practice it. Over time, it gradually declined. The Alchemy Path is a branch of the Healing Path, but the ability to truly refine pills beneficial to cultivators currently only exists in legends.\"","Pills like this \"Bloodburst Pill\" merely instantly burn a cultivator's potential, forcibly raising their level by one.","Such pills are inferior, evil pills steeped in human blood.","The system understood and suddenly asked: [\"So, does Lingsheng have a talent for learning the Healing Path?\"]","Qi Quan was taken aback.","She thought of the various foods with beneficial effects made by Lingsheng's hands, and of his precise technique when helping stop the bleeding for the injured man at the resort, and deeply agreed.","The other two men also immediately said, \"Right, we're just peripheral enforcers, we don't have access to such secrets.\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She thought for a moment, summoned a new peach wood tablet, and struck it against the three men. Their souls, no longer under their own control, were trapped within the peach wood tablet.","The remaining bodies, except for the Bloodburst Pills clutched in their hands, were completely incinerated by spiritual fire.","Qi Quan landed on the ground.","She looked at Lingsheng, who was walking towards her.","Without a doubt, these three souls also bore puppet seals. If she forcibly searched their souls, it would definitely trigger a self-destruct sequence.","But what if she performed \"surgery\" to remove the puppet seal?","Qi Quan felt she might be getting a bit fanciful, but she was never one to stick rigidly to convention.","Anyway, with three subjects, she could experiment slowly.","\"Senior,\" Shen Hui ran over, his expression very grave. \"There's no one else here, but I discovered many children's skeletons in those houses.\"","System: [\"A thousand cuts wouldn't be enough to atone for their evil deeds!\"]","Qi Quan: \"They likely abandoned this operation long ago. Today was just to lure me here.\"","The Investigation Department wasn't unaware of this possibility, but they had to send people to investigate any lead, no matter how slim.","\"Senior!\"","A voice full of pleasant surprise sounded from not far away.","Qi Quan turned around.","Di Meng, leading several investigators, ran over, his face excited. \"I knew it was you who came!\"","While trapped in the formation, they had already sensed their spiritual energy slowly draining away, but against an eighth-grade formation, they were powerless.","Fortunately, fortunately, the Senior had come.","Qi Quan instructed, \"Leave this place to you. I'm returning to Longjiang City first.\"","Di Meng's spirits lifted: \"Yes!\"","He and the several investigators watched the mighty expert leave, the light in their eyes more intense and fervent than the sun.","They had just witnessed the immense, elongated blade shadow spanning the vast sky.","It was simply—","So incredibly cool!"]},{"number":55,"title":"Chapter 55","paragraphs":["The estate in the suburbs of the capital.","\"What?!\"","The carving knife in the man's hand nearly slipped and cut his own fingers.","He looked up in shock, his expression almost contorted. \"Dead? All dead? One Level 8 and three Level 7s?\"","The steward was equally stunned.","In a daze, his voice strained, he replied, \"Yes, dead. Not a single one left.\"","The man's eyes widened. \"Didn't they have Bloodburst Pills?\"","Taking a Bloodburst Pill could elevate one's cultivation by a whole level. Couldn't three Level 8s and one Level 9 kill a single Level 8?","Their secret estimation was that Qi Quan's level should be around Level 8.","It wasn't that they were unwilling to consider a higher level, but rather they dared not.","She's only twenty-two!","Level 8 was already the absolute limit. Any higher wouldn't be genius, but monstrous.","No, even this was already monstrous.","The steward said in a low, hoarse voice, \"It's unclear. No one knows what happened there. The fight ended very quickly. I inquired with the Dragon Lake City Celestial Masters Association. Someone who was relatively close by only saw a massive long blade spanning the sky from afar, seemingly blotting out the sun and sky.\"","The man: \"...\"","He suddenly broke into a loud coughing fit, as if trying to cough his entire lungs out.","\"Family Head, please take care of your health,\" the steward urged anxiously. \"That place was just an abandoned den anyway. Nothing can be traced back. You needn't worry.\"","The man clutched his chest as the coughing gradually subsided.","He raised his pale, gaunt face, his eyes actually showing a trace of bewilderment. \"With a Celestial Master so formidable... can we really kill her?\"","If they couldn't kill her, Qi Quan would become their greatest obstacle.","The steward tried to console him, \"At most, she's a Level 9 Celestial Master. She can't possibly be a Human Sovereign, right? A Human Sovereign isn't something so easily...\"","His voice trailed off.","It was said a Human Sovereign could faintly touch the power of laws. Thinking of that massive blade formed from spiritual energy, a chill ran down his spine.","Could it be... she had truly reached the Human Sovereign realm?","His terrified expression was reflected in the man's eyes.","The man actually started chuckling, his voice raspy. \"Truly a favorite of the Heavenly Dao!\"","The steward: \"...\"","Ah, the Family Head is about to lose it again.","After a moment, the man regained his composure and asked, \"What about the people sent to attack the villa?\"","\"No news yet.\"","The man: \"...Contact them immediately!\"","\"Yes.\"","Lakeside Villa.","Outside the courtyard, the two Celestial Masters were still relentlessly attacking.","Xue Hong stretched lazily, bored. \"How long are they going to keep this up? It's disturbing my reading.\"","\"Probably brought a lot of talismans this time. They'll stop when they run out,\" Su Rong guessed.","As soon as he finished speaking, his phone received a message.","He looked down and suddenly broke into a delighted smile.","Xue Hong raised an eyebrow. \"From the Master?\"","\"Yes.\" Su Rong smiled. \"The Master says she'll be home in about two hours.\"","\"Is that all?\"","\"There's more,\" Su Rong said, his gaze turning towards the outside of the courtyard. \"The Master said there's no logic in being on guard against thieves for a thousand days.\"","Xue Hong: \"What does that mean? Those two outside are both higher level than us.\"","\"Before leaving, the Master specifically set up a retaliation array. Once activated, anyone attacking the protective array will suffer double the backlash.\"","Given the ferocity of the two attackers outside, once the array was activated, they would be severely injured if not killed.","Xue Hong floated up excitedly. \"That's perfect! Activate it quickly!\"","Following Qi Quan's instructions, Su Rong took out a sparrow-shaped jade token and... placed it into the eye of the retaliation array.","Instantly, another layer of light shield appeared outside the protective array.","The shield flashed for a second before vanishing.","The two Celestial Masters outside the courtyard looked at each other.","\"What was that just now?\"","\"Not sure. Probably just the array shield?\"","\"An extra layer?\"","\"Maybe.\"","\"The ghost servants know arrays too?\"","\"Who knows. Let's finish this quickly.\"","As they spoke, they threw out several Level 6 Thunder Talismans, all aimed at the retaliation array.","The retaliation array glowed with a faint halo. The energy from the several Thunder Talismans suddenly doubled and, with lightning speed, shot back and struck the two men!","\"Pfft—\"","\"Gah—\"","Both men vomited blood simultaneously and collapsed to the ground, unconscious.","Hearing the commotion outside, Su Rong smiled slightly and dialed Meng Yunzheng's number.","\"Director Meng, two Celestial Masters attacked the villa and were counterattacked by the array. They are now critically injured.\"","Meng Yunzheng: !!!","He immediately replied, \"I'll send someone right away.\"","Shortly after, Tang Mian led a team over, took the two men into custody, and brought them to the Investigation Department for interrogation.","Having suffered the backlash of double the power of Level 6 Thunder Talismans, the two were covered in wounds. However, being Level 6 Celestial Masters themselves, they could withstand it with some treatment.","The Investigation Department naturally showed no mercy to those who attacked the villa.","That was the Chief Consultant's home!","Within the Investigation Department now, who didn't know about the Chief Consultant's glorious feat of intimidating the major Celestial Master sect leaders at Guiyuan Sect?","Consultant Qi was a figure genuinely revered by all investigators from the bottom of their hearts.","Those daring to attack the Chief Consultant's home had to face the wrath of the Investigation Department!","Under the investigators' relentless questioning and unable to bear the pain from their injuries any longer, the two men revealed a little.","But only a little.","When pressed for deeper information, no amount of prying could make them talk.","Meng Yunzheng watched from outside for a while, then asked Tang Mian beside him, \"Do they seem like dead soldiers to you?\"","Tang Mian: \"Drugged?\"","\"Probably more than just drugs,\" Meng Yunzheng frowned. \"I'll report this to Dragon Capital.\"","Dragon Capital City Investigation Department.","Li Guoyan received a video transmitted by Di Meng.","In the video, there were three piles of human-shaped ashes on the ground. Within the ashes, three dark red pills were particularly conspicuous.","Di Meng's voiceover played in the video.","\"These are called Bloodburst Pills. They can help a Celestial Master instantly elevate their cultivation by a major realm. Side effects unknown.\"","A pair of hands placed the Bloodburst Pills into an evidence bag.","\"We discovered many children's skeletons inside the house, along with traces of a pile of ashes.\"","The scene in the video was truly horrifying.","The earth on the ground had been stained red by blood, and even after twenty years, the color had not faded.","This was undoubtedly the den where Bloodburst Pills were refined back then.","Li Guoyan sighed inwardly. The work of the Investigation Department was long and arduous.","Those inhuman evil cultivators hiding in the shadows must be brought to justice to appease the souls of the departed.","The phone rang, and he answered.","It was Meng Yunzheng.","\"Director Li, two Level 6 Celestial Masters suddenly attacked the Lakeside Villa. They were counterattacked by the villa's array and are now in the interrogation room. But no matter how we interrogate them, they won't reveal who's behind this.\"","Li Guoyan's heart skipped a beat. \"Attacked the Lakeside Villa?\"","\"Yes. It was reported by Mr. Su.\"","Mr. Su, the butler of Lakeside Villa, Qi Quan's first ghost servant—the Investigation Department was aware of this.","Li Guoyan instantly understood.","The latest chapter of \"The Aristocratic Diary\" had clearly made the evil cultivator organization behind the scenes restless. Obviously, all firepower was now focused on Qi Quan.","They understood the Investigation Department, they understood Qi Quan. They lay in wait at the abandoned den to ambush her, just like they did with Fu Jiuge back then.","They deployed Level 7 and Level 8 Celestial Masters, even equipped them with Bloodburst Pills, all to overpower Qi Quan. They even tried to attack Qi Quan's residence during the operation to disrupt her state of mind.","They would stop at nothing!","Unfortunately, they had misjudged Qi Quan's strength.","To be honest, when Li Guoyan heard Di Meng's report, he thought he might have misheard.","Three Level Sevens and one Level Eight?","And the Level Eight even took a Bloodburst Pill to reach Level Nine?","Then they were all beheaded by Master Qi with a single slash, leaving not even a speck of bone dust behind?","He couldn't fathom just how profound Master Qi's cultivation level truly was.","It was fortunate that such a master was a member of the Investigation Department.","The loose cultivator chat groups in Longhu City were already boiling over.","[Did you all see the giant blade shadow in the sky just now?!]","[I was watering plants on my balcony and dropped my watering can.]","[I was driving and ran a red light...]","[What on earth was that? Could any senior explain?]","[Perhaps, fellow cultivator, have you heard of Spirit Power Materialization?]","[That technique that condenses spirit power into a solid form? That's a divine ability only Masters of Level Seven or above can perform!]","[So, just now, a Level Seven Master passed by our area and left behind a giant blade?]","[Internal news: It seems high-level Masters were fighting in that restricted zone. Three Level Sevens and one Level Eight against a Master of unknown level. The result? They were all slain with a single slash!]","[Upstairs is writing fiction, that's impossible.]","[Damn, I'll never reach Level Seven in my lifetime. Are Level Sevens like cabbages now? Someone who can defeat three Level Sevens and a Level Eight with one move isn't human, they're a god!]","[What about Level Nine? You ignoring Level Nine?]","[Level Nine... do we even have Level Nine powerhouses in our mystical community?]","[Forgot about the Guiyuan Sect's feast? Forgotten about that certain big shot who saved all the Masters with a wave of their hand?]","[Wasn't it said she was above Level Seven? Level Eight at most!]","[They said 'above Level Seven,' but no one actually knows her true level.]","[My heavens, how ridiculously powerful is that.]","[The most crucial point is, she's only twenty-two.]","[So, where did the Investigation Department find such a colossal powerhouse? With her there, isn't the Investigation Department set?]","[Hey, Investigation Departments nationwide are recruiting. Fellow cultivators, want to form a group and go sign up?]","[Let's do it! To meet the great powerhouse just once in this lifetime would leave no regrets!]","The giant blade shadow over Longhu City sparked heated discussions.","Of course, ordinary people couldn't see it with the naked eye.","A fortunate Master happened to be nearby and used a Recording Talisman to capture the complete image of the blade shadow.","Possessing sharp business acumen, he purchased many expensive Recording Talismans, copied the original recording onto them, and began selling them online.","The price of a Recording Talisman containing the giant blade image was at least three times that of a blank one!","Sects, families, Master Associations, and loose cultivators outside of Longhu, all took a keen interest in the giant blade shadow.","Even the top sects and families in Longjing City were no exception.","He made a fortune... a real killing from selling those talismans.","As for the most precious original recording, of course, he kept it for his own collection.","This talisman would be a family heirloom from now on.","The Fu Family.","Fu Jiuge had just woken up and was still quite weak.","Leaning against the bed, she listened quietly as Fu Luanfei recounted recent events.","The protagonist in all of them was Qi Quan.","A smile lingered in Fu Jiuge's eyes throughout. After Fu Luanfei finished, she finally spoke, \"I'd like to read 'The Diary of a Wealthy Family.' Is that possible?\"","\"Of course!\" Fu Luanfei nodded. \"But you've just woken up, you shouldn't overexert yourself. You need more rest. How about I read it to you?\"","\"Alright.\"","Fu Luanfei opened her phone, about to tap into the app, when a message suddenly popped up in the family group chat, followed by a continuous stream of chat records.","[Have you all heard about that incident in Longhu City?!]","Fu Luanfei's mind stirred, and she switched to the group chat instead.","She knew of Longhu City; it was where her aunt had met with the accident years ago.","[I know! Ahhhhh! Why wasn't I there? Hearing the descriptions from fellow cultivators over in Longhu, I'm so excited and thrilled, I really wish I could have seen it myself!]","[So annoying! You've got me all curious now. So what exactly happened?]","[So cool, so cool! I was on a mission right here in Longhu, ahhhhh! I was capturing a ghost, looked up, and oh my heavens!]","[Could you all stop telling half the story? It's really annoying!]","[Did you learn cliffhangers from Author Baishui?]","[Pfft, Author Baishui is an old hand at cliffhangers.]","Fu Luanfei: \"...\"","So, what on earth happened?","She gave Fu Jiuge an apologetic smile. \"Aunt, there's something in the group chat, let me check first.\"","\"Go ahead.\"","Fu Luanfei asked directly in the group: [What happened in Longhu City?]","[Wow! It's Sister Fu!]","[Snagging Sister Fu! I'll explain! Just a moment ago, a giant blade suddenly appeared in the sky over Longhu City. It was so long it seemed to span half the sky. The blade shadow slowly descended for a slash and then vanished.]","Fu Luanfei: [And then?]","[There is no 'and then.']","Fu Luanfei: [?]","[That's all anyone saw. As for what actually happened, I'm not clear either. Perhaps, Sister Fu, you could inquire with the mystical community or the authorities?]","Fu Luanfei: [Thanks.]","Soon, the major sects and families in Longjing City each bought back an expensive Recording Talisman.","Seeing the long blade in the recording, the big shots fell silent.","They convened another video conference.","Master Yin: \"I consulted an elder who recently emerged from seclusion, Level Eight. He said he is incapable of such a feat.\"","Master Wan: \"Same here.\"","\"Senior Qi left Longjing this morning,\" Yan Family Head stated, sharing the known information. \"Based on the timing, she could have reached Longhu City.\"","\"What would she go to Longhu City for?\" Yu Lanzhi frowned.","Yan Family Head: \"Haven't you read her file? She grew up in Longhu City. Perhaps she just went back to visit her hometown.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","Master Wan said, \"Are you suggesting this giant shadow was left by Senior Qi?\"","Yan Family Head: \"Just a guess. It's unlikely the world has produced another monstrous talent, right?\"","Everyone: That makes sense.","\"Brother Fu, what's your view?\" Yan Family Head asked.","Fu Jiuchong hadn't uttered a word. He was more certain than the others that the blade shadow was indeed left by Qi Quan.","The clue about Longhu City was the one he had provided to the Investigation Department... Presumably, the Investigation Department would send someone to Longhu to investigate thoroughly. Last night's new chapter of \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family\" subtly hinted at the discovery of clues regarding the \"Bloody Pills.\"","The mastermind behind the scenes would definitely not sit idle and might even set a trap based on this.","He had a rough idea but couldn't say it.","The news of Jiuge's awakening was still confined within the Fu residence, known to very few even there.","He couldn't reveal the slightest hint.","\"Possibly,\" he said expressionlessly.","He had always been taciturn in front of others, so no one found it strange.","Master Yin suddenly sighed, \"Do you think... she might have reached Level Nine?\"","\"...\"","The big shots all fell silent.","As Level Sevens themselves, they were already the heads of top sects and first-rate families, looking down upon the entire mystical community. Level Eight elders were almost perpetually in secluded cultivation, detached from worldly affairs. Only someone like Qi Quan, a Master beyond Level Eight, was still active in the mortal world.","Didn't she need secluded cultivation?","How on earth did she reach Level Nine?","Master Wan suddenly remarked, \"What if this is her method of cultivation? Perhaps secluded cultivation alone isn't conducive to advancing one's realm. Maybe continuous engagement with the world is more likely to provide opportunities for breakthrough.\"","\"That makes sense,\" the Yan Family Head nodded.","Yu Lanzhi said helplessly, \"What, are we supposed to start writing novels like her?\"","\"...\"","Ahem, that's certainly not possible.","Master Yin said, \"Everyone has their own unique path of cultivation. What suits her may not suit us. Let's set this matter aside for now. Regardless of who left that sword shadow, what we should be discussing right now is the matter of the supervision teams.\"","\"Supervision teams have already begun stationing in various regional Celestial Master Associations. They are all swift and decisive, not easy to deal with,\" Master Wan stated.","The Yan Family Head said, \"It's only the beginning. The supervision teams haven't taken major action yet. Once friction accumulates to a certain degree, conflicts are probably unavoidable.\"","The others present: \"...\"","So you're just here for the show?","Longjiang City.","Qi Quan and the other two finally returned to the lakeside villa.","\"Master, the tea is ready. What would you like for dinner?\" Steward Su's eyes and brows were filled with joy.","Qi Quan smiled and said, \"Anything is fine.\"","Su Rong had expected that answer. He turned and walked into the kitchen, selecting a few of Qi Quan's favorite dishes.","\"It's been no fun reading without you here,\" Xue Hong followed Qi Quan to the sofa and poured her some tea.","Qi Quan felt a long-missed sense of ease.","Compared to business trips, staying at home was the most comfortable.","She had just finished a battle at Long Lake, and a trace of excitement still lingered within her.","Slaying a ninth-level Celestial Master, while not requiring her utmost effort, had still consumed a large portion of her spiritual power.","Since coming to this world, she had never unleashed such a powerful move. In her previous life, it was only during battles against ghost generals that she truly experienced what it meant to fight with exhilarating satisfaction.","[Master, I have good news to tell you!] the system suddenly announced.","Qi Quan: [What is it?]","[Your novel has reached number one on the site's monthly rankings! Reward: twenty days of lifespan!]","Qi Quan: [Good.]","[To celebrate this good news, you should at least update a chapter tonight, right?]","It wasn't even asking for an extra update, how considerate!","Qi Quan held her tea, her expression blank as she said, [No inspiration.]","[Can't you write about the big battle against the villain and the counterattack with the formation this time?]","Qi Quan: [No.]","[Why not?]","Qi Quan: [What's so interesting about all that fighting and killing...?]","[...]","Just making excuses!","Qi Quan sat quietly on the sofa, while over there, Xue Hong was already grading the test papers Ling Sheng had done during the business trip.","The sound of Steward Su washing and chopping vegetables came from the kitchen.","The warmth of everyday life filled the villa.","Cozy and beautiful.","Qi Quan finished a cup of tea, her lips unconsciously curving into a smile as she got up and entered her room.","She first released the Car-blocking Ghost.","The Car-blocking Ghost had previously been under the control of an eighth-level Celestial Master. Now that the eighth-level Celestial Master was dead, the control had dissipated.","He had been lectured by Qin Ruo all the way inside the peach wood talisman and learned that the eighth-level Celestial Master had been killed by Qi Quan with a single sword strike. He dared not show the slightest disrespect towards Qi Quan.","He bowed and scraped, saying, \"G-Great Master, I really haven't done any bad deeds. I'm just an ordinary ghost! If I hadn't been controlled by someone, I wouldn't have dared to harm you!\"","Qi Quan said calmly, \"I assume you wouldn't want to experience the taste of a soul search.\"","\"...\"","The Car-blocking Ghost wiped his face, his expression bitter as he said, \"That Celestial Master liked collecting ghosts. He had many ghosts under him, both powerful and weak. I was just the most insignificant one. Last night, I received the task to block your car on the road and then get in to guide you to Longhu City.\"","[What did he collect so many ghosts for?] the system asked.","Qi Quan: [Perhaps for him, ghosts were the cheapest labor force.]","[Because they don't require food or money?] the system asked, speechless.","[Yes, and they are easy to command.]","[...]","Then now that he's dead, wouldn't those powerful ghosts he raised be out of control?","The system voiced its concern.","Qi Quan said: [Powerful ghosts are hard to control; they might have been made into ghost servants. When the master dies, the ghost servants perish as well. The remaining lesser ghosts are not a concern.]","Even if the eighth-level Celestial Master hadn't died, those lesser ghosts would have been driven to do bad deeds.","[That's true.]","\"Great Master, I really don't know anything else. I only received this one task,\" the Car-blocking Ghost pleaded. \"I haven't done any evil. All these years, I've only wanted to move on to reincarnation. Please, let me go to reincarnation.\"","Qi Quan began forming hand seals.","Car-blocking Ghost: !!!","He couldn't tell what it was, but he could sense it was definitely nothing good!","He cried and begged, \"Great Master, I really don't know anything else!\"","Qi Quan's hands didn't stop forming the seal as she asked casually, \"How did you die?\"","\"I... I was killed by someone.\"","\"Who killed you?\"","The Car-blocking Ghost lowered his head, not daring to meet her eyes: \"It was like I said before. I went to find a corner to relieve myself, and then someone killed me.\"","[Still lying!] the system said.","Qi Quan completed the Soul Search Seal and slowly pushed it towards the Car-blocking Ghost.","\"No! I'll talk! I'll talk!\" the Car-blocking Ghost wailed. \"I just saw something I shouldn't have seen, heard something I shouldn't have heard. That's why they killed me.\"","Qi Quan's hand didn't stop.","\"I heard them say those children were to be sent to Longlin City!\"","[What? Did I hear that right?!] the system exclaimed.","Qi Quan: ...","Longlin City again.","She continued to push the Soul Search Seal forward. Just as the seal was about to touch the Car-blocking Ghost's forehead, he actually fainted from fright.","System: Well, that's...","It asked Qi Quan: [Can ghosts faint?]","Qi Quan: [Hence the saying 'scared out of one's wits'.]","System: Makes sense.","[He fainted from fright, so what he said must be the truth, right?]","Qi Quan: [Yes.]","She rarely used soul search techniques. Unless absolutely necessary, she wouldn't employ such a cruel method.","She had just been scaring the Car-blocking Ghost.","The Car-blocking Ghost was a white ghost (lesser ghost) and truly hadn't harmed anyone before this. Although he followed the eighth-level Celestial Master's orders to guide her to Longhu City, legally speaking, his punishment could be mitigated or reduced.","Just hand him over to the Investigation Department to deal with.","She put the Car-blocking Ghost back into the peach wood talisman.","The system asked: [Master, what about the other three?]","Qi Quan: [They've been implanted with puppet talismans. We'll deal with that later.]","She closed her eyes and began cultivating.","Longjing City.","Di Meng hurried back to the Investigation Department with the Bloodburst Pills and sent them to the technical department for analysis.","Soon, the technical department delivered their conclusion.","The Bloodburst Pills did indeed contain human blood components. The alchemist had used some method during refinement to refine the vitality within human essence-blood, fusing it with other pill ingredients to create this kind of pill that could instantly boost a Celestial Master's level.","Of course, this pill also had side effects.","After taking the pill, the short-term stimulated potential would place a tremendous burden on the body, causing irreversible damage to bodily functions and resulting in permanently stagnant cultivation.","In short, this pill was for those who didn't value their lives.","Di Meng sensed the enormous conspiracy hidden behind this.","\"If this kind of pill were mass-produced, it could absolutely build a formidable team of Celestial Masters in a short time. What does the one refining these pills intend to do?!\"","Li Guoyan's expression was grave as he said, \"They started this at least twenty years ago. The reach of this cult far exceeds our imagination.\"","\"Utterly devoid of conscience!\" Di Meng slammed his fist on the table angrily.","The thought of children drained of blood to death filled him with uncontrollable fury.","Children around three years old, full of vitality and easy to control, had become the premium \"herbs\" in the eyes of that evil cultivator organization.","Despicable! Absolutely despicable!","Li Guoyan thought for a moment and said, \"The Investigation Department is short-handed. This organization is deeply hidden. We need to unite with other factions of the Mystic Arts world.\"","\"Will they be willing?\" Di Meng frowned.","Li Guoyan replied, \"There are far-sighted individuals within the Mystic Arts world. Didn't the Fu family also pay a heavy price investigating this lead years ago? Twenty years ago, the Mystic Arts world also launched a major crackdown on evil cultivators. It wasn't as murky as it is now.\"","Di Meng nodded.","\"You're right. What do you plan to do?\"","Li Guoyan instructed, \"Make backups of the recorded video and send it to the Guiyuan Sect, Xuanqing Sect, Hengfeng Sect, as well as the Yan Family and the Fu Family... No, hold off on Hengfeng Sect for now.\"","His impression of Hengfeng Sect had soured after their recent act of \"relying on ghosts to bolster their standing.\"","He didn't quite trust Hengfeng Sect.","Di Meng frowned. \"Will that be enough? Will they truly care?\"","\"At the very least, it serves as a warning for them to discipline their disciples. If it can stir their sense of justice, all the better.\"","Di Meng said, \"I'll go back and do it right away.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, Li Guoyan's phone rang.","He looked down and saw the words \"Master Qi\". He immediately called Di Meng back.","He answered the call.","\"Master, I haven't had the chance to thank you for making the trip to Longhu City yet. The travel expenses will be transferred to you shortly.\"","Qi Quan said, \"That won't be necessary.\"","She had gone voluntarily this time and didn't need reimbursement.","\"I've just obtained a lead. In recent years, missing children have likely been taken to Longlin City. Furthermore, the Bloody Pills might have different versions.\"","...","Li Guoyan exclaimed in surprise, \"Longlin City?!\"","Hengfeng Sect was located in Longlin City. If this was true, his earlier intuition was correct.","\"It was extracted from a minor ghost's account, not one hundred percent certain.\"","\"What do you mean by different versions?\"","\"An evil cultivator confessed to one type of pill that only replenishes spiritual energy, but the Bloodburst Pill can instantly boost one's cultivation level.\"","One could say the latter was an upgraded version of the former.","Li Guoyan's expression turned grave. \"I understand. Thank you for informing me, Master. I am already aware of the attack on the Lakeside Villa. My sincerest apologies; the Investigation Department failed to detect the criminals in time.\"","\"They were all Level 6 Masters. It's normal you couldn't detect them.\" Qi Quan didn't mind much.","Li Guoyan, however, felt deeply remorseful. \"Master fights on the front lines, yet we cannot even secure your rear. It's truly...\"","“In that case, there's something I need to attempt, and I hope the Department will agree.” Qi Quan took the opportunity to make her request.","Li Guoyan said, \"Please, go ahead.\"","Qi Quan stated, \"The three Level 7 Masters and the two in the interrogation room all have Puppet Talismans planted on them. These talismans activate a self-destruct program when the implanted person reveals core secrets, which is very disadvantageous for interrogation.\"","\"Master wishes to remove the Puppet Talismans?\" Li Guoyan understood her implication.","Qi Quan: \"Correct. I want to conduct an experiment to remove them without alerting the talismans.\"","Li Guoyan smiled. \"I look forward to the results of Master's experiment.\"","He made the decision directly.","Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan closed her eyes, recalling various ancient texts in her mind, and finally unearthed methods related to removing Puppet Talismans.","The conditions were harsh.","Puppet Talismans are imprints directly branded onto the soul. Even after death, this imprint does not disappear unless one undergoes reincarnation.","Removing a Puppet Talisman is akin to performing surgery on the soul.","Those capable of performing soul surgery are typically high-level medical cultivators.","In this current era, medical cultivators are almost extinct.","Qi Quan had indeed perused many texts on the medical path. She had attempted it before but lacked the innate talent for medical cultivation and thus gave up.","The so-called all-round genius was merely accomplished in the paths of the sword, talismans, and formations.","The system suggested: [Big shot, how about letting Ling Sheng try?]","Qi Quan had the same thought, but the medical path in this world lacked a complete system. If Ling Sheng attempted it rashly, he might very well go down the wrong path.","\"Knock, knock, knock.\"","A knocking sound came at the door.","\"Come in.\"","The door opened. It was Ling Sheng.","He approached, holding a piece of paper, and handed it to Qi Quan.","Qi Quan looked down and was momentarily stunned.","The paper was filled with notes on the feasibility of \"surgically removing Puppet Talismans,\" along with specific experimental steps.","System: [!!!]","Qi Quan gave it a quick scan and asked, \"How did you know I was researching this?\"","Ling Sheng handed over his phone, which displayed a passage.","[They have imprints on their souls. Ding Ji had one too. Ding Ji was controlled by someone, so are they.]","The words were brief but clear.","This was likely a special trait of his innate spiritual body—the ability to sense Puppet Talismans on others' souls. Having \"interacted\" with Ding Ji for so long, he must have studied Ding Ji's Puppet Talisman.","The three people she apprehended in Longhu City had Puppet Talismans on their souls identical to Ding Ji's. Normally inactive, they would activate the self-destruct program once captured and interrogated.","Following normal procedure, she would naturally \"interrogate\" these three. But because they had Puppet Talisman imprints on their souls, if she wanted information about the person behind them, she would have to...","It is essential to deal with the puppet symbol first, otherwise all efforts would be in vain.","He had studied the talisman books Qi Quan gave him, understood the principles of Puppet Talismans, guessed her intention, and was willing to try with her.","He had never hidden his abilities from Qi Quan. Whether it was the enhancement effects on food or his word spirit power, he had always openly displayed them before her.","Qi Quan smiled and beckoned him.","\"Come here.\"","The young man stepped closer, half-squatting beside Qi Quan's leg, the paper still clutched in his hand, looking up at her.","Qi Quan sat on the sofa, reached out and ruffled his hair, and said with a smile, \"Your idea is that the Puppet Talisman is bound to the soul. Once the host utters key phrases or suffers external attack, the talisman activates its self-destruct program. So, during the surgery, first imprint another talisman on the host's soul. At the instant the Puppet Talisman self-destructs, suppress that self-destructive energy, and then extract it?\"","Ling Sheng nodded, his eyes sparkling.","Gathering courage, he stacked his hands and placed them over Qi Quan's left knee, then rested his chin on the back of his stacked hands.","Qi Quan asked with a smile, \"Where did you get the inspiration?\"","Ling Sheng looked at her.","[Big shot, it was from that scene at Guiyuan Sect where you controlled Lu Jiang's self-detonation!] The system exclaimed in surprise.","Qi Quan chuckled to himself: [However, among the talismans I've learned, there isn't one that can instantly envelop self-destructive energy.]","[Ah? Then what to do?]","[We can try creating a new talisman.]","Qi Quan enjoyed innovation. In the path of talismans, one couldn't always rely on old knowledge; it was necessary to innovate. Ling Sheng's idea was good. If they could invent a new type of talisman, they wouldn't have to fear others self-destructing in the future.","She nodded and said, \"Alright, let's try your method first. We'll research it together.\"","Ling Sheng happily curved his eyes into smiles.","\"Knock, knock.\"","Butler Su's voice came from outside the door. \"Master, dinner is ready.\"","\"Coming.\"","Qi Quan pinched Ling Sheng's cheek. \"We'll study the new talisman after dinner.\"","Ling Sheng moved his hand away from her knee, obediently stood up, and followed her out of the room.","Dinner consisted entirely of Qi Quan's favorite dishes. Butler Su's culinary skills had improved yet again, each dish a perfect blend of aroma and flavor, leaving Qi Quan thoroughly satisfied.","After dinner, she reclined in the wicker chair under the open courtyard skylight, gazing up contentedly at the starry sky, savoring this rare moment of peace.","Ling Sheng sat upright nearby, diligently studying the creation of a new talisman.","He had already mastered the entire talisman manual and could essentially draw every type of talisman. His understanding of talismanic principles was quite profound, and coupled with his innate spiritual physique, he possessed a unique insight into the flow of spiritual power.","Talismans were, after all, a special method of channeling spiritual energy.","He held a pencil, sketching and writing on paper.","Qi Quan's peripheral vision fell on the crown of his head, and she suddenly felt an itch in her fingers. As if guided by a whim, she extended her index finger and poked that spot.","Ling Sheng: ?","He froze for a moment, not daring to turn around, just sitting dumbly on the stool, feeling the warmth of her fingertip.","The system suddenly exclaimed with surprise: [Did Ling Sheng's hair just all stand on end?]","Qi Quan took a closer look and was amused.","The hair around his crown stood up like the bristles of a startled hedgehog, completely upright, losing its previous soft and smooth appearance.","With a mischievous thought, she poked it a few more times before withdrawing her hand, asking with feigned calm, \"Any progress with your research?\"","Ling Sheng's body remained stiff for a while before he shook his head, his head drooping...","down.","\"New talismans are inherently difficult to develop. Take your time, no rush.\"","Ling Sheng nodded and continued scribbling on the paper.","[Great One, look. Ling Sheng is researching new talismans, Butler Su is cultivating ghost techniques, Teacher Xue is delving into her professional studies. Only you are lying here like a salted fish.] The system tried to instill a sense of shame in her.","Qi Quan asked leisurely: [So?]","[So, you should go back to your room and write your novel now!] It argued its point logically.","Qi Quan: [I'm not being a salted fish. I'm cultivating by absorbing the power of the stars.]","The system: [...]","Faced with such a laid-back Great One, it gave up.","The evening breeze rustled gently in the courtyard, carrying a faint hint of osmanthus fragrance.","Qi Quan suddenly said, \"Ling Sheng, tomorrow I'll take you to get your ID card. You can think of a new name for yourself, and you can also choose your own surname.\"","The young man was taken aback and turned to look at her.","Under the deep, vast starry sky, his eyes reflected the lamplight from the villa, like a fallen Milky Way, shimmering and brilliant.","\"What is it?\"","The young man typed on his phone: [Qi Ling Sheng.]","Qi Quan's heart suddenly softened.","The system: [Ahhhhh! From now on, Ling Sheng is officially one of us at Lakeside Villa!]","Getting an ID card required household registration. Qi Quan's current household registration was at Lakeside Villa. Non-relatives could have their registration attached there, so Ling Sheng would also be registered under that address.","Although this was Qi Quan's original plan, seeing Ling Sheng unhesitatingly use her surname and accept the name she had given him filled her with a particularly warm and pleased feeling.","In a moment of joy, she couldn't help herself. She cupped the young man's face, planted a kiss on his forehead, then ruffled his hair, her brows and eyes brimming with laughter.","\"I'm going back to my room to cultivate. You should rest early too.\"","Leaving these words behind, she turned and walked away from the courtyard.","Ling Sheng stood rooted to the spot, staring wide-eyed in a daze. After a long while, he reached up and touched his forehead, feeling somewhat bewildered, yet also inexplicably happy.","Clutching his pencil, inspiration suddenly surged within him, and he began sketching rapidly.","Inside her room, Qi Quan was preparing to sit in meditation for cultivation.","The system asked slyly: [Great One, you kissed Ling Sheng just now!]","Qi Quan: [Is there a problem?]","The system: [Why did you kiss him?]","[I was happy.]","[Then why were you happy?] The system got straight to the point.","Qi Quan: [Adding a new member to the household isn't a cause for celebration?]","The system: [...]","Is that really how you use that phrase?!","Forget it, no more questions.","Early the next morning, Shen Hui drove to Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan didn't have a dedicated driver, so she had to ask him to come pick them up to go process the ID card.","The police station wasn't far, only a fifteen-minute drive.","Illusion techniques couldn't be used to alter appearances for ID photos, so Qi Quan only concealed Ling Sheng's spiritual physique.","Ling Sheng had previously been unregistered, with no identity information. However, the household registration officer was aware of Shen Hui's investigator status and didn't ask many questions. They proceeded directly with taking the photo and entering the information. The ID card production would take some time; they'd have to wait a while to receive it.","On the Lakeside Villa household register, the name \"Qi Ling Sheng\" was now added.","After the ID photo was taken, the three prepared to leave the police station.","A strikingly beautiful woman walked towards them. She wore a black, off-the-shoulder fitted sweater, a pencil skirt, and high heels, her walk swaying gracefully.","As they passed each other, a rich perfume scent wafted over.","Shen Hui had a sensitive nose and couldn't hold back a sneeze.","The beauty stopped, turned to look at them, her eyes instantly curving into crescents, her red lips...","parting slightly, even her hair seeming to carry a hint of allure.","\"Sorry about that.\"","Shen Hui: ?","He really hadn't encountered someone apologizing for their perfume before.","Habitually, he offered a smile and replied, \"It's fine, it's my problem.\"","\"You're so polite.\" The beauty's lips curved slightly, her gaze appreciative. \"Handsome, there aren't many gentlemen like you around these days.\"","Shen Hui smiled awkwardly.","This wasn't the first time he'd been hit on, but this approach was new to him.","He felt it would be impolite not to respond to the compliment.","Just as he was about to say \"thank you,\" a police officer suddenly approached the woman, his expression extremely serious: \"Excuse me, are you Ms. Shao Jing?\"","Shao Jing raised an eyebrow, \"I am.\"","\"Do you know Dai Chao?\"","Shao Jing remained calm: \"Yes, I do.\"","\"Please assist with a police investigation.\"","\"It's not him threatening to jump off a building again, insisting on seeing me, is it?\" Shao Jing sounded impatient. \"I'm not anything to him, why should I see him? I lost my ID card, I'm busy getting a new one. No time.\"","The police officer: \"...\"","Shen Hui: \"...\"","What a character!","But this matter had nothing to do with them.","Shen Hui followed Qi Quan and the others back to the car.","However, a doubt lingered in his mind. After dropping off Qi Quan and Ling Sheng, he returned to the Investigation Department, saw Tang Mian, and couldn't help but ask: \"Between me and Ling Sheng, who do you think is more handsome?\"","Qi Quan was the department's senior consultant. The department had her file, including information on the people and ghosts in her household.","Although Tang Mian hadn't met Ling Sheng in person, she had seen his photo. Hearing Shen Hui's question, she rolled her eyes. \"You have the nerve to ask that?\"","Shen Hui: \"I have self-awareness, but today a beauty only hit on me.\"","He recounted the incident to Tang Mian.","Tang Mian: \"...\"","She analyzed: \"You said her face shows abundant peach blossom luck, and she's dismissive of men infatuated with her. She's very likely a player.\"","\"So?\"","\"Players don't hit on just anyone,\" Tang Mian looked him up and down. \"It's not because you're more handsome than Ling Sheng. It's because you didn't have Senior Qi Quan by your side.\"","Shen Hui: \"...\"","He thought about it; it made sense.","Ling Sheng had the Great One Qi Quan with him. A female player, knowing she couldn't compete, could only settle for the next best option—him.","Just as their conversation ended, the department's alarm suddenly blared.","\"A Level Four ghost has appeared on Wutong Road in Nanhu District!\"","The two exchanged a glance and immediately rushed out of the Investigation Department.","Wutong Road is not far from the police station. According to the investigation, the last place the Level Four ghost appeared was Shengyuan Tower.","Shengyuan Tower is the office building of Shengyuan Real Estate. The Song family used to be the major shareholder here.","And just moments ago, a man named Dai Chao fell to his death from the thirty-fifth floor.","When they arrived at Shengyuan Tower, the onlookers had already been dispersed by the police. A pool of blood remained on the ground, and the body had been taken away.","Shao Jing was also at the scene. Having likely witnessed Dai Chao's fatal fall firsthand, she was quite shaken. Her face pale, she crouched on the ground, her body trembling uncontrollably.","Shen Hui quickly gathered the details.","After they left the police station, Shao Jing agreed to the police's request to come and persuade Dai Chao. Dai Chao then abandoned his intention to jump. But just as he had one leg back over the rooftop railing, his body suddenly tilted backward, as if pushed by someone, and he plummeted straight down.","He fell eerily past the safety air cushion set up below, dying instantly.","However, that \"someone\" did not exist."]},{"number":56,"title":"Chapter 56","paragraphs":["The Investigation Department detected the presence of a Level Four Red Ghost, but by the time they arrived, its traces had already vanished.","Shen Hui and Tang Mian pursued it for most of the day but found no sign of the Red Ghost.","The two returned to the Investigation Department, dejected.","The alarm in the department had not sounded again.","Could the ghost have fled beyond the boundaries of Longjiang City in such a short time?","Meng Yunzheng couldn't figure out the situation either.","He said, \"I'll go ask Senior Qi Quan.\"","He actually didn't want to disturb Qi Quan's secluded cultivation over every little thing. The department never bothered Qi Quan with ordinary cases, only turning to her for help when faced with difficult-to-solve incidents.","When Qi Quan received the call, she was making new clothes for her ghost servants.","Su Steward and Teacher Xue wore the same few outfits every day. Even if they weren't tired of them, she was tired of looking at them.","\"Director Meng.\"","Meng Yunzheng said respectfully, \"Senior, a case of an evil ghost harming people has appeared in the city. The department detected its traces, but the monitoring was lost very quickly. I'm worried that the evil ghost will continue to hide its tracks and commit more crimes.\"","Logically, the Investigation Department should be able to monitor evil ghosts. The department alarm had sounded, indicating the system was functioning normally. Why did it suddenly disappear?","Qi Quan thought for a moment and said, \"Perhaps the evil ghost is wearing a concealment talisman, preventing its ghostly aura from being detected.\"","\"A ghost wearing a talisman?\" Meng Yunzheng felt a chill. \"Could it be a ghost raised by a celestial master?\"","Qi Quan: \"It's possible.\"","\"But the department alarm did go off.\"","\"When it attacks people, ghostly aura will leak out.\"","\"That's true.\" Meng Yunzheng quickly asked, \"In this situation, is there a way to break through it?\"","Qi Quan: \"I'll try.\"","She put down her phone, closed her eyes, and expanded her spiritual sense. It spread rapidly from the lakeside villa as the center, radiating outward.","At the second stage of the Human Emperor realm, her spiritual sense could almost cover the entire Longjiang City.","As long as her cultivation level was higher than the grade of the concealment talisman, she could quickly lock onto that evil ghost.","Her spiritual sense swept over the city's steel forest, drifted past the busy streets, brushed against leaves already showing signs of withering, and finally—","Found it!","Her eyes snapped open, and she summoned Xue Hong.","The people at the Investigation Department couldn't see the evil ghost under the concealment talisman, but Xue Hong, being a ghost herself, could sense it.","That ghost was only Level Four, while Xue Hong was already Level Five.","Qi Quan pointed out the ghost's trail and instructed Xue Hong to capture it immediately and bring it back.","Xue Hong's face lit up with excitement. Since becoming a ghost, she had never fought another ghost.","In a mall next to Wutong Road, Shao Jing came out of a bathroom stall and turned on the faucet at the sink. The image of Dai Chao falling from the building flashed in her mind again, and her hands trembled slightly.","She hadn't wanted Dai Chao to die; otherwise, she wouldn't have cooperated with the police to try and persuade him.","But who knew Dai Chao would suddenly fall, right in front of her, shattered to pieces.","She retched dryly into the sink.","Stomach acid came up. She reached out to catch water to rinse her mouth when suddenly, the water from the faucet turned the color of blood!","She let out a gasp, stepping back in horror, staring at the blood on her hands and screaming sharply.","Others in the restroom: ???","A lunatic?","Someone asked kindly, \"What's wrong?\"","The voice was rather pleasant, somewhat familiar.","Shao Jing couldn't care about anything else, pointing at the sink and shouting, \"Blood! There's blood!\"","Everyone: \"...\"","Where's the blood? Could she really be mentally ill?","...","\"You must have seen wrong, there's no blood.\" That voice was gentle and pleasant, carrying a hint of indulgence. \"Take a closer look.\"","Shao Jing blinked. Looking over again, the sink was clean and white. Apart from splashed water droplets, there wasn't a trace of anything else.","\"Did I... see wrong?\" she asked dazedly.","The voice said, \"Yes, you saw wrong. Don't be afraid, I will protect you.\"","Shao Jing's eyes widened abruptly.","She looked fearfully into the mirror. In the reflection, a man had appeared beside her at some point.","The man was handsome and elegant, wearing gold-rimmed glasses, smiling at her.","But—","This man was already dead, ahhhhh!","Shao Jing was so frightened she couldn't speak.","Just as she was about to faint, another woman appeared in the mirror.","The woman had a neat, shoulder-length bob, strikingly beautiful features, and a pale complexion. She wore a beautiful red dress and stretched out a slender hand to grip the male ghost's neck.","\"Do you think you're very handsome?\" Xue Hong slapped his head with her palm. \"You think just because you wear a concealment talisman no one can catch you? So foolish, truly a waste of my time.\"","Male ghost: \"...\"","Shao Jing: ???","Xue Hong grabbed the male ghost by the collar and disappeared from the mirror, floating all the way back to the villa.","She moved quickly. Meng Yunzheng was still on his way.","The male ghost was trapped in the living room, unable to go anywhere.","Xue Hong leaned on the sofa, holding a book, sipping tea, keeping an eye on the male ghost's movements from the corner of her eye.","Her posture was too leisurely, sparking jealousy in the male ghost.","The male ghost sneered coldly, \"A ghost drinking tea? Can you even taste it?\"","Xue Hong paused for a moment, looked him over a few times, and said sympathetically, \"You're really pitiful.\"","Male ghost: ?","\"Of course I can taste it. My Master is someone your foolish-as-a-pig owner can compare to?\"","Male ghost: \"...\"","Why does she always have to call people stupid?","He didn't believe it. \"They're both celestial masters who raise ghosts, birds of a feather.\"","Xue Hong shot a burst of ghostly power at him, causing the male ghost's form to waver in pain as he bent over and fell to the ground.","\"If you don't know how to use idioms, then shut up. Our Master is beautiful and kind-hearted. Your owner only makes you do evil deeds. Don't worry, since you've killed someone, you'll definitely face soul dispersion.\"","She suddenly stopped, puzzled. \"You speak of your celestial master like that, aren't you afraid he'll hear?\"","The male ghost adjusted his glasses. \"Hah, he's already been dispersed himself, how could he control us anymore?\"","\"Us?\" Xue Hong keenly caught the word. \"How many more are there?\"","\"Many, many. More than you can count.\"","Xue Hong: \"...\"","A figure stepped into the living room, toying with a peach wood talisman in hand.","Xue Hong immediately stood up. \"Master, you're here. Please, have a seat.\"","Qi Quan sat on the sofa, released the Car-stopping Ghost from the peach wood talisman, and asked, \"Do you know him?\"","The Car-stopping Ghost looked carefully for a moment. \"I know him.\"","This ghost was Level Four, quite handsome. Among the ghosts raised by that Level Eight Celestial Master, his level was relatively high, and his status was much higher than a lowly Level Two White Ghost like himself, so he had an impression.","The system also reacted, asking: [Big shot, could this be one of the ghosts raised by that Level Eight Celestial Master?]","Qi Quan: [Not exactly 'raised,' more like controlled.]","Controlling ghosts is different from nurturing ghost servants.","There are many methods for celestial masters to command ghosts; ghost servants are the closest bond.","If a celestial master dies, their ghost servants also perish.","But other ghosts without a established contract would completely break free from the celestial master's control and become free ghosts.","That Level Eight Celestial Master probably controlled many ghosts. To better control the powerful ones, the major ghosts were likely forced into contracts. Now that the celestial master is dead, the ghost servants died with him.","The major ghosts under contract must have committed many evil deeds for the celestial master. In that sense, this can also be considered a good deed.","However—","Low-level ghosts like this male ghost and the Car-stopping Ghost, regaining their freedom after the celestial master's death, might cause trouble in various places.","She had already sent a message to Li Guoyan, instructing all regional investigation offices to strictly monitor the traces of evil ghosts.","The male ghost couldn't discern her cultivation level, but he could vaguely sense she was even more formidable than his former master. He wisely chose not to speak.","Qi Quan said, \"You worked for your master, so you must know quite a few secrets. Start talking.\"","Male ghost: ???","Wait, are you just going to \"interrogate\" me so casually?","Could you at least have some sense of ceremony?","Ultimately, intimidated by Qi Quan's aura, he complied, \"I wasn't a core ghost servant. I don't know much, and I don't know what you want to ask about.\"","Qi Quan: \"Bloodburst Pills.\"","Male ghost: \"...\"","He said awkwardly, \"I really wasn't involved in that sort of thing. The tasks the master assigned me were all minor.\"","\"For example?\"","\"Like going to some families to create spooky phenomena to scare them, then having the master show up to trick them into paying money. We also took on some jobs to harm people.\"","Qi Quan: \"What kind of jobs to harm people?\"","\"If someone held a grudge against an enemy and wanted them to have bad luck, they'd send me over to cause 'accidents' for that enemy, things like that.\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","[What's an eighth-level master doing this for? Is he short on money?] The system truly couldn't understand.","At that moment, Meng Yunzheng arrived.","He had brought Shen Hui and Tang Mian with him.","Qi Quan said, \"I still have some questions to ask. Please wait a moment.\"","Meng Yunzheng hurriedly said, \"Please, go ahead and ask.\"","\"Have a seat.\" Qi Quan nodded.","Su Steward timely came out to serve tea to the three guests.","Meng Yunzheng sat down with the other two, thinking to himself how enviable the senior's life seemed.","\"What level of ghosts were involved with the Bloodburst Pills?\" Qi Quan continued asking.","Male ghost: \"Around sixth or seventh level.\"","\"What tasks did they do?\"","The male ghost shook his head, \"I'm not too sure either, but they probably acted as bodyguards or security for the master.\"","Qi Quan: \"In which areas did they usually operate?\"","Ghosts were human before becoming ghosts, and humans are inherently social creatures.","People form groups, and so do ghosts.","When ghosts gather, they inevitably chat, and chatting always leaks information.","None of them were professionally trained ghosts, so their secrecy wasn't that tight.","Sure enough, the male ghost answered without much thought, \"I overheard them chatting before. They said Longtang, though remote, had pretty girls. They also said the spiritual energy in Longlin City was too strong, making it hard for them to breathe, so they all disliked going to Longlin for assignments.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","To be honest, there really isn't much difference between ghosts and people.","Previously, they learned about Longlin from the car-blocking ghost; now Longtang was added. The evil cultivator's hideouts were indeed more than one.","Qi Quan stopped questioning and said, \"Director Meng, you can take him back for interrogation.\"","Meng Yunzheng hesitated, \"His concealment talisman...\"","If he hadn't mentioned it, Qi Quan would have almost forgotten.","A surge of spiritual power struck the male ghost, dispelling the sixth-level concealment talisman. The monitor in Shen Hui's hand instantly beeped...","A mere fourth-level red ghost, yet equipped with a sixth-level talisman—it showed how wealthy and powerful this evil cultivator organization was.","The male ghost grew even more fearful of Qi Quan.","A sixth-level talisman was shattered by her so effortlessly.","Meng Yunzheng stood up and said, \"Then we won't disturb you any further, Senior.\"","[Big shot, aren't you going to ask who he harmed? I'm so curious.] The system said expectantly.","Qi Quan: ...","[Big shot, please, I'm begging you.]","Qi Quan asked casually, as if it were an afterthought, \"What did he do?\"","It was the system who begged her, not that she was curious herself.","Meng Yunzheng immediately answered, \"He pushed someone to their death from a building at Shengyuan Plaza.\"","[Just as I thought! A bad master can only raise bad ghosts! How vile!] The system was indignant.","Xue Hong suddenly spoke up, \"When I found him, he was in a mall restroom, terrorizing an innocent lady in front of the mirror.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","That preference was quite perverse.","\"She's not innocent at all!\" The male ghost suddenly erupted, his eyes reddening, \"I was killed because of her! No, wait, that's not right, she didn't kill me... I committed suicide...\"","Everyone was speechless again.","Was this ghost mentally sound?","The male ghost laughed neurotically, \"And that man wasn't killed by me either! He wanted to jump himself! He actually tried to use suicide to force Jingjing to accept his proposal! How ridiculous!\"","\"...\"","Xue Hong: \"If I may ask, how many years have you been dead?\"","The male ghost's eyes glowed red, and he said gloomily, \"Three years.\"","\"The Jingjing you mentioned, is that the woman in the restroom?\"","\"Exactly!\" A strange smile appeared on the male ghost's face. \"She was so scared when she saw me. I didn't mean to scare her. It's just that I hadn't seen her in three years, I missed her so much. So the moment I broke free from control, I rushed back as fast as I could. But what did I see?\"","His eyes burned with fury, \"She was accepting a proposal from some shameless scoundrel! How could she! She clearly said she loved me the most!\"","\"Since that shameless scoundrel wanted to prove his love by dying, I just gave him a little push.\"","Xue Hong raised an eyebrow, \"So, you committed suicide to prove your love for her too?\"","Male ghost: \"...\"","Everyone: Seems that's the case.","What a terrifying view of love!","Wasn't being alive good enough?","System: [So, does that Jingjing have issues?]","Shen Hui said, \"Senior, we've seen Shao Jing before, when we went to apply for the ID card, right outside the police station.\"","[It's her!] The system exclaimed in shock, [That woman who tried to flirt with Investigator Shen!]","Qi Quan: ...","She just went to get an ID card.","The system said, [Big shot, logically, with your constitution, you shouldn't trigger cases so easily.]","[Oh?]","[Your cultivation is so high; any demon or ghost would be finished if they met you. Why would they insist on crashing into you? It defies logic!]","Qi Quan: ...","System: [But then I thought about it again. Just as Philanthropist Ji said, you are someone with great fortune. Perhaps the Heavenly Dao has high hopes for you, which is why you have such a fateful connection with these demons and ghosts.]","Qi Quan: ...","This was probably the price for extending her life.","She didn't actually find it annoying.","In her previous life, she often handled various incidents, yet still cultivated faster than others. Talent might be one reason, but more likely, worldly cultivation was simply more suitable for her.","Qi Quan said, \"I observed her face reading before. She just has ordinary, excessive peach blossom luck. There's no sinister intent to harm others.\"","\"Of course she didn't harm anyone!\" The male ghost started shouting again, \"We were all willing! I was the one who loved her the most! I was willing to die for her!\"","Everyone had reached the peak of speechlessness.","What kind of love-struck fool was this?","Qi Quan: \"We?\"","\"Heh, she had quite a few pursuers. I knew them all. I also knew she did it on purpose. She deliberately strung us along. She just wanted us to love her. I wanted her to love me too. Why wouldn't she be with me?\"","Shen Hui: \"So you committed suicide?\"","He looked clever, yet did something so absurd. Unbelievable.","Male ghost: \"Wah wah wah... I saw her today. She's still so beautiful, still so pitiable and lovable.\"","\"...\"","Qi Quan: \"Take him away.\"","All that nonsense gave me a headache.","Meng Yunzheng and the other two quickly took the ghosts away, oh, and the car-blocking ghost too, all taken to the Investigation Department for questioning.","Peace and quiet returned to the Lakeside Villa.","As soon as Qi Quan returned to her room, Ling Sheng followed her in.","He was holding a piece of paper with intricate and complex talisman patterns drawn on it. These patterns carried a certain strange regularity and indeed held a hint of the power of laws.","She smiled and nodded. \"Not bad.\"","Although still somewhat rough, the ability to create new talisman patterns showed his profound understanding of the Talisman Dao.","Ling Sheng handed the paper and pen to her.","\"What for?\"","[You draw.]","Qi Quan: \"What if I can't draw it?\"","[You can.]","Qi Quan chuckled. She had studied it a bit last night and indeed had some ideas, but whether she could actually draw it would be proven on paper.","She didn't know where Ling Sheng got his confidence in her.","Instantly compressing energy shared the same principle as when she used a spiritual energy shield to compress Lu Jiang's self-detonation energy before.","But combining this principle with talisman patterns was not easy.","When the Puppet Talisman self-destructed, it would instantly obliterate the original soul. It was directly bound to the soul. Even Qi Quan couldn't guarantee she could act in time to protect the original soul.","She could compress Lu Jiang's explosion only because she could apply force externally. As for the Puppet Talisman bound to the soul, she couldn't achieve that level of precision.","Ling Sheng's idea was worth trying.","Binding a talisman seal to the soul. Once self-destruct energy appeared within the soul, the seal would be simultaneously activated, capture the energy, compress it, and then \"surgically\" remove it.","But the premise was that the Puppet Talisman had no exclusivity.","The Puppet Talisman couldn't reject the soul binding another talisman seal.","Fortunately, they had five people to experiment on.","Qi Quan took the paper and pen, bent over the desk, and began working.","Sunlight from outside the window slanted in, a few strands falling on her hair, shimmering with a dazzling light.","Ling Sheng looked down at her.","Wisps of spiritual energy emerged from his palm, splitting into two strands that continuously transformed behind Qi Quan's back.","One strand turned into a miniature Qi Quan, the other into a miniature Ling Sheng.","But clearly, the likeness of the miniature Ling Sheng was much rougher.","The two little figures faced each other.","The little Qi Quan cupped the little Ling Sheng's face and gave a soft peck on his forehead. The little Ling Sheng was stunned. After the kiss, the little Qi Quan heartlessly patted her bottom and walked away.","He played happily, thinking Qi Quan couldn't see because it was behind her, unaware that the system had watched the entire show.","[Hahahahahaha!] The system roared with laughter.","Qi Quan: [?]","...","System: [You haven't opened your spiritual sense, right?]","Qi Quan: [Mm.]","Using spiritual sense consumed energy. Unless necessary, she usually kept it closed.","The system snickered: [How about you open it and take a look?]","Without stopping her hand movements, Qi Quan quietly opened her spiritual sense.","Her hand holding the pen suddenly paused.","What... was this?","Ling Sheng remained unaware.","He didn't know why, but he really liked this scene. An inexplicable restlessness surged in his heart. He wanted to vent it but didn't know how, so he came up with this trick.","Repeating it a few more times should calm it down, right?","With single-minded focus, he used his spiritual energy to transform the miniature figures, repeating the scene over and over again. He didn't know what meaning this held either, he just felt happy doing it.","Qi Quan: ...","Last night, she just found Ling Sheng too well-behaved and cute and couldn't resist giving him a peck.","Anyway, Ling Sheng was already part of the Lakeside Villa. Her doing that shouldn't be a problem... right?","System: [...]","System: [Boss, how about I recommend a few romance novels for you to read?]","The boss was incredibly capable, just a bit lacking in certain areas.","Qi Quan said expressionlessly: [No need.]","She quickly finished the last stroke. \"Done.\"","The spiritual energy behind her swiftly returned to Ling Sheng's palm.","He immediately turned his gaze to the talisman pattern on the paper, his eyes revealing admiration.","The talisman she drew was more refined and fluid than his.","And more powerful.","Qi Quan: \"This is the first draft. I'll refine it further.\"","Researching new talismans couldn't be rushed. It needed to be slowly reasoned out and drawn, finding the point closest to the laws to achieve more effective results.","Ling Sheng nodded.","He picked up the paper and pen but didn't leave.","Qi Quan looked up and asked calmly, \"Something else?\"","The young man unconsciously glanced at the space between her brows, then quickly averted his gaze, shook his head, and left the room holding the paper and pen.","System: [Boss, which one are you planning to try first?]","Qi Quan: [Let them draw lots.]","[...]","Investigation Department.","After interrogating the car-blocking ghost and the male ghost, Meng Yunzheng compiled the information and reported it to the Longjing Headquarters.","The clues pointed to Longlin City and Longtang City.","The male ghost and the car-blocking ghost didn't know many core secrets. After the questioning, the car-blocking ghost was sent for reincarnation. As for the male ghost, since he had harmed people, he was definitely going to be obliterated.","Before his soul scattered, he screamed in terror, \"There's one more thing! One more thing I want to confess! I plead for leniency!\"","Meng Yunzheng: ?","He said with a solemn expression, \"Speak.\"","\"I don't want my soul scattered. I want leniency,\" the male ghost insisted. \"Otherwise I won't tell.\"","Meng Yunzheng: \"What kind of leniency do you want?\"","\"No death penalty.\"","Meng Yunzheng: \"That depends on the value of the clue you provide.\"","The male ghost gritted his teeth and said, \"I know a secret of Shao Jing's.\"","Everyone: ???","Weren't you just desperately in love before? Now you're dragging her down with you?","The male ghost could no longer care about that. Holding his head, he said bitterly, \"After I died, I wasn't immediately taken by a master to be a ghost servant. I loved her so much, I wished I could always be by her side, so I went to her house.\"","Tang Mian's face was icy. \"A male ghost, going to a girl's house, aren't you disgusting?\"","\"I didn't do anything!\" the male ghost argued for himself. \"I was only there for a little while.\"","\"Then what... secret did you see?\"","The male ghost: \"She has a group.\"","\"What group?\"","\"The group name is 'Siren Queen.' They chat about topics like how to hook up with men, lure men in, make men obsessed.\"","The male ghost's rationality and emotions were split.","He clearly knew Shao Jing was just toying with him, yet he still loved her so much.","Everyone: \"...\"","Stop pretending to be affectionate, okay?","Your final act of dragging her down already proves everything, okay?","The male ghost remained immersed in his own great love.","He said, \"I knew she was just playing with me, but I couldn't bring myself to be angry with her. I loved her too much, I couldn't bear to hurt her.\"","Tang Mian: \"So after all that, you just want to say Shao Jing has a player group?\"","\"No!\" The male ghost quickly shook his head. \"That's not the point!\"","\"Then get to the point,\" Shen Hui felt mentally exhausted.","The male ghost: \"The point is, I seemed to sense a bit of ghostly aura from that group, really! I swear I remember correctly, that group really had ghostly aura, and it wasn't weak, it was strong! I didn't dare provoke it, so I...\"","\"So you left Shao Jing's house?\" Tang Mian finished his unspoken words.","And you still claim to love her desperately?","Self-delusion is terrifying.","Meng Yunzheng: \"Lock him up for now. Investigate Shao Jing's group.\"","Somewhere in Longjiang City, inside a room.","Shao Jing huddled on her bed in the bedroom, her face extremely pale.","Falling to one's death, the familiar face in the mirror, the strange woman in the mirror—all transformed into spectral shadows, howling as they charged towards her.","She clenched the quilt, huddling inside and trembling uncontrollably.","What should she do?","What could she possibly do?","\"Beep.\"","Her phone suddenly chimed.","After the first sound, it began emitting a continuous stream of notification tones.","It must be the group chat.","As a woman living alone, she usually had no one to talk to. Now, terrified beyond measure, she thought of pouring out her fears to the people in the group.","Shao Jing grabbed her phone and burrowed back under the covers.","The glow from the phone screen cast a pallid light on her face.","She didn't bother to read their ongoing conversation, her hands shaking as she typed out a message.","[Seeking Purity: Sisters, what do I do? I'm so scared!]","[Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts: What happened? Don't be afraid, tell us quickly.]","[All Men Are Equally Rotten: Was it some disgusting guy trying to force himself on you to get you? Destroy him!]","[Are There Not Enough Fish in the Pond?: Caught in a love triangle? Men fighting over you? Men getting out of control?]","[Seeking Purity: No, it's that someone jumped off a building right in front of me. He died horribly, I saw it with my own eyes. I caused his death. Should I not have tried to lure him?]","[All Men Are Equally Rotten: Is that all? If he wanted to die, let him die. What does it have to do with you?]","[Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts: Don't worry, he just loved you too much. He used this method to prove his love for you. You don't need to feel guilty or blame yourself; it was his own choice.]","[Are There Not Enough Fish in the Pond?: Yeah, yeah, men. They talk all about love, but behind the scenes, pfft.]","[Seeking Purity: But today when I was washing my hands, I saw the water from the tap turn red! And I saw a dead person in the mirror! He used to pursue me too, but I didn't agree. It's really terrifying! Am I haunted...?]","[Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts: In the mirror? A dead person? You really saw it?]","[Seeking Purity: I really saw it!]","[All Men Are Equally Rotten: Not a hallucination? People can have hallucinations when they're too scared. Maybe you should get some sleep first?]","[Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts: Did he hurt you?]","[Seeking Purity: No.]","[Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts: Did he die for you?]","[Seeking Purity: I don't know...]","[Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts: You're doing great!]","[Seeking Purity: Huh?]","[Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts: Look, one man after another is so infatuated with you, dying for you, jumping for you. Isn't that success? You're the one who aspires to be a Siren Queen. Your calling is to make men lose their minds over you. They're just choosing to prove their love through death. What are you afraid of?]","Shao Jing unconsciously held her breath.","Shouldn't she be afraid?","Was this really success?","Was making men die for her truly what she wanted?","Shao Jing fell into deep contemplation.","She had initially joined this group simply because she had been hurt by a man. Feeling bitter and depressed, she had posted a rant online venting about the scumbag.","Not long after posting, a comment appeared below it, containing a group number and an invitation to join.","As if bewitched, she added it.","Everyone in the group was complaining about terrible men. Her emotions found an outlet, and she immersed herself in this cathartic frenzy, gradually nurturing thoughts of revenge.","She learned techniques for seducing men from the group.","She successfully hooked many men, reveling in their adoration and favor, recklessly toying with their emotions.","Three years ago, the suicide of the male ghost in the mirror hadn't bothered her much because she didn't have strong feelings for him; he was just another man who desired her but couldn't have her.","Suicide?","What did it have to do with her?","But when Dai Chao fell to his death right before her eyes, she was genuinely terrified by the scene.","In that instant, she was overwhelmed with guilt.","Was what she was doing really right?","Why were these men so utterly captivated by her?","Did she really possess such great charm?","She thought it, and so she asked.","[Seeking Purity: I don't think I'm unattractive, but I'm no stunning beauty either. Why is it that just by using the techniques taught in the group, those men swarm around me as if they've never seen a woman before? Are those techniques really that effective?]","Aren't they just psychological tactics?","[Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts: The techniques are just aids. The reason they're drawn to you is because of your own innate charm. Don't overthink it. Look, even if they come back, they won't hurt you, right? Just focus on being yourself. You're the one destined to be a Siren Queen.]","[Seeking Purity: But, but I'm really scared.]","Shao Jing felt she couldn't bear another shock like this.","She didn't want to actually cause someone's death.","[Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts: If you're truly afraid, I have a solution. Here, check your private messages.]","Shao Jing switched to the private chat interface.","[Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts: [Image]]","[Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts: This is a protective talisman I obtained from a Taoist temple. It's very effective. Take a look at it; you probably won't feel scared anymore.]","Shao Jing stared at the talisman for a while and discovered that her anxious fear indeed receded like a tide. She no longer felt guilty or blamed herself for Dai Chao's fall. Overjoyed, she hurriedly asked:","[Where did you buy this talisman? I'd like to get one too.]","[Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts: If you want it, I can give it to you.]","[Seeking Purity: That's not right, is it?]","[Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts: We're so close now, no need to be polite with me.]","[Seeking Purity: Really, it's not necessary. I feel much better now. Thank you, Sister Hazelnut.]","\"Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts\" had always been the group's caring big sister. No matter who encountered difficulties, she would appear promptly and help them through it. Many girls in the group trusted her implicitly.","[Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts: It's no trouble, it's what I should do.]","Shao Jing breathed a sigh of relief.","This probably meant she wouldn't insist on sending the talisman, right?","She had been tense all day. Once the fear subsided, she felt utterly drowsy and soon fell asleep.","Early the next morning, as soon as Shao Jing got up, she heard the doorbell.","Sunlight streamed in through the floor-to-ceiling windows, filling the apartment with bright, clean light. There wasn't a trace of eerie gloom; the fears and worries of the previous night had completely vanished.","In a cheerful mood, she peered through the peephole.","It was the delivery guy who often came.","She opened the door.","\"Ms. Shao, a package for you.\"","Shao Jing was surprised. \"Is there a mistake? I didn't order anything.\"","Delivery guy: \"It definitely has your address and contact info. Maybe it's a surprise from someone?\"","Thinking of the men pursuing her, Shao Jing accepted this explanation.","She signed for it and took the package.","The package was a very small box, light in weight. She shook it, but there wasn't a sound.","With a sense of unease, Shao Jing sliced open the tape on the packaging.","She opened the box. Inside lay a talisman paper, imprinted with vermillion markings—identical to the protective talisman \"Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts\" had sent her the night before!","A chill shot from the soles of her feet straight to the crown of her head.","Shao Jing took a step back in fright, her face pale, gasping for breath as she stared fixedly at the address and phone number on the delivery box.","She had never shared her private information in the group!","So how did \"Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts\" know her address and number?","Shao Jing felt a bone-deep cold.","Her phone suddenly chirped.","She looked at it in a daze.","[Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts: Jingjing, did you receive the delivery?]","Shao Jing's fingers trembled slightly. Just as she was about to reply, the doorbell rang again.","She shivered violently, her eyes darting between the delivery box and the front door.","What should she do?","The doorbell rang a few times, then switched to knocking.","The knocks were heavy, thudding against the door as if pounding directly on her heart, making it race wildly.","She picked up her phone, about to call the police.","\"Ms. Shao Jing, are you home? We're from the police. If you're home, please open the door.\"","A woman's voice sounded from outside.","Shao Jing: ?...","In a haze, she moved to the door and peered through the peephole.","They really were police officers!","But these days, it wasn't unheard of for people to impersonate officers to do harm.","She didn't respond immediately.","\"Ms. Shao Jing, regarding Dai Chao's falling case yesterday, we met at the scene.\"","Shao Jing's eyes lit up.","Yes! There was a female officer at the scene yesterday! The voice matched!","She had been too terrified earlier to make the connection.","Shao Jing quickly opened the door, seeing the female officer and a man who looked somewhat familiar.","The man wasn't in police uniform but wore another, unfamiliar type of uniform. He was handsome and appeared extremely approachable.","Shao Jing finally remembered—","\"You're the person from the police station yesterday!\"","Shen Hui gave a slight smile. \"Ms. Shao Jing, we're here to ask about a matter. Is now a convenient time?\"","The arrival of the police dispelled Shao Jing's panic.","She immediately stepped aside, saying, \"I was just about to call the police!\"","Shen Hui and the female officer entered the apartment. \"Why were you going to call?\"","\"A stranger sent me something, but I've never given out my address or phone number. It's terrifying!\" Shao Jing led them to the table, pointing at the delivery box. \"It's inside, it was a talisman—\"","Her eyes widened in shock. \"How is it gone? There was definitely a talisman in here! It was just here! I didn't even touch it!\"","Shen Hui looked into the box. It was indeed empty.","He said gently, \"Don't panic. Please tell us everything in detail.\"","But Shao Jing clutched her head, tugging at her hair.","\"Am I hallucinating again?\"","\"Again?\"","\"Yesterday in the mirror...\" She suddenly remembered something and opened her private messages on the phone. \"She sent me a picture of that talisman last night!\"","However, there was no chat history at all between her and \"Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts\" on her phone!","Even the \"Siren Queen\" group had vanished!","Shao Jing: \"...\"","Her mind went completely blank.","For a moment, she truly believed she was having hallucinations.","Had she been living in a dream for the past three years?","Remembering what the male ghost had said yesterday about \"ghostly aura in the group,\" Shen Hui felt a jolt of alarm and immediately said:","\"Ms. Shao, please bring your phone and the delivery box, and come with us.\""]},{"number":57,"title":"Chapter 57","paragraphs":["Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan made the final stroke on the talisman paper, and a pale golden light suddenly flashed, as if the sound of thunder rumbled high in the sky.","The birth of every new talisman that conforms to the laws of the Dao elicits a response from the Heavenly Dao.","Qi Quan looked at the new eighth-grade talisman in her hand, a slight smile lifting her lips.","Every time she completed a new talisman, or researched a new type of formation, she felt immense satisfaction.","A hand holding a phone appeared before her eyes.","[Very impressive.]","Qi Quan smiled and asked, \"You contributed to this new talisman too. Help me think of a name for it.\"","Ling Sheng was stunned for a moment. Sitting beside her, he propped his chin on one hand, pondered briefly, and then wrote on the phone: [Compression Talisman.]","Qi Quan: ?","System: ???","It was indeed straightforward and easy to understand.","Qi Quan sighed inwardly: [Suddenly, I feel the name I gave him isn't that bad.]","System: [Hahahahaha!]","After laughing, it asked: [So, have you thought of a nicer name?]","Qi Quan: [I can't deprive someone else of the sense of accomplishment from naming it. Let's go with this.]","System: [Pfft.]","Both were terrible at naming.","\"Let's go, to the Investigation Department,\" Qi Quan said.","Ling Sheng followed her.","She had contacted Meng Yunzheng earlier, and when she went out, a car was already waiting at the villa entrance.","Qi Quan cast an illusion spell on Ling Sheng's face and got into the Investigation Department's car.","The driver this time was Tang Mian.","She had changed her hairstyle to a neat, ear-length bob, making her look even more efficient and sharp.","She drove as steadily as Shen Hui.","The system was surprised: [It's actually not Investigator Shen picking you up this time.]","Qi Quan chuckled.","Shen Hui surely had his own missions; he wasn't her personal chauffeur.","\"Senior, Shen Hui is out on a case, so I'm here to pick you up today,\" Tang Mian proactively explained.","Qi Quan smiled, \"Thank you for your trouble.\"","Tang Mian felt excited internally, a hint of exhilaration showing on her face.","The car drove all the way to the Investigation Department.","The Investigation Department was still located in the standalone villa in the suburbs. Compared to its previous desolation, the place was now bustling with people.","A long line had even formed at the entrance.","A sign stood in front of the line with the words \"Recruitment\" written in large characters.","Meng Yunzheng had already come to the entrance to greet her, drawing the attention of many queuing practitioners.","\"Is that Director Meng?\"","\"Yes, I've seen his photo on the official website.\"","\"He's waiting for someone?\"","\"The Director himself is waiting? Who has such prestige?\"","\"You don't know? Our department's Chief Consultant lives in Longjiang!\"","The crowd suddenly fell silent, then erupted into a frenzy the next second.","\"Oh my god! It's the Chief Consultant!\"","\"Is the Chief Consultant really coming?\"","\"Wuwuwu, I never thought I'd get to see the goddess just by coming to queue!\"","Under everyone's expectant gazes, a car stopped at the entrance of the Investigation Department.","Meng Yunzheng personally stepped forward and opened the rear door.","Qi Quan inside the car: ?","Giving her this much face?","She smoothly got out of the car, facing a long line of fervent looks with calm and composed composure.","Ling Sheng got out from the other side, but circled around the car body to stand beside her.","\"My god! The goddess is so beautiful!\"","\"Both beautiful and heroic!\"","\"I came to sign up today at just the right time!\"","\"Who is that next to the senior?\"","\"An assistant, probably.\"","\"The assistant is so lucky, able to be by the senior's side every day.\"","\"Who says otherwise.\"","Ignoring these discussions, Qi Quan stepped through the Investigation Department's gate.","Suddenly, a young voice rang out from the crowd.","\"Senior Qi! Was that giant sword shadow in Longhu City your doing?\"","The entire area fell silent.","Brother, you've got guts!","But everyone pricked up their ears; they were also extremely curious about this.","Qi Quan turned around, her expression showing not the slightest arrogance, even revealing a faint smile.","\"Yes.\"","After speaking, she walked into the Investigation Department amidst the crowd's reverent and admiring looks.","The crowd suddenly erupted into fierce cheers.","It really was the senior!","Wuwuwu, getting to see the senior once, I have no regrets in this life!","This news instantly spread throughout the mystical community.","Members of the mystical community: It was really to be expected.","They couldn't help but feel even more awe.","Investigation Department meeting room.","Meng Yunzheng brought in two practitioners.","\"Senior, I've already received Director Li's call saying you intend to remove their puppet talisman seals. Shall we begin now?\"","The two practitioners: ???","Remove puppet talisman seals? Seriously?","How is that possible!","The two sneered, lifting their eyes to look at Qi Quan, but suddenly felt a sharp pain in their eyes, crying out and closing them.","Ling Sheng retracted his spiritual power and continued diligently holding Qi Quan's bag.","Qi Quan paid no mind to those two.","She tossed out the peachwood plaque, releasing the soul forms of the three seventh-grade practitioners.","The three souls faced the two living practitioners, and they were all dumbfounded.","This was truly... trying to steal a chicken only to end up losing the rice.","Not a single part of their plan succeeded.","The two living practitioners, seeing the three who had already become soul forms, couldn't help but ask, \"What about the other one?\"","The eyebrowless practitioner: \"Dead.\"","The shadow cast by that giant sword was still deeply branded in his soul.","He and the other two had long lost any will to resist.","These two fools, having never personally faced the pressure of that giant sword, simply couldn't understand their fear.","The two fools widened their eyes.","Are you kidding me? Three seventh-grades, one eighth-grade, plus the Bloodburst Pill, and you still couldn't take down a twenty-two-year-old girl?","Utterly speechless!","The tall, sturdy practitioner's soul form directly knelt on the ground, pleading cowardly: \"Senior, this lowly one was blind and failed to recognize Mount Tai, accidentally offending you. Please be magnanimous and allow this lowly one to go to the cycle of reincarnation.\"","The two fools: \"...\"","So disgraceful!","Qi Quan looked at Ling Sheng.","Ling Sheng understood, took five pieces of folded paper from the bag, and handed them to the two practitioners and three souls.","\"Each of you, pick one.\"","The two practitioners and three souls were confused, but didn't dare disobey Qi Quan, so they reached out to take them.","The two fools could pick up the paper, but the three souls couldn't; they could only point, and then Ling Sheng placed the paper in front of them.","\"Open them.\"","All the folded papers were opened.","\"Whoever drew number 1, please raise your hand.\"","One of the fools raised his right hand.","Qi Quan: \"Good, it's you.\"","She recalled the three souls into the peachwood plaque, and Meng Yunzheng immediately took the two practitioners away to make preparations.","One was put back in the interrogation room, the other was taken to the department's medical room.","The chosen practitioner: ???","What is this about?","When his hands and feet were shackled to the hospital bed, he finally felt fear.","Qi Quan and Ling Sheng stood by the bed, one on the left, one on the right, looking at him with extremely calm and indifferent eyes.","\"Senior, do I need to leave?\" Meng Yunzheng asked.","Qi Quan: \"No need.\"","Meng Yunzheng then stayed at ease.","He wanted to witness this miraculous moment firsthand.","Qi Quan asked Ling Sheng: \"Ready?\"","Ling Sheng nodded.","Qi Quan shot out a strand of spiritual power, and the practitioner on the bed instantly fell unconscious.","She used her spiritual power to draw a talisman in the air.","In a short while, the eighth-grade Compression Talisman, glowing with a pale golden light, was driven by spiritual power into the practitioner's brow, slowly seeping into his spiritual platform.","There was a seventh-grade puppet talisman seal at the spiritual platform.","The seal was tightly attached deep within the spiritual platform; the slightest unusual movement would trigger its self-destruct sequence.","Qi Quan's spiritual sense probed into his spiritual platform, accurately measuring the location of the puppet talisman seal. She imprinted the Compression Talisman seal into the practitioner's spiritual platform. The talisman seal was frame-shaped, perfectly encircling the puppet talisman seal, pressing tightly against its edges, carved into the practitioner's soul.","Meng Yunzheng had never seen a frame-shaped talisman before.","Earlier, Qi Quan drawing talismans in the void had already shocked him, but he never expected Qi Quan could also create a new talisman specifically designed to counter the puppet talisman.","She was truly incredible!","The talisman seal enveloped the puppet talisman seal, which showed no reaction at all.","Qi Quan withdrew her spiritual sense.","\"I will now use the Soul-Searching Art to activate the puppet talisman's self-destruct sequence and test the effect of the Compression Talisman.\"","Ling Sheng nodded, his eyes sparkling brightly.","As a born spiritual entity, he could sense the changes in the Heavenly Master's spiritual platform even without using spiritual sense.","He was eager for the Compression Talisman to succeed.","Qi Quan formed the Soul-Searching Seal with her hands, which entered the Heavenly Master's brow. The moment the Soul-Searching Seal touched the puppet talisman, the puppet talisman initiated its self-destruct sequence, exploding deep within the spiritual platform—","In that split second, the Compression Talisman sensed the explosion and simultaneously activated its compression mechanism, forcefully suppressing the explosive energy from the outside!","After the initial phase was complete, Ling Sheng immediately channeled his spiritual power, providing ample support to the Compression Talisman, helping it continue to compress the explosive energy bit by bit into a thin, paper-like shape attached to the spiritual platform.","This process was extremely slow and arduous, requiring immense control over spiritual power.","Precise, meticulous, with not a single room for error.","Ling Sheng closed his eyes, his fingertip pressed against the Heavenly Master's brow. Spiritual power continuously flowed into the spiritual platform, performing a delicate cut along the edges of the two talisman seals, \"peeling\" them off the soul.","He must neither harm the soul nor rupture the energy shield formed by the Compression Talisman encasing the puppet talisman.","Such fine manipulation would be impossible for anyone else, but for Ling Sheng, while not easy, it wasn't particularly difficult either.","It just consumed a tremendous amount of spiritual power and mental focus.","The \"surgery\" lasted a full three hours.","By the end, Ling Sheng's face had turned pale, with fine beads of sweat seeping from his temples.","Yet, the hand pressed against the brow remained perfectly steady.","Finally—","A thin \"paper sheet\" was peeled away from the Heavenly Master's soul.","It contained an incredibly powerful explosive energy; even Meng Yunzheng standing nearby could feel its formidable pressure.","He asked, \"How should we handle this?\"","Qi Quan replied, \"The spiritual power of the Compression Talisman still has some remnants. Once the spiritual power dissipates, this thing will explode. We have about ten minutes. Find an empty, uninhabited area and let it detonate.\"","\"Understood!\"","Meng Yunzheng immediately took the \"thin sheet\" and left the medical room.","Qi Quan looked at the exhausted Ling Sheng. \"Go sit over there and rest.\"","Ling Sheng smiled, obediently sitting on a chair and patting the seat beside him.","He was inviting Qi Quan to join him.","Qi Quan didn't refuse and sat down next to him.","System: [Great One, since the puppet talisman has been removed, can we use the Soul-Searching Art now?]","[This is a society governed by law. Extracting confessions through torture is unacceptable. The Soul-Searching Art causes irreversible damage to the subject. The Investigation Department won't use it lightly.]","If information can be obtained through interrogation, there's no need for the cruel Soul-Searching Art.","System: [Oh, right.]","Qi Quan had only drawn a talisman and performed a Soul-Searching Art, not expending much spiritual power, so she remained energetic.","She straightened her back, taking advantage of Meng Yunzheng's absence to cultivate.","Suddenly, a weight settled on her shoulder.","She opened her eyes and glanced sideways.","The young man's head was tilted, resting on her shoulder. His hair, damp with fine sweat, was messily plastered to his forehead. His eyes were closed, and from Qi Quan's angle, she could only see his dense, long eyelashes and straight nose bridge.","Qi Quan thought she would mind the sweat-dampened hair.","But upon seeing the young man's tired, pale face, her heart unexpectedly softened a little.","She reached out and took Ling Sheng's hand. Spiritual power flowed like a gentle stream into his body, alleviating his exhausted energy. Under the nourishment of the spiritual power, the fine sweat on his hair disappeared, and his strands became fluffy again.","Just as she was about to withdraw her hand, it was firmly held.","Qi Quan: ...","She asked: [Does he want me to continue channeling spiritual power to him?]","System: [...]","It refused to answer.","Qi Quan hadn't really expected it to give her an answer anyway.","The young man's palm was warm and dry, slightly larger than hers, with the blue veins on the back of his hand clearly visible.","\"What's wrong?\" she asked.","Ling Sheng nuzzled against her shoulder, lifted his head, his eyes seeming to hold fallen stars. His lips moved, as if he said two words, but no sound came out.","Qi Quan: ?","She wasn't very good at lip-reading.","Right at that moment, Meng Yunzheng hurried back. As soon as he entered the door, he saw the two leaning together.","Well, to be precise, it was the senior's assistant leaning on the senior's shoulder and holding her hand.","Ah, this...","Had he come at a bad time?","Meng Yunzheng was about to take a step back when Qi Quan called out to him.","\"The puppet talisman has been removed. Begin the interrogation.\"","She also wanted to know who had been targeting her all along.","Meng Yunzheng's expression turned serious. \"Yes!\"","The interrogation went more smoothly than they had imagined.","The Heavenly Master, now freed from the puppet talisman, was not a person of strong will. After sensing that the thing controlling his life and death within his soul was gone, he confessed everything he knew.","He did indeed serve an organization, but he had never met the leader. Only a handler contacted him via phone to assign tasks.","Meng Yunzheng stood outside, frowning. \"Our technical department checked his phone before. No special numbers or call records were found.\"","Qi Quan said, \"There's a network expert involved.\"","Back in Longjing City, Li Guoyan and the others had discovered traces of that network expert, but he escaped beforehand.","This expert was likely highly skilled. The technical personnel of the Longjiang City Investigation Department weren't as capable as those at the Longjing Headquarters, so they couldn't trace it.","Meng Yunzheng thought of this too, his face flushing slightly.","Fortunately, the senior had developed the Compression Talisman and removed the puppet talisman seal. Otherwise, even if they caught someone, they wouldn't have been able to uncover any leads.","Inside the interrogation room, the interrogated Heavenly Master revealed his handler's phone number.","The technical department immediately began investigating.","Perhaps the mastermind was overly confident, believing that someone under the puppet talisman couldn't reveal the truth and trusting in the network expert's abilities, so no precautions were taken with the phone number.","\"Director Meng, we found it,\" a technician said. \"The number is registered in Longjing City. The registered owner is named Yan Mao.\"","Meng Yunzheng showed surprise.","First Yan Wu, now Yan Mao. Could these matters be related to the Yan Family?","The Yan Family was the foremost major clan in the mystical arts community.","He immediately decided to report this to the Longjing Headquarters.","Manor in the suburbs of the capital.","A steward hurried to the main room and reported, \"Family Head, a puppet talisman just detonated.\"","The man's face was expressionless. \"Hmm.\"","Puppet talismans detonating was a common occurrence, nothing to worry about.","\"Whose was it?\" he asked.","\"It was one of those sent to attack the Lakeside Villa,\" the steward replied.","The man said, \"The other one will likely follow soon.\"","At the Longjing Investigation Department, Li Guoyan, upon receiving the reported message, immediately ordered someone to investigate Yan Mao's personal information.","[Yan Mao, male, twenty-nine years old, Fourth-Level Heavenly Master, outer disciple of the Yan Family.]","The information was extremely brief.","The information was relayed to the Longjiang City Investigation Department. Meng Yunzheng couldn't help but remark, \"A Fourth-Level Heavenly Master actually giving orders to a Sixth-Level Heavenly Master. The puppet talisman is truly effective.\"","Qi Quan asked, \"What does the Department plan to do?\"","Meng Yunzheng said, \"They said to continue investigating in depth.\"","This Yan Mao was definitely just a small pawn; a bigger fish was still hidden behind him.","Qi Quan nodded.","It was time for her to go back.","This person didn't know about the Blood-Bursting Pills and had no connection to that lead. To find out about the Blood-Bursting Pills, she could only go through those three seventh-level Celestial Masters.","\"Senior, please wait a moment,\" Meng Yunzheng called out to her, asking respectfully, \"I wonder if you have time to hear about another case?\"","Qi Quan: ?","After Meng Yunzheng gave her a brief overview of the case, she became quite interested.","A ghost in a group chat teaching people to be players?","She followed Meng Yunzheng to the interrogation room.","The case details had been clarified, but Shao Jing was still staying at the investigation office, afraid to leave.","She felt the investigation office had an aura of righteous energy, making it a safe and secure place. She wanted to stay as long as possible.","When Qi Quan arrived, Shen Hui and Tang Mian were both there.","[Big shot, it's the girl who tried to pick up Investigator Shen yesterday!] The system exclaimed in surprise. [Wasn't that male ghost caught by Teacher Xue and then taken away by the investigation office? How is she involved with ghosts again?]","Otherwise, she wouldn't be at the investigation office.","Shao Jing still remembered Qi Quan.","Or rather, she had a deep impression of her.","The first time she saw Qi Quan yesterday, she was stunned by her beauty. Then, looking at the young man beside her, she felt they were a perfect match.","She had never seen anyone more attractive than them.","Overwhelmed by their looks, she couldn't help but strike up a conversation with Shen Hui, just so she could sneak a few more glances at them out of the corner of her eye.","Who would have thought that just one day later, they would meet again.","Now she could finally look at Qi Quan openly.","She was truly beautiful, so beautiful it made one feel inadequate.","Qi Quan sat down opposite Shao Jing.","Shao Jing felt a bit uneasy and asked softly, \"Did you find something wrong?\"","\"May I see your phone?\" Qi Quan asked.","Shao Jing was taken aback for a moment, then subconsciously handed over her phone.","Even her voice was so pleasant.","Qi Quan tapped on her social media avatar, gathered spiritual energy in her eyes, observed for a moment, then returned the phone to Shao Jing. She asked Meng Yunzheng:","\"Has the technical department checked it?\"","Meng Yunzheng replied, \"They've already checked. No trace of the group 'Siren Queen' was found, and the account 'Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts' wasn't found either.\"","The nicknames on this social media app were unique; there wouldn't be duplicate accounts.","\"As for other accounts like 'All Men Are the Same,' they do exist, but no traces of their chats in the 'Siren Queen' group were found.\"","The system's voice trembled a little: [This is so eerie!]","Qi Quan asked, \"What about the delivery box?\"","Shen Hui immediately brought over the delivery box.","It was a very ordinary box, and there was no talisman paper inside that Shao Jing had mentioned.","Qi Quan glanced at it and said, \"Her avatar is tainted with a bit of ghostly aura, but the delivery box is not.\"","\"Ah?\" Shao Jing was confused. \"What does that mean?\"","Qi Quan explained, \"It means there is a ghost in the group, but the talisman paper was your hallucination.\"","\"That can't be. I saw it clearly this morning,\" Shao Jing said, becoming frantic.","She couldn't accept that she might have a mental problem.","Qi Quan said, \"It's not related to your mental state. The talisman pattern sent to you last night simply had a suggestive effect.\"","It was actually a simple illusion technique, but it was more appropriate to explain it in more scientific terms to an ordinary person.","Shao Jing: \"...\"","She didn't understand: \"Why would someone plant a suggestion in me? I'm just an ordinary person!\"","Shen Hui said, \"Probably to scare you.\"","If the investigation office hadn't shown up, perhaps Shao Jing would have questioned \"Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts\" again about the strangely disappearing talisman paper. What would happen next was anyone's guess.","After the police visited, the group immediately disappeared from Shao Jing's phone, showing how alert they were.","Qi Quan asked, \"How many people were in the group? Before this, what was your relationship with her like? Have you seen this kind of talisman before?\"","Shao Jing: \"I didn't pay close attention. I remember there were about two or three hundred people. She was the caring big sister in the group, often comforting the other sisters. I never had any major issues before, so I didn't have much interaction with her. I've also never seen this kind of talisman before.\"","\"Did you ever mention the incident about that male ghost's suicide?\"","\"I never mentioned it,\" Shao Jing shook her head.","There was no need for her to spread the news that someone had committed suicide because of her.","\"Do you remember the flirting techniques shared in the group?\"","\"I remember. I already told them when they asked earlier.\"","Qi Quan looked at Meng Yunzheng, who immediately handed over the interrogation transcript.","She flipped through it.","The system read along with her, puzzled: [These conversation tactics don't seem particularly special. Could they really help someone pick up men and make men devoted to them?]","It didn't understand.","Qi Quan didn't understand either.","If these techniques could truly earn a love so deep that a man would die for it, then why did that male ghost, knowing he was about to be annihilated, mention that Shao Jing was in a \"Siren Queen\" group?","Was that love?","Qi Quan put down the transcript and asked, \"Do you remember what the group's avatar was?\"","Shao Jing froze.","She frowned, trying to recall the group avatar, but couldn't remember no matter how hard she tried. She saw it every day!","How could this be?","She hit her head, trying to force herself to remember.","At this point, it was quite clear: the avatar was problematic.","Not everyone could be active in the group chat every day, and the so-called techniques shared in the group weren't suitable for everyone. But as long as they opened the social media app, as long as someone in the group sent a message pushing the group avatar to the top, the group avatar would constantly appear in the members' line of sight.","This avatar might contain some kind of illusion technique, not only affecting the group members but possibly also imbuing them with a certain \"alluring power\" that could influence the men around them.","Of course, these were just speculations. The truth could only be determined by finding the \"Siren Queen\" group and seeing the avatar.","Meng Yunzheng said, \"I have already reported this matter to the headquarters, requesting their technical department to trace it.\"","Qi Quan nodded and stood up to leave.","Shao Jing suddenly called out to her.","\"Wait, are you... a master? A master of... that kind of thing?\"","She had heard the part about her avatar being tainted with ghostly aura.","She was very scared now.","Qi Quan turned to look at her.","Shao Jing said sheepishly, \"I just wanted to ask if there are any protective talismans or something similar. I'd like to buy one.\"","\"...\"","Shen Hui immediately said, \"The office has protective talismans. I'll get one for you later.\"","Such a small matter didn't need to trouble the senior.","The investigation office didn't have many other types of talismans, but they had plenty of the simplest protective talismans.","Many low-level investigators could draw them.","When the investigation office handled cases involving ordinary citizens, they often encountered people asking for protective talismans. Giving them out had become a habit.","They weren't worth much anyway.","\"Senior,\" Meng Yunzheng walked Qi Quan to the entrance of the investigation office and asked before she got into the car, \"The weekend is almost here again. Previously, you agreed to use the wetland ferocious ghost to train everyone weekly. Would Saturday or Sunday be convenient for you?\"","Qi Quan said, \"Saturday.\"","\"Alright, then I'll come pick you up at the Lakeside Villa tomorrow morning.\"","Qi Quan: ?","So tomorrow was Saturday.","She didn't have a \"regular job,\" so she didn't really keep track of weekdays and weekends.","\"Alright.\"","Longjing City, the Yan Family.","Yan Huai was cultivating in his room when his phone suddenly received a message.","He glanced at it and summoned Yan Geng.","\"Brother Huai, any instructions?\" Yan Huai asked, \"Do you know Yan Mao?\"","\"I know him,\" Yan Geng replied without hesitation. \"Before I entered the inner circle, I was with him in the outer circle.\"","He was relatively fortunate, having been chosen to serve by the heir of the main family. As for Yan Mao, he seemed to have stayed in the outer circle all along, and Yan Geng hadn't paid much attention to his current situation.","Yan Huai: \"Investigate his recent movements discreetly. Don't alert anyone.\"","\"Anyone?\" Yan Geng grimaced. \"What matter in our family can be hidden from the Family Head?\"","Yan Huai looked at him. \"Do you know why you were chosen to enter the inner circle back then?\"","\"Why?\"","\"Because you're clever.\"","Yan Geng: \"...\"","He didn't need that kind of praise.","\"Alright, I'll go back and think of a way.\"","Yan Huai closed his eyes again.","No matter what kind of circle, it has its own rules. Yan Geng had thrived in the outer circle back then, which naturally involved having channels for gathering information.","Since childhood, Yan Huai had been called a cultivation fanatic. He seemed to ignore family affairs and didn't interact much with others. But precisely because of this, he could see many things clearly from an outsider's perspective.","He cultivated diligently precisely to become a high-level Celestial Master early and gain more say.","When one's strength is low, no amount of talk is meaningful.","Yan Geng returned very quickly.","His channels were indeed efficient.","\"Brother Huai, I found out. Yan Mao's movements aren't particularly special, but someone has seen him frequently going to the suburbs.\"","Yan Huai: \"Hmm.\"","\"However, one thing is strange. His aptitude used to be poor; he was only a second-level Celestial Master in his twenties. But in the last two years, he progressed rapidly, jumping straight to the fourth level, second rank, almost catching up to me.\"","Yan Huai: \"Keep investigating.\"","\"Got it.\"","Yan Mao was now the only clue. The Investigation Department and Yan Huai were cooperating, sharing information internally and externally, to see if they could catch the bigger fish behind him through him.","Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan returned home and said to Su Steward, \"Ling Sheng expended some energy today. Make some dishes to replenish him.\"","Su Steward looked at Ling Sheng; his face was indeed somewhat pale. He smiled and said, \"Ling Sheng has worked hard. I'll make something delicious for lunch.\"","Ling Sheng nodded in thanks.","He was much more polite than when he first arrived.","Su Rong's smile deepened, and he turned to go to the kitchen.","The Master had already told them about Ling Sheng's background.","For someone who had been imprisoned since birth, had never seen anyone other than Ding Ji, and had never been exposed to human society, becoming like this was already quite an achievement.","Qi Quan had Ling Sheng return to his room to rest, while she went to the computer room to write.","The person behind the scenes, trying to mess with her state of mind, attacked her villa while she was away. She had always believed in the principle of reciprocity.","After finishing a chapter and cultivating for a while, lunch was ready.","Xue Hong came out of the study and, seeing the dishes on the table, exclaimed in surprise, \"The food is so lavish today!\"","There were more dishes than usual.","Su Rong smiled and said, \"The Master and Ling Sheng worked hard today, so I made a few extra dishes they like.\"","He had figured out everyone's tastes in the villa. When cooking, he paid attention to catering to everyone, ensuring each person tasted an equal amount of dishes suited to their palate every day.","Today, as Qi Quan and Ling Sheng had been \"out on duty,\" he made two extra dishes for each of them.","Xue Hong smiled and gave a thumbs-up.","Su Steward was really considerate!","The family of four had a harmonious and pleasant meal.","Qi Quan asked, \"How is your spiritual energy recovery?\"","Ling Sheng nodded, indicating he had recovered.","\"Good.\"","Qi Quan took him to a side room, previously used for \"treating\" people, and released the three souls from the peach wood talisman.","Following the same method, she had them draw lots.","The tall, burly Celestial Master was the lucky winner.","He was so scared his soul became unstable, kneeling on the ground and pleading for mercy repeatedly.","The system was disdainful: 【He looks big and strong, but who knew he'd be such a coward.】","Qi Quan waved her hand, putting the other two souls back, then shot out a stream of spiritual energy. The tall Celestial Master instantly fainted, his soul enveloped by the spiritual energy and placed on the bed in the treatment room.","Performing surgery on a living soul was somewhat more convenient than on a living person.","The flesh and blood of a living person posed a barrier, but a living soul did not.","The two of them easily saw the puppet seal branded on his soul. The seal had not been activated yet and was in a stable state.","The first time is unfamiliar, the second time is familiar.","Qi Quan effortlessly imprinted the compressed seal into the tall Celestial Master's spiritual platform, then performed a soul-searching technique, triggering the puppet seal. The puppet seal suddenly self-destructed, tightly wrapped by the compressed seal.","She withdrew her hand and looked at Ling Sheng.","Ling Sheng nodded and skillfully channeled his spiritual energy.","This surgery took less time than the previous one, finishing an hour earlier. After the surgery, Ling Sheng still had some energy left.","But a trace of fatigue still appeared on his face.","Considering he had performed two \"surgeries\" in one day, which indeed consumed a great deal of energy, Qi Quan said, \"Go back and rest first.\"","Ling Sheng shook his head and pointed at the tall Celestial Master.","He wanted to stay and accompany Qi Quan during the interrogation.","Qi Quan respected his decision, but they had to deal with the puppet seal \"bomb\" first.","She casually set up an isolation array, threw the \"bomb\" inside, and it exploded with a boom. The energy released continuously within the array, causing the array barrier to become somewhat unstable.","Before long, it gradually dissipated.","The system was puzzled: 【Big shot, since you can use this array to isolate the explosion, why did you have someone take the bomb away last time?】","Qi Quan: 【Didn't think of it.】","【...】","Qi Quan: 【A loud explosion serves as a warning to others. At the Guiyuan Sect, Mr. Lu's bomb was a warning to them.】","【What about this morning at the Investigation Department?】","Qi Quan: 【Really didn't think of it.】","System: 【Alright.】","The big shot was a model of letting others handle things whenever possible, never doing it herself.","In the villa, she couldn't just throw a bomb, so she had no choice but to think of a way to isolate the explosion's energy.","Qi Quan ignored it further, woke up the tall Celestial Master, sat in a chair, and said, \"Leniency for those who confess.\"","Tall Celestial Master: ???","Huh, something seemed different.","He shook his head and asked in surprise, \"Just now... what happened?\"","Qi Quan said calmly, \"Your puppet seal is gone. You can speak freely now.\"","\"Impossible!\" The tall Celestial Master looked incredulous. \"How could the puppet seal be removed?\"","No one wanted to be a puppet.","They had tried many methods in private, but none could remove this thing. How could it be gone after he just took a nap?","Qi Quan: \"Don't waste time.\"","Tall Celestial Master: \"...\"","He suddenly felt that the puppet seal was truly gone!","What kind of person was this woman? Terrifyingly formidable!","He said tremblingly, \"W-what do you want me to say?\"","Qi Quan: \"The Bloodburst Pills, the organization you serve.\"","The tall Celestial Master said with a bitter face, \"I don't know much either.\"","\"You have two brothers. Someone will be willing to talk.\"","Tall Celestial Master: \"...\"","He wiped his face and tentatively said, \"The Bloodburst Pills... their main ingredient is the blood of children around three years old.\"","No explosion! Really no explosion!","\"Three-year-old children aren't too frail, their vitality is extremely vigorous, and they are easier to control, making abduction more convenient.\"","System: 【Ahhhhh! This infuriates me! So vicious! So cruel!】","Qi Quan's gaze darkened slightly. \"The specific location of the Bloodburst Pill production site, the profit chain of the child trafficking, and the leader of your organization.\"","The tall, burly Taoist master was inherently timid and cowardly. Faced with Qi Quan's formidable presence, he had no intention of resisting. Unshackled by any puppet talisman, he answered the questions earnestly.","\"The organization is called 'Tian Qi.' Although I am a seventh-level Taoist master, I don't even rank within the organization.\"","System: [Hmph, why not call it 'Qi Tian'?]","Qi Quan: [Perhaps it's taken from the phrase 'longevity equal to heaven.']","[So, this organization is very concerned with lifespan?]","[Just a guess.]","The tall Taoist master continued, \"I'm just a hired thug, not a core member. I've never met the big boss. All I know is that one of the Bloodburst Pill production bases is in Longlin City. Whether there are others in different regions, I don't know, but I suspect there probably are.\"","Qi Quan: \"The exact location of the Longlin City production base.\"","The tall Taoist master gave a place name.","\"That eighth-level Taoist master, how much do you know about his ghost-raising activities?\" Qi Quan asked.","The tall Taoist master shook his head, \"I'm not too clear. He's considered quite powerful within the organization. I didn't dare pry into his affairs.\"","Qi Quan: \"What are the defenses like at the Longlin City production base?\"","\"There are high-level protective formations. The guards are mostly sixth and seventh-level practitioners.\"","Qi Quan had recorded a video during the interrogation. She sent the video to Li Guoyan.","A moment later, Li Guoyan replied: [Received. Thank you for your hard work, Master.]","Qi Quan: [Seventh-level Taoist masters. The department is short-handed.]","[Li Guoyan: It's alright. The department has already reached a cooperation agreement with Master Yin, Master Wan, and the Head of the Fu Family.]","Qi Quan: ?","Although somewhat surprised, she didn't ask further.","Having the help of major sects and families was naturally good; no need for her to intervene.","She waved her hand, and the tall Taoist master returned to the peachwood plaque.","Longjing City Investigation Department.","Li Guoyan put down his phone and looked at the large screen in front of him.","On the screen, Master Yin, Master Wan, and Fu Jiuchong were clearly present.","He said, \"You have all seen the video from the abandoned mountain village in Longhu City, where the bones of countless children are buried. Since you are willing to participate in this video conference, you must also be deeply affected.\"","Master Yin sighed, \"To be honest, over twenty years ago, the metaphysical community did try to crack down on the cult organizations. But during that period, we lost many elite disciples and suffered heavy losses. The members of those cult organizations were utterly fearless of life and death. We simply couldn't manage it all.\"","The will was there, but not the strength.","Master Wan of the Xuanqing Sect also said, \"That is indeed true.\"","Fu Jiuchong said solemnly, \"Cracking down on cult practitioners and restoring peace to the metaphysical community is our inherent duty.\"","\"Good. With such noble integrity from the three of you, I, Li, am deeply impressed.\" Li Guoyan smiled. \"The department has located a cult stronghold, heavily guarded. I must ask the three of you to spare some time and lend the department a hand.\"","The three: ???","Li Guoyan said gravely, \"According to reliable information, the cult stronghold is protected by high-level formations and guarded by seventh-level Taoist masters. Just one stronghold possesses such formidable combat power. If this continues, the metaphysical community will eventually be unable to resist the cult organizations. The principle that 'when the lips are gone, the teeth will be cold' is something I believe you all understand.\"","The three were slightly shocked.","It must be known that in today's metaphysical community, a seventh-level Taoist master can become the head of a sect or a family.","Yet for the cult organization, a seventh-level Taoist master is merely a watchdog.","These cult practitioners are far more terrifying than they were twenty years ago.","When the nest is overturned, no egg remains unbroken.","As leaders of their respective sects, Master Yin and Master Wan had always prioritized their sect's interests. If they allowed the cult practitioners to develop like this, their sects would inevitably be affected.","The two immediately made up their minds.","As for Fu Jiuchong, twenty years ago, Fu Jiuge had fearlessly investigated clues about the cult practitioners. Twenty years later, the Fu family would still not back down.","No matter what, he had to find the culprit and give an explanation to his sister and brother-in-law.","Master Wan suddenly asked, \"What about the Yan Family Head and Master Yu? Why aren't they here? With them, our chances of success would be greater.\"","Li Guoyan: \"...\"","10 PM, late at night. \"Diary of the Rich and Powerful\" updated.","[Too numerous to record!","Simply too numerous to record!","Following the clues provided by the human trafficker, I found an abandoned mountain village.","The soil here is red, soaked with the blood of countless children.","They were only three years old, yet they are forever buried in this demonic realm flowing with endless sin. Upon their pale white bones are engraved the sneers and madness of the executioners.","The human heart is more terrifying than the demonic realm.","My mood is exceptionally heavy.","The joy from concluding my business trip has vanished completely.","There is too much evil in the world, and my power is still very limited.","I returned home and began researching a new type of talisman.","The senior who guided me into this field once said that the metaphysical community needs constant innovation to stay vibrant.","The current metaphysical community is stagnant and lifeless, which is why those wicked people and malevolent ghosts run rampant.","I attempted to draw a type of talisman specifically designed to break the vile tricks of demons and monsters.","They are skilled in a type of sorcery that controls the human mind.","What I need to do is create a talisman powerful enough to break this sorcery, to extract more valuable clues from the mouths of those malevolent ghosts.","Creating new talisman patterns is difficult, but I will not give up.","The senior said I have quite a talent for the talisman path.","One puppet is gone, but there will be another.","I will find a way.","Moving on from the unhappy topic, let's talk about some strange encounters from the past.","During my part-time jobs, I've met all sorts of people.","But the most unforgettable was a colleague.","She was a very pretty girl, straightforward, generous, innocent, and lovely.","During a break once, she sidled up to me and excitedly told me—","she had fallen in love!","I looked at her in surprise, checking her physiognomy, but there was no sign of the Red Luan Star moving.","Could it be that my skills were not refined enough?","I asked, \"What is the other person like?\"","She said, \"I don't know.\"","I was confused.","How can you be in a relationship without knowing what the other person is like?","She explained to me, \"We met online. I don't know what he looks like, nor what he does for a living, but I know he's a very good person.\"","I asked hesitantly, \"Can I see your chat history?\"","She very generously opened it.","I looked at the person's profile picture and was suddenly shocked.","That profile picture clearly radiated an aura of death!]","End of the new chapter.","[If you see me, tell me to go prepare my lessons: Online dating is risky! You never know if it's a person or a ghost on the other end of the internet. Sisters, never casually engage in online dating, beware of being deceived! P.S.: The executioners who murdered those children all deserve the death penalty!]","[Dying of laughter: Heavy at the front, silly at the back. The author can do it.]","[Pythagorean theorem abc: It's not exactly silly. If it's based on a true story, it's actually quite terrifying.]","[Really desperate for something to read: Finally updated! Author is the best!]","A residence in the suburbs of the capital.","A man in a wheelchair put down his phone, his brows furrowed.","He asked the steward, \"What she mentioned in the text, is she referring to breaking the Puppet Talisman?\"","The steward smiled, \"How could there be a method to break the Puppet Talisman? She hasn't innovated it yet, has she?\"","\"That's true.\" The man looked at the jade talisman on the table. \"Thinking back, that person was hailed as a top genius in talisman making. Hah, so what if he was a top genius? In the end, wasn't he still...\"","The steward did not dare to answer.","\"Am I truly inferior to him?\" The man clenched his carving knife, asking in a low, somber voice.","The steward hurriedly replied, \"Master, your talisman-crafting skill is the pinnacle of the mystic arts. No one surpasses you.\"","The man gave a low, soft laugh.","Inventing a new talisman? It was nothing but a fool's dream."]},{"number":58,"title":"Chapter 58","paragraphs":["Qi Quan, lost in her wishful thinking, set down her pen.","She had written down the detailed steps for drawing the compression talisman on paper and placed it in her bag.","Just then, the Investigation Department's car arrived.","Shen Hui was driving this time.","Qi Quan got into the car with Ling Sheng. With Chen Feilu not around, Ling Sheng had become her \"assistant.\"","\"Senior, the investigators sent for this special training session are all from various local departments who have reached a bottleneck and show signs of a breakthrough, as well as new recruits from our own department. It's sort of a benefit for the newcomers. We'll be troubling you later.\"","Qi Quan: \"Mm.\"","It didn't matter to her; the one who would be tired was the wetland fierce ghost.","\"There's another piece of news.\" Shen Hui's expression turned serious. \"Last night, the technical team at the Longjing Headquarters captured traces of the 'Siren Queen,' but they vanished quickly. The other party's methods are highly sophisticated, likely the same person who escaped in Longjing City before.\"","The system fumed: 【This person is really a persistent nuisance!】","First selling citizens' information, then helping Lu Jiang with that \"Fortune Immortal\" public account, and now being connected to the \"Siren Queen.\"","What was he trying to do?","Qi Quan said, \"He is likely a core member of the evil cultivator organization.\"","Every case was related to him, indicating his importance within the organization.","Shen Hui: \"This person is too cunning.\"","The department wanted to catch him, but he was like a ghost, coming and going freely within the network.","The \"Siren Queen\" was also connected to ghosts.","This evil cultivator organization truly employed both humans and ghosts.","Inside the Investigation Department, the investigators waiting for the special training could hardly contain their excitement.","\"Will Senior Qi Quan really come in person?\"","\"Wow, that's great! I'll get to see the senior!\"","\"My workplace is too remote. Senior Qi Quan would probably never go there in a lifetime. I worked so hard to get this opportunity and traveled for so long. If I really get to see her, I'll have no regrets in this life!\"","The investigators from Longjiang City shared in the pride.","Senior Qi Quan was from their Longjiang City, after all. She had even come to the department yesterday, and many people saw her.","There would be plenty of chances to meet her in the future.","Moreover, for the weekly training sessions, the number of participants from the Longjiang City Investigation Department would surely be higher than from other places.","Such happiness!","Tang Mian stood at the entrance, waiting, glancing at her watch from time to time.","They should have arrived by now, in theory.","On the road.","Shen Hui saw the red light and stepped on the brake.","This was a main road, a crossroads, and the red light lasted a long time.","He glanced in the rearview mirror at the back seat.","The senior had her eyes closed, resting, so he didn't speak.","The autumn wind was cool. The car window was open, letting the wind rush in, carrying a faint scent of osmanthus.","The peaceful and tranquil atmosphere was suddenly shattered by a sharp scream.","\"Don't go—\" The voice was mournful and piercing.","Shen Hui instinctively rolled up the window, then turned to look.","On the roadside, a girl was desperately clutching a boy's hand. Ignoring the stares of passersby, she knelt on the ground, weeping bitterly and pleading, \"Don't go, don't leave me! I love you, I really love you!\"","\"Hah, you don't love me at all. You only love yourself. Search your heart, aren't you just in love with the gentleness and care I give you? What if all that disappeared? Would you still love me then?\" The boy spoke coldly.","The girl shook her head frantically... \"I love you for who you are! Why won't you believe me? What can I do to make you believe me? I really love you!\"","\"How much?\" The boy's eyes held mockery.","The girl paused, then suddenly said in an eerie tone, \"I could die for you.\"","The boy: \"I don't believe you.\"","Passersby: \"...\"","Shen Hui: \"...\"","Was this some cheesy, cliché idol drama?","The red light had only one second left. Shen Hui released the brake, and the car moved forward—","A figure suddenly appeared in front of the car!","He reacted swiftly, slamming on the brakes. The car jolted violently.","Due to inertia, Ling Sheng was thrown forward, his head bumping against the back of the passenger seat. He looked up, dazed.","Qi Quan remained perfectly still.","She couldn't help but ask Ling Sheng, \"Last time in Longjing City, you were like this too. Can't you use spiritual energy to balance your body?\"","Ling Sheng: \"...\"","He only refrained from using spiritual power to balance his body when sharing a car with Qi Quan.","He took out his phone: 【Forgot.】","Qi Quan: ...","Shen Hui always drove very steadily, never with sudden starts or stops. Today was truly an exception.","To prove her deep love for the boy, the girl had recklessly run in front of his car.","Although he wasn't at fault, he still had to follow traffic rules and wait for the traffic police to handle it.","He had stopped in time; the car hadn't touched the girl. Yet, she lay on the ground, wailing loudly and shouting, \"Do you see now? Do you see now! I really do love you!\"","Shen Hui: \"...\"","If you were really determined, why pick a car that had just started moving to stage a collision?","What did he do to deserve this?","Many passersby stopped to watch. Shen Hui got out of the car, speechless.","The boy seemed infuriated. Blurting out harsh words, he said, \"That's it? A car that just started moving? What does that prove? If you have the guts, don't do it at the crosswalk—go to the middle of the road!\"","Stimulated by his words, the girl immediately stood up and tried to dash into the middle of the road.","Shen Hui quickly grabbed her arm, shouting sternly, \"Are you trying to get yourself killed?\"","\"If he doesn't believe I love him, what's the point of living?\" the girl screamed hysterically.","Shen Hui: \"...\"","A passerby advised, \"Young lady, don't be so rash. You look quite pretty. Don't degrade yourself like this. If this one doesn't love you, there will surely be another. You only have one life.\"","\"Yes, yes, don't let love cloud your judgment.\"","\"Miss, please don't do anything foolish.\"","\"Young man, don't say things in anger. Go and talk to her.\"","The boy looked embarrassed, a trace of malice flashing in his eyes. He sneered coldly, \"What does her wanting to die have to do with me?\"","The crowd: \"...\"","Hearing this, the girl was heartbroken and struggled fiercely against Shen Hui's grip. \"Let me go! Let me die!\"","Shen Hui's frown deepened.","He still had to take the senior to the Investigation Department. He really didn't have time to waste here.","Fortunately, the traffic police arrived promptly.","Shen Hui showed his credentials. With bystanders as witnesses, the traffic police restrained the frantic girl, allowing him to return to the car.","He really couldn't understand young people these days.","The car started and slowly maneuvered around the crowd.","Through the window, Qi Quan saw the boy lowering his head to fiddle with his phone. From an angle invisible to the passersby, a smug smile appeared at the corner of his mouth.","More crucially, his phone faintly emitted a ghostly aura.","Qi Quan drew a shadow-retaining talisman in the air. The transparent talisman floated to the top of the boy's head, capturing the screen of his phone from the best angle.","With her level of cultivation, the talismans she drew were difficult for humans or ghosts to detect.","The boy didn't notice, nor did the ghost inside the phone...","notice.","When the boy turned off his phone, the shadow-retaining talisman returned to Qi Quan's hand.","Shen Hui asked keenly, \"Senior, is there a problem?\"","\"Yes. We'll look at it back at the department.\"","Investigation Department.","Tang Mian, having waited an extra ten minutes, finally saw the car arrive.","When Shen Hui got out, she whispered, \"Maybe I should drive next time.\"","Shen Hui: \"...\"","Please don't compete for the driver's position, okay?","The two followed Qi Quan into the Investigation Department.","The investigators in the training room craned their necks to look outside.","\"They're here, they're here!\"","\"Wow, I see the senior!\"","\"As expected of a senior master. Even though she didn't do anything, I just feel she's incredibly impressive.\"","\"That's called aura!\"","Facing the young people with their burning gazes, Qi Quan remained composed. She placed the fierce ghost into the training room and instructed, \"Be a good training partner.\"","The fierce ghost: \"...\"","Hopeless existence.","The investigators participating in this training session were at most at the third level, third tier. She adjusted the fierce ghost's level to the fourth level, first tier, and then left the training room.","\"The senior is leaving already?\"","\"The senior is so busy, how could she possibly stay to watch us train?\"","\"I wanted to leave a good impression in front of the senior.\"","\"Give it up, you.\"","Qi Quan went to the conference room.","A moment later, Meng Yunzheng hurried over, his face apologetic as he said, \"I had something to deal with just now. Have you been waiting long, Senior?\"","Qi Quan first activated the Shadow Retaining Talisman.","The talisman transformed into a luminous screen, displaying the footage from that male student's phone.","He was chatting in a group.","Shen Hui exclaimed in surprise, \"The Siren King!\"","Previously, there was a Siren Queen, and now a Siren King appears. Could they possibly be unrelated?","The girl's frenzied appearance, what difference was there from those men bewitched by Shao Jing?","There was a difference.","Shao Jing subjectively didn't know her \"seduction techniques\" would harm people, but this boy was clearly intentionally guiding the girl to suicide.","System: [So there's more than just a Siren Queen!]","In the Siren King group chat.","[WomenAreTrash: Hahahaha, took care of another woman today. It's way too easy, boringly easy. Just sweet-talked her a bit and she's utterly devoted. She even wanted to throw herself in front of a car just now to prove her love. So damn cheap!]","[GonnaKillTheShrewEventually: Sigh, so jealous of you, single and free. Not like me, stuck with a shrew at home, hardly any chance to mess with young girls.]","[WomenJustNeedABeating: That shrew of yours, just beat her a few times and she'll behave. What are you so frustrated about? Coward.]","[GonnaKillTheShrewEventually: Who are you calling a coward? You're the damn coward!]","[WomenAreTrash: Stop fighting. I've taken care of five pieces of trash this month, that's a pretty good record, right?]","[SquirrelLovingHazelnut: Did she really get hit by the car?]","[WomenAreTrash: She did, but the car stopped in time, not seriously hurt.]","[SquirrelLovingHazelnut: Then it doesn't count.]","[WomenAreTrash: The first four count, right? One slit her wrists, one jumped off a building, one swallowed sleeping pills, one died by gas.]","[SquirrelLovingHazelnut: Counts.]","[GonnaKillTheShrewEventually: Dude, you're seriously awesome!]","[WomenJustNeedABeating: Badass!]","Seeing this, Meng Yunzheng and the others were so angry their veins bulged and their breathing became heavy.","Scum! Utterly inhuman scum!","System: [Too terrifying!]","The video ended here.","Qi Quan retrieved the Shadow Retaining Talisman and said, \"Someone is exploiting the extreme psychology of some women and men, inciting them to recklessly play with others' emotions and guide them to suicide.\"","\"Exactly,\" Meng Yunzheng said gravely. \"The behavior is extremely vile.\"","\"We didn't see the group avatar, but we saw the avatar of that 'SquirrelLovingHazelnut'. My cultivation is low, I couldn't see through it. Senior, did you?\" Shen Hui asked.","This person was definitely in cahoots with \"HazelnutLovingSquirrel\", their names were too similar.","Qi Quan: \"There's high-level illusion magic on the avatar.\"","\"What level?\" Meng Yunzheng asked urgently.","Qi Quan: \"Eighth level.\"","\"...\"","Are the eighth-level celestial masters of this evil cultivation organization as common as cabbages?","Qi Quan took out several talismans and a piece of paper from her bag.","\"Director Li plans to send people to Longlin City and Longtang City to investigate the criminal dens. The den in Longlin City is guarded by several seventh-level celestial masters. If they are overpowered by the Investigation Department and choose to self-destruct, it could destroy evidence at the den and cause unnecessary casualties. Send these to Longjing City.\"","Meng Yunzheng hadn't seen such talismans before and asked, \"These are?\"","\"Talismans that can suppress the self-destruction of a seventh-level celestial master,\" Qi Quan pointed to the paper. \"These are the steps for creating the talisman. Give them to the Investigation Department.\"","Meng Yunzheng was overjoyed.","At the Hongmen Banquet hosted by the Guiyuan Sect, he had heard countless retellings of how Qi Quan instantly suppressed a seventh-level celestial master's self-destruction.","He had previously thought, if only their investigators could also suppress enemy self-destruction during operations.","Who would have thought Senior Qi would deliver such a pleasant surprise!","He said with a smile, \"Thank you so much!\"","Qi Quan nodded. \"Send this Shadow Retaining Talisman along as well.\"","The group chat Shao Jing was in is now being tracked by technical personnel in Longjing City. This group can be handled together with that case.","\"Alright!\"","Longjing City Investigation Department.","\"Director Li, there's news from Yan Huai.\" Di Meng strode into the office. \"Yan Mao is going out today.\"","Li Guoyan's spirits lifted.","\"Keep a close eye on him.\"","Yan Mao is only a fourth-level celestial master. Whether Ning Zhi or Di Meng goes, it would be more than sufficient.","Di Meng accepted the order and left.","The Yan Family.","Yan Mao finished his morning studies and asked for leave to go out in the afternoon.","He was an outer sect disciple. The life of an outer sect disciple was dull and monotonous: either cultivating, going out to do low-level tasks to earn some living expenses, or handling mundane affairs to provide more cultivation resources for the main family.","He was now at the fourth level, considered quite high among outer sect disciples. If he won first place in the upcoming internal family competition next month, he could leap to become an inner sect disciple.","The family competition was next month.","Humming a little tune happily, Yan Mao walked out.","His pace was swift, and he soon entered the nearest subway station entrance.","The Yan family's main estate wasn't in the downtown area, but it wasn't remote either.","His destination was quite far, about a two-hour subway ride.","He had taken this route many times, always arriving safely without being discovered.","After all, who would care where an outer sect disciple went?","He didn't notice the person following him.","Di Meng wore a mask, suppressed all his aura, and blended inconspicuously into the crowd.","Nearly two hours on the subway, from the city center to the suburbs, from crowded to sparse, he remained absolutely vigilant.","Finally, Yan Mao was about to get off.","Di Meng followed at a leisurely pace.","This suburban area was located in the northwest part of Longjing City, somewhat remote, but the feng shui was good, very suitable for recuperation.","Yan Mao remained completely unaware of Di Meng.","Every time he came here, he could receive his share of pills. Taking the pills made his cultivation progress much faster.","But he had to do tasks for them.","He was an outer sect disciple of the main family. In principle, he should serve the main family. If anyone found out he was working for the people here, he would surely lose even his status as an outer sect disciple.","Not only did he have to pass on information about the main family, but he also acted as a liaison, instructing others to do unsavory things.","If this ever came to light, he was finished!","Feeling uneasy, Yan Mao arrived at the courtyard gate. After looking around, he knocked.","But the door remained unopened.","Strange. He had never encountered this situation before. He took out his phone, planning to send a message to ask, only to find that all the related phone numbers and records in his phone were gone!","A chill ran down Yan Mao's spine.","Suddenly, a few black and red characters appeared on the phone screen: [\"There's a tail behind you.\"]","Yan Mao: !!!","Without a second thought, he slapped on a Swift Movement Talisman and took off running.","If Di Meng let him escape right under his nose, he might as well quit the Investigation Division.","He grabbed Yan Mao in one swift move, slapped on special handcuffs, pulled out his phone, and made a call: \"Send a few more people over.\"","\"On what grounds are you arresting me? What right do you have to cuff me! I'm a law-abiding citizen!\" Yan Mao struggled and shouted.","Di Meng found him too noisy and sealed his mouth shut.","\"You can say whatever you want slowly back at the Division.\"","Yan Mao: \"Mmph mmph mmph!\"","Di Meng ignored him, looking up to observe the mansion.","He took a photo and sent it back to the Division for investigation. Soon, a message came back:","[The homeowner of the residence is named Yan Fengqing, a cousin of the current head of the Yan family.]","Investigators who enter the Investigation Division have memorized the genealogies of all major occult families and sects.","Seeing the name, Di Meng quickly retrieved this person's information from his memory and couldn't help but click his tongue.","On the surface, this seemed like a pitiable figure.","But with Yan Mao currently in his grasp, and Yan Mao's connection to this place, it was hard not to be suspicious.","There were plenty of examples of pitiable people turning to the dark side.","Other members of the Investigation Division soon arrived.","Di Meng had Yan Mao taken back first, while he and the others stayed behind, intending to meet Yan Fengqing.","\"Captain Di, the mansion is protected by an array.\"","Di Meng nodded and stepped forward himself, knocking on the door.","No matter how long he knocked, there was no response.","Without clear evidence linking Yan Fengqing to the case, they couldn't force their way in. They could only return to interrogate Yan Mao.","Di Meng said, \"Keep a close watch here. Report any unusual activity to me immediately.\"","\"Yes, Captain Di.\"","Di Meng returned to the Investigation Division.","Yan Mao was already being interrogated.","Standing outside, he asked a team member beside him, \"Has the phone been examined?\"","\"Yes, there are signs of deleted data. The tech team is trying to recover it.\"","Just as Di Meng was about to speak, someone ran over and said, \"Captain Di, Director Li wants to see you in his office.\"","\"Understood.\"","He turned and headed to the office.","In Li Guoyan's office was another person, an investigator from Longjiang City, specifically sent to deliver something.","After Di Meng entered, the investigator activated a Shadow Retention Talisman, projecting the recorded footage for both of them to see.","After the video ended, the atmosphere in the office grew heavy.","Li Guoyan asked, \"What did the Master say?\"","The investigator replied, \"...It can be handled jointly with the Siren Queen case. The Division has not summoned the young man in the video for now, fearing he might detect it and erase traces, similar to the Shao Jing case.\"","Di Meng clenched his fist, angrily saying, \"What is the purpose of them doing this?\"","Since the senior said there were ghosts and illusion magic in the group, the masterminds behind these two groups must be a Taoist master and a ghost.","What were they trying to achieve by controlling these groups?","These were just the groups they had discovered. Could there be more such groups secretly inciting people to harm others?","He said through gritted teeth, \"This evil cultivator organization really has a diverse portfolio.\"","Li Guoyan, however, frowned. \"It doesn't seem like it.\"","\"Doesn't seem like it?\" Di Meng was puzzled. \"Doesn't seem like what?\"","\"I have a feeling the methods of these two Siren groups are somewhat different from the Ghost Marriage case and the Bloody Pill case,\" Li Guoyan said. \"The former is more subtle, like a venomous snake hiding in the shadows, while the latter appears crude and violent.\"","Thinking it over carefully, Di Meng agreed.","He said, \"But they seem to share the same network expert.\"","The tech department had analyzed it; the online traces likely came from the same person.","Li Guoyan: \"One person holding two jobs isn't impossible. This is just my speculation.\"","He paused. \"What about the situation with Yan Fengqing?\"","\"Yan Mao only admits to having received favors from Yan Fengqing in the past, which is why he often visited. He claims to know nothing else and denies instructing the two sixth-level Taoist masters to attack the Lakeside Villa.\"","Li Guoyan: \"Intensify the interrogation. Have the tech department recover the information from his phone as soon as possible.\"","\"Yes, sir!\"","Yan Mao couldn't withstand the Investigation Division's relentless interrogation and eventually confessed.","The Yan Family.","Yan Fengjun, upon hearing the butler's report, was momentarily stunned.","\"An outer disciple? The Investigation Division?\"","\"Yes, an outer disciple was taken for interrogation by the Investigation Division. Should we inquire for details?\"","Yan Fengjun pondered for a moment, then asked, \"When and where was he captured?\"","\"He was captured this afternoon at three o'clock, right in front of that mansion in the northwestern suburbs.\"","Yan Fengjun's eyes suddenly darkened.","\"You mean... Yan Fengqing's residence?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"What is a Yan family outer disciple doing over there?\"","The butler shook his head. \"It's unclear at the moment.\"","Yan Fengjun: \"Investigate.\"","\"Yes, sir.\"","At the suburban mansion in the capital, Yan Fengqing downed a large bowl of medicinal brew, frowning as he said, \"How did the Investigation Division find Yan Mao so quickly?\"","The steward took the medicine bowl and replied, \"Only those two had contact with Yan Mao. But one's Puppet Talisman has already detonated. Could the other have talked? That doesn't seem right either. If he had revealed Yan Mao, why wouldn't the Puppet Talisman have detonated?\"","He was also utterly perplexed by this.","Yan Fengqing's voice was hoarse: \"Either there was a slip-up on Ghost's end.\"","\"That shouldn't be. Ever since the Investigation Division traced him through Yan Wu's phone, he's been extremely cautious. If the Investigation Division had really traced through their phones, he wouldn't have been unaware. Moreover, it was he who alerted us in time today about Yan Mao having a tail.\"","Yan Fengqing's brow furrowed with malice. \"It's not this, it's not that. Are the people at the Investigation Division all gods?\"","The steward: \"...\"","He suddenly remembered something. \"The latest chapter of 'The Diary of a Wealthy Family' wrote about breaking puppet control. Could it be that she has created a new talisman?\"","\"Impossible!\" Yan Fengqing flatly denied. \"I haven't even managed to create one. How could she? Even if she did create one, how could she remove a Puppet Talisman from someone's soul?\"","After all, once a Puppet Talisman is activated, it detonates instantly.","The steward deeply agreed: \"I was mistaken.\"","The family head's talent for talisman creation was once among the best in the occult world, second only to that person, with no other rivals.","\"I wonder if Yan Mao will give us away,\" the steward worried.","Yan Mao was an outer disciple of the main family. To avoid detection, they hadn't used a Puppet Talisman on him. He might say things he shouldn't.","\"And what if he does?\" Yan Fengqing wasn't concerned. \"He's a disciple of the main family. What does that have to do with me?\"","The steward understood.","One person's testimony wasn't enough to convict them. Moreover, a main family disciple might only take orders from the head of the main family.","Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan was meditating and cultivating in her room when an incredibly fragrant scent drifted to her nose. She opened her eyes.","It was the scent of osmanthus.","Was Su Steward making something delicious again?","She got up, left her room, and came to the courtyard under the skywell.","One person and two ghosts were squatting on the ground, sorting through freshly picked osmanthus flowers, filling the courtyard with fragrance.","\"What's going on here?\"","Ling Sheng looked up, his hands still channeling spiritual energy to filter the delicate petals. He smiled at her, his eyes clear and bright.","\"Tomorrow is the Mid-Autumn Festival. I plan to make some pastries with osmanthus flowers to taste, and also send some to my parents and some previous clients,\" Su Steward said with a smile.","Qi Quan was momentarily stunned.","So tomorrow was the Mid-Autumn Festival.","By the time she processed this, Ling Sheng had already packed more than half of the filtered osmanthus flowers into glass jars, leaving the rest untouched.","The meaning was clear.","The osmanthus filtered of impurities was for the Lakeside Villa; the rest were for gifts.","Qi Quan couldn't help but laugh.","She asked, \"What else needs to be prepared?\"","\"Mooncakes, pomegranates, persimmons—they're all ready,\" Xue Hong thought for a moment. \"It would be even more perfect if we could get some hairy crabs.\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","Su Steward smiled. \"Alright, I'll ask around to see where they're sold.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, the villa's doorbell rang.","It was Du Jiaming and the other two.","Each of them was carrying a large pile of gifts.","Su Rong opened the door.","\"Steward Su, long time no see!\" Zhang Chengyan squeezed to the front, saying cheerfully, \"Tomorrow is the Mid-Autumn Festival. I thought there wasn't much I could do to help the Master, so I came to deliver some things. Just a small token of my appreciation, I hope the Master will accept it.\"","Du Jiaming and Yang Su were not to be outdone.","Su Rong smiled. \"Come in.\"","The three followed him into the courtyard and immediately spotted Qi Quan under the skylight, their faces lighting up with delight.","\"Master!\"","Zhang Chengyan rushed forward. \"Master, it's so great to see you!\"","The other two also hurried over.","Qi Quan: \"...\"","Too syrupy, causing discomfort.","She smiled. \"Come in for some tea.\"","The three entered the living room beaming with joy.","The gifts were all placed under the corridor. Xue Hong took a glance and saw that among them were premium hairy crabs. They really knew how to handle things.","Su Steward was busy making pastries, so Xue Hong proactively took on the household duties, pouring tea for the three guests.","The three said politely, \"Thank you, Teacher Xue.\"","After pouring the tea, Xue Hong didn't leave either, sitting on the nearby sofa to chat with the guests.","\"Master, your complexion is even better than before,\" Zhang Chengyan said bluntly, buttering her up.","\"Master, it's such a shame I couldn't go see the martial arts competition in person. I saw many comments in the novel's forum saying they want to have your babies, haha,\" said Yang Su.","Du Jiaming refused to fall behind. \"Master, has your cultivation advanced again? You seem even more radiant yet restrained, profound and unfathomable.\"","\"...\"","The system said disdainfully, \"They're getting more and more nauseatingly sweet.\"","Qi Quan asked somewhat amusedly, \"Alright, out with it. What do you all want?\"","\"Master,\" Du Jiaming spoke first. \"There's a custom here for the Mid-Autumn Festival: making wishes to the moon. But I thought about it left and right, making wishes to the moon isn't as good as making wishes to the Master's protective talisman. I wonder if the Master could bestow upon me a protective talisman?\"","He looked at Qi Quan anxiously.","Although his face was burning with embarrassment, he really, really wanted a protective talisman drawn by the Master!","The system timely reported, \"Big Boss, I just checked. 'Today is Auspicious,' 'Today is Greatly Beneficial,' and 'Greatly Auspicious and Profitable' each dropped five thousand deep-water torpedoes for you half an hour ago.\"","Back when Zhang Chengyan was rescued, \"Today is Auspicious\" had appeared in the then still quiet comments section of \"Diary of a Wealthy Family\" to thank the Master for saving his life. The system had deduced it was him.","From this, it could be inferred that the other two corresponded to Du Jiaming and Yang Su.","Protective talismans were truly insignificant to Qi Quan.","She asked Yang Su and Zhang Chengyan, \"Are you two the same as him?\"","Yang Su nodded, but Zhang Chengyan shook his head.","All three members of the Zhang family already had protective talismans, unused so far, so they weren't needed for now.","She glanced at Ling Sheng.","Ling Sheng understood and went to the storeroom to fetch two protective talismans.","\"Thank you, Master!\" Du Jiaming and Yang Su accepted them excitedly.","Little did they know how much they had envied Zhang Chengyan's protective talisman!","Zhang Chengyan seized the moment to say, \"Master, I'd like to ask you to take a look at my career prospects.\"","He had been quite troubled these days.","Since giving up his playboy ways, Old Zhang had taken him to the company for training. Of course, he wanted to do well, but there was always one person in the company who overshadowed him, leaving him frustrated and stifled.","He might as well let the Master take a look. If he really wasn't cut out for this, he could start some other side business early and not waste his life at the company.","Qi Quan glanced at his facial features and said, \"Success depends on one's efforts. It depends on whether you want to do it or not.\"","\"I do want to do well. It would be nice to make Old Zhang happy too. But there's this incredibly talented guy at the company who outshines me no matter where I go. Once, I hid in the fire escape to smoke and relieve my frustration, and I overheard people behind my back comparing me to that guy, saying I only have my family background to rely on and am actually good for nothing.\"","This had hit him hard.","Du Jiaming raised an eyebrow. \"Why didn't you mention this to us?\"","\"How embarrassing,\" Zhang Chengyan said gloomily.","Yang Su teased him, \"We all know about you wetting the bed at six. What's this compared to that?\"","Zhang Chengyan's face flushed bright red. He glared at him. \"What nonsense are you talking about?!\"","Bringing up such embarrassing things in front of the Master? Did he have no face to save?","The system was also curious. \"Big Boss, how is his fortune really?\"","Qi Quan: \"Not bad.\"","\"Then why didn't you just tell him directly?\"","Qi Quan: \"Consciousness has an active role.\"","System: ...","\"So what kind of amazing person is he anyway?\" Du Jiaming asked with a grin. \"He's so influential in the company, and Uncle Zhang doesn't do anything about it?\"","Zhang Chengyan said with a bitter face, \"Old Zhang appreciates him a lot. His professional skills are indeed good.\"","\"Then hire him as a professional manager in the future,\" Yang Su advised him. \"Wouldn't it be nice for you to lie back comfortably and make money?\"","Zhang Chengyan: \"You're just making fun of me!\"","Competition breeds motivation.","Before, he was a slacker living off his parents, but now, with someone to compare to, he had developed some ambition.","He sighed. \"Actually, if it was just a blow to my career, that would be fine. I could start a side business. But what I can't stand is that he wounded my dignity as a man!\"","Qi Quan: ?","System: ???","Du Jiaming was stunned for a second and blurted out, \"A man's dignity? Don't tell me...\"","Yang Su also looked him up and down. \"He didn't bully you, did he?\"","\"Damn it, what are you two thinking!\" Zhang Chengyan was frantic. \"It's not what you're imagining!\"","\"Then what is it?\"","Zhang Chengyan pointed at his own face and asked, \"Am I not handsome?\"","Du Jiaming: \"Although not as handsome as me, you're passable.\"","\"Right, so? Did he call you ugly?\"","Zhang Chengyan was speechless. \"If he really did that, I would have beaten him up long ago. Can you imagine, a handsome guy like me, and not a single girl in the company is interested in me? Instead, they all adore him?\"","\"Uh,\" Du Jiaming paused. \"You are handsome, but maybe he's both handsome and capable?\"","\"Right, personal charisma can be a bigger plus sometimes.\"","Zhang Chengyan: \"If he were really handsome, I wouldn't be so depressed and conflicted. The key point is, he really isn't good-looking at all. He's not even average. Sure, personal charm can attract girls' favor too, but can it really make every single girl, without exception, fall in love with him?\"","\"Seeing is believing. Are there any photos?\" Du Jiaming asked.","Zhang Chengyan said, \"Yes, my assistant posted some on her social feed. Let me find them.\"","Du Jiaming and Yang Su: \"...\"","Even his own assistant was captivated. That really was pitiful.","Soon, Zhang Chengyan found the social post his assistant had made just yesterday.","[\"They say a man focused on his work is the most handsome, and truer words were never spoken! [Photo][Photo][Photo]\"]","Yang Su: ?","Du Jiaming: ?","Seeing the photos, the system also couldn't believe it: [This? Just this? This is enough to win the admiration of all the women in the company? If I were Zhang Chengyan, I'd be resentful too!]","A face that was plain, even somewhat ugly—small eyes, a flat nose bridge, thick lips, plus a short, stocky build—revealed not a shred of charm.","Du Jiaming silently patted Zhang Chengyan's shoulder.","Yang Su asked, puzzled, \"Are you sure he's the one charming all the women in the company?\"","\"Isn't my assistant's social feed proof enough?\"","\"Fair point.\"","Zhang Chengyan couldn't hold back: \"He really treats the company like his personal harem. I've even heard the women have titles like 'Empress' and 'Imperial Consort.' They used to vie for his favor among themselves, making me feel like I was watching a palace drama!\"","\"...\"","The system was already quite experienced by now.","It stated with certainty: [Boss, this guy definitely has a problem. Could he be another one of the Siren King's crew?]","Qi Quan: [Judging by his physiognomy, he is indeed tainted by a significant amount of Yin energy.]","To possess such great charm, he was likely a core member of the Siren King group.","She looked at Zhang Chengyan: \"Help me with something.\"","Zhang Chengyan perked up: \"Please, go ahead!\"","\"Get me a file on him.\"","\"Will a resume do?\"","\"That's fine.\"","An idea struck Zhang Chengyan, and he asked: \"Master, you want his file... is it because there's something wrong with him?\"","\"Possibly.\"","Zhang Chengyan's gloominess vanished instantly: \"I knew it! How could someone as handsome as me possibly lose to him?\"","Xue Hong, standing nearby, remarked quietly: \"But professional competence really does add points.\"","Regardless, that man's outstanding work performance alone added a lot to his appeal.","Provoked by her words, Zhang Chengyan declared with great spirit: \"I'll do an even better job than him!\"","Xue Hong: \"Good luck.\"","After the three left, Qi Quan sent the information to Li Guoyan.","Once this person's identity was confirmed, the technical department could monitor his phone.","The more targets they monitored, the greater the chance of uncovering clues.","That online phantom was just one person; it was impossible for him to keep track of all the \"tools\" at all times.","[Li Guoyan: Received. Tomorrow, Yin Yi and Fu Jiuchong will personally go to Longlin City, and Wan Du will head to Longtang City, aiming to destroy the production base of the Bloody Pills in one fell swoop.]","Qi Quan: [Good.]","[Li Guoyan: After interrogation, Yan Mao has confessed. He was the one who directed the two sixth-level celestial masters to attack the Lakeside Villa. The person commanding him is a member of the Yan family's collateral branch, Yan Fengqing. However, we only have his testimony, no direct evidence. The department summoned Yan Fengqing, but he refused to cooperate. Due to barrier arrays obstructing access, no one answers at his residence, and forced entry is ineffective.]","Qi Quan: [Send me his file.]","Li Guoyan sent it promptly.","[Yan Fengqing, male, fifty-six years old, seventh-level celestial master, proficient in talisman arts. Currently the third younger cousin of the current Yan family head, Yan Fengjun. Became a seventh-level celestial master at twenty-eight and was once seen as a potential candidate for family head. Twenty-five years ago, suffered damage to the meridians in both legs in an accident and has since lived in a residence in the Beijing suburbs to recuperate. PS: Once pursued Fu Jiuge.]","The system: [He actually had a crush on Ling Sheng's mother! He's eleven years older than her. An old cow trying to eat young grass, what wishful thinking!]","Qi Quan: [Age isn't particularly important for cultivators.]","For a seventh-level celestial master, fifty-six is still quite young, and he was only around thirty when he was pursuing her.","[That still doesn't make it okay!]","Qi Quan smiled faintly and asked: [Do you think a seventh-level celestial master with crippled legs could command three seventh-level and one eighth-level masters?]","[He's proficient in talisman arts, right? He could use puppet talismans.]","Qi Quan: [Puppet talismans can at most be used on cultivators of the same level. He cannot bind a puppet talisman to the soul of an eighth-level celestial master.]","The system: [So then?]","Qi Quan chuckled and said: [But Yan Wu and Yan Mao likely followed his orders, repeatedly provoking my Lakeside Villa. Do they truly think I have no temper?]","The system: [The boss is mighty!]","Qi Quan replied to Li Guoyan: [What if I can break his barrier array?]","[Li Guoyan: Ah, that would be excellent, of course. Are you planning to come to Longjing?]","Qi Quan: [No.]","[Li Guoyan: ?]","Suburban residence outside the capital.","The man, buried in his work carving talismans, felt an inexplicable chill run down his spine and shivered.","The intuition of a seventh-level celestial master told him—","Disaster was approaching."]},{"number":59,"title":"Chapter 59","paragraphs":["Lakeside Villa.","After Zhang Chengyan and the other two left, more visitors arrived with gifts.","It was Chen Feilu.","He had rushed back from Longjing City straight to Lakeside Villa, bringing Mid-Autumn Festival gifts for his respected \"Master.\"","He brought Ning Zhiting's share as well.","\"Master, Brother Ning is on a mission and couldn't make it. He specifically asked me to deliver his gift too.\"","Qi Quan smiled and said, \"That's very thoughtful of you.\"","\"Master, I also have some questions about cultivation I'd like to ask you.\"","\"Go ahead.\"","A question-and-answer session ensued.","Qi Quan was immensely knowledgeable, and Chen Feilu was quick-witted, so the teaching session concluded swiftly.","Chen Feilu's face was full of admiration; he truly wished he could learn by Qi Quan's side every day.","But he still needed to get his university diploma.","\"Master, I still have two years until graduation. When the time comes, please don't refuse me,\" Chen Feilu said pitifully before leaving.","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She smiled and closed the door.","Carving Room.","Ling Sheng held a carving knife, meticulously engraving a jade plaque.","After the recent attack on the formation, the stock in the storeroom had diminished somewhat, so he needed to replenish it.","As he carved, he suddenly remembered something. He took out his phone and searched for keywords: [Men, career, plus points.]","The first search result: [Ladies, Listen Up: How to Make a Career-Successful Man Find You More Attractive and Earn Bonus Points.]","The second: [Which Zodiac Signs in Women Can Add Points to a Man's Career.]","The third: [Debating with Wife: A Man's Career is More Important Than Family. Need Arguments! Bonus points! Urgent!]","Ling Sheng: ...","He decisively turned off his phone.","During the discussion about Zhang Chengyan's career, Teacher Xue's words had stirred ripples in his heart.","Should he also have his own career?","But it seemed all he knew how to do was draw talismans.","During dinner, Ling Sheng was uncharacteristically distracted.","Xue Hong asked with concern, \"Is there a problem you can't solve?\"","He shook his head.","\"Does the food not suit your taste?\" Su Rong asked with a smile.","Ling Sheng continued shaking his head.","\"So what exactly is on your mind?\" Xue Hong examined his expression carefully and suddenly laughed. \"Our Ling Sheng has his own little thoughts now.\"","When they first met, his expressions weren't this varied.","Ling Sheng's expression stiffened, and he could only lower his head to eat his rice.","After dinner, Qi Quan convened a family meeting.","The theme was: Caring for Family Members' Physical and Mental Health.","As the head of the household, she had a responsibility to care for and protect every family member.","She looked at Ling Sheng. \"Speak up. What were you thinking about during dinner?\"","The system teased: [Ling Sheng is growing up, has his own little secrets now.]","Qi Quan's opening remark carried the authoritative air of a patriarch.","Xue Hong and Su Rong watched Ling Sheng with amused anticipation.","Under the gaze of the three, Ling Sheng had no choice but to lower his head and type on his phone.","He extended the phone, the screen clearly displaying a sentence: [Teacher Xue said, having a career is a big plus for a man. I want to have my own career.]","The three and the system: ...","Xue Hong asked in surprise, \"Did I say that?\"","Seeing Ling Sheng nod, she searched her memory. It turned out she had casually mentioned it today while listening to Zhang Chengyan's complaints.","That was it?","She sighed and said, \"You're already very impressive. You don't need a career for bonus points. Of course, if you want to pursue a career, I fully support you. But what to pursue and how to go about it, we should ask our Master.\"","Ling Sheng looked at Qi Quan with hopeful eyes.","Qi Quan respected his choice and asked, \"What do you want to do?\"","If Ling Sheng could have thought of it, he wouldn't have been spacing out during dinner.","He shook his head.","Qi Quan thought for a moment and said, \"You've read the talisman books. You have great talent in talisman-making. I'll give you a few more books on formations, sword techniques, and medical arts. Decide after you've finished reading them.\"","A Natural Spiritual Body does not need to be graded by levels.","Taoist masters differentiate levels by the spiritual power stored within their bodies. However, a Natural Spiritual Body, in the same environment, can utilize far more spiritual power than a high-level Taoist master. As long as the world's spiritual energy exists, a Natural Spiritual Body's power will not be exhausted.","Previously, when she advanced at Lu Jiang's residence, Ling Sheng's spiritual energy was depleted because nearly all the spiritual energy around the house had been absorbed by her for her advancement. He had to use the spiritual energy stored within his own body to support her through the process.","In short, Ling Sheng does not need to cultivate like an ordinary Taoist master.","But having a body full of spiritual power isn't enough; he needs to learn how to use it.","It depends on which path suits him best.","The young man nodded eagerly, his eyes reflecting starlight.","Qi Quan returned to her room, selected a few books, and handed them to him.","These books were ones she had transcribed during her spare time. Fortunately, the language of Taoist methods is concise, each book was thin, and it hadn't taken her much effort.","Ling Sheng obediently took the books back to his room to study.","Qi Quan, however, did not cultivate.","After drawing a few talismans, she went to the front courtyard's atrium and began arranging a formation using formation stones.","The system asked: [Great One, what are you doing?]","Qi Quan: [Have you heard of long-range attacks?]","[Of course, games also have melee and ranged attacks.]","Qi Quan smiled and said: [I want to try using a talisman from Longjiang City to shatter a formation in Longjing City.]","The system: ???","Great One, are you serious?","From Longjiang City to Longjing City, it's a six-hour drive by car!","It watched in a daze as Qi Quan tinkered. After setting up a small formation, she placed a talisman within it.","The talisman patterns were dense and complex, but a few strokes in the center formed a clearly recognizable pattern.","The system exclaimed in surprise: [That's a sword!]","[Yes.]","[A sword drawn on a talisman paper? What kind of talisman is this?]","[A composite talisman I researched before, combining talisman and sword techniques. Haven't tried it yet, haven't thought of a name either.]","The system: ...","The Great One is always dedicated to researching these strange yet incredibly powerful Taoist methods.","The talisman paper was placed at the formation's eye. Qi Quan placed a spirit talisman beside the formation stones.","The formation activated.","A blazing sword light shot up from the talisman paper at the formation's eye, streaking across the night sky like a meteor, racing towards the direction of Longjing City.","Qi Quan had already obtained the precise coordinates of that mansion from Li Guoyan. She had programmed the attack; the sword light would only strike the formation of that mansion.","Under the starry night sky, a pale golden streak of light flashed and vanished, cutting through hundreds of kilometers of sky at a speed invisible to the naked eye, accurately piercing towards the suburban mansion in the capital.","Inside the mansion, Yan Fengqing suddenly felt a chill run down his spine.","He frowned, immediately put down his carving knife, maneuvered his wheelchair out of the room, and looked up towards the direction of Longjiang City.","The steward had been waiting outside the room and asked with concern, \"Master, do you have any instructions?\"","Yan Fengqing frowned, his tone strained as he said, \"Do you feel an extremely powerful pressure?\"","The steward looked in the direction he indicated but saw nothing. He instinctively replied, \"No—\"","Under the vast starry sky, an intensely bright light rushed closer, growing brighter and brighter...","\"Oh no!\" The steward immediately reacted, pushing Yan Fengqing's wheelchair to return to the house.","But it was already too late.","The overwhelmingly powerful sword light pierced through the sky, carrying a force that seemed capable of destroying heaven and earth, accurately striking the mansion's protective formation shield.","Crash—","The seventh-level formation shattered abruptly.","The steward stood dumbfounded, having already forgotten to flee.","Faced with such a formidable sword radiance, he couldn't muster any thought of escape.","Yan Fengqing gripped the armrests of his wheelchair tightly, staring intently towards Longjiang City, muttering in a low, almost frenzied voice, \"Impossible, how is this possible? This simply cannot be!\"","\"Master, the formation is broken. I'll go activate the backup formation.\"","As soon as the steward finished speaking, another sword light appeared in the night sky.","Again?!","There were no more arrays left in the courtyard to slash!","Terror-stricken, his legs felt as if filled with lead, nailed to the ground, unable to move.","The sword light struck directly into the courtyard. In an instant, the earth shook, mountains trembled, and dust filled the air.","The sword light blasted a deep pit in the courtyard.","If not for the protective talismans they wore, they would likely have been reduced to a bloody pulp.","The steward's face paled with horror, and he said in disbelief, \"What... what on earth is going on?\"","He had only heard of long-range missiles, never long-range sword light!","When the sword light first appeared above the mansion, the major factions in Longjing City had detected it.","By the time the sword light appeared again, the major factions had swiftly prepared recording talismans and captured a complete image of the sword light streaking across the sky.","These two sword lights directly intimidated the entire Mystic Sect of Longjing City.","Longjing City Investigation Department.","Li Guoyan was equally astonished by these two sword lights.","Coming from the direction of Longjiang City, striking Yan Fengqing's mansion with pinpoint accuracy—who else could have done such a thing but Qi Quan?","He knew Qi Quan was strong, incredibly strong, but he never imagined she could be strong to this extent.","Outside his office, the young men and women were already immersed in excited discussions.","He let out a long sigh and was about to call Qi Quan when his phone chimed.","[Master Qi: I previously developed a type of composite talisman but never had the chance to test it. I just conducted two tests.]","Li Guoyan: ...","Such a rare thing as a composite talisman, and the Master could invent it herself?","But thinking of the compression talismans just delivered, he found it understandable.","Master Qi could not be judged by ordinary standards.","\"Chief Li!\" Di Meng burst into the office excitedly. \"The monitors show the impact points of the sword lights were at Yan Fengqing's courtyard! The first one shattered the courtyard's protective array, the second left a huge crater in the yard. No casualties.\"","His admiring expression was unmistakable.","\"It was the Senior, right? It must have been her! Only she could do this!\"","Li Guoyan nodded. \"It was her. She used a composite talisman.\"","\"A composite talisman! That's so awesome!\"","Truly, those two sword lights had shocked their colleagues at the Investigation Department for a whole year!","Li Guoyan replied to Qi Quan: [Master, your composite talisman is truly astounding. May I ask what kind of composite talisman it is?]","[Qi Quan: A combination of talisman arts and sword arts.]","Li Guoyan sighed in admiration: [The Master always has ingenious ideas.]","[Qi Quan: For the Mystic Sect in the new era, innovation is the source of development.]","Well said!","Li Guoyan felt immensely encouraged that the Investigation Department had such talent.","He asked: [Is this a long-range attack talisman? What's the maximum range?]","[Master Qi: Currently, from Longjiang to Longjing is the limit, but both the talisman and the array can be improved.]","Li Guoyan: [Does it also require an array?]","[Master Qi: Yes, the array provides the power for the talisman.]","Li Guoyan understood.","This composite talisman couldn't be widely used yet, but it could serve as a secret weapon in reserve.","He said cheerfully: [We look forward to the Master's improvements.]","\"Chief Li, Yan Fengqing's courtyard array is broken, the yard has a huge crater, and the walls are damaged. Investigators observing from outside have spotted him. Should we summon him for questioning now?\"","After extracting a confession from Yan Mao, the department had planned to summon Yan Fengqing for questioning. However, Yan Fengqing's residence was protected by a seventh-level array, and no one answered the door. The department had no choice but to post people outside to keep watch.","Who could have imagined that Senior Qi could launch a long-range attack directly from Longjiang City? One sword light shattered the seventh-level array, another blasted through the courtyard ground, giving Yan Fengqing a uniquely dramatic warning.","Incredible.","Li Guoyan was in a very good mood. \"Good. Summon him immediately.\"","At the mansion in the outskirts of the capital.","Yan Fengqing sat in his wheelchair, staring fixedly at the deep pit in the courtyard, his face pale and contorted.","No sword cultivator's sword light could fly hundreds of kilometers through the sky and land precisely on its target.","The only thing he could think of was a composite talisman.","Having studied talisman arts for so many years, he had only seen legends of composite talismans in ancient texts. He had also attempted to create one, but the conditions were too stringent, and he had never succeeded.","At this moment, he was absolutely certain these two sword lights came from a composite talisman.","A fusion of talisman arts and sword arts!","As a fervent enthusiast of talisman arts, he was thrilled to witness the power of a composite talisman firsthand.","But as the target of the attack, he could not accept that his enemy had created a composite talisman before he did!","Yan Fengqing had spent his whole life competing.","In his youth, he competed with Yan Fengjun. Later, he competed with the Daoist companion of Fu Jiuge, a genius of talisman arts in the Mystic Sect. Now, with only a crippled body left, he competed with his own legs.","He lived in pain and wanted others to suffer too.","The courtyard wall, affected by the sword light, had a breach. Outside the breach appeared several young people wearing Investigation Department uniforms, their eyes burning as they looked at him.","Yan Fengqing lowered his head and laughed mockingly.","\"Open the courtyard gate. Let them in.\"","Rather than having them break in by force, it was better to maintain composure and not lose face.","Although he had already been made a fool by the two sword lights, his opponent was not the Investigation Department, but Qi Quan, hundreds of kilometers away.","—He was certain it was Qi Quan.","The steward sighed softly and opened the gate. The investigators stepped inside.","Their eyes immediately fell on the huge crater in the yard.","The Grandmaster is too amazing!","A long-range attack—how did she think of that?!","They had been watching outside the courtyard and had a close-up view of the two sword lights streaking from the horizon. It was a scene they would never forget.","One of the investigators suppressed his excitement, looked at Yan Fengqing, and said sternly:","\"Mr. Yan Fengqing, based on Yan Mao's confession, you are suspected of inciting others to intentionally trespass on a citizen's residence. Please come with us.\"","Yan Fengqing sat under the corridor eaves and said unhurriedly, \"Now my residence has also been trespassed upon. I am a victim as well.\"","Investigator: \"...\"","Another investigator, quick-witted, said, \"You repeatedly refused the Investigation Department's summons. This is enforcement action.\"","First breaking the array, then issuing a warning.","Yan Fengqing chuckled softly. \"I didn't incite anyone. Summoning me based solely on one person's testimony is unfair.\"","\"Citizens have the obligation to cooperate with investigations. Your refusal grants the Investigation Department the authority for enforcement action.\"","Yan Fengqing lowered his head in thought, then, with his handsome and refined face, said, \"Alright. I'll go with you.\"","\"Master?!\" the steward couldn't help exclaiming.","Yan Fengqing glanced at him. \"While I'm away, you are in charge. Make sure nothing goes wrong.\"","The steward felt a chill: \"Yes.\"","There were still things in the mansion that must not be seen by the Investigation Department. Before they obtained the authority to search the premises, he needed to move them.","The Yan Family Residence.","Upon hearing the news, Yan Fengjun almost dropped his teacup.","He asked in surprise, \"The array shattered with one strike? The courtyard was damaged? And Yan Fengqing went with the Investigation Department people?\"","Steward: \"Yes.\"","Yan Fengjun set down his teacup, his expression of shock gradually subsiding.","When Yan Mao was arrested earlier, he had wondered what method the Investigation Department would use to successfully summon Yan Fengqing.","Perhaps they had exhausted the formation's spiritual power with attack talismans, perhaps they had invited Qi Quan to come to Longjing City to take action, or perhaps Yan Fengqing himself was cooperating with the investigation.","But he never expected it to turn out like this.","Those two sword beams not only pierced through Yan Fengqing's defenses but also left him deeply shaken.","Fortunately, he had not made an enemy of a powerhouse like Qi Quan.","Just as he was thinking this, his phone suddenly rang. It was a call from Sect Master Yin of the Guiyuan Sect.","\"Brother Yan, you know what that was, right?\" Yin Yi's voice held barely concealed excitement.","Yan Fengjun laughed, \"Of course I know. The legendary composite talisman.\"","\"A composite talisman! That was a composite talisman!\" Yin Yi exclaimed in awe. \"I've only read about them in ancient texts. All these years, so many talisman masters have studied diligently, yet none have succeeded in creating a composite talisman, let alone one with such immense power. I thought it was just a legend, but who would have thought...\"","Even the usually dignified and proper Sect Master Yin was left sighing in admiration.","Actually, this wasn't the first time Qi Quan had used a composite talisman.","When she went to capture ghosts at Yao Mountain before, she used two protective formation talismans. Protective formation talismans are a fusion of talisman arts and formation arts, a type of composite talisman.","However, at that time, only Ning Zhiting, Chen Feilu, Fang Ye, and two ordinary people were present, so others were unaware.","Moreover, compared to the awe-inspiring sword talismans, protective formation talismans are much gentler and wouldn't attract much attention.","The entire mystical community of Longjing City was so excited by the two sword beams that they stayed up all night.","Qi Quan, however, slept soundly.","Early the next morning, she was lured awake by the fragrance of osmanthus pastries.","The Mid-Autumn Festival had arrived.","Breakfast was freshly baked osmanthus cakes. Butler Su's skills were impeccable, and the ingredients had been purified of impurities by Ling Sheng's hands. Eating them was pure enjoyment.","\"Master, after the meal, I'll pack a few boxes of osmanthus cakes to send to my parents, as well as the Du, Yang, Zhang, and Qian families. How does that sound?\" Butler Su asked.","These families had helped the Lakeside Villa quite a bit.","Qi Quan nodded, \"You decide on these matters. But, will you deliver them yourself?\"","Butler Su shook his head, \"I plan to use a flash delivery service.\"","\"Good.\"","Right now, with the mystical community and the evil cultivators locked in a struggle, in her opinion, it was better for the people and ghosts in the villa not to go out casually.","When the four families received gifts from the Lakeside Villa, they were overjoyed.","Qian Kun, being the youngest, couldn't keep things to himself and excitedly showed off in the group chat.","[Qian Kun: Ahhhhhhh! Our family received pastries from the Lakeside Villa!!!]","[Sun Yu: So jealous! And hateful!]","[Su Nuanuan: Our family received some too. [dancing.jpg]]","[Peng Peng: How do they taste? I heard you say before that the tea from Lakeside Villa is especially good.]","Qian Kun had previously gone to plant fruit trees for the Lakeside Villa and was rewarded with a cup of tea. The taste of that tea was something he still remembered to this day.","[Qian Kun: Wuwuwu the pastries are really so fragrant, but my parents and I can't bear to eat them!]","[Su Nuanuan: Hehe, super delicious!]","[Sun Yu: Don't worry, I'm coming to your house right now to help you eat them!]","[Peng Peng: Me too.]","[Qian Kun: Get lost! My house doesn't welcome you!]","It was the Mid-Autumn Festival holiday, everyone had returned home, so visiting was easy.","[Qi Yuan: Save some for me?]","The group chat suddenly went quiet.","When Qian Kun was showing off, he hadn't thought that much about it. It was only when Qi Yuan spoke up that he belatedly realized the Qi family might not have received a gift from the Lakeside Villa.","This was very awkward.","[Qi Yuan: Don't be like that, I was joking. I didn't go home, I'm doing a part-time job here in Longjing.]","[Peng Peng: Brother Yuan, why are you doing a part-time job?]","[Sun Yu: Brother Yuan, if you're in trouble, just say it! Don't stand on ceremony with us!]","[Su Nuanuan: What's wrong with a part-time job? Being self-reliant is pretty good, isn't it?]","[Qian Kun: Sister Nuanuan is right! Brother Yuan, I support you in getting rich through your own labor!]","[Qi Yuan: ......]","In another group chat for second-generation heirs, the situation was similar.","Du Jiaming and the other two were bragging in the group, leaving Qi Lin and Song Lin speechless and even wanting to leave the group.","Lakeside Villa.","Ling Sheng had spent the entire night reading all the books Qi Quan had given him. After breakfast, he came to Qi Quan's room.","He typed on his phone: [I want to study the Medical Path.]","His understanding of the Talisman Path was already deep enough. He wasn't interested in the Formation Path or other paths. Only the long-lost Medical Path was worth delving into.","Qi Quan wasn't surprised by his choice.","The Natural Spirit Body seemed born for the Medical Path.","Heaven's Dao favored him, and he held \"benevolent love\" for the world.","Qi Quan smiled and asked, \"How do you plan to start your Medical Path career?\"","In the current mystical community, there was no such practice as the Medical Path. Pioneering a new field wouldn't be easy.","Ling Sheng showed a look of confusion.","He typed: [I'll think about it some more.]","Qi Quan had no intention of interfering with his career plans. After he left the room, she focused on her cultivation.","While she was peacefully celebrating the festival, Sect Master Yin and Fu Jiuchong, along with several seventh-level elders, set foot in Longlin City. Master Wan went to the remote Longtang City.","Their mission today was to destroy the two production bases in Longlin City and Longtang City.","Sect Master Yin sighed, \"Brother Fu, look at us. We've become unofficial members of the Investigation Department now.\"","Taking orders from Li Guoyan to come here and crack down on evil cultivators.","Fu Jiuchong said coldly and gravely, \"Cracking down on evil cultivators has always been the duty of the mystical community. It's just that the community was weak, forcing the authorities to step in and reorganize.\"","Seeing the children's skeletons at the abandoned den in Longhu City had left him deeply unsettled.","Jiuge's child was still missing, very likely in the hands of those insane evil cultivators. He didn't even know what state they might be in now. Just thinking about it felt like a lump of cotton was stuck in his chest.","Twenty years ago, Jiuge and her husband died pursuing clues. Twenty years later, he must seek justice for his sister and brother-in-law!","Sect Master Yin continued sighing, \"That's true, but back then, we also lost many elite disciples in our pursuit of the evil cultivators.\"","The mystical community had the will but not the strength.","Fu Jiuchong: \"The mystical community of the past was scattered. It's different now.\"","Back then, the various factions of the mystical community refused to submit to each other, each acting on their own. Naturally, they couldn't consolidate resources or come up with the best plan to destroy the evil cultivator organization. Now, with official leadership, they would surely restore peace to the mystical community.","Sect Master Yin was taken aback for a moment, then thought of the two sword beams he saw last night and couldn't help but smile.","\"That's true.\"","Longjing City Investigation Department.","After overnight interrogation, Yan Fengqing still hadn't said anything.","The Investigation Department had no evidence. They couldn't convict him based solely on Yan Mao's testimony.","He sat in his wheelchair, face pale, expression calm, showing no trace of panic, as if he truly had a clear conscience.","\"What do we do, Captain Di? We can't hold him for too long either,\" a team member said worriedly.","Based on their investigative experience, this Yan Fengqing was highly suspicious, but there was just no evidence.","Di Meng was also troubled.","Suddenly, the technical department sent good news.","\"Captain Di, based on multiple pieces of information transmitted from Longjiang, we've tracked the traces of 'Siren King' and obtained a lot of intel, including the identity and location of 'Squirrel-Loving Hazelnut,' messages from various sub-groups, and member profiles, etc.\"","\"Excellent!\" Di Meng's face lit up with joy. \"Who is this 'Squirrel-Loving Hazelnut'?\"","\"According to the records, he's already dead.\"","Di Meng raised an eyebrow. \"A real ghost?\"","\"Very likely,\" the technician said. \"But it's also possible someone is using a dead person's identity.\"","Di Meng: \"Send me the file.\"","Previously, the technical department had been unable to find any trace of the \"Siren King\" and \"Siren Queen.\" Fortunately, Qi Quan provided the video from the Shadow-Retaining Talisman and information on that ordinary man from Zhang Chengyan's company. Through these two individuals' online footprints, the technical department finally managed to locate the \"Siren King's\" group and quietly infiltrated it.","They had finally caught \"Squirrel-Loving Hazelnut.\"","The identity records showed that this \"Hazelnut\" was a 37-year-old male. His time of death was ten years ago, and the cause was being accidentally stabbed to death by his wife during a domestic violence incident, after she finally fought back.","The weapon was a small fruit knife.","Such a man deserved his death.","The records only showed this much. As for whether this \"Hazelnut\" was indeed an abuser, they could only verify that after capturing him.","But the current situation was that they could locate living people, but not the dead.","Where could they find this \"Hazelnut\"?","The case had hit another dead end.","The mastermind behind this was truly cunning, using ghosts to increase the difficulty of solving the case.","Di Meng's head was starting to ache.","\"Captain Di, perhaps we should consult the Senior Advisor?\" a team member suggested.","Di Meng thought for a moment and finally decided, \"Alright.\"","Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan received Di Meng's call.","\"Senior, we've identified 'Squirrel-Loving Hazelnut,'\" Di Meng said, getting straight to the point. \"He's already dead. We can't locate his position, which means we can't capture him.\"","Qi Quan pondered for a moment. \"Does he have any living relatives?\"","\"Senior, are you suggesting...\" Di Meng hesitated, \"...using his relatives to deduce his location?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"But if he's only a white ghost below the third level, he might be influenced and drawn by his relatives' bloodline. If he's above the third level, wouldn't it be very difficult... to deduce his location through divination?\"","Qi Quan explained, \"The reason divination fails is because their own power is strong enough to resist the pull of kinship.\"","For ghosts above the third level, if a Taoist master wants to use relatives to divine a ghost's location, it requires immense mental effort. The higher the ghost's level, the more difficult the divination.","But difficult doesn't mean impossible.","Thinking of her mysterious and unfathomable methods, Di Meng's confidence suddenly surged. He asked excitedly, \"Senior, do you have a way?\"","\"First, confirm if he has any living relatives. Direct blood relatives are best.\"","\"Understood!\"","The Investigation Department quickly identified the man's relatives.","Ten years ago, he was stabbed to death by his wife who finally fought back. Overwhelmed with terror, his wife then took her own life without hesitation, leaving behind their seven-year-old son.","The son, who had witnessed everything while hiding in a room, suffered severe trauma. After a high fever lasting several days, he became mentally impaired. He is now adopted by a welfare institution.","The welfare institution is in Longtang City.","The Longtang City Investigation Branch, upon receiving the task from headquarters, immediately obtained a hair sample from the teenager and expedited its delivery to Lakeside Villa.","It arrived in Qi Quan's hands just before the Mid-Autumn Festival reunion dinner.","Qi Quan set up a small formation. She placed a single hair at the formation's eye, channeled her spiritual power, and activated the formation.","She had seen \"Squirrel-Loving Hazelnut's\" avatar in the Shadow-Retaining Talisman video. The avatar emanated dense ghost energy, indicating a high level.","To accurately locate the direction of a powerful ghost required sufficient spiritual power to sustain the spell. Furthermore, the spell-casting Taoist master had to be at least two levels higher than the powerful ghost. This was extremely challenging for ordinary Taoist masters.","At first, the hair strand remained motionless. Then, it slowly began to rotate, moving at a snail's pace around the formation's eye.","Longtang City.","In a remote mountain village, Xiong Wangchun held his phone, typing rapidly.","He had many groups on his phone, with messages popping up one after another. But he didn't find it annoying at all; he loved this feeling of controlling everyone. It made him forget the humiliation from ten years ago.","Ten years ago, while disciplining his disobedient wife, he was accidentally stabbed to death by her.","Xiong Wangchun had always enjoyed the thrill of controlling women. Such a careless death became his obsession.","How could he be killed by a weak woman?","He should be the one controlling women's life and death.","This obsession made him resist reincarnation.","Ordinary ghosts couldn't linger in the mortal world for long, but powerful ghosts could.","Filled with malice, Xiong Wangchun continuously harmed people to increase his ghost power. Later, he encountered a Taoist master. He was subdued by the master and became the master's \"servant,\" forced to work for him.","Fortunately, the master didn't ask him to do much, only to manage all the \"Siren King\" groups.","Over ten years, his cultivation steadily improved. He could now split into many ghost shadows, allowing him to chat in different groups simultaneously without issue.","He loved this job.","He controlled those greedy men, and those men in turn controlled those lowly, cowardly women.","He was the true Siren King!","Xiong Wangchun opened a group. Someone had uploaded another video of a woman committing suicide for love. He watched with relish. Just as he saw the woman frantically slashing her own throat with a knife, he—","His ghost body suddenly turned cold.","He stood up in alarm, sensing an inexplicable pressure approaching.","The intuition of an eighth-level green ghost was extremely sharp.","He instinctively tried to raise a defense, but it was easily shattered. A low, unhurried chuckle seemed to ring in his ears.","\"Got you.\"","Xiong Wangchun's eyes widened. An invisible pressure enveloped him, rendering him immobile.","He had only felt such terrifying power from his master!","Just as he was about to struggle desperately, his ghost body suddenly exploded.","Xiong Wangchun stared fixedly in one direction, making gurgling sounds.","He was a ghost servant, bound by an unequal contract.","His master only needed a single thought, and he would be utterly annihilated.","Thus, the eighth-level green ghost vanished from the world.","Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan paused for a moment before calling Di Meng. She told him the specific location and added, \"By the time you find him, he had already been eliminated.\"","Di Meng was shocked. \"How did the other party know?!\"","Qi Quan: \"Ghost servant.\"","\"I understand,\" Di Meng said gravely. \"That 'Squirrel' from the 'Siren Queen' group, could it also be a ghost servant?\"","Common ghost servant contracts are unequal.","The master can dispose of the ghost servant with a mere thought at any time and place.","It was highly likely that \"Squirrel-Loving Hazelnut\" died this way.","Qi Quan: \"His phone should still be there.\"","Although the information inside had probably been wiped by a network expert, it was at least evidence. Handed over to the technical department, there was a possibility of recovering the data.","\"I've already sent investigators from the Longtang branch.\"","Qi Quan said, \"This subtle method seems different from the previous ones.\"","\"Senior, Director Li said something similar,\" Di Meng replied. \"The Peach Blossom Mark, ghost marriage, stealing merit, the Explosive Blood Pill... these methods are cruel and blatant, but they're all basically related to forbidden Taoist arts. However, these two groups feel very different.\"","Qi Quan: \"Mhm.\"","The earlier cases all stemmed from forbidden Taoist arts. Even though they were forbidden, they were still related to Taoist methods. But \"Siren Queen\" and \"Siren King\" seemed out of place among these cases.","The perpetrators in the earlier cases were mostly Taoist masters, but this one was operated by ghosts.","What could the person behind this gain from these groups?","Qi Quan pondered thoughtfully.","The investigation team had retrieved Xiong Wangchun's phone, and the information on it had indeed been wiped clean.","Fortunately, the team had already intercepted information on many members. Following these leads, they could continue the pursuit.","Meanwhile, based on the clues provided by the investigation team, Yin Yi, Fu Jiuchong, and a few others had finally located the production base in Longlin City.","They used high-level concealment talismans, remaining undetected for the time being.","Sect Master Yin gazed into the distance, frowning. \"Does something feel off?\"","Fu Jiuchong's expression was equally grave.","It was normal for a production base to be hidden deep in the mountains. What was abnormal was its peculiar feng shui relationship with the terrain of the Hengfeng Sect.","There was a complementary, mutually reinforcing dynamic.","The distance wasn't particularly close, but the connection was remarkably tight.","An ordinary master might not see it, but Yin Yi was, after all, the sect master of the number one major sect. It was impossible for him not to have some special skills. He was extremely proficient in the intricacies of feng shui and fortune, even capable of discerning levels beyond his own.","Even with an eighth-level protective array shielding it, the Hengfeng Sect could not block his discerning eyes.","A sudden chill ran through Yin Yi's heart.","\"That's not right. Doesn't the Hengfeng Sect only have a few seventh-level elders? How could they have an eighth-level mountain-protection array?\"","The reason the Hengfeng Sect could only rank third was precisely because they lacked an eighth-level elder overseeing them, always falling short of the Xuanqing Sect and...","The Guiyuan Sect.","Who would have guessed they had quietly established an eighth-level array?","A master capable of setting up an eighth-level array must have cultivation at least at the eighth level or above.","They had been completely unaware of this situation.","Why had Yu Lanzhi been hiding this from them?","Exchanging glances, they all had a vague guess in their hearts. Without hesitation, they headed straight for the production base.","The production base was located beneath a deep pool at the bottom of a cliff within a mountain range.","This underground structure was incredibly well-hidden.","It could only mean the ambitions of the person behind it were vast.","Before they could even get close, an invisible barrier blocked their way. A flash of light suddenly appeared on the barrier, and surging spiritual power transformed into a heavy hammer, striking toward them!","Ninth level! It was actually a ninth-level array!","They nimbly dodged the attack.","Before accepting the mission, they had no idea the so-called \"high-level array\" was a ninth-level one!","Yin Yi's face darkened. \"We've been discovered. Let's leave this place immediately.\"","With just a few seventh-level masters like them, breaking through was utterly impossible.","Inside the Hengfeng Sect.","Yu Lanzhi's eyes snapped open.","He looked up in a certain direction, his heart filled with extreme shock.","How could this be?","How did they find this place so quickly?!","Logically, those captured by the investigation team all had puppet seals. They shouldn't have been able to reveal the truth.","He felt extremely uneasy.","After a moment, with no further fluctuations from the array, he calmed down slightly.","Right, that array was ninth-level. No matter how many people came, it would be useless.","Lakeside Villa.","Night drew its curtain, and a bright moon slowly rose above the treetops.","The table under the skylight courtyard was laden with delicacies, including freshly steamed hairy crabs.","This was Qi Quan's first time dining in the courtyard, which held a unique charm.","The villa's lights reflected in the pool water under the skylight, like brilliant starlight fallen to the bottom, shimmering and dazzling.","The osmanthus wine brewed by Butler Su himself was fragrant, mellow, and sweet, more intoxicating than the moonlight itself. Xue Hong took a sip of wine, then a bite of crab, feeling utterly content.","After all, she was in a ghost form now; however much she ate wouldn't cause any illness.","Right in the midst of this beautiful scene, the villa's telephone rang.","Su Rong paused, then drifted to the living room to answer it.","After just a few moments, he drifted back out.","\"Master, it's Director Meng on the phone.\"","Meng Yunzheng usually wouldn't bother her without good reason.","Qi Quan got up to answer the call.","\"Master, I truly apologize for disturbing you during the holiday, but just now, a group brawl broke out at the Master Association. The head of the supervision team was injured in the arm while trying to break it up—specifically, the meridians in his arm. If he doesn't receive treatment, I'm afraid his cultivation will struggle to advance further.\" Meng Yunzheng's tone was quite dejected.","With the supervision team stationed at the Master Association, friction with the association's staff was inevitable, but no one expected it to escalate into a full-blown brawl.","Those masters, in their excitement, had struck without holding back, damaging the supervision team leader's meridians.","These meridians specifically referred to the ones used for cultivation.","A master's cultivation requires spiritual energy to circulate smoothly within the body without the slightest obstruction. Damage to any meridian would affect one's cultivation level.","Qi Quan's expression turned cold. \"Where is he now?\"","\"In the medical room at the department.\"","Qi Quan looked toward the front courtyard, her gaze meeting Ling Sheng's, who had turned his head with concern.","An idea began to form in her mind.","\"I'll head over right now.\""]},{"number":60,"title":"Chapter 60","paragraphs":["Longjiang City Investigation Office.","Meng Yunzheng stood at the door of the infirmary, his expression extremely grave.","Although he had never worked directly with the leader of the inspection team, they were still colleagues within the same system. Hearing about the meridian damage filled him with profound distress.","Shen Hui's usual smile was also gone.","He stepped out of the infirmary, frowning and lowering his voice, \"Damaged meridians... it will be very difficult to continue cultivation in the future.\"","That inspection team leader would never be able to attempt breakthroughs to higher levels in this lifetime, and might even gradually regress to being an ordinary person.","\"I'm going to beat those scumbags to death!\" a furious roar erupted from inside the infirmary.","Someone weakly tried to stop it, \"Don't go!\"","\"Team Leader, they've gone too far!\"","The Team Leader, enduring the pain, said, \"The matter has already escalated. If you go beat them up now, are you prepared to face disciplinary action?\"","\"But—\"","\"Enough,\" the Team Leader coughed a few times, soothing them, \"No 'buts'. I'm the Team Leader. Listen to me.\"","Silence fell within the infirmary.","Damaged meridians could not be reconnected. The doctor in the infirmary had only bandaged the Team Leader's external wounds.","Everyone was holding back a suffocating anger.","Suddenly, someone cried out, \"It's all my fault! It's all because I couldn't hold back! I shouldn't have started the conflict with them! Before we went in, the Team Leader told us not to act impulsively no matter what. I was too impulsive. I'm sorry, I'm truly sorry!\"","\"It's not your fault. Honestly, I wanted to punch them a few times too,\" the Team Leader said gently. \"I just can't advance anymore, it's not like I'm dying. What's with all the crying?\"","\"Team Leader, they hurt you. They can't just get away with it, right?\" another team member said coldly. \"Causing meridian damage—making him serve some prison time isn't too much to ask, is it?\"","The Team Leader let out a soft sigh.","The situation had already become ugly enough. He didn't know what instructions would come from above.","Outside the infirmary.","Tang Mian bit through a lollipop, chewing it fiercely, and said coldly, \"They should go to jail!\"","She refused to believe those Taoist masters acted unintentionally.","Having been Taoist masters for so many years, could they not know the severity of their strikes?","To damage someone's meridians—how vicious must that strike have been!","Meng Yunzheng's face showed regret as he said, \"I've already asked Senior Qi Quan. She said she would come as soon as possible. She's experienced and knowledgeable. I wonder if she has any solutions.\"","\"The senior really said she's coming?\" Shen Hui asked in surprise.","Meng Yunzheng, \"Yes, why?\"","\"Why didn't you arrange for me to drive and pick her up!\"","Meng Yunzheng, \"...\"","Oh no. Things were too chaotic; he had genuinely forgotten.","Oh heavens!","\"Go, you should drive right now to—\"","His words cut off abruptly.","Two figures appeared in the corridor. Under the bright white lights, their appearances were exceptionally striking, their skin glowing with a jade-like sheen.","\"Senior!\" Shen Hui called out joyfully.","The sound reached the infirmary, causing the inspectors inside to freeze momentarily.","Within the same system, everyone knew each other's reputations. Who else could Shen Hui address with such delighted reverence but the great Senior Qi Quan?","An inspector whispered, \"Is it that... great senior?\"","\"Probably, right?\"","\"I... I'm so nervous.\"","\"Team Leader, why are you trembling? Is the pain that bad?\"","Team Leader, \"...\"","He was trembling with excitement!","Was it really that senior? Could he really get to meet that senior?","Outside the infirmary.","Qi Quan and Ling Sheng approached.","\"Senior, how did you get here?\"","...","Meng Yunzheng was stunned. It seemed like only a few minutes had passed since his phone call?","Qi Quan said, \"Swift Travel Talisman.\"","\"It was my oversight. I forgot to have Shen Hui pick you up,\" Meng Yunzheng said apologetically.","\"Swift Travel Talisman is faster,\" Qi Quan replied. \"Saving someone is more urgent.\"","The lives of inspectors within the Taoist Association weren't easy. Those selected to be inspectors were all people of strong will and upright character.","Meridian damage not only hindered cultivation progress; the pain involved was also unbearable for ordinary people.","She, too, was unwilling to see elite talent end their paths with such regret.","Meng Yunzheng's eyes lit up, \"Senior, do you have a solution?\"","Qi Quan didn't make any promises, \"I can only confirm after seeing him.\"","\"Alright! He's inside. Please, come in!\"","Tang Mian stepped forward and opened the infirmary door.","As soon as it opened, a row of straight-backed inspectors stood inside the room, their eyes shining brightly, all focused intently on Tang Mian... and the person behind her.","It's the senior! It really is the senior!","The Team Leader sitting on the sickbed flushed red.","He looked truly disheveled.","Qi Quan glanced over everyone and said calmly, \"The Team Leader stays. Everyone else, step outside.\"","Accustomed to giving orders in her past life, her tone naturally carried the authority of a superior.","The inspectors all shuddered reflexively, then filed out in an orderly, disciplined line.","There was also a doctor sitting at a desk.","Qi Quan said politely, \"My apologies, but we need to borrow your infirmary for a moment.\"","\"Ah, it's no trouble at all! Please, go ahead! I'll step out!\"","The doctor, catching on, left the infirmary to the three of them and thoughtfully closed the door.","The previously crowded room instantly became much more spacious.","The Team Leader was a man with regular features, nearly thirty years old. Due to the nature of his work, he usually wore a stern, serious expression.","Now, facing the senior he deeply admired, he was actually blushing, fidgeting, and utterly at a loss for words.","Qi Quan's voice was low and gentle, \"Lie down.\"","The Team Leader lay down on the bed without the slightest hesitation.","\"Close your eyes.\"","He closed his eyes with utmost compliance.","Qi Quan observed the dark circles under his eyes and drew a Tranquilizing Talisman in the air, which sank into the space between his eyebrows.","The Tranquilizing Talisman took effect quickly, and the Team Leader soon fell into a deep sleep.","His nerves had been stretched taut for too long; it was time for a proper rest.","Qi Quan set up an isolation array within the infirmary and said to Ling Sheng, \"Examine his arm.\"","Ling Sheng sat on the chair by the sickbed and placed his hand near the edge of the Team Leader's wound.","The wound was long and thin, made by a peach wood sword.","The peach wood sword carried spiritual energy, which rushed into his meridians, causing the damage.","Ling Sheng closed his eyes. Spiritual energy gathered at his fingertips, transforming into an extremely fine thread that slowly probed into the man's wound, reaching the damaged section of his meridian.","He clearly \"saw\" that part of the meridian filled with other, chaotic spiritual energy. This energy forcefully blocked the flow of the man's own spiritual power, causing that section of the meridian to become sluggish and obstructed.","The Taoist master who inflicted the injury had a higher cultivation level than the Team Leader. His spiritual energy was more domineering. The Team Leader couldn't use his own power to expel it, and the spiritual energy of others couldn't help him either.","Even a high-level Taoist master couldn't precisely channel their own spiritual energy into another person's meridians and perfectly \"expel\" a third party's energy.","Meridians were inherently narrow. With foreign energy already packed inside and under obstruction, the meridian's capacity was even lower. A third party rashly probing with their energy could easily cause more severe damage.","But the spiritual energy of a healing cultivator was different.","The spiritual energy cultivated according to the healing path by a healing cultivator could be easily accepted by most practitioners.","Although Ling Sheng hadn't fully embarked on the healing path, his constitution was special, possessing an extremely strong affinity for all types of spiritual energy. As expected, his spiritual energy met no resistance from the Team Leader's meridians.","He easily captured several strands of the \"destructive elements.\"","His spiritual energy carefully enveloped them. Once all the \"destructive elements\" were surrounded, he forcefully pulled them out and dispersed them into the air.","With the destructive elements gone, the Team Leader's meridians were no longer obstructed, and the flow of his spiritual energy returned to normal.","As Ling Sheng manipulated his spiritual power to leave, he conveniently repaired the flesh wounds on the team leader's meridians, speeding up the healing process.","He withdrew his hand and looked up at Qi Quan.","Qi Quan could sense the changes in spiritual energy at the team leader's arm and praised sincerely, \"Truly amazing.\"","Ling Sheng's lips curved into a smile, his entire brow radiating joy.","The entire \"surgery\" took no more than ten minutes.","Qi Quan put away the isolation barrier and walked out of the infirmary with Ling Sheng.","The area outside the infirmary was crowded with people, all waiting for the result.","Qi Quan said, \"It's done.\"","\"Done?\" Meng Yunzheng asked eagerly, \"You mean his arm is fine? He can continue cultivating?\"","\"Yes.\"","Everyone looked at Qi Quan with a mix of pleasant surprise and admiration.","Qi Quan didn't want to take the credit. \"I didn't do it.\"","If she didn't do it, then it was naturally Ling Sheng who did.","Even the assistant by the big shot's side is this capable!","Regardless of how he managed to heal it, just this skill alone is enough for him to establish himself in the mystical arts community!","Meng Yunzheng was clearly also somewhat surprised.","His impression of Ling Sheng was still stuck on \"exceptionally good-looking, unable to speak.\"","Truly, you can't judge a book by its cover.","As expected, a master's side is full of hidden dragons and crouching tigers.","Qi Quan instructed, \"He's resting, don't disturb him for now. Also, don't spread this matter.\"","Those present naturally nodded.","They'd have to be out of their minds to talk about it.","With the task completed, Qi Quan and Ling Sheng returned to the villa.","On a whim, the former sat down in front of the computer to write; the latter, after entering his room, took out a brand new notebook and began jotting down his thoughts and experiences from his first \"house call.\"","At ten o'clock in the evening, a new chapter of \"Diary of the Wealthy\" was published.","[What does it mean when an avatar is shrouded in ghostly energy?","It means this person is either tainted by a ghost, or is a ghost themselves.","Either way, it's not good for my colleague.","Seeing me stare blankly at the avatar, my colleague somewhat uncomfortably pulled her phone back and asked, \"Is there a problem?\"","How should I answer?","Should I tell her the other party is connected to a ghost?","Absolutely not.","She, deeply in the throes of infatuation, would definitely not believe me and would distance herself from me from then on.","I can't just watch a young girl walk into a fiery pit.","I weighed my words and said, \"I just think his avatar looks familiar.\"","\"Familiar?\" My colleague said in surprise, \"I think his avatar is very unique. I've never seen anything like it.\"","As she spoke, a blissful smile appeared on her face. \"He must be a very special man.\"","For a moment, I didn't know whether I should shatter her fantasy.","\"I remember now.\" I decided to warn her anyway. \"I've seen this avatar before. It's a talisman pattern.\"","My colleague exclaimed happily, \"He even studies talismans! He must be a noble and unsullied person, detached from worldly concerns!\"","I: \"...\"","My colleague was too deeply poisoned. I shouldn't have been indirect; I should have administered a strong dose of medicine.","I said, \"This is a type of hallucination-inducing talisman. It has a disorienting effect.\"","\"What do you mean?\" She frowned at me, clearly harboring doubts and wariness towards me.","I said seriously, \"How about we make a bet?\"","\"Bet on what?\"","\"Bet on what kind of person he is in real life.\"","My colleague looked suspicious. She didn't trust me, but she clearly also wanted to know what the other person was really like.","Before her condition became terminal, I decided to take her to sober up.","\"Let me ask you, do you want to see him?\"","In the chat logs, my colleague had repeatedly suggested meeting up, but was always refused by the other party.","It was because the most opportune moment hadn't arrived yet.","Once my colleague became \"deeply attached\" to him, he would treat her as a slave, ordering her around arbitrarily; she wouldn't resist even insults or abuse.","My colleague nodded fiercely. \"I do!\"","She asked me mysteriously, \"You're not some kind of internet expert, are you? Can you find out who he is? Would that be illegal?\"","I smiled. \"Not an internet expert. I have other methods.\"","\"Alright.\" My colleague was half-convinced, half-doubting.","The mystical arts community has special methods. I could use the other party's avatar to locate their position.","Seeing me form hand seals, my colleague's face took on the expression of an old man on the subway looking at his phone.","Her doubt turned into speechlessness.","One minute later, I lowered my hands and said, \"I've found him. Want to go see him?\"","My colleague's face was full of conflict. \"You're not just going to grab some random guy off the street and claim it's him, are you?\"","She thought I was playing a prank.","I directly grabbed her hand and pulled her outside.","Colleague: ?","Fortunately, the man wasn't far away—after all, my colleague had found him through a \"shake to meet\" feature.","The man was in an internet cafe, wearing a floral shirt and baggy shorts, flip-flops on his feet. His hair looked like it hadn't been washed for who knows how many days, greasy and giving off a strange odor.","I led my colleague past him slowly from behind.","He happened to be chatting online with someone.","My colleague glanced over, her face instantly turning pale.","On the computer screen, his chat avatar was unmistakably that \"unique talisman pattern\"!","I deliberately chose the empty seat next to the man to sit down; my colleague sat on my other side.","I turned on the computer, pretending to play a game, then discreetly messaged my colleague on my phone: [Chat with him.]","After the initial shock, my colleague took out her phone, put it on silent, opened the chat interface, and started chatting with him.","The moment she sent the first message and he replied, my colleague pretended to get up and walk towards the counter. As she passed behind the man, she saw the chat box on his computer screen, and her lips trembled even more violently.","She had finally seen this man's true face!","Afraid she might still be holding onto hope, I kept her in the internet cafe, sitting right next to the man, listening to him hum a terrible tune and spit out a few curse words from time to time.","My colleague was almost depressed.","The \"special\" man in her mind had completely crumbled.","On the way back, she resentfully blocked the man and posted a moment on her social feed.","[Online dating is risky; who knows if it's a person or a ghost on the other end of the line!]","It was then that I realized what I had forgotten earlier.","The man wasn't a ghost, yet his avatar had ghostly energy.","So, was there a problem with the talisman pattern?]","The new chapter ends.","[Call Me to Prepare Lessons When You See Me: Ahhhhh the author finally updated again! I've been waiting so hard! Thankfully my colleague recognized that man's true colors! So is there something wrong with that talisman pattern?]","[Dying of Laughter: What does the talisman pattern actually look like? Are there really talismans that can confuse people's minds?]","[We Want Male Virtue Stories: Dying of Laughter, this is just a novel, you actually believe it? PS: I don't even care about the male lead anymore, these little supernatural stories are quite interesting, author can you update faster!]","[Soaring Sky and Noble Steed: Grabbing a front-row seat! One hundred depth charges!]","[Book Famine is Deadly: Ahhhhh I have pocket money again, twenty depth charges!]","[Goddess of Clear Water, My Wife: Hehehe, you might not know this, but that colleague is me. The goddess held my hand, hehehe.]","[Today is Auspicious: The one above, go dream on, you can have anything in dreams. One hundred depth charges!]","[Today Brings Great Profit: Better not dream; wouldn't it be even more painful to wake up? One hundred depth charges!]","[Auspicious and Profitable: All I'm saying is, girls, keep your eyes open and don't get fooled by scumbags. One hundred depth charges!]","[Passerby A: Looking forward to what comes next.]","Longjiang City Investigation Department.","The leader of the inspection team slept soundly for several hours before slowly opening his eyes.","He hadn't slept this well in a very long time.","\"Leader, you're awake!\" a team member exclaimed joyfully. \"Would you like some water?\"","A cup of warm water was brought to his lips.","The leader took a sip, then suddenly remembered something and cried out in alarm, \"The senior! Senior Qi Quan! How did I just fall asleep?\"","He raised his hand in frustration to knock on his own head.","Huh?","The injury on his arm seemed almost completely healed?","The leader looked at his team member with a bewildered expression and asked, \"Am I dreaming? I dreamed that Senior Qi Quan came to treat me.\"","\"Hahahaha!\" The team member burst out laughing. \"Leader, I really should take a picture of you like this.\"","It was mainly because their leader was usually so proper and stern.","Now, he really had a cute contrast going on.","The leader gave a light cough, resuming his usual stern face, and asked, \"What exactly happened?\"","\"Leader, you did indeed meet Senior Qi Quan, and your meridians were indeed healed. You should be the clearest about that, right?\" The team member also straightened his expression, becoming serious.","The leader nodded.","Whether his spiritual power flowed smoothly or not, he knew best.","\"So, it really was the senior who healed me?\" His stern face couldn't hold any longer.","Team member: \"To be precise, it was Senior Qi Quan and her assistant working together to complete it.\"","The leader grinned.","He was simply overjoyed!","\"By the way, leader, how should we deal with those few practitioners who injured people?\" the other team members asked indignantly.","There was more than one person who had attacked. The members of the inspection team had all suffered some minor external injuries, but only the leader had sustained meridian damage, making his situation the most serious.","Those who had injured people were still locked in the interrogation room.","The leader said coldly, \"We'll follow the instructions from above.\"","They had been monitoring the association's operations day and night, not just current ones but also past dealings, and had indeed uncovered some practitioners with unclean hands.","Perhaps this touched on certain people's interests, provoking this conflict, or perhaps someone was deliberately stirring the pot.","He stood up and said, \"I'm going to find Director Meng.\"","The conflict between the inspection team and the staff of the Practitioners' Association had already been reported to the headquarters in Longjing.","Meng Yunzheng was listening to Li Guoyan's instructions.","\"Let it be?\" he asked, puzzled. \"Why let it be? Wouldn't that just fuel their arrogance?\"","Li Guoyan said slowly, \"Precisely to fuel their arrogance.\"","Meng Yunzheng thought for a moment and suddenly understood.","This conflict wasn't particularly intense yet. Those practitioners who injured people were stubbornly sticking to excuses like 'it was an accident' or 'it wasn't intentional.' At most, they would be detained for a few days for education and made to pay some medical compensation. That would likely be the end of it.","After all, members of the inspection team had also taken action.","But the cause of the incident was far too simple.","A certain practitioner had \"accidentally\" bumped into an inspector and insisted on turning the tables, starting with a war of words. When emotions ran high, peachwood swords and techniques were used, and the two began to fight.","Then, more and more practitioners and inspectors joined in, turning it into a brawl.","The one who initially stirred up trouble was now the most cowardly.","In the interrogation room, he kept insisting that he just didn't like that inspector. After bumping into him, he seized the chance to curse at him a few times. He never imagined it would escalate into a group fight.","The matter wasn't major, but it wasn't minor either.","The difficulty lay in how to handle it.","If the punishment was too light, the inspection team would be looked down upon; if it was too heavy, the Practitioners' Association would make a fuss.","And right now, they couldn't determine if it was just a random incident or if there was a mastermind behind it.","If there was a mastermind behind it, then they might as well let this fire burn even more fiercely.","\"I understand,\" Meng Yunzheng replied.","Li Guoyan suddenly said, \"It's not just Longjiang City. I've received similar feedback from other regions. Some of our inspectors have been injured and may no longer be suitable for this kind of work in the future.\"","Injured?!","Meng Yunzheng quickly asked, \"Is it also meridian damage?\"","He hadn't had time yet to report the matter of Qi Quan and Ling Sheng treating the inspection team leader.","Senior Qi Quan only said not to spread it externally; within the Investigation Department was not included in that restriction.","\"Also?\" Li Guoyan caught the implication, his voice grave. \"It seems team members in Longjiang have also been injured.\"","Across the country, such large-scale conflicts erupting simultaneously—it's impossible for there not to be something fishy going on.","That's why Li Guoyan intended to adopt a wait-and-see approach.","Meng Yunzheng said with a smile, \"Director Li, you don't need to worry. Our inspector has already been healed.\"","\"Healed?\" Li Guoyan instinctively lowered his voice. \"You mean, truly cured?\"","\"Yes.\"","Li Guoyan: \"How is that possible? Isn't it said that if a cultivator's meridians are damaged, they can no longer continue cultivating?\"","\"But it is indeed cured.\" Meng Yunzheng felt immense gratitude towards Qi Quan and Ling Sheng in his heart.","Because of her, because of Ling Sheng, the elite members of the inspection teams could be saved!","Li Guoyan was still hesitant. \"Completely cured? No side effects?\"","It should be known that the headquarters was still holding a seventh-level practitioner.","Yan Fengqing's leg meridians had been damaged over twenty years ago, leaving him unable to walk, and his spiritual power unable to circulate.","Logically, after so many years, his spiritual power should have degraded completely, making it impossible to maintain seventh-level cultivation.","The Investigation Department had already asked about this.","Yan Fengqing's explanation was that he had researched ancient texts and developed a medicine. As long as he took the medicine according to the prescription on schedule, his damaged meridians would temporarily return to normal for a day and night after taking it. He used that brief window to maintain his seventh-level cultivation.","He also said that if the Investigation Department needed it, he could provide this prescription.","Shortly after he said this, chaos broke out in Practitioners' Associations across various regions, and many inspectors suffered meridian injuries.","It was by connecting these dots that Li Guoyan suspected this turmoil likely had someone deliberately muddying the waters behind the scenes.","After receiving the news, he questioned Yan Fengqing in detail and had professional physicians examine him.","The meridians in his legs were still in a damaged state, and the ingredients listed on that prescription required enormous financial resources and effort to obtain.","Not only that, but taking the medicine too much was not very beneficial for the body and could even affect fertility.","Li Guoyan was unwilling to see inspectors suffer the pain of blocked meridians, nor did he want them to undergo such a treatment plan.","While he was in a dilemma, Meng Yunzheng's words were like a timely rain, instantly dousing the anxiety and simmering anger in his heart.","\"Director Li, it was Senior Qi Quan who came in person.\"","That one sentence was enough to prove everything.","Qi Quan had never made a mistake when she acted. She was the stabilizing pillar, the hope of the mystical world.","Li Guoyan's face showed excitement. \"Good, I'll contact her right away.\"","He picked up the phone, then remembered it was the middle of the night and worried about disturbing Qi Quan's rest. He restrained himself and waited until the next morning.","Lakeside Villa.","After finishing breakfast, Qi Quan received a call from Li Guoyan.","\"Master, from what Meng Yunzheng said, you healed a damaged inspector's meridians last night. I was wondering if there were any special requirements during the treatment?\" Worried about the inspectors' conditions, Li Guoyan didn't waste words and got straight to the point.","Qi Quan looked towards Ling Sheng, who was beside her, intently studying a medical text.","\"To be precise, it was done by Ling Sheng.\"","Li Guoyan was taken aback for a moment before continuing his inquiry, \"Last night, similar conflicts occurred at Heavenly Master Associations across the country. Many inspectors suffered injuries of varying severity. I wonder if Ling Sheng can treat them?\"","Qi Quan replied, \"I'll ask him.\"","The situation had been urgent the previous night, so she had taken Ling Sheng with her directly.","Now, with so many inspectors injured, rushing wouldn't help, and given the large number of people, she felt she must consult Ling Sheng's willingness.","She said, \"Ling Sheng, there are many people now with injuries similar to that person from last night. Are you willing to treat them?\"","Ling Sheng paused, took out his phone, and typed: [Can I earn money to support the family?]","Qi Quan chuckled, put the call on speakerphone, and asked Li Guoyan on his behalf, \"In principle, the Investigation Department has a medical office. Would Ling Sheng practicing medicine without a license be considered illegal?\"","The implication was clear.","Li Guoyan decided to handle this as a special case. Moreover, as far as he knew, there were no mystical methods within the metaphysical community capable of healing a cultivator's damaged meridians. Someone like Ling Sheng could be considered the foremost expert in medical arts. Such talent naturally had to be promptly recruited by the Investigation Department.","He immediately replied, \"Rest assured, if he can treat our inspectors, the department will certainly appoint him as the Chief Physician, with full salary, bonuses, and other benefits.\"","Qi Quan looked at Ling Sheng, seeking his opinion with her eyes.","Ling Sheng continued typing: [Does this count as a career?]","[Hahahaha, Ling Sheng is still thinking about his career!] The system was amused by him.","Qi Quan smiled and nodded, \"It counts.\"","[I am willing.] Ling Sheng typed these three words.","Qi Quan relayed the message to Li Guoyan, \"Ling Sheng is willing to treat the injured. However, please keep his identity confidential for now, limited to within the Investigation Department.\"","\"I understand, Master. Please rest assured, the Investigation Department will not leak a single piece of information,\" Li Guoyan said. \"I will immediately notify all local Investigation Departments to have the injured gather at the Longjiang City branch for treatment. How does that sound?\"","Qi Quan: \"That's acceptable.\"","Longjing City Investigation Department.","After hanging up, Li Guoyan immediately sent out a notice to all local Investigation Departments, instructing all personnel with meridian injuries to proceed to the Longjiang City Investigation Department.","As for the reason, it wasn't explicitly stated.","They just needed to follow orders.","...","Local Investigation Departments had been grappling with the inspectors' injuries. Once the order from headquarters came down, they sprang into action. Almost simultaneously, dozens of inspectors from across the country headed towards Longjiang City.","With the inspectors' injuries being addressed, Li Guoyan breathed a sigh of relief, but the phone rang again.","He answered. It was Sect Leader Yin.","Yin Yi's voice was very grave, \"Director Li, we located the production base in Longlin City, but there's a ninth-level protective array surrounding it. With just the few of us, we truly cannot break through it.\"","\"Not even with attack talismans?\" Li Guoyan asked.","Yin Yi said, \"We have attack talismans, but don't they have spiritual talismans? Moreover, the person who can set up a ninth-level array... we few seventh-level cultivators are simply no match.\"","It wasn't cowardice; it was that sacrificing themselves would be utterly meaningless.","Precisely because of this, the other side was acting so brazenly.","Even knowing their base had been discovered, they showed no reaction, not even bothering with Yin Yi, Fu Jiuchong, and the others.","They had no choice but to return to Longjing City.","Li Guoyan's expression turned solemn. \"Thank you for your hard work.\"","As soon as the call ended, the phone rang again.","The caller was Sect Leader Wan Du.","His message was the same as Yin Yi's: the site in Longtang City was also protected by a high-level array he couldn't crack, forcing him to return to Longhai City.","Li Guoyan's heart grew heavy once more.","A ninth-level array indicated that the organization behind it had at least a ninth-level array master.","Previously, they had sent three seventh-level and one eighth-level cultivator to deal with Master Qi. Now, a ninth-level array had appeared. The more the opponent revealed, the more alarmed Li Guoyan became.","This was a colossal entity.","Eradicating it completely would not be a simple task.","Perhaps even Yan Fengqing was merely a pawn.","He entered the interrogation room again.","Yan Fengqing was handcuffed to the chair, looking at him calmly.","\"Made up your mind?\"","Li Guoyan asked, \"How many years have you been taking this medicine?\"","A faint, cold smile tinged with a hint of scorn appeared on Yan Fengqing's pale face.","\"About twenty years now.\"","Li Guoyan: \"You said these medicinal ingredients are very expensive. Twenty years must have cost a considerable fortune. Your accounts don't show that much money. Where did the funds to buy the ingredients come from?\"","\"I am a member of the Yan family. The Yan family is far wealthier than you imagine,\" Yan Fengqing said, lowering his gaze. \"If the Yan family couldn't even support a cripple like me, what right would they have to call themselves the premier family?\"","Li Guoyan went straight to the point, \"You and Yan Fengjun have a good relationship?\"","\"I know what you're thinking,\" Yan Fengqing sneered. \"You just want to say, since Yan Fengjun and I don't get along, why would he spend so much money.\"","Li Guoyan stared at him.","\"He is the impartial and selfless head of the Yan family. He needs to demonstrate his benevolence and righteousness; otherwise, how could he command respect?\" Yan Fengqing's lips curled in mockery.","Li Guoyan's eyes darkened. \"I asked him. He said he didn't.\"","\"Generally speaking, testimony from both family and enemies lacks sufficient credibility. He happens to be both.\"","Li Guoyan: \"...\"","This man was cunning, constantly leading him in circles.","He struck directly at Yan Fengqing's sore spot, \"You've searched for over twenty years and still haven't found a way to cure your legs. Have you ever considered it might be because of things you've done? Karma is a cycle; retribution is inevitable.\"","Li Guoyan wasn't speaking without basis.","It was known that Yan Wu was involved in the ghost marriage case, and Yan Mao ordered two sixth-level Heavenly Masters to attack the villa when Qi Quan was besieged, cooperating with the evil cultivator in Longhu City to unsettle Qi Quan.","Both of these individuals were connected to Yan Fengqing. It could be inferred that both the ghost marriage case and the Bloodburst Pill case were intricately linked to Yan Fengqing.","It was known that Fu Jiuge was ambushed in Longhu City years ago while investigating the bloody pills, encountering a peripheral member of the Buddhist cultivator group. Previously, during the Peach Blossom Seal case, Qi Quan killed a Buddhist cultivator and brought back Ling Sheng.","It was known that Ling Sheng's photo bore a seventy to eighty percent resemblance to Fu Jiuge's photo. Furthermore, after Master Qi attended Fu Luanfei's birthday banquet, Fu Jiuge regained consciousness. It could be speculated that Ling Sheng and Fu Jiuge were related.","It was known that Ling Sheng could heal damaged meridians.","If Yan Fengqing had truly participated in these evil deeds, harming Fu Jiuge and causing Ling Sheng to live in darkness for nineteen years, then he truly had brought this upon himself.","The only person in the world who might have been able to cure his legs, because of his own greed and cruelty, had made it utterly impossible for him to ever be healed.","If one day Yan Fengqing learned this truth, what would he think?","\"Heh,\" Yan Fengqing scoffed at his words. \"Karma is a cycle? Retribution is inevitable? If that were really true, why did I end up like this after hunting down evil cultivators back then?\"","A genius had fallen. He had lost everything.","The position of family head, the woman he loved, his healthy body—he had lost far too much.","He had watched helplessly as the inferior Yan Fengjun ascended to the head of the family, watched helplessly as Fu Jiuge married a rogue cultivator, watched helplessly as the spiritual power within his body slowly dissipated.","He was about to become an ordinary person.","He would have nothing left.","The pity, the mockery, the kicking someone when they're down from others pierced him like sharp thorns, leaving him bleeding.","He refused to accept it.","Li Guoyan looked at him with both sympathy and pity.","If Yan Fengqing hadn't been so deluded, he might have waited for the birth of a new life, for the hope that belonged to him.","But he didn't.","\"What do you mean?\" Yan Fengqing was provoked by his gaze, his face growing even gloomier. \"What right do you have to look at me like that? You're just an ordinary person. I am a seventh-level Celestial Master, the most talented Talisman Master in the Mystic Arts community!\"","\"Wasn't the most talented one Xie Lanzhou?\" Li Guoyan stabbed at his sore spot once more.","Yan Fengqing scoffed, \"What is he? Just a poor, wretched rogue cultivator. What does he have to compare with me?\"","\"I heard he was a fifth-level Talisman Master at seventeen, even capable of crafting talismans beyond his level,\" Li Guoyan said leisurely. \"While you advanced to the fifth level at eighteen and could not craft beyond your level.\"","Yan Fengqing: \"...\"","\"I heard he was a kind and righteous person, extremely passionate about the profession of a Celestial Master. He diligently studied the Talisman Path, all to create better talismans for exorcising evil and capturing ghosts. For a rogue cultivator to achieve such a level is truly outstanding. Otherwise, Fu Jiuge wouldn't have...\"","\"So what!\" Yan Fengqing interrupted him, his face contorted. \"He was still foolish to the extreme, dying—\"","He caught himself and promptly shut his mouth.","Li Guoyan feigned surprise, \"He's dead? You know about it? Why don't we talk about how he died.\"","Yan Fengqing gave a cold laugh.","\"Something even the Fu family doesn't know, yet you know so clearly. Yan Fengqing, I have reason to suspect you are connected to the case from back then. Please cooperate with the interrogation.\"","The corner of Yan Fengqing's mouth lifted, \"With no news of him for so many years, anyone could guess he died out there.\"","No matter how much Li Guoyan pressed him, he stuck to this story.","Li Guoyan didn't waste any more time. With Yan Fengqing's self-exposure, he had grounds to detain him for a few more days.","\"Continue the interrogation,\" he instructed the interrogator.","\"Yes.\"","Early the next morning, Shen Hui drove to Lakeside Villa to pick up Qi Quan and Ling Sheng.","\"Senior, all the injured inspectors from various regions arrived yesterday,\" Shen Hui said with a pleased smile. \"They are all arranged in the training room now.\"","The infirmary was too small and couldn't accommodate them all.","Qi Quan replied, \"Mm.\"","This time, there were no unexpected incidents on the road. The journey to the Investigation Department was smooth.","Everything inside the Investigation Department had been arranged.","The more severely injured were placed at the front, the less severely injured at the back.","Meng Yunzheng met Qi Quan and Ling Sheng at the entrance and asked quietly, \"Senior, there are quite a few injured. I wonder how many patients Physician Ling Sheng can treat at once?\"","\"His surname is Qi,\" Qi Quan corrected. \"We haven't tested his limits yet.\"","Meng Yunzheng understood. \"Senior, Physician Qi, the most severe case has damaged meridians in both legs. He currently cannot walk at all.\"","\"Mm, let's take a look first,\" Qi Quan said, not making any promises.","She came this time primarily because it was Ling Sheng's first official \"house call.\" After this, Ling Sheng would be able to come and go from the Investigation Department freely.","The two entered the infirmary, set up an isolation array, and only then had the first injured person brought in for treatment.","The patient was carried in on a stretcher.","Both the patient and the two carrying him gazed at Qi Quan with shining eyes.","They got to see the Senior!","Qi Quan hadn't paid it much mind initially, but when she looked at the patient, she suddenly froze.","She sensed an extremely faint trace of ghost energy.","The ghost energy was very well concealed. Its source should be an eighth-level green ghost. Others couldn't detect it, and the Investigation Department's instruments couldn't monitor it, but she, at the Human Emperor realm, vaguely sensed it.","She asked directly, \"Have you recently encountered an eighth-level green ghost?\"","The injured man: ???","What? How would he know!"]},{"number":61,"title":"Chapter 61","paragraphs":["The injured man wore a look of genuine confusion, not feigned.","Qi Quan stopped questioning and sat to the side to cultivate.","The three others: ?","The senior wasn't speaking, so they didn't know what to do either.","Ling Sheng pulled an electronic device from his bag.","He pressed a button, and the device emitted a synthetic voice: \"Please lie down.\"","Ling Sheng pointed to the hospital bed.","The three: \"...\"","The two team members moved the injured man onto the bed.","Ling Sheng pressed another button.","\"Please leave.\"","The two walked out somewhat bewildered and closed the door.","Ling Sheng looked at the injured man and pressed another button.","\"Please close your eyes.\"","The injured man wanted to ask something, but seeing Ling Sheng's demeanor, he obediently closed his eyes.","With his eyes closed, his sense of touch became sharper.","At the wound on his right leg, a gentle surge of spiritual energy flowed in. Miraculously, his own meridians and spiritual energy did not reject this foreign strand.","In his understanding, the spiritual energy of different cultivators was mutually exclusive. If another cultivator's energy invaded one's meridians, it would result in his current condition.","Yet, he felt no resistance to this physician's energy!","Did this mean he could be cured?","Ling Sheng was intensely focused.","Having saved one person yesterday, he had gained some insight, and today he was even more adept.","He detected the third-party spiritual energy wreaking havoc within the meridians, carefully seeped his own energy around it, enveloped it, and meticulously moved it out of the meridians. Once the foreign energy left the meridians, it dissipated into the air.","The injured man opened his eyes in astonishment.","The pain in his right leg had completely vanished! His spiritual energy could also circulate normally now!","How much time had passed?","One minute or two?","Sob sob sob sob, Senior Qi truly lived up to his reputation, even his assistant was this incredible!","Ling Sheng glanced up at him, his amber eyes calm and unreadable.","The injured man tensed up and hurriedly closed his eyes again.","Although this physician's spiritual energy felt very amiable, his temperament was quite aloof.","Ling Sheng repeated the method and soon healed the man's other leg.","He pressed a button.","\"Treatment complete. Please leave.\"","The injured man instinctively lifted his leg—it was truly healed!","He excitedly expressed his gratitude, \"Thank you, doctor! Thank you!\"","Then, supporting himself on both legs, he left the infirmary.","In the training room, the waiting inspectors were stunned.","The most severely injured person was cured that quickly?","It was unbelievable!","As more injured received treatment, Ling Sheng's technique became increasingly proficient. He could even simultaneously control spiritual energy with both hands to treat two injuries on a patient, which significantly increased his speed.","Several dozen injured were treated in just over an hour.","Towards the end, for those with lighter injuries, it took less than a minute each.","Everyone marveled at the sight.","Meng Yunzheng was naturally overjoyed. Once all the injured were cured without exception, he immediately reported the matter to headquarters.","Upon receiving the news, Li Guoyan wasted no time. He called Qi Quan to specially appoint Ling Sheng as the Chief Physician of the Investigation Department.","Currently, within the Mystic Arts world, aside from Ling Sheng, there was no one else capable of completely curing damaged meridians.","\"I'll have someone start making his credentials and salary card immediately. Please send a photo of his ID card.\"","Qi Quan, sitting in the car on the way back, replied, \"His ID card hasn't been processed yet.\"","\"...\"","Li Guoyan said, \"Then we'll make the credentials first.\"","\"Mm.\"","\"Master, I have another question,\" Li Guoyan asked somewhat apologetically. \"I wonder if old, chronic injuries can be treated?\"","The Investigation Department had been secretly established for some time, and personnel had been trained early on. Some investigators were injured in earlier cases, which were carried out covertly and known to very few.","After their injuries, the Department was unable to provide effective treatment and could only arrange for them to recuperate in sanatoriums.","These investigators had been enduring immense pain due to injuries to their meridians or dantians.","Qi Quan said, \"After we return, I'll have Ling Sheng contact you himself via text message.\"","\"Good.\" Li Guoyan agreed, then added, \"There's another matter. The production bases in Longlin City and Longtang City are both shielded by a ninth-grade formation. Yin Yi and Wan Du had no choice but to return to Longjing.\"","Qi Quan's brow twitched slightly—a ninth-grade formation.","The grade of a formation and the cultivator's cultivation level are not always directly corresponding. Many formation masters reach a certain cultivation level, but their mastery of formations may not necessarily match it.","Someone capable of setting up a ninth-grade formation is at least a ninth-grade formation master, and more likely has already reached the Human Sovereign realm.","Even if the formation master is only ninth-grade, whoever commands a ninth-grade formation master must absolutely be at the Human Sovereign realm.","As for the Human Immortal realm, Qi Quan didn't consider it.","It wasn't that she refused to acknowledge that someone's cultivation could reach the Human Immortal level, but rather that upon reaching it, one's lifespan becomes almost immeasurably long.","A Human Immortal with such a long lifespan would have no need to engage with these evil organizations, seizing others' vitality and fortune.","The most likely candidate is a Human Sovereign realm cultivator seeking to break through to the Human Immortal realm.","Qi Quan instantly guessed the hidden power behind the evil cultivator organization.","But it was just a guess; she didn't elaborate.","\"Master, they are acting with impunity,\" Li Guoyan said gravely.","Qi Quan asked, \"They possess Bloodburst Pills and other special pills, so they won't lack high-level masters. Given the current state of the Investigation Department and the Mystic Arts world, it's not advisable to take drastic action.\"","Their impunity stems from knowing that the Investigation Department and the Mystic Arts world can do nothing against them.","In this situation, they wouldn't feel the need to lash out recklessly.","The conflict between the Master Association and the inspection teams was most likely instigated by a third party infiltrating both sides, preventing genuine cooperation between the authorities and the Mystic Arts world.","This proves the other side needs time.","The Investigation Department and the Mystic Arts world also need time.","It becomes a race.","She had realized this, and Li Guoyan naturally had too.","He said, \"Knowing they are harming children, we cannot just stand by and watch.\"","\"Take a two-pronged approach,\" Qi Quan stated. \"Since we already know the locations of their production bases, increase surveillance efforts, deploy defenses around the perimeters, and strictly inspect suspicious individuals with children. Another point is the third-party moles within the Master Association.\"","\"I've already dispatched people to monitor the areas around the bases. The Department has considered capturing the moles, but evil masters are still masters; they are adept at disguise.\"","Qi Quan smiled. \"No matter how adept at disguise, they will slip up. Who, able to live in the sunlight, would willingly hide in the shadows?\"","Li Guoyan understood immediately. \"You mean, they are either under the control of a high-level puppet talisman or need to take certain pills.\"","\"Mm. If instruments could detect those who have been implanted with puppet talismans or have taken such pills, the moles could be identified without raising alarm.\"","Li Guoyan: \"I'll have the technical department start developing that right away.\"","\"There's one more thing,\" Qi Quan said. \"On the first inspector treated today, I sensed the aura of an eighth-level powerful ghost.\"","Li Guoyan exclaimed in surprise, \"Eighth-level? Could it be the 'Siren Queen' who hasn't been captured yet?\"","\"Not necessarily.\"","Qi Quan had sensed the ghostly aura but did not feel any bloodlust or malice.","\"Alright, I understand. The Department will investigate thoroughly,\" Li Guoyan said with a smile. \"Thank you for your hard work today, and Dr. Ling's as well.\"","\"Mm.\"","Li Guoyan added, \"Regarding the Siren groups, I've already notified the relevant departments to increase publicity efforts, urging the public to download the related software, which will automatically block such groups.\"","System: [Wow, this is really good!]","\"The master warns readers in his novel, so we shouldn't lag behind, right?\" Li Guoyan joked with a laugh.","Qi Quan: \"...\"","The call ended as the car arrived at the villa gate.","Back in her room, Qi Quan suddenly heard Qin Ruo's furious shouts coming from the peachwood plaque.","\"You old fart, stop crowding me! Get lost!","\"","\"You old, ugly woman! We're all prisoners here, what's there to be so high and mighty about!\"","\"Shut up, all of you!\" the Wetland Fierce Ghost roared, suppressing them impatiently.","Qi Quan: ?","If they hadn't made a sound, she would have almost forgotten about a certain matter.","The peachwood plaque was indeed a bit crowded. It was time for a clean-up.","She called for Ling Sheng.","Healing damaged meridians didn't consume much spiritual power. On the way back, Ling Sheng had long since recovered.","He looked at Qi Quan with bright, energetic eyes.","\"Two more procedures,\" Qi Quan said, releasing Qin Ruo and the Long-bearded Master.","The Long-bearded Master was the one who arranged the ghost marriage for Ma Sisi in Longtan City.","Both were members of the evil cultivator organization, albeit low-ranking ones, but they might still yield some useful information.","Previously, they had been implanted with puppet talismans, preventing them from truly answering questions. Now, with the compression talisman, everything could be resolved smoothly.","Once released, Qin Ruo saw Qi Quan's serious expression and turned pale with fear: \"Senior, please don't kill me! I can be really useful!\"","Qi Quan couldn't be bothered with lengthy explanations. A pulse of spiritual energy struck, and Qin Ruo instantly fell into a deep sleep.","She drew the compression talisman seal in the air, which then sank deep into Qin Ruo's spiritual platform.","The two worked in seamless cooperation, quickly removing the puppet talisman and placing it within an array to let it explode.","The unconscious Qin Ruo was tossed back into the peachwood plaque.","Next was the Long-bearded Master.","They repeated the process, removed the puppet talisman, and threw him back into the peachwood plaque as well.","The system asked in surprise: [Big shot, aren't you going to interrogate them?]","[There are still two level-seven Masters.]","Qi Quan said to Ling Sheng, \"We'll do two more procedures tomorrow.\"","Ling Sheng took out his phone: [I can rest for a bit and then do it.]","\"...Alright.\"","Qi Quan didn't refuse.","Why wait for a specific day when today is as good as any? Let's remove them all today!","They were so busy with the procedures, with their phones on silent, that they missed Li Guoyan's attempts to contact them.","They didn't even eat lunch or dinner, continuing until deep into the night.","After four consecutive \"procedures,\" Qi Quan only needed to draw the talismans and use the soul-searching technique to trigger the puppet talismans. Ling Sheng, however, had to expend immense spiritual power and mental energy to complete each procedure.","The former showed no signs of fatigue, while the latter looked somewhat pale.","\"Let's go out for a meal.\"","Qi Quan collected the last soul into the peachwood plaque and led Ling Sheng out of the room.","Su Steward and Xue Hong were both waiting for them.","For ghost servants, eating was optional. Without Qi Quan and Ling Sheng present, the two ghosts found little pleasure in dining alone.","\"Master, the kitchen has prepared the ingredients. I'll start cooking now, it'll be quick,\" Su Steward said gently.","Qi Quan nodded.","Xue Hong brewed a pot of tea and brought it over.","The tea leaves had been purified of impurities by Ling Sheng. After just one cup, fatigue vanished, and their bodies felt replenished with spiritual power.","Ling Sheng drank two cups, and some color returned to his cheeks.","Before long, Su Steward served the food. The two humans and two ghosts gathered around the dining table.","Xue Hong raised her teacup and said, \"Here's to celebrating our Ling Sheng securing an iron rice bowl.\"","\"That's right,\" Su Steward smiled, also raising her cup. \"From now on, Ling Sheng has a career too. Work hard.\"","A hint of joy appeared in Ling Sheng's eyes. He imitated their gesture, raising his teacup, and turned to look at Qi Quan.","Qi Quan chuckled and joined their toast.","[Wah... I want to celebrate together too!] The system cried with envy.","Qi Quan smiled: [Come on, cheers.]","System: !","Wow, the big shot is so gentle! So touching!","After the meal, the two humans and two ghosts went to the living room.","Qi Quan released Qin Ruo, the Long-bearded Master, the Eyebrowless Master, and the Short, Stout Master.","The four ghosts, now aware their puppet talismans had been removed, felt both excited and apprehensive.","They understood perfectly well why Qi Quan had removed the talismans.","Once she extracted their information, would she then scatter their souls to the wind?","Each ghost had their own calculations.","Qi Quan said calmly, \"I presume you've heard of the soul-searching technique.\"","The four ghosts: \"...\"","\"Provide valuable information, and it will be considered a significant merit.\"","Qin Ruo asked, her voice trembling, \"Senior, if we perform a meritorious deed, what will happen?\"","Qi Quan: \"Naturally, you'll be spared the agony of soul-searching.\"","The four ghosts: \"...\"","So we still end up with our souls scattered?","Of course, no one wanted to undergo soul-searching. Though they hadn't experienced it, the feeling of having one's spiritual platform forcibly excavated must be excruciating.","Qin Ruo was the \"senior member\" within the peachwood plaque and understood Qi Quan's temperament best. She didn't dare cause any trouble, merely wailing pitifully:","\"Senior, I'm only level four, just a peripheral member of the organization, not part of the core. I really don't know much. However, I once heard Ding Ji mention something.\"","\"Speak.\"","\"He taught me the Peach Blossom Seal. He knew quite a few forbidden arts, but he used to be a Buddhist cultivator. Where could he have learned them? He told me he once encountered a ghost who begged for mercy and offered him a book on forbidden arts in exchange.\"","Xue Hong asked curiously, \"So did he let that ghost go?\"","Qin Ruo shook her head. \"No.\"","\"Why would a ghost have a forbidden arts book?\" Su Steward was somewhat puzzled. \"Ding Ji's cultivation level wasn't high back then. A ghost capable of hiding such a book should have already attained a physical form. How could it have been defeated?\"","\"I don't know the specifics,\" Qin Ruo shook her head, then looked at Qi Quan expectantly. \"Senior, does this count as a clue?\"","Qi Quan: \"What happened afterwards?\"","\"What afterwards?\"","\"He was boasting to you about his encounter. Surely he wouldn't stop at just that? He must have told you how he joined the evil cultivator organization?\"","Qin Ruo thought carefully, organizing her words: \"He seemed to say... after getting the forbidden arts book, he was skeptical at first but tried practicing it anyway. He found he could actually steal others' luck for himself, boosting his own level. So he kept using forbidden arts to harm people. How he joined the organization... I'm not too sure.\"","Qi Quan didn't question her further and turned her gaze to the Long-bearded Master.","\"Next.\"","The Long-bearded Master shuddered, trembling as he said, \"Senior, I'm only level three! I was only in charge of the low-end ghost marriage business chain. I truly don't know anything else!\"","\"How did you join the evil cultivator organization?\"","The Long-bearded Master looked ready to cry: \"I don't know either! I was just greedy for money. Someone approached me, asked me to run this business, I agreed, and then somehow I got implanted with a puppet talisman. Occasionally, I'd receive orders from superiors that I had to carry out.\"","\"What kind of orders?\"","\"I had more contact with the impoverished lower classes. Sometimes my superiors would tell me to find a few unpopular children, or children whose families wanted to sell them, around three years old was best. They also had me search for children with exceptional luck or outstanding innate talent.\"","[So the ones arranging ghost marriages and the ones making the Bloodburst Pills are definitely the same group!] The system exclaimed indignantly.","Qi Quan asked calmly, \"Exceptional luck? Outstanding talent? To cultivate loyal enforcers?\"","\"I really don't know about that either! I'm just a bottom-rung member of the organization. I simply don't know much,\" the Long-bearded Master said helplessly.","Qi Quan temporarily let him off and turned to the remaining two.","\"You are both level-seven Masters. Presumably, you know more than these two. Who wants to go first?\"","The two exchanged a glance, neither knowing how to begin.","To think that a seventh-level Master would end up in such a state.","\"It seems you'd like to experience a Soul-Searching Technique.\" Qi Quan's tone was even as spiritual power swirled and overflowed from her palm, poised to form a seal.","\"We'll talk!\" they said in unison.","Xue Hong found it rather amusing.","Qi Quan first questioned the Eyebrow-less Master: \"Aside from Longlin City and Longtang City, where else are there production bases?\"","\"I truly don't know. Each region has its assigned Masters, and information isn't shared between us to maintain secrecy.\"","Qi Quan turned to the Short and Stocky Master: \"You answer.\"","\"I, I...\" The Short and Stocky Master stammered for a moment before gritting his teeth and saying, \"I don't know if there are other bases, but I once overheard by accident that the Master refining those pills is surnamed Shi, and he should be within the Hengfeng Sect.\"","[Just as I expected!] The system snorted. [I always thought that Sect Leader Yu was no good!]","Qi Quan's expression remained unchanged. \"Who crafted the Puppet Talismans?\"","\"We don't know that.\"","The Eyebrow-less Master suddenly raised his hand. \"I just thought of something! There is indeed a mysterious Talisman Master in the organization, but he never appears in person. The talismans are always delivered by others. I heard the person receiving them call him 'Master Yan'.\"","[Yan Fengqing! It must be him!]","Unlike the system, Qi Quan wouldn't jump to conclusions. She hadn't forgotten to record the video during the interrogation. She could just send it to Li Guoyan and let the Investigation Department handle the follow-up.","She continued asking, \"Is there anything else?\"","The souls racked their brains. A few more sentences could buy them a little more time in this world!","The Short and Stocky Master had a flash of inspiration. \"I know another piece of information! Recently, they seem to be developing a new type of pill related to healing meridian damage, but it hasn't been successful yet. I heard they've even captured quite a few Masters with damaged meridians for experiments...\"","\"Ah, right! I heard about that too!\" The Eyebrow-less Master hurriedly chimed in.","Qi Quan: \"...\"","[Utterly depraved! Their crimes are too numerous to record! Just destroy them all!] The system was so angry it nearly ascended to heaven on the spot.","Xue Hong couldn't help but ask, \"In your organization, besides the Bloodburst Pills and the spirit-replenishing pills, what other specific pills are there? What are the ingredients? Do you understand the principles?\"","The souls: \"...\"","Xue Hong smiled slightly. \"Sorry, my major is biochemistry. I'm quite interested in this.\"","The Short and Stocky Master said, \"The spirit-replenishing pills are the lowest grade, usually only given to peripheral members.\"","Peripheral member Qin Ruo: \"...\"","\"Bloodburst Pills are generally for higher-level enforcers, to make them more valuable. There's also a pill called the Enlightenment Pill, which can help cultivators increase their cultivation speed. This type of pill is basically available to all cultivators within the organization, though, of course, it's rarely given to peripheral members.\"","Peripheral member Qin Ruo suffered another critical hit.","She genuinely regretted it now.","Why had she been so foolish as to become a Cultivator of Unorthodox Ways? Hiding, living day to day, without even basic benefits or security... She must have had water in her brain to join this lousy organization.","Qi Quan remained silent.","The four souls trembled with fear.","After a long while, she asked again, \"Are you sure you have nothing else to disclose?\"","\"Um,\" the Eyebrow-less Master raised his hand cautiously, \"Senior, perhaps you could continue asking specific questions? We really don't know what you want to know.\"","Qi Quan then asked bluntly, \"There's a network expert in the organization.\"","\"Ah, that's what you asked me about last time!\" Qin Ruo suddenly said. \"That public account that provided me with information.\"","Qi Quan nodded and looked at the other three souls.","The three souls looked at each other.","The Long-bearded Master, being the lowest in rank, shook his head and sighed. \"I truly haven't heard of it.\"","\"I haven't heard of it either,\" replied the Short and Stocky Master.","The Eyebrow-less Master thought for a moment and said, \"I haven't heard anything, but I've speculated. Once, I was on a mission, a rather covert one. The message came, and shortly after, it was deleted, all traces wiped clean as if it never existed.\"","\"Maybe you could ask the one inside? He's cowardly, but he's quite the gossip. He might know something.\" The Short and Stocky Master was determined to delay his dissipation for as long as possible.","He was referring to the Tall and Burly Master still inside the peachwood plaque.","The Tall and Burly Master was the second to undergo the \"surgery.\" The information Qi Quan had extracted from him wasn't particularly special.","But since the Short and Stocky Master suggested it, she released the Tall and Burly Master.","Upon seeing her, the Tall and Burly Master knelt on the ground again.","The other four souls: \"...\"","Qi Quan paid no mind and got straight to the point. \"Have you heard of a network expert?\"","The Tall and Burly Master was taken aback. He glanced timidly at Qi Quan and mumbled an affirmative.","The Short and Stocky Master and the Eyebrow-less Master exchanged a look. He actually knew!","It seems gossip can sometimes extend one's life cycle.","Qi Quan: \"Tell me.\"","\"I don't know the specifics,\" the Tall and Burly Master said slowly. \"I only know others call him 'Ghost.' He's the master of the network. A lot of the organization's information comes from him. I've never seen him.\"","\"Is he human or a ghost?\"","Tall and Burly Master: \"He's said to be a seventh-level Master.\"","Another seventh-level.","Seventh-level Masters in this Cultivators of Unorthodox Ways organization seemed as common as cabbages.","No wonder the orthodox sects suffered heavy losses when they suppressed the Cultivators of Unorthodox Ways back in the day.","\"Tell me all the gossip you know.\"","The Tall and Burly Master racked his brains and rambled on about a lot of trivial gossip concerning others in the organization. It wasn't until he mentioned the words \"His Excellency\" that everyone perked up.","[That's so cringey!] The system complained.","His Excellency? Why not just ascend to heaven already?","Qi Quan: \"Who is 'His Excellency'?\"","\"I don't know either. Someone of our level would never get to see him. I just heard someone mention in passing that he's a master of formations.\"","A master of formations...","Qi Quan thought of the ninth-level formations in Longlin City and Longtang City.","Perhaps this \"His Excellency\" was the leader of this organization, a Master possibly at the Human Sovereign realm.","\"Who gets to see him?\"","\"Maybe eighth-level Masters, or ninth-level ones?\" the Tall and Burly Master guessed.","The system was puzzled: [If \"His Excellency\" is the organization's leader, why haven't they heard of him? They only pick up bits and pieces through gossip.]","Qi Quan asked, \"Who implanted the Puppet Talismans in you?\"","\"Don't know,\" the Tall and Burly Master answered. \"When we joined the organization, our cultivation was relatively low. We were just taken into a dark room and lost consciousness. When we woke up, the puppet mark was already in our minds.\"","\"Who usually issues your missions?\" Qi Quan asked slowly. \"Who gave the order for the ambush at the abandoned base in Longhu City that day?\"","Tall and Burly Master: \"Mobile messages. Mobile phones were already widespread when I joined. Missions were received via phone. I never saw the person issuing the commands. As for those who joined earlier than me, I'm not sure.\"","\"What about you?\" Qi Quan turned to the others.","They all concurred.","The widespread use of mobile phones hasn't been that long. When they first joined, their cultivation was low. To become seventh-level Masters in such a short time—equivalent to a sect leader or family head in the orthodox world—their advancement speed was undeniably fast.","Qi Quan: \"Have you all taken Enlightenment Pills?\"","Except for Qin Ruo and the Long-bearded Master, the other three nodded.","Qin Ruo was struck by another blow.","All these years, what had she been doing?","\"We're finished talking.\"","Qi Quan looked at them with an indifferent expression, a cluster of spiritual energy gathering at her fingertips.","\"Senior, spare us! Have mercy!\" The tall, burly Master prostrated himself on the ground, begging loudly. \"I... I know a lot more gossip, let me think harder! I'll think again!\"","\"Me too, me too, I'll try to remember more!\"","Among the few, only Qin Ruo showed neither sorrow nor joy.","With her aged and haggard face, she stared blankly at Qi Quan.","Qi Quan shot out two streams of spiritual energy.","In an instant, the souls of Qin Ruo and the Long-bearded Master were utterly annihilated.","The remaining three souls trembled in fear.","Qi Quan gathered spiritual energy once more.","\"Don't kill me! Don't kill me!\" the tall, burly Master pleaded tearfully, when suddenly an idea struck him. \"I remembered something else! I did!\"","Qi Quan did not withdraw her spiritual energy, watching him expressionlessly.","\"I heard, I just heard, that 'Ghost' is a teenager, he, he, he...\"","Spiritual energy struck the brow of the Eyebrowless Master, and his soul instantly dissipated.","The short, plump Master was already shaking like a sieve.","They had killed so many people with such nonchalance, yet when facing their own demise, they couldn't remain calm and composed at all.","\"I thought of another one! Another one!\" the tall, burly Master babbled incoherently. \"I once took on a mission. My cultivation was low back then, so I was only assigned to trick a Master into walking into a trap. That Master, he... he was very young, quite handsome too, seemed to be a talisman master, he, he...\"","He began racking his brains again.","Xue Hong said gloomily, \"You're not just making up a story, are you?\"","\"I'm not!\"","The tall, burly Master abruptly looked up at her, intending to refute her doubt, but he paused as his peripheral glance swept past Ling Sheng, and his memory suddenly became clear.","Looking at Ling Sheng's profile, he blurted out, \"That person looked a lot like him!\"","Qi Quan: ?","System: [Huh? Looks like him? Doesn't Ling Sheng look like his mother?]","Ling Sheng turned his face to look at the tall, burly Master.","\"No, now it seems a bit different,\" the tall, burly Master clutched his head. \"But just a moment ago, he really resembled that person.\"","\"What was that person's name?\" Qi Quan asked.","Tall, burly Master: \"I only exchanged a few words with him. He said his surname was Xie, didn't say anything else.\"","\"Did he fall into the trap?\"","\"No,\" the tall, burly Master fell into recollection. \"He was quite alert, didn't enter the trap, and seemed to have found some clues. Later, I received orders to leave. I just heard the organization sent elites to surround and kill him. He probably died.\"","Qi Quan: \"Where?\"","\"In Longhu City.\"","\"Specific location.\"","The tall, burly Master reported the location. It wasn't the abandoned mountain village, and it wasn't particularly close to it either.","Qi Quan remembered Fu Jiuchong saying that Ling Sheng's father went to Longhu City on a business trip the day before Fu Jiuge went on her mission, and then all contact was lost.","Could this person be Ling Sheng's father?","She didn't speak, directly killing the short, plump Master.","The tall, burly Master cried, \"Let me think more, please let me think!\"","Qi Quan obliged him, throwing him back into the peachwood tablet.","[Big shot, you're not killing him?]","Qi Quan: [He does have significant digging potential. Sending him to the interrogation room might squeeze out many unexpected surprises.]","[That's true.]","This guy's \"gossip\" was like water in a sponge—squeeze it, and there's always more.","The interrogation ended.","Qi Quan sent the video to Li Guoyan.","Not long after, Li Guoyan called.","\"Master, Fu Jiuge's husband's surname was Xie, Xie Lanzhou. He was twenty-six when it happened, the most talented talisman master in the occult world at the time.\"","Qi Quan: \"Understood.\"","\"The department previously learned that Yan Mao had mediocre aptitude and his cultivation was always low, but it improved by leaps and bounds in the past two years, which is quite unusual. After seeing the 'Enlightenment Pill' mentioned in the video, I've already had someone take blood samples for testing.\"","\"Good.\"","Li Guoyan suddenly chuckled, \"Master, I've been waiting for Physician Qi's message.\"","Qi Quan: ...","She had previously promised Li Guoyan to have Ling Sheng communicate with him about employment matters, but she had been too busy and forgot.","She said, \"Several surgeries were performed, which delayed things. My apologies.\"","\"It's fine.\" Li Guoyan suddenly thought of something. \"Oh, right. Xie Lanzhou's death is likely related to Yan Fengqing.\"","\"Mhm.\"","\"As for the first inspector who received treatment, after repeated questioning, we've confirmed he has no issues, but we cannot guarantee that the people he came into contact with are problem-free.\"","\"Who did he come into contact with?\"","\"He is an inspector at the Longtan City Masters Association. Based on the dissipation time of ghostly aura after contact with ghosts, we reviewed his itinerary from the previous two days.\"","Li Guoyan's voice was low. \"He followed a simple routine: association during the day, residence at night. Apart from the Masters and other inspectors at the association, he didn't have close contact with anyone else.\"","\"An eighth-level great ghost is adept at hiding its traces,\" Qi Quan reminded.","Li Guoyan: \"That is indeed a possibility. However, after analysis, we believe one person is somewhat suspicious.\"","\"Who?\"","\"Chu Changyi. You've met him.\"","Qi Quan was a bit puzzled. Who was that?","[Big shot, it's that Master who fled at the critical moment when we went to Yaoshan in Longtan City to capture the ghost!] the system reminded.","Qi Quan still couldn't remember.","Never mind, not important.","\"What's suspicious about him?\"","Li Guoyan said, \"The inspector had uncovered a lead related to Chu Changyi. He had the most contact with Chu Changyi during those two days.\"","\"Mhm.\"","\"But news from Longtan City says Chu Changyi has shown no obvious unusual activity recently.\"","Qi Quan: \"Understood.\"","It felt like a layer of fog obscured the view. Different clues were intricate and complex. To sort them out, they needed to find an anchor point.","Ghost marriages stealing people's vitality and fortune; bloody pills boosting the organization's combat power; Ding Ji accidentally obtaining forbidden technique books; the ninth-level formations in Longlin City and Longtang City; the Ghost dominating the network.","The above were clearly all related to the leader of the evil cultivator organization.","Then there was the out-of-place Siren group.","What was the purpose of the Siren group? To lure others to suicide for amusement?","The Siren group also had a network expert. After assessment by the technical department, their methods were identical to the Ghost's.","Was this Siren group related to the evil cultivator organization or not?","Did the Ghost serve only one person?","A muffled thunderclap suddenly sounded from the horizon.","A flash of insight struck Qi Quan, and the corners of her lips lifted slightly.","The occult world itself had three major sects and three great families, and below them countless large and small forces. No one decreed that there could only be one evil cultivator organization.","She looked out the window at the night sky. Dark clouds surged from the horizon, obscuring the bright moonlight.","Rain was coming.","After ending the call, Qi Quan instructed Ling Sheng to communicate with Li Guoyan via message, while she returned to her room to cultivate.","At midnight, Longjiang City welcomed the first heavy rain since autumn began, which didn't cease until the next morning.","Rainwater slanted down, falling into the fishpond under the courtyard's skylight, creating a continuous pitter-patter.","The fish in the pond, lacking oxygen, surfaced one after another.","The sky was gloomy and overcast, an endless curtain of rain enveloping the entire city.","Qi Quan leaned against the small sofa by the window, listening to the rain outside, closing her eyes to recall all the occult texts she had read.","The palace of memory opened to her, and she slowly searched for the answers hidden deep within.","The characteristic of the Siren group is that all men and women \"seduced\" by the group members share the same action: they voluntarily use the abandonment of their lives to prove their love.","The key point is voluntary.","Voluntary also means sacrifice.","Before committing suicide, everyone thinks: I will sacrifice my life to prove this great love.","What is being proven is not important; what is important is the sacrifice of life.","What is the sacrifice of life for?","She flipped through a book in her memory.","Found it.","[\"I am willing to give up my life for you, prostrate at your feet, and be your most loyal servant.\"]","Taken from—","\"Sacrificial Rite: The Birth of the Ghost King\"","When more and more devout \"believers\" voluntarily sacrifice their lives and willingly become obedient servants, it provides increasingly powerful strength to the ghost hidden behind.","Qi Quan closed the memory.","One wants to become a human immortal, the other wants to become a ghost king, both using sinister methods. The former is crude and violent, while the latter is more hidden and insidious.","Ling Sheng approached with a teacup and handed it to her.","Qi Quan took it and asked, \"Did you speak with Director Li last night?\"","The young man nodded, squatting down beside her legs on the carpet, resting his head against her knee.","\"You agreed?\"","He nodded again.","\"When?\"","Ling Sheng took out his phone and showed her the message log.","Qi Quan looked down.","In ten days, all the injured personnel will be transferred to the Longjiang City Investigation Department, to be received and treated by Ling Sheng.","Suddenly, the phone on the low table rang.","Ling Sheng reached out his arm and fetched it for her. The caller ID showed Meng Yunzheng.","Qi Quan answered the call.","\"Master, something has happened in Longtan City!\" Meng Yunzheng's voice sounded slightly anxious.","The system suddenly announced: [\"Light is in My Heart\" just donated a thousand \"Deep Waters\".]","Qi Quan: ?","Isn't that Zheng Guangming? Why donate so much all of a sudden? Could the matter in Longtan City be related to him?","She said, \"Go on.\"","\"The Longtan City Investigation Department sent word that several investigators from their department took on a task to trace missing children and are now all out of contact! The Investigation Department cannot detect their location, suspecting they are being shielded by talismans or formations.\"","Now not only are the children missing, but the investigators have also disappeared. The investigators at the Longtan City Investigation Department are relatively low-level, and further delay could be very dangerous.","Qi Quan pondered.","Yesterday, they just rescued a supervisor from Longtan City who was tainted with ghost energy, and today investigators are missing.","But she truly hadn't sensed any malice from an eighth-level great ghost.","Could there be another reason?","\"Master,\" Meng Yunzheng said worriedly, \"The Investigation Department's instruments haven't detected anything, meaning the troublemakers must be very high-level. The Longtan City Investigation Department is asking us for aid. What do you think?\"","Qi Quan looked at the pouring rain outside the window, thought of the pure and righteous ghost energy from the eighth-level great ghost, and immediately decided to make a trip.","\"Alright, I'll go to Longtan City now.\"","Meng Yunzheng was overjoyed: \"Then I'll trouble you, Master! I'll arrange for someone to pick you up right away!\"","The call ended. As soon as Qi Quan put the phone down, another call came in.","It was Zheng Guangming.","\"Master, it's me, Zheng Guangming!\" He gasped for breath, speaking urgently, \"I'm truly at my wit's end. Can I beg you for one thing?\"","Qi Quan: \"The missing children case?\"","Zheng Guangming was stunned, exclaiming in shock, \"Master, you're too incredible!\"","Recommend Jiang Yuequ's novel \"The Supporting Female Lead Explodes in Popularity on the Mother-in-Law and Daughter-in-Law Variety Show\"","Jiang Lan transmigrated into the male lead's gold-digging first love. According to the original plot, she just needed to meet the male lead's mother once to walk away with twenty million.","Sitting in the restaurant, Jiang Lan said, \"Give me twenty million, and I'll leave your son.\"","The male lead's mother said, \"I'll give you two 'ten millions': ten million to be happy, ten million to be joyful.\"","Jiang Lan: \"...\"","Through a twist of fate, Jiang Lan and the male lead's mother, Yu Wanqiu, joined the variety show \"Here Comes the Mother-in-Law.\" Everyone thought the Cinderella and the wealthy mother-in-law would be at odds, but instead they surpassed the popular drama's lead couple to become the internet's hottest CP.","In the sweet and doting group, mothers-in-law routinely take their daughters-in-law shopping. Yu Wanqiu and Jiang Lan attended a fashion show, with a top-tier young heartthrob on the left and a handsome middle-aged uncle on the right.","In the wealthy family group, daughters-in-law nervously cooked a table of good food to please their mothers-in-law. Jiang Lan dragged Yu Wanqiu to have fried chicken and beer at food stalls, barbecue, hot pot, and skewers.","When the variety show ended, Yu Wanqiu hooked her arm around Jiang Lan's shoulders, \"Whether you break up or not doesn't matter. Breaking up shouldn't affect our relationship. Breaking up might even be better; I'll introduce you to even more handsome and richer guys.\"","Lu Yicheng: ???","Mini Theater:","When asked about mother-in-law and daughter-in-law relationships, Yu Wanqiu's initial answers were very standard: mothers-in-law and daughters-in-law shouldn't live together, meet a few times a year is enough, don't interfere in the young couple's affairs, have as many children as they want, matching social status is also important. If it doesn't work out, they can break up or divorce.","After the variety show ended, Yu Wanqiu's answers were very self-contradictory: It's best to live in upstairs-downstairs apartments with Jiang Lan, do yoga together morning and night. As for children, it's better not to have them too early; it can easily affect her relationship with Jiang Lan. If they divorce, she supports it too—she knows many young heartthrobs. If Jiang Lan prefers the uncle type, that's also fine."]},{"number":62,"title":"Chapter 62","paragraphs":["Shen Hui and Tang Mian arrived quickly.","Qi Quan got into the car with Ling Sheng. In case anyone got injured, having Ling Sheng along would ensure timely treatment.","The rain was pouring down, and the car moved slowly.","Fortunately, halfway through the journey, the rain began to ease up. By the time they were nearing Longtan City, it had stopped completely.","The sky cleared, and beneath the gray-blue expanse of the heavens, the faint colors of a rainbow became visible.","Shen Hui asked, \"Senior, should we go to the hotel to rest first, or head straight to the Investigation Department?\"","\"To the Investigation Department.\"","\"Understood.\"","The car exited the highway and headed directly for the Longtan City Investigation Department.","Longtan City's economy wasn't as developed as Longjiang's, so the Investigation Department's office was located in a more remote area, and the building was smaller.","The person in charge here was surnamed Fan.","Director Fan was a woman around thirty years old, with delicate and graceful features, who spoke and acted with crisp efficiency.","She personally came forward to greet them. Though inwardly anxious about the missing child and investigators, her expression remained composed.","\"Senior Qi Quan, your presence is most welcome. Given the urgency of the situation, I'll skip the formalities. Please, come in.\"","Qi Quan and the other three followed her into the Investigation Department.","Inside, the department appeared busy but not chaotic. Everyone was diligently handling their tasks. Upon seeing Qi Quan, they struggled to contain their excitement and reverence but didn't neglect their work—a testament to Director Fan's management skills.","The group entered a conference room.","Director Fan personally poured tea for the four of them, sat down, and said, \"Senior, shall we get straight to the point?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Yesterday, the police received a report of a missing child. Through surveillance footage, they found no trace of the child at the disappearance site. However, the case was indeed suspicious, so the police transferred it to the Investigation Department. The Investigation Department discovered traces suggesting the work of a Taoist master and dispatched three investigators to track them down. But they lost contact not long after. The department tried various methods but couldn't locate any trace of them.\"","Qi Quan asked, \"Do you have a photo of the child?\"","\"Yes.\" Director Fan pulled a photo from the case file.","It was a child of about three years old.","Qi Quan channeled her spiritual power into her eyes.","Piercing through layers of obscurity, she \"saw\" an illusion array and also caught sight of a ghostly figure.","The ghostly figure suddenly turned its head, as if locking eyes with Qi Quan across the distance.","Qi Quan withdrew her \"gaze,\" returned the photo, and said, \"The ghost is at Yao Mountain.\"","[Yao Mountain again? Why do ghosts appear there so often?] The system exclaimed in surprise.","Qi Quan: [Yao Mountain is remote and rarely visited by people, with dense forests and heavy Yin energy. The environment also provides benefits for ghosts.]","[Alright then. Shall we go now?]","Director Fan asked simultaneously, \"Shall we set off for Yao Mountain now?\"","Qi Quan stood up. \"Yes.\"","Shen Hui was driving again. Director Fan, along with several investigators, followed in another car.","The Investigation Department was neither too close nor too far from Yao Mountain, about a half-hour drive.","Half an hour later, the cars arrived at the foothills of Yao Mountain, only to find others already there.","The system remembered and cried out in surprise: [It's Fang Ye!]","Fang Ye was standing not far away with several Taoist masters from the Taoist Association. Hearing the cars, they all turned around.","Seeing it was the Investigation Department, the other masters wore expressions of arrogance.","Fang Ye, however, smiled and waved in greeting.","The system wondered: [Why doesn't he apply to join the Investigation Department?]","Qi Quan ignored it and stepped out of the car.","Fang Ye, who was in the middle of greeting them, froze instantly.","\"Se-Se-Senior Qi Quan!\" He broke into a run, rushing over excitedly. Not daring to get too close, he exclaimed with delight, \"Senior Qi Quan, you actually came! Do you remember who I am?\"","Qi Quan nodded.","Fang Ye immediately grinned like a fool.","\"Master Fang, what are you all doing here?\" Director Fan inquired.","Within the Taoist Association, Fang Ye had always been friendly towards the Supervisory Group, so the people at the Investigation Department were somewhat familiar with him.","\"Looking for someone. Someone from the Association is missing.\"","\"Missing? Who?\"","Fang Ye didn't hide it. \"It's Senior Chu Changyi. We tried contacting him before but couldn't get through. The Association detected anomalies here, so they sent us to investigate.\"","He glanced carefully at Qi Quan and asked, \"Why are Senior Qi and Director Fan here?\"","\"There have been some special circumstances,\" Director Fan replied vaguely.","Fang Ye said happily, \"Then we can work together!\"","\"Work together how?\" Someone stepped forward and said, \"Master Fang, don't forget, you're from the Taoist Association. Being close with the Supervisory Group before was one thing, but with—\"","Just then, Qi Quan turned slightly, and he caught a full view of her face. He abruptly stopped.","His face immediately flushed bright red.","For Taoist masters who hadn't attended the Guiyuan Sect's \"Martial Arts Tournament,\" the photos circulated from the event were extremely precious materials.","Among them, photos of Qi Quan were the most prized.","Countless people revered Qi Quan as their idol in the mystical arts world.","This person was no different.","He had once imagined how he would make a good impression on his idol if he ever met Senior Qi Quan. However, reality was far more unforgiving than dreams. This sudden opportunity had been ruined by his own careless words.","At this moment, he wished he could turn back time and strangle his earlier self for speaking recklessly.","He didn't actually dislike the Supervisory Group or the Investigation Department. It was just that within the Association, everyone stuck together. If he didn't follow suit, he'd be ostracized.","But now, he truly regretted it!","He didn't even dare to look at Qi Quan, let alone utter a word.","The system tutted: [So boastful a moment ago, and now he's scared stiff.]","Qi Quan completely ignored him and said to Director Fan, \"Let's enter the mountain.\"","\"Alright.\"","The Investigation Department team followed behind Qi Quan. Fang Ye also shamelessly stuck close behind.","The first time is unfamiliar, the second time is familiar.","Seeing this, the remaining members of the Taoist Association exchanged glances and followed at a not-too-distant pace.","They had only traced Chu Changyi's disappearance to this area, but after being here for a while, they couldn't find a way in. Now that a top-tier expert was leading the way, naturally, they had to latch onto this powerful ally.","As for face or pride? Please, that's the legendary idol and supreme expert! They might only get this one chance in their lifetime to see her. What use was pride?","It was daytime, so Yao Mountain wasn't as sinister.","But the deeper they went, the more the lower-level Taoist masters felt a chilling Yin energy, raising goosebumps.","\"What exactly is in this mountain? Why isn't the monitoring device reacting at all?\" the Taoist Association members whispered among themselves.","\"Whatever it is, we can't go wrong following the expert. Even if we encounter something, the expert will handle it.\"","\"Right.\" One of them agreed, then suddenly countered, \"Wait, that's not right. We don't even know what the experts are here to do. We're just here to find someone. Why are we following them?\"","Someone hesitated, \"Isn't Fang Ye following them too?\"","\"You know how well Fang Ye gets along with the official side.\"","\"Maybe... this is just the power of a top expert's charisma.\"","Upon seeing the great expert Qi Quan, they unconsciously followed in her footsteps, regardless of whether the person they were looking for had anything to do with her mission.","Securing the connection with this powerful figure came first!","The group: \"...\"","Well, they'd come this far. Could they just turn back now?","Fang Ye blended into the Investigation Department team and quietly asked one of the investigators, \"Who are the people around Senior Qi Quan?\"","The investigator replied, \"Probably comrades from the Longjiang City branch.\"","\"Oh, I see.\"","Last time there were two, this time there were three, and they were all different people.","It seems the competition for positions close to the big shot is fierce.","If he went to sign up at the Longjiang City Investigation Department, would he have a chance to work by the big shot's side?","Not far away, in the valley, the glow of an illusionary formation flickered faintly.","Inside the formation, a man with handsome, clear-cut features wore a grave expression, gazing in the direction from which Qi Quan and the others were approaching.","He performed a quick divination with his fingers, but it was as if a thin mist obscured his vision; he couldn't divine whether the newcomers' influence on this matter would be good or bad.","There were two reasons for being unable to divine.","Either the newcomer's level was higher than his, or the newcomer was connected to him.","The latter could basically be ruled out, leaving only the former.","Just moments ago, he had felt a pair of eyes watching him from behind. Could it have been this person?","Sunlight filtered through the gaps in the trees, scattering fragmented spots of light on the ground covered with dead branches.","Qi Quan suddenly stopped walking, her gaze fixed on the formation in the valley.","It was an illusionary formation, yet not a proper one. It was a formation composed of illusionary talismans.","Quite the talisman expert.","\"Senior Qi, is there a problem?\" Director Fan and the others, being of lower cultivation levels, couldn't see the formation set up with eighth-level talismans.","Qi Quan: \"Stay here for now.\"","She handed a protective formation talisman to Ling Sheng and said, \"Activate the protective formation.\"","Ling Sheng nodded, not particularly worried about Qi Quan's safety.","Because he sensed that the formation in the valley was about to collapse, and its level wasn't higher than Qi Quan's.","There was no danger.","Everyone stayed within the protective shield of the formation, watching Qi Quan's figure drift towards the valley.","Bathed in the dappled sunlight, her tall figure appeared mysterious and noble.","Fang Ye's eyes sparkled as he said, \"If only I could become the master's assistant.\"","As soon as the words left his mouth, he felt a chill run down his spine.","He turned his head to see three pairs of eyes staring deeply at him.","They belonged to the three \"assistants\" by Senior Qi's side.","He hurriedly added, \"I was just fantasizing, nothing more! You guys are the most suitable, really!\"","The three pairs of eyes simultaneously looked away.","The others: Pfft, hahahahaha.","Inside the valley, Qi Quan hovered in mid-air before the illusionary formation.","The formation gradually showed signs of insufficient spiritual energy and would soon collapse.","Qi Quan waited quietly, saying nothing.","The person inside the formation probably also knew the outcome and, not wasting any more time, suddenly appeared outside the formation shield. He was entirely wrapped in black ghostly energy, making his features indistinct.","He was an eighth-level green ghost.","But there was no aura of bloodshed on him; instead, he faintly glimmered with the golden light of virtue.","Another virtuous ghost.","Qi Quan was relatively gentle towards people and ghosts who bore virtue.","She spoke, \"The missing child and the investigators, are they inside the illusionary formation?\"","The great ghost paused, his voice clear and bright, \"You're not going to destroy me?\"","Qi Quan: \"Why would I destroy you?\"","She asked her system: [Do I look that bloodthirsty?]","System: [Not at all! The big shot is beautiful and kind-hearted. How could she be bloodthirsty? This great ghost has no discernment!]","The great ghost chuckled, \"You're a celestial master. Isn't it the natural order for celestial masters to capture ghosts? Why would there be a 'why'?\"","Qi Quan: \"I only capture evil ghosts.\"","\"A celestial master who only captures evil ghosts...\" The great ghost's smile widened. \"Right now, the people you're looking for are trapped by me. Doesn't that make me an evil ghost?\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She tossed out a peachwood tablet. \"Perhaps you could come inside and try.\"","The great ghost: \"...\"","He scrutinized Qi Quan carefully and asked curiously, \"I never saw you, senior, in the Mystic Realm when I was alive. May I ask your honorable surname?\"","Qi Quan: \"How many years have you been a ghost?\"","\"Twenty years.\"","\"Twenty years ago, I was only two years old.\"","Only two years old, so naturally, he wouldn't have seen her in the Mystic Realm.","\"...\"","The great ghost was so shocked his ghostly energy wavered, his voice full of astonishment: \"You're only twenty-two? But your cultivation level... How is that possible!\"","The system shared the pride: [Our big shot is simply the best!]","\"State your purpose,\" Qi Quan said, tired of continuing the small talk.","Recovering from his shock, the great ghost said, \"You might not believe it, but I was trying to save that child.\"","A ghost saving a child—sounded absurd.","Qi Quan showed no reaction.","The great ghost knew it was hard to believe, but it was the truth.","His voice grew low, \"I just didn't expect to encounter an expert like you.\"","He had done similar things before, always cautiously and never discovered. He never imagined he'd run into such a powerful celestial master this time.","And one only twenty-two years old!","Qi Quan looked at the fading illusionary formation and said, \"You were a celestial master in life? Skilled in the talisman path?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"These talismans, you drew them after becoming a ghost?\"","\"Yes.\"","The system was shocked: [Is this the legendary 'ghost-drawn talismans'?!]","Qi Quan: ...","\"The formation is about to disappear,\" the great ghost said solemnly. \"There's a man named Chu Changyi inside. I've been observing him for days; he's the one abducting the child. To stop him, I used illusionary talismans on him and lured him into the formation. As for the others, they chased after Chu Changyi and accidentally entered the formation.\"","Qi Quan asked, \"You're an eighth-level ghost. You have many ways to stop this, even notifying the authorities.\"","Why use such a roundabout method?","And what's the point of trapping Chu Changyi and the child?","\"The authorities? What authorities?\" The great ghost was puzzled. \"Do you mean the police?\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","Too lazy to explain, she took out her phone and texted Ling Sheng: [Everyone, come over.]","Seeing her silence, the great ghost also fell quiet.","A moment later, Ling Sheng brought everyone to stand behind Qi Quan.","He was under an illusion spell cast by Qi Quan, which concealed his appearance and special constitution. He now looked like an ordinary, clean-cut young man.","Yet, the great ghost's gaze was involuntarily drawn to him.","A strange sense of familiarity seemed to rise in his heart.","Qi Quan landed on the ground and said to Director Fan, \"You talk to him.\"","Director Fan pressed her lips together.","This was a high-level great ghost; she had never seen one before. But since Senior Qi asked her to talk, she had to steel herself and do it.","\"Hello, we are from the Longtan City Investigation Department. We are here to find the missing child and our team members. Whatever your request is, you can tell us.\"","The great ghost hesitated, \"Investigation Department... what is that?\"","Everyone: \"...\"","Even if you're a ghost, you have to keep up with the times!","Director Fan patiently explained, \"The National Special Cases Investigation Department. We specialize in handling paranormal cases.\"","\"What about the Celestial Master Association then?\" The great ghost was somewhat perplexed. \"...Isn't the Celestial Master Association still around?\"","Director Fan: \"We are the official organization. They are a civilian group.\"","The great ghost carefully examined the people before him, clearly seeing two distinct groups.","He said, \"I've been tracking child trafficking clues in remote mountain areas, following the traffickers to Longtan City. It's only been about a month or so. I remember about a month ago, there didn't seem to be an Investigation Department.\"","\"Thank you for your good deeds.\" Director Fan smiled. \"The Investigation Department was indeed established not long ago.\"","The great ghost looked at Qi Quan and asked, \"Is this senior also from the Investigation Department?\"","Director Fan's smile deepened. \"Yes, Senior is the Chief Consultant of the Investigation Department.\"","The great ghost then looked at Ling Sheng. \"And him?\"","\"He is the senior's assistant,\" Director Fan replied.","In front of outsiders, Ling Sheng was indeed Qi Quan's assistant.","Qi Quan, however, said, \"He is my family, and also the Chief Physician of the Investigation Department.\"","Hearing this, the powerful ghost felt inexplicably happy.","Working for the official authorities meant guaranteed benefits and treatment—a secure iron rice bowl.","Not bad at all.","He said to Director Fan, \"I followed the clues to Chu Changyi, tailed him for several days, and yesterday saw him secretly holding a child. I then lured him into an illusion array.\"","\"Thank you.\" Director Fan sensed his character from the ghost's tone, and her smile gained a touch more sincerity. \"However, your level should be higher than Chu Changyi's. Why use such a roundabout method?\"","The ghost replied, \"Using talisman arrays can conceal ghostly aura. If I used ghost techniques, I would be detected by the Heavenly Master Association. The talisman array drains a heavenly master's spiritual power. Once his power was exhausted, I could take the child from him without a fight and return the child home.\"","The system understood perfectly: [It's right to be cautious. Even Chu Changyi is involved in child trafficking now; the Heavenly Master Association is completely unreliable!]","\"Thank you very much. But regardless, citizens have an obligation to cooperate with investigations,\" Director Fan stated. \"Regarding this case, please come with us.\"","The ghost: \"...\"","Before he could agree, the array behind him suddenly lost its effect.","Chu Changyi appeared before the crowd, clothes disheveled and looking utterly wretched. The three investigators were less disheveled but wore expressions of slight tension.","At the edge of the array's cover lay a three-year-old child.","Everyone understood the effect of the illusion array—it conjures countless ghostly phantoms. Those trapped inside easily become deeply immersed, forced to fight the phantoms for their lives.","The current situation clearly showed that Chu Changyi, upon encountering the ghostly phantoms, had simply tossed the child aside without a second thought.","Apart from the three-year-old, both Chu Changyi and the three investigators wore dazed expressions.","One moment they were facing a horde of twisted ghosts, the next they saw a crowd of people staring at them, creating a rather embarrassing sense of disconnection.","So, had they just been fighting ghosts... for nothing?","Chu Changyi, feeling guilty inside, glanced at the people from the Heavenly Master Association, then at those from the Investigation Department, and had the audacity to say, \"You've finally arrived! I saw a heavenly master trafficker earlier, gave chase, but fell into their trap. Luckily, you're here!\"","\"The heavenly master trafficker you mentioned... is that me?\" The powerful ghost, his body shimmering with ghostly energy, drifted before Chu Changyi and asked softly.","Seeing the dense ghostly aura surrounding him, Chu Changyi's eyes widened in terror. \"You... you...\"","Director Fan had no time for his act. Special handcuffs were snapped on immediately. \"Come with us,\" she said coldly.","\"I haven't done anything wrong! I really was chasing a heavenly master! How was I to know a powerful ghost was here? You've got the wrong person!\"","The ghost suddenly added, \"I also used a recording talisman. It captured the whole process. Should I play it for you?\"","Chu Changyi: \"...\"","...","Everyone: Damn, Ghost Senior is awesome!","Chu Changyi fell completely silent. The others from the Heavenly Master Association wouldn't speak up under these circumstances either.","Caught red-handed—what was there to say?","What a disgrace to the Heavenly Master Association!","Director Fan looked at the ghost and asked, \"Have you made your decision?\"","Seeing the handcuffs, the ghost had no more doubts; the Investigation Department was indeed an official agency.","He replied, \"Alright.\"","But he still hadn't retracted his ghostly aura.","Director Fan said, \"This will draw attention.\"","Billowing with ghostly energy—wasn't he afraid the monitoring instruments would pick him up?","They couldn't use a concealment talisman either, or they wouldn't know if he was still there.","The ghost said apologetically, \"For certain reasons, I cannot reveal myself right now.\"","\"You'll have to reveal yourself at the Department anyway,\" Director Fan countered.","\"At the Department is fine, but not here now.\"","Director Fan: \"...\"","She couldn't help but look at Qi Quan.","Qi Quan casually cast an illusion spell. \"No one can recognize you now.\"","Sensing the profound spiritual power in the illusion, the ghost's estimation of Qi Quan's cultivation level rose another notch.","Truly, the new generation surpasses the old!","He retracted his ghostly aura, transforming into an ordinary-looking young man who wouldn't stand out in a crowd.","A Level Eight ghost's body can solidify, making it indistinguishable from a living person by appearance.","The group hadn't experienced traveling with a ghost of this level before and found it quite novel.","The ghost smiled at Qi Quan. \"Thank you, Senior.\"","Regardless of Qi Quan's age, those with higher cultivation are addressed as Senior.","Qi Quan turned and led the group out of Yao Mountain.","Ling Sheng stayed close by her side, with Shen Hui and Tang Mian following behind. Director Fan led the investigators, clearly separate from the few from the Heavenly Master Association.","\"Might I ask for your esteemed name, Senior?\" the ghost asked politely, walking beside Qi Quan.","\"Qi Quan.\"","The ghost then turned to Ling Sheng, his gaze unconsciously softening with a hint of fondness. \"And this young brother?\"","Ling Sheng didn't speak.","Shen Hui answered for him from the side, \"Ghost Senior, his name is Qi Lingsheng.\"","The ghost seemed to realize something and didn't press further.","The group returned to the Investigation Department.","Chu Changyi was taken to an interrogation room, while the ghost was escorted to an interview room.","Director Fan personally conducted the inquiry with her team.","Qi Quan and the other three observed.","\"May I have your name, please?\"","Once inside the Investigation Department, the ghost finally stopped hiding himself.","He looked at Qi Quan and said gently, \"Senior, could you please dispel the illusion for me?\"","Qi Quan waved her hand, and the illusion dissolved.","The man revealed a handsome, refined face with an elegant demeanor. He appeared to be in his twenties, with a faint smile in his eyes—a remarkably outstanding young man.","Shen Hui and Tang Mian both stared in surprise.","From their seated angle to the side, they had a clear view of the man's profile.","That profile...","They both instinctively glanced at Ling Sheng.","Qi Quan, already prepared, remained perfectly calm and said, \"You are Xie Lanzhou.\"","Although she had never seen a photo of Xie Lanzhou, she could tell from his appearance that he and Ling Sheng were definitely father and son.","Shen Hui and Tang Mian, with their lower cultivation levels, couldn't discern the features of higher-level heavenly masters, nor did they have the clearance to know Xie Lanzhou's identity. But just from the similarity in their profiles, they also harbored suspicions.","The man said in surprise, \"Senior actually knows me?\"","\"I've heard the name,\" Qi Quan said briefly, then turned to Director Fan. \"...Let's begin the questioning.\"","Director Fan nodded.","\"Mr. Xie, regarding the recording talismans you mentioned earlier, would you be willing to provide them to the Investigation Department as evidence?\"","\"Of course.\"","Xie Lanzhou smiled. Black ghostly energy gathered in his palm, materializing several recording talismans that landed on the table.","\"Besides these, I have others,\" he paused. \"However, Chu Changyi falls under the jurisdiction of Longtan City's Investigation Department. For the others... you might not have jurisdiction.\"","Director Fan: \"...\"","Had this Mr. Xie been undercover as a ghost?","She looked at Qi Quan.","Qi Quan said, \"If you're willing, I can take you to Longjing City.\"","\"Longjing City?\" The smile faded from Xie Lanzhou's face. \"That place is dense with sects and influential families. If I appear there in my ghost form, there's a high chance I'd be exterminated.\"","That was also why he had never returned to Longjing City.","His concealment talismans might evade the Heavenly Master Associations elsewhere, but they might not escape the notice of the powerful factions in Longjing City.","Moreover, over these twenty years, he had never sensed his wife's soul through the Dao Companion Bond, which made him increasingly reluctant to return to Longjing City.","Although the Dao Companion Bond had recently stirred, he was in the midst of tracking a lead on child trafficking and hadn't yet decided whether to return to Longjing to investigate.","When Qi Quan suggested taking him to Longjing, he hesitated.","\"You conceal your identity simply to avoid being recognized by the hidden cult of evil cultivators,\" Qi Quan said, looking at him. \"But after twenty years of investigation, you hold substantial evidence. This evidence can only serve its greatest purpose if handed over to the Investigation Headquarters.\"","Xie Lanzhou naturally understood this logic.","On the way back from Yaoshan, an enthusiastic Master Tian-shi named Fang had enthusiastically explained the formation and development of the Investigation Department to him.","He trusted the authorities and was willing to hand over the evidence.","Xie Lanzhou didn't ponder for long and nodded in agreement.","\"Senior Qi, should we activate these Shadow Retaining Talismans now?\" Director Fan asked.","Qi Quan gave a slight nod. \"Activate them.\"","The Shadow Retaining Talismans floated into the air, transforming into shimmering screens, each displaying Chu Changyi's figure.","He thought he was well-hidden, unaware that an eighth-level powerful ghost was silently recording all his actions.","Xie Lanzhou provided timely commentary: \"Based on the clues I uncovered, I deduced Longtan City was a operational base, so I came here and discovered Chu Changyi.\"","Chu Changyi received a message instructing him to prepare a three-year-old child with strong fortune and deliver the child to a designated \"drop-off\" location, where he would receive payment.","The Shadow Retaining Talisman fully recorded this message, but soon after, it vanished from his phone without a trace.","Chu Changyi, clearly accustomed to this, showed no surprise.","Following the message's instructions, after several days, he finally found a suitable child, abducted them, and used Tian-shi methods to evade pursuit.","Unexpectedly, he was lured into an illusion array by Xie Lanzhou.","After watching, Director Fan and the others felt deep respect for Xie Lanzhou.","This Mr. Xie was truly a model for the ghost realm!","The footage captured by Shadow Retaining Talismans cannot be forged. This evidence was sufficient to prove Chu Changyi's criminal acts. Further crimes would depend on the interrogation results.","Regardless, he could not escape legal punishment.","With the Longtan City mission concluded, Qi Quan did not plan to stay longer.","She looked at Xie Lanzhou. \"Mr. Xie, shall we make a trip to Longjing?\"","Xie Lanzhou nodded... and agreed.","As they left the Investigation Department, they saw Zheng Guangming standing at the entrance holding a large pile of items, accompanied by the child's family. Their faces were filled with gratitude and lingering fear.","\"Master, these are some local specialties from our Longtan City. They're not worth much, but please accept them,\" Zheng Guangming said sincerely, offering the gifts.","Shen Hui glanced at Qi Quan, and seeing her slight shake of the head, he declined with a smile. \"That's not necessary. The important thing is the child is safe. This is what our Investigation Department should do.\"","\"Please, take them!\" the family urged.","Shen Hui waved his hand. \"We have business travel ahead. Carrying so many things on the road isn't very convenient. Please take them back.\"","Zheng Guangming, understanding the nature of their work, didn't want to delay them further and retrieved the gifts.","After the car drove away, the child's parent said, \"Lao Zheng, we are truly grateful. I feel ashamed they didn't accept the gifts.\"","Zheng Guangming smiled slightly, took out his phone, opened the Scream APP, and said mysteriously, \"There are other ways.\"","The child's parent: ???","In the car, Qi Quan and Ling Sheng sat side by side in the back seat as usual.","After getting in, Xie Lanzhou automatically shrank in size and sat on the storage compartment between the driver and passenger seats.","\"Senior, are we heading straight to Longjing?\" Shen Hui asked.","Qi Quan: \"Yes.\"","What can be resolved today should not be postponed until tomorrow.","Shen Hui recalculated the route, following the navigation towards Longjing City.","Sitting on the storage compartment, Xie Lanzhou looked around and suddenly asked, \"Which sect or family does Senior Qi hail from?\"","Qi Quan answered gently, \"No sect, no family.\"","\"A rogue cultivator!\" Xie Lanzhou felt even more affinity. \"You are truly remarkable.\"","He was also a rogue cultivator. Though called a genius, he had only reached the sixth level by age twenty-six.","He then looked at Ling Sheng and asked, \"What about this young brother?\"","He wasn't truly prying into their privacy, just wanting to chat more.","The system shouted: 【What young brother! The seniority is wrong!】","Only then did Qi Quan remember that the illusion art on Ling Sheng's face hadn't been dispelled.","Fu Jiuge had recognized Ling Sheng as her child at first glance. Xie Lanzhou only felt a sense of familiarity, suggesting the bond from ten months of pregnancy created a stronger connection between child and mother.","Qi Quan waved her hand, dispelling the illusion art on Ling Sheng, while the concealment of his special physique remained.","The moment the illusion vanished, Xie Lanzhou was stunned.","His eyes widened, fixed intently on Ling Sheng, as if struck by lightning. His handsome face displayed only one word—","Shock!","After a long moment, he spoke haltingly, asking, \"W-who are your parents?\"","His voice was extremely soft, as if speaking louder might disturb something.","Qi Quan said, \"He has been locked in a mountain cave since birth.\"","Xie Lanzhou's face showed pain. \"How could that be? How could the Fu... family let him suffer such a fate?\"","He thought of something and asked urgently, \"Senior, have you heard of the Longjing Fu family?\"","Qi Quan told the truth: \"I was invited to attend the Fu family young lady's coming-of-age ceremony previously.\"","\"The Fu family young lady?\" Xie Lanzhou was puzzled.","Qi Quan: \"Fu Jiuchong's daughter.\"","Xie Lanzhou was stunned again.","Twenty years had passed; things and people had changed.","His expression sorrowful, he asked, \"Then did you see his sister?\"","Qi Quan nodded. \"I did.\"","\"How is she?\"","\"Lost in a state of mental impairment for twenty years,\" Qi Quan said. \"When you reach Longjing, everything will become clear.\"","Xie Lanzhou: \"Thank you.\"","He couldn't help but stare... at Ling Sheng again.","Locked in a cave since birth? Why?","What exactly happened after his death all those years ago?","Senior Qi used illusion art on Ling Sheng, likely to protect him.","Why conceal? Why protect?","Could it be that hidden enemies were also watching the Fu family?","Considering this, he instantly resolved to temporarily conceal Ling Sheng's relationship with the Fu family.","\"Senior, perhaps you should reapply the illusion art on Ling Sheng.\"","Qi Quan naturally did not refuse.","Just like Fu Jiuge, he made the same choice: even knowing Ling Sheng was their child, protecting him came first.","It wasn't that exposure meant they couldn't protect him, but avoiding exposure would reduce many unnecessary dangers.","They understood well the strength of the evil cultivator organization.","They were unwilling to take even the slightest risk.","Xie Lanzhou was very grateful that Ling Sheng had a powerful protector like Qi Quan.","They arrived at the Longjing Investigation Department late at night.","Li Guoyan, having received the message earlier, was waiting at the department.","The car stopped at the entrance.","Qi Quan said to Xie Lanzhou, \"To avoid external scrutiny, please bear with entering the peachwood talisman for now.\"","She tossed out a peachwood talisman, letting it hover before Xie Lanzhou.","Longjing City was crowded and full of prying eyes; even near the Investigation Department, many watchful gazes existed.","As a ghost, it was wiser for Xie Lanzhou to keep a low profile.","He decisively slipped into the peach wood tablet.","Qi Quan put away the tablet and led Ling Sheng and the other two into the Investigation Department. Without wasting words, they headed straight for the conference room.","\"Master, please have a seat.\" Li Guoyan personally poured tea for her. \"You came directly from Longtan City. Did you discover something major?\"","Only Qi Quan, Ling Sheng, and Li Guoyan were in the conference room.","Qi Quan cast an isolation array and released Xie Lanzhou.","The moment he appeared, Li Guoyan exclaimed, \"Master Xie!\"","He had seen photos of Xie Lanzhou before.","Xie Lanzhou smiled gently. \"Director Li, hello. I am Xie Lanzhou. I died twenty years ago.\"","Li Guoyan: \"...\"","Before he could ask, Xie Lanzhou pulled out a large stack of Shadow-Retaining Talismans and said, \"These are the pieces of evidence I have gathered over the past twenty years.\"","He was well aware that the members of the Heavenly Master Association were a mixed bag, with some even personally involved in criminal cases. He did not trust the Association.","Over the years, he had actually been quite lost, unsure of the purpose behind collecting all this.","Fortunately, he had finally waited for the dawn.","System: [Ling Sheng's dad is amazing!]","To remain so diligent in gathering evidence of the evil cultivators' crimes even after becoming a ghost.","Even the seasoned Li Guoyan was astonished by this move.","\"I have uncovered many criminal dens of the evil cultivator organization. Some are abandoned, some are newly established, and there are also complete industrial chains. If we act swiftly, we can take them all down in one fell swoop.\"","Li Guoyan's heart swelled with excitement. He laughed heartily, \"Thank you for your efforts, Master Xie! However, how have you managed to evade the evil cultivator organization all these years?\"","The organization had so many experts; it was impossible they couldn't sense an eighth-level ghost.","Xie Lanzhou said modestly, \"Just some petty tricks.\"","\"White ghosts below the third level generally cannot leave the place of their death. How did you break free?\"","What Li Guoyan really wanted to ask was how he had become an eighth-level great ghost, but being too direct would seem impolite. For a contributor like this, no amount of courtesy was too much.","Xie Lanzhou explained, \"Back then, I was close to uncovering the production base in Longhu City when I was suddenly ambushed. A second before my death, I used a high-level Illusion Talisman to make them believe my soul had already... scattered, that I wouldn't become a ghost.\"","\"Mr. Xie, you were very cautious,\" Li Guoyan praised sincerely.","Xie Lanzhou continued, \"While ambushing me, they kept forcing me to move away from the production base. So, after I died, my soul was far from the base, and no one discovered me. With the help of the Daoist Companion Bond, I wasn't forced into reincarnation and began cultivating ghost arts.\"","\"Ghost arts?\" Li Guoyan asked. \"You understand ghost arts?\"","\"I am a talisman master. To better control ghosts with talismans, one must have a deep understanding of ghosts. I once read about ghost arts in an ancient text. Ghosts can also cultivate using the spiritual energy of heaven and earth, as long as it can be converted into ghost power.\"","Li Guoyan said, \"Can ghost power also be used to draw talismans?\"","\"Yes.\"","Xie Lanzhou said sorrowfully, \"But after just a few days, my Daoist Companion Bond failed. I could no longer sense my wife's soul. I was frantic, yet I couldn't leave that place.\"","The taste of that powerless despair was still fresh in his memory.","The system sighed: [Ling Sheng's mother sealed her own spiritual awareness, so he couldn't sense her.]","\"I cultivated desperately, desperately, until I finally became a fourth-level red ghost, freeing myself from the control of the death place. I was about to go find my wife when I heard that not long before, a female heavenly master named Fu Jiuge had been ambushed and killed tragically.\"","Unable to sense his wife's soul and hearing this news, he thought his wife had truly died. His entire being was in a daze.","After the numbness, an intense desire for revenge arose within him.","He would make those evildoers pay the price they deserved!","Over twenty years, Xie Lanzhou collected much evidence of the evil cultivators' crimes and also schemed to rescue many kidnapped children. If deceased children turned into ghosts, he would even teach them some ghost arts.","He recounted the events of these years intermittently.","The system suddenly realized: [Ah! Can-Can probably learned from him! Great One, could you ask him for me? I'm so curious!]","Before Qi Quan could speak, Li Guoyan asked.","\"Do you know Fang Lan?\"","Xie Lanzhou paused, his eyes brightening slightly. \"I remember her. A very lovely little girl. You've met her too? How is she now?\"","\"She's living with her mother and younger brother now, very happily. But her time to leave the mortal world is approaching,\" Li Guoyan said.","Xie Lanzhou smiled genuinely. \"That's good.\"","\"You helped her. Her appearance also led the Investigation Department to the clues of the Bloody Pills,\" Li Guoyan said sincerely. \"Mr. Xie, thank you so much.\"","Xie Lanzhou shook his head with a smile. \"I am a heavenly master. Doing these things is my duty. However, I have a request.\"","\"Please, go ahead.\"","Xie Lanzhou's expression turned tender. \"May I... see my wife?\""]},{"number":63,"title":"Chapter 63","paragraphs":["The man's request was not excessive in the slightest.","Li Guoyan contacted Fu Jiuchong.","After being repelled by the ninth-level formation during his last trip to Longlin City, Fu Jiuchong was extremely unwilling to accept defeat. Upon returning home, he had thrown himself into relentless cultivation.","When he received Li Guoyan's call, his voice was calm, yet tinged with a suppressed intensity.","Li Guoyan said, \"Are you free for a video call, Mr. Fu?\"","\"A video call?\" Fu Jiuchong was puzzled. \"A video conference?\"","\"A private video call,\" Li Guoyan said with a laugh.","Fu Jiuchong: ?","He hung up the phone, went to his study, and turned on the screen projector.","Li Guoyan happened to send a video invitation at that moment.","He pressed accept.","The communication tools of the Investigation Department were monitored and protected by the technical division regardless of the destination, so there was no need to worry about the network expert from the Cultivator organization.","Fu Jiuchong looked at the screen, his voice low. \"What matter brings you to call me, Director Li?\"","\"Brother Fu, let me show you someone.\"","Li Guoyan shifted to the side, revealing a male spirit with handsome, refined features standing behind him.","\"Big brother, it's me,\" Xie Lanzhou said, his eyes slightly red.","Fu Jiuchong was stunned.","His mind went blank with shock. He stared dumbfounded at Xie Lanzhou, unable to speak for a long while.","\"Big brother?\"","Fu Jiuchong suddenly snapped back to reality. He abruptly stood up and quickly left the study.","Xie Lanzhou: ?","Was his big brother so unwilling to see him?","Li Guoyan said with a smile, \"He probably went to fetch your wife.\"","Xie Lanzhou understood. His solidified spirit form nearly wavered. His eyes reddened as he stared intently at the screen, his fists clenching involuntarily.","The wait was agonizing.","Though only five minutes had passed, it felt like an eternity, seemingly longer than the previous twenty years.","Finally, there was movement from the video—the sound of a door opening and closing.","Xie Lanzhou couldn't help but step forward, wanting to be closer to the screen.","A figure slowly appeared in the video.","A woman with striking features sat in a wheelchair, asking Fu Jiuchong with a gentle smile, \"What are you bringing me here for so late?\"","Her body had not yet fully recovered, confining her to the wheelchair.","Fu Jiuchong's voice was extremely hoarse. \"Look up, look ahead.\"","\"What's ahead—\"","Fu Jiuge subconsciously looked up and froze abruptly.","Her eyes widened in disbelief. She instinctively reached to turn the wheelchair's wheels, wanting to move closer.","Xie Lanzhou had already mentally prepared himself and regained his composure relatively quickly.","He gazed quietly at Fu Jiuge for a long moment before saying in a raspy voice, \"Jiuge, I'm back. I'm sorry for making you wait so long.\"","Hearing the familiar voice, Fu Jiuge's eyes instantly reddened. Tears welled up, clinging to her lashes. \"You are...\" she choked out.","As a celestial master, she could naturally tell the difference between a spirit form and a living person.","\"Don't worry, I'm fine,\" Xie Lanzhou reassured her with a smile. \"You must focus on recovering your health. Once this matter is settled, I'll come back to see you.\"","Before the Cultivator organization was destroyed, news of his return absolutely could not be leaked. Visiting the Fu family at this time would be too risky.","Fu Jiuge struggled to suppress her emotions, her hands tightly clasped together. \"Okay,\" she said with a smile.","There weren't many overly sentimental words between them. Just a few brief phrases were enough for them to understand each other's feelings.","The video call ended.","Li Guoyan asked, \"How should Master Xie be accommodated next?\"","\"I...\" Xie Lanzhou faltered.","For twenty years, he had been solely focused on gathering clues. Suddenly relieved of that burden, he felt somewhat lost and at a loss.","The two men stared at each other, one wide-eyed, the other bewildered.","Li Guoyan turned to ask Qi Quan, \"Do you have any suggestions, Master?\"","[He can stay at the department and draw talismans!] The system excitedly... offered its suggestion.","Qi Quan followed its line of thought and said, \"Since Master Xie is proficient in the art of talismans, why not have him stay at the Investigation Department to draw them?\"","Based on her output of ten talismans per month, the department's supply was far from sufficient.","Li Guoyan's eyes lit up.","That's right! Xie Lanzhou was a talisman genius renowned throughout the celestial master community in his day!","Xie Lanzhou also found it feasible.","The matter was settled.","\"Wait,\" Xie Lanzhou suddenly called out to Qi Quan and Ling Sheng.","He pulled out a peace talisman folded into a star shape and offered it to Ling Sheng.","\"I know you don't lack for these things, but I want to give this to you. I hope you'll accept it.\"","The situation here was different from the Fu family.","Since Ling Sheng was the Chief Physician of the Investigation Department, the department surely had his photo. Anyone who had seen both Fu Jiuge and Ling Sheng would know of Ling Sheng's connection to the Fu family.","As the director, Li Guoyan was naturally fully aware.","But since Qi Quan had always concealed Ling Sheng's identity, and the Fu family had not disclosed that Fu Jiuge had given birth, Li Guoyan simply acted as if he knew nothing.","Xie Lanzhou could easily deduce this situation.","That's why he dared to give Ling Sheng the peace talisman in Li Guoyan's presence.","But Fu Jiuge did not dare.","The Fu household had many people and prying eyes. Even if she recognized Ling Sheng, she couldn't reveal anything.","Ling Sheng, having never experienced such a situation, stood frozen in place.","Although he had received \"education,\" before entering the Lakeside Villa, he had never interacted with others and had rarely participated in normal social activities.","He didn't know whether he should accept it, nor what kind of reaction he should have.","Thinking of Ling Sheng's nineteen years of confinement, Xie Lanzhou felt a pang of heartache. He directly pressed the little star into Ling Sheng's hand, his voice low and hoarse. \"If you don't like it, you can tear it up, throw it away... anything is fine.\"","Ling Sheng stared blankly at the star resting in his palm.","It felt light, yet also seemed very heavy.","The young man blinked and instinctively placed the little star into his pocket.","Xie Lanzhou smiled, exceptionally happy.","\"Master, your accommodations have been arranged. They're very close by. If you need anything, please don't hesitate to call me,\" Li Guoyan said respectfully.","Qi Quan nodded.","Li Guoyan saw her to the door, watched her get into the car, and then returned to the Investigation Department.","The number of memory-retaining talismans provided by Xie Lanzhou was enormous. He needed to mobilize the entire department to work through the night to locate the Cultivator organization's hideouts.","Arriving at the temporary residence, Shen Hui and Tang Mian moved the luggage while Qi Quan entered her room to cultivate.","A knock sounded at the door.","\"Come in.\"","The lock turned, and Ling Sheng walked in, holding a star, his expression somewhat bewildered.","Qi Quan asked, \"What's wrong?\"","The young man half-knelt beside the bed, lowered his head, and typed: [Should I have taken it?]","\"Why shouldn't you have?\" Qi Quan asked.","[I don't know.]","He hung his head. With his almost blank social experience, he simply couldn't arrive at an answer.","Qi Quan ruffled his hair and said gently, \"Don't overthink it. In matters like these, just follow your natural instincts.\"","Ling Sheng nodded, seeming to understand, yet not fully.","He leaned against Qi Quan's knee and continued typing: [Why was it folded into a star?]","Qi Quan: ?","How would she know?","Shouldn't he ask Xie Lanzhou that?","She patted the young man's head and said, \"I need to start cultivating. You should go back to your room for now.\"","Ling Sheng paused, raised his head to look at her, his eyes seeming to hold a trace of... disappointment?","Huh? Was his curiosity that strong?","Qi Quan simply closed her eyes, pretending not to see.","Ling Sheng: ...","He had no choice but to get up and leave the room.","Manor in the Beijing suburbs.","...","The steward, having received the report from an attendant, couldn't help but show surprise. \"Is what you're saying true? How is that possible?\"","\"I didn't believe it at first either,\" the attendant said, his face scrunched up. \"But all those injured inspectors returned to the Celestial Master Association completely unharmed, acting as if nothing was wrong. They didn't seem like people whose meridians had been damaged at all.\"","The steward: \"...\"","He still couldn't believe it, muttering to himself, \"The family head has searched for so many years for a method to heal damaged meridians, with no success to this day. And now, all those inspectors were cured overnight? How is that possible?\"","Having followed Yan Fengqing for so many years, his understanding was the deepest.","Damaged meridians were fundamentally incurable!","\"Are you sure their cultivation hasn't regressed? They can wield spiritual energy normally?\"","\"Absolutely true!\" The servant would stake his head on it.","The steward was frustrated.","They had previously contacted their mole within the Heavenly Master Association, deliberately muddying the waters to create conflict between the Heavenly Masters and the Inspection Team, resulting in the team members' meridians being damaged.","With so many inspectors injured across the country, the authorities couldn't possibly ignore it.","The family head would then conveniently provide a prescription that could \"alleviate the symptoms,\" putting the Investigation Department in their debt, and many things would fall into place.","But now?","Those inspectors were all completely healed!","His brows were tightly knitted. \"Investigate! Find out what exactly happened!\"","The servant said, \"No need to investigate. They just went to the Longjiang City Investigation Department and came out cured.\"","\"...\"","The steward simply didn't believe it.","\"Were there any other unusual occurrences that day?\"","\"Nothing particularly special. That Senior Qi Quan went to the Investigation Department, didn't stay long, and left,\" the servant reported.","The steward: \"...\"","Why is it her again!","He had a vague feeling that the inspectors' recovery was inextricably linked to Qi Quan.","But what method did she use?","If there truly was a method in this world to heal damaged meridians, why would the family head have suffered for so many years?","Early the next morning, just after Qi Quan got up, she received a call from Li Guoyan.","The Investigation Department had spent the entire night integrating clear leads from those memory-retention talismans, marking them one by one on a map.","Xie Lanzhou had spent twenty years finding nearly thirty hideouts of the Cultivator of Evil Paths organizations.","He was a ghost. These organizations were full of high-level Heavenly Masters. His actions were extremely risky; the slightest misstep could lead to his soul scattering.","Li Guoyan held him in the highest esteem.","\"Grandmaster, please come over. We need to discuss the plan to destroy these Cultivator of Evil Paths hideouts.\"","Qi Quan: \"Alright.\"","\"Also, we originally planned to send the injured to Longjiang City. However, Physician Qi is currently in Longjing. There's one severely injured patient, and we'd like to ask Physician Qi for a consultation.\"","Qi Quan chuckled: \"You could have texted him directly about that.\"","\"I sent him a message. He didn't reply.\"","Qi Quan paused for a moment, then walked out of her room.","The Investigation Department had arranged a homestay for them, fully equipped with all facilities.","Ling Sheng was in the kitchen making breakfast.","The young man wore a loose sweater, an apron tied around his waist, holding a spatula as he fried eggs.","Qi Quan smiled and said into the phone, \"Director Li, I'll get back to you shortly.\"","\"Alright.\"","Hearing movement behind him, Ling Sheng turned to look at her. He scooped the fried egg out of the pan onto a plate, pairing it with vegetable congee and pickles—a simple yet flavorful breakfast.","\"Smells amazing!\" Shen Hui followed the aroma, saying to Tang Mian beside him, \"You haven't tasted our Chief Physician's cooking yet, have you?\"","Tang Mian: \"...\"","Just because he gets more opportunities to travel on assignments with the senior than she does, what's there to boast about?","Shen Hui didn't want to offend her too much and quickly added, \"Actually, it's because your cultivation is higher than mine. The department needs you more to handle cases. That's why Director Meng let me drive. Your driving skills are on par with mine.\"","\"Do I need to thank you for the compliment?\" Tang Mian shot him a sidelong glance.","Shen Hui: \"Uh, up to you.\"","\"...\"","After the meal, Shen Hui rushed to wash the dishes. Ling Sheng didn't refuse.","Qi Quan said, \"Director Li sent you a message.\"","The young man opened his phone.","[Li Guoyan: A comrade had his dantian damaged three years ago. Wondering if it can be treated?]","Ling Sheng thought for a moment and replied: [Will try.]","His current medical notes were filled with cases concerning meridians. He hadn't yet treated a patient with dantian damage.","[Li Guoyan: Good. I'll have him brought to the Investigation Department.]","Ling Sheng put down his phone and looked at Qi Quan.","\"Once Shen Hui finishes washing up, we'll head to the Investigation Department,\" Qi Quan said.","The lights at the Investigation Department had been on all night.","Yet, all the investigators involved in the case were still energetic and alert.","When Qi Quan stepped into the department, she sensed an undercurrent of excitement.","It seemed things were progressing quite smoothly.","Li Guoyan smiled upon seeing them.","\"Grandmaster, let's go to the conference room to discuss. Physician Qi, the injured patient in the infirmary will be troubling you.\"","Ling Sheng was momentarily taken aback, perhaps because they would be separating. He looked at Qi Quan somewhat reluctantly.","The latter patted his shoulder. \"Looking forward to your success.\"","The young man's lips immediately curved into a smile, his eyes filled with determination. He followed another investigator's guidance towards the infirmary.","Qi Quan and Li Guoyan turned and entered the conference room.","Inside, Di Meng, Ning Zhi, and several other elites were present. They stood straight, and upon seeing the two enter, their expressions held a hint of excitement.","Li Guoyan: \"Everyone, sit.\"","They all took their seats.","A map suddenly appeared before Qi Quan. Nearly thirty hideouts were marked on it with a red marker, scattered across the country. Just looking at this map was enough to send chills down one's spine.","[They're all worse than beasts!] The system cursed angrily.","Qi Quan glanced over the map and asked, \"How does Director Li plan to destroy these hideouts?\"","\"The hideouts in Longlin City and Longtang City both had ninth-grade protective arrays. Presumably, the other hideouts also have arrays as obstacles.\" Li Guoyan paused and asked, \"Can Grandmaster's composite talismans shatter a ninth-grade array?\"","Composite sword talismans are difficult to make, requiring a Heavenly Master proficient in both talisman and sword arts. To shatter a ninth-grade array in one strike, one must reach the ninth grade in both talisman craft and swordsmanship.","Qi Quan's skills in talismans and swordsmanship could indeed reach the ninth grade. However, there is energy loss during the creation of composite talismans, so they might not necessarily shatter a ninth-grade array in one go.","She considered carefully and said, \"Haven't tried it. But if once isn't enough, we can try twice. If twice isn't enough, three times.\"","As long as the array's energy is depleted and not replenished in time, a ninth-grade array ceases to be a major threat.","\"Good!\" Li Guoyan had been waiting for these words. He said excitedly, \"I plan to set up arrays capable of holding composite talismans at Investigation Departments across the country. Then, at an opportune moment, activate all the composite talismans simultaneously, catching them completely off guard!\"","Qi Quan: \"That's feasible.\"","However, with so many locations, who would set up the arrays?","Li Guoyan understood her unspoken question and said, \"Among the investigators, there are promising talents studying array formations. I wonder if they can learn this?\"","Qi Quan nodded.","That array was merely to provide energy support for the composite talisman. As long as the energy was sufficient, it could activate the sword light inscribed on the talisman paper. It wasn't too complex, didn't require profound mastery of array formations, and could also ignore grade limitations.","Everyone present felt a surge of excitement.","If arrays could be established across the country, combined with the power of composite talismans, there was great hope of simultaneously breaking the arrays protecting the Cultivator of Evil Paths hideouts.","Furthermore, not all hideouts had ninth-grade arrays.","During his investigation, Xie Lanzhou had also discovered arrays of varying grades at different hideouts. Apart from large-scale ones like in Longlin City, the smaller hideouts only had arrays around the fifth, sixth, or seventh grade, and the guarding forces weren't overwhelmingly strong.","Li Guoyan smiled and said, \"The specific arrangements for the study still need to be discussed. But, Master, we'll have to trouble you from now on.\"","Qi Quan readily agreed.","The person behind this had a grudge against her; she was also seeking justice for herself.","\"By the way,\" Li Guoyan suddenly added, \"The department took Yan Fengqing's blood for testing and indeed discovered conditions different from ordinary people. The technical team is now developing detection equipment based on these anomalies.\"","Qi Quan asked, \"Approximately how long?\"","\"A conservative estimate, half a month,\" Li Guoyan said. \"Equipment for detecting puppet talismans is also under development.\"","Once the authorities got serious, their efficiency was remarkably high.","Qi Quan replied, \"Half a month is sufficient for learning the formation.\"","\"That's excellent!\"","Everyone present showed expressions of \"seeing the dawn.\"","Li Guoyan cleared his throat lightly, reined in his smile, and said, \"Twenty days from now, the Yan family will hold a clan competition. All Tian Masters, whether from the main family or branch families, can participate as long as their cultivation level meets the standard.\"","\"Director Li, do you mean we temporarily release Yan Fengqing?\" Di Meng's mind worked quickly.","Ning Zhi followed his train of thought, \"Since we don't have concrete evidence to prove his guilt yet, we release him first to let his guard down?\"","\"Yes, without concrete evidence, we can't hold him for long,\" Li Guoyan said. \"The Yan family has a rule: if a particular branch achieves excellent results in the internal clan competition, they can obtain more cultivation resources, and their status rises accordingly.\"","Yan Fengqing appeared handsome and elegant on the surface, but in reality, he was a man consumed by lust for power.","Unwilling to accept losing the position of family head years ago due to meridian damage, he had been \"biding his time\" all these years and would absolutely not want to miss the clan competition opportunity.","With the aid of the Enlightenment Pills, the disciples under his command probably already possessed considerable combat strength.","As long as he held enough power and tied the entire family to the same chain of interests, he would be invincible within the clan.","But—","What good would it do if the disciples who took the Enlightenment Pills won first place?","In the medical room.","A gaunt man lay on the hospital bed.","He was once a talented investigator, a promising seedling secretly cultivated by the authorities, but his dantian was injured during a secret mission three years ago. He had suffered excruciating pain, unable to sleep day or night.","However, his will was strong. Seeing Ling Sheng, he even managed a smile, his voice very gentle.","\"Doctor, thank you for being willing to treat me. I know it's very difficult to cure. The Mystic Arts world also has no method to completely heal it. Please just do your best; don't feel burdened.\"","The doctor who treated him three years ago cried because they couldn't cure him, repeatedly apologizing.","He truly didn't blame them at all; meridian damage inevitably led to this outcome.","...","Ling Sheng's expression remained unchanged as he pressed a button.","\"Please close your eyes.\"","The injured man: ???","With a strange feeling, he complied and closed his eyes.","Ling Sheng's right hand hovered above his dantian. Gentle spiritual power slowly probed in, examining the damage around the dantian.","He had already prepared a treatment plan before coming.","The dantian is where a cultivator stores spiritual power, which is different from the meridians.","For cultivators below the Human Sovereign Realm, only the dantian can store spiritual power; meridians are merely conduits for spiritual power to circulate.","Damage to the dantian, preventing effective storage of spiritual power, is an extremely heavy blow for a cultivator.","Dantian damage is caused by external force invasion.","The enemy's spiritual power not only destroys the dantian's storage function but also lingers like a persistent bone-deep ulcer, constantly churning inside the dantian, causing unbearable agony.","That heterogeneous spiritual power is different from one's own.","One's own spiritual power is refined by absorbing the spiritual energy of heaven and earth. Cultivators use certain techniques to \"lock\" this spiritual energy within the dantian. Once the dantian is damaged, the heaven and earth spiritual energy scatters and escapes.","An outsider's spiritual power is different; once forced in, it won't retreat on its own and must be expelled by external force.","What Ling Sheng needed to do was first expel this spiritual power, then use his own spiritual power to repair the damaged dantian.","Expelling the spiritual power was effortless for him.","In just a moment, his spiritual power enveloped the third-party spiritual power and moved it out of the injured man's dantian. Once separated from the dantian, the spiritual power instantly dissipated into the air.","The injured man's eyes snapped open, his face filled with shock.","What was going on?!","The thing that had tormented him for three years was just gone like that?","It had only been a few minutes!","Was he dreaming again?","\"Doctor, is... is the thing in my dantian really gone?\" he asked incredulously.","Even as he asked, he already mostly believed it.","Because in the past three years, he had never felt so comfortable and at ease.","Without the churning of the heterogeneous spiritual power, he felt like a new person.","Ling Sheng pressed a button.","\"Please be quiet.\"","Pressed another.","\"Please close your eyes.\"","The injured man: \"...\"","He closed his eyes again, filled with excitement.","Spiritual power probed into the dantian once more.","After three years of torment, the dantian damage was quite severe. Gentle, water-like spiritual power continuously nourished the injured area. Like a long drought meeting sweet rain, the dantian's storage function gradually recovered.","The injured man subconsciously absorbed a bit of spiritual energy.","The spiritual energy transformed into spiritual power and entered the dantian. That spiritual power seemed to greatly favor Ling Sheng's spiritual power, circling around it playfully, unwilling to settle down.","The injured man was so moved he almost cried.","Thinking he would suffer for a lifetime, who could have imagined he would be cured just like that!","Before coming, he was skeptical. Now, he just wanted to say, the great kindness and virtue of the divine doctor is beyond repayment!","The repair treatment took a long time. By the time Qi Quan came out of the meeting, the medical room door was still closed.","Xie Lanzhou quietly came over and asked, \"I saw Ling Sheng go into the medical room earlier, and he hasn't come out yet. What's wrong with him?\"","\"You'll know when he comes out,\" Li Guoyan said with a smile.","A moment later, the medical room door opened.","Ling Sheng came out holding the electronic player. Seeing Qi Quan waiting for him outside, his eyes immediately curved as he approached her.","\"All cured?\" Qi Quan asked with a smile.","The young man nodded and put the player back into his bag.","...","Li Guoyan couldn't help but praise greatly, \"Doctor Qi's medical skills are extraordinary.\"","\"Cured what?\" Xie Lanzhou leaned over to ask.","As soon as he finished speaking, a man ran out from the medical room, his gaunt face full of gratitude.","\"Thank you, Divine Doctor! Thank you, Divine Doctor!\" He then turned to Li Guoyan, \"Thank you, Director Li, for giving me this opportunity!\"","Li Guoyan patted his shoulder and said with relief, \"You've suffered these past years. Now that you're healed, you can find a stable job and live a good life.\"","The man suddenly paused, tears welling in his eyes, \"Director Li, you don't want me anymore?\"","Li Guoyan smiled, \"How could we not want you? You've endured three years of hardship. Don't you really want to go enjoy life?\"","\"Director Li, saying I don't want to would be a lie,\" the man wiped his face. \"But I understand clearly, as long as the evil cultivators aren't eradicated, none of us will have peaceful days.\"","He straightened his back and said firmly, \"Director Li, I request to return to the team!\"","Li Guoyan's eyes reddened slightly. He nodded and said with emotion, \"Good. First, recuperate well. Once you pass the physical exam standards, we'll discuss returning to the team.\"","The man nodded vigorously, then said, \"Director Li, everyone hopes to be able to return to the team.\"","Li Guoyan said solemnly, \"Don't worry, I will arrange it.\"","\"Thank you, Director Li! Thank you, Divine Doctor!\"","The man left, his heart filled with hope.","\"What exactly is the treatment?\" Xie Lanzhou had a vague suspicion in his mind but dared not dwell on it too much.","Previously, when he heard that Ling Sheng was working as a physician at the Investigation Department, he assumed it was just as an ordinary doctor. His mind had been too chaotic to think deeply about it. It was only after seeing the man's excited and thrilled demeanor just now that he sensed something was off.","Given that Ling Sheng had been trapped for nineteen years, and given that Ling Sheng was only nineteen years old now, he simply hadn't had the time to obtain a conventional medical practitioner's license. So how could he possibly be a physician at the Investigation Department?","Therefore, the only way one could be specially recruited by the Investigation Department as a physician was by mastering the esoteric medical arts of the mystical path.","This was the Medical Dao!","Xie Lanzhou's expression was tense as he waited for Li Guoyan's answer.","\"The injured man from earlier had suffered severe damage to his dantian,\" Li Guoyan did not hide it from him.","Xie Lanzhou: !!!","He looked at Ling Sheng in astonishment, then at Qi Quan.","In that instant, he felt immensely grateful to Qi Quan.","She had not only saved Ling Sheng's life but also taught him how to establish himself in this world.","\"Senior, I am truly grateful to you,\" he said sincerely.","Qi Quan smiled. \"He has a natural talent for it.\"","\"You all talk, I need to head to the interrogation room,\" Li Guoyan bid farewell and left.","After he left, Xie Lanzhou wanted to express his gratitude again, but Qi Quan cut him off with one sentence.","\"Mr. Xie, I need your help drawing talismans.\"","Xie Lanzhou: \"What kind of talisman? I'll draw it!\"","\"Combined Talismans.\"","Xie Lanzhou: \"...\"","\"I've heard that Mr. Xie was not only a top genius in the Talisman Dao in his time but also highly accomplished in the Sword Dao.\"","Xie Lanzhou said with shame, \"That was just others giving me face. To be honest, I've tried Combined Talismans before and never succeeded once.\"","\"I will teach you the principles. Combined Talismans below the ninth level will be entrusted to you.\"","She had heard that Xie Lanzhou could create talismans beyond his level back in the day.","He is currently at the eighth level, so creating a ninth-level talisman shouldn't be too difficult, right?","Xie Lanzhou's eyes burned with intensity. \"Senior... you actually created Combined Talismans?!\"","\"Do you want to learn?\"","\"Yes!\"","So, the two people and one ghost found an empty lounge.","Qi Quan taught Xie Lanzhou how to draw talismans, while Ling Sheng sat close beside her, drawing spirit talismans.","No matter the time, spirit talismans were always a scarce resource.","Ling Sheng... whenever he had time, he never forgot to make spirit talismans. At home, he carved jade talismans. When outside and carving jade was inconvenient, he would draw paper talismans.","When Xie Lanzhou finished learning the principles and looked up, he saw a large stack of spirit talismans already piled on the table.","Ling Sheng was still diligently drawing, head down.","Xie Lanzhou: \"...\"","His feelings were... complex and hard to describe.","He focused his mind and, based on the principles Qi Quan had just taught him, began to draw.","The two were absorbed in drawing talismans, so Qi Quan didn't want to disturb them and sat to the side to cultivate.","Interrogation Room.","Seeing Li Guoyan walk in, Yan Fengqing's gloomy face couldn't help but reveal a trace of mockery and triumph.","\"Has Director Li come to his senses?\"","Li Guoyan sat across from him and asked in a deep voice, \"Come to my senses about what?\"","\"Actually, I bear no ill will towards the Investigation Department. I also hold you in high esteem. It pains me to think that those young investigators have to suffer a lifetime of agony just because of a minor conflict.\"","Li Guoyan asked with a smile, \"So, are you planning to generously provide the prescription?\"","\"You've investigated up to now and still haven't found enough evidence to convict me. For every extra day you detain me, those inspectors suffer for another day.\"","Li Guoyan hit the nail on the head: \"You've been drinking that medicine for so many years, aren't you still in pain?\"","\"...\"","Yan Fengqing chuckled coldly. \"Li Guoyan, if you can't find evidence, you can't hold me for much longer. We can still discuss terms now. Once I'm out...\"","\"I'll release you right now,\" Li Guoyan interrupted him, his expression calm. \"You are free to go.\"","The interrogator beside him stood up and unlocked the Spirit-Restraining Chair for Yan Fengqing.","Yan Fengqing: ?","He tilted his head, scrutinizing Li Guoyan's expression but couldn't read anything.","Could it really be that they have no choice but to release him due to lack of evidence?","The interrogator returned his phone to him.","\"This is your phone. You can now notify your family to pick you up.\"","Yan Fengqing was genuinely puzzled.","He asked, \"You don't seem to have asked me for the prescription.\"","\"Mm.\"","\"You're not going to do anything about those inspectors?\"","Li Guoyan said with a stern face, \"That's no concern of yours, Mr. Yan. Please leave.\"","Yan Fengqing got into his wheelchair, left the interrogation room, and dialed his steward's number.","\"Come pick me up.\"","Soon, the steward drove to fetch him.","After getting in the car, Yan Fengqing asked, \"Is the courtyard repaired?\"","\"Patriarch, it has been repaired,\" the steward replied respectfully. \"Everything else has also been handled properly.\"","\"Mm.\"","\"Patriarch, there's one strange thing.\"","\"What is it?\"","The steward said cautiously, \"All those injured inspectors have completely recovered in just a day and a night.\"","\"Recovered... what do you mean?\" Yan Fengqing asked with difficulty.","The steward swallowed. \"They have already returned to the Heavenly Master Association.\"","The meaning of this statement was very clear.","Only if their cultivation was unaffected could they continue serving as inspectors.","Yan Fengqing flatly denied it: \"Impossible.\"","The steward thought to himself: Sigh, ever since Qi Quan appeared out of nowhere, 'impossible' has become the patriarch's catchphrase.","He replied, \"This is the information sent back by our undercover agents. It's absolutely true.\"","\"Impossible!\" Yan Fengqing suddenly pounded his legs fiercely, his eyes turning red. \"I don't believe it!\"","How could he believe this?","He had endured over twenty years of pain, drinking medicine day after day like a cripple, just to maintain the cultivation level of a seventh-level Heavenly Master at best.","And now he was being told that all the injured inspectors had completely recovered?","Why! On what grounds!","It's not fair!","To placate him, the steward couldn't help but fabricate a theory: \"Patriarch, do you think it's possible that the inspectors who returned were actually placed under an illusion spell, making others think they are the same people as before?\"","\"Why don't you just say plastic surgery?\" Yan Fengqing asked darkly.","The steward: \"...\"","Illusion spells have spiritual energy fluctuations that are easily detected by instruments.","He knew this idea was far-fetched, but he couldn't think of any other possibility.","Yan Fengqing suddenly said, \"There is another possibility.\"","\"What?\"","\"A Medical Cultivator.\"","The steward was shocked: \"A Medical Cultivator? Hasn't that been lost for ages? It's not like no one in the mystical community has tried to practice it, but none had good results. Does the Investigation Department have a Medical Cultivator?\"","He paused, then said in horror, \"Or... is Qi Quan also a Medical Cultivator?\"","Yan Fengqing: \"...\"","He recalled Li Guoyan's expression in the interrogation room just now.","When he mentioned the prescription, Li Guoyan didn't show even a flicker of reaction. At the time, he thought the authorities were going to abandon those inspectors. Who would have guessed that Li Guoyan was holding such a good card up his sleeve.","\"Hah, truly a person of great fortune,\" Yan Fengqing murmured. \"But so what? Once that one succeeds in advancing, there will be no match left in this world.\"","Soon.","The sky of the mystical community is about to change.","Investigation Department.","Xie Lanzhou truly lived up to being a genius of the Talisman Dao in his time. Although not as prodigiously talented as Qi Quan, with a master like her teaching him, he quickly grasped the essence of Combined Talismans and became utterly absorbed in drawing them, unable to extricate himself.","Seeing him like this, Qi Quan took Ling Sheng back to their accommodation.","[Big shot, your readers are all urging for an update. How about you post a chapter tonight?] the system said weakly.","Qi Quan: [Okay.]","[It's not good to stay on hiatus for too long... huh? What did you just say? Did I hear that right?]","The guesthouse was equipped with a computer.","Qi Quan sat in front of the computer, opened a document, and started typing away.","System: Ah! The feeling of successfully getting an update is just too wonderful!","At 10 PM, readers habitually clicked into \"Diary of a Wealthy Family.\"","They jolted upright from their sickbeds.","Oh my god! Author White Water actually updated!","[I have some understanding of talisman patterns.","But I've never seen a talisman pattern like this before. I have a vague sense that it seems to contain some kind of mental suggestion.","What exactly does the person who drew this talisman pattern want?","To take pleasure in seducing others?","Of course, I'm just an ordinary, unremarkable office worker.","After my colleague blocked that person and wouldn't step into the trap again, I stopped paying attention to this matter.","Who would have thought that not long after, I would encounter cases of \"suicide for love\" driven by madness.","Not just one case, but several.","I saw with my own eyes people caught in love traps, losing their self-awareness and reason. Their dignity and even their lives were tightly controlled by another person.","In order to get a response, they were willing to gamble with their very lives.","How utterly insane.","I told my colleague about these things.","She was still shaken with fear.","She thanked me for warning her early, helping her escape that terrifying vortex.","I said to her, \"Don't believe in online romance anymore. If you see any strange talisman patterns, it's best not to pay attention to them either. Preserving your life is the most important thing.\"","She firmly promised she would never be fooled again.","Life just went on...","peacefully and uneventfully.","But even in ordinary days, some ripples always appear.","Compared to my first twenty-two years, my life now has become exceptionally thrilling and dangerous.","No, to be accurate, my fate was arranged by others from the moment I was born.","They used what they thought were subtle methods to suppress me, trying to push me into the dust, trying to make me lose the courage to live.","Unfortunately, after all these years of their efforts, I'm still alive in this world.","Finally—","They couldn't hold back any longer and made their move.","Truly a grand gesture, with experts as numerous as clouds.","Since entering this world, I've rarely engaged in fights and killings. I prefer peaceful resolutions.","Excessive greed can make people lose their humanity.","I don't really like such people, and I imagine the Heavenly Dao doesn't either.","I hope there won't be any more of these violent conflicts in the future.","I prefer a harmonious and stable life.]","End of the new chapter.","[If you see me, tell me to go prepare my lessons: I also prefer a peaceful and warm life! I hope the author won't be so busy like this in the future!]","[Dying of Laughter: What kind of talisman pattern? I think I saw a profile picture with a talisman pattern design the other day.]","[Malantianhua Thirty-One: You need to be careful!]","[Pythagorean Theorem abc: Sis, you really need to be careful!]","[Book Famine is Deadly: The things the author repeatedly mentions must be important, Dying of Laughter, you really must not take this lightly!]","[Dying of Laughter: I only saw it on someone else's phone, I'm not sure if it's the same one.]","[Today Auspicious: Those who don't listen to the master will suffer! One hundred depth charges!]","[Today Profitable: How dare someone harm the master! Scram! One hundred depth charges!]","[Auspicious and Profitable: Isn't creating a harmonious society together good enough? Must they stir up trouble? Those who harm others will eventually bring about their own destruction! One hundred depth charges!]","Ordinary readers couldn't discern the deeper meaning in the text, but those in the know grasped something.","Li Guoyan put down his phone and said with a smile, \"Master is issuing a challenge.\"","\"Since Senior has issued a challenge, she must have a plan in mind,\" Di Meng replied. \"Once all the detection devices are developed, we'll definitely be able to expose those people!\"","Li Guoyan's phone suddenly buzzed.","He looked down and couldn't help but pause.","[Master Qi: Check the details of the user 'Dying of Laughter'.]","He immediately instructed Di Meng to notify the technical department.","After Di Meng relayed the order, he didn't forget to go to the comment section to find the comment by 'Dying of Laughter'.","Senior is indeed sharp. This is very likely a clue!","Huh? Wait a minute.","Does Senior also read the comment section after posting a new chapter?","Inside the guesthouse, Qi Quan sent the message to Li Guoyan and said to the system: [If this really leads to a clue, I'll credit you with the merit.]","System: [Hehe, as a writer's system, helping the host monitor the comment section is my duty!]","Qi Quan smiled slightly and continued her cultivation."]},{"number":64,"title":"Chapter 64","paragraphs":["After a moment, Li Guoyan replied with a message.","[Fan Xiaoxiao, female, 30 years old, nurse, works at Longhai City First Hospital.]","The information was completely normal, with no issues at all.","Nurses interact most frequently with patients, but there were far too many patients, making it impossible to investigate further.","Qi Quan put away her phone and continued her cultivation.","At the Yan Family residence.","Yan Huai was meditating in his room when someone knocked on the door.","\"Brother Huai, the family head is calling for you,\" Yan Geng shouted from outside.","Yan Huai opened his eyes, stood up, left his room, and went to the study, sitting opposite Yan Fengjun.","\"I want you to be in charge of this year's family competition,\" Yan Fengjun said with a deep, thoughtful expression.","Yan Huai did not decline. \"Alright.\"","\"This is the list of participating disciples from the main family and the branch families. Take it back and review it,\" Yan Fengjun said, handing him the roster. \"This time, other families have quite a few formidable disciples, mostly around Level Five.\"","Yan Huai: \"Hmm.\"","\"Our main family doesn't have many age-eligible disciples who have reached Level Five,\" Yan Fengjun worriedly furrowed his brow.","Yan Huai straightened his posture. \"Doing our best is sufficient.\"","\"Our family has hosted the family competition many times; there's nothing particularly special to note. If you have any matters, consult the steward.\"","\"Hmm.\"","Seeing his demeanor, Yan Fengjun felt a pang of frustration and waved his hand. \"Go back.\"","Yan Huai stood up.","\"Wait!\" Yan Fengjun swept a glance over him and suddenly called out, asking with surprise and doubt, \"You... have you broken through?\"","Yan Huai nodded.","After the intense battle with the wetland ferocious ghost, he had already shown signs of an impending breakthrough. Upon returning, he cultivated continuously and finally broke through to Level Seven two days ago!","A Level Seven Heavenly Master was already qualified to become the head of a family.","Yan Fengjun said joyfully, \"Then soon, the Yan Family can be handed over to you, and I can go into seclusion for focused cultivation.\"","Although being the family head meant holding power, handling mundane affairs also greatly affected cultivation.","He had always wanted to break through to Level Eight.","Yan Huai did not respond. He took the roster and returned to his room.","\"Brother Huai, what did the family head want?\" Yan Geng leaned in close, asking curiously.","Yan Huai raised the roster slightly.","\"The family competition?\" Yan Geng's eyes widened in surprise. \"He put you in charge?\"","\"Hmm.\"","Yan Geng whispered, \"Can I take a look?\"","There was no reason not to. Everyone already knew who was participating, as everyone wanted to know their opponents in advance.","Yan Huai handed it to him.","\"Wow, these branch family disciples have such high cultivation levels! There's even one at Level Five, Third Tier!\"","\"No way, how are some of these branch families so incredibly strong this time? I see the highest from the main family is only Level Five, Second Tier.\"","\"Each one is remarkably talented.\"","Yan Geng exclaimed while reading.","\"Notify the steward to come here. I have some matters to discuss with him,\" Yan Huai instructed.","Yan Geng straightened up. \"Yes!\"","A moment later, the steward knocked and entered.","\"Young Master, what are your orders?\"","Yan Huai spread out the blueprint of the competition arena. \"In previous years, how was the venue arranged?\"","Steward: ?","Haven't you participated in the competition before? Why ask this?","Though he thought this internally, he replied respectfully, \"In past competitions, the family head and the heads of the other branch families would observe the matches together. Observing disciples would sit in the spectator stands, and participating disciples would sit in the waiting area.\"","\"Make some changes.\"","Steward: \"Please go on.\"","\"This year, divide the seating according to the main family and each branch family's disciples.\"","\"Ah?\"","\"Including the main family, there are five groups of disciples participating this time... Divide the spectator stands into five sections. The main family's participating and observing disciples will sit together, and so on for the others.\"","The steward asked, puzzled, \"Won't that create too much distance?\"","With such clear boundaries between them, how could they maintain even a superficial appearance of unity?","Yan Huai's expression remained unchanged, his voice cold. \"Do as I said.\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Leave some space at the entrance. I need to make some arrangements there,\" Yan Huai instructed.","Steward: \"...Alright. May I ask what kind of arrangements? I can have people decorate it.\"","He thought Yan Huai, newly appointed, wanted to create an impressive facade.","Yan Huai: \"No need.\"","\"Alright. Any other orders?\"","\"None.\"","The steward then respectfully withdrew.","A residence in the Beijing suburbs.","The attendant brought a bowl of pitch-black medicine, but Yan Fengqing swatted it away with a palm strike.","The medicine bowl hit the floor, shattering into several pieces.","Yan Fengqing said gloomily, \"What's the use of drinking this? Hasn't the pill from over there been developed yet?\"","\"We have not received any news yet,\" the attendant replied, head bowed.","\"They're all useless. What good are Bloodburst Pills and Enlightenment Pills? If they could develop a medicine to treat meridian damage, would the Mystic Realm still dare oppose us?\"","Attendant: \"...\"","\"Any news from Ghost?\"","\"Not for now,\" the attendant replied. \"He tried to obtain information from the Investigation Department but was blocked by their technical personnel.\"","\"Hah.\" Yan Fengqing sneered coldly. \"With this level of skill, and yet he's a favorite in front of that person. Rotten on the inside. I don't know how that person took a liking to him.\"","Attendant: ...","He felt the family head was currently embodying what online folks called a \"misanthropic\" style.","After all, he even dared to disparage that person's subordinate.","Although the family head had always been arrogant and never addressed that person as \"Your Eminence,\" he had never shown any disrespect before.","This time, he was probably provoked by the recovered inspectors.","A moment later, Yan Fengqing calmed his hidden anger.","\"The family competition is coming up soon, right?\"","\"Yes.\"","Yan Fengqing's eyes showed contempt. \"I want to see how Yan Fengjun loses face this time.\"","\"Just received news that this competition will be overseen by Young Master Yan Huai.\"","Yan Fengqing didn't care in the slightest. \"Just an idiot who knows nothing about practical affairs. No need to worry.\"","\"Yes.\" The attendant paused, then said, \"Qi Quan arrived in Longjing last night.\"","Yan Fengqing frowned. \"What is she doing here again?\"","\"Unclear.\"","Yan Fengqing's expression suddenly darkened. \"Could the Investigation Department be planning some major operation?\"","\"Previously, the Investigation Department discovered bases in Longlin City and Longtang City. Sect Leader Yin, Family Head Fu, and Sect Leader Wan went to those two places respectively. It might be related to that.\"","Yan Fengqing scoffed. \"It's fine. With the cultivation levels of those old fellows, they can't break a Level Nine formation.\"","\"But Qi Quan...\"","\"No matter how powerful she is, she can't be in two places at once,\" Yan Fengqing wasn't worried. \"Even if she personally goes to Longlin City to cause trouble, by the time she breaks through the Level Nine formation, her spiritual power will likely be depleted. How could she then face the siege of the experts inside the formation?\"","As for the rest of the Mystic Realm, they were even less of a concern—all trash.","The attendant reminded him, \"She has composite talismans.\"","\"Composite talismans aren't that easy to create,\" Yan Fengqing shook his head. \"To break a Level Nine formation, one needs to create a Level Nine composite talisman. I don't believe she can produce one easily.\"","The attendant deeply agreed.","At the guesthouse.","Qi Quan leaned over a desk, sketching on paper.","[Master, what are you drawing? It doesn't seem like a composite sword talisman.]","Qi Quan smiled. [Indeed, it's not a composite talisman. It's a new type of talisman.]","[Master is inventing a new talisman again!] The system exclaimed excitedly. [What's the use of this new talisman?]","Qi Quan: [Back at the Lakeside Villa, Chen Feilu and Ning Zhi once debated the pros and cons of forbidden arts in the Mystic Realm. Do you remember?]","【Remember!】The system had gotten smarter. 【You said before that since the Peach Blossom Mark can provide vitality to people, from another perspective, it can also aid one's own comrades in group battles and share damage equally, right?】","A smile touched Qi Quan's eyes: 【That's right, you remember very clearly.】","【So you're planning to research this skill, right? Wow, that's amazing!】","Qi Quan: 【I already had the idea before.】","【Big shot, is something major about to happen?】","Qi Quan: 【Perhaps.】","\"Knock, knock, knock.\"","Qi Quan didn't look up: \"Come in.\"","The sound of the door opening came from behind, bringing with it a waft of sweet melon and fruit fragrance, along with the faint scent of grass from the young man.","【Big shot, it's Ling Sheng.】","Qi Quan put down the final stroke of her brush, looked up, and turned around, her gaze meeting the young man's serene eyes.","A fruit platter was placed beside her, filled with neatly sliced pieces, accompanied by delicate little forks.","The service was truly quite considerate.","Qi Quan smiled and ate a piece. \"It's delicious.\"","A phone was handed to her.","【What are you drawing?】","Qi Quan said, \"A new type of talisman. It can establish a connection between multiple people, allowing them to share spiritual power and share risks.\"","【Multiple people? Are there many people?】","Qi Quan nodded. \"Based on the strength the Cultivator of Unorthodox Methods organization has shown so far, with the forced growth from various pills, their overall power far surpasses that of the Orthodox Daoist sects. Once a battle starts, the Orthodox sects will be no match.\"","Creating this new talisman was her way of minimizing casualties within the Orthodox sects to the greatest extent possible and preserving their strength.","Ling Sheng looked carefully at the new talisman and typed: 【Too many. You'll get tired. I'll draw too.】","Having help was naturally good. Qi Quan didn't refuse and taught him the principles of the new talisman.","Ling Sheng learned quickly, producing a complete talisman in just a short while.","He looked at Qi Quan with delight.","\"Not bad.\" Qi Quan leaned her head slightly towards him, pointing at a less fluent part of the talisman paper. \"When drawing here, you should...\"","Her voice was low and gentle. As she leaned closer, a unique, faint fragrance seemed to drift over. Her profile seemed to glow like jade as she explained the talisman patterns.","Ling Sheng stared at her blankly, his face inexplicably growing warm, his heart beating fast. An impulse surged from the depths of his heart. Her voice seemed both very close and yet very far away.","\"Did you understand?\" Qi Quan suddenly looked up and asked.","Ling Sheng snapped back to reality, hurriedly averted his gaze, fixed his eyes on the talisman paper on the desk, and instinctively shook his head.","Qi Quan: ?","She had explained it in great detail. How could he not understand?","System: 【Big shot, he seemed distracted while you were explaining just now.】","Qi Quan: 【...】","She looked solemnly at the young man and asked, \"Is something on your mind?\"","Ling Sheng didn't dare look at her and continued shaking his head.","\"I'll explain it one more time, only this once.\" After saying this, Qi Quan patiently explained it to him again.","\"Understood?\"","Ling Sheng quickly nodded and picked up his brush to draw.","He could sense the spiritual energy around Qi Quan was quite subdued, so naturally, he didn't dare let his mind wander and waste her time again. He finished drawing a talisman with swift strokes and carefully handed it to her for review.","Qi Quan glanced at it. \"Very good. Keep drawing them like this.\"","Ling Sheng secretly breathed a sigh of relief. Just as he was about to pick up his brush to draw again, he suddenly thought of something, picked up his phone, and typed: 【I'm sorry for being distracted earlier.】","\"Don't let it happen again.\" Qi Quan's expression was neutral.","Ling Sheng secretly sensed her spiritual power; it seemed to have returned to its usual calm state, and he couldn't help but curve the corners of his lips slightly.","It seemed she didn't like inattentive people.","Inside the Investigation Department, Li Guoyan and the others were also studying the plan for the encirclement and suppression.","In the original plan, they would set up formations at Investigation Department branches across the country and use composite sword talismans to simultaneously attack the Cultivator of Unorthodox Methods hideouts.","But even after shattering the formations, the Cultivator of Unorthodox Methods still had super high-level Heavenly Masters stationed. With the combat power of the Orthodox sects and the Investigation Department, it would be difficult to inflict significant damage on them.","The Investigation Department was still too young, lacking sufficient reserves of talented personnel. The Orthodox sects also lost many elite Heavenly Masters during the previous crackdown on Cultivator of Unorthodox Methods, leading to a decline in talent.","Faced with a Cultivator of Unorthodox Methods organization that had been lurking for decades, they seemed to have no chance of victory.","Even though Chief Consultant Qi Quan possessed formidable combat power, she was only one person, while there were multiple Cultivator of Unorthodox Methods hideouts across the country.","Fortunately, the information provided by Xie Lanzhou was very detailed. He had basically given specific data on the defensive formations and the approximate cultivation levels of the guards at each Cultivator of Unorthodox Methods hideout, which greatly aided their allocation of combat resources.","Apart from Longlin City and Longtang City having ninth-level formations, the formations at the other bases were below ninth-level.","Five were eighth-level, nine were seventh-level, and the rest were above fifth-level but below seventh-level.","The base in Longlin City was backed by the Hengfeng Sect. The Hengfeng Sect had many disciples and quite a few high-ranking elders within the sect. Even with Master Qi present, she couldn't be in multiple places at once. Moreover, not all Hengfeng Sect disciples and elders were involved with the Cultivator of Unorthodox Methods organization.","This point was rather troublesome.","The meeting grew increasingly heavy. The energy of the Cultivator of Unorthodox Methods organization was too vast; they simply couldn't come up with strong guarantees.","Di Meng suddenly said, \"Can we mobilize Daoist practitioners from the Orthodox sects across the country, including independent cultivators, to jointly clear out the Cultivator of Unorthodox Methods hideouts?\"","Forget about the eighth and ninth-level bases, but for the remaining bases, they could still organize like-minded individuals from the Orthodox sects to go together and destroy the Cultivator of Unorthodox Methods hideouts.","Li Guoyan: \"You're right, but the forces of the Orthodox sects are scattered, like loose sand. There must be a strong leader to call on them to participate in this clearing operation.\"","The Guiyuan Sect couldn't do it, nor could the Xuanqing Sect.","\"Senior Qi Quan.\" Ning Zhi said decisively.","Everyone present smiled.","Currently, within the Orthodox sects, the one who could command practitioners was none other than Master Qi.","But how to issue the call without alerting the Cultivator of Unorthodox Methods was a challenge.","\"Director Li.\"","An investigator knocked on the meeting room door.","Li Guoyan: \"What is it?\"","\"Consultant Qi is here. She's waiting for you on the fourth-floor training ground.\"","Li Guoyan stood up abruptly and quickly walked out of the meeting room, the others following behind him.","Everyone arrived at the training ground.","Qi Quan stood in the field, her tall and slender figure commanding respect.","Ling Sheng stood beside her, holding a bag that seemed stuffed with many things.","\"Master, what is this?\" Li Guoyan strode in and asked, puzzled.","\"I've created a new type of talisman and wanted to test it.\" As Qi Quan spoke, she glanced at the Investigation Department members. \"Who's willing to come up and give it a try?\"","Almost all the investigators raised their hands simultaneously.","\"Me! I'm willing!\"","\"Senior, pick me! I'll do it!\"","\"Let me try, let me try, let me try!\"","\"Me, me, me, me, me!\"","As for those who didn't raise their hands, they were simply a bit slow to react.","Qi Quan nodded with satisfaction. \"The test will adopt a combat mode. Those willing to try, step forward and divide yourselves into two groups.\"","Di Meng and Ning Zhi exchanged a glance.","As the investigators with the highest combat power in the department, they naturally became the leaders of the two groups, standing on opposite sides.","The others divided themselves equally into two groups based on numbers, following behind the two leaders respectively.","Qi Quan signaled to Ling Sheng.","Ling Sheng took out a stack of talisman paper from his bag and distributed new talismans of different levels to each person according to their investigator rank.","Each talisman paper was imprinted with a peach blossom, surrounded by countless vines.","It was a very beautiful and novel talisman, truly something no one had seen before.","Shen Hui, who had been observing all along, couldn't help but raise his hand and ask, \"Senior, can I participate?\"","He was stirred up by the investigators brimming with fighting spirit.","Tang Mian said enthusiastically, \"Senior, I want to participate too.\"","\"Alright.\" Qi Quan smiled slightly. \"You all pick a team. Ling Sheng, hand out the talismans.\"","After the talisman papers were distributed,","Qi Quan instructed, \"Everyone, channel a stream of spiritual power and a drop of blood from your fingertip into the talisman paper.\"","Without a moment's hesitation, everyone did as told, infusing their spiritual power and blood.","They held absolute trust in Qi Quan.","Qi Quan: \"Place the talisman on your person. Both sides will now begin combat mode. Do not injure each other's meridians. The side whose members' spiritual power is depleted first loses. As soon as anyone's spiritual power is exhausted, they must stop fighting. You may use spirit talismans in the fight. Understood?\"","Everyone: \"Understood!\"","Their shouts shook the heavens, their excitement palpable.","Qi Quan left the training ground with Ling Sheng, closing the door behind them. Together with Li Guoyan, they observed the situation inside through the glass wall.","Neither team moved at first.","They were discussing tactics.","Li Guoyan asked with a smile, \"Master, what is the purpose of this new talisman?\"","\"To share spiritual power and share risks.\"","Li Guoyan was astonished upon hearing this. He suddenly realized that such a talisman would play an extremely crucial role in group battles.","The Master truly never ceased to amaze him!","\"What are you all looking at?\" A voice suddenly came from behind.","It was Xie Lanzhou.","Nowadays, aside from drawing talismans, Xie Lanzhou spent his time wandering around the Investigation Department.","Seeing the three of them standing there, he drifted over without a second thought, squeezing in beside them and craning his neck to look inside.","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She had almost forgotten there was another potential labor force here.","\"Mr. Xie, how is the progress on the composite talismans?\"","Xie Lanzhou said apologetically, \"I'm sorry, I can only manage up to eighth-grade at the moment. Ninth-grade is beyond me.\"","Li Guoyan beside him: \"...\"","Even an ordinary eighth-grade talisman was an extremely rare treasure in the mystical world, let alone an eighth-grade composite talisman?","The world of geniuses was truly astounding.","\"Then perhaps you should take a break and try some other new talismans?\"","As soon as Qi Quan finished speaking, Ling Sheng took a new talisman from his bag and handed it to Xie Lanzhou.","Xie Lanzhou felt a surge of emotion—this was the first time Ling Sheng had taken the initiative to interact with him.","Handing something over was a form of interaction, after all.","He carefully accepted the talisman paper, looked down, and indeed it was a new type he had never seen before.","\"What kind of talisman is this?\" He became exceptionally serious when it came to the art of talismans.","\"Watch the training ground,\" Qi Quan said, keeping him in suspense.","Xie Lanzhou instinctively turned his head, his gaze falling on the training ground.","Inside the training ground, the two team leaders made the first move.","Di Meng fought fiercely, while Ning Zhi leaned towards steadiness. The peachwood hammer slammed against the peachwood sword; as their spiritual powers collided, both took a step back.","That strike had used about seventy percent of their strength.","\"Huh?\" Di Meng suddenly let out a sound of confusion.","That wasn't right.","...","Logically, after receiving Ning Zhi's strike, his spiritual power should have diminished somewhat. Why was it still so full?","It wasn't just him; Ning Zhi felt the same.","The two exchanged a glance, simultaneously recalling the talismans Qi Quan had just given them.","Ning Zhi's eyes suddenly lit up. This was...","He couldn't help but look towards the glass wall.","He clearly remembered the teachings Qi Quan had imparted to him and Chen Feilu back at the lakeside villa.","Forbidden arts of the mystical world could also become an aid to cultivators.","The senior had actually researched and created it!","He excitedly raised his peachwood sword and thrust it towards Di Meng!","Since the senior wanted to conduct an experiment, he would do his utmost to fulfill it.","Di Meng had also guessed something and immediately ordered, \"The first half of the team, join the fight!\"","Ning Zhi's team did the same.","Half of each team's members split off and engaged in a melee, while the remaining half stood still in their original positions.","Gradually, everyone began to notice something was off.","\"What's going on? Why do I still have so much spiritual power?\"","\"I just used a big move. I thought my spiritual power was about to run out and I was ready to step down.\"","\"Me too, this is amazing!\"","\"Is it the talisman Senior gave us that's working?\"","\"Heavens, what kind of celestial being is Senior Qi!\"","The above were the team members participating in the melee.","The observing half felt exactly the opposite.","\"I feel my spiritual power fading...\"","\"Me too! And I haven't done anything!\"","\"I remember they weren't usually this fierce. How can they last this long?\"","\"It must be the effect of the senior's talisman.\"","\"Wow, the senior is incredible!\"","\"This is a game-changer on the battlefield!\"","As the fight continued, everyone's spiritual power was nearing depletion, and even the combatants showed signs of fatigue.","Di Meng and Ning Zhi issued orders again.","\"Team One, fall back to replenish! Team Two, engage!\"","The team members were well-trained and executed the commands immediately.","Team One withdrew, Team Two stepped up.","The withdrawn members immediately pulled out spirit talismans and began frantically replenishing their spiritual energy, providing power for their teammates still on the \"battlefield.\"","When the melee had gone on for an hour, all the spiritual power and spirit talismans on everyone were exhausted, and the talisman papers gradually lost their effect.","But they didn't stop until the last trace of spiritual power was drained, collapsing to the ground.","The last one standing was Di Meng.","His cultivation level was the highest, so his victory was expected.","He walked up to Ning Zhi, panting, extended his right hand, his smile exceptionally brilliant. Ning Zhi mustered his strength to reach out and shake it, then with Di Meng's help, stood up, revealing a sincere smile.","Everything was understood without words.","They had personally experienced the benefits brought by the new talisman.","Outside the glass wall, Xie Lanzhou was completely stunned.","He turned to Qi Quan, his gaze burning with intensity. \"A genius. You are the true genius!\"","To have conceived such a talisman!","Li Guoyan's mood was also extremely uplifted. With such a talisman, their chances against the evil cultivators were even greater.","He smiled and made a gesture of invitation.","\"Master, shall we discuss this in the conference room?\"","Qi Quan nodded.","The three humans and one ghost entered the conference room.","Li Guoyan didn't waste words. He directly spread out a map, pointed at the marked locations, and said, \"Master, the local Investigation Department at the evil cultivators' hideout doesn't have high combat strength. If we confront them head-on... it would likely be... But with your new talisman, it will be like adding wings to a tiger. If we can also unite with the local celestial master forces, we might just have a chance of success.\"","\"But the key now is whether the celestial master forces are willing to unite and follow command,\" Xie Lanzhou said.","Back when the mystical world cracked down on evil cultivator organizations, it was mostly a disorganized effort without strong cohesion or trust between parties. It was all thunder but little rain, often hurting themselves as much as the enemy.","Li Guoyan looked at Qi Quan.","\"Master, you have quite a few fans now.\"","Xie Lanzhou: ?","He knew Qi Quan was powerful, but he wasn't clear about her current standing in the mystical world. He only knew her as the Investigation Department's chief consultant, with not much connection to the broader mystical community.","System: [Big shot, is Director Li suggesting you rally those celestial masters to join the fight?]","[Yes.]","[Will you agree?]","Qi Quan: [Why wouldn't I?]","The evil cultivators saw her as a stumbling block, deliberately creating numerous accidents to suppress her fortune. If she didn't act as this \"stumbling block,\" wouldn't she be letting them down?","She didn't hesitate, merely stating, \"I can call upon the celestial masters, but I don't guarantee they will listen to me.\"","Being a fan was one thing; personally going to the battlefield was another.","Li Guoyan smiled and said, \"With your word, that's enough.\"","\"However, with so many combatants, just the few of us drawing talismans won't be enough in time,\" Qi Quan reminded.","Li Guoyan instinctively replied, \"The department has people who can draw talismans.\"","\"Too few in number.\" Qi Quan looked at him. \"I do have an idea, though.\"","\"Please, go ahead.\"","Qi Quan said, \"Start a live stream.\"","The meeting room fell silent.","Li Guoyan was surprised by her unconventional approach, while Xie Lanzhou, having been dead for twenty years, simply couldn't keep up with the tides of the times.","\"I understand.\" Li Guoyan clapped his hands together with a smile. \"I will arrange this as soon as possible. Master Qi only needs to post one Weibo message.\"","Qi Quan nodded.","Talking with smart people was so refreshing; no need for excessive explanations.","Xie Lanzhou, sitting to the side, was completely bewildered.","But he felt it wasn't his place to ask too much about the \"tactics,\" so he said instead, \"Senior Qi, what is the new talisman called? I would also like to learn how to draw it, to contribute my modest effort to crushing the evil cultivators.\"","Qi Quan paused and said, \"I haven't thought of a name. Perhaps Director Li and Mr. Xie could help think of one.\"","The two readily agreed.","This was an honorable matter.","Xie Lanzhou thought for a moment and said, \"This talisman carries a sense of unity and collective will. How about calling it the 'Unity Talisman'?\"","The three of them: \"...\"","The system couldn't help but complain: 【He looks good, but how come his naming sense is so lame?】","\"Doesn't it sound good?\" Xie Lanzhou asked, scratching his head in embarrassment.","Li Guoyan cleared his throat lightly and suggested, \"The Mystic Gate and the Investigation Department are joining forces in this operation, working together with one heart. How about calling it the 'One Heart Talisman'?\"","\"The talisman already has peach blossoms on it. Calling it 'One Heart' sounds a bit weird,\" Xie Lanzhou said.","Li Guoyan frowned. \"What's weird about it? It's about being united in purpose. Don't deliberately misinterpret it.\"","\"I'm not misinterpreting it, but what about others?\"","Li Guoyan said, \"I think 'One Heart Talisman' is excellent.\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","The system couldn't even be bothered to complain anymore.","\"Senior Qi, what do you think?\" Xie Lanzhou handed the decision-making power to Qi Quan.","Qi Quan said with a calm expression, \"Let's just call it...\"","The two pricked up their ears.","\"...the Solidarity Talisman.\"","\"...\"","The meeting room fell silent for a moment. Li Guoyan was the first to regain his composure, praising with a laugh, \"That's a good one! Straightforward and easy to understand, and it won't lead to misinterpretations. Let's go with that!\"","Xie Lanzhou also chimed in, \"Yes, this one is indeed better!\"","Ling Sheng gave her a thumbs-up.","...","【Hahahahaha!】 The system laughed hysterically. 【So, Master, what was the point of asking them for names then?】","In the end, you still had to come up with one yourself.","Qi Quan: ...","And so, the name \"Solidarity Talisman\" was finalized.","The Fu Residence.","Fu Luanfei knocked on the study door and entered only after receiving Fu Jiuchong's permission.","She closed the door, her face filled with excitement, and said, \"Dad, have you heard about the dozens of inspectors whose damaged meridians were healed?\"","The conflict between the Heavenly Master Association and the inspection team was naturally observed by all factions within the Mystic Gate. News of many inspectors suffering meridian damage had spread, and almost everyone believed their cultivation careers were over.","Destroying someone's meridians is a major taboo within the Mystic Gate.","Many factions immediately inquired with their trusted contacts within the Heavenly Master Association. After learning the specific details, they all sensed a whiff of conspiracy.","A proper cultivator wouldn't do such a thing; there must be evil cultivators stirring up trouble behind the scenes.","Fu Jiuchong had guessed as much.","Upon hearing the news of the inspectors' meridian damage, he felt profound regret and heartache.","Back when Jiuge was rescued, her dantian was almost completely destroyed. If not for the Fu family having some remaining resources, secret techniques, and medicines to desperately preserve Jiuge's dantian and prevent further deterioration, she probably wouldn't have held on for so many years.","But even after she woke up, it would be extremely difficult for her to continue cultivating.","When he heard the news that the inspectors had gone to Longjiang City and returned completely recovered and healed, Fu Jiuchong was utterly shocked.","He once thought it might be smoke and mirrors released by the Investigation Department.","However, given the Investigation Department's way of doing things, it was unlikely they would release so much false information simultaneously.","Often, the most unbelievable thing is the truth.","Fu Jiuchong sighed softly and said, \"I've heard. I've already had people verify repeatedly. The injured inspectors have indeed fully recovered, with spiritual energy flowing without the slightest hindrance.\"","The Investigation Department clearly didn't intend to truly hide it.","But how they were cured was left for everyone to guess.","\"Dad, since the Investigation Department has someone who can heal meridians, could they possibly heal dantians as well?\" Fu Luanfei asked hopefully.","What she could think of, Fu Jiuchong naturally could too.","\"You want to ask the Investigation Department to help treat your aunt?\"","\"Yes!\" Fu Luanfei said with heartache. \"Although Auntie hasn't said anything since she woke up, I can tell a heavy weight is pressing on her heart.\"","Fu Jiuchong said, \"Meridians and the dantian are different. Don't get your hopes up too high. Don't tell your aunt about this yet. I'll contact Director Li to inquire.\"","\"Okay, I understand!\"","As news of the healed inspectors spread, more and more Heavenly Masters expressed astonishment.","The Investigation Department is just too impressive!","First, there's the supremely high-level Master Qi holding the fort, and now there's a mysterious physician who can heal cultivators' meridians. How could anyone not be envious?","After various major factions repeatedly confirmed the news without error, Li Guoyan received many phone calls probing indirectly.","\"Director Li, I heard the inspectors with damaged meridians went to the Longjiang City Investigation Department and were healed very quickly?\"","\"Director Li, your department is truly a gathering place for talented individuals, it's really enviable.\"","\"Director Li, it seems Longjiang City is a land blessed with spiritual energy, producing nothing but heroes and outstanding talents.\"","\"Director Li...\"","Li Guoyan had just finished giving vague replies and hanging up when the phone rang again.","He chuckled wryly and answered the call.","\"Director Li, this is Fu Jiuchong.\"","Li Guoyan's mind stirred. He remembered that the detailed file on Fu Jiuge mentioned her dantian had once been severely injured.","...","\"Mr. Fu, please speak your mind.\"","Fu Jiuchong got straight to the point: \"I heard your department has a miraculous physician capable of healing damaged meridians. My sister, Fu Jiuge's dantian was injured in the past and hasn't fully recovered. I wonder if your miraculous physician could also heal dantian injuries?\"","\"If you trust me, you can send Ms. Fu to the Investigation Department. As for whether it can be cured, I dare not make any guarantees,\" Li Guoyan agreed very straightforwardly.","Fu Jiuchong's brow relaxed slightly. \"I naturally trust you. When would be convenient?\"","\"Anytime.\"","\"Good. Can I make arrangements right now?\" Fu Jiuchong didn't want to delay for a moment.","Li Guoyan smiled and said, \"Of course.\"","He had already made an arrangement with Ling Sheng: during his stay in Longjing City, Ling Sheng would treat the Investigation Department's injured personnel.","Yesterday, he had already successfully treated an investigator with a damaged dantian. Presumably, he could also heal Fu Jiuge's injury.","After the call ended, Li Guoyan went to Qi Quan's office.","As Qi Quan needed to stay in Longjing City for this period, the department had set up a temporary office for her.","As the department's Chief Consultant, she rightfully should have her own office. However, since she resided long-term in Longjiang City and the department was short on space and resources, the office originally meant for her had been turned into workspace for investigators. Hence, they temporarily allocated this one.","In the office, Ling Sheng was diligently drawing talismans, with Xie Lanzhou sitting beside him, equally focused.","Qi Quan was cultivating by the window.","Li Guoyan waited until Ling Sheng finished the last brushstroke before speaking. \"Doctor Qi, a wounded individual will be arriving shortly. The injury is to the dantian.\"","Ling Sheng nodded.","\"An injury to the dantian?\" Xie Lanzhou looked up at an opportune moment. \"The one who inflicted that wound is truly ruthless.\"","Li Guoyan smiled. \"When the person arrives, you can accompany Doctor Qi to the infirmary.\"","\"Huh?\" Xie Lanzhou was somewhat bewildered.","The Fu family acted with high efficiency.","Fu Jiuchong personally delivered Fu Jiuge to the entrance of the Investigation Department.","The woman sat in a wheelchair, her hair loose and disheveled, leaning limply against the backrest, appearing as if she had lost her senses.","This was, of course, an act.","The news of Fu Jiuge's awakening had not yet spread.","Back when the Fu family rescued Fu Jiuge, the fact that she had become mentally impaired and her dantian destroyed had spread throughout the mystical community.","Now, with the current turbulent situation, Fu Jiuchong dared not take the slightest risk.","He knew that Fu Jiuge had been hidden by a Buddhist cultivator back then, but others did not know, nor did the remaining members of the malevolent cultivators.","During the year she was missing, whether Fu Jiuge had uncovered any clues about the malevolent cultivators was something no one could guarantee.","If the malevolent cultivator organization learned of Jiuge's awakening, they would rather kill by mistake than let her go. Jiuge would then be in grave danger.","It was better to feign madness for now.","The fact that the Investigation Department could treat meridian damage was already known within the mystical community. His act of sending his sister there to heal her dantian wouldn't raise too much suspicion.","Perhaps many others wished to do the same.","Which family didn't have a few mystics with damaged meridians?","He stood at the entrance, handing the wheelchair's handles to the investigator who came to receive them, and said softly, \"Thank you.\"","The investigator was a young woman who smiled brightly. \"You're welcome.\"","Following Li Guoyan's instructions, she wheeled the patient into the infirmary.","Fu Jiuge kept her eyes closed.","Her emaciated hand rested on her leg, like a soulless puppet.","No one knew her heart was pounding fiercely.","She knew Xie Lanzhou was at the Investigation Department.","...","When she heard her elder brother say he was sending her to the Investigation Department for treatment, her first thought wasn't that her dantian would be healed, but that she could see Xie Lanzhou.","She thought the treatment was merely a pretext.","There simply wasn't anyone in the mystical community who could heal a dantian.","The infirmary door opened.","The young woman said cheerfully, \"Doctor Qi, the patient is here.\"","An electronic voice sounded. \"Please lie down.\"","The investigator lifted Fu Jiuge onto the sickbed.","\"Please leave.\"","The investigator complied, leaving the infirmary and closing the door.","The room fell into silence.","Fu Jiuge, with her eyes closed, could see nothing. She had little spiritual energy left in her body and couldn't use her spiritual sense to perceive her surroundings.","It was too quiet.","She felt somewhat uneasy.","Suddenly, a touch of coolness met her right hand. Just as she was startled and suspicious, a familiar voice fell beside her ear.","\"Jiuge.\"","The voice was very soft, afraid of startling her.","Fu Jiuge's eyes flew open.","Human and ghost met each other's gaze, a thousand words tangled in their hearts.","\"You've gotten so thin,\" Xie Lanzhou said, heart aching.","Fu Jiuge's eyes filled with sorrow. \"Much better than you.\"","\"I'm fine. Being a ghost is quite carefree.\"","Fu Jiuge didn't know whether to laugh or cry. Just as she was about to speak again, three consecutive electronic tones shattered the atmosphere of heartfelt confessions.","\"Treatment commencing. Please remain quiet. Please close your eyes.\"","Human and ghost: \"...\"","Fu Jiuge instinctively looked towards Ling Sheng. The moment her gaze touched him, the bond between mother and child surged over her abruptly.","Her eyes widened in shock.","It was actually two surprises!","She tightly grasped Xie Lanzhou's hand, nervous and excited. \"He, he, he...\"","\"I know. He is our son.\"","A pang of sorrow hit Fu Jiuge's heart, her eyes turning red.","\"Wahhh... child, I'm sorry for you, I truly am sorry for you...\"","Back then, she knew she was pregnant but still decided to go out and pursue the malevolent cultivators; after being injured and having her soul searched, she chose to shut herself away, becoming a mentally impaired person.","It was she who let the child face the world's cruelty and malice alone from the moment of birth.","Although she didn't know how Ling Sheng had lived before, she could imagine how that malevolent cultivator must have tormented and abused the child after she gave birth.","She didn't dare to think about it, yet she forced herself to.","Fu Jiuge sank into immense guilt, not daring to look again at Ling Sheng's calm, indifferent face.","The Fu family didn't know Ling Sheng's identity or what he had experienced; the Investigation Department knew of Ling Sheng's experiences but wouldn't specifically tell her.","Now, beside her, there was only Xie Lanzhou.","She asked urgently, \"Lanzhou, do you know his name? How was his life before?\"","Xie Lanzhou sighed deeply, not intending to hide it from her.","\"His name is Qi Lingsheng. From birth, he was imprisoned by a malevolent cultivator in a mountain cave. It was Senior Qi who found him when killing that cultivator, took him home, hired tutors to teach him to read and write, and passed on the ways of talismans and medicine to him, allowing him to live a normal, healthy life in this world.\"","Fu Jiuge's tears streamed down.","\"We gave him life, but Senior Qi gave him a more complete, meaningful life.\"","That's why he never felt any dissatisfaction with the name \"Qi Lingsheng.\"","This was Ling Sheng's own choice, and as a father in name only, he fully respected it.","Fu Jiuge wept bitterly.","Ling Sheng sat blankly on the chair, watching the two hug and cry incessantly. A strange stirring touched his heart, but more than that, he felt puzzled.","He pulled out his pho...ne and sent a text message to Qi Quan.","Qi Quan, who was in the midst of cultivation, heard the sound and glanced down.","[Ling Sheng: The patient is not following medical advice. What should I do?]","Qi Quan: ?"]},{"number":65,"title":"Chapter 65","paragraphs":["Qi Quan opened the door to the infirmary with a sense of curiosity.","Inside the infirmary, a husband and wife were embracing and weeping. Ling Sheng stared blankly at the electronic audio device, unsure of what to do.","Seeing her enter, the young man's eyes lit up, and he immediately stood up to greet her.","[Ah, Ling Sheng's mother is crying so pitifully.] The system said with a pained heart.","Qi Quan asked, \"Is the treatment done?\"","Ling Sheng shook his head, a hint of confusion appearing in his eyes.","He had pressed the button, but they didn't listen. He couldn't treat the patient.","Qi Quan turned to the human and the ghost.","Fu Jiuge's sobs had already stopped. She lowered her head somewhat shamefully to wipe her tears, while Xie Lanzhou hurriedly handed her a tissue.","\"Sorry, I... I couldn't hold back,\" she said in a hoarse voice. \"Did I delay your matters?\"","Xie Lanzhou slapped his forehead. \"Right! Director Li said you were here to treat your injury. I was so overjoyed to see you that I actually forgot! Where are you injured?\"","\"My dantian is somewhat damaged. Elder Brother used a secret medicine to barely prevent it from worsening.\" Fu Jiuge, her eyes red, looked gently at Ling Sheng. \"Are you the one who will treat me?\"","Ling Sheng immediately returned to his role as the doctor and pressed the button.","\"Please lie down.\"","Xie Lanzhou released his wife, allowing her to lie down slowly.","\"Please close your eyes.\"","Fu Jiuge very much wanted to ask him why he couldn't speak, but now was clearly not the right time.","She obediently closed her eyes.","Ling Sheng sat beside the sickbed, his right hand suspended above her dantian. A gentle spiritual power carefully probed inward.","He clearly \"saw\" that her dantian area was riddled with holes. Even though it was controlled by secret medicine, the amount of spiritual power her dantian could store was extremely meager. There were also some stubborn strands of spiritual energy lingering and wreaking havoc, continuously damaging her dantian.","Those who have never suffered such an injury would find it hard to understand this kind of pain.","Fu Jiuge had lost her sanity for the past twenty years and might not have felt the pain. But since waking up, she had endured this torment day and night.","Fortunately, starting today, she would no longer suffer this pain.","Ling Sheng skillfully captured the \"destructive elements,\" wrapped them with his spiritual power, and removed them all from the dantian.","The pain vanished instantly without a trace.","Fu Jiuge opened her eyes in surprise, her expression exactly the same as every other injured person before her.","Before her surprise could finish, Ling Sheng once again circulated his spiritual power, gently nourishing the damaged dantian and repairing all the wounds. Her originally ice-cold abdomen actually began to feel somewhat warm.","Fu Jiuge's pale, thin cheeks gradually became rosy.","Xie Lanzhou excitedly clenched his fist.","It works, it really works!","With the experience from the first dantian injury patient, Ling Sheng was even more adept this time. He quickly repaired her dantian and withdrew his spiritual power.","Then he looked at Qi Quan.","Qi Quan asked, \"All done?\"","He nodded.","\"Truly amazing.\" These three words now came to her lips effortlessly.","Although he had heard them many times, Ling Sheng still loved hearing them.","The corners of his eyes curved into a smile, and he suddenly opened his arms, making a move as if to hug her.","Qi Quan: ?","A barrier instantly materialized between the two of them.","Ling Sheng bumped his head against the barrier, his eyes widening slightly.","He pointed at Fu Jiuge and Xie Lanzhou, clasped his hands together briefly to indicate their earlier hugging scene, then poked at the barrier between him and Qi Quan, his eyes showing confusion and grievance.","Qi Quan looked at him somewhat helplessly and shook her head.","She really wasn't very accustomed to hugging.","Ling Sheng then pointed to his own forehead, placed the back of his hand to his lips, imitating the scene where Qi Quan had kissed him before.","[Hahahahaha, Boss, is he... asking why you can kiss him, but he can't hug you?] The system's tone was full of gossipy teasing.","Qi Quan: [Is that the same thing?]","[How is it different?]","[I kissed him because I was happy.]","[He saved someone, he's happy too.]","Qi Quan: ...","That made some sense.","Put that way, her refusing his hug really wasn't very fair.","Just as she was feeling conflicted, a sudden \"pfft\" of laughter came from the side.","\"Sorry, I didn't mean to disturb you.\" Fu Jiuge covered her mouth with her hand, smiling as she looked at them. \"I'm healed. Should I leave this place now?\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She expressionlessly dispelled the barrier.","Although Fu Jiuge wanted to get closer to her own child, now was clearly not the right time. Many people outside were waiting for the results of her treatment.","She sat back in the wheelchair and closed her eyes.","Xie Lanzhou stood behind her, his hands gripping the wheelchair handles, a pained look flashing in his eyes before quickly fading away.","He pushed Fu Jiuge out of the infirmary.","Outside the infirmary, a young investigator took over the wheelchair, nodded to Xie Lanzhou, and pushed Fu Jiuge towards the exit of the Investigation Department.","The system sighed: [These two, one became a ghost, the other pretends to be foolish. Ah!]","The man stood in the corridor, watching the wheelchair leave his sight, then turned to face the wall, resting his forehead against it.","[When will these days come to an end!] The system said indignantly. [That evil cultivator organization is truly harmful. This time we must strive to catch them all in one net!]","Qi Quan smiled: [We will.]","Her sleeve was suddenly tugged.","Qi Quan turned her head, meeting Ling Sheng's amber eyes.","The young man extended his phone: [Sorry.]","She asked in surprise, \"Why do you say that?\"","[I made you unhappy earlier.]","Ling Sheng unconsciously picked at his phone case.","Although he really wanted to be close to her, if she didn't like it, he should apologize to her.","The hair on his head seemed listless, lacking its previous vitality.","Qi Quan couldn't help but laugh.","He's quite good at pretending to be pitiful.","However, wanting a hug wasn't a bad thing; it fell within the normal range of human social interaction. His desire to hug indicated he possessed relatively normal human social psychology.","The last time he was imitating Su Wenwen, this time he was imitating Fu Jiuge.","Imitating others showed he had curiosity about the world.","This was a good thing.","She should affirm this.","Considering this, Qi Quan pointed towards Xie Lanzhou, who had his forehead against the wall not far away.","\"If you want to hug someone, you can go to him.\"","Xie Lanzhou definitely wouldn't refuse.","Ling Sheng: ...","System: ...","The young man slowly typed: [He is a ghost.]","Qi Quan paused, unsure how to respond.","The phone was extended again: [I'm going to draw talismans.]","She subconsciously nodded. \"Okay, go ahead.\"","Ling Sheng slowly glanced at her, then turned and left, holding the electronic audio playback device.","He hung his head, his tall, slender back conveying a hint of loneliness.","As he passed by Xie Lanzhou, he suddenly stopped.","The system exclaimed excitedly: [Ah! He wouldn't be listening to you and planning to hug Mr. Xie, would he!]","Qi Quan also raised an eyebrow in surprise.","Unexpectedly, the young man lowered his head, typed a line of text, and held it under Xie Lanzhou's eyes.","Xie Lanzhou, immersed in sorrow: ?","[Go draw talismans.]","Even the period seemed particularly forceful.","Xie Lanzhou's sorrowful mood was abruptly interrupted; it seemed he couldn't feel sad anymore.","He wiped his face. \"Let's go.\"","The man and the ghost walked side by side towards the office.","Xie Lanzhou looked at his cold profile and, thinking of what happened earlier in the infirmary, couldn't help but speak in the tone of an experienced person, lowering his voice: \"Did you want to hug her earlier?\"","Ling Sheng slowed his pace.","The man's eyes lit up. This was promising!","He leaned closer to Ling Sheng and said with great experience, \"You shouldn't have been so abrupt earlier.\"","Ling Sheng pricked up his ears.","Xie Lanzhou wanted to tease him. After building up his anticipation, he deliberately didn't continue.","He waited for Ling Sheng to ask.","To his surprise, Ling Sheng did not continue waiting. Instead, he quickened his pace, returned to the office, sat down in his chair, and began focusing on drawing talismans.","Xie Lanzhou: ???","Seriously? He had built up his appetite so high, so why wouldn't he just ask proactively?","After finishing one talisman, Ling Sheng saw him still standing there pondering his ghostly existence. He then took out a stack of blank talisman papers and placed them in front of Xie Lanzhou's seat. The meaning was quite clear.","If you have nothing better to do, draw talismans.","Xie Lanzhou: ...","Those who ignore the advice of their elders will suffer the consequences.","At the entrance of the Investigation Department, Fu Jiuchong, who had been waiting anxiously, finally saw his sister's figure.","Compared to before she went in, her complexion was noticeably much rosier.","This was...","She was cured?!","Fu Jiuchong, his face filled with excitement, helped her into the car, closed the door to block the prying eyes from outside, and instructed the driver, \"Home.\"","He suppressed his emotions and didn't speak to Fu Jiuge immediately. He held it in all the way home until they entered the study room equipped with an isolation array. Then, with a trembling voice, he asked, \"Jiuge, you... you're better?\"","Fu Jiuge opened her eyes, revealing a comfortable smile. \"I haven't felt this relaxed since I woke up.\"","Her dantian was completely healed; she could continue cultivating!","Fu Jiuchong's eyes reddened, and he smiled sincerely.","In the past twenty years, he had never laughed so freely.","After laughing, he asked, \"Does the Investigation Department really have a miraculous doctor?\"","The smile on Fu Jiuge's lips deepened. \"Yes, a miraculous doctor.\"","\"With Senior Qi Quan already stationed at the Investigation Department, adding such a formidable figure... I'm afraid they will truly lead the Mystic Arts world in the future,\" Fu Jiuchong sighed with emotion.","\"Brother, is that not a good thing?\" Fu Jiuge's gaze was calm.","Fu Jiuchong was taken aback, then suddenly smiled.","\"Right, it's not a bad thing either.\"","No longer tormented by illness, Fu Jiuge's once haggard face radiated a dazzling brilliance.","\"Should we release the news that my dantian is healed?\"","Fu Jiuchong snorted lightly. \"No. Let those people guess.\"","The various factions within the Mystic Arts world were indeed guessing.","\"Was Fu Jiuge really cured or not?\"","\"Unclear. The Fu family hasn't said.\"","\"Looking at the comparison photos from before she went in and after she came out, I feel there should be some effect.\"","\"Should be? Comparison photos? What effect?\"","\"Look, before she went in, her face was very pale. After coming out, her complexion was noticeably much rosier. That means the treatment was effective.\"","\"Really? I can't see it.\"","Some with good relationships grew tired of guessing and called Fu Jiuchong directly.","Yan Fengjun asked with a smile, \"Brother Fu, does the Investigation Department really have a miraculous doctor?\"","\"If your family also has a mystic master with damaged meridians, you can send them to give it a try,\" Fu Jiuchong played coy with him.","Yan Fengjun teased, \"If that's really the case, wouldn't we all end up owing favors to the Investigation Department?\"","\"Would the official side force you to repay a favor?\" Fu Jiuchong said solemnly. \"Admitting that the Mystic Arts world itself lacks the strength to achieve much isn't that difficult.\"","Yan Fengjun laughed. \"Brother Fu speaks... as straightforwardly as ever.\"","In the past, when it came to suppressing evil cultivators, the Mystic Arts world indeed hadn't performed well.","The Yan family also lost many elites, with the most regrettable being Yan Fengqing.","Yan Fengqing was once a top contender for the position of family head. He was both a young seventh-level mystic master and a genius in talisman arts within the Mystic Arts world, with a large following within the family.","But during a mission to pursue an evil cultivator, he accidentally damaged the meridians in his legs, causing his star to fall from then on.","Yan Fengjun originally wanted to compete with him fairly. Under such circumstances, without even a competition, he directly became the head of the Yan family.","Seeing the heartbroken and despairing look in Yan Fengqing's eyes back then, Yan Fengjun didn't feel good either.","He just never expected that Yan Fengqing would get involved with an evil cultivator organization.","Although there was no evidence, the Investigation Department wouldn't detain him in an interrogation room without reason.","The loss of elites happened in many sects and families.","Since then, the Mystic Arts world had been in low spirits for a long time, which allowed evil cultivators to become increasingly rampant in recent years.","\"I'm just stating facts,\" Fu Jiuchong said. \"If you want to know, you might as well go and try it yourself.\"","Yan Fengjun chuckled. \"Thank you, Brother Fu.\"","He hung up the phone, lowered his head in thought for a moment, then dialed Li Guoyan's number.","With Senior Qi Quan and the miraculous doctor stationed at the Investigation Department, the various forces of the Mystic Arts world would eventually accept the Investigation Department's leadership. Yan Fengjun was willing to be the first to bow his head.","However, this time Li Guoyan did not agree directly.","He said, \"Family Head Yan, you also know that injuries like damaged meridians and dantian are extremely difficult to treat. The doctor may not be able to take on so many patients again in a short time.\"","Those investigators at the convalescent home were still waiting for treatment.","He agreed to let Fu Jiuge come because of the natural parent-child relationship between Fu Jiuge and Ling Sheng. Moreover, Xie Lanzhou had provided so many clues to the Investigation Department.","Reuniting a righteous and kind family was an outcome he favored.","Yan Fengjun didn't doubt it either.","Healing meridians and dantian was inherently arduous. Otherwise, why would so many mystic masters have suffered for so many years?","Li Guoyan's answer actually made him more convinced.","He asked, \"I wonder when the doctor will be able to accept patients?\"","Li Guoyan: \"When the time comes, Mr. Yan will naturally be notified.\"","\"Awaiting your good news.\"","Besides Yan Fengjun, others like Yin Yi and Wan Du also called to inquire afterward.","Li Guoyan had only one meaning: Treatment is possible, but show your sincerity.","After all the calls ended, he went to Qi Quan's office.","\"Master, the technical department has already registered a live-streaming account for you. It will only be accessible to Investigation Departments nationwide.\"","That is to say, people outside the Investigation Department wouldn't be able to see the stream.","Qi Quan nodded and posted a Weibo message.","[White Water True Person V: The live-streaming room is now open, for a period of half a month. Details on the official website.]","White Water True Person now had a considerable number of Weibo followers. Moreover, as an \"industry heavyweight,\" she had many active fans.","As soon as the Weibo post went up, many people using fan names commented.","[White Water Goddess, Please Update Today: Ahhhhh! Live stream! Is it the kind of live stream I'm thinking of?! Can I see the living goddess?!]","[White Water Goddess, I Want to Marry You: Did the person above not read clearly? You can only see the stream at the Investigation Department! Wuwuwuwu I hate this! Why didn't I join the Investigation Department earlier!]","[White Water Big Sis, I Want to Have Your Babies: The person above might want to check out the Weibo posted by the official Investigation Department account. There's a surprise!]","[Senior, Take Me Flying: Oh my god! Fellow practitioners, hurry up and sign up! Just by signing up, you can go to the Investigation Department to watch the stream! Big Sis White Water personally live-streaming to impart knowledge, it's definitely full of valuable insights. Maybe after listening, we can advance to the next level hahahaha!]","[Good Thing My Hand Speed is Fast: Hehehe, I've already signed up.]","For a time, mystic masters who received the news all flocked to the official websites of local Investigation Departments to submit their applications.","A live stream from the number one person in the Mystic Arts world probably only happens once in a lifetime. It would be such a loss to miss it!","Many people who saw the official announcement were practically fainting with happiness.","[Aspiring to Be the Top Talisman Master: Fellow practitioners, did you see... the official website says the senior is proficient in sword arts, talisman arts, and array arts? This... this is the world of geniuses, isn't it?]","[Sword Cultivators Are the Coolest: Ahhhhh! I want to watch the stream! I want to learn sword arts from the goddess! I've already signed up!]","【Without formations, you're nothing: Just the Dao of Formations alone is enough to make my head spin, but I never expected the grandmaster to be proficient in three paths!】","For a while, even more Heavenly Masters eagerly signed up.","But before long, someone raised questions on Weibo.","【It's Not Bad Being a Couch Potato: Why wasn't my application approved? My Heavenly Master certificate isn't expired!】","【Heaven Bestow Power Upon Me: Me too! Why won't they let me pass? I want to watch the livestream!】","【Watching the Sky, the Sea, and You: Is the Investigation Department discriminating against people? They pretend to be magnanimous on the surface, but are they actually afraid that Heavenly Masters will learn too much and surpass the investigators?】","【Aspiring to Live to 999: Is this intentional restriction? Can we get an explanation? On what grounds are they rejecting us?】","More and more people clamored online.","The Investigation Department didn't spare their feelings either, directly posting a list. The people on the list all had criminal records, mostly involving illegal activities committed during their youth. According to the laws at the time and their age, it wasn't severe enough for prison, but it definitely indicated major flaws in their character.","The Investigation Department naturally wouldn't allow such people to watch the livestream.","The protesters immediately fell silent.","Other Heavenly Masters were practically dying of laughter. Did they really think the Investigation Department, just because it was newly established, didn't know their backgrounds?","Before its establishment, the Investigation Department had secretly carried out countless missions and uncovered plenty of information.","Most Heavenly Masters were well aware of this.","Apart from weeding out Heavenly Masters with poor character, the Investigation Department also screened the list of applicants and selected many with upright character and good talent, allowing them priority access to watch the livestream at Investigation Department branches.","Local Investigation Departments methodically arranged the livestream viewing.","The various factions of the Mystic Arts world were once again thrown into confusion by the Investigation Department's move.","First the Divine Physician, now a grandmaster's livestream... what were they trying to do?","The Sect Leader, elders, and elite disciples of the Guiyuan Sect had no choice but to convene a meeting.","\"What is a 'livestream'?\" asked an old-fashioned elder.","The sect's chief disciple, Liu Qiang, replied: \"It's where Senior Qi Quan uses a livestreaming platform to teach the Dao methods face-to-face with everyone.\"","His face showed some excitement.","It wasn't just him; the other elite disciples felt the same.","They also wanted to watch the livestream, but without the sect's permission, they didn't dare to sign up casually.","At times like this, they really envied those independent cultivators.","Independent cultivators were free and unfettered, not controlled by any sect. They had probably already filled all the spots!","\"Teach Dao methods?\" Another elder shook his head. \"Every sect's Dao methods are different. How can they be taught?\"","A female disciple spoke up loudly: \"Senior Qi Quan excels in the three paths of Sword, Talisman, and Formations! Although the cultivation heart techniques differ, the skills of these three paths can be taught. Even learning just a little would bring endless benefits.\"","\"That's right, Sect Leader, esteemed elders, the combined talisman invented by Senior Qi Quan, integrating sword techniques and talismans, can fly hundreds of kilometers and accurately shatter a seventh-grade formation!\"","Just this point alone was enough to benefit one for a lifetime.","Yin Yi glanced at the disciples who were clearly itching to go, sighed inwardly, and said, \"If that's the case, it wouldn't hurt to go watch the livestream. Liu Qiang, you enjoy studying the Dao of Formations. Select two more disciples skilled in the Dao of Talismans and the Dao of the Sword to sign up.\"","\"Yes!\"","Other factions reacted similarly.","The Investigation Department was highly efficient, arranging personnel within a single day.","The livestream was scheduled to start at 8 PM.","After finishing dinner, Qi Quan continued to meditate and cultivate.","The system asked: 【Grandmaster, class is about to start. Aren't you going to prepare your lesson?】","【No need.】","In her previous life, she often taught sect disciples. A livestream lecture was nothing major.","Outside the Longjing City Investigation Department branch, many Heavenly Masters were lining up to enter.","The classroom for watching the livestream was arranged in the fourth-floor training ground.","The training ground was very large, capable of accommodating over a thousand people.","There weren't as many Mystic Arts practitioners as one might imagine, and even fewer Heavenly Masters were willing to sign up.","Some failed the character check, some were on missions and unaware, some were too arrogant to think it worth watching, and some were simply too lazy to come.","\"Look! Is that Yan Huai?\"","\"Wow, even Yan Huai is here? He's actually watching a livestream!\"","\"Didn't you know? He's a fan of Senior Qi Quan. His name is on the tipping leaderboard.\"","\"No wonder he came. He's a master of the Sword Dao. I wonder if watching the livestream will help him improve.\"","\"Fu Luanfei from the Fu family is here too!\"","\"And Liu Qiang from the Guiyuan Sect!\"","\"They're all elites from various sects. It seems the top masters also have great trust in Senior Qi Quan.\"","\"Of course! Senior Qi Quan is now the number one figure in the Mystic Arts world!\"","Everyone lined up to enter.","There were no desks or chairs in the training ground, so they could only sit on the floor. Fortunately, they all had cultivation, so sitting on the cold, hard floor didn't bother them.","A projection appeared on one wall of the training ground.","The venue was large, with many sitting in the back dozens of meters away from the screen, but practitioners had keen eyesight, so that distance was nothing.","At 8 PM, the livestream began.","In Investigation Department branches across the country, amidst everyone's eager anticipation, a figure finally appeared on the screen.","Thunderous applause simultaneously erupted in the training grounds as everyone used their phones to enter the livestream room, sending a variety of gifts to express their respect.","Only those inside the Investigation Department branches could use their phones to access the livestream room.","Qi Quan sat in front of the livestream camera, her long hair loosely tied at the back. Her exceptionally beautiful face was very photogenic, glowing with a soft, moist luster under the lights.","Her eyes were deep and serene, like the vast ocean or the boundless starry sky, calm and undisturbed when gazing into the distance. But everyone knew what immense, powerful energy lay beneath the sea's surface and within the cosmos.","It inspired awe.","Qi Quan had no idea what her \"students\" were thinking.","She addressed the camera: \"The livestream will be one hour daily. I will first discuss the Sword Dao, then the Talisman Dao, and finally the Formation Dao. Each segment will be twenty minutes. You may not leave early, but those only interested in one path can rest for forty minutes during the class.\"","The classrooms burst into laughter, and comments on the screen scrolled rapidly.","There was also some hushed conversation.","\"I never thought the grandmaster, who seems so serious, could be quite humorous.\"","\"I love her even more now, what should I do!\"","\"The grandmaster is the grandmaster. 'I don't care if you sleep in class.'\"","\"Because who would dare to sleep!\"","Qi Quan wasted no time and directly began explaining the Sword Dao.","Her knowledge was extensive, and she had taught many classes. She had no script in hand, but one in her mind, speaking without pause while students in the \"classroom\" took notes furiously.","\"The Sword Dao should not be confined to traditional sword techniques and methods. It can be combined with other Dao methods to create new forms of attack. For example, the combination of Sword Dao and Talisman Dao, or Sword Dao and Formation Dao. That's all for the Sword Dao for now. Let's begin the Talisman Dao.\"","The comment section went wild.","【The combination of Sword Dao and Talisman Dao! That's the combined talisman the grandmaster invented! I really want to hear the senior explain the combined talisman!】","【So much substantial content. The senior's understanding of the Sword Dao is truly profound.】","【We've already witnessed the combination of Sword Dao and Talisman Dao firsthand. What about Sword Dao and Formation Dao? How can those two be combined? Will the senior explain that later?】","Qi Quan took out a Unity Talisman and held it up to the camera, asking, \"Has anyone seen this talisman before?\"","[No.]","[Never seen it.]","[Ahhhh! Is this a new talisman created by the senior?!]","[Respect!]","Qi Quan smiled and said, \"It's a talisman I created a few days ago. I won't reveal its name just yet. Today, I'll only teach you how to draw this talisman. If any talisman masters present have brought talisman paper, cinnabar, and a brush, you might as well follow along. Once you learn this talisman, there will be an unexpected surprise.\"","[Wow! Today was really worth it!]","[The master is truly not keeping secrets for herself.]","[Am I the only one who wants to know what kind of surprise it is?]","[I want to know too! It's a pity I'm not a talisman master!]","[Talisman masters are so lucky!]","Getting to learn a new talisman for free sounded enviable to anyone.","Carrying talisman-drawing tools was a habit for every talisman master.","All the talisman masters stared intently at the screen.","On the screen, the camera angle lowered, focusing on the desk, capturing only Qi Quan's hands.","[The senior's hands... no, the way she holds the talisman brush is so beautiful!]","[Screenshotting to admire! This talisman paper looks so good!]","[The color of the cinnabar is also gorgeous.]","The comments were from Taoist masters who didn't understand the art of talismans.","The talisman masters who did understand the art were all staring at the screen, not daring to blink, afraid of missing the senior's brushwork technique and sequence.","The talisman pattern was completed in one fluid motion, a faint golden light flashing briefly.","Warm applause erupted once again in various training grounds.","The talisman masters' hands were red from clapping.","After drawing one talisman, Qi Quan explained the drawing method she had just used. Her teaching was profound yet easy to understand, not confusing but enlightening.","\"I'll give you ten minutes. Those who can draw the complete talisman pattern on the spot should hand it over to the Investigation Department staff after the livestream ends and register.\"","[What if we can't draw it on the spot?]","\"For those who don't draw it on the spot, bring it to the next class.\"","In the Director's office, Li Guoyan, watching the livestream, couldn't help but smile.","Actually, the Unity Talisman was the key to this livestream.","The Unity Talisman, well, it's about uniting everyone to draw it together.","There were so many investigators and Taoist masters across the country, requiring a vast number of Unity Talismans. It was impossible for Qi Quan, Ling Sheng, and Xie Lanzhou to draw them all.","Therefore, this method was used to involve talisman masters of good character.","Of course, this didn't mean swordsmen and formation masters were useless.","Qi Quan would also teach them various combat skills during the livestream.","And the upcoming...","formation explanations were prepared for the investigators of the local Investigation Departments across the country.","From now on, all national Investigation Departments would enter a state of readiness for battle. Each department would formulate corresponding combat plans based on the specific situation of the local cultist bases.","The one-hour livestream ended quickly. The Taoist masters listened with great interest, completely unwilling to leave.","\"Why doesn't the senior establish her own school? I really want to hear her teach the Dao every day!\"","\"Even if she established a school, it wouldn't be your turn to join.\"","\"How can you say that!\"","\"Based on your low cultivation level, you wouldn't qualify to enter!\"","\"Want to compare?\"","\"Let's compare then!\"","Liu Qiang took his junior brother and sister back to the Guiyuan Sect and immediately went to see the Sect Leader.","All three of them looked very excited.","Yin Yi felt a pang in his heart. His good disciples had become someone else's fans.","He put on a stern face and asked, \"How was the livestream? Was it helpful?\"","Liu Qiang said excitedly, \"Senior Qi taught a new type of formation, one I've never seen before.\"","The junior sister specializing in talismans said joyfully, \"She also taught us a new talisman!\"","The junior brother specializing in swordsmanship said with a flushed face, \"Senior Qi's comprehension of the Sword Dao is truly profound!\"","Yin Yi: \"...\"","He asked incredulously, \"She really taught you all that?\"","Which faction in the Mystic World doesn't keep their secrets?","Want to learn? Sure, join the sect first.","The Guiyuan Sect never passed on its various Dao techniques to outsiders. Even the most basic talisman patterns were never taught to outsiders.","Yin Yi truly didn't want to believe that someone would selflessly teach their own Dao techniques, let alone new formations and talismans!","For a moment, he felt an immense sense of respect.","Compared to Qi Quan, the entire Mystic World seemed somewhat narrow-minded.","He waved his hand, dismissing the three, and pondered for a long time. Certain ideas began to take root and sprout in his heart.","Manor in the Beijing suburbs.","Yan Fengqing listened to the steward's report and frowned.","\"A new talisman? A new formation? Teaching the Sword Dao?\"","The steward nodded and said, \"Although the Taoist masters who watched the livestream kept tight-lipped, we managed to glean some information from their words. After collating and analyzing it, we confirmed she taught a new talisman and a new formation.\"","\"Can we find out what the new talisman and formation are?\" Yan Fengqing asked.","The steward shook his head. \"They reportedly signed a confidentiality agreement. The specifics of the new talisman and formation cannot be found out.\"","Once a Taoist master signs a confidentiality agreement, unless facing life or death, they won't break their promise.","Given the current severe situation and the fact that \"that person\" was at the most critical juncture, the organization couldn't afford any more disturbances. Concealment was better than exposure.","He snorted coldly. \"It's just a show to gain popularity. Relying on Qi Quan's reputation to attract more followers. They're all just low-level Taoist masters, not worth worrying about.\"","The steward deeply agreed and also didn't take it too seriously.","But there was one thing he wasn't sure whether to mention.","\"Hesitating like that, just say what you have to say,\" Yan Fengqing said impatiently, his face cold.","The steward secretly took a deep breath and said, \"I also heard a piece of news, saying that the Investigation Department indeed has a miraculous doctor who can treat damage to meridians and dantians. Even...\"","Yan Fengqing subconsciously gripped the armrests of his wheelchair, staring at him intently.","\"Even what?\"","\"Even the Fu Family Head sent his sister to the Investigation Department, and she seems to have received good treatment.\"","Yan Fengqing was stunned for a long moment, then suddenly let out a short, sharp laugh.","\"Even if it's an act, they should follow basic logic. Using a 'miraculous doctor' as a gimmick, are the people in the Mystic World fools? How can they... believe that?\"","The steward said, \"But this undoubtedly gives the Investigation Department even greater authority.\"","No one was unaware of how strong an attraction a physician capable of treating meridian and dantian injuries held for Taoist masters.","Probably not a single sect leader or family head could sit still.","Yan Fengqing gritted his teeth. \"I don't believe it. It's all fake.\"","The steward wanted to say more but was silenced by his gloomy gaze.","\"How much longer for 'that person'?\"","The steward frowned. \"Recently, the Investigation Department has been managing things strictly. Checkpoints are set up everywhere, and the monitoring teams within the Taoist Master Association are also keeping a close eye on the masters. Many things have been delayed.\"","\"No matter how slow, it's almost time,\" Yan Fengqing said. \"After the family competition ends, everything will be reorganized.\"","He gazed in the direction of the main Yan Family residence, a cold smile playing on his lips.","Time flew by.","Half a month passed in a flash. The Taoist masters who participated in watching the livestreams benefited greatly. Their respect for Qi Quan rose steadily, and they even began to feel a sense of belonging towards the Investigation Department.","When the final day ended, many Taoist masters were reluctant to leave, lingering for a long time.","\"I sat on that spot for fifteen days!\"","\"Who didn't?\"","\"I sparred with the person behind me after class every day. We even developed a bond through fighting.\"","\"Oh right, didn't the senior say there would be a surprise for those who learned to draw the new talisman?\"","\"Could the surprise be teaching another new talisman?\"","\"Don't dream about it!\"","\"Just received a notice: Masters who submitted talismans can collect an equivalent amount of talisman-making tools and an invitation card.\"","\"Although I don't mind the used talisman paper and cinnabar, the Investigation Department's gesture truly makes me feel appreciated.\"","\"What is the invitation card for?\"","\"It seems to be an opportunity to enter the live stream next time!\"","\"Oh my! Is that true?\"","\"Absolutely true!\"","\"Wuwuwu, why is it only for Talisman Masters?\"","\"Perhaps... the talismans drawn by Talisman Masters are actually useful?\"","\"We Sword Masters are useful too!\"","\"Formation Masters refuse to be left behind!\"","The Investigation Department timely stepped in to explain: \"Talisman Masters have already made contributions to the Investigation Department, hence they receive an invitation card.\"","\"We can also contribute! Why deprive us of the right to choose? Wuwuwu.\"","Investigation Department: \"The time for contributions has not yet arrived. Please wait patiently for the notice. All Masters who participate in making contributions will receive an invitation card. Those with higher contribution values will receive more benefits.\"","\"What are 'more benefits'?\"","The Investigation Department kept it mysterious: \"You'll find out later.\"","Upon hearing this, the Masters excitedly left the Investigation Department, eagerly rubbing their hands in anticipation of the notice.","They were not fools.","From the Investigation Department's actions, most of them guessed that the department might be planning a major operation soon.","And this major operation was closely related to the Mystic Arts community.","As members of the Mystic Arts community, they were willing to contribute!","Everyone sensed the impending storm.","Several days later, the Yan family's internal competition finally arrived.","Yan Fengqing took a car to the main family estate.","This was the first time in many years he had set foot in the main family estate.","The main estate hadn't changed at all, still exuding the sternness and decay of an aristocratic family.","Yan Fengqing sat in his wheelchair, pushed by a steward, and entered the main gate under the scrutiny of the crowd.","The competition arena was quite far from the main gate.","...","As the competition approached, every corner of the mansion was filled with tension and excitement.","Yan Fengqing passed through long corridors and pavilions, finally arriving at the entrance of the competition arena.","There was something extra on both sides of the entrance compared to previous years.","Yan Fengqing asked, \"What are these?\"","Several rows of flower baskets placed outside the competition arena? Was it for opening celebrations or welcoming guests?","He swept his spiritual sense over the flower baskets but detected nothing unusual.","The steward said, \"I heard this was Young Master Yan Huai's instruction.\"","\"He seems cold and heartless, yet has such a hobby.\"","Yan Fengqing scoffed, suppressing an inexplicable unease in his heart, and slowly entered the competition arena.","Inside the arena, Yan Huai looked down at his phone.","The steward's face flashed briefly on the screen, marked in black.","Black indicated being implanted with a puppet talisman; red indicated having taken the Bloody Pill.","His expression unchanged, he put away his phone.","Yan Geng suddenly leaned over, looking nervous. \"Brother Huai, it's bad!\"","Yan Huai: \"What is it?\"","\"Among the branch family members, there are several at Level 5, third and second tiers. They just suddenly advanced to Level 6 while waiting backstage!\"","Yan Huai himself was at Level 6 when he competed back then, unmatched among his peers, winning immense support for the main family.","But this year, is the main family going to lose its edge?","Several Level 6 practitioners—how can we compete with that?","Yan Huai's face remained calm. \"It's fine.\"","Yan Geng was on the verge of tears.","Aren't you really worried at all about the main family losing face?","At the same time, Investigation Department branches across the country reported to headquarters.","\"Formations are in position. Awaiting instructions.\"","Li Guoyan's expression was stern, his energy focused and steady.","\"Execute as planned.\""]},{"number":66,"title":"Chapter 66","paragraphs":["The Yan Family Competition Arena.","On the viewing platform, Yan Fengjun sat in the center, with Yan Fengqing seated in a wheelchair beside him. Both were Level Seven Celestial Masters. Two other stewards had recently broken through to Level Seven, and the remaining one, a Level Six, held little presence.","The appointed time had arrived. Yan Fengjun issued the command: \"Let the competition begin.\"","He had already received news that several disciples from the collateral branches had just broken through to Level Six. In this competition, the main family might be at a disadvantage.","He instinctively glanced at Yan Huai below the stage.","Yan Huai still wore his usual cold and stern demeanor, as if nothing weighed on his mind.","Was he truly unconcerned, or did he have a well-laid plan?","Since catching a glimpse of the shrewdness hidden beneath Yan Huai's exterior, Yan Fengjun had begun trying to interpret him from a different angle.","After news spread of the collateral branch disciples' breakthroughs to Level Six, the main family disciples participating in the competition, aside from a few with firm resolve, all sat listlessly in the main family's waiting area like frost-bitten eggplants.","Hearing the competition begin, they forced themselves to muster their spirits, waiting to enter the arena.","The competition was presided over by Yan Huai.","He leapt onto the referee's platform and announced the list of the first contestants.","To save time, the arena was divided into six sections, each enveloped by a formation. Whoever was forced out of their formation first would lose.","The formation also served another purpose: to promptly protect the safety of the competing disciples. If an opponent used a lethal move judged as such by the formation, the formation would first eject the opponent from the arena, preventing anyone from losing control in the heat of battle and causing unnecessary casualties.","Twelve contestants entered the arena simultaneously.","The order of appearance and the match pairings were determined by lot drawn by the participants themselves, with no distinction made for cultivation level.","Within the family, any disciple aged eighteen or above but under thirty, with a cultivation level above Level Four but below Level Seven, could register for the competition.","Of course, those who had participated in previous sessions were not allowed to compete again.","Even if a Level Four drew a match against a Level Six, they had to grit their teeth and face it.","In a family competition, a Level Four inherently stood little chance of winning. Unless they could defeat a higher-level opponent, it was better to seize the opportunity to spar with a high-level Celestial Master, as they might gain significant insights.","The competition was in full swing.","All electronic devices were blocked within the arena to prevent leaks of the family's internal matches, which could lead to targeting by other families at next year's Grand Assembly of the Mystic Arts.","Longlin City Investigation Division.","Qi Quan had already taken her seat before the formation.","On the night the live stream ended, she had secretly come to the Longlin City Investigation Division and personally set up this formation.","Although both Longlin City and Longtang City possessed Level Nine formations, Qi Quan had a vague intuition that the person she wanted to uncover would be in Longlin City.","The spiritual energy and fortune of Hengfeng Sect far surpassed other places.","She had noticed this the first time she came to Longlin City.","But at the time, she hadn't seen anything particularly unusual, merely assuming the location of Hengfeng Sect had exceptionally good feng shui.","Who could have guessed that such an excellent place concealed such horrifying and shocking crimes?","Qi Quan placed the Level Nine Composite Sword Talisman into the formation's core.","[Ahhhh! It's about to start!] The system shouted, both excited and anxious.","Once the various formations were broken, the Cultivator organization would undoubtedly dispatch their most powerful forces to obstruct the Investigation Division and the Mystic Arts community from entering the mountains for the purge.","A major confrontation was imminent.","Simultaneously, all Celestial Masters who had participated in watching the live stream received notifications from their local Investigation Divisions.","[Greetings, Celestial Master XXX. Recently, a Cultivator organization has been running rampant, acting recklessly, harming countless civilians, and committing heinous crimes! The authorities have decided to organize a large-scale purge operation and call upon individuals of conscience to join this battle to defend justice! If you are willing... to participate, please proceed immediately to XXXX location to accept command from the Investigation Division.]","The Celestial Masters: ???","Was this the opportunity to obtain an invitation card that the Investigation Division mentioned before?","What are we waiting for? Hurry up and go!","If you're late, there might not be a spot left!","Almost the instant the messages were sent, across the nation, all Investigation Divisions involved in the case simultaneously unleashed a blazing sword light.","The sword lights streaked across the azure sky, flying like meteors towards various strongholds, striking the protective formations of the Cultivator bases almost at the same time.","The Celestial Masters hastily rushing to their destinations were stunned.","Heavens! It's the light from a Composite Talisman Sword!","If one could look down upon the earth from high above, an extremely magnificent and grand scene would unfold.","Thirty sword lights instantly shattered the protective formations of the Cultivator strongholds.","The righteous sword light obliterated every hidden darkness.","Although they could have continued using the sword lights to destroy the bases, considering there might still be living children and other hostages inside, the Investigation Division did not continue using the Composite Talismans.","Some smaller bases had weaker reserves. After their formations shattered, with no backup formations, the Cultivators had no time to react before being firmly subdued by the waiting investigators and the Celestial Masters who had rushed to the scene in time!","Large bases had ample resources.","For instance, at the Longlin City Cultivator stronghold, after the Level Nine protective formation was shattered, the Cultivators reacted swiftly, activating a backup Level Nine formation, once again blocking the personnel arriving for the purge.","Many personnel participated in the Longlin City purge operation.","Under the deterrence and allure of the \"Human Emperor Realm Grandmaster\" and the \"Divine Physician,\" following Fu Jiuchong's lead, the leaders of many sects and families contacted Li Guoyan, showing signs of allegiance.","The large-scale live stream suddenly launched by the Investigation Division made them sense an unusual shift in the atmosphere.","High-level Celestial Masters possessed sharp intuition.","The authorities were about to make a major move!","If they didn't actively participate this time, they might lose all presence within the Mystic Arts community in the future.","Taking a step back, it was the authorities' inevitable duty to eradicate Cultivators, and as members of the Mystic Arts community, combating Cultivators was inherently part of their responsibility.","Moreover, the authorities' show of force this time was so grand, clearly indicating they had a well-laid plan.","If they missed this opportunity to show their face and earn merits, their standing within the Mystic Arts community would only become more difficult in the future.","Just the \"Divine Physician\" alone was enough to make her \"hard to get an appointment with.\"","The leaders made decisive decisions, following the command of the Investigation Headquarters.","Outside the Longlin City Cultivator stronghold, Master Yin, Fu Jiuchong, and other Level Seven and Eight elders from sects and families were all standing ready.","Behind them were the young and vibrant investigators.","Further back were the multitude of Celestial Masters who had rushed to the scene.","Everyone shared a common hatred for the enemy.","\"Such a grand gesture indeed!\"","Witnessing another Level Nine formation light up, Di Meng said with a serious expression.","Longlin City was a key area, and the elite forces of the Investigation Headquarters had been deployed.","Ning Zhi's expression was grave: \"A fierce battle is imminent.\"","As soon as the words fell, another earth-shattering sword light streaked across, accurately shattering the Level Nine formation.","The Cultivators inside the base were shocked.","What in the world were those two sword lights just now!","Inside Hengfeng Sect, Yu Lanzhi stood up in astonishment.","Two layers of Level Nine formations... just gone like that?","They had previously estimated that, whether from the authorities or the Mystic Arts community, there were only three ways to break a Level Nine formation.","Either a Human Emperor Realm cultivator expended most of their spiritual power in one strike to shatter it; or a formation master of the same level was dispatched to exhaust their mental energy unraveling the formation; or countless attack talismans were used to deplete the formation's spiritual energy.","None of these options seemed realistic.","Qi Quan was indeed powerful, capable of shattering a ninth-grade formation with a single strike, but that blow would absolutely consume an immense amount of her spiritual power. If another ninth-grade formation appeared, she would be hard-pressed to handle it. Even if she exhausted all her spiritual power to break it, once the formation vanished, just a few eighth or ninth-grade Celestial Masters could easily wear her down and finish her off.","A formation master of the same level could break one formation only to face another. If the formation in Longlin City was gone, what about the formations in other regions?","As for the last option, aside from wasting talismans, it held no meaning whatsoever.","But who could have imagined that just two sword beams could destroy a ninth-grade formation!","Yu Lanzhi suddenly felt a pang of panic.","He abruptly remembered the news he had heard before.","Yan Fengqing's residence in Longjing City had been destroyed remotely by two sword beams.","He hadn't paid it any mind at the time, assuming it was just Qi Quan using sword techniques to pierce the formation, and the \"remote\" part was merely a distorted rumor.","But now, the facts were laid bare before his eyes.","Just as he was at a loss, a figure drifted to his side.","\"It's merely the shattering of a formation, no need to worry. The Venerable's cultivation is nearing completion. As long as the puppets hold off those ants outside, once the Venerable attains Human Immortality, what is there left to fear?\"","Upon hearing this, Yu Lanzhi instantly felt reassured and said respectfully, \"Elder Shi's words are most true.\"","This Elder Shi was a favorite in front of the Venerable, specializing in making those medicinal pills.","Thanks to these pills, the organization had developed rapidly over the years, obtaining considerable fortune for the Venerable, allowing him to be on the verge of breaking through to the Human Immortal realm recently!","Those Celestial Masters outside, at most seventh-grade, wouldn't even withstand a single major technique from a ninth-grade Celestial Master.","With two layers of formations broken, the Cultivator base had no choice but to dispatch several high-grade Celestial Masters and numerous mid to low-grade ones.","The highest among them was eighth-grade, the same as the official side.","But the Cultivators held Bloodburst Pills, allowing them to temporarily elevate their grade by one at any moment.","On the official side, the leaders were an eighth-grade elder from the Guiyuan Sect and an eighth-grade elder from the Fu family.","They each held a Unity Talisman.","Behind them, investigators and Celestial Masters all gripped a Unity Talisman, distributed by the Investigation Department.","At the command, everyone unhesitatingly channeled spiritual power into their Unity Talismans and dripped in a drop of blood from their fingertips.","Although the later-joining Celestial Masters didn't know the exact use of this talisman, they knew it was the very one Grandmaster Qi had taught them to draw during the half-month live stream!","The commander for this battle was Di Meng.","He divided the forces into Group A and Group B, leading one group himself while Ning Zhi led the other.","The official eighth-grade elders and the Cultivator eighth-grade Celestial Masters faced off in mid-air, neither side making the first move.","Seeing the Unity Talismans in the officials' hands, the Cultivators had no idea what they were, simply assuming the officials were so destitute they'd use any shabby talisman, and couldn't help but sneer contemptuously.","\"With just these third-rate Celestial Masters, you think you can breach the base?\" one Cultivator mocked.","Another chimed in, \"Where on earth did you get the courage?\"","They had been stationed at the base for so many years without a proper fight and had long wanted to kill a few high-grade Celestial Masters for fun.","Today, they were delivered right to their doorstep.","A third Cultivator said steadily, \"Today is not the day for a major conflict.\"","The other Cultivators all tensed up.","The Venerable had reached a critical moment; the base truly couldn't afford any further complications.","If it weren't for the fact that all the ninth-grade Celestial Masters were protecting the ritual, they wouldn't have had to come out. Sending a ninth-grade Celestial Master would have blasted these intruders back home with a single technique...","But the official and orthodox forces were poised for a purge, and now with the formations broken, even if they wanted to avoid a major conflict, they had no choice but to grit their teeth and hold the line, keeping them outside.","\"Regardless, we must repel them first,\" one Cultivator said with a grim expression, pulling out a Bloodburst Pill.","If it weren't for the recent years being critical for the Venerable's advancement to Human Immortality, why would they have needed to hide? With their grades, they could have dominated the orthodox world long ago.","But the Venerable had said that before their strength was enough to look down on everyone, they couldn't take steps too large, or they would easily attract the attention of the authorities.","This attention wasn't just about the establishment of the Investigation Department, but could provoke suppression with the authorities' heavy weaponry.","The organization hid deep, revealing little of its power, so the authorities wouldn't deploy those weapons, buying him time to advance to the Human Immortal realm.","Once he became a Human Immortal, with life as eternal as the heavens, he could roam freely between heaven and earth.","Now it seemed the Venerable was right.","This time, the authorities only sent some small fry.","The others also took out their Bloodburst Pills.","\"Attack!\" Di Meng didn't give them a chance to upgrade, directly giving the order.","The two eighth-grade elders instantly brandished their peach wood swords.","Eighth-grade sword beams shot towards several Cultivators simultaneously, forcing them to abandon taking the pills and raise their magical instruments to meet the attack.","With the big shots engaged, everyone else charged forward.","However, the Cultivators lacked organization. Like the orthodox sects of the past, they were a scattered mess. The official side, commanded by Di Meng, had well-trained investigators leading the newly joined Celestial Masters in an assault on the Cultivator organization's enforcers.","Group A attacked first, with Group B behind them replenishing spiritual power.","In mid-air, the Cultivator organization's eighth-grade Celestial Masters felt something increasingly wrong as the fight progressed.","They were indeed eighth-grade, but according to strict grade subdivisions, they were actually a minor stage higher than those two eighth-graders. How was it that their own spiritual power was nearly half depleted, while these two were still outputting so fiercely?","Impossible!","The Fu family's eighth-grade elder was a female Celestial Master.","Sensing their thoughts, the female Celestial Master couldn't help but sneer, \"You upgraded using pills soaked in human blood. Did you never consider that your realms might be utterly hollow?\"","\"...\"","A sword beam from the female Celestial Master shot forth, its spiritual power incredibly dense. Striking one of the Cultivators, he cried out in pain, his spiritual power destabilizing, and actually fell from mid-air.","\"How is this possible?!\" the other Cultivators exclaimed in shock.","Having fought until now, everyone's spiritual power was nearly spent. How could these two still unleash major techniques?","It wasn't just the eighth-grade Celestial Masters' battle; the same was true for the mixed combat involving seventh-grade and sixth-grade Celestial Masters.","On the ground, Yin Yi, Fu Jiuchong, and others were locked in fierce combat with seventh-grade Cultivators. Even when the Cultivators' spiritual power was nearly exhausted and they swallowed Bloodburst Pills, temporarily rising to eighth-grade, they couldn't withstand the relentless attacks from the seventh-grade Celestial Masters.","Was their spiritual power a bottomless pit?!","Fu Jiuchong's sword pierced a Cultivator's dantian, his domineering spiritual power viciously churning inside. The Cultivator screamed as his spiritual power scattered everywhere, quickly becoming a cripple. He was instantly slain by other lower-grade Celestial Masters, his soul not even spared.","The man showed no mercy.","Thinking of the suffering his sister and brother-in-law had endured, he couldn't bring himself to be lenient.","These demons had harmed so many innocent lives; death ten thousand times over wouldn't be enough to atone for their crimes!","On another front, Yin Yi also slew many Cultivators.","The orthodox world had suffered humiliation for so many years, losing so many elites. In today's battle, they were determined to settle accounts with the Cultivators thoroughly!","After a long fight, fatigue began to show on everyone's faces...","Di Meng seized the moment and commanded, \"Group A, retreat! Group B, advance!\"","The situation on the battlefield shifted instantly.","Ning Zhi led Group B in a charge.","The Cultivators were exhausted one by one. Though they had pills and talismans to replenish spiritual power, in terms of stamina, they were completely no match for Group B, who had been holding back until now.","The eighth-grade Cultivators in mid-air finally realized something was wrong.","The authorities were actually using a rotation tactic!","But that doesn't make sense either. Even if they're using a war of attrition strategy, why hasn't the opponent's spiritual power been exhausted yet?","They haven't even used spirit talismans to replenish their energy up to now!","The demonic cultivators had no way of knowing, this was all thanks to the Unity Talisman.","Before Qi Quan created the Unity Talisman, Li Guoyan wasn't very confident about destroying the demonic cultivator organization, given the vast disparity in strength between the two sides.","The official side had only one top-tier expert, Qi Quan. The number of other Level 8 and Level 7 Celestial Masters paled in comparison to the demonic cultivator organization.","Although most of the demonic cultivators had boosted their levels using pills, a gap in cultivation realm was still a gap. Moreover, they also had Bloodburst Pills.","The appearance of the Unity Talisman undoubtedly greatly increased the official side's chances of victory.","Both the Composite Sword Talisman and the Unity Talisman were achievements credited to Qi Quan.","The investigators and Celestial Masters of Team B were fiercely engaged in battle, while Team A rested and replenished their spiritual power within the protective formation at the rear.","The protective formation was also a composite talisman provided by Qi Quan. After she taught Xie Lanzhou, it was Xie Lanzhou who supplied them to the Investigation Department.","During the fifteen days of the live broadcast, the Investigation Department had made countless preparations.","They would either not strike at all, or they would completely eradicate the demonic cultivator organization!","With the aid of the Composite Sword Talismans and Unity Talismans, the battles at the lower-level bases in other regions concluded swiftly. Local Investigation Departments, leading the participating Celestial Masters, successively destroyed one demonic cultivator base after another, capturing dozens or hundreds of demonic cultivators and rescuing numerous children and other victims.","Reports of victories kept streaming into the Dragon Capital headquarters. Li Guoyan's grave expression gradually softened, but the biggest stone had yet to fall.","Dragon Rain City.","Inside the largest base of the Tianqi Organization, three Level 9 Celestial Masters stood guard outside the cave abode, protecting the Venerable One within.","The base producing the pills was hidden beneath a mountain valley pool, but the Venerable One's cultivation site was built into a cliff face.","They had carved a cave abode into the cliff and constructed a resplendent, golden palace inside it.","Isolated by a Level 9 formation, no one knew of its existence.","Outside the cliffside cave abode, the three Level 9 Celestial Masters looked down at the fierce battle below. Their initial confidence had turned to doubt and unease.","\"How can this be?\" one Celestial Master, with arrogant red hair, spoke, his expression no longer arrogant.","In their view, the official and orthodox sects' battle plan was simple: one group gets tired, another group takes over.","But something just felt off.","Why was those people's spiritual endurance so long?","They had never seen those people replenish their energy during combat, only using spirit talismans after being rotated out.","A Celestial Master with a goatee said, \"Could it be due to the influence of the pills?\"","They had all taken Enlightenment Pills. Enlightenment Pills could increase cultivation speed, allowing them to advance to Level 9 in a short time.","Although Enlightenment Pills were useless for advancing from Level 9 to Human Sovereign Realm, Level 9 was already enough for them. Their lifespans were already much longer than ordinary people's.","With such a long lifespan, why worry about not advancing to Human Sovereign Realm?","Perhaps it was precisely because their cultivation speed was too fast, leading to unstable foundations and poor spiritual power endurance?","The Red-haired Celestial Master frowned, \"Impossible. It's not like we haven't encountered properly cultivated Celestial Masters before. They weren't this formidable.\"","The last Celestial Master had a scar on his face and a fierce glare. \"What's there to fear? Kill one if they come, kill two if a pair arrives.\"","No matter what, they had to ensure the Venerable One's advancement.","Suddenly, a light chuckle reached their ears.","\"Who's there?!\" The Red-haired Celestial Master sharply looked up, his sinister gaze sweeping the surroundings.","The Goatee Celestial Master was puzzled, \"What are you doing? Seeing ghosts.\"","\"Didn't you hear that?\" The Red-haired Celestial Master's thick brows knitted tightly.","The Scarred Celestial Master was displeased, \"Don't disrupt morale.\"","The Red-haired Celestial Master: \"...\"","He really did hear laughter, a woman's laughter!","But the other two simply didn't believe him.","He curled his lip and continued focusing on his guard duty.","Before he could steady his mind, another soft sigh landed by his ear.","\"Who is it?!\" he shouted again, \"Who's playing tricks! Get the hell out here!\"","The Goatee Celestial Master said impatiently, \"Will you stop already? Now is not the time for your jokes!\"","The Scarred Celestial Master glared coldly, already extremely displeased.","\"I'm not joking!\" The Red-haired Celestial Master was utterly exasperated, \"Why would I? Why won't you believe me?\"","\"Then tell us, you're only Level 9, First Tier. We're both Level 9, Second Tier. Why can you hear it and we can't? Are you looking down on us?\"","The Red-haired Celestial Master: \"What if the other party intentionally only let me hear?\"","The Scarred Celestial Master snorted coldly, \"What nonsense are you spouting? Besides the Venerable One, who else in the orthodox sects could do that?\"","They were all Level 9 Celestial Masters!","The highest among those orthodox sect elders was only Level 8.","The Red-haired Celestial Master rolled his eyes, \"Didn't you listen to what Yu Lanzhi said? The orthodox sects have produced a powerful expert. Last time in Dragon Lake City, they killed three Level 7 and one Level 8 with a single move.\"","\"We could do that too,\" the Goatee Celestial Master said disdainfully.","In this world, besides the Venerable One, could there be another Human Sovereign Realm expert?","Moreover, the Venerable One had cultivated for so many years and used so much fortune energy to achieve the current peak of the Human Sovereign Realm. If the orthodox sects had a Human Sovereign Realm expert, could they have been so passive all these years?","The three had long resided deep in the mountains and had no idea about the earth-shaking changes that had occurred outside over the past two months.","Ever since Qi Quan returned to her rightful place, the orthodox sects had gained another Human Sovereign Realm expert, though very few knew about it.","Even the orthodox sects only speculated; the demonic cultivator organization would be even less likely to believe such \"nonsense.\"","But the Red-haired Celestial Master said, \"Don't forget, just now two sword beams shattered our Level 9 formation.\"","\"Those two sword beams were at most Level 9,\" the Goatee Celestial Master said dismissively, \"The orthodox sects have many Level 8 Celestial Masters. It's not strange if someone suddenly advanced to Level 9.\"","He added contemptuously, \"Besides, those two sword beams probably already consumed most of that person's cultivation. Even if they came personally, are the three of us afraid we can't handle them?\"","The Red-haired Celestial Master: \"...\"","The Scarred Celestial Master: \"Enough talk. The situation below isn't right.\"","As time passed, the demonic cultivators' spiritual power was becoming unsustainable. The prolonged battle had nearly exhausted their energy.","Looking at the official team, everyone was still fighting fervently, their momentum overwhelming.","The Goatee Celestial Master also grew uneasy.","\"We've already deployed most of our combat power. Should we send more people out?\" the Red-haired Celestial Master asked.","The Scarred Celestial Master shook his head, \"No, we must keep people to guard the base under the pool.\"","\"How about we make a move ourselves, repel them with one strike and then return?\" the Goatee Celestial Master suggested, \"It really wouldn't take much effort or time, and it would save us from letting those people charge into the base.\"","The Scarred one pondered for a moment. Seeing the battle situation was indeed unfavorable for their side, he said to the Red-haired Celestial Master, \"You go.\"","\"Why me?\" The Red-haired Celestial Master felt uneasy, \"I won't go. What if there's a hidden expert outside and I get killed as soon as I step out?\"","He hadn't forgotten the voice he heard earlier.","It was definitely not his imagination!","\"You're the lowest level. Even if the Venerable One needs spiritual assistance during the advancement process, you're the least useful,\" the Scarred Celestial Master said bluntly.","The Red-haired Celestial Master felt a sharp sting in his pride.","He felt indignant, but what Scarred said was the truth.","Goatee and Scarred were sticking together, ganging up on him alone. If he didn't go out, and the situation outside became irreparable, if something happened to the base, the responsibility would definitely fall on him.","These two were just cunning cowards.","The Red-haired Celestial Master got up reluctantly.","He was now standing on a platform on the cliff face. The platform was enveloped by a ninth-grade formation. Inside the formation, he was protected by it. Once he stepped out, he would lose a layer of security.","The higher the grade of a Celestial Master, the more they cherished their lives, because there was a long lifespan waiting for them to enjoy. To lose their life before enjoying it was truly unacceptable.","Especially for greedy and cruel evil cultivators.","They stripped others of their vitality and fortune precisely to achieve their own cultivation.","Asking them to go to their deaths was harder than ascending to heaven.","The Red-haired Celestial Master dawdled, unwilling to move out of the formation.","Goatee Celestial Master said, \"If you don't go out now to salvage the battle, Scarred is going to push you off.\"","The Red-haired Celestial Master glared at him, grabbed his peach wood sword, gritted his teeth, and flew out of the formation.","He really hoped what he heard earlier was just an illusion!","He instantly flashed before an official eighth-grade Celestial Master, just about to swing his sword for the kill, when an extremely powerful blade light suddenly assaulted him from behind. He wanted to dodge, but under the suppression of the overwhelming spiritual power, he simply couldn't move!","The long blade accurately struck his back.","Vast and domineering spiritual power instantly rushed into his meridians and dantian, a tearing agony sweeping through his entire body. Gurgling, he spat blood and turned around.","A slender, tall figure hovered in mid-air.","Bathed in golden sunlight, her hair danced wildly in the surging spiritual energy. Her eyes were deep and calm, a faint smile playing on her lips, as if she hadn't been the one who unleashed that blade light moments ago, but merely a passing bystander.","The Red-haired Celestial Master spat another mouthful of blood.","He was a ninth-grade Celestial Master!","So, what level of cultivation must she, who crippled his cultivation with one move, possess?","Had the Mystic Sect truly produced a Human Emperor realm cultivator?","In the instant he fell from the sky, his greatest regret was not sticking to his guns earlier.","Those two idiots would join him down here sooner or later, ah ah ah!","Qi Quan had no intention of leaving his corpse or soul intact. Another blade light swept over. Before the Red-haired Celestial Master even hit the ground, his flesh, blood, and soul were utterly annihilated.","The official forces in the midst of the melee felt their spirits soar.","Senior Qi is here, ah ah ah ah!","When the Red-haired Celestial Master appeared earlier, Fu Jiuchong and the others had sensed something amiss and were already resolved to die, but fortunately, Senior Qi appeared in time and killed him with one strike.","This action undoubtedly boosted morale even higher.","On the cliff platform, a heavy silence fell.","Goatee Celestial Master witnessed the Red-haired Celestial Master's death firsthand, and a wave of fear suddenly rose in his heart.","That woman was too strong!","Red-haired's worries were indeed not without reason.","...","The Mystic Sect really had produced a Human Emperor realm cultivator!","Not some ninth-grade Celestial Master, but a Human Emperor realm Celestial Master!","His voice trembling lightly, he said, \"Scarred, what should we do? The voice Red-haired heard earlier must have been hers, right?\"","Scarred clenched his fists, glaring fiercely at Qi Quan not far away, his voice hoarse as he said, \"The Venerable is at a critical moment. We cannot engage lightly.\"","Don't be fooled by the organization having Enlightenment Pills in abundance; there actually weren't many Celestial Masters who could rapidly reach high grades relying on them.","Ninth-grade Celestial Masters were only the three of them.","The rest, the eighth and seventh grades, merely outnumbered those of the Mystic Sect, enough to hold back those lower-grade Celestial Masters outside.","If the officials truly possessed a Human Emperor realm Celestial Master, it would absolutely be a massive obstacle for the organization.","Goatee suddenly said, \"The Venerable once divined that there would be a great obstacle on his path to immortality. It's just that this person's fortune is extremely strong, and they cannot be easily eliminated, otherwise it would incur heaven's wrath and affect his advancement.\"","\"What's the use of saying that now?!\" Scarred Celestial Master snapped impatiently.","Goatee Celestial Master: \"Could it be... her?\"","\"Earlier, the Venerable sent out three seventh-grades and one eighth-grade. Was it also to control or kill her?\"","Scarred said, puzzled, \"If that's the case, why didn't they just plant a puppet talisman on her back then?\"","A low, slow laugh suddenly fell beside their ears, startling them, their hair standing on end.","He stared in shock at the woman outside the formation.","\"I'd like to know why too.\" Qi Quan, holding a long sword formed from spiritual power, poked at the formation shield covering the platform and said leisurely, \"Why not invite me in so I can ask your Venerable myself.\"","The two: \"...\"","This was a ninth-grade formation, capable of blocking the prying of Celestial Masters below the ninth grade.","And she was just chatting with them through the formation like this?","Human Emperor realm, confirmed!","Goatee was completely at a loss.","Their fear of the Venerable wasn't just because of the puppet talismans, but also because of his Human Emperor realm strength.","By the same logic, they would also feel fear towards Qi Quan.","Qi Quan hovered outside the formation shield. Her powerful, matchless spiritual sense pierced through the formation, swept across the platform, and pressed straight towards the evil cultivator leader's cave dwelling!","The cave dwelling's gate was hidden deep within the cliff, constructed with imposing grandeur.","But so what?","No matter how luxurious the cave dwelling, it could only hide on a sheer cliff face, living as a rat scurrying in the shadows for decades.","That gate, inlaid with gold and jade, was bought with the bones of countless people.","Qi Quan's expression turned cold. She retreated some distance, the blade in her palm suddenly lengthening. Spiritual power poured into her hands as she slowly raised them.","The golden sun hung in the sky, the heavens vast and boundless.","The long blade, with earth-shattering, sky-propping force, struck the ninth-grade formation fiercely. The moment the pale-white blade edge collided with the formation shield, the formation crumbled with a roar, and the platform protected by it also turned to dust, scattering down the cliff.","Goatee Celestial Master and Scarred Celestial Master had no time to escape before they were severely wounded by Qi Quan's single blade strike.","Taking advantage of the collapsing rocks, they hastily swallowed several pills, downing both spirit-replenishing and blood-boosting pills together.","As soon as the blood-boosting pills entered their stomachs, their entire spiritual power began to boil.","Their eyes turned red, their auras climbing level by level, actually directly advancing from ninth-grade second tier to Human Emperor realm first tier.","They hovered before the cave dwelling, blocking Qi Quan's path.","As long as the Venerable succeeded in his advancement, they wouldn't have to hide anymore in the future!","[Big Boss, they're at Human Emperor realm now? Two Human Emperors, can you handle them?] The system was extremely worried.","Before Qi Quan could answer, another group of people suddenly appeared not far away!","It was Hengfeng Sect's Yu Lanzhi and several eighth-grade elders.","Yin Yi couldn't help but roar, \"Yu Lanzhi, what are you doing?!\"","Yu Lanzhi ignored his angry shout and immediately joined the evil cultivator forces fighting against the officials.","The Celestial Masters still in the thick of battle were shocked.","The third major sect of the Mystic Sect was actually colluding with evil cultivators!","But upon closer thought, this place wasn't far from Hengfeng Sect indeed.","The evil cultivator organization's largest base relied on and was shielded by a major sect, hiding right under the Mystic Sect's nose for so many years. How could this not provoke fury?!","There were even Hengfeng Sect disciples among the fighting Celestial Masters.","They simply couldn't believe that their sect's leader and elders were actually evil cultivators.","Their faith crumbled, morale plummeting.","This was precisely the effect Yu Lanzhi wanted. He seized the moment to strike at the group of lower-grade Celestial Masters, thinking he could kill a few to dampen their spirits. Who would have thought the lower-grade Celestial Masters didn't die?","His immense spiritual power had only left minor wounds on them?!","Could it be that every single one of them was wearing a high-grade defensive talisman?","Defensive talismans, of course, they had.","But the greatest credit still goes to the Unity Talisman.","Spiritual power shared, damage distributed equally.","The damage inflicted by Yu Lanzhi would be severe on a single person, but when spread across everyone, it was merely a drizzle.","He refused to believe it and attacked the low-level Celestial Master again.","A peachwood hammer suddenly smashed towards his face.","\"How shameless.\" Di Meng brandished the peachwood hammer, sneering, \"A dignified sect leader, yet you only target low-level Celestial Masters? Utterly disgraceful!\"","Yu Lanzhi easily countered his technique, scoffing disdainfully, \"You're merely a level five... You've advanced?!\"","He revealed a look of astonishment.","\"Yan Huai is already level seven, how could I possibly still be stuck at level five?\" Di Meng retorted sharply, \"Unlike you, old man, who only reached level seven after all these years. Your talent is truly worrying!\"","Yu Lanzhi's face twisted with rage as he raised his sword to stab at him.","Di Meng showed not a trace of fear.","He was inherently a powerhouse capable of challenging those above his level. After training with the Investigation Department, his combat skills and experience were far beyond anything Yu Lanzhi could match.","Level six versus level seven sounded unbelievable, but for Di Meng, it was far from impossible.","Back during the Profound Sect Grand Competition, he fought Yan Huai, who was at level six, with his own level five cultivation. He lost, yes, but he held out for a long time. Moreover, Yan Huai's innate talent far surpassed Yu Lanzhi's; the two were simply incomparable.","On another front, an eighth-level elder from the Hengfeng Sect joined the fray, putting immense pressure on Fu Jiuchong, Yin Yi, and the others.","The Hengfeng Sect had chosen their moment to strike perfectly.","Had they appeared before Qi Quan broke the cliff-face formation, she could have wiped them out with a single major technique.","But now, after Qi Quan destroyed the formation, she was forced to face two Human Sovereign realm cultivators who had taken Bloodburst Pills.","With the Human Sovereign realm experts keeping her occupied, she had no spare attention to manage this side.","They were sure to win!","By the cliff, Goatee and Scar stood facing Qi Quan.","Neither side made the first move.","Qi Quan's spiritual sense enveloped the entire mountain range, yet it couldn't pierce through the cave abode's entrance.","The person inside was also at the Human Sovereign realm, likely even at its peak. It made sense that their spiritual sense could block hers.","She had never fought a Human Sovereign realm Celestial Master before. However, she had destroyed Ghost Generals, whose rank among ghosts was equivalent to the Human Sovereign realm among cultivators, so she wasn't entirely without experience.","The Ghost General from her past life had reached the third tier, not too different from the peak of the Human Sovereign realm.","...","Qi Quan raised her long blade, her fighting spirit blazing like a raging fire, growing fiercer and fiercer.","The terrifying aura she emitted not only made the two before her tremble but even affected the Celestial Masters below the cliff.","Everyone involuntarily ceased fighting, looking up at the immensely powerful figure hovering in mid-air.","Someone couldn't help but ask, \"Wasn't it said that Senior Qi was proficient in the sword path? Why does she prefer using a blade?\"","\"At her level, the weapon probably doesn't matter anymore.\"","There was no difference between a blade and a sword.","An investigator worried, \"Senior Qi is using her major technique already. When the leader of the evil cultivators emerges, won't she be...\"","\"She won't.\" Ning Zhi stated firmly.","\"Why not?\" someone asked. \"They're both Human Sovereign realm, and that villain might even be at a higher level than Senior Qi.\"","Ning Zhi smiled. \"Look at Di Meng fighting Yu Lanzhi. Is he at a disadvantage?\"","\"No!\"","Their eyes lit up.","That's right. Geniuses capable of cross-level challenges weren't unique to Di Meng in this world.","In mid-air, the long blade transformed into a gigantic blade shadow. With a force that could crush everything in its path, it struck with overwhelming dominance towards the two drug-enhanced Human Sovereign realm cultivators.","Bathed in sunlight, the pale white spiritual power took on a golden halo, like a blade of virtue carrying justice, cleaving towards the utterly wicked fiends.","Goatee and Scar wore expressions of terror.","At this moment, only one thought remained in their minds—","Run! Run fast! Get away now!","Their Human Sovereign realm potential erupted. Disregarding everything else, they fled in panic in opposite directions.","The pale golden blade shadow descended.","The long blade spanned half the sky. No matter how fast they fled, they couldn't escape the range of the blade shadow in an instant.","BOOM—","In an instant, the earth shook and the mountains trembled. The cliff face was split open by a massive gash from the long blade. Rubble flew in all directions, dust filled the air, and the cave abode hidden behind the layered rock walls was finally revealed before everyone.","Not far away, the two Human Sovereign realm cultivators turned to dust, their forms and spirits utterly annihilated.","Silence.","Boundless silence.","Everyone held their breath, not daring to disturb the figure in mid-air, majestic as a mountain peak.","In their hearts, they were screaming wildly, shrieking wildly, doing all the things they didn't dare to do in that moment.","Someone couldn't hold back, overwhelmed by the scene, tears streaming down their face as they sobbed,","\"Wuwuwu... I've truly seen a deity.\""]},{"number":67,"title":"Chapter 67","paragraphs":["A grand and luxurious cave mansion came into view.","Everyone realized—","The leader of the cultist organization was hiding inside.","The atmosphere was so tense a single spark could set it off.","Di Meng knocked Yu Lanzhi down with his hammer, handcuffed him, and grinned at the stunned man. \"Never worn these before, huh?\"","Yu Lanzhi: \"...\"","What shocked him was how a Level 6 Celestial Master could possibly knock him down!","Di Meng tossed him to the back.","Many cultists had been subdued in the melee, but not everyone received this special treatment.","Some lower-level cultists had damaged meridians and couldn't run; they were left lying on the ground for now. As for the high-level Celestial Masters, they had to be restrained with special handcuffs that sealed their spiritual power.","Yu Lanzhi was the first Level 7 Celestial Master to be cuffed.","Utterly humiliating.","Seeing Di Meng's action, the others snapped out of their shock and returned to the fray.","They wanted to watch Senior Qi Quan battle the cult leader, but there were still so many cultists right in front of them!","They couldn't focus on one and neglect the other.","So they had to finish this fight quickly, then join forces to cheer Senior Qi Quan on.","The morale of the official Mystic Order team soared even higher.","The scene of Qi Quan killing two Human Emperor realm cultists with a single move had thoroughly ignited the bloodlust of the investigators and Celestial Masters.","Charge!!!","The cultists, however, felt the opposite.","Having witnessed Qi Quan's immense power, they had almost lost their will to fight. With a god-like figure like her holding the line, could they possibly win?","An extremely deep gash on the cliff face served as a constant reminder that, with their level of strength, they weren't even qualified to face Qi Quan.","Except for that one person inside.","Yet, despite all the commotion, that person still showed no intention of revealing themselves.","Qi Quan hovered outside the cave mansion, calm and composed.","[Great One, what do we do now?] The system was extremely nervous.","Qi Quan: [I have plenty of blades.]","System: !!!","Another long blade materialized before the cliff face, its imposing aura even more vast than the previous one.","The cultists at the bottom of the ravine: ???","Are you serious? You still have strength to spare?!","The giant blade pressed down on the cliff wall and, with the force of a roaring tide and flashing lightning, slashed towards the resplendent golden cave door.","The cave door exploded with a thunderous boom.","Chunks of gold and jade flew, the rock wall and valley echoing with the roar.","No matter how sturdy, the cave door couldn't withstand a strike from the Human Emperor realm.","Qi Quan had even held back her strength.","Her power was focused inward, deep into the cave mansion, destroying the defensive formations inside without causing excessive damage to the mountain itself.","This person was truly afraid of death.","Two Level 9 formations on the outer perimeter, one Level 9 formation outside the cave, and layer upon layer of formations set up inside the cave itself.","And with this setup, he still dreamed of immortality?","An insult to heaven itself.","The formations inside the cave were mostly destroyed by her. No matter how critical a stage of cultivation the person inside had reached, they had no choice but to react.","Qi Quan chuckled lightly. \"A Celestial Master at the peak of the Human Emperor realm can only set up Level 9 formations? Truly...\"","Her voice, infused with spiritual power, could be heard clearly by everyone present.","No one misunderstood her unspoken meaning.","Qi Quan never belittled others' talent, but the person inside this cave... he deserved it.","\"You turtle grandson inside! Stop hiding in your shell!\" Di Meng shouted loudly. \"Have the guts to come out! Didn't blink an eye when harming others? Scared shitless when it's your turn?\"","The crowd burst into laughter.","The cultists' faces flushed with shame.","After all, this was the Venerable One they had served so carefully. To be disparaged like this was utterly humiliating for them.","Their already dwindling fighting spirit vanished completely.","Just as Qi Quan raised her blade to attack the cave again—","A sword light shot out from the cave, aiming straight for Qi Quan's face. Qi Quan blocked horizontally with her blade, her figure drifting back several meters.","As expected of the peak Human Emperor realm.","The smile on Qi Quan's lips deepened.","In her previous life, she cultivated to the first stage of the Human Emperor realm and was unmatched in the Mystic Order, her realm never loosening again.","In this life, at the Lu Manor, she received the merit light bestowed by Ji Shengzhe and, seizing the opportunity, advanced to the second stage of the Human Emperor realm.","Progressing further would likely be extremely difficult.","A battle against a peak Human Emperor realm master was a rare, perhaps unique, opportunity for her.","She was looking forward to it.","Seeing his first strike miss, the person in the cave shot out another beam of sword light.","Qi Quan raised her blade and cleaved down. The sword light was actually split in two, dissolving into specks of white light that vanished into the air.","She raised an eyebrow with interest.","Was it because he couldn't attack freely, or was his attack power really this shallow?","If the people below heard her inner thoughts, they'd probably spit blood.","This is shallow?","A single beam of that sword light could kill them!","Qi Quan was not one to wait for others to make moves.","Spiritual power coalesced into a pale white longbow. A spirit arrow held in her palm, her fingertips released, and the arrow whooshed towards the cave's now-open entrance, plunging into the pitch-black den of iniquity.","Inside the cave, a man sat at the eye of a formation, continuously absorbing the life force and fortune transported from the base beneath the pool. The aura around him grew stronger and stronger.","This was a forbidden art, a formation specifically designed to seize the life force and fortune of others.","Through this formation, that life force and fortune could be transferred to himself, accelerating his cultivation speed.","It was said that those with great fortune were beloved by the Heavenly Dao, granted supreme talent, and could cultivate the path to immortality.","His fortune was already vast. He was just one step away from success.","It was a pity that twenty-two years ago, he hadn't dared to kill Qi Quan.","The forbidden text was right. Qi Quan was the greatest obstacle on his cultivation path.","He should have killed her back then!","The spirit arrow traversed the long, dark cave, shooting straight for his face...","No, for the formation stone!","The arrow tip struck the formation stone. With a crack, several fine fissures appeared on the stone.","The formation's glow suddenly dimmed, and the transmission of life force and fortune stuttered for an instant.","Before the man could react, another spirit arrow shot into the cave, striking the formation stone once more.","More cracks spread across the formation stone, now unable to continue supporting the formation.","A fierce light flashed in the man's eyes.","If this continued, the formation would be destroyed before he could advance to the Human Immortal realm.","He decisively stood up, his figure flashing, and appeared outside the cave.","On the steep cliffside, two figures stood facing each other from a distance.","The pressure unique to the Human Emperor realm spread throughout the entire valley, forcing everyone to drop their magical tools and even kneel on the ground.","When giants fight, ordinary folk cannot participate.","Qi Quan observed the man before her.","To be honest, he wasn't much different from what she had imagined.","Very ordinary.","So ordinary he'd be hard to pick out in a crowd.","He wore a flowing Daoist robe, his long hair tied up with a wooden hairpin, giving him a somewhat ethereal, immortal air.","System: [What an insult to Daoist robes. It looks so awkward on him!]","Suddenly, a voice full of shock and doubt came from below.","It was Yin Yi.","As a sect leader, he stubbornly resisted kneeling under the man's pressure, even managing to look up several times. Those few glances shocked him.","\"You... you... you...\" He stared at the man, struggling to speak. \"I think I've seen you before!\"","The man glanced down lightly, looking at him as one would an ant.","\"Yin Yi.\" His voice was light, tinged with mockery. \"After all these years, you're only Level 7.\"","Yin Yi: ???","A dignified sect leader, mocked in front of everyone. He wished he could burrow into the ground.","\"Just who are you?\" he roared, his face flushed with anger.","The man waved his hand dismissively, a surge of spiritual power striking Yin Yi, who vomited a mouthful of blood and half-knelt on the ground.","Fortunately, he still had the Unity Talisman on him, and his teammates shared the damage for him.","The man hissed in surprise, saying, \"Your defense... shouldn't be this strong.\"","He had been focused on his cultivation earlier, paying no attention to outside matters, and was unaware of the peculiarities of the official team. Only after injuring Yin Yi did he realize something was wrong.","\"No wonder,\" he said, looking at Qi Quan. \"No wonder the officials dared to send these low-level masters. So they have something to rely on.\"","He sneered, \"Using forbidden arts?\"","Qi Quan replied, \"You talk too much.\"","\"...\"","The man's expression turned icy. \"Do you really think I can't kill you?\"","Qi Quan said, \"Try me.\"","Spiritual power gathered in his palm, this time forming a short blade.","Everyone thought: Great One, how many techniques do you actually know?","\"I remember now!\"","Yin Yi suddenly shouted.","\"I remember now! You're Cai Ji! You're Cai Ji!\"","The scene fell silent.","Master Yin, even if you dislike him, you don't have to call him \"Chicken,\" do you?","The evil cultivators were also stunned.","The Venerable One had never told them his name; they had always called him \"Venerable One.\"","So, was it just because his name sounded bad?","Masters rarely change their names; unless they die, Cai Ji could only be Cai Ji.","Yin Yi's eyes reddened. \"I never thought you were still around!\"","Cai Ji's face was as cold as it could get.","He looked down at Yin Yi below the cliff, gathering vast spiritual power in his palm.","Qi Quan stood with her blade held horizontally, smiling lightly. \"Your opponent is me.\"","Cai Ji turned to Qi Quan, asking solemnly, \"Are you truly set on opposing me?\"","\"Not opposing you,\" Qi Quan said with a stern expression. \"It's about seeking justice for the dead.\"","Cai Ji laughed heartily, disdainfully saying, \"To be able to use their mediocre lives to achieve the status of a Human Immortal—that is their honor!\"","Everyone thought: This is far too arrogant.","[Great One, destroy him!] The system shouted angrily.","Qi Quan asked, puzzled, \"You don't actually think that after killing so many people, the Heavenly Dao would let you become a Human Immortal?\"","\"Why wouldn't it?\" Cai Ji said fearlessly. \"I cultivated through my own abilities. Why wouldn't it let me become a Human Immortal? Does the Heavenly Dao, claiming to be fair, resent me for finding a different path?\"","Everyone: \"...\"","This person is truly deranged.","Qi Quan pointed her blade at him. \"Let's begin.\"","\"Wait,\" Cai Ji suddenly said. \"Don't you want to become a Human Immortal?\"","Qi Quan remained silent.","\"If you're willing, I can share that fortune with you. The two of us can join forces, eliminate these annoying ants, and reign supreme over the whole world. Wouldn't that be wonderful?\"","...","Qi Quan shook her head firmly. \"No.\"","\"Why not?\"","\"You're too ugly.\"","Cai Ji: ?","Qi Quan: \"Ugly in appearance, even uglier at heart. I never associate with the ugly.\"","\"...\"","Someone below couldn't hold back and snorted a laugh.","Cai Ji flew into a rage. He hated being looked down upon more than anything in his life.","He had been treated poorly because of his average looks, relegated to being a menial servant in the sect due to his inferior aptitude. Everyone looked down on him; everyone could curse and scold him at will.","Those sharp, mocking words seeped into his heart like poison, gradually corroding what little kindness and honesty remained, turning him sinister and cruel.","\"Qi Quan, I should have killed you back then, rather than...\"","\"Rather than snatching me away from my birth parents, making my life full of hardships, and draining away my fortune?\"","Cai Ji snorted coldly.","\"It's not that you didn't want to kill me,\" Qi Quan said calmly. \"You were just as timid as a mouse, not daring to defy the Heavenly Dao.\"","Cai Ji's spiritual power erupted from his entire body. \"I'll kill you today!\"","A spiritual sword materialized in his palm. He raised it and thrust towards Qi Quan, his figure moving like light, like lightning, too fast for the eye to follow.","Qi Quan didn't use her sword.","Her sword arts were her most powerful, but to deal with Cai Ji, she didn't need her sword yet.","The short blade was just fine.","A stab to the left, a thrust to the right, each strike drawing blood, each infused with overwhelmingly powerful spiritual energy that surged into Cai Ji's meridians.","Cai Ji was at the peak of the Human Emperor realm. Although his swordsmanship had grown rusty after so many years in seclusion, the depth of his spiritual power still matched his peak Human Emperor strength.","His realm was higher than Qi Quan's, so he wouldn't easily suffer damage to his meridians from her attacks.","The two fought fiercely in the air, the flashes of blades and swords leaving afterimages so fast that those below the cliff couldn't see clearly, yet they all watched, utterly captivated.","Di Meng also wanted to keep watching, but he was the commander.","He shouted, \"All units, listen up! Speed up, destroy the evil cultivators' den!\"","If they didn't charge into the base at the bottom of the pool while the Great One was fighting, when would they? Wait until she finished and then slowly rescue people?","The investigators and masters suddenly snapped back to attention.","Charge, ahhhhh!","By now, the evil cultivators were exhausted. In contrast, the official team members were full of energy, as if they hadn't been fighting at all.","Wait, that's right—they had been fighting in shifts, taking breaks!","Three ninth-level cultivators on their side had already died, two of whom were Human Emperors who had taken pills. And on the official side?","Not a single serious injury so far!","How could they possibly compete?","Looking up at the sky, the Venerable One and that woman had been fighting without a clear winner. That woman had killed Human Emperors with ease; perhaps she could even finish off the Venerable One directly.","So what was the point of resisting anymore?","Just give up. Everyone, just give up.","Those with weak willpower were the first to throw down their magical tools and surrender.","One led to many.","More and more evil cultivators gave up resistance, allowing the officials to subdue them.","Some tried to flee, but their escape skills were too pathetic. The professionally trained investigators had them in their sights, every single one.","No one escaped the official net.","As evil cultivators surrendered one after another, the pressure on the official team lessened considerably. Di Meng led half of the investigators towards the base at the bottom of the pool.","The entrance to the base was set beside the water pool, concealed by a high-level formation that lower-level masters would find hard to detect.","Yin Yi was quite skilled in this area.","He pointed to the Gen position of the water pool. \"An eighth-level formation is set here. To enter, you either need to be... a member of the organization, or you must break the formation.\"","Di Meng pondered. If they wanted to enter, they would have to break the formation.","Should they attack with talismans or decipher the formation?","\"I can attempt to break the formation,\" someone said, arriving gracefully.","It was the Fu family's eighth-level female elder.","She was an eighth-level formation master; the forbidden art formation used to save Fu Jiuge back then was set up by her.","Di Meng said happily, \"We'll trouble you, Elder.\"","The Fu family had substantial heritage. The female master was intimately familiar with various formations and quickly found the anchor point to break this one, successfully dismantling it.","As the formation vanished, a dark, sinister staircase was revealed, descending deep into the pool's depths. A faint smell of blood wafted up.","Everyone's expressions turned extremely grave.","Yin Yi's brow was tightly furrowed.","Because Cai Ji had once come from the Guiyuan Sect, even if only as a menial servant, it still brought shame to Yin Yi's old face.","He said in a heavy voice, \"I'll go down first.\"","Di Meng said, \"Let me do it.\"","They had received professional training and might react faster in the face of danger.","Yin Yi understood his reasoning and patted his shoulder. \"After all, Cai Ji came from the Guiyuan Sect. I might be more familiar with his methods.\"","Di Meng didn't refuse further.","Yin Yi went down the stairs first, followed by Di Meng second, the female master third, and the investigators behind them.","They brought all the video recording equipment and memory-retaining talismans.","The steps were dark and deep. A flashlight beam shone to the bottom, revealing a narrow, long passageway.","Di Meng threw out a pebble, one he had just picked up by the pool.","The pebble vanished from sight the moment it was thrown.","\"Another formation,\" Yin Yi sighed.","The female celestial master followed the same method to break the formation.","Perhaps because Cai Ji had set up several ninth-grade formations outside and felt overconfident, he hadn't placed very high-grade formations inside the base, nor any traps. The female celestial master broke through them one after another, leading everyone safely through.","After passing through the long passageway, they finally reached an iron door.","\"Judging by this location, we should be at the bottom of the mountain now. The room behind this door should be connected to Cai Ji's cave dwelling,\" Yin Yi said.","Here, \"connected\" meant connected through formations.","Di Meng said, \"Break it down.\"","The investigators used formation talismans to erect a protective barrier, ensuring their own safety before using talismans to blast the iron door.","The talismans were all eighth-grade, even some ninth-grade ones, diligently drawn by Xie Lanzhou these past few days. With just one or two strikes, the iron door exploded violently. Shattered fragments of iron slammed against the protective barrier and were flung back, leaving deep marks on the stone walls.","Amidst the flying debris and dust, crimson blood slowly flowed.","Blood. Blood filled the entire room.","A thick, pungent smell of blood assaulted everyone's nostrils. The cruel and bloody scene served as a stark reminder that this was a living hell.","Yin Yi and the female celestial master could hardly bear to look, softly reciting scriptures.","Di Meng's eyes nearly burst with rage, rendered speechless by fury.","This was an enormous underground base.","The moment the door was blasted open, someone was in the act of slitting the wrist of a three-year-old child, placing it over a container to let the blood drain.","Di Meng was the first to charge forward, roaring, \"Save them, now!\"","The base interior also had its own security forces.","After the door was blown open, many evil cultivators poured out, and battle commenced without a word.","Enraged by the sheer evil before them, the investigators and the two celestial masters held nothing back, their weapons showing no mercy.","Devils! These were a pack of devils...!","Fighting spirit grew amidst the flames of anger.","Di Meng fought while rescuing people, swinging his peach wood hammer at a sixth-grade evil cultivator. The cultivator was no match; his dantian was directly shattered by Di Meng's spiritual power, and he collapsed in agony.","Di Meng felt not a shred of pity.","These evil cultivators could no longer be called human. Having harmed so many innocent lives, the suffering they endured now was far from enough to repay the debts they owed!","Yin Yi and the female celestial master, with their high cultivation levels, quickly eliminated a large number of evil cultivators.","The base being breached was sensed by Cai Ji.","But he was currently focused entirely on his battle with Qi Quan and had no attention to spare for that.","If he didn't kill Qi Quan today, he himself would die.","Cai Ji gripped his long sword, his eyes filled with fierce malice, aiming specifically for Qi Quan's vital points.","Qi Quan's protective spiritual energy defense was extremely high; she showed no fear of his sword energy. Her short blade hacked fiercely at his shoulder. The blade edge broke through his protective spiritual energy, leaving a bloody gash on his shoulder!","\"How is this possible?!\" Cai Ji questioned in shock. \"You're only at Human Emperor second rank. How could you break my defense?\"","Qi Quan swung her blade at his long sword. The sword formed from spiritual energy instantly chipped.","She said, \"A gentleman carries a sword. Are you worthy?\"","Cai Ji: Aaaaaah! He must kill this woman!","He couldn't understand why Qi Quan's spiritual power was denser than his. Was it just because she was a person of great fortune, favored by the Heavenly Dao?","He refused to accept it, he truly refused!","Moreover, after fighting this long, most of his spiritual power was already depleted, so why did she still seem so effortless?","And those official team celestial masters below, why did they still have so much spiritual power?","He had lived for so many years. Apart from being bullied at the Guiyuan Sect, he had never suffered setbacks at the hands of others. Yet, at the critical moment when his great achievement was nearly complete, this Qi Quan appeared, and then this Investigation Department appeared.","The Heavenly Dao was simply unjust!","His eyes gradually darkened, like a madman on the verge of demonic possession.","\"You cannot win against me.\" A sinister, cruel smile appeared at the corner of Cai Ji's mouth.","The system couldn't stand it anymore, indignantly saying: [Big shot, as long as you don't kill him, beat him to death! Anyway, we still have Ling Sheng's logistical support!]","Qi Quan: ...","Before coming, she knew she would be facing a Human Emperor realm criminal, possibly even a peak Human Emperor realm criminal.","She was only at Human Emperor second rank. Although she could challenge those above her level, accidents could always happen.","Qi Quan did not like accidents.","She had made thorough preparations for herself.","Ling Sheng stayed at the Longlin City Investigation Department, bound to her with a Unity Talisman. As long as the Unity Talisman was activated, he would draw upon the world's spiritual energy to provide her with a supply.","Of course, this was just a backup plan.","It wasn't time for that yet.","She wanted to see what her true limits were.","Cai Ji fiercely slashed his sword downward, attempting to use the people at the bottom of the cliff as hostages to force Qi Quan to rescue them.","The fierce sword energy was about to fall upon the crowd. Qi Quan's figure flashed over at extreme speed. Her spiritual blade severed the sword energy, which dissipated into the air after its force was spent.","And this just gave Cai Ji the time he needed.","He spread his arms and loudly recited an incantation.","The incantation was short, lasting only a few breaths. As the last word fell, a faint rumbling sound emerged from within the valley. Black mist surged forth, shrouding everyone's heads.","Qi Quan heard his incantation clearly, her expression turning slightly grave.","[Big shot, what is he doing?] The system was somewhat worried.","Qi Quan: [A forbidden technique.]","[What forbidden technique?]","Qi Quan gripped her short blade and said: [He is going to extract all the spiritual power and life force from his puppets for his own use. The lives of the puppets will become his.]","[What's the use of that?]","Qi Quan: [To kill me.]","[Then let's interrupt him quickly!]","Qi Quan: [It's too late.]","Almost the instant the incantation ended, all across the country, every evil cultivator who had been implanted with a Puppet Talisman suddenly had their spiritual power and life force extracted, collapsing into dried corpses.","In the valley, before everyone's eyes, except for Yu Lanzhi, all eighth-grade evil cultivators lost their lives in the blink of an eye.","They died without even knowing how.","Yu Lanzhi: ???","Because he was a sect leader who often went out on business, Cai Ji, worried that the Puppet Talisman might be discovered, hadn't implanted one in him. He narrowly escaped this fate.","He stared in terror, utterly unable to speak.","He only knew the Puppet Talisman prevented leaks; he never knew it could also instantly take one's vitality!","An immense amount of spiritual power and vitality gathered within Cai Ji. The aura around him grew increasingly violent and terrifying.","\"Is this... about to breakthrough?\" someone asked, trembling.","If Cai Ji truly became a Human Immortal, could any of them still leave here alive?","Only Qi Quan's eyes burned brightly, showing no fear at all.","She flew up to stand before Cai Ji. The short blade in her hand disappeared, replaced by a pale golden long sword.","The sword light was pale gold, signifying she had comprehended a sword path of her own, recognized by the Heavenly Dao.","Cai Ji looked at her, shock mixed with boundless jealousy.","\"It's just so unfair.\"","Why were some people born blessed with great fortune?","Qi Quan said calmly, \"The Heavenly Dao is fair. Having studied the Dao for so long, are you not aware of the concept of merit and virtue?\"","To bear great fortune in one's life is generally due to accumulating immeasurable merit in a past life.","To be born ordinary, perhaps it is because one's past life was simply ordinary. But if one performs many good deeds and accumulates merit in this life, it is not impossible to become a person of great fortune in the next.","Cai Ji snorted with a laugh. \"I only acknowledge the 'me' of this life. Whether it's a past life or a future life, is that still me? It's nothing but empty talk meant to persuade people to be good.\"","\"You only acknowledge the 'you' of this life, yet you do not accept the 'you' of this life. How contradictory.\"","Qi Quan raised her sword. The golden light on the blade echoed the brilliant sunlight.","The sword's aura was vast and righteous, specialized in vanquishing evil demons and wicked paths.","Cai Ji simultaneously raised his sword.","His sword had already turned black-red, steeped in the blood of countless people, roiling with a nauseating stench of blood.","He said, \"Qi Quan, with your strength alone, can you shake the spiritual power of countless people? Give up now, and I will spare your life.\"","In response, there was only the blazing light of her sword.","In mid-air, two swords of immense power collided. Their vast spiritual powers clashed against each other, instantly stirring up an extremely terrifying wave of spiritual energy that exploded outwards in all directions.","The spectators had learned their lesson and hurriedly took shelter within protective arrays.","The scattered spiritual energy waves struck the array shields, which flickered several times as if on the verge of failing the next second.","Filled with nothing but shock, the crowd immediately replaced them with new spirit talismans, re-establishing the arrays.","These were ninth-level array talismans personally crafted by Senior Qi!","If the mere energy waves were so domineering, how powerful must the two at the center of that energy be?","No, the powerful one... was only Senior Qi.","That Cai Ji was nothing but a shameless thief.","This strike from Qi Quan had nearly exhausted all the spiritual power in her dantian. The pale golden sword light intertwined and contended with the black-red sword light. The collision of energies at the Human Sovereign Realm, capable of nearly destroying heaven and earth, was something even she found slightly hard to withstand.","Yet, precisely because of this, she felt an unprecedented excitement.","Battling an opponent of the same level was an endless delight!","Cai Ji was also shocked by her profound spiritual power.","The density of her spiritual power was actually heavier than that of a peak Human Sovereign Realm cultivator!","Why on earth was this?","Qi Quan's expression remained composed. \"Your cultivation is quite hollow.\"","Cai Ji's face instantly turned green.","In fact, his spiritual power density was the normal one; it was clearly her who was abnormal!","Qi Quan dared to fight a peak Human Sovereign Realm expert not without confidence.","She enjoyed challenging those above her level.","In her previous life, when she defeated a Ghost General, she hadn't actually reached the Human Sovereign Realm yet; she was only at the ninth level, third stage. It was after destroying the Ghost General that she advanced to the first stage of the Human Sovereign Realm.","Qi Quan once again squeezed the spiritual power within her body, coalescing it into a short sword.","\"Hahahahaha,\" Cai Ji laughed wildly and unrestrainedly. \"Have you run out of spiritual power? Reduced to using a short sword?\"","Black-red spiritual power, shimmering with sin and blood, transformed into a massive long blade.","\"You like long blades, don't you? I'll return the favor!\"","The black-red long blade, carrying a terrifying energy, pressed down upon the slender figure in mid-air.","Qi Quan raised the short sword.","The tip of the sword met the descending blade edge.","Compared to the giant blade, the golden light emitted by the short sword was as faint as a firefly's glow.","Cai Ji grinned, laughing maniacally. Victory was right before his eyes!","Qi Quan forced out the last trace of her spiritual power; the short sword was about to vanish.","[Great One, quickly activate the Unity Talisman!] The system was frantic with worry.","The short sword vanished; the black-red blade pressed down.","\"Senior!\"","\"Great One!\"","\"Ahhhhh no!\"","The crowd cried out in anguish.","Cai Ji watched as the giant blade chopped down towards Qi Quan. In the next moment, it would reduce her to ashes...","Suddenly, an extremely dazzling light suppressed the black-red giant blade.","The giant blade was actually forced to flip over completely, and beside it, another identical giant blade appeared!","What... was this?!","The system reacted, howling excitedly: [Ahhhhhh! Great One, you are the most, most, most, most amazing! This is the Retribution Talisman, right? This is the double retribution talisman you mentioned before!]","Previously, when Qi Quan went to the Fu family to treat Fu Jiuge, the system had worried on the way back about the danger if she exhausted her spiritual power. Qi Quan had explained the existence of the Retribution Talisman to it.","Just now, Qi Quan feigned weakness precisely to lure Cai Ji into using his ultimate move.","Now, one ultimate move had become two ultimate moves.","Could he swallow the move he himself had fed?","Under Cai Ji's gaze, filled with terror and confusion, the two black-red giant blades simultaneously slashed towards his body.","Without a Retribution Talisman of the Human Sovereign Realm, he could only endure it head-on.","\"Ahhhhhhh—\"","The black-red giant blades completely engulfed him.","Before Qi Quan could plummet to the bottom of the cliff, she was enveloped by a frenzied surge of heaven and earth spiritual energy.","Cai Ji had picked a good location.","This place was extremely rich in spiritual energy. From the continuous mountain ranges, countless streams of heaven and earth spiritual energy, summoned, poured into this valley.","The spiritual energies joyfully drilled into Qi Quan's meridians and dantian, causing them to continuously fill, fill, and fill some more...","They supported Qi Quan's body, suspending her in mid-air, bathing her in the golden sunlight, as if she were a noble and transcendent deity.","The crowd: Ahhhhhhh!","Only the word \"ah\" could express the unparalleled excitement here.","Once the spiritual energy in the mountains was fully absorbed, Qi Quan still didn't stop.","More and more spiritual energy swarmed in from all directions. Even the spiritual energy of the Hengshan Sect couldn't help but rush to Qi Quan's side, merging into her body.","Yu Lanzhi: ???","The sect has a grand protective array! How could the spiritual energy run over?!","Cai Ji was still screaming miserably under the shroud of the black-red giant blades.","Qi Quan, carried by the spiritual energy, rose higher and higher, and the aura around her grew increasingly terrifying.","\"Is Senior... about to advance?\"","Someone asked with trembling lips, voicing everyone's thoughts.","No one answered him.","Everyone held their breath and waited.","Qi Quan was indeed advancing.","With the aid of the heaven and earth spiritual energy, she progressed from the second stage of the Human Sovereign Realm directly into the third stage, gradually climbing towards perfection.","But she had a premonition; this time she would not become a Human Immortal.","Sure enough, at the brink of reaching perfection, her advancement stalled.","She faintly touched a trace of the power of laws.","After reaching the peak of the Human Sovereign Realm, her spiritual sense grew even stronger, and her connection with the heaven and earth spiritual energy became even closer.","On the other side, Cai Ji's physical body could not withstand the two black-red giant blades and was utterly pulverized beneath them.","But he was quite cunning. Just as his body was about to be destroyed, at the cost of instantly shattering his flesh and blood, he allowed his soul to separate from his physical form, attempting to escape amidst the chaos.","He had almost fled beyond the boundaries of the Hengfeng Sect when he ran into Qi Quan, who had just advanced.","Qi Quan's spiritual sense was spreading out. Capturing the soul brimming with sin, she couldn't help but let out a light laugh. Her spiritual power transformed into a rope, easily pulling it back and tossing it into a peachwood tablet.","When Cai Ji activated the forbidden technique, all the evil cultivators implanted with puppet talismans turned into desiccated corpses and died. Thus, the chaotic battle in the underground base ended instantly.","Di Meng and the others had rescued the children who had not yet been harmed and had returned to the surface.","They gazed up at Qi Quan, who had landed gracefully, their eyes filled with fervent worship.","The peak of the Human Sovereign Realm—that was the peak of the Human Sovereign Realm!","Senior Qi is truly too incredible!","Although they had much they wished to say to Qi Quan, the children in their arms still needed to be settled.","Qi Quan landed back at the bottom of the cliff and was about to withdraw her spiritual sense when she suddenly froze, looking towards a spot not far away.","[Huh? Why is Ling Sheng here? Wasn't he at the Investigation Department?] the system exclaimed in surprise. [He looks a bit disheveled.]","Ling Sheng ran over swiftly, his amber eyes filled with panic. In his urgency, he opened his mouth and asked without thinking, \"Why didn't you use a talisman?\"","He had been at the Investigation Department, using his spiritual sense to monitor the battle here the entire time.","When he \"saw\" Qi Quan lose her spiritual power and be engulfed by the black-red giant blade, his mind went blank. Without a second thought, he rushed over at his fastest speed.","The young man's eyes were rimmed red, his face pale, and his voice trembled as he asked.","Qi Quan fell silent.","The others present also fell silent.","So, Physician Qi could actually speak?","System: [Wahhh, Ling Sheng was so frantic he even cut his arm.]","Qi Quan looked at his arm.","The mountain forest was dense... and rushing over at high speed made it difficult to control spiritual power for protection; the slightest misstep could lead to cuts from branches.","As a natural spiritual body, his wounds healed quickly. The fact that this wound still looked deep showed how severe the initial cut must have been.","Qi Quan took his wrist and cast a cleansing spell. The wood splinters and grime near the wound on his arm all vanished.","\"You...\"","Qi Quan placed her palm over his lips and smiled, \"Don't speak for now. I'll tell you when we get back.\"","The young man stared at her blankly.","Qi Quan withdrew her hand. \"Be good.\"","Holding the young man's wrist, she turned as if to leave the valley, but was suddenly pulled back by him.","Her body fell into an embrace.","A faint scent of green grass enveloped her, vibrant and fervent, yet also incredibly awkward, tinged with a hint of cautiousness.","The onlookers: Oh ho.","System: [Hehehe.]","Qi Quan: ...","She was just about to tell Ling Sheng to let go when the young man, blushing, released her and didn't dare to look at her further.","Fine, a hug is just a hug.","The others stayed behind to clean up the aftermath, while Qi Quan took Ling Sheng back to the Longlin City Investigation Department first.","Longjing City, the Yan Family.","The family competition had reached a fever pitch, with the disciples taking the stage being the best of the best.","The two sides facing off were a master from the Yan Family's main branch and a master from Yan Fengqing's line.","A fifth-level against a sixth-level was a tough fight.","Just as the main branch contestant was about to be defeated, a commotion suddenly erupted not far away.","Yan Huai immediately stood up.","The steward came to report with a strange expression: \"Young Master, something has happened in the rest area.\"","The rest area was specifically provided for the family servants.","The heads and contestants from each branch, more or less, had servants and attendants with them. These people, not suitable to enter the competition arena, were arranged to wait in the rest area until the matches concluded.","Yan Huai hurried to the rest area immediately.","By the time he arrived, many servants were crowded outside the rest area, their faces panicked and at a loss.","The steward pointed inside the room. \"You'll understand once you go in and see.\"","Yan Huai stepped into the rest area.","A desiccated corpse lay collapsed on the sofa, thoroughly dead.","This person was Yan Fengqing's steward. When he passed through the detector at the entrance to the competition arena, a black marker had appeared.","He had been implanted with a puppet talisman.","The steward asked, \"What should we do now?\"","\"Wait.\"","\"Wait? Wait for what?\"","Yan Huai gripped his phone tightly, a flicker of anticipation rising in his eyes.","\"Wait for some news.\""]},{"number":68,"title":"Chapter 68","paragraphs":["Yan Huai did not have to wait long.","Just as the family competition was about to conclude, he received a call from Li Guoyan.","\"Director Li.\"","Even he, usually so composed, felt a flicker of nervousness.","Li Guoyan's steady tone could not fully conceal his excitement, and his inspiring words fell on Yan Huai's ears: \"Just one minute ago, all the evil cultivator dens we had identified were completely raided and cleared out.\"","\"What about Longlin City...\"","\"Thanks to Master Qi Quan, the damage was minimal,\" Li Guoyan said with profound admiration. \"Yan Huai, you can proceed with the action now.\"","For once, Yan Huai smiled.","\"Good.\"","He was overjoyed by this victory. His only regret was that he couldn't be there in person, couldn't witness Master Qi Quan's heroic demeanor as he eradicated the evil cultivators.","The butler nearby was quite adept at reading the room.","Seeing the hint of joy on Yan Huai's face, he chimed in at the right moment: \"Young Master, they are still waiting at the competition grounds.\"","Yan Huai put his phone in his pocket, turned, and strode away.","The final match was underway on the competition stage.","This was the battle for the championship.","Both contestants were disciples from branch families. The disciples from the main family had long been eliminated, failing to even make it into the top three.","In the viewing stands, Yan Fengjun's expression was calm.","A branch family head seated to his right said with a chuckle, \"The disciples performed remarkably well this year. Several have truly exceptional talent, actually advancing to Level Six just before the competition. If I recall correctly, last time only Yan Huai was at Level Six, wasn't he?\"","Another nodded in agreement. \"It seems we needn't worry about the upcoming Mystic Sect Grand Competition. With several Level Six cultivators, why fear other sects?\"","Yan Fengqing suddenly let out a soft laugh, his tone deliberately slow, as if afraid others couldn't hear clearly. \"Does the Family Head share this view?\"","The viewing stands fell silent.","The main family hadn't even made the top three this time; their face was thoroughly lost.","Yan Fengqing was deliberately provoking the Family Head.","\"As long as they bear the Yan surname and can bring glory to the family, they are all good disciples of our Yan family,\" Yan Fengjun said with a smile. \"The disciples from Fengqing's branch are all prodigies. I'm sure they will shine brightly at next year's Mystic Sect Grand Competition.\"","Yan Fengqing gave a cold smirk.","He didn't believe Yan Fengjun could be this pleased while being suppressed by the branch families.","At that moment, the match on the stage finally concluded.","The one who clinched the championship was precisely a disciple from Yan Fengqing's branch.","Thunderous applause erupted from the audience seats.","Only the main family's section was enveloped in a somber atmosphere.","One young contestant even covered his face and began to cry.","He was originally the most promising candidate from the main family.","Only nineteen years old, he was already at Level Five, Second Tier, considered a rare genius.","But his peers and opponents had all broken through to Level Six just before the competition. This undoubtedly placed immense pressure on him before he even stepped onto the stage.","During the match, being completely overpowered by his opponent shattered his confidence even further.","Now that the competition was over, not a single main family disciple had qualified for next year's Mystic Sect Grand Competition. They had disgraced the main family; they had failed the careful nurturing of the Family Head and the elders.","While gloom hung over the main family's section, three other branch family sections were beaming with joy. The remaining branch, never particularly strong and always rather laid-back, simply watched the spectacle from the sidelines.","\"This year is truly strange. So many genius disciples suddenly emerged, and all from the branch families.\"","\"Look, someone from the main family seems to be crying. It does look pitiful, but to be honest, the main family has really lost face this year.\"","\"What's there to lose face about? Back then, Brother Yan Huai was in a league of his own, far more impressive than these several Level Six cultivators who are now on par with each other?\"","\"Speaking of Brother Huai, where is he? He was just here.\"","\"Over there! He's coming back!\"","All eyes turned.","With the competition concluded, it was time for the closing address. Yan Huai's return was perfectly timed.","He stepped onto the high platform with composure, swept his gaze across the entire arena, and uttered only one sentence.","\"Today's competition is invalid.\"","The entire arena erupted in an uproar.","\"Invalid? Did I hear that correctly?\"","\"Is the main family unable to accept defeat?\"","\"Yan Huai, and here I thought you were my idol. I was clearly mistaken!\"","\"Is this the magnanimity of the main family? Truly eye-opening!\"","\"Brother Huai, blink if you're being held against your will.\"","Discussions buzzed through the audience sections of the four branch families.","The main family section was completely bewildered.","Although they had indeed suffered a loss of face, surely declaring the competition invalid was going too far?","They could still accept defeat gracefully.","On the viewing platform, including Yan Fengjun, everyone was stunned.","Yan Fengqing scoffed openly. \"Family Head, what is the meaning of this?\"","The heads of the other two branches who had secured rankings also voiced their questions.","\"Family Head, Yan Huai is young and impulsive, but there must be limits to such mischief.\"","\"Family Head, it seems Yan Huai holds us in no regard.\"","The remaining spectator branch, adhering to principles of fairness, chimed in: \"Family Head, this matter is indeed improper.\"","Yan Fengjun: \"...\"","He himself was at a loss.","If this kid wanted to stir up trouble, he didn't have to make it this big!","With one sentence, he had offended everyone present.","The atmosphere on the competition grounds grew extremely tense. Everyone was waiting for an apology and explanation from Yan Huai.","Yan Huai moved.","He reached into his pocket and pulled out a remote control.","Everyone: ???","Under the watchful eyes of the crowd, Yan Huai pressed a button.","The audience seating areas underwent a sudden transformation.","All five sections of the audience seating lit up with formation barriers—Level Eight formations at that!","These formations could trap people but would not cause any harm. Those inside could not exit unless they broke the formation.","The formations were contained within talismans—a type of composite talisman that Yan Huai had arranged in advance in the audience seating.","These were drawn by Xie Lanzhou.","The remote control wasn't a normal one; it was programmed so that pressing the button would instantly activate the composite talismans.","This sudden turn of events left everyone dumbfounded.","After a moment of stunned silence, someone slammed the table and stood up, shouting angrily, \"Yan Huai! Have you gone mad!\"","Yan Huai glanced at him from afar and said, \"Be quiet.\"","Breaking a Level Eight formation was impossible, and there were several powerful figures on the viewing platform. Presumably, Yan Huai wouldn't dare to harm them.","The disciples in the audience seats quieted down.","But the big shots on the viewing platform could not remain calm.","Those with guilty consciences naturally did not want Yan Huai to continue. Disregarding all else, one of them directly shot a sword beam towards Yan Huai.","Yan Huai reacted with astonishing speed. The peach wood sword on his wrist instantly enlarged, blocking the fierce sword beam and shattering it to pieces.","The crowd gasped in surprise.","The head who had attacked was already a Level Seven, First Tier cultivator!","For Yan Huai to block it so effortlessly... something wasn't quite right.","The attacker was momentarily stunned before asking, \"You've actually reached Level Seven already?!\"","The entire arena was in an uproar.","In the hearts of all the family disciples, Yan Huai was indeed the most dazzling presence.","But they never imagined Yan Huai would advance to Level Seven so quickly!","That was Level Seven—a level qualifying one to become Family Head.","Yan Fengqing's smile turned icy. \"The Family Head has truly raised a fine son.\"","Yan Fengjun feigned composure. \"Everyone, calm down. Let's hear what Yan Huai has to say first.\"","The attacker had no choice but to sit back down.","The first strike could be explained as a moment of impulse. A second attempt would likely not be tolerated by Yan Fengjun.","Without further ado, Yan Huai took out a list and handed it to the butler.","\"Read it.\"","The butler dared not disobey and began reading in a clear, loud voice.","Huh? Why did it sound more and more off as he read?","These were all disciples from three of the branch families, including those who had placed in the top ranks of the competition.","Within the formation barriers enveloping the three factions, many people began to look panicked.","The weakest faction was still watching the spectacle.","\"Why are those few trembling?\"","\"What's the deal with this list? What does it actually mean?\"","\"I wondered why the seating arrangements changed this year. So this was the reason.\"","\"Right, when I arrived, I thought our main family was snubbing us.\"","\"I have a feeling something major is about to happen.\"","After the list was finished, the steward looked towards Yan Huai.","Yan Huai's voice was cold and heavy: \"All names on the list are connected to demonic cultivators.\"","Those named were all disciples under Yan Fengqing and the other two branch families.","If the disciples are connected to demonic cultivators, what about the heads in charge?","The competition grounds instantly erupted.","\"Demonic cultivators? What demonic cultivators!\"","\"What proof do you have that we colluded with demonic cultivators? Show the evidence!\"","\"Yan Huai, if you can't accept defeat, just say so. Don't make up these baseless accusations.\"","\"Bullshit! I'm completely innocent, I've never colluded with demonic cultivators!\"","On the viewing platform, Yan Fengqing remained composed and calm, while the other two heads showed shock on their faces.","Yan Fengjun was equally surprised.","He hadn't known that Yan Huai had silently carried out such a major operation.","But as the voices on the field said, where was the evidence?","A mocking smile appeared on Yan Fengqing's face. \"The magnanimity and boldness of the main family, I truly understand it today.\"","\"Yan Fengjun, you're not actually so unable to accept defeat that you'd fabricate charges against us just to save your face as the family head, are you?\"","Yan Fengjun composed his expression, his eyes dark and heavy as he looked towards the head seated on his right.","The imposing aura of the family head forced the other man to lower his head.","\"I, Yan Fengjun, do not enjoy such underhanded tricks,\" he said, looking at Yan Huai. \"I also do not accept making claims without proof. Yan Huai, present the evidence.\"","Yan Huai said, \"The Investigation Department has developed a detection device. Any celestial master who has taken demonic cultivation pills to accelerate their advancement, or any celestial master who has been implanted with a puppet talisman, can be detected by it.\"","He turned and fixed his gaze on Yan Fengqing on the viewing platform.","\"Just moments ago, a steward in the resting room died suddenly. All his vitality and spiritual power vanished in an instant, turning him into a desiccated corpse.\"","Yan Fengqing's expression changed drastically.","\"A desiccated corpse? Why did he suddenly become a desiccated corpse?\"","\"I said the changes to the competition grounds this year were abnormal. Now something has indeed happened!\"","\"Yan Huai! Let us out! You can't do this just to save face for the main family!\"","The disciples of the three factions within the formation continued to clamor and shout.","Yan Huai said expressionlessly, \"Save your words for when you're at the Investigation Department.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","Yan Fengqing gripped the armrests of his wheelchair tightly, his expression dark as he said, \"Yan Huai, do you know what you're doing? You truly intend to send family members to the Investigation Department for interrogation?\"","\"Weren't you the first one to enter the Investigation Department for interrogation?\" Yan Huai met his gaze, completely unafraid.","Yan Fengqing: \"...\"","He was now a cripple, possessing only seventh-level cultivation. Due to blocked meridians in his legs, he could hardly use any arts.","He looked towards the other two heads.","The other two heads were originally sixth-level and had only recently broken through to seventh-level. Their foundations were unstable. Earlier, when one of them \"impulsively\" struck at Yan Huai, the sword light was feeble, not even matching Yan Huai's, let alone Yan Fengjun who was at the third tier of the seventh level.","They dared not confront Yan Fengjun and his son head-on.","The two men guiltily lowered their heads, not daring to say another word.","Yan Fengqing's expression grew increasingly distorted.","He said in a low, hoarse voice, \"Yan Fengjun, if you send them to the Investigation Department today, aren't you afraid they won't acknowledge you as family head in the future?\"","If the three branches truly united and caused trouble, even the powerful main family would struggle to handle it.","A family might not be perfectly united, but at the very least, it shouldn't engage in internal strife. Otherwise, it would be easy for external forces to take advantage of the chaos and suppress them.","The Yan family was the number one clan in the Mystic Arts world, a position coveted by countless other families.","Even for the sake of family interests, the main family couldn't let outsiders laugh at their discord.","Yan Fengjun looked at Yan Huai.","Father and son exchanged a look across the distance, reaching a silent understanding.","Yan Fengjun declared, \"I announce that, from this day forward, the position of Yan Family Head shall be assumed by Yan Huai. I will enter seclusion for quiet cultivation and will no longer involve myself in worldly affairs.\"","Before the crowd could even express their shock, a team of people entered the competition grounds. They wore Investigation Department uniforms and held small detection devices in their hands.","The faces of Yan Fengqing and the other two heads instantly turned ashen. The disciples of the three factions within the formation all wore expressions of panic and despair.","Simultaneously, Celestial Master Associations across the country were conducting operations to root out hidden agents.","With the assistance of the detection devices, the monitoring teams caught them completely off guard. From association presidents down to low-level staff, there were hidden agents of the demonic cultivation organization.","Those implanted with puppet talismans had already turned into desiccated corpses. Those captured were celestial masters who had only taken the pills.","When arrested, they still shouted about not having done anything wrong. But when the bloody pills were found in their residences, they all fell silent.","The Investigation Department carried out a major purge within the Mystic Arts world.","The speed and thoroughness of their actions sent shockwaves through all the Mystic Arts factions.","After the corrupt elements in the Celestial Master Associations were arrested, the Investigation Department sent messages to all registered celestial masters, notifying them to report to the Investigation Department for testing at designated times. Failure to report voluntarily would result in enforcement and penalties according to relevant regulations.","While some sects and families were still hesitating, the Yan family was the first to step forward and voluntarily undergo testing. They actually did detect individuals who had colluded and interacted with demonic cultivators, and the number was not small.","The Mystic Arts world was in an uproar.","If the number one family was closely following the Investigation Department's lead, what reason did the others have to resist?","If the Yan family's move merely made them compliant, the declaration from the Guiyuan Sect made them completely abandon hope.","All celestial masters of the Guiyuan Sect would undergo testing by the Investigation Department!","Immediately after, the Fu family, Zhou family, Xuanqing Sect, and others all issued announcements, entering a mode of full-member testing.","As for the Hengfeng Sect, ever since Cai Ji's death and the arrest of elders like Yu Lanzhi, it had already been under the supervision of the Investigation Department.","Within the Hengfeng Sect, all elders and disciples were gathered in the sect's main square, queuing up to be tested.","Feng Ke was the first to be tested.","He had not been implanted with a puppet talisman, nor had he taken any pills. He should have been happy, but he couldn't feel any joy at all.","The Hengfeng Sect's leader had participated in a demonic cultivation organization, using the sect's influence to provide cover for them. The Hengfeng Sect's Elder Shi had refined bloody pills for the demonic cultivators, harming countless children, and many righteous celestial masters had even been secretly harmed by them.","Feng Ke's mind was in complete turmoil.","He had entered the sect to cultivate since childhood. His master, Yu Lanzhi, was the person he most revered. The other elders were respected seniors. As the head disciple, he diligently managed sect affairs and taught his junior brothers and sisters cultivation techniques whenever his master and the elders were in seclusion. Yet, it turned out he had never truly understood the sect's true nature.","\"Senior Brother, will our Hengfeng Sect be disbanded?\" a disciple standing behind him asked quietly.","Feng Ke shook his head, his voice hoarse. \"I don't know either.\"","During the earlier battle, nearly all the sect disciples had witnessed it.","They saw clearly everything: Qi Quan slaying the demonic cultivator, Cai Ji using forbidden arts to turn people into desiccated corpses, the sect leader and elders colluding with demonic cultivators, and them being handcuffed by the Investigation Department.","Feng Ke was momentarily unsure whether he should feel gratitude or resentment towards his master.","His master had taught him the esoteric arts of the Mystic Sect, yet in secret, he had committed heinous acts that harmed innocent lives. Simultaneously, however, neither his master nor the elders had turned the sect's disciples into puppets or forced them to take any pills.","It was truly contradictory and jarring.","The inspections were now complete. Aside from a few elders who had avoided the battle and hidden within the sect being detected, all other disciples were in normal condition.","Feng Ke let out a long sigh of relief.","Steeling himself, he mustered his courage and walked over to the investigator conducting the inspections. He asked politely, \"Hello, may I ask if, now that the inspections are finished, we can still remain within the sect?\"","The investigator replied, \"For now, stay within the sect. Do not leave without permission. Await further notification for specific arrangements.\"","Inspections were currently underway everywhere, and the data still needed to be reported to the headquarters to await their instructions.","The specific procedures for handling the implicated sects had not yet been finalized.","Feng Ke said, \"Alright, thank you.\"","Longlin City Investigation Division.","Qi Quan sat in the lounge, consolidating her cultivation, while Ling Sheng followed her every step, refusing to leave her side.","Qi Quan had initially tried to persuade him to go out, but no matter what she said, the young man just hung his head and remained motionless, insisting on staying with her.","He was incredibly stubborn.","Helpless, Qi Quan had no choice but to let him stay.","The task of apprehending the suspects was handled by the investigators. She had already completed her mission by eliminating Cai Ji and several ninth-level evil cultivators.","However, Cai Ji's soul still needed to be sent to Longjing City for interrogation.","By the time she finished her meditation, it was already three in the afternoon.","Qi Quan got up and left the lounge, with Ling Sheng following closely behind.","\"Senior, have you finished your cultivation?\" Shen Hui, who had been waiting outside the lounge, immediately stood up upon seeing her emerge and asked, \"Are we returning to Longjing now?\"","Qi Quan nodded and asked, \"Where's Tang Mian?\"","\"She broke through during the battle and is currently advancing her cultivation. We can return to Longjing first.\"","Both he and Tang Mian had participated in the intense battle. While he hadn't broken through, he had gained some insights and wasn't far from a breakthrough himself.","Qi Quan said, \"Good, let's return to Longjing.\"","The car arrived at the Longjing City Investigation Division in the evening.","Li Guoyan personally stood at the entrance to welcome them.","No amount of respect was too great for the one who had contributed the most to the success of this purge operation.","As soon as Qi Quan stepped into the Investigation Division, she was met with thunderous applause. Everyone present was visibly excited, clapping until their palms turned red, cheering wholeheartedly for this victory.","With sharp eyes, she spotted Xie Lanzhou mingling in the crowd, clapping fervently along with everyone else, his face overflowing with excitement.","He was the unsung hero who had silently borne his burden for twenty years.","Li Guoyan followed her gaze and couldn't help but smile.","\"Master Xie is also a great contributor. Once the entire case is concluded, the Division will hold an awards ceremony.\"","Qi Quan nodded and asked, \"To the interrogation room?\"","\"Yes,\" Li Guoyan replied, his smile fading. \"...There may still be undiscovered bases, and that 'ghost,' we haven't managed to trace.\"","The group entered the interrogation room.","Qi Quan released Cai Ji's soul from the peachwood talisman and bound it to the interrogation chair with spiritual power.","Li Guoyan conducted the interrogation personally, with Qi Quan observing. Ling Sheng, unwilling to leave, took on the role of recorder.","\"I regret it,\" Cai Ji sneered coldly. \"I should have killed you at birth.\"","He had meticulously plotted for so many years, coming so close to success, only to be thwarted by Qi Quan. Now reduced to a mere wisp of a soul, how could he not hate?","He was filled with utter hatred!","Qi Quan said, \"You are as timid as a mouse. Even if time reversed and you went back to that moment, you still wouldn't dare kill me.\"","If he could have killed her, Cai Ji would have done so long ago. How could he have spared her just because she was an infant?","It was simply that he didn't dare risk killing someone with great fortune.","As for previously having people surround and attack her, it was only because her fortune had already returned. She had established her power and possessed self-preservation abilities; the Heavenly Dao wouldn't overly favor her.","If she possessed great fortune but still couldn't survive under Cai Ji's hand, the Heavenly Dao would only be disappointed in her and seek the next person of fortune.","To put it in more straightforward terms, she had a \"newbie protection period\" at birth. If Cai Ji had killed her then, he would have suffered immense backlash and punishment.","Cai Ji's ordinary face twisted with resentment.","\"Why? Why do you all have such great fortune, while I could only be a menial servant, a low-level mystic master for life?\"","In the premier major sect, teeming with geniuses, being a lowly, ordinary-talented menial servant could indeed breed immense imbalance.","But that was no excuse for committing evil deeds.","Li Guoyan had already learned about Cai Ji's life story from Yin Yi.","He began, \"Forty years ago, after the previous sect leader passed away, you chose to leave Guiyuan Sect. Was it from that time that you established the Tianqi organization using forbidden arts?\"","Cai Ji merely sneered coldly, not answering his question.","Qi Quan delivered a sharp blow: \"Actually, even without me, you still wouldn't have become a Human Immortal.\"","\"Impossible!\" Cai Ji spat hatefully. \"If not for your interference, I would have become a Human Immortal today! It's all your fault! You so-called geniuses are always so hypocritical! Disgusting!\"","\"Your vehement reaction shows you are well aware of this fact,\" Qi Quan said unhurriedly. \"You simply wanted to gamble once. Win the gamble, and you become a Human Immortal. Lose, and you're still the highest-ranked Human Sovereign realm peak cultivator in the Mystic World, beyond anyone's reach.\"","Cai Ji laughed mockingly at himself. \"I expended so much effort, spent so many years, just to reach the Human Sovereign realm peak. And you, barely over twenty, are already... How can I possibly accept this?\"","\"Being content with an ordinary life can also be a kind of joy,\" Li Guoyan said. \"Life is brief, but doing meaningful things within that limited time can make life feel fuller and more substantial.\"","Cai Ji said contemptuously, \"Words like that can only come from someone like you, with no qualifications whatsoever. You've never tried mystic arts, never experienced their profundity, so naturally, you can't comprehend the great pursuits of a cultivator.\"","\"I truly don't understand, but the previous sect leader of Guiyuan Sect understood better than you,\" Li Guoyan steered the conversation back. \"You were a menial servant by the previous sect leader's side; you must have known of his divine abilities. Back then, he was just one step away from the eighth level, but his lifespan ran out, and he could only pass away with regrets.\"","Cai Ji snorted coldly. \"You think he never considered extending his own life? I learned the forbidden arts from that forbidden arts book in his possession. He hid it from everyone, afraid people would know the thoughts he'd entertained, but I still found out.\"","\"So, you took the forbidden arts book and left Guiyuan Sect?\"","\"...He died. Was I supposed to stay and watch Yin Yi's inauguration ceremony?\"","\"Although Yin Yi wasn't the sect leader's direct disciple, he was the sect's chief disciple. His succession was perfectly reasonable. Why did you hold such a deep prejudice against him?\"","\"Prejudice?\" Cai Ji sneered. \"I was just a menial servant. How could I possibly hold prejudice against the sect's chief disciple?\"","Qi Quan hit the nail on the head: \"Many criminal suspects like to lament the injustices and suffering they experienced in the past. You, however, seem purely wicked. Quite different from the rest.\"","\"......\"","Cai Ji, who had felt a slight urge to lament his past, now felt none at all.","\"Since you don't wish to discuss your past sect life, let's talk about your 'rise to power.' Over these forty years, how many bases did you establish in total?\"","Cai Ji snorted with a laugh: \"I heard from Yu Lanzhi earlier that someone personally visited Longlin City and Longtang City and was repelled by the ninth-level formations. You don't really only know about those two places, do you?\"","He laughed heartily, \"Don't worry, even if I die, the people under me will continue this business. As long as they are human, they can't resist the temptation of rapid advancement.\"","Li Guoyan replied calmly, \"Unfortunately for you, just today, we simultaneously raided thirty hideouts, arrested thousands of suspects, and rescued many innocent children.\"","\"Through interrogations conducted by the Investigation Departments across various locations, our department has obtained the entire business network of the ghost marriage case and has already begun to uproot it completely.\"","Although most of the thousands of suspects had already been turned into desiccated corpses by Cai Ji's forbidden arts, they still managed to extract a lot of information from a few low-level peripheral members.","The operational network of the Tianqi organization included both evil cultivators and ordinary people. Low-level peripheral evil cultivators and ordinary people were not qualified to be implanted with puppet talismans, thus they luckily escaped that fate.","Don't underestimate these peripheral personnel for being low-level; the secrets they knew or observed were not few.","Cai Ji's expression finally changed.","\"You're bluffing me!\" he blustered, his voice fierce but lacking real strength. \"How could you possibly investigate thirty locations in such a short time! It's impossible!\"","Li Guoyan met his skeptical gaze, his tone low and measured: \"Longlin, Longtang, Longtan, Longxi, Longqu...\"","With each place name he recited, Cai Ji's expression twisted further.","But even after the list was finished, Cai Ji still refused to believe it.","\"Thirty locations, raided simultaneously in one day? Are you joking with me?\" He shook his head. \"It's impossible even if you combined the forces of the Investigation Department and the Mystic Arts Sect.\"","Li Guoyan said, \"It seems Yan Fengqing didn't report to you.\"","\"Report what?\"","\"Composite Sword Talismans,\" Li Guoyan explained patiently. \"By setting up Composite Sword Talismans at the local Investigation Departments, we can destroy the formations simultaneously and catch them all in one net.\"","Only then did Cai Ji realize what he had overlooked.","Before leaving his cave abode, he was at a critical juncture in his cultivation and didn't pay attention to what was happening outside.","Later, Qi Quan disturbed his advancement, forcing him to flee his cave abode to fight her. He simply had no time to find out how the formations were broken, instinctively assuming it was Qi Quan, a Human Sovereign realm cultivator, who shattered them.","But now, Li Guoyan was talking about some composite talisman?","Although he was just a menial disciple, he had also heard of composite talismans. Weren't those legendary things?","Li Guoyan continued to provoke him: \"Chief Consultant Qi created the Composite Sword Talisman, which allows for long-range attacks.\"","Cai Ji was stunned.","He stared at Qi Quan, muttering, \"You really are heaven's favorite. It's unfair, so unfair.\"","\"Did you personally set up those ninth-level formations?\" Qi Quan suddenly asked.","Cai Ji: \"So what if I did?\"","Qi Quan said, \"Your talent for formations isn't bad. If you had cultivated seriously, you might have... perhaps become a respected formation master.\"","\"Hah, a formation master? What's the use of having talent for formations if my cultivation level can't improve? I'd never reach a high rank in my lifetime.\"","Formation levels are restricted by cultivation level.","Li Guoyan said, \"If you couldn't set them up yourself, you could have researched the theory and taught others to do it. That would have been equally meaningful.\"","Cai Ji: \"Why should I let others benefit from my own achievements? What if others bullied me for my low cultivation and simply stole them?\"","\"......\"","In truth, the Mystic Arts Sect is not lacking in cultivators who possess talent in specialized fields. Their own cultivation speed might be slow, but they excel in other mystical arts, even authoring books and works passed down through generations.","Otherwise, where did all those Mystic Arts classics come from?","Those truly focused on cultivation and advancement probably don't have much time to research such things.","Qi Quan suddenly said, \"Even if you don't confess, the Investigation Department will eventually discover any remaining hideouts. Those hideouts are already insignificant. However...\"","\"However what?\"","\"Your Tianqi organization has paved the way for someone else's gain.\"","Cai Ji didn't understand: \"What do you mean, paved the way for someone else's gain?\"","\"Ghost,\" Li Guoyan continued. \"The network expert you nurtured and valued is also a 'ghost' under someone else's command. Since he could hide from us, naturally he could hide from you too.\"","Cai Ji's brow twitched, but he feigned calmness. \"What are you implying? You didn't catch Ghost, so you want to find him through me? Don't even think about it.\"","It wasn't that he particularly cared for Ghost; he simply wanted to cause trouble for the Investigation Department.","\"Do you know about the Siren groups?\" Li Guoyan asked. \"Controlling people's minds through talisman patterns and verbal suggestions, making them willingly sacrifice their lives. It's a much more sophisticated method than your slaughtering techniques.\"","\"Sophisticated?\" Cai Ji, who was quite competitive, sneered. \"What's so sophisticated about that?\"","\"Willingly sacrificing one's life to empower a Ghost King. But this method is extremely covert. Under the blatant spectacle of your atrocities, it appears almost non-existent.\" Li Guoyan deliberately provoked him. \"In other words, he's hiding behind you, attempting to use your crimes to cover for himself, even using the Ghost you trained.\"","The theory of a Ghost King was something Li Guoyan hadn't initially considered at all. If Qi Quan hadn't suggested the possibility to him, he would never have imagined such ghostly arts existed in the world.","But who wants to become a Ghost King, and where are they? The Investigation Department currently has no clues and can only investigate along the leads of the Siren groups.","Ghost thus became the key figure.","Cai Ji: \"......\"","He didn't want to believe what Li Guoyan said, but he couldn't help but doubt.","Qi Quan said softly, \"Have you ever truly considered why a menial disciple like you could come into contact with those forbidden art books?\"","\"I discovered them by accident while cleaning the sect leader's residence. I, I...\"","The more Cai Ji tried to explain, the more he fell into self-doubt.","He had been by the sect leader's side for so many years. When had the sect leader ever been careless, let alone leave something as secret as forbidden art books in his residence?","Did the sect leader really not know he had taken the forbidden art books?","Could it be that he himself was also part of someone's scheme?","Cai Ji simply couldn't accept such a premise.","He was a peak Human Sovereign realm cultivator, just one step away from becoming an Earth Immortal, one of the top existences in the Mystic Arts world. How could he possibly be just a pawn?","But the loopholes in his memory that he had deliberately ignored kept reminding him that the reality might not be as he imagined.","Seizing the moment when Cai Ji was on the verge of collapse, Li Guoyan suddenly asked, \"Did you once command a ghost servant to deliver a forbidden art book to a Buddhist cultivator named Ding Ji?\"","After Qi Quan removed the puppet talisman from Qin Ruo, Qin Ruo revealed that Ding Ji had obtained a forbidden art book from a ghost and subsequently joined the evil cultivator organization.","This point had always been questionable.","Back then, Ding Ji's cultivation was low. That ghost couldn't even defeat him. So how did it come to possess a Mystic Arts forbidden art book?","\"What?\" Cai Ji looked bewildered.","\"Did you command a ghost servant to deliver a forbidden art book to Ding Ji?\" Li Guoyan repeated.","Cai Ji: \"Who is Ding Ji? Why would I send him a forbidden art book? I've never sent one to anyone.\"","What he obtained could only be his own.","There was no need for him to lie about this.","Qi Quan suddenly thought of a possibility.","She asked, \"Did Fu Jiuge and Xie Lanzhou know each other?\"","Cai Ji scoffed, \"Why should I know such juniors?\"","\"But you know me.\"","Cai Ji's expression froze. \"What do you mean?\"","\"How did you calculate that I am the obstacle on your path to immortality?\"","Cai Ji: \"Naturally, it was deduced through the principles of metaphysics and fate.\"","\"You left Guiyuan Sect forty years ago, and I was born twenty-two years ago. Did you deduce all this even before I was born?\"","Cai Ji said, \"What exactly are you trying to say?\"","\"Based on what did you make your deduction?\" Qi Quan asked. \"The forbidden arts tome?\"","Cai Ji fell silent.","He had no talent and was naturally not skilled in divination. The reason he knew Qi Quan was an obstacle was because it was explicitly mentioned in the forbidden arts tome.","To achieve human immortality through the forbidden arts, one must eliminate in advance a person of a specific fate, as this person would become the greatest obstacle on the cultivation path.","That fate was even precise to the specific location and time of birth.","At the time, he found the book sinister and still had doubts. But when he truly waited for Qi Quan to be born, he began to regard it as an infallible guide.","He ordered someone to use a scheme to swap the child, attempting to alter Qi Quan's destiny.","His dazed and hesitant expression had already revealed everything.","Li Guoyan said, \"The former sect leader of Guiyuan Sect was proficient in divination, the foremost master of metaphysical deduction in the Taoist community at that time.\"","\"So what?\" Cai Ji stubbornly retorted.","Li Guoyan: \"Since you didn't know Fu Jiuge and Xie Lanzhou, why did you send people to ambush and kill them?\"","\"Ambush and kill?\"","\"Twenty years ago, they discovered clues to the Longhu City stronghold. They encountered an ambush near that location. Wasn't that a trap you set in advance?\"","Although Cai Ji's talent was lacking, his memory was quite sharp.","\"I don't recall such an event.\"","Li Guoyan: \"...\"","At the same time, news came from the interrogation room where Yan Fengqing was held.","\"Chief Li, Yan Fengqing has confessed. He did indeed receive a letter sent by the codename 'Ghost.' The letter mentioned that Xie Lanzhou had found clues and instructed him to eliminate both Xie Lanzhou and Fu Jiuge. He first dispatched personnel to besiege Xie Lanzhou, then used a scheme to lure Fu Jiuge to Longhu City.\"","Upon receiving the message, Li Guoyan looked at Cai Ji and said, \"Twenty years ago, Yan Fengqing received instructions transmitted to him by 'Ghost.'\"","\"Impossible!\" Cai Ji blurted out. \"Ghost is only seventeen years old this year!\"","How could there have been a Ghost twenty years ago?","After saying it, he suddenly felt a chilling cold in his soul.","The truth of the matter seemed to be drifting further and further from what he had believed.","Li Guoyan was almost certain: \"Ghost has existed for a long time. It's just a codename. Anything capable of transmitting information can be called Ghost.\"","Twenty years ago, electronic products were not yet fully widespread. Ghost transmitted messages using letters. The Ghost of the new era uses network technology.","Cai Ji's expression twisted...","\"Twenty years ago, I didn't issue any orders. I didn't know those two people either. I often went into seclusion for cultivation and didn't personally handle many matters.\"","Qi Quan stated bluntly, \"You are the biggest chess piece of all.\"","\"No, I'm not.\" Something inside Cai Ji began to crumble. \"How could I possibly be a chess piece?\"","\"Since you never gave the forbidden arts tome to anyone, and never issued orders to ambush Xie Lanzhou and Fu Jiuge, why did Ding Ji obtain the forbidden arts tome, and why did Ghost send instructions to Yan Fengqing?\" Li Guoyan mercilessly shattered his mental defenses.","\"Including the divination about Master Qi in the forbidden arts tome, it was deliberately shown to you.\"","Cai Ji: \"...\"","[Master, then why did the person behind all this want to harm Ling Sheng's parents?] The system, hearing this, was very puzzled.","Qi Quan deduced a possibility.","[If he wanted to act against heaven's will, as a master of divination, the first thing he would deduce is whether the path he intends to take is feasible.","He first divined me, and thus began formulating a plan, hinting and luring Cai Ji into the trap.","When his lifespan reached its end, he used some forbidden art to escape reincarnation, hid behind Cai Ji, and secretly accumulated power.","But one day, he divined the emergence of Ling Sheng. A natural spirit body is an uncertain variable. It could become a saint or a demon.","If Ling Sheng were born into the Fu family, with outstanding talent and the love of his parents and clan, he would undoubtedly become a genius revered by all. A smooth life would more likely create a saint.","Such a darling of heaven would be the greatest nemesis for ghosts and monsters.","But if he became a demon, that would be a different ending.]","The system asked with dread: [What ending?]","Qi Quan's gaze turned to Ling Sheng.","He would kill Ding Ji, leave the cave, embark on a path of utterly inhuman slaughter, become the most feared demonic head in the metaphysical community, attracting everyone's attention, buying more ample time for the ghost behind the scenes.","Until... the Ghost King is born."]},{"number":69,"title":"Chapter 69","paragraphs":["The interrogation room fell into silence.","Cai Ji could accept his own failure, could accept being exterminated by a child of fortune, but he could not accept that his entire life had been nothing but a joke.","How could he possibly be just a minor pawn on the chessboard?","\"I saw him die with my own eyes. How could he still be alive?\" Cai Ji shook his head, on the verge of a breakdown.","\"He is indeed dead,\" Qi Quan said. \"And you, from being his menial servant in life, became his shield after his death.\"","Cai Ji was struck another devastating blow.","He had just been smug about his achievements, only to be told now that it was all just a dream manipulated by someone else.","\"Then tell me, if he's dead, why is he doing all this? What does he want?\"","Li Guoyan answered him: \"The Siren clusters, luring people to suicide, which is a sacrifice of life. Through this ritual, he strengthens his ghostly form, aiming to become a Ghost King.\"","\"A Ghost King? What's the use of becoming a Ghost King?\"","Cai Ji still didn't understand. Before leaving the Guiyuan Sect, he was just a menial servant with little chance to peruse the sect's ancient texts, never gaining access to such knowledge.","Qi Quan explained: \"A Ghost King corresponds to a Human Immortal. Both can break free from the cycle of reincarnation, existing freely and without restraint.\"","\"What's so good about being a ghost?\"","Qi Quan: \"Once he breaks free from reincarnation, he is no longer a mere ghost. He can enjoy everything the living can enjoy, while also possessing powerful ghostly abilities and an extended lifespan.\"","\"...\"","Considering the former sect leader's search for forbidden arts before his death, Cai Ji was starting to believe it.","He had truly thought the former sect leader died with regrets back then.","Who could have guessed he had already set a trap?","An insignificant little servant had thus become the head of a sinister cultivation organization, drawing the attention of the mystical sects in the open, while that person secretly accumulated power in the shadows, attempting to become a transcendent Ghost King.","Cai Ji had planted puppet talismans in so many people, but in the end, he himself was the true puppet.","How utterly laughable.","Li Guoyan continued to twist the knife: \"You are now a wisp of a soul, sitting in this interrogation room, while that person is secretly hidden somewhere, perhaps in one of your undiscovered bases, on the verge of becoming a Ghost King.\"","Cai Ji made one last struggle. \"But without you all, I would have already become a Human Immortal by now.\"","\"You think becoming a Human Immortal is easy?\" Qi Quan asked. \"Can one become a Human Immortal just by relying on forbidden arts that harm others? Wouldn't that mean everyone in the world could become one?\"","Cai Ji's eyes widened. \"What do you mean?\"","\"To ascend from Human Sovereign to Human Immortal, one must undergo a trial of the heart. Can you truly say your heart is clear and without guilt?\"","\"...\"","\"Even if you don't believe what you did was wrong, if during the trial you learned the whole truth, knew you were just a pawn meant to draw fire, are you sure you could pass that stage?\"","Cai Ji shuddered all over.","He didn't know. He was just a servant. He had relied on forbidden arts to forcefully rise from a lowly servant to the peak of the Human Sovereign realm and naively thought the Human Immortal realm was just a step away.","But in reality, he could never have become a Human Immortal.","[But, Great One, aren't the Siren clusters also about harming people? Can the one behind it all really become a Ghost King?]","Qi Quan: [Exploiting a loophole in the Heavenly Dao. Those people voluntarily sacrificed their lives. What does that have to do with him?]","[But the talismanic patterns with illusion magic, isn't that incitement?]","Qi Quan: [He merely drew the talismanic patterns. As for their use, whether they were exploited by others, no one can say for sure.]","[Huh? What does that mean?]","Qi Quan stated plainly: [Before this, did you think Cai Ji was incited by someone?]","The system paused, then had a sudden realization.","Utilizing the desires of the human heart, weaving a seductive net, making those people, like Cai Ji, believe they were in control, when in fact they were merely puppets manipulated by their own desires.","[That's too terrifying!]","Li Guoyan's previously somewhat relaxed mood grew heavy again.","They had dismantled one sinister cultivation organization, but there was an even more cunning mastermind behind the scenes.","He tapped the table, his sharp gaze fixed on Cai Ji, and said, \"I imagine you are also unwilling to remain someone else's puppet. Speak up, who is 'Ghost'?\"","Cai Ji was silent for a moment, then said, \"I have a request.\"","\"Speak.\"","\"I know my crimes are unforgivable, and what awaits me is surely soul dispersion. But before my soul scatters, I want to see that person's soul scatter with my own eyes, if what you say is true.\"","Li Guoyan: \"Agreed.\"","Cai Ji raised his head, looking at the glaringly bright light on the ceiling, and said faintly, \"His name is Cai Guang. Seventeen years old. A seventh-level Celestial Master. Of course, that rank was achieved by piling up elixirs.\"","\"Did you adopt him?\"","Cai Ji smiled self-deprecatingly. \"Yes. I adopted him when he was three.\"","\"Three years old...\" Li Guoyan asked, \"Was he one of the trafficked children?\"","\"Yes. It was just a coincidence that day. I happened to see him, discovered his talent was quite good, his fortune not ordinary either, and conceived the idea of training him to work for me.\"","Fourteen years ago, the internet was in a period of rapid development. Electronic products were gradually entering public view. Cai Ji realized the organization had to keep up with the times; he needed talent in network-related matters.","Cai Guang's mind was very sharp; he grasped many concepts as soon as he learned them.","Destined to become a ghost in the network, unable to live in the sunlight, Cai Ji named him Cai Guang (Light).","With Cai Guang's operations on the network, the sinister cultivation organization developed more extensive operations and grew at an extremely rapid pace.","For some unknown reason, he never planted a puppet talisman in Cai Guang.","He had a special trust in him, mixed with a certain reluctance, perhaps because he had invested effort in Cai Guang.","Cai Ji used to think that was the reason, but now, he had learned to question.","Happening to see Cai Guang outside the cave dwelling, conceiving the idea to train him, being unwilling to plant a puppet talisman—none of these actions fit his usual temperament.","Cai Ji sighed with emotion. \"He was indeed very obedient.\"","But whose orders he was obeying was another matter.","Once the floodgates opened, they couldn't be stopped.","Cai Ji confessed everything, including several overlooked small bases and the more secretive business chains of the Tianqi organization.","For the following period, the Investigation Department would be very busy.","Fortunately, more and more Celestial Masters were applying to join the Investigation Department, injecting fresh blood and lightening the burden on the investigators.","Testing all registered Celestial Masters, compiling data, interrogating suspects, dealing with implicated sects and families...","By the time everything was finished, a week had passed.","During that week, the Investigation Department did not forget to search for Cai Guang, but Cai Guang seemed to have evaporated from the face of the earth, leaving no trace.","The Investigation Department's decision regarding the implicated sects, especially the Hengfeng Sect, was announced.","The Hengfeng Sect was dissolved. All its Celestial Masters had their certificates temporarily revoked and were to undergo ideological education. After completing their studies, they would be assessed. Upon passing the assessment, their certificates would be returned.","Regarding the whereabouts of the Celestial Masters after the dissolution, the Investigation Department also offered suggestions.","They could join other sects or families; they could become free rogue cultivators; they could apply to join the Investigation Department.","Although these Celestial Masters were not involved in the case, the nature of the Hengfeng Sect's leader and elders participating in a sinister cultivation organization was too egregious. The authorities had to issue a warning.","The dissolution of the Hengfeng Sect was inevitable.","Outside the sect grounds, disciples gathered around Feng Ke, asking him what choice he would make.","Feng Ke pondered for a moment, then said with a smile, \"That day in the sect, I looked up at Senior Qi's heroic bearing and admired her powerful yet unarrogant character. I want to follow in her footsteps and join the Investigation Department.\"","\"Ah! I think the same way, I want to join the Investigation Department too!\"","\"Count me in!\"","\"Me, me, me!\"","Longjing City.","Di Meng arrived at the guesthouse early in the morning and knocked on the door of Qi Quan's residence.","Shen Hui opened the door.","He asked, \"Investigator Di, what brings you here?\"","Di Meng grinned and said, \"Naturally, I'm here to pick up Senior to the Department.\"","\"Pick up?\" Shen Hui was puzzled. \"Can't I just take her there?\"","Di Meng smiled smugly. \"Today is the commendation ceremony. To show respect, the Department specifically sent me to escort Senior Qi.\"","\"I bet you weren't specifically sent, were you?\" Tang Mian came out of her room, teasing him.","She had recently had a breakthrough in her cultivation in Longlin City. After consolidating for two days, she hurried to Longjing to stay by Qi Quan's side.","Di Meng chuckled. \"Ning Zhi wanted to come too. We fought over it, and I won.\"","\"...\"","Shen Hui said, \"That still doesn't mean you can take my job.\"","\"It's fine. After the ceremony, we'll be returning to Longjiang and will see Senior every day,\" Tang Mian patted Shen Hui's shoulder.","Shen Hui brightened up. \"That's true.\"","Di Meng felt as if he had swallowed a huge mouthful of lemon, so sour it was.","After a grand and sweeping cleanup operation, Qi Quan's status within the entire Mystic Realm was now unshakable.","She was the super expert who had eliminated three Human Sovereign realm cultivators!","Even if they were Human Sovereign realm cultivators boosted by drugs, they were still Human Sovereign realm, yet the great master had annihilated them in a single move.","Everyone present was utterly impressed by her.","In this operation, the Investigation Department also established immense authority and gained recognition from many young exorcists.","Since the authorities released the list of individuals involved in the case, the reputation of the Exorcist Association had plummeted to rock bottom.","Many names on the list were high-ranking officials and staff within the Association. How could such a corrupt association still be qualified to govern exorcists?","Many sects and families also had exorcists who colluded with the evil cultivator organization. Even the top family, the Yan family, and the third-ranked sect, the Hengfeng Sect, were not spared.","Moreover, the organization's leader, Cai Ji, was originally a menial servant from the top sect, the Guiyuan Sect.","As for the matters related to the Siren groups, the authorities had not yet made them public.","This situation was truly a disgrace to the entire Mystic Realm.","Qi Quan was the Chief Consultant of the Investigation Department and had made the greatest contributions in this operation, so she deserved the highest commendation.","Other meritorious personnel would also receive their due awards.","Di Meng glanced around the living room and asked, \"Where is Senior?\"","As soon as he finished speaking, a figure descended from the second floor.","Her hair was tied in a neat high ponytail, and she wore the uniform of the Investigation Department. The fitted uniform accentuated her tall, straight figure, making her look heroic and impressive.","Qi Quan usually dressed casually and comfortably; this was the first time she had worn the uniform.","The three of them immediately brightened up.","...","Senior looks incredibly good in uniform!","Before they could recover, another figure appeared.","He wore the same uniform, standing on the steps behind Qi Quan, tall and slender, his gaze fixed on the person in front of him.","The three downstairs: \"...\"","It was just... a double assault of stunning beauty.","Lingsheng had also performed great deeds in this operation.","He and Xie Lanzhou worked day and night drawing talismans. Most of the spirit talismans, protective charms, and attack talismans used by the Investigation Department during the operation were drawn by them.","Furthermore, all the injured whose meridians were damaged during the operation were sent to Longjing City and received proper treatment.","Thanks to him, there were no casualties for the Investigation Department and the Mystic Realm this time.","He would also be commended.","Since he couldn't continue using illusion magic to conceal his face during the commendation, Qi Quan dispelled the illusion, allowing his true appearance to show.","However, revealing his true face carried certain risks.","From the interrogation of Cai Ji, it was concluded that Fu Jiuge's ambush and subsequent discovery by Ding Ji were not coincidences but traps set by someone behind the scenes.","The target was the child in Fu Jiuge's womb.","Once Lingsheng was exposed to the public, it might attract a lot of trouble.","But from another perspective, since that person had guided Ding Ji to suppress the \"Heaven's Favored Child,\" they would surely keep a close watch on Lingsheng's situation.","Perhaps as early as when Qi Quan killed Ding Ji and brought Lingsheng back to the villa, the other party already knew.","Whether Lingsheng showed his face or not didn't matter much anymore.","Moreover, Qi Quan never feared the demons and monsters hiding in the darkness.","To some extent, her and Lingsheng's circumstances were quite similar.","She was also a stumbling block in that person's eyes.","Two stumbling blocks coming together might just smash the other party to pieces, scattering their soul.","The malevolent ghost hiding in the shadows probably never foresaw this day when it divined their fortunes, did it?","\"Chief Consultant Qi, Chief Physician Qi, please get in the car,\" Di Meng saluted, saying with a serious expression.","Qi Quan and Lingsheng got into his car, while Shen Hui and Tang Mian followed behind in another car.","Di Meng drove extremely steadily this time.","In the back seat, Lingsheng sat upright, but his head was turned towards Qi Quan, gazing intently at her profile.","Qi Quan: ?","She turned her head to meet the young man's gaze and asked, \"What is it?\"","Lingsheng swiftly turned his head back, flusteredly avoiding her gaze, and shook his head.","Pfft. The system couldn't help but laugh.","Qi Quan: What are you laughing at?","System: Hehe, nothing.","Silence returned to the car as it drove towards the Investigation Department.","This commendation ceremony was held with great grandeur. The sect leaders, family heads, and elders from various forces who participated in the cleanup operation, such as Yin Yi, Fu Jiuchong, Wan Du, and others, were all present.","Also gathered in the Investigation Department's auditorium were the exorcists who had performed exceptionally well in operations across different regions.","The commendation ceremony was broadcast live within all local Investigation Departments.","In the auditorium, the esteemed figures sat in the front rows, with two seats left empty in the very center.","Sect Leader Wan of the Xuanqing Sect said with admiration, \"Sect Leader Yin, being able to fight alongside Senior Qi is truly enviable.\"","He had led his team to Longtang City at the time and missed witnessing Senior Qi's magnificent feat of slaying the Human Sovereigns, which he had always regretted.","Yin Yi smiled gracefully. \"Senior Qi is indeed a model for the Mystic Realm.\"","Actually, he hadn't seen much at the time.","The battle between two Human Sovereign realm cultivators was so fast they could barely see anything. He only vaguely saw the final two...","enormous black-red blades engulfing Cai Ji.","But that didn't stop him from feeling a bit superior in front of Wan Du.","\"Who is that? He looks somewhat familiar,\" Wan Du said, looking towards a seat not far away, surprised. \"And why is there a trace of ghostly aura?\"","\"Xie Lanzhou,\" Fu Jiuchong beside him suddenly spoke. \"The first-place winner of the Mystic Realm Grand Competition years ago.\"","Winning first place as a rogue cultivator had made Xie Lanzhou a hot topic in the Mystic Realm that year.","Wan Du suddenly remembered. \"So it's Brother Fu's brother-in-law! But he...\"","\"He was also a major contributor to this cleanup plan,\" Yin Yi explained. \"Master Xie, as a ghost cultivator, spent twenty years investigating thirty evil cultivator hideouts and secretly rescuing many children.\"","Wan Du said respectfully, \"Truly worthy of being the Mystic Realm's top champion back then.\"","He then asked, \"Why is there another empty seat next to him?\"","\"I'm not sure about that either,\" Yin Yi shook his head.","Suddenly, several figures appeared at the auditorium entrance.","The entire hall fell silent, watching the newcomers with immense fervor.","Li Guoyan walked at the very front, his posture tall and imposing, his aura incredibly strong.","Everyone involuntarily craned their necks.","Finally—","Qi Quan, clad in her uniform, appeared in their line of sight.","Like a peerless sword, sharp and powerful, the crisp uniform made her appear even more towering and majestic, inspiring awe and immense reverence in everyone's hearts.","Everyone was inwardly cheering.","This was their Senior Qi Quan!","But when another figure appeared beside Qi Quan, most people wore expressions of surprise and confusion.","Who was he?","Ling Sheng rarely showed his true face in public. Apart from the few who knew his real identity, even within the Investigation Department, not many recognized him.","Why could such an unknown person stand beside Senior Qi Quan? Why could he walk into the auditorium alongside Director Li?","Under the gaze of the crowd, Ling Sheng went and sat down next to Xie Lanzhou.","Only Fu Jiuchong's eyes widened in shock.","He stared intently at Ling Sheng's face, his eyes filled with disbelief.","How remarkably similar this face was to his sister's!","Moreover, he was sitting next to Xie Lanzhou.","What did this mean?","Fu Jiuchong's emotions churned violently, so much so that he didn't even hear Yin Yi calling him.","\"Brother Fu, Brother Fu, it's starting.\"","Fu Jiuchong snapped back to reality, taking a deep breath. Once the ceremony was over, he had to get to the bottom of this.","Investigation Departments across the country were simultaneously broadcasting the commendation ceremony live.","Inside the Longjiang City Investigation Department's auditorium, the investigators couldn't contain their pride. Thunderous applause erupted the moment Qi Quan appeared.","The applause lasted for a long time.","They weren't at the live broadcast site, and the atmosphere in their auditorium wasn't as solemn and dignified as at the headquarters. Investigators whispered among themselves, and even the person in charge, Meng Yunzheng, seeing this, turned a blind eye.","Truth be told, he wanted to join the discussion too.","\"Wuwuwu... Senior is so beautiful and dashing! She looks super, super good in that uniform!\"","\"Longjiang City! Senior is from Longjiang City!\"","\"Will Senior stay in Longjing City from now on, or continue living in Longjiang?\"","\"Senior must come back to Longjiang!\"","\"Huh? Who's that next to Senior?\"","\"Haven't seen him before, but his looks are truly top-tier!\"","\"Rare to see someone standing next to Senior whose looks aren't completely overshadowed by hers.\"","\"Did you notice, he's always half a step behind Senior, and his gaze is always fixed on her?\"","\"It seems... that's really true!\"","...","The commendation ceremony officially began.","Meng Yunzheng gave a light cough, and the auditorium instantly fell silent.","Director Li Guoyan of the National Investigation Headquarters took the stage to deliver a speech.","Although he was an ordinary person, no one dared to look down on him. The medals he had earned and the contributions he had made were achievements that everyone in the Investigation Department found hard to match.","In this solemn and dignified setting, he rarely revealed a trace of a smile, passionately recounting the achievements made since the establishment of the Investigation Department and the results of this nationwide large-scale cleanup operation.","Thunderous applause echoed from below the stage, and investigators watching the live broadcast from various locations also clapped excitedly.","They felt proud to wear this uniform.","Li Guoyan's speech was concise, powerful, and weighty as a thousand pounds, each word striking deep and stirring emotions.","Many people's eyes reddened, tears welling up.","\"This cleanup operation has been successfully completed. Everyone who participated will receive commendation.\"","Hearing this, everyone knew it was time to award the merit medals.","Needless to say, Senior Qi Quan would definitely receive the Special Class Merit!","Her contributions were witnessed by all; no one could question or deny them.","Without her invention of the Unity Talisman, without her development of the Composite Talisman, without her live teaching sessions, without her single-handedly defeating the Human Emperor realm leader Cai Ji, there would be no commendation ceremony today.","This medal was the consensus of the public.","When Qi Quan took the stage to receive and have the medal pinned on her, the applause from below was even more deafening than thunder. Many people cried tears of excitement.","Standing on the stage, a surge of warmth filled her chest—full, swelling—an emotion she had never felt before.","[Big Boss, congratulations! You look really, really, really handsome today!] The system excitedly lavished praise.","Qi Quan smiled. [Thank you.]","Compared to being revered by disciples in her sect, a scene like this was even more touching.","It seemed her mindset was different from before.","After the medal-awarding ceremony concluded, Qi Quan returned to her seat.","The second to receive commendation was Xie Lanzhou.","Many present didn't know Xie Lanzhou. Listening to his story with puzzled expressions, they gradually felt a sense of pity, but after the pity came even greater admiration.","For twenty years, unwavering, he had located thirty hideouts and preserved countless pieces of evidence. This contribution carried immense weight.","Not to mention, after returning, he had worked day and night drawing talismans.","Everyone gave him a warm round of applause.","Xie Lanzhou smiled with exceptional joy.","After him, Yin Yi, Fu Jiuchong, and a group of other senior figures all received commendations.","Finally, someone noticed something unusual.","\"Senior Yin, Senior Fu... they all accepted official commendations?\"","\"They all rendered meritorious service, so why couldn't they accept official commendations?\"","\"No, what I mean is, accepting official commendation implies...\"","\"Implies what?\"","\"How can you be so slow!\"","\"Oh! I get it now!\"","Many people sensed this shift in the wind.","Were the major sects and families of the Mystic Arts world about to accept the leadership and supervision of the official authorities?","Just as the mystics were pondering this, Ling Sheng taking the stage interrupted their train of thought.","Although Ling Sheng didn't directly participate in combat, he had provided many talismans for the Department and treated numerous injured after the cleanup operation. Such contributions could not be erased no matter what.","When the identity of Chief Physician was announced, the entire hall erupted in an uproar.","Fu Jiuchong was stunned, immediately turning his gaze to Xie Lanzhou.","Xie Lanzhou smiled and nodded at him...","Fu Jiuchong: \"...\"","He never imagined that the person who cured his sister Jiuge would be her own child!","This was truly... fate.","Others thought: So this is the Investigation Department's divine doctor? He's so young!","The Longjiang City auditorium also went wild.","\"If I remember correctly, the one who treated dozens of injured at our department before was Senior Qi's assistant, right?\"","\"It was him!\"","\"Although the face is different, I'm sure the build is exactly the same!\"","\"It's Senior Qi's assistant! Even the hairstyle is the same!\"","\"I never knew the assistant was this good-looking!\"","\"If the little assistant became the Chief Physician, will he still stay by Senior Qi's side?\"","\"Not sure.\"","The revelation of the divine doctor's identity genuinely shocked the vast majority of people.","The commendation ceremony gradually approached its conclusion. Those able to take the stage and receive awards were all individuals with outstanding merits.","Other mystics who participated in the cleanup operation and rendered meritorious service would receive one treatment slot and one invitation card. The remaining mystics who merely participated would receive a live-stream invitation card.","Both the treatment slots and invitation cards were extremely valuable.","The treatment slot could be used for oneself or for relatives and friends.","Anyone with damaged meridians or dantian could receive one free treatment opportunity using the treatment slot.","The mystics were incredibly excited.","This was an opportunity countless mystics had dreamed of!","In the past, the Mystic Arts world had no medical practitioners. When Taoist masters were injured, they had nowhere to seek treatment. They not only had to endure the pain but also watch helplessly as their cultivation stagnated, or even regressed and vanished.","Countless Taoist masters faded into obscurity because of this.","Some masters, having witnessed their friends and family suffer for years, actually shed tears upon hearing this news.","There was hope!","Thank goodness they hadn't chosen to retreat. Thank goodness they had taken part in this battle!","After the commendation ceremony, Li Guoyan personally escorted Qi Quan to her car.","His expression was grave as he said, \"Master Qi, there are ghosts in the shadows. You and Physician Qi must be careful.\"","Qi Quan nodded. \"Thank you.\"","After being away on business for so many days, she truly missed home.","Li Guoyan watched them leave, then turned back to the Investigation Department. Entering an interrogation room, he saw Yan Fengqing and asked, \"How does it feel?\"","He had specially arranged for Yan Fengqing to watch a live stream alone, showing him the news that Fu Jiuge's child could treat damaged meridians.","— Anyone who knew Fu Jiuge would be certain of Ling Sheng's relationship to her just by looking at his face.","Yan Fengqing had indeed recognized him.","His fists were clenched so tightly his knuckles were white, veins bulged on his forehead, and his face was nearly contorted. His voice squeezed out from his throat as he laughed maniacally, \"You told me this on purpose, didn't you? To see me filled with regret?\"","He did regret it, but he refused to show weakness before Li Guoyan.","Li Guoyan shook his head. \"That wasn't my intention.\"","\"Hmph.\" Yan Fengqing clearly didn't believe him.","\"Twenty years ago, you received a letter from 'The Ghost'. It instructed you to deliberately fabricate false information to lure Xie Lanzhou and then Fu Jiuge to Longhu City one after the other, and then arrange an ambush to kill them.\"","Yan Fengqing lifted his eyelids slightly. \"You already asked about that yesterday.\"","\"However, the one who gave you that order was not the 'Honored Master' you believed it to be.\" Li Guoyan observed his expression.","That ghost hiding in the shadows still had no trace. Based on current evidence, only Yan Fengqing...","had been in contact with that side.","He wanted to see if he could find a new lead.","Yan Fengqing looked up in surprise. \"What do you mean?\"","His astonishment seemed genuine.","Li Guoyan said seriously, \"Your so-called 'Honored Master,' that is, Cai Ji, never issued such an order back then. He was merely a pawn himself. And you? You weren't even a pawn.\"","Yan Fengqing: \"...\"","A proud son of heaven could accept being a pawn, but not being less than a pawn.","He stared blankly at Li Guoyan for a moment, then suddenly began to laugh.","\"Cai Ji...\" Yan Fengqing laughed until tears streamed down his face. \"So that's his name.\"","Li Guoyan: \"He was originally a menial servant under the former sect master of the Guiyuan Sect.\"","Yan Fengqing wiped away his tears, a faint smile curling his lips.","\"A menial servant? A menial servant is just fine.\"","\"He left the sect with only second-level cultivation. But by using forbidden arts, he became a high-level Taoist master in an extremely short time and established the Tianqi Organization.\"","Cai Ji had personally witnessed the despair of the former sect master as his lifespan neared its end. That despair relentlessly assaulted him, breeding greed within.","He wanted immortality.","\"Life as long as heaven's\" was the ultimate goal he pursued.","However, everything he experienced was merely a dream woven for him by someone else—a dream steeped in blood and cruelty.","After a long silence, Yan Fengqing suddenly spat out with hatred, \"A mere menial servant! A mere menial servant! A mere... cough, cough, cough!\"","He coughed violently, as if trying to cough his entire lungs out.","Li Guoyan watched him quietly, without a trace of sympathy.","His current fate was nothing but the consequence of his own actions.","He continued twisting the knife: \"Based on the existing confessions and evidence, it can be inferred that the former sect master of the Guiyuan Sect, He Xiuyu, is likely the true mastermind behind all this.\"","\"What?!\" Yan Fengqing questioned, \"Didn't Sect Master He pass away long ago?\"","He Xiuyu died when Yan Fengqing was just a teenager, a prodigy of the Yan family. He had followed the family head at the time to attend the funeral at the Guiyuan Sect, so he remembered it clearly.","Sect Master He was indeed confirmed dead.","\"Ordinary people can become ghosts after death, and so can Taoist masters,\" Li Guoyan stated. \"The person who sent you the order and used you as a tool for murder was not Cai Ji.\"","A chill ran down Yan Fengqing's spine.","A ghost hidden in the shadows, knowing all his affairs, had used him to set a trap and kill.","He asked with difficulty, \"If it really was him, why would he want to kill Fu Jiuge?\"","\"On the forbidden arts manual Cai Ji stole, there was a prophecy. It stated that if one practiced the forbidden arts, a person of great fortune would appear to obstruct their path to immortality. The specific birthplace and birth time were clearly marked.\"","Yan Fengqing wasn't stupid. He understood almost immediately.","\"It was deliberate?\"","What kind of forbidden arts manual would contain such a prophecy?","Only an ignorant menial servant like Cai Ji would believe it completely.","Li Guoyan nodded. \"He Xiuyu was famous in the Mystic Arts world for his divination arts back then. This was the child of destiny he divined before his death, the one who would hinder his path to becoming a Ghost King.\"","\"What does that have to do with Fu Jiuge?\" Yan Fengqing asked.","Li Guoyan replied, \"The one he divined before his death was Qi Quan. Three years later, he divined another child of destiny—precisely Fu Jiuge's child.\"","\"...\"","Yan Fengqing truly couldn't accept it.","His cooperation with the Tianqi Organization, while not entirely voluntary, at least meant he wasn't kept completely in the dark.","A dead man turned ghost, secretly manipulating events for decades, all just to become a Ghost King?","His voice was hoarse as he asked, \"Why are you telling me all this? What do you want?\"","\"I want to ask, is that letter still in existence?\"","This might be the only clue left; even a single letter couldn't be overlooked.","Yan Fengqing: \"It's gone.\"","Li Guoyan's expression didn't change; this was within expectations.","He said nothing more and turned to leave.","\"But I can imitate the handwriting,\" Yan Fengqing suddenly said. \"And I investigated the source of the paper back then.\"","His cooperation with Tianqi hadn't lasted long back then, and his vigilance was quite high. After receiving the letter, he immediately sent someone to secretly investigate its origin and memorized the handwriting on it.","The letter had no return address. The handwriting was unremarkable, seemingly ordinary, even a bit delicate. But the stationery was unusual.","Li Guoyan turned back.","\"I have a condition,\" Yan Fengqing looked at him.","Li Guoyan nodded. \"Go on.\"","\"I want to see him utterly destroyed, his soul scattered. If what you say is true.\"","Li Guoyan: \"...\"","It seemed the hatred ran as deep as Cai Ji's.","Yan Fengqing probably thought that without that letter, he likely wouldn't have moved against Fu Jiuge. Then Fu Jiuge could have given birth safely, the child would have grown up in the Fu family, studied medical arts, and there would have been hope for curing his legs.","But he might have forgotten that it was precisely because he joined the Tianqi Organization that he caught He Xiuyu's attention.","Li Guoyan agreed.","Yan Fengqing said, \"Back then, there was no online 'Ghost' network; information transmission wasn't that fast. I had people investigate the clues very carefully, without alerting the other party.\"","\"What did you find?\"","\"That kind of thick, colored letter paper had just become popular in Longhai City. It hadn't spread widely yet and was rare in Longjing City,\" Yan Fengqing explained. \"Following this lead to Longhai City, through purchase records and handwriting comparison, I found a person.\"","Li Guoyan was quite surprised.","Searching for purchase records in Longhai City and conducting handwriting comparisons was an extremely difficult task at the time. To be able to find this person amidst such a massive amount of information shows Yan Fengqing's capability and determination.","With such skills, why didn't he do something good instead of joining a sinister cultivation organization?","What a pity.","\"What kind of person?\" Li Guoyan asked.","Yan Fengqing: \"A dead woman.\"","\"...\"","\"So the lead ends here.\" Yan Fengqing, appreciating his look of astonishment, felt a certain pleasure. \"Does Director Li have anything else to ask?\"","Li Guoyan, however, smiled and said, \"Coincidentally, the person I'm looking for is also a dead woman.\"","Yan Fengqing: ?","\"Tell me, who is she.\"","The user \"Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts\" from the Siren Queen group still hadn't been found. She should be a major ghost of similar rank to Xiong Wangchun from the Siren King group.","Such a major ghost lingering in the mortal world, guiding others to suicide, is a rather dangerous matter.","Even though the authorities have already urged the public to download the software to prevent being lured by groups like the Siren group, there will always be those who like to be contrarian, or simply don't care.","A female ghost capable of transmitting information twenty years ago is certainly not a nobody.","Not seeing the expression he had hoped for on Li Guoyan's face, Yan Fengqing said with some disappointment, \"Longhai City, Gao Peilan.\"","Li Guoyan immediately left the interrogation room and ordered someone to look up the information.","\"Director Li, she's been dead for at least twenty years. It won't be easy to find,\" an investigator said. \"It wasn't digital office work back then. Records were all handwritten, with very few being printed.\"","Li Guoyan said, \"Contact the local investigation office in Longhai City. Get the detailed information as soon as possible.\"","\"Yes, sir!\"","On the other side, Qi Quan and Lingsheng returned to their accommodation and did not immediately go back to Longjiang City.","Just as Shen Hui and Tang Mian were puzzled, someone came to visit.","It was the Fu family.","Seeing Fu Jiuge's face, the two instantly understood.","So the Senior had already guessed. The reason they didn't return to Longjiang immediately was because they knew the Fu family was coming.","Shen Hui made tea for the guests, while Tang Mian went upstairs to inform Qi Quan.","The three members of the Fu family sat on the living room sofa, all looking anxious.","\"Dad, is he really Aunt's child?\" Fu Luanfei asked excitedly. \"That makes him my cousin, right?\"","Fu Jiuchong nodded firmly. \"Yes, your cousin.\"","\"So that means Cousin saved Aunt twice. That's fate.\"","Fu Jiuchong suddenly smiled.","\"Yes, fate.\"","As soon as the words were spoken, they saw Lingsheng coming downstairs carrying a suitcase.","Behind him were Qi Quan and Tang Mian.","After the commendation ceremony, Qi Quan no longer concealed Lingsheng's face, but still shielded his special constitution.","\"Senior Qi.\" Fu Jiuchong and the other two quickly stood up.","The Fu family could never repay the debt of gratitude they owed Qi Quan in this lifetime, so no amount of respect was excessive.","\"Mr. Fu, Ms. Fu, Miss Fu.\" Qi Quan gave a slight nod. \"You can speak with Lingsheng. I'll go wait in the car first and leave this space for you.\"","\"That's not necessary!\" Fu Jiuge said decisively. \"Senior Qi, we won't delay your journey. Just being able to meet, to know that Lingsheng is doing well, is already more than enough for me.\"","She looked at Lingsheng, then suddenly took out her phone from her bag and said with a smile, \"Could we maybe add each other as contacts first?\"","Lingsheng was stunned and instinctively looked towards Qi Quan.","Qi Quan: ...","Ms. Fu is indeed quite a unique person."]},{"number":70,"title":"Chapter 70","paragraphs":["Ling Sheng and Fu Jiuge added each other as friends, and they returned to Longjiang City with Qi Quan.","On the way back, Qi Quan received a message from Li Guoyan.","[Li Guoyan: The suspicious person who passed information to Yan Fengqing twenty years ago has been identified. Gao Peilan, female, 22, died thirty years ago, suicide by falling from a building. She was eight months pregnant at the time of death.]","The system felt a chill: [That's too tragic!]","To fall from a building while pregnant, her heart must have been filled with utter despair.","It asked: [Could this Gao Peilan be \"The Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts\"?]","Qi Quan said: [Uncertain for now.]","She replied to Li Guoyan: [Any photos?]","Not many people could afford photos thirty years ago, but Longhai City was a major metropolis after all. Gao Peilan's family was relatively well-off, and she had taken quite a few photos during her lifetime.","Li Guoyan sent one.","The photo was taken over thirty years ago. Gao Peilan was still in university at the time, her eyes and brows lovely and bright, with a touch of charming naivety. She looked like someone who led a happy life.","For someone originally so happy to despair and jump from a building shows the magnitude of the blow she suffered.","The specific reason that led to her suicide hadn't been uncovered yet; after all, thirty years had passed. Her parents fell ill and died early because of this incident, and finding other people who might know the details would take time.","From the remarks made by \"The Squirrel Who Loves Hazelnuts\" in the group chat, her aversion to men was evident.","It was highly likely she had been deeply hurt in a relationship.","[Great One, we just took down Cai Ji and the others. Won't the ghostly thing behind them lie low for now? What if he never shows himself and continues to harm people?] The system worried anxiously.","Qi Quan couldn't answer that.","If their guess was correct, and the mastermind behind it all was indeed the deceased He Xiuyu, then after scheming for so many years, he would absolutely not let them catch him easily.","If he wanted to exploit loopholes in the Heavenly Law, he would be extremely cautious.","But it was reasonable to speculate that, due to the collapse of the Tianqi organization, He Xiuyu probably wouldn't make any major moves for the time being.","This also just gave the Mystic Arts world time for reorganization.","After this battle, the Mystic Arts world should accept the leadership of the Investigation Department and undergo reforms. But reform isn't just talk; concrete measures need to be implemented.","These were all headaches for Li Guoyan to deal with.","The car drove smoothly all the way back to Longjiang City.","Qi Quan and Ling Sheng had been away from home for too long. Su Steward and Teacher Xue had been bored out of their minds at home. The former, aside from cultivating ghost arts, spent his time studying recipes. The latter, aside from cultivation, just studied, not even bothering to eat.","Upon hearing the news of their return, they were overjoyed.","Su Rong started preparing dishes early in the morning, all of Qi Quan and Ling Sheng's favorites. Xue Hong used a dust-clearing talisman to clean the house spotlessly and fed the fish in the pond until they were full.","When movement sounded outside the courtyard, she immediately poured freshly brewed tea, floated to the courtyard gate, wearing her prettiest dress, to welcome the villa's masters home.","Qi Quan opened the courtyard gate, and a tall figure instantly rushed over, saying with utmost delight, \"Great One, you're finally back!\"","\"Mm, we're back.\" Qi Quan replied with a smile.","This business trip had indeed been long.","Only upon returning home did she feel a long-missed sense of comfort.","She sat on the living room sofa, drinking the brewed tea, smelling the delicious aromas wafting from the kitchen, admiring the scenery in the courtyard, her heart gradually growing peaceful.","Before long, Su Steward was bringing dishes to the table.","Qi Quan took a bite, her eyes lighting up. It seemed Su Steward's culinary skills had improved even further during these days she was away.","During this period, she had been eating food cooked by Ling Sheng. Although Ling Sheng's cooking was also excellent, different people create dishes with different flavors. Changing it up occasionally prevents getting tired of the taste.","\"Great One, what's the situation outside now?\" Xue Hong asked curiously.","She and Su Steward had been staying in the villa, completely unaware of the storms outside.","Qi Quan picked out the key points and told them.","\"Peak Human Sovereign realm?\" Su Steward was momentarily stunned, then his eyes showed admiration. \"The Great One is truly extraordinary.\"","To challenge a peak Human Sovereign while only at the second tier of the Human Sovereign realm—only the Great One could accomplish that.","Xue Hong said, \"Since... the Tianqi organization is destroyed, will the Mystic Arts world be peaceful from now on? Won't we have to worry about being captured by evil cultivators anymore?\"","\"No.\" Qi Quan denied.","Su Steward and Xue Hong exchanged a look, both showing surprise.","Could it be that after wiping out one batch, another would sprout?","\"The Siren Group hasn't been dug out yet.\" Qi Quan said slowly. \"Cai Ji was just a pawn. There's still one behind him.\"","The two ghosts: \"...\"","When will there ever be peace and quiet?","Su Steward said with a smile, \"Great One, since the person behind this is lying low for now, we don't need to worry too much. You've been on a business trip for so long, and you just got home today. How about resting and relaxing?\"","\"Do you have something in mind?\" Xue Hong asked.","Su Steward nodded. \"When the Great One was away, Young Master Du and the others came by once. They brought quite a few things, including some discs. How about watching a movie after dinner?\"","\"Oh, right.\" Xue Hong agreed. \"The Great One seems to rarely watch movies, and Ling Sheng hasn't formally watched one to this day.\"","[Great One! I want to watch a movie too!] The system exclaimed excitedly.","Qi Quan was indifferent either way, but seeing their expectant faces, she nodded in agreement.","After dinner, Su Steward went to clean the kitchen. Xue Hong prepared fruits and snacks to enjoy during the movie. Ling Sheng sat at the table organizing his medical notes.","Only Qi Quan lounged comfortably on the sofa.","Suddenly, the doorbell rang from outside.","Ling Sheng put down his notes, walked through the courtyard, and went to open the door.","It was Shen Hui.","He had just dropped off Qi Quan and Ling Sheng, then went to the police station to pick up the completed ID cards. He came to deliver them after the meal time had passed.","\"Physician Qi, here is your ID card.\" Shen Hui handed it over.","Ling Sheng didn't take it immediately. First, he took out his phone and typed two words.","[Thank you.]","Shen Hui was momentarily taken aback, then smiled sincerely. \"You're welcome.\"","He left after delivering the ID card.","Ling Sheng closed the door, clutching the ID card, returned to the living room, hesitated for a moment, then walked up to Qi Quan, squatted down, and presented the ID card to her as if offering a treasure.","\"Keep it safe yourself. Carry it with you for travel from now on.\" Qi Quan instructed.","Ling Sheng nodded.","He carefully tucked the ID card into his pocket.","Xue Hong prepared the fruit platter and snacks, found a box of discs, and brought it before Qi Quan, saying, \"Great One, please pick one.\"","\"Let Ling Sheng pick.\" Qi Quan said.","Ling Sheng obediently lowered his head, didn't even look at the disc covers, and randomly pointed at one.","Xue Hong pulled it out, saw the cover, and couldn't help but laugh.","\"'The Ghost Wife's Temptation'. What luck! Picked a ghost movie right away, and quite suitable for us to watch.\"","In this room full of either celestial masters or ghosts, a ghost movie was indeed fitting.","Just then, Su Steward finished cleaning the kitchen, floated into the living room, and sat on a nearby sofa.","The living room had a TV and playback equipment.","Xue Hong inserted the disc and asked, \"Should we draw the curtains? It'll create more atmosphere.\"","\"Alright.\" Qi Quan nodded.","She rarely watched movies. In fact, she had never watched a single movie from beginning to end and had never even been to a cinema.","Today was actually the first time she was watching a film with family and friends.","Xue Hong pressed the remote, and the living room curtains all closed. The curtains were blackout, so once fully shut, not a sliver of sunlight came in, plunging the entire living room into darkness.","Coincidentally, the horror movie began its opening scene. The background music played through the surround sound system, making it seem especially eerie.","A female ghost suddenly appeared on the screen.","The actress's face was painted pale and stiff, her lips crimson, her eyes glowing green. Under the lighting and atmosphere, she looked extremely terrifying.","However, the two humans and two ghosts in the living room all remained expressionless.","They didn't find it scary, just ridiculous.","The female ghost paused facing the camera for a few seconds, then slowly turned around.","The camera followed her perspective, pushing from the entryway of the living room to the bedroom door.","...","The female ghost wore a bright red dress, her jet-black long hair cascading down her back. She stretched out a pale, withered hand and placed it on the bedroom doorknob.","A faint rustling sound seemed to come from inside the bedroom.","The two humans and two ghosts simultaneously thought: There's definitely someone inside trying to save themselves.","The movie deliberately used slow motion to build a tense, horrifying atmosphere. Even the female ghost opening the door took a full minute, leaving the living room audience in silent speechlessness.","The door finally opened.","Qi Quan: ?","Su Rong: ...","Xue Hong: Oh my.","Ling Sheng: !","System: [Wahhhh! I'm tainted, I'm tainted, I'm tainted!]","Inside the dim, gloomy bedroom, a man and a woman, completely unaware, were engaged in activities unsuitable for children.","Just... absurd.","They were here to watch a ghost movie, not an action film!","Qi Quan leaned back calmly on the sofa, watching the action on screen without the slightest ripple of emotion.","Su Steward coughed lightly, lowering his head in embarrassment.","Xue Hong glanced around. Seeing Qi Quan completely unbothered, she also pretended to be composed. When her gaze swept past Ling Sheng, she noticed curiosity flickering in his eyes.","Although she was Ling Sheng's teacher, having taught him from elementary school through university, she hadn't covered certain types of knowledge.","This kind of scene must be quite novel to him.","Fortunately, the camera didn't linger on the couple, shifting back to the female ghost.","The female ghost curled her lips into a sinister smile and reached out to kill the immoral pair, when suddenly a person jumped out from the wardrobe. Dressed in Taoist robes and holding a peach wood sword, he chanted incantations and thrust the sword towards her with a whoosh.","The two humans and two ghosts: ???","The scoundrel sat up from the bed, sneering contemptuously, \"You think you can harm me? Even as a ghost, you're still an idiot!\"","After fighting the Taoist for a moment, the female ghost was injured. Knowing she was no match, she fled the room with hatred.","The Taoist gave chase relentlessly as she desperately tried to escape.","This was a bizarre, deserted street. In front of shop doors, a few broken neon lights flickered weakly. From a dark alley, a hand suddenly reached out and yanked the female ghost inside!","The camera zoomed in on the hand's owner.","He was also playing a ghost, likely one of a decent rank, as his appearance was almost like a living person's, not as horrifying as the female ghost's.","\"Wait,\" Qi Quan suddenly said. \"Pause it.\"","Xue Hong pressed the remote, pausing the movie.","\"Master, what is it?\"","Qi Quan scrutinized the male actor's face carefully and said, \"This person is already dead.\"","Xue Hong and Su Steward were shocked.","They were ghosts themselves, yet they hadn't sensed any ghostly aura from him!","This was truly unbelievable.","The system hugged itself fearfully: [Big Boss, so is he a ghost? Can ghosts act in movies?]","Qi Quan: [Ghosts have physical forms, no different from living people.]","Actually, she hadn't noticed at first either, but her intuition told her this male actor seemed off. Looking closely, she realized he was a ghost.","She was already at the peak of the Human Sovereign realm. Even she hadn't reacted immediately upon seeing this ghost, let alone others.","No wonder this ghost dared to act in movies so brazenly.","Qi Quan suddenly thought of something and asked Ling Sheng, \"Can you tell he's a ghost?\"","The young man didn't react, just stared down at his own hands, as if he hadn't heard.","The living room fell silent for a moment.","\"Ling Sheng, snap out of it!\" Xue Hong called out loudly.","Ling Sheng looked up abruptly to find Su Steward and Teacher Xue looking at him with teasing expressions. His face suddenly felt hot.","He sat up straight, flustered, and looked at Qi Quan, his ears turning red.","Qi Quan: \"What were you thinking about?\"","Ling Sheng shook his head hurriedly, his gaze even becoming somewhat evasive.","Qi Quan didn't press further. She tilted her chin towards the screen and said, \"Take a look.\"","The young man turned to look at the TV.","As soon as his eyes met the male ghost on screen, he paused, then pulled out his phone to type: [He is a ghost.]","\"How can you tell?\"","...","Ling Sheng was stunned, hesitantly replying: [A feeling.]","He didn't know how he could tell; he just knew it was a ghost.","Qi Quan understood what he meant.","\"Keep watching.\"","The movie resumed.","The male ghost didn't have many scenes. His purpose was to teach the female ghost how to cultivate ghostly arts. After learning, the female ghost became extremely beautiful and alluring. She went back to seduce the scoundrel and then tortured him thoroughly.","It wasn't much of a ghost movie, mainly telling the story of how the female ghost, after becoming beautiful, captivated everyone and took revenge.","Very satisfying, very melodramatic.","Xue Hong asked tentatively, \"Should we keep watching?\"","Qi Quan: \"Ling Sheng, pick another one.\"","The young man looked hesitantly at the box of discs. What if he picked another movie with that kind of content?","\"Choose based on your intuition.\"","Ling Sheng had no choice but to randomly select another disc.","Fortunately, the new movie was a proper horror film, without too much melodramatic plot.","Halfway through the movie, Xue Hong exclaimed in surprise, \"Isn't that the male ghost from before?\"","It turned out he had acted in more than one film.","Seemed like a ghost obsessed with acting.","Qi Quan asked Su Steward, \"Were these discs sent by Du Jiaming?\"","\"Young Master Du and the others came together, bringing quite a few gifts. These discs were just mixed in. I'm not sure exactly who sent them. Should I ask now?\" Su Rong replied.","\"Yes.\"","Su Rong dialed Du Jiaming's number.","The other side answered quickly.","\"Su Steward! You needed something from me?\"","Su Rong put the call on speaker and asked, \"Last time, you and Zhang Chengyan and the others sent some gifts. Among them was a box of movie discs. Who sent those?\"","\"Hehe, that was me,\" Du Jiaming said sheepishly. \"Earlier in the group chat, Teacher Xue mentioned being bored at home, so I thought of sending some discs for you all to pass the time.\"","He was referring to the \"Master's Guardians Squad\" group chat.","Su Rong asked, \"Why are they all horror movies?\"","\"They're not all horror movies. I remember there were quite a few other genres. I didn't know what you'd like, so I put in all kinds of films.\"","Su Rong and Xue Hong: \"...\"","So Ling Sheng randomly picked two, and both were horror movies?","What kind of luck was that?","Du Jiaming added, \"Actually, I never used to watch horror movies, but since meeting the Master, I've become really interested in this stuff. Coincidentally, I have a friend who makes horror films, so I asked him for a bunch. Have Su Steward and Teacher Xue watched any? Any criticisms or suggestions?\"","\"What do you need criticisms and suggestions for?\" Xue Hong asked curiously.","Du Jiaming said with chagrin, \"Well, I'm interested in the mystical arts, but I have no talent. So I thought about investing in a few horror movies to get my fix.\"","\"...\"","Su Rong stifled a laugh and said, \"No suggestions, they're fine. When does your horror movie start filming?\"","\"Soon, it's being filmed at the film and television base.\" Du Jiaming teased, \"Will Su Steward and Teacher Xue come to visit the set?\"","Su Rong looked at Qi Quan.","Qi Quan asked, \"Have all the actors been cast?\"","\"Master!\" he exclaimed joyfully, \"Master, you're back! Yes, all actors are set, just waiting to pick a date to start filming.\"","Qi Quan: \"Could you provide a list of the actors and their photos?\"","\"Of course!\" Du Jiaming agreed without hesitation, \"I'll send them to Su Steward shortly.\"","He didn't ask Qi Quan why she wanted them; it wasn't a big deal anyway.","Du Jiaming was very efficient and soon sent over the actor list with corresponding photos.","Su Rong flipped through them and said in surprise, \"It's that male ghost!\"","They had already seen this ghost in two horror films today.","Was this really just a coincidence?","The system was also confused: 【Big shot, what's going on exactly?】","Qi Quan: 【This ghost has cultivated a special ghost technique, or used some other method to conceal its ghost form. I only noticed something amiss after observing carefully just now.】","【Can Ling Sheng see it easily?...】","Qi Quan: 【He is a born spiritual body; he should be very sensitive to both spiritual power and ghostly energy.】","System: 【So what's wrong with this ghost? Has it harmed people?】","【It feels very familiar to me.】","【Very familiar? Have you seen it before?】","Qi Quan: 【Remember 'The Squirrel-Loving Hazelnut' in the Siren King's group chat?】","【I remember, the one whose real name was Xiong Wangchun, who was killed by his wife after abusing her. You found him using his son's hair, but he was instantly annihilated upon discovery.】","Qi Quan: 【Mm, they give me a similar feeling.】","The system understood: 【You mean, they might have the same master?】","【Mm.】","Xiong Wangchun was instantly destroyed back then, and Qi Quan suspected he might have been someone's ghost servant.","Only a ghost servant could be killed by their master's mere thought.","While deep in thought, she suddenly received a message from Li Guoyan.","【Li Guoyan: We've uncovered some information about Gao Peilan's cause of death. Thirty years ago, she graduated from Longhai University. Due to an unplanned pregnancy, she had to marry her boyfriend early. According to sources, her husband cheated on her during her pregnancy. The exact details of what happened in between haven't been verified yet. All we know is that she jumped to her death when she was eight months pregnant.】","The system was puzzled: 【She committed suicide out of despair just because of infidelity?】","Qi Quan also sensed there was more to the story.","She replied to Li Guoyan: 【What about her husband?】","【Li Guoyan: It's said that not long after her death, her husband became mentally unstable. His current whereabouts are unknown; the department is investigating.】","Qi Quan: 【Please help me investigate another person.】","She sent over the information about the actor ghost.","Li Guoyan replied quickly: 【This person is named Zhang Feng. He died five years ago; he was an extra when alive. Master, is there a problem?】","Qi Quan: 【No major problem, it's just that he's planning to join another film crew.】","Li Guoyan: ???","Longjiang City Film and Television Base.","The extras, having received their pay, left the set one after another, asking in the group chat if there was any more work.","Zhang Feng was also inquiring about opportunities in the extras' group.","Suddenly, someone patted him on the shoulder from behind and said, \"Hey man, your acting's not bad! And you're so young, the future looks bright!\"","Zhang Feng loved hearing such praise and replied with a grin, \"You're not bad either. Let's encourage each other.\"","\"Hey, have you found your next gig?\"","Zhang Feng nodded, \"Got one, but it hasn't started filming yet.\"","\"Wow, already booked before it even starts? Must not be a small role, right?\"","\"Not a big one either, just a casual part.\"","The man pulled out a cigarette and offered it, \"Hey man, hook a brother up with an introduction, will you?\"","Zhang Feng waved his hand, \"I don't smoke. I'm just a minor role, how could I make introductions?\"","\"Even an extra role is fine. Please introduce me. Later, if I get into other crews, I'll introduce you too.\"","Zhang Feng was somewhat tempted. He hesitated, \"Even if I introduce you for an extra role, it'd probably only be playing a corpse.\"","\"Playing a dead person is nothing, as long as there's money.\"","Zhang Feng said, \"It's a ghost movie. You still want in?\"","\"Of course! Absolutely!\" The man quickly took out his phone, \"Hey man, add me as a friend?\"","Zhang Feng opened his QR code.","\"Alright, Brother Feng, thanks so much. Let me treat you to a meal.\"","Zhang Feng didn't refuse.","\"Brother Feng, your profile picture is pretty interesting. Looks like some kind of talisman pattern, haha.\"","Zhang Feng lowered his eyes, the corner of his mouth lifting as if just making casual conversation, \"Yeah, a peace talisman requested from a Taoist temple.\"","\"You believe in that stuff?\" the man said in surprise, \"But then again, you're filming ghost movies, so having this peace talisman for peace of mind makes sense.\"","Zhang Feng asked, \"Aren't you going home for dinner tonight? Don't you need to make a call?\"","\"Ah, what's there to call about? I have no father, no mother, no relatives at all. I'm an orphan.\"","...","Zhang Feng patted his shoulder, full of camaraderie, \"Don't worry, I'll definitely try my best to get you a role with lines.\"","\"Thank you so much!\"","After the meal, the man said, \"Brother Feng, where do you live? Let me give you a ride.\"","He patted his little electric scooter.","Zhang Feng smiled, \"No need. Your scooter can't carry passengers; you'll get fined if the traffic police see you. I'll walk back; it's good exercise.\"","\"Brother Feng is such a law-abiding good citizen!\" The man got on his scooter and suddenly said, \"Brother Feng, where did you get that peace talisman? I was thinking, since I'm going to act in a ghost movie, maybe I should get one too.\"","Zhang Feng lifted his eyelids and smiled at him, \"It's not some famous temple. Just the Lingxu Temple up in the northern suburbs. Heard of it?\"","The twilight was deep, half of his face hidden in shadow, his pupils somewhat dark. The neon lights from the street lit up, making his skin appear rather pale.","The man suddenly felt a chill, but didn't pay it much mind, replying, \"I know of it. I'll go check it out when I have time.\"","\"Mm.\"","\"See you later, Brother Feng!\" The man rode out a meter, then remembered something and stopped to ask, \"Oh, by the way, is the talisman expensive?\"","Before he could finish the question, he realized Zhang Feng was already gone.","\"Whoa, he left so fast!\"","Zhang Feng chose a corner without surveillance cameras, transformed back into his ghost form, and floated back to Lingxu Temple.","His level wasn't high, but he cultivated a special ghost technique that allowed him not only to turn into a human and enjoy everything humans could, but also to evade detection by the Heavenly Master Association and the Investigation Department.","Even super high-level Heavenly Masters would find it hard to sense his ghostly aura.","Lingxu Temple was located on a hill in the northern suburbs. It wasn't famous, but it had quite a few devotees in Longjiang City.","It was late, and the temple gates were closed.","Zhang Feng floated into the dormitory at the back of the temple, materialized, and said to a teenager playing on a computer nearby, \"Another offering took the bait today.\"","\"If you keep being this reckless, aren't you afraid of getting caught?\" The teenager took off his headphones, \"Tianqi has already been destroyed. If you don't act more carefully, be careful...\"","\"Pfft—\" Zhang Feng's lips curled in mockery, \"I'm not careful? I wonder who was discovered by the Investigation Department in the middle of the night, had to use thunder talismans to destroy equipment, and fled all the way from Longjing to hide here. Cai Guang, what right do you have to tell me what to do?\"","Cai Guang fell silent for a moment, then said, \"The Siren group has been discovered, and the authorities are watching closely. If you get exposed again, it will only slow down the Master's cultivation progress.\"","\"Isn't that just your incompetence?\" Zhang Feng drifted onto the bed, crossing his legs. \"I've been acting for so many years without being discovered. Everything you touch gets exposed. If Gao Peilan hadn't noticed something was wrong in time, her soul would have scattered just like Xiong Wangchun's.\"","Cai Guang: \"...\"","\"The Master never involves himself in these mundane affairs. Last time, if you hadn't been useless and let the investigation lead to Xiong Wangchun, would the Master have had to personally kill him?\"","Cai Guang hung his head.","\"I think it's you who needs to be more careful. The Master is in seclusion, at the most critical juncture. If you hold him back now and ruin the Master's plans, he will surely be disappointed in you.\"","Cai Guang put his headphones back on, a flash of malice in his eyes.","Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan carefully sorted through the threads of the matter.","The Tianqi organization was destroyed, and the \"Ghost King\" had also surfaced.","As for the mastermind being He Xiuyu, it was still just speculation, not yet confirmed.","When the Investigation Division requested He Xiuyu's files from the Guiyuan Sect, they found his records were extremely brief and clean. The Guiyuan Sect had also left behind no traces of him from his lifetime.","According to Yin Yi, He Xiuyu was indeed extremely skilled in divination and was famous in the mystical community for this ability. But very few knew he also studied talisman arts.","Yin Yi was not He Xiuyu's disciple; He Xiuyu never took a disciple in his life. Although he was the sect leader, his temperament was not approachable, and few truly understood him.","Yin Yi only knew about his research into talisman arts because his own master had mentioned it.","If he hadn't been the sect's chief disciple back then and had to visit He Xiuyu's residence several times on sect business, he wouldn't have recognized Cai Ji during the cleanup operation.","Cai Ji was He Xiuyu's servant. He... would run into Cai Ji every time he went, which left some impression.","As a sect leader, leaving no traces from his lifetime showed He Xiuyu had made preparations before his death.","The cleaner it was, the more it proved his guilt.","Where would such a cautious person hide?","Qi Quan asked her system: [If you were He Xiuyu, how would you hide?]","The system thought seriously and said: [The most dangerous place is the safest place.]","[For him, what is the most dangerous place?]","The system instinctively said: [He's a ghost, so the most dangerous places should be like... heavenly master sects and families, right? Or maybe the Heavenly Master Association.]","[No.] Qi Quan said, [Look at Zhang Feng, acting without fear.]","Although Longjiang City didn't have any major sects or families, it did have a Heavenly Master Association and an Investigation Division. Yet Zhang Feng was still passionate about starring in ghost movies.","If even Zhang Feng didn't fear heavenly masters, how much less would a ghost general on the verge of becoming a Ghost King?","The system suddenly remembered and said: [I know what he fears most!]","[What?]","[It's you, Boss!] the system exclaimed, [And Ling Sheng!]","Otherwise, there would be no need for him to go to such lengths, suppressing Qi Quan and imprisoning Ling Sheng.","Although he didn't act with his own hands, both Qi Quan being switched at birth and Ling Sheng being imprisoned stemmed from his manipulation.","He Xiuyu exploited Cai Ji's greed, luring him to steal the forbidden technique book, leave the sect, and establish the Tianqi organization.","He could similarly exploit Ding Ji's psychology, letting him obtain the forbidden technique book, become a peripheral member of the cultist organization, and carry out actions to suppress the Child of Destiny.","The commonality between Cai Ji and Ding Ji was: mediocre talent, but sky-high ambition.","Cai Ji's forbidden technique book stated that Qi Quan would be an obstacle to achieving immortality. Did the forbidden technique book Ding Ji snatched from a ghost also contain similar words that tempted him into these actions?","Why go to such redundant lengths?","Because He Xiuyu was a cautious person. He couldn't allow any mistakes; he needed to have a backup plan.","There was a time gap here.","He Xiuyu first divined her birth, wrote this information in the forbidden technique book, and let Cai Ji steal it.","After he died and became a ghost, he then divined Ling Sheng's appearance.","By then, using Cai Ji again wasn't feasible, so he devised another plan, finding a narrow-minded and greedy person like Ding Ji.","Everything then fell into place.","Cai Ji, fearing the prophecy, would definitely send people to monitor her birth. Ding Ji, also fearing the prophecy about her, would operate primarily within Longjiang City.","One was the cult leader, the other a peripheral cult member. One giving orders, the other implementing them. Perfect.","Ding Ji was in the know. He Xiuyu didn't have to worry about an uninformed person carelessly handling an infant, causing unnecessary oversights.","And once Ding Ji realized the prophecy was true, he would pay extra attention to the second prophecy about Ling Sheng.","That's why, three years later, he appeared in Longhu City, found Fu Jiuge, made her give birth to the child, and imprisoned the child in a cave to suppress his destiny.","Prompted by the system, Qi Quan finally straightened out her train of thought.","Even though He Xiuyu had made all preparations, he wouldn't be truly at ease. He would keep watching his greatest obstacle.","Longjiang City!","Could he be in Longjiang City?","Qi Quan suddenly remembered: the Tianqi organization had thirty hideouts across the country, but none in Longjiang City.","Why?","Qi Quan couldn't think of an answer for now.","She instantly released her spiritual sense, covering the entire city of Longjiang.","Last time, when she sent Xue Hong to capture the love-struck male ghost who pushed people off buildings, she had already covered the whole city.","Back then, she was tracking the male ghost based on the traces of the concealment talisman on him, automatically filtering out other people and events in the city in her mind.","This time was different.","If Cai Ji could block her spiritual sense in his cave dwelling, He Xiuyu naturally could too.","Her spiritual sense soared over the city, gradually extending to the remote, desolate outskirts, probing bit by bit...","Nothing, nothing, still nothing.","Her spiritual sense moved extremely smoothly through the entire city, encountering not the slightest obstruction.","Was her guess wrong? Or was He Xiuyu already this cautious?","Her spiritual sense reached the Lingxu Temple in the northern suburbs.","She had been here once before, to lure Du Jiaming and the other two, using the peace talisman to find Qin Ruo, who used the Peach Blossom Seal.","When she came, she found all the Taoist priests in this temple were ordinary people without cultivation, so she didn't pay further attention.","Her spiritual sense reached the dormitory behind the temple, again without being blocked.","The dormitory was full of men who had taken off their Taoist robes. She had no intention of looking closely and was about to move on when she suddenly paused.","There seemed to be a heavenly master of considerable level.","It was normal for a temple to have heavenly masters, but a high-level heavenly master appearing in a small Lingxu Temple made her take note.","Keeping her spiritual sense in place, she dialed Meng Yunzheng's number.","\"Senior!\" Meng Yunzheng said excitedly, \"Any instructions?\"","Qi Quan asked: \"Does the Investigation Division have a roster of all heavenly masters currently in Longjiang City?\"","\"Yes, Senior. If you want to see it, I'll bring it over tomorrow immediately.\"","\"No need. Help me check something: is there a Level 7 heavenly master at Lingxu Temple?\"","Meng Yunzheng remembered the data; he didn't need to check. He said directly: \"No.\"","\"Thank you.\"","She hung up.","Spiritual sense couldn't \"see\" people; it only sensed the presence of a target through spiritual energy.","Qi Quan sensed the presence of a seventh-level celestial master, but she didn't know what they looked like.","She didn't want to alert them, so she immediately withdrew her spiritual sense.","Her spiritual sense encountered no obstruction, which could be due to two reasons.","Either the target was not in Longjiang City; or the target wasn't using their spiritual sense to conceal themselves.","If it was the former, it meant her previous line of thinking was wrong; if it was the latter, it meant the target's cultivation level was so high they had nothing to fear.","Just like Zhang Feng, who appeared freely among people, completely unafraid of being discovered.","But there was a question: since Zhang Feng could cultivate a special ghost technique to conceal his ghostly aura, why did the powerful ghost behind the Siren group leak its aura?","Why would someone as cautious as He Xiuyu make such a mistake on this matter?","Qi Quan thought for a moment, then got up and left her room.","[Master, where are you going?]","[To find Ling Sheng.]","The system was shocked: [What time is it! Isn't it inappropriate to go to his room so late?]","Qi Quan didn't understand: [Why? I need to discuss something with him.]","[Alright then.]","Inside his room, Ling Sheng was still awake.","He held a carving knife, frowning at a piece of jade, seeming unsure where to start, as if no matter how he carved it, it wouldn't be satisfactory.","He had never encountered this situation before.","A few outlines had begun to appear on the jade, resembling a girl's face, but it was just a rough shape; the facial features hadn't been carved yet.","He stared at the jade, troubled.","\"Knock, knock, knock.\"","A sudden knocking at the door startled him. For some reason, he felt guilty. Flustered, he stuffed the unfinished jade carving into his pants pocket, threw down the carving knife, used a flick of spiritual power to turn the lock, and opened the door.","It was Qi Quan outside.","His eyes lit up, and he was about to step forward to welcome her, but then he remembered the jade carving in his pocket. His guilt made him hesitate.","Qi Quan didn't notice his complicated emotions and simply asked, \"May I come in?\"","Ling Sheng quickly nodded, pulled out his own chair, cast a cleansing spell on it, and gestured for Qi Quan to sit.","The door closed.","Qi Quan sat on the chair, looking at the young man who was standing quite far from her, a trace of surprise flickering in her heart.","Why was he keeping his distance?","Never mind, let's get to the main issue.","\"That male actor was a ghost. You recognized it at a glance today. Why?\"","She had asked this question while watching the movie. Ling Sheng had said it was intuition at the time, but she suspected it wasn't just that.","Hearing this, Ling Sheng was stunned.","Thinking of the movie scenes he saw today, his gaze involuntarily drifted... towards Qi Quan's face, then flinched away as if startled. His face inexplicably grew hot, and his heartbeat became somewhat unruly.","Qi Quan asked in surprise, \"What's wrong with you?\"","Why is your face so red?","Ling Sheng shook his head.","He didn't know why he was like this either. He just felt somewhat uncomfortable physically, and even more flustered inside.","He forced himself to look only at the floor, banishing the images that shouldn't be in his mind, and carefully considered Qi Quan's question.","Qi Quan frowned. \"Is there a problem with your spiritual energy circulation?\"","She stood up and walked over to Ling Sheng, reaching out to take his wrist, using her spiritual energy to sense his condition.","Ling Sheng never refused her. Although he instinctively wanted to flee, he forcibly held himself still. However, the agitation only grew stronger, spreading from his face to his neck, which also turned red.","\"Your spiritual energy is fine,\" Qi Quan said, releasing his wrist. \"If you're not feeling well, rest early. I can ask you tomorrow.\"","She finished speaking and turned to leave.","A hand tugged at her sleeve.","Qi Quan turned back.","The young man typed on his phone with his other hand, then held it out for her to see.","[I can sense fluctuations of spiritual energy, whether from humans or ghosts.]","Ghost power is also transformed from spiritual energy.","Qi Quan: \"Even when they try to conceal it?\"","Ling Sheng nodded.","\"You can sense my spiritual energy too?\"","Ling Sheng typed: [It was easy before, now just a little bit.]","Qi Quan understood.","His sensing ability also had limits; she estimated it could only detect those below the Human Immortal and Ghost King realms.","She said, \"You can sense it, and you can also conceal it.\"","She remembered during their first business trip to Longjing City, Ling Sheng had followed her, often seeming to have no presence at all.","Ling Sheng nodded again.","Qi Quan said directly, \"Conceal yourself to the best of your ability. Let me see.\"","Ling Sheng complied.","He communed with the spiritual energy of heaven and earth. Gradually, he seemed to merge with his surroundings, his presence becoming almost non-existent.","The system exclaimed: [He's really gone!]","Qi Quan couldn't help but smile.","With her peak Human Emperor realm cultivation, if she wasn't paying attention, it was difficult to detect him. Even though a person was standing right in front of her, it was as if her perception was being obscured.","She said, \"Get some rest early. Come with me on a trip tomorrow.\"","Her sleeve was tugged again.","The phone was extended: [Should I bring my ID card?]","Qi Quan was taken aback for a moment, then couldn't help but laugh.","He really did remember her words well.","\"No need. We'll just be within the city.\"","The phone was extended again, asking: [Can I still watch movies in the future?]","\"Of course you can.\"","After answering, Qi Quan reflected on whether she was usually too strict, making him ask so cautiously even about watching a movie.","Ling Sheng breathed a sigh of relief.","He didn't understand why he felt so uncomfortable after watching the movie.","Teacher Xue had said that if you don't understand something, studying it a few more times will make it clear.","He needed to watch it a few more times."]},{"number":71,"title":"Chapter 71","paragraphs":["Lakeside Villa.","Su Rong got up early to make breakfast. Passing through the living room, he discovered someone sitting on the sofa.","The young man was frowning, his gaze fixed intently on the television screen.","An unfamiliar movie was playing on the screen, set to mute to avoid disturbing others.","Su Rong: ?","He stood silently for a moment before speaking. \"You didn't watch movies all night, did you?\"","Ling Sheng looked at him upon hearing this and nodded.","\"You like watching that much?\"","The young man shook his head.","Su Rong asked, \"Then why did you stay up all night watching movies?\"","Ling Sheng pulled out his phone and typed slowly: 【There's a problem I can't figure out.】","\"Watching movies won't help you figure it out,\" Su Rong said with a slight smile. \"Why not help me make breakfast instead? We can talk.\"","Ling Sheng nodded, turned off the TV, and followed him into the kitchen.","The kitchen was Su Rong's \"domain.\" He didn't like others interfering when he cooked. Asking Ling Sheng to help with breakfast was just a pretext; he wouldn't actually let Ling Sheng do anything.","\"Care to tell me about it?\" he asked skillfully, handling a pot.","Ling Sheng didn't know how to explain.","\"It's just the two of us guys here, and it's not like you can talk to anyone else,\" Su Rong said gently. \"I'm older than you, and I've seen a lot more during my time as a ghost. Maybe I can help.\"","Ling Sheng thought for a moment, then lowered his head and typed on his phone.","【Watched a movie yesterday. Felt uncomfortable.】","Su Rong glanced at the screen, surprised. \"Are you scared of horror movies?\"","Ling Sheng shook his head.","\"What kind of discomfort?\"","【Burning, hot, restless.】","\"Are you sick?\" Su Rong instinctively asked, then immediately corrected himself. \"No, that's not right. You have cultivation; you can't get a fever or fall ill.\"","He examined Ling Sheng carefully. \"Do you still feel uncomfortable now?\"","Ling Sheng shook his head.","Su Rong pondered for a moment. \"What part of the movie did you start feeling uncomfortable at?\"","【When the female ghost entered the bedroom.】","Su Rong recalled yesterday's movie. After the female ghost entered the bedroom...","He suddenly froze.","When he had watched that part yesterday, he had felt a bit embarrassed too, but only for a short while and hadn't paid it much mind.","Back when he was a young ghost, he would seize any chance to come to Longjiang City to find his dad and had accidentally encountered such situations a few times. He was already used to it.","But Ling Sheng had never been exposed to such things.","Teacher Xue had only taught him academic knowledge, not that kind of knowledge.","Su Rong suddenly laughed.","He asked, \"How many movies did you watch last night?\"","【Three.】","\"All horror films?\"","Ling Sheng nodded.","\"I remember there are some romance-type films in the box. I'll find them for you later. Watch a few and you'll understand,\" Su Rong said, pausing briefly. \"Watch them in your own room.\"","Ling Sheng looked confused.","Romance?","He knew humans had familial love, friendship, and romantic love.","But what these three types of feelings actually were, he didn't really understand. Or rather, he didn't have a clear concept of them.","He asked: 【What is romantic love?】","Su Rong hadn't experienced it himself either. He could only explain based on his superficial understanding. \"It's when two people are attracted to each other, like each other, and want to be together for a lifetime.\"","Seeing Ling Sheng still didn't grasp it, he decided to be blunt. \"In the movie you watched yesterday, after the female ghost entered the bedroom, she saw a man and a woman... cough... engaged in intimate behavior. That kind of behavior is something two people who like each other can do. Of course, we don't advocate that kind of adulterous intimate behavior.\"","Ling Sheng was even more direct than him.","【I want to hold her, I want to kiss her, but I don't dare to look at her. Why?】","Su Rong: !!!","With a look of shock on his face, he exclaimed, \"You have someone you like?!\"","Hearing this, Ling Sheng was stunned for a moment, then slowly opened his eyes wide, the light in them growing brighter and brighter.","So... this is what liking someone feels like?","\"Who has someone they like?\" Xue Hong floated over with great interest, looking at Ling Sheng. \"Is it you? Really? Which family's young lady is it?\"","Ling Sheng opened his mouth as if to say a name, but for some reason gave up.","He turned and left the kitchen, returning to his room. He pulled out the jade carving from the drawer that he couldn't carve properly last night. The tip of his knife spun swiftly, and in no time, the facial features of the carving became clearly visible.","A certain restless emotion seemed to ease.","He meticulously carved the jade statue, striving for perfection in every detail, not missing a hair's breadth.","His carving skill was extremely proficient, enhanced by his spiritual power. In a short while, he had completed a jade statue.","It was Qi Quan wearing her uniform.","\"Time to eat,\" Xue Hong knocked on his door.","The corners of Ling Sheng's lips lifted. He carefully placed the jade carving on the bedside table, then opened the door and went to sit at the dining table.","The dining table was by the window.","During the meal, the morning sunlight shone in obliquely, just falling behind Qi Quan, making the hair on her back reflect a dazzling, radiant light.","Ling Sheng gazed at her without blinking.","The statue he just carved didn't seem so perfect anymore.","Qi Quan: \"Do you have something to say?\"","Under her gaze, Ling Sheng felt embarrassed again and lowered his head to eat.","\"Ling Sheng watched movies all night last night,\" Butler Su teased.","Qi Quan: \"...\"","It seems he really does love watching movies.","Xue Hong laughed. \"Ling Sheng might have someone he likes.\"","The two of them rarely got to gossip about such matters and naturally wouldn't hide it from Qi Quan.","Qi Quan was taken aback.","The system was equally shocked: 【Someone he likes! Oh my! Did Ling Sheng tell them?】","【Tell them what?】","【That he...】 The system suddenly stopped.","Qi Quan narrowed her eyes: 【Why did you stop?】","The system snorted proudly: 【I'm a writer's system, not a dating system.】","It was only here to watch the drama, not responsible for other aspects.","Qi Quan asked Ling Sheng, \"Do you really have someone you like?\"","Ling Sheng first nodded, then shook his head.","\"What does nodding and then shaking your head mean?\" Xue Hong teased him. \"Do you like them or not?\"","Before Ling Sheng could answer, Qi Quan's phone rang.","She got up from the table, picked up her phone, and answered.","\"Master, good morning,\" Li Guoyan's deep voice came through the receiver. \"We've found out the specific reason for Gao Peilan's fall.\"","Qi Quan: \"Please go ahead.\"","\"Gao Peilan's parents were both salaried workers with decent incomes and owned two properties in Longhai City. After she was admitted to Longhai University, she met her husband, Pan Hao. She became pregnant before graduating, and her parents weren't keen on her marrying Pan Hao, who came from a poor background. But since Gao Peilan was already pregnant, they had to accept it.\"","System: 【Definitely a phoenix man!】","After they got married, Gao Peilan, who was pregnant, found it difficult to get a job and planned to look for work after giving birth. Pan Hao had just graduated; even if he found a job, his salary wouldn't be high, so their life was quite strained. However, Gao Peilan's parents, feeling sorry for their daughter, transferred the ownership of one of their properties to her. The couple lived in that apartment.","System, conspiratorially: 【Could it be that Pan Hao wanted the apartment and intentionally killed his wife!】","\"Pan Hao himself was quite ambitious. After graduation, he joined a private company, striving hard to climb the ladder. His work was very demanding every day. But he had no background, and his abilities weren't exceptionally outstanding, making it hard to stand out in a big corporation. By chance, he discovered a secret and thought of a way.\"","System, indignantly: 【He must have hooked up with some boss's daughter! That's how it always goes in novels!】","\"Even Li Guoyan, with all his worldly experience, couldn't keep his voice from turning hoarse. 'He discovered,' he said, 'he discovered that the company's boss had a... peculiar preference.'\"","Qi Quan had roughly guessed it, and her expression turned icy.","\"He liked pregnant women.\"","The System: \"...\"","It was utterly stunned. After recovering, it couldn't help but spew a string of curses: [Bleep— Bleep— Bleep—]","How could there be such a disgusting person in this world?!","Qi Quan's voice was cold. \"Did he give Gao Peilan to his superior?\"","\"That's what the informant indeed said.\"","Such a truth was truly hard to accept.","The so-called husband's infidelity during pregnancy was merely a fig leaf. This was far more chilling than mere infidelity.","Unable to bear such humiliation, Gao Peilan chose to jump to her death in despair.","Qi Quan asked, \"What about Pan Hao now?\"","\"We found out that Pan Hao went insane the year after her death and has remained so until now. He lives in a shabby rented room, and someone delivers meals to him every day. According to the delivery person, he often mutters Gao Peilan's name, begging her not to kill him, and things like that.\"","\"What about his family?\"","\"Communication was inconvenient thirty years ago. After he went mad, he never contacted his family again, and they couldn't find him, so all contact was lost. After he went mad, no one knew who he was.\"","Qi Quan: \"What about the person who delivers the meals?\"","\"We asked. The delivery person said someone hired him to do this job, but he doesn't know who the employer is. I suspect it's very likely Gao Peilan, having become a ghost, intentionally tormenting him.\"","\"What happened to the superior from back then?\"","Li Guoyan: \"Died of a sudden, severe illness years ago.\"","\"What are your plans, Director Li?\"","Li Guoyan: \"I've already sent people to stake out the area near Pan Hao's residence. If Gao Peilan truly is tormenting Pan Hao, she should appear.\"","However, Qi Quan said, \"If the ghost arts she cultivates are the same as Zhang Feng's, they won't be detected. That would hinder the department's capture operation.\"","\"What does Master suggest?\"","Qi Quan felt something was off intuitively. After pondering for a moment, she said, \"Proceed with the original plan.\"","\"Is there a problem somewhere?\" Li Guoyan was equally sharp.","Qi Quan said, \"It's been too smooth.\"","Given that He Xiuyu was a master of deduction, having schemed for so many years, attempting to use Cai Ji and Ling Sheng to cover his evil deeds and perfectly hide in the shadows, how could he leave so many traces?","Including the Lingxu Temple she detected with her spiritual sense last night—perhaps that was also intentionally exposed by the other party.","Why?","Cai Ji, at a critical moment of breaking through a cultivation stage, still knew to have the evil cultivator organization lay low a bit. Wouldn't He Xiuyu be aware of this too?","What she thought of, Li Guoyan also thought of.","Dealing with such a cunning enemy, they truly couldn't afford to be careless.","He asked, \"If that's really the case, what is his intention?\"","Qi Quan said, \"He should also be at a critical juncture. But the discovery of the siren group caused him to lose a lot of sacrificial power. He's bound to replenish it from elsewhere.\"","\"Speaking of which, I just happen to have another matter to tell you,\" Li Guoyan said. \"Previously, we traced the comment 'filial piety kills me' to find her information, but found nothing suspicious. However, the department didn't give up and continued investigating from her surroundings. Data shows that the patient mortality rate at Longhai City First Hospital in recent years is far higher than before.\"","Qi Quan: \"Patients... what kind of patients?\"","\"Terminally ill patients, or elderly people with not much lifespan left,\" Li Guoyan explained. \"The strange thing is, these patients chose death early, even before their time was truly up.\"","\"Suicide?\"","Li Guoyan: \"These people refused further treatment and went home to await death. The specific circumstances after returning home are still being verified.\"","\"I understand,\" Qi Quan said. \"Last night, I detected a seventh-level Celestial Master at Lingxu Temple. I asked Meng Yunzheng, and he denied that Lingxu Temple has any seventh-level Celestial Master.\"","\"You mean... 'Ghost'?!\"","Li Guoyan, true to his reputation, immediately thought of this.","As the saying goes, the darkest place is under the lamp.","Their pursuit of 'Ghost's' trail had yielded no results. On one hand, 'Ghost' was too secretive; on the other hand, they had greatly overlooked Longjiang City.","Because Longjiang City had a top-tier expert, Qi Quan, holding the fort.","Following normal logic, would a fugitive run to the place with the strongest police presence?","Qi Quan smiled. \"Whether it's him or not remains to be verified.\"","\"Master, could this be a setup by the other party?\" Li Guoyan asked warily.","Overnight, both \"Nut-Loving Squirrel\" and \"Ghost\" had abruptly revealed themselves before the Investigation Department.","Qi Quan said, \"Then we'll go along with their plan.\"","After hanging up the phone, the System hurriedly asked: [Big Boss, what do you mean? What setup? What 'go along with the plan'?]","The corner of Qi Quan's mouth lifted slightly as she patiently explained: [The clues were indeed discovered and pursued by us, but it also feels like they were handed to us. The other party has been hidden for years, never revealing a hint. Before capturing Cai Ji, who would have suspected a dead person?]","[But capturing Cai Ji, interrogating Cai Ji, all followed the normal procedure,] the System didn't understand.","Qi Quan: [If not for the siren group, we wouldn't have thought much, and Cai Ji wouldn't have either.]","[But our discovery of the siren group was an accident.]","[It was an accident,] Qi Quan said. [Let's just call it intuition.]","[I, of course, believe you, Big Boss! So what should we do now?]","Qi Quan: [Go out to offer incense.]","System: ?","After breakfast, Qi Quan prepared to take Ling Sheng out.","\"Master, should we hire a driver in the future?\" Su Rong asked.","Before Qi Quan could speak, Ling Sheng held out his phone: [I'll learn. I'll drive in the future.]","He now had an ID card and could do many things.","Su Rong smiled. \"Alright, when you get back, we'll look for a suitable driving school and sign you up.\"","Ling Sheng nodded.","\"Try the skill of concealing your presence from last night,\" Qi Quan said.","Ling Sheng instantly retracted all his spiritual energy, merging seamlessly with the surrounding environment.","\"Huh? Where's Ling Sheng?\" Xue Hong widened her eyes.","Even though Ling Sheng was right in front of her, she couldn't sense him at all. It deceived not only the eyes but also the perception of spiritual power and ghostly energy.","It was amazing!","Qi Quan was the same.","She knew Ling Sheng hadn't vanished, yet she completely overlooked his presence.","And she was now at the peak of the Human Sovereign realm.","Ling Sheng's skill was different from a Breath-Concealing Talisman.","A Breath-Concealing Talisman could at most mask spiritual fluctuations, preventing others from discerning one's cultivation level or physique, but one could still perceive the \"person's\" existence.","Qi Quan asked with a smile, \"Can it only be used on yourself?\"","[Don't know. Let's try.]","He extended his hand, palm up. His fingers were long and clean, with clear lines.","Qi Quan understood his meaning and reached out her hand.","The young man carefully held it. His palm was warm and dry, not causing any aversion.","He channeled spiritual power, which gradually spread from his palm to Qi Quan. In moments, he had generated a set of \"armor\" for Qi Quan. The armor was intangible, capable of isolating both aura and life presence.","The two stood in the small courtyard, yet Su Rong and Xue Hong could perceive nothing, their very sight veiled.","The people hadn't vanished, but their brains received no signals from their eyes.","Success.","Qi Quan withdrew her hand and said, \"Follow me.\"","\"Wait,\" Xue Hong called out to her, \"Master, I can see you again!\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","Hadn't the \"armor\" already formed?","She looked at Ling Sheng.","Meeting her gaze, Ling Sheng's eyes showed confusion.","Su Rong said, \"Is physical contact necessary for the skill to work on others?\"","Qi Quan didn't insist. She instructed Ling Sheng, \"Conceal your form and follow me.\"","As a peak Human Sovereign realm cultivator, meeting a seventh-level Celestial Master wasn't strictly necessitating this skill, but it was a precaution.","Ling Sheng: \"...\"","He didn't know what Qi Quan intended for him to do, but her seriousness meant the matter was undoubtedly important.","He couldn't let Qi Quan be discovered, just as she had once concealed his appearance and physique for him.","Ling Sheng grabbed her sleeve and typed: [Let me try again.]","He closed his eyes, continuously communing with the spiritual energy of heaven and earth, trying to persuade it to envelop Qi Quan and completely hide her traces.","The system asked: [Big Boss, don't you have invisibility talismans?]","It remembered that during previous outings, the boss had specifically worn invisibility talismans to avoid being caught on surveillance.","Qi Quan said: [The principle of an invisibility talisman is a type of illusion. Activating it requires channeling spiritual power, which creates fluctuations easily detectable by other cultivators.]","Although her level was high and she wasn't worried about lower-level Celestial Masters, the ghost lurking in the shadows couldn't be taken lightly.","Once they reached Lingxu Temple, Ling Sheng could handle the task.","[Alright.]","Ling Sheng tried for a while, fine sweat beading on his forehead, before he finally persuaded the spiritual energy of heaven and earth to conceal Qi Quan.","Qi Quan's presence vanished once more.","He opened his eyes and looked at Qi Quan happily.","[As expected of a born spiritual body, so beloved by the spiritual energy of heaven and earth,] the system said approvingly.","Qi Quan also smiled at Ling Sheng. \"Let's go.\"","The two drifted out of the courtyard, their bodies in harmony with heaven and earth, their passage unnoticed.","[Big Boss, where exactly are you going?]","[Lingxu Temple.]","System: [We're in the southern suburbs, Lingxu Temple is in the northern suburbs. That's quite far. Are you and Ling Sheng planning to walk?]","Qi Quan: [How could we? Naturally, we'll use swift travel talismans.]","[But swift travel talismans also require channeling spiritual power. Aren't you worried about the fluctuations being detected?]","Qi Quan: [Now, with the spiritual energy of heaven and earth providing cover, there's no need to worry.]","Her earlier comment about invisibility talismans being detectable was based on the scenario without Ling Sheng's concealment.","System: [Oh, right.]","It then added: [Actually, holding hands and walking together earlier wouldn't have been impossible either.]","Qi Quan: [Inconvenient.]","When each person only has one free hand, actions become limited.","The system chuckled: [I thought...]","[Thought what?]","[I thought you might be avoiding impropriety because Ling Sheng has someone he likes.]","Qi Quan couldn't help but laugh: [Why avoid impropriety?]","System: [Uh...]","Big Boss, what do you mean by that?","Qi Quan's next sentence directly shocked it into speechlessness.","[The one he likes is me, isn't it?]","System: !!!","It remained silent for a long moment before exclaiming in surprise: [Big Boss, why are you so sure he likes you? You, you...]","You're supposed to lack emotional cells!","Qi Quan: [I have eyes.]","Such obvious behavior—she wasn't a wooden puppet, how could she not see it?","The system asked with thrilled excitement: [Then do you like him?]","Qi Quan deliberately teased it: [Guess.]","System: ...","Amidst the idle chat between the person and the system, the two quickly arrived at Lingxu Temple.","Lingxu Temple was a famous Taoist temple in Longjiang City, with a considerable number of devotees, if not a massive crowd.","The two stood side by side, suspended in mid-air, looking down at the temple below.","Inside and outside the temple, people came and went—some burning incense, some seeking divination slips, some specifically there for sightseeing.","But all this liveliness was concentrated in the front halls, having nothing to do with the rear halls.","From the rear halls to the living quarters, the atmosphere was extremely desolate. Not a single person could be seen for the longest time, a stark contrast to the front halls.","Actually, judging from the layout, the rear halls were more spacious and imposing, more like the main halls. It was somewhat strange that Lingxu Temple only opened the front halls to the public.","Qi Quan took out a recording talisman and asked, \"Can you make it undetectable?\"","Ling Sheng took it, and moments later, the recording talisman vanished from sight.","\"Later, I'll go knock on the door. Once it opens, you send the talisman inside.\"","Ling Sheng nodded.","\"Let's go down.\" She led the way, diving down and floating close to the rear courtyard living quarters.","Ling Sheng followed closely, landing outside the door of one of the rooms.","The living quarters were rows of single-story houses, quite old and somewhat dilapidated in appearance, though kept very clean.","Qi Quan knocked three times. There was no movement from inside.","She knocked three more times.","Still no movement.","She could sense someone inside, but that person was clearly alarmed and hesitant, unwilling to open the door.","Inside the room, the young man frowned deeply.","He had naturally heard the knocking, but according to the surveillance monitor outside, there was simply no one there!","He initially thought it might be a ghost outside, but when he probed with his spiritual power, he couldn't sense the slightest trace of ghostly energy.","Could it be a powerful ghost?","But he was already a seventh-level Celestial Master. No matter what, he shouldn't be completely unable to sense any ghostly energy.","Cai Guang stared intently at the monitor, trying to find any clue.","It was a pity Zhang Feng was out acting; otherwise, he could have this special ghost sense it out.","The knocking started again.","Cai Guang looked suspiciously at the door panel. He knew he shouldn't open the door lightly, but what if it was one of the organization's ghosts outside?","Ghosts like Zhang Feng, who had cultivated special ghost arts, could indeed evade surveillance, and ordinary Celestial Masters wouldn't be able to detect them.","He hesitated for a moment, about to speak, when the knocking stopped.","Gone?","He walked quietly to the back of the door and looked through the peephole.","Still nothing.","After waiting a bit longer and seeing no further movement outside, he turned and returned to his seat.","He had just sat down when the knocking sounded again.","Cai Guang: ...","He was young, at an age prone to mischief and rebellion. Being trapped in this tiny room every day was already agonizing, and having to share space with a scumbag like Zhang Feng added to his pent-up frustration. Now, some \"ghost\" was deliberately messing with him outside, and his anger flared instantly.","\"Who is it? Get the hell away from here!\"","Outside, it suddenly fell silent.","Cai Guang took a deep breath and refocused on the online situation.","Recently, the Investigation Department had been pursuing them very closely. He didn't dare make any major moves online easily. The authorities had also released a blocking software, urging the public to download it, causing the Siren groups to suddenly lose their vast pool of potential members.","Although those already in the Siren groups wouldn't leave easily, the number of new joiners was dwindling. The social circles of the old members in the groups were limited, so the number of people available for sacrifice plummeted.","The development of the Siren groups had only been going on for about ten years.","In the beginning, very few people had internet access. Most in these circles were elites with high discernment and self-control, making them extremely difficult to sway.","Later, with the proliferation of smartphones and computers, more and more people gained internet access. The online space became flooded with vast amounts of junk information. He would filter users from this junk, then have others lure these users into the groups.","To be honest, some people fail in real life and fail online just the same. Even with the support of talisman patterns and linguistic hints, they can't bewitch many willing to sacrifice their lives.","Only a very few can trick three or four people a month.","However, the Siren groups still provide the Master with a steady stream of sacrificial energy.","Besides the Siren groups, they have other clandestine operations.","The Master said that once the final step is completed, they would succeed.","As for what that final step is, he didn't know either.","\"Knock, knock, knock.\"","The knocking interrupted his reverie about the future.","Cai Guang rolled his eyes. Was there no end to this!","He abruptly stood up, grabbed a peach wood sword, pulled out several high-level attack talismans, and charged over furiously. He flung open the door, hurled the talismans out in a rush, and swung the peach wood sword haphazardly.","Qi Quan outside the door: \"...\"","Ling Sheng seized the opportunity. A memory-retaining talisman slipped through the door crack, found the best angle, and obediently stuck itself to the wall.","After throwing the talismans and waving the sword a few times, Cai Guang saw no reaction from outside, leaving him with nothing but helpless rage.","[He can't be the Ghost, can he?] The system's preconceived image shattered completely.","The Ghost online was technically powerful and very mysterious. Who would have thought that in reality, he was just a rash, irritable brat.","Qi Quan said: [He's only seventeen. Being a king online doesn't mean he is one in reality.]","Growing up in a cultist organization, without formal education, surrounded by bloodshed and violence, and \"imprisoned\" in the internet all day, it would be a miracle if he didn't turn out twisted.","For Cai Guang, the internet was both his paradise and his cage.","He was already bound by it.","After placing the memory-retaining talisman, Qi Quan took Ling Sheng and returned to the Lakeside Villa.","Leaving Cai Guang alone, cursing wildly at the empty courtyard.","[Big shot, when are you coming back to retrieve it?] the system asked.","Qi Quan: [Why retrieve it?]","[Didn't we always have to take the memory-retaining talisman away to view it before?]","Qi Quan: [Memory-retaining talismans can also be innovated.]","She returned to the villa, activated another memory-retaining talisman, and projected it in the living room.","The two talismans were connected, allowing for real-time video streaming.","System: Amazing, my big shot!","Qi Quan called Li Guoyan, explained the function of the memory-retaining talisman, and then instructed Su Rong to use electronic equipment to synchronize the talisman's feed to Li Guoyan.","Let the Investigation Department keep an eye on it.","Longjiang City Film and Television Base.","Zhang Feng had been here for a day and hadn't encountered the person from yesterday asking about the peace talisman, which left him feeling rather frustrated.","In his opinion, just kidnap and kill the person. The resentment and terror bursting forth at the moment of death—that energy must be extremely potent, much faster than this slow-boiling frog method.","It was just a pity the Master insisted they had to sacrifice willingly to deceive the Heavenly Dao, leaving it no grounds for complaint.","Zhang Feng found it utterly boring.","He found a corner to turn invisible and floated back to Lingxu Temple.","The moment he entered, he saw the garbage from Cai Guang's meals and drinks.","\"Can't you clean up?\" he snapped with a cold face.","Cai Guang, staring at the computer screen, said in a low voice, \"I'm busy. No time.\"","\"Busy?\" Zhang Feng sneered. \"Now that the Siren groups are blocked by the authorities and Tianqi has been smashed by them, you don't need to relay messages anymore. What are you busy with? Busy playing games?\"","Cai Guang paused.","He suddenly remembered that after the Tianqi organization was destroyed, he really didn't have much to do.","Besides monitoring the authorities' movements and reporting to the Master on schedule, there was nothing else.","It seemed... he had no value left.","Seeing him dumbstruck, Zhang Feng pressed on: \"Oh right, you used to work for Cai Ji. Now that he's gone, you really don't have much to do.\"","\"Cai Ji was captured. Could he give me away?\" Cai Guang murmured eerily. \"If the Investigation Department finds me, you won't escape either.\"","Zhang Feng: \"...\"","\"Even if Cai Ji gives you up, how would the Investigation Department know where you are? How could they possibly find this place?\"","A sudden chill ran down Cai Guang's spine.","He thought of the knocking incident today.","Could the Investigation Department really not find it? Was Lingxu Temple truly safe?","After being discovered in Longjing City, he received orders to hide at Lingxu Temple in Longjiang City. He was reluctant at the time because Qi Quan was in Longjiang City.","Sharing a city with such a big shot scared him stiff.","But he couldn't disobey the Master's order, so he came to Lingxu Temple, carefully hiding his tracks.","After a while, sure enough, no one found him, and he gradually let his guard down. Even when the Tianqi organization was wiped out by the authorities, he didn't take it too seriously.","Because all of this was within the Master's expectations.","The Master said Tianqi had lost its purpose and it was time for it to disappear.","Then what about him?","Did he still have a purpose now?","Cai Guang shot to his feet.","\"What are you doing?\" Zhang Feng asked.","Cai Guang said, \"I'm going to find the Master.\"","Zhang Feng frowned. \"The Master probably doesn't have time to see you now. Don't disturb him.\"","\"But I have something important to tell him.\"","\"What important thing?\"","Now Cai Guang became alert. \"I'm not telling you.\"","He looked around, afraid something might be watching him.","\"Tch—\" Zhang Feng scoffed. \"What important thing could you have, playing online all day? Don't disturb the Master.\"","Panicked inside, Cai Guang was stubborn. \"I'm going to find him!\"","Ignoring Zhang Feng's attempts to dissuade him, he ran out of the dorm. The invisible memory-retaining talisman on the wall quietly drifted down and followed Cai Guang all the way to the rear hall of Lingxu Temple.","In the main hall of the rear hall stood a majestic stone statue, with an aura of an immortal sage.","Upon seeing it, Cai Guang knelt on the ground and said, \"Master, today... today I think I made a mistake. I shouldn't have opened the door, but that thing was so annoying. Now I'm really worried I've affected your plan. What should I do?\"","Like a devout believer, he prayed for divine guidance.","The deity did not answer him.","Cai Guang continued to confess and weep: \"Master, I know I shouldn't disturb you, but I'm just too scared. Can you guide me to find the right path?\"","He was essentially afraid of ending up like Cai Ji.","His so-called piety was merely because the \"deity\" controlled his life and death.","Both the Lakeside Villa and the Investigation Department witnessed this scene.","The system exclaimed in surprise: [He's calling a stone statue 'Master'? This Master isn't that ghost, is he? Is the ghost inside the statue?]","Qi Quan: [The statue is probably just a medium.]","She didn't sense any ghostly aura on the statue, so she asked Ling Sheng, \"Any ghostly aura?\"","Ling Sheng shook his head.","The system worried: [If this ghost ignores Cai Guang, even with the memory-retaining talisman, won't we still be unable to find where the ghost is?]","Just then, a light flashed from the stone statue.","After the glow, a faint human figure appeared before the statue. He had handsome features, a cold and aloof demeanor, with an expression of compassion and solitary pride.","Li Guoyan immediately switched the video feed to the interrogation room.","\"It's him! It's him!\" Cai Ji shouted, both furious and awestruck, pointing at the figure. \"He is He Xiuyu!\"","He Xiuyu died forty years ago, leaving behind no photos or video footage, not even the Guiyuan Sect had any, let alone the Investigation Department.","The Investigation Department could only have Cai Ji identify him.","At that very moment, He Xiuyu looked up, as if making eye contact with Cai Ji directly through the memory-retaining talisman.","Those eyes were deep and calm, exactly the same as forty years ago.","Cai Ji let out a startled cry and actually lowered his head, not daring to look again.","Years of being a menial servant had filled him with awe and reverence for the sect master he served. Even though he had grown accustomed to being the leader of the Tianqi organization, when facing He Xiuyu, the deeply buried inferiority and cowardice in his heart involuntarily burst forth.","He Xiuyu floated before the stone statue, looking down at Cai Guang with lowered eyes, speaking in a compassionate tone, slow and deliberate:","\"You are still young. Making a small mistake is of no great consequence.\"","Cai Guang trembled as he prostrated himself on the ground. \"Thank you for your forgiveness, Master!\"","He Xiuyu chuckled lightly. \"Do you know how many eyes are watching you right now?\"","\"Master?\" Cai Guang didn't understand.","He Xiuyu's gaze once again turned towards the Shadow-Retaining Talisman.","\"But it's no matter. They won't be able to find me regardless.\"","With that, his figure faded away.","Li Guoyan's heart was suddenly gripped by shock.","This was a Shadow-Retaining Talisman arranged by the Master, and He Xiuyu had actually discovered it?","Just what level had his cultivation reached?","Lakeside Villa.","The system was frightened by those words.","It asked: [Big shot, did he really discover the Shadow-Retaining Talisman?]","Qi Quan remained calm as ever: [So what if he did? So what if he didn't?]","[If he discovered it, it means he's really powerful!]","Qi Quan: [Don't forget, he's skilled at reading people's minds. It's very possible he deduced the location of the talisman from the optimal filming angle and deliberately said those words.]","[So, you mean he's actually sure there is a Shadow-Retaining Talisman?]","Qi Quan: [Not necessarily. If there is a talisman, his words achieve the purpose of provocation; if there isn't, he doesn't lose face anyway—Cai Guang doesn't know if there is one or not—and he can still admonish Cai Guang.]","The system suddenly understood.","This guy is too cunning!","But—","[Didn't you say before that the Shadow-Retaining Talisman was innovated? How could he guess you have an upgraded version?]","Qi Quan: [What if the eradication of the Tianqi organization was his way of testing us?]","The system: [...]","That was utterly chilling.","Whether it was the Peach Blossom Mark or the Ghost Marriage case, neither cost Qi Quan any effort. It wasn't until the Tianqi organization surfaced.","During this process, Qi Quan innovated the Compression Talisman, the Composite Sword Talisman, and the Unity Talisman, fully demonstrating her talent in talisman-making.","Based on this, it wasn't hard to infer she also had the ability to create other new talismans.","Everything He Xiuyu did boiled down to one word: a gamble.","He had been gambling all along.","His methods were covert, never leaving traces, never acting personally. Instead, he used others' greed to remove obstacles for him and to provide the energy for his sacrifices.","He was gambling that the Heavenly Dao could not truly punish him.","Having someone deliver a letter to Yan Fengqing was probably his first personal intervention. Either he used some method to avoid the risk, or he paid a certain price.","And weren't those words he spoke before the Shadow-Retaining Talisman also a kind of test?","If there really was a talisman, his goal was achieved.","He hid in the shadows, waiting for the authorities to exhaust themselves trying to find him, even wasting energy on pawns like Cai Guang and Gao Peilan.","He reveled in the sense of achievement from manipulating everyone like pieces on a chessboard.","The system stammered: [Then what should we do?]","Qi Quan pondered.","A phone was handed over to her: [His ghost power is almost full.]","Qi Quan said, \"You can tell?\"","Ling Sheng nodded.","'Almost full' meant he was on the verge of becoming a Ghost King.","Qi Quan asked, \"Then what's the point of his provocation?\"","Since he was close to cultivating into a Ghost King, given his cautious nature, he should have been hiding in a cave like Cai Ji. Why this unnecessary move?","Unless—","He had another objective."]},{"number":72,"title":"Chapter 72","paragraphs":["Knowing that He Xiuyu had ulterior motives, the authorities naturally would not sit idly by.","The Investigation Department immediately mobilized to go to Lingxu Temple to apprehend Cai Guang and Zhang Feng.","After seeing He Xiuyu's phantom projection, Cai Guang realized something was wrong. He returned to his dormitory intending to dispose of his electronic devices and flee, but the authorities arrived swiftly. Armed with the high-level talismans provided by Qi Quan, they quickly captured both the person and the ghost.","Zhang Feng: ???","He twisted his body, feigning confusion as he asked, \"On what grounds are you arresting me?!\"","The investigators: ...","Although you're an actor, there's really no need to keep up the act in this situation, okay?","Both the person and the ghost were taken to the interrogation room.","Simultaneously, the Longhai City Investigation Department also discovered traces of Gao Peilan. Like Zhang Feng, she was invisible to ordinary people, and monitoring equipment couldn't detect her ghostly aura.","The investigators only found her because she appeared at Pan Hao's residence, tormenting him.","Pan Hao's wretched screams echoed, alerting the investigators staking out outside. They rushed into the house and, unexpectedly, managed to apprehend Gao Peilan.","When the news reached the Central Department, Li Guoyan couldn't help but frown.","It was indeed too smooth.","It was as if someone was intentionally throwing pawns towards the Investigation Department.","Gao Peilan was one, and Cai Guang was another.","The Longjiang City and Longhai City Investigation Departments conducted interrogations simultaneously, with the entire process being livestreamed to the Central Department in Longjing.","Longjiang City Investigation Department.","Meng Yunzheng personally participated in the interrogation.","He first interrogated Zhang Feng.","Zhang Feng died five years ago and hadn't been following He Xiuyu for very long. Over these five years, he often mingled in film crews as an extra, appearing at first glance to be just a passionate minor actor.","He was utterly bewildered by his arrest.","\"You've got the wrong person! I'm just a small-time extra, I'm truly a law-abiding citizen!\"","Meng Yunzheng held a transparent evidence bag containing an ID card and said, \"The fake ID is well-made. Where did you get it done?\"","It was truly the first time he'd seen a ghost with an ID card.","Zhang Feng: \"...\"","\"Stop pretending,\" Meng Yunzheng tapped the table. \"You're a ghost, we all know that.\"","Zhang Feng said sheepishly, \"Well, you see, I really love acting. I am indeed a ghost, but no one said ghosts can't act, right? I haven't harmed anyone. You can't arrest me just for that, can you?\"","Zhang Feng's actions were similar to those in the Siren group.","He mingled among extras, seeking suitable targets, understanding their desires, and using that knowledge to lure them into stepping onto the altar, becoming nourishment for the Master's cultivation.","Those people went willingly, so what did it have to do with him or the Master?","After all, \"suicide\" isn't a crime.","Just like those in the Siren group, they used the name of \"love\" to lure targets, infinitely amplifying the desires in their hearts, making them sink into the quagmire of craving, step by step walking the path of sacrifice.","Before their death, the extreme emotions bursting from their souls would transform into energy, becoming the favorite nourishment for ghost cultivators.","That's right, ghost cultivators.","Zhang Feng referred to himself as a ghost cultivator.","They were different from other ghosts. Other ghosts could generally only gain energy by harming people, increasing their ghost power, while they used a unique cultivation secret method to enhance their own cultivation level.","The further they cultivated, the more they resembled living people.","He had only been dead for five years but could already eat and drink like a normal person, and his appearance was no different from a living person. Unlike those harmful ghosts with their pale, ghastly, ugly faces and slow cultivation speed.","This ghost technique was something he accidentally found in a book. He didn't know its name, but after cultivating it, he could sense other \"ghost cultivators\" and even developed a feeling of submission towards the Master.","Zhang Feng wasn't stupid; there's no such thing as a free lunch in this world.","He relied on the \"Sacrificial Ghost Technique\" to escape reincarnation, so naturally, he had to pay a price.","That price was placing invisible shackles upon himself.","That's why he looked down on Cai Guang.","Cai Guang was the only living person among them, and the Master paid more attention to him than to the others.","Take tonight for example,","Cai Guang could boldly go to the rear hall to see the Master, but they couldn't.","Wait—","Could it really be that idiot Cai Guang who exposed them?","A trace of anger flickered across his face.","That brainless brat really was, encountering a little trouble and running to cry to the Master. Look what happened now, cried his way right into the Investigation Department!","Meng Yunzheng scrutinized his expression and suddenly said, \"Tonight, Cai Guang went to see He Xiuyu and said you don't take your work seriously, that all you know is acting...\"","\"He's talking nonsense!\" Zhang Feng blurted out angrily. \"He's the one who's not focused on his duties! All he knows is playing on the computer, he doesn't understand anything else!\"","\"Oh, so you do know He Xiuyu,\" Meng Yunzheng said leisurely. \"Tell us, how did you meet Master He?\"","Zhang Feng: \"...\"","In the interrogation room next door, Cai Guang stubbornly refused to speak.","He never expected that just going to see the Master once would lead to his capture by the Investigation Department.","Remembering the Master's earlier words about many eyes watching him, a tremor of fear ran through him.","\"You're a ghost on the internet, you've spied on countless people,\" Tang Mian said coldly. \"Now that you know you're being watched, how does it feel?\"","Cai Guang bit his lip and remained silent.","He thought the Master would protect him as always.","But the Master didn't.","Before leaving, the Master just gave him a faint glance.","Tang Mian continued her psychological attack: \"Your name is Cai Guang, yet you can only live hiding in the gutter. You're only seventeen. A child your age should be sitting in a bright classroom, dreaming of a bright future, not sitting in an interrogation room being questioned.\"","Cai Guang still didn't speak.","He leaned back in the chair, staring at a fixed point in the empty air, motionless.","Tang Mian continued targeting his heart: \"Haven't you ever thought about finding your birth parents?\"","Perhaps \"birth parents\" touched a nerve in Cai Guang.","He finally looked at Tang Mian, expressionless, and said, \"I know who they are.\"","\"Then you...\"","\"They are them, I am me. What does it have to do with me?\"","Tang Mian: \"...\"","Cai Guang sneered, \"I'm just an object, lost and forgotten. They aren't sad. They already have a perfect son. If I went back, I'd just embarrass them.\"","\"...\"","\"Are you going to say that's not true?\" The seventeen-year-old boy laughed mockingly. \"You adults are so hypocritical. Don't try to persuade me with that set of theories; it makes me sick.\"","Tang Mian: \"You haven't even tried. How do you know they wouldn't like you?\"","Cai Guang: \"Isn't your Consultant Qi a living example? She's so capable, but what happened after she found her birth parents?\"","\"...\"","\"Don't waste your time on me. Anyway, the Master is about to succeed. If Consultant Qi is also watching this interrogation, I'll give you a reminder: if you can't find the Master soon, you'll get to witness the birth of a Ghost King.\"","Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan was indeed watching the interrogation.","Zhang Feng and Cai Guang remained tight-lipped, and Gao Peilan hadn't revealed anything either.","A moment later, she received a call from Li Guoyan.","\"Master, I'm a bit puzzled.\"","Qi Quan: \"Are you trying to say, since Gao Peilan cultivated a special ghost technique that shouldn't leak ghostly aura, why could that male ghost still detect ghostly aura from Shao Jing's phone, and why could we also detect Xiong Wangchun's ghostly aura during our previous investigation?\"","\"Correct.\" Li Guoyan replied gravely. \"It seems like clues were intentionally left for us, guiding our investigation.\"","Yet everything had unfolded so plausibly; they hadn't sensed anything amiss before.","Qi Quan lowered her gaze. \"It's a trap.\"","He Xiuyu's ghostly minions were already so well-hidden. As long as they continued the living sacrifices, his power would keep growing. So why would he reveal clues for them to investigate?","Especially last night—knowing full well he'd be exposed, he still manifested on the stone statue.","Either he was utterly confident, or it was deliberate guidance.","Qi Quan leaned towards the latter.","Li Guoyan understood. \"The one he wants to guide is you.\"","\"Not just me.\" Qi Quan said. \"He once used Yan Fengqing and Ding Ji to suppress Lingsheng's fortune.\"","Lingsheng, sitting at the table drawing talismans, suddenly looked up when he heard her mention him, his eyes sparkling.","\"Master, what is your plan?\" Li Guoyan asked.","Qi Quan replied, \"Becoming a Ghost King isn't easy; there must be extremely specific conditions. Everything he's doing is likely to fulfill the requirements for his ascension.\"","\"Exactly.\" Li Guoyan sighed. \"If I'm not mistaken, what he wants is you and Lingsheng.\"","\"Mm.\"","By deliberately leaving these loopholes and clues, He Xiuyu wanted her to notice. It was an overt scheme, laid bare for all to see.","Everyone was aware of it.","But he lurked in the shadows. With no telling how many more people were being ensnared by him, they couldn't just stand by and do nothing.","No matter what, Qi Quan would have to confront him directly.","Qi Quan only knew that sacrificial rituals could give rise to a Ghost King, but the specifics of how a Ghost General becomes a Ghost King were unclear to her.","Besides sacrificing living beings, were other special conditions needed?","If He Xiuyu wanted to lure her and Lingsheng to him, why was he still hiding and delaying?","Perhaps he was waiting for the perfect moment.","People like Cai Ji, Ding Ji, Cai Guang, Zhang Feng, and Gao Peilan were all just his tools.","He didn't care about them at all.","\"Lingsheng,\" Qi Quan suddenly looked at the young man, \"can you find him?\"","Since Lingsheng could sense fluctuations in her spiritual power, he should similarly be able to sense fluctuations in He Xiuyu's ghostly power. No matter how cautious He Xiuyu was, with the aid of the world's spiritual energy, he couldn't truly remain hidden.","Lingsheng shook his head and typed on his phone: [Too far away. Can't sense him.]","After He Xiuyu's image appeared, he had instinctively tried to commune with the spiritual energy of the entire Longjiang City but found no trace of the other.","He was acutely aware of this ghost's malice towards Qi Quan and himself.","He wanted to contribute his part too.","\"He's not in Longjiang City.\" Qi Quan dismissed her earlier speculation. \"He merely placed a stone statue in Longjiang City, using it to monitor the happenings here.\"","The more devotees the temple had, the more information he could gather.","The Taoist priests inside the temple and the devotees outside were all his eyes and ears.","Lingsheng lowered his gaze to type, a flicker of determination in his eyes.","Compared to a busy, rushing-about Qi Quan, he much preferred to see her lying leisurely on the courtyard lounge chair, basking in the starlight.","He extended his phone: [Together.]","Qi Quan raised an eyebrow. \"Together for what?\"","[Find him. Exterminate him.]","Qi Quan laughed.","From their first meeting, she had known Lingsheng wasn't as harmless as he appeared on the surface.","Compared to someone truly naive and incapable of handling matters, she much more appreciated someone like this, with whom she could fight side by side.","She nodded with a smile. \"Alright. Let's exterminate him together.\"","Lingsheng's eyes grew even brighter. Gathering his courage, he slowly reached out his hand, inching towards her fingertips.","The system suddenly spoke up: [Master, someone sent you a private message on Weibo!]","[A plea for help?]","[Yes!] The system quickly said, [It's your reader 'Dutiful to Death' from under your story. She says she's on night duty at the hospital tonight and suddenly noticed many inpatients, not sleeping, all heading to the rooftop. She and her colleagues couldn't get a response no matter how much they called. They've already called the police, but the officers haven't arrived yet. She has a gut feeling those people aren't right and is worried something major will happen. She's at a loss and came to ask you on Weibo.]","Qi Quan: [Understood.]","She immediately called Li Guoyan to inform him. Li Guoyan instantly instructed the Longhai City Investigation Department to rush to First Hospital as soon as possible.","Previously, 'Dutiful to Death' had commented under the story saying she'd seen the talisman patterns. The Investigation Department had already checked her background and knew she was a nurse at Longhai City First Hospital.","Although she had called the police, it would take time for them to arrive. Moreover, typically, the police would only transfer a case to the Investigation Department if they discovered it was a supernatural incident they couldn't handle.","That would be too late.","Upon receiving the message, the Longhai City Investigation Department immediately headed to First Hospital to control the situation.","After Li Guoyan finished issuing instructions, Qi Quan continued, \"Director Li, I'd like to know how many temples similar to Lingxu Temple exist nationwide, and if they have identical stone statues.\"","Forty years ago, the metaphysical community was largely dormant, and temples, shrines, etc., open to the secular world were not yet prevalent.","They gradually flourished later on.","Many temples were newly built or renovated in recent years.","Li Guoyan instantly grasped her meaning. \"I'll have someone investigate and clarify as soon as possible, then send you the information.\"","\"Alright.\"","Qi Quan hung up.","A hand suddenly brushed against her fingertips, then quickly withdrew.","Qi Quan: ?","She turned to look at Lingsheng. The young man offered her a smile.","\"What is it?\"","The young man handed over his phone: [Rest early.]","Then, head bowed, he got up and returned to his room, with a hint of fleeing in panic.","System: [Pfft.]","Qi Quan leaned back on the sofa, lowered her eyes in quiet contemplation for a moment, and couldn't help but smile too.","Back in his room, Lingsheng pressed a hand over his pounding heart, sat at the desk, and was lost in thought for a while. Suddenly remembering something, he took out the unfinished jade statue from the drawer.","Just as he was about to pick up the carving knife again, his phone rang.","It was the new group he had joined.","[Mom: Lingsheng, I heard traces of He Xiuyu were found in Longjiang City. You and Senior Qi must be careful. If you need anything, just ask.]","[Dad: Need talismans? Dad will draw some for you.]","Lingsheng paused for a moment, then slowly replied: [No need.]","He could draw them himself.","[Dad: I'll still draw a few more. They might come in handy sometime.]","[Mom: Right, right! I'll also have the family prepare more jade talismans, formation stones, and such, and send them over tomorrow.]","Lingsheng: ...","He was a bit puzzled, but didn't feel averse to it in his heart. He replied: [Have plenty. No need.]","The family storeroom was already packed full of such things. If they really sent more over, there'd be no place to put them.","[Dad: Alright then. Next time you and Senior Qi come to Longjing City on business, how about having a meal together?]","[Mom: [Penguin spinning in circles jpg]]","Lingsheng thought again and replied: [Okay.]","Next time they went to Longjiang City, he would still be the one cooking. Having a meal together would just mean two more sets of bowls and chopsticks.","[Mom: Wonderful! Lingsheng, if you have any questions you don't understand, you can always ask me. Of course, asking your dad is fine too.]","Lingsheng originally didn't have much to say, but upon seeing this message, he suddenly thought of something and asked very bluntly: [I like someone and want to be with her. What should I do?]","He often felt shy and flustered when facing Qi Quan, but when mentioning such matters to others, he had no concept of shame whatsoever.","It was the same with Steward Su, and also with Fu Jiuge and Xie Lanzhou.","The group chat fell silent for a moment.","Just as Lingsheng thought they wouldn't answer, a message popped up.","[Dad: Let's talk privately.]","Lingsheng: ?","He switched to the private chat page.","[Dad: First, you need to be obedient.]","Lingsheng quickly replied: [I am obedient.]","[Dad: ...Then, you need to have a career, can't be a freeloader.]","Lingsheng: [I have a career.]","[Dad: [Thumbs up] I've also heard that guys who can cook are more popular nowadays.]","Lingsheng: [I can cook.]","[Dad: My son is truly amazing! [Thumbs up]]","Lingsheng: [Is that enough then?]","Something felt a bit off.","[Dad: Of course not! The last one might require some natural talent. You need to be romantic, know how to pursue, and know how to win her heart.]","Lingsheng: Pursue...?","He asked: [How do I pursue?]","[Dad: That depends on knowing what she likes, hence it relies on talent. It needs to be analyzed case by case, can't really be taught.]","Lingsheng gained some understanding and replied seriously: [Thank you.]","[Dad: Wishing you success!]","He put down his phone, feeling he had found a direction. He took out a notebook and listed several plans.","[She likes cultivating the most, must keep the villa filled with spiritual energy at all times;","She also likes pure, unadulterated food, should prepare more;","She dislikes evil cultivators harming people, should accompany her to eliminate them;","She dislikes going out, in the future draw more high-level talismans for the Investigation Department, let them handle less serious matters;","She...]","He wrote slowly and earnestly, a hint of a smile appearing at the corner of his lips with each item he listed.","After finishing, he suddenly thought of something and added another line.","[Get a driver's license, so we won't need to hire a driver when going out in the future.]","He immediately went online to research getting a driver's license. Before long, he downloaded a test question app on his phone and started staying up late practicing the questions.","He practiced until the next morning. After taking five consecutive mock tests, each with a perfect score, he walked out of his room feeling quite satisfied.","He ran into Su Rong making breakfast again.","Steward Su asked with a smile, \"Up so early?\"","Lingsheng showed him his test results.","Su Rong raised his eyebrows in surprise and said, \"I was actually planning to talk to you about getting a driver's license after breakfast. I didn't expect you were already prepared. Impressive, all perfect scores.\"","[Thank you.]","\"I've found a suitable driving school. After breakfast, will you go register yourself?\"","Lingsheng nodded.","His intelligence was never low; he just hadn't received any education and didn't understand the knowledge and social norms of human society.","Under the influence of Lakeside Villa, Lingsheng had evolved from a \"primitive style\" to a \"highly educated style.\"","He had been capable of handling these things independently for a while now, but due to his identity and physical constitution, he never had the chance to put it into practice.","During breakfast, just as he was about to bring this up with Qi Quan, she received a message from Li Guoyan.","[Li Guoyan: Master, as you requested, all Taoist temples and Buddhist monasteries nationwide have been surveyed. Those with identical stone statues have been marked on the map.]","Attached was a map.","Qi Quan opened it for a detailed look and was suddenly startled.","Unlike the evil cultivators' hideouts, these stone statues weren't scattered across various cities. Instead, they formed concentric circles, spreading outward with one city at the center.","The center was in Longjing City.","There were nine concentric circles in total. Longjiang City was merely one among the outer circle.","Qi Quan's expression turned grave.","What He Xiuyu intended to do had exceeded their imagination.","She immediately called Li Guoyan.","\"Director Li, notify the Investigation Departments in the cities where the stone statues are located to destroy them immediately. I'm heading to Longjing City right away.\"","Upon hearing this, Li Guoyan quickly issued the order before asking Qi Quan, \"Master, is there a problem with the statues?\"","\"The statues aren't just mediums for He Xiuyu's appearances. Connected across cities, they form a massive array. Once activated, the consequences would be unthinkable.\" She paused, then suddenly asked, \"What happened at the hospital in Longhai City last night?\"","Li Guoyan felt a chill. \"The patients' actions were stopped in time. Are you suggesting...\"","Before he could finish, Di Meng anxiously knocked and entered, reporting, \"Director Li, multiple Investigation Departments have sent messages. Last night, many patients in hospitals across several locations exhibited collective suicidal behavior. Although police arrived promptly, many patients had already... before they got there.\"","Li Guoyan's mood turned extremely heavy. \"Why is this only being reported now?\"","\"Similar situations occurred in multiple hospitals across the cities,\" Di Meng explained. \"Local Investigation Departments received reports from the police. They were short-handed and spent the whole night dealing with it. They've only just now compiled the current situation and casualty data.\"","Thanks to the private message from \"You're Filial to Death\" on Weibo, the Longhai City Investigation Department arrived in time to prevent the patients' suicide attempts. Otherwise, it would have been like other places, with unavoidable casualties.","Qi Quan heard everything clearly.","\"Director Li, the statues must be destroyed to curb the spread of the situation.\"","Li Guoyan said gravely, \"I've already issued the order. Master, since you're coming to Longjing, does that mean there's a problem here?\"","\"Uncertain for now. I'll know when I get there. Send me a detailed map of Longjing City, one with precise specifics.\"","\"Alright, I'll send it immediately. I'll also have Meng Yunzheng send someone to pick you up.\"","Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan received the map of Longjing City, with various architectural landmarks clearly marked.","She glanced at it and put down her phone.","\"Steward Su, Teacher Xue, I need to go to Longjing with Lingsheng immediately. Please guard the house well.\"","Seeing her expression, Su Rong and Xue Hong both realized the seriousness of the matter.","\"Master, rest assured, we will definitely protect the villa.\"","Qi Quan nodded and instructed, \"I will set up a Spirit Gathering Array in the courtyard shortly. After I leave, if there's any movement in the array, you must place all the talismans from the storeroom into it. Understood?\"","Xue Hong said earnestly, \"Master, don't worry. We will keep watch over the Spirit Gathering Array at all times.\"","\"Good.\" After saying this, Qi Quan added reassuringly, \"I've already upgraded the villa's protective arrays to the Human Emperor level. No need to worry.\"","\"Master...\" Steward Su said with concern, \"Please take good care of yourself.\"","Qi Quan chuckled softly.","She was just giving instructions, not delivering a last testament.","\"I will.\"","Before the words faded, Lingsheng brought out the array stones and placed them in the courtyard.","Qi Quan began setting up the Spirit Gathering Array.","[Big Boss, what are you setting up this Spirit Gathering Array for?] the system asked.","Qi Quan: [He Xiuyu has upgraded the sacrificial ritual.]","[What do you mean?]","Qi Quan explained: [The characteristic of a sacrificial ritual lies in having others willingly offer their lives. This is also what He Xiuyu previously revealed to us through the Siren groups—he achieved Ghost King status through rituals of willing sacrifice.]","[What's wrong with that?]","Qi Quan continued her actions without pause: [He has deceived everyone. The Siren group was merely a smokescreen he released. His true purpose is not to become a Ghost King by exploiting this sacrificial ritual that can bypass the Heavenly Dao's loopholes.]","[Then what does he want to do?]","Qi Quan: [He wants to defy the Heavenly Dao.]","The system asked in surprise: [Why?]","[Perhaps, the so-called sacrificial ritual was never that easy to succeed in the first place.]","Qi Quan finished setting up the Spirit Gathering Array and placed a Unity Talisman within it.","[Big shot, can a Unity Talisman be bound to a Spirit Gathering Array?]","Qi Quan: [Upgraded version.]","Knowing there was a deeply scheming, powerful ghost lurking in the shadows, it was impossible for her not to make any preparations.","When dealing with someone like He Xiuyu, one could never be too cautious.","The Unity Talisman could previously only bind between people. After her modifications, it could now bind between a person and an array.","As long as the spiritual energy in the Spirit Gathering Array did not extinguish, the spiritual energy within her body would not be depleted. This was an insurance policy she had placed on herself.","The system said with concern: [Big shot, you're being very cautious this time. Is that ghost thing particularly difficult to deal with?]","[We'll know when we see it.]","Not long after, Shen Hui and Tang Mian arrived at the Lakeside Villa.","Qi Quan turned around, scanned the room, and asked, \"Where's Lingsheng?\"","\"He seems to be carving jade tokens in his room,\" Su Steward replied. \"Probably wants to increase his stock.\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She personally went to the carving room.","The door was not closed. The young man was bent over the table carving jade tokens. In the intervals while she was setting up the array, a stack of sparrow jade tokens had already piled up beside his hand.","His speed was incredibly fast. Not only did his carving tool fly, but his spiritual power also transformed into carving tools to etch the jade tokens. In just a few breaths, a fresh sparrow jade token was produced.","Qi Quan quietly waited for him to finish carving one before speaking to remind him: \"Let's go.\"","Lingsheng stopped his movements, glanced back at her, then stuffed the carving tool and the unfinished jade tokens into his bag.","It seemed he planned to continue carving on the way.","Qi Quan did not stop him. She walked up to him, naturally took his hand, smiled lightly, and said, \"Don't worry, I'm here.\"","Lingsheng instinctively clasped her hand back, then remembered his hand was still covered in jade dust. He used a cleansing technique, his eyes and brows radiating joy.","The two of them walked hand in hand into the courtyard.","Su Steward's expression faltered slightly. Teacher Xue raised an eyebrow, but neither said anything extra, only stating:","\"Master, Lingsheng, we'll be waiting for you to return home.\"","Qi Quan and Lingsheng left through the villa's gate.","\"Senior!\"","Shen Hui and Tang Mian were waiting outside. Seeing the two holding hands, they weren't particularly surprised.","When the cleanup in Longlin City ended that day, Senior and Physician Lingsheng had embraced right in front of everyone. Holding hands was nothing in comparison.","The car drove all the way towards Longjing City.","\"Senior, investigation departments everywhere are currently destroying the stone statues. The stone statues in Longjing City have all been destroyed,\" Tang Mian reported.","Qi Quan nodded, lowering her head to carefully examine the map of Longjing City.","Lingsheng sat beside her and began carving jade tokens.","The jade dust did not fly about randomly but, wrapped in spiritual power, fell into a pre-prepared bag, not touching Qi Quan in the slightest.","Seeing the two big shots treating the situation with such seriousness, Shen Hui and Tang Mian exchanged a glance, both seeing determination in each other's eyes.","No matter what happened this time, they would not retreat!","Qi Quan's full concentration was on the map.","The urban planning of Longjing City was quite particular. Whether in terms of layout or function, it was impeccable.","Her mind worked at high speed, trying to find clues from the map, but this was like looking for a needle in a haystack. Without any hints, trying to accurately extract information from a vast amount of data was truly not an easy task.","Longhai City Investigation Department.","In the interrogation room, Gao Peilan suddenly began to laugh softly.","The investigator noticed this and immediately entered the interrogation room to question her.","\"What are you laughing at?\"","Gao Peilan's long hair was disheveled. Her face was no different from a living person's, except she still maintained the eight-month pregnancy from the time of her death.","She originally had a bright and pretty appearance but had become sinister and ghostly due to hatred. When she looked up at the investigator, the upturned corners of her eyes were like snake tongues dripping with venom.","\"You were very busy last night, weren't you?\" she asked in a low, hoarse voice, tinged with a hint of pleasure.","The investigator: \"You know about the hospital incident?\"","Gao Peilan laughed: \"Do you have some misunderstanding about me? I'm not that fool who was cheated and still helped count the money. If I didn't want to, you wouldn't have been able to catch me.\"","\"If that's the case, why did you come to the Investigation Department?\" the investigator asked sternly. \"Once you're here, won't you be unable to witness the birth of the Ghost King firsthand?\"","Gao Peilan stiffened.","\"You trust him that much?\" the investigator said. \"It seems after all these years, you haven't changed.\"","Gao Peilan's face turned fierce: \"What do you mean?\"","\"We treated your husband,\" the investigator said.","\"He is not my husband!\" Gao Peilan shrieked sharply. \"He's a devil! He's a devil!\"","The investigator: \"If you hate him so much, why didn't you kill him?\"","\"Wouldn't killing him be letting him off too easily?\" Gao Peilan sneered. \"Besides, I am a law-abiding good ghost. I haven't harmed anyone. You can't find any evidence of my crimes, so you still have to let me out.\"","The investigator: \"To go out and see the Ghost King being born?\"","Gao Peilan chuckled softly, her eyes filled with anticipation.","\"That might not be possible,\" the investigator said.","\"Oh?\"","The investigator explained: \"We have discovered the stone statues in various places. All the statues have now been destroyed. Your method of using the statues to control people for sacrifice is no longer viable.\"","Without the sacrifices, the Ghost King cannot gain power.","Gao Peilan was stunned for a moment, then suddenly laughed, her whole body shaking with laughter. \"You... you are too naive, hahahaha.\"","The investigator quietly prompted: \"Naive?\"","\"Yes, naive.\" Gao Peilan twirled her hair with her fingers, humming a tune, and stopped speaking.","The investigator smiled and said, \"We performed deep hypnosis on Pan Hao overnight.\"","Gao Peilan paused, her eyes lowered, and said nothing.","\"Although he's insane, through deep hypnosis, we discovered something.\" The investigator's low words were like a thunderclap. \"He simply didn't know he had ever given you to his superior.\"","Gao Peilan accidentally snapped off a few strands of hair.","After a moment of silence, she asked, \"What do you mean?\"","\"It means he likely never did that thing.\" The investigator looked at her and said. \"Is it possible that you were deceived?\"","What the Investigation Department had previously found indeed indicated that Pan Hao had sent the pregnant Gao Peilan to his superior's bed. Pan Hao was already insane; no hypnosis technique would work on him. The investigator said this merely to trick Gao Peilan.","Gao Peilan had just revealed a very crucial piece of information. To save more people in time, they had to use this kind of rhetoric.","The investigator's confident expression made Gao Peilan's heart flutter with panic.","If Pan Hao himself didn't do it, then who could have done it?","She growled in a low, hoarse voice: \"Impossible! Impossible! Is this how you shield criminals? For such a devil, you actually want to whitewash him?\"","\"You've been a ghost for so many years, you should know the methods of a Celestial Master,\" the interrogator said. \"Creating someone exactly like Pan Hao wouldn't be difficult for a high-level Celestial Master.\"","Gao Peilan clenched her hands, nails digging into her palms, and said venomously, \"You're bluffing me.\"","\"Did you truly never have even a shred of doubt?\"","Gao Peilan suddenly fell silent, her memories rushing back.","After she fell to her death, due to powerful resentment and hatred, she did not immediately reincarnate but instead became a ghost.","After becoming a ghost, she could not leave the place of her death.","The place of her death was right below their residence.","She saw Pan Hao's grief-stricken appearance before her spirit tablet, but at the time, filled with resentment, she thought he was just putting on an act.","Later, Pan Hao returned home every day looking lost and desolate. He never married and was praised by the neighbors for his devotion, which only deepened the resentment in her heart.","Until one day, she encountered a male ghost more powerful than her.","He looked no different from a living person, but he was undoubtedly a ghost.","She felt she had found her chance.","She asked the ghost, \"Can I become like you?\"","As long as she became such a powerful ghost, she could take her revenge.","The male ghost generously taught her.","After Gao Peilan cultivated ghost arts, she found herself connected to the male ghost by a faint thread. One could say the male ghost had become her master.","She wasn't surprised.","There's no such thing as a free lunch in this world. If she wanted revenge, she had to pay a price.","She soon cultivated into a powerful ghost and went to take revenge on Pan Hao.","She manifested before Pan Hao, expecting his terror upon seeing her, but unexpectedly, this man's mental fortitude was far stronger than she had imagined.","He wasn't afraid at all; he even tried excitedly to embrace her.","Gao Peilan had long lost patience with him.","She tortured him mercilessly.","So many years had passed, her memories had actually grown very fuzzy. She could only grope for residual images from the corners of her mind.","After the interrogator's counter-question, she truly began to doubt the events of that time.","The interrogator continued, \"That ghost was a Celestial Master in life. As you know, the ghost arts he cultivated were very special. He used the energy of willing sacrifices to continuously strengthen his ghost power.\"","\"So what?\" Gao Peilan's voice was extremely hoarse.","Interrogator: \"When you jumped to your death, the burst of resentful energy must have been considerable.\"","Gao Peilan: \"...\"","\"You were just an insignificant pawn in his experiment.\"","Gao Peilan was stunned.","For so many years, she had grown accustomed to witnessing those scenes of men committing suicide \"for love.\" She transferred her hatred for Pan Hao onto those disgusting men, watching them sacrifice their lives one after another, and she never felt any sympathy.","But what if her death was just part of a scheme?","She stared at the interrogator. \"I'm just an ordinary person. Why would he specifically choose me?\"","Interrogator: \"Perhaps he just happened to come across you.\"","Gao Peilan's mind was in complete turmoil at this moment.","Having followed He Xiuyu for so many years, she had some understanding of him.","In his eyes, this world was merely his game and training ground. He manipulated everyone with ease, and those being manipulated were completely unaware.","Then what about her?","Was she also a pawn without even realizing it?","Was her death really just an accident?","Was it really Pan Hao who caused her to be violated?","The more Gao Peilan thought, the more she broke down.","The video of her interrogation was simultaneously transmitted to the Longjing City Investigation Department.","Di Meng couldn't help but ask, \"Did Pan Hao really not do that thing?\"","Li Guoyan: \"It was too long ago. The specific circumstances are unclear.\"","\"...\"","\"However, we still have doubts about whether He Xiuyu was involved in this matter.\"","He Xiuyu died forty years ago; Gao Peilan died thirty years ago.","Ten years was enough time for He Xiuyu to cultivate to a considerable level.","Master Qi had said that He Xiuyu had upgraded the sacrificial ritual. Could it be that the simple sacrificial ritual could no longer satisfy his needs, and Gao Peilan was just a test subject and sacrifice for the upgraded version?","This point could not be verified for now.","Just then, Gao Peilan spoke.","\"There's no point in interrogating me further. The formation is already complete. No one can stop him now.\"","Interrogator: \"What do you mean?\"","Gao Peilan said, \"I was only responsible for the Siren Queen group. I'm not clear about other matters. I don't believe what you said about Pan Hao being hypnotized. He might have truly liked me, but compared to his future prospects, I wasn't that important. No matter how much you say, I cannot provide more information.\"","Interrogator: ...","Li Guoyan's thick brows furrowed tightly.","He simply couldn't figure out what He Xiuyu was trying to do.","The phone suddenly rang.","It was Qi Quan.","\"Found it.\"","\"What?\"","Her voice was as calm as ever.","\"The entire city of Longjing will become his altar.\""]},{"number":73,"title":"Chapter 73","paragraphs":["Qi Quanting's words struck like a thunderbolt, leaving minds blank.","\"Master Qi, what do you mean...\"","Even when learning about the thirty hideouts of the Tianqi organization, Li Guoyan hadn't been this shaken.","Qi Quan spoke rapidly yet steadily.","\"I've studied the map of Longjing City and identified several key nodal points. He Xiuyu has spent decades laying out an exquisitely perfect sacrificial array across Longjing. Even if not the entire city, at least half of Longjing will become his altar.\"","\"Isn't he afraid of heavenly retribution?\"","Previously, when targeting Qi Quan and Ling Sheng, he had only used methods to suppress their fortunes.","Qi Quan: \"He has deceived everyone.\"","Li Guoyan: \"...\"","\"All his 'gentle' methods, seemingly designed to exploit loopholes in the heavenly way, seemingly avoiding direct confrontation with it, are actually just a smokescreen.\"","Qi Quan's tone was firm.","\"His true goal is to defy heaven itself.\"","No matter how special the ghost technique, no matter how 'gentle' the sacrificial ritual, they cannot conceal their essence of harming people.","No ghost can truly become a Ghost King through such sacrificial rituals.","He Xiuyu must have long guessed this.","But he was unwilling to accept it.","If the heavenly way wouldn't allow him to become a Ghost King and escape the cycle of reincarnation, then he would defy the heavenly way.","As \"favorites of the heavenly way,\" Qi Quan and Ling Sheng were not mere obstacles in his eyes, but the most perfect sacrificial offerings he had meticulously selected.","All the clues he intentionally revealed earlier were solely to mislead the authorities, to lure Qi Quan and Ling Sheng, forcing them to voluntarily enter Longjing City, this grand altar.","Li Guoyan: \"Master, what should we do?\"","\"I have identified several hub points. Notify the metaphysical masters in Longjing City, unite all forces, and first disrupt these hubs.\"","To operate such a vast and complex array, different smaller arrays need to be combined, much like a massive machine assembled from various parts.","But arrays differ from machines.","A machine missing a part might cease to function; an array might not.","From the map, Qi Quan could only roughly locate several particularly special positions. These positions were the hubs connecting the array. Destroying the hubs might disrupt the array's normal operation.","Each hub was a small array itself.","Li Guoyan: \"Understood.\"","He trusted Qi Quan completely. Following Qi Quan's deductions, he immediately notified all metaphysical factions in Longjing City to fight for the city's defense!","Sect leaders and family heads like Fu Jiuchong, Yin Yi, and Yan Huai responded one after another, leading elders and disciples to destroy the arrays at various hubs.","But when they arrived, they were all dumbfounded.","They simply couldn't find where the arrays were!","Arrays of Ghost General level were beyond their perception.","Moreover, these array sites were all in densely populated areas. To dismantle the arrays, they first had to evacuate the crowds, adding pressure to the destruction effort.","If it was truly as Senior Qi predicted—that once activated, half of Longjing would become lambs on the altar—then they were now in a race against time.","They couldn't stand by and watch Longjing's citizens lose their lives.","Trusting in Qi Quan, no one questioned the existence of the arrays.","But what to do now?","Senior Qi was traveling from Longjiang to Long...jing. By car, it would take six hours—far too long.","Li Guoyan immediately issued an order for Shen Hui to drive to the nearest city's airport, where a flight was already on standby.","\"Master, they haven't found the arrays,\" Li Guoyan reported, his voice heavy.","This was within Qi Quan's expectations.","If He Xiuyu could let them find it easily, he wouldn't have remained hidden for so many years undiscovered.","If he didn't possess such great capability, how would he dare to contend with the heavenly way?","Longjing City had the most powerful metaphysical forces. That he could construct such a massive array right under their noses, completely undetected, spoke volumes about his caution and strength.","His previous appearance via the stone statue likely meant he was fully prepared.","Yet, despite being well-prepared, He Xiuyu hadn't activated the array, indicating he was waiting for a specific moment.","A moment when the lambs would walk into the tiger's den.","Qi Quan already had a guess in mind. \"The array won't activate immediately. Evacuate the crowds first.\"","Li Guoyan: \"Alright.\"","Soon, the plane was over Longjing City.","Viewing the entire city from high above was more intuitive than looking at a map.","Qi Quan, with her peak Human Emperor realm spiritual sense, probed downward, and the layout of Longjing City unfolded completely in her mind.","She looked at Ling Sheng.","Ling Sheng nodded in tacit understanding, closed his eyes, and began communing with the spiritual energy of heaven and earth.","Lower-level masters couldn't see the arrays, but Qi Quan, being of the same level, could \"see\" them, and Ling Sheng, through communion with the spiritual energy, could also \"see.\"","The two divided the city in half, each responsible for one side.","The plane landed at the airport, where Li Guoyan personally met them.","This matter now concerned the fate of the entire city, the most heart-stopping case he had handled in his career.","As soon as Qi Quan and Ling Sheng got in the car, they handed him the marked locations of the arrays.","The arrays avoided the city center, where the concentration of fortune was extremely thick. No matter how arrogant He Xiuyu was, he wouldn't dare place an array there.","Most arrays were set in the outer city or suburbs.","With the city's expansion in recent years, the population in outer city and suburban areas had grown significantly. New commercial buildings and residential areas gathered massive numbers of people.","Eighty-one locations in total.","Li Guoyan's expression turned grave. \"He really went to great lengths!\"","With so many locations, they simply didn't have time to dismantle them all.","Qi Quan said, \"There's another way.\"","\"What?\"","\"Find the array's core and destroy it.\"","Li Guoyan: \"The core... he must be at the core!\"","As soon as the words left his mouth, Di Meng, who was driving, suddenly cried out in alarm.","It wasn't just him. All cultivators in Longjing City sensed something was wrong.","An extremely powerful force began spreading through the air above.","They even sensed the surrounding spiritual energy of heaven and earth starting to grow thin.","Li Guoyan had no cultivation, but his instincts were sharp. His primal sense of danger made his spine go cold.","He asked, \"Has the array been activated?\"","Qi Quan nodded. \"Yes.\"","He Xiuyu had been waiting for the moment when she and Ling Sheng entered Longjing City.","\"Master,\" Li Guoyan said, his expression stern, \"what is your plan?\"","Qi Quan said, \"Stop the car.\"","\"Senior?\" Di Meng was puzzled but pulled over.","Qi Quan said, \"Director Li, I suggest we first concentrate our forces to destroy the most critical hubs.\"","\"What about you and Ling Sheng?\" Li Guoyan asked.","Di... Meng also stared at them intently.","Qi Quan did not hide it. \"We are going to the array's core.\"","What lay at the array's core was no mystery to anyone.","The Investigation Department was fully aware of He Xiuyu's targeting of Qi Quan and Ling Sheng.","And now, Qi Quan and Ling Sheng had no choice but to head to the most dangerous place. This feeling of helplessness filled them with shame and anguish.","Qi Quan smiled. \"No need to worry.\"","She took Ling Sheng's hand, and their figures vanished abruptly.","Di Meng's eyes reddened, his voice hoarse. \"Director Li, I request to lead a team to destroy the array hubs!\"","Now that the array was activated, with its spiritual energy fluctuations, the metaphysical practitioners could already sense the arrays' presence.","The authorities were evacuating the populace while efficiently deploying combat forces. All the Celestial Masters from the Mystic Sects were mobilized.","Yan Huai received his orders and led the Yan family elders and disciples to rush towards one of the key nodes.","\"Brother Huai, how come another evil ghost appears right after we vanquished Tian Qi?\" Yan Geng followed closely beside him, his voice filled with worry. \"I feel like this is even more serious than the last time.\"","He had never experienced such a heavy, oppressive atmosphere before.","During the purge of Tian Qi, although he hadn't participated, he had heard snippets from those who did. Thanks to the Unity Talismans, the battle ended swiftly, and the participating cultivators suffered no serious casualties. The overall mood had been one of fervent excitement.","Nothing like the present.","Everyone wore expressions that spoke of an impending catastrophe.","Yan Huai replied, \"He Xiuyu attempted to use an array to seize the lives of half the populace of Longjing. This is no trivial matter. Choose your words carefully.\"","Yan Geng's jaw dropped in shock.","Half the populace's lives? This wasn't about becoming a Ghost King, this was about becoming a devil!","A surge of fighting spirit immediately rose within him.","\"Let's kick his ass!\"","Southwest of Longjing.","A towering, oppressive aura gradually rose. Churning dark clouds rolled in from the horizon, blotting out the brilliant golden sunlight.","To ordinary citizens, it looked like a storm was coming.","But all Mystic Sect cultivators could see that these black clouds brought not rain, but ghostly energy capable of destroying heaven and earth.","\"The southwest... the Guiyuan Sect?!\"","\"Is the Ghost King about to manifest? Longjing is in peril!\"","Yin Yi was leading a team to destroy an array node when he suddenly saw the overwhelming ghostly energy emanating from above the Guiyuan Sect. He froze in place.","His eyes widened abruptly.","How had he not thought of it? How had he not realized!","He Xiuyu was the former sect leader. His tomb was built on the back mountain of the sect. If there was any place in the world most secret and secure, it would absolutely be his own tomb!","Of course, this only applied to ghosts who practiced special ghost arts.","Ordinary ghosts couldn't possibly hide within the Guiyuan Sect.","He Xiuyu was truly audacious. Although he practiced ghost arts to evade detection by Celestial Masters, what if? Wasn't he afraid of being discovered?","Above the Guiyuan Sect, a dense, black mass of ghostly energy enveloped the entire sect.","Qi Quan and Ling Sheng hovered beneath the dark clouds, looking down at the tomb on the back mountain.","The array's core was here.","This man, He Xiuyu, truly could not be judged by common logic.","[Great One, is the Ghost King about to emerge?] The system was even more nervous than during the fight with Cai Ji.","Qi Quan: [He is not a Ghost King yet.]","The system added, [Great One, the other Mystic Sect members are all attacking the array elsewhere. It's just you and Ling Sheng here. Shouldn't we tell the others to wear Unity Talismans?]","[Unity Talismans are useless now.]","[Why?]","[He's using the array to steal life force. Unity Talismans can't stop that.]","...","Unity Talismans could only share spiritual power and distribute damage.","If one person was severely injured, it could be shared with others. But what if everyone's life force was being stolen simultaneously?","No amount of Unity Talismans would help.","The system sighed gloomily.","The dark clouds gathered thicker, plunging the entire Guiyuan Sect into gloom—the perfect environment for ghosts and monsters.","[Why isn't he coming out yet?]","Qi Quan: [Just building up his presence.]","How could the \"Ghost King's\" entrance not be a spectacle?","Naturally, Qi Quan had no patience to wait for him.","She materialized a bow from her spiritual energy. An arrow glowing with pale gold light shot accurately towards He Xiuyu's tomb. The arrowhead struck the protective array surrounding the tomb, causing the barrier to shimmer violently for several seconds before stabilizing once more.","Qi Quan raised her bow again.","The dark clouds above seemed to pause abruptly.","Just as she was about to loose the second arrow, a figure materialized above the tomb.","He was handsome, his expression aloof. He wore a light cyan Daoist robe, his long hair tied up with a jade hairpin. A hint of compassion for all living things flickered in his eyes. At first glance, he possessed an air of transcendent grace.","It was He Xiuyu.","[Pah! What an act!] The system spat.","The two sides hovered in the air, facing each other from a distance.","He Xiuyu examined the pair, then a faint smile appeared on his face, his tone gentle and benign: \"Truly worthy of being Children of Destiny.\"","Qi Quan remained silent. Ling Sheng was even less likely to engage with him.","A sinister, chilling ghostly energy churned menacingly around the two.","A trace of provocation surfaced on He Xiuyu's refined features.","Even the most restrained and introverted person, after hiding for decades, would find it hard to suppress the deeply buried urge to show off upon finally revealing themselves.","He wasn't flustered in the slightest. He even chatted leisurely with them.","\"One possesses a unique destiny, the other is a Natural Spirit Body. I am pleased to see you have grown to such heights.\"","The system hated pretentious people the most and complained: [He talks as if it's all his doing.]","Qi Quan: [What pleases him is that he is about to acquire two well-nourished sacrifices.]","[Huh?] The system was shocked. [He wants to use you and Ling Sheng as sacrifices? Damn, the audacity!]","He Xiuyu happened to speak again, confirming Qi Quan's words.","\"Advisor Qi, since you hold an official position, I presume you are willing to lead by example and sacrifice yourself for the people?\"","Qi Quan: \"Your pointless chatter is as bad as Cai Ji's.\"","He Xiuyu: \"...\"","Considering himself superior and having once been the leader of the Guiyuan Sect, he never used such blunt language. Hearing this, he was momentarily stunned.","Qi Quan said, \"You want to use us as sacrifices?\"","The excitement in He Xiuyu's heart cooled slightly.","He looked at Qi Quan, standing proud and imposing, then at Ling Sheng, whose gaze was deep and cold. He suddenly felt this might be somewhat troublesome.","\"I never said I would use you as sacrifices. I merely wish to know what you hold more important: your lives and his, or the lives of half the city's populace.\"","[Holy crap, how shameless! He's actually threatening you with so many people's lives!] The system exclaimed.","A mocking smile appeared on Qi Quan's face. \"I originally thought Cai Ji was the most cowardly and despicable person I had ever seen. Who knew you could surpass him? Worthy of having been a sect leader.\"","\"Cowardly?\" He Xiuyu's smile faded. \"I cannot bear the sight of bloodshed. I dislike fighting and killing.\"","[Gag! Gag! Gag! Gag!]","\"How much bloodshed have you personally orchestrated?\" Qi Quan's expression turned cold and stern. \"You lured Cai Ji into establishing the Tian Qi organization, causing the deaths of countless people. You deliberately manufactured conflicts, nurtured Gao... Peilan, Xiong Wangchun, and drove them to do your bidding. Do you truly believe such underhanded methods can deceive the Heavenly Dao?\"","He Xiuyu expressed surprise. \"When did I ever lure him? He was merely my servant. I never spoke to him. I also never deliberately manufactured conflicts. Their obedience to me was simply because I freed them from their shackles. As for deceiving the Heavenly Dao...\"","He suddenly laughed.","\"Nothing I have done is the slightest bit wrong. Why would I need to deceive the Heavenly Dao?\"","He portrayed himself as a compassionate savior of all living beings.","Qi Quan: \"You lured us here precisely to plunder our destiny, didn't you?\"","\"You're speaking so much. Are you waiting for an opportunity?\" A faint smile appeared on He Xiuyu's face. \"But unfortunately, you won't get it.\"","The array he had laid down over many years was not so easily broken.","If those Mystic Sects were truly effective, he wouldn't have been able to hide safely within the Guiyuan Sect for so many years.","In his view, the only ones who posed a threat to him were the two before him.","Qi Quan also smiled.","She asked, \"Are you sure about that?\"","He Xiuyu: ?","\"Ling Sheng,\" Qi Quan called out softly.","The young man instantly understood her meaning, communicating with the spiritual energy of heaven and earth to conceal the traces of both her and himself.","The two suddenly vanished from sight, stirring a hidden unease in He Xiuyu's heart.","With his cultivation at the peak of the Ghost General realm, he actually couldn't sense them at all!","He sneered inwardly. Even if they wanted to launch a sneak attack while invisible, it would be futile. Right now, the lives of half the city's populace were tied to him alone.","Everyone had guessed wrong.","He had never intended to use those ants as sacrificial offerings. The offering he had always wanted was the Child of Destiny.","When Qi Quan's sword light finally struck him, many innocent people would be indirectly killed by her. He eagerly anticipated the expression on her face when she learned the truth.","To personally deprive innocent citizens of their lives—it would probably—","A streak of sword light abruptly shot towards the nearest array node.","The pale golden sword radiance struck the array, carrying the force of a thunderous avalanche, instantly obliterating it.","With a soft pop, the array shattered.","Before he could even react, another streak of sword light shot out, causing another array node to vanish.","The power of someone at the peak of the Human Sovereign realm was beyond what mere mortals could compare to.","The exorcists who had been desperately attacking the arrays: ???","So they had been fighting all this time without breaking through, but the big boss shattered one with a single sword light?","Big boss is awesome!!!!!","\"Comrades! Let's go support the other locations!\"","The team leader was stunned for a moment, then immediately issued the order, swiftly moving to support other squads.","With eighty-one locations across the city, manpower was truly insufficient.","Senior Qi Quan destroying two at once undoubtedly lightened their burden.","A third streak of sword light shattered another array.","Qi Quan's actions were like three slaps, striking He Xiuyu's face hard!","After the initial shock, He Xiuyu's gentle mask showed faint signs of cracking.","Unable to sense the figures of the two, frustration churned in his heart.","\"There are eighty-one in total, Qi Quan. Do you truly believe that after breaking the arrays, you can save everyone?\"","Qi Quan ignored him and unleashed another sword strike.","The fourth location shattered.","Watching the arrays he had painstakingly laid out being destroyed by Qi Quan one by one, He Xiuyu could no longer endure it.","He raised his voice, \"Qi Quan, have you considered that after exhausting your spiritual power to break the arrays, will you have any strength left to deal with me?\"","His scheme was almost unsolvable.","Judging from the battle with the Tianqi organization, the spiritual power within Qi Quan's body couldn't sustain many major moves.","With eighty-one arrays, if she broke them one by one, she'd likely exhaust her internal spiritual power before even reaching the tenth.","Even if she possessed that so-called talisman that allowed shared spiritual power, how much could these people provide her?","And how long could the spiritual power they provide possibly sustain her?","He Xiuyu knew she had a backlash talisman. She could use it to kill Cai Ji, but she couldn't use it to kill him.","Either she would exhaust her spiritual power before breaking all eighty-one arrays and become his offering.","Or she would kill him, condemning half the city's populace to be buried with him.","Qi Quan turned a deaf ear, unleashing a fifth streak of sword light.","Another array shattered.","He Xiuyu chuckled softly.","Seeing Qi Quan act so recklessly and impulsively, he was no longer worried about the outcome.","He was destined to become a Ghost King.","The system naturally heard his words and said anxiously, 【Big boss, why aren't you killing him, but instead attacking the arrays?】","Qi Quan explained, 【The moment he appeared, I knew my earlier guess was wrong.】","【Wrong about what?】","【The function of the arrays isn't to have half the city sacrificed. It's to bind his fate to the fate of half the city's people. If I kill him, half the city's populace will die too.】","【Ah? What can be done then?】 the system said, 【But just breaking the arrays is useless too. You're expending spiritual power to break them. Even if the arrays are broken, you won't have any power left to kill him.】","Qi Quan smiled, 【Who said I'm the one breaking them?】","【Huh?】 The system also couldn't see the traces of the two.","Qi Quan grasped the hand of the young man beside her and threw out one composite sword talisman after another. The composite sword talismans transformed into pale golden sword light, striking the target arrays.","For long-range attacks, composite sword talismans required array support, but at this close distance, she only needed to activate them.","Since others couldn't see her, they naturally assumed it was her sword radiance.","However, the composite sword talismans were only ninth-grade. The spiritual power they carried wasn't enough to shatter an array in one hit, at most creating a few cracks.","Being able to shatter the arrays was largely thanks to Ling Sheng.","Qi Quan threw out another composite sword talisman. At the moment the sword light struck the array, Ling Sheng's lips moved slightly.","\"Break.\"","A barely audible sound, yet filled with the power of verbal incantation, instantly shattered the array on the foundation laid by the composite sword talisman.","The two complemented each other. Even after breaking the sixth array, Qi Quan only needed to expend the spiritual power to activate the talisman, and Ling Sheng's verbal power wasn't heavily depleted either.","Their forms were hidden within the spiritual energy of heaven and earth. Others couldn't see or hear them, having no way of knowing this was how they were breaking the arrays.","When the tenth array was broken, a smile touched He Xiuyu's lips.","Qi Quan should have no strength left.","When the twentieth was broken, the smile vanished from his lips.","She must have used the Unity Talisman.","But no matter how many Unity Talismans or spirit talismans she had, what use were they?","Could spiritual energy possibly be inexhaustible?","When the thirtieth streak of sword light shattered an array, He Xiuyu completely lost his composure.","Unable to see Qi Quan, he looked towards the destroyed arrays and said, \"Qi Quan, if you continue like this, you're only courting your own doom.\"","Qi Quan chuckled lightly, \"Isn't that exactly the result you wanted to see?\"","He Xiuyu: \"...\"","That wasn't what he wanted!","What he wanted to see was Qi Quan struggling with the agonizing choice between half the city's people and her own life. What he wanted to see was the expression on Qi Quan's face when the authorities chose the half-city populace. What he wanted to see was Qi Quan, exhausted of strength, becoming his perfect offering.","Thirty arrays exploded like fireworks. The number of people whose fates were linked to his was rapidly decreasing.","If Qi Quan truly destroyed all the arrays, what would he have left to restrain her with?","He Xiuyu lowered his gaze. Black energy churned in his palm.","In an instant, three great ghosts radiating black energy appeared before him.","\"Go.\"","All three great ghosts had reached the first tier of Ghost General!","He Xiuyu himself was already at the peak of Ghost General, just a step away from advancing to the Ghost King realm.","With three more first-tier Ghost Generals, who could possibly stop him?","Unable to sense the location of the two, he didn't order the Ghost Generals to attack them. Instead, he directed the Ghost Generals to charge at the lower-level exorcists of the Mystic Gate.","Having experienced one purge operation, the Mystic Gate exorcists had learned their lesson. Going into battle, they naturally wore Unity Talismans.","The three Ghost Generals roared as they charged. Wherever they went, the black energy was sinister and terrifying.","When one person suffered a severe injury, shared among the others, it was indeed temporarily manageable. But over time, once the accumulated damage exceeded everyone's threshold, the Unity Talisman would become useless.","Moreover, they still had to attack the arrays.","Qi Quan and Ling Sheng had blasted away thirty arrays in one go. The official Mystic Gate teams, working together until now, had destroyed ten.","Forty-one remained.","Qi Quan could indeed slay a Ghost General with one sword strike, but He Xiuyu was truly cunning. He had actually linked the fates of the Ghost Generals to the arrays as well.","If she destroyed the Ghost Generals, who knew how many people would die because of it.","But she couldn't just stand by and watch the Mystic Gate exorcists suffer losses.","Just then, Xie Lanzhou appeared.","He was an eighth-level ghost, still far from a Ghost General, but he was a ghost with accumulated virtue, one that ordinary ghosts dared not provoke lightly, and even Ghost Generals were the same.","Xie Lanzhou moved with extreme speed.","Each place he drifted to, he left a Guardian Talisman. These were composite formation talismans, drawn by Qi Quan during her half-month livestream in Longjing when she had spare time. There weren't many, but they were sufficient.","Activated by spiritual power, the Guardian Talismans enveloped the masters at each attack formation, blocking the Ghost General's assaults.","The Ghost General, furious and flustered, tried to stop Xie Lanzhou.","After all, Xie Lanzhou was an experienced master. Now transformed into a ghost with unrestricted speed and protected by the golden light of his virtue, he skillfully maneuvered around the three ghosts.","He Xiuyu: \"...\"","Qi Quan chuckled softly, not wasting the time Xie Lanzhou had bought for her, and continued to unleash composite sword talismans.","In an instant, two more formations shattered.","He Xiuyu's expression suddenly darkened.","He understood now. Qi Quan wasn't using her own cultivation at all, but composite sword talismans.","Her concealment wasn't to prevent his attacks either, but to confuse him, deliberately buying time.","But what was strange was, how could a composite sword talisman shatter a formation in a single strike?","Uncertain and furious, He Xiuyu's heart filled with rage.","He was always the one who deceived others; no one could ever deceive him!","He Xiuyu observed quietly, deducing Qi Quan's possible location from the pattern of the sword talismans attacking the formations. Black energy crept into his pupils, his entire body shrouded in ghostly aura. The dark clouds in the sky, heeding his call, crashed down like a massive wave.","The black clouds were formed from condensed ghostly energy, blanketing the entire sky. Such a wide-ranging attack meant that no matter where Qi Quan was, she would be struck by the ghostly energy.","He Xiuyu no longer cared about the Heavenly Dao.","His attempt to devour the fortunes of Qi Quan and Ling Sheng was already an act of defiance against heaven.","...","If Qi Quan and Ling Sheng were to \"voluntarily\" sacrifice their lives to protect half the city's population, He Xiuyu naturally wouldn't need to act himself.","But now, he couldn't let Qi Quan continue any longer.","Vast, overwhelming ghostly energy blotted out the sky and sun, seemingly intent on destroying the entire world. It gathered around Qi Quan and Ling Sheng, concealing countless killing intent.","The ghostly energy, controlled by He Xiuyu, was also part of his ghostly form, bound to the lives of half the city's people.","It could harm Qi Quan, but Qi Quan could not fight back.","The system was frantic: [Big shot, what do we do now? This ghost is too cunning!]","The big shot's ultimate move couldn't even be used!","Qi Quan turned her head to look at Ling Sheng, her eyes showing hesitation.","The young man hooked her finger, smiled at her, and moved his lips without making a sound.","Qi Quan originally couldn't read lips, but at this moment, she clearly understood his reply.","He said: \"I can do it.\"","Qi Quan hesitated no longer and decisively let go of his hand.","A golden, blazing long sword coalesced in her palm, bursting forth with a dazzling, brilliant light amidst the gloomy, terrifying black clouds.","The golden radiance dispelled the darkness.","He Xiuyu laughed, \"Qi Quan, you cannot kill me.\"","If he died, the people connected to the formation would die too.","Qi Quan didn't speak, nor did she move.","She just gazed at the young man before her, her eyes clear and resolute.","Ling Sheng looked at her deeply, then closed his eyes. Countless streams of heaven and earth spiritual energy surged towards him, scattering the sky-obscuring ghostly energy and gathering around him, ready for his command.","The young man hovered in mid-air, a layer of pure white spiritual energy swirling around him.","He Xiuyu couldn't help but frown, a sense of unease suddenly arising within him.","He had always calculated without error; there couldn't be any miscalculations!","But while he had deduced that Ling Sheng was a Natural Spirit Body, he didn't know Ling Sheng possessed the power of Word Magic.","The Natural Spirit Body existed only in the legends of ancient texts. He had never seen one with his own eyes, let alone knew what abilities a Natural Spirit Body might possess.","Ling Sheng floated in the air, his voice clear and melodious like the chime of jade.","\"Borrowing the power of the Nine Heavens, break the Sacrificial Evil Formation.\"","A series of thunderclaps suddenly echoed from the high sky. An immensely powerful force poured down from the vast firmament, all of it channeling into Ling Sheng's body.","The pure white spiritual energy actually began to shimmer with a hint of golden light.","He Xiuyu's eyes widened in terror.","\"No, this is impossible!\"","The young man abruptly opened his eyes, his pupils tinged with a faint golden glow. He looked down upon the dozens of formations below, his voice like ten thousand sharp arrows, crashing down upon the Sacrificial Evil Formation.","\"Break!\"","As the syllable fell, all forty-one formations turned to dust, instantly dissipating.","The world fell into utter silence.","Everyone looked up at the young man in the high sky.","The young man raised his gaze, his eyes soft as he looked at Qi Quan, then suddenly coughed up a mouthful of blood, staining his chest.","Yet he smiled at her.","Qi Quan pressed her lips together, flew over, and took his hand. She was about to transfer her spiritual power into him but was stopped by Ling Sheng.","He pointed at He Xiuyu, who stood shocked and speechless.","Qi Quan was stunned for a moment, then suddenly chuckled softly. \"Alright, leave it to me.\"","She had been unwilling for Ling Sheng to use the power of Word Magic until the last moment. Such a powerful skill would undoubtedly come at a cost.","Her earlier relentless destruction of the numerous formations was precisely to ensure Ling Sheng wouldn't need to use too much of his Word Magic power.","With the formations broken, He Xiuyu had nothing left to rely on.","Qi Quan turned around.","The golden long sword shot through the gloomy ghostly energy like a meteor, heading straight for He... Xiuyu's face.","He Xiuyu nearly vomited blood in fury.","His meticulously laid plan of decades, shattered so easily?","Qi Quan! It was all because of Qi Quan!","If she hadn't rescued Ling Sheng from the cave, Ling Sheng would now be the most feared demon lord in the Mystic Arts world, drawing everyone's attention, and no one would have paid him any heed.","Once his plan neared completion, he could have lured the mindless demon lord into the formation, and he would surely have been able to contend with the Heavenly Dao!","Qi Quan was indeed his biggest stumbling block!","\"You think I'm like Cai Ji?\" He Xiuyu's false mask completely shattered as he sneered with sinister contempt. \"I won't fall for your tricks. Wanting to kill me is impossible.\"","Black ghostly energy entangled the golden spirit sword.","Qi Quan smiled. \"To deal with you, a Backlash Talisman isn't even necessary.\"","\"What do you mean?\"","Qi Quan channeled all her spiritual power. The spirit sword's golden light blazed brilliantly, its resplendent and magnificent radiance spreading from her as the center, extending into the boundless black clouds.","Wherever the golden light reached, the ghostly energy dissipated completely.","The sword embodied righteousness, specifically designed to vanquish sinister ghosts and evil spirits, a natural bane to malevolent ghosts.","Moreover, within this sword light, there was a faint trace of the power of law.","It was the Sword Dao Qi Quan had comprehended, and also the gift bestowed upon her by the Heavenly Dao when she advanced after annihilating Cai Ji.","Feeling that power of law, He Xiuyu could no longer maintain his composure, his eyes widening in disbelief.","\"Impossible! This is impossible!\"","Back in the day, he had been stuck at the threshold of the eighth level for so many years, with no breakthrough even as his lifespan neared its end. How could Qi Quan, at such a young age, comprehend the Human Immortal realm?!","Even achieving the peak of Ghost General had taken him forty years!","For a moment, his thoughts aligned with Cai Ji's.","It's unfair. The Heavenly Dao is unfair.","His pupils were completely dyed black by ghostly energy.","He summoned all three Ghost Generals back, commanding them to attack Qi Quan without mercy.","With one sword strike, Qi Quan dispersed half of the black clouds, allowing half of the city to see the light again.","The crowd cheered with joy.","Ling Sheng had already descended to the ground, surrounded by many people protecting his safety.","Xie Lanzhou, Fu Jiuchong, and even Fu Jiuge, who hadn't fully recovered yet, had all come.","While protecting the injured and blood-spitting Ling Sheng, they anxiously looked up at Qi Quan in mid-air.","Qi Quan unleashed another sword strike, its radiance even more intense than before.","It seemed that from the previous battle, she had gained insight into even more profound principles. This sword light carried a might more majestic and vast.","The sword light pierced through the bodies of the three ghost generals.","The ghost generals didn't even have time to utter a cry before their souls were utterly destroyed.","Three ghost generals slain with a single sword.","Such formidable power was something even He Xiuyu dared not face head-on.","But—","\"Do you have any spiritual power left?\" He Xiuyu asked.","Qi Quan had already used two major techniques; the power of these two moves was enough to drain the spiritual power within her.","[Big shot, use the Unity Talisman now!] the system urged anxiously.","Qi Quan remained unmoved.","The two sword strikes had indeed exhausted her spiritual power, but she faintly sensed that she still had reserves!","She had touched the threshold of the Human Immortal realm, glimpsing a thread of the Dao's principles through the crack in the door. It was this thread that allowed her spiritual power to recover at an unimaginably fast rate.","In just a few breaths, her spiritual power had mostly recovered.","Was this the profound mystery of the Human Immortal realm?","Spiritual power...","Inexhaustible and ever-flowing?","Under the astonished gazes of the crowd, Qi Quan gathered a golden long sword once more.","This spiritual sword was thinner and shorter, but the golden light radiating from its blade was purer and more dazzling.","He Xiuyu actually faintly sensed the power of the Heavenly Dao.","She...","She had already grown to this extent!","He Xiuyu no longer dared to underestimate his opponent.","Boundless ghostly energy converged around him, its oppressive might forcing the Daoist masters to prostrate themselves on the ground.","Only Ling Sheng stood tall and straight.","His face was pale, but an intense light burst forth from his eyes.","He sensed Qi Quan's nearly full spiritual power.","Countless ghostly energies shifted and changed before He Xiuyu, finally transforming into a colossal black dragon. The dragon's gaping maw faced Qi Quan, roaring as if to devour her whole.","The dragon spanned the entire horizon. Standing before it, Qi Quan seemed as insignificant as a mayfly.","\"Senior Qi!\"","\"Big shot!\"","Everyone cried out in worry.","Yet, Qi Quan's expression remained calm and composed. Without hesitation, she raised her sword and charged into the abyssal maw of the black dragon.","Her body and the long sword merged into one, like a golden stream of light, piercing into the dragon's form.","The sword light traveled from the dragon's mouth, down its throat, resolutely pushing towards the churning, ghostly energy-filled belly.","\"Ahhhhhhhhh—\"","The black dragon was connected to He Xiuyu's true form.","The overwhelmingly powerful sword light split the black dragon in two, and He Xiuyu simultaneously felt the extreme agony of being cleaved apart by the sword light.","The sword light, unstoppable, came to an abrupt halt within the dragon's belly.","He Xiuyu, thinking her spiritual power had finally run out, let out a maniacal, distorted laugh.","\"Hahahahaha, in the end, you are no match for me—\"","In the next instant, the blinding sword light suddenly exploded.","Tiny golden rays sliced the dragon's belly into countless fragments. Golden light erupted from the fissures, and with a thunderous roar, the dragon disintegrated!","He Xiuyu's solidified ghostly form turned translucent.","He roared in fury, \"I refuse to accept this! I refuse! I refuse!\"","Decades of meticulous planning, waiting for his prey to willingly step into the cage he had woven—all this caution and patience shattered into pieces under Qi Quan's sword light.","He was a master of deduction, skilled at speculating on human hearts. He could deduce that Qi Quan and Ling Sheng would be obstacles to him, yet he could not calculate the consequences of his own series of evil deeds.","He Xiuyu's refusal to accept death was what led him to choose forbidden arts to become a Ghost King, revealing his extreme craving for immortality.","Such an ending was unacceptable to him.","The dragon in mid-air vanished in an instant, and sunlight gently bathed the earth.","The world was cleansed.","Was it over?","Everyone silently wondered.","Qi Quan stood in the air, seemingly enveloped in a holy radiance.","She looked at He Xiuyu, her gaze calm and composed.","He Xiuyu had already gone mad when he decided to use the forbidden arts; now, his madness was complete.","He actually burned his soul as a price, transforming into a terrifying mass of energy that shot towards Qi Quan at incredible speed!","Could destroying the dragon truly have been so easy?","She must have completely exhausted her spiritual power by now, right?","She must have!","Harboring such a desperate and vicious thought, He Xiuyu attempted to drag Qi Quan down with him to the grave.","In that split second, no one could react.","A cold glint flashed in Ling Sheng's eyes as he prepared to utter a word of power.","High in the sky, a...","silver-white pillar of light suddenly descended.","He Xiuyu's soul force did not collide with Qi Quan but instead struck the silver-white light pillar, instantly letting out a scream of utter agony.","Qi Quan, wrapped within the light pillar, had no attention to spare for anything else.","When she burst forth from the black dragon's belly, she had stepped into the Human Immortal realm in one stride.","To truly become a Human Immortal, one must undergo the Trial of the Heart.","She calmly faced her trial within the light pillar, while He Xiuyu's soul wailed incessantly outside it.","The Daoist masters were stunned.","After a long moment, someone uttered a voice filled with disbelief.","\"Senior Qi... is she advancing?\"","Everyone: \"...\"","Given that Senior Qi was at the peak of the Human Sovereign realm, was she now advancing to Human Immortal?","Human Immortal! A true Human Immortal!","A surge of passionate fervor and heroic spirit at witnessing history suddenly welled up in their hearts.","Earlier, when Qi Quan and He Xiuyu were locked in their confrontation, Recording Talismans had already captured the entire scene.","Now, more and more Recording Talismans rose into the air, each seeking the best angle to record this precious, priceless footage.","\"Don't crowd my talisman!\"","\"You go over there!\"","\"This spot is already taken!\"","\"Wuwuwu, I can die without regrets now.\"","Is there anything more hyped (exciting) than this?","\"This talisman will be a family heirloom from now on.\"","Within the light pillar, Qi Quan began the first layer of the Trial of the Heart.","Sealed memories flooded into her mind like a torrent. She finally remembered everything she had experienced.","Memories belonging to the \"true heiress\" played continuously in her mind: the helplessness of childhood, the bullying in the orphanage, the dangers of society encountered while working, the inferiority and extremism after returning to the Qi family. All these negative emotions filled her heart.","She was trapped within the memories.","She was no longer the revered peak Human Sovereign senior, but the despised and scorned \"true heiress.\"","Qi Quan felt as if she were soaking in a vat of bitter water. Helplessness, inferiority, timidity, extremism, madness—all entangled her steps, trying to drag her into the mire.","Could she, about to become a Human Immortal, still accept such a weak former self?","Qi Quan suddenly let out a light laugh.","Why couldn't she?","She had long guessed she was the \"true heiress\" herself. She accepted that humble past with composure.","The negative emotions receded like the tide.","Qi Quan took a step forward, reaching the second layer of the Trial of the Heart.","In a world where evil cultivators were powerful and ghosts ran rampant, she was a revered peak Human Sovereign cultivator. The entire Daoist community saw her as the savior who would slay the demon lord.","The demon lord's entire body was shrouded in demonic energy, his face and form indistinct. Only his ankle-length hair occasionally spilled beyond the range of the black energy, allowing a glimpse.","Qi Quan held her sword. The demon lord stood before her.","She knew who he was.","So, should she kill him?","Qi Quan gazed at him quietly, then suddenly spoke, \"Being covered in demonic energy is inconvenient. Fight me after you put some clothes on.\"","The demon lord: \"...\"","He had never known what wearing clothes meant.","Thick demonic energy surged from his palm, mercilessly attacking Qi Quan.","Qi Quan did not hesitate in the slightest. Sword light pierced through the demonic aura, sinking into the demon's body, extinguishing it in one decisive strike.","\"I will avenge you.\"","Before the demon completely dissipated, she made this vow.","A person whose fate is manipulated and who loses their mind is innocent... but once they are stained with blood, they are innocent no longer.","She would avenge him, but she must first avenge the innocent people who died tragically by his hand.","The third layer of Heart's Inquiry.","The system said tearfully, [Big Boss, you are now a Human Immortal. Your lifespan is no longer limited. I should leave.]","Qi Quan: [Why leave?]","[The reason for my existence is to extend your lifespan, but you are a Human Immortal now. Human Immortals possess a long, long lifespan. You don't need me anymore.]","Qi Quan smiled: [Who says I don't need you?]","[But, if you keep me, you will never be able to advance to the Human Immortal stage.]","The choice was clear: either keep the system to extend life, or advance to Human Immortal and possess a long lifespan.","This choice wasn't difficult.","Choosing the former meant she would have to continue writing novels to extend her life. Who could predict the future of online novels? What if the website shut down, or policies banned writing? Wouldn't she be unable to gain lifespan then?","The latter was within her grasp—truly just a step away.","Taking that one step would allow her to step into the Human Immortal realm, free and unfettered from then on.","Yet Qi Quan said without the slightest hesitation: [Without you, what joy would there be in a long, long life?]","The system exclaimed in surprise: [You really choose me? Choosing me means being pestered by me to write updates every single day!]","Qi Quan said seriously: [A novel cannot be left without an ending.]","She had only stopped updating due to official business; she never intended to abandon the story.","The system cried out excitedly: [Big Boss, I really love you to death!]","A golden light appeared before Qi Quan, and the sound of thunder rumbled in her ears, like the low whisper of the Heavenly Dao.","She reached out and touched the golden light.","The light abruptly sank into her fingertip, disappearing within her body. She closed her eyes, sensing a surge of pure and potent power circulating continuously, gradually breaking through the bottleneck of the Human Sovereign realm and touching upon even more profound laws.","She had truly stepped into the Human Immortal realm.","The silvery-white light pillar transformed into a dazzling, brilliant gold. He Xiuyu's soul let out a short, mournful cry before completely turning to ashes, vanishing without a trace.","Qi Quan opened her eyes.","The sky was bright with daylight."]},{"number":74,"title":"Chapter 74","paragraphs":["The instant He Xiuyu was vanquished, ghost cultivators like Zhang Feng and Gao Peilan all dissipated into nothingness along with him.","So-called masters, even in death, would drag so many ghosts down with them.","No one pitied these ghost cultivators.","They had followed He Xiuyu, using talisman patterns and verbal suggestions to cause many people to \"commit suicide.\" Their current fate was nothing but well-deserved retribution.","It was worth mentioning that the moment Gao Peilan vanished, Pan Hao also lost his life. Only then did the Investigation Department learn that a ghost and a person had actually formed a binding contract: if the ghost died, the person would die too.","Naturally, everyone was glad that the criminal ghost cultivators had received their due punishment. But what excited and thrilled them even more was undoubtedly the fact that Senior Qi Quan had advanced to become a Human Immortal! Ahhhhh!","A Human Immortal! That was a Human Immortal!","To witness such a miracle with their own eyes in their lifetime, how could they not be moved to tears?","The ghostly aura dispersed, and the world returned to peace.","[Big Boss, wuwuwuwu, thank you for choosing me.] The system was so touched it almost cried.","Qi Quan teased: [Will you still pester me for updates then?]","[Ah, well...] the system said quietly, [I'll still have to urge you... To be honest, you've been on a hiatus for many, many days.]","Qi Quan smiled: [I am a Human Immortal now.]","Having become a Human Immortal, her lifespan was no longer limited. The so-called \"writing to extend life\" was no longer necessary.","The system: [Wuwuwuwu, you just said you wouldn't abandon the story.]","Qi Quan: [Yes, I did.]","[Then...]","[Just teasing you.]","The system was stunned for a moment, then started laughing happily.","Qi Quan did not linger in mid-air. Her gaze lightly swept over the reverent-looking Taoist masters below and settled on Ling Sheng's face.","The young man looked somewhat pale, a trace of crimson blood still at the corner of his lips, but his eyes were exceptionally clear and burning with intensity.","In a flash, she appeared before Ling Sheng, took his hand, and channeled pure, powerful spiritual energy into his body, rapidly healing the backlash injuries he suffered from using his Word-Spirit power.","In moments, the injuries were fully healed.","A group of senior Taoist masters gathered around, not daring to disturb her in the slightest. Only after she released Ling Sheng's hand did Fu Jiuchong, urged by the others' glances, step forward and ask:","\"Senior Qi, you, you have already...\"","His usually calm voice trembled uncontrollably.","Qi Quan did not answer directly, only saying, \"I need to go to the Department first.\"","\"Please, you go ahead, you go ahead.\"","Everyone unanimously made way.","Faced with a legendary figure of this caliber, they truly were at a loss for words.","Li Guoyan had already received the news.","After the evil formation was broken and He Xiuyu's spirit scattered, he let out a long sigh of relief. If not for Taoist masters like Qi Quan and Physician Qi within the Taoist community, the consequences would have been unimaginable.","At this moment, his gratitude towards Qi Quan and Ling Sheng was beyond words.","They had saved countless lives!","According to the compiled casualty statistics, although this operation was hastily arranged, thanks to the presence of Master Qi and Physician Qi, 174 members of the official forces were injured, but there were zero fatalities.","The Taoist masters were injured due to attacks from the three Ghost Generals, but thanks to the Unity Talismans and protective formations, everyone escaped death.","In short, this was a victory worth celebrating.","When Qi Quan arrived, Li Guoyan had just finished instructing on the follow-up cleanup.","He solemnly saluted Qi Quan and Ling Sheng.","\"You've both worked hard.\"","He understood deeply that this battle had not been easily won.","Even though Qi Quan seemed to have effortlessly destroyed He Xiuyu, at the very beginning, they were quite passive due to He Xiuyu's formation.","He Xiuyu had linked his own fate with that of half the city's populace, making it impossible for Qi Quan and Ling Sheng to take direct action.","If not for Qi Quan's thorough preparations and formidable strength, and if not for Ling Sheng's unique Word-Spirit power, this battle would not have been won so smoothly. It could very well have ended in total annihilation.","He Xiuyu's divination was not wrong.","The only ones who could break this deadlock were Qi Quan and Ling Sheng.","They were truly deserving heroes.","The situation at the time was extremely perilous. If Ling Sheng did not possess the \"Concealment\" skill, He Xiuyu and the three Ghost Generals could have precisely targeted and besieged the two of them. Even if Qi Quan had the power to slay all four ghosts, she would have been severely hampered by their connection to the lives of half the city's residents.","Li Guoyan was filled with emotion.","He said sincerely, \"Master Qi, Physician Qi, now that He Xiuyu is dead, logically you two could return to Longjiang City. However, many people suffered meridian injuries from ghost energy during this battle. Could you possibly stay in Longjing for a while to heal the wounded?\"","Qi Quan looked at Ling Sheng, who nodded decisively.","This was his vocation; he naturally wouldn't give it up. Without a career, he wouldn't meet the standards of an excellent man as defined by his dad.","\"Alright. I'll have someone arrange accommodations immediately.\"","\"Wait!\" Xie Lanzhou suddenly floated over, his face full of expectation. \"Director Li, could you give Jiuge and me a chance to show our sincerity?\"","Li Guoyan understood instantly. He smiled and asked Qi Quan, \"Then should we arrange separate accommodations for you, Master?\"","\"Senior Qi has shown us great kindness. If the senior doesn't mind, perhaps we could make the arrangements?\" Xie Lanzhou's offer was full of sincerity.","Qi Quan was fine with staying anywhere and nodded in agreement.","\"Please.\"","Outside the Investigation Department, Fu Jiuge waited nervously.","\"Don't worry. Since Ling Sheng agreed in the group chat before, he probably won't mind having a meal with you and Lanzhou,\" Fu Jiuchong comforted her.","Fu Luanfei added, \"That's right, Aunt. Cousin just has difficulty speaking; he's not truly cold-hearted.\"","He had healed many of the wounded and saved half the city's population. He was undoubtedly a warm and kind person at heart.","Before today, although they wondered about the reason Ling Sheng didn't speak, they never asked out of turn.","It was only today, upon hearing Ling Sheng's Word-Spirit and seeing him cough up blood from the backlash, that they understood why he seldom spoke.","Fu Jiuge's heart ached for her child, but she also felt immensely proud of Ling Sheng's life-saving actions.","She was deeply grateful to Qi Quan from the bottom of her heart; it was she who had given Ling Sheng a new life.","Li Guoyan personally escorted Qi Quan and Ling Sheng to the entrance of the Investigation Department. Seeing the eagerly waiting trio from the Fu family outside, he was filled with emotion.","In the past, Fu Jiuge was traumatized and became reclusive, Xie Lanzhou sacrificed himself and became a ghost, and Ling Sheng was trapped in a cave from birth. What should have been a happy family of three was torn apart for twenty years due to the greed of evil cultivators.","Fortunately, Master Qi was there, allowing the family of three to reunite.","Such an ending was truly wonderful.","Fu Jiuge looked at Qi Quan and said with a smile, \"Senior Qi, we have a small, unused courtyard at home. While you're in Longjing on business these days, perhaps you could stay there?\"","Qi Quan replied, \"Thank you.\"","[Hehehe, I wonder if it comes with a computer.]","The system, having held back from urging updates while Qi Quan was busy clearing out the evil and ghost cultivators, now that everything was settled, started pushing her to write again.","Qi Quan: ...","Back at the Investigation Department, Li Guoyan returned to the interrogation room and played the images from the Memory Retention Talisman for Cai Ji and Yan Fengqing to see.","This was what he had promised earlier.","After watching, Cai Ji's ghostly face contorted wildly. He laughed maniacally and then chose to dissipate on his own.","As for Yan Fengqing and the remaining members of the evil cult, the death penalty was inevitable.","Meanwhile, Qi Quan and the others arrived at a residence.","This was a traditional Chinese courtyard, its style similar to the lakeside villa, with every arrangement within the courtyard exuding delicacy and an air of refined luxury.","Shen Hui and Tang Mian, having participated in the battle, were currently recovering their spiritual power and handling the cleanup work, so they didn't come along.","They didn't need to come anyway. Anyone could see this was a family gathering; it was better for outsiders not to play the third wheel.","Arriving at the small courtyard, Fu Jiuge and Xie Lanzhou volunteered to cook. Although Xie Lanzhou had become a ghost, he was a ghost of merit, an eighth-level powerful ghost with cultivation, able to remain in the mortal world for a long time, with ample time to accompany his family.","Having been apart for twenty years, the couple cherished each other even more after their reunion than they had in their youth.","Qi Quan sat on the living room sofa, with Ling Sheng beside her. Fu Jiuchong and Fu Luanfei sat on the left and right respectively.","\"Senior, the family intends to transfer the ownership of this residence to Ling Sheng's name. What do you think?\" Fu Jiuchong asked.","Qi Quan: ?","Why was he asking her this question?","\"Mr. Fu can ask Ling Sheng for his opinion.\"","Fu Jiuchong smiled and looked at Ling Sheng, saying, \"In the future, when you and the Senior come to Longjing on business, you won't need to stay elsewhere.\"","Although the likelihood of future business trips was small, what if? They couldn't possibly stay at someone else's villa or in accommodations arranged by the Investigation Department every time, right? That would be quite inconvenient.","Ling Sheng didn't answer immediately. He took out his phone and asked Qi Quan: [What do you think? Is this place good?]","Objectively speaking, the courtyard was indeed excellent.","She nodded. \"It's very nice.\"","Ling Sheng's eyes curved into a smile. Using his phone, he replied to Fu Jiuchong: [Thank you.]","He didn't care whether the courtyard was under his name or not; he only cared about whether Qi Quan would be comfortable staying here.","Fu Jiuchong secretly breathed a sigh of relief. He had genuinely been afraid the gift would be refused.","Fu Luanfei, watching the interaction between Ling Sheng and Qi Quan, stifled a giggle.","Before long, Fu Jiuge and Xie Lanzhou brought the dishes to the table.","After twenty years of suffering, the Fu family was finally reunited.","Fu Jiuchong couldn't help but feel his eyes grow hot, discreetly wiping the corner of his eye.","Fu Jiuge and Xie Lanzhou's culinary skills were truly exceptional.","The dinner table atmosphere was less formal. Fu Luanfei, being the youngest and with fewer reservations than the adults, asked curiously, \"Senior, will you be residing in Longjiang permanently from now on?\"","Qi Quan replied gently, \"Yes.\"","\"Then, can I visit my cousin in Longjiang in the future?\"","Actually, she wanted to see both the Senior and her cousin, but she was too shy to say it outright.","Qi Quan: \"Of course.\"","After advancing to the Human Immortal realm, her entire being had an inner radiance, with not a trace of spiritual energy fluctuation around her. Her demeanor was composed and serene. Although she displayed no imposing aura, it involuntarily inspired reverence in others.","Fu Luanfei's eyes shone with admiration.","The legendary Human Immortal realm. To have the fortune to witness it once in a lifetime was worth it.","She asked further, \"Senior, are there realms beyond the Human Immortal realm?\"","Qi Quan: \"I don't know either.\"","Human Immortal realm cultivators possessed long lifespans, but they were not immortal or indestructible. Wishing for a lifespan as long as heaven's was impossible. Exactly how long one could live, she hadn't had time to prove yet.","\"And cousin...\" Fu Luanfei asked carefully, \"What are cousin's future plans?\"","She wanted to ask, given Ling Sheng's lifespan, if he could stay by Qi Quan's side all along.","Ling Sheng... turned to look at Qi Quan upon hearing this, his meaning clear.","He intended to stay by Qi Quan's side.","But—","He didn't know how long he could live, didn't know how long he could accompany her.","Qi Quan no longer concealed Ling Sheng's special constitution either.","\"He is a Natural Spirit Body.\"","As she spoke, she waved her hand, dispelling the illusion technique that had been concealing Ling Sheng's constitution.","Fu Jiuchong and the others were extremely surprised.","A Natural Spirit Body! This was a legendary constitution!","One had reached the legendary Human Immortal realm at such a young age, the other possessed the legendary Natural Spirit Body. No wonder He Xiuyu had laid such an elaborate scheme, determined to suppress their fortunes and use them as the most perfect sacrificial offerings.","Fu Jiuge, coming back to her senses, suddenly remembered something and asked, \"Do the ancient texts mention the lifespan of a Natural Spirit Body?\"","\"I don't think so,\" Xie Lanzhou shook his head.","The couple exchanged a glance, both seeing worry in each other's eyes.","Fu Jiuchong said, \"I did read in another text a few years ago that Natural Spirit Bodies are born in response to the Heavenly Dao, and their lifespans are longer than ordinary people's.\"","But it didn't specify how much longer.","The system was also very curious: [Great One, how long can Ling Sheng actually live?]","A Heavenly Master's lifespan could be estimated based on their realm, but the Natural Spirit Body had no cultivation realm, making it impossible to discern lifespan length.","Qi Quan said: [He could previously sense spiritual energy fluctuations at the peak of the Human Emperor realm and could utilize far more of the world's spiritual energy than ordinary cultivators. Logically, his lifespan shouldn't be short.]","[That's good then!]","Qi Quan chuckled lightly.","The meal was enjoyable for both guests and hosts.","Having just advanced to the Human Immortal realm, Qi Quan went to her room after dinner to consolidate her cultivation.","Ling Sheng originally wanted to accompany her but was called into the kitchen by Xie Lanzhou.","Xie Lanzhou was cleaning the dishes with his ghostly power in the kitchen and asked in a low voice, \"What are your plans for the future?\"","Ling Sheng didn't quite understand the subtext of his question. After thinking, he replied on his phone: [Get a driver's license.]","Xie Lanzhou: \"...\"","He looked at the bewildered young man and sighed softly. \"I'm asking about you and Senior Qi.\"","Ling Sheng understood now.","He typed: [Let things take their natural course.]","\"You're not going to actively pursue her?\"","Ling Sheng shook his head.","It wasn't that he was unwilling, but he believed those so-called pursuit methods weren't suitable for Qi Quan.","What he should do most was simply stay by Qi Quan's side.","If she stayed home, he would cook delicious food for her; if she went out to vanquish demons and uphold righteousness, he would drive for her; if she was developing new talismans, he would brainstorm with her...","Wherever she went, he would follow.","Xie Lanzhou found his answer in the young man's eyes.","Forget it. The younger generation will have their own fortune.","Interfering too much might backfire.","Qi Quan and Ling Sheng temporarily settled in the small courtyard.","Fu Jiuge and Xie Lanzhou visited occasionally to have meals with them, then threw themselves back into their work at the Investigation Department.","It was worth mentioning that after Fu Jiuge fully recovered, she also applied to become an investigator, often taking on missions with Xie Lanzhou.","Ling Sheng went to the Investigation Department every day to treat the injured.","Only Qi Quan was so idle she felt she might grow moss.","The system finally couldn't resist urging: [Great One, your realm is consolidated now. Isn't it time to update \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family\"?]","Qi Quan had previously turned a deaf ear, but this time she finally reacted.","She slowly sat down in front of the computer, opened the document, and typed the first word of the new chapter.","At ten o'clock in the evening, the long-waiting readers were thrilled and excited—\"The Diary of a Wealthy Family\" had finally updated!","[Achieving a harmonious and stable life... is not easy.","As long as greed does not vanish from this world, my steps will not cease.","After achieving a phased victory, I finally have some leisure time.","The first ray of morning sunlight awakens me from my dreams.","I open my eyes. Wherever my gaze falls, the sky is clear and pure as if washed.","Stepping out of the room, the courtyard's riot of colorful flowers vies to catch my eye, their faint, subtle fragrance lingering at the tip of my nose.","The aroma wafting from the kitchen makes one's mouth water.","On the dining table sits a pot of freshly brewed tea.","The table is by the window. A little sparrow perches on the windowsill, tilting its head, its round, bead-like eyes open, occasionally pecking lightly at the window frame with its slender beak.","A hand sets down breakfast and casually opens the window.]","The little sparrow hopped a few times, drawing closer to her hand.","A finger tapped its little head, and the sparrow seemed utterly content, its eyes half-closed, feathers slightly puffed.","He turned his head to look at me.","The sunlight outside the window was just right.","End of new chapter.","[If you see me, tell me to go prepare lessons: Ahhhhhh! The author finally updated!!! Even though it's even shorter, I can glimpse something a little different in these few words! One deep-water torpedo!]","[You're killing me with filial piety: Thank you so much, Author Bai Shui, for that night! Ten deep-water torpedoes!]","[I demand Male Virtue Literature: What? Just when I gave up asking about the male lead, a \"he\" appears in the new chapter?! Author, I ask you, is this person who can cook, make tea, and pet fluffy creatures the male lead?","Readers were already used to \"I demand Male Virtue Literature\" repeatedly asking related questions in the comment section.","Just as everyone thought she would never get an answer, a prominent author's reply suddenly appeared under her comment—","[He is.]","Everyone: ???","[Book famine is deadly: Ahhhhhh what did I just see!]","[Today, Great Auspice: Holy crap, who is he?!]","[Today, Great Profit: Isn't it easy to guess?]","[Auspicious and Profitable: Ah, I guessed right, as expected.]","[Soaring Sky, Prosperous Steed: What?! I need to go practice some swordplay to calm my shock.]","[Tranquility Leads to Far Reaches: One hundred deep-water torpedoes!]","Ling Sheng was treating an injured person at the Investigation Department when his phone suddenly rang.","He finished treating the patient before opening his phone.","[Mom: Congratulations! [Fireworks][Fireworks][Fireworks]]","[Dad: Son, you're amazing!]","Ling Sheng: ?","A screenshot appeared in the group chat.","He opened it with an expressionless face.","The next second, he dashed out.","Qi Quan's reply instantly caused a sensation within the Mystic Arts community.","Many Taoist masters were loyal fans of \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family\" and, seeing Qi Quan personally acknowledge the \"male lead,\" flocked to leave comments under her Weibo post.","[Wuwuwu I really want to know who he is! Who has captured Senior's heart!]","[If I'm not mistaken, it should be him, right?]","[Upstairs, I think so too.]","[What riddle are you all talking in? Who is it exactly!]","[Ahhhhhh I know I know I know! I just want to say, they're such a good match!]","[Can someone who actually speaks plainly come forward?]","[You still can't guess? The handsome guy who followed Senior Qi at the commendation ceremony, it must be him!]","[Isn't he Physician Ling from the Investigation Department? I have a treatment slot and I'm in line waiting for him to treat me.]","[Envious of the person upstairs.]","[As everyone knows, Physician Ling used to be our Bigshot Qi's assistant, then somehow... lit up his talent for the medical path and became our Head Physician. I thought he had already reached the peak of life, but I didn't expect it could get even higher... That's Qi Quan, the absolute legend, ahhhhhh!]","[Wuwuwu the goddess has admitted it herself, I can only offer blessings, blessings, and more blessings.]","[I think Senior Qi and the Head Physician are a match made in heaven, perfect in looks, perfect in ability, perfect in every way!]","[What? Senior Qi is in love? Who captured her heart? Oh, it's Physician Ling? Well, that's fine then.]","[Hehe, you guys didn't see the scene before where Senior Qi held Physician Ling's hand after annihilating He Xiuyu, it was too, too, too beautiful!]","[Wuwuwu, I beg for a high-definition picture!]","[I'm shipping them, I'm shipping them!]","The Fu Family Residence.","Fu Jiuchong scrolled through the online comments, the corners of his mouth uncontrollably turning up.","His phone suddenly rang. It was Yin Yi.","\"Old Fu, congratulations,\" his voice sounded somewhat sour.","Fu Jiuchong pretended not to understand. \"Congratulations for what?\"","\"We know each other so well, stop pretending with me,\" Yin Yi said. \"I don't believe you haven't seen Senior's new chapter. The Head Physician is your nephew, who doesn't know that now?\"","Fu Jiuchong said with a smile, \"Ah, these young people's affairs, I can't control them anymore.\"","Even if he wanted to control them, he couldn't.","A Human Immortal realm cultivator, a legendary existence—just being remotely connected to such a person was enough to bring joy, let alone such a joyous event.","Just listen to the tone of the Sect Leader of the Number One Sect now.","Yin Yi: \"...\"","After hanging up, another call came in.","\"Brother Yan, weren't you in seclusion?\" Fu Jiuchong asked.","Yan Fengjun sighed with emotion. \"Even if I were in a tomb, hearing such good news, I'd have to crawl out.\"","His words were filled with both envy and jealousy.","Fu Jiuchong: \"Brother Yan, choose your words carefully. That doesn't sound auspicious.\"","\"Brother Fu, congratulations to you.\"","\"Hahahaha, thank you, Brother Yan.\"","After Yan Fengjun, many more people called, ostensibly offering congratulations but secretly envious, making Fu Jiuchong feel utterly delighted.","Life was looking more and more promising.","On the other side, Ling Sheng rushed all the way back to the small courtyard.","Qi Quan was leaning on a rocking chair, basking in the sun.","A little sparrow hopped around the chair, chirping from time to time as if talking to her.","This sparrow had accidentally crashed into the window a few days ago and was badly injured. Ling Sheng found it and treated it, and it ended up staying in the courtyard, refusing to leave.","After a few days of being fed, it had become quite plump.","Ling Sheng abruptly stopped in his tracks.","Clutching his phone, he stood not far away, gazing intently at Qi Quan. After calming his emotions somewhat, he silently walked to the side of the rocking chair and half-knelt before Qi Quan.","He had so much he wanted to say but didn't know where to start.","[Bigshot, Ling Sheng is back, hehe.] The system's tone was that of someone watching a drama unfold.","Qi Quan didn't need its reminder to know Ling Sheng was kneeling before her.","She didn't open her eyes.","She was feeling mischievous and wanted to see how he would react.","The autumn wind brushed past the white pine needles in front of the courtyard, a faint, subtle fragrance quietly arrived, the fish pond shimmered with rippling light. The little sparrow tilted its head and chirped. Ling Sheng glanced at it, and it fluttered its wings and flew away.","Ling Sheng studied her \"sleeping\" face, a smile rising in his eyes.","Since Qi Quan advanced to the Human Immortal realm, he could no longer sense her emotions through fluctuations of spiritual energy.","But he had learned a new skill.","He could guess her mood from Qi Quan's subtle expressions and movements.","Right now, she was relaxed, peaceful, and harboring a bit of a teasing thought.","Ling Sheng knew she was doing it on purpose but didn't wake her. Instead, he got up, left the courtyard, and returned to his room.","[Bigshot, why did he leave?] The system wondered. [At a time like this, shouldn't the male lead kiss the female lead awake?]","That's how it happened in many novels it had read!","Qi Quan: ...","She remained calmly leaning in the chair.","But after a moment, a faint scent of fresh grass came with the wind. The young man returned to her side and took her hand.","Qi Quan: ?","[Bigshot!] The system exclaimed excitedly. [He, he...]","He what?","Qi Quan couldn't help but feel a bit curious and instinctively opened her eyes.","A touch of gentle coolness met the tip of her ring finger.","This was...","She slowly sat up, her gaze falling on Ling Sheng's hand.","He was holding a white jade ring, reverently slipping it onto her finger.","The jade ring was warm, flawless, and simply designed, its edges polished extremely smooth without the slightest roughness. The ring was imbued with spiritual energy. Somehow, within such a small jade ring, the concentration of spiritual power was remarkably dense.","This was personally carved by Ling Sheng, a perfect fit for her finger.","Seeing her \"awaken,\" Ling Sheng stopped his movements, lifted his head to look at her, and anxiously awaited her reply.","Under the sunlight, the young man's amber eyes reflected a soft glow; the delight in their depths had not yet faded, now mingled with a trace of nervousness. Even the hand holding the jade ring trembled slightly.","Qi Quan asked with a smile, \"Do you know what this means?\"","Ling Sheng replied solemnly, \"I do.\"","He gazed at Qi Quan with eager anticipation.","\"Put it on me,\" Qi Quan said, her eyes sparkling.","Unable to contain his joy, Ling Sheng's lips curved into a high smile as he carefully slipped the jade ring onto her finger.","A hand suddenly lifted his chin.","The young man's eyes widened slightly.","The person he loved was now right before him.","The slender petals of a white pine-needle flower suddenly drifted down, carried by the wind to brush against Qi Quan's cheek before settling in her hair.","Ling Sheng raised his hand to remove it.","But as his fingertips grazed her hair, he changed direction—his palm pressed against her temple, applying gentle pressure.","He lifted his head and kissed her.","The fragrance filled the courtyard."]},{"number":75,"title":"Chapter 75","paragraphs":["Qi Quan did not stay long in Longjing City.","Upon returning, she found the villa had changed its appearance.","The system exclaimed in surprise: [Big Boss, the house has turned red!]","Indeed, it had turned red.","Steward Su and Teacher Xue came forward to greet her, faces beaming with joy.","\"Master, Ling Sheng, welcome home.\"","Qi Quan raised an eyebrow and asked, \"What are you all doing?\"","\"Master, didn't you confirm it in the comments section of 'The Rich Family Diary'?\" Xue Hong said with a smile. \"No matter what, the home should reflect some changes too.\"","Su Rong asked, \"Master, do you not like it?\"","Qi Quan: \"...\"","It wasn't that she disliked it.","She turned to ask Ling Sheng, \"Do you like it?\"","The smile on Ling Sheng's face was particularly evident as he spoke, \"I like it.\"","Su Rong and Xue Hong looked utterly shocked.","\"Ling Sheng, you can talk?!\"","Ling Sheng nodded.","After eliminating He Xiuyu last time, his power of speech had improved. He could now say simple things in daily life without overthinking it too much.","Of course, he only spoke when it was important.","Not long after Qi Quan returned, Du Jiaming and the other two couldn't wait to visit with gifts.","The gift boxes were also in festive red.","Having some free time, Qi Quan personally received them.","Zhang Chengyan held his teacup, looked around curiously, and asked, \"Master, where is Master Ling Sheng?\"","\"He went to get his driver's license.\"","The three: \"...\"","It felt like an ethereal, immortal being had suddenly become very down-to-earth.","\"Master, I don't know if you've heard,\" Du Jiaming said, gathering his courage, \"Qi Yingxue's verdict is out. She's going to prison.\"","Qi Quan: ...","She had already forgotten about that person.","Seeing her complete lack of interest, Du Jiaming changed the subject. \"Has Master ever thought about holding a wedding ceremony?\"","Qi Quan shook her head.","Neither she nor Ling Sheng had any such plans.","She disliked trouble, and Ling Sheng didn't like being the center of attention either.","Replying in the comments section was already high-profile enough. As for a wedding, it was better to forget it.","Yang Su suggested, \"Wedding ceremonies are indeed troublesome, but Master, you could have a destination wedding. Now that Master Ling Sheng is getting his driver's license, once he gets it, you could totally go on a road trip.\"","[That's a great suggestion!] The system fully agreed. [Big Boss, traveling can bring inspiration and accumulate material. How about you and Ling Sheng go on a honeymoon trip!]","Qi Quan: That didn't sound bad at all.","The three chatted a bit more before reluctantly taking their leave.","Before lunch, Ling Sheng returned from driving school, moved close to Qi Quan, held out his phone, and said: [I can take the subject two test next week.]","Qi Quan smiled and said, \"Very impressive.\"","Praise received, the young man's hair seemed to perk up even more.","He shifted his position, getting closer to Qi Quan, rested his head on her shoulder, wrapped his arms around her, and rubbed his cheek against hers contentedly.","His fine hair tickled the side of Qi Quan's face.","She pinched his chin, gently lifted it, leaned down to kiss the tip of his nose, and said, \"Du Jiaming and the other two visited this morning. Yang Su suggested a road trip. What do you think?\"","Ling Sheng naturally had no objections.","He learned everything quickly, passing all the driving tests on the first try, and got his license not long after.","There was one catch: to drive alone on the highway, he still had to wait a while. Fortunately, Qi Quan had no immediate travel plans, so they could wait.","Two years passed in the blink of an eye.","The people and ghosts at the Lakeside Villa showed no change.","During these two years, unless absolutely necessary, no one disturbed them. Qi Quan enjoyed a rare and comfortable life as a homebody.","Compared to the diligent investigators at the Investigation Department, she seemed particularly idle, even dragging the department's Chief Physician into idleness with her.","When the first rays of morning sunlight peeked through the curtains, Qi Quan received a call from Chen Feilu.","\"Master, I've reached level four! I can participate in next year's Metaphysics Competition!\"","As Qi Quan's \"half\" disciple, Chen Feilu had already reached the peak of level three by the time he graduated from university. After graduation, he cultivated frantically and finally reached level four last night.","Early in the morning, he called Qi Quan to share the good news.","Qi Quan had previously said she would let him be her assistant after he graduated, so he returned to Longjiang City. His main job was being an assistant, with cultivation as his side pursuit.","The Lakeside Villa no longer answered calls casually.","If someone wanted to request Qi Quan's help, they had to go through Chen Feilu's screening. Only after review, confirming that only Qi Quan could solve the problem, would he report it to her.","This saved the Lakeside Villa a lot of trouble.","Qi Quan praised, \"Not bad.\"","\"I still have to work harder. Brother Ning is already level seven, Di Meng is also level seven. I'm too far behind them,\" Chen Feilu said with great ambition.","Qi Quan said, \"Impatience is a major taboo.\"","\"Thank you for the advice, Master. I'll remember it.\"","A knock sounded on the door.","Qi Quan hung up the phone. \"Come in.\"","The tall, slender young man entered, wearing loose loungewear and holding a bouquet of flowers. The flowers were picked from the garden, each stem carefully chosen by him. The bouquet in his hand could be considered the most perfect blooms in the garden.","[This is just absurd!] The system complained. [You've been together for two years, and he still knocks before entering your room. And up to now, you two still haven't...]","Qi Quan raised an eyebrow: [Haven't what?]","[It's just kissing and hugging.] The system said euphemistically.","Qi Quan chuckled.","It was true. Ling Sheng had always liked being close to her, but it had only ever been kissing and hugging. He never thought about anything else. For two years, they still occupied separate bedrooms.","She didn't really care about such things, but she was a little curious.","Ling Sheng placed the bouquet in the vase by the window, the corners of his lips lifting in a happy smile.","Today was their two-year anniversary.","Qi Quan got out of bed and asked, \"What made you think of picking flowers?\"","Ling Sheng turned and hugged her, pressing his cheek against hers, his voice low and pleasant. \"Two-year anniversary.\"","He had a fresh, pleasant scent about him, like grass after rain, refreshing and soothing.","Qi Quan liked it very much and cupped his face.","Their eyes met.","Ling Sheng's breathing suddenly became rapid, his ears turning red. He hastily took a step back, avoiding Qi Quan's gaze, and said, \"Breakfast is almost ready.\"","Qi Quan: ?","Was he shy?","It wasn't like they hadn't kissed before. What was there to be shy about?","\"I'll go out first.\"","Ling Sheng lowered his head and quickly left the bedroom.","Qi Quan was puzzled: [What did he mean by that?]","The system: [Probably thinking about things not suitable for children.]","But what's the use of just thinking about it?","Qi Quan: ...","In the kitchen, Xue Hong leaned against the wall with her arms crossed, chatting with Su Rong.","\"Two years. It's been two years, and it's still the same old story,\" Xue Hong sighed. \"What's the use of him watching all those movies?\"","Su Rong smiled gently. \"He went to pick flowers this morning. That's very thoughtful.\"","\"Remembering the anniversary is indeed praiseworthy, but... the progress is just too slow.\"","\"Master and Ling Sheng know what they're doing. Your anxiety won't help.\"","Xue Hong: \"I'm not anxious, I just feel embarrassed.\"","After all, he was her student. He learned academic subjects quickly and well, so why was he so hesitant in a relationship?","Su Rong suddenly said, \"Could it be that we're being too much like third wheels?\"","Xue Hong: \"...\"","That was also a possibility.","During breakfast, Su Steward was the first to speak: \"Master, my mother hasn't been feeling well lately. I'd like to go home for a few days to spend some time with her.\"","Qi Quan: \"Go ahead.\"","\"Master, there's a professional lecture coming up with a lot of valuable content. I'd like to attend, but it's quite far away. The round trip might take several days.\"","Qi Quan: \"Understood.\"","Over the past two years, Su Rong had reached Level 5, and Xue Hong had reached Level 7. As Qi Quan's ghost attendants, they faced no danger traveling alone.","Qi Quan wasn't worried.","After the two ghosts left, only she and Ling Sheng remained in the villa.","Qi Quan's reclusive life was monotonous, consisting of cultivation, studying sword arts, talisman arts, and formation arts, and occasionally writing novels when inspiration struck.","The departure of the two ghosts had no impact on her.","Well... there was a slight impact.","At least when they were around, Ling Sheng wouldn't get intimate with her in the living room.","The young man cradled the back of her head, his eyes closed, kissing her meticulously.","Whenever such moments occurred, the system would automatically shield itself.","Qi Quan lounged lazily on the sofa, her fingers threading through his hair, allowing him to act freely.","Just as things were about to progress naturally, he abruptly stopped again.","The young man suddenly pulled away from her, standing to the side, flushed and flustered, not knowing what to do, even showing a hint of frustration and self-reproach in his eyes.","Qi Quan: ?","The system was released and sighed: [It's over again?]","[Yes.]","The system speculated: [Does he not understand?]","Qi Quan: [After watching so many movies, with his learning ability, he should understand.]","[Then why...]","Qi Quan: [It's indeed time to clarify things.]","Leaning against the sofa, her disheveled hair cascading down, legs crossed, she asked calmly, \"Why are you standing so far away?\"","Ling Sheng hung his head low, his voice slightly hoarse: \"Being closer might hurt you.\"","Qi Quan was puzzled: \"Hurt me?\"","Leaving aside the fact that she was a Human Immortal realm cultivator and no one could easily harm her, even if she were an ordinary person, she wouldn't get hurt just by someone being close, right?","And weren't they very close just a moment ago?","The system was utterly confused: [What exactly is Ling Sheng thinking?]","Qi Quan asked, \"Why do you say that?\"","\"The movies are all like that,\" Ling Sheng's voice was so low it was almost inaudible.","Qi Quan: ?","System: ?","What movies? What did they show?","\"Like what in the movies?\"","Ling Sheng glanced at her cautiously and obediently replied, \"It's painful.\"","\"......\"","Qi Quan barely maintained her composure and asked, \"What's painful?\"","\"I would hurt you, make you uncomfortable.\"","System: [Don't say such wild things with such an innocent expression!]","Qi Quan decided to abandon this topic.","Fortunately, the ringing of her phone broke the awkward atmosphere.","It was Li Guoyan calling.","He had rarely contacted Qi Quan in the past two years. A direct call from him indicated a rather tricky problem.","\"Master, sorry to disturb you.\"","Qi Quan: \"What is it?\"","\"Is Physician Qi with you?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"I sent him a message, but he hasn't replied,\" Li Guoyan explained. \"A strange illness has appeared in Longqu City. The affected are ordinary citizens. After assessment by the department, it's believed to be caused by some kind of ghost energy contamination. Hospitals can't treat it.\"","Qi Quan: \"Are there many infected?\"","\"Quite a few, and it appears to be somewhat contagious,\" Li Guoyan said. \"We are currently investigating the source.\"","\"Understood. Ling Sheng and I will come as soon as possible.\"","Although the Investigation Department had been vigorously training medical cultivators over the past two years, there weren't many with talent, and their levels were relatively low. For such difficult and complicated diseases, they still needed Ling Sheng's expertise.","Due to its contagious nature, moving the patients was impractical, requiring Ling Sheng to make the trip himself.","\"Master, you're coming too?\" Li Guoyan asked with pleasant surprise.","Qi Quan: \"Since it involves ghost energy, I'll go take a look as well.\"","With Su Steward and Teacher Xue not at home, it was better to go on this business trip with Ling Sheng.","\"Alright, I'll arrange for someone to pick you up right away.\"","Qi Quan glanced at Ling Sheng and said, \"No need. We'll get there ourselves.\"","They had talked about going on a road trip two years ago. Why not take a long journey after resolving this case?","\"Okay, then I'll have someone arrange accommodations.\"","After hanging up, Qi Quan didn't delay. She and Ling Sheng drove to Longqu City.","Longqu City was not economically developed. The city's appearance seemed somewhat shabby and dilapidated, lacking vitality and vigor.","After entering the Longqu City area, Ling Sheng followed the navigation directly to the accommodation arranged by the Investigation Department.","Finding decent lodging here was difficult, so they had to settle for the city's best hotel. However, even the best hotel in Longqu City looked somewhat old and run-down.","The head of the Longqu City Investigation Department personally waited at the hotel entrance.","A young investigator followed behind him.","The investigator gathered his courage and asked, \"Director, who are we waiting for?\"","Director Dong glanced at him, deliberately keeping him in suspense: \"You'll know when they arrive.\"","\"Director, if you don't tell me, I'll be too nervous. What if I fail to react properly and offend someone important?\" the investigator worried.","Director Dong: That's true. Facing someone of that caliber, not just his subordinates, even he felt apprehensive.","After receiving the instructions from the headquarters, it had taken him a while to regain his composure.","He pretended to be calm and said, \"The people we're welcoming are Chief Consultant Qi and Chief Physician Qi from the Investigation Headquarters.\"","Investigator: \"......\"","Director Dong waited a moment but received no response. He turned to look and was met with a dumbfounded expression.","The young investigator's face wore a dreamlike look.","Director Dong: Ah, still too young!","Before long, an understated car slowly drove up and stopped at the hotel entrance.","Director Dong had sharp eyes and immediately recognized the license plate. His heart started pounding wildly.","Wasn't this the license plate from the Lakeside Villa!","He quickly led the investigator forward to greet them.","The car was modest, and the two people who got out were dressed simply, but their looks and demeanor were absolutely outstanding.","Truly worthy of Chief Consultant Qi and Chief Physician Qi!","Director Dong barely suppressed his excited and surging emotions and stepped forward respectfully, saying, \"Chief Consultant Qi, Chief Physician Qi, I am the head of the Longqu City Investigation Department, surname Dong. The hotel rooms have been booked. Please follow me.\"","Qi Quan nodded: \"Thank you for your trouble.\"","Ling Sheng walked around the car, took two suitcases from the trunk, and effortlessly wheeled them over.","\"Little Cheng, go help the Chief Physician with the luggage,\" Director Dong instructed.","Little Cheng had been in a daze. Hearing this, he snapped back to reality, his face flushing crimson, and hurriedly reached for the suitcases.","Ahhhhhhh!","The Chief Consultant and Chief Physician are such a perfect match!","Ling Sheng subtly moved the suitcase handle back, avoiding his hand.","Little Cheng: ?","\"No need to trouble yourself,\" Qi Quan said gently.","Director Dong suddenly slapped his forehead: \"Right, right, how foolish of me.\"","How could they let anyone casually touch the luggage of these two esteemed figures?","Qi Quan: ...","That wasn't what she meant. It was just that Ling Sheng didn't like others touching their belongings. He preferred to handle everything himself when they traveled.","The booked room was on the top floor of the hotel, a large suite with all necessary amenities. It had a living room, kitchen, bathroom, gym, and other functional spaces, but... there was only one bedroom.","The bedroom was spacious, and the bed was not small either—it could easily sleep three or four people. Now that everyone aware of Qi Quan and Ling Sheng's identities assumed they were a Daoist couple, and since it was perfectly natural for such a couple to share a bed, the person in charge hadn't thought much about it when arranging accommodations.","\"Advisor Qi, Physician Qi, please let us know if anything is unsatisfactory.\"","Qi Quan didn't mind. She looked at Ling Sheng.","Ling Sheng shook his head.","Neither of them were the type to trouble others unnecessarily. Since the room was already booked, there was no need to change it.","Director Dong said respectfully, \"Would you two like to rest first?\"","Qi Quan said, \"Let's go see the patients first.\"","\"Of course!\" Director Dong was overjoyed, his respect for Qi Quan and Ling Sheng growing even deeper.","When he received the notification, he had been both happy and apprehensive. Having two such heavyweight experts come to support Longqu City was extremely welcome, but he couldn't help worrying they might be aloof or put on airs.","He never expected them to be so approachable!","The hospital wasn't far, just a ten-minute drive.","Qi Quan and Ling Sheng rode in the Investigation Department's car. Little Cheng drove, Director Dong sat in the passenger seat, and the two of them sat side by side in the back.","\"Advisor Qi, Physician Qi, all current patients at the hospital are isolated. Because the ghost energy is highly contagious, ordinary medical staff cannot get close to the patients. Only our investigators are looking after them,\" Director Dong explained the situation.","Qi Quan asked, \"Has the source been traced?\"","\"We're still investigating.\"","[Ghost energy can be contagious too? I've truly never heard of such a thing.] The system felt its knowledge was lacking.","Qi Quan replied, [The abilities of ghosts are ever-changing. Different ghosts may possess different ghost powers.]","[What other strange ghost powers has the great one seen?]","Qi Quan: [Does unbearably foul stench count?]","[Uh...]","The conversation between the one and the system ended there.","The car stopped at the hospital entrance, and the four soon arrived at the isolation ward.","It was called an isolation ward, but it was essentially an ordinary ward sealed off with an array to prevent the ghost energy from leaking.","Director Dong led them to one of the rooms.","\"This patient is in the most critical condition. He has already lost consciousness.\"","Qi Quan stepped into the room, her gaze falling on the patient.","The man was in his forties. Sores had broken out all over his skin, oozing pus and exuding a dark aura.","The system exclaimed, [That's just too disgusting!]","\"Physician Qi, can this be treated?\" Director Dong asked anxiously.","Ling Sheng nodded. Spiritual energy flowed from his fingertips into the patient's forehead. The pure spiritual energy continuously drove out the ghost energy within the patient's body. Wherever the spiritual energy reached, the festering sores and ghost energy gradually dissipated. In no more than fifteen minutes, the patient returned to normal.","Director Dong and Little Cheng: !!!","Truly worthy of being the Chief Physician. His skill was extraordinary!","Ling Sheng expressionlessly withdrew his hand. But when he turned to look at Qi Quan, his demeanor suddenly became animated, his eyes bright.","\"Impressive,\" Qi Quan praised without reservation.","Little Cheng inwardly cheered: Mmm! I got my sugar fix!","The patient slowly regained consciousness. Opening his eyes, the first person he saw was Ling Sheng, who was closest to him, and for a moment, he was speechless.","Director Dong stepped forward, blocking the patient's view, and asked with a serious expression, \"How do you feel?\"","The patient replied, \"...Alright.\"","\"Little Cheng, notify someone to come take a statement.\"","\"Yes, sir!\"","They needed to carefully inquire about the patient's movements and contacts to trace the source of the ghost energy.","Ling Sheng was only responsible for treatment and soon cured all the patients.","But the source hadn't been found yet. Other patients might still appear, so they had to remain in Longqu City for the time being.","Little Cheng drove them back to the hotel.","Not long after he left, the hotel delivered a sumptuous dinner.","While eating, Qi Quan asked, \"What do you think about today's ghost energy?\"","Ling Sheng said, \"Extremely deep resentment.\"","Such methods were enough to torment a person to death, not to mention the high contagiousness. It indicated that this ghost had become an embodiment of resentment.","The system wondered, [Could it be some unjust case?]","Qi Quan replied, [Possibly.]","After dinner, Qi Quan sat in meditation to cultivate, and Ling Sheng joined her.","Time passed gradually, and it grew late into the night.","Qi Quan opened her eyes, and Ling Sheng followed suit.","\"Time to sleep,\" she said.","Although a Human Immortal realm cultivator could go without sleep for long periods, life needed a sense of ritual; otherwise, it would be too dull.","Ling Sheng nodded. \"I'll sleep on the sofa.\"","The sofa was in the living room, large and long enough for him to lie down.","[Pfft.] The system laughed rather disloyally.","Qi Quan, having anticipated this, said without changing her expression, \"The hotel hygiene might not be up to standard.\"","Ling Sheng understood. He used a cleansing technique, thoroughly cleaning the entire suite inside and out.","The smell of laundry detergent on the bedroom quilt was replaced by a faint scent of fresh grass.","Qi Quan got into bed.","The blackout curtains were fully drawn, plunging the room into darkness.","She took out her phone and sent a message: [After we finish handling things in Longqu City, let's go on a road trip.]","In the living room, Ling Sheng, who had been tossing and turning unable to sleep, heard his phone chime. Thinking it was work-related, he picked it up expressionlessly.","Opening it, his expression instantly softened.","He replied with a smile: [Okay.]","[Quanquan: Where would you like to go?]","Ling Sheng: [I'll follow your lead.]","[Quanquan: I don't have any particular ideas. Anywhere is fine.]","Ling Sheng: [Then I'll look up some guides first and plan a route.]","[Quanquan: Okay.]","Ling Sheng: [Good night.]","He switched out of the chat interface and was about to search for travel guides online when Qi Quan sent another message: [There's a spot in the bedroom that wasn't cleaned properly.]","Ling Sheng abruptly sat up and, without a second thought, pushed the door open and entered.","The bedroom was lit by a wall lamp, its dim, yellowish light gentle and serene.","\"Where?\" He felt a pang of self-reproach. He must have accidentally missed a spot.","Qi Quan, leaning against the headboard, patted the space beside her.","Suspecting nothing, Ling Sheng walked to the bedside, lifted the quilt, and tried to find the missed stain.","A hand suddenly grasped the nape of his neck.","He froze instantly, staring blankly at Qi Quan, who was now so close.","Qi Quan's hair fell smoothly, a few strands covering the side of her face. In the lamplight, her features looked exceptionally gentle, her eyelashes casting shadows beneath her eyes.","She asked, \"Did you find it?\"","Ling Sheng replied dazedly, \"No.\"","Qi Quan chuckled softly and asked again, \"Do you want to keep looking?\"","She didn't get a verbal answer.","Ling Sheng stared intently at her, his lips parting slightly as if he wanted to say something, but in the end, no words came out.","He remained in a bent-over posture, one hand pinching the corner of the quilt, the other braced against the sheet, the veins on the back of his hand standing out.","Qi Quan's voice was extremely soft and slow: \"Would you ever hurt me?\"","Of course not.","Ling Sheng was absolutely certain of that.","Precisely because of this, he was unwilling to \"hurt\" the person he liked, like those rough men in the movies.","Yet, he couldn't suppress this impulse.","He often despised and loathed himself for it.","Reading this certainty in his resolute gaze, Qi Quan smiled, leaned close to his ear, and whispered, \"I trust you.\"","Her words, falling on his ear, plucked at the strings of his heart.","The clear amber color of the young man's eyes was suddenly tinged with a deep, dark intensity.","He turned his head and kissed her.","Reason crumbled and fled.","The system was shielded for an entire night, finally regaining its senses the next morning at breakfast.","Although the experience of being locked in a dark room wasn't particularly pleasant, seeing the couple it shipped finally get together made it easy to overlook such a minor inconvenience.","It spent a good while inwardly going \"Hehehe,\" until a knock came from outside the room.","Ling Sheng went to open the door.","Outside were Director Dong and Little Cheng. The moment they saw Ling Sheng, they noticed he seemed quite different from the day before.","It was hard to pinpoint exactly what was different, but one thing was certain: the Chief Physician was in an exceptionally cheerful mood today, radiating a sweet, buoyant energy. His usually expressionless face was remarkably animated.","The two men thought: Ah, this...","As fellow men, they understood perfectly.","Perhaps they shouldn't have come so early?","Ling Sheng turned sideways, inviting them inside.","Director Dong didn't move, showing great tact. \"Dr. Qi, I'm just here to report the situation. A few more patients appeared in the early hours. Their injuries aren't severe. If you and Advisor Qi don't have time, you can...\"","\"Wait a moment,\" Ling Sheng replied, turning and walking towards the dining area.","He took Qi Quan's hand, brought it to his lips, and kissed it. \"Finish your meal and rest. I'll go to the hospital.\"","Qi Quan nodded.","After Ling Sheng left, she finished her breakfast and lounged lazily in an armchair by the floor-to-ceiling window, basking in the warm sunlight.","She hadn't been lying there long before Ling Sheng returned.","He half-knelt beside her legs and said, \"We found the source.\"","Qi Quan opened her eyes. \"Where?\"","\"In a remote village.\"","One of the patients admitted to the hospital today was from that very village.","The patient explained that he had returned to his hometown a few days ago and found that many people in the village were suffering from the same illness. However, he was in a hurry at the time and didn't pay it much mind. Who could have guessed he'd be infected too?","Qi Quan made a move to get up. \"Let's go take a look.\"","\"You should rest,\" Ling Sheng stopped her.","Qi Quan: \"...\"","She was perfectly healthy and didn't need rest.","\"I want to wrap things up here quickly and start our road trip sooner. Just the two of us.\"","Ling Sheng's ears instantly burned red.","\"Alright.\"","The two packed their luggage and checked out of the hotel.","Director Dong and Little Cheng were waiting at the hotel entrance. Seeing them with their luggage, they asked, \"Chief Advisor, Dr. Qi, are you two driving there yourselves?\"","Qi Quan nodded.","So, Director Dong and Little Cheng led the way in their car.","The village was deep in the mountains of Longqu City. To this day, it still lacked a proper paved road and remained extremely isolated.","The cars couldn't drive in, so they had to park by the roadside and proceed on foot.","Before even getting out of the car, Qi Quan sensed the dense Yin energy hanging over the village.","\"Did the Investigation Department not notice this before?\" she asked.","Director Dong shook his head. \"No.\"","The ghostly aura must have appeared only recently.","Qi Quan looked at the soaring resentment and sighed inwardly. \"Let's go.\"","Ling Sheng held her hand, enveloping her in spiritual energy to protect her from the ghostly aura.","Even though no ghostly aura could harm Qi Quan, he instinctively wanted to shield her.","Director Dong and Little Cheng, who were currently being buffeted by the ghostly aura, fell silent.","Fortunately, they were wearing the protective talismans issued by the Investigation Department. The talismans' light fended off the howling ghostly energy.","The arrival of strangers put the villagers on high alert.","They peered out through their windows.","The System: [Hiss, this feels a bit creepy.]","Ignoring the villagers covered in sores, Qi Quan walked straight towards the source of the black energy.","It was a deep pool.","Dense willow trees grew around its edge, their branches trailing into the water. The wind blew, stirring ripples across the surface.","\"Who are you people? What are you doing here?\"","A middle-aged man with a weathered face approached, speaking in a thick local dialect that was hard to understand. A group of villagers followed behind him, holding farm tools like hoes and rakes.","Little Cheng, who understood the dialect, acted as translator.","Director Dong looked at Qi Quan. \"Advisor Qi, what do you think?\"","Qi Quan didn't spare the villagers a single glance. The imposing aura of a Human Immortal gradually spread around the pool.","\"Come out.\"","She was speaking to the water.","The villagers grew even more panicked, raising their farm tools in unison.","\"You're not welcome here! Get lost!\"","A cold glint flashed in Ling Sheng's eyes. He parted his lips and uttered, \"Halt.\"","Instantly, the villagers couldn't move their bodies, nor could they speak.","Terror appeared on every face.","Director Dong and Little Cheng: \"...\"","When experts make a move, it's always this straightforward and decisive.","Finally, the pool water stirred. A pitch-black ghostly shadow rose from its surface.","It was a little girl.","To be precise, it was many little girls.","Sensing Qi Quan's immense power and gentle nature, they began to accuse all the villagers holding farm tools with sharp, furious cries.","It turned out that in recent years, many boys born in the village had died young. The superstitious villagers began offering girls as sacrifices to the mountain god, hoping it would bless the village boys with health and long life.","This deep pool on the mountain, surrounded by willow trees, was deemed the perfect sacrificial site.","The four of them: \"...\"","Innocent girls had lost their precious lives because of these villagers' ignorance, superstition, and cruelty.","How could they not hate?","After hearing their story, Qi Quan waved her hand, guiding the girls to find peace and move on to reincarnation. As for these villagers, having committed murder, they would naturally face the severe punishment of the law.","With the matter resolved, Qi Quan and Ling Sheng didn't linger.","The two left the mountain village and embarked on a new journey.","No one knew their whereabouts; one could only catch glimpses from the updates in \"The Diary of a Wealthy Family.\"","[The End]"]}]);
